msgid "伪墓"
msgstr "The False Tomb"

msgid "追到黑衣道士，弄清老松寨和那口墓。"
msgstr "Catch the Daoist in Black and get to the bottom of Old Pine Stockade and that tomb."

msgid "查明了瀑布山洞里的墓是假的"
msgstr "Found the tomb in the waterfall cave was a fake"

msgid "顺着布条上的记号去老松岭，沿松树上的刀痕找老松寨。"
msgstr "Follow the marks on the strip of cloth to Old Pine Ridge, and the blade cuts on the pines to Old Pine Stockade."

msgid "松树上的刀痕指向灌木后的一条小径：老松寨藏在林子深处。"
msgstr "The cuts on the pines point to a path behind the brush: Old Pine Stockade is hidden deep in the woods."

msgid "过老松寨的寨门：留下买路钱、叫阵，或者打进去。"
msgstr "Get through the gate of Old Pine Stockade: pay the toll, call them out, or fight your way in."

msgid "你给了寨门的喽罗十两银子买路钱，寨里的人不再拦你。"
msgstr "You give the lackey at the gate ten taels of toll money. The stockade stops getting in your way."

msgid "给老松寨的喽罗付了买路钱"
msgstr "Paid the toll to Old Pine Stockade's lackeys"

msgid "你在寨门外叫阵，喽罗放你进去：常老大在聚义厅等你。"
msgstr "You call them out from outside the gate, and the lackey lets you in: Boss Chang is waiting for you in Brotherhood Hall."

msgid "在老松寨的寨门外叫阵"
msgstr "Called out Old Pine Stockade at its gate"

msgid "你打倒了寨门的喽罗，硬闯进了老松寨。"
msgstr "You knock down the lackey at the gate and force your way into Old Pine Stockade."

msgid "硬闯了老松寨的寨门"
msgstr "Forced the gate of Old Pine Stockade"

msgid "到聚义厅找常老大，问黑衣道士的去向。"
msgstr "Find Boss Chang in Brotherhood Hall and ask where the Daoist in Black went."

msgid "常老大说那道士拿一块金牌买了路，往东边的瀑布去了。"
msgstr "Boss Chang says the Daoist bought his way through with a gold token and went east, to the waterfall."

msgid "你打倒了常老大。他跌坐在熊皮上骂道：那道士拿金牌买的路，往东边的瀑布去了，找他去！"
msgstr "You knock Boss Chang down. He slumps onto his bearskin, cursing: \"The Daoist paid with a gold token and went east to the waterfall. Go find him!\""

msgid "打倒了老松寨的常老大"
msgstr "Beat Boss Chang of Old Pine Stockade"

msgid "从瀑布后面进山洞，找黑衣道士。"
msgstr "Go into the cave behind the waterfall and find the Daoist in Black."

msgid "瀑布后的山洞尽头有一具骸骨和一面刻字的石壁。"
msgstr "At the end of the cave behind the waterfall lie a skeleton and a stone wall with words carved into it."

msgid "拦住黑衣道士。"
msgstr "Stop the Daoist in Black."

msgid "黑衣道士落败，石匣还锁着，留在洞里。"
msgstr "The Daoist in Black is beaten. The stone casket is still locked, and stays in the cave."

msgid "看看洞里的石壁和那具骸骨。"
msgstr "Look at the stone wall in the cave, and the skeleton."

msgid "石壁上的字自称「南危水」，说埋骨于此——可骸骨身量矮小、骨龄不过三十，身边没有剑；字迹深浅如一，是活人慢慢刻的。这不是南危水的墓。"
msgstr "The words on the wall call themselves \"Nan Weishui\" and say his bones are buried here. But the skeleton is short, no more than thirty years old, with no sword beside it; and every stroke is cut to the same depth, slowly, by a living hand. This is not Nan Weishui's tomb."

msgid "处置那具骸骨：安葬他，或者带走他身边的腰牌。"
msgstr "Deal with the skeleton: bury him, or take the waist token beside him."

msgid "你把无名人安葬了，腰牌随他入土。洞顶落下一本《过招要旨》。"
msgstr "You bury the nameless man, and the token goes into the ground with him. A copy of \"Sparring Primer\" drops from the cave roof."

msgid "安葬了瀑布山洞里的无名人"
msgstr "Buried the nameless man in the waterfall cave"

msgid "你拿走了骸骨身边的水烟阁腰牌：金乌徽，背面一个「岭」字。"
msgstr "You take the Waterfog Pavilion waist token from beside the bones: a golden-crow badge, with the character \"Ling\" on the back."

msgid "拿走了瀑布山洞骸骨身边的腰牌"
msgstr "Took the waist token from the bones in the waterfall cave"

msgid "旧案"
msgstr "The Old Case"

msgid "去水烟阁，问清五长老的死。"
msgstr "Go to Waterfog Pavilion and find out how the Fifth Elder died."

msgid "查清了二十年前水烟阁五长老的旧案"
msgstr "Got to the bottom of Waterfog Pavilion's old case of the Fifth Elder, twenty years back"

msgid "回雪亭镇淳风武馆，把山洞里的事告诉柳淳风。"
msgstr "Go back to Pure Wind Hall in Snow Pavilion and tell Liu Chunfeng what was in the cave."

msgid "柳淳风写了一封引荐信，让你去水烟阁找他的结拜义弟、执法使潘军禅；他说二十年前失在老松岭的那趟镖是振远镖局押的。"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng writes a letter of introduction and sends you to Waterfog Pavilion, to his sworn brother the Enforcer, Pan Junchan. The escort lost on Old Pine Ridge twenty years ago, he says, was a Far-Road Escorts job."

msgid "去绮云镇振远镖局，问陈剑秋二十年前的失镖。"
msgstr "Go to the Far-Road Escorts in Cloudweave Town and ask Chen Jianqiu about the escort lost twenty years ago."

msgid "陈剑秋拿出二十年前的镖单：押的是水烟阁盟主印一方、密件一匣，失镖于老松岭，无一人生还。振远至今不提这桩丢人事。"
msgstr "Chen Jianqiu brings out the waybill from twenty years ago: one seal of the Waterfog Pavilion's Alliance Leader and one casket of secret papers, lost on Old Pine Ridge, no one left alive. The Far-Road Escorts still don't speak of that shame."

msgid "上水烟阁的山，看葬剑亭里的碑。"
msgstr "Climb Waterfog Pavilion's mountain and read the stone in the Sword Tomb Pavilion."

msgid "葬剑亭碑：第四代七长老以奸计害人，被众武者合力击杀，甲辰年立亭为后人殷鉴。"
msgstr "The stone of the Sword Tomb Pavilion: the Seventh Elder of the fourth generation did harm by treachery and was slain by martial artists acting together; the pavilion was raised in a Jiachen year as a warning to those who come after."

msgid "看虹谷石台的碑。"
msgstr "Read the stone on the terrace in Rainbow Gorge."

msgid "虹谷石台碑：乙丑年，第六代阁主关雨楼立——正是失镖那年。字是用手指在岩石上写的，和山洞石壁上的刻字是一个手法。"
msgstr "The stone on the terrace in Rainbow Gorge: raised by Guan Yulou, sixth Head of the Pavilion, in a Yichou year—the very year the escort was lost. The words were written into the rock with a finger, the same way as the words on the cave wall."

msgid "上楼找五长老南危水，拿证据问他山洞里的骸骨。"
msgstr "Go upstairs to the Fifth Elder, Nan Weishui, and confront him with your proof about the skeleton in the cave."

msgid "南危水承认了：山洞里死的是他的随从阿岭，伏击的是白衣武官，盟主卫沧澜被带走。他装死二十年，是怕哥哥槐阳王知道朝廷伏击了自己的弟弟会反。"
msgstr "Nan Weishui admits it: the one who died in the cave was his attendant, A-Ling. The ambush was the Officer in White's, and the Alliance Leader, Wei Canglan, was taken away. He has played dead for twenty years for fear his brother, the Prince of Huaiyang, would rebel if he learned the court had ambushed his own brother."

msgid "拿着引荐信到前厅找执法使潘军禅，问「邪剑穿灵」。"
msgstr "Take the letter of introduction to the Enforcer, Pan Junchan, in the front hall and ask him about \"Spiritpiercer, the Evil Sword.\""

msgid "潘军禅说那把邪剑穿灵是仿剑、是鱼饵：去年一个黑衣道士来试过它，往野羊山北麓去了。"
msgstr "Pan Junchan says the evil sword Spiritpiercer is a copy—bait. Last year a Daoist in black came to try it, then went off to the North Foot of Goathill."

msgid "替南危水保密（他欠你一个人情，到了关北替你引见他哥哥槐阳王），还是告诉七长老颜违（颜违借这件事坐稳代盟主，南危水不会再和你同路）？"
msgstr "Keep Nan Weishui's secret (he'll owe you, and Beyond the Pass he'll introduce you to his brother, the Prince of Huaiyang), or tell the Seventh Elder, Yan Wei (Yan Wei will use it to settle in as acting Alliance Leader, and Nan Weishui won't walk with you again)?"

msgid "你替南危水保了密。他说，到了关北，他替你引见槐阳王。"
msgstr "You keep Nan Weishui's secret. Beyond the Pass, he says, he'll introduce you to the Prince of Huaiyang."

msgid "替水烟阁五长老南危水保住了二十年的秘密"
msgstr "Kept the twenty-year secret of Nan Weishui, Waterfog Pavilion's Fifth Elder"

msgid "你把南危水的事告诉了七长老颜违。颜违当日便以代盟主自居；南危水闭门不出，水烟阁来信告诉了关北。"
msgstr "You tell the Seventh Elder, Yan Wei, about Nan Weishui. That same day Yan Wei calls himself acting Alliance Leader; Nan Weishui shuts his door, and a letter from Waterfog Pavilion goes Beyond the Pass."

msgid "把五长老南危水装死二十年的事告诉了七长老颜违"
msgstr "Told the Seventh Elder, Yan Wei, that the Fifth Elder, Nan Weishui, had played dead for twenty years"

msgid "进野羊山北麓的黑道观，找到失踪的大寨主。"
msgstr "Get into the black Daoist abbey on the North Foot of Goathill and find the missing chief of the stockade."

msgid "查清了逆灵宫纳供的真相"
msgstr "Found out the truth of the Black Palace's tribute"

msgid "黑衣道士往野羊山北麓去了。去打听北麓的道观：野羊寨的黄霸在山路边的土地庙里；淳风武馆的门房刘安禄也知道——若他肯说。"
msgstr "The Daoist in Black went to the North Foot of Goathill. Ask around about the abbey there: Huang Ba of Goathill Stockade is at the Earth God Shrine by the mountain road; Liu Anlu, Pure Wind Hall's gatekeeper, knows too—if he'll talk."

msgid "刘安禄说了：野羊寨的大寨主霍铮是他拜过把子的大哥，半年前被北麓黑砖道观的道士带走，再没回来；那伙人自称逆灵宫。三寨主黄霸接了寨子，每年给道观纳供；他不肯伺候那群道士，才下山做了门房。纳供的车这几天上山，到山路转角，道士从北边山壁的裂口把东西吊上去——道观就在裂口上头。"
msgstr "Liu Anlu talks. Huo Zheng, chief of Goathill Stockade, is his sworn elder brother. Half a year ago the Daoists of the black-brick abbey on the North Foot took him away, and he never came back; they call themselves the Black Palace. The third chief, Huang Ba, took over the stockade and pays the abbey tribute every year; Liu Anlu wouldn't wait on those Daoists, so he came down the mountain and became a gatekeeper. The tribute cart goes up any day now. At the bend in the mountain road the Daoists haul the goods up through a crack in the north cliff—the abbey is right above the crack."

msgid "黄霸说了：两年前北麓起了一座黑砖道观，自称逆灵宫，寨里折了一半弟兄；半年前大寨主霍铮、二寨主一前一后没了下落，寨子落到他手里。他打不过那些道士，每年纳供换野羊寨还在山上。今年的车已经上去了，这会儿该到了山路转角。"
msgstr "Huang Ba talks. Two years ago a black-brick abbey went up on the North Foot, calling itself the Black Palace, and the stockade lost half its brothers. Half a year ago the chief, Huo Zheng, and the second chief went missing one after the other, and the stockade fell to him. He can't beat those Daoists, so he pays tribute every year to keep Goathill Stockade on the mountain. This year's cart has already gone up; by now it should be at the bend in the mountain road."

msgid "去野羊山的山路转角，看黄霸的纳供车。"
msgstr "Go to the bend in the Goathill road and look at Huang Ba's tribute cart."

msgid "两个黑衣道士守着一辆盖着油布的车。车上的箱子一只只吊进北边山壁的裂口里——他们不走山路。"
msgstr "Two Daoists in black guard a cart under an oilcloth. The chests on it are hauled one by one up into a crack in the north cliff—they don't use the road."

msgid "逆灵宫就在裂口上头。找到失踪的大寨主霍铮。跟着纳供车上去、打倒押车道士攀绳，或者戴上黑衣道士的黑冠——黄霸那里有一顶。"
msgstr "The Black Palace is right above the crack. Find the missing chief, Huo Zheng. Go up with the tribute cart, knock down the Daoists guarding it and climb the rope, or put on a black Daoist's black cap—Huang Ba has one."

msgid "你进了逆灵宫。"
msgstr "You're inside the Black Palace."

msgid "站稳脚跟，看看这是哪里。"
msgstr "Get your footing and see where you are."

msgid "你缩在供品箱子中间，和纳供一起被吊上了裂口。绞盘旁的道士只当你是箱子。"
msgstr "You curl up among the tribute chests and get hauled up the crack with the goods. The Daoist at the windlass takes you for one more chest."

msgid "混在野羊寨的供品里进了逆灵宫"
msgstr "Got into the Black Palace hidden in Goathill Stockade's tribute"

msgid "你打倒了押车道士，攀着他们的绳子上了裂口。"
msgstr "You knock down the Daoists guarding the cart and climb their rope up the crack."

msgid "打倒押车道士闯进了逆灵宫"
msgstr "Beat the cart's Daoists and broke into the Black Palace"

msgid "你戴上黑冠，押车道士只当你是宫里的人，让你自己攀了上去。"
msgstr "You put on the black cap. The Daoists guarding the cart take you for one of their own and let you climb up yourself."

msgid "戴着黑冠走进了逆灵宫"
msgstr "Walked into the Black Palace wearing a black cap"

msgid "顺着货道往北，进黑砖山门，看看这座道观。戴着黑冠的，道士当你是自己人。"
msgstr "Follow the goods track north, through the black-brick gate, and have a look at this abbey. If you're wearing a black cap, the Daoists take you for one of theirs."

msgid "黑砖的前院：黑幡垂地，香炉里烧的不是香。前殿的门关着，东边的矮房是货栈。"
msgstr "The black-brick front court: black banners trail on the ground, and what burns in the censer isn't incense. The door of the front hall is shut; the low building to the east is a storehouse."

msgid "前殿的门关着。推开殿门进前殿，找到霍铮。"
msgstr "The door of the front hall is shut. Push it open, go in, and find Huo Zheng."

msgid "前殿里没有神像。五个黑冠道士面壁诵逆灵天书，领诵的敲着木鱼，谁进来都不抬头。殿西有门，殿北的门关着。"
msgstr "There is no idol in the front hall. Five black-capped Daoists face the wall chanting the Black Scripture; the lead chanter beats a wooden fish, and none of them looks up at whoever comes in. There is a door on the west side of the hall, and the north door is shut."

msgid "殿西是丹房和账房。账房的案上摊着纳供的账册，翻一翻。"
msgstr "West of the hall are the Elixir Room and the Counting Room. The tribute ledger lies open on the desk in the Counting Room. Leaf through it."

msgid "纳供的不只是金帛，是人：野羊寨三名「入丹房」；关北民夫七名，三名入丹房、四名留用；傅家坡七岁的孩童一名，「留用，待子时」。"
msgstr "The tribute isn't only gold and silk—it's people: three from Goathill Stockade, \"to the Elixir Room\"; seven laborers from Beyond the Pass, three to the Elixir Room and four kept; one child of seven from Fu Family Slope, \"kept, until midnight.\""

msgid "案上还有一叠盖着朱印的文书。"
msgstr "On the desk there's also a stack of papers under a vermilion seal."

msgid "一叠盖着兵部大印的文书：「着逆灵宫代为收管」关北的河工、野羊山的「匪徒」。兵部的印，盖在一座黑道观的账上。"
msgstr "A stack of papers under the great seal of the Ministry of War: \"The Black Palace is charged to take in and hold\" the river workers of Beyond the Pass and the \"bandits\" of Goathill. The Ministry of War's seal, stamped on the books of a black abbey."

msgid "丹房西南角有石阶往下。下地牢，找霍铮。"
msgstr "Stone steps lead down from the southwest corner of the Elixir Room. Go down to the dungeon and find Huo Zheng."

msgid "霍铮锁在西边的牢房里，瘦得脱了形，骂声还在；北边那间是傅家坡的石头，七岁，头上两个小抓揪；东边两个关北来的民夫。三扇铁栅门的钥匙在大弟子玄冥子腰上。"
msgstr "Huo Zheng is locked in the west cell, wasted to nothing, still cursing. In the north cell is Shitou from Fu Family Slope, seven years old, hair in two little tufts; in the east, two laborers from Beyond the Pass. The keys to the three iron grates hang from the belt of the senior disciple, Xuanmingzi."

msgid "牢门开不了，钥匙在大弟子玄冥子腰上。前殿北门后的后殿有诵经声——钥匙该在那里。"
msgstr "The cells won't open: the keys are on the belt of the senior disciple, Xuanmingzi. There's chanting from the rear hall behind the front hall's north door—the keys should be there."

msgid "后殿没有神像，只有一座黑石坛。商玦行「唤首」：黑焰里现出一个无头的黑影，摸索着找什么。商玦把地牢钥匙丢给了玄冥子——「子时开坛，带祭品上来」——退进黑门，玄冥子跟着走了。坛底爬出两个鬼卒。"
msgstr "There's no idol in the rear hall, only an altar of black stone. Shang Jue performs the Calling of the Head: in the black flames a headless black shadow appears, groping for something. Shang Jue tosses the dungeon keys to Xuanmingzi—\"The altar opens at midnight. Bring the offering up\"—and steps back through the black door; Xuanmingzi follows him. Two ghost soldiers crawl out from under the altar."

msgid "坛底爬出来的鬼卒拦在你面前。打退它们。"
msgstr "The ghost soldiers that crawled out from under the altar block your way. Drive them off."

msgid "鬼卒散成黑烟。坛后的黑门开着；地牢的钥匙在狱卒手里了。"
msgstr "The ghost soldiers break up into black smoke. The black door behind the altar is open; the dungeon keys are in the jailer's hands now."

msgid "两件事只来得及做一件：回地牢，狱卒手里有钥匙了，救霍铮和石头；或者穿过黑门追商玦。"
msgstr "There's only time for one of two things: go back to the dungeon—the jailer has the keys now—and save Huo Zheng and Shitou; or go through the black door after Shang Jue."

msgid "你打开了牢门。霍铮和石头跟你走了，关北的民夫自己逃回关北。商玦带着逆灵天书从后山下了崖，玄冥子跟着走了。"
msgstr "You open the cells. Huo Zheng and Shitou come with you, and the laborers from Beyond the Pass make their own way home. Shang Jue goes down the cliff behind the mountain with the Black Scripture, and Xuanmingzi follows him."

msgid "从逆灵宫的地牢里救出了霍铮和石头"
msgstr "Saved Huo Zheng and Shitou from the Black Palace's dungeon"

msgid "你穿过黑门和宫主的居所，追到了后山的崖径。等你再下地牢，狱卒已经动了手。"
msgstr "You go through the black door and the Palace Master's quarters and catch up on the cliff path behind the mountain. By the time you're back in the dungeon, the jailer has already done his work."

msgid "穿过黑门追到了逆灵宫的后山"
msgstr "Went through the black door after them to the back of the Black Palace's mountain"

msgid "带霍铮回野羊山的土地庙。"
msgstr "Take Huo Zheng back to the Earth God Shrine on Goathill."

msgid "黄霸跪下让位，霍铮派弟兄送石头回傅家坡。野羊寨欠你一条命。"
msgstr "Huang Ba kneels and gives up his seat, and Huo Zheng sends brothers to take Shitou home to Fu Family Slope. Goathill Stockade owes you a life."

msgid "追上商玦。"
msgstr "Catch Shang Jue."

msgid "商玦割断绳索下了崖。玄冥子断后，和你一战，倒在崖径上；逆灵天书的残卷落在他身边。"
msgstr "Shang Jue cuts the rope and goes down the cliff. Xuanmingzi holds the rear, fights you, and falls on the cliff path; a fragment of the Black Scripture lies beside him."

msgid "寒於宝衣在晚月庄。守它的人不白给。"
msgstr "Hanyu's Robe is at Latemoon Manor. Whoever guards it won't just hand it over."

msgid "找到了寒於宝衣"
msgstr "Found Hanyu's Robe"

msgid "寒於的宝衣在哪？水烟阁的潘军禅、南危水知道旧事。"
msgstr "Where is Hanyu's Robe? Pan Junchan and Nan Weishui of Waterfog Pavilion know the old story."

msgid "潘军禅说了：当年三件东西各归一处，宝衣归月神族保管。月神族早没了，只剩晚月庄——她们自称人灵区冥的后人，庄里供着神像，池边立着凤凰护庄。守它的人不白给。"
msgstr "Pan Junchan tells you: back then the three things each went to a different keeper, and the robe went to the Moon God clan. The Moon God clan is long gone; only Latemoon Manor is left—they call themselves the descendants of the Human Soul Ouming, keep her statue in the manor, and have phoenixes standing guard by the pool. Whoever guards it won't just hand it over."

msgid "南危水说了：寒於的宝衣当年归月神族保管，月神族的后人在晚月庄，供着人灵区冥的神像。守衣的人几百年没换过。"
msgstr "Nan Weishui tells you: Hanyu's Robe went to the Moon God clan for safekeeping, and the Moon God clan's descendants are at Latemoon Manor, where they keep the statue of the Human Soul Ouming. The robe's keeper hasn't changed in centuries."

msgid "去晚月庄。绮云镇西出镇的石板路尽头。"
msgstr "Go to Latemoon Manor, at the end of the flagstone road out of Cloudweave Town to the west."

msgid "晚月庄的前厅。庄里来的都是找宝衣的人：逍遥派的芙云、天山派的梦玉楼、书房里的老妇和那个蒙面杀手，还有西厢的客人。"
msgstr "The front hall of Latemoon Manor. Everyone here has come for the robe: Fuyun of the Carefree School, Meng Yulou of the Tianshan School, the old woman in the study and that masked killer, and the guest in the west wing."

msgid "西厢的客人安妮儿也在等宝衣。去问她。"
msgstr "Anni'er, the guest in the west wing, is waiting for the robe too. Go ask her."

msgid "安妮儿——东方神教的一代教主——在西厢住了三年。她说她等一件东西，也等一个配得上它的人。"
msgstr "Anni'er—who led the Golden Crow Order in her day—has lived in the west wing for three years. She says she is waiting for a thing, and for someone worthy of it."

msgid "东厢的瑷伦是守衣人。问她宝衣。"
msgstr "Ailun in the east wing is the robe's keeper. Ask her about it."

msgid "瑷伦认了：衣在庄里，她守着，守了几百年——三十七岁的脸。宝衣不白给：接她三鞭，站着不倒，再谈。"
msgstr "Ailun admits it: the robe is in the manor, and she has kept it for centuries—with the face of a woman of thirty-seven. The robe isn't given away: take three lashes of her whip, still standing, and then you'll talk."

msgid "接瑷伦三鞭。倒了可以歇好再来。"
msgstr "Take three lashes from Ailun. If you go down, rest up and come back."

msgid "你接下了瑷伦的三鞭。她收起鞭子，问你一句：你拿它去做什么。"
msgstr "You take Ailun's three lashes. She coils her whip and asks you one thing: what will you do with it?"

msgid "瑷伦问：你拿它去做什么？——为了斩鬼、交给安妮儿，还是不知道。"
msgstr "Ailun asks what you'll do with it: slay the ghost, give it to Anni'er, or you don't know."

msgid "你说：为了斩鬼。瑷伦点头：寒於留它，本来就是为这个。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」。"
msgstr "You say: to slay the ghost. Ailun nods. That's what Hanyu left it for. The robe is in the ice chest in the second secret room, and the chest opens only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court.\""

msgid "对守衣人说，要拿寒於宝衣去斩鬼"
msgstr "Told the robe's keeper you'd take Hanyu's Robe to slay the ghost"

msgid "你说：交给安妮儿。瑷伦的脸冷了下来，却不拦：拿得走就拿。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」。"
msgstr "You say: to give to Anni'er. Ailun's face goes cold, but she doesn't stop you: take it if you can. The robe is in the ice chest in the second secret room, and the chest opens only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court.\""

msgid "对守衣人说，要把寒於宝衣交给安妮儿"
msgstr "Told the robe's keeper you'd give Hanyu's Robe to Anni'er"

msgid "你说：不知道。瑷伦说，不知道比胡说一个好。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」。"
msgstr "You say: you don't know. Ailun says not knowing beats making something up. The robe is in the ice chest in the second secret room, and the chest opens only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court.\""

msgid "对守衣人说，还不知道拿寒於宝衣做什么"
msgstr "Told the robe's keeper you didn't know yet what to do with Hanyu's Robe"

msgid "宝衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」：女子自己跳，男子请内厅的筱薇或禁闭房的芳绫替跳。第二密室从内厅穿堂南边的花门进，或在第一密室跳「有凤来仪」。"
msgstr "The robe is in the ice chest in the second secret room, and the chest opens only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court\": a woman dances it herself; a man asks Xiaowei in the inner hall or Fangling in the confinement room to dance it for him. Reach the second secret room through the flower gate south of the inner hall's passage, or by dancing \"The Phoenix Comes to Court\" in the first secret room."

msgid "冰匣开了。一件月白的衣落在地上，寒气扑面。"
msgstr "The ice chest opens. A moon-white robe falls to the floor, and cold hits your face."

msgid "宝衣到手。交回瑷伦守到决战；交给安妮儿，或者带着它走出晚月庄的大门——宝衣一离开瑷伦，庄就没了护佑，当夜会出事：东方神教派来的杀手会摸进前厅，见人就动手——要打一场；打不过，退出前厅，她不追。"
msgstr "The robe is yours. Give it back to Ailun to keep until the final battle; give it to Anni'er; or walk out of Latemoon Manor's gate with it. Once the robe leaves Ailun, the manor loses its protection and something will happen that night: a killer sent by the Golden Crow Order will slip into the front hall and go for anyone there—you'll have to fight; if you can't win, back out of the front hall and she won't follow."

msgid "你把宝衣交给了安妮儿。她说：月神族守了几百年，守给我的。你配得上——东方神教记得你。"
msgstr "You give the robe to Anni'er. She says: \"The Moon God clan kept it for centuries—kept it for me. You're worthy. The Golden Crow Order will remember you.\""

msgid "把寒於宝衣交给了东方神教的安妮儿"
msgstr "Gave Hanyu's Robe to Anni'er of the Golden Crow Order"

msgid "你把宝衣交回瑷伦。她披上它：我守到决战那日。到时候你来叫我，我跟你下湖底。"
msgstr "You give the robe back to Ailun. She puts it on: \"I'll keep it until the day of the battle. When it comes, call me, and I'll go down to the lake bed with you.\""

msgid "把寒於宝衣留给了守衣人瑷伦"
msgstr "Left Hanyu's Robe with its keeper, Ailun"

msgid "你带着宝衣走出了晚月庄的大门。庄失去了护佑。"
msgstr "You walk out of Latemoon Manor's gate with the robe. The manor has lost its protection."

msgid "带走了寒於宝衣"
msgstr "Took Hanyu's Robe away"

msgid "人证"
msgstr "The Witness"

msgid "兵部的印是真的，令不是先帝的。要动兵部的人，须有人在堂上说。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War's seal is real; the decree isn't the late Emperor's. To move against the Ministry's men, someone has to speak up in court."

msgid "把寻剑令的真相递到了乔阴县的公堂上"
msgstr "Brought the truth of the Sword Decree before the court of Tallshade County"

msgid "带着逆灵宫那叠盖兵部印的文书去乔阴县衙，击门口的大皮鼓。没带文书，侍卫不开门——文书还躺在逆灵宫的账房。"
msgstr "Take the Black Palace's stack of papers with the Ministry of War's seal to Tallshade's Magistrate's Court and beat the big hide drum at the gate. Without the papers, the guard won't open up—the papers are still lying in the Black Palace's Counting Room."

msgid "带刀侍卫从内院出来：是你击鼓申冤吗？——衙门的大门开了。"
msgstr "An armed guard comes out of the inner yard: \"Was it you who beat the drum for justice?\" The gates of the yamen open."

msgid "进大堂，把兵部文书给县官程不平看。"
msgstr "Go into the court hall and show the Ministry of War's papers to the magistrate, Cheng Buping."

msgid "程不平看得出文书是真的，可要动兵部的人，须有人证——印是谁盖的，人去了哪，得有人在堂上说。他指了一个人：福林酒楼里日日发呆、丢了箱子的武官，姓陈。"
msgstr "Cheng Buping can see the papers are genuine, but to move against the Ministry's men he needs a witness—whose hand stamped the seal and where the people went, someone has to say it in court. He points you to a man: the officer named Chen who sits staring into space in Fulin Tavern every day, the one who lost his chest."

msgid "福林酒楼里丢了箱子的武官姓陈。给他看兵部的印。"
msgstr "The officer in Fulin Tavern who lost his chest is named Chen. Show him the Ministry of War's seal."

msgid "陈显祖见了兵部的印脸色就变：他是二十年前老松岭那队白衣武官里的逃兵。当年念给全队听的寻剑令抄本一直藏在他的桃木箱里——箱子丢在树王坟的树洞里。"
msgstr "Chen Xianzu goes pale at the sight of the Ministry's seal: he deserted from that troop of Officers in White on Old Pine Ridge twenty years ago. The copy of the Sword Decree read out to the whole troop has been hidden in his peachwood chest ever since—and the chest is lost in the hollow tree at the Tree King's Tomb."

msgid "寻剑令的抄本在陈显祖的桃木箱里。箱子在树王坟的树洞里——洞里不干净。箱子已经还了他的，问他要抄本。"
msgstr "The copy of the Sword Decree is in Chen Xianzu's peachwood chest. The chest is in the hollow tree at the Tree King's Tomb—and the hollow isn't clean. You've given him back his chest; ask him for the copy."

msgid "寻剑令的抄本到手：「寻剑，不得扰民一户」，一句。底下是当年全队的名字。"
msgstr "The copy of the Sword Decree is yours: \"Seek the sword, and trouble not one household\"—one line. Below it, the names of the whole troop."

msgid "县衙的带刀侍卫是槐阳王的人。问他兵部的令。"
msgstr "The yamen's armed guard is the Prince of Huaiyang's man. Ask him about the Ministry's order."

msgid "槐阳王也收到过兵部「征三千民夫修官道寻剑」的令。老王爷拒了。"
msgstr "The Prince of Huaiyang got the Ministry of War's order too: \"Raise three thousand laborers to build an official road and seek the sword.\" The old prince refused."

msgid "护送陈显祖进衙门作证（问他「作证」），或放他带箱子走（「走吧」）。"
msgstr "Escort Chen Xianzu into the yamen to testify (ask him to \"Testify\"), or let him go with his chest (\"Off You Go\")."

msgid "你把陈显祖护送进了乔阴县衙。福林大街上庾家的人动了手——他活着站上了公堂。"
msgstr "You escort Chen Xianzu into Tallshade's yamen. The Yu family's men strike on Fulin Street—and he makes it to the court alive."

msgid "护送陈显祖上了乔阴县的公堂"
msgstr "Escorted Chen Xianzu into the court of Tallshade County"

msgid "你放陈显祖带着箱子走了。抄本和文书留在你手里。"
msgstr "You let Chen Xianzu go with his chest. The copy and the papers stay with you."

msgid "放陈显祖带着箱子走了"
msgstr "Let Chen Xianzu go with his chest"

msgid "堂审。带着抄本和兵部文书回大堂见程不平。"
msgstr "The hearing. Take the copy and the Ministry of War's papers back to the court hall and see Cheng Buping."

msgid "程不平录了供，写信给叔父槐阳王：假印和失踪的人都往关北去了。兵部的海捕文书也到了县衙——说你是逆灵宫的同党。程不平压着，压不了几天；文书往雪亭去了，你住的那家客栈。"
msgstr "Cheng Buping takes down the testimony and writes to his uncle, the Prince of Huaiyang: the false seal and the missing people have all gone Beyond the Pass. A Ministry of War warrant for your arrest has reached the yamen too—it says you're in league with the Black Palace. Cheng Buping is sitting on it, but can't for long; the warrant has gone on to Snow Pavilion, to the inn where you stay."

msgid "假印和失踪的人都往关北去了。先在天驼关把印的事问清楚，再出关去槐阳城，把程不平的信递给槐阳王；然后借兵踏平工地，或者带郭承夜里潜进去。卢卡说他们那边也传说一个找头的鬼。"
msgstr "The false seal and the missing people have all gone Beyond the Pass. First get the truth about the seal at Camelback Pass, then go out through the pass to Huaiyang and give Cheng Buping's letter to the Prince of Huaiyang. Then borrow his soldiers and flatten the work site, or take Guo Cheng and slip in by night. Luca says his people have a tale too, of a ghost looking for its head."

msgid "在关北救出了兵部工地上的民夫"
msgstr "Saved the laborers at the Ministry of War's work site Beyond the Pass"

msgid "带着程不平的信去天驼关军营，给镇国大将军严廷殷看（军营要大队长的名册）。"
msgstr "Take Cheng Buping's letter to the camp at Camelback Pass and show it to the Guardian General, Yan Tingyin (the camp wants you on a captain's roll)."

msgid "严廷殷看了信：兵部的印是真的，令不是先帝的——这话他不敢说。他的印丢过一回，找回来了；那三天的事，军师比他清楚。"
msgstr "Yan Tingyin reads the letter. The Ministry's seal is real, the decree isn't the late Emperor's—that he won't dare say. His own seal went missing once and turned up again; his adviser knows more than he does about those three days."

msgid "程不平的信在你身上"
msgstr "You have Cheng Buping's letter"

msgid "信丢了的话，回乔阴县衙问程不平「兵部文书」，他会再写一封"
msgstr "If you lose the letter, go back to Tallshade's yamen and ask Cheng Buping about \"War Ministry Papers\"; he'll write another"

msgid "军师赫造基知道印的事。他卖秘密——八两银子。"
msgstr "The adviser, He Zaoji, knows about the seal. He sells secrets—eight taels of silver."

msgid "赫造基收了八两银子：真印丢的那几天他拓了模子，卖了一份给兵部来的人。留着的那一份印模，他给了你。"
msgstr "He Zaoji takes the eight taels. In the days the real seal was missing, he took a mold of it and sold one copy to a man from the Ministry of War. The mold he kept, he gives to you."

msgid "拿印模比一比兵部文书上的印（印模的「比印」）。真印泛黄光，假的没上朱。"
msgstr "Compare the seal mold with the seal on the Ministry of War's papers (the mold's \"Compare Seals\"). The real seal shines yellow; the fake took no vermilion."

msgid "印模上的朱砂正红、泛黄光；兵部文书上那方「镇国大将军」印暗红发黑。字口一笔不差，只差一个颜色：兵部的文书是真的，镇国大将军的印是照模子浇的，令是兵部添的。"
msgstr "The cinnabar on the mold is true red with a yellow sheen; the \"Guardian General\" seal on the Ministry's papers is a dark red going black. Every stroke matches; only the color is wrong. The Ministry's papers are genuine, the Guardian General's seal was cast from the mold, and the order was the Ministry's own addition."

msgid "出关：天驼关谷地东壁的关门。有信、名册上有你、留五两过路钱，或者打过去。"
msgstr "Out through the pass: the pass gate in the east wall of the Camelback Pass valley. Have the letter, be on the roll, leave five taels' toll, or fight your way through."

msgid "关门兵放了行。门后的军道绕过骆驼东峰往北折。"
msgstr "The gate soldiers let you through. Beyond the gate the military road winds round the East Camel Peak and turns north."

msgid "顺着军道往北，出了山就是关北。"
msgstr "Follow the military road north; out of the mountains is Beyond the Pass."

msgid "黄土变成了草。路边一方青石界碑：「关北封国界」。往北，一座土黄的城墙横在草地尽头——槐阳城。"
msgstr "The yellow earth turns to grass. By the road stands a bluestone boundary marker: \"Frontier of the Beyond-the-Pass Fief.\" To the north, a yellow earth wall stretches across the end of the grassland—Huaiyang."

msgid "进槐阳城。城门旁有一张王府的告示，看看。"
msgstr "Go into Huaiyang. There's a notice from the prince's house beside the gate; read it."

msgid "王府的告示：「兵部征夫令，本府不奉。有持兵部文书到关北拿人者，以盗论。」告示上的印色正红——和逆灵宫那叠文书上的不一样。"
msgstr "The prince's notice: \"This House refuses the Ministry of War's levy of laborers. Anyone who comes Beyond the Pass with Ministry papers to seize people will be treated as a robber.\" The seal on the notice is true red—not like the one on the Black Palace's stack of papers."

msgid "王府在大街北头。门军认程不平的信；把信递给槐阳王程朔。"
msgstr "The prince's house is at the north end of the main street. The gate soldiers know Cheng Buping's letter; give it to the Prince of Huaiyang, Cheng Shuo."

msgid "程朔读了信：兵部的印是真的，令不是先帝的——他早说了。失踪的人在草原东边兵部的工地上挖一座古冢，挖不动的让道士的车接走。两条路：借他的兵踏平，或者让郭承带你夜里进去。"
msgstr "Cheng Shuo reads the letter. The Ministry's seal is real, the decree isn't the late Emperor's—he said so long ago. The missing people are digging out an ancient barrow at the Ministry of War's work site east of the grassland, and those who can't dig anymore are taken off in the Daoists' cart. Two ways: borrow his soldiers and flatten it, or let Guo Cheng take you in by night."

msgid "借槐阳王的兵踏平工地（问程朔「借兵」：救下所有人，但兵部会说关北反了），或带骁将郭承夜里潜入（在校场问郭承「潜入」：救一半，王府干净）。"
msgstr "Borrow the Prince of Huaiyang's soldiers and flatten the work site (ask Cheng Shuo to \"Borrow Soldiers\": everyone saved, but the Ministry will say Beyond the Pass has rebelled), or slip in by night with the captain Guo Cheng (ask Guo Cheng on the drill ground to \"Slip In\": half saved, the prince's house stays clean)."

msgid "你借了槐阳王的兵。程朔：「踏平了，兵部的文书第二天就到京师：槐阳王反了。」郭承领六骑听你的。"
msgstr "You borrow the Prince of Huaiyang's soldiers. Cheng Shuo: \"Flatten it, and the Ministry's report reaches the Capital the next day: the Prince of Huaiyang has rebelled.\" Guo Cheng and six riders take your orders."

msgid "借了槐阳王的兵，要踏平兵部的工地"
msgstr "Borrowed the Prince of Huaiyang's soldiers to flatten the Ministry of War's work site"

msgid "你和郭承约好了夜里潜入工地。「救得几个算几个，救不完的别回头。王府不知道这件事。」"
msgstr "You and Guo Cheng agree to slip into the work site by night. \"Save as many as we can. The ones we can't, don't look back. The prince's house knows nothing about this.\""

msgid "和王府骁将郭承约好夜里潜入工地"
msgstr "Agreed with the prince's captain, Guo Cheng, to slip into the work site by night"

msgid "去草原东边兵部的工地（出马市东门，过帐篷营地和草原）。借了兵的，郭承跟着你，白天就去；约好潜入的，先在营地的篝火边等到天黑。"
msgstr "Go to the Ministry of War's work site east of the grassland (out the east gate of the Horse Market, past the tent camp and across the grassland). If you borrowed the soldiers, Guo Cheng comes with you and you go by day; if you agreed to slip in, first wait by the campfire in the camp until dark."

msgid "草原东边的工地：一道木栅栏，三顶帐篷，两溜民夫棚，土堆得像小山。白衣的武官守着门，监工吕隼拿着名册。"
msgstr "The work site east of the grassland: a wooden stockade, three tents, two rows of laborers' sheds, and earth heaped up like little hills. Officers in white guard the gate; the overseer, Lu Sun, holds the roll."

msgid "踏平工地：打倒白衣武官、队长裴照和监工吕隼，打开民夫棚前的枷锁。"
msgstr "Flatten the work site: knock down the Officers in White, their captain Pei Zhao and the overseer Lu Sun, and open the shackles in front of the laborers' sheds."

msgid "王府的六骑冲进了工地。白衣武官倒了，裴照倒了，吕隼趴在他的名册上。你打开了八副枷锁，八个民夫回营地去了；古冢口的道士丢下车跑了。兵部的文书明天就到京师：槐阳王反了。"
msgstr "The prince's six riders charge into the work site. The Officers in White go down, Pei Zhao goes down, Lu Sun sprawls across his roll. You open eight sets of shackles, and eight laborers head back to the camp; the Daoists at the mouth of the barrow leave their cart and run. The Ministry's report reaches the Capital tomorrow: the Prince of Huaiyang has rebelled."

msgid "夜里跟着郭承潜进工地，到民夫棚解枷。救得几个算几个，救不完的别回头。"
msgstr "Slip into the work site by night with Guo Cheng and free the laborers in the sheds. Save as many as you can; the ones you can't, don't look back."

msgid "夜里的工地只有两个守夜的。你和郭承解开了四副枷锁——王石头、刘拐子、巴图、胡阿大跑了；第四副铁销响了，守夜的武官扑上来。打完，郭承说：走。另外四个人的名字，你在名册上见过：老魏、周二牛、陈满仓、马三。"
msgstr "At night the work site has only two watchmen. You and Guo Cheng get four sets of shackles open—Wang Shitou, Liu the Lame, Batu and Hu Ada get away; the fourth pin clanks, and the officer on watch comes at you. When it's over, Guo Cheng says: go. The other four names you saw on the roll: Old Wei, Zhou Erniu, Chen Mancang, Ma San."

msgid "回马市问大秦剑手卢卡「会首」——他们那边也传说一个找自己脑袋的鬼。"
msgstr "Go back to the Horse Market and ask the Daqin swordsman Luca about his \"Guild Head\"—his people have a tale too, of a ghost looking for its own head."

msgid "卢卡说他的会首安敦在番坊，番坊的人知道那个鬼的事。番坊在海边：从玉螺湖村出忘情谷，走海崖道。"
msgstr "Luca says his Guild Head, Andun, is in the Foreign Quarter, and the people there know about that ghost. The Foreign Quarter is by the sea: from Jade Conch Village go out through Forgetting Valley and take the Sea Cliff Road."

msgid "卢卡说他的会首安敦在番坊，会首的祖上三百年前见过那个鬼的头是怎么封的。番坊在海边：从玉螺湖村出忘情谷，顺着小路往南，走海崖道下去。"
msgstr "Luca says his Guild Head, Andun, is in the Foreign Quarter; three hundred years ago the Guild Head's forefather saw how that ghost's head was sealed. The Foreign Quarter is by the sea: from Jade Conch Village go out through Forgetting Valley, follow the path south, and take the Sea Cliff Road down."

msgid "从拜火祠取回了三百年前老兵刻下封法的铜牒"
msgstr "Brought back from the Fire Shrine the copper tablet where an old soldier carved the sealing three hundred years ago"

msgid "去番坊找大秦人的会首安敦——卢卡说他们知道鬼的头在哪。出忘情谷，顺着小路往南，走海崖道。"
msgstr "Go to the Foreign Quarter and find Andun, Guild Head of the Daqin people—Luca says they know where the ghost's head is. Out through Forgetting Valley, south along the path, then the Sea Cliff Road."

msgid "林子到头，崖下第一次看见了海。海崖道顺着崖往南下去，崖脚是番坊的码头。"
msgstr "The woods end, and for the first time you see the sea below the cliffs. The Sea Cliff Road runs south down the cliff; at its foot are the docks of the Foreign Quarter."

msgid "找大秦人的会首安敦——市集北头，门口立着两面大盾的铁盾会，院子北头会首的屋。"
msgstr "Find Andun, Guild Head of the Daqin people—at the north end of the market, the Iron Shield Guild with two great shields at its gate; the Guild Head's house is at the north end of the yard."

msgid "铁盾会的会首安敦见了你：他的祖上三百年前替皇叔於兰淳焉打过北方的蛮族，其中一个老兵见过那个鬼的头是怎么封的。"
msgstr "Andun, head of the Iron Shield Guild, sees you. Three hundred years ago his forefathers fought the northern barbarians for the Imperial Uncle Yulan Chunyan, and one old soldier among them saw how that ghost's head was sealed."

msgid "安敦的祖上把看见的刻在一片铜牒上，传到了他手里——问他「铜牒」。"
msgstr "Andun's forefather carved what he saw on a copper tablet, and it came down to Andun—ask him about the \"Copper Tablet.\""

msgid "铜牒存在拜火祠的火前，三十年了。祠规「火前不说谎」：取牒要过一场问话，三句。大秦人自己过不了——三十年前他们为了这块地在火前说过一句谎。"
msgstr "The copper tablet has stood before the fire in the Fire Shrine for thirty years. The shrine's rule is \"No lies before the fire\": to take the tablet you must get through a questioning, three questions. The Daqin people can't pass it themselves—thirty years ago they told one lie before the fire for this land."

msgid "市舶司要清走大秦人，鬼笠馆的浪人想要他们的地。站大秦人（问安敦「站大秦人」：拜火祠过问话取牒，再替他们挡住冯禄），还是站浪人（去日陀罗寺南墙小门外的鬼笠馆，问早川「站浪人」，过他一刀，让浪人替你偷牒——浪人会作证，市舶司就把大秦人清出番坊）？"
msgstr "The Maritime Trade Office wants the Daqin people cleared out, and the ronin of Ghost Hat Hall want their land. Side with the Daqin people (ask Andun to \"Side with the Daqin\": pass the questioning at the Fire Shrine for the tablet, then stand off Feng Lu for them), or side with the ronin (go to Ghost Hat Hall outside the little gate in Ritola Temple's south wall, ask Hayakawa to \"Side with the Ronin,\" survive one stroke of his blade, and the ronin steal the tablet for you—they'll testify, and the Maritime Trade Office will clear the Daqin people out of the Foreign Quarter)?"

msgid "你站了大秦人。安敦：「三句真话，牒是你的。读了，再还我们一个人情：冯禄来的时候，站在门口。」"
msgstr "You side with the Daqin people. Andun: \"Three true answers, and the tablet is yours. Once you've read it, do us one favor back: when Feng Lu comes, stand at the gate.\""

msgid "在番坊站到了大秦人一边"
msgstr "Sided with the Daqin people in the Foreign Quarter"

msgid "你站了浪人。早川只说了一句：「要铜牒？过我一刀。」"
msgstr "You side with the ronin. Hayakawa says only: \"You want the copper tablet? Get past one stroke of my blade.\""

msgid "在番坊站到了浪人一边"
msgstr "Sided with the ronin in the Foreign Quarter"

msgid "拜火祠（市集东头的黑石房子）：站到火前，答穆护三句真话，取铜牒。问的是你自己做过的事——撒一句谎，火蹿起来，当天不再问。"
msgstr "The Fire Shrine (the black stone house at the east end of the market): stand before the fire, give the Magus three true answers, and take the copper tablet. The questions are about things you've done—tell one lie and the fire leaps up, and there are no more questions that day."

msgid "火静了。穆护从火坛底下取出铜牒，放在你手里——还是温的。「火前拿的，谁也不能说你偷。」"
msgstr "The fire goes still. The Magus takes the copper tablet from under the fire altar and puts it in your hands—it's still warm. \"Taken before the fire. No one can say you stole it.\""

msgid "回铁盾会：冯禄带着他雇的四个浪人到了院门口。站到门口去，对质那纸文书——有印模的，按在印旁边对一对印色；没有的，只能动手。"
msgstr "Back to the Iron Shield Guild: Feng Lu has come to the gate with four ronin he hired. Stand at the gate and challenge that paper—if you have the seal mold, hold it beside the seal and compare the color; if not, it can only come to blows."

msgid "冯禄退走了。大秦人留下了，安敦说：「你欠我们的人情，我们记着；我们欠你的，也记着。」"
msgstr "Feng Lu backs off. The Daqin people stay, and Andun says: \"The favor you owe us, we'll remember. The one we owe you, we'll remember too.\""

msgid "鬼笠馆（日陀罗寺南墙的小门外，坡道底下）：找馆主早川直义，过他一刀——一击之内定生死。"
msgstr "Ghost Hat Hall (outside the little gate in Ritola Temple's south wall, at the foot of the slope): find its master, Hayakawa Naoyoshi, and survive one stroke of his blade—life or death in a single blow."

msgid "早川收刀入鞘：「过了。今夜，拜火祠——火坛前站着，别出声。」"
msgstr "Hayakawa sheathes his blade. \"You passed. Tonight, the Fire Shrine—stand before the fire altar, and keep quiet.\""

msgid "等到天黑（鬼笠馆的板地能歇到天黑），去拜火祠的火坛前站着，别出声。浪人替你偷牒。"
msgstr "Wait until dark (you can rest on Ghost Hat Hall's plank floor until nightfall), then go stand before the Fire Shrine's altar and keep quiet. The ronin will steal the tablet for you."

msgid "黑影把铜牒塞进你手里，走了。祠里传出祭司的骂声。第二天，冯禄的文书有了浪人作证——铁盾会空了，安敦被押上了船，卢卡剩在码头上。"
msgstr "A shadow presses the copper tablet into your hands and is gone. Curses ring out from the priest inside the shrine. The next day Feng Lu's paper has the ronin's testimony—the Iron Shield Guild stands empty, Andun is marched onto a ship, and Luca is left on the docks."

msgid "读铜牒——三百年前的老兵刻下的，那个鬼的头是怎么封的。"
msgstr "Read the copper tablet—carved three hundred years ago by an old soldier: how that ghost's head was sealed."

msgid "「头在湖底冰下，以穿灵为钉；钉在，鬼不得全；钉拔，鬼成形；要灭它，三器齐；要再封，须有人留下。」——三百年前的老兵刻的。那把剑是钉子。"
msgstr "\"The head lies under the ice at the bottom of the lake, with Spiritpiercer for its nail. While the nail holds, the ghost cannot be whole; pull the nail, and the ghost takes shape. To destroy it, bring the three together; to seal it again, someone must stay behind.\"—carved three hundred years ago by an old soldier. That sword is the nail."

msgid "湖底封物"
msgstr "What's Sealed Under the Lake"

msgid "铜牒说：头在湖底冰下，以穿灵为钉。那把剑钉着鬼的头——在玉螺湖底。渔夫说湖里不太平，别碰那把剑。"
msgstr "The copper tablet says: the head lies under the ice at the bottom of the lake, with Spiritpiercer for its nail. That sword pins the ghost's head—at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake. The fisherman says the lake isn't safe, and to leave that sword alone."

msgid "下到玉螺湖底，看清了三百年的封物"
msgstr "Went down to the bottom of Jade Conch Lake and saw what has been sealed there for three hundred years"

msgid "回玉螺湖村，下湖底，看清封物。别拔那把剑。"
msgstr "Go back to Jade Conch Village, go down to the bottom of the lake and see what's sealed there. Don't pull that sword."

msgid "你到了湖底。从湖心潜下来的，身后的入口结上了冰；从忘情谷下冰阶来的，一下阶就是冰龙的厅。"
msgstr "You're at the bottom of the lake. If you dived from the middle of the lake, the way in behind you has iced over; if you came down the ice steps from Forgetting Valley, the dragons' hall is right at the foot of the steps."

msgid "玄冰上站不住人。顶住寒气，穿过冰龙的厅——它们是守者，不先动手就不打。"
msgstr "No one can stand on the black ice. Bear the cold and cross the hall of the ice dragons—they are guardians, and won't fight unless you start it."

msgid "六条白鳞冰龙抬头看了你一眼，又盘了回去。"
msgstr "Six white-scaled ice dragons raise their heads, look at you, and coil back down."

msgid "冰龙厅的水潭底下透着白光。潜下去。"
msgstr "White light glows up from the pool in the ice dragons' hall. Dive in."

msgid "潭底的黑石台阶下是一间冰室：黑石封坛，冰里的头，钉着它的剑，柱里的人。"
msgstr "Below the black stone steps at the bottom of the pool is a chamber of ice: a sealing altar of black stone, a head in the ice, the sword that pins it, and someone inside a pillar."

msgid "看清封物：冰里的头、钉着它的剑、冰柱里的人。听她说——把铜牒念给冰柱里的人听。"
msgstr "See what's sealed: the head in the ice, the sword that pins it, the woman in the ice pillar. Hear her out—read the copper tablet to the woman in the pillar."

msgid "璃虹：钉拔，它成形，先回这附近的村子；要灭它，三器齐——穿灵、旋芒、宝衣；要再封，须有人留下。"
msgstr "Lihong: pull the nail and it takes shape, and goes first to the village near here. To destroy it, bring the three together—Spiritpiercer, Whirling Edge and the robe. To seal it again, someone must stay behind."

msgid "商玦劝你拔剑。拔，剑到手、鬼醒；不拔，带着封法去京师和岚城，终章再回来。"
msgstr "Shang Jue urges you to pull the sword. Pull it, and the sword is yours and the ghost wakes; leave it, and take the sealing to the Capital and the Wind City, and come back for the last chapter."

msgid "你拔出了穿灵。冰里的头睁开了眼，璃虹从冰里跌了出来，商玦笑着散成了黑烟。上岸——天黑之前。"
msgstr "You pull out Spiritpiercer. The head in the ice opens its eyes, Lihong tumbles out of the ice, and Shang Jue laughs and breaks up into black smoke. Get ashore—before dark."

msgid "在玉螺湖底拔出了穿灵"
msgstr "Pulled Spiritpiercer out at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake"

msgid "你没有动那把剑。璃虹给了你一片她的羽：再封的时候，放回坛上。"
msgstr "You leave the sword where it is. Lihong gives you one of her feathers: when it's sealed again, put it back on the altar."

msgid "在玉螺湖底看清了封物，没有动它"
msgstr "Saw what's sealed at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake, and left it alone"

msgid "天黑了。鬼卒从湖里上来——守住村子：湖畔、村口、稻田边。（湖畔的木船边能等到天黑。）"
msgstr "Night has fallen. Ghost soldiers come up out of the lake—hold the village: the lakeside, the village gate, the edge of the paddies. (You can wait for dark by the wooden boat on the lakeside.)"

msgid "天亮了。村子烧了一半，渔夫死在岸边，璃虹在田老财家的东房里躺着。钉没了，它每一夜都在长。"
msgstr "Day breaks. Half the village is burned, the fisherman lies dead on the shore, and Lihong is lying in the east room of Landlord Tian's house. The nail is gone, and every night it grows."

msgid "原令"
msgstr "The Original Decree"

msgid "璃虹说三器齐才灭得了它：穿灵、旋芒、宝衣。旋芒在岚城，岚城寻风而至——先帝找了它一辈子，寻剑的档案和那道寻剑令的原本都在皇城。去京师。"
msgstr "Lihong says only the three together can destroy it: Spiritpiercer, Whirling Edge and the robe. Whirling Edge is in the Wind City, and the Wind City comes on the wind—the late Emperor searched for it all his life, and the sword-search records and the original of the Sword Decree are all in the Palace City. Go to the Capital."

msgid "拿到了寻剑令的原本"
msgstr "Got the original of the Sword Decree"

msgid "进皇城。三条路：校武场的武举、相国府的公文，或者尚书府里有人知道的一条暗路。"
msgstr "Get into the Palace City. Three ways: the military examination on the Drill Ground, papers from the Chancellor's House, or a hidden way someone in the Minister's Mansion knows."

msgid "校武场三场全胜，殿试授了御前侍卫腰牌。退朝时福安凑过来：皇上说，今夜养心殿。"
msgstr "You win all three bouts on the Drill Ground, and at the palace examination you're given an Imperial Guard's waist token. As court lets out, Fu'an sidles up: His Majesty says, tonight, the Hall of Mental Cultivation."

msgid "在京师校武场中了武状元"
msgstr "Took first place in the military examination on the Capital's Drill Ground"

msgid "你随韦相国上了早朝。庾子建当殿驳了奏本，皇上「容朕想想」。退朝时福安追出来：皇上请相国的随员到养心殿说话。"
msgstr "You go to the morning court with Chancellor Wei. Yu Zijian rebuts the memorial right there in the hall, and His Majesty says, \"Let Us think on it.\" As court lets out, Fu'an hurries after you: His Majesty asks the Chancellor's attendant to come to the Hall of Mental Cultivation for a word."

msgid "随韦相国上了早朝"
msgstr "Went to the morning court with Chancellor Wei"

msgid "你从冷宫的井里爬了上来。"
msgstr "You climb up out of the well in the Cold Palace."

msgid "从冷宫的枯井潜进了皇城"
msgstr "Slipped into the Palace City through the dry well in the Cold Palace"

msgid "见皇帝：福安说，养心殿。"
msgstr "See the Emperor: Fu'an says, the Hall of Mental Cultivation."

msgid "养心殿里，十六岁的皇帝说：御书房里有父皇的匣子。"
msgstr "In the Hall of Mental Cultivation, the sixteen-year-old Emperor says: in the Imperial Study is my father's box."

msgid "御书房：把先帝的原令和兵部的抄本放在一起。"
msgstr "The Imperial Study: put the late Emperor's original decree beside the Ministry of War's copy."

msgid "原令只一句：寻剑，不得扰民一户。抄本上多出来的三句，是拿着假印的人加的。皇帝给了你一页樵夫的旧记载：风停处即是城。"
msgstr "The original has one line: Seek the sword, and trouble not one household. The three extra lines on the copy were added by whoever had the false seal. The Emperor gives you a page of an old woodcutter's account: Where the wind stops, there is the city."

msgid "怎么办：在养心殿朝上揭发（要原令加两样人证物证，关北踏平了工地的要三样）、去尚书府私了，或请皇上先解皇叔的通缉。"
msgstr "What now: denounce it at court from the Hall of Mental Cultivation (it takes the original and two more witnesses or proofs; three if you flattened the work site Beyond the Pass), settle it privately at the Minister's Mansion, or ask His Majesty first to lift the warrant on the Imperial Uncle."

msgid "太和殿上，原令和抄本并排摊开。庾子建拔了刀，冯策站在你身边。他下了狱。"
msgstr "In the Hall of Supreme Harmony, the original and the copy are laid out side by side. Yu Zijian draws a blade, and Feng Ce stands at your side. Yu goes to prison."

msgid "在太和殿上揭发了兵部尚书庾子建"
msgstr "Exposed the Minister of War, Yu Zijian, in the Hall of Supreme Harmony"

msgid "原令进了庾子建的火盆。你换来了先帝推敲遗书的手稿。他留在朝上。"
msgstr "The original goes into Yu Zijian's brazier. In return you get the late Emperor's drafts of his last testament. He stays at court."

msgid "把先帝的原令交给了庾子建"
msgstr "Gave the late Emperor's original decree to Yu Zijian"

msgid "皇帝亲笔写了手诏，东二门的布告撤了。手诏要送到水烟阁。"
msgstr "The Emperor writes an edict in his own hand, and the notice at the Second East Gate comes down. The edict must be taken to Waterfog Pavilion."

msgid "请皇帝撤了皇叔於兰天武的通缉"
msgstr "Asked the Emperor to lift the warrant on the Imperial Uncle, Yulan Tianwu"

msgid "把手诏送到水烟阁，交给皇叔於兰天武。"
msgstr "Take the edict to Waterfog Pavilion and give it to the Imperial Uncle, Yulan Tianwu."

msgid "於兰天武读了手诏，把传功使交给萧辟尘，回京了。"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu reads the edict, hands the post of Teaching Envoy to Xiao Bichen, and goes back to the Capital."

msgid "樵夫说：风停处即是城。岚城寻风而至，寻风而逝——天驼关石林里那面镜子后头，有一条原作没修完的路。"
msgstr "The woodcutter says: Where the wind stops, there is the city. The Wind City comes on the wind and goes with the wind—behind that mirror in the stone forest at Camelback Pass there is a road its maker never finished."

msgid "找到了岚城"
msgstr "Found the Wind City"

msgid "读懂风，找到岚城。天驼关石林那面镜子里，上道通到哪里？"
msgstr "Learn to read the wind and find the Wind City. In the mirror in the stone forest at Camelback Pass, where does the upper road lead?"

msgid "风停了。"
msgstr "The wind stops."

msgid "白石街尽头的风铃阁。"
msgstr "The Wind Chime Pavilion at the end of White Stone Street."

msgid "风铃阁里，十口大铃，有的响，有的不响。"
msgstr "In the Wind Chime Pavilion hang ten great bells; some ring, some don't."

msgid "见岚翁，问他旋芒。"
msgstr "See the Wind Elder and ask him about Whirling Edge."

msgid "岚翁：剑在云台。他不卖，不赏，只问谁拔。"
msgstr "The Wind Elder: the sword is on the Cloud Terrace. He won't sell it and won't give it as a reward; he only asks who will draw it."

msgid "云台：谁拔旋芒——你自己（十铃里要响六口，先接岚翁的接风三刃）、皇叔（要他已经入朝）、萧辟尘（要带着他的风铃）。"
msgstr "The Cloud Terrace: who draws Whirling Edge—you yourself (six of the ten bells must ring, and first take the Wind Elder's three welcoming blades), the Imperial Uncle (he must already have gone back to court), or Xiao Bichen (he must have his wind chime with him)."

msgid "风散了，剑落进你手里。岚翁说：十口铃里有人信你，剑就认你。"
msgstr "The wind breaks up, and the sword drops into your hand. The Wind Elder says: if anyone among the ten bells trusts you, the sword will accept you."

msgid "在岚城的云台上拔了旋芒"
msgstr "Drew Whirling Edge on the Wind City's Cloud Terrace"

msgid "风把於兰天武送上云台。三百年前於兰家拔错了一把剑，这一把，他拔了。"
msgstr "The wind carries Yulan Tianwu up to the Cloud Terrace. Three hundred years ago the Yulan family drew the wrong sword. This one, he draws."

msgid "在岚城的云台上，看着旋芒落进皇叔於兰天武手里"
msgstr "On the Wind City's Cloud Terrace, watched Whirling Edge fall into the hand of the Imperial Uncle, Yulan Tianwu"

msgid "铃挂回了萧家的钩上，风把萧辟尘送回了家。剑落进他手里。"
msgstr "The bell is hung back on the Xiao family's hook, and the wind carries Xiao Bichen home. The sword drops into his hand."

msgid "在岚城的云台上，看着旋芒落进萧辟尘手里"
msgstr "On the Wind City's Cloud Terrace, watched Whirling Edge fall into Xiao Bichen's hand"

msgid "回到湖底"
msgstr "Back to the Lake Bed"

msgid "穿灵、旋芒、宝衣。三器凑没凑齐，湖底那颗头都在等。拔钉，斩鬼，或者再封它。"
msgstr "Spiritpiercer, Whirling Edge, the robe. Whether or not the three are together, the head at the bottom of the lake is waiting. Pull the nail and slay the ghost—or seal it again."

msgid "从玉螺湖底回到了雪亭镇，听了宣诏"
msgstr "Came back to Snow Pavilion from the bottom of Jade Conch Lake and heard the edict read"

msgid "回到湖底。拔钉，斩鬼，或者再封它。"
msgstr "Go back to the bottom of the lake. Pull the nail and slay the ghost—or seal it again."

msgid "湖面平得像一块铁，结着一层黑冰。冰底下的光一下一下地暗下去。"
msgstr "The lake lies flat as a sheet of iron under a skin of black ice. The light beneath the ice dims, pulse by pulse."

msgid "点将：三器在谁手里，来了几拨人。备好了，在湖畔「等到天黑」。"
msgstr "Call your people: who holds the three, and how many have come. When you're ready, \"Wait Until Dark\" on the lakeside."

msgid "你在岸边等到了天黑。"
msgstr "You wait on the shore until dark."

msgid "穿灵在你手里"
msgstr "Spiritpiercer is in your hands"

msgid "穿灵钉在封坛上"
msgstr "Spiritpiercer is nailed into the sealing altar"

msgid "旋芒在你手里"
msgstr "Whirling Edge is in your hands"

msgid "交给了庾子建"
msgstr "Given to Yu Zijian"

msgid "旋芒在皇叔手里，他在岸边"
msgstr "Whirling Edge is in the Imperial Uncle's hands; he's on the shore"

msgid "旋芒在萧辟尘手里，他在岸边"
msgstr "Whirling Edge is in Xiao Bichen's hands; he's on the shore"

msgid "宝衣在你身上"
msgstr "You're wearing the robe"

msgid "带上它，下湖前穿上"
msgstr "Bring it, and put it on before you go into the lake"

msgid "宝衣在瑷伦身上"
msgstr "Ailun is wearing the robe"

msgid "她在晚月庄东厢等你去叫（问她「湖底」）"
msgstr "She's waiting in the east wing of Latemoon Manor for you to call her (ask her about \"The Lakebed\")"

msgid "宝衣在安妮儿身上，她在岸边"
msgstr "Anni'er is wearing the robe; she's on the shore"

msgid "帮手"
msgstr "Helpers"

msgid "野羊寨（霍铮）守村口"
msgstr "Goathill Stockade (Huo Zheng) holds the village gate"

msgid "关北的骑兵（郭承）守湖畔"
msgstr "The riders from Beyond the Pass (Guo Cheng) hold the lakeside"

msgid "铁盾会的盾守稻田边"
msgstr "The Iron Shield Guild's shields hold the edge of the paddies"

msgid "冰龙没有动过，在冰龙厅"
msgstr "The ice dragons have never been fought; they're in the ice dragons' hall"

msgid "大内侍卫营（冯策）随你下湖"
msgstr "The Palace Guard (Feng Ce) go down into the lake with you"

msgid "东方神教（安妮儿）守潭口"
msgstr "The Golden Crow Order (Anni'er) holds the mouth of the pool"

msgid "水烟阁（南危水）守潭口"
msgstr "Waterfog Pavilion (Nan Weishui) holds the mouth of the pool"

msgid "水烟阁（卫沧澜）守潭口"
msgstr "Waterfog Pavilion (Wei Canglan) holds the mouth of the pool"

msgid "水烟阁（潘军禅）守潭口"
msgstr "Waterfog Pavilion (Pan Junchan) holds the mouth of the pool"

msgid "封山（柳淳风）守渡口"
msgstr "Empty Mountain (Liu Chunfeng) holds the ferry"

msgid "北宗（柳绘心）守渡口"
msgstr "The North Branch (Liu Huixin) holds the ferry"

msgid "晚月庄（蓝止萍）守岸"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor (Lan Zhiping) holds the shore"

msgid "晚月庄（老妇母女）守岸"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor (the old woman and her daughter) hold the shore"

msgid "铁卫营（严廷殷）守官道"
msgstr "The Iron Guard (Yan Tingyin) hold the official road"

msgid "茅山（林忌）截住了北麓下湖的路"
msgstr "Mount Mao (Lin Ji) has cut off the way down to the lake from the North Foot"

msgid "岸上：庾子建来要剑"
msgstr "On the shore: Yu Zijian has come for the sword"

msgid "三器都在，帮手也够：能灭它"
msgstr "All three are here and there are helpers enough: it can be destroyed"

msgid "这一回只能再封"
msgstr "This time it can only be sealed again"

msgid "天黑了，鬼卒爬上了岸。没人守的地方你自己守；划到湖心，潜下去。"
msgstr "Night has fallen, and ghost soldiers crawl up onto the shore. Wherever no one stands guard, you guard it yourself; row out to the middle of the lake and dive."

msgid "你潜下了湖。岸上的人替你守着。"
msgstr "You dive into the lake. The people on the shore hold it for you."

msgid "冰龙厅：商玦在水潭边等你。"
msgstr "The ice dragons' hall: Shang Jue is waiting for you by the pool."

msgid "商玦倒在冰龙厅的水潭边。"
msgstr "Shang Jue falls by the pool in the ice dragons' hall."

msgid "水潭底下就是封坛。潜下去。"
msgstr "The sealing altar is at the bottom of the pool. Dive."

msgid "你回到了湖底。坛心的冰里，那颗头睁着眼。"
msgstr "You're back at the bottom of the lake. In the ice at the heart of the altar, the head has its eyes open."

msgid "封坛：侮天鬼。（钉还钉着的，先拔出穿灵；拔过了的，到坛心「迎上去」。）"
msgstr "The sealing altar: the Heaven-Defier. (If the nail still holds, pull Spiritpiercer out first; if it's already been pulled, go to the heart of the altar and \"Meet It.\")"

msgid "侮天鬼散成一团黑焰，退回了那颗头底下。"
msgstr "The Heaven-Defier breaks up into a mass of black flame and draws back under the head."

msgid "最后一下：三器齐、人够，可以钉下去灭了它——宝衣会烧掉；也可以把穿灵交给一个肯留下的人，再封。"
msgstr "The last stroke: with all three and people enough, you can drive the nail home and destroy it—the robe will burn; or you can hand Spiritpiercer to someone willing to stay behind, and seal it again."

msgid "旋芒斩它，宝衣挡它的黑焰，穿灵钉它的头。侮天鬼灭了，宝衣烧成了灰。"
msgstr "Whirling Edge cuts it down, the robe holds off its black flame, and Spiritpiercer nails its head. The Heaven-Defier is destroyed, and the robe burns to ash."

msgid "在玉螺湖底灭了侮天鬼"
msgstr "Destroyed the Heaven-Defier at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake"

msgid "瑷伦把穿灵钉回那颗头上，留在了冰里。侮天鬼再封了。"
msgstr "Ailun drives Spiritpiercer back into the head and stays in the ice. The Heaven-Defier is sealed again."

msgid "在玉螺湖底再封了侮天鬼，瑷伦留在了冰里"
msgstr "Sealed the Heaven-Defier again at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake; Ailun stayed in the ice"

msgid "璃虹把穿灵钉回那颗头上，留在了冰里。侮天鬼再封了。"
msgstr "Lihong drives Spiritpiercer back into the head and stays in the ice. The Heaven-Defier is sealed again."

msgid "在玉螺湖底再封了侮天鬼，璃虹留在了冰里"
msgstr "Sealed the Heaven-Defier again at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake; Lihong stayed in the ice"

msgid "南危水把穿灵钉回那颗头上，留在了冰里。侮天鬼再封了。"
msgstr "Nan Weishui drives Spiritpiercer back into the head and stays in the ice. The Heaven-Defier is sealed again."

msgid "在玉螺湖底再封了侮天鬼，南危水留在了冰里"
msgstr "Sealed the Heaven-Defier again at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake; Nan Weishui stayed in the ice"

msgid "萧辟尘把穿灵钉回那颗头上，留在了冰里。侮天鬼再封了。"
msgstr "Xiao Bichen drives Spiritpiercer back into the head and stays in the ice. The Heaven-Defier is sealed again."

msgid "在玉螺湖底再封了侮天鬼，萧辟尘留在了冰里"
msgstr "Sealed the Heaven-Defier again at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake; Xiao Bichen stayed in the ice"

msgid "你把穿灵钉回那颗头上，自己留在了冰里。"
msgstr "You drive Spiritpiercer back into the head, and stay in the ice yourself."

msgid "在玉螺湖底再封了侮天鬼，自己留在了冰里"
msgstr "Sealed the Heaven-Defier again at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake, and stayed in the ice yourself"

msgid "回雪亭镇。广场上，那队白衣武官又来了。"
msgstr "Go back to Snow Pavilion. In the square, that troop of Officers in White has come again."

msgid "雪亭镇的广场上，宣了诏。"
msgstr "In the square of Snow Pavilion, the edict is read."

msgid "淳风武馆的门房换了个年轻人。刘安禄在野羊山上当他的二寨主，逢年过节下山喝一回酒。"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall has a young man on the gate now. Liu Anlu is second chief up on Goathill, and comes down for a drink at the New Year and the festivals."

msgid "淳风武馆的门房还是那张桌子。刘安禄的事，镇上没人再提。"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall's gatehouse still has the same table. No one in town talks about Liu Anlu anymore."

msgid "淳风武馆的门房空了一冬。刘安禄走的那天没有人送，柳淳风在门里站了很久。"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall's gatehouse stood empty all winter. No one saw Liu Anlu off the day he left; Liu Chunfeng stood inside the gate a long time."

msgid "淳风武馆的门房还是那张桌子。刘安禄的来历，武馆里只有三个人知道。"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall's gatehouse still has the same table. Only three people in the hall know where Liu Anlu came from."

msgid "淳风武馆照旧每天卯时开门，「剑不外传」四个字还挂在正厅。绮云镇口多了一块「北宗」的木牌，柳淳风从没去看过，也从没叫人摘。"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall still opens its doors at dawn every day, and \"The sword is not taught to outsiders\" still hangs in the main hall. At the edge of Cloudweave Town there is a new wooden sign, \"North Branch.\" Liu Chunfeng has never gone to look at it, and never had it taken down."

msgid "淳风武馆的内院开了一道侧门，镇上的孩子从那里进出。柳淳风书房朝着内院的那扇窗，一冬天都没有关。"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall has opened a side gate into its inner yard, and the town's children come and go through it. The window of Liu Chunfeng's study that faces the inner yard stayed open all winter."

msgid "开春，你回了一趟山里，在老岑的坟前把信末那一行念给他听：风停处，替我再看一眼。——看过了。"
msgstr "In spring you go back up into the mountains and, at Old Cen's grave, read him the last line of his letter: Where the wind stops, take one more look for me.—I have."

msgid "广场上的人散了。卖馄饨的说，那天的官爷，跟三年前来的是同一拨。"
msgstr "The crowd in the square breaks up. The wonton seller says the officials that day were the same lot that came three years ago."

msgid "振远的绮云分局照旧走镖。陈天星那本总账烧了，二十年前那笔抚恤银，振远没有人再提。"
msgstr "The Far-Road Escorts' Cloudweave branch still runs escorts. Chen Tianxing's ledger was burned, and no one at the Far-Road Escorts mentions the compensation silver from twenty years ago anymore."

msgid "振远的绮云分局关了门。陈剑秋天天坐在柜台后面，不接镖，也不走。"
msgstr "The Far-Road Escorts' Cloudweave branch has shut its doors. Chen Jianqiu sits behind the counter every day, taking no escorts and not leaving."

msgid "瀑布后的山洞里，那座无名的坟前多了一块碑，碑上没有字。"
msgstr "In the cave behind the waterfall, there's a stone now before the nameless grave. It bears no words."

msgid "瀑布后的山洞空了。那块腰牌后来回到了水烟阁，挂在葬剑亭里。"
msgstr "The cave behind the waterfall is empty. The waist token went back to Waterfog Pavilion in the end, and hangs in the Sword Tomb Pavilion."

msgid "老松寨的寨门还在，买路钱一年比一年收得少。"
msgstr "Old Pine Stockade's gate still stands, and the toll it takes gets smaller every year."

msgid "五长老的椅子空着，说是等一个回不来的人。正月十七还没到，阁里没人提虹台。"
msgstr "The Fifth Elder's chair stands empty, waiting, they say, for a man who can't come back. The seventeenth of the first month hasn't come yet, and no one in the Pavilion speaks of the Rainbow Terrace."

msgid "卫沧澜回来了，坐在正厅侧的矮凳上，不肯坐那把太师椅。没有人再提「代盟主」三个字；正月十七的虹台，九派要上去推选。"
msgstr "Wei Canglan has come back. He sits on a low stool at the side of the main hall and won't take the great armchair. No one speaks of an \"acting Alliance Leader\" anymore; on the seventeenth of the first month, the nine schools will go up to the Rainbow Terrace to choose."

msgid "南危水说，正月十七他要上虹台，只说一句：老松岭的那个人，替我死了。"
msgstr "Nan Weishui says that on the seventeenth of the first month he will go up to the Rainbow Terrace and say just one thing: the man on Old Pine Ridge died in my place."

msgid "七长老颜违以代盟主自居。他说正月十七一过，「代」字就该去掉了，二十年的旧案，到此为止。"
msgstr "The Seventh Elder, Yan Wei, calls himself acting Alliance Leader. Once the seventeenth of the first month is past, he says, the \"acting\" should go, and the twenty-year-old case ends here."

msgid "传功使的位置空着。弟子们说，萧师父回城里去了。"
msgstr "The Teaching Envoy's seat stands empty. The disciples say Shifu Xiao has gone back to the city."

msgid "东厢的门关着。庄里的人说，守衣人去守另一件东西了。"
msgstr "The door of the east wing is shut. The people of the manor say the robe's keeper has gone to keep something else."

msgid "瑷伦回了东厢，宝衣挂在墙上。她说，几百年了，该歇一歇。"
msgstr "Ailun has gone back to the east wing, and the robe hangs on the wall. After centuries, she says, it's time for a rest."

msgid "瑷伦回了东厢，墙上挂衣的钉子空着。她说，衣裳烧了，守衣人也该歇了。"
msgstr "Ailun has gone back to the east wing, and the peg where the robe hung is empty. The robe has burned, she says; its keeper can rest too."

msgid "安妮儿把宝衣带回了东方神教。神教的香案上，多了一盏长明灯。"
msgstr "Anni'er took the robe back to the Golden Crow Order. On the Order's incense table there is a new everlasting lamp."

msgid "安妮儿把宝衣带回了晚月庄的西厢。西厢的门一直关着——神教的事，她不再过问。"
msgstr "Anni'er took the robe back to the west wing of Latemoon Manor. The west wing's door stays shut—she no longer has a say in the Order's affairs."

msgid "安妮儿回了东方神教，带回去的是一捧灰。神教的香案上，多了一只小瓷坛、一盏长明灯。"
msgstr "Anni'er went back to the Golden Crow Order carrying a handful of ash. On the Order's incense table there is a new little porcelain jar, and an everlasting lamp."

msgid "安妮儿带回西厢的是一捧灰。西厢的门一直关着，窗下多了一只小瓷坛。"
msgstr "What Anni'er carried back to the west wing was a handful of ash. The west wing's door stays shut, and under its window there is a new little porcelain jar."

msgid "安妮儿收回了教主令。西厢的灯从此夜夜亮着，神教的人进进出出；朱鸿雪派出去的差事，只剩该死的人。"
msgstr "Anni'er took back the Order Leader's token. From then on the lamp in the west wing burns every night, and the Order's people come and go; of the jobs Zhu Hongxue sends out, only the ones on people who deserve to die are left."

msgid "庄里少了一件东西，多了一个故事。池边的人说，护庄的光，那年暗了一暗。"
msgstr "The manor is short one thing and has one more story. The people by the pool say the light that guards the manor dimmed a little that year."

msgid "宝衣出过一回庄，又被人送了回来。池边的人说，护庄的光，那年暗了一暗，又亮了。"
msgstr "The robe left the manor once, and someone brought it back. The people by the pool say the light that guards the manor dimmed a little that year, then shone again."

msgid "后院书房那幅湘绣图前，又有人在学沧海龙吟了。"
msgstr "In the back-garden study, someone is learning the Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea again in front of the Xiang embroidery."

msgid "内书房的老妇再没有开过口。蓝止萍说，庄规是庄规；那一年起，晚月庄的门关得比从前早。"
msgstr "The old woman in the inner study never spoke again. Lan Zhiping says the manor's rules are the manor's rules; from that year on, Latemoon Manor shut its gates earlier than before."

msgid "内书房里多了一个人，不再蒙面。庄里的人说，每天傍晚，老妇擦她的鞭子，她女儿擦她的剑。"
msgstr "There is one more person in the inner study now, no longer masked. The people of the manor say that every evening the old woman cleans her whip, and her daughter cleans her sword."

msgid "野羊寨的旗子又插回了山顶。霍铮说，逆灵宫的黑砖，拆下来正好砌寨墙。"
msgstr "Goathill Stockade's flag flies on the summit again. The Black Palace's black bricks, Huo Zheng says, are just right for the stockade wall."

msgid "黄霸还在土地庙里收他的供。北麓的黑砖道观，没人敢上去看一眼。"
msgstr "Huang Ba still collects his tribute in the Earth God Shrine. No one dares go up and take a look at the black-brick abbey on the North Foot."

msgid "有人说在北边的雪里见过商玦：一身黑衣结着霜，说话还像念经。"
msgstr "Someone says they saw Shang Jue in the snow up north: frost on his black robe, still talking like he's chanting scripture."

msgid "灵心观藏经楼的二楼，镇教秘籍还是六函，第七函的位置空着。林忌说，茅山宁可没有那一函。"
msgstr "On the second floor of Clear Heart Abbey's Scripture Library, the abbey's treasured manuals still fill only six cases; the place of the seventh stands empty. Lin Ji says Mount Mao would rather do without that one."

msgid "京师尚书府的花园里，那个老花匠又在浇他的花。庾清尘去哪里，他就跟到哪里。"
msgstr "In the garden of the Minister's Mansion in the Capital, the old gardener is watering his flowers again. Wherever Yu Qingchen goes, he follows."

msgid "藏经楼二楼的第七函回来了。花匠在书架边搭了一张竹床，夜里点着灯，教山上的小道士认北麓的字。"
msgstr "The seventh case has come back to the second floor of the Scripture Library. The gardener has set up a bamboo bed by the shelves, and at night, by lamplight, he teaches the young Daoists of the mountain to read the North Foot's script."

msgid "北麓下来的孩子在灵心观后山开了一片地。花匠一页一页念给他们听：烧了一辈子的香，坛上写的原来是这些。"
msgstr "The children who came down from the North Foot have cleared a patch of ground on the hill behind Clear Heart Abbey. The gardener reads to them page by page: a whole life of burning incense, and this is what was written on the altar."

msgid "日照山的流云轩里，多了一个独眼的头陀。被鬼卒抓伤的人抬上山来，他一掌按下去，寒气冒成一缕白烟。"
msgstr "At Drifting Cloud Lodge on Sunlit Mountain there's a one-eyed wandering monk now. When people clawed by ghost soldiers are carried up the mountain, he presses down with one palm, and the cold rises off them in a wisp of white smoke."

msgid "头陀在流云轩教人婆萝蜜多心经。玄智说，西来的经和本寺的经放在一个经柜里，没有打架。"
msgstr "The wandering monk teaches the Heart Sutra at Drifting Cloud Lodge. Xuanzhi says the sutra from the west and the temple's own sit in the same cabinet, and they haven't come to blows."

msgid "日照山金门外，那块地方空了。山烟寺还是三百年前的山烟寺：外人不进流云轩，外来的经，也不进。"
msgstr "Outside the Golden Gate on Sunlit Mountain, that spot stands empty. Mountain Mist Temple is still the Mountain Mist Temple of three hundred years ago: no outsider enters Drifting Cloud Lodge, and no outside sutra either."

msgid "被鬼卒抓伤的人抬上山来，玄智守着，三天三夜。有的救回来了，有的没有。"
msgstr "When people clawed by ghost soldiers are carried up the mountain, Xuanzhi sits with them three days and three nights. Some he brings back; some he doesn't."

msgid "乔阴的老葛每年秋天挑一担柴上日照山，放在金门边上，说是还那一掌的情。"
msgstr "Every autumn Old Ge of Tallshade carries a load of firewood up Sunlit Mountain and leaves it by the Golden Gate—to repay that palm, he says."

msgid "乔阴的老葛用左手砍柴，砍得慢。逢人就说：命是山烟寺的方丈守回来的。"
msgstr "Old Ge of Tallshade chops wood left-handed now, and slowly. He tells everyone he meets: the abbot of Mountain Mist Temple sat up and kept my life for me."

msgid "那一夜，茅山的人截在北麓下湖的路上。黑砖道观里再没人提起那个新来的道士——只有门房记得，他戴冠的样子不太像。"
msgstr "That night, Mount Mao's people blocked the way down to the lake from the North Foot. In the black-brick abbey no one ever mentioned the new Daoist again—only the gatekeeper remembers that he didn't quite wear his cap right."

msgid "冰龙厅里那第一剑，是从商玦背后来的。活着回到北麓的道士说，刺他的人戴着宫里的冠。"
msgstr "That first blade in the ice dragons' hall came from behind Shang Jue. The Daoists who made it back to the North Foot say the one who stabbed him wore a Palace cap."

msgid "北麓的道士还在找一个戴过黑冠的人。他们说他是茅山的眼线；茅山说，没这回事。"
msgstr "The Daoists of the North Foot are still looking for someone who once wore a black cap. They say he was Mount Mao's spy; Mount Mao says no such thing."

msgid "程不平对着一本黑皮的名册，把上面的押印一个一个对了出来。槐阳城外有几户人家，收到了县衙的一封信。"
msgstr "Cheng Buping went down a black-bound roll and matched its marks one by one. A few households outside Huaiyang got a letter from the yamen."

msgid "程不平的卷宗送上了京城。陈显祖回了乡，桃木箱里只剩一件旧官服。"
msgstr "Cheng Buping's case file went up to the Capital. Chen Xianzu went home to his village; nothing is left in the peachwood chest but an old official's robe."

msgid "陈显祖带着他的箱子走了，没人知道去了哪里。福林酒楼的说书人，把这件事编成了一段新书。"
msgstr "Chen Xianzu went off with his chest, and no one knows where. The storyteller at Fulin Tavern has made a new tale of it."

msgid "县衙门口的大皮鼓，又有人敢去敲了。"
msgstr "Someone dares to beat the big hide drum at the yamen gate again."

msgid "福林大街的巷子口站着一个官差，叫花子从他跟前过，点个头。真龙头坐在街当中，数着酒囊上的结。"
msgstr "A constable stands at the mouth of the alley off Fulin Street, and the beggars nod to him as they pass. The true Dragon Head sits in the middle of the street, counting the knots on his wineskin."

msgid "乔阴的巷子里还是没有官差。陆得财腰里那只皮酒囊，二十三个结。"
msgstr "There are still no constables in Tallshade's alleys. The leather wineskin at Lu Decai's waist has twenty-three knots."

msgid "乔阴县衙的公案上，又摊开了庾子建的卷宗：小屋那封信，天驼关那本账。京城没有回话，程不平也没有收卷。"
msgstr "Yu Zijian's case file lies open again on the bench of Tallshade's yamen: the letter from the little house, the ledger from Camelback Pass. The Capital has not replied, and Cheng Buping has not closed the file."

msgid "乔阴县衙的卷宗里，压着骆建章的一张供状：兵部抄本上多出来的三句，是谁口述的。"
msgstr "In the files of Tallshade's yamen lies a statement from Luo Jianzhang: who dictated the three extra lines on the Ministry of War's copy."

msgid "曼雩台上多了一张书案。骆建章给弟弟抄谱，骆云舟在台边练剑；兄弟俩还是不怎么说话。"
msgstr "There's a writing desk on the Rain Dance Terrace now. Luo Jianzhang copies sword manuals for his brother while Luo Yunzhou practices at the terrace's edge; the brothers still don't talk much."

msgid "曼雩台上还是骆云舟一个人。他说，大哥的字比他的剑直。"
msgstr "On the Rain Dance Terrace it's still just Luo Yunzhou. His elder brother's writing, he says, is straighter than his sword."

msgid "天驼关的关门照旧，出关留五两。官道上再没有人卖路引；严廷殷换了一个不会茅山术的军师。"
msgstr "The gate at Camelback Pass is as it was: five taels to go through. No one sells travel passes on the official road anymore; Yan Tingyin has taken an adviser who knows no Mount Mao tricks."

msgid "天驼关的关门抬着，过关不要钱。严廷殷回了京城，再没回来；将军营帐里坐着李信，案上压着一本账的抄本。"
msgstr "The gate at Camelback Pass stands raised, and going through costs nothing. Yan Tingyin went back to the Capital and never came back; Li Xin sits in the general's tent, a copy of a ledger under his hand on the desk."

msgid "京城的诏书到了槐阳：槐阳王不反。城门上那张「槐阳反」的告示，郭承亲手撕了。"
msgstr "An edict from the Capital reached Huaiyang: the Prince of Huaiyang has not rebelled. Guo Cheng tore down the \"Huaiyang Rebels\" notice on the city gate with his own hands."

msgid "槐阳城门上那张告示还贴着：槐阳反。程朔说，随他们说。"
msgstr "The notice on Huaiyang's gate is still up: Huaiyang Rebels. Let them say it, says Cheng Shuo."

msgid "槐阳王府照旧不问兵部的事。草原上没救出来的四个人，后来有两个自己走了回来。"
msgstr "The Prince of Huaiyang's house still keeps out of the Ministry of War's business. Of the four left behind on the grassland, two later walked home on their own."

msgid "铁盾会的院子里又练起了盾。卢卡说，等他攒够了钱，要回海那边去看一看。"
msgstr "The Iron Shield Guild's yard rings with shield drill again. Once he's saved up enough, Luca says, he'll go back across the sea to have a look."

msgid "铁盾会的院子空了。鬼笠馆的浪人占了那块地，早川直义从此不再出刀。"
msgstr "The Iron Shield Guild's yard is empty. The ronin of Ghost Hat Hall have taken the land, and Hayakawa Naoyoshi never draws his blade again."

msgid "拜火祠的火，一年到头没有灭过。"
msgstr "The fire in the Fire Shrine never goes out, all year round."

msgid "傅家坡的草顶重新铺过了。渔夫的网挂在他家门口，没有人去收。"
msgstr "The thatch on Fu Family Slope has been laid again. The fisherman's net hangs at his door, and no one takes it in."

msgid "玉螺湖的渔夫照旧撒网。湖底那盏灯，再没有人见过。"
msgstr "The fishermen of Jade Conch Lake still cast their nets. No one has seen that lamp on the lake bed again."

msgid "石头长高了一截，天天往湖边跑。"
msgstr "Shitou has grown a head taller and runs down to the lake every day."

msgid "庾子建在天牢里过了冬。少年皇帝第一次在早朝上，说了一整句话。"
msgstr "Yu Zijian spent the winter in the Heavenly Prison. For the first time, the boy Emperor spoke a whole sentence at morning court."

msgid "京城里都说，是兵部尚书带回了那把剑。皇帝在早朝上，一句话也没有说。"
msgstr "All the Capital says it was the Minister of War who brought back the sword. The Emperor said not one word at morning court."

msgid "庾子建还在兵部。他派人去过一回玉螺湖，回来的人说，湖面上什么也没有。"
msgstr "Yu Zijian is still at the Ministry of War. He sent someone to Jade Conch Lake once; the man came back and said there was nothing on the lake."

msgid "於兰天武回了朝，把旋芒挂在养心殿的墙上，对少年皇帝说：剑是用来记事的。"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu went back to court, hung Whirling Edge on the wall of the Hall of Mental Cultivation, and told the boy Emperor: a sword is for remembering."

msgid "於兰天武回了朝，站在少年皇帝身后。"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu went back to court and stands behind the boy Emperor."

msgid "骆建章流放关北。出城那天，他替押解的差人写了一封家书，最后一笔没有甩出格子。"
msgstr "Luo Jianzhang was exiled Beyond the Pass. The day he left the city, he wrote a letter home for the men escorting him, and his last stroke stayed inside the box."

msgid "朝上那天，骆建章的供状和原令摆在一处。西街骆家五代的门匾，后来是骆云舟自己摘的。"
msgstr "The day of the court, Luo Jianzhang's statement lay beside the original decree. The plaque over the gate of the Luo family on West Street, five generations old, Luo Yunzhou later took down himself."

msgid "骆建章的供状进了刑部的案底，乔阴县衙也有一份；庾子建还在兵部。西街骆家的大门，从此没有官家的人来敲。"
msgstr "Luo Jianzhang's statement went into the Ministry of Justice's files, and Tallshade's yamen has a copy; Yu Zijian is still at the Ministry of War. No official ever knocks at the Luo family's gate on West Street again."

msgid "骆建章那张供状，韦相国一直收在袖子里；庾子建还在兵部。西街骆家的大门，从此没有官家的人来敲。"
msgstr "Chancellor Wei has kept Luo Jianzhang's statement up his sleeve all along; Yu Zijian is still at the Ministry of War. No official ever knocks at the Luo family's gate on West Street again."

msgid "玉螺湖底"
msgstr "The Bottom of Jade Conch Lake"

msgid "冰下封坛一片空。三百年的冰化了一半，水是清的。冰龙还在，只是不再抬头。"
msgstr "The sealing altar under the ice is empty. Half of three hundred years' ice has melted, and the water is clear. The ice dragons are still there; they just don't raise their heads anymore."

msgid "冰下封坛的冰柱里，瑷伦披着宝衣站着，眼睛睁着。三百年后，会有人来叫醒她。"
msgstr "In the ice pillar at the sealing altar, Ailun stands wrapped in the robe, eyes open. In three hundred years, someone will come to wake her."

msgid "冰下封坛的冰柱里，璃虹的光又亮了。她说过：第一个带着铜来的，是你。"
msgstr "In the ice pillar at the sealing altar, Lihong's light shines again. She said it once: the first to come with the copper was you."

msgid "冰下封坛的冰柱里，南危水手按剑柄，像还在等什么人。"
msgstr "In the ice pillar at the sealing altar, Nan Weishui stands with his hand on his sword hilt, as if still waiting for someone."

msgid "冰下封坛的冰柱里，萧辟尘握着旋芒。岚城的风，每年会吹到湖面上一回。"
msgstr "In the ice pillar at the sealing altar, Xiao Bichen holds Whirling Edge. Once a year, the wind of the Wind City blows across the lake."

msgid "冰下封坛的冰柱里，站着一个年轻人。没有人知道他的名字。"
msgstr "In the ice pillar at the sealing altar stands a young man. No one knows his name."

msgid "店小二擦着桌子：「小哥您有所不知——前几天有个人从湖那边回来，说湖水清得能看见底。我说，那是人家的功劳，那碗茶不收钱。」"
msgstr "The waiter wipes down a table. \"You wouldn't know, young sir—a few days back a man came back from the lake way and said the water's so clear you can see the bottom. I said, that's somebody's doing. That cup of tea's on the house.\""

msgid "店小二擦着桌子：「小哥您有所不知——前几天有个人从湖那边回来，说湖底冰里站着一个人。我说，那是替咱们守着的，逢年过节，要给他留一碗酒。」"
msgstr "The waiter wipes down a table. \"You wouldn't know, young sir—a few days back a man came back from the lake way and said there's someone standing in the ice down at the bottom. I said, he's keeping watch for the rest of us. New Year and holidays, we pour him a bowl.\""

msgid "店小二擦着桌子：「前些日子有个客官从这儿走出去，就再没回来。楼上那间房，我一直给他留着。」"
msgstr "The waiter wipes down a table. \"A while back a guest walked out of here and never came back. That room upstairs—I'm keeping it for him.\""

msgid "终"
msgstr "The End"

msgid "那少年，留在了冰里。"
msgstr "That young man stayed in the ice."

msgid "以《东方故事 2》（Eastern Stories 2）为底。"
msgstr "Built on Eastern Stories 2 (东方故事 2)."

msgid "谢谢 ES2 的作者们，和 MUD 年代守着它的巫师们。"
msgstr "Thanks to the makers of ES2, and to the wizards who kept it going in the MUD years."

msgid "也谢谢你，走到了这里。"
msgstr "And thank you, for making it this far."

msgid "正月十七，九派过半，推你做了武林盟主。那天虹台上，你答了三件事。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, more than half of the nine schools named you Alliance Leader of the wulin. That day on the Rainbow Terrace, you answered three things."

msgid "正月十七，九派过半，颜违做了武林盟主。他说二十年的旧案，到此为止。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, more than half of the nine schools made Yan Wei Alliance Leader of the wulin. The twenty-year-old case, he said, ends here."

msgid "正月十七，颜违没能过半。卫沧澜走到石椅前，坐了回去。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, Yan Wei didn't get half. Wei Canglan walked up to the stone chair and sat back down in it."

msgid "正月十七，颜违没能过半，那把石椅还空着。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, Yan Wei didn't get half, and the stone chair is still empty."

msgid "那天一早，你在山道上截住了神教的杀手，山烟寺的轿子上了山。"
msgstr "Early that day, you cut off the Order's killer on the mountain road, and Mountain Mist Temple's sedan chair made it up the mountain."

msgid "那天一早，你回葬剑亭扑灭了逆灵宫余孽放的火。"
msgstr "Early that day, you went back to the Sword Tomb Pavilion and put out the fire set by the last of the Black Palace."

msgid "那天一早，你下山解了封山的围。"
msgstr "Early that day, you went down the mountain and broke the siege on Empty Mountain's people."

msgid "那天一早，你从山下的茶棚里请回了骆云舟。"
msgstr "Early that day, you brought Luo Yunzhou back from the tea shed at the foot of the mountain."

msgid "山烟寺的轿子在山道上让神教截了，玄智和尚没能上山。"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple's sedan chair was stopped by the Order on the mountain road, and the monk Xuanzhi never made it up."

msgid "葬剑亭的火烧了半个时辰，林忌提着剑一路追下了北麓。"
msgstr "The fire at the Sword Tomb Pavilion burned for half a double-hour, and Lin Ji chased all the way down to the North Foot, sword in hand."

msgid "封山的人在官道上让人堵到了天黑。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain's people were held up on the official road until dark."

msgid "骆云舟在山下的茶棚里，陪兵部的人喝了一整天的茶。"
msgstr "Luo Yunzhou spent the whole day drinking tea with the Ministry of War's men in the tea shed at the foot of the mountain."

msgid "旋芒供在了葬剑亭，用黄绫裹着，九派来往的人都看得见。"
msgstr "Whirling Edge rests in the Sword Tomb Pavilion, wrapped in yellow silk, where everyone of the nine schools who passes can see it."

msgid "你把旋芒还给了风。岚城云台的旋风里，它又转了起来。"
msgstr "You gave Whirling Edge back to the wind. In the whirlwind over the Wind City's Cloud Terrace, it spins again."

msgid "旋芒还在你身上。九派的人说起它，都说那是斩过湖底那颗头的剑。"
msgstr "You still carry Whirling Edge. When the nine schools speak of it, they all say it's the sword that cut down the head at the bottom of the lake."

msgid "那天一早，山下出了事，你没有下石阶。"
msgstr "Early that day there was trouble at the foot of the mountain, and you didn't go down the stone steps."

msgid "虹台上，陈剑秋当着九派说了一句「那本账烧了」，就再没有开口。"
msgstr "On the Rainbow Terrace, Chen Jianqiu said \"That ledger is burned\" before the nine schools, and said nothing more."

msgid "虹台上，陈剑秋坐在振远的旗下，没有提那本烧掉的账。"
msgstr "On the Rainbow Terrace, Chen Jianqiu sat under the Far-Road banner and didn't mention the burned ledger."

msgid "虹台上，陈剑秋替振远要了一个说法。他身后的绮云分局，门还关着。"
msgstr "On the Rainbow Terrace, Chen Jianqiu demanded an answer for the Far-Road Escorts. Behind him, the Cloudweave branch's door is still shut."

msgid "虹台上，陈剑秋坐在振远的旗下，没有提那本账。他身后的绮云分局，门还关着。"
msgstr "On the Rainbow Terrace, Chen Jianqiu sat under the Far-Road banner and didn't mention the ledger. Behind him, the Cloudweave branch's door is still shut."

msgid "虹台上，蓝止萍坐在晚月庄的旗下。神教的人在台下转了一圈，没有一个走近晚月庄那一席。"
msgstr "On the Rainbow Terrace, Lan Zhiping sat under Latemoon Manor's banner. The Order's people circled below the terrace once, and not one came near Latemoon Manor's seat."

msgid "虹台上，晚月庄的旗后面站着一个老妇人和她的女儿。九派里有人认得那把细剑，没有人说破。"
msgstr "On the Rainbow Terrace, behind Latemoon Manor's banner stood an old woman and her daughter. Some among the nine schools knew that slender sword; no one said so."

msgid "虹台上，花紫会的旗下坐着一个打二十三个结的老叫花子，一直看着台下官道上的官差。"
msgstr "On the Rainbow Terrace, under the Beggars' Guild's banner sat an old beggar with twenty-three knots, his eyes on the constables on the official road below."

msgid "虹台上，陆得财坐在花紫会的旗下抠着脚。腰里那只皮酒囊，多了一个结。"
msgstr "On the Rainbow Terrace, Lu Decai sat under the Beggars' Guild's banner picking at his feet. The leather wineskin at his waist has one more knot."

msgid "饮风客栈的店小二逢人便说：新盟主在小店住过，就住楼上那间。"
msgstr "The waiter at Drinkwind Inn tells everyone: the new Alliance Leader stayed at our little inn—in the room upstairs."

msgid "柳淳风说，盟主回来了，封山总算等到了这一天。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader is back, Liu Chunfeng says. Empty Mountain has finally lived to see the day."

msgid "北宗在虹台上有了一个座。柳淳风关了武馆的门，一天没有出来。"
msgstr "The North Branch has a seat on the Rainbow Terrace. Liu Chunfeng shut the hall's doors and didn't come out all day."

msgid "封山的人那天没能上山。柳淳风回来，只说了一句：明年再去。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain's people never made it up the mountain that day. When Liu Chunfeng came back, all he said was: we'll go next year."

msgid "北宗的人那天没能上山。柳淳风在武馆里听说了，一句话也没有说。"
msgstr "The North Branch never made it up the mountain that day. Liu Chunfeng heard about it in the hall and said not a word."

msgid "饮风客栈照旧开门。店小二说，正月十七那天，镇上的人都在等山上的消息。"
msgstr "Drinkwind Inn still opens its doors. On the seventeenth of the first month, the waiter says, the whole town was waiting for news from the mountain."

msgid "正厅的太师椅上，坐着颜违。山门的告示上写着：老松岭旧案，到此为止。"
msgstr "In the great armchair of the main hall sits Yan Wei. The notice at the mountain gate reads: The old case of Old Pine Ridge ends here."

msgid "正厅的太师椅上，坐着卫沧澜。二十年的空椅子，有了人。"
msgstr "In the great armchair of the main hall sits Wei Canglan. A chair empty for twenty years has someone in it."

msgid "正厅的太师椅空着。阁里的人说，那是盟主的椅子——盟主就是你，可你很少回来坐。"
msgstr "The great armchair of the main hall is empty. The people of the Pavilion say it's the Alliance Leader's chair—and the Alliance Leader is you, but you seldom come back to sit in it."

msgid "正厅的太师椅空着。颜违照旧代理，「代」字没能去掉。"
msgstr "The great armchair of the main hall is empty. Yan Wei is still acting, and the \"acting\" never came off."

msgid "正厅的太师椅空着，等一个回不来的人。"
msgstr "The great armchair of the main hall is empty, waiting for a man who can't come back."

msgid "老松岭的旧案重新翻了出来，水烟阁的人往京城去了几回。"
msgstr "The old case of Old Pine Ridge has been dug up again, and Waterfog Pavilion's people have gone to the Capital several times."

msgid "水烟阁同朝廷走近了。兵部来了人，在山门外喝了一回茶。"
msgstr "Waterfog Pavilion has drawn closer to the court. Men from the Ministry of War came and drank a cup of tea outside the mountain gate."

msgid "绮云镇 · 场院"
msgstr "Cloudweave Town · The Pleasure Yard"

msgid "九派逐了东方神教。棺材铺后面的场院关了门，朱鸿雪不知去向。"
msgstr "The nine schools drove out the Golden Crow Order. The Pleasure Yard behind the coffin shop has shut its gates, and no one knows where Zhu Hongxue has gone."

msgid "神教照旧在棺材铺后面的场院里派差事。九派说，只要不犯到他们头上。"
msgstr "The Order still hands out its jobs in the Pleasure Yard behind the coffin shop. As long as it doesn't come down on their heads, say the nine schools."

msgid "虹台上没有人提神教的事。朱鸿雪照旧派她的差事。"
msgstr "No one on the Rainbow Terrace mentioned the Order. Zhu Hongxue still hands out her jobs."

msgid "安妮儿闭了西厢的门。神教的事，她不再同人说起。"
msgstr "Anni'er has shut the west wing's door. She no longer speaks to anyone about the Order."

msgid "朱鸿雪记住了，那天山道上截住她的人的，是你。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue remembers: the one who cut her off on the mountain road that day was you."

msgid "北麓的道观空了，官兵封了山门。"
msgstr "The abbey on the North Foot is empty, and soldiers have sealed its gate."

msgid "下了山的道士在茅山的田里种地，坛上的火灭了。"
msgstr "The Daoists who came down the mountain farm Mount Mao's fields, and the fire on the altar is out."

msgid "九派的人上了北麓。道观里剩下的人，一个也没走脱。"
msgstr "The nine schools went up the North Foot. Of those left in the abbey, not one got away."

msgid "茅山的人上了北麓，把肯下山的领了回去。"
msgstr "Mount Mao's people went up the North Foot and led back those willing to come down."

msgid "官兵上了北麓，把道观里剩下的人领下了山。卫沧澜说，这一回欠朝廷的。"
msgstr "Soldiers went up the North Foot and led those left in the abbey down the mountain. This time, Wei Canglan says, we owe the court."

msgid "北麓的道观里，续灯的火一直没灭。"
msgstr "In the abbey on the North Foot, the lamp that's kept burning has never gone out."

msgid "林忌那天一路追到北麓，追回了两个放火的孩子。"
msgstr "That day Lin Ji chased all the way to the North Foot and brought back two children who had set the fire."

msgid "这是一把宝剑，隐含神秘力量。\n"
msgstr "This is a fine sword with some hidden, mysterious power in it.\n"

msgid "只有女生才可穿哦!你变态呀! \n"
msgstr "Only girls can wear this! What are you, some kind of pervert?\n"

msgid "这是一柄纤细的柳玉刀，轻薄短小。\n"
msgstr "This is a slender willow-jade saber, thin, light and short.\n"

msgid "这是一把用竹子作成的玉竹剑，手工细腻别致。\n"
msgstr "This is a jade-bamboo sword made of bamboo, finely and cleverly worked.\n"

msgid "这是一封用蜡密封起来的信件，上面有一奇怪的图案。\n"
msgstr "This is a letter sealed with wax, with a strange design on it.\n"

msgid "用火烧"
msgstr "Burn it"

msgid "你看见密函上出现几行字 : \n"
msgstr "You see several lines of writing appear on the letter:\n"

msgid "师父: \n      展信愉悦 \n    徒儿在晚月庄作客已有一阵子了!\n在这徒儿无意中发现晚月庄的秘密。\n一、原来晚月庄主是同性恋，她似乎在对男人失望之馀，\n    对比自己年轻的姑娘由恨转而成一种变相畸型的爱。\n二、在密室之中藏有一秘笈。以及庄内有一处有神奇宝物\n    玛瑙手镯。在另一神秘的地方有通往庄主秘密情人的\n    密室入口。\n三、在庄内小花池中有火神族的神像。小花池似乎有神奇\n    的力量在里头。\n"
msgstr "Shifu:\n      I hope this letter finds you well.\n    Your disciple has been a guest at Latemoon Manor for some time now!\nHere I have happened upon the manor's secrets.\n1. The Mistress of Latemoon Manor, it turns out, loves women. She seems to have lost\n    hope in men, and her hatred of them has turned into a twisted\n    sort of love for girls younger than herself.\n2. A secret manual is hidden in a secret room. Also, the manor holds a wondrous\n    treasure, an agate bracelet. And in another hidden place is the entrance to\n    a secret chamber where the Mistress keeps her secret lover.\n3. In the small flower pool inside the manor stands a statue of the Fire God clan.\n    The pool seems to hold some wondrous power.\n"

msgid "你身上没有火没法烧。\n"
msgstr "You have no fire to burn it with.\n"

msgid "一个黑木作的杀手令牌，上面刻著火焰的图腾标志。\n"
msgstr "An assassin's token of black wood, carved with the flame totem.\n"

msgid "这是一道香辣可口的佳肴。\n"
msgstr "This is a spicy, mouth-watering dish.\n"

msgid "这是一个手工细腻的水饺，看起来很好吃。\n"
msgstr "This is a finely made dumpling, and it looks delicious.\n"

msgid "这是一坛香味浓郁的陈年老酒，是存给待嫁女儿喝的酒。\n你闻了闻，好香好香哦!你有点想喝它\n"
msgstr "This is a jar of rich, aged wine, put away for a daughter to drink when she marries.\nYou sniff it. So fragrant, so fragrant! You feel a bit like drinking it\n"

msgid "这是一只看了都会流口水的、香喷喷的烤鸭。\n"
msgstr "This is a fragrant roast duck that would make anyone drool.\n"

msgid "这是一个可以生火的火摺"
msgstr "This is a tinder tube for lighting fires."

msgid "这是一串用宝石镶串成的闪亮耳环。\n"
msgstr "This is a string of shining earrings set with gems.\n"

msgid "这是一个用钻石镶成的美丽胸饰。\n"
msgstr "This is a lovely brooch set with diamonds.\n"

msgid "这是一条丝绸制的彩带，质感佳，上绣有彩霞江水纹。\n"
msgstr "This is a silk sash of fine feel, embroidered with a pattern of rosy clouds and river water.\n"

msgid "这卷罗巾由上等丝绸编成，绣了一幅幅美女图。个个体态轻盈，翩然\n起舞。每一曲舞步姿态美妙迷人，旁题著舞曲名称与步法。\n"
msgstr "This silk handkerchief is woven of the finest silk and embroidered with pictures of beauties, each one light of build and dancing gracefully. Every dance is shown in a wondrous, charming pose, and beside each is written the name of the dance and its steps.\n"

msgid "这是一块精致可口的小点心，似雪花般柔软。\n"
msgstr "This is a fine, tasty little cake, soft as snowflakes.\n"

msgid "这是一根玉竹，还有一些竹叶在上面。\n"
msgstr "This is a stalk of jade bamboo, with a few bamboo leaves still on it.\n"

msgid "一种上等铁做成的绣花针\n"
msgstr "An embroidery needle made of fine iron.\n"

msgid "一种铁做成的绣花针\n"
msgstr "An embroidery needle made of iron.\n"

msgid "才摘的桂花，发出阵阵淡淡的幽香。\n"
msgstr "Freshly picked osmanthus, giving off a faint, hidden fragrance.\n"

msgid "这是一朵金黄色的奇特花蕊，有一种淡淡香气。\n"
msgstr "This is a strange golden flower heart with a faint fragrance.\n"

msgid "这是一杯香味浓郁上等好茶。是招待贵宾品茗的。\n你闻了闻，好香好香哦!\n"
msgstr "This is a cup of rich, fine tea, served to honored guests to sip.\nYou sniff it. So fragrant, so fragrant!\n"

msgid "金轩茶"
msgstr "Golden Pavilion tea"

msgid "这是一个竹蜻蜓，手工相当细腻。\n"
msgstr "This is a bamboo dragonfly, quite finely made.\n"

msgid "一个由玛瑙作成的美丽手镯。\n再仔细玩看，似乎有其它作用。\n"
msgstr "A lovely bracelet made of agate.\nLook it over more carefully, and it seems to have some other use.\n"

msgid "祈祷"
msgstr "Pray"

msgid "你双手合掌，虔诚的祈祷。\n手上的镯子嗡嗡作响。 突然一阵烟雾.... \n"
msgstr "You press your palms together and pray with devotion.\nThe bracelet on your hand hums. Suddenly a cloud of smoke... \n"

msgid "这是一卷由上等丝绸编成，以湘绣作成的舞曲图。上有记载一些舞曲 \n每一曲都有它独特的风格与内涵。一幅幅玄天玉女翩然起舞，十分壮观。\n\n  曲目： \n \n  广陵散 \n  春宫怨 \n \n对你而言基本舞步你可以参悟，至于较高深步法似乎需人指导了。 \n"
msgstr "This is a scroll of fine silk, embroidered in Xiang style with dance pieces. It records several dances, \neach with its own style and meaning. Scene after scene shows the Jade Maiden of Dark Heaven dancing, a magnificent sight.\n\n  Pieces: \n \n  Song of Guangling \n  Spring Palace Lament \n \nYou can work out the basic steps for yourself; the higher steps seem to need someone to teach you. \n"

msgid "跳「春宫怨」"
msgstr "Dance \"Spring Palace Lament\""

msgid "你双手合掌，脚步轻盈。一曲『 春宫怨 』......\n"
msgstr "You press your palms together, your steps light. A dance, 'Spring Palace Lament'...\n"

msgid "这似乎是一本寒雪鞭法的前几页，虽然并没有关於招式的详细解说，可是\n前面有关鞭法的总纲与精义倒是不少。\n"
msgstr "This seems to be the first few pages of a Cold Snow Whip manual. It has no detailed explanation of the moves, \nbut there is a good deal in front on the whip's general principles and essence.\n"

msgid "一个闪闪发亮的黄金令牌，上有一些图腾标志。\n"
msgstr "A gleaming gold token, stamped with some totem marks.\n"

msgid "蓝雨梅是晚月庄主蓝止萍的养女，由于庄主不信任男子，因此\n晚月庄接待外宾的工作向来由她负责。\n"
msgstr "Lan Yumei is the adopted daughter of Lan Zhiping, Mistress of Latemoon Manor. Since the Mistress does not trust men, \nreceiving outside guests has always been her duty.\n"

msgid "蓝雨梅微笑著说道：我们晚月庄是『 以舞会友，以神换技 』\n"
msgstr "Lan Yumei says with a smile, \"Here at Latemoon Manor, we 'make friends through dance, and trade Spirit for skill.'\"\n"

msgid "蓝雨梅看你一脸疑惑！笑著说：我教你跳一曲『西出阳关』好吗?\n"
msgstr "Lan Yumei sees the puzzled look on your face! Smiling, she says, \"Shall I teach you to dance 'Westward Out of Yangguan'?\"\n"

msgid "蓝雨梅微笑著说道：我跳支舞给您看好不好？\n"
msgstr "Lan Yumei says with a smile, \"Shall I dance for you?\"\n"

msgid "蓝雨梅微笑著说道：我的舞跳得不好，待会儿我请芳绫跳舞给您看，别走远喔。\n"
msgstr "Lan Yumei says with a smile, \"I don't dance well. In a while I'll ask Fangling to dance for you. Don't go far, now.\"\n"

msgid "西出阳关"
msgstr "Westward Out of Yangguan"

msgid "『西出阳关』是一种幻影式舞步。可以移形换影。\n"
msgstr "'Westward Out of Yangguan' is a phantom-style dance. It lets you shift your form and shadow.\n"

msgid "学舞"
msgstr "Learn to dance"

msgid "来!我教你...『西出阳关』是 ..... \n经过雨梅指导后你渐渐懂了! \n"
msgstr "Come! I'll teach you... 'Westward Out of Yangguan' is ... \nWith Yumei's guidance, you gradually understand! \n"

msgid "舞"
msgstr "Dance"

msgid "我会的舞是属于「幻影式舞步」。\n"
msgstr "The dances I know are the \"phantom-style steps.\"\n"

msgid "她是个可爱的女孩。不过有点任性，听说她贪玩被关在 \n禁闭室。听说她爱玩竹蜻蜓哦。\n"
msgstr "She's a sweet girl, though a bit willful. I hear she was too fond of play and got shut up in \nthe Confinement Room. And I hear she loves playing with bamboo dragonflies.\n"

msgid "庄内有人会用竹子作成不同物品。\n"
msgstr "Someone in the manor can make different things out of bamboo.\n"

msgid "沧海龙吟"
msgstr "Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea"

msgid "是一种失传以久的「寒谷龙舞」\n"
msgstr "It's a long-lost \"Cold Valley Dragon Dance.\"\n"

msgid "雨梅对你微笑，和善的对你说：\n  这位$RESPECT，你好！欢迎来到晚月庄。请坐！"
msgstr "Yumei smiles at you and says kindly:\n  \"Hello, $RESPECT! Welcome to Latemoon Manor. Please, have a seat!\""

msgid "雨梅对你微笑，纤细的双手捧著茶，\n 说道：这位$RESPECT，你好！欢迎来到晚月庄。请用茶！"
msgstr "Yumei smiles at you, holding a cup of tea in her slender hands,\n and says, \"Hello, $RESPECT! Welcome to Latemoon Manor. Please, have some tea!\""

msgid "这是上等金轩茶!您品尝一下。\n"
msgstr "This is the finest Golden Pavilion tea! Have a taste.\n"

msgid "她看起来像个小灵精，头上梳两个小包包头。\n她坐在地上，看到你看她便向你作了个鬼脸!\n你想她一定是调皮才会在这受罚!\n"
msgstr "She looks like a little imp, with two small buns in her hair.\nShe is sitting on the floor, and when she sees you looking, she pulls a face at you!\nShe must have been naughty to be punished here, you think!\n"

msgid "顽皮的芳绫向你扮个鬼脸。  *^G^* \n"
msgstr "Naughty Fangling pulls a face at you.  *^G^* \n"

msgid "芳绫走到中央，一个姿势(Pose)。哇!你没想到她跳舞时竟有此深造诣。\n"
msgstr "Fangling steps to the middle and strikes a pose. Wow! You never thought she'd be so deeply skilled at dancing.\n"

msgid "芳绫说：好不好看！这可是我花好久练成的哦! \n"
msgstr "Fangling says, \"Pretty, huh? It took me ages to learn this!\" \n"

msgid "芳绫缓缓的移动著，手上的动作变化万千，有一种说不出的美妙。\n"
msgstr "Fangling moves slowly, her hands changing form in endless ways, with a beauty you can't put into words.\n"

msgid "芳绫说：你好烦哦! 快走开! \n"
msgstr "Fangling says, \"You're so annoying! Go away!\" \n"

msgid "芳绫说：你想学可以去问昭仪姐，她会的比我多。嘻! \n"
msgstr "Fangling says, \"If you wanna learn, go ask Sister Zhaoyi. She knows more than I do. Hee!\" \n"

msgid "芳绫说：丑八怪! 不要烦我。走开啦! \n"
msgstr "Fangling says, \"Ugly! Stop bothering me. Go away!\" \n"

msgid "她嘟著嘴。有点生气的翻过头去，不理你！\n"
msgstr "She pouts. A little angry, she turns her head away and ignores you!\n"

msgid "谢谢!我已经告诉你秘密了呀!去找呀! "
msgstr "Thanks! I already told you the secret! Go find it!"

msgid "芳绫很开心的拿起竹蜻蜓把玩!\n"
msgstr "Fangling happily picks up the bamboo dragonfly and plays with it!\n"

msgid "满怀感激的谢谢你! 她小声的在你耳边说：\n"
msgstr "Full of gratitude, she thanks you! She whispers in your ear:\n"

msgid "『 庄内前厅某处藏有一宝物手镯哦!』\n"
msgstr "\"A treasure, a bracelet, is hidden somewhere in the front hall of the manor!\"\n"

msgid "你可以找找看! \n"
msgstr "You can try to find it! \n"

msgid "这要送给我啊?! 怎么好意思!谢谢你。"
msgstr "This is for me?! I'm so embarrassed! Thank you."

msgid "替跳"
msgstr "Dance in my place"

msgid "从地上一跃而起。"
msgstr " springs up from the floor."

msgid "沧海龙吟？！图跟谱都凑齐了？"
msgstr "Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea?! You found both the chart and the score?"

msgid "带我去佛堂——这支舞我做梦都想跳。蓝姐姐问起来，你替我扛着。"
msgstr "Take me to the Shrine Room. I've dreamed of dancing this one. If Sister Lan asks, you'll cover for me."

msgid "走呀走呀！密室在哪边？"
msgstr "Let's go, let's go! Which way is the secret room?"

msgid "我都替你跳过了！还要？"
msgstr "I already danced for you! You want more?"

msgid "从地上跳起来。"
msgstr " jumps up from the floor."

msgid "关着也闷死了！第二密室？带我去——蓝姐姐问起来，你替我扛着。"
msgstr "I'm bored to death shut in here! The Second Secret Room? Take me. If Sister Lan asks, you'll cover for me."

msgid "替什么跳？我在受罚呢。你先去问守衣人吧。"
msgstr "Dance for what? I'm being punished. Go ask the Robe-Keeper first."

msgid "芳绫踮着脚跟在你后面，一步一个花样。\n"
msgstr "Fangling tiptoes along behind you, a new trick with every step.\n"

msgid "晚月庄第三代弟子"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor, Generation 3 disciple"

msgid "她看起来非常可爱。身材玲珑有致，曲线苗条。\n第一眼印象，你觉的她舞蹈一定跳的不错，看她的一举一动\n有一种说不出的流畅优雅！\n"
msgstr "She looks very sweet. Her figure is slight and shapely, her lines slender.\nAt first glance you think she must dance very well. Every move she makes\nhas a flowing grace you can't quite name!\n"

msgid "昭仪以轻妙的舞步，在房内跳了起来!你看的入神。\n"
msgstr "Zhaoyi begins to dance in the room with light, nimble steps! You watch, entranced.\n"

msgid "昭仪抬头望著那幅图画，略有所思... \n"
msgstr "Zhaoyi looks up at the picture on the wall, lost in thought... \n"

msgid "这是一张非常真贵的湘绣舞曲图，我也在研究中。\n"
msgstr "This is a very precious embroidered dance chart. I'm studying it too.\n"

msgid "嗯 ...为这舞曲名。似乎雨梅姊知道。"
msgstr "Hmm... that's the name of a dance. I think Sister Yumei knows."

msgid "回头看了一眼墙上的图。"
msgstr " glances back at the chart on the wall."

msgid "庄主让你找它？步子就绣在这幅图上——你仔细看那几位姐姐的姿势。曲子图上没有，在舞曲谱里；欣芳姐知道谱放在哪。"
msgstr "The Mistress told you to look for it? The steps are embroidered on this chart. Look closely at the poses of those sisters. The tune isn't on the chart, it's in the dance score, and Sister Xinfang knows where the score is kept."

msgid "有凤来仪"
msgstr "The Phoenix Comes to Court"

msgid "嗯 ...为这舞曲名。(dancing yu-fong)很有名！ \n"
msgstr "Hmm... that's the name of a dance. (dancing yu-fong) It's very famous! \n"

msgid "「幻影式舞步」步法与地点都很重要。\n"
msgstr "For the \"phantom-style steps,\" both the steps and the place matter.\n"

msgid "她聪明伶俐，会跳一些自创的舞步。\n"
msgstr "She's clever and quick, and dances some steps of her own making.\n"

msgid "画"
msgstr "Chart"

msgid "沧海龙吟是一幅湘绣舞曲图，记载一些珍贵舞步。\n"
msgstr "Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea is an embroidered dance chart that records some precious dance steps.\n"

msgid "寒谷龙舞"
msgstr "Cold Valley Dragon Dance"

msgid "昭仪很奇怪的望著你，说道:嘻!你对舞有兴趣呀! "
msgstr "Zhaoyi looks at you oddly and says, \"Hee! So you're interested in dance, are you?\""

msgid "只见两眼溜来溜去，一种很神秘的表情，嘟著嘴。"
msgstr "Her eyes dart this way and that, a very mysterious look on her face, and she pouts."

msgid "过了一会说：好吧!偷偷跟你说，你可以查看墙上的图。(dragon-dance) "
msgstr "After a while she says, \"Fine! I'll tell you a secret. You can look at the chart on the wall. (dragon-dance)\""

msgid "...."
msgstr "..."

msgid "昭仪很高兴的看著你，说道:嘻!你对舞有兴趣呀!"
msgstr "Zhaoyi looks at you happily and says, \"Hee! So you're interested in dance!\""

msgid "这有一幅图画，我从那悟到好多新舞步哦! "
msgstr "There's a picture here. I learned lots of new dance steps from it!"

msgid "『 沧海龙吟』是一首失传以久的舞曲。传说...."
msgstr "'Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea' is a dance lost for a long time. They say..."

msgid "......"
msgstr "..."

msgid "她长得十分漂亮！让你忍不住多瞧她几眼，从她身上\n你闻到淡淡的香气。她很有礼貌的向你点头，优雅的\n动作，轻盈的步伐，好美哦!\n"
msgstr "She is very beautiful! You can't help looking at her a few more times, and from her\nyou catch a faint fragrance. She nods to you with great courtesy. Her graceful\nmovements and light steps are so lovely!\n"

msgid "我舞跳的不好!我比较喜欢静态的活动。\n"
msgstr "I don't dance well! I prefer quiet pastimes.\n"

msgid "听说她贪玩被关在禁闭室。她最爱玩竹蜻蜓了! \n"
msgstr "I hear she was too fond of play and got shut up in the Confinement Room. She loves bamboo dragonflies most of all! \n"

msgid "昭蓉对你微笑，和善的对你点点头。"
msgstr "Zhaorong smiles at you and nods kindly."

msgid "昭蓉对你微笑，以纤细轻柔的声音 \n 说道：这位$RESPECT，你好！欢迎来到晚月庄。"
msgstr "Zhaorong smiles at you and says in a slender, gentle voice:\n \"Hello, $RESPECT! Welcome to Latemoon Manor.\""

msgid "密函里写的就是它。师父要我在庄里住着，等——等有人把它拿出来。"
msgstr "That's what the letter is about. Shifu told me to stay at the manor and wait. Wait until someone brings it out."

msgid "天山派也想要它。守衣的那个女人我打不过，等着看谁打得过。"
msgstr "The Tianshan School wants it too. I can't beat the woman who keeps the robe, so I'll wait and see who can."

msgid "她国色天香，娇丽无伦；温柔娴静，秀绝人寰。\n她姿容绝美，世所罕见。从她身旁你闻道一寒谷\n幽香。\n"
msgstr "She is a beauty beyond compare, delicate and lovely, gentle and serene, a loveliness rare in this world.\nBeside her you catch the hidden fragrance of Cold Valley.\n"

msgid "她是惜春的妹妹，跟姐姐从小就在晚月庄\n长大。因为与双亲失散，被庄主收留。平\n常帮忙庄内琐碎事务。\n"
msgstr "She is Xichun's younger sister. She grew up at Latemoon Manor with her sister,\ntaken in by the Mistress after losing touch with her parents. She\nusually helps with the manor's small chores.\n"

msgid "她看起来很有活力，两眼明亮有神。给你\n一种巾帼不让须眉的气势，但刚毅之中似\n又隐含著女孩子有的娇柔。\n"
msgstr "She looks full of life, her eyes bright and keen. She gives you the feeling\nof a woman who is the equal of any man, yet within that firmness\nthere seems to be a girl's gentle charm.\n"

msgid "阁下! 这里是庄内后厅厢房。不方便男客进入哦! \n请随手关门，并保持安静! 谢谢! \n"
msgstr "Sir! These are the rear hall's wing rooms. Men are not welcome inside! \nPlease close the door behind you and keep quiet! Thank you! \n"

msgid "看管人"
msgstr "Keeper"

msgid "这个老妇人不知姓甚名谁, 她在晚月很久了, 一直看管\n书房, 连庄主都对她很尊敬。\n"
msgstr "Nobody knows this old woman's name. She has been at Latemoon for a very long time and has always looked after \nthe study. Even the Mistress treats her with respect.\n"

msgid "前辈"
msgstr "Senior"

msgid "这里是书房，有些鞭法教材存放在这儿。"
msgstr "This is the study. Some whip teaching texts are kept here."

msgid "心事"
msgstr "What weighs on your mind"

msgid "坐在窗下，没有抬头，也没有开口。"
msgstr " sits under the window, not looking up and not speaking."

msgid "她在这屋里。我压了这些年的心事，你替我了了。"
msgstr "She's in this room. I've carried this weight for years. You settle it for me."

msgid "低下头。"
msgstr " lowers her head."

msgid "她都跟你说了？……道观、神教——当年是我把她送出庄门的。"
msgstr "She told you everything?... The Daoist temple, the Order. I was the one who sent her out of the manor gate, back then."

msgid "去问问她。她不对我说的话，也许会对你说。她就在这屋里。"
msgstr "Go and ask her. What she won't say to me, she may say to you. She's in this room."

msgid "去问问她。她不对我说的话，也许会对你说。夜里，后山的竹林。"
msgstr "Go and ask her. What she won't say to me, she may say to you. At night, in the bamboo grove on the back hill."

msgid "实不相瞒，这杀手是我的私生女，但已误入歧途 ...\n我一直舍不得亲手杀了她，你若能帮忙我会非常感谢。 \n只是要以令牌为证，唉 ..."
msgstr "To be frank, this assassin is my illegitimate daughter, but she has gone astray...\nI could never bring myself to kill her with my own hands. If you can help, I'll be very grateful.\nOnly, it must be proven with the token. Sigh..."

msgid "沉默了很久。"
msgstr " says nothing for a long time."

msgid "……这些年我想的，其实不是这个。我想知道她为什么走到这一步，可她从来不对我说。"
msgstr "...That's not really what I've been thinking about all these years. I wanted to know why she came to this, but she never tells me."

msgid "她就在这屋里，蒙着面，在书架那边走来走去——你看她的眉眼。替我问她一声「娘」。"
msgstr "She's in this room, veiled, pacing by the bookshelves. Look at her eyes and brows. Ask her about \"Mother\" for me."

msgid "那一夜之后，她再没进过庄门。可我知道她没走远：夜里，庄后山路尽头的竹林里有人在哭。替我去问她一声「娘」。"
msgstr "After that night she never set foot in the manor again. But I know she didn't go far. At night, in the bamboo grove at the end of the road up the back hill, someone weeps. Go and ask her about \"Mother\" for me."

msgid "令牌在我这里。她还活着——这就够了。"
msgstr "The token is with me. She's still alive. That's enough."

msgid "你还给了神教？……也好。那块东西，本来就不该在晚月庄。"
msgstr "You gave it back to the Order?... Just as well. That thing never belonged at Latemoon Manor."

msgid "令牌在你手上？给我。我不要它为证她死了——我要它为证她还活着。"
msgstr "The token is in your hands? Give it to me. I don't want it as proof she is dead. I want it as proof she is alive."

msgid "就在我儿身上 ...你拿到了就给我。"
msgstr "It's on my child... Bring it to me when you get it."

msgid "衣在庄里几百年了。它在，庄就在；它走了，庄里的人就得自己守了。"
msgstr "The robe has been in the manor for hundreds of years. While it stays, the manor stands. If it goes, the people here must guard themselves."

msgid "女儿"
msgstr "Daughter"

msgid "带她回来：她留在晚月庄，跟着她娘守内书房，不再蒙面。\n晚月庄这一票投旧盟主（不要官府、也不要颜违管到庄里来）（已经入了虹台的席的，这一票不再跟着变）；蓝止萍从此对你冷一分。本庄弟子的执事，由老妇向庄主讨。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Bring her back: she stays at Latemoon Manor and keeps the Inner Study with her mother, no longer veiled.\nThe manor's vote at the Assembly goes to the old leader (no officials, and no Yan Wei meddling in the manor) (if you already took a seat at Rainbow Terrace, this vote will not change again); Lan Zhiping will be colder to you from now on. The old woman will ask the Mistress to give the manor's disciples their duties.\nSay it that way?"

msgid "她在这里。"
msgstr "She's here."

msgid "你已经不是晚月庄的人了。这是晚月庄的事。"
msgstr "You're no longer one of Latemoon Manor. This is Latemoon Manor's business."

msgid "走过去，伸手把女儿脸上的面巾摘了下来。"
msgstr " walks over and pulls the veil from her daughter's face."

msgid "她是我女儿。我把她送出去过一回，不送第二回。"
msgstr "She is my daughter. I sent her away once. I won't send her away twice."

msgid "庄主那里，我去说。"
msgstr "I'll speak to the Mistress myself."

msgid "她的令牌已经在我这里了。"
msgstr "Her token is with me already."

msgid "你把她那块令还给了神教。别的令牌，我不要。"
msgstr "You gave her token back to the Order. I don't want any other token."

msgid "接过令牌，攥在手心里，手在抖。"
msgstr " takes the token and grips it in her palm, her hand shaking."

msgid "她还活着……我拿着它，就知道她还活着。"
msgstr "She's alive... holding this, I know she's alive."

msgid "作为感谢，我传你一些内力。"
msgstr "In thanks, I'll pass some Inner Force to you."

msgid "无名老妇手抵在你的后心，头上冒出丝丝白气。\n"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman presses a hand against your back, thin wisps of white steam rising from her head.\n"

msgid "你感觉到一股热气传了过来。\n"
msgstr "You feel a rush of heat pass into you.\n"

msgid "把令牌交给无名老妇：她知道女儿还活着，给你一份谢礼（谢礼只给一回）。\n令牌给了她，就不能再还给朱鸿雪了。\n要给吗？"
msgstr "Give the token to the Nameless Old Woman: she will know her daughter is alive, and give you a gift of thanks (once only).\nOnce she has it, you can no longer return it to Zhu Hongxue.\nGive it?"

msgid "作为感谢，我给你一本寒雪鞭法密笈。"
msgstr "In thanks, I'll give you a Cold Snow Whip secret manual."

msgid "谢礼，我早先给过你一回了。这一回，是我欠你的。"
msgstr "I gave you my thanks once before. This time, it's me who owes you."

msgid "我要的不是令牌。你见过她了么？"
msgstr "It's not the token I want. Have you seen her?"

msgid "令牌我收过一回了。谢礼，也只给一回。"
msgstr "I've taken a token from you once. And the gift of thanks is given only once."

msgid "无名老妇坐在书房里，手里的鞭子一直没举起来。\n"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman sits in the study, the whip in her hand never raised.\n"

msgid "无名老妇坐在书房里，把那根鞭子横在膝上，一下一下地擦。\n"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman sits in the study with the whip across her knees, wiping it, again and again.\n"

msgid "无名老妇坐在书房的窗下，一句话也不说。\n"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman sits under the study window, not saying a word.\n"

msgid "无名老妇和她女儿对坐在窗下，一个擦鞭子，一个擦剑。\n"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman and her daughter sit facing each other under the window, one wiping a whip, the other a sword.\n"

msgid "是她。我听见前厅的声音就知道是她。我没拦住——我一直没拦住。"
msgstr "It's her. I knew it was her the moment I heard the sound in the front hall. I couldn't stop her. I never could stop her."

msgid "抬起头，看着东厢的方向。"
msgstr " raises her head and looks toward the East Wing."

msgid "衣回来了？……好。庄里还守得住。"
msgstr "The robe is back?... Good. The manor can still be held."

msgid "坐在窗下，手里攥着那块黑木令牌，没有抬头。"
msgstr " sits under the window, clutching the black-wood token, not looking up."

msgid "坐在窗下，两只手空空地搁在膝上，没有抬头。"
msgstr " sits under the window, both hands empty on her knees, not looking up."

msgid "回来了就好。……庄主那里，执事的事我替你讨了。"
msgstr "Good that she's back. ...As for the Mistress and the matter of her duties, I've asked on your behalf."

msgid "这是个蒙面杀手，眉眼看起来有些面熟。\n"
msgstr "This is a masked assassin, and the eyes and brows look a little familiar.\n"

msgid "蒙面杀手喝道：为什么杀我？\n"
msgstr "The Masked Assassin shouts, \"Why kill me?\"\n"

msgid "蒙面杀手叹道：你知道我心里有多痛苦吗？！\n"
msgstr "The Masked Assassin sighs, \"Do you know how much pain I'm in?!\"\n"

msgid "娘"
msgstr "Mother"

msgid "令牌丢了？……"
msgstr "The token is lost?..."

msgid "又从怀里摸出一块黑木令牌，丢给你。"
msgstr " pulls another black-wood token from her robe and tosses it to you."

msgid "拿好。神教给我的令，不止一块。"
msgstr "Take it. The Order gave me more than one."

msgid "我说完了。"
msgstr "I'm done."

msgid "的手停在剑柄上，很久没有动。"
msgstr "'s hand stops on her sword hilt and stays there a long time."

msgid "她让你来问的？……她从来不问。"
msgstr "She sent you to ask?... She never asks."

msgid "我七岁那年，她把我送出了庄门——晚月庄容不下一个来历不明的孩子。北麓有个道观收孩子，说是收道童。"
msgstr "When I was seven, she sent me out of the manor gate. Latemoon Manor had no room for a child of unknown origin. There was a Daoist temple on the north foothills that took in children, said it took in young acolytes."

msgid "那里的人不念经，只教剑。六阴追魂剑，从追魂那一部学起；学不会的孩子，后来就不见了。"
msgstr "The people there recited no scriptures. They only taught the sword. The Six-Chaos Sword, starting from the Soul-Chasing part. The children who couldn't learn it were gone after a while."

msgid "我是自己逃出来的。东方神教收留了我，给了我这块令。"
msgstr "I got out by myself. The Golden Crow Order took me in and gave me this token."

msgid "朱鸿雪派我回晚月庄：我是她的女儿，内书房的门对我开着，宝衣藏在哪里，我看得见。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue sent me back to Latemoon Manor: I'm her daughter, the door of the Inner Study is open to me, and wherever the robe is hidden, I can see it."

msgid "我在这屋里住了三年。宝衣一直在瑷伦身上，我一回也没有动手。"
msgstr "I lived in this house for three years. The robe was on Ailun the whole time, and I never once made a move."

msgid "从腰间解下一块黑木令牌，丢给你。"
msgstr " unties a black-wood token from her waist and tosses it to you."

msgid "拿去。给她，还是还给神教，你定。我累了。"
msgstr "Take it. Give it to her or give it back to the Order, you decide. I'm tired."

msgid "杀手站在书架边，剑在鞘里，手离剑柄远远的。\n"
msgstr "The assassin stands by the bookshelves, her sword in its sheath, her hand far from the hilt.\n"

msgid "她看起来成熟中带有一些稚气。飘逸的长发\n十分迷人。她是个孤儿，从小与妹妹圆春被\n庄主收留，她很聪明，在第四代弟子中算是\n武功很出色的一个。\n"
msgstr "She looks mature, with a touch of the girl still in her. Her flowing long hair\nis very charming. She is an orphan, taken in by the Mistress with her younger sister Yuanchun\nwhen they were small. She's very clever, and among the Fourth Generation disciples\nher martial arts are quite outstanding.\n"

msgid "晚月庄开山祖师"
msgstr "Founder of Latemoon Manor"

msgid "她看上去三十七岁。庄里最老的仆妇说，她小时候见到的瑷伦也是这张脸。鞭子挂在腰上，手搭在鞭柄上，像搭在一个老朋友的肩上。\n"
msgstr "She looks 37. The oldest servant woman in the manor says that the Ailun she saw as a child had this same face. The whip hangs at her waist and her hand rests on its handle, like a hand on an old friend's shoulder.\n"

msgid "叫瑷伦随你下湖？她穿着宝衣跟你去玉螺湖，等事情了结。"
msgstr "Ask Ailun to go down the lake with you? She will wear the robe and go with you to Jade Conch Lake, until this is settled."

msgid "我去湖边等你。"
msgstr "I'll wait for you at the lake."

msgid "站起来，把宝衣的带子系紧。"
msgstr " stands and ties the robe's sash tight."

msgid "三百年……不，比三百年长。走吧，我在湖边等你。"
msgstr "Three hundred years... no, longer than that. Let's go. I'll wait for you at the lake."

msgid "还不到时候。等湖底那颗头醒了，你再来叫我。"
msgstr "It isn't time yet. When the head in the lakebed wakes, come and call me."

msgid "湖底？你问错人了。"
msgstr "The lakebed? You're asking the wrong person."

msgid "衣在我身上。决战那日，你来叫我。"
msgstr "The robe is on me. On the day of the final battle, come and call me."

msgid "衣出过庄，又回来了。决战那日，你来叫我。"
msgstr "The robe left the manor and came back. On the day of the final battle, come and call me."

msgid "衣在你身上。你说留着，就留着——别丢了它。"
msgstr "The robe is on you. If you say keep it, keep it. Don't lose it."

msgid "衣出了庄。你带着它，就别再回头问我。"
msgstr "The robe left the manor. Since you carry it, don't come back asking me."

msgid "你把它给了西厢那个人。几百年的东西，一句话就换了主。"
msgstr "You gave it to the one in the West Wing. Something hundreds of years old, and one word changed its owner."

msgid "衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」。我说过了。"
msgstr "The robe is in the ice chest in the Second Secret Room, and the chest answers only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court.\" I told you already."

msgid "你接住了。再问你一句：你拿它去做什么？——斩鬼，交给别人，还是你自己也不知道。想好了告诉我。"
msgstr "You caught it. One more question: what will you do with it? Slay the ghost, give it to someone else, or you don't know yourself? Think it over and tell me."

msgid "潘军禅的嘴向来快。是，衣在庄里，我守着。守了几百年——你看我多大？"
msgstr "Pan Junchan's mouth was always quick. Yes, the robe is in the manor, and I guard it. I've guarded it for hundreds of years. How old do you think I am?"

msgid "宝衣不白给。接我三鞭，站着不倒，我们再谈。"
msgstr "The robe isn't given away for nothing. Take three lashes from me, stay on your feet, and then we'll talk."

msgid "南危水肯开口，是你的本事。是，衣在庄里，我守着。守了几百年——你看我多大？"
msgstr "If Nan Weishui was willing to speak, that's your doing. Yes, the robe is in the manor, and I guard it. I've guarded it for hundreds of years. How old do you think I am?"

msgid "什么宝衣？老身只会教鞭。"
msgstr "What robe? This old woman only teaches the whip."

msgid "为了斩鬼"
msgstr "To slay the ghost"

msgid "这是你给守衣人的答复，说出去就改不了。"
msgstr "This is your answer to the Robe-Keeper. Once said, it can't be taken back."

msgid "寒於留它，本来就是为这个。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」——那支舞你跳得成，我教你记住它的名字。"
msgstr "Hanyu left it for exactly this. The robe is in the ice chest in the Second Secret Room, and the chest answers only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court.\" If you can dance that dance, I'll teach you to remember its name."

msgid "开了匣，衣是你的。带走，还是留给我守到决战那日，你自己定。"
msgstr "Once the chest is open, the robe is yours. Take it away, or leave it with me to keep until the day of the final battle. That's for you to decide."

msgid "寒於留它，本来就是为这个。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」——那是玄天玉女的步法，男子跳不成。"
msgstr "Hanyu left it for exactly this. The robe is in the ice chest in the Second Secret Room, and the chest answers only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court.\" That is a step of the Jade Maiden of Dark Heaven, and a man can't dance it."

msgid "请庄里的姑娘替你跳：筱薇在内厅，或者禁闭房里那个贪玩的芳绫。开了匣，衣是你的。带走，还是留给我守到决战那日，你自己定。"
msgstr "Ask one of the manor's girls to dance it for you: Xiaowei in the Inner Hall, or that mischievous Fangling in the Confinement Room. Once the chest is open, the robe is yours. Take it away, or leave it with me to keep until the day of the final battle. That's for you to decide."

msgid "你答过了。"
msgstr "You already answered."

msgid "先接我三鞭。"
msgstr "Take my three lashes first."

msgid "交给安妮儿"
msgstr "Give it to Anni'er"

msgid "脸冷了下来。"
msgstr "'s face goes cold."

msgid "西厢那个人等了三年，等的就是你这句话。我不拦——拿得走就拿。"
msgstr "The one in the West Wing has waited three years for those very words from you. I won't stop you. If you can take it, take it."

msgid "衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」。你跳得成，记住它的名字。"
msgstr "The robe is in the ice chest in the Second Secret Room, and the chest answers only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court.\" If you can dance it, remember its name."

msgid "衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」，男子跳不成。请筱薇或者芳绫替你跳。"
msgstr "The robe is in the ice chest in the Second Secret Room, and the chest answers only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court\"; a man can't dance it. Ask Xiaowei or Fangling to dance it for you."

msgid "安妮儿？你连她在等什么都没问过，就要替她拿衣？"
msgstr "Anni'er? You haven't even asked what she's waiting for, and you want to take the robe for her?"

msgid "不知道"
msgstr "I don't know"

msgid "不知道，比胡说一个好。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」——你跳得成，记住它的名字。"
msgstr "Better to say you don't know than to talk nonsense. The robe is in the ice chest in the Second Secret Room, and the chest answers only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court.\" If you can dance it, remember its name."

msgid "开了匣再想。带走，还是留给我守到决战那日。"
msgstr "Think again once the chest is open. Take it away, or leave it with me to keep until the day of the final battle."

msgid "不知道，比胡说一个好。衣在第二密室的冰匣里，匣只认「有凤来仪」，男子跳不成——请筱薇或者芳绫替你跳。"
msgstr "Better to say you don't know than to talk nonsense. The robe is in the ice chest in the Second Secret Room, and the chest answers only to \"The Phoenix Comes to Court\"; a man can't dance it. Ask Xiaowei or Fangling to dance it for you."

msgid "还衣"
msgstr "Return the robe"

msgid "把寒於宝衣还给瑷伦：她又是守衣人，池边的凤凰回来；决战那日问她「湖底」，她穿着它跟你下湖。\n宝衣从此不在你身上，下湖时没有它挡寒气。\n要还吗？"
msgstr "Return Hanyu's Robe to Ailun: she becomes the Robe-Keeper again, and the phoenix by the pool returns. On the day of the final battle, ask her about \"The Lakebed\" and she will wear it and go down the lake with you.\nThe robe will no longer be on you, and you'll have nothing to turn the cold aside when you go down.\nReturn it?"

msgid "衣在湖底烧了。它挡在了该挡的地方，不必再说还不还。"
msgstr "The robe burned in the lakebed. It stood where it needed to stand. There's no more need to talk of returning it or not."

msgid "衣在我身上了。"
msgstr "The robe is on me already."

msgid "你说过留着。"
msgstr "You said keep it."

msgid "native:latemoon/cold_robe"
msgstr "native:latemoon/cold_robe"

msgid "看着你手里的衣，很久没有伸手。"
msgstr " looks at the robe in your hands and does not reach for it for a long time."

msgid "出了庄门的衣，我说过不收。"
msgstr "A robe that has left the manor gate, I said I would not take back."

msgid "接过宝衣，抖开，披在肩上。衣角落下去的时候，屋里凉了一截。"
msgstr " takes the robe, shakes it out and drapes it over her shoulders. As the hem falls, the room goes a degree colder."

msgid "……可它回来了。我守到决战那日——到时候你来叫我，我跟你下湖底。"
msgstr "...But it came back. I'll keep it until the day of the final battle. When it comes, call me, and I'll go down to the lakebed with you."

msgid "衣不在你身上，就别说还。"
msgstr "If the robe isn't on you, don't talk of returning it."

msgid "还什么？"
msgstr "Return what?"

msgid "宝衣留在你身上：瑷伦不再问，庄里照旧没有护佑。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Keep the robe: Ailun will not ask again, and the manor will go on without its protection.\nSay it that way?"

msgid "衣已经回来了。"
msgstr "The robe is back already."

msgid "说过了。"
msgstr "You said so already."

msgid "你说过，为了斩鬼。那就带着它去斩。"
msgstr "You said it was to slay the ghost. Then take it and go slay it."

msgid "你说过要交给西厢那个人，到头来自己带着。也好——总比给她好。"
msgstr "You said you'd give it to the one in the West Wing, and in the end you carry it yourself. Just as well. Better than giving it to her."

msgid "没有说话，过了一会儿才开口。"
msgstr " says nothing, and only after a while speaks."

msgid "你说过你不知道拿它做什么。带着吧——到了湖底那一天，你就知道了。"
msgstr "You said you didn't know what to do with it. Keep it, then. On the day you reach the lakebed, you'll know."

msgid "留着什么？"
msgstr "Keep what?"

msgid "拜师! 不敢当，我都老了!你去找「芷萍」好了，看她收不收你?"
msgstr "Become my disciple? I wouldn't dare, I'm too old now! Go and find \"Zhiping\" instead. See whether she'll take you?"

msgid "老身不收男徒!"
msgstr "This old woman takes no male disciples!"

msgid "瑷伦说道：小心了，这是第一鞭..."
msgstr "Ailun says, \"Careful now, this is the first lash...\""

msgid "瑷伦面露微笑：好！第二鞭来了..."
msgstr "Ailun smiles. \"Good! Here comes the second lash...\""

msgid "瑷伦叹了口气道：看来还是不行啊..."
msgstr "Ailun sighs and says, \"It seems it still won't do...\""

msgid "瑷伦鼓励道：很不错，看这最后一鞭..."
msgstr "Ailun says encouragingly, \"Very good. Now watch for the last lash...\""

msgid "瑷伦叹了口气道：太可惜了！"
msgstr "Ailun sighs and says, \"What a pity!\""

msgid "瑷伦露出慈祥的面容：看来我没看错人。"
msgstr "Ailun's face turns kind. \"It seems I didn't misjudge you.\""

msgid "晚月庄第一代弟子"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor Disciple, First Generation"

msgid "接她三鞭"
msgstr "Take her three lashes"

msgid "瑷伦的三鞭是真打：\n· 每一鞭都实打实地落在你身上。\n· 哪一鞭接不住，就算没接下：你会昏倒，但不伤性命、不留伤，歇一会儿就能再来。\n· 接不接得住看气长不长：气随内力上限涨，内力上限靠打坐——先向师父学一门内功、装上，再去打坐。\n确定接她三鞭吗？"
msgstr "Ailun's three lashes are real:\n- Each lash lands on you in earnest.\n- A lash you cannot take counts as not taken: you will pass out, but you will not be killed or hurt, and can try again after a rest.\n- Whether you can take them depends on how long your Qi lasts. Qi rises with your Inner Force cap, and your Inner Force cap rises by meditation: first learn a neigong from a shifu, equip it, and then meditate.\nAre you sure you want to take her three lashes?"

msgid "瑷伦看了你很久：倒了两回，还站到我面前来。这份硬气，我认——这三鞭，我不用内力。"
msgstr "Ailun looks at you for a long time. \"You fell twice, and still you stand before me. I respect that kind of toughness. For these three lashes, I will not use Inner Force.\""

msgid "瑷伦摆摆手：你的气还没喘匀。歇好了再来。"
msgstr "Ailun waves her hand. \"You haven't caught your breath yet. Come back when you've rested.\""

msgid "瑷伦收起鞭子：站得住。那就再问你一句——你拿它去做什么？"
msgstr "Ailun puts away her whip. \"You can stand. Then I'll ask you one more thing: what will you do with it?\""

msgid "接下了守衣人瑷伦的三鞭"
msgstr "Took the Robe-Keeper Ailun's three lashes"

msgid "衣要还，你开口说一声。"
msgstr "If the robe is to be returned, say so."

msgid "出了庄门的衣，不是晚月庄的了。拿走吧。"
msgstr "A robe that has left the manor gate is no longer Latemoon Manor's. Take it."

msgid "我守到决战那日。到时候你来叫我，我跟你下湖底。"
msgstr "I'll keep it until the day of the final battle. When it comes, call me, and I'll go down to the lakebed with you."

msgid "守衣人"
msgstr "Robe-Keeper"

msgid "瑷伦的手搭在腰间，那里多了一层月白的衣角。\n"
msgstr "Ailun's hand rests at her waist, where a layer of moon-white cloth now shows.\n"

msgid "瑷伦说：决战那日，你来叫我。\n"
msgstr "Ailun says, \"On the day of the final battle, come and call me.\"\n"

msgid "瑷伦望着东厢的窗，很久没动。\n"
msgstr "Ailun gazes at the East Wing window, not moving for a long while.\n"

msgid "瑷伦低声说：几百年……到我手里丢的。\n"
msgstr "Ailun says in a low voice, \"Hundreds of years... and it was lost in my hands.\"\n"

msgid "看了你一眼，又看向你空着的手。"
msgstr " glances at you, then at your empty hands."

msgid "衣出了庄，凤凰暗了。前厅的事你看见了——那是衣走了的价钱。"
msgstr "The robe has left the manor, and the phoenix has gone dark. You saw what happened in the front hall. That was the price of the robe leaving."

msgid "没有看你。"
msgstr " does not look at you."

msgid "你把它给了西厢那个人。凤凰暗了，前厅死了人——几百年的东西，一句话就换了主。"
msgstr "You gave it to the one in the West Wing. The phoenix has gone dark, and someone died in the front hall. Something hundreds of years old, and one word changed its owner."

msgid "手搭在膝上那件月白的衣上，没有抬头。"
msgstr " rests a hand on the moon-white robe on her knees, head down."

msgid "蓝止萍让你来要？"
msgstr "Lan Zhiping sent you to ask for it?"

msgid "衣在我这里。月神族守了几百年，守给我的——这话我对你说过。回去告诉她：湖上出事那天，衣会在该在的地方。"
msgstr "The robe is with me. The Moon God clan guarded it for hundreds of years, and guarded it for me. That is what I told you. Go back and tell her: the day trouble comes to the lake, the robe will be where it ought to be."

msgid "它在我这里。你记得这一点就够了——东方神教也记得。"
msgstr "It is with me. Remember that and it's enough. The Golden Crow Order remembers it too."

msgid "衣回了瑷伦身上？……出过庄的衣，回得去。你倒比我想的懂它。"
msgstr "The robe is back on Ailun?... A robe that has left the manor can go back. You understand it better than I thought."

msgid "宝衣出了庄。你的名字，我记下了。"
msgstr "The robe left the manor. I've noted your name."

msgid "守衣人让你过了？那她看中了你。我在西厢住了三年，等一件东西，也等一个配得上它的人——衣交给我，不比交给一个几百年不出庄的人差。"
msgstr "The Robe-Keeper let you pass? Then she thinks well of you. I've lived in the West Wing for three years, waiting for a thing, and for someone worthy of it. Giving the robe to me is no worse than giving it to someone who hasn't left the manor in hundreds of years."

msgid "我在西厢住了三年，等一件东西，也等一个配得上它的人。你是哪一个？"
msgstr "I've lived in the West Wing for three years, waiting for a thing, and for someone worthy of it. Which are you?"

msgid "等谁"
msgstr "Who you're waiting for"

msgid "门关着。神教的事，去问你的教主。"
msgstr "The door is closed. For the Order's business, ask your Order Leader."

msgid "不等了。教主令收回来了，你身上有黄金令——想学天山的剑，就在这里学（「请教」）。"
msgstr "I'm done waiting. The Order Leader's token is back, and you carry the gold token. If you want to learn the Tianshan sword, learn it here (\"Learn\")."

msgid "把膝上的衣叠好，站起身来。"
msgstr " folds the robe on her knees and stands up."

msgid "朱鸿雪的名单上，还差最后一个名字。我知道是谁。"
msgstr "On Zhu Hongxue's list, one name is still missing. I know whose."

msgid "到场院去。我会在那里。"
msgstr "Go to the Pleasure Yard. I'll be there."

msgid "膝上空着。她看了你一会儿。"
msgstr "Her lap is empty. She looks at you for a while."

msgid "朱鸿雪派你来的。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue sent you."

msgid "衣烧了，在湖底。我等的东西，用过了——它最后挡在了该挡的地方。"
msgstr "The robe burned, at the bottom of the lake. What I waited for has been used. In the end it stood where it needed to stand."

msgid "我不用再等了。神教还想要什么，让她自己来西厢问我。"
msgstr "I don't need to wait any longer. Whatever the Order still wants, let her come to the West Wing and ask me herself."

msgid "回去告诉朱鸿雪吧。你可以照实说。"
msgstr "Go back and tell Zhu Hongxue. You may tell her the truth."

msgid "衣在我这里。可它不是神教的——它守的是湖底的东西，不是谁家的香火。"
msgstr "The robe is with me. But it isn't the Order's. What it guards is what lies at the bottom of the lake, not anyone's incense."

msgid "我等的是那一天：湖底那东西醒的那一天，衣该在一个配得上它的人身上。也许是你，也许是别人。不会是朱鸿雪。"
msgstr "I wait for that day: the day the thing at the bottom of the lake wakes, when the robe should be on someone worthy of it. Perhaps you, perhaps another. Never Zhu Hongxue."

msgid "抬眼看了你一会儿。"
msgstr " looks up at you for a while."

msgid "衣回了瑷伦身上。守衣人守着它，我也就不急了。"
msgstr "The robe is back on Ailun. The Robe-Keeper guards it, so I'm not in a hurry."

msgid "我在等湖上出事的那一天。那一天，衣该在一个配得上它的人身上——瑷伦，你，都行。只是不该在神教手里。"
msgstr "I'm waiting for the day trouble comes to the lake. On that day, the robe should be on someone worthy of it: Ailun, you, any of you. Only it shouldn't be in the Order's hands."

msgid "看了你一眼，像在数你的名字有几个字。"
msgstr " looks at you as if counting the characters in your name."

msgid "衣出了庄，跟着你走了。我等的东西从我门前过去了，没进我的门。"
msgstr "The robe left the manor and went with you. What I was waiting for passed my door and never came in."

msgid "我还在等——等你哪一天明白那件衣是做什么用的。到那时，它不该在神教手里。"
msgstr "I'm still waiting, for the day you understand what that robe is for. When that day comes, it shouldn't be in the Order's hands."

msgid "看了一眼你的包袱，又看着你。"
msgstr " looks at your pack, then at you."

msgid "衣出了冰匣，在你身上。我等的就是它，也在等拿着它的人——你还没想好把它交给谁。"
msgstr "The robe is out of the ice chest, and on you. It's what I was waiting for, and I'm waiting for whoever holds it too. You haven't decided yet whom to give it to."

msgid "交给谁都行，只是不该交给神教。"
msgstr "Give it to anyone, only not to the Order."

msgid "我在等一件衣，也在等一个人。衣在这庄子的冰匣里；人……我还没见到。"
msgstr "I'm waiting for a robe, and for a person. The robe is in this manor's ice chest; the person... I haven't met yet."

msgid "等到了，我把衣交给那个人——交给那个人，不是交给神教。"
msgstr "When I find them, I will give the robe to that person. To that person, not to the Order."

msgid "教主令在我这里。神教往后只派该死的人的差事——鸿雪答应了。"
msgstr "The Order Leader's token is with me. From now on the Order will only take jobs against those who deserve to die. Hongxue agreed."

msgid "天山雪影剑、雪影心法，你来学（「请教」）。"
msgstr "Tianshan Snowshade Sword, Snowshade Heart Method: learn them from me (\"Learn\")."

msgid "门关着。"
msgstr "The door is closed."

msgid "教主？"
msgstr "The Order Leader?"

msgid "出了庄的衣，不必再拿来给我看。"
msgstr "A robe that has left the manor needn't be brought to show me."

msgid "接过宝衣，手指在衣料上停了一停。"
msgstr " takes the robe, her fingers pausing on the cloth."

msgid "月神族守了几百年，守给我的。"
msgstr "The Moon God clan guarded it for hundreds of years, and guarded it for me."

msgid "你配得上。东方神教记得你——这句话，以后有用。"
msgstr "You're worthy of it. The Golden Crow Order remembers you. Those words will be of use to you later."

msgid "安妮儿把一件月白的衣叠在膝上，谁也不看。\n"
msgstr "Anni'er folds a moon-white robe on her knees, looking at no one.\n"

msgid "安妮儿看了你一眼，像在数你的名字有几个字。\n"
msgstr "Anni'er looks at you as if counting the characters in your name.\n"

msgid "宝衣出了庄，没进我的门。你的名字，我记下了。"
msgstr "The robe left the manor and never came through my door. I've noted your name."

msgid "晚月庄弟子"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor Disciple"

msgid "琼衣很礼貌的向你微笑! \n"
msgstr "Qiongyi smiles at you very politely!\n"

msgid "说道：请保持安静哦! \n"
msgstr "She says, \"Please keep quiet!\"\n"

msgid "你觉得被打中的地方一阵麻痒！"
msgstr "The place where you were hit tingles and itches!"

msgid "韶吟惊慌生气的怒斥： 喂! 兄台不要乱闯! \n"
msgstr "Shaoyin shouts in alarm and anger, \"Hey! Sir, don't just barge in!\"\n"

msgid "她的眼神骤变，隐约中似乎让人神智渐模糊! \n"
msgstr "Her gaze changes suddenly, and somehow your mind seems to blur by degrees!\n"

msgid "欣郁大喊： 喂! 兄台! 这不准男人进来! \n"
msgstr "Xinyu cries out, \"Hey! Sir! No men allowed in here!\"\n"

msgid "欣郁从袖里取出一把粉红色细粉泼撒出去。\n"
msgstr "Xinyu takes a handful of pink powder from her sleeve and flings it out.\n"

msgid "欣郁一脚往闯入者踢了出去。\n"
msgstr "Xinyu kicks out at the intruder.\n"

msgid "护庄神像"
msgstr "Guardian Statue"

msgid "火神「凤凰」乃勇士寒于的魂魄所化成的十三个精灵之一。\n由于其奇异神迹，被晚月庄供奉为护庄神兽。\n"
msgstr "The Fire God \"Phoenix\" is one of the thirteen spirits formed from the soul of the warrior Hanyu.\nBecause of its marvelous miracles, Latemoon Manor reveres it as the manor's guardian beast.\n"

msgid "神像眼神骤变，幻化成七彩凤凰，出现金色光芒。\n"
msgstr "The statue's eyes change suddenly, and it turns into a seven-colored phoenix, giving off a golden light.\n"

msgid "她国色天香，娇丽无伦；温柔娴静，秀绝人寰。\n可惜眉心上有一道地煞纹干犯紫斗，恐要玉手\n染血，浩劫武林。\n"
msgstr "She is a beauty beyond compare, delicate and lovely, gentle and serene, a loveliness rare in this world.\nA pity that between her brows is an Earth Fiend mark that offends the Purple Star; she is fated to have blood on her fair hands and to bring calamity upon the wulin.\n"

msgid "她长得十分漂亮！让你忍不住多瞧她几眼，从她身上\n你闻到淡淡的香气。她很有礼貌的向你点头，优雅的\n动作，轻盈的步伐，好美哦!\n她是晚月庄主蓝止萍的养女。\n"
msgstr "She is very beautiful! You can't help looking at her a few more times, and from her\nyou catch a faint fragrance. She nods to you with great courtesy. Her graceful\nmovements and light steps are so lovely!\nShe is the adopted daughter of Lan Zhiping, Mistress of Latemoon Manor.\n"

msgid "咦..!你也喜欢玩啊! 我会做哦! \n不过我需要一根竹子! 你找来我帮你做! \n"
msgstr "Oh...! You like to play with them too! I can make one! \nBut I need a stalk of bamboo! You find it and I'll make it for you! \n"

msgid "筱薇对你微笑，和善的对你点点头。"
msgstr "Xiaowei smiles at you and nods kindly."

msgid "筱薇对你微笑，以纤细轻柔的声音 \n 说道：这位$RESPECT，你好！欢迎来到晚月庄。"
msgstr "Xiaowei smiles at you and says in a slender, gentle voice:\n \"Hello, $RESPECT! Welcome to Latemoon Manor.\""

msgid "我已经帮你做一个竹蜻蜓了呀! "
msgstr "I already made you a bamboo dragonfly!"

msgid "筱薇微笑的看著你说：你要作竹蜻蜓呀!\n"
msgstr "Xiaowei says with a smile, \"So you want to make a bamboo dragonfly!\"\n"

msgid "筱薇将你给她的竹子仔细的看了一下。说道：不错是根玉竹! \n"
msgstr "Xiaowei looks the bamboo you gave her over carefully and says, \"Yes, it's jade bamboo!\" \n"

msgid "筱薇将竹子周围的叶子弄掉，灵巧的削凿著。\n"
msgstr "Xiaowei strips the leaves from around the bamboo and begins to whittle and carve it deftly.\n"

msgid "经过不久，筱薇把竹蜻蜓做好了。\n"
msgstr "Before long, Xiaowei has finished the bamboo dragonfly.\n"

msgid "筱薇将做好的竹蜻蜓递给你，微笑说道：嗯! 做好了! \n"
msgstr "Xiaowei hands you the finished bamboo dragonfly and says with a smile, \"There! All done!\" \n"

msgid "采花少女是绮云镇居民的小孩，从小就到晚月庄来摘桂花，蓝止\n萍很喜欢她们，也教给她们了些基本的武功，时间久了，这些少\n女的功夫还都不错。\n"
msgstr "The flower-picking girls are children of Cloudweave Town. Since they were small they have come to Latemoon Manor to pick osmanthus. Lan\nZhiping is fond of them and has taught them some basic martial arts, and after a while these girls' skills have grown quite decent.\n"

msgid "顽皮的采花少女向你扮个鬼脸。  *^G^* \n"
msgstr "The naughty flower-picking girl pulls a face at you.  *^G^* \n"

msgid "采花少女说道：华中理工大学的桂花树比晚月庄多多了，你知道吗？\n"
msgstr "The flower-picking girl says, \"Huazhong University of Science and Technology has way more osmanthus trees than Latemoon Manor, you know?\"\n"

msgid "采花少女望着天边的晚霞，双手托着香腮，说道：我好想去华工大摘桂花。\n"
msgstr "The flower-picking girl gazes at the evening glow in the sky, chin in her hands, and says, \"I want to go pick osmanthus at Huazhong Tech so badly.\""

msgid "采花少女嘀咕着：听说华工的桂花有好几种呢。\n"
msgstr "The flower-picking girl mutters, \"I heard Huazhong Tech has several kinds of osmanthus.\""

msgid "采花少女秀眉微蹙，说道：你欺负我年纪小是吗？\n"
msgstr "The flower-picking girl knits her pretty brows. \"You're picking on me because I'm young, aren't you?\"\n"

msgid "采花少女说道：你要是再无理取闹，让火玫瑰毒死你！\n"
msgstr "The flower-picking girl says, \"If you keep making trouble for nothing, I'll let the Fire Rose poison you dead!\"\n"

msgid "采花少女骂道：你这无赖，别死缠着我！\n"
msgstr "The flower-picking girl scolds, \"You scoundrel, stop pestering me!\"\n"

msgid "桂花"
msgstr "Osmanthus"

msgid "华中理工大学的桂花树比晚月庄多多了，你知道吗？"
msgstr "Huazhong University of Science and Technology has way more osmanthus trees than Latemoon Manor, you know?"

msgid "一只可爱的长尾巴的小金鼠。 \n"
msgstr "A cute little golden mouse with a long tail. \n"

msgid "小金鼠摇摇尾巴!全身晃呀晃! \n"
msgstr "The little golden mouse wags its tail! Its whole body wobbles and sways! \n"

msgid "小金鼠眼睛眨呀眨!好像快睡著了! \n"
msgstr "The little golden mouse blinks and blinks! It looks about to fall asleep! \n"

msgid "嘟嘟玩太累了!睡著了! \n"
msgstr "Dodo played too hard and is tired! He's fallen asleep! \n"

msgid "小金鼠「嘟嘟」它跳啊跳的! \n"
msgstr "The little golden mouse \"Dodo\" hops and hops! \n"

msgid "小金鼠「嘟嘟」眼睛眨呀眨看著你 \n"
msgstr "The little golden mouse \"Dodo\" blinks and blinks, looking at you \n"

msgid "小金鼠发出「  叽! 叽!」」的叫声! \n"
msgstr "The little golden mouse goes \"Squeak! Squeak!\" \n"

msgid "一只羽毛鲜艳的小金丝雀。\n"
msgstr "A little canary with bright feathers.\n"

msgid "小金丝雀叽叽的叫! \n"
msgstr "The little canary chirps away! \n"

msgid "金丝雀用嘴整理羽毛。 \n"
msgstr "The canary preens its feathers with its beak. \n"

msgid "她看起来成熟中带有一些韵味。飘逸的长发\n十分迷人。\n"
msgstr "She looks mature and has a certain charm. Her flowing long hair\nis very charming.\n"

msgid "一只红眼睛的小白兔。\n"
msgstr "A little white rabbit with red eyes.\n"

msgid "小白兔蹦蹦跳跳的。\n"
msgstr "The little white rabbit hops and bounces.\n"

msgid "小白兔用嘴舔前肢。 \n"
msgstr "The little white rabbit licks its forepaw. \n"

msgid "舞曲谱啊，师姐她们练习舞步的时候才用的着，\n你也想学吗？ 嘻嘻...\n"
msgstr "The dance score? Only Senior Sisters use it when practicing steps,\nand do you want to learn it too? Hee hee...\n"

msgid "神像"
msgstr "Statue"

msgid "人灵「区冥」乃勇士寒于的魂魄所化成的十三个精灵之一。\n晚月庄的开山先辈，传说是其后裔子孙。故其为\n晚月庄的祖先神位。\n"
msgstr "The Human Soul \"Ouming\" is one of the thirteen spirits formed from the soul of the warrior Hanyu.\nThe founder of Latemoon Manor is said to be among his descendants. So it stands as the manor's\nancestral tablet.\n"

msgid "神像的目光落在你身上，柔和得像晚月。\n"
msgstr "The statue's gaze falls on you, soft as a late moon.\n"

msgid "你有一种奇特的感觉，彷佛有人在盯著你看。\n"
msgstr "You have a strange feeling, as if someone is staring at you.\n"

msgid "这是条用鹅卵石铺成的小路，往西可以看到一座用淡青色围墙围住\n的庭院，有两个身着彩衣的女子笑盈盈的站在那里说笑着，她们身后的\n一扇拱门，檐顶下面写着「晚月庄」。院墙那边飘出的阵阵曲声勾\n人魂魄，隐约还可闻到一股香气。\n"
msgstr "This is a path paved with river pebbles. To the west you can see a courtyard enclosed by a pale blue wall, where two women in bright clothes stand laughing and chatting. Behind them is an arched gate, and under its eaves are written the words \"Latemoon Manor\". Strains of music drift over the wall, enough to steal a soul, and you catch a faint scent of incense.\n"

msgid "你来到了这个小径的尽头，一个有著朱红漆大门大宅\n院矗立在你的面前，门口挂著两串灯笼,上面写\n得有字，像这样一间豪华的大宅院出现在这样的乡间野外\n，使你觉得有些突兀，大宅的南边、东边都是茂密的林子\n，看来也没有其他的路。\n"
msgstr "You reach the end of the path, and a great house with a vermilion-lacquered gate rises before you. Two strings of lanterns hang at the door, with writing on them. Such a grand house, standing in open country like this, strikes you as a little out of place. The woods to the south and east of the house are thick, and there seems to be no other way on.\n"

msgid "一走入这个庭园，扑鼻而来的便是一股若有似无，但是又沁人心\n脾的花香，庭园甚是宽敞，许多奇花异石错落其间，显是经过高手匠\n人的精心布置，西边花丛间可看到主屋的屋角，一条石板小径沿著假\n山通往主屋。\n"
msgstr "As soon as you step into this courtyard garden, a faint, fleeting fragrance of flowers floods your nose and soaks into the heart. The garden is spacious, with many rare flowers and strange rocks scattered through it, clearly laid out with great care by master craftsmen. To the west, among the flower beds, you can see a corner of the main house, and a flagstone path winds along the rockery toward it.\n"

msgid "走进大厅，抬头迎面看见的是一面紫红绣金挂幔，一面屏风将宽敞的\n大厅隔成两半，东西两面各设著七张紫檀雕案，案上一色白玉羊脂花瓶，\n瓶中插著粉红的处子牡丹，紫檀雕案中间又都挂著七尺来长的画轴，各式\n鸟兽虫鱼，翎毛丹青，栩栩如生，宛如要从画纸上飞出，嬉戏于大厅之中\n，这大厅中的富贵气派之中透著一股秀气，但是却也无一般富豪人家或酒\n店的庸脂俗粉之气。\n    屏风两旁的白石嵌云柱上工整地刻著一幅对联写道：\n\n    「座上珠玑照日月，却掩珠帘，难为芳心;\n      堂前飘香焕云霞，不知岁月，但晓清音。」\n\n"
msgstr "You walk into the great hall. Facing you is a purple-red curtain embroidered with gold, and a screen divides the wide hall in two. On the east and west sides stand seven rosewood carved tables each, and on each table a vase of white jade the color of mutton fat, holding pink virgin peonies. Between the tables hang scrolls seven feet long, painted with birds, beasts, insects and fish, feathers and flowers so lifelike they seem about to fly off the paper and frolic through the hall. There is wealth and grandeur here, yet a delicate grace within it, with none of the cheap powder and rouge of a rich man's house or a wine shop.\n    On the white stone pillars inlaid with cloud patterns on both sides of the screen, a couplet is carved in neat characters:\n\n    \"Pearls and jade on the seats outshine sun and moon, yet pearl curtains hide them, and a heart is hard to win;\n      Fragrance drifts before the hall and lights the rosy clouds, the years go unmarked, and only clear music is known.\"\n\n"

msgid "这里是晚月庄接待宾客的傍厅，厅中摆了一张桌几，上面摆著\n一块大红镶金桌巾，靠东壁面西设著半旧青缎靠背引枕，两张太师\n椅座。桌几上有一精致的茶壶，旁有盛好的上等茗茶。\n"
msgstr "This is the side hall where Latemoon Manor receives guests. A table stands in the hall, covered with a red cloth trimmed in gold, and against the east wall, facing west, are a half-worn blue satin cushion for leaning on and two grand armchairs. On the table is a delicate teapot, with fine tea poured beside it.\n"

msgid "这是晚月庄后的小小庭院，面积似乎不大，但花木扶疏，举目四望，\n竟种满了无数梅花，婉约娟秀，别有一番滋味。清风徐来，梅花特有的\n清香弥漫在风中.....\n"
msgstr "This is a small courtyard at the back of the manor. It doesn't look large, but the flowers and trees are lush and spread out, and wherever you look it is planted with countless plum blossoms, graceful and delicate, with a charm all its own. When a breeze comes, the special fragrance of plum blossoms drifts through the wind...\n"

msgid "你走在一条长廊上，两旁都是庭台堂庑，廊上弥漫著一股\n香郁的气息，廊下是由青石砖铺成，一边接后厅内院，一边的\n尽头则是一幅大石壁画，西侧似有一铜门。\n有一间书房。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a long corridor, with halls and rooms on both sides. A rich fragrance fills the corridor, and the floor below is paved with bluestone bricks. One end joins the inner court of the back hall, and the other ends at a great stone wall painting. On the west side there seems to be a bronze door.\nThere is a study.\n"

msgid "这里四面都是单调的墙壁。通常庄内弟子犯错就是\n关在这儿！反省思过。\n"
msgstr "All four sides here are plain walls. This is usually where disciples of the manor are shut up when they've done wrong! To reflect on their faults.\n"

msgid "你走在一条长廊上，两旁都是庭台堂庑，廊上弥漫著一股\n香郁的气息，长廊向东西方延伸而去。东边是后厅院子，西边\n有一间书房。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a long corridor, with halls and rooms on both sides. A rich fragrance fills the corridor. The corridor runs east and west. To the east is the back hall's courtyard, and to the west is a study.\n"

msgid "这是一间小小的书房，窗明几净，朴素典雅，一张古意盎然的红木书桌，\n吸引了你的目光，上面摆著一座小小的香炉，几本善本书整齐的堆放在桌上\n，可见主人相当的爱惜书本。一幅「沧海龙吟」的舞曲图画挂在墙上，似乎\n有一些秘密在里头。\n"
msgstr "This is a small study, bright and clean, plain and elegant. An old-fashioned rosewood desk catches your eye, with a small incense burner on it and a few rare editions neatly stacked, which shows how much the owner cherishes books. A dance chart, \"Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea\", hangs on the wall, as if some secret lay within it.\n"

msgid "这是一间密室。地上铺著可以合地打坐的大理石床。四周挂了一\n些兵器，正面墙上写了偌大的 『 舞 』字！ 地板上隐约看到一幅先\n天八卦图。中央画著两仪，八个角落分别是：乾坤兑离震巽坎艮、等\n卦相。墙上画著几幅玄天玉女翩然起舞的美妙步法。\n"
msgstr "This is a secret room. The floor is laid with marble beds on which one can sit in meditation. Weapons hang all around, and on the front wall is written a huge character, \"Dance\"! On the floor you can faintly make out a Former Heaven bagua diagram. The two forces are drawn in the center, and in the eight corners are the trigrams: Qian, Kun, Dui, Li, Zhen, Xun, Kan and Gen. On the walls are painted several scenes of the Jade Maiden of Dark Heaven dancing her wondrous steps.\n"

msgid "你从后廊往西出了内厅进入穿堂。往北是内院，一条宽过道，西  \n面立著一个粉油大影壁，后有一大半门，小小的一所庭宇。\n"
msgstr "You leave the inner hall westward along the rear corridor and enter a passage hall. To the north is the inner court, a wide passage. To the west stands a large pink-painted screen wall, and behind it a big half-door leads to a small, secluded courtyard.\n"

msgid "走入内厅，你看到袭地铺满红毯。四面相对十二张雕漆椅上，都\n是一色灰鼠椅搭小褥，厅中摆了小屏风，四周挂满山水墨画。一个木\n隔架，旁边还有一碧纱橱。\n"
msgstr "You enter the inner hall and see a red carpet covering the floor. Twelve carved lacquer chairs face one another on all four sides, each with a gray squirrel-fur cushion on it, and a small screen stands in the middle of the hall, with ink landscapes hung all around. There is a wooden shelf, and next to it a green gauze cabinet.\n"

msgid "你走在后厅内院的仪门，是晚月庄后厅内院长廊走道的相接路\n口。东北方是往膳房的夹道，西面是长廊夹道，南面是到后厅，往北\n则可走出大门前往前院。\n"
msgstr "You are at the ceremonial gate of the back hall's inner court, where the long corridors of the court meet. To the northeast is a narrow lane leading to the dining hall, to the west is a corridor lane, to the south is the back hall, and to the north you can leave by the main gate toward the front court.\n"

msgid "你走在后厅内院的夹道上，庄内像这样的走廊很多，你若没有地\n理概念很容易迷路。长长的走道中, 纯金铸成的长灯架上挂了一排饰\n丽的宫灯! 入夜之后灯火辉煌! 十分美丽!\n"
msgstr "You are in a lane of the back hall's inner court. The manor has many corridors like this, and without a sense of direction you easily get lost. Along the long passage, rows of ornate palace lanterns hang from long lamp stands cast of pure gold! After dark the lights are dazzling! Very beautiful!\n"

msgid "这是一间客房，两边摆了一对小茶几。上面的彩绘瓶中插了一束\n琼花，茶几旁两张雕漆椅。整个房间简朴幽静，为晚月庄供外客留宿\n的一间厢房。\n"
msgstr "This is a guest room, with a pair of small tea tables on either side. In the painted vase on each stands a bunch of jasmine, and beside the tables are two carved lacquer chairs. The whole room is plain and quiet, one of the wing rooms where Latemoon Manor lodges outside guests.\n"

msgid "这是一间上等厢房，光线适中。近窗边有一张桌子，旁有书橱!\n还有一个古琴放在平台上! 墙上除了美丽的饰物外，还挂了一些书画\n有一浓郁清新的书香气息! 通常是给远道而来的贵客休憩夜宿的一间\n上等厢房。\n"
msgstr "This is a fine wing room with moderate light. By the window is a table with a bookcase beside it! An old zither also rests on a platform! Besides beautiful ornaments, the walls hold some calligraphy and paintings, with a rich, fresh air of books! It is usually where honored guests from afar rest for the night.\n"

msgid "你走进一间装饰华丽的大饭厅，有一种说不出的气派，一张杉木  \n雕饰的大圆桌子在厅子中央，铺著丝绸彩桌巾，上等南湖紫玉盘，湘\n陵的瓷玉碗，银匙金筷。十分奢华。这是晚月庄宴请宾客的地方，平\n常也是庄主及庄内辈份高的前辈用膳的地方。\n"
msgstr "You walk into a splendidly decorated dining hall, with an air of grandeur you can't quite name. A big round table of carved cedar stands in the middle of the hall, spread with a silk cloth of many colors, with fine Nanhu purple jade plates, porcelain-jade bowls from Xiangling, and silver spoons and gold chopsticks. It is truly lavish. This is where Latemoon Manor entertains its guests, and ordinarily where the Mistress and the manor's senior elders take their meals.\n"

msgid "这是一间膳房，中央摆了二张大圆桌。周围三十二张雕饰木藤椅。\n平常庄内上下用膳的地方，东边是厨房，西边则是大饭厅，这虽然不\n及饭厅华丽，但所有锅盘匙碗，也都是上等珍品。有大户人家的气派\n与富贵。\n"
msgstr "This is the refectory, with two big round tables in the middle and thirty-two carved rattan chairs around them. It is where everyone in the manor eats on ordinary days. To the east is the kitchen, and to the west the great dining hall. It is not as grand as the dining hall, but every pot, plate, spoon and bowl is a fine treasure, with the air of a great and wealthy household.\n"

msgid "你走进厨房，看到有好多的烹饪用品与设备，小蒸笼、大锅、平  \n炊灶、烧饭炉等，五花八门，式样齐全。旁边的大仓储中，更放满各\n式各样山珍美味，各种材料，调味物品应有尽有。里头的掌厨师姐们\n忙里忙外，在为准备一道道佳肴辛苦著! 闻到那阵阵美味的菜香，你\n的肚子咕噜咕噜叫了起来!\n"
msgstr "You walk into the kitchen and see all kinds of cooking tools and equipment: small steamers, big woks, flat stoves, rice cookers, in every variety and style. In the big storeroom nearby are all sorts of mountain delicacies, ingredients and seasonings, nothing missing. The Senior Sisters in charge of the cooking bustle in and out, working hard on one fine dish after another! Smelling the wafts of tasty food, your stomach starts to rumble!\n"

msgid "你进了后厅，这是后院上房五间中，最大的一间厅房。四面墙            \n壁，玲珑剔透，琴剑书画，挂在墙上。锦笼纱罩，金彩珠光，连地上                  \n踏的砖，皆是碧绿凿花，是雕空的紫檀板壁。厅上摆了二十六张桧木\n交椅，庄内对外展示舞步表演，都是在这举行。\n"
msgstr "You enter the back hall, the largest of the five main rooms at the back of the court. The four walls are delicate and carved through, with zithers, swords, books and paintings hung on them. Brocade cages and gauze covers, golden gleam and the shine of pearls; even the bricks underfoot are green and chiseled with flowers, and the paneling is openwork rosewood. Twenty-six cypress chairs stand in the hall. When the manor shows its dance performances to outsiders, they are held here.\n"

msgid "这是一间安静的书房, 光线适中, 近窗边有一张桌子, 旁有书橱\n还有一个古琴放在平台上! 墙上除了美丽的饰物外, 还挂了一些书画                  \n有一股浓郁清新的书香气息!\n"
msgstr "This is a quiet study with moderate light. By the window is a table with a bookcase beside it. An old zither also rests on a platform! Besides beautiful ornaments, the walls hold some calligraphy and paintings, with a rich, fresh air of books!\n"

msgid "这是一间安静的书房, 光线适中。近窗边有一张桌子，旁有书橱! \n还有一个古琴放在平台上! 墙上除了美丽的饰物外，还挂了一些书画 \n有一股浓郁清新的书香气息! \n"
msgstr "This is a quiet study with moderate light. By the window is a table with a bookcase beside it! An old zither also rests on a platform! Besides beautiful ornaments, the walls hold some calligraphy and paintings, with a rich, fresh air of books! \n"

msgid "通过后厅走道，接著你走进东厢房走道。除了长长的走道中，\n一排饰丽的宫灯! 走道两旁摆设了许多奇花异草，各有各的特色与\n形态，空气中弥漫一种淡淡的香气。往南通往东厢房。\n"
msgstr "Passing through the back hall's walk, you enter the East Wing walk. Along the long passage hangs a row of ornate palace lanterns. Rare flowers and strange plants line both sides, each with its own character and form, and a faint scent hangs in the air. To the south is the way to the East Wing.\n"

msgid "通过后厅走道，接著你走进东厢房走道。除了长长的走道中，\n一排饰丽的宫灯! 走道两旁摆设了许多奇花异草，各有各的特色与\n形态，空气中弥漫一种淡淡的香气。东面你看到一扇厢门。\n"
msgstr "Passing through the back hall's walk, you enter the East Wing walk. Along the long passage hangs a row of ornate palace lanterns. Rare flowers and strange plants line both sides, each with its own character and form, and a faint scent hangs in the air. To the east you see a door to a wing room.\n"

msgid "你进入东厢房来，临窗的地上铺著猩红毛毯，正面设著大红金钱\n蟒靠背，石青金钱蟒引枕，秋香色金钱蟒大条褥。两边设一对梅花式\n红漆小几，几上茗琬瓶花俱备。这是一间上等厢房。\n"
msgstr "You enter the East Wing. By the window the floor is spread with a scarlet blanket, and on the front is a great red leaning-back seat woven with gold coin-and-python patterns, with a stone-blue cushion and a wide mattress in autumn-fragrance color, in the same pattern. On both sides is a pair of plum-blossom-shaped small red lacquer tables, with bowls of tea and vases of flowers on them. This is a fine wing room.\n"

msgid "通过后厅走道，接著你走进西厢房走道。长长的走道中，纯金\n成的长灯架上挂了一排饰丽的宫灯! 走道两旁摆设了许多奇花异草，\n空气中弥漫一种淡淡的香气。在一柱柱雕饰华丽的长柱，刻画许多\n彩绘的图形，美不胜收。\n"
msgstr "Passing through the back hall's walk, you enter the West Wing walk. Along the long passage, rows of ornate palace lanterns hang from long lamp stands cast of pure gold! Rare flowers and strange plants line both sides, and a faint scent hangs in the air. On the long pillars, richly carved, many painted figures are drawn, a beauty beyond words.\n"

msgid "你走在西厢房走道上。长长的走道中，纯金成的长灯架上挂了一排\n饰丽的宫灯! 走道两旁摆设了许多奇花异草，空气中弥漫一种淡淡的香\n气。在一柱柱雕饰华丽的长柱，刻画许多彩绘的图形，美不胜收。西面\n你看到一扇门。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along the West Wing walk. Along the long passage, rows of ornate palace lanterns hang from long lamp stands cast of pure gold! Rare flowers and strange plants line both sides, and a faint scent hangs in the air. On the richly carved long pillars are drawn many painted figures, a beauty beyond words. To the west you see a door.\n"

msgid "你进入西厢房来，地下面西放著四张椅子，都搭著银红撒花椅被\n椅子两边有一对高几，右边几上文王鼎，匙筋香盒；左边几上汝窑美\n人瓶内插著花卉茗琬棰壶等物。隔窗望去，隐约可看见花园景色。.\n"
msgstr "You enter the West Wing. Four chairs face the west on the floor, each draped with a silver-red chair cover scattered with flowers. Beside the chairs on each side stands a tall stand: on the right, a Wenwang tripod and a box of incense with spoon and chopsticks; on the left, a Ru-ware beauty vase holding flowers, with tea bowls and a pot. Looking through the window, you can dimly see the garden scenery.\n"

msgid "你进了内厅，迎面挂著葱绿洒花软帘，掀帘进去，抬头一看，\n只见四面墙壁，玲珑剔透，琴剑书画，挂在墙上。锦笼纱罩，金彩\n珠光，连地上踏的砖，皆是碧绿凿花，左一架书，右一架屏。四面\n是雕空的紫檀板壁。\n"
msgstr "You enter the inner hall. A light green curtain sprinkled with flowers hangs before you. Lift it and go in, look up, and you see four walls, delicate and carved through, with zithers, swords, books and paintings hung on them. Brocade cages and gauze covers, golden gleam and the shine of pearls; even the bricks underfoot are green and chiseled with flowers. On the left a shelf of books, on the right a screen, and on all four sides openwork rosewood paneling.\n"

msgid "通过『 垂花门 』便是往后院。垂花门为男女之门限，古来女\n人就有「大门不出，二门不迈」的谚语，于是二门堪称为男女门限\n。后院为庄内女弟子厢房，与湘园。东面一扇小门，为庄内更衣沐\n浴的小花池。更是严禁外人胡乱闯入。\n"
msgstr "Beyond the Hanging-Flower Gate lies the rear court. The Hanging-Flower Gate is the boundary between men and women; since ancient times women have had the saying, \"Don't leave by the great gate, don't cross the second gate,\" so the second gate is the line between the sexes. The rear court holds the women disciples' wing rooms, and the Xiang Garden. A small door on the east side leads to the manor's small flower pool, for changing clothes and bathing, which outsiders are strictly forbidden to enter.\n"

msgid "这是一间更衣室，你看到许多柜子，衣架上挂了许多的衣服饰\n品。墙上的架上挂了一些丝巾，你可以闻到淡淡的香气围绕四周。\n东侧一蓝青洒花软帘，隔帘望去，隐约可看到小花池，一团的雾气\n你有点想去冲凉沐浴，让精神好些。当然此处是禁止男性进入!\n"
msgstr "This is a changing room. You see many cabinets, and many clothes and ornaments hang on the racks. Some silk scarves hang on the shelves on the wall, and you can smell a faint fragrance all around. To the east a soft blue curtain sprinkled with flowers hangs, and through it you can dimly see the small flower pool, with a cloud of mist. You feel a bit like going for a wash and a bath to refresh your spirit. Of course, men are forbidden here!\n"

msgid "这是一个小花池，清澈的池水含著淡淡的幽香。池周围有许多奇花    \n异草，时如至芝兰之室，清香袭脑，温馨荡魄。缤纷的花瓣飘在池上，\n云幢羽葆中，簇拥著许多师姐妹，有的嘻戏玩耍，有的翩然起舞。你也\n想到小花池中沐浴休憩。\n"
msgstr "This is a small flower pool. The clear water carries a faint, hidden fragrance. Many rare flowers and strange plants surround the pool, as if you had entered a room of orchids, the scent rising to your head and warming the soul. Colorful petals drift on the water, and amid the banners and plumes, many Senior and Junior Sisters crowd around, some playing and laughing, some dancing gracefully. You'd like to bathe and rest in the pool too.\n"

msgid "你走到前院，你看到几块山石，东面一处假山小池。其上植有藤  \n萝、青芷，异草芬芳荔薛。池中几尾小鱼自在的游来游去。假山外隔\n著围篱，有一种山怀中的小花园的感觉。.\n"
msgstr "You come to the front yard and see a few rocks, and to the east a small pool by a rockery. Vines and angelica grow on it, with strange grasses giving off fragrance. A few small fish swim in the pool at ease. Beyond the rockery is a fence, which gives the feeling of a little garden in the arms of the mountain.\n"

msgid "走进月洞门，只见迎面一带翠嶂，挡在南面。只见白石崚嶒，  \n或如鬼怪，或如猛兽，纵横拱立，上边苔藓成斑，藤萝掩映，其\n中微露羊肠小径。往南进入翠嶂，往北是小花厅。\n"
msgstr "Passing through the moon gate, you see a green screen of rock blocking the way to the south. White stones jut sharp, some like ghosts, some like fierce beasts, standing crosswise and in rows, spotted with moss and hung with creepers, with a narrow winding path faintly showing through. To the south you enter the green screen, and to the north is the small flower hall.\n"

msgid "穿过一层竹篱、花嶂编的月洞门，在你眼前出现的是那由粉墙环\n护，绿柳周垂的翠嶂。两边分别是游廊相接通往桃花林与长廊曲洞。\n在这儿一棵西府海棠吸引你的注意，只见其势若伞，丝垂翠\n缕，葩吐丹砂，十分漂亮。\n"
msgstr "Passing through a moon gate woven of bamboo fence and flower screens, what appears before you is a green screen ringed by pink walls and surrounded by green willows. On either side, covered corridors lead to the peach grove and to the long corridor tunnel. Here a Xifu crabapple tree draws your attention, its shape like an umbrella, its branches hanging in green threads, its blossoms red as cinnabar, very beautiful.\n"

msgid "湘园的桂花小径是以不同颜色的细石砌成各种图案。路面的\n图案组成，全员是一个整体。但每幅图案又有独立的内容，总计\n花石子路上约有二百幅。沿路观赏，美不胜收。\n"
msgstr "The osmanthus path of Xiang Garden is laid with fine stones of different colors in all sorts of patterns. The patterns on the road form one whole, but each picture has its own content, about two hundred of them in all along the flower-stone path. Walking along and admiring them, you find them beyond beautiful.\n"

msgid "你走入一长廊曲洞，里头略略的有几点山石，种著芭蕉，你可以\n听到潺潺的流水声，这里是园内假山开凿的通道，蜿蜒盘旋，从洞口\n向外望去，是一碧清的水池。顺著曲径走去，转了两个弯子，看见一\n座石板桥。\n"
msgstr "You enter a long, winding grotto. A few rocks sit inside, with plantains growing, and you can hear the murmur of flowing water. This is a passage cut through the garden's rockery, twisting and coiling, and looking out from the mouth you see a clear green pool. Follow the winding path, and after two turns you see a stone slab bridge.\n"

msgid "这是一片桂花园，园内种植桂花树十万多株，枝干苍劲，枝叶  \n茂盛，树冠完整，富有生气。放眼展望，满遍披翠盖绿，葱郁的桂\n花树斑烂绚丽，优雅大方，碧海银花，清香阵阵。薰的游人醉，衣\n发常留馀香。\n"
msgstr "This is an osmanthus garden, planted with over a hundred thousand osmanthus trees, their trunks sturdy, their foliage thick, their crowns whole and full of life. Looking out, everything is draped in green, and the lush osmanthus trees glow in mottled splendor, graceful and generous, a sea of jade with silver flowers, fragrant in waves. It intoxicates the visitor, and the scent lingers in clothes and hair.\n"

msgid "你走至大桥前，见水如晶帘一般奔入，扶著藤栏过去，只见水\n上落花愈多，其水愈清，溶溶荡荡，曲折萦纡，池边两行垂柳，杂\n著桃、杏，遮天蔽日般，真无一些尘土。度过桥去则通往湖心亭。\n"
msgstr "You come before the big bridge, where the water pours in like a crystal curtain. Holding the vine railing, you cross, and the more fallen petals on the water, the clearer it is, brimming and winding, with two rows of weeping willows by the pool, mixed with peach and apricot, shading the sky and the sun, not a speck of dust. Cross the bridge to reach the lake pavilion.\n"

msgid "走在桥上，可以远观山坡帏脉，两边飞楼插空，雕饰绣栏，隐\n于亭园树木之间；俯而视之，则清流泻雪石磴穿云。朱红玉石为栏\n，环抱池沿，柳垂金线，桃吐丹霞。\n"
msgstr "Walking on the bridge, you can look far to the hills and slopes. On both sides towers soar into the sky, carved and embroidered railings hidden among the garden's trees and pavilions. Look down and a clear stream spills like snow, with stone steps threading through the clouds. Vermilion jade rails ring the pool's edge, with willows hanging golden threads and peach blossoms spitting rosy clouds.\n"

msgid "桂花园的石子甬道是以不同颜色的细石砌成各种图案。路面\n的图案组成，全员是一个整体。但每幅图案又有独立的内容，总\n计花石子路上约有二百幅。沿路观赏，美不胜收。\n"
msgstr "The pebble path of the osmanthus garden is laid with fine stones of different colors in all sorts of patterns. The patterns on the road form one whole, but each picture has its own content, about two hundred of them in all along the flower-stone path. Walking along and admiring them, you find them beyond beautiful.\n"

msgid "你一进了小轩内，只觉异香扑鼻，那些奇草仙藤，越冷越苍翠，\n都结了实，似珊瑚豆子一般，累垂可爱。房内雪洞一般，清凉舒适  \n，案上一个土定瓶，中供著数枝菊花，旁边放了两本书、茶瓯茶杯  \n而已，床上只吊著青纱帐幔被褥，也十分朴实。\n"
msgstr "As you enter the little lodge, a strange perfume fills your nose. The rare herbs and fairy vines grow greener the colder it gets, all bearing fruit, hanging down like coral beans, lovely. The room is like a snow cave, cool and comfortable. On the desk is a clay vase holding a few sprays of chrysanthemum, beside it two books, a tea bowl and a cup, and that is all. On the bed hang only green gauze curtains and a quilt, quite plain.\n"

msgid "亭子座落在园内小水池上，亭柱周围以弧形座凳式栏板，内外\n雕刻各种不同样式的梅枝，钻尖式紫琉璃瓦顶，天花板也有雕刻非\n常精细的百花图案。上下担额枋彩画题材是海墁式点金加彩琼花。\n体形别致，色彩丰富。亭边石桥飞架，通萃赏楼，轻灵精巧，为园\n中一大奇景。\n"
msgstr "The pavilion stands over a small pond in the garden. Around its pillars run curved seat-rails, carved inside and out with plum branches of every pattern, and the roof is tiled in pointed purple glaze. The ceiling too is carved with very fine designs of a hundred flowers. The upper and lower beams are painted with gilded, colored jasmine in the sea-spread style. Its shape is distinctive and its colors rich. A stone bridge flies over beside the pavilion to the Cuishang Tower, light and delicate, one of the garden's great wonders.\n"

msgid "暖香榭位于水池东岸，秋水山房之西，依岩为屋，结构曲折，\n极幽致，室小而精，尚朴去华，渊然静修，古香袭人。走进这里\n你有一种心源湛澈，天地虚灵，彷佛置身于仙境的感觉。往西面\n望去，水底亭台，历历可鉴。\n"
msgstr "Warm Scent Bower stands on the east bank of the pond, west of Autumn Water Mountain House. It is built against the rock, winding and twisting, deeply secluded, small but fine, plain and free of show, a place of deep and quiet cultivation, with an air of antiquity. Entering, you feel your mind clear and still, as if heaven and earth had gone hollow and spirit-bright, as if you stood in fairyland. Looking west, you can see terraces and pavilions beneath the water, clearly mirrored.\n"

msgid "转过翠嫣桥，隐隐露出一带黄泥筑就矮墙，墙头用稻茎掩护，\n有几百株杏花，如喷火蒸霞一般，里面数楹茅屋，外面却是桑、\n榆、槿、杉各色树木新条，随其曲折编就两溜青篱，篱外有一土  \n井，旁有一石牌。旁边有一些佳蔬菜花。\n"
msgstr "Past the Green Grace Bridge, a low wall of yellow mud comes faintly into view, its top shielded with rice straw. Several hundred apricot trees stand like roaring fire and steaming clouds, and inside are a few thatched rooms. Outside grow mulberry, elm, hibiscus and fir, each with new shoots, woven along the bend into two rows of green fence. Beyond the fence is an earthen well, with a stone marker beside it. Nearby are some fine vegetables and flowers.\n"

msgid "这是一座最精美的桥，全长十二米，宽度恰可走两人。石拱\n是单孔结构，青石桥面，汉白玉雕石栏杆，栏板上刻有精致美丽\n的花纹。二十个望柱头上各有一小孔雀，情态各异，饶有趣味。\n"
msgstr "This is the most exquisite bridge, twelve meters long and just wide enough for two people. The stone arch is a single span, the deck is bluestone, and the railings are carved of Han white jade, with fine and beautiful patterns on the panels. On each of the twenty posts sits a little peacock, each in a different mood, full of charm.\n"

msgid "你走在石子墁的花园甬路上，只见两边翠竹夹路，土地下苍苔\n布满，往东北你看到凤尾森森，龙吟细细，通往暖香榭。南面则是\n一个小门。西方通往园中小桥。\n"
msgstr "You are on a garden path paved with laid stones, with green bamboo crowding both sides and moss spread over the ground. To the northeast you see dense stands of phoenix-tail bamboo, their dragon-songs soft and fine, leading to Warm Scent Bower. To the south is a small door. To the west a way leads to the small bridge in the garden.\n"

msgid "这是晚月庄的后门，在美丽的湘园南侧，这有一个木制的小门。\n走出门外应是通往天山的小径。\n"
msgstr "This is Latemoon Manor's back gate, on the south side of beautiful Xiang Garden, a small wooden door. Outside, the road should lead to a trail up to Tianshan.\n"

msgid "你走在后厅二楼的走廊上，庄内像这样的走廊很多，你若没有地\n理概念很容易迷路。长长的走道中, 纯金铸成的长灯架上挂了一排饰\n丽的宫灯! 入夜之后灯火辉煌! 十分美丽!\n"
msgstr "You are in the corridor on the back hall's upper floor. The manor has many corridors like this, and without a sense of direction you easily get lost. Along the long passage, rows of ornate palace lanterns hang from long lamp stands cast of pure gold! After dark the lights are dazzling! Very beautiful!\n"

msgid "这是晚月庄的舞曲步法研究室, 名曰「翠湘」。墙上刻画著各种\n基本步法与一些诗词曲赋。在每一位美女图的姿态形体之中，那种翩\n然起舞的曼妙舞姿，含蕴许多珍贵奇妙的舞步。你可以看到几位师姐\n一起走著奇特的步法，正在试著模拟这些舞步，一边低头沉思要如何\n运用，十分的投入。\n"
msgstr "This is Latemoon Manor's research room for dance pieces and steps, called \"Green Xiang\". On the walls are carved all kinds of basic steps and some poems, lyrics and verse. In the posture of every beauty in the pictures, in her graceful dancing form, lie many precious, wondrous dance steps. You can see several Senior Sisters walking strange steps together, trying to imitate these dances while lowering their heads to think how to use them, completely absorbed.\n"

msgid "这里是庄院二楼的佛堂门前，你可以闻到一股浓郁的檀香气息。\n走在这里你有一种庄严肃静的感觉，在闲暇之馀你觉得来到这可以\n暂时忘去周遭的烦人琐事，彷佛可以放开一切，所有时空都静止般\n的虚空幽静。西面你看到一扇檀香木门。\n"
msgstr "This is in front of the shrine room on the manor's second floor, and you smell a rich scent of sandalwood. Walking here gives you a solemn, hushed feeling. In your free time, you feel that coming here lets you forget the troublesome affairs around you for a while, as if you could let go of everything, all time and space still, empty and quiet. To the west you see a sandalwood door.\n"

msgid "这是专供庄内祭祀的佛堂，是一座精构楼阁，屋顶覆以琉璃瓦，四\n角钻尖覆以鎏金铜瓦。堂内供奉  人灵「区冥」，旁有雨神「天龙」、\n火神「凤凰」。两翼有琉璃鹤照壁，姿态生动。四周置陈神龛佛像，供\n盘塔磬，及一股檀香的气息。\n"
msgstr "This is the shrine room used for the manor's sacrifices, a finely built pavilion, its roof covered in glazed tiles, its four pointed corners covered in gilded copper tiles. Inside are enshrined the Human Soul \"Ouming,\" with the Rain God \"Heavenly Dragon\" and the Fire God \"Phoenix\" beside him. On both wings are glazed crane screen walls, lively in pose. Shrines and Buddha statues stand all around, with offering plates, pagodas, chimes, and a scent of sandalwood.\n"

msgid "这里是庄院二楼的前堂楼，有著传统的古式建筑风格。由上好的        \n桧木搭建而成, 东面一阵耀眼的的白光由两扇敞开的落地窗口射进来\n，泛映出一种清新幽静的格局。开了楼门出去可以一览庄院内外的山\n川景色，欣赏其美丽景观。\n"
msgstr "This is the front tower hall on the manor's second floor, in the traditional old style. Built of fine cypress, a dazzling white light comes in from the two open floor-length windows on the east, filling the place with a fresh, quiet air. Open the tower door and go out, and you can take in the mountains and rivers inside and out of the manor, and enjoy the beautiful view.\n"

msgid "这是晚月庄的前堂楼观景台，站在台前你可以看到整个庄院的  \n布局，瀚烟山美丽景色尽收眼里。微微的山风轻拂你的脸庞，有种\n说不出的轻爽。远处山寺的钟声，飞鸟的鸣啼，与眼前的景色构成\n一幅山林风光的风景画。正下方是前院。\n"
msgstr "This is Latemoon Manor's front-tower viewing deck. Standing before it you can see the layout of the whole manor, and the beautiful scenery of Hanyan Mountain lies spread before your eyes. A soft mountain wind brushes your face, with a lightness you can't describe. The bell of a mountain temple far off, the cry of birds in flight, and the view before you make a picture of mountain and forest. Directly below is the front yard.\n"

msgid "这是晚月庄让弟子们静修的地方, 名曰「缀芳」。简单的布置加上\n一座檀香炉, 你觉得这绝对是一个静修的好场所。空气中弥漫\n著一股肃穆的气息, 使人很容易进入忘我的境界。\n"
msgstr "This is where Latemoon Manor lets its disciples practice quiet cultivation, called \"Blossom\". With simple furnishings and a sandalwood censer, you feel this is certainly a fine place for quiet meditation. A solemn air fills the room, making it easy to enter a state of selflessness.\n"

msgid "你走在一条蜿蜒的小径, 小径的两旁是半个人高的杂草, 你可以感受\n到清凉的微风从两侧吹来。\n"
msgstr "You walk on a winding trail, with weeds half a person high on either side, and you can feel a cool breeze coming from both sides.\n"

msgid "你走在这条蜿蜒的小径上, 本来向北走的小径被一道峭壁挡住了,\n因此小径从这弯向东边去, 在你的西边是一片杂草和几棵小树。\n"
msgstr "You walk on this winding trail. The trail that once led north is blocked by a sheer cliff, so it bends east here, and to your west is a stretch of weeds and a few small trees.\n"

msgid "条蜿蜒的小径通往东南方, 在你的东面是一道峭壁, 而在你的\n南边是一片浓密的竹林。\n"
msgstr "The winding trail leads southeast. To your east is a sheer cliff, and to your south is a thick bamboo grove.\n"

msgid "这条蜿蜒的小径通往西南方, 西边是一片茂密的竹林, 小\n径两旁是绿油油的草地，凉风从草地上吹拂而过，像嬉戏的儿\n童般溜过你的足畔，使你不知不觉间脚步轻快了起来。\n"
msgstr "This winding trail leads southwest. To the west is a lush bamboo grove, and both sides of the trail are green grass. A cool wind sweeps across the grass, slipping past your feet like playing children, and before you know it your steps have grown light.\n"

msgid "这条蜿蜒的小径通往东南方, 在你的东面是一处陡坡, 而在你的\n西边是一座茂密的竹林。\n"
msgstr "This winding trail leads southeast. To your east is a steep slope, and to your west is a dense bamboo grove.\n"

msgid "这是一座茂密的竹林。当你进入后彷佛迷失了方向！\n"
msgstr "This is a dense bamboo grove. Once inside, you seem to lose your sense of direction!\n"

msgid "你现在的神太少了，无法专注跳出舞步！"
msgstr "You don't have enough Spirit right now to concentrate on the dance steps!"

msgid "你在卦象中跳起舞来。但似乎不得要领！"
msgstr "You dance in the bagua pattern. But you can't seem to get the knack!"

msgid "$N在卦象中跳起舞来..一曲「 有凤来仪 」突然..."
msgstr "$N {N:dance|dances} in the bagua pattern... a piece, \"The Phoenix Comes to Court\", suddenly..."

msgid "$N在卦象中跳起舞来..一曲「 西出阳关 」突然..."
msgstr "$N {N:dance|dances} in the trigram pattern... \"Westward Out of Yangguan\", and suddenly..."

msgid "请人替跳"
msgstr "Ask someone to dance for you"

msgid "冰匣已经开了。\n"
msgstr "The ice chest is already open.\n"

msgid "看我的！"
msgstr "Watch me!"

msgid "走到卦象中央，一个姿势，起舞——一曲「有凤来仪」，脚尖从乾到坎没点错一个。"
msgstr " steps into the middle of the bagua, strikes a pose and begins to dance, a piece, \"The Phoenix Comes to Court\", her toes touching every trigram from Qian to Kan without one mistake."

msgid "冰匣的盖子无声地滑开了。一件月白的衣从匣里浮起来，落在地上——寒气扑面，屋里的灯焰都矮了一截。\n"
msgstr "The lid of the ice chest slides open without a sound. A moon-white robe floats up from the chest and settles on the floor. A chill strikes your face, and the lamp flames in the room sink a little lower.\n"

msgid "好不好看！我得回去啦，不然蓝姐姐要骂。"
msgstr "Wasn't that pretty! I have to go back now, or Sister Lan will scold me."

msgid "替你跳一支？好。我舞跳得不好，这一支倒是会的。"
msgstr "Dance for you? Fine. I don't dance well, but this one I do know."

msgid "在卦象中起舞，一曲「有凤来仪」，轻得像没踩在地上。"
msgstr " dances in the bagua pattern, a piece, \"The Phoenix Comes to Court\", so lightly she seems not to touch the floor."

msgid "几百年没人跳对过——原来是要给人跳的。"
msgstr "Hundreds of years and nobody danced it right. It turns out it was meant to be danced for someone."

msgid "这里没有人替你跳。筱薇在隔壁的内厅，芳绫关在前院的禁闭房。\n"
msgstr "There's no one here to dance for you. Xiaowei is in the Inner Hall next door, and Fangling is shut in the Confinement Room in the front yard.\n"

msgid "你在神位前跳起舞来。但似乎不得要领！"
msgstr "You dance before the spirit tablet. But you can't seem to get the knack!"

msgid "舞到最后一转，满堂的檀香烟忽然一齐往上走。区冥神像的眉间亮了一下，像高处有人点了一盏灯。\n"
msgstr "On the last turn of the dance, the sandalwood smoke filling the hall all rises together. Between the brows of the Ouming statue something lights up, as if someone high above had lit a lamp.\n"

msgid "$N在区冥的神位前跳起舞来..一曲「 沧海龙吟 」，步子是图上的，曲子是谱上的..."
msgstr "$N {N:dance|dances} before Ouming's spirit tablet... \"Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea\": the steps from the chart, the tune from the score..."

msgid "沧海龙吟已经在神位前跳过了。\n"
msgstr "\"Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea\" has already been danced before the spirit tablet.\n"

msgid "图和谱还没凑齐，谁也跳不出沧海龙吟。\n"
msgstr "Without both the chart and the score, no one can dance \"Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea\".\n"

msgid "走到神位前，照着图上的姿势起舞——一曲「沧海龙吟」，转到第七转时裙角带起了风。"
msgstr " walks up before the spirit tablet and dances, following the poses on the chart, a piece, \"Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea\", and on the seventh turn her skirt hem stirs up a breeze."

msgid "跳成了！跳成了！我要去跟蓝姐姐说——不行，她会骂我偷跑出来。"
msgstr "I did it! I did it! I have to tell Sister Lan... no, she'll scold me for sneaking out."

msgid "沧海龙吟？谱是我让你去找的，这一支我来跳。"
msgstr "\"Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea\"? I'm the one who sent you to find the score, so I'll dance this one."

msgid "在神位前站定，袖子一扬，一曲「沧海龙吟」，满身都是寒谷的幽香。"
msgstr " takes her place before the spirit tablet, flicks her sleeves, and dances, a piece, \"Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea\", her whole body full of the hidden fragrance of Cold Valley."

msgid "几十年没人跳过了——区冥还认得。"
msgstr "Nobody has danced this in decades. Ouming still knows it."

msgid "这里没有人替你跳。翠湘阁的莫欣芳在回廊那头，芳绫关在前院的禁闭房。\n"
msgstr "There's no one here to dance for you. Mo Xinfang of Green Xiang Chamber is at the far end of the gallery, and Fangling is shut in the Confinement Room in the front yard.\n"

msgid "翻找"
msgstr "Search"

msgid "你盲目的找著，但无发现什么!\n"
msgstr "You search blindly but find nothing!\n"

msgid "你翻箱倒柜想找出手镯，但似乎毫无所获。\n"
msgstr "You turn the cabinet upside down looking for the bracelet, but seem to get nothing for it.\n"

msgid "你从橱子内取出玛瑙手镯。"
msgstr "You take an agate bracelet from the cabinet."

msgid "你在石床后面找到了一本舞曲谱！\n"
msgstr "Behind the stone bed you find a dance score!\n"

msgid "你在石床附近找了很久，结果一无所获。\n"
msgstr "You search near the stone bed for a long time and find nothing.\n"

msgid "沐浴"
msgstr "Bathe"

msgid "此处是禁止男性进入！男人下池沐浴会中火玫瑰毒：毒发时不断伤神，伤得重了会丧命。\n确定要下池沐浴吗？"
msgstr "Men are forbidden here! A man who bathes in the pool is poisoned by Fire Rose poison: when it takes hold, it keeps hurting your Spirit, and if badly hurt you can die.\nSure you want to bathe in the pool?"

msgid "确定沐浴"
msgstr "Bathe anyway"

msgid "你觉得池水好像有种奇特的沁凉！\n"
msgstr "The water of the pool feels strangely cool!\n"

msgid "你在池子中尽情沐浴，舒服的泡在池中。\n"
msgstr "You bathe to your heart's content in the pool, soaking comfortably.\n"

msgid "静修"
msgstr "Meditate"

msgid "你双手合掌，安静的坐在地上。\n"
msgstr "You press your palms together and sit quietly on the floor.\n"

msgid "你彷佛变的较为祥合慈善了! \n"
msgstr "You seem to have become a little more gentle and kind! \n"

msgid "一只玄冰雕的匣子，齐膝高，匣盖上结着不化的霜。匣面刻着一行小字：凤仪起，匣自开。几百年没人跳对过。\n"
msgstr "A chest carved of dark ice, knee-high, with a frost on its lid that never melts. A line of small characters is cut in its face: \"When the phoenix rises, the chest opens on its own.\" Hundreds of years and no one has danced it right.\n"

msgid "灯笼上几个娟秀的字迹写著：\n晚霞西照人影依稀 \n月影高挂和风婉约 \n"
msgstr "The lanterns bear a few delicate characters:\nSunset glow in the west, human shadows faint \nMoon high aloft, a soft and gentle breeze \n"

msgid "    你仔细观看石墙，突然发现原本单调的墙上隐隐约约出现了\n一幅渺渺茫茫，似有似无的景像。彷佛是幻境，但又似真实，你\n清楚的看到一首词：「梦里消魂无说处，觉来惆怅消魂误。」\n"
msgstr "    You look closely at the stone wall and suddenly notice that on the once plain wall a faint, hazy scene seems to appear, half there, half not. It seems an illusion, yet also real. You see clearly a lyric: \"In dreams the soul melts, with nowhere to say it; on waking, grief and regret that the soul melted in error.\"\n"

msgid "取出衣服"
msgstr "Take clothes"

msgid "你从橱子内取出布裙。"
msgstr "You take a cloth skirt from the cabinet."

msgid "橱子内的衣服好像被拿光了。"
msgstr "It seems the clothes in the cabinet have all been taken."

msgid "这是一个上等木材作成的小橱子，里面放了一些物品。\n你看到一件件的美丽衣饰，真想取出看看。\n"
msgstr "This is a small cabinet made of fine wood, with some things inside.\nYou see one beautiful garment after another and would like to take a look.\n"

msgid "这是一幅湘绣的彩图，上有几名貌美的女子，以不同的姿态\n舞著，其漫妙之处让你著迷。图旁另绣有一曲名『西出阳关』\n(dancing out)与『有凤来仪 』\n"
msgstr "This is a colorful Xiang embroidery with several beautiful women on it, dancing in different poses, their grace and charm captivating you. Beside the picture are embroidered the names of the pieces 'Westward Out of Yangguan' (dancing out) and 'The Phoenix Comes to Court'.\n"

msgid "摘花蕊"
msgstr "Pick a flower heart"

msgid "你从西府海棠中摘下一朵小花蕊。"
msgstr "You pick a small flower heart from the Xifu crabapple."

msgid "西府海棠上的小花蕊已经被摘光了。"
msgstr "The small flower heart on the Xifu crabapple has all been picked."

msgid "    你仔细看这是一棵形状有些奇特的西府海棠，有一淡淡\n的奇异香气。原来在旁边还有一朵不太起眼，但是略成金黄\n色的小花蕊，你的直觉告诉你它似乎是一种珍贵药材。你想\n把它摘下。\n"
msgstr "    You look closely: this is a somewhat oddly shaped Xifu crabapple tree, with a faint, strange fragrance. Beside it is also a small flower heart, not very noticeable, a little golden in color, and your instinct tells you it is some kind of precious medicinal herb. You'd like to pick it.\n"

msgid "\n 「六神」、「四鬼」、「三灵」 \n\n         旋芒震日月\n         宝剑护河山\n\n"
msgstr "\n \"Six Gods\", \"Four Fiends\", \"Three Spirits\" \n\n         Whirling Edge shakes sun and moon\n         Treasure sword guards the rivers and hills\n\n"

msgid "此处是禁止男性进入！闯进去的男人会被晚月庄的女弟子撒下火玫瑰毒、一脚踢出来：毒发时不断伤神，伤得重了会丧命。\n确定要进去吗？"
msgstr "Men are forbidden here! A man who barges in is showered with Fire Rose poison by Latemoon Manor's women disciples and kicked out: when it takes hold, it keeps hurting your Spirit, and if badly hurt you can die.\nSure you want to go in?"

msgid "确定进去"
msgstr "Go in anyway"

msgid "你将瓷杯交回给雨梅。\n"
msgstr "You hand the porcelain cup back to Yumei.\n"

msgid "你起身往南离开!"
msgstr "You stand and leave to the south!"

msgid "前庭"
msgstr "Front Court"

msgid "湘园"
msgstr "Xiang Garden"

msgid "跳下前院"
msgstr "Jump down to the front yard"

msgid "这种厚重的大刀，强盗喜欢用，份量大约十斤重。\n"
msgstr "A heavy broadsword, the kind robbers like to use. It weighs about ten jin."

msgid "这是一把很锋利的钢刀, 就是短了些。\n"
msgstr "A very sharp steel knife, only a little short."

msgid "一把量衣用的尺子，比一般的宽些。\n"
msgstr "A ruler for measuring cloth, wider than the usual kind."

msgid "一把长而锋利的剪刀。\n"
msgstr "A long, sharp pair of shears."

msgid "这件青色的袈裟洗得很是干净。\n"
msgstr "This blue-green kasaya has been washed very clean."

msgid "这件淡绿色的绸衫上面绣著几只彩蝶，煞是好看。\n"
msgstr "A pale green silk blouse embroidered with a few colorful butterflies. Very pretty."

msgid "这是一把耀眼的利刃，刀背上面带有道凹槽，乃是陈剑秋的成名武器。\n"
msgstr "A dazzling, sharp blade with a groove along its back. It is Chen Jianqiu's famous weapon."

msgid "才采的新茶，发出一股淡淡的香气。\n"
msgstr "Freshly picked new tea, giving off a faint fragrance."

msgid "棋子是一种较轻的暗器。\n"
msgstr "A go stone is a rather light kind of hidden weapon."

msgid "枚"
msgstr "piece"

msgid "这是一本介绍读书识字的入门书籍。\n开篇上赫然写着人之初，性本善什么的。\n"
msgstr "A primer for learning to read and write. The first page opens, big as life, with \"At birth, people are good by nature\" and the like."

msgid "看样子是牛的后腰，但是生肉, 不知能不能吃。\n"
msgstr "Looks like the loin of an ox, but it's raw. Who knows whether it can be eaten."

msgid "哇! 好香的牛腿! 不吃还等什么?\n"
msgstr "Wow! What a fragrant leg of beef! Why wait to eat it?"

msgid "牛腿骨"
msgstr "beef leg bone"

msgid "啃得精光的牛腿。\n"
msgstr "A leg of beef gnawed clean."

msgid "一根又粗又长的牛尾\n"
msgstr "A thick, long oxtail."

msgid "可以吃的杂碎\n"
msgstr "Offal, fit to eat."

msgid "哇! 好香的狗肉! 不吃还等什么?\n"
msgstr "Wow! What fragrant dog meat! Why wait to eat it?"

msgid "狗骨头"
msgstr "dog bone"

msgid "啃得精光的狗骨头。\n"
msgstr "A dog bone gnawed clean."

msgid "一条又粗又长僧棍，表面已被磨得十分光滑。\n"
msgstr "A thick, long monk's staff, its surface worn very smooth."

msgid "师叔：\n    小徒在我这里学满，欲求教于您老，敬请收纳他为徒。\n                                侄：剑秋 敬上\n"
msgstr "Martial Uncle:\n    The student I took on has learned all I can teach here, and wishes to seek your instruction. I humbly beg you to accept him as your disciple.\n                                Your nephew: Jianqiu, with respect\n"

msgid "这强盗满脸伤疤，虎背熊腰，一脸凶狠而霸道的样子。\n"
msgstr "This robber has a scarred face and a big, burly frame. He looks vicious and domineering."

msgid "看你也不象有钱的样子，大爷我只要十两金子意思一下。\n"
msgstr "You don't look like you've got money. Ten taels of gold, boss here will take, just for the trouble."

msgid "强盗喝道：呔！此山是我开，此树乃我栽。要想从此过，留下 买路财！\n"
msgstr "The robber roars: Halt! This mountain is mine, these trees I planted! Wanna pass this way, leave your toll money!"

msgid "强盗将你上上下下打量了一番，说道：识相的放下十两买路钱 走你的路。\n"
msgstr "The robber looks you up and down and says: Be smart. Leave ten taels of toll money and go on your way."

msgid "强盗显是以劫为生，刀刀冲要害而来。\n"
msgstr "Plainly a man who lives by robbery, the robber strikes at your vitals with every stroke."

msgid "强盗高喊：叫你人财两空。\n"
msgstr "The robber shouts, \"I'll leave ya with no money and no life!\""

msgid "强盗眼中放出异样的光彩，忙不迭的笑道：算你识相，以后我不会难为你的。\n"
msgstr "The robber's eyes light up strangely, and he grins, in a great hurry: Smart of ya. I won't make trouble for ya anymore."

msgid "强盗接过钱，眼睛瞪得大大的，点了点头，说道：大爷今天做个善人，放你条生路。还不快滚！\n"
msgstr "The robber takes the money, eyes wide, nods, and says: Boss is feelin' charitable today. I'll let ya go. Now scram!"

msgid "强盗往地上吐了口唾沫，目露凶光，说道：不给你点颜色你是不知道大爷的厉害！\n"
msgstr "The robber spits on the ground, a fierce light in his eyes, and says: If I don't teach ya a lesson, ya won't know what boss is worth!"

msgid "竟敢太岁爷头上动土？纳命来！"
msgstr "You dare stir up the Year God himself? Come and die!"

msgid "你看到一个剽悍的大块头, 正在用钢刀剔牛骨。\n"
msgstr "You see a burly, brawny fellow trimming meat off an ox bone with a steel knife."

msgid "这刀可是个宝物, 据说是当年张家老祖宗退隐时皇上赐的。"
msgstr "That knife is a treasure. They say the Emperor gave it to the first Zhang ancestor when he retired."

msgid "您也知道'碧海银针'？茶楼就在街对面，我常去的。"
msgstr "You know about Sea-Jade Silver Needle too? The teahouse is right across the street. I go there often."

msgid "屠夫边剔骨头边嘟囔着：真是好刀，剔得好舒服! \n"
msgstr "The butcher mutters as he trims the bone: Now that's a good knife, it cuts so nicely!"

msgid "屠夫摇摇头, 叹了口气说：唉, 不知那碧玉刀究竟比我这刀厉害几倍...\n"
msgstr "The butcher shakes his head and sighs, \"Ah, I wonder how many times better that green jade saber is than this knife of mine...\""

msgid "屠夫咧开大嘴, 笑着道：这位$RESPECT，要买肉是吗? \n"
msgstr "The butcher splits his big mouth in a grin: Looking to buy meat, $RESPECT?"

msgid "屠夫忙着给人取肉, 似乎没注意到你进来。\n"
msgstr "The butcher is busy fetching meat for someone, and does not seem to notice you come in."

msgid "一只绿头金翅的大苍蝇。\n"
msgstr "A big fly with a green head and golden wings."

msgid "茶博士正忙着招呼客人, 一手提着茶壶, 一手拿着抹布\n"
msgstr "The tea waiter is busy greeting customers, a teapot in one hand and a rag in the other."

msgid "这里就是香茗坊呀! 客官。"
msgstr "This is Sweetleaf Teahouse, sir!"

msgid "碧海银针"
msgstr "Sea-Jade Silver Needle"

msgid "您算是问着啦! 这可是百年的贡品啦，可惜..."
msgstr "Now you're asking! That is a hundred-year tribute tea. Too bad..."

msgid "金匾"
msgstr "Golden Plaque"

msgid "这是当今皇上的高祖御笔亲书的，好不威风!"
msgstr "The present Emperor's great-grandfather wrote that with his own brush. What grandeur!"

msgid "茶博士笑咪咪地说道：这位$RESPECT，进来喝杯茶，歇歇腿吧。\n"
msgstr "The tea waiter says with a smile: Come in and have a cup of tea, $RESPECT, and rest your legs."

msgid "茶博士用毛巾抹了抹靠门的一张桌子，说道：这位$RESPECT，请进请进。\n"
msgstr "The tea waiter wipes a table by the door with a towel and says: Come in, come in, $RESPECT."

msgid "茶博士说道：这位$RESPECT，进来尝尝才采的新茶叶。哇! 好香啊!...\n"
msgstr "The tea waiter says: Come in and try our fresh-picked new tea, $RESPECT. Wow! It smells wonderful!..."

msgid "棺材铺老板"
msgstr "Coffin Shop Owner"

msgid "这位面目慈善的老人经营棺材铺已经有很多年了。\n"
msgstr "This kind-faced old man has run the coffin shop for many years."

msgid "棺材"
msgstr "Coffin"

msgid "您这么年轻就要棺材，早了点吧？"
msgstr "Such a young person, wanting a coffin already? Isn't it a bit early?"

msgid "他一副垂头丧气的样子，一脸倒霉相。\n"
msgstr "He looks dejected, his face full of bad luck."

msgid "朱鸿雪慈眉善目，可又有谁能想到她竟是杀手组织中人。\n"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue looks gentle and kind, but who would guess she is one of an organization of assassins."

msgid "教主"
msgstr "Order Leader"

msgid "生命可贵！不要自寻死路！"
msgstr "Life is precious! Do not seek your own death!"

msgid "令牌"
msgstr "Token"

msgid "看着你，脸上的笑一点也没有了。"
msgstr " looks at you, and the smile on her face is gone entirely."

msgid "你手上有神教的血。令，不会再给你。"
msgstr "You have the Order's blood on your hands. The token will not be given to you again."

msgid "你手上有神教的血。令，不会给你。"
msgstr "You have the Order's blood on your hands. The token will not be given to you."

msgid "黄金令牌，是她给你的。神教认它。"
msgstr "The gold token. She gave it to you. The Order honors it."

msgid "黄金令牌在你身上。神教上下，见令如见我。"
msgstr "The gold token is on you. Everyone in the Order, seeing it, sees me."

msgid "赤铜令在你身上。神教的人认它，不认脸。"
msgstr "The red copper token is on you. The Order's people know it, not faces."

msgid "令在你身上，就是你的。神教的人认它，不认脸。"
msgstr "The token is on you, so it is yours. The Order's people know the token, not the face."

msgid "有差事，我会叫你。"
msgstr "When there is an errand, I will call you."

msgid "令不在你身上？神教的人认令，不认脸。"
msgstr "The token is not on you? The Order's people know the token, not the face."

msgid "从袖子里摸出一块旧黑木令，火焰的图腾磨得快看不清了。"
msgstr " fishes an old black-wood token from a sleeve, the flame totem on it worn almost past seeing."

msgid "神教的令不发新的。这一块是从湖边另一个没回来的人身上收的——拿好，别再丢了。"
msgstr "The Order does not issue new tokens. This one was taken from another man who never came back from the lakeside. Hold on to it, and don't lose it again."

msgid "接过黑木令，拿拇指抹掉火焰图腾上的泥，看了很久。"
msgstr " takes the black-wood token, rubs the mud off the flame totem with a thumb, and looks at it for a long time."

msgid "他没回来，令回来了。神教的规矩就是这样。"
msgstr "He didn't come back, but the token did. That is the Order's rule."

msgid "把令牌放回你手里。"
msgstr " puts the token back in your hand."

msgid "现在它是你的。带着它，神教的人见了你，就当见了自己人。"
msgstr "Now it is yours. Carry it, and the Order's people who see you will take you for one of their own."

msgid "令呢？"
msgstr "The token?"

msgid "听你说丢在了半路上，叹了口气，从袖子里摸出一块旧黑木令。"
msgstr " hears you say it was lost on the road, sighs, and fishes an old black-wood token from a sleeve."

msgid "神教的令不发新的，这一块是我收着的旧令。湖边那块，就当他没回来。"
msgstr "The Order does not issue new tokens. This is an old one I kept. As for the one by the lake, call it that he never came back."

msgid "把令牌放进你手里。"
msgstr " puts the token in your hand."

msgid "令只从上一个持令人手里接。你要的那一块，还在别人身上。"
msgstr "A token is only taken over from the last person who held it. The one you want is still on someone else."

msgid "笑眯眯地看着你，鼻子却皱了一下。"
msgstr " looks at you with a smiling face, though her nose wrinkles a little."

msgid "你身上一股流云轩的药味。山烟寺的人，神教不用。"
msgstr "You smell of the medicine of Drifting Cloud Lodge. The Order has no use for people of Mountain Mist Temple."

msgid "看见你腰间那块黑木令，脸上的笑一点没变。"
msgstr " sees the black-wood token at your waist, and the smile on her face does not change at all."

msgid "火焰的图腾。这块令，是神教的。"
msgstr "The flame totem. This token belongs to the Order."

msgid "神教的令不发新的，一块令只从上一个持令人手里接过来——你这块是从谁手里来的，我不问。"
msgstr "The Order does not issue new tokens. A token is only taken over from the last person who held it. Whose hand yours came from, I will not ask."

msgid "想替神教办事，问我「接令」。想好了再问：神教的事，接了就放不下。"
msgstr "If you want to work for the Order, ask me about \"Accept the Token\". Think it over before you ask: once you take the Order's business, you can't put it down."

msgid "看了看你腰间的令牌，又看了看你。"
msgstr " looks at the token at your waist, then looks at you."

msgid "你身上有逆灵宫那座道观的香灰味。神教的令，不交给替两家办事的人。"
msgstr "You carry the incense ash of that Daoist temple in the Black Palace. The Order's token is not given to people who serve two houses."

msgid "令牌？你身上没有我要看的东西。"
msgstr "The token? You have nothing on you that I want to see."

msgid "奇怪的眼神盯着你，说："
msgstr " stares at you with a strange look and says:"

msgid "就凭你这种小角色也想? 还不快滚!"
msgstr "A nobody like you wants that? Get lost, now!"

msgid "接令"
msgstr "Accept the Token"

msgid "接下朱鸿雪的令，替东方神教办事。\n一个人只藏得住一重身份：接了这块令，逆灵宫那边的门就不再为你开；山烟寺流云轩的门也一样。\n接吗？"
msgstr "Take Zhu Hongxue's token and work for the Golden Crow Order.\nA person can hide only one identity. Take this token, and the door on the Black Palace side will no longer open for you; neither will the door of Drifting Cloud Lodge at Mountain Mist Temple.\nTake it?"

msgid "慢慢摇了摇头。"
msgstr " slowly shakes her head."

msgid "你已经戴过逆灵宫的冠了。神教的令，不交给替两家办事的人。"
msgstr "You have already worn the Black Palace's crown. The Order's token is not given to people who serve two houses."

msgid "令你已经接了。我交代的事，去办。"
msgstr "You have already taken the token. Go and do what I told you."

msgid "第一桩不杀人。晚月庄的西厢住着一个人，住了三年——神教的一代教主。"
msgstr "The first job kills no one. In Latemoon Manor's West Wing lives a person who has lived there three years: the Golden Crow Order's first Leader."

msgid "去看看她在等谁。回来告诉我。"
msgstr "Go and see whom she is waiting for. Come back and tell me."

msgid "接什么令？"
msgstr "What token are you taking?"

msgid "照实说"
msgstr "Tell the Truth"

msgid "照实告诉朱鸿雪安妮儿说的话：那件衣，她不打算交给神教。\n朱鸿雪会记住这句话。\n照实说吗？"
msgstr "Tell Zhu Hongxue truthfully what Anni'er said: she does not mean to hand that robe over to the Order.\nZhu Hongxue will remember those words.\nTell her the truth?"

msgid "西厢的事，已经与你无关了。"
msgstr "What happened in the West Wing is no longer your concern."

msgid "西厢的话，你说过了。"
msgstr "You have already told me what was said in the West Wing."

msgid "上个月我派了一个人去玉螺湖，他没回来。令在他身上。"
msgstr "Last month I sent a man to Jade Conch Lake, and he did not come back. The token is on him."

msgid "入了夜，去湖畔的芦苇丛找他。湖边夜里不太平——把令带回来，再问我「令牌」。"
msgstr "When night falls, go find him in the reeds by the lake. The lakeside is not safe at night. Bring the token back, then ask me about \"Token\"."

msgid "西厢的话，你上回已经说过了。"
msgstr "You already told me what was said in the West Wing last time."

msgid "听你说完，把手里的茶盏放下了。"
msgstr " hears you out and puts down the teacup in her hand."

msgid "不交给神教。……她总是这样。"
msgstr "She will not hand it to the Order. ...She is always like this."

msgid "你没替她遮掩。神教的人，要的就是这个。"
msgstr "You did not cover for her. That is just what the Order's people want."

msgid "神教的令不发新的。一块令，只从上一个持令人手里接过来。"
msgstr "The Order does not issue new tokens. A token is only taken over from the last person who held it."

msgid "照实说什么？"
msgstr "Tell the truth about what?"

msgid "替她瞒"
msgstr "Cover for Her"

msgid "替安妮儿瞒下来，只说她在西厢等一个故人。\n安妮儿欠你一回；朱鸿雪信你这一回。\n瞒下来吗？"
msgstr "Cover for Anni'er, and say only that she is waiting in the West Wing for an old friend.\nAnni'er will owe you one; Zhu Hongxue will trust you this once.\nCover for her?"

msgid "西厢的话，你上回已经照实说过了。"
msgstr "You already told me the truth about the West Wing last time."

msgid "等一个故人。……好。"
msgstr "Waiting for an old friend. ...Good."

msgid "我信你这一回。"
msgstr "I trust you this once."

msgid "替谁瞒？"
msgstr "Cover for whom?"

msgid "你手上有神教的血。差事，不会再给你。"
msgstr "You have the Order's blood on your hands. No errand will be given to you again."

msgid "你手上有神教的血。"
msgstr "You have the Order's blood on your hands."

msgid "端起茶盏，又放下了。"
msgstr " lifts the teacup and sets it down again."

msgid "差事照旧派——只派该死的人。她说的。"
msgstr "Errands go on as before. We send out only those who deserve to die. So she said."

msgid "要差事，问我「任务」。"
msgstr "If you want an errand, ask me about \"Quests\"."

msgid "神教的差事，照旧。要差事，问我「任务」。"
msgstr "The Order's errands go on as before. If you want one, ask me about \"Quests\"."

msgid "名单念完了。你站哪一边，问「教主」。"
msgstr "The list has been read through. Which side you stand on, ask me about \"Order Leader\"."

msgid "名单上还有最后一个名字。出去走一走，再回来。"
msgstr "There is one last name on the list. Go out for a walk, and come back."

msgid "三个名字，都是靠近湖底那件东西的人。"
msgstr "Three names, all of them people who came close to that thing at the bottom of the lake."

msgid "玉螺湖村稻田西头的湖岸上，有个戴黑冠的道士，白天在那里量水——逆灵宫的人。"
msgstr "On the lakeshore at the west end of Jade Conch Village's rice paddies there is a Daoist in a black crown who measures the water by day. A person from the Black Palace."

msgid "天驼关黄石隘口，兵部派了个画吏，在山壁下画当年石匣出土的地方。打倒他，让他把图丢下就够了。"
msgstr "At the Yellow Rock narrows of Camelback Pass, the Ministry of War has sent a painter to draw the spot beneath the cliff where the stone box was dug up in those days. Knock him down and make him drop the drawing. That is enough."

msgid "第三个，是玉螺湖村凿冰的老头。他年年在湖上凿冰，看见过冰下的光，讲给村里的孩子听。"
msgstr "The third is the old man who chisels ice on Jade Conch Village's lake. Every year he chisels on the lake, he has seen the light beneath the ice, and he tells it to the village children."

msgid "办完了，回来问我「交差」。"
msgstr "When it is done, come back and ask me about \"Hand In\"."

msgid "从袖子里抽出一张纸，压在茶盏底下。"
msgstr " draws a sheet of paper from a sleeve and presses it under the teacup."

msgid "神教的差事，有时候是杀人，有时候是不让一样东西被人看见。"
msgstr "The Order's errands are sometimes killing a person, and sometimes keeping a thing from being seen."

msgid "差事？先把令接回来。"
msgstr "An errand? First get the token back."

msgid "交差"
msgstr "Hand In"

msgid "你手上有神教的血。差事，与你无关了。"
msgstr "You have the Order's blood on your hands. The errand is nothing to do with you now."

msgid "差事早交过了。黄金令在你身上，令是她给的。"
msgstr "The errand was handed in long ago. The gold token is on you, and she gave it."

msgid "差事早交过了。黄金令在你身上。"
msgstr "The errand was handed in long ago. The gold token is on you."

msgid "差事交过了。赤铜令在你身上。"
msgstr "The errand is handed in. The red copper token is on you."

msgid "黑木令呢？"
msgstr "The black-wood token?"

msgid "看了你一会儿，从袖子里摸出一块旧黑木令，丢到你手里。"
msgstr " looks at you for a while, fishes an old black-wood token from a sleeve, and tosses it into your hand."

msgid "神教的令不发新的，这一块是收回来的旧令。拿着它，再来交差。"
msgstr "The Order does not issue new tokens. This one is an old one taken back. Hold on to it and come hand in again."

msgid "es2:d/latemoon/room/npc/obj/token"
msgstr "es2:d/latemoon/room/npc/obj/token"

msgid "听你说完，点了点头。"
msgstr " hears you out and nods."

msgid "湖上凿冰的人没了。冰下的光，就没人再讲给孩子听。"
msgstr "The man who chisels ice on the lake is gone. Now no one will tell the children about the light under the ice."

msgid "黑木令给我。"
msgstr "Give me the black-wood token."

msgid "收回黑木令，从匣里取出一块赤铜令。"
msgstr " takes back the black-wood token and takes a red copper token from a box."

msgid "赤铜令，认的是替神教办成过事的人。"
msgstr "The red copper token is known to people who have gotten things done for the Order."

msgid "名单上还有最后一个名字——出去走一走，再回来。"
msgstr "There is one last name on the list. Go out for a walk, and come back."

msgid "native:village/ice_chisel"
msgstr "native:village/ice_chisel"

msgid "接过冰凿掂了掂，凿尖上的冰碴还没化。"
msgstr " takes the ice chisel and weighs it. The ice crumbs on the tip have not yet melted."

msgid "好。你在西厢没替人瞒过话——这一回，我也信你。"
msgstr "Good. You covered for no one in the West Wing. This time, I trust you too."

msgid "接过冰凿，看了很久，没有说话。"
msgstr " takes the ice chisel, looks at it for a long time, and says nothing."

msgid "人呢？冰凿呢？凭一张嘴，交不了差。"
msgstr "Where is the man? Where is the ice chisel? You can't hand in an errand on a mouth alone."

msgid "三个名字，还没办完。"
msgstr "The three names are not done yet."

msgid "交什么差？"
msgstr "Hand in what?"

msgid "站朱鸿雪：神教只有一个教主，是她。\n她收回赤铜令，给你黄金令牌，教你天山雪影剑和雪影心法；安妮儿回西厢闭门，往后不再同你说神教的事（宝衣要是在她手里，终章还没打完的，她照样带着它来）。正月十七那天，神教的杀手会在山道上截一派的轿子。\n这是东方神教这条线的大分裂，选了不能改。要站朱鸿雪吗？"
msgstr "Stand with Zhu Hongxue: the Order has only one Leader, and it is she.\nShe takes back your red copper token and gives you the gold token, and teaches you the Tianshan Snowshade Sword and the Snowshade Heart Method. Anni'er goes back into the West Wing and shuts the door, and from now on will not speak to you of the Order (if the robe is in her hands and the finale is not yet fought out, she will still bring it along as ever). On the seventeenth of the first month, the Order's assassins will stop one school's sedan chair on the mountain road.\nThis is the great split in the Golden Crow Order's line, and it can't be undone once chosen. Stand with Zhu Hongxue?"

msgid "神教只有一个教主。你知道是谁。"
msgstr "The Order has only one Leader. You know who it is."

msgid "我认输。教主令在她手里，我还坐在这里——神教总得有人倒茶。"
msgstr "I concede. The Order Leader's token is in her hands, and I am still sitting here. The Order has to have someone to pour the tea."

msgid "native:cloud/copper_token"
msgstr "native:cloud/copper_token"

msgid "看了你一会儿，笑了，眉眼还是那样慈善。"
msgstr " looks at you for a while and smiles, her eyes as kind as ever."

msgid "收回你的赤铜令，把一块闪闪发亮的黄金令牌放进你手里。"
msgstr " takes back your red copper token and puts a gleaming gold token in your hand."

msgid "黄金令，神教见了，就是见了我。天山雪影剑、雪影心法，往后来这里学。"
msgstr "The gold token: the Order, seeing it, sees me. The Tianshan Snowshade Sword and the Snowshade Heart Method, from now on, come here to learn them."

msgid "名单上的那个名字，等湖底的事了了，再说。"
msgstr "That name on the list. We'll speak of it when the matter at the bottom of the lake is over."

msgid "安妮儿没有再看朱鸿雪一眼，转身出了场院。"
msgstr "Anni'er does not look at Zhu Hongxue again, and turns and leaves the yard."

msgid "神教的教主，坐在你面前。"
msgstr "The Order's Leader sits before you."

msgid "还令"
msgstr "Return the Token"

msgid "把那块杀手令牌还给朱鸿雪：神教的令回了神教，内书房的老妇就没有它了（她的谢礼也没有了）。\n要还吗？"
msgstr "Return that assassin's token to Zhu Hongxue: the Order's token goes back to the Order, and the old woman in the inner study will no longer have it (her thanks are gone too).\nReturn it?"

msgid "令回来了。她的事，神教不再提。"
msgstr "The token is back. The Order will not bring up her business again."

msgid "那块令，你给了书房里那个老人家？……也好。人还活着，令在谁手里都一样。"
msgstr "That token. You gave it to the old person in the study? ...Just as well. If she is still alive, it does not matter whose hand holds the token."

msgid "你手上有神教的血。令，我不收。"
msgstr "You have the Order's blood on your hands. I will not take the token."

msgid "接过令牌，拿拇指抹过火焰的图腾。"
msgstr " takes the token and runs a thumb over the flame totem."

msgid "她还活着？……"
msgstr "She is still alive? ..."

msgid "笑了一下，又不笑了。"
msgstr " smiles for a moment, then stops smiling."

msgid "令回来了就好。神教的令，只从上一个持令人手里接；她不拿，就该回到我这里。"
msgstr "It is good that the token is back. The Order's token is only taken over from the last person who held it. If she will not keep it, it should come back to me."

msgid "你不是神教的人，却把神教的令送了回来。想替神教办事，问我「接令」——想好了再问。"
msgstr "You are not of the Order, yet you brought the Order's token back. If you want to work for the Order, ask me about \"Accept the Token\". Think it over before you ask."

msgid "你接过神教的令，又替神教收回了一块。我记你这一回。"
msgstr "You took the Order's token, and then took back another for the Order. I will remember this time."

msgid "令呢？在你身上，我才收。"
msgstr "The token? I take it only if it's on you."

msgid "还什么令？"
msgstr "Return what token?"

msgid "看见你进来，放下茶盏，笑眯眯地招了招手。"
msgstr " sees you come in, puts down the teacup, and beckons with a smiling face."

msgid "那件衣，你给了西厢。她说你配得上——她很少这么说。"
msgstr "That robe. You gave it to the West Wing. She says you deserve it. She seldom says that."

msgid "神教缺人。你要是有意，问我「接令」。神教的事，接了就放不下，想好了再问。"
msgstr "The Order is short of people. If you are willing, ask me about \"Accept the Token\". Once you take the Order's business, you can't put it down. Think it over before you ask."

msgid "西厢那位，记下了一个名字。她记下的人，我也要看一看。"
msgstr "The one in the West Wing has noted down a name. Whoever she notes down, I want to look at too."

msgid "宝衣从她门前过去了，你没给她。她不恨你——她只是记下了。"
msgstr "The robe passed by her door, and you did not give it to her. She does not hate you. She only noted it down."

msgid "放下茶盏，看了你一眼。"
msgstr " puts down the teacup and looks at you."

msgid "晚月庄那个使六阴剑的，回了她娘身边。神教少了一个人。"
msgstr "The Six-Chaos Sword user from Latemoon Manor has gone back to her mother's side. The Order is one person short."

msgid "人是你带回去的。……我不追。可神教的账上，记着这一笔。"
msgstr "You are the one who took her back. ...I will not chase. But the Order's ledger has this entry."

msgid "一位看上去很和蔼的老裁缝，正在缝制衣服。\n"
msgstr "A very kindly-looking old tailor, sewing a garment."

msgid "您也知道'碧海银针'？茶楼就在斜对面，我常去的。"
msgstr "You know about Sea-Jade Silver Needle too? The teahouse is just across the way. I go there often."

msgid "老裁缝抬起头看了你一眼，问道：客官买布还是制衣?\n"
msgstr "The old tailor raises his head and looks at you, and asks: Cloth or tailoring, sir?"

msgid "裁缝的手脚甚是麻利，显然已做了多年了。\n"
msgstr "The tailor's hands are quick and deft. He has plainly done this for many years."

msgid "卖杂货的是个年轻汉子，面带微笑。\n"
msgstr "The grocer is a young fellow with a smile on his face."

msgid "这是祖上传下来的产业，小的在勉力维持。"
msgstr "This is a business handed down from my forebears. I'm just doing my best to keep it going."

msgid "杂货贩笑脸相迎，道：这位$RESPECT，要买什么？\n"
msgstr "The grocer greets you with a smiling face and says: What can I get you, $RESPECT?"

msgid "杂货贩正忙着整理货架\n"
msgstr "The grocer is busy tidying the shelves."

msgid "药店的小伙计，正在学着配药。\n"
msgstr "A young assistant at the herb shop, learning to mix medicines."

msgid "抓药"
msgstr "Fill a Prescription"

msgid "这里是附近最好的药店，您要什么？"
msgstr "This is the best herb shop around. What do you need?"

msgid "小伙计称了几味药，包做个纸包。\n"
msgstr "The young assistant weighs out a few herbs and wraps them in a paper packet."

msgid "伙计点头道：这位$RESPECT，买药？\n"
msgstr "The assistant nods and says: Buying medicine, $RESPECT?"

msgid "卖兵器的是个中年人，满脸伤疤。\n"
msgstr "The weapon seller is a middle-aged man with a scarred face."

msgid "本店专卖各种长短兵器"
msgstr "This shop sells weapons of all kinds, long and short."

msgid "兵器贩子道：这位$RESPECT，自个儿挑一件称手的兵器吧\n"
msgstr "The weapon seller says: Pick yourself a weapon that feels right in your hand, $RESPECT."

msgid "兵器贩子突然间出了神，好象想起了他的往事\n"
msgstr "The weapon seller suddenly goes blank, as if remembering his past."

msgid "    这和尚是从南边山烟寺来的，寺院常在此化缘施斋。\n"
msgstr "    This monk comes from Mountain Mist Temple to the south. The temple often begs alms and gives out meals here."

msgid "和尚道：我佛慈悲，望住持不会怪罪我。\n"
msgstr "The monk says: Merciful Buddha. I hope the Abbot will not blame me."

msgid "贫僧即是山烟寺来的，从此南行便是。"
msgstr "This poor monk is from Mountain Mist Temple. Go south from here and you will reach it."

msgid "和尚说道：多谢这位$RESPECT，佛祖一定会保佑你的。\n"
msgstr "The monk says: Thank you, $RESPECT. The Buddha will surely bless you."

msgid "阿弥陀佛！出家人戒逞强恶斗！贫僧不敢违反清规。"
msgstr "Amitabha! Those who have left the world must not show off strength or fight in hatred! This poor monk dares not break the rules."

msgid "施主既然身负绝艺，贫僧佩服便是，也不必较量了。"
msgstr "Since you, Benefactor, carry such peerless skill, this poor monk admires you. There is no need to compete."

msgid "书局老板"
msgstr "Bookshop Owner"

msgid "潘老板长得很白净，一副读书人的老实相。\n"
msgstr "Proprietor Pan is fair-skinned, with the honest look of a scholar."

msgid "为读书人办点事也是尽一份心意。"
msgstr "To do a little something for scholars is also a way of doing my part."

msgid "潘若秋迎上来，说道：$RESPECT可是来买书的？\n"
msgstr "Pan Ruoqiu comes up and says: Have you come to buy books, $RESPECT?"

msgid "潘若秋幽幽地叹了口气，说道：“作个读书人难啊！”。\n"
msgstr "Pan Ruoqiu sighs softly and says: \"It is hard to be a scholar!\""

msgid "潘若秋真聚精会神地看着书，似乎没注意你的到来。\n"
msgstr "Pan Ruoqiu is reading, deeply absorbed, and does not seem to notice you come in."

msgid "一位精明能干的老媒婆\n"
msgstr "A shrewd and capable old matchmaker."

msgid "婚约"
msgstr "Marriage Contract"

msgid "是啊... 这里就可以缔结和解除婚约"
msgstr "Yes... Marriage contracts can be made and dissolved right here."

msgid "渡口"
msgstr "Ferry"

msgid "船夫的皮肤晒得黝黑，脸上的沧桑是多年摆渡的痕迹。\n"
msgstr "The boatman's skin is tanned dark, and the weathering on his face is the mark of many years of ferrying."

msgid "过江"
msgstr "Cross the River"

msgid "交两文钱"
msgstr "Pay 2 wen."

msgid "摆渡"
msgstr "Ferry"

msgid "船夫说：客官可以过江啦！\n"
msgstr "The boatman says: You can cross the river now, sir!"

msgid "船夫拉过条小船，你走了上去。\n"
msgstr "The boatman pulls over a small boat, and you step aboard."

msgid "这么少？我还要养家呀！\n"
msgstr "So little? I have a family to feed!"

msgid "    鸨母是个浓妆艳抹的中年女子，身材微胖，全身上下珠光宝气。\n"
msgstr "    The madam is a heavily made-up woman in middle age, slightly plump, and glittering with jewels from head to toe."

msgid "鸨母说道：你当这里是什么地方，敢来这里骚扰？\n"
msgstr "The madam says: What do you take this place for, to come here making trouble?"

msgid "哎呀！就是我们这里啊，您里面请"
msgstr "Oh my! It's right here with us. Come in, please."

msgid "他脸上的表情仿佛是看到了你口袋里的钱一般。\n"
msgstr "He looks as though he can see the money in your pocket."

msgid "客官您把钱给我就行了。\n"
msgstr "Just hand the money to me, sir."

msgid "快来赌，快来赌啦！\n"
msgstr "Come bet, come bet!"

msgid "赢了可是利滚利啊！\n"
msgstr "Win, and it rolls over with interest!"

msgid "什么？ 您押小？！好的。\n"
msgstr "What? You bet small?! Fine."

msgid "宝官说道：开！押大的赢啦！这位$RESPECT，您下次一定好运！\n"
msgstr "The croupier says: Open! Big wins! Better luck next time, $RESPECT!"

msgid "宝官说道：开！押小的赢啦！这位$RESPECT真是好运道！这是您的赢头。\n"
msgstr "The croupier says: Open! Small wins! What luck, $RESPECT! Here are your winnings."

msgid "    飞贼经常出没于大户人家, 因为他轻功高强, 官府也拿他没有办法。\n"
msgstr "    The burglar often haunts the houses of the rich. His qinggong is so high that even the authorities can do nothing about him."

msgid "飞贼说道: 小心我把你变成穷光蛋! 吓得你不禁把钱攥紧了\n"
msgstr "The burglar says, \"Watch out, or I'll turn you into a pauper!\" You can't help clutching your money tighter."

msgid "飞贼恶狠狠的说道: 快滚！这没你的事！"
msgstr "The burglar snarls: Get lost! This is none of your business!"

msgid "飞贼喝道: 你要是敢惹我, 咱们以后可没完!"
msgstr "The burglar shouts: If you dare cross me, we ain't done!"

msgid "好小子, 居然管起大爷的事来, 看招!"
msgstr "Nervy punk, sticking your nose in my business! Here it comes!"

msgid "    陈剑秋在十几年前创立了振远镖局，凭着一手春风快意刀法在远近\n颇有些名头，因此镖局的生意还算可以。\n"
msgstr "    Chen Jianqiu founded the Far-Road Escorts more than ten years ago, and his Spring Blade has made him quite a name far and near, so the agency's business is fairly good."

msgid "陈镖头"
msgstr "Escort Chief Chen"

msgid "旧账"
msgstr "Old Accounts"

msgid "你已经不是振远的人了。振远的账，不劳外人。"
msgstr "You are no longer one of Far-Road's. Far-Road's accounts are not for outsiders to trouble over."

msgid "账烧了。振远照旧走镖。"
msgstr "The ledger is burned. Far-Road goes on running escorts as before."

msgid "坐在柜台后面，没有抬头。"
msgstr " sits behind the counter and does not look up."

msgid "账在县衙了。该怎么样，就怎么样。"
msgstr "The ledger is at the county court. What happens, happens."

msgid "天星要告，就让他去告。"
msgstr "If Tianxing wants to sue, let him sue."

msgid "你呢？到此为止，还是跟他查到底——你说一句。"
msgstr "And you? Let it end here, or see it through with him. Say one word."

msgid "听你说完，半晌没有出声。"
msgstr " hears you out and says nothing for a good while."

msgid "天星翻到了。"
msgstr "Tianxing dug it up."

msgid "那年振远死了十一个人，我爹是头一个。兵部给钱，我拿了。"
msgstr "That year eleven of Far-Road died, and my father was the first. The Ministry of War paid, and I took the money."

msgid "没有那笔钱，就没有今天的绮云分局，也没有你押的这一趟。十一家的孤儿寡母，是那笔钱养大的——贺长庚家那一份，我按月送到他娘手里，送了十年。"
msgstr "Without that money there would be no Cloudweave branch today, and no shipment for you to escort. The orphans and widows of eleven families were raised on that money. He Changgeng's family's share I delivered to his mother every month, for ten years."

msgid "天星要告。告兵部，就得先说振远拿过兵部的钱。振远的招牌，在江湖上就倒了。"
msgstr "Tianxing wants to sue. To sue the Ministry of War, he must first say that Far-Road took the Ministry's money. Far-Road's name would fall in the jianghu."

msgid "你说一句「到此为止」，我写信叫他把账烧了。你要是站他那边，去京师跟他说「查到底」。"
msgstr "Say \"Let It End Here,\" and I will write and tell him to burn the ledger. If you stand on his side, go to the Capital and tell him \"Trace It to the End.\""

msgid "旧账？振远的账，清清楚楚。"
msgstr "Old accounts? Far-Road's accounts are clear as day."

msgid "到此为止"
msgstr "Let It End Here"

msgid "到此为止：陈剑秋写信叫陈天星把那本总账烧了，抚恤银的事振远不再提。\n正月十七，振远那一票投颜违——旧案到此为止（已经入了虹台的席的，这一票不再跟着变）。陈剑秋教你春风快意刀；陈天星往后见你，只谈生意。\n说了就不能再站到陈天星那边。要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Let it end here: Chen Jianqiu writes to Chen Tianxing to burn that master ledger, and Far-Road will not bring up the pension silver again.\nOn the seventeenth of the first month, Far-Road's vote goes to Yan Wei, and the old case ends here (for those who have already taken seats at the Rainbow Terrace, this vote no longer changes with it). Chen Jianqiu teaches you the Spring Blade; from now on Chen Tianxing will speak to you only of business.\nOnce said, you can never stand on Chen Tianxing's side. Say it?"

msgid "说定了。账，天星烧了。"
msgstr "It is settled. The ledger, Tianxing has burned."

msgid "你站了天星。……还来说这个做什么。"
msgstr "You stood with Tianxing. ...Why come and say this now?"

msgid "长长地吐了一口气。"
msgstr " lets out a long breath."

msgid "多谢。"
msgstr "Thank you."

msgid "我这就给天星写信。他脾气倔，可这一回，他会听我的。"
msgstr "I will write to Tianxing right now. He has a stubborn temper, but this time he will listen to me."

msgid "振远欠你的，拿刀还。春风快意刀，你想学，随时来。"
msgstr "Far-Road owes you, and I pay with the blade. The Spring Blade, if you want to learn it, come any time."

msgid "请陈剑秋把振远这一票交给你：正月十七虹台上，振远听你的——你要站出来，这一票就是你的；不站，就由你说投谁。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Ask Chen Jianqiu to hand you Far-Road's vote: on the seventeenth of the first month at the Rainbow Terrace, Far-Road listens to you. If you stand up, the vote is yours; if you do not, you say whom it goes to.\nSay it?"

msgid "说过了。振远听你的。"
msgstr "It's been said. Far-Road listens to you."

msgid "拍了拍柜台。"
msgstr " slaps the counter."

msgid "好。振远这一票，你说了算。"
msgstr "Good. Far-Road's vote is yours to say."

msgid "走镖"
msgstr "Escort Run"

msgid "替振远押一趟镖去京师总局。\n趟子手老周推车，你一路跟着：出绮云镇往北到雪亭镇，沿青石官道往西南过碎石小路，从铁索下到天驼关，再沿黄土大道往南到京师东街的振远总局。车马行不拉镖车。\n路上要是有人劫镖，镖车只靠你。\n要接这趟镖吗？"
msgstr "Escort a shipment to the Capital head office for Far-Road.\nThe escort runner Old Zhou pushes the cart, and you follow all the way: out of Cloudweave Town north to Snow Pavilion, southwest along the Bluestone high road over the Gravel Lane, down the iron chains to Camelback Pass, then south along the yellow-earth highway to the Far-Road Head Office on Capital East Street. The coach stop does not haul escort carts.\nIf anyone raids the shipment on the road, the cart depends on you alone.\nTake this escort job?"

msgid "你已经不是振远的人了。镖局的事，不劳你。"
msgstr "You are no longer one of Far-Road's. The agency's business is not for you to trouble over."

msgid "分局不接镖了。"
msgstr "The branch takes no more escort jobs."

msgid "镖交到了，叔父来信夸你。振远欠你一个人情。"
msgstr "The shipment arrived, and my uncle wrote to praise you. Far-Road owes you a favor."

msgid "镖交给叔父，京师东街北头的振远总局。老周推车——跟他说一声「上路」。"
msgstr "Deliver the shipment to my uncle at the Far-Road Head Office at the north end of Capital East Street. Old Zhou pushes the cart. Tell him \"Set Out.\""

msgid "本局的人，我就不多说了。镖交到叔父手里，回来你就是镖头。"
msgstr "You're one of ours, so I won't say much. Put the shipment in my uncle's hands, and when you are back you will be an escort chief."

msgid "老周推车，你跟着——跟他说一声「上路」。碎石小路那一段荒，当心。"
msgstr "Old Zhou pushes the cart, and you follow. Tell him \"Set Out.\" The stretch of Gravel Lane is lonely. Be careful."

msgid "好。两箱红货，京师振远总局收，交给我叔父陈天星。"
msgstr "Good. Two chests of valuables, to the Far-Road Head Office in the Capital, to be handed to my uncle, Chen Tianxing."

msgid "走镖？振远的镖，不交给不认识的人。"
msgstr "An escort job? Far-Road does not hand its shipments to people it doesn't know."

msgid "在下姓陈，人称霹雳刀"
msgstr "I am surnamed Chen, and am called Thunderbolt Blade."

msgid "江湖上的弟兄看得起在下就这么叫开了，实在是惭愧。"
msgstr "The brothers of the jianghu think well of me, and the name just spread. I am truly ashamed."

msgid "他是我师叔，如果你帮我找到忘忧草并交给我，我就介绍你去那学艺。"
msgstr "He is my martial uncle. If you help me find the forget-worry grass and bring it to me, I will send you to him to learn."

msgid "我在乔阴县城游玩时丢的，据说被藏在一个隐蔽的地方了。"
msgstr "I lost it while sightseeing in Tallshade. They say it was hidden somewhere out of the way."

msgid "失镖"
msgstr "Lost Shipment"

msgid "镖单在潘执法使那里锁着——他派人来说过了。"
msgstr "The manifest is locked away with Enforcer Pan. He sent word of it."

msgid "你还要用？……底账里还有一张存根，拿去吧。"
msgstr "You need it again? ...There is still a stub in the account books. Take it."

msgid "从柜子最底下又翻出一张发黄的镖单，递给你。"
msgstr " digs another yellowed shipment manifest from the very bottom of a cabinet and hands it to you."

msgid "镖单在叔父那里。"
msgstr "The manifest is with my uncle."

msgid "叔父写信来了。那趟镖本该走官道，是兵部来人点名改走老松岭的。"
msgstr "My uncle has written. That shipment should have gone by the main road. It was a man from the Ministry of War who named Old Pine Ridge instead."

msgid "二十年，振远替人背了这口锅。"
msgstr "Twenty years, Far-Road has carried that blame for someone else."

msgid "松了一口气。"
msgstr " breathes out in relief."

msgid "潘执法使派人来说了：镖单锁进了水烟阁的刑堂。振远的脸面，水烟阁替我们留着。"
msgstr "Enforcer Pan sent word: the manifest has been locked in Waterfog Pavilion's punishment hall. Waterfog is keeping Far-Road's face for us."

msgid "镖单你交给叔父了？……他那个脾气，要查到底的。"
msgstr "You handed the manifest to my uncle? ...With that temper of his, he will see it through to the end."

msgid "潘执法使要的？"
msgstr "Enforcer Pan wants it?"

msgid "潘执法使的手令？拿来我看。"
msgstr "Enforcer Pan's warrant? Let me see it."

msgid "皱了皱眉。"
msgstr " frowns."

msgid "镖单丢了？……镖局的底账里还有一张存根，拿去吧。别再丢了。"
msgstr "The manifest is lost? ...There is still a stub in the agency's account books. Take it. Don't lose it again."

msgid "镖单你拿着。这事振远认了二十年，你要翻出来，别说是从我这儿翻的。"
msgstr "Keep the manifest. Far-Road has borne this for twenty years. If you dig it up, don't say you dug it up from me."

msgid "脸色一变，半晌才道："
msgstr " changes color, and it is a good while before he says:"

msgid "柳馆主让你来问的？……二十年了。那趟镖是关北来的，押的是水烟阁的盟主印和一匣密件，走老松岭那条道，到瀑布一带就没了。"
msgstr "Master Liu sent you to ask? ...Twenty years. That shipment came from Beyond the Pass. It carried Waterfog Pavilion's Alliance Leader seal and a box of secret papers, went by the Old Pine Ridge road, and was lost somewhere around the waterfall."

msgid "镖师、趟子手、水烟阁派来押行的一个随从，一个都没回来。振远丢了这趟镖，从此不接水烟阁的生意。"
msgstr "The escorts, the runners, and the one attendant Waterfog sent along to ride with it: not one came back. Far-Road lost that shipment, and has taken no business from Waterfog since."

msgid "从柜子最底下翻出一张发黄的镖单，递给你。"
msgstr " digs a yellowed shipment manifest from the very bottom of a cabinet and hands it to you."

msgid "振远镖局没有失过镖。谁跟你说的？"
msgstr "Far-Road Escorts has never lost a shipment. Who told you that?"

msgid "正月十七过去了。分局还是不接镖。"
msgstr "The seventeenth of the first month has passed. The branch still takes no escort jobs."

msgid "正月十七过去了。振远照旧走镖。"
msgstr "The seventeenth of the first month has passed. Far-Road runs escorts as before."

msgid "振远这一票，正月十七照你说的。"
msgstr "Far-Road's vote, on the seventeenth of the first month, went as you said."

msgid "振远这一票，天星做主——投旧盟主。旧案查到底，是他要的。"
msgstr "Far-Road's vote is Tianxing's to decide: for the old Alliance Leader. To see the old case through, that is what he wants."

msgid "你要这一票，去京师问他。"
msgstr "If you want that vote, go ask him in the Capital."

msgid "账烧了。振远这一票投颜违——旧案到此为止。"
msgstr "The ledger is burned. Far-Road's vote goes to Yan Wei: the old case ends here."

msgid "这件事是你替振远压下的。你要这一票，开口就是。"
msgstr "You are the one who smoothed this over for Far-Road. If you want the vote, just ask."

msgid "振远这一票，投旧盟主。说定了——查到底。"
msgstr "Far-Road's vote goes to the old Alliance Leader. It is settled: see it through."

msgid "二十年前那趟镖，我原想就这么算了。颜违当了盟主，旧案到此为止——正合我的意。"
msgstr "That shipment twenty years ago, I meant to let lie just as it was. Yan Wei is Alliance Leader, the old case ends here, and that suits me exactly."

msgid "把手按在柜台上，指节发白。"
msgstr " presses a hand on the counter, knuckles white."

msgid "可天星查清了：是兵部点名改走的老松岭。振远死在瀑布底下的那些弟兄……"
msgstr "But Tianxing has found out: it was the Ministry of War that named Old Pine Ridge. Those brothers of Far-Road who died beneath the waterfall..."

msgid "你说一句，振远这一票就投旧盟主。旧案查到底。"
msgstr "Say one word, and Far-Road's vote goes to the old Alliance Leader. The old case, seen through."

msgid "振远这一票投颜违。"
msgstr "Far-Road's vote goes to Yan Wei."

msgid "旧案到此为止——二十年了，振远的脸面经不起再翻一回。"
msgstr "The old case ends here. Twenty years on, Far-Road's face cannot bear being dug up again."

msgid "请陈剑秋改投旧盟主：二十年前那趟镖查到底，振远这一票不投颜违了。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Ask Chen Jianqiu to change the vote to the old Alliance Leader: see through the shipment of twenty years ago, and Far-Road's vote no longer goes to Yan Wei.\nSay it?"

msgid "账都烧了。说过到此为止，振远不改。"
msgstr "The ledger is all burned. We said let it end here, and Far-Road does not change."

msgid "账在县衙了。振远投旧盟主，不用再改。"
msgstr "The ledger is at the county court. Far-Road votes for the old Alliance Leader. There is no need to change it."

msgid "说过了。振远投旧盟主。"
msgstr "It's been said. Far-Road votes for the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "从抽屉里摸出那张镖单的存根，往柜台上一拍。"
msgstr " takes the manifest stub from a drawer and slaps it on the counter."

msgid "好。查到底。"
msgstr "Good. See it through."

msgid "从柜台后面抬起头，上下打量了你一眼。"
msgstr " raises his head from behind the counter and looks you up and down."

msgid "来得正好。有一趟红货要走京师总局，镖局里的人手都派出去了。"
msgstr "You come at just the right time. There is a shipment of valuables to go to the Capital head office, and the agency's men have all been sent out."

msgid "你肯跟车走一趟吗？问我「走镖」。"
msgstr "Will you go along with the cart? Ask me about \"Escort Run\"."

msgid "坐在柜台后面，门板上了一半。"
msgstr " sits behind the counter, the door boards half in place."

msgid "天星的人来过了，账押去了乔阴。"
msgstr "Tianxing's people have been. The ledger was taken to Tallshade."

msgid "分局不接镖了。我在这儿坐着——振远的事，总得有个人在。"
msgstr "The branch takes no more escort jobs. I sit here. Someone has to be here for Far-Road."

msgid "走镖危险甚大，依我看$RESPECT似乎不宜冒这份险？"
msgstr "An escort run is very dangerous. In my view, $RESPECT should not take the risk."

msgid "很好，$RESPECT多加努力，本镖局不会亏待你的。"
msgstr "Very good. Work hard, $RESPECT, and this agency will not treat you unfairly."

msgid "看了手令上的朱印，脸色一变，半晌才道："
msgstr " sees the red seal on the warrant, changes color, and it is a good while before he says:"

msgid "潘执法使要它？……二十年了。那趟镖是关北来的，押的是水烟阁的盟主印和一匣密件，走老松岭那条道，到瀑布一带就没了。"
msgstr "Enforcer Pan wants it? ...Twenty years. That shipment came from Beyond the Pass. It carried Waterfog Pavilion's Alliance Leader seal and a box of secret papers, went by the Old Pine Ridge road, and was lost somewhere around the waterfall."

msgid "哦，雪亭驿的信。有劳$RESPECT，替我谢谢杜驿长。"
msgstr "Oh, a letter from Snow Pavilion Post Station. Thank you for bringing it, $RESPECT. Please thank Postmaster Du for me."

msgid "大喜过望，：“好，好，我这就给你写信。”"
msgstr " is overjoyed. \"Good, good, I'll write you a letter right now.\""

msgid "提笔刷刷点点，顷刻间一封信写就。"
msgstr " takes up a brush and dashes off a letter in a moment."

msgid "陈剑秋交给你一封信件。"
msgstr "Chen Jianqiu hands you a letter."

msgid "说到路上小心，把信直接给陈师叔。"
msgstr " says to be careful on the road, and to give the letter straight to Martial Uncle Chen."

msgid "笑了笑说：“这不是你得到的吧？”。"
msgstr " smiles and says: \"You didn't come by this yourself, did you?\""

msgid "你是何人？为什么有我的忘忧草？"
msgstr "Who are you? Why do you have my forget-worry grass?"

msgid "你拿什么东西唬我？"
msgstr "What are you trying to fool me with?"

msgid "这是一位镖局的趟子手，负责镖局的护镖任务。\n"
msgstr "An escort runner of the agency, in charge of guarding shipments."

msgid "趟子手喊道：振远镖局..., 盛名远扬...\n"
msgstr "The escort runner shouts: Far-Road Escorts... famous far and wide..."

msgid "趟子手喊道：教你尝尝我的厉害！\n"
msgstr "The escort runner shouts: Let me show you what I can do!"

msgid "趟子手叫道：我们镖局可不是好惹的！\n趟子手大叫：我一定要杀了你，替镖局扬名！\n"
msgstr "The escort runner cries: Our agency is not to be trifled with!\nThe escort runner yells: I will kill you and win fame for the agency!"

msgid "贴身保镖"
msgstr "Bodyguard"

msgid "你看到一个剽悍的大块头。\n"
msgstr "You see a burly, brawny fellow."

msgid "镇关西"
msgstr "Zhen Guanxi"

msgid "这雪亭镇有谁不知道我家老爷镇大官人！"
msgstr "Who in Snow Pavilion doesn't know my master, Lord Zhen!"

msgid "主人"
msgstr "Master"

msgid "一位精明能干的大奸商\n"
msgstr "A shrewd and capable big profiteer."

msgid "张府家丁"
msgstr "Zhang Household Retainer"

msgid "张府的家丁的俸禄极高，当然能在张府做事武功也不弱\n"
msgstr "The Zhang household's retainers are paid very well, and of course those who work in the Zhang house are no weak fighters."

msgid "茶工正在忙碌着。\n"
msgstr "The tea worker is busy at work."

msgid "这要到香茗坊去问。"
msgstr "You'll have to ask at Sweetleaf Teahouse."

msgid "一位十分文气的男子，装束象个雅儒。\n"
msgstr "A very refined-looking man, dressed like an elegant scholar."

msgid "下棋"
msgstr "Play Go"

msgid "要比试一盘？好啊！"
msgstr "A game, you want? Gladly!"

msgid "你赢了。"
msgstr "You win."

msgid "好棋技！佩服。无以为报，就给您两枚棋子防身吧！"
msgstr "A fine player! I admire you. I have nothing to repay you with, so please take two go stones for self-defense!"

msgid "好棋技！佩服。"
msgstr "A fine player! I admire you."

msgid "你输了。"
msgstr "You lose."

msgid "承让承让！"
msgstr "Thanks for going easy on me!"

msgid "名妓"
msgstr "Famous Courtesan"

msgid "    李师师是怡红院的名妓，精通琴棋书画，周围的纨绔子弟们常往这\n里钻。\n"
msgstr "    Li Shishi is a famous courtesan of Red Delight House, skilled in zither, chess, calligraphy and painting. The idle young gentlemen of the neighborhood are always drifting in."

msgid "李师师秀眉微蹙，说道：喂！我哪里得罪您了？干嘛这样跟我拼死拼活？\n"
msgstr "Li Shishi knits her pretty brows and says, \"Hey! What did I ever do to you? Why fight me to the death like this?\""

msgid "过夜"
msgstr "Stay the Night"

msgid "官人可要洁身自好啊！"
msgstr "Sir, do keep yourself pure!"

msgid "嫖妓"
msgstr "Visit a Courtesan"

msgid "学艺"
msgstr "Learn a Skill"

msgid "请您留件信物！"
msgstr "Please leave a keepsake!"

msgid "我对钱没兴趣！"
msgstr "I'm not interested in money!"

msgid "我对您没兴趣！"
msgstr "I'm not interested in you!"

msgid "能做相公的老师，真是三生有幸。"
msgstr "To be your teacher, sir, is great good fortune, three lifetimes in the making."

msgid "李师师说道：咦？我不记得您啊......\n"
msgstr "Li Shishi says: Hm? I don't remember you, sir..."

msgid "小女子哪里是您的对手？"
msgstr "How could a poor girl like me be a match for you?"

msgid "    小姑娘是晚月庄的女弟子，虽说身形单薄，可眼神里透出的傲气让\n人感到并不好欺负。\n"
msgstr "    The girl is a disciple of Latemoon Manor. Slight of frame, but the pride in her eyes tells you she is not to be bullied."

msgid "少女说道：你当这里是什么地方，敢来这里骚扰？\n"
msgstr "The girl says: What do you take this place for, to come here making trouble?"

msgid "少女说道：你要是再无理取闹，当心庄主的鞭子！\n"
msgstr "The girl says: Keep making trouble for no reason, and watch out for the Mistress's whip!"

msgid "少女手中的鞭子越舞越快，让你应接不暇。\n"
msgstr "The girl's whip flies faster and faster, until you can hardly keep up."

msgid "少女说道：你当晚月庄的女子好欺负么？！\n"
msgstr "The girl says: Do you think the women of Latemoon Manor can be bullied?!"

msgid "庄主的名字也是你这等人随便叫的么？"
msgstr "Is the Mistress's name for a person like you to throw about?"

msgid "庄主吩咐过，不许乱讲。"
msgstr "The Mistress has given orders. We must not talk."

msgid "    知客僧伫立在佛像前，那虚闭的双眼中似乎透出一道仁慈而有力的\n光芒。\n"
msgstr "    The guest monk stands before the Buddha, and from his half-closed eyes seems to shine a kindly and powerful light."

msgid "这里就是山烟寺，施主有何贵干?"
msgstr "This is Mountain Mist Temple. What brings you here, Benefactor?"

msgid "你身为佛家弟子，竟敢违反清规！"
msgstr "You are a disciple of the Buddha, and dare break the rules!"

msgid "佛门圣地也是可随意骚扰的么！"
msgstr "Is the Buddha's holy ground a place to be disturbed at will!"

msgid "这里是雪亭镇通往绮云镇的必经之路。北面就是雪亭镇，南面通往\n卧龙岗。早先官府想在此修条大路连接两镇，无奈地势所限，加上卧龙\n岗上常有强人出没，只得做罢。虽说是土路，可过往的人很多，路面已\n被踩得很平了。\n"
msgstr "This is the road you must take from Snow Pavilion to Cloudweave Town. To the north is Snow Pavilion; to the south it leads to Crouching Dragon Ridge. Long ago the authorities wanted to build a big road here to join the two towns, but the lay of the land stood in the way, and robbers are often about on the ridge, so they gave it up. It is only a dirt road, but so many people pass that the surface has been trodden quite flat."

msgid "从这往西北有条路通往雪亭镇，向南爬就是卧龙岗。\n"
msgstr "From here a road leads northwest to Snow Pavilion; climb south and you reach Crouching Dragon Ridge."

msgid "这是位于雪亭和绮云两镇间的一道山梁。据说山上时常有强盗拦路\n抢劫。\n"
msgstr "A mountain ridge between the two towns of Snow Pavilion and Cloudweave. They say robbers are often on the mountain, stopping travelers."

msgid "这是卧龙岗的东南坡。东南的路通向绮云镇，往北就要过岗了。\n"
msgstr "The southeast slope of Crouching Dragon Ridge. The road to the southeast leads to Cloudweave Town; going north, you must cross the ridge."

msgid "这里是雪亭镇通往绮云镇的必经之路。南面就是绮云镇，北面通往\n卧龙岗。早先官府想在此修条大路连接两镇，无奈地势所限，加上卧龙\n岗上常有强人出没，只得做罢。虽说是土路，可过往的人很多，路面已\n被踩得很平了。\n"
msgstr "This is the road you must take from Snow Pavilion to Cloudweave Town. To the south is Cloudweave Town; to the north it leads to Crouching Dragon Ridge. Long ago the authorities wanted to build a big road here to join the two towns, but the lay of the land stood in the way, and robbers are often about on the ridge, so they gave it up. It is only a dirt road, but so many people pass that the surface has been trodden quite flat."

msgid "这里是绮云镇的入口。绮云镇是坐落在泓水北岸的一个大镇, 以其商业\n发达和盛产茶叶而为来往客商们所青睐。北边过了卧龙岗就是著名的\n封山剑派北宗所在的雪亭镇; 镇南有个渡口, 过了江就是少林的支脉 \n-- 山烟寺。镇上很是热闹, 在这里就能听到南边集市上传来的叫卖声。\n入口处有个官府的公告, 不知是写了些什么。 \n"
msgstr "The entrance to Cloudweave Town. Cloudweave sits on the north bank of the Deepwater, a big town favored by travelers for its flourishing trade and its tea. To the north, over Crouching Dragon Ridge, is Snow Pavilion, home of the famous North Branch of Empty Mountain School; south of town is a ferry, and across the river is Mountain Mist Temple, a branch of Shaolin. The town is lively, and from here you can hear the hawking from the market to the south. At the entrance is an official notice, though who knows what it says."

msgid "这里是绮云镇的北市场，再向北就是镇口了。\n    一股茶香与腥膻相混合的气味扑鼻而来，西首铺子外挂着个牛头;\n东面是家二层的茶楼，金字招牌十分晃眼。\n"
msgstr "This is Cloudweave Town's North Market, and past it to the north is the town gate.\nA smell of tea fragrance mixed with the rank smell of meat hits your nose. An ox head hangs outside the shop on the west side; to the east is a two-story teahouse, its gold-lettered signboard dazzling."

msgid "你现在正站在镇北肉铺里，肉架上挂满了血淋淋的生肉，一股腥\n气扑面而来，不时有几只苍蝇在屋里飞来飞去。\n    靠近门口的地方有一块牛骨雕成的招牌，上面写着些\n什么。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in the butcher's shop at the north end of town. The racks are hung full of bloody raw meat, a rank smell hits you in the face, and now and then a few flies buzz about the room.\nNear the door is a signboard carved from ox bone, with something written on it."

msgid "你来到绮云镇西边的一家茶坊里, 它的历史已不下百年, 绮云镇本 \n就是以盛产茶叶而闻名于世, 因此茶楼的生意出奇的好。\n    高高悬起的金匾让你的有一种眩晕的感觉, 幸好阵阵茶香使\n你清醒了许多。\n    站在门口, 你可以看到北首有一扇不太起眼的木雕门。\n    东侧的楼梯通往楼上的雅座, 不时能听到上面传来丝竹之声和阵阵\n笑声... \n"
msgstr "You come to a teahouse on the west side of Cloudweave Town. Its history goes back over a hundred years, and since Cloudweave is famous the world over for its tea, the teahouse does remarkable business.\nThe high-hung golden plaque makes you a little dizzy, but fortunately waves of tea fragrance clear your head.\nStanding at the door, you can see an unobtrusive carved wooden door to the north.\nThe stairs to the east lead up to the private seats upstairs, and from time to time you hear strings and flutes from above, and bursts of laughter..."

msgid "茶窖里有几个大竹箩，里面装满了茶叶。 \n"
msgstr "The tea cellar holds several big bamboo baskets full of tea leaves."

msgid "这里是绮云镇的西市场，西边是家棺材铺，南面是家布庄。\n"
msgstr "This is Cloudweave Town's West Market. To the west is a coffin shop; to the south, a cloth shop."

msgid "你现在正站在棺材铺里\n    靠近门口的地方有一块乌木雕成的招牌。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in the coffin shop.\nNear the door hangs a signboard carved from ebony."

msgid "    这里好象是大户人家子弟玩乐的场院, 原来建有秋千架的草地，\n已经成了荆棘丛生的荒草场了。再往西是一座凉亭，亭子似乎也快要倒塌了...\n"
msgstr "This seems to be a playground for the sons of great families. The grass where a swing frame once stood has become a wasteland overgrown with brambles. Farther west stands a pavilion, which looks about to collapse too..."

msgid "    这里是这座场院的前厅，简单的陈设中透出一股尊贵不凡的气派。\n一张黑漆镶金的八仙桌摆放在大厅中央，两只黝黑的太师椅座在这张桌\n子的两旁。\n"
msgstr "This is the front hall of the courtyard, its plain furnishings hinting at a bearing of dignified rank. A black-lacquered, gold-inlaid eight-immortals table stands in the middle of the hall, with a dark armchair on either side of it."

msgid "你现在正站在布庄里。靠近门口的墙壁上挂着招牌。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in the cloth shop. A signboard hangs on the wall near the door."

msgid "这里是绮云镇的中市场，北面是茶楼，南面是杂货铺。\n"
msgstr "This is Cloudweave Town's Central Market. To the north is the teahouse; to the south, the general store."

msgid "你现在正站在杂货铺里\n    靠近门口的地方有一块乌木雕成的招牌。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in the general store.\nNear the door hangs a signboard carved from ebony."

msgid "这里是绮云镇的东市场，北面是药店，东面是兵器店。\n"
msgstr "This is Cloudweave Town's East Market. To the north is the herb shop; to the east, the weapon shop."

msgid "你现在正站在药店里\n    靠近门口的地方有一块乌木雕成的招牌。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in the herb shop.\nNear the door hangs a signboard carved from ebony."

msgid "你现在正站在兵器屋里\n    靠近门口的地方有一块乌木雕成的招牌。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in the weapon shop.\nNear the door hangs a signboard carved from ebony."

msgid "这里是绮云镇的南市场，西面是杂货铺，向东可看到 怡红院 的二楼。\n"
msgstr "This is Cloudweave Town's South Market. To the west is the general store; to the east you can see the upper floor of Red Delight House."

msgid "绮云镇的两条青石路在这里交叉，路旁栽着棵古槐，有两个汉子合\n抱那么粗。槐树下有个告示，象是官府立的。\n"
msgstr "Cloudweave's two bluestone roads cross here. An old locust tree stands by the road, so thick that two men could barely reach round it. Under the tree is a notice, apparently put up by the authorities."

msgid "这里是绮云镇西，东边就是十字路口。南面的院子里甚是喧闹，象\n是有很多人的样子。北面是杂货铺，不过门不朝这个方向开。\n"
msgstr "This is the west side of Cloudweave Town, with the crossroads just east. The courtyard to the south is very noisy, as if many people were in it. To the north is the general store, though its door does not face this way."

msgid "你现在正站在斋院里\n    靠近门口的地方有一块乌木雕成的招牌。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in the vegetarian hall.\nNear the door hangs a signboard carved from ebony."

msgid "东边青板石铺的路与向西的碎石小径在这里汇合。西面仿佛是座庄\n院，似可听到曲乐声，却又分辨不清; 南面是家私塾。 \n"
msgstr "Here the road paved with bluestone slabs from the east meets the gravel path leading west. To the west seems to be a manor; you think you hear music, but cannot make it out. To the south is a private school."

msgid "你现在正站在书局里\n    靠近门口的地方有一块乌木雕成的招牌。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in the bookshop.\nNear the door hangs a signboard carved from ebony."

msgid "东边青板石铺的路与向西的碎石小径在这里汇合。西面仿佛是座庄\n院，似可听到曲乐声，却又分辨不清; 北面是红娘庄，常常有一对对\n男女来往。 \n"
msgstr "Here the road paved with bluestone slabs from the east meets the gravel path leading west. To the west seems to be a manor; you think you hear music, but cannot make it out. To the north is the Matchmaker's House, where couple after couple come and go."

msgid "你现在正站在红娘庄里，这里是专门替人缔结婚约和解除婚约的地方，\n镇里所有的夫妇都是在这里喜结良缘的，就连附近镇子也有许多慕名\n而来的。靠近门口的地方有一块乌木雕成的招牌。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in the Matchmaker's House, a place for making and dissolving marriage contracts. All the married couples in town were joined here, and many come from nearby towns because they have heard of it. Near the door hangs a signboard carved from ebony."

msgid "这里是绮云镇南，通往过江的渡口。\n"
msgstr "This is the south of Cloudweave Town, leading to the ferry across the river."

msgid "这是个虽说不大却过客甚多的渡口。往北去是通往绮云镇里的青石\n道，南面就是无风亦起浪的泓水了。向南望去，隐约可见对岸日照山的\n轮廓，山顶有袅袅炊烟升起。\n"
msgstr "A ferry landing that is not big but has many travelers. To the north, the bluestone road leads into Cloudweave Town; to the south is the Deepwater, which raises waves even when there is no wind. Looking south, you can make out the outline of Sunlit Mountain across the river, with thin smoke rising from its top."

msgid "这里是十字路口的东侧，两边房子里都颇为吵闹。北面似乎是家春\n楼，不时可听到风尘女子的卖笑声。南面却是些三教九流的人物在吆三\n喝五，象是家赌场。\n"
msgstr "This is the east side of the crossroads, and both houses are quite noisy. To the north seems to be a brothel, and from time to time you hear the laughter of the women of the pleasure trade. To the south, people of all trades are bawling and shouting, as if in a gambling den."

msgid "你现在正站在怡红院里\n    靠近门口的地方有一块乌木雕成的招牌。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in Red Delight House.\nNear the door hangs a signboard carved from ebony."

msgid "你现在正站在赌场里。靠近门口的地方有一块乌木雕成的招牌。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in the gambling house. Near the door hangs a signboard carved from ebony."

msgid "这里是绮云镇东，通往茶场的路。南边是一家有名的大镖局 -- 振\n远镖局。北面是绮云张家的宅院。\n\n"
msgstr "This is the east side of Cloudweave Town, the road to the tea garden. To the south is a well-known big escort agency, Far-Road Escorts. To the north is the Zhang family's compound."

msgid "你现在正站在张家花园里\n"
msgstr "You are standing in the Zhang family garden."

msgid "你现在正站在镖局里。靠近门口的地方有一块乌木雕成的招牌。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in the escort agency. Near the door hangs a signboard carved from ebony."

msgid "这里是绮云镇东头，北面是张家，东南方就是茶场。\n"
msgstr "This is the east end of Cloudweave Town. To the north is the Zhang family's; to the southeast is the tea garden."

msgid "你现在正站在张百万家里\n    靠近门口的地方有一块乌木雕成的招牌。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in Moneybags Zhang's house.\nNear the door hangs a signboard carved from ebony."

msgid "这里是张百万的府宅，常人可进不来\n"
msgstr "This is Moneybags Zhang's mansion. Ordinary people cannot come in."

msgid "这里是绮云镇的茶场，绮云盛产茶叶，因此这里有不少茶工在忙着\n采茶。\n"
msgstr "This is Cloudweave Town's tea garden. Cloudweave is rich in tea, so many tea workers are busy picking here."

msgid "这是茶楼的二层，附近的文人墨客常喜欢在此品茗作赋。\n    里首摆着个棋盘。\n"
msgstr "This is the second floor of the teahouse, where scholars and men of letters from the neighborhood like to sip tea and compose verse.\nA go board is set out at the inner end."

msgid "这是怡红院的姑娘们陪客人们饮酒品茗，吟诗作赋的地方，甚是幽\n雅。\n"
msgstr "This is where the girls of Red Delight House keep guests company over wine and tea and compose verse, a very elegant place."

msgid "这里是赌场的二楼，很多人在围着几张桌子高声叫嚷，煞是热闹。\n靠近门口的地方有一块乌木雕成的招牌。\n"
msgstr "This is the upper floor of the gambling house. Many people crowd around a few tables, shouting loudly, quite a lively sight.\nNear the door hangs a signboard carved from ebony."

msgid "本店即将收购死狗"
msgstr "Dead dogs bought here soon"

msgid "赌，胜者赢双"
msgstr "Bet: winner wins double"

msgid "囍"
msgstr "Double Happiness"

msgid "缔结或解除婚约"
msgstr "Marriages made or dissolved"

msgid "善"
msgstr "Kindness"

msgid "绮云"
msgstr "Cloudweave"

msgid "张府"
msgstr "Zhang Residence"

msgid "衣"
msgstr "Clothes"

msgid "御赐亲笔"
msgstr "Imperial Brush, Gift of the Throne"

msgid "专卖各式兵器"
msgstr "Weapons of Every Kind"

msgid "棺"
msgstr "Coffin"

msgid "商"
msgstr "Trade"

msgid "一个手工制造的陶壶, 看起来年代久远.\n"
msgstr "A handmade clay jug that looks very old."

msgid "米酒"
msgstr "rice wine"

msgid "这是一把淡青色的的长剑，看上去锋利异常。\n"
msgstr "A longsword of pale blue-green, and strikingly sharp to look at."

msgid "这是一捆粗麻绳. 你可以用它来上吊.\n\n"
msgstr "A coil of coarse hemp rope. You could use it to hang yourself."

msgid "上面刻著一些字:\n行气, 深则蓄, 蓄则伸, 伸则下, 下则定, 定则固, 固则萌, 萌则长, 长则退,\n退则天. 天几舂在上, 地几舂在下, 顺则生, 逆则死.\n"
msgstr "Some words are carved on it:\nMove the qi: deep, then it gathers; gathered, then it spreads; spread, then it sinks; sunk, then it settles; settled, then it hardens; hardened, then it sprouts; sprouted, then it grows; grown, then it withdraws;\nwithdrawn, then it reaches Heaven. Heaven's spring is above, Earth's spring below. Follow it and live; go against it and die."

msgid "沈记商行掌柜"
msgstr "Shopkeeper of Shen's Store"

msgid "你真贪心耶... "
msgstr "You're a greedy one, aren't you..."

msgid "这样东西... 刚刚有人来要过了."
msgstr "That item... somebody just came and asked for it."

msgid "一份只要 10 两银子, 保证有效喔.\n"
msgstr "Only 10 taels of silver a packet, and it works, I guarantee it."

msgid "老板塞了一包蒙汗药给你。\n"
msgstr "The shopkeeper slips you a packet of knockout powder."

msgid "想骗我啊?\n"
msgstr "Trying to cheat me?"

msgid "我不知道你给我钱干嘛, 不过谢啦!"
msgstr "I don't know why you're handing me money, but thanks!"

msgid "柜子上一堆冥纸和香烛等, 标价 10 文钱. 墙上挂著几把竹扫帚,\n每把 50 文钱. 柜台上摆著一块木牌, 上面写著:\n棺材: 时价. 没看到的东西问一下掌柜的, 我们应该都有.\n"
msgstr "A pile of spirit money, incense and candles sits on the cabinet, 10 wen apiece. A few bamboo brooms hang on the wall, 50 wen each. On the counter stands a wooden sign that reads: \"Coffins: market price. If you don't see what you want, ask the shopkeeper. We probably have it.\""

msgid "我不卖东西给陌生人!"
msgstr "I don't sell to strangers!"

msgid "没见识过我的菜刀神功是吧, 接招!"
msgstr "Never seen my Kitchen Cleaver Kung Fu, have you? Take this!"

msgid "死小孩, 专们欺负老人家!"
msgstr "Little brat, picking on an old woman on purpose!"

msgid "以大欺小啊你..."
msgstr "Picking on someone smaller... shame on you..."

msgid "妇人说道：我说啊, 管管你们家那小鬼啊.\n"
msgstr "The woman says, \"Really now, you ought to keep a hand on that brat of yours.\""

msgid "妇人说道：明知山洞那边闹鬼, 没事带著我们家那两个跑过去.\n"
msgstr "The woman says, \"Everyone knows the cave is haunted, and still you go running over there with those two of ours in tow.\""

msgid "妇人打开锅盖闻了一下.\n"
msgstr "The woman lifts the pot lid and sniffs."

msgid "妇人朝门外看了看.\n"
msgstr "The woman looks out the door."

msgid "喊道: 老公我来帮你了!"
msgstr " shouts: Husband, I'm coming to help you!"

msgid "叫道: 好啊,敢砍我老婆, 去死吧!"
msgstr " cries: How dare you hack at my wife! Die!"

msgid "嗯...... 你是说那个从古墓盗出来的玉佩?\n"
msgstr "Hmm... You mean that jade pendant robbed out of the old tomb?"

msgid "应该蛮珍贵的, 可是有点来路不明...\n"
msgstr "It ought to be worth a lot, but where it came from is not clear..."

msgid "我送给一个年轻人了, 不过听说他得此玉佩后性情大变.\n"
msgstr "I gave it to a young man. But I hear that after he got it, he became a different person."

msgid "看来此物不祥... \n"
msgstr "It seems that thing is ill-omened..."

msgid "你要找他吗? 有人说他现在以酒度日, 我也不知他的下落.\n"
msgstr "Are you looking for him? Some say he drinks his days away now. I do not know where he is."

msgid "造孽啊........\n"
msgstr "A sin... a sin..."

msgid "国之将亡，必有妖孽。"
msgstr "When a country is about to fall, monsters are sure to rise."

msgid "望着北边的山，摇了摇头。"
msgstr " shakes his head, looking at the mountain to the north."

msgid "……这回，是真的出来了。"
msgstr "...This time, it really got out."

msgid "听你说孩子回来了，长长地出了一口气。"
msgstr " hears that the children are back and lets out a long breath."

msgid "回来了就好，回来了就好……"
msgstr "Back is good. Back is good..."

msgid "拄着拐杖站起来，望着北边的山。"
msgstr " rises on his cane and gazes at the mountain to the north."

msgid "那洞里的冷，不是人间的冷。我拴那道门的时候就知道。"
msgstr "The cold in that cave is not the cold of the living world. I knew it when I bolted that door."

msgid "国之将亡……"
msgstr "When a country is about to fall..."

msgid "顿了很久。"
msgstr " pauses for a long time."

msgid "……必有妖孽。"
msgstr "...monsters are sure to rise."

msgid "我活了九十五年，这句话从来不敢说完。"
msgstr "I have lived ninety-five years, and never dared to finish that saying."

msgid "看见你身后的阿牛，拐杖在地上顿了一下。"
msgstr " sees Aniu behind you, and the cane thumps once on the ground."

msgid "快，快带他去北边路口，他娘在那儿喊了一天了。"
msgstr "Quick, quick, take him to the crossroads on the north side. His mother has been calling there all day."

msgid "阿牛和小翠还在洞里。开了那道木门往里走——洞里有东西，小心。"
msgstr "Aniu and Xiaocui are still in the cave. Open the wooden door and go in. There is something in there, so be careful."

msgid "叹了一口气。"
msgstr " sighs."

msgid "北边那个山洞？那道门是我拴的，拴了好些年了。洞里冷，冷到骨头缝里——绝对不可以打开。"
msgstr "That cave to the north? I bolted that door myself, many years ago. It is cold in there, cold to the marrow of the bones. It must never be opened."

msgid "可妇人家的阿牛，背着他妹妹，又钻进去了。门上那条铁链……早就锈断了。"
msgstr "But Aniu, the woman's son, took his little sister and slipped in again. The iron chain on the door... it rusted through long ago."

msgid "这阵子夜里，洞口那边有声音。不是风。"
msgstr "These nights there have been sounds at the cave mouth. It is not the wind."

msgid "你要是去，就开了那道木门往里走。把孩子带出来。"
msgstr "If you go, open the wooden door and walk in. Bring the children out."

msgid "北边那个山洞？那道门是我拴的。洞里冷，绝对不可以打开。"
msgstr "That cave to the north? I bolted that door myself. It is cold in there. It must never be opened."

msgid "村长说道：国之将亡.....\n"
msgstr "The Village Head says: When a country is about to fall..."

msgid "必有妖孽"
msgstr "monsters are sure to rise"

msgid "对呀.. 你就是妖孽... "
msgstr "Right... you are the monster..."

msgid "小孩很好奇地往门缝里看去。\n"
msgstr "The child peers curiously through the crack in the door."

msgid "小孩说道：村长说这道门绝对不可以打开喔!\n"
msgstr "The child says: The Village Head says this door must never be opened!"

msgid "小孩说道：不知道里面是什么...\n"
msgstr "The child says: I wonder what's inside..."

msgid "这是一只体型相当大的蜘蛛, 看来有点吓人.\n\n"
msgstr "A spider of considerable size, and a little frightening to look at."

msgid "这是一条平整的石板路, 上面隐约可以看见两道很深的车轮, 看来\n是用来作运输用途的道路. 往西是通往山下的路, 往东你可以看到一些\n建筑物, 像是村庄之类的. 南边看去是一片矮树丛.\n"
msgstr "A level slab-stone road. You can just make out two deep cart ruts in it; it must be a road for hauling goods. West, the road leads down the mountain; east you can see some buildings, a village or something like it. To the south is a stretch of low scrub."

msgid "这是一条平整的石板路, 上面隐约可以看见两道很深的车轮, 看来\n是用来作运输用途的道路. 往北是一条较小的碎石路通往村内. 东边有\n一栋石屋, 旁边的空地堆了一些石料. 南边看去是一片矮树丛. 石板路\n往西边延伸.\n"
msgstr "A level slab-stone road. You can just make out two deep cart ruts in it; it must be a road for hauling goods. To the north a narrower gravel road leads into the village. To the east stands a stone house, with stone blocks piled on the open ground beside it. To the south is a stretch of low scrub. The slab road runs on to the west."

msgid "这里是采石场在村口的工作站，一栋小小的木屋立在东边，旁边是一\n条上山的斜坡。路旁有一口井。空地上停著几辆载满石料的车。往西是一\n条铺著大石板的路，一路往山下延伸过去。\n"
msgstr "This is the quarry's work station at the mouth of the village. A small wooden hut stands to the east, and beside it a slope leads up the mountain. There is a well by the road, and a few carts loaded with stone stand on the open ground. To the west a road paved with big slabs runs on down the mountain."

msgid "你走在一条不算宽的碎石路上, 往北是一个交叉路口. 东边有一栋\n木造建筑, 看来相当的破旧, 一片快要散掉似的木牌悬挂在门口, 上面\n的字迹已经不是很清楚了. 往南过去是一条铺著石板的大路.\n"
msgstr "You are walking on a gravel road, not a wide one. To the north is a crossroads. To the east stands a wooden building, quite dilapidated; a wooden sign hangs at the door, nearly falling to pieces, its writing no longer clear. To the south a slab-paved road leads on."

msgid "这里是青石村唯一的商店 -- 沈记商行, 在这里村民可以购买\n日常生活用品, 工具, 甚至于棺材. 真可以说是一间「杂」货店.\n屋内相当的拥挤, 到处都是箱子和杂物.\n"
msgstr "This is Bluestone Village's only store, Shen's Store, where villagers buy daily necessities, tools, even coffins. You could call it a \"general\" store in every sense. The room is crowded, with crates and odds and ends everywhere."

msgid "你来到一条三叉路口, 往东看去是另一条更小更窄的黄土路, 主要\n道路是南北向的, 西边有一栋民宅.\n"
msgstr "You come to a three-way fork. To the east is another, smaller and narrower dirt road. The main road runs north and south, and to the west stands a house."

msgid "这是一间简陋的民宅，阴暗窄小的屋内散著一地的柴火和各式工具。\n屋角的石炉上闪著微弱的火光，一锅不知是什么的东西正冒出阵阵香味。\n另一角放著一张简陋的木床和几张椅子。\n"
msgstr "A shabby house, dark and cramped, with firewood and tools strewn across the floor. A faint fire flickers in the stone stove in the corner, and a pot of something unknown gives off a savory smell. In another corner stand a rough wooden bed and a few chairs."

msgid "这是一条小小的巷子，地上铺著碎石和黄土。南北各有一栋建筑，不\n过南方的屋子出口不在这边。往东可以看到一个小小的广场，往西则是一\n个三岔路口。\n"
msgstr "A small lane, paved with gravel and yellow earth. There is a building to the north and one to the south, though the south house's door is not on this side. To the east you can see a small square; to the west is a three-way fork."

msgid "这是一间普通的民宅，矮小的屋内整齐地堆著一排排的石板，墙上则\n挂著各式各样的雕刻，切割的工具。屋角放著各式的成品及半成品如石桌\n、石椅、墓碑等。\n"
msgstr "An ordinary house. Inside the low room, slabs of stone are stacked in neat rows, and carvings and cutting tools of every kind hang on the walls. In the corner lie finished and half-finished pieces: stone tables, stone chairs, gravestones and the like."

msgid "这是一个小小的广场，地上铺著切割整齐的大石块。广场周围有几间\n屋子，其中以正南边那栋木屋最为特别。往西是一条窄窄的小巷子，往东\n则是连接著采石场的空地。中央有一棵大榕树，像一座凉亭般地立在广场\n上。\n"
msgstr "A small square paved with neatly cut big stones. A few houses stand around it, and the wooden one due south is the most unusual. To the west is a narrow lane; to the east is the open ground that joins the quarry. In the middle a great banyan tree stands over the square like a pavilion."

msgid "这是一间简陋的民宅, 屋顶隐约还可以看到一些破洞. 墙角堆\n著些柴火, 墙壁上还可以看到烟熏的痕迹. 除了一些简陋的家具外\n屋内空空荡荡的.\n"
msgstr "A shabby house. You can just make out some holes in the roof. Firewood is piled in a corner, and smoke stains show on the walls. Apart from a few poor pieces of furniture, the room is empty."

msgid "这是一间看起来有点不一样的民宅，屋子的中央有一个石制的炉子，\n上面生著一堆火，熊熊的火光把屋内照得像白天似的光亮。墙上挂著几幅\n字画，一边还放了一个木制的书架，上面整齐地排著一些旧得不能再旧的\n书。炉子的旁边摆了一张手工精美的石椅，看来像个很重要的位置。\n"
msgstr "A house that looks a little different. In the middle of the room is a stone stove with a fire going, and its roaring blaze lights the room bright as day. A few scrolls of calligraphy and painting hang on the walls, and to one side stands a wooden bookshelf, neatly lined with books so old they could not be older. Beside the stove sits a beautifully made stone chair, which looks like an important seat."

msgid "这是一片黄土空地，四周堆著一些切割整齐的大石块和碎石。往东看\n去就是采石场，高耸的石璧经过多年的采挖已经看不出原来的模样了。往\n南看去是一些矮小的房舍和储存工具的地方，往西是村内的广场，往北靠\n近广场的地方有一栋简陋的民宅。\n"
msgstr "An open stretch of yellow earth, with neatly cut big stones and gravel piled around it. To the east is the quarry, whose towering rock walls, dug at for years, no longer look as they once did. To the south you see some low houses and a place for storing tools; to the west is the village square; to the north, near the square, stands a shabby house."

msgid "这是一间民宅, 屋内除了一张石床外其他一无所有. 昏暗的屋\n内看来死气沉沉的, 似乎这屋子的主人很久没回来了. 屋角有一个\n形状很奇怪的蜘蛛网.\n"
msgstr "A house with nothing in it but a stone bed. The dim room looks lifeless, as if its owner has not been back for a long time. In the corner hangs a strangely shaped cobweb."

msgid "这里是采石场的工作站，几间矮小的房舍延著山壁建造。靠南的山边\n有一间马房，旁边还堆著山一般的乾草饲料，几辆运输用的车子停在旁边\n。往北看去是采石场的空地往南是一条由石板铺成的小斜坡，通往村前的\n工作站。西边不远处有一栋看来相当特别的房舍。\n"
msgstr "This is the quarry's work station, where a few low houses are built along the mountain wall. By the mountain to the south is a stable, with hay piled like a hill beside it and a few transport carts parked next to it. To the north you see the open ground of the quarry; to the south a small slope paved with stone slabs leads to the work station at the front of the village. A rather special-looking house stands not far to the west."

msgid "小路到了这里往北就算是出了村子. 西边有一间小小的土地庙, 东\n边是一栋民宅似的建筑, 不过入口不在这边. 往南是一个交叉路口.\n"
msgstr "Going north from here, the path leaves the village. To the west is a small Earth God shrine; to the east is a building that looks like a house, though its entrance is not on this side. To the south is a crossroads."

msgid "这是一间小小的土地庙, 庙内相当的暗, 一股湿气混上焚烧冥\n纸的味道使得屋内的的气味显得很奇特. 供桌上零星地放个一些水\n果, 一尊木刻的土地公像孤独地立在前面. 庙外的小空地边有一个\n简陋的金纸亭.\n"
msgstr "A small Earth God shrine, quite dark inside. Damp air mixed with the smell of burning spirit money gives the room an odd smell. A few scattered pieces of fruit lie on the offering table, and a wooden statue of the Earth God stands alone before it. On the small clearing outside the shrine is a rough gold-paper burner."

msgid "一条看来相当荒凉的小路, 两旁杂草丛生, 好像很久都没有人来过\n的样子. 往南很远的地方可以看到村子的入口, 往北的路似乎不是很明\n显.\n"
msgstr "A rather desolate little path, weeds growing thick on both sides, as if no one has been here for a long time. Far to the south you can see the entrance of the village; the way north does not look clear."

msgid "小路到了这里以后往北变得很不明显, 往南还可以依稀看到村子的\n入口, 路的四周长满了杂草和小树之类的, 看来相当的荒凉. \n"
msgstr "Past this point the path to the north becomes very faint. To the south you can still dimly see the entrance of the village. The path is overgrown all around with weeds and small trees, and looks quite desolate."

msgid "这里是山洞的入口, 往南看去是一条小小的碎石路, 两旁长满\n杂草, 看来很不明显. 往北是一道厚厚的木门, 上面用一条手臂粗\n的铁链拴著. 虽然如此, 你仍可以感到一股寒气从里面透出来.\n"
msgstr "This is the mouth of the cave. To the south is a small gravel road, weeds growing thick on both sides, barely noticeable. To the north is a thick wooden door, bolted with an iron chain as thick as an arm. Even so, you can feel a chill seeping out from inside."

msgid "山洞很矮，几乎站不直身子，脚下偶尔踩到石头或是些莫名其妙的东西，\n洞内奇寒澈骨，南面是一扇木门，北面隐隐地有些亮光。\n"
msgstr "The cave is low; you can hardly stand straight. Underfoot you now and then step on stones or on odd things you cannot name. The cold inside bites to the bone. To the south is a wooden door; to the north a faint light shows."

msgid "山洞很矮，几乎站不直身子，脚下偶尔踩到石头或是些莫名其妙的东西，\n洞内奇寒澈骨，南面似乎可以前行，北面是一出口。\n"
msgstr "The cave is low; you can hardly stand straight. Underfoot you now and then step on stones or on odd things you cannot name. The cold inside bites to the bone. To the south it seems you can go on; to the north is an exit."

msgid "这是一段荒芜的山路，显然很少有人走过，东面是陡峭的\n山壁，山壁上零星的长着几棵小树，西面是深不见底的悬崖，\n仔细一听，仿佛下面有潺潺的流水声。山路的南边有一个山洞\n黑乎乎的看不清里面的景色，山路一直向北蜿蜒。\n"
msgstr "A desolate mountain road, plainly seldom walked. To the east is a steep rock wall with a few small trees scattered on it; to the west is a bottomless cliff, and if you listen closely, you seem to hear running water far below. To the south of the road is a cave, black and impossible to see into. The mountain road winds on to the north."

msgid "这是一段荒芜的山路，显然很少有人走过，东面是陡峭的\n山壁，山壁上零星的长着几棵小树，西面是深不见底的悬崖，\n仔细一听，仿佛下面有潺潺的流水声。山路一直向北蜿蜒。\n"
msgstr "A desolate mountain road, plainly seldom walked. To the east is a steep rock wall with a few small trees scattered on it; to the west is a bottomless cliff, and if you listen closely, you seem to hear running water far below. The mountain road winds on to the north."

msgid "这是一段荒芜的山路，显然很少有人走过，东面是陡峭的\n山壁，山壁上零星的长着几棵小树，西面是深不见底的悬崖，\n仔细一听，仿佛下面有潺潺的流水声。山路的北边似乎到了\n尽头。\n"
msgstr "A desolate mountain road, plainly seldom walked. To the east is a steep rock wall with a few small trees scattered on it; to the west is a bottomless cliff, and if you listen closely, you seem to hear running water far below. The road to the north seems to end."

msgid "你走到了山路的尽头，发现三面都是石壁，东面石壁上有一个洞口，洞内隐隐\n发出风雷之声，洞口上方似乎刻着一副图，北面是一扇大石门，\n门上苔迹斑斑，显然已经很久没人打开过了。\n"
msgstr "You have reached the end of the mountain road and find stone walls on three sides. In the east wall is a cave mouth, from which comes a faint sound of wind and thunder; above the opening seems to be a carved picture. To the north is a great stone door, mossy and mottled, plainly not opened for a very long time."

msgid "这是一间石室，室内透着一种说不清的神秘力量，西边有两张石椅\n东首墙上挂这一把木剑。北边通往大厅，但墙上写了两行字，走近仔细\n辨认，是：非我弟子，莫入此门。\n"
msgstr "A stone chamber with a mysterious power in it that cannot be put into words. Two stone chairs stand on the west side, and a wooden sword hangs on the east wall. The way north leads to the great hall, but two lines are written on the wall; go close and look carefully, and they read: Not my disciple, do not enter this door."

msgid "这就是传说中的绝尘子的修行之所，北面是一座佛像，佛像顶部\n有一颗夜明珠发出莹莹的光芒。室内设施古朴，但却一尘不染。\n"
msgstr "This is the legendary retreat of Juechenzi. To the north is a Buddha statue, with a night-shining pearl atop it giving off a soft glow. The furnishings are simple and old, yet not a speck of dust lies on them."

msgid "这是一间石室，西边有一个大厅，大厅中有光线透出来，因此可以看清\n石室中的东西，南边有两个蒲团，似是用来打坐的，此外别无他物。\n"
msgstr "A stone chamber. To the west is a great hall, and light from it shows what is in the chamber. To the south are two meditation cushions, which seem to be for sitting in meditation. There is nothing else."

msgid "你来到了一条小溪的旁边，溪水很清澈，缓缓地向南流去，西面\n灌木丛中隐隐的有条小路。\n忽然水中有一道亮光闪过，不过看不清是什么，你是否要下去\n找一找?\n"
msgstr "You come to the side of a little stream. The water is clear and flows slowly south, and a faint path runs through the brush to the west.\nSuddenly a flash of light goes by in the water, but you cannot see what it was. Will you go down and look for it?"

msgid "从这里向四周望去，只见一片无垠的绿野，然而地面上似乎\n罩着一层神密的薄雾，渐渐地远处的景色模糊起来，你觉得\n自己正深处一个飘忽的所在。你一回身，看见有一个路牌\n树在那里。\n"
msgstr "Looking around, you see only an endless green wilderness, yet the ground seems covered by a mysterious thin mist, and the distant scenery gradually blurs. You feel you are deep in a drifting, unreal place. You turn around and see a signpost standing there."

msgid "从这里向四周望去，只见群山环绕，不知所处，地面上似乎\n罩着一层神密的薄雾，渐渐地远处的景色模糊起来，你觉得\n自己正深处一个飘忽的所在。你一回身，看见有一个路牌树\n在那里。\n"
msgstr "Looking around, you see only mountains ringing you, and you cannot tell where you are. The ground seems covered by a mysterious thin mist, and the distant scenery gradually blurs. You feel you are deep in a drifting, unreal place. You turn around and see a signpost standing there."

msgid "从这里向四周望去，只见四面环水，只有脚下一点陆地，水面上\n似乎罩着一层神密的薄雾，渐渐地远处的景色模糊起来，你觉得\n自己正深处一个飘忽的所在。你一回身，看见有一个路牌树\n在那里。\n"
msgstr "Looking around, you see water on every side and only a patch of land underfoot. The water seems covered by a mysterious thin mist, and the distant scenery gradually blurs. You feel you are deep in a drifting, unreal place. You turn around and see a signpost standing there."

msgid "从这里向四周望去，只见寒风阵阵，奇寒澈骨，如入北极风洞，四周\n似乎罩着一层神密的薄雾，风吹不散，渐渐地远处的景色模糊起来，你\n觉得自己正深处一个飘忽的所在。你一回身，看见有一个路牌树\n在那里。\n"
msgstr "Looking around, you feel gusts of cold wind and a chill that bites to the bone, as if you had entered the Arctic wind cave. A mysterious thin mist seems to cover everything, and the wind cannot blow it away. The distant scenery gradually blurs. You feel you are deep in a drifting, unreal place. You turn around and see a signpost standing there."

msgid "从这里向四周望去，只见铅云低沉，忽然一道闪电，跟着一阵巨雷，\n远山为之回响，身旁似乎罩着一层神密的薄雾，渐渐地远处的景色\n模糊起来，你觉得自己正深处一个飘忽的所在。你一回身，看见有\n一个路牌树在那里。\n"
msgstr "Looking around, you see heavy lead-grey clouds. Suddenly lightning flashes, followed by a crash of thunder that echoes off the far mountains. A mysterious thin mist seems to cover the air about you, and the distant scenery gradually blurs. You feel you are deep in a drifting, unreal place. You turn around and see a signpost standing there."

msgid "从这里向四周望去，只见火光冲天，炽热难当，身旁似乎罩着一层\n神密的薄雾，渐渐地远处的景色模糊起来，你觉得自己正深处一个\n飘忽的所在。你一回身，看见有一个路牌树在那里。\n"
msgstr "Looking around, you see flames rising to the sky and unbearable heat. A mysterious thin mist seems to cover the air about you, and the distant scenery gradually blurs. You feel you are deep in a drifting, unreal place. You turn around and see a signpost standing there."

msgid "从这里向四周望去，只见身处一个大湖泊之中，脚下只有四尺见方的\n一块陆地，湖上似乎罩着一层神密的薄雾，渐渐地远处的景色模糊起来，\n你觉得自己正深处一个飘忽的所在。你一回身，看见有一个路牌\n树在那里。\n"
msgstr "Looking around, you find yourself in the middle of a great lake, with only a patch of land four feet square underfoot. A mysterious thin mist seems to cover the lake, and the distant scenery gradually blurs. You feel you are deep in a drifting, unreal place. You turn around and see a signpost standing there."

msgid "从这里向四周望去，只见长天一碧，沃野千里，正自心旷神怡，\n那层神密的薄雾又起，渐渐地远处的景色模糊起来，你觉得自\n己正深处一个飘忽的所在。你一回身，看见有一个路牌\n树在那里。\n"
msgstr "Looking around, you see a clear sky and a thousand li of rich fields, and your heart is light and glad. But then the mysterious thin mist rises again, and the distant scenery gradually blurs. You feel you are deep in a drifting, unreal place. You turn around and see a signpost standing there."

msgid "这是一块绝地,四周没有任何出口,你不禁急得要哭了出来,忽然,你发现\n远方有一块大石动了一下,走近一看,似乎可以推一下。\n"
msgstr "A dead end with no exit on any side. You are so desperate you almost cry. Suddenly you notice that a big rock in the distance has moved. Go closer and it seems you can push it."

msgid "这是一副八卦阵图,图下面有一行模糊的小字：八卦古阵\n"
msgstr "This is a trigram formation chart. Below the picture is a line of small, blurred writing: The Ancient Eight-Trigram Formation."

msgid "路牌上写着：  坤--坤为地，遇青龙而生，遇玄武而死，遇白虎而困，遇朱雀而涉。\n"
msgstr "The signpost reads: Kun—Kun is Earth. Meeting the Azure Dragon, it lives; meeting the Black Tortoise, it dies; meeting the White Tiger, it is trapped; meeting the Vermilion Bird, it wades."

msgid "路牌上写着：  艮--艮为山，遇青龙而涉，遇玄武而生，遇白虎而死，遇朱雀而困。\n"
msgstr "The signpost reads: Gen—Gen is Mountain. Meeting the Azure Dragon, it wades; meeting the Black Tortoise, it lives; meeting the White Tiger, it dies; meeting the Vermilion Bird, it is trapped."

msgid "路牌上写着：  坎--坎为水，遇青龙而死，遇玄武而涉，遇白虎而生，遇朱雀而困。\n"
msgstr "The signpost reads: Kan—Kan is Water. Meeting the Azure Dragon, it dies; meeting the Black Tortoise, it wades; meeting the White Tiger, it lives; meeting the Vermilion Bird, it is trapped."

msgid "路牌上写着：  巽--巽为风，遇青龙而生，遇玄武而死，遇白虎而涉，遇朱雀而困。\n"
msgstr "The signpost reads: Xun—Xun is Wind. Meeting the Azure Dragon, it lives; meeting the Black Tortoise, it dies; meeting the White Tiger, it wades; meeting the Vermilion Bird, it is trapped."

msgid "路牌上写着：  震--震为雷，遇青龙而涉，遇玄武而生，遇白虎而困，遇朱雀而死。\n"
msgstr "The signpost reads: Zhen—Zhen is Thunder. Meeting the Azure Dragon, it wades; meeting the Black Tortoise, it lives; meeting the White Tiger, it is trapped; meeting the Vermilion Bird, it dies."

msgid "路牌上写着：  离--离为火，遇青龙而死，遇玄武而涉，遇白虎而生，遇朱雀而困。\n"
msgstr "The signpost reads: Li—Li is Fire. Meeting the Azure Dragon, it dies; meeting the Black Tortoise, it wades; meeting the White Tiger, it lives; meeting the Vermilion Bird, it is trapped."

msgid "路牌上写着：  兑--兑为泽，遇青龙而困，遇玄武而生，遇白虎而死，遇朱雀而涉。\n"
msgstr "The signpost reads: Dui—Dui is Lake. Meeting the Azure Dragon, it is trapped; meeting the Black Tortoise, it lives; meeting the White Tiger, it dies; meeting the Vermilion Bird, it wades."

msgid "路牌上写着：  乾--乾为天，遇青龙而死，遇玄武而困，遇白虎而涉，遇朱雀而生。\n"
msgstr "The signpost reads: Qian—Qian is Heaven. Meeting the Azure Dragon, it dies; meeting the Black Tortoise, it is trapped; meeting the White Tiger, it wades; meeting the Vermilion Bird, it lives."

msgid "推"
msgstr "Push"

msgid "远方有一块大石动了一下,走近一看,似乎可以推一下。\n"
msgstr "A big rock in the distance has moved. Go closer and it seems you can push it."

msgid "你出力不太够喔！"
msgstr "You are not strong enough!"

msgid "你用力推活动的大岩石,大岩石动了一下"
msgstr "You push hard at the loose boulder, and it shifts a little."

msgid "大岩石滚开了,你从大岩石后面的小洞钻了出去"
msgstr "The boulder rolls aside, and you crawl out through the small hole behind it."

msgid "四周没有任何出口。推不动那块大石的话，就只能在这里等下去了。\n"
msgstr "There is no exit on any side. If you cannot push that big rock aside, all you can do is wait here."

msgid "你在绝地里苦等良久，终于昏昏沉沉地睡了过去……醒来时，你已经躺在雪亭镇的饮风客栈里。"
msgstr "You wait a long while in the dead end, and at last drift off into a dull sleep... When you wake, you are lying in Drinkwind Inn in Snow Pavilion."

msgid "下水寻找"
msgstr "Search the water"

msgid "溪水很清澈，水中忽然有一道亮光闪过，不过看不清是什么。\n"
msgstr "The stream is clear. Suddenly a flash of light goes by in the water, but you cannot see what it was."

msgid "你跳入溪水之中，开始仔细寻找...."
msgstr "You jump into the stream and begin searching carefully..."

msgid "你竟从水中找出一把追风剑!"
msgstr "You pull a Windchaser sword out of the water!"

msgid "你在水中忙了半天，结果一无所获。"
msgstr "You spend a good while busy in the water, and find nothing."

msgid "一个很大的蜘蛛网.\n"
msgstr "A very big cobweb."

msgid "突然你觉得头上有个阴影, 不自觉的抬起头来一看 ............好大的 ..... 蜘蛛..... \n"
msgstr "Suddenly you feel a shadow overhead and look up without thinking ... What a huge ... spider..."

msgid "你向石洞走去，忽然一阵狂风涌至，你抵受不住，只好退了回来"
msgstr "You walk toward the stone cave, but a sudden gale surges up and you cannot withstand it, so you retreat."

msgid "入口被魔法封住了！"
msgstr "The entrance is sealed by magic!"

msgid "非我弟子  莫入此门"
msgstr "Not my disciple, do not enter this door"

msgid "一件鲜红色的锦衣，上面绣著水烟阁的金色乌鸦徽号。\n"
msgstr "A bright red brocade robe, embroidered with the golden crow badge of Waterfog Pavilion."

msgid "这是水烟阁武士常戴的红色圆顶帽，帽缘镶著一圈金线。\n"
msgstr "The round red cap that Waterfog warriors often wear, its brim edged with a ring of gold thread."

msgid "一把通体黝黑，又带著一丝焦味的铁剑。\n"
msgstr "An iron sword, black from end to end, with a faint smell of scorching about it."

msgid "这条黑铁杖光看就知道非常沈重，拿在手里才知道比想像中更重。\n"
msgstr "One look is enough to tell this black iron staff is heavy, and in the hand it is heavier than you thought."

msgid "这个人相貌十分魁梧。\n"
msgstr "This man is powerfully built."

msgid "这个人看起来十分和蔼可亲，一双眼睛炯炯有神。\n"
msgstr "This man looks kindly, with bright, piercing eyes."

msgid "这是一只天邪派的灵兽「天邪虎」，火红的毛皮上有著如白银般的\n白纹，湛蓝色的眼珠中散发出妖异的光芒。\n"
msgstr "A spirit beast of the Wayward School, the \"Wayward Tiger\". Its fiery red coat is marked with stripes like white silver, and its deep blue eyes give off an uncanny light."

msgid "后腿"
msgstr "hind legs"

msgid "这个人看起来十分和蔼可亲，看起来不像是会武功的人。\n"
msgstr "This man looks kindly, and not like someone who knows martial arts."

msgid "这个人身著红色水烟阁武士服色，眼神十分锐利。\n"
msgstr "This man wears the red uniform of a Waterfog warrior, and his eyes are very sharp."

msgid "红衣武士喝道：这点玩意儿也敢上水烟阁撒野，真是不自量力！\n"
msgstr "The Red-Robed Guard shouts, \"With tricks this feeble you dare make trouble at Waterfog Pavilion? You don't know your place!\""

msgid "红衣武士说道：快快滚下山去，别在这里罗唆！\n"
msgstr "The Red-Robed Guard says, \"Get down the mountain, quick, and quit yammering here!\""

msgid "这位$RESPECT，在下正在执行勤务，恕不奉陪。"
msgstr "I am on duty, $RESPECT. Forgive me, but I cannot oblige you."

msgid "哼 ... 原来阁下是找麻烦来著？"
msgstr "Hmph... so you have come looking for trouble, sir?"

msgid "（水烟阁的红衣武士从此都把你当作敌人，见到你就会动手。）"
msgstr "(From now on the Red-Robed Guards of Waterfog Pavilion will treat you as an enemy and attack you on sight.)"

msgid "水烟阁五长老"
msgstr "Fifth Elder of Waterfog Pavilion"

msgid "南危水是当世使剑的名家，也是槐阳王的弟弟，一身武学集天邪、封山\n两派之所长，在水烟阁七长老中武功仅次于二长老莫谦容。南危水手中\n的焦殇剑也是一把罕见的利器，传说这把剑是名铸剑师黄炎炎生平六把\n名剑中排名第一的杰作。\n"
msgstr "Nan Weishui is one of the great swordsmen of his age, and a younger brother of the Prince of Huaiyang. His learning gathers the best of both the Wayward School and the Empty Mountain School. Among the seven Elders of Waterfog Pavilion, only the Second Elder, Mo Qianrong, is his better in martial arts. The Sorrowfire in his hand is also a rare and keen blade; legend says it is the foremost masterpiece among the six famous swords forged in the lifetime of the great swordsmith Huang Yanyan."

msgid "你来了。老夫欠你一个人情，到了关北，老夫替你引见槐阳王。"
msgstr "You have come. This old man owes you a favor. When you reach Beyond the Pass, this old man will introduce you to the Prince of Huaiyang."

msgid "看着你，忽然开口。"
msgstr " looks at you and suddenly speaks."

msgid "是你埋了阿岭。"
msgstr "It was you who buried A-Ling."

msgid "老松岭瀑布后头那个山洞——骸骨旁边本来有一面腰牌，背面一个「岭」字。你把他葬了，连腰牌也葬了。这二十年，没有人替他做过这件事。"
msgstr "The cave behind the waterfall at Old Pine Ridge. Beside the bones there used to be a waist token with the character \"Ling\" on the back. You buried him, and the token with him. In these twenty years, no one has done that for him."

msgid "他是老夫的随从。那年老夫押着盟主印和密件过老松岭，白衣武官在瀑布前伏击，阿岭替老夫挡了刀，盟主卫沧澜被他们带走了。老夫逃进山洞，在石壁上刻了那些字——让人以为南危水死在那里。"
msgstr "He was this old man's attendant. The year this old man escorted the Alliance seal and the secret papers through Old Pine Ridge, the officers in white ambushed us before the waterfall. A-Ling took the blade for me, and the Alliance Leader, Wei Canglan, was carried off by them. This old man fled into the cave and carved those words on the rock wall, so that people would think Nan Weishui died there."

msgid "老夫的哥哥是槐阳王。他若知道朝廷伏击了自己的弟弟，关北立刻就反。老夫装死二十年，是为了这个。"
msgstr "This old man's elder brother is the Prince of Huaiyang. If he learned that the court had ambushed his own brother, Beyond the Pass would rise in revolt at once. For that, this old man has feigned death for twenty years."

msgid "看着你，半晌才开口。"
msgstr " looks at you, and only after a long while speaks."

msgid "你站到颜违那边去了。……老夫替盟主守了二十年的口，守的就是那把椅子。"
msgstr "You have gone over to Yan Wei's side... This old man has held his tongue for the Alliance Leader for twenty years. It was that chair that I was guarding."

msgid "五长老"
msgstr "Fifth Elder"

msgid "老夫便是五长老。你想问什么？"
msgstr "This old man is the Fifth Elder. What do you want to ask?"

msgid "山洞的骸骨"
msgstr "The bones in the cave"

msgid "老夫都说了。阿岭的事，你知道就好。"
msgstr "This old man has told it all. As for A-Ling, it is enough that you know."

msgid "盯着你手里的腰牌，脸色一点点白了。"
msgstr " stares at the waist token in your hand, and his face slowly goes white."

msgid "背面一个「岭」字……阿岭的腰牌。你从山洞里拿来的。"
msgstr "The character \"Ling\" on the back... A-Ling's waist token. You took it from the cave."

msgid "看了看镖单，又看了看你。"
msgstr " looks at the waybill, then at you."

msgid "乙丑年，关雨楼立的碑，字是用手指写的——山洞石壁上的字也是。你看出来了。"
msgstr "In the year Yichou, Guan Yulou raised that stele, and its words were written with a finger. So were the words on the cave wall. You saw that."

msgid "死的是老夫的随从阿岭。那年老夫押着盟主印和密件过老松岭，白衣武官在瀑布前伏击，阿岭替老夫挡了刀，盟主卫沧澜被他们带走了。老夫逃进山洞，在石壁上刻了那些字——让人以为南危水死在那里。"
msgstr "The dead man is A-Ling, this old man's attendant. The year this old man escorted the Alliance seal and the secret papers through Old Pine Ridge, the officers in white ambushed us before the waterfall. A-Ling took the blade for me, and the Alliance Leader, Wei Canglan, was carried off by them. This old man fled into the cave and carved those words on the rock wall, so that people would think Nan Weishui died there."

msgid "两块碑你都看过了。……空口说的事，老夫不认。拿出凭据来——镖局的镖单，或是山洞里的东西。"
msgstr "You have seen both steles... This old man does not accept words alone. Bring proof: a waybill from the escort agency, or something from the cave."

msgid "老夫不知道你在说什么。"
msgstr "This old man does not know what you are talking about."

msgid "保密"
msgstr "Keep it secret"

msgid "替南危水保密，七长老颜违就永远不会从你这里知道这件事。要答应他吗？"
msgstr "Keep Nan Weishui's secret, and the Seventh Elder, Yan Wei, will never learn of it from you. Promise him?"

msgid "多谢。到了关北，老夫替你引见槐阳王。"
msgstr "Thank you. When you reach Beyond the Pass, this old man will introduce you to the Prince of Huaiyang."

msgid "沉默了很久，向你抱了抱拳。"
msgstr " is silent a long while, then cups a fist to you."

msgid "老夫欠你一个人情。到了关北，老夫替你引见槐阳王。"
msgstr "This old man owes you a favor. When you reach Beyond the Pass, this old man will introduce you to the Prince of Huaiyang."

msgid "保什么密？老夫没有什么要瞒的。"
msgstr "Keep what secret? This old man has nothing to hide."

msgid "晚月庄。老夫只说一遍。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor. This old man will say it only once."

msgid "压低了声音。"
msgstr " speaks in a low voice."

msgid "老夫欠你一桩事，这件事告诉你。寒於的宝衣，当年归月神族保管——月神族的后人在晚月庄，供着人灵区冥的神像。"
msgstr "This old man owes you a matter, and this one I will tell you. In those days Hanyu's Robe was kept by the Moon God clan. The descendants of the Moon God clan are at Latemoon Manor, where they keep a shrine to Ouming, the Human Soul."

msgid "守衣的人几百年没换过。你去了，别和她动手。"
msgstr "The keeper of the robe has not changed in hundreds of years. When you go, do not fight her."

msgid "宝衣？归月神族保管——晚月庄。老夫只说这一句。"
msgstr "The robe? The Moon God clan kept it. Latemoon Manor. This old man will say only that."

msgid "老夫知道的都说了。"
msgstr "This old man has told all he knows."

msgid "水烟阁六长老"
msgstr "Sixth Elder of Waterfog Pavilion"

msgid "陈长老本来的名字已经没有人知道了，但是他的横练功夫「石猿功」成名\n数十年，加上个性有点....那个....顽固，因此水烟阁执法使潘军禅给他\n起了个绰号叫「坚石」，久而久之陈长老倒也挺喜欢这个名字，索性舍弃\n了原来的名字改名叫陈坚石。\n"
msgstr "No one knows Elder Chen's original name any more, but his hard-body skill, the \"Stone Ape Art\", has been famous for decades, and since his temper is a bit... well... stubborn, the Enforcer of Waterfog Pavilion, Pan Junchan, gave him the nickname \"Hard Stone\". As time went by, Elder Chen came to like it quite a lot, and simply dropped his old name and became Chen Jianshi."

msgid "水烟阁七长老"
msgstr "Seventh Elder of Waterfog Pavilion"

msgid "颜违是水烟阁七位长老中最年轻的，虽然他的武功跟其他六位长老\n相比仍略逊一筹，但是他办事十分精明干练，因此七长老每年都派\n他出外办理武林大会事宜。\n"
msgstr "Yan Wei is the youngest of the seven Elders of Waterfog Pavilion. His martial arts are a notch below the other six, but he is shrewd and capable, so every year the seven Elders send him abroad to handle the business of the Wulin Assembly."

msgid "正把案上的文书一件件收进匣子里，见你进来，点了点头。"
msgstr " is putting the papers on the desk away into a box one by one. Seeing you come in, he nods."

msgid "正厅那把椅子，本座这就下去坐。"
msgstr "The chair in the main hall. I am going down to sit in it now."

msgid "向你拱了拱手：盟主。"
msgstr " cups his hands to you. \"Alliance Leader.\""

msgid "看了你一眼，把目光移开了。"
msgstr " glances at you and looks away."

msgid "水烟阁代盟主"
msgstr "Acting Alliance Leader of Waterfog Pavilion"

msgid "五长老？他就在这边，有什么话你自己问他。"
msgstr "The Fifth Elder? He is right over there. If you have something to say, ask him yourself."

msgid "站颜违：正月十七，天邪派在虹台上的那一票投颜违，由他坐那把椅子（已经入了虹台的席的，这一票不再跟着变）。\n他许你水烟阁执事；潘军禅从此只同你谈公事。二十年的旧案，到此为止。\n这是天邪这条线的大分裂，选了不能改。要站颜违吗？"
msgstr "Stand with Yan Wei: on the seventeenth of the first month, the Wayward School's vote on the Rainbow Terrace goes to Yan Wei, and he takes the chair (once seats are taken on the Rainbow Terrace, the vote no longer changes).\nHe grants you the post of Deacon of Waterfog Pavilion; from then on Pan Junchan will speak with you of business only. The twenty-year-old case ends there.\nThis is the great split in the Wayward line, and it can't be undone. Stand with Yan Wei?"

msgid "执事，正月十七之前，本座还要你跑几趟。"
msgstr "Deacon, before the seventeenth of the first month I will still have you run a few errands."

msgid "你选了执法使。好——水烟阁的事，本座记性好。"
msgstr "You chose the Enforcer. Good. In the affairs of Waterfog Pavilion, I have a long memory."

msgid "点了点头，像是早算到了这一步。"
msgstr " nods, as if he had worked out this step long ago."

msgid "识时务。二十年的空椅子，总要有人去坐。"
msgstr "A man who knows the times. Twenty years of an empty chair, and someone has to go and sit in it."

msgid "从今日起，你是水烟阁的执事。正月十七，天邪派那一票，本座记在你头上。"
msgstr "From today you are a Deacon of Waterfog Pavilion. On the seventeenth of the first month, the Wayward School's vote goes on your account."

msgid "椅子？正月十七，自有分晓。"
msgstr "The chair? On the seventeenth of the first month, it will be settled."

msgid "南危水的事"
msgstr "About Nan Weishui"

msgid "把南危水装死二十年的事告诉七长老，他就再也瞒不住了。要说吗？"
msgstr "Tell the Seventh Elder that Nan Weishui has feigned death for twenty years, and Nan Weishui will no longer be able to hide it. Tell him?"

msgid "五长老的事，本座已经知道了。盟主不在，水烟阁总要有人主事。"
msgstr "The Fifth Elder's affair I already know. The Alliance Leader is absent, and Waterfog Pavilion must have someone in charge."

msgid "听完，半晌没有说话，然后慢慢坐直了。"
msgstr " listens, says nothing for a long while, then slowly sits up straight."

msgid "盟主二十年前就被朝廷带走了，五长老知情不报。这件事，水烟阁得有人主事。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader was taken away by the court twenty years ago, and the Fifth Elder knew and said nothing. In this matter, Waterfog Pavilion must have someone in charge."

msgid "从今日起，本座代行盟主之职。你的话，本座记下了。"
msgstr "From today I take up the Alliance Leader's duties. I have noted your words."

msgid "南危水？他是五长老，有什么事？"
msgstr "Nan Weishui? He is the Fifth Elder. What is it?"

msgid "这是一条宽敞坚实的青石板大道，从这里已经可以望见北边山腰上\n水烟阁琉璃色的屋瓦，映著山上茂密的枫树林，显得十分诗情画意，由\n于这条路是禁兵统领亲自督造，因此造得格外平整，从这里开始已经进\n入由历代水烟阁主人所管辖的封地，即使是官府也不能过问这片土地上\n发生的事，因此你最好小心一点。\n"
msgstr "This is a wide, solid road of blue flagstones. From here you can already see the glazed tiles of Waterfog Pavilion on the hillside to the north, set against the dense maple woods, a scene as lovely as a poem. As the road was built under the personal supervision of the commander of the Palace Guard, it is laid especially level. From here on you are in the fief governed by the successive masters of Waterfog Pavilion. Even the government may not inquire into what happens on this land, so you had best be careful."

msgid "这是一条宽敞坚实的青石板大道，从这里沿著山势弯向西边与南边\n，往西不远处就是通往水烟阁的石阶。\n"
msgstr "This is a wide, solid road of blue flagstones. From here it bends west and south along the mountain, and not far to the west are the stone steps up to Waterfog Pavilion."

msgid "这是一条宽敞坚实的青石大道，大道沿著山腰往东向山下延伸，一\n道长长的白石阶梯从这里往北边上山，从这里仰望阶梯的尽头有一座雄\n伟的楼阁，那就是著名的「水烟阁」。\n"
msgstr "This is a wide, solid road of blue stone. It runs east down the mountainside, and a long stairway of white stone climbs north from here. Looking up to the top of the stairs, you see a grand pavilion: the famous Waterfog Pavilion."

msgid "你现在正走在一条长长的白石阶梯上，这些建造阶梯的白石出产于\n东海滨的裂瓶山，距离此地有近千里之遥，而且虽然年代久远，仍然可\n以看得出所用的全部都是品质最好的「拟玉」石，可见这里的主人必定\n大有来头。\n"
msgstr "You are climbing a long stairway of white stone. The stone of the steps comes from Split Bottle Mountain on the east coast, nearly a thousand li from here. Though it is old, you can still see that all of it is the finest \"near-jade\" stone, so whoever lives here must be a person of great standing."

msgid "这里是一个用白石砌成的亭子，亭子的东面和北面都是深不见底的\n悬崖，从这里望出去只见一片云雾之中突出几座山峰，云雾之中隐隐可\n以看到好似水波的微光，使你一时之间彷佛以为这座亭子是建在一个湖\n中，往西北望去可以看到水烟阁漂浮在云雾之中。\n"
msgstr "This is a pavilion built of white stone. To the east and north are bottomless cliffs. Looking out, you see only a few peaks poking out of a sea of cloud and mist, and in the mist a faint shimmer like rippling water, so that for a moment you almost think the pavilion stands in the middle of a lake. Looking northwest, you can see Waterfog Pavilion floating in the clouds."

msgid "你现在正走在一条长长的白石阶梯上，阶梯随著山峰蜿蜒盘旋，宛\n如一条白龙，水烟阁就矗立在北边的山峰顶上，即使是从这么近的距离\n你仍然感觉这座楼阁飘飘渺渺，难以捉摸。\n"
msgstr "You are climbing a long stairway of white stone that winds with the mountain like a white dragon. Waterfog Pavilion stands on the northern peak. Even this close, it still feels drifting and elusive, hard to pin down."

msgid "你现在正站在一座高大的楼阁，水烟阁前，琉璃色的屋瓦和白玉般\n的白石砖使得水烟阁在崇山峻岭中显得十分抢眼，这座楼阁最早的主人\n据说是有「武术之神」称号的太阳神君「杞庸」，后来被当作历代武林\n盟主的居所，可说是学武之人的朝圣地，一条白石阶梯沿著山腰往南而\n下，水烟阁的大门就在你的北方。\n"
msgstr "You are standing before a tall pavilion, Waterfog Pavilion. Its glazed tiles and jade-white stone bricks make it stand out among the mountains. They say its first master was the Sun Lord Qi Yong, called the \"God of Martial Arts\"; later it became the residence of the successive Alliance Leaders, a place of pilgrimage for all who study martial arts. A white stone stairway runs south down the mountainside, and the gate of Waterfog Pavilion is to the north."

msgid "你现在正走在一条山坡上的小径，往南望去只见山下一条白色石阶\n蜿蜒上山，通往东边不远处的一个平台，平台的北边就是赫赫有名的武\n者圣地「水烟阁」，小径的北边整齐地种著一排枫树，往西上了山坡通\n往位于山巅的「虹台」。\n"
msgstr "You are on a trail on the mountain slope. Looking south you see a white stone stairway winding up the mountain to a platform not far to the east. North of the platform is the renowned holy ground of fighters, Waterfog Pavilion. A row of maple trees is planted neatly on the north side of the trail. West, up the slope, is the Rainbow Terrace on the summit."

msgid "你现在正走在一条山坡小径上，东边不远处可以望见水烟阁琉璃色\n的屋瓦，小径东北是一道白石阶梯通往山巅的虹台，往西则是「水烟十\n景」之中最有名的虹谷断崖，小径旁立著一个七、八尺高的石碑(stone\n)。\n"
msgstr "You are on a trail on the mountain slope. Not far east you can see the glazed tiles of Waterfog Pavilion. Northeast of the trail, a white stone stairway climbs to the Rainbow Terrace on the summit. West is Rainbow Gorge Cliff, the most famous of the \"Ten Views of Waterfog\". By the trail stands a stone tablet seven or eight feet tall (stone)."

msgid "你正走在一道白石阶梯上，这道阶梯依著山壁而建，东边隔著一个\n深不见底的山谷可以望见对面傲立在山巅之上的水烟阁，每当清晨山谷\n中的晨雾慢慢飘起，从这里可以看见水烟阁彷佛飘在云间，这就是水烟\n十景中的「飞天楼阁」，石阶沿著山壁从这里转往北方。\n"
msgstr "You are on a white stone stairway built along the mountain wall. To the east, across a bottomless valley, you can see Waterfog Pavilion standing proudly on its summit. When the morning mist rises in the valley, the pavilion seems to float among the clouds from here. This is the \"Pavilion in the Sky\", one of the Ten Views of Waterfog. The stairs turn north along the wall."

msgid "你现在正走在一道依著山壁而建的白石阶梯上，随著阶梯越爬越高\n，从这里已经可以望见西面山顶上竖立在虹台中央的「擎天柱」，阶梯\n从这里转向西北坡度较缓的山腰，你的东边是一个深不见底的深谷，隔\n著深谷可以望见对面不远处的水烟阁。\n"
msgstr "You are on a white stone stairway built along the mountain wall. As you climb higher, you can already see, on the western summit, the \"sky pillar\" standing in the middle of the Rainbow Terrace. The stairs turn northwest onto a gentler stretch of the slope. To your east is a bottomless valley, and across it, not far away, Waterfog Pavilion."

msgid "你现在走在一道依著山壁而建的白石阶梯上，通过西边不远处的葬\n剑亭，就是虹台的入口，东边和北边都是深不见底的深谷，隔著深谷，\n东北边的野羊山连著隐樵山、图云岭、破魔山、虎啸坡、沙牢山一直到\n大漠都是数百丈的高山，虹台地势虽不甚高，但是在三面深谷的环绕下\n，却自有一股群山朝拜的威严气象。\n"
msgstr "You are on a white stone stairway built along the mountain wall. Past the Sword Tomb Pavilion a little way west is the entrance to the Rainbow Terrace. East and north are bottomless valleys. Across them, to the northeast, Goathill, Hidden Woodcutter Mountain, Cloud Painting Ridge, Demon-Breaker Mountain, Tiger Roar Slope and Sandcage Mountain run on to the great desert, all peaks a thousand feet and more high. The Rainbow Terrace is not so high, but ringed by valleys on three sides it has an air of mountains bowing to it."

msgid "你现在来到一个山腰靠近山顶的亭子，亭子前立著一个两丈多高的\n石碑，从亭子里远眺北方连绵不尽的大山，使你不禁感到胸\n臆之间一股英雄情怀油然而生，葬剑亭据说每到夏日夜晚，野风吹过，\n会产生一阵阵呜呜的哭泣声，这也是水烟十景中的「孤亭剑泣」。出了\n亭子，往南便是直通虹台的石阶，一条黄土小路往西通往另一条下山的\n小路。\n"
msgstr "You have come to a pavilion near the summit, with a stone tablet over twenty feet tall in front of it. Looking from the pavilion at the unbroken mountains to the north, you feel a heroic spirit rise in your chest. They say that on summer nights, when the wild wind blows, the Sword Tomb Pavilion makes sobbing sounds; this is the \"Weeping Swords of the Lone Pavilion\" among the Ten Views of Waterfog. Out of the pavilion, stairs lead south straight to the Rainbow Terrace, and a dirt path west joins another path down the mountain."

msgid "这里是水烟阁的正门，一股沁人心脾的檀香使你精神为之一振，正\n门共分三进，全部都是上等的檀木雕成，最里的门上悬著一块匾额，上\n面龙飞凤舞地写著几个大字，可是你全然看不出到底是什么字。\n"
msgstr "This is the front gate of Waterfog Pavilion. A fragrance of sandalwood refreshes your spirit. The gate has three layers, all carved from the finest sandalwood. On the innermost hangs a plaque with a few big characters in flying script, but you cannot make out what they say."

msgid "这里是水烟阁的正厅，简单的陈设中透出一股尊贵不凡的气派，一\n张黝黑的太师椅端坐在大厅中央，这里同时也是「武者」们议事的所在\n，每年的正月十七都要在水烟阁外的「虹台」推选武林盟主，然後在这\n里举行登位大典。你可以看到北边的墙上挂著一樟木匾，似乎写\n著一些有关成为一名武者的事项。\n"
msgstr "This is the main hall of Waterfog Pavilion. The plain furnishings carry a dignity beyond the ordinary. A dark, polished master's chair sits in the middle of the hall. This is also where the \"fighters\" hold council; every year on the seventeenth of the first month the Alliance Leader is chosen at the Rainbow Terrace outside the Pavilion, and the enthronement is held here. On the north wall hangs a camphor-wood plaque that seems to say something about becoming a fighter."

msgid "这里是水烟阁入口西侧的花厅，东边是水烟阁的正门，南边和西边\n围著一圈白玉栏杆，栏杆外种著许多茶花，往北是水烟阁的侧门，从这\n里可以看到通往水烟阁二楼的阶梯。\n"
msgstr "This is the west parlor off the entrance of Waterfog Pavilion. The front gate is to the east. To the south and west a white jade railing runs round, and many camellias grow outside it. To the north is the side gate of Waterfog Pavilion, and from here you can see the stairs up to the second floor."

msgid "这里是水烟阁正门东边的花厅，东边和南边围著一圈白石栏杆，栏\n杆外种著许多茶花，往西是水烟阁的正门，往北则是东侧的侧厅，从这\n里可以看见通往二楼的阶梯。\n"
msgstr "This is the parlor east of the front gate of Waterfog Pavilion. To the east and south a white stone railing runs round, and many camellias grow outside it. West is the front gate; north is the east side hall, and from here you can see the stairs up to the second floor."

msgid "这里是水烟阁西侧的厅院，一道白石梯从这里通往二楼，往北是仆\n役的卧房跟柴房，南边是出水烟阁的侧门，往西则是一个可以眺望山谷\n的阳台。\n"
msgstr "This is the west courtyard hall of Waterfog Pavilion. A white stone stair leads up from here to the second floor. North are the servants' bedrooms and the woodshed; south is the side gate out of Waterfog Pavilion; west is a balcony with a view over the valley."

msgid "这里是水烟阁东边的侧厅，东边隔著栏杆就是深不见底的深谷，从\n这里向外眺望，更可以感受到水烟阁孤立于独峰之上，傲视群山的气魄\n，这里有一道阶梯通往二楼，往北是厨房与储存杂物的仓库。\n"
msgstr "This is the east side hall of Waterfog Pavilion. To the east, beyond the railing, is a bottomless valley. Looking out from here, you feel even more the might of Waterfog Pavilion, standing alone on a lone peak and looking down on the mountains. A stair here leads up to the second floor, and north are the kitchen and a storeroom for odds and ends."

msgid "这里是一间柴房，一捆一捆劈好的柴薪都整齐地堆放在柴房北侧，\n留下一条通道通往东边仆役的卧室。往南可以回到水烟阁的西侧厅。\n"
msgstr "This is a woodshed. Bundle after bundle of split firewood is stacked neatly along the north side, leaving a passage east to the servants' bedroom. South you can go back to the west hall of Waterfog Pavilion."

msgid "这里是在水烟阁从事杂役的仆佣所住的卧室，房间相当宽敞，东西\n向一张大通铺最少可以睡二、三十人，东首一张大炕是冬天才用\n的，因为有不少仆役回家过冬，所以比床铺稍小，北边开了几扇窗子，\n南边则是摆放仆役私物的橱柜。\n"
msgstr "This is the bedroom of the servants who do the odd jobs of Waterfog Pavilion. The room is quite spacious: a big shared sleeping platform running east to west could sleep twenty or thirty at the least. At the east end is a large heated brick bed used only in winter; it is a little smaller than the other beds, because many servants go home for the winter. Several windows open in the north wall, and to the south are cupboards where the servants keep their own things."

msgid "这里是水烟阁的厨房，东首一座大灶，灶边堆著许多瓦瓮，北边是\n一张方桌，桌上锅碗瓢盆一应俱全，西边则是一个橱柜，往南可以回到\n厅中。\n"
msgstr "This is the kitchen of Waterfog Pavilion. At the east end stands a big stove, with many earthenware jars piled beside it. To the north is a square table, and on it pots, bowls and ladles of every kind. To the west is a cupboard. South you can go back into the hall."

msgid "这里是水烟阁西侧厅的二楼，由于侧厅是挑高建筑，因此这里只有\n一条约七、八尺宽的走道连接楼梯与往东的门。\n"
msgstr "This is the second floor of the west side hall of Waterfog Pavilion. As the side hall is open to the roof, there is only a walkway seven or eight feet wide joining the stairs to the door to the east."

msgid "这里是水烟阁二楼的聆啸厅，南面是一个大露台，按著西、西南、\n南、东南、东等方向立著五块灰绿色的怪石，东西各有一个出\n口通往侧厅，往北则是水烟阁主所居的春秋水色斋。\n"
msgstr "This is Long Whistle Hall on the second floor of Waterfog Pavilion. To the south is a large terrace, with five strange gray-green stones standing in the directions west, southwest, south, southeast and east. East and west there is an exit to each side hall, and to the north is the Spring-Autumn Water Studio, where the master of Waterfog Pavilion lives."

msgid "这里是水烟阁东侧厅的二楼，由于侧厅是挑高建筑，因此这里只有\n一条约七、八尺宽的走道连接楼梯与往西的门。\n"
msgstr "This is the second floor of the east side hall of Waterfog Pavilion. As the side hall is open to the roof, there is only a walkway seven or eight feet wide joining the stairs to the door to the west."

msgid "入席"
msgstr "Take a seat"

msgid "入席？\n入了席，就不能再去各派游说、改票：九派的票，就照现在这样。\n那天山下会出事，你只来得及管一件——没管的那一派上不了虹台，它那一票不算。照现在的样子：\n{lines}要入席吗？"
msgstr "Take a seat?\nOnce you have taken your seat, you can no longer go to the schools to lobby or to change votes: the nine schools' votes stay as they are now.\nThat day something will happen at the foot of the mountain, and you will only have time to deal with one thing. The school left unattended cannot ascend the Rainbow Terrace, and its vote does not count. As things stand:\n{lines}Take a seat?"

msgid "· 神教的杀手会在山道上截山烟寺的轿子：不管，山烟寺不来。"
msgstr "· The Golden Crow Order's killers will stop Mountain Mist Temple's sedan chair on the mountain road: if you do nothing, Mountain Mist Temple will not come."

msgid "· 逆灵宫的余孽会去烧葬剑亭，林忌会离席去追：不管，茅山不来。"
msgstr "· Remnants of the Black Palace will set fire to the Sword Tomb Pavilion, and Lin Ji will leave his seat to chase them: if you do nothing, Mount Mao will not come."

msgid "· 颜违的人会堵封山剑派上山的官道：不管，封山不来。"
msgstr "· Yan Wei's men will block the official road up to the Empty Mountain School: if you do nothing, Empty Mountain will not come."

msgid "· 兵部的人会「请」骆云舟去山下喝茶：不管，步玄派不来。"
msgstr "· The Ministry of War's men will \"invite\" Luo Yunzhou down for tea: if you do nothing, the Mystic Step School will not come."

msgid "· 照现在的样子，那天山下太平。"
msgstr "· As things stand, all is quiet at the foot of the mountain that day."

msgid "· 绝尘派不来：绝尘子不问世事。"
msgstr "· The Dustless School will not come: Juechenzi does not ask about worldly affairs."

msgid "正月十七。天还没亮，你踏着白石阶上了虹台。九个旗座都还空着，擎天柱下的香炉冷着。\n"
msgstr "The seventeenth of the first month. It is not yet light, and you climb the white stone steps to the Rainbow Terrace. All nine banner stands are still empty, and the incense burner under the sky pillar is cold."

msgid "天刚亮，山下接连跑上来几个报信的。\n"
msgstr "At first light, several messengers run up the mountain one after another."

msgid "山下出了事，你只来得及管一件："
msgstr "Trouble has come at the foot of the mountain, and you only have time to deal with one thing:"

msgid "山道上：神教的杀手截住了山烟寺的轿子"
msgstr "On the mountain road: the Order's killers have stopped Mountain Mist Temple's sedan chair"

msgid "去山道上截住神教的杀手，山烟寺的轿子才上得了虹台。\n别的事就顾不上了：没人管的那一件，那一派今天上不了虹台，它那一票不算。\n要去吗？"
msgstr "Go to the mountain road and stop the Order's killers, so that Mountain Mist Temple's sedan chair can reach the Rainbow Terrace.\nYou will have no time for anything else: the school left unattended cannot ascend the Rainbow Terrace today, and its vote does not count.\nGo?"

msgid "去山道"
msgstr "Go to the mountain road"

msgid "你下了石阶，在山道转角截住了几个黑衣人。他们认出是你，扔下刀走了。山烟寺的轿子晃晃悠悠地抬了上来。\n"
msgstr "You go down the stairs and stop several men in black at a bend of the mountain road. They recognize you, throw down their blades and leave. Mountain Mist Temple's sedan chair is carried up, swaying."

msgid "葬剑亭：逆灵宫的余孽在放火"
msgstr "Sword Tomb Pavilion: Black Palace remnants are setting fire to it"

msgid "回葬剑亭救火，茅山的林忌就不必离席去追。\n别的事就顾不上了：没人管的那一件，那一派今天上不了虹台，它那一票不算。\n要去吗？"
msgstr "Go back and put out the fire at the Sword Tomb Pavilion, and Lin Ji of Mount Mao will not have to leave his seat to chase them.\nYou will have no time for anything else: the school left unattended cannot ascend the Rainbow Terrace today, and its vote does not count.\nGo?"

msgid "去葬剑亭"
msgstr "Go to the Sword Tomb Pavilion"

msgid "你赶回葬剑亭。几个戴黑冠的道士正往亭柱上泼油，见了你，火把一扔就往崖下跑。火扑灭了，亭子只熏黑了一角。\n"
msgstr "You hurry back to the Sword Tomb Pavilion. Several Daoists in black caps are pouring oil on the pavilion pillars. Seeing you, they throw down their torches and run for the cliff. The fire is put out, and the pavilion is blackened at only one corner."

msgid "官道上：颜违的人堵了封山剑派的路"
msgstr "On the official road: Yan Wei's men have blocked the road of the Empty Mountain School"

msgid "下山解封山的围，封山剑派才上得了虹台。\n别的事就顾不上了：没人管的那一件，那一派今天上不了虹台，它那一票不算。\n要去吗？"
msgstr "Go down and break the blockade, so that the Empty Mountain School can reach the Rainbow Terrace.\nYou will have no time for anything else: the school left unattended cannot ascend the Rainbow Terrace today, and its vote does not count.\nGo?"

msgid "去官道"
msgstr "Go to the official road"

msgid "你下到官道上。十几个红衣武士横在路口，领头的见是你，犹豫了一下，让开了。封山的人上了山。\n"
msgstr "You go down to the official road. A dozen red-robed guards bar the junction, and their leader, seeing it is you, hesitates and steps aside. The Empty Mountain people go up the mountain."

msgid "山下茶棚：兵部的人「请」骆云舟喝茶"
msgstr "The tea shed at the foot of the mountain: the Ministry of War's men are \"inviting\" Luo Yunzhou to tea"

msgid "去山下茶棚请回骆云舟，步玄派才上得了虹台。\n别的事就顾不上了：没人管的那一件，那一派今天上不了虹台，它那一票不算。\n要去吗？"
msgstr "Go to the tea shed at the foot of the mountain and bring Luo Yunzhou back, so that the Mystic Step School can reach the Rainbow Terrace.\nYou will have no time for anything else: the school left unattended cannot ascend the Rainbow Terrace today, and its vote does not count.\nGo?"

msgid "去茶棚"
msgstr "Go to the tea shed"

msgid "你在山下的茶棚里找到了骆云舟。两个穿便服的兵部武官一左一右陪着他，见你进来，起身结了账走了。\n"
msgstr "You find Luo Yunzhou in the tea shed at the foot of the mountain. Two War Ministry officers in plain clothes sit on either side of him. When you come in, they get up, settle the bill and leave."

msgid "哪件也不管"
msgstr "Deal with none of them"

msgid "哪件也不管：你留在虹台上等着开会。\n山下出事的那几派，今天都上不了虹台，它们那一票都不算。\n要这么办吗？"
msgstr "Deal with none: you stay on the Rainbow Terrace and wait for the meeting.\nThe schools in trouble at the foot of the mountain cannot ascend the Rainbow Terrace today, and their votes do not count.\nDo it this way?"

msgid "你没有下石阶。山下的消息一件一件传上来，你只是听着。\n"
msgstr "You do not go down the steps. News from the foot of the mountain comes up one piece at a time, and you only listen."

msgid "日头升到擎天柱顶。九派的人陆续上了台，一面一面的旗插上了旗座。\n"
msgstr "The sun climbs to the top of the sky pillar. The people of the nine schools come up onto the terrace one after another, and banner after banner is planted in the banner stands."

msgid "封山剑派的旗座空着：上山的官道让人堵了。\n"
msgstr "The Empty Mountain School's banner stand is empty: the official road up the mountain has been blocked."

msgid "茅山的旗座空着：林忌一早上了台，葬剑亭那边一起烟，他提剑追下去了。\n"
msgstr "Mount Mao's banner stand is empty: Lin Ji came up early, but when smoke rose by the Sword Tomb Pavilion he took up his sword and ran down after it."

msgid "山烟寺的旗座空着：轿子在山道上让人截了，没能上来。\n"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple's banner stand is empty: its sedan chair was stopped on the mountain road and could not come up."

msgid "步玄派的旗座空着：骆云舟让兵部的人「请」去山下喝茶了。\n"
msgstr "The Mystic Step School's banner stand is empty: Luo Yunzhou has been \"invited\" down the mountain for tea by the Ministry of War."

msgid "绝尘派的旗座空着：绝尘子不问世事。\n"
msgstr "The Dustless School's banner stand is empty: Juechenzi does not ask about worldly affairs."

msgid "站在石椅旁，向四面拱了拱手。"
msgstr " stands by the stone chair and cups his hands to all sides."

msgid "诸位远道而来。正月十七，虹台推选——九派各一票，过半者为盟主；不过半，椅子照旧。"
msgstr "Gentlemen, you have come a long way. The seventeenth of the first month, the election at the Rainbow Terrace: one vote for each of the nine schools, and whoever has more than half is Leader. If no one does, the chair stays as it is."

msgid "本座代理了这些年，今天把话说清楚：本座也算一个。"
msgstr "I have acted in his place all these years, and today I will make it plain: I count as one too."

msgid "本座也算一个。"
msgstr "I count as one too."

msgid "二十年没上过这座台了。……诸位定吧，老夫听着。"
msgstr "Twenty years since this old man was last on this terrace... Decide, gentlemen. This old man is listening."

msgid "封山剑派，等盟主回来。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain waits for the Alliance Leader to return."

msgid "封山这一票，今天照约好的投。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain's vote goes today as agreed."

msgid "北宗这个座，是颜长老给的。北宗记着。"
msgstr "This seat for the North Branch was given by Elder Yan. The North Branch remembers it."

msgid "北宗这一票，在你手里。"
msgstr "The North Branch's vote is in your hands."

msgid "振远来了。二十年前那趟镖，到此为止吧。"
msgstr "The Far-Road Escorts have come. That escort job twenty years ago, let it end here."

msgid "振远来了。那本账烧了——二十年前那趟镖，到此为止。"
msgstr "The Far-Road Escorts have come. That ledger is burned. The escort job of twenty years ago ends here."

msgid "振远来了。二十年前那趟镖，今天要一个说法。"
msgstr "The Far-Road Escorts have come. That escort job twenty years ago, today we want an explanation."

msgid "振远来了。天星把账送进了县衙——二十年前那趟镖，今天要一个说法。"
msgstr "The Far-Road Escorts have come. Tianxing delivered the ledger to the county yamen. That escort job twenty years ago, today we want an explanation."

msgid "振远这一票，在你手里。"
msgstr "The Far-Road Escorts' vote is in your hands."

msgid "茅山主剿。谁说剿，茅山就投谁。"
msgstr "Mount Mao is for suppression. Whoever says suppress, Mount Mao votes for him."

msgid "茅山投旧盟主。北麓剩下的人，交茅山看着——茅山认得他们的字了。"
msgstr "Mount Mao votes for the old Alliance Leader. Those left at the North Foot, leave them to Mount Mao to watch. Mount Mao knows their handwriting now."

msgid "茅山欠你一回，今天还。"
msgstr "Mount Mao owes you one, and pays it today."

msgid "晚月庄的封地，谁也别想过问。"
msgstr "No one is to inquire into Latemoon Manor's fief."

msgid "晚月庄的封地，谁也别想过问。庄里收着谁，也是晚月庄自己的事。"
msgstr "No one is to inquire into Latemoon Manor's fief. Whom the Manor shelters is the Manor's own affair."

msgid "神教的人，不该再在江湖上走。"
msgstr "The Order's people should no longer walk the jianghu."

msgid "神教的人进过晚月庄的门。往后庄门关紧，江湖上也不该再有他们走的路。"
msgstr "The Order's people have been through the Manor's gate. From now on the gate stays shut, and the jianghu should have no road left for them to walk."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。神教之事，今日总要有个了断。"
msgstr "Amitabha. The matter of the Order must be settled today."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。本寺一脉，守的是清规。神教之事，今日总要有个了断。"
msgstr "Amitabha. This temple's line keeps the pure rules. The matter of the Order must be settled today."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。容得下，才是佛门。"
msgstr "Amitabha. A Buddhist gate is one that can take people in."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。西来的经，山烟寺收下了。容得下，才是佛门。"
msgstr "Amitabha. The scriptures from the west, Mountain Mist Temple has received. A Buddhist gate is one that can take people in."

msgid "骆家在京城住了五代。京城的意思，步玄不敢违。"
msgstr "The Luo family has lived in the Capital for five generations. Mystic Step does not dare go against the Capital's wishes."

msgid "步玄投旧盟主。骆家的人写过一张供状——兵部的旧案，查到底。"
msgstr "Mystic Step votes for the old Alliance Leader. A Luo family man wrote a confession. The Ministry of War's old case will be traced to the end."

msgid "骆家欠你一份情，今天还。"
msgstr "The Luo family owes you a favor, and pays it today."

msgid "嘿嘿，叫花子最怕官。有个旧盟主坐着，官就不敢上门。"
msgstr "Heh heh, a beggar fears officials most. With an old Leader sitting there, the officials won't dare come knocking."

msgid "嘿嘿。龙头把酒囊系在我腰上了——叫花子最怕官，花紫会投旧盟主。"
msgstr "Heh heh. The Chief tied the wine gourd on my belt. A beggar fears officials most, so the Beggars' Guild votes for the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "入席之前说定的，花紫会投旧盟主。叫花子说话算话。"
msgstr "What was settled before we took our seats stands: the Beggars' Guild votes for the old Alliance Leader. A beggar keeps his word."

msgid "花紫会吃上官饭了。颜违跟朝廷走得近，叫花子跟着他。"
msgstr "The Beggars' Guild is eating official rice now. Yan Wei is close to the court, so the beggars follow him."

msgid "花紫会这一票，在你手里。"
msgstr "The Beggars' Guild's vote is in your hands."

msgid "老道下山，就这一回。"
msgstr "This old Daoist comes down the mountain just this once."

msgid "长老们说投七长老，天邪就投七长老。今天的票，由执法使来唱。"
msgstr "The Elders say vote for the Seventh Elder, so the Wayward School votes for the Seventh Elder. Today the Enforcer calls the votes."

msgid "天邪等盟主回来。今天的票，由执法使来唱。"
msgstr "The Wayward School waits for the Alliance Leader to return. Today the Enforcer calls the votes."

msgid "天邪这一票，执事说了算。今天的票，由执法使来唱。"
msgstr "The Wayward School's vote is up to the Deacon. Today the Enforcer calls the votes."

msgid "唱票之前，还有一句：九派之外，还有谁要站出来？"
msgstr "One thing before the count: besides the nine schools, who else will step forward?"

msgid "九派之外，还有谁要站出来？"
msgstr "Besides the nine schools, who else will step forward?"

msgid "我也算一个"
msgstr "I count too"

msgid "要灭了侮天鬼，九派才认你"
msgstr "The nine schools will not accept you until the Heaven-Defier is destroyed"

msgid "听你的一派也没来，还差五派"
msgstr "No school that follows you has come: 5 more needed"

msgid "听你的只有一派，还差四派"
msgstr "Only 1 school follows you: 4 more needed"

msgid "听你的只有两派，还差三派"
msgstr "Only 2 schools follow you: 3 more needed"

msgid "听你的只有三派，还差两派"
msgstr "Only 3 schools follow you: 2 more needed"

msgid "听你的只有四派，还差一派"
msgstr "Only 4 schools follow you: 1 more needed"

msgid "还差几派"
msgstr "Not enough schools follow you"

msgid "站出来参选：今天上了台、听你的那几派都投你，五派过了半数，你就是武林盟主；台上三件事——朝廷、逆灵宫、东方神教——由你来答。\n站出来就不能再坐回去。要参选吗？"
msgstr "Run for Leader: the schools that came up today and follow you all vote for you. With 5 schools, a majority of the nine, you become Alliance Leader, and you answer the three matters on the terrace: the court, the Black Palace and the Golden Crow Order.\nOnce you step forward you cannot sit back down. Run for Leader?"

msgid "参选"
msgstr "Run for Leader"

msgid "好。九派之外，多一个。"
msgstr "Good. Besides the nine schools, one more."

msgid "听我的那几派，投旧盟主"
msgstr "The schools that follow me vote for the old Alliance Leader"

msgid "不参选：今天上了台、听你的那几派都投旧盟主（卫沧澜回来了就是他，没回来就是那把空椅子）。\n说了就是定了。要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Not running: the schools that came up today and follow you all vote for the old Alliance Leader (Wei Canglan if he has returned, otherwise the empty chair).\nOnce said, it is settled. Say it?"

msgid "投旧盟主"
msgstr "Vote for the old Alliance Leader"

msgid "听我的那几派，投颜违"
msgstr "The schools that follow me vote for Yan Wei"

msgid "不参选：今天上了台、听你的那几派都投颜违。\n说了就是定了。要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Not running: the schools that came up today and follow you all vote for Yan Wei.\nOnce said, it is settled. Say it?"

msgid "坐着听唱票"
msgstr "Sit and listen to the count"

msgid "不参选，也没有哪一派听你的：坐着听唱票。\n要这样吗？"
msgstr "Not running, and no school follows you: you sit and listen to the count.\nDo it this way?"

msgid "坐着听"
msgstr "Sit and listen"

msgid "唱票。"
msgstr "The count."

msgid "封山剑派——颜违。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain School: Yan Wei."

msgid "封山剑派——卫盟主。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain School: Leader Wei."

msgid "封山剑派——旧盟主。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain School: the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "封山剑派——投你。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain School: you."

msgid "封山剑派——没有来，不算。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain School: did not come, not counted."

msgid "天邪派——颜违。"
msgstr "Wayward School: Yan Wei."

msgid "天邪派——卫盟主。"
msgstr "Wayward School: Leader Wei."

msgid "天邪派——旧盟主。"
msgstr "Wayward School: the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "天邪派——投你。"
msgstr "Wayward School: you."

msgid "天邪派——没有来，不算。"
msgstr "Wayward School: did not come, not counted."

msgid "振远镖局——颜违。"
msgstr "Far-Road Escorts: Yan Wei."

msgid "振远镖局——卫盟主。"
msgstr "Far-Road Escorts: Leader Wei."

msgid "振远镖局——旧盟主。"
msgstr "Far-Road Escorts: the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "振远镖局——投你。"
msgstr "Far-Road Escorts: you."

msgid "振远镖局——没有来，不算。"
msgstr "Far-Road Escorts: did not come, not counted."

msgid "茅山派——颜违。"
msgstr "Mount Mao School: Yan Wei."

msgid "茅山派——卫盟主。"
msgstr "Mount Mao School: Leader Wei."

msgid "茅山派——旧盟主。"
msgstr "Mount Mao School: the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "茅山派——投你。"
msgstr "Mount Mao School: you."

msgid "茅山派——没有来，不算。"
msgstr "Mount Mao School: did not come, not counted."

msgid "晚月庄——颜违。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor: Yan Wei."

msgid "晚月庄——卫盟主。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor: Leader Wei."

msgid "晚月庄——旧盟主。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor: the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "晚月庄——投你。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor: you."

msgid "晚月庄——没有来，不算。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor: did not come, not counted."

msgid "山烟寺——颜违。"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple: Yan Wei."

msgid "山烟寺——卫盟主。"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple: Leader Wei."

msgid "山烟寺——旧盟主。"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple: the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "山烟寺——投你。"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple: you."

msgid "山烟寺——没有来，不算。"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple: did not come, not counted."

msgid "步玄派——颜违。"
msgstr "Mystic Step School: Yan Wei."

msgid "步玄派——卫盟主。"
msgstr "Mystic Step School: Leader Wei."

msgid "步玄派——旧盟主。"
msgstr "Mystic Step School: the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "步玄派——投你。"
msgstr "Mystic Step School: you."

msgid "步玄派——没有来，不算。"
msgstr "Mystic Step School: did not come, not counted."

msgid "花紫会——卫盟主。"
msgstr "Beggars' Guild: Leader Wei."

msgid "花紫会——旧盟主。"
msgstr "Beggars' Guild: the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "花紫会——颜违。"
msgstr "Beggars' Guild: Yan Wei."

msgid "花紫会——投你。"
msgstr "Beggars' Guild: you."

msgid "花紫会——没有来，不算。"
msgstr "Beggars' Guild: did not come, not counted."

msgid "绝尘派——卫盟主。"
msgstr "Dustless School: Leader Wei."

msgid "绝尘派——旧盟主。"
msgstr "Dustless School: the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "绝尘派——没有来，不算。"
msgstr "Dustless School: did not come, not counted."

msgid "颜违，零票。"
msgstr "Yan Wei, 0 votes."

msgid "颜违，一票。"
msgstr "Yan Wei, 1 vote."

msgid "颜违，两票。"
msgstr "Yan Wei, 2 votes."

msgid "颜违，三票。"
msgstr "Yan Wei, 3 votes."

msgid "颜违，四票。"
msgstr "Yan Wei, 4 votes."

msgid "颜违，五票。"
msgstr "Yan Wei, 5 votes."

msgid "颜违，六票。"
msgstr "Yan Wei, 6 votes."

msgid "颜违，七票。"
msgstr "Yan Wei, 7 votes."

msgid "颜违，八票。"
msgstr "Yan Wei, 8 votes."

msgid "卫盟主，零票。"
msgstr "Leader Wei, 0 votes."

msgid "旧盟主，零票。"
msgstr "The old Alliance Leader, 0 votes."

msgid "卫盟主，一票。"
msgstr "Leader Wei, 1 vote."

msgid "旧盟主，一票。"
msgstr "The old Alliance Leader, 1 vote."

msgid "卫盟主，两票。"
msgstr "Leader Wei, 2 votes."

msgid "旧盟主，两票。"
msgstr "The old Alliance Leader, 2 votes."

msgid "卫盟主，三票。"
msgstr "Leader Wei, 3 votes."

msgid "旧盟主，三票。"
msgstr "The old Alliance Leader, 3 votes."

msgid "卫盟主，四票。"
msgstr "Leader Wei, 4 votes."

msgid "旧盟主，四票。"
msgstr "The old Alliance Leader, 4 votes."

msgid "卫盟主，五票。"
msgstr "Leader Wei, 5 votes."

msgid "旧盟主，五票。"
msgstr "The old Alliance Leader, 5 votes."

msgid "卫盟主，六票。"
msgstr "Leader Wei, 6 votes."

msgid "旧盟主，六票。"
msgstr "The old Alliance Leader, 6 votes."

msgid "卫盟主，七票。"
msgstr "Leader Wei, 7 votes."

msgid "旧盟主，七票。"
msgstr "The old Alliance Leader, 7 votes."

msgid "卫盟主，八票。"
msgstr "Leader Wei, 8 votes."

msgid "旧盟主，八票。"
msgstr "The old Alliance Leader, 8 votes."

msgid "卫盟主，九票。"
msgstr "Leader Wei, 9 votes."

msgid "旧盟主，九票。"
msgstr "The old Alliance Leader, 9 votes."

msgid "你，零票。"
msgstr "You, 0 votes."

msgid "你，一票。"
msgstr "You, 1 vote."

msgid "你，两票。"
msgstr "You, 2 votes."

msgid "你，三票。"
msgstr "You, 3 votes."

msgid "你，四票。"
msgstr "You, 4 votes."

msgid "你，五票。"
msgstr "You, 5 votes."

msgid "你，六票。"
msgstr "You, 6 votes."

msgid "你，七票。"
msgstr "You, 7 votes."

msgid "你，八票。"
msgstr "You, 8 votes."

msgid "过了半数。从今天起，武林盟主是你。"
msgstr "A majority. From today, the Alliance Leader is you."

msgid "转过身，向你抱了抱拳。九派的人一个一个站了起来。"
msgstr " turns and cups his hands to you. One by one, the people of the nine schools rise to their feet."

msgid "武林盟主"
msgstr "Alliance Leader"

msgid "七长老过了半数。"
msgstr "The Seventh Elder has a majority."

msgid "整了整衣襟，走到石椅前，坐了下去。"
msgstr " straightens his robe, walks to the stone chair and sits down."

msgid "承蒙诸位。二十年的旧案，到此为止；水烟阁同朝廷，往后好好说话。北麓那座道观里剩下的，剿；东方神教，逐。"
msgstr "Thank you, gentlemen. The twenty-year-old case ends here, and Waterfog Pavilion and the court will speak on good terms from now on. Those left in the abbey at the North Foot: suppress. The Golden Crow Order: banish."

msgid "没有人过半。换盟主要过半——椅子不换人。"
msgstr "No one has a majority. To change the Leader takes a majority, and the chair does not change hands."

msgid "卫盟主过了半数。换盟主要过半，旧盟主过半——椅子不换人。"
msgstr "Leader Wei has a majority. To change the Leader takes a majority, and the old Alliance Leader has it: the chair does not change hands."

msgid "慢慢站起来，走到石椅前，坐了下去。"
msgstr " slowly stands up, walks to the stone chair and sits down."

msgid "老夫回来了，就坐回来。老松岭的旧案，查到底；北麓的孩子，交茅山看着；神教不犯九派，就容它。"
msgstr "This old man is back, so this old man sits again. The old case at Old Pine Ridge: trace it to the end. The children at the North Foot: leave them to Mount Mao to watch. The Order, if it does not trouble the nine schools: tolerate it."

msgid "老夫回来了，就坐回来。老松岭的旧案，查到底；神教不犯九派，就容它。北麓的孩子——老夫这条命是皇叔拿手诏从尚书府要回来的，欠朝廷一份——交官府看着。"
msgstr "This old man is back, so this old man sits again. The old case at Old Pine Ridge: trace it to the end. The Order, if it does not trouble the nine schools: tolerate it. The children at the North Foot: this old man's life was fetched back from the Minister's Mansion by the Imperial Uncle with a handwritten edict, and I owe the court one. Leave them to the officials to watch."

msgid "还有一句：老夫是叫花子从狗洞里领出来的。乔阴的巷子，往后不许官差进。"
msgstr "One more thing: this old man was led out of a dog hole by the beggars. From now on no yamen runner is to enter the alleys of Tallshade."

msgid "还有一句：老夫是叫花子从狗洞里领出来的。花紫会要吃官饭，老夫不拦——只是官府的眼线，不许盯九派。"
msgstr "One more thing: this old man was led out of a dog hole by the beggars. If the Beggars' Guild wants to eat official rice, this old man will not stop them. But no official spy is to watch the nine schools."

msgid "没有人过半。换盟主要过半——椅子不换人，还空着，等盟主回来。"
msgstr "No one has a majority. To change the Leader takes a majority, so the chair does not change hands. It stays empty, waiting for the Leader to return."

msgid "旧盟主过了半数——椅子不换人，还空着，等盟主回来。"
msgstr "The old Alliance Leader has a majority, so the chair does not change hands. It stays empty, waiting for the Leader to return."

msgid "七长老照旧代理。"
msgstr "The Seventh Elder acts as before."

msgid "盟主，台上有三件事，九派等你一句话。头一件：朝廷。二十年前老松岭那桩旧案——"
msgstr "Alliance Leader, there are three matters on the terrace, and the nine schools await a word from you. The first: the court. That old case at Old Pine Ridge, twenty years ago..."

msgid "老松岭的旧案："
msgstr "The old case at Old Pine Ridge:"

msgid "查到底：封地照旧，不许官府过问"
msgstr "Trace it to the end: the fief stays as it is, and the government may not inquire"

msgid "查到底：二十年前老松岭的旧案一查到底，水烟阁的封地照旧，不许官府过问。\n这一句是盟主在虹台上说的，写进武林的规矩，不能收回。要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Trace it to the end: the old case at Old Pine Ridge of twenty years ago will be traced to the end, Waterfog Pavilion's fief stays as it is, and the government may not inquire.\nThis is said by the Alliance Leader on the Rainbow Terrace and written into the rules of the wulin. It cannot be taken back. Say it?"

msgid "查到底"
msgstr "Trace It to the End"

msgid "好。旧案，查到底。"
msgstr "Good. The old case: traced to the end."

msgid "到此为止：水烟阁同朝廷走近"
msgstr "Let it end: Waterfog Pavilion draws closer to the court"

msgid "到此为止：老松岭的旧案不再提，水烟阁同朝廷走近。\n这一句是盟主在虹台上说的，写进武林的规矩，不能收回。要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Let it end: the old case at Old Pine Ridge is not mentioned again, and Waterfog Pavilion draws closer to the court.\nThis is said by the Alliance Leader on the Rainbow Terrace and written into the rules of the wulin. It cannot be taken back. Say it?"

msgid "好。旧案，到此为止。"
msgstr "Good. The old case: let it end here."

msgid "第二件：北麓那座道观里剩下的人。"
msgstr "The second: those left in the abbey at the North Foot."

msgid "逆灵宫剩下的人："
msgstr "Those left of the Black Palace:"

msgid "剿：一个不留"
msgstr "Suppress: leave none"

msgid "剿：北麓那座道观里剩下的人，九派一个不留。\n这一句是盟主在虹台上说的，写进武林的规矩，不能收回。要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Suppress: of those left in the abbey at the North Foot, the nine schools will leave none.\nThis is said by the Alliance Leader on the Rainbow Terrace and written into the rules of the wulin. It cannot be taken back. Say it?"

msgid "好。剿。"
msgstr "Good. Suppress."

msgid "交茅山看管：肯下山的，给一条路"
msgstr "Leave them to Mount Mao: give a road to those willing to come down the mountain"

msgid "交茅山看管：北麓那座道观里剩下的人，肯下山的给一条路，交茅山看着。\n这一句是盟主在虹台上说的，写进武林的规矩，不能收回。要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Leave them to Mount Mao: of those left in the abbey at the North Foot, those willing to come down the mountain are given a road and left to Mount Mao to watch.\nThis is said by the Alliance Leader on the Rainbow Terrace and written into the rules of the wulin. It cannot be taken back. Say it?"

msgid "交茅山"
msgstr "Leave them to Mount Mao"

msgid "好。交茅山。"
msgstr "Good. Leave them to Mount Mao."

msgid "第三件：东方神教。"
msgstr "The third: the Golden Crow Order."

msgid "东方神教："
msgstr "The Golden Crow Order:"

msgid "逐：神教的人不许再在江湖上走"
msgstr "Banish: the Order's people may no longer walk the jianghu"

msgid "逐：东方神教的人，从今往后不许在九派的地方走。\n这一句是盟主在虹台上说的，写进武林的规矩，不能收回。要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Banish: from now on, the people of the Golden Crow Order may not walk in the lands of the nine schools.\nThis is said by the Alliance Leader on the Rainbow Terrace and written into the rules of the wulin. It cannot be taken back. Say it?"

msgid "好。逐。"
msgstr "Good. Banish."

msgid "容：不犯九派，就容它"
msgstr "Tolerate: if it does not trouble the nine schools"

msgid "容：东方神教不犯九派，九派就容它。\n这一句是盟主在虹台上说的，写进武林的规矩，不能收回。要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Tolerate: if the Golden Crow Order does not trouble the nine schools, the nine schools will tolerate it.\nThis is said by the Alliance Leader on the Rainbow Terrace and written into the rules of the wulin. It cannot be taken back. Say it?"

msgid "容"
msgstr "Tolerate"

msgid "好。容。"
msgstr "Good. Tolerate."

msgid "还有一件。你身上那把旋芒，斩过湖底那颗头——它往后在哪里？"
msgstr "One more. That Whirling Edge on you, which cut down the head at the bottom of the lake: where will it be from now on?"

msgid "旋芒："
msgstr "Whirling Edge:"

msgid "交给水烟阁，供在葬剑亭"
msgstr "Give it to Waterfog Pavilion, to be enshrined at the Sword Tomb Pavilion"

msgid "把旋芒交给水烟阁，供在葬剑亭，让九派都看得见：它就不在你手里了。\n要交吗？"
msgstr "Give Whirling Edge to Waterfog Pavilion, to be enshrined at the Sword Tomb Pavilion where all nine schools can see it: it will no longer be in your hands.\nHand it over?"

msgid "供在葬剑亭"
msgstr "Enshrine it at the pavilion"

msgid "你把旋芒交了出去。潘军禅双手接过，用一块黄绫裹了。\n"
msgstr "You hand over Whirling Edge. Pan Junchan takes it in both hands and wraps it in a piece of yellow silk."

msgid "还给岚城"
msgstr "Return it to the Wind City"

msgid "把旋芒还给岚城：举起剑，让风把它带回去，岚城云台的旋风里会再转着它。它就不在你手里了。\n要还吗？"
msgstr "Return Whirling Edge to the Wind City: hold the sword up and let the wind carry it back, and it will turn again in the whirlwind on the Cloud Terrace of the Wind City. It will no longer be in your hands.\nReturn it?"

msgid "你把旋芒举过头顶。山风从虹谷里卷上来，剑在你手里一轻，转着往西去了。\n"
msgstr "You raise Whirling Edge over your head. Mountain wind rolls up out of the Rainbow Gorge, the sword grows light in your hand and, turning, drifts off to the west."

msgid "我留着"
msgstr "I keep it"

msgid "旋芒留在你身上：它斩过湖底那颗头，往后还跟着你走。\n九派不再问它的去处。要留着吗？"
msgstr "Keep Whirling Edge: it cut down the head at the bottom of the lake, and it will still go with you.\nThe nine schools will not ask where it goes again. Keep it?"

msgid "留着"
msgstr "Keep it"

msgid "你把旋芒收回鞘里。潘军禅看了你一眼，没有再问。\n"
msgstr "You sheathe Whirling Edge. Pan Junchan looks at you and does not ask again."

msgid "散会。"
msgstr "The meeting is adjourned."

msgid "九派的人陆续下了虹台。旗一面一面拔了下来。\n"
msgstr "The people of the nine schools go down from the Rainbow Terrace one after another. The banners come down one by one."

msgid "看告示"
msgstr "Read the notice"

msgid "告示上写着：正月十七，九派会于虹台，推举武林盟主。下面一行朱笔：「九派过半，新盟主在此。九派诸事，听盟主吩咐。」\n那新盟主，就是你。\n"
msgstr "The notice reads: On the seventeenth of the first month the nine schools meet at the Rainbow Terrace to choose the Alliance Leader. Below it, one line in red brush: \"Nine schools by majority: the new Alliance Leader is here. In all matters of the nine schools, follow the Leader's word.\"\nThe new Leader is you."

msgid "告示上写着：正月十七，九派会于虹台，推举武林盟主。下面一行朱笔：「九派过半，水烟阁七长老颜违为武林盟主。老松岭旧案，到此为止。」\n"
msgstr "The notice reads: On the seventeenth of the first month the nine schools meet at the Rainbow Terrace to choose the Alliance Leader. Below it, one line in red brush: \"Nine schools by majority: Yan Wei, Seventh Elder of Waterfog Pavilion, is Alliance Leader. The old case at Old Pine Ridge ends here.\""

msgid "告示上写着：正月十七，九派会于虹台，推举武林盟主。下面一行朱笔：「无人过半，盟主之位照旧。卫沧澜盟主复位。」\n"
msgstr "The notice reads: On the seventeenth of the first month the nine schools meet at the Rainbow Terrace to choose the Alliance Leader. Below it, one line in red brush: \"No majority; the Leader's seat stays as it was. Alliance Leader Wei Canglan returns to his seat.\""

msgid "告示上写着：正月十七，九派会于虹台，推举武林盟主。下面一行朱笔：「无人过半，盟主之位照旧，虚位以待。」\n"
msgstr "The notice reads: On the seventeenth of the first month the nine schools meet at the Rainbow Terrace to choose the Alliance Leader. Below it, one line in red brush: \"No majority; the Leader's seat stays as it was, kept open.\""

msgid "坐一坐"
msgstr "Sit a while"

msgid "你在太师椅上坐了一会儿。椅子又硬又凉，扶手让二十年前的手掌磨得发亮。\n"
msgstr "You sit in the master's chair for a while. The chair is hard and cold, its armrests polished bright by twenty years of hands."

msgid "加入武者同盟"
msgstr "Join the Fighters' Guild"

msgid "恭喜，从今天起您已经成为一名武者！"
msgstr "Congratulations, from today you are a fighter!"

msgid "你已经参加了其他公会。"
msgstr "You have already joined another guild."

msgid "要成为一名武者并不难，水烟阁随时欢迎任何身家清白之人成为我们的\n一份子，只要你加入武者同盟，就可以向同盟中的各大门派拜师\n学艺。\n"
msgstr "It is not hard to become a fighter. Waterfog Pavilion welcomes anyone of clean background to join us. Once you join the Fighters' Guild, you may apprentice yourself to the great schools within it."

msgid "石碑上面几个苍劲古朴的字写道：虹谷石台，乙丑年水烟阁第六代\n阁主关雨楼立。\n你仔细一看，这几个字迹丝毫没有斧凿痕迹，竟像是题字的人直接\n用手指在岩石上写出来一般。\n"
msgstr "A few vigorous, archaic characters on the tablet read: Rainbow Gorge stone terrace, raised in the year Yichou by Guan Yulou, sixth master of Waterfog Pavilion.\nLooking closely, you see not a trace of chisel in the characters. It seems the writer wrote them on the rock with his bare finger."

msgid "石碑上龙飞凤武地刻著几个大字：\n\n    风波剑神黎红药前辈葬剑于此，水烟阁第四代七长老比武\n    不胜，以奸计害人而自取其辱，武者皆不齿其小人行径，\n    合力击杀于此，甲辰年立此亭书铭其事以为后人殷鉴。\n\n                        第三代水烟阁主 于兰玫音\n                        第四代水烟阁主 聂    言   合立\n                        第五代水烟阁主 段 柏 山\n"
msgstr "The tablet is carved in characters like flying dragons and dancing phoenixes:\n\n    Here the elder Li Hongyao, Sword God of Wind and Waves, buried his sword. The Fourth Generation Seventh Elder of Waterfog Pavilion lost to him in a contest, harmed others by treachery and brought shame on himself. All fighters despised his petty conduct, and together struck him down here. In the year Jiachen this pavilion was raised and this inscription written, as a warning to later generations.\n\n                        Third Master of Waterfog Pavilion, Yu Lanmeiyin\n                        Fourth Master of Waterfog Pavilion, Nie Yan\n                        Fifth Master of Waterfog Pavilion, Duan Boshan, jointly raised it"

msgid "一根两丈多高的白石柱子，四四方方，上头一道一道刻着箍纹，柱身让几百年的风雨磨圆了角。\n柱脚的石座上刻着历代盟主的名字，一行一行，最早的几行已经看不清了；最后一行是「卫沧澜」三个字，后面空着。\n"
msgstr "A square white stone column over twenty feet tall, ringed with bands cut across it, its corners worn round by hundreds of years of wind and rain.\nOn the base at its foot are the names of the successive Alliance Leaders, line after line; the earliest lines can no longer be read. The last line reads \"Wei Canglan\", with blank space after it."

msgid "一把整块青白石凿成的椅子，椅背对着南边的深谷，两边扶手上磨出了浅浅的手印。\n椅面上积着几片落叶，石缝里钻出一蓬草——很多年没有人坐过了。\n"
msgstr "A chair chiseled from one block of blue-white stone, its back to the deep valley to the south, with shallow handprints worn into both armrests.\nA few fallen leaves lie on the seat and a tuft of grass pushes out of a crack in the stone. No one has sat here in many years."

msgid "谷底的水雾一阵一阵往上涌，白茫茫的看不见底。\n太阳照过来的时候，雾里挂着一道淡淡的虹，一头搭在虹台的石沿上，一头没进对面的山里——虹谷的名字就是这样来的。\n"
msgstr "Water-mist from the valley floor surges up in waves, a white vastness whose bottom you cannot see.\nWhen the sun shines, a faint rainbow hangs in the mist, one end resting on the stone rim of the Rainbow Terrace and the other sinking into the mountain opposite. That is how Rainbow Gorge got its name."

msgid "水烟阁武士喝道：慢著，进水烟阁，先放下你的兵刃！"
msgstr "The Waterfog Guard shouts, \"Hold! To enter Waterfog Pavilion, set down your weapons first!\""

msgid "水烟阁武士挡住了你的去路。"
msgstr "The Waterfog Guard blocks your way."

msgid "水烟"
msgstr "Waterfog"

msgid "武林"
msgstr "Wulin"

msgid "水烟阁封地"
msgstr "Waterfog Fief"

msgid "禁兵督造"
msgstr "Built by the Palace Guard"

msgid "武者同盟"
msgstr "Fighters' Guild"

msgid "春秋水色斋"
msgstr "Spring-Autumn Water Studio"

msgid "这是一把八楞玄铁锤，沉甸甸的。\n"
msgstr "This is an eight-ridged dark iron hammer, solid and heavy."

msgid "一把长而锋利的园工剪刀。\n"
msgstr "A long, sharp pair of garden shears."

msgid "用来清除灰尘的鸡毛\n"
msgstr "A chicken-feather duster, for clearing away dust."

msgid "哇! 好香的烤山猪肉! 不吃还等什么?\n"
msgstr "Wow! What a smell! Roast mountain boar! What are you waiting for?"

msgid "山猪骨头"
msgstr "boar bones"

msgid "啃得精光的山猪骨头。\n"
msgstr "Mountain boar bones, gnawed clean."

msgid "一个人皮缝的大酒袋，大概装得八、九升的酒。\n"
msgstr "A big wineskin sewn from human hide. It looks like it holds eight or nine sheng of wine."

msgid "竹叶青"
msgstr "Bamboo Leaf Green"

msgid "这是一把当年张家老祖宗退隐时皇上赐的宝刀"
msgstr "A treasured saber, given to the old ancestor of the Zhang family by the Emperor when he retired."

msgid "高贵典雅的紫罗兰，闻起来还有一股淡淡的香味儿。\n"
msgstr "A violet, noble and refined, with a faint, sweet scent."

msgid "热奔奔放的红玫瑰。\n"
msgstr "A red rose, fiery and unrestrained."

msgid "含情脉脉的黄玫瑰。\n"
msgstr "A yellow rose, full of tender feeling."

msgid "庄重朴实的蓝天鹅。\n"
msgstr "A blue swan flower, grave and unadorned."

msgid "冰清玉洁的白茶花。\n"
msgstr "A white camellia, pure as ice and jade."

msgid "清高冷傲的黑牡丹。\n"
msgstr "A black peony, aloof and proud."

msgid "这件粉红色的布衫上沾满了暗红色的血迹。\n"
msgstr "This pink blouse is soaked with dark red bloodstains."

msgid "美丽的卖花姑娘正在向行人售花儿\n"
msgstr "A pretty girl selling flowers to the passersby."

msgid "卖花姑娘笑着道：这位$RESPECT，买朵黑牡丹吗？ \n"
msgstr "The flower seller says with a smile, \"Would you like a black peony, $RESPECT?\""

msgid "卖花姑娘笑着道：这位$RESPECT，买朵黄枚瑰吗？ \n"
msgstr "The flower seller says with a smile, \"Would you like a yellow rose, $RESPECT?\""

msgid "卖花姑娘笑着道：这位$RESPECT，买朵白茶花吗？ \n"
msgstr "The flower seller says with a smile, \"Would you like a white camellia, $RESPECT?\""

msgid "卖花姑娘笑着道：这位$RESPECT，买朵紫罗兰吗？ \n"
msgstr "The flower seller says with a smile, \"Would you like a violet, $RESPECT?\""

msgid "卖花姑娘笑着道：这位$RESPECT，买朵红枚瑰吗？ \n"
msgstr "The flower seller says with a smile, \"Would you like a red rose, $RESPECT?\""

msgid "这是一位黑松堡的家丁，专负责盘察去黑松堡的行人。\n"
msgstr "A servant of Black Pine Castle, whose job is to question anyone traveling up to the castle."

msgid "家丁喝道：站住！你干什么的。"
msgstr "The servant barks, \"Halt! What are you here for.\""

msgid "看你那贼眉鼠眼，尖嘴猴腮的样儿，决不是什么好东西！"
msgstr "\"Look at that shifty face, those pointy cheeks. You're no good, I'll bet!\""

msgid "黑松一剪是方园几十里有名的园工。一把大剪使的出神如化。"
msgstr "Black Pine Shears is a groundskeeper famed for dozens of li around. He swings his big shears like a god."

msgid "一只疯狂的杀人蜂\n"
msgstr "A frenzied killer bee."

msgid "一位年轻的小园工\n"
msgstr "A young groundskeeper."

msgid "这是黑松堡的护院\n"
msgstr "A guard of Black Pine Castle."

msgid "护院喝道：大胆刁民，私闯民宅，该当何罪？\n"
msgstr "The estate guard shouts, \"Insolent peasant! Breaking into a private home—what's the penalty for that?\""

msgid "护院喝道：来人啦！抓小贼呀！\n"
msgstr "The estate guard shouts, \"Come quick! Catch the little thief!\""

msgid "满脸风霜的女佣人\n"
msgstr "A maid with a weathered face."

msgid "这要到地牢去找。"
msgstr "You'll have to look in the dungeon for that."

msgid "淳于"
msgstr "Chunyu"

msgid "堡主"
msgstr "Castle Lord"

msgid "这是一只凶猛无比，半人多高的巨型狼犬\n"
msgstr "A fierce giant wolfhound, taller than half a man."

msgid "狼犬向你疯狂的哮道：呜汪！呜汪！呜汪！呜汪！"
msgstr "The wolfhound snarls at you madly, \"Wooow! Wooow! Wooow! Wooow!\""

msgid "一只乖巧的小信鸽\n"
msgstr "A clever little carrier pigeon."

msgid "你看到一个小厨子， 正在用碧玉刀剔猪骨。\n"
msgstr "You see a young cook carving bones from a pig with a green jade saber."

msgid "厨子嘟囔着：“真是的，堡主又在地牢里留涟忘返。”\n"
msgstr "The cook mutters, \"Honestly, the Castle Lord is lingering down in the dungeon again.\""

msgid "厨子道：“去地牢叫堡主上来吃饭。\n"
msgstr "The cook says, \"Go down to the dungeon and call the Castle Lord up to eat.\""

msgid "一只疯狂的大老鼠\n"
msgstr "A frenzied giant rat."

msgid "淳于堡主"
msgstr "Lord Chunyu"

msgid "淳于怀太是强盗出身，年轻时打家劫舍，无恶不做。尤于生\n性恶顽，没人愿收其为徒。但他绝顶聪明，盗百家之长而集\n于一身。\n"
msgstr "Chunyu Huaitai started out as a bandit, robbing and plundering in his youth, and there was no evil he did not do. Stubborn and wicked by nature, he found no one willing to take him as a disciple. But he is brilliantly clever, and he stole the best of a hundred schools and gathered it all in himself."

msgid "淳于怀太喝道：呔！你竟敢坏大爷的好事！\n"
msgstr "Chunyu Huaitai roars, \"Hey! You've got some nerve, spoiling my fun!\""

msgid "民女"
msgstr "Village Girl"

msgid "小娟姓刘，是这里刘老农的独生女。今年十六岁，人长的漂靓又大方。\n小娟已经被折磨的遍体鳞伤。\n"
msgstr "Xiaojuan is a Liu, the only daughter of Old Farmer Liu here. She is sixteen, a pretty girl and an open-hearted one. Xiaojuan has been tortured until she is covered in wounds."

msgid "小娟说道：唉！ 没料道你和那些坏人是一伙的！\n"
msgstr "Xiaojuan says, \"Ah! I never thought you were with those bad men!\""

msgid "救我！救救我呀！"
msgstr "Save me! Please, save me!"

msgid "竭力挣扎，渐渐从绳索里摆脱出来……。"
msgstr " struggles with all her strength, slowly working free of the ropes..."

msgid "小娟遍体鳞伤，只剩一口气，这一击会要了她的命。确定要攻击她吗？"
msgstr "Xiaojuan is covered in wounds and has only a breath left; this blow would kill her. Attack her anyway?"

msgid "这是黑松堡的狱卒\n"
msgstr "A jailer of Black Pine Castle."

msgid "你正走在一条黄土大道上。路上尘土飞扬，路旁稀疏几棵矮树。\n往南通往京师，东北是通往天驼关的大道。\n"
msgstr "You are walking on a broad road of yellow earth. Dust flies along it, and a few sparse, low trees stand by the roadside. South leads to the Capital; northeast is the main road to Camelback Pass."

msgid "这里是个交叉路口，过往行人很多。路边有一个茶馆，是供行\n人歇息的地方。向南是通往京师的北驿道，北方可见阴森的黑松山。\n"
msgstr "This is a crossroads, with many travelers passing through. By the road stands a teahouse where people rest. South is the north post road to the Capital; to the north you can see the forbidding Black Pine Mountain."

msgid "你的两侧是茂盛的稻田，还有一条清澈见底的小溪。许多乡民在田里\n辛苦的忙碌着。再北面是黑松山。眺望山顶，你似乎可以看到一个颇具规\n模的城堡。城堡的最顶端插着一面大旗，大旗上绣着两个斗大的金字：淳于。\n"
msgstr "On both sides of you lie lush rice paddies and a clear, shallow stream. Many villagers are hard at work in the fields. Further north is Black Pine Mountain. Looking up toward the summit, you seem to make out a sizable castle. At its very top flies a great banner, embroidered with two golden characters as big as dippers: Chunyu."

msgid "一座高而险的山峰耸立在你面前。北面是一条上山的羊肠小路，盘旋曲折。\n黑湮湮的松林给你不祥的感觉。\n"
msgstr "A tall, steep peak towers before you. To the north a goat-track winds up the mountain, twisting and turning. The dark, murky pine forest gives you an ominous feeling."

msgid "你正在艰难的走在唯一通往山顶的小路上。路边堆着很多面目\n狰狞的巨石。几棵幼松顽强的从石缝中挤了出来。你在这\n里可以看到山顶城堡的大致伦廓。\n"
msgstr "You are struggling along the only path to the summit. Heaps of fierce-looking boulders lie by the path, and a few young pines have stubbornly forced their way out of the cracks in the rock. From here you can make out the outline of the castle on the summit."

msgid "这是通往城堡的石街，整条石街全是用巨大的花岗岩砌成的。\n单这条石路就足已表明城堡主人的富有和气势。\n"
msgstr "This is the stone street leading to the castle, paved entirely with huge slabs of granite. This one stone road alone is enough to show the wealth and grandeur of the castle's master."

msgid "山顶强劲的风吹得铁索桥左右晃动，脚下的万丈深渊使你头晕目旋。\n你竭尽全力的维持身体平衡。\n"
msgstr "The strong wind on the summit sets the chain bridge swaying from side to side. The bottomless gorge beneath your feet makes your head spin. You use all your strength to keep your balance."

msgid "你站立在一座宏伟的城堡之前，城门之上挂着一块金匾。金匾上\n龙飞凤舞的写着四个大字“黑松淳于”，金匾左下角刚劲草书落款：\n“淳于怀太”，“壬子年一月十八日”。\n"
msgstr "You stand before a magnificent castle. Above the gate hangs a golden plaque. On it four big characters are written in flowing, flying brush: \"Chunyu of Black Pine\". At the lower left of the plaque is a bold cursive signature: \"Chunyu Huaitai\", and the date, \"the eighteenth day of the first month, year Renzi\"."

msgid "你站在黑松山顶，黑松城堡的东侧。高耸的城墙上长满了青色的\n蔓藤。蔓藤从墙顶一直垂到你的脚下。再往东是刀削般的万丈悬崖。\n往西则是城堡的正门。你脚下是一块青石板。\n"
msgstr "You are on the summit of Black Pine Mountain, on the east side of the castle. Green vines cover the towering walls and hang from the top down to your feet. Beyond to the east is a cliff, sheer as if sliced with a knife, with a bottomless drop. To the west is the castle's main gate. You are standing on a slab of blue-gray stone."

msgid "你站在黑松山顶，黑松城堡的西侧。高耸的城墙上长满了青色的\n蔓藤。蔓藤从墙顶一直垂到你的脚下。再往西是刀削般的万丈悬崖。\n往东则是城堡的正门。\n"
msgstr "You are on the summit of Black Pine Mountain, on the west side of the castle. Green vines cover the towering walls and hang from the top down to your feet. Beyond to the west is a cliff, sheer as if sliced with a knife, with a bottomless drop. To the east is the castle's main gate."

msgid "你现在处于一个窄窄的夹道里，通向北面的路被一块巨石堵死。\n夹道的两侧是三丈高的石墙。出乎你的意料，石墙上布满了\n碗大的圆孔。石墙的后面传出“吱吱嘎嘎”的声音。\n"
msgstr "You are in a narrow passage. The way north is blocked by a huge rock. On both sides stand stone walls thirty feet high. Surprisingly, the walls are riddled with round holes as big as bowls. From behind the walls come creaking, grating sounds."

msgid "你站在黑松城堡的西花园里。花园里长满了各式各样奇花异草。\n西侧高耸的城墙上长满了青色的蔓藤。蔓藤从墙顶一直垂到你的脚下。\n再往东则是雄伟的黑松阁。\n"
msgstr "You are in the west garden of Black Pine Castle. It is overgrown with all kinds of rare flowers and strange plants. On the west, green vines cover the towering wall and hang from the top down to your feet. To the east stands the imposing Black Pine Hall."

msgid "你站在黑松城堡的北花园里。花园里长满了各式各样奇花异草。\n再通向北面的路被一块巨石堵死。再往南则是雄伟的黑松阁。\n"
msgstr "You are in the north garden of Black Pine Castle. It is overgrown with all kinds of rare flowers and strange plants. The way further north is blocked by a huge rock. To the south stands the imposing Black Pine Hall."

msgid "这是黑松堡主淳于怀太迎宾的西厅。整个大厅布置的雍荣典雅。\n向东是黑松阁的正厅，向西和向北都是精心修剪过的花园。楼上则是\n淳于巨大的睡房。南面是一个小小的储藏室。\n"
msgstr "This is the west hall where Chunyu Huaitai, Lord of Black Pine Castle, receives his guests. The whole hall is arranged with rich and elegant taste. East is the main hall of Black Pine Hall; west and north are carefully trimmed gardens. Upstairs is Chunyu's huge bedchamber. To the south is a small storeroom."

msgid "一个小小的储藏室。四壁上布满了灰尘。\n"
msgstr "A small storeroom. Dust covers all four walls."

msgid "黑松阁正厅完全是用檀香木打造的。一阵阵的檀香飘过来，\n使你心旷神夷。厅口悬着一幅字画，写道：“是非成败转头空，\n青山依旧在，几度夕阳红。”整幅字画是用一条很粗的绳子挂起\n来的。\n"
msgstr "The main hall of Black Pine Hall is built entirely of sandalwood. Waves of sandalwood scent drift over you and ease your heart. At the hall's mouth hangs a scroll, which reads: \"Right and wrong, success and failure, all turn to nothing in the end. The green hills remain, and how many times have the sunsets reddened.\" The scroll is hung by a very thick rope."

msgid "这是黑松堡主淳于怀太迎宾的东厅。整个大厅布置的雍荣典雅。\n向东和向西都是精心修剪过的花园。楼上则是淳于巨大的睡房。\n偶尔有几声狗叫从东花园里传来。\n"
msgstr "This is the east hall where Chunyu Huaitai, Lord of Black Pine Castle, receives his guests. The whole hall is arranged with rich and elegant taste. East and west are carefully trimmed gardens. Upstairs is Chunyu's huge bedchamber. Now and then a few barks drift in from the east garden."

msgid "你站在黑松城堡的东花园里。花园里长满了各式各样奇花异草。\n东侧高耸的城墙上长满了青色的蔓藤。蔓藤从墙顶一直垂到你的脚下。\n再往西则是雄伟的黑松阁。\n"
msgstr "You are in the east garden of Black Pine Castle. It is overgrown with all kinds of rare flowers and strange plants. On the east, green vines cover the towering wall and hang from the top down to your feet. To the west stands the imposing Black Pine Hall."

msgid "你站在黑松城堡的南花园里。花园里长满了各式各样奇花异草。\n再往北则是雄伟的黑松阁。\n"
msgstr "You are in the south garden of Black Pine Castle. It is overgrown with all kinds of rare flowers and strange plants. To the north stands the imposing Black Pine Hall."

msgid "这是淳于堡主起居的地方。东面的楼梯向下通向黑松阁东厅，\n西面的楼梯向下通向黑松阁西厅。北面是一个小小的阳台。南面则\n是堡主的膳房。\n"
msgstr "This is where the Castle Lord Chunyu lives. The stairs to the east lead down to the east hall of Black Pine Hall, and those to the west lead down to the west hall. To the north is a small balcony. To the south is the lord's dining room."

msgid "这是一个小小的阳台。从这里你可以一直望到山脚。强劲\n的山风吹在你身上，让你感到份外的凉爽。真是一个好去处。\n"
msgstr "This is a small balcony. From here you can see all the way to the foot of the mountain. The strong mountain wind blows against you, and it feels especially cool. A fine place to be."

msgid "这是淳于堡主的用膳房。整个房间飘荡着上等竹叶青的酒香和\n令人垂滟欲滴的烤山猪的香气。你似乎听到你的肚子在“咕咕咕”\n的叫了起来。\n"
msgstr "This is Castle Lord Chunyu's dining room. The whole room is filled with the aroma of the finest Bamboo Leaf Green wine and the mouth-watering smell of roast mountain boar. You seem to hear your stomach start to rumble."

msgid "这里黑黑暗暗，几乎伸手不见五指。唯一的光亮来自墙上忽明忽暗的\n松油灯。地上和墙上布满了暗红色的血痕，散发出阵阵腥气。不断传来的\n哀嚎声在死沉的地牢里回荡，令人毛骨耸然。\n"
msgstr "It is dark here, so dark you can hardly see your hand in front of your face. The only light comes from pine-oil lamps on the wall, flickering in and out. Dark red bloodstains cover the floor and walls, giving off a reek of blood. Cries of agony keep echoing through the dead stillness of the dungeon, making your hair stand on end."

msgid "这里黑黑暗暗，几乎伸手不见五指。唯一的光亮来自墙上忽明忽暗的\n松油灯。地上和墙上布满了暗红色的血痕，散发出阵阵腥气。不断传来的\n哀嚎声在死沉的地牢里回荡，令人毛骨耸然。地牢的天花板上镶着一块石\n板，从石板的缝隙间射进几束阳光。\n"
msgstr "It is dark here, so dark you can hardly see your hand in front of your face. The only light comes from pine-oil lamps on the wall, flickering in and out. Dark red bloodstains cover the floor and walls, giving off a reek of blood. Cries of agony keep echoing through the dead stillness of the dungeon, making your hair stand on end. A stone slab is set into the dungeon ceiling, and a few beams of sunlight shine through its cracks."

msgid "你处在一个阴湿的地牢里。地牢的角落里堆着一些干草，干草上沾满了\n暗红色的血迹。许多骷髅被生锈的铁链绑在墙上。偶尔之间，你还可以听到\n老鼠“吱吱”的尖叫声。\n"
msgstr "You are in a damp dungeon. In the corner lies a pile of straw, soaked with dark red blood. Many skeletons are bound to the walls with rusty iron chains. Now and then you hear the squeak of rats."

msgid "整间刑房已被乾曷的血迹然成暗红色。散发着扑鼻的腥臭。墙上挂满了\n各式各样的邢具。刑房的地上散落着生锈的铁链和破碎的骷髅。偶尔之间，\n你还可以听到老鼠“吱吱”的尖叫声。\n"
msgstr "The whole torture chamber has been dyed dark red by dried blood and stinks of it. All kinds of instruments of torture hang on the walls. Rusty iron chains and broken skeletons lie scattered on the floor. Now and then you hear the squeak of rats."

msgid "你被黑松堡散出的强烈杀气当了回来。"
msgstr "The fierce killing intent coming off Black Pine Castle drives you back."

msgid "刹那间石墙的后面“嘣嘣”声不绝，无数羽箭从圆孔中向你激射而出！！\n"
msgstr "All at once there is a rattling from behind the walls, and countless arrows shoot out at you from the round holes!!"

msgid "你被乱箭射得头破血流，遍体鳞伤！\n"
msgstr "You are shot full of arrows, your head bloody and your whole body wounded!"

msgid "这根绳子顺着墙垂下来，你似乎可以拉它，但是你有一种不祥的感觉。\n"
msgstr "The rope hangs down along the wall. You seem to be able to pull it, but you have an ominous feeling about it."

msgid "城墙虽陡，但长满了蔓藤。你似乎可以试着爬上去。\n"
msgstr "The wall is steep, but it is covered with vines. You seem to be able to try climbing up."

msgid "蔓藤长满了城墙，你似乎可以试着爬上去。\n"
msgstr "Vines cover the wall. You seem to be able to try climbing up."

msgid "青石板劳牢的镶在地下，但它下面似乎是空的。\n"
msgstr "The slab of blue-gray stone is set firmly into the ground, but it seems to be hollow underneath."

msgid "这是一块千斤巨石，阻住了通向北面的路。\n"
msgstr "This is a boulder weighing a thousand catties, blocking the way north."

msgid "这是一道三丈高，厚达尺许的石墙。墙上的圆孔很适合用来发暗箭。\n"
msgstr "A stone wall thirty feet high and about a foot thick. The round holes in it are just right for shooting hidden arrows."

msgid "你试着往圆孔里看，可是里面太黑了，什么也看不到。\n"
msgstr "You try looking into a hole, but it is too dark inside to see anything."

msgid "这显然是拉开强弩的声音。\n"
msgstr "That is plainly the sound of a heavy crossbow being drawn."

msgid "这里只有一条铁链。\n"
msgstr "There is only an iron chain here."

msgid "很沉重的石板，但你似乎可以推动它。\n"
msgstr "A very heavy stone slab, but it seems you could push it."

msgid "你试著往上用力推动石板，石板变得越来越松动了...."
msgstr "You push up hard on the slab, and it grows looser and looser..."

msgid "石板终于被推的斜立起来，露出一个向上的缝隙。"
msgstr "At last the slab is pushed up on its edge, leaving a gap leading upward."

msgid "石板“轰”的一声又倒了下来，将向上的通道盖住了。"
msgstr "The slab falls back with a \"boom\", covering the way up."

msgid "石板“轰”的一声又倒了下去，将向下的通道盖住了。"
msgstr "With a boom, the slab falls back and covers the way down."

msgid "你抓着蔓藤，慢慢的顺着城墙爬了上去。\n"
msgstr "You grip the vines and slowly climb up the wall."

msgid "你用手一撑墙头儿，轻巧的跳了过来。\n"
msgstr "You push off the top of the wall with one hand and hop lightly over."

msgid "顺着走下去"
msgstr "Follow it down"

msgid "你抓紧铁链，顺着铁索桥走了下去。\n"
msgstr "You hold tight to the iron chain and make your way down the chain bridge."

msgid "拉"
msgstr "Pull"

msgid "这根绳子连着翻板：一拉就会掉进下面的地牢，摔得不轻，也没法顺着绳子爬回来。确定要拉绳子吗？"
msgstr "This rope is joined to a trapdoor: pull it and you fall into the dungeon below, hurt badly, and with no way to climb back up the rope. Pull the rope anyway?"

msgid "拉绳子"
msgstr "Pull the rope"

msgid "你试着拉了一下绳子，触动了翻板，整个人“轰隆”一声掉了下去！\n"
msgstr "You give the rope a try and set off the trapdoor, and down you go with a crash!"

msgid "你“轰隆”一声，从上面掉了下来！摔得你好痛！\n"
msgstr "With a crash you fall from above! It hurts terribly!"

msgid "茶"
msgstr "Tea"

msgid "一把沈重的大钢叉，七根尖刺发出黑黝黝的光芒。\n"
msgstr "A heavy steel pitchfork. Its seven spikes gleam a dull black."

msgid "一个负责看守鬼门关的阴卒，他们是鬼卒中的精锐，负责阻挡想要\n侵入酆都城的妖魔鬼怪。\n"
msgstr "A ghost guard who keeps the Ghost Gate, one of the elite among the ghost soldiers. He holds off the demons and spirits who would break into Fengdu."

msgid "阴鬼牙将是守关鬼卒里的精锐，你现在只是一缕鬼魂，打输了会再死一次，再受一次死亡的惩罚。确定要攻击他吗？"
msgstr "The Ghost Captain is among the best of the gate guards. You are only a wisp of a soul now; if you lose, you will die again and suffer death's penalty once more. Attack him anyway?"

msgid "白无常伸著长长的舌头瞪著你，死白的脸上看不出任何喜怒哀乐。\n"
msgstr "White Impermanence glares at you with his long tongue lolling out. Nothing, joy or anger, shows on his deathly white face."

msgid "白无常发出一阵像呻吟的声音，当他发现你正注视著他的时候，瞪了你一眼。\n"
msgstr "White Impermanence lets out a sound like a groan. Noticing you watching him, he glares back."

msgid "白无常把长长的舌头伸出来，缓缓地舔了舔自己又白又长的手指。\n"
msgstr "White Impermanence slowly licks his long, white fingers with his long tongue."

msgid "白无常说道：喂！新来的，你叫什么名字？"
msgstr "White Impermanence says, \"Hey! Newcomer! What's your name?\""

msgid "白无常用奇异的眼光盯著你，好像要看穿你的一切似的。"
msgstr "White Impermanence stares at you with strange eyes, as if he could see right through you."

msgid "白无常「哼」的一声，从袖中掏出一本像帐册的东西翻看著。"
msgstr "White Impermanence snorts and pulls a book like an account ledger from his sleeve, leafing through it."

msgid "白无常阁上册子，说道：咦？阳寿未尽？怎么可能？"
msgstr "White Impermanence snaps the book shut. \"Huh? Your years are not used up? How can that be?\""

msgid "白无常搔了搔头，叹道：罢了罢了，你走吧。"
msgstr "White Impermanence scratches his head and sighs, \"Oh, never mind. Go on, off with you.\""

msgid "黑无常伸著长长的舌头瞪著你，黝黑的脸上看不出任何喜怒哀乐。\n"
msgstr "Black Impermanence glares at you with his long tongue lolling out. Nothing, joy or anger, shows on his swarthy black face."

msgid "黑无常发出一阵像呻吟的声音，当他发现你正注视著他的时候，瞪了你一眼。\n"
msgstr "Black Impermanence lets out a sound like a groan. Noticing you watching him, he glares back."

msgid "黑无常把长长的舌头伸出来，缓缓地舔了舔自己又黑又长的手指。\n"
msgstr "Black Impermanence slowly licks his long, black fingers with his long tongue."

msgid "喂！阳人来阴间做什么？"
msgstr "Hey! What does a living man want in the Underworld?"

msgid "黑无常说道：喂！新来的，你叫什么名字？"
msgstr "Black Impermanence says, \"Hey! Newcomer! What's your name?\""

msgid "黑无常用奇异的眼光盯著你，好像要看穿你的一切似的。"
msgstr "Black Impermanence stares at you with strange eyes, as if he could see right through you."

msgid "这里是一条漫长的石桥，往南石桥延伸进大雾之中，望不到尽头，\n往北引隐约约有一座城楼，不过你分不清是真实的影像还是幻觉，东西\n两面都是一望无际的大雾，一阵阵阴冷的微风从雾中吹过。\n"
msgstr "This is a long stone bridge. To the south it runs on into a great fog, and you cannot see where it ends. To the north there is the faint shape of a gate tower, though you cannot tell whether it is real or a trick of the eye. East and west there is only endless fog, and a cold, damp breeze keeps drifting through it."

msgid "你现在正站在一条极长的石桥上，桥头一块石碑上面刻著「奈何桥\n」三个古篆，东、西两面都是大雾，连桥底下是不是水都看不到，浓雾\n中有许多朦胧的人影鱼贯地向北走去，奈何桥往南延伸到一片大雾之中\n，北边引隐约约有一座城楼的影子。\n"
msgstr "You are standing on a very long stone bridge. On a stone tablet at the bridge head three ancient seal characters are carved: \"Bridge of Helplessness\". Fog fills the east and west, so thick you cannot even tell whether there is water under the bridge. In the fog many hazy figures file northward. The bridge runs south into the fog, and to the north you can just make out the shadow of a gate tower."

msgid "这里就是著名的阴间入口「鬼门关」，在你面前矗立著一座高大的\n黑色城楼，许多亡魂正哭哭啼啼地列队前进，因为一进鬼门关就无法再\n回阳间了。\n"
msgstr "This is the famous entrance to the Underworld, the Ghost Gate. A tall black gate tower rises before you. Many dead souls are lining up and moving forward in tears, for once through the Ghost Gate there is no going back to the world of the living."

msgid "你现在来到一座黑色城楼之前，城楼上刻著三个大字：酆都城。往\n南不远处有一座桥，桥上鬼影幢幢，但是却听不到半点声音，往北走进\n城楼只见一片黑漆漆的，只有少许暗红色的火光若隐若现地闪烁著。\n"
msgstr "You have come before a black gate tower. Three big characters are carved on it: Fengdu. Not far south is a bridge crowded with ghostly shapes, yet not a sound comes from it. Going north into the gate tower, you see only pitch darkness, with a little dull red firelight flickering in and out."

msgid "你走在一条阴森森的路上, 浓浓的雾环绕在你的四周, 好像永\n远都不会散去似的. 往南看去你勉强可以分辨出一个城楼的模样,\n往北隐约可以看到几盏灯笼, 在浓雾中显得格外的诡异. 路的两旁\n各有一栋木造的建筑, 门都是半开的, 但你看不清楚里面有什么.\n\n"
msgstr "You are walking on a gloomy road. Thick fog wraps around you, as if it will never lift. Looking south you can just make out the outline of a gate tower; to the north you can faintly see a few lanterns, eerie in the thick fog. On either side of the road stands a wooden building, its door half open, but you cannot see what is inside."

msgid "你一进来就发现屋里异常的温暖, 墙角壁炉里微弱的火光将你\n的影子投射在对面的墙上. 几个人影围在炉旁不知在讨\n论些什么. 屋内有几张木桌, 椅, 墙上挂了几幅字画, 一切看来非\n常的详和宁静, 你几乎忘了自己身在何处.\n \n"
msgstr "The moment you come in you notice how strangely warm the room is. The faint firelight from the hearth in the corner throws your shadow on the opposite wall. A few shadowy figures are gathered round the hearth, talking of something. There are several wooden tables and chairs, and a few paintings and scrolls hang on the walls. Everything looks so peaceful and calm that you almost forget where you are."

msgid "屋里相当冷清, 外面的浓雾还不时地从半开著的门缝飘进来,\n地面上散著一些破旧的物品, 不过光从外表已经无法分辨出那是些\n什么东西了. 墙上刻著一些潦草的字体, 墙角的一盏灯笼挣\n扎似地发出一阵阵微弱的光芒, 也始得那些字看来格外的诡异.\n\n"
msgstr "The room is rather bleak. Thick fog from outside drifts in now and then through the half-open door. Worn, broken things are scattered on the floor, but they are so decayed you can no longer tell what they were. Scrawled writing is carved on the wall. A lantern in the corner struggles to give off a faint glow, which makes the words look all the stranger."

msgid "你走在一条阴森森的路上, 浓浓的雾环绕在你的四周, 好像永\n远都不会散去似的. 整条路前后只看到零星的几盏灯笼........\n \n"
msgstr "You are walking on a gloomy road. Thick fog wraps around you, as if it will never lift. Along the whole road you can see only a few scattered lanterns..."

msgid "浓雾在这里聚成一堵墙，路到这里就断了。\n"
msgstr "The fog has piled up into a wall here, and the road ends."

msgid "一个空洞的声音在你耳边响起...."
msgstr "A hollow voice sounds in your ear..."

msgid "没有回头路了!"
msgstr "There is no way back!"

msgid "你走著走著..... 发现四周景色居然都没有变...."
msgstr "You walk and walk... and find that the scenery around you has not changed at all..."

msgid "从你站的位置很难辨别出那几个人的容貌, 四个披著黑斗蓬的人斜靠在壁\n炉边的角落, 偶尔传来其中几人说话的声音, 不过从这个距离你无法听到\n他们讨论的内容. 当你还在考虑要不要靠过去一点时, 其中一人回头看了\n你一眼, 你愣住了... 那人... 那人......... 居然长得跟你一模一样!\n"
msgstr "From where you stand it is hard to make out their faces. Four people in black cloaks lean in the corner by the hearth, and now and then you hear one of them speak, but from this far you cannot make out what they are saying. While you are still wondering whether to move closer, one of them turns to look at you, and you freeze... That person... that person... looks exactly like you!"

msgid "几行你勉强分辨得出来的字:\n我被困在这里了.... 我要回家啦!!!!!!!!!!!\n                      ^^^^\n                        靠自己啦...\n什么叫靠自己啊?!?!? 这里连个活人都没有...\n\n看到你自己时问一下吧... 自己人都会互相帮忙的说.. \n                                    ^^^^\n                                 你... 确... 定?!?!\n喔.. \n"
msgstr "A few lines you can just make out:\nI'm stuck here... I want to go home!!!!!!!!!!!\n                      ^^^^\n                        Count on yourself...\nWhat does that mean, count on yourself?!?!? There isn't a living soul here...\n\nAsk when you see yourself... Your own people always help each other, y'know... \n                                    ^^^^\n                                 You... are... sure?!?!\nOh..."

msgid "打听「回家」"
msgstr "Ask about \"Go Home\""

msgid "你走上前去, 低声的向那个长得跟你一样的人询问回家的事.\n"
msgstr "You step forward and quietly ask the one who looks like you about going home."

msgid "那人一句话也不说就往你这边撞过来, 你眼前一阵黑....\n"
msgstr "Without a word the figure slams into you. Everything goes black..."

msgid "一棵翠绿色的小草，发着晶莹的光芒和醉人的香味。\n"
msgstr "A small, jade-green plant, glowing with a crystal light and giving off an intoxicating fragrance.\n"

msgid "这是一把黑黝黝的乌檀木刀，闻起来有一股淡淡的香气。\n"
msgstr "A saber of dark, glossy ebony wood. It smells faintly sweet.\n"

msgid "这是时下读书人常看的书籍。\n"
msgstr "The sort of book scholars read these days.\n"

msgid "这是一件有钱人家的小姐穿著的衣物，手工相当细致。\n"
msgstr "Clothes of the kind a rich family's daughter wears, very finely made.\n"

msgid "一个用红线绑著的平安符，据说可以避邪。\n"
msgstr "A peace charm tied with a red thread. They say it keeps evil away.\n"

msgid "这是一顶镶著美玉的帽冠。\n"
msgstr "A cap inlaid with fine jade.\n"

msgid "一个香喷喷、热腾腾的大烧饼。\n"
msgstr "A big flatbread, fragrant and piping hot.\n"

msgid "一串看起来就让人垂涎欲滴的糖渍葫芦。\n"
msgstr "A skewer of candied haws that makes your mouth water just to look at it.\n"

msgid "一个大红龟，上面盖了个印子：保境安民。\n"
msgstr "A big red turtle cake, stamped with a seal: Guard the Border, Keep the People Safe.\n"

msgid "圆溜溜的山药蛋，忒新鲜。\n"
msgstr "Round, plump yams, ever so fresh.\n"

msgid "这条布条是从一件寿衣上撕下来的，上面密密麻麻写了许多字。\n"
msgstr "A strip of cloth torn from a burial shroud, packed with tiny writing.\n"

msgid "一个刻工相刚精细的桃木箱，也许是用来装首饰用的。\n"
msgstr "A peachwood box with fine, careful carving, perhaps made to hold jewelry.\n"

msgid "翻看"
msgstr "Search"

msgid "箱底的夹层空了，抄本已经在你手里。\n"
msgstr "The false bottom is empty. The copy is already in your hands.\n"

msgid "你翻看桃木箱：首饰早没了，底板却比箱壁厚得不像话。你抠开底板——夹层里是一卷发黄的纸。\n"
msgstr "You go through the peachwood chest. The jewelry is long gone, but the bottom board is far too thick compared with the sides. You pry it open, and inside the hollow lies a roll of yellowed paper.\n"

msgid "这是一粒仙丹，服食可位列仙班。\n"
msgstr "An immortal's pill. Swallow it and you take a seat among the immortals.\n"

msgid "这是一条由上等金丝编成的绳索, 可缚禽兽鬼怪。上刻有无数咒文，发出耀目金光.\n"
msgstr "A rope braided from the finest gold thread. It can bind beasts, ghosts and monsters. Countless spells are carved into it, and it gives off a dazzling golden light.\n"

msgid "缚"
msgstr "Bind"

msgid "你双手合掌，随风而起，落于仙鹤背上......\n"
msgstr "You press your palms together and rise on the wind, landing on the back of the crane...\n"

msgid "你要缚何物? \n"
msgstr "Bind what?\n"

msgid "一株寒谷幽兰，散发着淡淡的香气, 你似乎在晚月庄闻到过.\n"
msgstr "A cold-valley orchid, giving off a faint fragrance. You seem to have smelled it at Latemoon Manor before.\n"

msgid "这是一本讲述吐纳、养生之法的古书，现在已经不多见了。\n"
msgstr "An old book on breathing and the nurturing of life. Few of these are left now.\n"

msgid "一个绣工十分精细的紫色丝绸荷包，上面绣著一对鸳鸯。\n"
msgstr "A purple silk pouch, exquisitely embroidered with a pair of mandarin ducks.\n"

msgid "这是隐士们常看的书籍。\n"
msgstr "The sort of book hermits read.\n"

msgid "这是个正在这里站岗的守城官兵，虽然和许多武林人物比起来，官兵\n们的武功实在稀松平常，但是他们是有组织、有纪律的战士，谁也不\n轻易地招惹他们。\n"
msgstr "A city guard on duty here. Next to many wulin figures, a soldier's martial arts are nothing much, but these men are organized and disciplined fighters, and nobody lightly picks a quarrel with them.\n"

msgid "守城官兵喝道：还不快放下武器束手就缚？\n"
msgstr "City Guard shouts, \"Drop your weapon and surrender at once!\"\n"

msgid "守城官兵喝道：大胆刁民！竟敢杀官造反？\n"
msgstr "The city guard shouts, \"Insolent scoundrel! You dare kill an officer? This is rebellion!\"\n"

msgid "一个相貌朴实的卖饼大叔，憨厚的脸上挂著和蔼的笑容。\n"
msgstr "A plain-looking cake vendor, a kindly uncle with an honest face and a warm smile.\n"

msgid "大叔"
msgstr "uncle"

msgid "小的"
msgstr "this humble one"

msgid "卖饼大叔吆喝道：卖饼哟！又香又脆的大饼哟！\n"
msgstr "The cake vendor calls out, \"Flatbread! Fragrant, crispy flatbread!\"\n"

msgid "卖饼大叔掀开蒸笼，伸手探了探温度。\n"
msgstr "The cake vendor lifts the lid of the steamer and reaches in to feel how hot it is.\n"

msgid "卖饼大叔吆喝道：刚出炉的大饼哟！热呼呼的大饼哟！\n"
msgstr "The flatbread vendor calls out, \"Flatbread, fresh from the oven! Hot, hot flatbread!\"\n"

msgid "这个卖包子的小贩对你微微一笑，说道：热腾腾的包子，来一笼吧？\n"
msgstr "This dumpling seller gives you a small smile and says, \"Steaming hot dumplings. Care for a basket?\"\n"

msgid "卖包子的吆喝道：包子！热腾腾的包子！\n"
msgstr "The dumpling seller calls out, \"Dumplings! Steaming hot dumplings!\"\n"

msgid "汤掌柜是这家大酒楼的主人，别看他只是一个小小的酒楼老板，乔阴\n县境内除了知县老爷以外，恐怕就属他最财大势大。\n"
msgstr "Shopkeeper Tang owns this grand tavern. He may be only a tavern keeper, but in all Tallshade County, apart from the magistrate himself, probably nobody has more wealth and influence.\n"

msgid "在下姓汤单名一个业字。\n"
msgstr "My surname is Tang, and my given name is Ye.\n"

msgid "此处便是福林酒楼，客倌如要点菜，吩咐店里的小二一声便可。\n"
msgstr "This is Fulin Tavern. If you wish to order, sir, just tell the waiter.\n"

msgid "汤业"
msgstr "Tang Ye"

msgid "不敢，在下便是汤业，不知客倌有何吩咐？\n"
msgstr "I would not dare presume. I am Tang Ye. What can I do for you, sir?\n"

msgid "这里就是，客倌是第一次来吗？\n"
msgstr "This is the place. Is this your first visit, sir?\n"

msgid "陈武官？进了衙门就没再回来。听说在堂上说了什么，县太爷把人留下了。半年的账，他临走前倒是结清了。"
msgstr "Officer Chen? He went into the yamen and never came back. They say he said something in court, and His Honor kept him there. At least he paid up his half year's bill before he left."

msgid "那位陈武官抱着他的箱子走了，天没亮就走的。半年的账没结——罢了，他那个样子，谁忍心要。"
msgstr "Officer Chen left with his chest in his arms, before it was even light. Half a year's bill unpaid, but, well, the state he was in, who had the heart to ask?"

msgid "陈武官跟你出去了？这半年他没出过这道门。"
msgstr "Officer Chen went out with you? In all this half year he never once stepped out of that door."

msgid "堂下那位武官姓陈，在小店住了半年，天天坐在那儿发呆，丢了个桃木箱子。客倌若见着，他会重谢。"
msgstr "The officer sitting down there is named Chen. He has lived in my humble inn for half a year, sitting there in a daze every day. He lost a peachwood chest. If you find it, sir, he will reward you handsomely."

msgid "一位相貌威武的武官，独自一个人站在这里发呆，似乎正有什么\n事困扰著他。\n"
msgstr "A powerful-looking officer standing alone here in a daze, as if something is troubling him.\n"

msgid "在下姓陈，名显祖，阁下是？"
msgstr "My surname is Chen, and my name is Xianzu. And you, sir?"

msgid "真是不巧，我也是外地来的，对这个地方并不熟悉。"
msgstr "What bad luck. I am from elsewhere too, and I do not know this place well."

msgid "在下失落了一件重要物事，是装在一个桃木箱子里，不知你有没有看见？"
msgstr "I have lost something important. It was in a peachwood chest. Have you seen it?"

msgid "对，是桃木做成的箱子。"
msgstr "Yes, a chest made of peachwood."

msgid "桃木箱子"
msgstr "Peachwood Chest"

msgid "如果你见著了，麻烦送还给我，在下定当重重报答。"
msgstr "If you find it, please bring it back to me. I will thank you generously."

msgid "不敢，正是在下，不知阁下有何指教？"
msgstr "I would not dare presume. That is I. What advice do you have for me, sir?"

msgid "兵部"
msgstr "Ministry of War"

msgid "我认了。抄本在桃木箱的底板里，箱子在树王坟的树洞里——我不敢去取。"
msgstr "I admit it. The copy is in the false bottom of the peachwood chest, and the chest is in the hollow of the Tree King's Tomb. I do not dare go and fetch it."

msgid "看见文书末尾那方朱红的印，脸色一下变了，手按住了桌沿。"
msgstr " sees the vermilion seal at the end of the document, and his face changes at once. His hand grips the edge of the table."

msgid "这印……二十年了，还是这方印。"
msgstr "This seal... Twenty years, and it is still the same seal."

msgid "在下不瞒阁下：二十年前老松岭那队白衣武官，我是其中一个——走到半路跑了的那个。原令只一句：寻剑，不得扰民一户。是我念给全队听的。念完第三天，领队拿着另一道令来了：征民夫，拿人。"
msgstr "I will hide nothing from you, sir. Twenty years ago I was one of that company of Officers in White at Old Pine Ridge, the one who ran off halfway. The original order was a single line: find the sword, and trouble not one household. It was I who read it out to the whole company. Three days later the leader came with another order. Conscript laborers. Seize people."

msgid "我抄了一份原令，缝在桃木箱的底板里，怕了二十年。箱子……箱子丢在树王坟的树洞里了，洞里不干净，我不敢去取。"
msgstr "I copied the original order and sewed it into the bottom board of the peachwood chest. I have been afraid for twenty years. The chest... I left the chest in the hollow of the Tree King's Tomb. The hollow is not clean. I do not dare go and get it."

msgid "兵部？在下一个外地人，不懂这些。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War? I am a stranger here. I know nothing of such matters."

msgid "抄本"
msgstr "Copy"

msgid "抄本你已经拿了。念给公堂听，还是烧了，都在你。"
msgstr "You already have the copy. Read it out to the court, or burn it. That is up to you."

msgid "把桃木箱翻过来，抠开底板，取出一卷发黄的纸。"
msgstr " turns the peachwood chest over, pries open the bottom board and takes out a roll of yellowed paper."

msgid "就是它。二十三个名字，我一个一个点过——点到的都不在了。"
msgstr "That is it. Twenty-three names. I went through them one by one, and everyone I called is gone."

msgid "在箱子底板的夹层里。箱子在树王坟的树洞里——洞里那三个影子，我见过一回，再没敢下去。"
msgstr "It is in the hidden layer under the chest's bottom board. The chest is in the hollow of the Tree King's Tomb. Those three shadows inside, I saw them once, and I never dared go down again."

msgid "什么抄本？"
msgstr "What copy?"

msgid "作证"
msgstr "Testify"

msgid "护送陈显祖进衙门作证：他会跟着你走，从福林酒楼到县衙。\n路上会有人拦。\n确定吗？"
msgstr "Escort Chen Xianzu to the yamen to testify. He will follow you from Fulin Tavern to the magistrate's court.\nPeople will try to stop you on the way.\nAre you sure?"

msgid "我跟着你。到了衙门再说。"
msgstr "I will follow you. We can talk once we reach the yamen."

msgid "我已经在堂上说过了。"
msgstr "I have already said my piece in court."

msgid "沉默了很久，手从桌沿上拿了下来。"
msgstr " is silent for a long while, then takes his hand off the edge of the table."

msgid "二十年，我天天想着这一天会不会来。来了就来了——我跟你去。箱子我带着，抄本你拿着。"
msgstr "Twenty years, and every day I wondered whether this day would come. Now it has come. Let it. I will go with you. I will carry the chest, and you carry the copy."

msgid "阁下走前头。庾家的人在这条街上有眼睛。"
msgstr "You go first, sir. The Yu family has eyes on this street."

msgid "作什么证？在下只是个丢了箱子的过路人。"
msgstr "Testify to what? I am only a passing traveler who lost a chest."

msgid "走吧"
msgstr "Off You Go"

msgid "放陈显祖带着箱子走：他交出抄本，一去不回——公堂上就没有人证了。\n确定吗？"
msgstr "Let Chen Xianzu leave with the chest. He hands over the copy and is gone for good, and there will be no witness in court.\nAre you sure?"

msgid "我已经答应跟你去了。到了衙门再说走不走。"
msgstr "I have already agreed to go with you. We will see whether I go or stay once we reach the yamen."

msgid "箱子还没回到我手里——你先把箱子还我。抄本在箱底的夹层里，你要就先翻出来。"
msgstr "The chest is not back in my hands yet. Return it to me first. The copy is in the false bottom of the chest. If you want it, bring it out first."

msgid "把桃木箱翻过来，抠开底板，取出一卷发黄的纸，递给你。"
msgstr " turns the peachwood chest over, pries open the bottom board, takes out a roll of yellowed paper and hands it to you."

msgid "多谢。这二十三个名字，往后替我记着。"
msgstr "Thank you. Keep these twenty-three names in mind for me from now on."

msgid "抱起桃木箱，出了福林酒楼的门，再没有回头。"
msgstr " hugs the peachwood chest, walks out of Fulin Tavern and does not look back."

msgid "多谢。抄本在你手上，就不用我这张嘴了。"
msgstr "Thank you. With the copy in your hands, there is no more need for my mouth."

msgid "走？在下的箱子还没找回来。"
msgstr "Leave? My chest has not been found yet."

msgid "太好了！就是这个箱子！"
msgstr "Wonderful! That is the chest!"

msgid "在下出门在外，没有携带太多银两 ... "
msgstr "I am traveling and carry little silver ..."

msgid "如果您不嫌弃的话，这本古书便请笑纳。"
msgstr "If you do not mind, please accept this old book."

msgid "武官给你一本「白杨经」。"
msgstr "The officer gives you a \"White Poplar Classic\"."

msgid "武官跟在你身后，一只手一直按在剑柄上。\n"
msgstr "The officer follows close behind you, one hand always on the hilt of his sword.\n"

msgid "卖糖葫芦的吆喝道：糖葫芦！好甜好香的糖葫芦！\n"
msgstr "The candied-haw seller calls out, \"Candied haws! Sweet, fragrant candied haws!\"\n"

msgid "衙役精明强干, 满脸正气. \n"
msgstr "A bailiff, sharp and capable, righteousness all over his face.\n"

msgid "衙役说道：你当这里是什么地方，敢来这里骚扰？\n"
msgstr "The bailiff says, \"What do you think this place is, that you dare come and make trouble?\"\n"

msgid "衙役说道：你要是再无理取闹，当心捕头把你抓去坐牢!\n"
msgstr "The bailiff says, \"Make more trouble and the constable will haul you off to jail!\"\n"

msgid "衙役手中的刀越砍越快，让你应接不暇。\n"
msgstr "The bailiff's blade comes down faster and faster, leaving you barely able to keep up.\n"

msgid "衙役说道：衙门岂是你放肆的地方？！\n"
msgstr "The bailiff says, \"The yamen is no place for your insolence!\"\n"

msgid "带刀侍卫皆为槐阳王程老王爷麾下骁将,身负绝艺.\n"
msgstr "The armed guards were all fierce commanders under Old Prince Cheng of Huaiyang, and each has a rare skill.\n"

msgid "老王爷"
msgstr "Old Prince"

msgid "我们都是槐阳王程老王爷麾下的人。老王爷镇关北二十年，兵部的令到了他手里，不合先帝法度的，一概不接。"
msgstr "We are all men of Old Prince Cheng of Huaiyang. He held Beyond the Pass for twenty years. Any order that reached him from the Ministry of War and broke the late emperor's law, he refused, every one."

msgid "兵部的令"
msgstr "Ministry of War order"

msgid "老王爷拒了。我说过了。"
msgstr "The Old Prince refused. I have said so already."

msgid "兵部去年也给关北发过一道令：征三千民夫修官道，寻剑。老王爷拒了——先帝的令只说寻剑，没说征人。"
msgstr "Last year the Ministry of War sent Beyond the Pass an order too: conscript three thousand laborers to build an official road, and find the sword. The Old Prince refused. The late emperor's order said only to find the sword. It said nothing of conscripting people."

msgid "拒了之后，关北的民夫还是一批一批地没了。往哪儿去的，老王爷查到今天。"
msgstr "Even after he refused, laborers from Beyond the Pass still vanished, batch after batch. Where they went, the Old Prince is still looking into it today."

msgid "这个老太婆怀中抱了个竹篓，似乎在卖什么东西，也许你可以跟她问问\n价钱？\n"
msgstr "This old woman has a bamboo basket in her arms and seems to be selling something. Perhaps you could ask her the price?\n"

msgid "年龄"
msgstr "Age"

msgid "老身今年七十有八啦。\n"
msgstr "This old woman is seventy-eight this year.\n"

msgid "这一带我可熟了。\n"
msgstr "I know this area very well.\n"

msgid "老身隐隐约约地听说过什么‘草’啊，‘狮子’的，具体的也就不知了。\n"
msgstr "This old woman has faintly heard of some \"grass\" and some \"lion\". More than that, I do not know.\n"

msgid "对不起，老婆子耳背，$RESPECT您是想买东西吧？这儿有价钱 ...."
msgstr "Forgive me, this old woman is hard of hearing. You want to buy something, $RESPECT, yes? Here is the price..."

msgid "老太婆打开竹篓，盖子上贴了张纸片。"
msgstr "The old woman opens the basket. A slip of paper is stuck to the lid."

msgid "这是一位来乔阴县游玩的游客。\n"
msgstr "A tourist who has come to Tallshade County for the sights.\n"

msgid "我游历过大半个中国，小小的乔阴县对我能有什么秘密？\n"
msgstr "I have traveled over half of China. What secret could little Tallshade County hold from me?\n"

msgid "这个。。好象是给狮子衔去了。\n"
msgstr "That... seems to have been carried off by a lion.\n"

msgid "一个看起来相当斯文的书生，正拿著一本书摇头晃脑地读著。\n"
msgstr "A rather refined-looking scholar, book in hand, nodding and shaking his head as he reads.\n"

msgid "一个看起来像是有钱人家的女子，正在这里游湖。\n"
msgstr "A young woman who looks to be from a rich family, out for a stroll on the lake.\n"

msgid "我 ... ？ 你们外地人都做兴这么问陌生姑娘的闺名吗？"
msgstr "Me...? Do all you outsiders go around asking strange girls their names like this?"

msgid "这里啊？这里就是乔阴县有名的翠柳湖啊！"
msgstr "This place? This is Green Willow Lake, famous all through Tallshade County!"

msgid "闺名"
msgstr "Maiden Name"

msgid "真是没有礼貌的家伙，我才不告诉你！"
msgstr "What a rude person! I will not tell you!"

msgid "游晋"
msgstr "You Jin"

msgid "小女子有一事相求 ... 请您将这个交给游 ... 游公子。"
msgstr "I have a favor to ask of you... Please give this to Master... Master You."

msgid "一个服侍有钱人家小姐的丫鬟，正无聊地玩弄著衣角。\n"
msgstr "A maid who attends a rich family's young lady, idly fiddling with the hem of her clothes.\n"

msgid "乔阴县县官"
msgstr "Magistrate of Tallshade County"

msgid "他虽然出身望族，然攻读刻苦，榜中探花，如今已是才高八斗，满腹\n经纶，还略通佛理。为官数年清贫廉正，人人敬仰。\n"
msgstr "Though born into a prominent family, he studied hard, took third place at the palace examination, and is now a man of great talent and deep learning, with some knowledge of Buddhist teaching too. In his years in office he has been poor, honest and upright, and everyone respects him.\n"

msgid "这是衙门，快回去吧。"
msgstr "This is a yamen. Go home."

msgid "来人哪！把$N拖下去打{boards}大板！"
msgstr "Men! Drag $N out and give {boards} strokes of the heavy board!"

msgid "哎, 早知今日,何必当初?"
msgstr "Ah, had you known it would come to this, why did you do it?"

msgid "来人呀, 把$N给我抬出去!"
msgstr "Men! Carry $N out of here!"

msgid "...退...堂...!"
msgstr "...Court... is... adjourned...!"

msgid "$N对$n说道: 再敢犯案, 定斩不饶!"
msgstr "$N {N:say|says} to $n, \"Commit another offense and you will be beheaded without mercy!\""

msgid "真是对不起, 下人办事不周, 让您受委屈了."
msgstr "I am truly sorry. My men were careless and have wronged you."

msgid "接过名册，一页一页翻下去，翻到「槐阳河工所」的戳，停了很久。"
msgstr " takes the register, turns it page by page, and stops for a long time at the stamp of the Huaiyang River Works Office."

msgid "兵部的印，河工所的戳，一口一口人，都有来处。"
msgstr "The Ministry's seal, the River Works Office's stamp, each man with a record of where he came from."

msgid "京师的事是定了。可这些人有家有姓——本县一个一个对出来，给他们的家里一个说法。"
msgstr "The matter in the Capital is settled. But these people have homes and names. This county will check them one by one and give each family an account."

msgid "兵部的印在上面。京师的事没定之前，这本册子在你手里，比在本县手里有用——带它上京。"
msgstr "The Ministry's seal is on it. Until the Capital's matter is settled, this register does more good in your hands than in this county's. Take it to the Capital."

msgid "捕快"
msgstr "Constable"

msgid "做乔阴县的捕快：程不平给你一块腰牌，头一件案子是官道上挂着官府告示收过路费的人。\n尚书府小屋里那封密信，官府和花紫会都要——信给了花紫会，官府这条线就断了。\n花紫会的人、惯窃，程不平不收。\n要做吗？"
msgstr "Become a constable of Tallshade County. Cheng Buping gives you a badge, and your first case is the man collecting tolls on the official road under a government notice.\nThe secret letter in the little house in the Minister's Mansion is wanted by both the government and the Beggars' Guild. Give it to the Guild and the government's line is cut off.\nBeggars' Guild members and habitual thieves, Cheng Buping will not take.\nWill you do it?"

msgid "上下打量了你一眼。"
msgstr " looks you over."

msgid "花紫会的人？本县的捕快，不从叫花子堆里挑。"
msgstr "A member of the Beggars' Guild? This county's constables are not picked from among beggars."

msgid "那封信，你给了叫花子。本县的案子，不跟你说了。"
msgstr "You gave that letter to the beggars. This county will not discuss its cases with you."

msgid "官府的案子，本县不跟你说了。"
msgstr "This county will not discuss government cases with you."

msgid "腰牌呢？……丢了？"
msgstr "Your badge? ...Lost?"

msgid "从案下又摸出一块，在背面烙了县印。"
msgstr " takes another from under the desk and brands the county seal on its back."

msgid "捕快丢了腰牌，传出去是笑话。这回收好。"
msgstr "A constable who loses his badge is a joke once it gets out. Keep this one safe."

msgid "把一本抄来的账、小屋那封信和一张供状并排摊在案上。"
msgstr " lays an account book copied out, the letter from the little house and a written confession side by side on the desk."

msgid "天驼关的账，小屋的信，骆建章的供状——兵部抄本上那三句是谁口述的，也有了。"
msgstr "The Camelback Pass accounts, the letter from the little house, Luo Jianzhang's confession. And who dictated those three lines in the Ministry of War copy is known as well."

msgid "原令烧了，案子没烧——本县又开了一回堂。京城不回话，本县就一直不收卷。"
msgstr "The original order was burned, but the case was not. This county has held court once more. Until the Capital answers, this county will keep the file open."

msgid "把一张抄来的供状摊在案上，用镇纸压住。"
msgstr " lays a copied confession on the desk and weighs it down with a paperweight."

msgid "骆建章的供状，韦相国抄了一份送来：兵部抄本上那三句，是庾子建口述的。"
msgstr "Chancellor Wei had a copy of Luo Jianzhang's confession made and sent over. Those three lines in the Ministry of War copy were dictated by Yu Zijian."

msgid "把一本抄来的账和小屋那封信并排摊在案上。"
msgstr " lays an account book copied out and the letter from the little house side by side on the desk."

msgid "天驼关的账，小屋的信。原令烧了，案子没烧——本县又开了一回堂。"
msgstr "The Camelback Pass accounts, the letter from the little house. The original order was burned, but the case was not. This county has held court once more."

msgid "京城不回话，本县就一直不收卷。"
msgstr "Until the Capital answers, this county will keep the file open."

msgid "李信的账上了京，严将军回了京城。乔阴县的捕快，告下来一个镇国大将军——家叔要是知道，要笑三天。"
msgstr "Li Xin's accounts have gone up to the Capital, and General Yan has gone back there. A constable of Tallshade County brought down a Guardian General. If my uncle knew, he would laugh for three days."

msgid "严将军自己收拾了军师，路引停了。关上的事关上了——本县管不到天驼关，也只能这样。"
msgstr "General Yan dealt with his strategist himself, and the travel passes have stopped. What happened at the Pass is settled at the Pass. This county's reach does not extend to Camelback Pass, so it can only end this way."

msgid "严将军要自己收拾？军师还在帐里——他交给你拿，就去拿。"
msgstr "General Yan will deal with it himself? The strategist is still in his tent. He left him for you to take, so go and take him."

msgid "严将军认了印？那三天的账，副将李信记着。"
msgstr "General Yan acknowledged the seal? His deputy, Li Xin, kept the accounts for those three days."

msgid "路引上是天驼关的印。印在严将军手里——带着路引去天驼关，问他。"
msgstr "The pass bears the seal of Camelback Pass. The seal is in General Yan's hands. Take the pass to Camelback Pass and ask him."

msgid "两个都拿下了？路引带来本县看——问「路引」。"
msgstr "Both taken? Bring the passes here for this county to see. Ask about \"Travel Passes\"."

msgid "雪亭镇西边青石官道的路口、绮云镇口，两个挂着官府告示收过路费的。乔阴县衙没贴过那样的告示——拿下，搜身。"
msgstr "At the junction of the bluestone official road west of Snow Pavilion, and at the entrance to Cloudweave Town, two men are collecting tolls under government notices. Tallshade yamen never posted any such notice. Take them down and search them."

msgid "翻开巡捕的簿子，找到一个名字，又抬头看了你一眼。"
msgstr " opens the constables' register, finds a name, and looks up at you again."

msgid "偷东西被人当场拿住，簿子上记了不止十回。惯窃当捕快？"
msgstr "Caught red-handed stealing, and more than ten times by the register. A habitual thief as a constable?"

msgid "等街上把你忘了，再来。"
msgstr "Come back once the street has forgotten you."

msgid "从案下取出一块黑漆木牌，在背面烙了县印，推到你面前。"
msgstr " takes a black-lacquered wooden badge from under the desk, brands the county seal on its back and pushes it over to you."

msgid "陈显祖那件案子，你办得比本县的捕快干净。乔阴县缺一个不归庾家管、也不归叫花子管的人。"
msgstr "You handled the Chen Xianzu case more cleanly than this county's own constables would have. Tallshade County lacks someone who answers neither to the Yu family nor to the beggars."

msgid "这块腰牌带在身上，乔阴的巡捕认你。本县不给你俸禄，也不教你功夫——只给你案子。"
msgstr "Wear this badge and Tallshade's patrolmen will know you. This county pays you no salary and teaches you no martial arts. It only gives you cases."

msgid "京师今年要开武举。到时候带着腰牌去校武场报名——本县往兵部武选司递一封荐书，乔阴县保举的人，第一场免考。"
msgstr "The Capital holds the military examination this year. Take the badge to the Martial Grounds and register. This county will send a letter of recommendation to the Ministry of War's Bureau of Military Appointments. Anyone Tallshade County recommends is exempt from the first round."

msgid "头一件：雪亭镇西边青石官道的路口、绮云镇口，有人挂着官府的告示收过路费，黄金一两。乔阴县衙没贴过那样的告示——拿下，搜身，看看他们是哪个衙门的。"
msgstr "The first case: at the junction of the bluestone official road west of Snow Pavilion, and at the entrance to Cloudweave Town, men are collecting tolls under government notices, one tael of gold each. Tallshade yamen never posted such a notice. Take them down, search them, and see which office they come from."

msgid "本县的捕快够用。你是什么人？"
msgstr "This county has constables enough. Who are you?"

msgid "印是严将军的，他认了。剩下的，问天驼关的人。"
msgstr "The seal is General Yan's, and he acknowledged it. As for the rest, ask the people at Camelback Pass."

msgid "路引上是天驼关铁卫营的印。印在严将军手里——带着它去天驼关，问严廷殷。"
msgstr "The pass bears the seal of the Iron Guard Camp at Camelback Pass. The seal is in General Yan's hands. Take it to Camelback Pass and ask Yan Tingyin."

msgid "把路引摊在案上，一张一张翻过去，翻到一半停住了。"
msgstr " spreads the passes out on the desk and turns them over one by one, stopping halfway through."

msgid "空白的路引，填上名字就能过关。印是天驼关铁卫营的——严将军的大印。"
msgstr "Blank travel passes. Write in a name and you can go through the gate. The seal is the Camelback Pass Iron Guard Camp's, General Yan's own great seal."

msgid "天驼关收过路钱，不是新闻，家叔骂了他十年。可收到雪亭、绮云来，还打着官府的告示，一张路引卖一两黄金……"
msgstr "Camelback Pass collecting tolls is no news. My uncle has cursed him for it for ten years. But collecting them as far as Snow Pavilion and Cloudweave, under a government notice, one tael of gold a pass..."

msgid "这一方印是真是假，本县看不出来。印在严将军手里——带着路引去天驼关，问他。"
msgstr "This county cannot tell whether the seal is real or false. The seal is in General Yan's hands. Take the pass to Camelback Pass and ask him."

msgid "路引呢？搜出来的东西，要拿来本县看。"
msgstr "The passes? Whatever you found on them, bring it here for this county to see."

msgid "雪亭那个拿下了。绮云镇口还有一个——两个都拿下了再来。"
msgstr "The one at Snow Pavilion is taken. There is another at the entrance to Cloudweave Town. Come back when both are taken."

msgid "绮云那个拿下了。雪亭镇西边的路口还有一个——两个都拿下了再来。"
msgstr "The one at Cloudweave is taken. There is another at the junction west of Snow Pavilion. Come back when both are taken."

msgid "路引？先把收过路费的两个人拿下。"
msgstr "Travel passes? First take down the two men collecting tolls."

msgid "把密信交给程不平：他收下当物证，京师的事还没定的，揭发时照样算一样。\n花紫会的真龙头也要这封信——交给官府，花紫会那条线就断了，叫花子往后不跟你说正事。\n要交吗？"
msgstr "Hand the secret letter to Cheng Buping: he takes it as evidence. The Capital matter is not settled yet, and when it is exposed this letter will count just the same.\nThe Beggars' Guild's true leader wants this letter too. Give it to the government and the Guild's line is cut, and the beggars will not talk to you about serious matters again.\nHand it over?"

msgid "信在本县这里。案子还没完。"
msgstr "The letter is here with this county. The case is not over."

msgid "那封信，你给了叫花子？……本县不问了。"
msgstr "That letter, you gave it to the beggars? ...This county will not ask."

msgid "native:city/courier_letter"
msgstr "native:city/courier_letter"

msgid "展开信，看了很久。"
msgstr " unfolds the letter and reads it for a long time."

msgid "「湖底之事，子时前办妥。」——庾子建的字，兵部尚书的私印。本县认得。"
msgstr "\"The business at the bottom of the lake, see it done before midnight.\" Yu Zijian's handwriting, the Minister of War's private seal. This county knows both."

msgid "京师的事还没定的，到了朝上，本县替你作这一样的证；定了的，本县留着它——庾家的案子，总有再开的一天。"
msgstr "Where the matter in the Capital is not yet settled, this county will testify to this letter for you in court. Where it is settled, this county will keep it. The Yu family's case will be reopened some day."

msgid "信呢？拿来本县看。"
msgstr "The letter? Bring it for this county to see."

msgid "陈显祖的供词录下了，信也给了你。他留在内厅——庾家的人进不了这道门。"
msgstr "Chen Xianzu's statement is recorded, and the letter is yours. He stays in the inner hall. The Yu family's people cannot get through that door."

msgid "把录好的供词压在文书底下，另取一张纸写了一封信，封好，压上县印。"
msgstr " presses the recorded statement under the documents, takes another sheet of paper and writes a letter, then seals it and stamps it with the county seal."

msgid "堂没审完，供词本县录下了。这封信给家叔槐阳王——假印和失踪的人都往关北去了，拿着它去天驼关，军营的门会开。"
msgstr "The hearing is not finished, but this county has recorded the statement. This letter is for my uncle, the Prince of Huaiyang. The false seal and the missing people have all gone Beyond the Pass. Take it to Camelback Pass and the camp's gates will open."

msgid "陈显祖留在衙门里。庾家的人进不了这道门。"
msgstr "Chen Xianzu stays in the yamen. The Yu family's people cannot get through this door."

msgid "信给了你。本县只能照纸写——退堂。"
msgstr "The letter is in your hands. This county can only write by the paper. Court is adjourned."

msgid "对着抄本和文书上的印看了半晌，提笔写了一封信，封好，压上县印。"
msgstr " studies the copy against the seal on the document for a long while, then picks up the brush, writes a letter, seals it and stamps it with the county seal."

msgid "纸能证纸，不能证人。这封信给家叔槐阳王，本县只能照纸写——假印和失踪的人都往关北去了，拿着它去天驼关。"
msgstr "Paper can vouch for paper, not for people. This letter is for my uncle, the Prince of Huaiyang. This county can only write by the paper. The false seal and the missing people have all gone Beyond the Pass. Take it to Camelback Pass."

msgid "信呢？……丢了？"
msgstr "The letter? ...Lost?"

msgid "叹了口气，另取一张纸，照着底稿又写了一封，封好，压上县印。"
msgstr " sighs, takes another sheet of paper, writes it out again from the draft, then seals it and stamps it with the county seal."

msgid "县印还在本县手里，信就还写得出来。这回收好——拿着它去天驼关。"
msgstr "The county seal is still in this county's hands, so the letter can still be written. Keep it safe this time. Take it to Camelback Pass."

msgid "文书本县看过了，信也写了。拿着信去天驼关——假印和失踪的人都往关北去了。"
msgstr "This county has read the documents, and the letter is written. Take the letter to Camelback Pass. The false seal and the missing people have all gone Beyond the Pass."

msgid "文书本县看过了。印是真的——所以才要人证。福林酒楼里那位姓陈的武官，去问他。"
msgstr "This county has read the documents. The seal is genuine, and that is exactly why a witness is needed. The officer surnamed Chen at Fulin Tavern, go and ask him."

msgid "接过文书，一张一张看过去，看到末尾的印，看了很久。"
msgstr " takes the documents and looks through them one by one, and at the seal at the end for a long time."

msgid "印是兵部的，不假。纸是新的，字也是新的——这不是先帝的令。"
msgstr "The seal is the Ministry of War's, no forgery. But the paper is new and the writing is new. This is not the late emperor's order."

msgid "可要动兵部的人，须有人证：印是谁盖的，人去了哪，得有人站在这堂上说。纸能证纸，不能证人。"
msgstr "But to move against the Ministry of War's people, there must be a witness: who stamped the seal, where the people went. Someone must stand in this court and say it. Paper can vouch for paper, not for people."

msgid "本县指你一个人。福林酒楼里有个武官，姓陈，日日坐在堂下发呆，丢了一个箱子——二十年前老松岭那队白衣武官，他在里头。你把这文书拿给他看。"
msgstr "This county points you to one man. At Fulin Tavern there is an officer, surnamed Chen, who sits in a daze downstairs every day. He lost a chest. Twenty years ago he was among that company of Officers in White at Old Pine Ridge. Show him this document."

msgid "什么文书？拿来本县看看。"
msgstr "What document? Bring it, and this county will look."

msgid "陈显祖在内厅。他说的本县都录下了——有了他，这案子才是案子。"
msgstr "Chen Xianzu is in the inner hall. This county recorded everything he said. With him, this case is a case."

msgid "你放他走了。纸能证纸，不能证人——本县只能照纸写信。"
msgstr "You let him go. Paper can vouch for paper, not for people. This county can only write a letter by the paper."

msgid "福林酒楼里那位姓陈的武官。他知道的比他说的多——看他的脸就知道。"
msgstr "The officer surnamed Chen at Fulin Tavern. He knows more than he says. You can tell by looking at his face."

msgid "人证？你先把案子说给本县听。"
msgstr "A witness? First tell this county the case."

msgid "槐阳王"
msgstr "Prince of Huaiyang"

msgid "家叔。本县这个县官，是叔父保举的——所以乔阴县的衙门，不认兵部的私令。"
msgstr "My uncle. This county's magistrate was recommended by my uncle, and that is why the yamen of Tallshade County does not recognize the Ministry of War's private orders."

msgid "供词"
msgstr "Statement"

msgid "陈显祖的供词有力：原令只一句，征民夫、拿人的不是先帝的令——人证、物证都在。叔父见了这封信，关北的兵不会再替人修官道。"
msgstr "Chen Xianzu's statement carries weight: the original order was a single line, and whoever conscripted laborers and seized people was not acting on the late emperor's order. Witness and proof are both here. Once my uncle reads this letter, the soldiers Beyond the Pass will no longer build official roads for somebody else."

msgid "没有供词，只有纸。本县写信时迟疑了半晌——叔父信不信纸，本县不敢说。"
msgstr "There is no statement, only paper. This county hesitated a long while in writing. Whether my uncle will believe paper, this county cannot say."

msgid "还没有供词。"
msgstr "There is no statement yet."

msgid "拿起惊堂木，没有拍下去，放回了书案上。"
msgstr " picks up the gavel, does not bring it down, and sets it back on the desk."

msgid "堂下何人？"
msgstr "Who is down there?"

msgid "跪下了。"
msgstr " kneels down."

msgid "罪人陈显祖。二十年前老松岭那队白衣武官，罪人在其中。原令只一句——寻剑，不得扰民一户。征民夫、拿人的，不是先帝的令，是后头来的。"
msgstr "A guilty man, Chen Xianzu. Twenty years ago I was among that company of Officers in White at Old Pine Ridge. The original order was a single line: find the sword, and trouble not one household. The ones who conscripted laborers and seized people did not act on the late emperor's order. They came later."

msgid "抄本呈上来。"
msgstr "Present the copy."

msgid "接过抄本，对着文书上的印看了半晌，提笔录供。"
msgstr " takes the copy, compares it against the seal on the document for a long while, then picks up the brush and records the statement."

msgid "印是兵部的，令不是先帝的。录了。"
msgstr "The seal is the Ministry of War's, but the order is not the late emperor's. Recorded."

msgid "另取一张纸，写了一封信，封好，压上县印。"
msgstr " takes another sheet of paper, writes a letter, then seals it and stamps it with the county seal."

msgid "这封信给家叔槐阳王。假印和失踪的人都往关北去了——拿着它去天驼关，军营的门会开。"
msgstr "This letter is for my uncle, the Prince of Huaiyang. The false seal and the missing people have all gone Beyond the Pass. Take it to Camelback Pass and the camp's gates will open."

msgid "陈显祖，你留在衙门里。庾家的人进不了这道门。"
msgstr "Chen Xianzu, you will stay in the yamen. The Yu family's people cannot get through this door."

msgid "两名带刀侍卫领着陈显祖进了内厅。\n"
msgstr "Two armed guards lead Chen Xianzu into the inner hall."

msgid "看了看堂下——只有你一个人。"
msgstr " looks down the hall. There is only you."

msgid "人证呢？"
msgstr "Where is the witness?"

msgid "接过抄本，对着文书上的印看了半晌。"
msgstr " takes the copy and studies it against the seal on the document for a long while."

msgid "纸能证纸，不能证人。你放他走了。"
msgstr "Paper can vouch for paper, not for people. You let him go."

msgid "提笔，停了停，还是写了一封信，封好，压上县印。"
msgstr " picks up the brush, pauses, and writes a letter all the same, then seals it and stamps it with the county seal."

msgid "这封信给家叔槐阳王。本县只能照纸写——他信不信，本县不敢说。假印和失踪的人都往关北去了，拿着它去天驼关。"
msgstr "This letter is for my uncle, the Prince of Huaiyang. This county can only write by the paper, and whether he believes it, this county cannot say. The false seal and the missing people have all gone Beyond the Pass. Take it to Camelback Pass."

msgid "退堂。"
msgstr "Court is adjourned."

msgid "你上过水烟阁？那里有位南五长老——我们程家的人，家里当他死了二十年。……见没见过他，本县不问。"
msgstr "You have been to Waterfog Pavilion? There is a Fifth Elder there, Nan, a man of our Cheng family. At home we have treated him as dead for twenty years. ...Whether you have met him, this county does not ask."

msgid "说吧，你今天来，为的什么事。"
msgstr "Speak. What brings you here today?"

msgid "水烟阁来了消息：南五长老装死二十年，让人告到了长老会。那是我们程家的人。……你来乔阴，是为别的事吧。说。"
msgstr "News has come from Waterfog Pavilion: Fifth Elder Nan faked his death for twenty years, and someone has brought him before the Elders' Council. He is one of ours, a Cheng. ...You came to Tallshade for some other matter, surely. Speak."

msgid "一个衣饰华丽的妇人正跪在这里虔诚地膜拜著。\n"
msgstr "A richly dressed woman kneeling here, praying devoutly."

msgid "一个相貌俊美的年轻贵公子正优雅地欣赏著窗外的景物。\n"
msgstr "A handsome young nobleman, gracefully admiring the view outside the window."

msgid "在下姓游，单名一个晋字，不知阁下如何称呼？"
msgstr "My surname is You, and my given name is Jin. And how should I address you?"

msgid "这里是乔阴县城，您是外地来的吧？"
msgstr "This is Tallshade. You're not from these parts, are you?"

msgid "实不相瞒，在下仰慕前面曲桥上赏莲的姑娘已久 ..."
msgstr "To tell you the truth, I have long admired a young lady who was enjoying the lotus on the zigzag bridge ahead..."

msgid "但是一直不知那位姑娘芳名 ..."
msgstr "But I have never learned that young lady's name..."

msgid "唉 ..."
msgstr "Ah..."

msgid "就是那位绿裙黄衫的姑娘 ..."
msgstr "The one in the green skirt and yellow blouse..."

msgid "贵公子一眼瞥见荷包上的鸳鸯图案，立刻一把抢了过去。"
msgstr "The young nobleman catches sight of the mandarin ducks on the pouch and snatches it away at once."

msgid "贵公子随即从怀中掏出一方手帕，上面竟也绣著一幅相同的鸳鸯图。"
msgstr "Then he pulls a handkerchief from his robe, and it turns out to be embroidered with the very same pair of ducks."

msgid "原来爹爹替我主张的婚事，竟然是 ..."
msgstr "So the marriage Father arranged for me turns out to be..."

msgid "一个穿著家人服色的男子，必恭必敬地垂手站在一旁。\n"
msgstr "A man in a household servant's livery, standing respectfully to one side with his hands at his sides."

msgid "一个身穿蓝布衣的人，从他锐利的眼神跟神情，显然是个练家子。\n"
msgstr "A man in blue cloth. From his sharp eyes and bearing, he is plainly a martial artist."

msgid "掌柜的有交代，不准任何人在这里打架！"
msgstr "The boss said nobody fights in here!"

msgid "干什么？！"
msgstr "What are you doing?!"

msgid "有强人打劫哪... 快去报官！"
msgstr "Robbers! Someone's being robbed... Quick, go report it to the yamen!"

msgid "（福林酒楼报了官：从此守城官兵和县城官兵见到你就会动手。）"
msgstr "(Fulin Tavern has reported you to the yamen: from now on the city guards and the town's soldiers will attack you on sight.)"

msgid "他白发苍苍,老态龙钟.\n他终年采药于深山，当有些不同凡响之处。\n他宽五尺，高三尺.你实在无法理解他怎么这么的胖。\n"
msgstr "His hair is white and he is bent with age.\nHe has gathered herbs deep in the mountains all year round, so there must be something out of the ordinary about him.\nHe is five feet wide and three feet tall. You really cannot understand how he got so fat."

msgid "老者说道：哎。。。你这可怜的孩子，饿得面黄肌瘦的。"
msgstr "The old man says, \"Ah... you poor child, so hungry you are all skin and bones.\""

msgid "老者抚摸着你的头，老泪纵横。"
msgstr "The old man strokes your head, tears streaming down his face."

msgid "老者拈起衣角擦了擦眼角的浊泪。"
msgstr "The old man picks up the hem of his clothes and wipes the muddy tears from the corners of his eyes."

msgid "我给你的山药蛋好吃吗??"
msgstr "Did the yam I gave you taste good??"

msgid "老者抚摸着你的头，老泪纵横。\n说道：哎。。。你这可怜的孩子，饿得面黄肌瘦的。\n老者哆哆嗦嗦从怀里拿出个小布包，打开一层又一层，打开一层又一层..最后拿出个小山药蛋塞到你手里。"
msgstr "The old man strokes your head, tears streaming down his face.\nHe says, \"Ah... you poor child, so hungry you are all skin and bones.\"\nWith trembling hands the old man takes a small cloth bundle from his coat. He unwraps layer after layer, layer after layer... and at last takes out a little yam and presses it into your hand."

msgid "老者捂著受伤的地方，白发散乱，勉强稳住身行。"
msgstr "The old man clutches his wound, his white hair disheveled, barely keeping his footing."

msgid "老者从口袋摸出一粒象小山药蛋的仙豆吞了下去。"
msgstr "The old man takes a magic bean from his pocket, shaped like a little yam, and swallows it."

msgid "采药老者眼放异光，说道：你真的不喜欢山药蛋吗??"
msgstr "The herb gatherer's eyes flash strangely, and he says, \"You really do not like yams??\""

msgid "沉吟半响道：既然如此，老头子今天豁出去了，纳命来！"
msgstr "After a long moment's thought he says, \"In that case, this old fellow will risk everything today. Hand over your life!\""

msgid "山药蛋双手一招，一团黑雾涌起......"
msgstr "The yam waves both hands, and a cloud of black mist rises..."

msgid "只听见「砰」地一声，你像一捆稻草般飞了出去！！"
msgstr "With a loud \"bang\", you fly off like a bundle of straw!!"

msgid "鬼门关 "
msgstr "Ghost Gate"

msgid "    这里就是著名的阴间入口「鬼门关」，在你面前矗立著一座高大的\n黑色城楼，许多亡魂正哭哭啼啼地列队前进，因为一进鬼门关就无法再\n回阳间了。"
msgstr "This is the famous entrance to the underworld, the \"Ghost Gate\". Before you rises a tall black gate tower, and many dead souls are lining up, weeping, to march forward, because once through the Ghost Gate there is no returning to the world of the living."

msgid "    这里明显的出口是北边和南边。"
msgstr "The obvious exits are north and south."

msgid "黑无常发出一阵像呻吟的声音，当他发现你正注视著他的时候，瞪了你一眼。"
msgstr "Black Impermanence lets out a moaning sound, and glares at you when he notices you watching him."

msgid "黑无常说道：喂！新来的，你叫什么名字？ "
msgstr "Black Impermanence says, \"Hey! Newcomer! What is your name?\""

msgid "黑无常「哼」的一声，从袖中掏出一本像帐册的东西翻看著。"
msgstr "Black Impermanence gives a \"hmph\" and pulls something like an account book from his sleeve, flipping through it."

msgid "黑无常阁上册子，说道：咦？阳寿未尽？怎么可能？"
msgstr "Black Impermanence shuts the book and says, \"Hm? Your allotted years are not up? How can that be?\""

msgid "黑无常搔了搔头，叹道：罢了罢了，你走吧。"
msgstr "Black Impermanence scratches his head and sighs, \"Forget it, forget it. Go on, off with you.\""

msgid "一股阴冷的浓雾突然出现，很快地包围了你。"
msgstr "A cold, thick fog suddenly appears and quickly closes in around you."

msgid "你觉得有什么地方不对了，使劲掐了一下自己，你惨叫了一声:哇，好痛啊～～～～～～"
msgstr "You feel that something is wrong. You pinch yourself hard and yelp, \"Waaah, that hurts~~~~~~\""

msgid "你出窍的真魂绕了一大圈，终于归位了。"
msgstr "Your spirit, slipped out of your body, circles round and round, and at last settles back in place."

msgid "黑雾慢慢消散了"
msgstr "The black mist slowly clears."

msgid "山药蛋就地一滚，没入土中不见了......"
msgstr "The yam rolls on the ground and vanishes into the earth..."

msgid "老者骨碌碌就地打了个滚，说道：我赢了！"
msgstr "The old man tumbles over on the ground and says, \"I win!\""

msgid "白羽如雪，不似凡间之物。 \n"
msgstr "Feathers white as snow, not of this mortal world."

msgid "翅"
msgstr "wing"

msgid "紫衣童子是乔阴县的小孩，从小孤苦零丁。仙人怜之，带入云台。\n"
msgstr "The Boy in Purple is a child of Tallshade, orphaned and alone from early on. An immortal took pity on him and brought him up to Cloud Terrace."

msgid "紫衣童子躬身一揖。 \n"
msgstr "The Boy in Purple bows deeply with cupped hands."

msgid "童子说道：仙人 ，只在此山中，云深不知处。\n"
msgstr "The boy says, \"The immortal is right here in these mountains, but the clouds are deep and I do not know where.\""

msgid "紫衣童子拧眉说道：你欺负我年纪小是吗？\n"
msgstr "The Boy in Purple frowns and says, \"You are bullying me because I am small, aren't you?\""

msgid "紫衣童子笑道：你杀不死我的。\n"
msgstr "The Boy in Purple laughs, \"You cannot kill me.\""

msgid "紫衣童子冲你一龇牙, 说道: 您盗过古墓吗?\n"
msgstr "The Boy in Purple bares his teeth at you and says, \"Have you ever robbed an ancient tomb?\""

msgid "仙人"
msgstr "Immortal"

msgid "只度有缘人。"
msgstr "I only ferry the fated."

msgid "一个高大的身影，看起来像是个人，不过 ....\n"
msgstr "A tall figure that looks like a person, but..."

msgid "看守忘忧草的护草神兽。\n"
msgstr "The sacred beast that guards the forget-worry grass."

msgid "     巡捕个个身手矫健，强盗、山贼无不闻风丧胆。\n"
msgstr "Every constable is nimble and strong. Robbers and bandits lose heart at the mere rumor of them."

msgid "巡捕说道：你想干什么? 还不跟我去县衙受审!?\n"
msgstr "The constable says, \"What do you think you are doing? Come with me to the yamen for trial!\""

msgid "巡捕说道：大胆! 居然敢当街拒捕! 想造反？\n"
msgstr "The constable says, \"How dare you! Resisting arrest in the open street! Do you want to rebel?\""

msgid "巡捕手中的刀越砍越快，让你应接不暇。\n"
msgstr "The constable's blade comes down faster and faster, leaving you barely able to keep up."

msgid "巡捕说道：别胡闹了，还是乖乖的跟我走吧。\n"
msgstr "The constable says, \"Stop this nonsense and come along quietly.\""

msgid "贿赂"
msgstr "Bribe"

msgid "说哪里话来，县太爷清贫廉正，我们作手下的岂能辱没他的名声？\n收起你的钱吧！\n"
msgstr "What are you saying? The magistrate is poor and upright. How could we, his men, disgrace his name?\nPut your money away!"

msgid "年饷"
msgstr "Annual Pay"

msgid "哎，老爷俸银微薄，我们的年饷自然更少了......\n"
msgstr "Ah, His Honor's salary is meager, so our annual pay is naturally even less..."

msgid "说实在的，我也想要钱。但要是让老爷知道了我收受贿赂，\n不死也得扒层皮\n"
msgstr "To tell the truth, I would like money too. But if His Honor found out I had taken a bribe,\nI would be skinned alive, if not killed."

msgid "闹了半天原来{name}是个贼啊! 我走一趟吧!"
msgstr "So {name} is a thief after all! Come, I will take you in!"

msgid "嘿嘿, 还想往哪逃?!"
msgstr "Heh, where do you think you are running to?!"

msgid "老爷，人犯已带到，小人巡街去了。"
msgstr "Your Honor, the culprit has been brought in. This humble one is going back to patrol the streets."

msgid "这怎么好?......要是让老爷知道了......"
msgstr "How can I... If His Honor found out..."

msgid "盛情难却....我就收下了.."
msgstr "Since you press me... I will take it..."

msgid "你这是什么意思?......谁稀罕你的钱?!"
msgstr "What do you mean by this?... Who wants your money?!"

msgid "这里乔阴县城的北门，一座高大的石牌楼上面刻著「北门」两个大\n字，一条黄土路往北穿过一片松树林，青郁郁地通往北边的山上，石牌\n楼旁蹲著两只石狮，由于乔阴县城最热闹的火龙将军庙远在城南，因此\n北门这一带反而显得比较冷清，和附近的乡村一般的宁静纯朴。\n"
msgstr "This is the north gate of Tallshade. A tall stone archway carved with the two characters for \"North Gate\" stands here, and a yellow dirt road runs north through a stretch of pine woods, lush and green, up into the mountains. Two stone lions crouch beside the archway. Since the Fire Dragon Temple, the liveliest spot in Tallshade, lies far to the south, the area around the north gate is rather quiet, as peaceful and plain as the nearby countryside."

msgid "你现在正走在一条宽敞的街道上，这里是乔阴县城联通北门与南\n门的福林大街，街道两旁有做生意的，有做粗活的，这里的老百姓大多\n是老老实实的农人与工匠，街上卖的也多半是一些日用品，往东边是一\n条小巷子，南边的街道似乎比较热闹一些，北边则是北门。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a wide street, Fulin Street, which links the north and south gates of Tallshade. There are shops and workshops on both sides, and the people here are mostly honest farmers and craftsmen. What is sold in the street is mostly everyday goods. A small lane leads east, the street to the south seems livelier, and to the north is the north gate."

msgid "你现在正走在一条宽敞的街道上，这里是乔阴县联通南北城门的福\n林大街，街道从这里向南北延伸，往北远远地可以望见北门的石牌楼，\n南边不远处则是乔阴县城著名的地标「树王坟」，你的东边有一家三层\n楼的酒馆，西边则是远近驰名的老姚布庄，街上不时有贩夫走卒穿梭\n而过，十分热闹。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a wide street, Fulin Street, which links the north and south gates of Tallshade. The street runs north and south from here. To the north you can see the stone archway of the north gate in the distance, and a little way south stands the famous landmark of Tallshade, the Tree King's Tomb. To your east is a three-story tavern, and to your west the far-famed Old Yao's Cloth Shop. Peddlers and porters dart through the street from time to time, and it is very busy."

msgid "你现在正走在一条宽敞的大街上，街道往北边笔直地延伸，南边则\n是一个隆起的石台，你可以看见石台前有块石碑，上书「树王坟」三个\n大字，街道的东边和西边都是石板空地，围绕著树王坟成为一个圆环，\n许多小贩客商都聚集在这里交易买卖。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a wide avenue. The street runs straight north, and to the south rises a raised stone platform with a stone tablet in front of it, bearing the three big characters \"Tree King's Tomb\". East and west of the street are open stretches of flagstones, forming a ring around the Tree King's Tomb, where many peddlers and merchants gather to trade."

msgid "这里是树王坟西北边的石板空地，因为树王的根范围太广，因此树\n王坟周围十几丈都没有办法盖房子，因此这里铺了石板，平时便当作百\n姓散步休憩的地方。\n"
msgstr "This is the flagstone plaza northwest of the Tree King's Tomb. The Tree King's roots spread so wide that no house can be built within a hundred feet or so of the tomb, so the ground here is paved with flagstones, and the common people usually stroll and rest here."

msgid "这里是乔阴县城的西大街.\n"
msgstr "This is West Street in Tallshade."

msgid "这里是乔阴县城的西大街，东边不远处的石台便是远近驰名的「树\n王坟」，西大街往西一直通往西城门，街道两边有许多的商店，街上人\n来人往好不热闹。\n"
msgstr "This is West Street in Tallshade. A short way east, the stone platform is the far-famed Tree King's Tomb. West Street runs west all the way to the west gate. There are many shops along both sides, and people come and go in a bustle."

msgid "这里是乔阴县城的西大街，西门就在你的西边几十丈外，望东则是\n通往乔阴县的著名地标「树王坟」，街上有许多商店，北边是一家大酒\n楼，南边则有一间染坊。\n"
msgstr "This is West Street in Tallshade. The west gate lies a few hundred feet west of you, and looking east you can see the famous landmark of Tallshade, the Tree King's Tomb. There are many shops in the street, a large tavern to the north and a dye works to the south."

msgid "这里是乔阴县城的西大街，西边就是县城的西门，一座巨大的牌楼\n上刻著「西门」二字，往北有一条小巷，南边则是一间书肆，街道中央\n立著一尊石狮，而且是站著的，将来往行人分为左右两道。\n"
msgstr "This is West Street in Tallshade. To the west is the town's west gate, a huge archway carved with the two characters for \"West Gate\". A lane leads north, and to the south is a bookshop. In the middle of the street stands a stone lion, and it is standing upright, splitting the traffic into a left lane and a right lane."

msgid "你现在来到了著名的「树王坟」前，这里是个高台，中央约两丈见方\n的地上有一截巨大的树桩，少说有三、四十人合抱那么粗，树桩中间有一\n个大洞，望下去黑漆漆地，石台靠南的地方还有一间小庙\n，东西南北四个方向都有阶梯通往四面的街道。\n"
msgstr "You have arrived before the famous Tree King's Tomb. It is a high platform, and in the middle, on a patch of ground about twenty feet square, sits the huge stump of a tree, easily thirty or forty people's embrace around. In the middle of the stump is a great hole, pitch black when you look down. Toward the south end of the platform stands a small shrine. Steps lead down from all four sides, north, south, east and west, to the streets."

msgid "    这里是乔阴县城的东大街，西边不远处的石台便是远近驰名的「树\n王坟」，东大街往东一直通往东城门，街道两边有许多的民宅，街上行\n人渐稀。\n"
msgstr "This is East Street in Tallshade. A short way west, the stone platform is the far-famed Tree King's Tomb. East Street runs east all the way to the east gate. There are many dwellings along both sides, and fewer and fewer people are about."

msgid "    这里乔阴县城的东门，一座高大的石牌楼上面刻著「北门」两个大\n字，一条土路青郁郁地通往南边的山上，石牌楼旁蹲著一只铁狮. 与南\n北两城门相比, 北门这一带显得比较冷清，偶见几个采药, 砍柴之人由\n此出入。\n\n"
msgstr "This is the east gate of Tallshade, a tall stone archway carved with the two characters for \"East Gate\". A lush green dirt road leads south to the mountains, and an iron lion crouches beside the archway. Compared with the south and north gates, this area is rather quiet, and only the occasional herb gatherer or woodcutter passes in and out."

msgid "这里是乔阴县城的福林大街，往北是一座高台，台上便是著名的「\n树王坟」，打从这里往南就是乔阴县最热闹的街道，接上来往的行商贩\n子也最多，你的东边和西边都是石板空地，平常的市集便在此处，遇到\n赛会节庆这里更是挤得水泄不通，福林大街往南是个路口。\n"
msgstr "This is Fulin Street in Tallshade. To the north is a high platform, and on it the famous Tree King's Tomb. From here south is the busiest street in Tallshade, with the most traveling merchants and peddlers coming and going. To your east and west are open stretches of flagstones, where the regular market is held. On festival and fair days it is jammed with people. South along Fulin Street is a crossroads."

msgid "这里是乔阴县城的福林大街，东首一栋雕梁画栋，美仑美奂的华厦\n便是乔阴县最大的酒楼「福林楼」，不但乔阴县城的富商大贾常来此楼\n饮宴，就连方圆百里内的许多豪门巨绅也常常到这里喝酒，西边是一条\n宽敞的青石官道，通往县府衙门，街道往南则是热闹的南门广场。\n"
msgstr "This is Fulin Street in Tallshade. To the east stands a magnificent building with carved beams and painted rafters, Fulin Tavern, the biggest tavern in Tallshade. Not only the rich merchants of the town dine here, but many wealthy gentry from within a hundred li come to drink. To the west a broad bluestone official road leads to the county yamen, and south along the street is the lively South Gate Square."

msgid "这里便是乔阴县驰名远近的福林酒楼，连乔阴县最热闹的一条大街\n都以此命名，福林酒楼是一家近百年老店，传到现在的这位掌柜已经是\n第三代，如果你是初到此地的外地人，不妨和他攀攀交情，酒楼一楼多\n半是县城里熟客人，东北边有一道方梯通往楼上雅座，往西则可以出大\n街。\n"
msgstr "This is the far-famed Fulin Tavern of Tallshade, after which even the busiest street in the county is named. It is a century-old establishment, and the present shopkeeper is the third generation. If you are a stranger new to these parts, you might try making friends with him. The first floor is mostly local regulars. To the northeast a square staircase leads up to the private rooms on the second floor, and to the west you can go out to the street."

msgid "这里便是乔阴县城最大的一处广场，往北是贯通县城南北门的福林\n大道，往东则是一个绿柳环绕的湖泊「翠柳湖」，广场上只见卖艺的，\n卖糖葫芦的，捏面人的，各色小贩穿梭来去，广场中央有一口大井，井\n旁用绳索绑著几只杯子供人取水喝，南门的牌楼因为几年前改建\n翠柳湖的曲桥，因此移到西边的县府衙门所在的昌平街，现在广场的南\n面就是一座曲桥通往湖东岸的雨桥庄，西南边一条宽敞的街道沿著湖岸\n通往城外，广场的西边则一直延伸到昌平街。\n"
msgstr "This is the largest square in Tallshade. To the north, Fulin Street runs through the town between the north and south gates, and to the east is a lake ringed by green willows, Green Willow Lake. In the square you see street performers, candied-haw sellers, dough-figure makers, all kinds of peddlers weaving back and forth. In the middle of the square is a large well, with several cups tied to it by ropes for people to take a drink. A few years ago, when the zigzag bridge over Green Willow Lake was rebuilt, the south gate archway was moved west to Changping Street, where the county yamen is. Now to the south of the square a zigzag bridge leads across to Rain Bridge Manor on the east shore of the lake, a wide street to the southwest runs along the lakeshore out of town, and to the west the square extends all the way to Changping Street."

msgid "这里是乔阴县城城南的承安街，街道十分宽敞，南北两边都是一些\n贩卖南北货、日用品的商店，这里虽然正当乔阴县人车来往最频繁的要\n冲，可是却没有福林大街热闹，往东走便是南门广场，往西则是和昌平\n街的交叉路口。\n"
msgstr "This is Cheng'an Street, in the south of Tallshade. The street is very wide, with shops selling goods from north and south and daily necessities on both its north and south sides. Though this is the thoroughfare where people and carts come and go most in Tallshade, it is not as busy as Fulin Street. East leads to South Gate Square, and west to the crossroads with Changping Street."

msgid "这里是乔阴县城南的承安街，往东可以通往热闹的南门广场，西边\n的路口则是通往县府衙门的昌平街，街道北边是一些贩卖日常用具的商\n店，南边则是一块空地，从这里可以看到南边的城墙。\n"
msgstr "This is Cheng'an Street, in the south of Tallshade. East leads to the busy South Gate Square, and the crossroads to the west leads to Changping Street and the county yamen. To the north of the street are shops selling daily goods, and to the south is an empty lot, from which you can see the city wall to the south."

msgid "这里是昌平街跟承安街的交叉路口，往南就是乔阴县城的南门，往\n北不远处则是衙门的所在地，乔阴县到了这里显得格外安静，路人大多\n沈默地走著，不敢大声喧哗，和城东的花花世界相比，这里显得宁静许\n多。\n"
msgstr "This is the crossroads of Changping Street and Cheng'an Street. South leads to the south gate of Tallshade, and a little way north is the yamen. Here the town grows especially quiet. Passers-by mostly walk in silence, not daring to speak loudly, and compared with the bustle of the east of town, the place is far more peaceful."

msgid "这里是乔阴县府衙门的大门，就像你印象中的衙门一般，高大的大\n门、两只巨大的石狮、以及一种令人为之肃然的气氛。门口有一面大皮\n鼓，不用说，这当然是让百姓击鼓申冤用的，乔阴县的知县据说\n是槐阳王的侄子，虽然算不上是包青天，不过倒也没有听说过有什么贪\n赃枉法的劣迹。\n"
msgstr "This is the gate of the county yamen of Tallshade, just like the yamen you picture: a tall gate, two huge stone lions, and an air that commands respect. By the gate hangs a big leather drum, which of course is for common people to beat when they have a grievance. The magistrate of Tallshade is said to be the nephew of the Prince of Huaiyang. He is no Justice Bao, but you have never heard of any corruption or abuse of the law either."

msgid "这里是乔阴县城的南门，由于这个南门是十多年前重建的，因此和\n古老斑驳的东、西、北门相比，南门显得漂亮许多，而且南门正对著县\n府衙门，平日的修缮当然也勤快些。乔阴县城南门外住著许多上次羿水\n河鲁公堤溃决之后迁来的农民，因此虽然出了城门，街道依然人来人往\n，往东是一条沿著城墙的街道，可以经过火龙将军庙入城，西边的街道\n沿著城墙通往新建的驿站，往南则是许多房舍与农田。\n"
msgstr "This is the south gate of Tallshade. The south gate was rebuilt a dozen or so years ago, so it looks much nicer than the old, weathered east, west and north gates, and since it faces the county yamen, it is naturally kept up more diligently. Outside the south gate live many farmers who moved here after the Lu Gong Dike on the Yi River broke last time, so even outside the gate the street is still full of people coming and going. East, a street runs along the city wall and enters the town by way of the Fire Dragon Temple. West, a street runs along the wall to the newly built post station. South are many houses and fields."

msgid "这里是乔阴县城香火最盛的火龙将军庙，火龙将军据说就是两百年\n前率领官兵和杀死树王的骷髅妖怪作战的黎方黎将军，这里就是当年火\n龙将军驻兵扎营之处，如果你想知道火龙将军的事迹，不妨问问附近的\n年长的居民，将军庙的建筑十分奇特，一条道路东西贯通庙的中央，而\n火龙将军的神像立在横跨道路的一个高台上，往来的行人都从火龙将军\n的脚底走过，要上香的信徒必须从南北两边的阶梯爬上高台。\n"
msgstr "This is the Fire Dragon Temple, the most heavily incensed in Tallshade. The Fire Dragon General is said to be General Li Fang, who two hundred years ago led government troops against the skeleton demons that killed the Tree King, and this is where the general camped his troops. If you want to know about the general's deeds, you might ask the older residents nearby. The temple's architecture is very unusual: a road runs east and west through the middle of the temple, and the statue of the Fire Dragon General stands on a raised platform spanning the road, so everyone passing walks beneath the general's feet. Worshippers who want to burn incense must climb the steps at the south and north sides up to the platform."

msgid "这是一条沿著湖岸的街道，往东北可以通到人车来往的南门广场，\n这一带原本是在乔阴县城的旧南门之外，因此仍然保留浓厚的乡村气息\n，往南是一条小路继续沿著湖岸通往翠柳湖南岸，街道往东通往著名的\n火龙将军庙。\n"
msgstr "This is a street along the lakeshore. Northeast it leads to the South Gate Square with its traffic of people and carts. This area used to lie outside Tallshade's old south gate, so it still keeps a strong country feel. To the south a small path continues along the lakeshore to the south shore of Green Willow Lake, and east the street leads to the famous Fire Dragon Temple."

msgid "这是一座弯弯曲曲的曲桥，横过翠柳湖连接东岸的雨桥庄跟西岸的\n乔阴县城，从这里可以欣赏翠柳湖的美景，许多睡莲散布在桥墩四周，\n湖面飘著数不尽的浮萍，浮萍底下有不少艳红锦鲤穿梭来去。\n"
msgstr "This is a zigzag bridge winding across Green Willow Lake, joining Rain Bridge Manor on the east shore to the town of Tallshade on the west. You can enjoy the beauty of Green Willow Lake from here. Many water lilies are scattered around the bridge piers, countless duckweeds drift on the lake, and under the duckweed many bright red koi dart back and forth."

msgid "这里是雨桥庄西边的曼雩台，也是乔阴县城的文人墨客时常聚集谈\n论诗文的地方，台宽约十丈，西边是连接乔阴县城的翠柳曲桥，从翠柳\n湖中的片片睡莲中弯弯曲曲地通往西边的广场，北边和南边各有数十根\n梁柱，常有许多落拓的士人将他们的作品贴在这里希望得到贵人赏识，\n往东是一片桃树林，春天时和翠柳湖畔的柳树相辉映，蔚为乔阴县的第\n一盛景。\n"
msgstr "This is the Rain Dance Terrace at the west of Rain Bridge Manor, where the scholars and literati of Tallshade often gather to talk poetry and prose. The terrace is about a hundred feet wide. To the west is the Green Willow zigzag bridge, winding through the water lilies of Green Willow Lake to the square in the west. North and south stand dozens of beams and pillars, where many down-at-heel scholars post their works in hope of a patron's notice. To the east is a peach grove, which in spring sets off the willows along Green Willow Lake and makes the finest sight in Tallshade."

msgid "这是很大的一片桃林。每年花开的季节，这里一片桃花灿烂，总引得\n邻近的镇集的游客来观看，甚至京城的游客也不乏其人。桃林中阡陌纵横\n，不熟悉此地的游客经常迷路。当然啦，一些先行者在桃树枝上挂了些字\n条以指示道路。看。。字条在那儿。。\n"
msgstr "This is a very large peach grove. Every year when the blossoms open, the grove is ablaze with peach flowers and draws visitors from neighboring towns, even from the Capital. Paths crisscross through the grove, and visitors who do not know the place often get lost. Of course, some who went before have hung slips of paper in the peach branches to point the way. Look... there is a slip of paper."

msgid "院内草木繁茂,亭榭错落有致,可见这位县太爷也是位雅人.\n"
msgstr "Within the yard, plants and trees grow thick, and pavilions and kiosks are spaced just so. The magistrate is evidently a man of refinement."

msgid "正中高悬一匾,匾下的书案上放着笔,墨,纸,砚,惊堂木等物.两旁各置屏风.堂下摆着各式刑具,你从未见过.\n"
msgstr "High up in the center hangs a plaque (board), and on the desk beneath it lie brush, ink, paper, inkstone, a gavel and other things. Screens stand on both sides. Instruments of punishment of every kind are laid out below the hall, such as you have never seen."

msgid "内厅是老爷与好友叙话, 品茶, 吟诗, 作画之所; 格外幽静......\n"
msgstr "The inner hall is where His Honor chats with friends, sips tea, composes poems and paints. It is especially quiet..."

msgid "这里就是奉祀火龙将军的大殿，火龙将军高大威武的神像\n就立在你的面前，旁边还有火龙将军的部属虎豹熊鹰四位将军，你现在\n所站的地方是横过街道而建的一个高台，隔著栏杆可以看见下面的街道\n川流不息的人群，南北各有一道阶梯往下回到街道。\n"
msgstr "This is the great hall that honors the Fire Dragon General. The tall, majestic statue of the Fire Dragon General stands right before you, and beside it are four of his lieutenants, the Tiger, Leopard, Bear and Eagle generals. You are standing on a raised platform built across the street. Through the railing you can see the crowds streaming along the street below, and steps at the south and north lead down to the street."

msgid "这里是福林酒楼的二楼雅座，这里的客人大多衣冠鲜明，若不是富\n豪巨绅，便是秀才举人，使你不知不觉跟著斯文起来，从这里可以眺望\n乔阴县城的市景，东边不远处隔著几栋建筑便是县府衙门，南边是碧波\n荡漾的翠柳湖，湖对岸的雨桥庄在柳树间若隐若现，东边许多民房，再\n过去便是一方方的稻田，北边可望见树王坟的石台，以及乔阴县城北的\n建筑。你可以沿角落的方梯回到一楼，或者到三楼的客房。\n"
msgstr "These are the second-floor private rooms of Fulin Tavern. The guests here are mostly smartly dressed: if not rich gentry, then licentiates and provincial graduates, and you find yourself growing refined without noticing. From here you can look out over the town. A few buildings away to the east is the county yamen, to the south is the sparkling Green Willow Lake with Rain Bridge Manor half hidden among the willows on the far shore, to the east are many dwellings and beyond them checkered rice paddies, and to the north you can see the platform of the Tree King's Tomb and the buildings in the north of town. You can go back down to the first floor by the square stairs in the corner, or up to the guest rooms on the third floor."

msgid "这里是福林酒楼的客房，住的都是一些从外地来的富商大贾，为了\n预防宵小盗窃财物，福林酒楼的汤掌柜特别雇请了许多武师担任守卫的\n工作，往下可以回到二楼。\n"
msgstr "These are the guest rooms of Fulin Tavern, where the guests are all wealthy merchants from elsewhere. To guard against thieves, Shopkeeper Tang of Fulin Tavern has hired many martial arts masters as guards. Down leads back to the second floor."

msgid "这里是树王坟内部的树洞，由于这棵大树实在太大，因此你站在树\n洞里，一点也不觉得局促，树洞约有两个人的高度那么深，你可以攀附\n粗糙的洞壁往上离开，东边的树根比较少，露出一些土层，北边跟西边\n则是树洞的另一端。\n"
msgstr "This is the hollow inside the Tree King's Tomb. The tree is so huge that you do not feel cramped standing in the hollow at all. The hollow is about two people deep, and you can climb up the rough wall to leave. The east side has fewer roots and shows some layers of earth, and north and west are the other end of the hollow."

msgid "这里是树王坟树洞的内部，你的北、西、南三面都是盘根错节的树\n根，地面上铺著一堆乾草，似乎有人睡过的样子，往东的出口通往树洞\n的另一端。\n"
msgstr "This is inside the hollow of the Tree King's Tomb. To your north, west and south are tangled masses of roots. A pile of dry grass lies on the ground, as if someone has slept here. The exit to the east leads to the other end of the hollow."

msgid "这里是树王坟树洞的内部，你在这里可以闻到一股浓郁的檀香，奇\n怪的是，这棵大树并不是檀木，却不知这股香味从哪里来？往南的出口\n通往树洞的另一端。\n"
msgstr "This is inside the hollow of the Tree King's Tomb. Here you can smell a rich sandalwood fragrance. Strangely, the great tree is not sandalwood, so where could the fragrance come from? The exit to the south leads to the other end of the hollow."

msgid "洞内黑漆漆的，几乎什么都看不见，只是在一个角落里\n有两点红光闪烁，凭你多年的经验，那一定是一双野兽的眼\n睛。这个地方最好不要久留。\n"
msgstr "The cave is pitch black and you can hardly see anything, except that in one corner two points of red light flicker. From your years of experience, that must be a pair of beast's eyes. Best not to stay long here."

msgid "黄土铺就的小路.阴雨天,泥泞难行.往南就上山了.\n"
msgstr "A path of packed yellow earth. In rainy weather it is muddy and hard to walk. South of here the way goes up into the mountains."

msgid "荒野中的小路,依稀可变,蜿蜒曲折,不知通向何方.\n"
msgstr "A little path through the wilds, barely discernible, winding and twisting, leading who knows where."

msgid "云梦大泽八百里,雾气沼沼,商旅绝行.\n"
msgstr "Yunmeng Marsh stretches eight hundred li, shrouded in mist. Traveling merchants no longer pass this way."

msgid "    铺路的青石采自桐柏山.因行人稀少,已快被茅草遮没.\n"
msgstr "The bluestone paving this road was quarried from Mount Tongbai. Few people pass, and it is nearly buried under thatch grass."

msgid "铺路的青石采自桐柏山.因行人稀少,已快被茅草遮没.\n"
msgstr "The bluestone paving this road was quarried from Mount Tongbai. Few people pass, and it is nearly buried under thatch grass."

msgid "此地山势平缓,山坡尽是湘妃竹.南面就是桐柏山了,西面即为隐士结庐修身之所\n.往北可见下山的青石小径.\n"
msgstr "Here the mountains are gentle, and the slopes are covered with mottled bamboo. To the south is Mount Tongbai, and to the west is where a hermit built his hut to cultivate himself. To the north you can see a bluestone path leading down the mountain."

msgid "诺大的一片竹林，密密匝匝，望不道尽头。游目四顾，没有路了。\n微风乍起，竹林深处现出一角竹篱。\n"
msgstr "A vast bamboo grove, dense and thick, with no end in sight. You look all around, and there is no path. A breeze stirs, and deep in the bamboo a corner of a bamboo fence shows."

msgid "一间由白茅草搭成的草堂，室内仅有一竹榻，一矮几，四把竹椅．堂前一幅拓片装裱精\n致，上书:\n      书有未曾经我读\n      事无不可对人言\n矮几上摊有书卷放着一支朱砂笔，一房歙砚竟题有岳武穆藏，另几张上好生宣． \n"
msgstr "A hall built of white thatch grass. Inside are only a bamboo couch, a low table and four bamboo chairs. In front of the hall hangs a finely mounted rubbing, inscribed:\n      No book there is that I have not read\n      No deed there is that I could not tell\nOn the low table lie open scrolls and a vermilion brush, and an inkstone from Shezhou even bears the inscription \"Yue Wumu's collection\", beside several sheets of fine raw rice paper."

msgid "这是一间什麽也没有的空房间。\n"
msgstr "An empty room with nothing at all in it."

msgid "鬼神皆修于桐柏,故而此地人烟稀少,仅山下青石峪的那位隐士结庐在此.东边山\n壁天成一洞,据传是姑射山的仙人炼丹之所,终日烈焰雄雄,烤得此地寸草不生.\n然而,一株老松仍枝繁叶茂,立于巨石之上.\n"
msgstr "Spirits and gods all cultivate on Mount Tongbai, so few people live here, only the hermit from Bluestone Gorge at the foot of the mountain, who built his hut here. In the cliff to the east is a natural cave, said to be where the immortals of Mount Guye refine their elixirs, the flames raging all day and scorching the land so nothing grows. Yet an old pine still thrives, standing atop a huge rock."

msgid "雷霆不断击向一粒粒仙丹,仙丹慢慢由黑转为红色.你注意到炉门好象开着.\n"
msgstr "Thunder keeps striking at the pills one by one, and slowly the pills turn from black to red. You notice that the furnace door seems to be open."

msgid "这是一条土路，路旁隐约可见房舍，皆已破败。往南是一座高山，\n据说有鬼怪出没。\n"
msgstr "A dirt road, with houses dimly visible along it, all fallen into ruin. To the south is a tall mountain, said to be haunted by ghosts and monsters."

msgid "    这是一条铺著砾石的上路，险峻难行。南面一座高山，云雾\n缭绕险峻异常。山前断碑字迹依稀可辨--「姑射山』。传说中有\n位仙人曾居于此地，不知如今还在不在......\n"
msgstr "A gravel-paved road leading up, steep and hard going. To the south is a tall mountain, wreathed in clouds and mist, extremely perilous. On a broken stele in front of the mountain the characters are faintly legible: \"Mount Guye\". Legend says an immortal once lived here, and it is unknown whether he is still there..."

msgid "    采药人言曰：有仙人乘鹤飞升，径入此山，不知所终.....\n此地林木繁茂，藤蔓错杂。南耸绝壁，下临深谷.\n半山腰处，隐隐可见一洞，流云出岫。\n"
msgstr "A herb gatherer once said: an immortal rode a crane up to heaven and went straight into this mountain, and where he ended up no one knows... Here the trees are lush and the vines tangled. To the south a sheer cliff looms over a deep valley. Halfway up the mountain a cave can faintly be seen, with clouds drifting from its mouth."

msgid "古树果非寻常之物，树冠白雾升腾，上接霄汉，如仙境一般，让人流连忘返...\n"
msgstr "The old tree is surely no ordinary thing. White mist rises from its crown, reaching up to the heavens like a land of immortals, so lovely that you linger and forget to leave..."

msgid "这里就是半山腰处的山洞。四壁空无一物，极为荒凉......\n"
msgstr "This is the cave halfway up the mountain. The four walls are bare, and it is very desolate..."

msgid "姑射之巅，祥云朵朵，瑞彩千条。藐姑射之山，有神人居焉，肌肤若冰雪，绰约如处子..\n仙踪难觅，只觉风声飒然，云开之出，凸现一座云台\n"
msgstr "On the summit of Mount Guye, auspicious clouds float in drifts, and a thousand colors gleam. On the far mountain of Guye lives a divine person, with skin like ice and snow and a gentle grace like a maiden... The immortal's trail is hard to find, and you feel only the sough of the wind. Where the clouds part, a Cloud Terrace stands revealed."

msgid "两面皆为峭壁，光滑无物。一阵寒谷幽香，沁人心脾，却不知来自何方。。。\n"
msgstr "Both sides are sheer cliffs, smooth and bare. A fragrance of the cold valley drifts in, refreshing heart and lungs, yet you cannot tell where it comes from..."

msgid "    两面皆为峭壁，光滑无物。一阵寒谷幽香，沁人心脾，却不知来自何方。。。\n"
msgstr "Both sides are sheer cliffs, smooth and bare. A fragrance of the cold valley drifts in, refreshing heart and lungs, yet you cannot tell where it comes from..."

msgid "两面皆为峭壁，光滑无物。一株寒谷幽兰,暗香浮动，沁人心脾。山壁天然行成\n一空穴,积满寒露.\n"
msgstr "Both sides are sheer cliffs, smooth and bare. A cold-valley orchid gives off a hidden fragrance that drifts about, refreshing heart and lungs. In the mountain wall is a natural hollow, full of cold dew."

msgid "也不知道隐士怎么弄的，你的玛瑙手镯不灵验了。"
msgstr "Who knows what the hermit did, but your agate bracelet no longer works."

msgid "也不知道隐士怎么弄的，你无法跳出专注的舞步。"
msgstr "Who knows what the hermit did, but you cannot find your focused dance steps."

msgid "东行的道路被骆云舟挡住了."
msgstr "The road east is blocked by Luo Yunzhou."

msgid "你将书放回到矮几。\n"
msgstr "You put the book back on the low table."

msgid "你离开草堂!"
msgstr "You leave the Thatched Hall!"

msgid "举"
msgstr "Lift"

msgid "你努力地抬着石狮子，试图抬起一点点。"
msgstr "You strain to lift the stone lion, trying to raise it even a little."

msgid "石狮子竟然向左移动了尺许，漏出向下的洞穴。\n你从洞口掉了下去。"
msgstr "The stone lion actually slides a foot or so to the left, revealing a hole leading down.\nYou fall in through the opening."

msgid "石狮子又缓缓地向右移动了尺许，正好盖住洞口。"
msgstr "The stone lion slowly slides a foot or so back to the right, just covering the hole."

msgid "这尊石狮跟一般寻常人家放在门口镇宅避邪的石狮颇有不同，姿势是立\n著的，而且大小要大得多，只怕有几万斤重，从来没见过谁能举起它。\n你注意到石狮的额头上刻著一个「举」字，不知是何用意？\n"
msgstr "This stone lion is quite unlike the ordinary ones that stand at doorways to guard a house against evil. It stands upright, and it is much bigger, perhaps tens of thousands of jin. Nobody has ever been seen to lift it. You notice the character for \"lift\" carved on the lion's forehead. What can it mean?"

msgid "爬下去"
msgstr "Climb down"

msgid "你攀著粗糙的洞壁，爬进了树桩中间的大洞。"
msgstr "You cling to the rough wall and climb into the great hole in the middle of the stump."

msgid "一个黑漆漆的大洞，看来像是什么蛀虫蛀出来的，可是天底下哪里\n有这么大的蛀虫？这个洞连人也进得去。\n"
msgstr "A great, pitch-black hole, apparently bored by some kind of worm, but where in the world is there a worm that large? A person can walk right into this hole."

msgid "一间砖砌的小庙，庙里供奉的当然就是「树王公」，你注意到庙里\n树王公的神像左手残缺不全，木刻的神像竟然有一条条白蚁的痕迹，和\n一般庙里金身神像给人的印象不太一样。\n"
msgstr "A small brick shrine. What it houses is, of course, the Lord Tree King. You notice that the left hand of the Tree King's statue is missing, and the wooden statue bears the tracks of white ants, quite unlike the impression a golden-bodied statue in an ordinary temple gives."

msgid "篱笆依地势而曲折延伸，你注意到柴门里面有一间草堂。\n"
msgstr "The fence winds along the lay of the land, and you notice a thatched hall inside the brushwood gate."

msgid "几上的书信手而放，装帧古朴，竟是宋版书，还有几卷汉碑原拓。你按捺不住好奇心想拿\n起来仔细研究一番。\n"
msgstr "The books on the table lie where a hand left them, plainly bound. They are actually Song editions, and there are several rolls of original Han stele rubbings too. You cannot hold back your curiosity and want to pick one up and study it closely."

msgid "你伸手往不远处的一根藤蔓抓去...."
msgstr "You reach for a vine not far away..."

msgid "只听见一声杀猪般的惨叫，你已坠落深谷。。"
msgstr "You let out a scream like a pig being slaughtered and plunge into the deep valley..."

msgid "你手脚俐落地攀附著藤蔓，慢慢地爬近山洞。"
msgstr "Nimbly you cling to the vine and slowly make your way toward the cave."

msgid "其中有一根藤蔓距离你比较近，你可以试著抓住藤蔓\n"
msgstr "One of the vines is closer to you. You could try to grab hold of it."

msgid "你七手八脚地爬上了古树。"
msgstr "You scramble up the old tree, hands and feet flailing."

msgid "这是一株万年古树，寻常人等休想爬得上去.\n"
msgstr "A ten-thousand-year-old tree. Ordinary people can forget about climbing it."

msgid "一座精雕细琢的玉台,放有一矮几;几上立有玉瓶,几株寒谷幽兰\n绽放其中.台旁置一云幡,可是仙家宝物.\n"
msgstr "A finely carved jade terrace with a low table. On the table stands a jade vase with a few cold-valley orchids in bloom. Beside the terrace stands a cloud banner, surely a treasure of the immortals."

msgid "碰云幡"
msgstr "Touch the cloud banner"

msgid "你碰了云幡,云幡动了一下.....\n白光一闪,云台忽地裂开"
msgstr "You touch the cloud banner, and it stirs a little...\nA flash of white light, and the Cloud Terrace suddenly splits open"

msgid "此幡可翻云覆雨,最好不要碰它.\n"
msgstr "This banner can turn clouds and bring rain. Best not to touch it."

msgid "插幽兰"
msgstr "Place the orchid"

msgid "寒谷幽兰忽地绽放,幻出七色光华.你轻轻地飘起..."
msgstr "The cold-valley orchid suddenly blooms, conjuring seven-colored light. You float gently upward..."

msgid "石穴呈瓶状,想是用来插什么东东的.\n"
msgstr "The hollow in the rock is shaped like a bottle, evidently for sticking something into."

msgid "你在洞里苦等良久，终于昏昏沉沉地睡了过去……醒来时，你已经躺在雪亭镇的饮风客栈里。"
msgstr "You wait a long time in the cave and finally drift into a dazed sleep... When you wake, you are lying in Drinkwind Inn in Snow Pavilion."

msgid "洞内黑漆漆的，四下摸索，却摸不到任何出口。\n"
msgstr "The cave is pitch black. You grope around but cannot find any exit."

msgid "读"
msgstr "Read"

msgid "欲将愁心附明月,随君直到夜郎--"
msgstr "\"I would send my sorrow along with the bright moon, to follow you all the way to the -- of Yelang\""

msgid "问君能有几多愁,恰似一江春水向--流"
msgstr "\"You ask how much sorrow I can hold: it is like a river of spring water flowing --\""

msgid "自笑堂堂汉使,得似洋洋河水,依旧只流--"
msgstr "\"I laugh at myself, an envoy of the great Han: am I like the broad river, that still flows only --\""

msgid "--朝四百八十寺,多少楼台烟雨中"
msgstr "\"-- Dynasties' four hundred and eighty temples, and how many towers in the misty rain\""

msgid "孔雀--飞,五里一徘徊"
msgstr "\"The peacock flies --, lingering every five li\""

msgid "帘卷--风,人比黄花叟"
msgstr "\"The curtain rolls up in the -- wind, and the woman is thinner than the yellow chrysanthemum\""

msgid "醉别--楼醒不记,春梦秋云,聚散真容易"
msgstr "\"Drunk, we parted at the -- Tower and I woke remembering nothing. A spring dream, an autumn cloud, how easily we meet and part\""

msgid "春草绿色,春水碧波,送君--埔,伤之如何"
msgstr "\"Spring grass is green, spring water ripples blue, seeing you off on the -- shore, how it hurts\""

msgid "--望，射天狼"
msgstr "\"Gazing --, I shoot the Wolf Star of the sky\""

msgid "--风卷地白草折，胡天八月即飞雪"
msgstr "\"The -- wind rolls over the ground and snaps the white grass; in the foreign sky, snow flies in the eighth month\""

msgid "青山横--郭，白水绕东城"
msgstr "\"Green hills lie across the -- wall, white water circles the east city\""

msgid "你看见:{note}"
msgstr "You see: {note}"

msgid "你走出了桃林"
msgstr "You step out of the peach grove."

msgid "这是一张指示路径的字条.似乎可以读它.\n"
msgstr "A slip of paper that points the way. It seems you can read it."

msgid "你在桃林里苦等良久，终于昏昏沉沉地睡了过去……醒来时，你已经躺在雪亭镇的饮风客栈里。"
msgstr "You wait a long time in the peach grove and finally drift into a dazed sleep... When you wake, you are lying in Drinkwind Inn in Snow Pavilion."

msgid "桃树一株挨着一株，阡陌纵横，每条小路看来都差不多。找不到出路的话，就只能在这里等下去了。\n"
msgstr "Peach trees stand one beside another, paths crisscrossing every which way, and each looks much like the next. If you cannot find the way out, you can only wait here."

msgid "石缝里的鬼臼，你已经采过了。\n"
msgstr "You have already picked the mayapple root from the crack in the rocks."

msgid "一个灰绿皮肤的鬼卒守在坟边，钢叉横在石缝前面。先得打发了它。\n"
msgstr "A gray-green ghost soldier stands guard by the tomb, its steel fork laid across the crack in the rock. You have to deal with it first."

msgid "你在树王坟边阴湿的石缝里找到几丛八角形叶子的草，叶下垂着一朵暗红的花——鬼臼。你连根拔了一株，根上凉凉的。\n"
msgstr "In a damp crack in the rocks by the Tree King's Tomb you find a few clumps of plants with eight-lobed leaves, a dark red flower hanging beneath the leaves: mayapple root. You pull up one plant by the root, and the root is cool to the touch."

msgid "树王坟边的石缝阴湿得很，长着几丛八角形叶子的草，叶下垂着暗红的花。\n"
msgstr "The cracks in the rocks by the Tree King's Tomb are very damp, with a few clumps of plants with eight-lobed leaves and dark red flowers hanging beneath them."

msgid "喝水"
msgstr "Drink water"

msgid "你在井边用杯子舀起井水喝了几口。\n"
msgstr "You scoop up well water with a cup by the well and drink a few mouthfuls."

msgid "你已经再也喝不下一滴水了。\n"
msgstr "You cannot drink another drop."

msgid "闻忘忧草"
msgstr "Smell the forget-worry grass"

msgid "一阵怪风骤然刮起，你仿佛腾云驾雾般。\n"
msgstr "A strange wind suddenly whips up, and you feel as if you are riding the clouds."

msgid "你身上没有忘忧草啊。\n"
msgstr "You are not carrying any forget-worry grass."

msgid "击鼓"
msgstr "Beat the drum"

msgid "鼓已经击过了。衙门的大门开着，直走进去就是。\n"
msgstr "The drum has already been beaten. The yamen gate is open. Just walk straight in."

msgid "你抡起鼓槌，「咚——咚——咚——」三声。\n带刀侍卫从衙门内院走了出来，看了看你，说道：是你击鼓申冤吗？"
msgstr "You raise the drumstick: \"boom... boom... boom\", three beats.\nAn armed guard comes out from the yamen's inner yard, looks you over and says, \"Are you the one beating the drum to plead a grievance?\""

msgid "是"
msgstr "Yes"

msgid "好吧，跟我来...."
msgstr "All right, follow me..."

msgid "衙门的大门「吱呀」一声开了。带刀侍卫转身进去，没有回头。\n"
msgstr "The yamen gate creaks open. The armed guard turns and goes in without looking back."

msgid "你抡起鼓槌，「咚——咚——咚——」三声。\n"
msgstr "You raise the drumstick: \"boom... boom... boom\", three beats."

msgid "从衙门内院走了出来，看了看你两手空空。"
msgstr " comes out from the yamen's inner yard and sees that your hands are empty."

msgid "空口无凭，回去吧。"
msgstr "Empty words are no proof. Go home."

msgid "拿书"
msgstr "Take a book"

msgid "你乘人不备，抓起一本书藏入怀中。\n"
msgstr "While nobody is looking, you snatch a book and tuck it inside your robe."

msgid "书有未曾经我读 事无不可对人言"
msgstr "No book there is that I have not read; no deed there is that I could not tell"

msgid "南门"
msgstr "South Gate"

msgid "西门"
msgstr "West Gate"

msgid "东门"
msgstr "East Gate"

msgid "泓水南岸"
msgstr "Deepwater South Bank"

msgid "城外土路"
msgstr "Dirt Road Outside Town"

msgid "县衙"
msgstr "Yamen"

msgid "桃林深处"
msgstr "Deep in the Peach Grove"

msgid "老姚布庄"
msgstr "Old Yao's Cloth Shop"

msgid "布"
msgstr "Cloth"

msgid "酒楼"
msgstr "Tavern"

msgid "书肆"
msgstr "Bookshop"

msgid "染坊"
msgstr "Dye Works"

msgid "南北货"
msgstr "Dry Goods"

msgid "陶"
msgstr "Pottery"

msgid "乔阴县衙"
msgstr "Tallshade Yamen"

msgid "明镜高悬"
msgstr "Clear Mirror on High"

msgid "肃静"
msgstr "Silence"

msgid "回避"
msgstr "Stand Clear"

msgid "衙门口"
msgstr "Yamen Gate"

msgid "一把粗制滥造的长剑，把手部份用布缠绕了好几圈以防止武器脱手。\n"
msgstr "A shoddy long sword, its grip wrapped round and round with cloth so the weapon won't slip from the hand.\n"

msgid "一把粗制滥造的短剑，把手部份用布缠绕了好几圈以防止武器脱手。\n"
msgstr "A shoddy short sword, its grip wrapped round and round with cloth so the weapon won't slip from the hand.\n"

msgid "一具已经腐朽的骸骨，靠着石壁坐着，骨头上还挂着几片烂成灰褐色的衣料。身量矮小，牙齿齐全，骨龄不过三十；手边没有剑，也没有刀。石壁上的字自称南危水，说埋骨于此——可水烟阁的五长老南危水，是个高大的老人。\n"
msgstr "A rotted skeleton sits against the stone wall, a few scraps of clothing gone gray-brown with rot still hanging from the bones. It is small and has all its teeth, and the bones are those of someone no more than thirty; there is no sword or blade beside it. The words on the wall call the dead man Nan Weishui and say he was buried here. But Nan Weishui, the fifth elder of Waterfog Pavilion, was a tall old man.\n"

msgid "这是一把沈重的鬼头刀，刀柄上雕著 一个丑陋可怖的鬼头正裂开了嘴大笑。\n"
msgstr "This is a heavy ghost-head saber. On the hilt is carved an ugly, frightful ghost head with its mouth split wide in a laugh.\n"

msgid "一根约两寸多长的竹管，上面戳了三个小孔，也许可以用来吹奏？\n"
msgstr "A length of bamboo a little over two inches long, pierced with three small holes. Perhaps it can be blown like a pipe?\n"

msgid "这是一本介绍过招时如何拆招卸力的书籍。\n对练武人来说是本不可多得的珍宝。\n"
msgstr "This book explains how to break an opponent's moves and turn aside his force when trading blows.\nTo a martial artist, it is a rare treasure.\n"

msgid "这是一件夜行人用来掩藏行踪的黑色紧身衣。\n"
msgstr "A black skintight suit that night-walkers wear to hide their tracks.\n"

msgid "这人满脸匪气，一付百无聊赖的模样，令人望而生厌。\n"
msgstr "This man's face is full of bandit menace. He has the bored, idle look of someone with nothing to do, and the sight of him puts you off.\n"

msgid "这家伙长得高高瘦瘦，脸色苍白，一付无精打采的样子。\n"
msgstr "A tall, thin fellow with a pale face and a listless air.\n"

msgid "这家伙又矮又胖，圆滚滚的眼珠子在满脸肥肉中骨碌碌地转来转去。\n"
msgstr "A short, fat fellow. His round eyes roll back and forth in his fleshy face.\n"

msgid "一只乌黑油亮的巨蟒，头上生著一个大肉瘤。\n"
msgstr "A huge, glossy black python with a big fleshy lump on its head.\n"

msgid "躯干"
msgstr "body"

msgid "这个老头子正对著你龇牙裂嘴，他看起来已经完全疯了。\n"
msgstr "This old man is baring his teeth at you. He looks completely mad.\n"

msgid "一只凶猛的狼狗，一只独眼正恶狠狠地瞪著你。\n"
msgstr "A fierce wolf-dog, its one eye glaring at you with hatred.\n"

msgid "狼狗用一只独眼恶狠狠地瞪著你。\n"
msgstr "The wolf-dog glares at you with hatred in its one eye.\n"

msgid "一只翩翩起舞的小蝴蝶哦! \n"
msgstr "A little butterfly, dancing about! \n"

msgid "翅膀"
msgstr "wings"

msgid "蝴蝶拍动著翅膀! \n"
msgstr "The butterfly flaps its wings! \n"

msgid "蝴蝶停在花上吸花蜜。 \n"
msgstr "The butterfly rests on a flower, sipping nectar. \n"

msgid "这家伙满脸横肉，一付凶神恶煞的模样，令人望而生畏。\n"
msgstr "This fellow's face is all hard flesh, and he looks like a fiend straight from the underworld. The sight of him fills you with dread.\n"

msgid "土匪喽罗横刀拦住去路，喝道：站住！要过老松寨，留下十两银子买路钱！\n"
msgstr "The Bandit Lackey bars the way with his saber and barks, \"Hold it! Wanna get through Old Pine Stockade, ya leave ten taels of silver as toll!\"\n"

msgid "十两银子，一个子儿不能少。拿来！"
msgstr "Ten taels of silver, not a coin less. Hand it over!"

msgid "老松寨是常老大的寨子，泼风刀王常老大，听过没有？想进去，先留下买路钱。"
msgstr "Old Pine Stockade is Boss Chang's stockade. Boss Chang, the Storm-Blade King—heard of him? Wanna go in, ya leave the toll first."

msgid "前些天是来过一个黑衣黑冠的道士，拿一块金牌买了路，往里头去了。你要问，问寨主去——先留下买路钱。"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap did come by a few days back. Paid his way with a gold tablet and went on in. Wanna know more, ask the Chief—leave the toll first."

msgid "叫阵"
msgstr "Challenge"

msgid "叫阵是跟常老大单打独斗——寨里的人不插手，但常老大的泼风刀下，没几个人站得住。要叫阵吗？"
msgstr "A challenge is single combat with Boss Chang. Nobody in the stockade will butt in, but few stand up long under Boss Chang's Storm Blade. Wanna challenge him?"

msgid "叫过了还叫？聚义厅在东头，常老大等着你。"
msgstr "Ya already called him out, and now again? Brotherhood Hall's at the east end. Boss Chang's waitin' for ya."

msgid "好大的口气！"
msgstr "Big talk!"

msgid "朝寨子里扯着嗓子喊：有人叫阵——！"
msgstr " shouts into the stockade, \"We got a challenger—!\""

msgid "进去吧，聚义厅在东头。常老大一个人等你，寨里的弟兄不插手。"
msgstr "Go on in. Brotherhood Hall's at the east end. Boss Chang waits for ya alone, and the brothers in the stockade won't butt in."

msgid "钱已经交过了，进去吧。"
msgstr "Toll's paid. Go on in."

msgid "土匪喽罗掂了掂银子，咧嘴一笑：算你识相。进去吧，寨里的弟兄不会难为你。\n"
msgstr "The Bandit Lackey weighs the silver in his hand and grins. \"Smart of ya. Go on in. The brothers inside won't give ya trouble.\"\n"

msgid "土匪喽罗往地上啐了一口：打发叫花子呢？十两银子，少一个子儿都不行！\n"
msgstr "The Bandit Lackey spits on the ground. \"What, handin' alms to a beggar? Ten taels of silver, not a coin less!\"\n"

msgid "这家伙眼神凶恶，一双精光四射的眼珠正盯著你的脖子。\n"
msgstr "This fellow has a vicious gaze, and his glittering eyes are fixed on your throat.\n"

msgid "\n土匪首领阴恻恻地说道：这种三脚猫的功夫也敢上老松寨来撒野？！\n"
msgstr "\nThe Bandit Chief says in a sinister voice, \"Cheap tricks like yours, and ya dare come make trouble at Old Pine Stockade?!\"\n"

msgid "\n土匪首领说道：去你的，老子今天要剁下你的头来练练毒爪！\n"
msgstr "\nThe Bandit Chief says, \"Get lost! I'm gonna chop off your head today to try out my poison claws!\"\n"

msgid "\n土匪首领虎吼一声，欺身上前。\n"
msgstr "\nThe Bandit Chief roars like a tiger and closes in.\n"

msgid "那道士的事，寨主自己会说。聚义厅在东头。"
msgstr "The Chief will tell ya about that Daoist himself. Brotherhood Hall's at the east end."

msgid "老松寨寨主"
msgstr "Chief of Old Pine Stockade"

msgid "黑衣黑冠的道士？来过。拿一块金牌子买的路——金子打的，比你那十两银子值钱多了。"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap? Came by. Paid with a gold tablet—solid gold, worth a lot more than your ten taels of silver."

msgid "他问我瀑布后头的山洞怎么走。老子这寨子什么钱都收，收了钱就指路：往东过石桥，瀑布旁边有藤蔓，荡过去就是。"
msgstr "He asked me how to get to the cave behind the waterfall. This stockade takes any money, and once I'm paid, I point the way. East across the stone bridge, and beside the waterfall there are vines. Swing across and you're there."

msgid "他抱着个石匣子，宝贝得很。你要找他，也往瀑布去吧，老子不拦你。"
msgstr "He was hugging a stone casket, precious as could be. If you want him, go to the waterfall too. I won't stop you."

msgid "你是什么东西，也敢问老子的事？"
msgstr "What are you, to ask about my business?"

msgid "石匣"
msgstr "Stone casket"

msgid "石匣？那道士抱着的那个？老子没兴趣，老子只收钱。"
msgstr "The stone casket? The one the Daoist was hugging? I'm not interested in it. All I take is money."

msgid "老松寨是老子的寨子。进寨的规矩只有一条：什么钱都收。"
msgstr "Old Pine Stockade is mine. One rule to get in: I take any money."

msgid "这个男人看起来鬼鬼祟祟的，想必不是什么好东西。\n"
msgstr "This man looks shifty and sneaky; surely up to no good.\n"

msgid "哈哈哈哈哈哈。"
msgstr "Hahahahaha."

msgid "一支昂首吐信的毒蛇正虎视眈眈地盯著你。\n"
msgstr "A venomous snake, head raised and tongue flicking, eyes you like a tiger watching its prey.\n"

msgid "你觉得被咬中的地方一阵麻痒！"
msgstr "You feel an itching numbness where you were bitten!"

msgid "你现在正走在一条林间的小路，往北不远处走出这座林子就是雪亭\n镇，小路两旁长满了许多高耸的松树，雪亭镇的居民都把这里叫做「老\n松林」，据说林子里有株树龄上千的老松树，颇有灵验。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a path through the woods. Not far to the north, the path leaves the trees and comes out at Snow Pavilion. Tall pines crowd both sides of the path. The people of Snow Pavilion call this place \"Old Pine Wood,\" and they say a pine more than a thousand years old grows somewhere in it, one that answers prayers.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在一条林间的小路上，小路两旁长满了高耸的松树，从\n林间传来阵阵鸟叫声，小路往南北两个方向延伸出去。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a path through the woods, tall pines crowding both sides. Birdsong drifts out from among the trees. The path runs off to the north and the south.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在一条林间的小路上，小路往东似乎通往一处空地，林\n子到了这里变得静悄悄的，小路两旁的松树也比西边的矮小，看起来有\n点营养不良的样子。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a path through the woods. To the east the path seems to lead to a clearing. The wood has gone quiet here, and the pines beside the path are shorter than those to the west and look a little underfed.\n"

msgid "这是一块林间空地，四周的树木花草像是被人修剪过一般，环绕著\n空地围成一个整齐的圆形，空地中央一株巨大的松树像平地上撑\n起一把大伞，树上针叶茂密得遮去了大半的阳光，空地四周有三条小路\n分别通往东、西、南三个方向，往南的小路旁竖著一个牌子。\n"
msgstr "This is a clearing in the woods. The trees and flowers around it look as if someone has pruned them, forming a neat circle around the open ground. In the middle a huge pine spreads like a great umbrella set on flat ground, its needles so thick they shut out most of the sun. Three paths leave the clearing, east, west and south, and beside the south path stands a sign.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在一片松树林中的小路上，小路往北通往一处空地，一\n株巨大无朋的松树矗立在空地中央，小路往南是一条长长的下坡道，这\n条路上足迹很多，显然常有人经过。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a path through a pine wood. To the north it leads to a clearing, where one enormous pine rises in the middle. To the south the path is a long downhill slope. Many footprints mark this path; people clearly pass this way often.\n"

msgid "这是一条笔直的坡道，北高南低，道路两旁长满了许多松树，从松\n林间隐约可以听到东边传来流水的声音。\n"
msgstr "This is a straight slope, high in the north and low in the south, with pines growing thickly on both sides. Through the trees you can faintly hear running water to the east.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在一条松树林中的小路，这里的松树树干上都有著一些\n奇怪的记号，像是被人用刀子划过，小路的西边是一块空地，往东不远\n可以看到一条山涧，上面横跨著一座小石桥。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a path through a pine wood. The pines here have strange marks on their trunks, as if cut with a knife. West of the path is a clearing; not far to the east you can see a mountain stream with a small stone bridge across it.\n"

msgid "你现在正站在一座长满青苔的古桥上，桥下是一条山涧，几股清泉\n在乱石之中向山下奔流，桥北边不远处有一个瀑布 ，从山\n壁上犹如一条白练般垂了下来，瀑布两旁的石壁十分陡峭，高度和山涧\n旁的松林相差了近三、四十丈。\n"
msgstr "You are standing on an old bridge thick with moss. Below it runs a mountain stream, several threads of clear spring water rushing down the mountain over a tumble of rocks. Not far north of the bridge, a waterfall hangs from the cliff like a white silk ribbon. The rock walls on both sides of the falls are very steep, and the pines beside the stream stand some three or four hundred feet below the top.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在一条松树林间的小路，西边有一座小石桥横跨在一条\n山涧上，往东不远处似乎是林子的出口，一条破旧的栈道沿著山壁通往\n山上，你发现地上有一些湿漉漉的脚印，但是因为脚印太\n多，分不出是往哪里去。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a path through a pine wood. To the west a small stone bridge spans a mountain stream; not far to the east the wood seems to end, and a dilapidated plank road runs along the cliff up the mountain. You notice wet footprints on the ground, but there are so many that you cannot tell which way they lead.\n"

msgid "你现在正站在瀑布前的一个小水潭里，水潭大约深可及胸，淹不死\n人，一条白练般的瀑布从数百丈高的悬崖上冲激而下，溅\n得你全身湿透，水潭三面都被高耸的山壁所包围，只有南面沿\n著一条山涧可以出去。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in a small pool before the waterfall. The water is about chest deep, not enough to drown you. A white ribbon of water crashes down from a cliff thousands of feet high and soaks you through. The pool is walled in on three sides by towering rock; the only way out is south, along the stream."

msgid "你现在正站在一个深不见底的水潭边上，从潭底不时有气泡冒上来\n，散发著一股诡异的香味，水潭边长满了黄色叶子的怪草，四周陡峭的\n山壁近乎直立，抬头只见一个半圆形的天空，唯一的出路大概只有往北\n山泉流入水潭的缺口。\n"
msgstr "You are standing at the edge of a bottomless pool. Bubbles rise from its depths now and then, giving off an uncanny fragrance, and weeds with yellow leaves grow thick along the water. The cliffs around you are nearly sheer; looking up you see only a half-round of sky. The only way out seems to be north, through the gap where the spring water flows into the pool.\n"

msgid "你现在正站在一条山涧中的岩石上，几股泉水正从你脚边流过，水\n花溅得四处飞散，南边是一个深不见底的水潭，两边的山壁看起\n来又高又陡，看来要爬上岸边实在很不容易，你的北方有一座小石桥高\n高地跨过两边的山壁，可是桥的高度太高，即使是轻功绝顶的高手也跃\n不上去。\n"
msgstr "You are standing on a rock in a mountain stream. Several threads of spring water run past your feet, the spray flying everywhere. To the south is a bottomless pool. The cliffs on both sides look high and steep; climbing up to the bank would be no easy matter. To your north a small stone bridge arches high across the cliffs, but it is too high to reach, even for the finest qinggong master."

msgid "你现在正站在一条山涧中的岩石上，一座小石桥正高高地从你的头\n顶横跨过山涧两边的石壁，一个瀑布就在你的北方不远处，从一\n处更高的悬崖上垂了下来。\n"
msgstr "You are standing on a rock in a mountain stream. A small stone bridge arches high over your head, spanning the rock walls on both sides, and not far to your north a waterfall drops from a still higher cliff.\n"

msgid "你现在正站在一个松树林里，嗯....这是一个松树林....你所知就\n这么多，茂密的松树遮蔽了整个天空，使你连方向都弄不清楚，最好在\n天黑之前赶紧找道路径出去吧。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in a pine wood. Hmm... a pine wood... that is all you know. The dense pines shut out the whole sky and you cannot even tell which way is which. You had better find a way out before dark.\n"

msgid "你现在正站在一个松树林间的小空地上，你的北边、东边、南边都\n是茂密的松树，唯独西边是个悬崖，当你探头一看，立刻不由\n自主地倒抽一口凉气，在这里可得千万小心，一不小心跌了下去肯定是\n粉身碎骨。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in a small clearing among the pines. Dense pines lie to your north, east and south; only the west is a cliff. When you lean out for a look, you can't help drawing a cold breath. Be very careful here: one slip and you would surely be smashed to pieces.\n"

msgid "你现在正栖身在一个山壁上勉强足以容纳一个人休息的岩穴中，从\n这里无论是要往上爬或往下爬都有一段不算短的距离，最好先歇一歇，\n喘口气再走。\n"
msgstr "You are perched in a rock hollow in the cliff, just big enough for one person to rest. From here it is a fair distance whether you climb up or down. You had better rest a while and catch your breath before moving on.\n"

msgid "你现在正攀附在一株大松树的树干上，从这里可以很清楚地望见树\n下的一切动静，而不被人发觉，似乎是个干偷鸡摸狗勾当的好地方。\n"
msgstr "You are clinging to the trunk of a big pine. From here you can see everything going on beneath the tree without being noticed—a fine spot for sneaking and thieving.\n"

msgid "你现在正攀附在一株大松树的树干上，这里离地面已经有七、八丈\n高，如果不小心跌了下去，不断条腿也得去半条命，松树上结了许多球\n果，不过大部分都离树干很远，你构不到。\n"
msgstr "You are clinging to the trunk of a big pine, seventy or eighty feet off the ground. A fall would at the least break a leg and cost you half your life. The pine bears many cones, but most hang far out from the trunk, out of your reach.\n"

msgid "哇....你终于爬上这株松树的树顶了，一阵阵凉风从四面八方吹来\n，使你觉得心旷神怡，虽然你的经验告诉你在这种地方往下看是十分不\n智的，但是你还是忍不住看了一眼，这里离地面至少也有十五、六丈高\n，一阵晕眩警告你最好在跌下去以前离开这个地方。\n"
msgstr "Wow... you have finally climbed to the top of the pine! Cool breezes blow from every side and your heart lifts. Your experience tells you that looking down from a place like this is very unwise, but you cannot help one glance. You are at least a hundred and fifty feet off the ground, and a wave of dizziness warns you to leave before you fall.\n"

msgid "你现在正站在一个岩石的通道之中，在你南边有一片亮晶晶的帘幕\n，从帘幕后面传来阵阵轰隆隆的水声，通道两边的石壁上安置\n著许多铜铸的烛台，照亮了这个岩穴，往北似乎有亮光。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in a rock passage. To your south hangs a glittering curtain, and behind it comes the roar of water. On both walls of the passage are set many bronze candlesticks that light the grotto. To the north there seems to be light."

msgid "    你现在正站在一个阴森森的山洞之中, 一条昂首吐信的金银花蛇,\n爬伏在一块突出的大青石上, 令人望而生畏, 也许你该回头逃跑了。\n"
msgstr "    You are standing in a gloomy cave. A gold-and-silver snake, head raised and tongue flicking, lies coiled on a jutting slab of bluestone, a fearsome sight. Perhaps you should turn back and run.\n"

msgid "你现在正站在一块突出的大青石上, 虽然有点滑, 你还是能站稳,\n往四周看, 除了长满了青苔的石壁, 好象无路可走了。\n"
msgstr "You are standing on a jutting slab of bluestone. It is a little slippery, but you can keep your footing. Looking around, you see nothing but moss-covered rock walls; there seems to be no way on.\n"

msgid "你现在正站在一个岩石通道之中，从南边隐隐传来哗哗的水声，岩\n壁上生著厚厚的青苔，一股恶臭从北边传来，像是什么野兽，也许你该\n回头出去了。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in a rock passage. From the south comes the faint sound of rushing water. The walls are covered in thick moss, and a foul stench drifts from the north, as of some wild beast. Perhaps you should turn back and get out.\n"

msgid "你现在已经到达山洞的深处了, 四面八方都是些黑漆漆的小石洞,\n简直不知道该往那里走, 要不是北面还有一点光线, 你都要彻底绝望了。\n"
msgstr "You have reached the depths of the cave. All around are black little stone holes, and you have no idea which way to go. Were it not for a bit of light to the north, you would give up all hope.\n"

msgid "你现在已经到达山洞的深处了, 耶...东面就是洞口了, 还可以听\n见外面瀑布的水声, 仔细的观察石壁, 可以发现上面有一些用利\n剑雕刻的字....\n"
msgstr "You have reached the depths of the cave. Ah... the cave mouth is to the east, and you can hear the waterfall outside. Look closely at the wall and you will find words carved into it with a sharp sword...\n"

msgid "这里只见一个木头搭成的大门，门框上挂著四、五的不知道是什么\n动物的头骨跟一些铁链，外面再铺上一层乾枯的松枝，在这样一个森林\n里还真不容易发觉。\n"
msgstr "Here stands a big gate built of logs. On the door frame hang four or five skulls of some animals, and iron chains, all covered with a layer of dried pine twigs. In a forest like this it is hard to spot.\n"

msgid "这里应该是老松寨了，虽然围绕著你的墙都是木头搭成的，但是仔\n细一看，在许多险要的位置都放了不少沙包石堆，后面显然是埋伏人手\n的好地方，如果有人贸然从大门口攻进来，肯定会吃大亏的，大寨的门\n在你的西边，东边越过一排木桩之后就是大厅。\n"
msgstr "This must be Old Pine Stockade. The walls around you are all of wood, but look closely and at many strategic points there are piles of sandbags and stones, clearly good places to hide men; anyone who storms in through the main gate would pay dearly. The gate of the great stockade is to your west; to the east, past a row of wooden stakes, is the great hall.\n"

msgid "这里就是老松寨的大厅了，靠北边的地面上铺了一张巨大的熊皮，\n上面摆了三张椅子，大厅四周散落著几个取暖用的火盆，几个上了锁的\n木箱子，比较奇特的是中央掘了一个大坑，坑里是许多头骨浸在\n一种发著恶臭的黄水之中。\n"
msgstr "This is the great hall of Old Pine Stockade. Against the north wall a huge bearskin lies on the floor, with three chairs set on it. Around the hall are scattered several braziers for warmth and a few locked wooden chests. Oddest of all, a big pit has been dug in the middle, and in it many skulls soak in a foul-smelling yellow liquid.\n"

msgid "你听到你身后有几个声音大叫：把门关上！把门关上！一个也不许让他们溜走！"
msgstr "You hear several voices behind you shouting, \"Shut the gate! Shut the gate! Don't let a single one get away!\""

msgid "接著「轰」地一声，通往外面的大门已经被一块大石堵死了。"
msgstr "Then, with a boom, a great rock seals the gate to the outside."

msgid "你听到一阵轧轧的轮盘绞动声，堵住门口的大石慢慢地被移开了。"
msgstr "You hear the creak of a winch wheel turning, and the great rock blocking the gate slowly rolls aside."

msgid "爬树"
msgstr "Climb the tree"

msgid "一株又高又大的松树，当你抬头往上看的时候似乎有个人影\n在树梢之间移动，不过也许是风吹动所造成的错觉。\n"
msgstr "A tall, big pine. When you look up, a figure seems to move among the treetops, though it may be only the wind playing tricks.\n"

msgid "你手脚并用，敏捷地爬上了空地中央的大松树。"
msgstr "Hand over hand, you nimbly climb the great pine in the middle of the clearing."

msgid "往下爬"
msgstr "Climb down"

msgid "你顺著粗大的树干，慢慢地爬了下来。"
msgstr "You slowly climb down along the thick trunk."

msgid "抓住藤蔓"
msgstr "Grab a vine"

msgid "其中有一根藤蔓距离你比较近，你可以试著抓住藤蔓，看看\n能不能像泰山一样荡过去，看看瀑布后面有什么？\n对了，提醒你一点，这座石桥下面是高约百丈的山涧深谷....。\n"
msgstr "One of the vines hangs fairly close to you. You can try to hold it, swing across like Tarzan and see what is behind the waterfall.\nBy the way, a reminder: below this stone bridge is a gorge about a thousand feet deep...\n"

msgid "你爬上石桥的护栏，伸手往不远处的一根藤蔓抓去...."
msgstr "You climb onto the bridge railing and reach for a vine not far off..."

msgid "只听见一声杀猪般的惨叫，你已经往山涧中坠了下去。"
msgstr "With a scream like a stuck pig, you plunge into the gorge."

msgid "你听到有人高声惊叫，一条人影从上方掉了下来，「扑通」一声跌进潭中。"
msgstr "You hear someone cry out. A figure falls from above and lands in the pool with a splash."

msgid "你手脚俐落地攀附著藤蔓，慢慢地爬下山涧....。"
msgstr "Hand over hand, you nimbly cling to the vine and slowly climb down into the gorge..."

msgid "忽然一条人影从南边的帘幕穿了出来。"
msgstr "Suddenly a figure bursts out through the curtain to the south."

msgid "攀爬石壁"
msgstr "Climb the rock wall"

msgid "两边的山壁看起来又高又陡，看来要爬上岸边实在很不容易。\n"
msgstr "The cliffs on both sides look high and steep; climbing up to the bank would be no easy matter.\n"

msgid "你一付不信邪的表情，开始小心翼翼地攀著石壁爬了上去。"
msgstr "Refusing to believe it can't be done, you start carefully climbing the rock wall."

msgid "从这个勉强容身的岩穴往下爬，还有一段不算短的距离。\n"
msgstr "From this barely-big-enough hollow, it is still a fair distance down.\n"

msgid "你试了试脚边的岩石稳不稳，开始小心翼翼地往山涧中攀了下去。"
msgstr "You test whether the rock at your feet is firm, then carefully start climbing down into the stream."

msgid "往上爬"
msgstr "Climb up"

msgid "从这个勉强容身的岩穴往上爬，还有一段不算短的距离。\n"
msgstr "From this barely-big-enough hollow, it is still a fair distance up.\n"

msgid "你试了试脚边的岩石稳不稳，开始小心翼翼地往上攀爬。"
msgstr "You test whether the rock at your feet is firm, then carefully start climbing up."

msgid "一块比人还高的钟乳石, 虽然长满了青苔, 但爬上去\n应该不会太困难。\n"
msgstr "A pillar of dripstone taller than a man. Though covered in moss, it should not be hard to climb.\n"

msgid "你慢慢地攀上大青石。"
msgstr "You slowly climb up onto the big bluestone."

msgid "你迅速地爬下大青石。"
msgstr "You quickly climb down off the big bluestone."

msgid "埋葬骸骨"
msgstr "Bury the bones"

msgid "老夫南危水, 乃是昔年水烟阁五长老中第一高手,\n一生醉心武学, 集天邪、封山两派之所长, 为营救盟主遭小人暗算,\n埋骨于此。男子汉大丈夫死不足惜, 只可恨一身武学尚无传人!\n葬我遗骨者老夫将赠以过招要旨, 唉......\n"
msgstr "I, Nan Weishui, was once the foremost fighter among the five elders of Waterfog Pavilion.\nAll my life I was devoted to martial arts, combining the best of the Wayward and Empty Mountain schools.\nTo rescue the Alliance Leader I was struck down by a villain's trick, and my bones lie buried here.\nA man need not fear death, but I hate that my arts have no heir!\nWhoever buries my remains, I will reward with the essentials of parrying. Alas...\n"

msgid "你小心翼翼地埋好了那具骸骨。"
msgstr "You carefully bury the skeleton."

msgid "你听见山洞顶部的石壁「喀喇」地一声响，一本书坠落下来。"
msgstr "You hear a sharp crack from the stone of the cave roof, and a book drops down."

msgid "你只看见山洞顶部纷纷扬扬飘下几张纸片来。"
msgstr "You see only a few scraps of paper come fluttering down from the cave roof."

msgid "你听得「轰」的一声响，已经从这摔了下去"
msgstr "You hear a \"boom\" and have already fallen from here"

msgid "你定下心神一看，其实这个悬崖没有想像中那么恐怖，也许还\n可以从这里爬下山涧，只是这世界上大概没有这种白痴愿意干\n这种傻事吧。\n"
msgstr "You steady yourself and look again. The cliff is not as terrifying as you imagined; perhaps you could even climb down it to the stream—though probably no fool in the world would be willing to try.\n"

msgid "你一付认真的表情，开始小心翼翼地攀著石壁爬了上去。"
msgstr "With a serious look, you start carefully climbing the rock wall."

msgid "「官府告示：此处常有歹人出没。」\n"
msgstr "\"Official notice: bandits often lurk here.\""

msgid "一块旧木牌，刻着三行字：\n「往西，雪亭镇。」\n「往东，小石桥。」\n「往南，下坡道。」\n"
msgstr "An old wooden sign with three lines carved on it:\n\"To the west, Snow Pavilion.\"\n\"To the east, the little stone bridge.\"\n\"To the south, the downhill slope.\"\n"

msgid "顺着刀痕找"
msgstr "Follow the knife marks"

msgid "这几株松树的树干上都有刀划的记号，一道一道，深浅不一，像是有人怕走错了路，沿途留下的。记号一路往东，到那丛灌木跟前就断了。\n"
msgstr "The trunks of these pines are all marked with knife cuts, one after another, some deep, some shallow, as if someone afraid of losing the way had left them along the road. The marks run east and stop at a clump of bushes.\n"

msgid "你顺着树上的刀痕往东找去，拨开那丛灌木，后面果然有一条踩得结实的小径，通往林子深处。"
msgstr "You follow the knife marks on the trees east and push aside the bushes. Sure enough, behind them is a well-trodden trail leading into the depths of the woods."

msgid "刀痕指的就是灌木后面那条小径。"
msgstr "The knife marks point to the trail behind the bushes."

msgid "一些杂乱的脚印，不但有人的脚印，看起来还有不少马蹄印。\n"
msgstr "A jumble of footprints—not only men's, but, it seems, plenty of hoofprints too.\n"

msgid "这个瀑布从数百丈高的山壁上冲激而下，流入一个山涧底的小水潭\n，水潭两边的石壁垂下许多的藤蔓，你注意到瀑布后面似乎\n有什么东西在发著光。\n"
msgstr "This waterfall crashes down a cliff thousands of feet high into a small pool at the bottom of the gorge. Many vines hang down the rock walls on both sides of the pool. You notice something behind the falls seems to be glowing."

msgid "这个瀑布水势并不是很大，但是高度却极高，水珠溅在你的脸上\n打得隐隐生疼。你注意到瀑布后面似乎有什么东西在发著光。\n"
msgstr "This waterfall is not very strong, but it is very high; the spray stings your face. You notice something behind the falls seems to be glowing.\n"

msgid "水潭四周的山壁都有数百丈高，想要爬上去「肯定」是休想。\n"
msgstr "The cliffs around the pool are thousands of feet high. Climbing out is \"definitely\" out of the question."

msgid "这里的山壁比北边高度稍低了点，但是对凡人而言想要爬上去仍然\n还有一段差距。\n"
msgstr "The cliff here is a bit lower than in the north, but for a mortal it is still a long way up.\n"

msgid "这片帘幕似乎是用一种极薄的丝绸织成的，后面还传来阵阵水声。\n"
msgstr "This curtain seems woven of some extremely thin silk. Behind it comes the sound of water.\n"

msgid "这是一把僧人练武用的戒刀，份量大约四、五斤重。\n"
msgstr "A saber that monks use to practice martial arts, weighing four or five jin.\n"

msgid "一把不很利的菜刀, 不过拿来切菜砍肉还是绰绰有馀的。\n"
msgstr "A cleaver that is not very sharp, though it is more than enough for chopping vegetables and meat.\n"

msgid "一把快秃了头的竹扫把。\n"
msgstr "A bamboo broom, its bristles nearly bald.\n"

msgid "一个香喷喷、热腾腾的大馒头。\n"
msgstr "A big steamed bun, fragrant and piping hot.\n"

msgid "这个知客僧脸色和蔼，虽然在寺中的地位不高，但是他总是让人有一种\n值得信赖的感觉。\n"
msgstr "This guest monk has a kindly face. Though his standing in the temple is not high, he always gives a sense of being someone you can trust.\n"

msgid "阿弥陀佛！小僧武功低微，认输便是。"
msgstr "Amitabha! This humble monk's martial skill is meager. I yield."

msgid "瞧这个头陀的模样与服色，似乎不是山烟寺的僧人，但是他大喇喇地站在\n这里，一副不可一世的样子。\n"
msgstr "Judging by his looks and garb, this ascetic is not a monk of Mountain Mist Temple, yet he stands here in a high-handed way, as though no one mattered.\n"

msgid "独眼头陀跟在你身后，大步流星，那只独眼盯着前头的路。\n"
msgstr "The One-Eyed Ascetic follows behind you with long strides, his one eye fixed on the road ahead."

msgid "独眼头陀抱着刀站着，那只独眼半闭着，像是睡着了。\n"
msgstr "The One-Eyed Ascetic stands with his saber in his arms, his one eye half shut, as if asleep."

msgid "看了一眼叶边那行字，没有接。"
msgstr " looks at the line along the edge of the leaf and does not take it."

msgid "师父的字……你拿着。问我「经」。"
msgstr "My master's writing... Keep it. Ask me about \"Sutra.\""

msgid "病人"
msgstr "Patient"

msgid "大喇喇地站着，不理你。"
msgstr " stands there high-handed and ignores you."

msgid "转过身去，不理你。"
msgstr " turns away and ignores you."

msgid "那樵夫的寒，赶干净了。"
msgstr "The woodcutter's chill has been driven out clean."

msgid "走啊。流云轩在哪，你比我熟。"
msgstr "Go on, then. You know better than I where Drifting Cloud Lodge is."

msgid "那只独眼转过来，盯着你看了很久。"
msgstr " turns that one eye on you and stares for a long time."

msgid "流云轩那个樵夫。寒气退不下去，是不是？"
msgstr "The woodcutter at Drifting Cloud Lodge. The chill will not leave him, will it?"

msgid "那是鬼卒的阴寒，钻进骨头了。玄智的药是凉性的底子，赶不出来。"
msgstr "That is the Ghost Soldier's cold, burrowed into the bone. Xuanzhi's medicine has a cool base, and it cannot drive it out."

msgid "我能。"
msgstr "I can."

msgid "我的内功是火性的。可他们的寺规不许外人进流云轩——十年了，我连金门都没进过。"
msgstr "My inner force is of fire. But their temple rules do not allow outsiders into Drifting Cloud Lodge. Ten years, and I have never got past the Golden Gate."

msgid "你领我进去（问我「领路」），或者照他们的寺规来。"
msgstr "Either you lead me in (ask me about \"Lead the Way\"), or you go by their temple rules."

msgid "领路"
msgstr "Lead the Way"

msgid "领独眼头陀进流云轩，让他给老葛治伤。\n寺规不许外人进流云轩：老葛当场好，玄智记你不守寺规（山烟寺的弟子，这一回没有晋阶）；头陀从此肯跟你说话。\n这是山烟寺这条线上的一个选择，选了不能改，照寺规那条路就没了。要领他去吗？"
msgstr "Lead the One-Eyed Ascetic into Drifting Cloud Lodge so he can treat Old Ge.\nThe temple rules forbid outsiders in Drifting Cloud Lodge. Old Ge is cured on the spot, but Xuanzhi will hold it against you that you broke the temple rules (a Mountain Mist Temple disciple gets no promotion this time), and from then on the ascetic will speak with you.\nThis is a choice on the Mountain Mist Temple line. Once made it cannot be changed, and the path by the temple rules is closed. Lead him in?"

msgid "治完了。"
msgstr "It is done."

msgid "走。"
msgstr "Let us go."

msgid "把刀往背后一插，跟在你身后。"
msgstr " thrusts the saber behind his back and falls in behind you."

msgid "我是从番坊来的。日陀罗寺。"
msgstr "I come from the Foreign Quarter. Ritola Temple."

msgid "摸了摸那只瞎眼上的眼罩。"
msgstr " touches the patch over the blind eye."

msgid "我练的经，玄智的寺里不认。三十年前不认，今天也不认。……别的，去问我师父。"
msgstr "The sutra I practice, Xuanzhi's temple does not recognize. It did not recognize it thirty years ago, and it does not today... For the rest, ask my Shifu."

msgid "经"
msgstr "Sutra"

msgid "native:fanfang/sutra_leaf"
msgstr "native:fanfang/sutra_leaf"

msgid "你把那片贝叶举到他眼前。他转回来了。\n"
msgstr "You hold the palm-leaf page up before his eye. He turns back.\n"

msgid "接过那片贝叶，那只独眼在叶边那行字上停了很久。"
msgstr " takes the palm-leaf page, and his one eye rests a long while on the line along its edge."

msgid "师父的字。"
msgstr "Shifu's writing."

msgid "「收不收，是山烟寺的事。」……十年，我站在门外，等的就是这一句。"
msgstr "\"Whether to take him in is the temple's affair.\"... Ten years I stood outside the door, waiting for this one sentence."

msgid "我上殿去。你也来——玄智要问一个人，问的是你。"
msgstr "I go up to the hall. You come too. Xuanzhi has a question to put about one person, and that person is you."

msgid "独眼头陀把贝叶揣进怀里，大步跨进了金门，往大雄宝殿去了。\n"
msgstr "The One-Eyed Ascetic tucks the palm-leaf page into his robe, strides through the Golden Gate and heads for the Mahavira Hall.\n"

msgid "（龙若法王给你的那片贝叶，要举到他眼前。）\n"
msgstr "(Hold up to his eye the palm-leaf page that Dharma King Longruo gave you.)\n"

msgid "师父给你的东西呢？"
msgstr "Where is the thing Shifu gave you?"

msgid "一个笑咪咪的僧人对著你微微颔首。\n"
msgstr "A smiling monk nods slightly at you.\n"

msgid "阿弥陀佛！贫僧武功低微，施主不要开这种玩笑。"
msgstr "Amitabha! This poor monk's martial skill is meager. Benefactor, please do not make such jokes."

msgid "这个僧人跛了右腿，脸上没有什么表情，一副若有所思的样子。\n"
msgstr "This monk is lame in the right leg. His face shows no expression, and he looks lost in thought.\n"

msgid "阿弥陀佛！贫僧武功低微，又是个残废，施主不要开这种玩笑。"
msgstr "Amitabha! This poor monk's martial skill is meager, and he is a cripple besides. Benefactor, please do not make such jokes."

msgid "一位长得相当精壮的年轻僧人, 他正在整理药材。\n"
msgstr "A sturdy young monk, busy sorting herbs.\n"

msgid "替流云轩帮这个忙，做「流云轩的帮手」。\n山烟寺和东方神教是死对头：帮了流云轩，朱鸿雪的令就不会再交给你。\n要帮吗？"
msgstr "Lend Drifting Cloud Lodge a hand, as \"Helper of Drifting Cloud Lodge.\"\nMountain Mist Temple and the Golden Crow Order are mortal enemies: if you help the Lodge, Zhu Hongxue will no longer hand his orders to you.\nWill you help?"

msgid "看了你一眼，低下头接着整理药材，一句话也不说。"
msgstr " glances at you, lowers his head and goes on sorting herbs without a word."

msgid "流云轩的事，不劳施主了。"
msgstr "The affairs of Drifting Cloud Lodge are no concern of yours, Benefactor."

msgid "鬼卒抓的伤，流云轩现在治得了——头陀师兄一掌按下去，寒气冒成一缕白烟。"
msgstr "A wound from a Ghost Soldier's grab, Drifting Cloud Lodge can treat now. When Senior Brother the Ascetic presses a palm down, the chill rises as a thread of white smoke."

msgid "方丈说，早十年就该开那道门。"
msgstr "The Abbot said that door should have been opened ten years ago."

msgid "鬼卒抓的伤，流云轩还是治不了。……方丈说，本寺一脉。"
msgstr "A wound from a Ghost Soldier's grab, Drifting Cloud Lodge still cannot treat... The Abbot said, this temple keeps to its own line."

msgid "老葛回乔阴了。方丈守了他三天三夜……那只右手是保不住了。"
msgstr "Old Ge went back to Tallshade. The Abbot kept watch over him three days and nights... That right hand could not be saved."

msgid "老葛好了，回乔阴去了。……那头陀的手，热得跟炭一样。"
msgstr "Old Ge is well and has gone back to Tallshade... That ascetic's hands were as hot as coals."

msgid "药喂下去了，寒气还是退不下去。"
msgstr "The medicine has gone down, and still the chill will not go down."

msgid "方丈的方子：附子、麝香、鬼臼。三味齐了，拿来给我煎（问我「煎药」）。"
msgstr "The Abbot's prescription: aconite, musk, mayapple root. When all three are gathered, bring them to me to decoct (ask me about \"Brewing Medicine\")."

msgid "乔阴来的樵夫，伤口是冷的。去前殿问方丈「流云轩」。"
msgstr "The woodcutter from Tallshade, his wound is cold. Go to the front hall and ask the Abbot about \"Drifting Cloud Lodge.\""

msgid "师兄，乔阴来的樵夫老葛，在树王坟被鬼卒抓了一把，伤口是冷的。"
msgstr "Senior Brother, Old Ge, the woodcutter from Tallshade, was grabbed by a Ghost Soldier at Tree King's Tomb. The wound is cold."

msgid "方丈的药压不住。去前殿问方丈「流云轩」吧。"
msgstr "The Abbot's medicine cannot hold it down. Go to the front hall and ask the Abbot about \"Drifting Cloud Lodge.\""

msgid "朝草垫上那个裹着两床被子的人努了努嘴。"
msgstr " jerks his chin toward the person on the straw mat, wrapped in two quilts."

msgid "乔阴来的樵夫，姓葛，在树王坟被鬼卒抓了一把。伤口是冷的，方丈的药压不住。"
msgstr "A woodcutter from Tallshade, surnamed Ge, was grabbed by a Ghost Soldier at Tree King's Tomb. The wound is cold, and the Abbot's medicine cannot hold it down."

msgid "你肯帮忙？……好。去前殿问方丈「流云轩」，他开方子。"
msgstr "You are willing to help?... Good. Go to the front hall and ask the Abbot about \"Drifting Cloud Lodge.\" He will write the prescription."

msgid "煎药"
msgstr "Brewing Medicine"

msgid "药喂过了。"
msgstr "The medicine has been fed to him."

msgid "叹了口气，把药渣倒回罐里，又煎了一碗。"
msgstr " sighs, pours the dregs back into the pot and brews another bowl."

msgid "这一碗，别再洒了。"
msgstr "Do not spill this one again."

msgid "药在你手里，去喂他（「给」老葛）。我得看着火。"
msgstr "The medicine is in your hands. Go feed him (give it to Old Ge). I must watch the fire."

msgid "native:sanyen/fuzi"
msgstr "native:sanyen/fuzi"

msgid "native:snow/musk"
msgstr "native:snow/musk"

msgid "native:choyin/guijiu"
msgstr "native:choyin/guijiu"

msgid "把三味药摊在案上，一样一样地看过。"
msgstr " spreads the three herbs out on the table and examines them one by one."

msgid "附子、麝香、鬼臼——齐了。"
msgstr "Aconite, musk, mayapple root—all here."

msgid "药僧生起小炉子，药罐里咕嘟咕嘟地翻着黑汤，满屋子的药味更冲了。\n"
msgstr "The Medicine Monk lights a small stove. The medicine pot bubbles with black broth, and the smell of herbs in the room grows stronger.\n"

msgid "煎好了。你扶他起来喂（「给」老葛）——我得看着火。"
msgstr "It is brewed. Help him up and feed him (give it to Old Ge). I must watch the fire."

msgid "三味还没齐：附子在药圃，麝香找雪亭的杨掌柜，鬼臼在乔阴树王坟边。"
msgstr "The three ingredients are not all here yet. Aconite is in the herb garden. For musk, ask Shopkeeper Yang in Snow Pavilion. Mayapple root grows by Tree King's Tomb in Tallshade."

msgid "煎什么药？方丈没开方子。"
msgstr "Brew what medicine? The Abbot has written no prescription."

msgid "看见你进来，放下了手里的药杵。"
msgstr " sees you come in and puts down the pestle."

msgid "老葛回乔阴了。方丈守了他三天三夜，命保住了——那只右手，抬不起来了。"
msgstr "Old Ge went back to Tallshade. The Abbot kept watch over him three days and nights, and his life was saved. But that right hand can no longer be raised."

msgid "……那头陀不是坏人。他站在金门外十年，一句话没说过。"
msgstr "...That ascetic is no bad man. He stood outside the Golden Gate for ten years and never said a word."

msgid "他练的那门经，是从番坊来的。番坊的日陀罗寺。"
msgstr "The sutra he practices came from the Foreign Quarter. Ritola Temple in the Foreign Quarter."

msgid "一位长得肥肥胖胖, 福福泰泰的中年僧人。\n"
msgstr "A plump, comfortable-looking middle-aged monk.\n"

msgid "阿弥陀佛 !! 贫僧的菜刀是用来切菜的, 不是用来砍人的。"
msgstr "Amitabha!! This poor monk's cleaver is for cutting vegetables, not for cutting people."

msgid "一个天真无邪的小和尚, 一颗圆滚滚光溜溜可爱的小光头, 让人看了\n就十分的喜欢他。他正在为油灯添上香油。\n"
msgstr "An innocent little monk with a round, shiny, adorable little bald head, so lovable at a glance. He is topping up the oil lamps with fragrant oil.\n"

msgid "师父! 救命啊!!  啊....不要打我..:("
msgstr "Shifu! Help!! Ah... Do not hit me... :("

msgid "一个肥肥胖胖的僧人, 看他拿著扫把有一下没一下的扫著, 就知道他\n平常也是摸鱼大王。\n"
msgstr "A plump monk, sweeping with the broom just now and then. You can tell at once he is the temple's champion slacker.\n"

msgid "这里已靠近北岸，江水齐胸深，偶尔一个湍流卷过来，仿佛要将人\n打入江底似的。\n"
msgstr "You are near the north bank here. The river is chest deep, and now and then a rush of current rolls in as if meaning to throw you to the river bottom.\n"

msgid "这里虽说是泓水最窄的地方，可泓水在这里转了个弯，所以常有暗\n流出现。常有过往船只在这里沉入江底，连水性了得的船夫们也不敢在\n风大浪急时过江。\n"
msgstr "This is the narrowest point of the Deepwater, but the river takes a bend here, so hidden currents often appear. Passing boats often sink to the river bottom here, and even boatmen of great skill dare not cross when the wind is high and the waves rough.\n"

msgid "这里靠近南岸，江水甚是寒冷。从这儿已能望到山烟寺的一角。\n"
msgstr "You are near the south bank, and the water is bitterly cold. From here you can already see a corner of Mountain Mist Temple.\n"

msgid "这里是泓水南岸，再往南不远就是日照山了。\n"
msgstr "This is the south bank of the Deepwater. Not far to the south is Sunlit Mountain.\n"

msgid "这是条崎岖的黄土小径，北面通向渡口，往南小路蜿蜒而上，通往\n山顶。\n"
msgstr "A rugged yellow-earth path. To the north it leads to the ferry landing; to the south the path winds upward toward the mountaintop.\n"

msgid "这是条崎岖的黄土小径。\n"
msgstr "A rugged yellow-earth path.\n"

msgid "这是一条铺著生满青苔大石的山路，但是路面大概常有人行走，因\n此倒也并不湿滑，往南是一段石阶缓缓下山，往北则是通往山中的山路\n，东面的山壁上刻著「山烟寺」几个大字，看起来岁月已经颇久了。\n"
msgstr "This mountain road is laid with large stones thick with moss, but people probably walk it often, so it is not slippery. To the south a flight of stone steps leads gently down the mountain; to the north the road goes into the mountains. On the mountain wall to the east are carved the words \"Mountain Mist Temple,\" which look quite old.\n"

msgid "这条山路到这里转了个弯，往东穿过一个山壁上凿出来的隧道，往\n南则顺著山势缓缓下山。\n"
msgstr "The mountain road makes a turn here. To the east it passes through a tunnel cut in the mountain wall; to the south it follows the lie of the mountain gently downhill.\n"

msgid "这里是往山烟寺的山门，山烟寺在你的西面不远，由于寺中的老方丈\n玄智和尚医术通神，不少受过恩惠的各地富豪将山烟寺修整得金碧辉煌，\n庄严雄伟，因此山烟寺规模虽然不及京城的白象禅院，但是名气却是\n大得多了。\n"
msgstr "This is the gateway to Mountain Mist Temple, which lies not far to your west. Because the temple's old abbot, Monk Xuanzhi, heals with godlike skill, many wealthy people from all over, grateful for his kindness, have had the temple refurbished until it gleams with gold, solemn and magnificent. Though Mountain Mist Temple is smaller than the White Elephant Chan Monastery in the Capital, it is far more famous.\n"

msgid "你走进了一个凿穿山壁开成的隧道，东边是隧道的出口，往西不远\n处也可以从这里瞧见西边的出口，一股硫磺的味道从隧道壁中传来，想\n必左近便有温泉或是火山。\n"
msgstr "You walk into a tunnel cut through the mountain wall. The tunnel mouth is to the east, and a little way west you can already see the exit on the other side. A smell of sulfur comes from the tunnel walls; there must be hot springs or a volcano nearby.\n"

msgid "你走进了一个凿穿山壁开成的隧道，隧道也不甚长，约七、八丈左\n右，西边就是隧道的出口，隧道中你可以闻到一股硫磺的味道，想必左\n近便有温泉或是火山。\n"
msgstr "You walk into a tunnel cut through the mountain wall. The tunnel is not long, seventy or eighty feet or so, and the exit is to the west. You can smell sulfur in the tunnel; there must be hot springs or a volcano nearby.\n"

msgid "这里是山烟寺前的空地，平日僧人们就在这里练武强身，空地四周\n种了一排白杨树，靠北边的地方放了一堆用来锻链膂力的砖头，寺门就\n在你的北边, 东边则是山门。\n"
msgstr "This is the open ground before Mountain Mist Temple, where the monks usually practice martial arts to strengthen their bodies. A row of white poplars is planted around it, and to the north a pile of bricks lies ready for training strength. The temple door is to your north, and the mountain gate to the east.\n"

msgid "出现在眼前的是一座宏伟壮丽的寺门, 上方覆著镶金的瓦片, 瓦\n片的下方挂著一方翡翠匾额, 上面写著『山烟寺』三个烫金大字。正\n中的大门正紧紧关闭著, 只有在迎接大人物时才会开启。现在只开著\n两旁的偏门。\n"
msgstr "Before you rises a magnificent temple door, roofed above with gold-inlaid tiles, below which hangs a jade plaque inscribed in gilt with three large characters, \"Mountain Mist Temple.\" The great central door is shut tight and opens only to receive important persons. Now only the side doors on either side are open.\n"

msgid "一条铺著青石板的大道, 两旁种植一排芍药。北方就是大雄宝殿\n, 一座上覆金瓦的雄伟建筑, 屋檐的四个角落雕就著四只栩栩如的金\n龙, 屋檐下还各挂著一串金风铃, 清风吹来, 发出阵阵清脆的铃声。\n东边有条小一点的石板路, 阵阵的药香就从东边传来。\n"
msgstr "A broad road paved with bluestone slabs, peonies planted in a row on both sides. To the north is the Mahavira Hall, a majestic building roofed in gold tiles; at the four corners of its eaves are carved four lifelike golden dragons, and under the eaves hang strings of golden wind chimes that ring clearly when the breeze blows. To the east a smaller flagstone path leads off, and a scent of herbs comes drifting from that way.\n"

msgid "你正走在一条青石板铺造的小径上, 两旁种植著一排芍药。阵阵\n药香随风送了过来, 原来北边是片广大的药圃。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a path of bluestone slabs, peonies planted in a row on both sides. A scent of herbs is carried on the breeze; it comes from a broad herb garden to the north.\n"

msgid "一片广阔的药圃, 药香就是从这里散发出来的。这里似乎经过详\n细的规划, 一块一块的, 哪边种当归, 哪边种枸杞, 绝不会混在一起\n。只是看来看去都只是些寻常的药材, 看不到比较珍贵特殊的。\n"
msgstr "A broad herb garden, from which the scent of herbs drifts. It seems to have been carefully planned, plot by plot—angelica here, wolfberry there, never mixed together. But look as you will, they are only common herbs, nothing rare or special.\n"

msgid "一阵耀眼的金光向你袭来, 你定神一看原来是座一丈八尺的如来\n佛祖金身, 坐在一座三尺高的莲台上, 前方的香炉里香烟缓缓飘上天\n。这整座山烟寺都是由上好的桧木搭建而成, 南方则是两扇敞开的金\n门, 价值不菲, 气势不凡, 在佛像的右侧有道黄布幔, 布幔后似乎是\n条通道。西边则传来阵阵的流水声。\n"
msgstr "A dazzling golden light strikes you. Steadying yourself, you see a golden-bodied Tathagata Buddha, eighteen feet tall, seated on a lotus pedestal three feet high, incense smoke curling slowly up from the censer before him. All of Mountain Mist Temple is built of fine cypress. To the south are the two open leaves of the Golden Gate, costly and impressive. To the right of the Buddha is a yellow cloth curtain, and behind it there seems to be a passage. From the west comes the sound of flowing water.\n"

msgid "你正站在山烟寺的庭园里, 这庭园里不但花草茂盛, 而且小桥流\n水, 假山凉亭, 应有尽有, 气派非凡。北边有间雅房, 东边穿过拱门\n则是大殿。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in the garden of Mountain Mist Temple. Not only are flowers and plants lush here, there are small bridges and running water, rockeries and pavilions, everything, with an air of grandeur. To the north is an elegant room; through the arch to the east is the great hall.\n"

msgid "你走进这里, 一阵刺鼻药味向你扑了过来。这是一间相当宽敞的\n的大房间, 是玄智方丈为人看病的地方, 也是存放药草的地方。与屋\n顶齐高的木柜, 画分成许多抽屉, 里面分别摆放著药材。两侧的墙璧\n上挂了许许多多的檀木扁额。\n"
msgstr "As you walk in, a sharp smell of medicine rushes at you. This is a fairly spacious room, the place where Abbot Xuanzhi treats the sick and also where the herbs are stored. Wooden cabinets as tall as the roof are divided into many drawers, each holding herbs. On the walls to both sides hang many sandalwood plaques.\n"

msgid "你正走在一条长廊上, 两旁种植著一排月桂树。南边的布幔后是\n大殿, 北方则是后殿。东边是个不小的广场, 广场上正晒著一些不知\n名的药草。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a long corridor with bay laurel trees planted in rows on both sides. South, beyond the cloth curtain, is the great hall; north is the rear hall. To the east is a fair-sized square where some unidentified herbs are drying in the sun.\n"

msgid "你正走在一条长廊上, 两旁分别是流云轩及后殿的外墙, 墙上画\n著大慈大悲观世音菩萨救苦救难的事迹。长廊往东西两边延伸, 西边\n的尽是一间相当大的房屋。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a long corridor. On either side are the outer walls of Drifting Cloud Lodge and of the rear hall, painted with scenes of the Great Compassionate Guanyin Bodhisattva rescuing the suffering. The corridor stretches east and west, and at the west end is a fairly large house.\n"

msgid "一间整理相乾净的厨房, 西北边的角落里砌了两个大灶, 灶里正\n燃著熊熊大火, 灶上分别放著一个大锅 及一个蒸笼\n。锅子及蒸笼正冒著阵阵的热气以及香气, 你忍不住想打开来看看。\n"
msgstr "A tidy, clean kitchen. In the northwest corner are built two big stoves with roaring fires, and on them sit a large pot and a steamer, both giving off steam and fragrance. You can hardly resist lifting the lid to look.\n"

msgid "一间宽大的后殿, 正中有一尊药师如来的金身塑像。四周的墙上\n唯妙唯肖地彩绘著十八罗汉, 每个罗汉的旁边并写著他得道升天的过\n程。\n"
msgstr "A spacious rear hall, with a golden statue of the Medicine Buddha at the center. On the surrounding walls the Eighteen Arhats are painted lifelike, and beside each Arhat is written the story of how he attained enlightenment and ascended.\n"

msgid "你正站在两座高塔前, 左边这一座名曰: 『明心塔』, 右方名叫\n『见性塔』。历来, 当山烟寺中的高僧涅盘后, 遗体火化后所得的舍\n利子就存放在这两座塔里。\n"
msgstr "You stand before two tall pagodas. The one on the left is called \"Bright Heart Pagoda,\" the one on the right \"Seeing Nature Pagoda.\" Down the years, when a high monk of Mountain Mist Temple has entered nirvana, the relics gained from his cremated body have been kept in these two pagodas.\n"

msgid "┌————————┐ ┌————————┐ ┌————————┐\n│                │ │                │ │                │\n│ 妙  手  回  春 │ │ 华  陀  再  世 │ │ 扁  鹊  重  生 │\n│                │ │                │ │                │\n│    发呆部部长  │ │    打混部部长  │ │    摸鱼部部长  │\n│    兼奸商部部长│ │    兼强盗部部长│ │    兼奸商部次长│\n│         Elon 赠│ │     风火血舞 赠│ │       梦忆柔 赠│\n└————————┘ └————————┘ └————————┘\n┌————————┐ ┌————————┐ ┌————————┐\n│                │ │                │ │                │\n│ 药  到  病  除 │ │ 仁  心  德  术 │ │ 杏  坛  佳  话 │\n│                │ │                │ │                │\n│                │ │                │ │                │\n│    插花部部长  │ │    无言部部长  │ │    发呆部次长  │\n│     雷神之子 赠│ │     上官逸倩 赠│ │       克某某 赠│\n└————————┘ └————————┘ └————————┘\n┌————————┐ ┌————————┐ ┌————————┐\n│                │ │                │ │                │\n│ 悬  壶  济  世 │ │ 技  惊  关  羽 │ │ 医  界  圣  手 │\n│                │ │ 吓  死  曹  操 │ │                │\n│    打混部次长  │ │                │ │                │\n│    兼强盗部次长│ │    摸鱼部次长  │ │    发呆部食客  │\n│      托佛尼亚赠│ │         陈平 赠│ │         悟明 赠│\n└————————┘ └————————┘ └————————┘\n          ┌———————————————————┐ \n          │                                      │ \n          │      全      是      放      屁      │ \n          │                                      │ \n          │                                      │ \n          │                超  级  打  屁  大  神│ \n          │                  安 尼 席 洛 特 尔 赠│ \n          └———————————————————┘ \n"
msgstr "Plaques hang on the walls, each with its donor's name:\n\"Hand That Brings Back Spring\"—Head of the Daydreaming Dept. and Head of the Profiteering Dept. Presented by Elon.\n\"Hua Tuo Reborn\"—Head of the Loafing Dept. and Head of the Banditry Dept. Presented by Fenghuo Xuewu.\n\"Bian Que Returns\"—Head of the Slacking Dept. and Deputy Head of the Profiteering Dept. Presented by Mengyi Rou.\n\"Medicine Comes, Illness Goes\"—Head of the Flower-Arranging Dept. Presented by Leishen Zhi Zi.\n\"Kind Heart, Virtuous Art\"—Head of the Silent Dept. Presented by Shangguan Yiqian.\n\"A Fine Tale of the Apricot Grove\"—Deputy Head of the Daydreaming Dept. Presented by Ke Moumou.\n\"Gourd Hung Out to Save the World\"—Deputy Head of the Loafing Dept. and Deputy Head of the Banditry Dept. Presented by Tuofoniya.\n\"Skill That Startles Guan Yu and Scares Cao Cao to Death\"—Deputy Head of the Slacking Dept. Presented by Chen Ping.\n\"Saint Hand of Medicine\"—Freeloader of the Daydreaming Dept. Presented by Wuming.\n\"It's All Hot Air\"—Super Hot-Air Divinity. Presented by Annixiluoteer.\n"

msgid "一个冒著腾腾的热气的黑色大铁锅, 里头正煮著小米粥。\n"
msgstr "A big black iron pot, steaming hot, with millet porridge cooking inside.\n"

msgid "拿馒头"
msgstr "Take a bun"

msgid "你从蒸笼里拿出一粒热乎乎的馒头。"
msgstr "You take a hot bun from the steamer."

msgid "突然房间里好像传来梦忆柔的声音说拿太多小心吃到噎著哦!!"
msgstr "Suddenly a voice that sounds like Mengyi Rou's comes from somewhere in the room, saying you had better not take too many or you'll choke on them!!"

msgid "烧饭僧说:阿弥陀佛 !! 施主偷东西是不好的行为哦!!!"
msgstr "The Cook Monk says, \"Amitabha!! Benefactor, stealing is bad conduct!!!\""

msgid "一个竹藤编成的蒸笼, 阵阵的香味使你想打开来瞧一瞧。\n"
msgstr "A steamer woven of bamboo and rattan. The fragrance makes you want to open it and look.\n"

msgid "采"
msgstr "Gather"

msgid "附子已经挖了一块。药圃里别的，都是些寻常的药材。\n"
msgstr "You have already dug up a piece of aconite. Everything else in the herb garden is common herbs.\n"

msgid "你照方丈说的，到东边那一畦拨开叶子，挖出一块乌黑的块根——附子。\n"
msgstr "As the Abbot told you, you part the leaves in the plot to the east and dig out a lump of black root—aconite.\n"

msgid "药圃一块一块的，哪边种当归，哪边种枸杞，绝不会混在一起。只是看来看去都只是些寻常的药材，没有方子，你也不知道该采哪一味。\n"
msgstr "The herb garden is laid out plot by plot, angelica here, wolfberry there, never mixed together. But look as you will, they are only common herbs, and with no prescription you do not know which herb to gather.\n"

msgid "烧饭僧说:阿弥陀佛 !! 施主请勿动手动脚, 妨碍贫僧煮饭。\n"
msgstr "The Cook Monk says, \"Amitabha!! Benefactor, please do not fiddle about and get in the way of this poor monk's cooking.\"\n"

msgid "你打开蒸笼的盖子, 一股热气冒向你的脸上。\n你仔细一看, 只见蒸笼里排著一粒粒又白又Ｑ的大馒头。\n"
msgstr "You lift the lid of the steamer and a blast of hot steam hits your face.\nLooking closely, you see rows of big, white, springy buns in the steamer.\n"

msgid "药师殿"
msgstr "Medicine Buddha Hall"

msgid "一件式样简单的青布道袍\n"
msgstr "A simple blue-green cloth Daoist robe.\n"

msgid "这似乎是一本魔法的入门书，里面说了一些稀奇古怪的和一般的武学不同的东西\n"
msgstr "This seems to be an introductory book of magic. It speaks of strange things unlike ordinary martial arts.\n"

msgid "这似乎是一本符咒的简介，里面画着一些稀奇古怪的符号\n"
msgstr "This seems to be a primer of talismans, with strange symbols drawn in it.\n"

msgid "一柄以藤木为柄, 马尾为丝的拂尘\n"
msgstr "A whisk with a rattan handle and strands of horsetail hair.\n"

msgid "一件补了又补, 洗到泛白的旧道袍\n"
msgstr "An old Daoist robe, patched and patched again and washed pale.\n"

msgid "一顶青铜道冠\n"
msgstr "A bronze Daoist crown.\n"

msgid "一件胸前绣有八卦的黄色道袍。\n"
msgstr "A yellow Daoist robe with the Eight Trigrams embroidered on the chest.\n"

msgid "一顶镶著一块碧玉的道冠。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist crown set with a piece of green jade.\n"

msgid "一个福福泰泰的中年人, 他正气喘嘘嘘地走著石梯道\n"
msgstr "A plump, comfortable-looking middle-aged man, puffing his way up the stone steps.\n"

msgid "茅山派第八代弟子"
msgstr "Mount Mao School, Generation 8 disciple"

msgid "一个长得眉清目秀的小男孩, 正努力地在打扫石阶\n"
msgstr "A fine-featured little boy, hard at work sweeping the stone steps.\n"

msgid "僵尸侍者是林忌的弟子，着一身黑色的道袍\n"
msgstr "The Zombie Attendant is a disciple of Lin Ji and wears a black Daoist robe.\n"

msgid "僵尸侍者说道：我们茅山派实力最强！谁敢欺负我们？\n"
msgstr "The Zombie Attendant says, \"Our Mount Mao School is the strongest! Who dares bully us?\"\n"

msgid "僵尸侍者说道：大家快加入茅山派吧! \n"
msgstr "The Zombie Attendant says, \"Everyone, come join Mount Mao School!\" \n"

msgid "茅山派不和别派的人过招。"
msgstr "Mount Mao School does not spar with people of other schools."

msgid "僵尸护法是茅山派的护法，着一身黑色的道袍\n"
msgstr "The Zombie Guardian is a guardian of Mount Mao School and wears a black Daoist robe.\n"

msgid "一个长得眉清目秀的小男孩, 正忙著浇花除草\n"
msgstr "A fine-featured little boy, busy watering the flowers and pulling weeds.\n"

msgid "一位四处云游的老道士, 他正在观心观挂单中。\n看他饱经沧桑的脸孔, 似乎他也是经历过无数的大风大浪。\n"
msgstr "A wandering old Daoist, currently staying at Clear Heart Abbey as a guest.\nThe weathered lines of his face suggest he has been through countless storms.\n"

msgid "无量寿佛 ! 贫道年迈力衰, 怎是施主的对手。"
msgstr "Infinite Life! This poor Daoist is old and weak. How could he be a match for you, Benefactor?"

msgid "茅山派第六代弟子"
msgstr "Mount Mao School, Generation 6 disciple"

msgid "一位神色和平的中年道士, 他正在教授他的徒弟如何运功导气\n"
msgstr "A calm-faced middle-aged Daoist, teaching his disciples how to circulate their Inner Force and lead the Qi.\n"

msgid "茅山派第七代弟子"
msgstr "Mount Mao School, Generation 7 disciple"

msgid "一位身材魁武的年轻道士, 他正在练拳, 你看他舞得虎虎生风\n"
msgstr "A sturdily built young Daoist, practicing his fists; you watch him whirl them with a whistling of wind.\n"

msgid "一位神情专注的道士, 他正轮值到看守藏经楼。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist with a focused expression, on duty guarding the Scripture Library.\n"

msgid "这是一条宽敞坚实的青石大道, 大道沿著山腰往南向山下延伸, 东\n边是一条石英岩石阶蜿蜒往山上而去。在石阶的尽头, 是一座颇为雄伟\n的道观, 在江湖跑过的人都知道, 那是茅山派的所在地。\n"
msgstr "This is a wide, solid bluestone road. It runs south along the mountainside down the hill, and to the east a quartzite stair winds up the mountain. At the end of the stair stands a rather imposing Daoist abbey; anyone who has been around the jianghu knows it is the seat of Mount Mao School.\n"

msgid "你正站在这阶梯的起点, 纯白色宽敞的石英岩阶梯蜿蜒而上, 在青\n翠的山色中形成一条纯白色的巨龙。抬头仰望石阶尽头的那座庙宇, 虽\n然无情的岁月已经在它身上留下痕迹, 但仍不失其庄严神圣的气息。\n"
msgstr "You are standing at the foot of the stair. The pure white, wide quartzite steps wind upward, forming a great white dragon in the green of the hills. Looking up at the temple at the stair's end, you see that the merciless years have left their marks on it, yet it has not lost its solemn, sacred air.\n"

msgid "你正走在一道长长的石英岩阶梯上, 阶梯的两侧种植著一排高耸\n的松树。雪亭镇就在西边不远的山下, 你隐约还能听到从镇上传来的\n话语声。\n"
msgstr "You are walking up a long quartzite stair, with a row of tall pines planted on both sides. Snow Pavilion is just down the mountain to the west, and you can faintly hear voices from the town.\n"

msgid "你正走在一道长长的石英岩阶梯上, 阶梯的两侧种植著一排高耸\n的松树。雪亭镇就在西边不远的山下, 你隐约还能听到从镇上传来的\n话语声。阶梯从这里弯向北边。\n"
msgstr "You are walking up a long quartzite stair, with a row of tall pines planted on both sides. Snow Pavilion is just down the mountain to the west, and you can faintly hear voices from the town. The stair bends north from here.\n"

msgid "你正走在一道长长的石英岩阶梯上, 阶梯的两侧种植著一排高耸\n的松树。抬头望望东北边那座高耸挺拔的山峰, 在云雾飘渺的山顶上\n, 矗立著一座雄伟的白色楼阁。\n"
msgstr "You are walking up a long quartzite stair, with a row of tall pines planted on both sides. Looking up at the lofty, towering peak to the northeast, you see on its cloud-wreathed summit a majestic white pavilion.\n"

msgid "长长的阶梯也终将到了尽头, 阶梯的尽头矗立著一座山门, 山门\n上龙飞凤舞地写了三个字, 笔力苍劲有力显得气势非凡。山风吹来带\n著丝丝的寒意, 令你有股高处不胜寒的感觉。\n"
msgstr "The long stair finally reaches its end. At the top stands a mountain gate with three characters written in flowing, dragon-and-phoenix strokes, powerful and full of spirit. The mountain wind brings a hint of cold, and you feel the chill of the heights.\n"

msgid "在你眼前是一座古色古香的山门, 上面以龙飞凤舞的笔迹书写著\n「灵心观」三字, 据说是当年太阳神君「杞庸」亲笔所题。往北方看\n过去是一个颇大的广场。门前则是一条石英岩铺设的阶梯沿著山腰往\n东而下。\n"
msgstr "Before you is an old-fashioned mountain gate, with \"Clear Heart Abbey\" written above in flowing hand, said to have been brushed by the Sun Lord Qi Yong himself. To the north is a fairly large square. In front of the gate a quartzite stair runs down the mountainside to the east.\n"

msgid "你正站在灵心观前的广场前, 一片用石英岩铺成的广场。一对雄\n伟的石狮子站在庙门的两侧, 狮子的两侧立著两根雕著龙纹的石柱。\n广场的中央还有一个大香炉, 香炉里正冒著袅袅的香烟。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in the square before Clear Heart Abbey, paved with quartzite. A pair of mighty stone lions flank the temple gate, and beside the lions stand two stone pillars carved with dragons. In the middle of the square is a big incense burner, wisps of incense smoke curling from it.\n"

msgid "你现在来到灵心观的大殿, 在你的眼前是一尊真武大帝的金身。\n在金身的下方是一张朱红色的大供桌, 上面排满了鲜花素果。在桌子\n的前方则摆放著三四个蒲团。东西两侧的圆形拱门通往连接后殿的回\n廊。走过南边的红漆木门就是广场。\n"
msgstr "You have come to the main hall of Clear Heart Abbey. Before you is a golden statue of the Emperor Zhenwu. Below it is a big vermilion offering table covered with fresh flowers and vegetarian fruit. In front of the table lie three or four prayer cushions. Round arched doors on the east and west lead to the corridors that join the rear hall. Through the red-lacquered wooden door to the south is the square.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在一条回廊上, 西北方是一座花木扶苏的天井, 穿过\n西边的圆形拱门就可以回到大殿。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a corridor. To the northwest is a courtyard thick with flowers and trees; through the round arch to the west you can return to the main hall.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在一条回廊上, 东北方是一座花木扶苏的天井, 穿过\n东边的圆形拱门就可以回到大殿。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a corridor. To the northeast is a courtyard thick with flowers and trees; through the round arch to the east you can return to the main hall.\n"

msgid "你正走在一条回廊之上, 回廊往南北延伸, 两端分别连接著大殿\n及后殿。西边是一座花草扶苏的天井, 东边则是一排厢房。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a corridor that runs north and south, its ends joining the main hall and the rear hall. To the west is a courtyard of flowers and plants; to the east, a row of side rooms.\n"

msgid "你正走在一条回廊之上, 回廊往南北延伸, 两端分别连接著大殿\n及后殿。东边是一座花草扶苏的天井, 西边是一间上了锁的房间。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a corridor that runs north and south, its ends joining the main hall and the rear hall. To the east is a courtyard of flowers and plants; to the west, a locked room.\n"

msgid "你正站在灵心观的天井里, 这里种植著一些花草树木, 在西北角\n落里有著一口水井。北边就是供俸茅山派历代掌门人的地方, 南边则\n是一面墙, 墙的另一侧就是大殿。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in the courtyard of Clear Heart Abbey. Flowers, plants and trees grow here, and in the northwest corner is a well. To the north is the place where the successive masters of Mount Mao School are venerated; to the south is a wall, and on its other side is the main hall.\n"

msgid "这是一间供香客或其他江湖同道休息挂单的客房, 屋子里只是简\n单地摆放著几件家俱。从西边的天井中, 传来了阵阵的花香。\n"
msgstr "This is a guest room where pilgrims and other jianghu fellows rest and lodge. The room holds only a few simple pieces of furniture. From the courtyard to the west drifts the scent of flowers.\n"

msgid "你正站在回廊转角的地方, 回廊从这往西及南边而去。在走廊\n的东侧是一排厢房。北方是一条铺著青石板的小径。\n"
msgstr "You are standing at a corner of the corridor, which leads west and south. To the east of the corridor is a row of side rooms. To the north is a path paved with bluestone slabs.\n"

msgid "你现在走在围绕著天井的回廊上, 回廊往东西两侧延伸, 南边就\n是天井, 你也许可以走过去赏赏花, 散散心。在你的北方, 走过那扇\n红漆木门就是后殿, 也是茅山派供奉历代掌门人灵位的地方。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along the corridor around the courtyard, which stretches east and west. To the south is the courtyard, where you might stroll over to admire the flowers and clear your head. To the north, through the red-lacquered wooden door, is the rear hall, where the spirit tablets of the successive masters of Mount Mao School are enshrined.\n"

msgid "你正站在回廊转角的地方, 回廊从这往东边及南边而去。在北边\n是一间大房子, 里面传来阵阵叱喝的声音。\n"
msgstr "You are standing at a corner of the corridor, which leads east and south. To the north is a big house, from which come sounds of shouting.\n"

msgid "这是一间供香客或其他江湖同道休息挂单的客房, 屋子里只是简\n单地摆放著几件家俱。你闻到天井中传来淡淡的花香。\n"
msgstr "This is a guest room where pilgrims and other jianghu fellows rest and lodge. The room holds only a few simple pieces of furniture. You smell a faint scent of flowers from the courtyard.\n"

msgid "你正站在灵心观的后殿, 正中央供奉著茅山派开山祖师张天师的\n画像, 在画像的下方摆放著当年张天师收妖伏魔时所用的宝剑。剑的\n两旁陪祀著历代掌门人的牌位。走出南边的红漆木门可以看到天井。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in the rear hall of Clear Heart Abbey. At the center hangs the portrait of the founder of Mount Mao School, Celestial Master Zhang, and below the portrait lies the sword he used when subduing demons. On both sides of the sword are placed the tablets of the successive masters. Go out through the red-lacquered wooden door to the south and you will see the courtyard.\n"

msgid "你正站在一间宽阔的大房间里, 这里是茅山派弟子打坐练功的地\n方, 空气中弥漫著一股股汗臭味。四周的墙壁上画著一幅幅经脉穴道\n图。靠近墙壁的地上则摆著一个个练功用的木人。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in a spacious big room where the disciples of Mount Mao School sit in meditation and train. The air is heavy with the smell of sweat. On the surrounding walls hang pictures of the meridians and acupoints, and by the walls stand rows of wooden dummies for practice.\n"

msgid "一条铺著青石板的小径, 两侧高大的松树, 偶有松针缓缓飘落。\n树干上布满了青苔, 甚至还有些蔓延到石板上。南边通往回廊, 西侧\n则是后殿。\n"
msgstr "A path paved with bluestone slabs, tall pines on both sides, pine needles drifting down now and then. The trunks are covered in moss, some of it even creeping onto the slabs. To the south the path leads to the corridor; to the west is the rear hall.\n"

msgid "绕过了后殿, 出现在眼前的是一栋木造两层高的屋子。屋子四周\n的门窗都紧紧的关著, 门口上方挂著一方蓝色琉璃匾额, 上书『藏经\n楼』三个金字。门旁立著一个石碑。\n"
msgstr "Having gone around the rear hall, you see before you a two-story wooden building. Its doors and windows are all shut tight, and above the door hangs a blue glazed plaque with three golden characters: \"Scripture Library.\" Beside the door stands a stone stele.\n"

msgid "这里是灵心观中收藏书籍的地方, 四周的书架上堆了满满的书。\n有些书已经旧的纸张都泛黄了, 摸一摸可能就会散掉甚至变成飞灰。\n你再仔细的看了看, 发现这里都只是些寻常的修道的书籍, 似乎没有\n什么特别的。角落里有一座小小的木梯通往二楼。\n"
msgstr "This is where Clear Heart Abbey keeps its books. The shelves all around are piled full. Some of the books are so old their pages have yellowed, and a touch might make them crumble or even turn to dust. You look more closely and find only ordinary Daoist cultivation books, nothing special. In a corner, a small wooden ladder leads up to the second floor.\n"

msgid "上了楼来, 首先你看到一幅张天师的画像挂在对面的墙上, 画像\n的下方摆著一张覆著红布的桌子, 桌上整齐地放著茅山的镇教秘籍。\n"
msgstr "Upstairs, the first thing you see is a portrait of Celestial Master Zhang on the opposite wall. Below it stands a table covered with a red cloth, and on it the abbey's treasured secret manuals are neatly set out.\n"

msgid "红布桌上的镇教秘籍一函一函码得整整齐齐。你数过去，是六函；第七函的位置空着，红布上压着一张发黄的字条：\n\n    书我带走。师兄守山，我守人。\n\n"
msgstr "The treasured manuals on the red-cloth table sit in neat stacks, case by case. You count: six. The place for the seventh is empty, and on the red cloth lies a yellowed note:\n\n    I take the book. Senior Brother guards the mountain; I guard the people.\n\n"

msgid "石碑上写著 : \n\n    非\n    茅  不\n    山  得\n    弟  进\n    子  入\n\n"
msgstr "The stele reads:\n\n    No one but a\n    Mount Mao disciple\n    may enter\n\n"

msgid "一道无形的墙挡住了门口, 差点把你的鼻子给撞扁了。"
msgstr "An invisible wall blocks the doorway, and you nearly flatten your nose against it."

msgid "你推开门走了进去, 顺手把门关了起来。"
msgstr "You push open the door and go in, closing it behind you."

msgid "你拉开门大步走了出去, 随手把门带上。"
msgstr "You pull open the door, stride out, and close it behind you."

msgid "你一脚踩在青苔上, 不小心滑了一跤, 四脚朝天地摔在地上起不来。"
msgstr "You step on the moss, slip, and land flat on your back, arms and legs in the air, unable to get up."

msgid "一把极其沈重的大槌，要挥动这样的武器非得有过人的膂力不可。\n"
msgstr "An extremely heavy big sledgehammer. To swing a weapon like this, you need uncommon strength in the arms.\n"

msgid "一把沈重的钢刀，磨得又利又快，看起来相当具杀伤力。\n"
msgstr "A heavy steel saber, ground sharp and keen, and plainly very deadly.\n"

msgid "这种斧头的刃长柄短，是专门用来做兵器的斧头，近战具有相当强的\n杀伤力。\n"
msgstr "An axe with a long blade and a short handle, made specially as a weapon, and quite deadly in close combat.\n"

msgid "野羊山三寨主（代寨主）"
msgstr "Third Chief of Goathill (Acting Chief)"

msgid "黄霸原是关外一个山寨的寨主，后来因为逃避官府追捕而到也羊山\n避祸，他的成名武器是一对各重四十斤的大金槌，内功跟横练功夫\n也都有不错的造诣。\n大寨主、二寨主先后没了下落，如今野羊寨的事都是他说了算——只是每年得往北麓的道观纳供。\n"
msgstr "Huang Ba was once the chief of a mountain stockade beyond the frontier. Fleeing the government's pursuit, he came to Goathill to lie low. His famous weapons are a pair of great gold sledges, forty jin each, and he is well accomplished in neigong and iron-body training as well.\nThe First and Second Chiefs vanished one after the other, and now all of Goathill Stockade's affairs are his to decide—except that every year he must pay tribute to the abbey on the North Foot.\n"

msgid "纳供"
msgstr "Tribute"

msgid "说过的话老子不说第二遍。车在山路转角，去不去随你。"
msgstr "I don't say a thing twice. The cart's at the bend in the mountain road. Go or don't, suit yourself."

msgid "哼了一声。"
msgstr " grunts."

msgid "你倒打听得清楚。两年前北麓来了那群黑衣黑冠的道士，一座黑砖道观说起就起，自称逆灵宫。寨里折了一半弟兄。"
msgstr "You sure found out a lot. Two years back, a bunch of Daoists in black robes and black caps came to the north foot, and a black-brick abbey went up just like that. Calls itself the Black Palace. Half the brothers in the stockade fell."

msgid "半年前大寨主霍铮、二寨主一前一后没了下落，寨子就落到老子手里。老子打不过他们——每年纳供，金帛、牲口，他们要什么给什么，换这山上还有野羊寨。"
msgstr "Half a year ago the First Chief Huo Zheng and the Second Chief went missing one after the other, and the stockade fell into my hands. I can't beat 'em. Every year I pay tribute, gold and silks, livestock, whatever they want, and in exchange there's still a Goathill Stockade on this mountain."

msgid "把酒碗往桌上一顿。"
msgstr " slams the wine bowl down on the table."

msgid "今年的车今天就上去了，这会儿该到了山路转角。你要去，别说是老子说的。"
msgstr "This year's cart went up today. About now it should be at the bend in the mountain road. If ya go, don't say I told ya."

msgid "寨里的事，外人少打听。"
msgstr "Outsiders oughta ask less about the stockade's business."

msgid "前些日子茅山灵心观来了个小道士，说是替他们的林忌真人打听北麓那座道观——问寨里有没有人进去过，还出得来。"
msgstr "A few days back a little Daoist came from Clear Heart Abbey on Mount Mao, said he was askin' for Sage Lin Ji about that abbey at the north foot. Whether anyone in the stockade ever went in and still came out."

msgid "老子说有一个。……你要是不想再跟那群牛鼻子打交道，就当老子没说。"
msgstr "I said there was one... If ya don't wanna deal with that pack of ox-noses anymore, just pretend I never said it."

msgid "茅山？牛鼻子道士，老子不认得。"
msgstr "Mount Mao? Ox-nose Daoists, don't know 'em."

msgid "黄霸脸色一沉：北麓那座黑砖道观？少打听。要问，问纳供。"
msgstr "Huang Ba's face darkens. \"That black-brick abbey on the North Foot? Don't ask. If ya gotta ask, ask about tribute.\""

msgid "大哥在里屋。要见他，自己进去。"
msgstr "Big brother's in the back room. Wanna see him, go in yourself."

msgid "没了。野羊山现在姓黄。"
msgstr "Gone. Goathill's named Huang now."

msgid "霍铮？半年前让道观的人带走了。你问这个做什么。"
msgstr "Huo Zheng? The abbey's people took him away half a year ago. What d'ya want to know for?"

msgid "黑衣"
msgstr "Black Robe"

msgid "就那一顶，老子又不开成衣铺。"
msgstr "Just that one. I ain't runnin' a tailor's shop."

msgid "从墙角的箱子里翻出一顶黑冠，往你怀里一扔。"
msgstr " digs a black cap out of the chest in the corner and tosses it into your arms."

msgid "去年抓过一个落单的道士，衣冠都在这儿，人早喂了岩蛭。黑衣你自己有，戴上这顶冠，那群牛鼻子分不出你是谁。"
msgstr "Last year we caught a lone Daoist. His robe and cap are all here, the man himself got fed to the rock leeches long ago. You got your own black robe. Put on this cap and that pack of ox-noses won't tell who ya are."

msgid "见了霍铮——要是他还活着——说一声，黄霸没忘了他。"
msgstr "If ya see Huo Zheng—if he's still alive—tell him Huang Ba ain't forgotten him."

msgid "眯眼看了你一会儿，从墙角的箱子里翻出一顶黑冠，往你怀里一扔。"
msgstr " squints at you a while, digs a black cap out of the chest in the corner and tosses it into your arms."

msgid "刘老三让你来的？去年抓过一个落单的道士，衣冠都在这儿。黑衣你自己有，戴上这顶冠，那群牛鼻子分不出你是谁。"
msgstr "Liu the Third sent ya? Last year we caught a lone Daoist, and his robe and cap are all here. You got your own black robe. Put on this cap and that pack of ox-noses won't tell who ya are."

msgid "黑衣？老子穿的是布衣。少打听。"
msgstr "Black robe? I wear homespun. Ask less."

msgid "野羊山寨主"
msgstr "Chief of Goathill Stockade"

msgid "黄霸把酒碗往桌上一顿：野羊山，老子说了算。\n"
msgstr "Huang Ba slams his wine bowl down on the table. \"On Goathill, my word goes.\"\n"

msgid "黄霸嘟囔道：大寨主没了。没了就没了。\n"
msgstr "Huang Ba mutters, \"The First Chief's gone. Gone is gone.\"\n"

msgid "野羊山三寨主"
msgstr "Third Chief of Goathill Stockade"

msgid "黄霸给里屋送了一碗酒进去，出来时抹了把脸。\n"
msgstr "Huang Ba carries a bowl of wine into the back room, and wipes his face on the way out.\n"

msgid "黄霸嘟囔道：大哥回来了。好，好。\n"
msgstr "Huang Ba mutters, \"Big brother's back. Good, good.\"\n"

msgid "看了你一眼，又低头喝酒。"
msgstr " glances at you, then goes back to drinking."

msgid "逆灵宫的事老子听说了。大寨主没了，寨子是老子的——你也别想拿这个压老子。"
msgstr "I heard about the Black Palace business. The First Chief is gone, the stockade is mine—and don't think ya can lean on me with that."

msgid "手里的酒碗啪地掉在地上。"
msgstr " drops the wine bowl, and it smacks onto the floor."

msgid "大哥……大哥你还活着！"
msgstr "Big brother... Big brother, you're alive!"

msgid "活着。老三，寨子你管得不错——供也纳得不错。"
msgstr "Alive. Third Brother, you've run the stockade well. Paid the tribute well, too."

msgid "扑通一声跪下了。"
msgstr " falls to his knees with a thud."

msgid "大哥，寨子是你的。老子从今天起还是三寨主，你要打要杀，老子不还手。"
msgstr "Big brother, the stockade's yours. From today I'm still Third Chief, and if ya wanna beat me or kill me, I won't hit back."

msgid "起来。杀你不如杀道士。"
msgstr "Get up. I'd rather kill Daoists than you."

msgid "这娃娃是傅家坡的，派两个弟兄送他回家，少一根头发老子找你。"
msgstr "This kid's from Fu Family Slope. Send two brothers to take him home. If he's short a single hair, I'm comin' for you."

msgid "两个寨兵领着石头出了庙门。石头回头看了你一眼，没有说话。"
msgstr "Two of the stockade's men lead Shitou out of the temple gate. Shitou looks back at you once and says nothing."

msgid "兄弟，野羊寨欠你一条命。以后野羊山的路，你横着走。"
msgstr "Brother, Goathill Stockade owes you a life. From now on, on Goathill's roads, you can strut like a crab."

msgid "霍铮骂骂咧咧地进了土地庙的里屋，叫黄霸拿酒来。"
msgstr "Huo Zheng goes cursing into the inner room of the Earth God Shrine and tells Huang Ba to bring wine."

msgid "一个眼神凶恶的土匪，脸上好几条长长的刀疤，看起来就知道不好惹。\n"
msgstr "A fierce-eyed bandit, his face scarred by several long knife slashes; one look and you know he is trouble.\n"

msgid "这个土匪看起来相当强悍，至少你从他的动作就可以看得出来他显然\n是练过武功的硬手，并不是泛泛之辈。\n"
msgstr "This bandit looks quite tough. From the way he moves you can tell he has trained in the martial arts: a hardened fighter, no ordinary fellow.\n"

msgid "一条色作浅灰，带著白色斑点的水蛭模样怪虫，口中露出六对白森森\n的牙齿，看起来恶心极了。\n"
msgstr "A strange leech-like worm, light gray with white spots, with six pairs of gleaming white teeth showing in its mouth. It looks utterly disgusting.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在一条崎岖的山路上，凹凹凸凸的山石刺得你的脚底隐\n隐生疼，山路往南不远处通往一个山腰的台地，这一带最大的镇甸就位\n在台地上，东边跟西边都是陡峭的山壁，山路往北通往层层叠叠的群山\n之中。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a rugged mountain road. The jagged rocks prick the soles of your feet. A little way south, the road leads to a terrace halfway up the mountain, where the biggest town in the region lies. East and west are steep rock walls; to the north the road leads off among layer upon layer of mountains.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在一条崎岖的山路上，路面到处生满了及膝的杂草丛，\n显示这里已经有一段时间没有车马经过了，从这里往北就是野羊山的地\n界，野羊山有一座山寨，住著许多凶恶的盗匪，你最好绕道而行。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a rugged mountain road. Knee-high weeds grow all over the road, showing that no carts or horses have passed for some time. From here north is the territory of Goathill, where a stockade full of fierce robbers lives; you had best go around.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在一条崎岖的山路上，东边的路旁一个山壁的裂缝里有\n一间小庙，从这里看过去黑漆漆的似乎没有人照顾，山路往北是一段陡\n峭的上坡，往西南的山路就平缓得多。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a rugged mountain road. To the east, in a crack in the mountain wall beside the road, stands a small shrine; from here it looks pitch dark and seems untended. The road to the north is a steep climb, while the road to the southwest is much gentler.\n"

msgid "你现在正站在一间小土地庙中，这座庙的南北两面都是利用了山壁\n而建的，只有东面一面土墙，墙上嵌著一个小小的神龛，里面供著一尊\n残破不堪的土地爷爷，庙门在你的西边。\n"
msgstr "You are standing in a small Earth God shrine. The north and south sides of the shrine make use of the mountain wall; only the east side is a mud wall, with a small niche set in it, holding a ruined statue of Grandpa Earth God. The shrine door is to your west.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在一条崎岖山路的转角处，山路望东通往野羊山上，从\n这里可以望见东边不远处有一个石屋立在岩壁边上，看起来像是冈哨或\n什么的，北边的山壁有一个裂口，不过离地约有三到四丈， 往\n南的山路是段陡峭的下坡，如果你要下山，大概就是这条路了。\n"
msgstr "You are walking at a bend in a rugged mountain road. The road leads east up Goathill, and not far east you can see a stone house standing by the rock face, looking like a sentry post or some such. In the north wall is a crack, but it is thirty or forty feet off the ground. The road south is a steep descent; if you want to go down the mountain, this is probably the way.\n"

msgid "这里是一段狭窄的山路，往东不远处的岩壁边上有一座石屋，路旁\n生满了及腰的长草，山风吹过一起一伏的有如波浪一般，南北两边有许\n多大石，看起来倒是个埋伏的好地点，往西是一个山路的转角。\n"
msgstr "This is a narrow stretch of mountain road. Not far to the east, beside the rock face, stands a stone house. Waist-high grass grows along the road, and as the mountain wind passes it rises and falls like waves. Many big rocks lie to the north and south, which look like a fine place for an ambush. To the west is a bend in the road.\n"

msgid "这里是一处岩石斜坡，斜坡上到处布满乱石及杂草，东边的岩壁边\n有一间石屋，往西跟往北则可以回到铺满碎石的山路。\n"
msgstr "This is a slope of rock, littered with rubble and weeds. On the rock face to the east is a stone house, and to the west and north you can get back to the gravel-strewn mountain road.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在一条崎岖的山路上，往北是一个峡谷，通过「飞火崖\n」的正下方，从这里可以看到一条五、六丈宽的石梁魏颤颤地跨过峡谷\n，山路往西南转过，南边则是一片岩石斜坡。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along a rugged mountain road. To the north is a canyon, passing right beneath \"Flying Fire Cliff.\" From here you can see a stone beam fifty or sixty feet across spanning the canyon, trembling. The road turns southwest, and to the south lies a rocky slope.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在一条狭长的峡谷之中，东西两边都是高不可攀的峭壁\n，一根五、六丈宽的石梁正横跨在你头顶的谷口，看起来摇摇欲坠，万\n一掉下来只怕当场就会被压成一个肉饼，往南就是峡谷的出口，峡谷谷\n底的地面看起来像是乾涸的山涧，弯弯曲曲往北通入峡谷深处。\n"
msgstr "You are walking in a long, narrow canyon, with sheer cliffs on both east and west. A stone beam fifty or sixty feet across spans the mouth of the canyon above your head, looking ready to fall, and if it did come down you would probably be crushed flat on the spot. To the south is the canyon's exit. The canyon floor looks like a dried-up stream bed, winding north into the depths of the canyon.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在一条狭长的深谷之中，东西两面都是高不可攀的峭壁\n，往南沿著谷底一条乾涸的山涧可以通往峡谷的出口，北边的峭壁从这\n里斜斜向上宛如从天上掉下来倒插进地面，形势更是危峻，连天空都被\n北边的峭壁遮去了七、八分。\n"
msgstr "You are walking in a long, narrow gorge with sheer cliffs on both east and west. To the south, along a dry stream bed on the floor, you can reach the canyon's exit. The cliff to the north slants up from here as if it had fallen from the sky and stabbed head-down into the ground, even more perilous, blocking seven or eight tenths of the sky.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在一条峡谷的谷底，这里的峭壁斜度之大让你胆颤心惊\n，只消有人在这里一声大喝将上面的土石震了下来，只怕立刻就得被活\n埋，东边的峭壁上有一个黑漆漆的洞穴，里面似乎有什么东西蠕蠕而动\n，峡谷往西南和西北两边各有狭窄的出口。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along the floor of a canyon. The cliffs here slant so steeply they make your heart quake; one loud shout would be enough to bring the earth and stone above down, and you would be buried alive at once. On the east cliff is a pitch-black cave, and something inside seems to squirm. The canyon has narrow exits to the southwest and northwest.\n"

msgid "这个岩洞的内部似乎远比你想像得大，岩壁上有一条条的深沟彷佛\n是被什么蛀虫给蛀出来的，可是有什么虫会去啃咬这又硬又厚的岩壁呢\n？洞穴的出口在你的西边透著微光，东北边跟西北边各有一个洞穴，黑\n暗中似乎有什么东西在蠕蠕而动。\n"
msgstr "The inside of this cavern seems far bigger than you imagined. Deep grooves in the rock walls look as if some boring insect had gnawed them out, but what insect would gnaw such hard, thick rock? The cave mouth is to your west, letting in a faint light. To the northeast and northwest are two more caves, and in the dark something seems to squirm.\n"

msgid "你现在正在一个黑漆漆的岩洞中摸索前进，西南边隐隐有些光亮，\n想必是洞穴的出口，东边似乎有些滴水的声音，不过你得走过去才能听\n得仔细，你感觉脚边有一些东西在蠕蠕而动，举脚又有些黏黏的，一阵\n恶心的感觉压迫著你的胃。\n"
msgstr "You are groping forward through a pitch-black cave. To the southwest there is a faint glow, surely the cave's exit. From the east comes a sound like dripping water, though you would have to go over to hear it clearly. Things squirm at your feet, and when you lift a foot it feels sticky, and a wave of nausea presses on your stomach.\n"

msgid "这里一片黑漆漆，你必须全靠摸索才能不至于撞到岩壁，你听到东\n边传来阵阵滴水的声音，可是伸手一摸却仍是冷冰冰、又乾又硬的岩石\n，地上布满了许多又黏又稠的不知名东西，使你每一步都走得异常艰辛\n。\n"
msgstr "It is pitch black here, and you must feel your way to avoid bumping into the walls. You hear dripping water from the east, but a touch of the hand finds only cold, dry, hard rock. The ground is covered with sticky, thick, unknown stuff, and every step is exceptionally hard.\n"

msgid "这里是一处阴暗的岩洞，等你走近这个岩洞才发现原来是死路，东\n北边隐隐透出几道微光，想必是洞穴的出口，地上一滩滩暗黄色的黏稠\n物不知道士什么东西，闻起来竟一点味道也没有。\n"
msgstr "This is a dark cave. Only when you get close do you find it is a dead end. To the northeast faint beams of light seep in, surely the cave's exit. Puddles of dark yellow sticky matter lie on the ground, you do not know what, and it has no smell at all.\n"

msgid "北边的山壁上一道黑黝黝的裂口，离地约有三四丈，站在路上够不着。裂口边缘的岩石磨得发亮，像是常有东西从那里吊上吊下。\n"
msgstr "In the north wall is a black, gaping crack, thirty or forty feet off the ground, out of reach from the road. The rock along its edge has been worn smooth and bright, as if things are often hoisted up and lowered down there.\n"

msgid "钻进车里"
msgstr "Climb into the cart"

msgid "油布底下是供品的箱子。钻进去，就只能跟着箱子一起被吊上裂口，中途下不来。"
msgstr "Under the oilcloth are the offering boxes. If you crawl in, you can only be hoisted up to the crack with the boxes and cannot get out halfway."

msgid "钻进去"
msgstr "Climb in"

msgid "你掀开油布一角，缩进两只箱子中间。油布落下来，眼前一黑。\n"
msgstr "You lift a corner of the oilcloth and squeeze in between two boxes. The oilcloth falls back, and everything goes black.\n"

msgid "过了一会儿，车板一震，绳子绷紧了——你和箱子一起离了地，在半空里晃了半天，咚的一声落在硬地上。\n"
msgstr "After a while the cart bed shakes and the rope goes taut—you and the boxes leave the ground, swing in midair a good while, and land with a thump on hard floor.\n"

msgid "车停在那里，油布底下空空的，绳子松着——没人拉绳，钻进去也上不去。\n"
msgstr "The cart stands there, the space under the oilcloth empty and the rope slack. With no one hauling the rope, climbing in will not get you up.\n"

msgid "攀绳上去"
msgstr "Climb the rope"

msgid "你抓住垂下的麻绳，手脚并用地攀上裂口。岩壁磨得发亮，上头有绞盘吱吱的响声。\n"
msgstr "You grab the rope hanging down and climb hand and foot up to the crack. The rock face is worn smooth and bright, and above you a winch creaks.\n"

msgid "你戴着黑冠，押车的道士只当你是宫里的人，没人拦你。你抓住麻绳，手脚并用地攀上裂口。\n"
msgstr "You wear the black cap, and the Daoist escorting the cart takes you for one of the Palace's own, so nobody stops you. You grab the rope and climb hand and foot up to the crack.\n"

msgid "押车道士盯着你，手按在剑柄上：「此处无路，施主请回。」\n"
msgstr "The Cart Escort Daoist stares at you, hand on his sword hilt. \"There is no road here. Benefactor, please turn back.\""

msgid "裂口离地三四丈，壁上光溜溜的，没有绳子上不去。\n"
msgstr "The crack is thirty or forty feet off the ground and the wall is smooth; without a rope you cannot climb it.\n"

msgid "这是一把耀眼的利刃。\n"
msgstr "A blade that dazzles the eye.\n"

msgid "剑锋寒气逼人，剑身发出异样的青光。\n"
msgstr "The sword's edge gives off a bone-chilling cold, and the blade glints with an odd blue light.\n"

msgid "一盘西湖醋鱼，香气四溢，让人垂涎欲滴。\n"
msgstr "A plate of West Lake fish in vinegar, its fragrance everywhere, enough to make your mouth water.\n"

msgid "这是一坛香味浓郁的陈年老酒，是专待状元高中时喝的酒。\n"
msgstr "A jar of rich, fragrant old wine, kept for the day a Top Scholar passes the exams.\n"

msgid "这件淡青长袍绸衫上面绣著几只黄鹊，闻起来还有一股淡香。\n"
msgstr "A pale blue silk long robe embroidered with a few yellow magpies. It smells faintly sweet.\n"

msgid "一件大红色的女子衣衫，看起来有点鲜艳得过火。\n"
msgstr "A woman's blouse of bright red, a little too gaudy to look at.\n"

msgid "一把暗红色、两丈多长的巨杵。\n"
msgstr "A dark red pestle, over twenty feet long.\n"

msgid "简简单单的一套月白色长裙，上面并没有什么装饰，但总给人一种天外仙子的感觉。\n"
msgstr "A plain moon-white long skirt with no ornament at all, yet it still gives the feeling of a fairy from beyond the sky.\n"

msgid "一支遗失多年的令牌，或许在出城时还有用。\n"
msgstr "A token lost for many years. It may still be of use when leaving the city.\n"

msgid "这是个正在这里站岗的京师官兵，虽然和许多武林人物比起来，官兵\n们的武功实在稀松平常，但是他们是有组织、有纪律的战士，谁也不\n轻易地招惹他们。\n"
msgstr "A soldier of the Capital guard, standing watch here. Next to the many wulin figures, a soldier's martial skill is nothing much, but they are organized, disciplined fighters, and no one lightly picks a quarrel with them.\n"

msgid "守城官兵喝道：大胆刁民！竟敢在天子脚下造反？\n"
msgstr "The city guard shouts, \"How dare you, you scoundrel! Rebelling right under the Emperor's nose?\"\n"

msgid "出城"
msgstr "Leave the city"

msgid "你可以在京城里找一找，说不定可以找到一些出城的令牌。\n"
msgstr "You could look around the Capital. You may well find a pass for leaving the city.\n"

msgid "守城兵大叫：反了！反了！"
msgstr "The guard yells, \"Rebellion! Rebellion!\""

msgid "京师守城兵连忙说道：原来是官府中人，您请出城。\n"
msgstr "The Capital guard says quickly, \"So you are with the government. Please, go on out of the city.\"\n"

msgid "这是什么东西啊！你想偷渡呀？"
msgstr "What's this supposed to be? You trying to sneak out?"

msgid "黑你没商量是个看起来相当精明的中年人，他的本名叫做“魏阮”。\n不知作了什么黑心的生意，一夜之间暴富起来，开了钱庄后，逐渐地\n把其它钱庄全挤倒闭了，京师的居民对他的很多做法都非常不满，于\n是有了这个绰号。大家都知道他小肚鸡肠，所以谁也不去惹他。\n"
msgstr "The No-Haggle Fleecer is a sharp-looking middle-aged man whose real name is Wei Ruan.\nNo one knows what dirty business made him rich overnight. Once he opened his money shop, he squeezed every other one out of business, one by one. The people of the Capital are deeply unhappy with much of what he does, and so he got this nickname. Everyone knows he is petty and spiteful, so nobody crosses him.\n"

msgid "黑你没商量压低嗓音对你说道：“我在上面可有人，你知道我每年给上面多少金子吗？”\n"
msgstr "The No-Haggle Fleecer lowers his voice and says to you, \"I have friends up above, you know. Do you know how much gold I send them every year?\"\n"

msgid "黑你没商量恨恨地说：“哼，我要把NT也汉化，看你之星怎么办！”\n"
msgstr "The No-Haggle Fleecer says bitterly, \"Hmph. I'll have NT translated into Chinese too, and then let's see what Your Star does!\"\n"

msgid "黑你没商量突然三角眼倒立，眉间闪过几道黑气。\n"
msgstr "The No-Haggle Fleecer's triangular eyes suddenly slant upright, and a few streaks of black flash between his brows.\n"

msgid "黑你没商量的喉咙发出咕咕两声怪叫。\n"
msgstr "A strange gurgling comes from the No-Haggle Fleecer's throat, two croaks.\n"

msgid "黑你没商量神情忽然严肃了起来，不过好像是在想自己的事，与你无关。\n"
msgstr "The No-Haggle Fleecer suddenly turns solemn, though he seems to be thinking of his own affairs, nothing to do with you.\n"

msgid "黑你没商量忽然呵呵呵地笑了起来，却不知道在笑些什么....\n"
msgstr "The No-Haggle Fleecer suddenly breaks into a heh-heh-heh laugh, and no one knows what he is laughing at...\n"

msgid "黑你没商量一翻三角眼，不知又想出了什么坏主意。\n"
msgstr "The No-Haggle Fleecer rolls his triangular eyes, up to some new piece of mischief.\n"

msgid "黑你没商量说道：这位$RESPECT，换钱？我要抽点的啊！\n"
msgstr "The No-Haggle Fleecer says, \"Changing money, $RESPECT? I take a cut, you know!\"\n"

msgid "黑你没商量说道：这位$RESPECT，钱可要自己点清楚啊！\n"
msgstr "The No-Haggle Fleecer says, \"Count your money carefully, $RESPECT!\"\n"

msgid "武器店掌柜"
msgstr "Weapon Shopkeeper"

msgid "万晓生是个须发皆白的老人，闯荡江湖已近五十年。\n"
msgstr "Wan Xiaosheng is an old man with white hair and beard, who has roamed the jianghu for almost fifty years.\n"

msgid "万晓生道：这位$RESPECT，自个儿挑一件称手的兵器吧。\n"
msgstr "Wan Xiaosheng says, \"Pick out a weapon that feels right in your hand, $RESPECT.\"\n"

msgid "万晓生冷冷地说：客官请付现钞。\n"
msgstr "Wan Xiaosheng says coldly, \"Cash only, sir.\"\n"

msgid "万晓生忽然间似乎想起了远在美国的朋友和当年同闯江湖的情形。\n"
msgstr "Wan Xiaosheng suddenly seems to remember a friend far away in America, and the days when they roamed the jianghu together.\n"

msgid "振远镖局总镖头"
msgstr "Head of the Far-Road Escorts"

msgid "陈天星从十五岁出道至今已经有近五十个年头了。二十五岁时自己\n创建了振远镖局，苦心经营三十八载，使之而今成为京师第一大镖\n局.而他凭着春风快意刀法和天邪神掌被江湖同道称为「刀掌双绝」\n。绮云镇的陈剑秋是其侄子，如今也赫赫有名。\n"
msgstr "Chen Tianxing set out on the road at fifteen, nearly fifty years ago. At twenty-five he founded the Far-Road Escorts himself, and after thirty-eight years of hard work it is now the foremost escort agency in the Capital. With his Spring Blade and Wayward Palm, his fellows in the jianghu call him the \"Double Master of Blade and Palm.\" Chen Jianqiu of Cloudweave Town is his nephew, and is now quite famous himself.\n"

msgid "陈总镖头"
msgstr "Chief Chen"

msgid "你不是振远的人了。振远的账，不劳外人。"
msgstr "You are not one of Far-Road's people anymore. Far-Road's accounts are none of an outsider's business."

msgid "旧账？剑秋说没有旧账，就没有旧账。生意上的事，好说。"
msgstr "Old accounts? Jianqiu says there are no old accounts, so there are none. Business matters, we can talk about."

msgid "账押去乔阴县衙了，程知县收的。"
msgstr "The ledgers went under escort to the Tallshade Yamen. Magistrate Cheng took them."

msgid "绮云分局开张的本钱，是兵部的抚恤银。剑秋知道。你去问他。"
msgstr "The money to open the Cloudweave branch was the Ministry of War's compensation silver. Jianqiu knows. Go ask him."

msgid "贺长庚那封家信，你先给我看。"
msgstr "That letter home from He Changgeng, let me see it first."

msgid "从案底抽出一本厚厚的总账，翻到折了角的那一页。"
msgstr "Pulls a thick master ledger from under the desk and turns to a page with a folded corner."

msgid "老松岭那一笔查清了，我没歇手，又往前翻——翻的是总账，二十年的。"
msgstr "The Old Pine Ridge entry is settled. I did not stop there, I kept turning back. It was the master ledger, twenty years of it."

msgid "乙丑年冬，那趟镖之后两个月，振远进了一笔银子：兵部送来的，账上写「抚恤」。一千二百两。"
msgstr "Winter of the Yichou year, two months after that shipment, Far-Road took in a sum of silver. It came from the Ministry of War, and the ledger calls it \"compensation.\" Twelve hundred taels."

msgid "第二年开春，绮云分局开张。本钱就是这一笔。"
msgstr "The spring after, the Cloudweave branch opened. Its capital was that sum."

msgid "兵部点名改的路，兵部给的抚恤。剑秋知道。你去问他。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War named the route, and the Ministry of War paid the compensation. Jianqiu knows. Go ask him."

msgid "碎石小路上那个后生，天驼关的供词抄到了总局：他说振远把他爹卖给了兵部。"
msgstr "That young man on the Gravel Path, the confession from Camelback Pass has been copied to the head office. He says Far-Road sold his father to the Ministry of War."

msgid "我不信。翻了二十年的总账，想找一笔替振远说话的。"
msgstr "I do not believe it. I went through twenty years of the master ledger, looking for one entry that speaks for Far-Road."

msgid "乙丑年冬，那趟镖之后两个月，振远进了一笔银子：兵部送来的，账上写「抚恤」。一千二百两。第二年开春，绮云分局开张。本钱就是这一笔。"
msgstr "Winter of the Yichou year, two months after that shipment, Far-Road took in a sum of silver. It came from the Ministry of War, and the ledger calls it \"compensation.\" Twelve hundred taels. The spring after, the Cloudweave branch opened. Its capital was that sum."

msgid "兵部替一家镖局的死人发抚恤？剑秋知道。你去问他。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War pays compensation for an escort agency's dead? Jianqiu knows. Go ask him."

msgid "查到底：陈天星把振远的总账押去乔阴县衙，交程知县——告兵部，也告振远自己拿过兵部的钱。\n陈剑秋会关了绮云分局的门。正月十七，振远那一票投旧盟主（已经入了虹台的席的，这一票不再跟着变）；京师的事还没定的，这本账也算揭发的一样人证物证。\n说了就不能再站到陈剑秋那边。要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Follow it through: Chen Tianxing sends Far-Road's master ledger to the Tallshade magistrate's court, to Magistrate Cheng, accusing the Ministry of War and also Far-Road itself of taking the Ministry's money.\nChen Jianqiu will close the Cloudweave branch's doors. On the seventeenth of the first month, Far-Road's vote goes to the old Alliance Leader (for those who have already taken seats at the Rainbow Terrace, this vote no longer changes with it). As for the Capital's affairs not yet settled, the ledger counts as witness and proof of the exposure.\nOnce said, you can never stand on Chen Jianqiu's side again. Say it?"

msgid "账已经上路了。"
msgstr "The ledger is already on the road."

msgid "剑秋说了到此为止。……生意上的事，好说。"
msgstr "Jianqiu said to stop here... Business matters, we can talk about."

msgid "把总账合上，用一块蓝布包了。"
msgstr "Closes the master ledger and wraps it in a piece of blue cloth."

msgid "底账我也一并翻了：那趟镖改走老松岭，是兵部来人点名要的。改路的是兵部，给钱的也是兵部——这是封口钱。"
msgstr "I went through the underlying ledger too. The shipment was moved to the Old Pine Ridge road because men from the Ministry of War came and named it. The Ministry changed the route, and the Ministry paid. That is hush money."

msgid "账本我叫人押去乔阴县衙，交程知县。振远告兵部，也告振远自己。"
msgstr "I have had the ledgers escorted to the Tallshade magistrate's court, for Magistrate Cheng. Far-Road accuses the Ministry of War, and accuses Far-Road itself."

msgid "剑秋那里……他会恨我。由他。"
msgstr "Jianqiu... he will hate me. So be it."

msgid "改路的是兵部，给钱的也是兵部——这是封口钱。底账、总账，一起押去乔阴县衙，交程知县。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War changed the route, and the Ministry of War paid. That is hush money. The underlying ledger and the master ledger both go to the Tallshade magistrate's court, to Magistrate Cheng."

msgid "振远告兵部，也告振远自己。剑秋那里……他会恨我。由他。"
msgstr "Far-Road accuses the Ministry of War, and accuses Far-Road itself. Jianqiu... he will hate me. So be it."

msgid "查什么？"
msgstr "Follow what through?"

msgid "正月十七过去了。账还在县衙里。"
msgstr "The seventeenth of the first month has passed. The ledger is still in the magistrate's court."

msgid "振远这一票，照你说的。"
msgstr "Far-Road's vote goes as you said."

msgid "台上振远那一席，还是剑秋去坐。可振远这一票，我说了算：投旧盟主，旧案查到底。"
msgstr "At the Terrace, Jianqiu will still take Far-Road's seat. But Far-Road's vote I decide: for the old Alliance Leader, and the old case followed through to the end."

msgid "账是你陪我送去的。你要这一票，开口。"
msgstr "You helped me carry the ledger there. If you want this vote, say so."

msgid "虹台的事，问剑秋。生意上的事，再来找我。"
msgstr "Ask Jianqiu about the Terrace. Come to me again about business."

msgid "虹台？振远在台上那一席，剑秋去坐。"
msgstr "The Terrace? Far-Road's seat on the Terrace, Jianqiu will take."

msgid "请陈天星把振远这一票交给你：正月十七虹台上，振远听你的——你要站出来，这一票就是你的；不站，就由你说投谁。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Ask Chen Tianxing to give you Far-Road's vote: on the seventeenth of the first month at the Rainbow Terrace, Far-Road listens to you. If you stand up, the vote is yours; if not, you say whom it goes to.\nSay it?"

msgid "好。振远这一票，你说了算。剑秋那里，我去说。"
msgstr "Good. Far-Road's vote is yours to say. I will speak to Jianqiu myself."

msgid "镖车"
msgstr "Escort cart"

msgid "剑秋那趟镖到了。好。"
msgstr "Jianqiu's shipment has arrived. Good."

msgid "碎石小路上劫镖的那个后生，你还没给个了结。交官府还是放走，你回去定了，镖再进这个门。"
msgstr "The young man who robbed the shipment on the Gravel Path, you have not settled him yet. Hand him to the law or let him go, decide it back there, and then the shipment can come through this door."

msgid "剑秋的镖？车呢？镖车没进这个门，镖就没到。"
msgstr "Jianqiu's shipment? Where is the cart? If the cart has not come through this door, the shipment has not arrived."

msgid "呵呵…你连我都不知道嘛？去打听打听吧。\n"
msgstr "Heh heh... you don't even know who I am? Go ask around.\n"

msgid "这可是我一手创建的啊！可惜我也老了。\n"
msgstr "I built this with my own hands! A pity I have grown old.\n"

msgid "他是我侄子，有什么事找他？\n"
msgstr "He is my nephew. What do you want with him?\n"

msgid "那是我和於兰天武交换武功学的\n"
msgstr "I learned that by trading martial arts with Yulan Tianwu.\n"

msgid "是剑秋推荐的嘛？可有他的信物？\n"
msgstr "Did Jianqiu recommend you? Do you have his token?\n"

msgid "那趟镖是兵部点名改走老松岭的。底账、总账都押去乔阴县衙了，程知县那里有案可查。"
msgstr "That shipment was moved to the Old Pine Ridge road by the Ministry of War's own order. The underlying ledger and the master ledger have both gone to the Tallshade magistrate's court. Magistrate Cheng has the case on record."

msgid "那趟镖是兵部点名改走老松岭的。底账我收着，用得着的时候来找我。"
msgstr "That shipment was moved to the Old Pine Ridge road by the Ministry of War's own order. I hold the underlying ledger. Come to me when it is needed."

msgid "底账还在翻。你出去转一圈再来。"
msgstr "I'm still going through the old books. Take a turn outside and come back."

msgid "这张镖单……乙丑年老松岭那一趟？拿来我看。"
msgstr "This waybill... the Old Pine Ridge shipment of the Yichou year? Let me see it."

msgid "这张镖单……乙丑年老松岭那一趟。剑秋那里的旧账，你收好。"
msgstr "This waybill... the Old Pine Ridge shipment of the Yichou year. The old accounts at Jianqiu's place, keep them safe."

msgid "镖单？振远走过的镖，镖单都在剑秋那里。"
msgstr "Waybill? The waybills for every shipment Far-Road has run are with Jianqiu."

msgid "振远镖局第一代弟子"
msgstr "First-generation disciple of the Far-Road Escorts"

msgid "从案上拿起一本发黄的底账，翻到夹着纸条的那一页。"
msgstr "Takes a yellowed underlying ledger from the desk and turns to the page with a slip of paper in it."

msgid "镖单的事，我查了。"
msgstr "I looked into the waybill."

msgid "二十年前那趟镖，起运关北，本该走官道。底账上写着：改走老松岭——是兵部来人点名要的，说官道上有劫匪。"
msgstr "Twenty years ago that shipment started out from Beyond the Pass and should have taken the official road. The ledger says: moved to Old Pine Ridge. The Ministry of War sent a man to name it, saying there were robbers on the official road."

msgid "关北来的盟主印，兵部点名改的路，老松岭瀑布前的埋伏。振远替人背了二十年的锅。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader's seal from Beyond the Pass, the route moved by the Ministry of War, the ambush before the Old Pine Ridge waterfall. Far-Road has taken the blame for others for twenty years."

msgid "这件事，我陈天星可以当着满朝文武说。用得着的时候，来找我。"
msgstr "This, I, Chen Tianxing, can say in front of every civil and military official at court. Come to me when it is needed."

msgid "庾子建已经下了狱。这一笔，我写进状子里，叫他多背一条。"
msgstr "Yu Zijian is already in prison. This entry I will write into the complaint, so he carries one more charge."

msgid "朝上的事，你们已经定了，我不添乱。可振远的账，我要记清楚。"
msgstr "The matters at court, you have already settled. I will not add trouble. But Far-Road's accounts I will keep clear."

msgid "看见镖车进了门，放下手里的账本站了起来。"
msgstr "Sees the escort cart roll through the gate, and puts down the ledger and stands."

msgid "总镖头，绮云的镖，两箱红货，一路没丢。"
msgstr "Chief, the Cloudweave shipment, two chests of red goods, and not one lost all the way."

msgid "碎石小路上有人劫镖？……天驼关来人说了，人交了官。官府的赏金送到了振远，这一份归你。"
msgstr "Someone robbed the shipment on the Gravel Path? ... A man came from Camelback Pass and said the robber was handed to the law. The government's reward has reached Far-Road, and this share is yours."

msgid "碎石小路上有人劫镖，你放他走了？……镖到了就好。人，你看着办的。"
msgstr "Someone robbed the shipment on the Gravel Path, and you let him go? ... The shipment arrived, and that is good enough. As for the man, do as you see fit."

msgid "推着镖车进了后院。"
msgstr "Pushes the escort cart into the back courtyard."

msgid "你是振远的人。从今天起，你是振远的镖头了。"
msgstr "You are Far-Road's man. From today you are a Far-Road escort head."

msgid "铺开一张大红帖子，提笔写了几行，吹了吹墨，递给你。"
msgstr "Spreads out a big red card, writes a few lines with a brush, blows on the ink and hands it to you."

msgid "振远的名帖。京师有些门，要帖子才敲得开——相国府的俸银，年年是振远押的，韦相国认得这个字。"
msgstr "Far-Road's calling card. Some doors in the Capital open only to a card. Far-Road has escorted the Chancellor's stipend silver every year, and Chancellor Wei knows this hand."

msgid "振远的名帖。京师的门，你都敲开过了。帖子留着——振远的朋友，到哪儿都是朋友。"
msgstr "Far-Road's calling card. You have knocked on every door in the Capital. Keep the card. A friend of Far-Road is a friend wherever he goes."

msgid "看见你进门，把手边那本总账往怀里一收，又放下了。"
msgstr "Sees you come in, tucks the master ledger at hand into the chest of his robe, then puts it down again."

msgid "剑秋的信到了。"
msgstr "Jianqiu's letter has come."

msgid "把总账丢进了脚边的火盆。"
msgstr "Throws the master ledger into the brazier at his feet."

msgid "到此为止。……往后你来，只谈生意。"
msgstr "Let it end here... From now on, when you come, we speak only of business."

msgid "陈天星收下陈剑秋的推荐信，就愿意收你为徒，你再向他拜师，便成为振远镖局的弟子。信交出去就要不回来了。\n确定把信交给陈天星吗？"
msgstr "If Chen Tianxing takes Chen Jianqiu's letter of recommendation, he will accept you as his student. If you then ask him to take you on, you become a disciple of the Far-Road Escorts. Once the letter is handed over, you cannot get it back.\nHand the letter to Chen Tianxing?"

msgid "果然是剑秋侄儿推荐来的。我收你啦。"
msgstr "So it really was my nephew Jianqiu who sent you. I'll take you."

msgid "陈天星狐疑地望着你，说\n这是你的嘛？\n"
msgstr "Chen Tianxing looks at you doubtfully and says, \"Is this really yours?\"\n"

msgid "接过信，看了很久。"
msgstr "Takes the letter and reads it for a long time."

msgid "兵部的人在岭上等着，镖头说照走……底账上那一笔，信里也有。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War's men were waiting on the ridge, and the escort head said go on as planned... The entry in the underlying ledger is in the letter too."

msgid "贺长庚的儿子。他该恨振远。"
msgstr "He Changgeng's son. He has every reason to hate Far-Road."

msgid "接过信，就着窗口看了很久，手有点抖。"
msgstr "Takes the letter and reads it for a long time by the window, his hand shaking a little."

msgid "乙丑年，贺长庚……老松岭那一趟的趟子手。兵部的人在岭上等着，镖头说照走。"
msgstr "The Yichou year, He Changgeng... the runner on that Old Pine Ridge shipment. The Ministry of War's men were waiting on the ridge, and the escort head said go on as planned."

msgid "那趟镖本该走官道。改走老松岭，是兵部来人点名要的——兵部的人就等在岭上。振远替人背了二十年的锅。"
msgstr "That shipment should have taken the official road. It went by Old Pine Ridge because a man from the Ministry of War came and named it, and the Ministry's men were waiting on the ridge. Far-Road has taken the blame for others for twenty years."

msgid "这封信，我收着。用得着的时候，来找我。"
msgstr "I will keep this letter. Come to me when it is needed."

msgid "潘执法使那里锁着一张？……那这一张存根，你留着吧。"
msgstr "Enforcer Pan has one locked away?... Then keep this stub."

msgid "我手里有一张了。"
msgstr "I already have one in hand."

msgid "把镖单交给陈天星。\n他要查到底：查出来的，未必只是振远的丑事。镖单不会再回水烟阁。\n镖单只有一张。交给他吗？"
msgstr "Hand the waybill to Chen Tianxing.\nHe means to follow it through, and what comes out may not be only Far-Road's shame. The waybill will not return to Waterfog Pavilion.\nThere is only one waybill. Hand it to him?"

msgid "接过镖单，就着窗口看了很久，手有点抖。"
msgstr "Takes the waybill and reads it for a long time by the window, his hand shaking a little."

msgid "乙丑年，老松岭……这一趟是剑秋他爹押的。人没回来，振远的招牌在京师低了二十年。"
msgstr "The Yichou year, Old Pine Ridge... Jianqiu's father ran that shipment. He never came back, and Far-Road's sign has hung low in the Capital for twenty years."

msgid "当年是谁点的这条路，底账里该有。我翻。"
msgstr "Who chose that road back then, the underlying ledger should say. I will look."

msgid "你出去转一圈再来，我把底账翻一翻。"
msgstr "Take a turn outside and come back. I will go through the underlying ledger."

msgid "这是剑秋那里的旧账。你从哪儿得来的？……收好吧。"
msgstr "These are the old accounts from Jianqiu's place. Where did you get them? ... Keep them safe."

msgid "不要戏弄我！\n"
msgstr "Don't toy with me!\n"

msgid "绸缎庄"
msgstr "Silk Shop"

msgid "这里是京师绸缎庄，没钱别进来！\n"
msgstr "This is the Capital's silk shop. Don't come in without money!\n"

msgid "在下姓陶，闺名不能告诉你。\n"
msgstr "My family name is Tao. My maiden name I cannot tell you.\n"

msgid "您需要什么样的？"
msgstr "What sort would you like?"

msgid "老板娘道：这位$RESPECT，您需要什么？\n"
msgstr "The proprietress says, \"What do you need, $RESPECT?\"\n"

msgid "老板娘神秘地对你说：要南大食堂磁卡吗？\n"
msgstr "The proprietress says to you mysteriously, \"Would you like a Nanjing University canteen card?\""

msgid "老板娘悄声说道：奴家可是湖南人哦。\n"
msgstr "The proprietress says softly, \"I'm from Hunan, you know.\"\n"

msgid "这点钱，还不够买酒喝。"
msgstr "This little money doesn't even cover a drink."

msgid "谢谢这位客官了。"
msgstr "Thank you, sir."

msgid "钱掌柜长得如一个大面团般，白白胖胖的，虽说早已步入知天命\n的年龄，可保养得很好。一双小眼睛如俩枣核嵌在脸上，不时滴\n溜溜地乱转。他开的「太白酒楼」可是京城最大的。\n"
msgstr "Shopkeeper Qian is round as a big dumpling, pale and plump, and though well past fifty he has kept himself in fine shape. His small eyes sit in his face like two date stones and keep darting about. His Taibai Tavern is the biggest in the Capital.\n"

msgid "在下姓钱，因少有资产，别人叫我钱千万。\n"
msgstr "My family name is Qian. Since I have so little property, people call me Ten Million.\n"

msgid "小声点。偷偷地告述你，我真见过皇上的。\n"
msgstr "Keep your voice down. I'll tell you in secret, I have really seen the Emperor.\n"

msgid "作官"
msgstr "Become an official"

msgid "瞧见没有，上面的人才是你应去打听的。\n"
msgstr "See those people up there? They are the ones you should be asking.\n"

msgid "钱千万皱了皱眉，说:这里是可不是为你们开的，吃完了快走。\n"
msgstr "Ten Million frowns and says, \"This place is not open for the likes of you. Finish eating and be off.\"\n"

msgid "行人摇了摇头，说：世事无常，只苦了我们这些老百姓。\n"
msgstr "The passerby shakes his head and says, \"The world is unpredictable. It's only us common folk who suffer.\"\n"

msgid "行人愤愤地说：这年头，几个臭钱就能买到官。哼！\n"
msgstr "The passerby says angrily, \"These days, a few stinking coins can buy you an office. Hmph!\"\n"

msgid "行人叹了口气：皇上太年幼了，朝廷就让那个老不死的把持着。咳！\n"
msgstr "The passerby sighs: \"The Emperor is too young, so the court leaves that old undying thing in charge. Ah!\"\n"

msgid "买官"
msgstr "Buying office"

msgid "全是那个该死的尚书作的孽。\n"
msgstr "It's all the sin of that damned Minister.\n"

msgid "什么世道，几个臭钱就可以买官作。\n"
msgstr "What kind of world is this, where a few stinking coins can buy an office!\n"

msgid "这年头，生意不好做啊！\n"
msgstr "Times like these, business is hard to do!\n"

msgid "光天化日，朗朗乾坤，你也想打劫？\n"
msgstr "In broad daylight, under a bright sky, and you want to rob me too?\n"

msgid "鞋店"
msgstr "Shoe Shop"

msgid "李掌柜是不难看的女人，一直经营着祖传鞋店生意。\n"
msgstr "Shopkeeper Li is a woman who is not hard to look at, and she has always run the family shoe shop.\n"

msgid "鞋"
msgstr "Shoes"

msgid "李掌柜道：这位$RESPECT，您需要什么样的鞋？。\n"
msgstr "Shopkeeper Li says, \"What kind of shoes do you need, $RESPECT?\"\n"

msgid "李掌柜白了你一眼，冷冷地说：你有美钞吗？\n"
msgstr "Shopkeeper Li rolls her eyes at you and says coldly, \"Do you have US dollars?\"\n"

msgid "李掌柜忽然间说道：好久没去华工了，不知朋友是否还好吗。\n"
msgstr "Shopkeeper Li suddenly says, \"I haven't been to Huazhong Tech in a long time. I wonder if my friends are doing well.\""

msgid "一个满脸横肉的壮汉，口水四溅，正说着什么。\n"
msgstr "A burly man with a fleshy, scowling face, spit flying as he talks.\n"

msgid "卖艺壮汉吆喝道：出外靠朋友，诸位请捧个钱场！\n"
msgstr "The street strongman bellows, \"Away from home, you depend on friends! Gentlemen, please give a little coin!\"\n"

msgid "卖艺壮汉练了一套六阴剑，还象模象样。\n"
msgstr "The street strongman performs a set of the Six-Chaos Sword, and it looks quite the part.\n"

msgid "卖艺壮汉低声对你说道：在下刚路过八舍！\n"
msgstr "The street strongman says to you in a low voice, \"I just passed Dormitory Eight!\"\n"

msgid "尚书府的门房虽然没什么官衔，但所有想晋见\n尚书的白衣无不对他毕恭毕敬的\n"
msgstr "The Minister's Mansion's gatekeeper holds no official rank, but every commoner who wants an audience with the Minister treats him with deep respect.\n"

msgid "门房慢吞吞地说：是。。想见尚书大人的吗？。。\n"
msgstr "The gatekeeper says slowly, \"Yes... You want to see His Excellency the Minister?...\"\n"

msgid "门房嘿嘿地笑了笑，手里比划着一个数字.\n"
msgstr "The gatekeeper chuckles, and holds up a number with his fingers.\n"

msgid "大人太客气了"
msgstr "You are too kind, my lord."

msgid "这位大人，里面请！"
msgstr "This way, my lord, please come in!"

msgid "鼻子里哼了一声，头掉了过去。\n"
msgstr "Snorts through his nose and turns his head away.\n"

msgid "兵部尚书"
msgstr "Minister of War"

msgid "他是当今皇上身边的红人，与宫中的关系也很熟络，手中掌管着\n兵马大权。不过能爬上这个位置，绝不是仅仅因为溜须拍马的缘\n故，当年战功赫赫，才有今天的地位。\n"
msgstr "He is the Emperor's favorite, well acquainted with the inner palace, and holds the power over the army and horses. But no one climbs to such a post on flattery alone. He won great victories in his day, and that is why he stands where he stands.\n"

msgid "原令？什么原令。先帝的旨意，兵部奉旨办差。"
msgstr "The original decree? What original decree. It was the late Emperor's will, and the Ministry of War carries out what the throne commands."

msgid "东西带来了？给老夫。先帝推敲了二十年的东西，换一卷纸——你不亏。"
msgstr "You brought it? Give it to this old man. Something the late Emperor turned over for twenty years, for one scroll of paper. You lose nothing."

msgid "你是什么人？"
msgstr "Who are you?"

msgid "先帝的旨意，兵部奉旨办差。"
msgstr "The late Emperor's will. The Ministry of War carries out what the throne commands."

msgid "先帝推敲遗书最后两句，推敲了二十年。他推出来的东西在老夫手里。你给我那卷原令，它归你。"
msgstr "The late Emperor pondered the last two lines of his testament for twenty years. What he worked out is in this old man's hands. Give me that original decree, and it is yours."

msgid "岚城？说书人的话。"
msgstr "The Wind City? A storyteller's tale."

msgid "原令交给庾子建，当面就没有了。他会留在朝上，终章还会来要那把剑。你换来的是先帝推敲遗书的手稿——寻风的法子。交吗？"
msgstr "Once the original decree is handed to Yu Zijian, it is gone from your hands. He will remain at court, and in the final chapter he will come for that sword. What you get in exchange is the late Emperor's manuscript on his testament, the method of finding the wind. Hand it over?"

msgid "接过诏书，看也没看，一抬手扔进了火盆。火苗「呼」地窜起来，黄绫卷成了灰。"
msgstr "Takes the edict without so much as a glance and tosses it into the brazier. The flames leap with a whoosh, and the yellow silk curls into ash."

msgid "你以为老夫要的是权？权，老夫有了。皇上怕我，朝里一半的人听我——可那是怕，不是服。"
msgstr "You think this old man wants power? Power, this old man has. The Emperor fears me, half the court obeys me. But that is fear, not respect."

msgid "谁握着那把能救天下的剑，谁就是天下的恩人。恩人说话，皇上只能听，天下也只能听。老夫要的是这个——名正言顺。"
msgstr "Whoever holds the sword that can save the realm is the realm's benefactor. When a benefactor speaks, the Emperor can only listen, and so can the whole realm. This is what this old man wants: to be rightful."

msgid "先帝推敲了二十年遗书最后两句。推出来的是这个——"
msgstr "The late Emperor pondered the last two lines of his testament for twenty years. And this is what he worked out."

msgid "从袖子里抽出一卷纸，递给你。"
msgstr "Pulls a scroll of paper from his sleeve and hands it to you."

msgid "寻风的法子。你要找岚城，拿去。原令的事，到此为止。"
msgstr "The method of finding the wind. You want to find the Wind City, take it. As for the original decree, that is the end of it."

msgid "先帝的东西，你自己留着吧。"
msgstr "The late Emperor's things, keep them yourself."

msgid "尚书府护院"
msgstr "Estate Guard"

msgid "什么人！"
msgstr "Who goes there!"

msgid "两个护院一左一右扭住你的胳膊，提着灯笼把你从大门推了出去。"
msgstr "Two estate guards twist your arms, one on each side, and with a lantern in hand push you out through the main gate."

msgid "墙根底下，真龙头连眼皮都没抬：「说了别跟护院照面。脚底下轻些，下回再来。」"
msgstr "At the foot of the wall, the true Dragon Head does not so much as lift an eyelid. \"Told you not to cross the guards. Step lighter. Come again next time.\""

msgid "护院又把你从大门推了出去，骂骂咧咧地闩上了门。"
msgstr "The estate guard pushes you out through the main gate again, cursing as he bolts it behind you."

msgid "真龙头往墙根里缩了缩：「护院绕一圈要多久，你数过没有？」"
msgstr "The true Dragon Head shrinks back against the foot of the wall. \"How long does a guard take to go around? Ever counted?\""

msgid "客人"
msgstr "Guest"

msgid "我也不知道，主人吩咐我守着的。\n"
msgstr "I don't know either. The master told me to guard it.\n"

msgid "她是尚书府的司职厨务的丫鬟，一年四季呆在厨房中。但粗重的\n杂活也掩不住其天生丽质。\n"
msgstr "She is a maid of the Minister's Mansion in charge of the kitchen, and spends all four seasons in it. But even the heavy, rough chores cannot hide her natural beauty.\n"

msgid "一个老老实实、本本分分的庄园花匠，多年的风霜刻满\n了他的额头。多年以来从来没有人认真注意过他，他也\n总是默默地在花园里工作。\n"
msgstr "An honest, steady gardener of the estate, with years of wind and frost carved into his forehead. In all these years no one has taken real notice of him, and he goes on working quietly in the garden.\n"

msgid "那是我的师门。\n"
msgstr "That is my school.\n"

msgid "林忌？。。你问我师兄，好久没见着他了。\n"
msgstr "Lin Ji?... Ask my senior brother. I have not seen him in a long time.\n"

msgid "师兄的事……你不是茅山的人了，就别管了。"
msgstr "My senior brother's affairs... You are no longer of Mount Mao, so do not concern yourself."

msgid "师兄说得对，茅山宁可没有那本书。……也许吧。"
msgstr "Senior Brother was right, Mount Mao would rather not have that book. ... Perhaps."

msgid "师兄还好？……他那只金眼睛，二十年前就是那样看人的。"
msgstr "How is Senior Brother? ... That golden eye of his, twenty years ago he already looked at people that way."

msgid "手里的花剪停了。"
msgstr "The garden shears in his hand stop."

msgid "师兄让你来的？……他还记得我。"
msgstr "Senior Brother sent you? ... He still remembers me."

msgid "老爷那年从北边回来，夜里喊「老松岭」，喊得满府的人睡不着。镇宅？我镇了二十年——镇的不是鬼，是他自己。"
msgstr "The year the master came back from the north, he cried out \"Old Pine Ridge\" in the night, so loud that the whole household could not sleep. Guard the house against evil? I have guarded it for twenty years, and what I guard against is not ghosts. It is himself."

msgid "清尘那孩子，是这府里唯一不怕她爹的人。我教她几道符，让她护得住自己。"
msgstr "Qingchen is the only one in this house who is not afraid of her father. I taught her a few talismans so she could protect herself."

msgid "这两年，后头的小屋里来了北边道观的人。他们来了就烧东西——我从灰里、从门缝里，一页一页抄了下来，抄在那函书的空白处。"
msgstr "These two years, people from a Daoist abbey in the north have been coming to the little house at the back. Whenever they came, they burned things. I copied them out, page by page, from the ashes and from the gaps in the door, and I wrote them in the blank spaces of that volume."

msgid "府里还有一个不姓庾的，客厅里写字的那位。他的字比我的符好看。"
msgstr "There is one more person in this house who is not named Yu, the one who writes in the parlor. His writing is more beautiful than my talismans."

msgid "书该还给师兄了。你问我「符箓」。"
msgstr "The book should go back to Senior Brother. You asked me about \"talismans.\""

msgid "符箓"
msgstr "Talismans"

msgid "书回了山。烧也好，留也好，是师兄的事了。"
msgstr "The book has gone back to the mountain. Burn it or keep it, that is Senior Brother's affair now."

msgid "愣了一下，叹了口气，从花房里又捧出一函蓝布面的书。"
msgstr "Stunned for a moment, he sighs and brings out of the flower house another volume bound in blue cloth."

msgid "丢了？……抄的时候我留了一份底稿。拿去，这回别再丢了。"
msgstr "Lost it?... I kept a draft when I copied. Take it, and this time do not lose it again."

msgid "书在你那里。替我交给师兄。"
msgstr "The book is with you. Hand it to Senior Brother for me."

msgid "从花房的瓦盆底下摸出一只油布包，一层一层打开。"
msgstr "Reaches under a clay flowerpot in the flower house, takes out an oilcloth bundle, and unwraps it layer by layer."

msgid "《上清符箓》。前半是茅山的符；后半……你自己看。"
msgstr "\"Highest Clarity Talismans.\" The first half is Mount Mao's talismans. The second half... see for yourself."

msgid "他们烧掉的，都在这里。"
msgstr "Everything they burned is in here."

msgid "替我交给师兄。烧也好，留也好，是茅山的事。我这儿还有花要浇。"
msgstr "Hand it to Senior Brother for me. Burn it or keep it, that is Mount Mao's affair. I still have flowers to water here."

msgid "骆先生？老爷下了狱，相国把他叫去了。那个人，在这府里十年，没说过一句多余的话。"
msgstr "Mr. Luo? The master is in prison, and the Chancellor has summoned him. That man, in ten years in this house, has not spoken one word too many."

msgid "骆先生？客厅里写字的那位。老爷的信，十封有九封是他的笔。"
msgstr "Mr. Luo? The one who writes in the parlor. Nine of every ten of the master's letters are in his hand."

msgid "老爷下了狱，小姐去了相国府。……我在这儿把花浇完，也该走了。"
msgstr "The master is in prison, and the young lady has gone to the Chancellor's House... Once I finish watering the flowers here, it will be time for me to go too."

msgid "什么？清尘出事了？\n"
msgstr "What? Qingchen is in trouble?\n"

msgid "放下花剪，四下看了看，压低了声音。"
msgstr "Puts down the garden shears, looks around, and lowers his voice."

msgid "……她撞见了不该见的。老爷把她关在内宅，帘子外头有人守着。你要是能见着她，替我问一声。"
msgstr "... She saw what she should not have seen. The master has shut her in the inner quarters, with men posted outside the curtain. If you can see her, ask after her for me."

msgid "尚书府小姐"
msgstr "Young Lady of the Minister's Mansion"

msgid "她是尚书府的千金。平时一直呆在自己的绣房里，所以虽然外界\n如何盛传她是如何如何的文雅、娴淑，却极少有能见过她的人。\n不知从何时起，她竺信起道教来，所以一切讲究素雅。\n"
msgstr "She is the Minister's daughter. She has always stayed in her own embroidery chamber, so although the world says all manner of things about how refined and gentle she is, very few have ever seen her. At some point she came to believe in Daoism, and now everything must be plain and elegant.\n"

msgid "放下手里的符纸，看了你一眼，又看了一眼帘子外头。"
msgstr "Puts down the talisman paper in her hand, looks at you, then looks once more at the outside of the curtain."

msgid "你不是府里的人。……是花匠伯伯让你来的？"
msgstr "You are not from the household... Did Uncle Gardener send you?"

msgid "那天夜里我睡不着，走到小屋外头，听见我爹和一个黑衣人说话。黑衣人说「湖底」，我爹说「子时之前」。"
msgstr "That night I could not sleep, and I walked out to the little house, and I heard my father talking with a man in black. The man in black said \"the lake bottom,\" and my father said \"before the hour of Zi.\""

msgid "黑衣人走的是祭坛底下的路：顺着转一圈，逆着转三圈，按下去。密室的床底下还有一条道，往南——通到宫里，冷宫的井。我跟过一次。"
msgstr "The man in black takes the road under the altar: turn once clockwise, three times counterclockwise, and press down. Under the bed in the secret chamber there is another passage, going south. It leads to the palace, to the well in the Cold Palace. I followed it once."

msgid "第二天，我爹就让人守着帘子了。"
msgstr "The next day, my father had men posted at the curtain."

msgid "父亲"
msgstr "Father"

msgid "我爹……当年打仗是一把好手。这几年他书房里的灯，夜里总是亮着。"
msgstr "My father... in the war he was a fine fighter. These last few years the lamp in his study is always lit at night."

msgid "小屋里有人。黑衣裳，戴黑冠，白天不出来。我爹每隔几夜去一回。"
msgstr "There is someone in the little house. Black clothes, a black cap, never comes out by day. My father goes every few nights."

msgid "顺一逆三，按下去。床底下的石板，往南走。符你带着——夜里宫里的禁军眼睛短一截。"
msgstr "One turn clockwise, three counterclockwise, press down. The stone slab under the bed, go south. Keep the talisman with you. At night the Palace guards' eyes see a little short."

msgid "祭坛那块台子底下有个按钮，顺着转一圈，逆着转三圈，按下去。下面密室的床底下压着一块石板。"
msgstr "There is a button under the platform at the altar. Turn it once clockwise, three times counterclockwise, and press down. Under the bed in the secret chamber below, there is a stone slab pressed down."

msgid "从桌上抽出一张黄纸符，递给你。"
msgstr "Pulls a yellow paper talisman from the desk and hands it to you."

msgid "茅山的障眼符，花匠伯伯教我画的。带在身上，夜里巡夜的人眼睛短一截。"
msgstr "A Mount Mao veiling talisman. Uncle Gardener taught me to draw it. Keep it on you, and at night the eyes of the night watch see a little short."

msgid "花匠伯伯是茅山的人。我的符是他教的。我爹不知道。"
msgstr "Uncle Gardener is of Mount Mao. He taught me my talismans. My father does not know."

msgid "花匠伯伯……府里只有他还肯跟我说话。"
msgstr "Uncle Gardener... in this house only he will still talk to me."

msgid "这是一条青石铺地的大驿道，地处京师的北郊。北方入京必经\n此地。往南走就可以到京师了。东北是连绵的群山。\n"
msgstr "This is a great post road paved with bluestone, in the north suburb of the Capital. Everyone coming into the capital from the north must pass here. Go south and you reach the Capital. To the northeast are rolling mountains.\n"

msgid "你正走在一条青石铺地的大驿道上，四周人来人往。挑担子的\n苦力，赶着大车的马夫，赴京传书的军人，熙熙攘攘，非常热闹。\n不时还有两三骑快马从身边飞驰而过，引起一阵骚动。道路两旁各\n有一片小树林，南边就是京师。\n"
msgstr "You are walking on a great post road paved with bluestone, with people coming and going on every side. Porters carrying loads, carters driving big wagons, soldiers hurrying to the Capital with dispatches, it is crowded and lively. Every now and then two or three fast riders gallop past you, and a stir runs through the crowd. A small grove stands on either side of the road. To the south is the Capital.\n"

msgid "这是京师的北门，若干年前曾经遭到异族的攻打，因而显得有\n些陈旧。城门正上方清析可见当朝名家书写的“京师北门”几个金\n字，城墙上贴着几张告示。这里是罪犯逃往北方的必经之地，\n官兵们戒备森严，动不动就截住行人盘问。一条笔直的青石板大道\n向南北两边延伸。北边是郊外，骑马的、座轿的、走路的，行人匆\n匆涌入京师。南边是城里，隐约传来阵阵的喧闹声。\n"
msgstr "This is the north gate of the Capital. Some years ago it was attacked by foreigners, so it looks a little worn. Above the gate you can clearly see four golden characters, \"Capital North Gate,\" written by a famous master of the day, and several notices are posted on the wall. This is the road criminals must take to flee north, so the soldiers keep a tight guard and often stop travelers to question them. A straight bluestone road runs north and south. To the north is the countryside, where riders, sedan-borne travelers and walkers hurry into the Capital. To the south is the city, from which comes the faint sound of bustle.\n"

msgid "从这里再往北走就出了京师的北城门，在与异族交战的时期，为\n方便盘查行人，官兵在这儿放了一道很大的栅栏。后来尽管战争结束\n了，栅栏拿走了，但老人们还是习惯地把这叫做“大栅栏”，用京音\n读起来就变成了“大世烂儿”。西面是护国寺的侧门。\n"
msgstr "From here, going further north brings you out of the Capital's north gate. In the days of war with the foreigners, soldiers set up a huge fence here to check travelers. The war ended and the fence was taken away, but the old folk still call this place the \"Great Fence,\" which in the Capital accent comes out as \"Dashilar.\" To the west is the side gate of Huguo Temple.\n"

msgid "这是一间素来不讲信用的钱庄，钱庄的老板倒是读过几年书，脑筋\n很活络，你可以看到钱庄里里外外都打扫得乾乾净净，一个精瘦精瘦的\n中年人坐在柜台后面，柜台上放著一块牌子，往南是通往京城街\n道的大门。\n"
msgstr "This is a money shop with a long record of not keeping its word. Its owner has at least read a few years of books and has a quick head, and you can see the shop swept spotlessly clean inside and out. A thin, wiry middle-aged man sits behind the counter, on which stands a placard. To the south is the door out to the Capital's streets.\n"

msgid "这里是江湖中人人所向往的京师武器店。店铺宽敞，红砖铺地。\n四周的墙壁上挂满了各式的刀剑。东边的武器架上的枪戟的反光令\n你睁不开眼。靠北墙的大柜台一尘不染，几个伙计正在忙碌。\n    靠近店门的地方有一块金字招牌。\n"
msgstr "This is the Capital Weapon Shop, the dream of everyone in the jianghu. The shop is spacious, with a red brick floor. Blades and swords of every kind hang on the walls all around. The glint of spears and halberds on the rack to the east dazzles your eyes. The big counter against the north wall is spotless, and several clerks are busy at work.\n    Near the shop door hangs a gold-lettered signboard.\n"

msgid "你来到京师的西一门。城墙上贴着几张官家布告。东\n北方是大相国寺，不时传来几声钟声。西边是城外，抬头可见远处\n连绵的群山。东边就是京师的街道了。\n"
msgstr "You have come to the First West Gate of the Capital. Several official notices are posted on the wall. To the northeast is Great Chancellor Temple, from which the sound of a bell comes now and then. To the west is outside the city, and looking up you can see far mountains rolling one after another. To the east are the Capital's streets.\n"

msgid "这里是京师的大街上。西边是京师的西一门，护国寺的僧人西\n去取经必经此地。福缘好的话还可以看到几个有道高僧路过。\n"
msgstr "This is a street in the Capital. To the west is the First West Gate of the Capital, the way monks of Huguo Temple must pass going west for scriptures. With good fortune, you may even see a few eminent monks passing by.\n"

msgid "你来到京师的大街。北边是护国寺的大门，寺内香烟缭绕。\n"
msgstr "You have come to a main street of the Capital. To the north is the gate of Huguo Temple, where incense smoke curls through the temple.\n"

msgid "京师的中轴线和北面的主要街道护国道在这里交叉，东西向的护\n国道上人来人往，热闹非凡，南面的皇家祭坛反倒冷冷清清，往北可\n以望到大红颜色的北城门。\n"
msgstr "The Capital's central axis and State Guardian Road, the main street to the north, cross here. On State Guardian Road, running east and west, people come and go in lively crowds, while the Imperial Altar to the south is deserted by comparison. To the north you can see the big red north gate.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在京师的大街上，往东可以隐约看到城门铜扣上的反\n光，在你的北边是京城唯一的钱庄，往西有熙熙攘攘的人群，偶尔还\n能见到一俩个僧侣。\n"
msgstr "You are walking on a street of the Capital. To the east, you can faintly see the glint off the brass studs of a city gate. To your north is the Capital's only money shop. To the west is a bustling crowd, and now and then you see a monk or two.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在京师的大街上。东边就是京师的东一门了，隐约\n传来官兵搜查行人的吆喝声。在你的北边是京城的武器店，据说江\n湖上半数以上的武器精品出于此店。从店中走出的人都是一副心满\n意足的模样。\n"
msgstr "You are walking on a street of the Capital. To the east is the First East Gate, from which the shouts of soldiers searching travelers come faintly. To your north is the Capital's weapon shop, said to produce more than half of the best weapons in the jianghu. Everyone who comes out of the shop looks fully satisfied.\n"

msgid "你来到京师的东一门。城门口十来个手持刀枪的士兵正在检查\n过往的行人。经常有一些富丽堂皇的大车缓缓驶入城来，那是京师\n的官宦人家出游归来。城墙上有一张陈旧的布告。东边是\n城外，风景如画。西边是京师的街道。\n"
msgstr "You have come to the First East Gate of the Capital. A dozen or so soldiers with blades and spears are checking the travelers passing through. Now and then splendid carriages roll slowly into the city, officials' families returning from an outing. On the wall is an old notice. To the east is outside the city, a picture of scenery. To the west are the Capital's streets.\n"

msgid "你来到一所废园里。据说废园的主人原也是位极人臣的，后来却\n以「莫须有」的罪名被皇上斩了全族，其他的官员怕晦气，都不敢来\n此住，遂形成废园。废园里荒草丛生，往日的辉煌已不再现，仅留下\n几个残垣供人凭吊。\n"
msgstr "You have come to an abandoned garden. They say the garden's owner was once a minister of the highest rank, but was charged with \"something that may have happened\" and the Emperor put his whole clan to the sword. Other officials, afraid of ill luck, would not live here, and so it became an abandoned garden. The garden is overgrown with weeds, its old glory gone, and only a few broken walls remain for visitors to mourn over.\n"

msgid "这是一片宽阔的小广场，广场的中间是皇家的祭坛，每年\n朝廷庆祝丰收或祈祷的重大典礼都在这里举行，皇上、皇后和文武百\n官能上祭坛，其他人只能从旁边绕过去。除了禁卫军的官兵和宫里的\n杂役偶尔出入外，很少有人来往。往南是紫禁城的神武门，北面是一\n个非常热闹的十字路口。\n"
msgstr "This is a wide little square, and in the middle of it is the Imperial Altar. Every year the court holds its great ceremonies here, for the harvest and for prayer; only the Emperor, the Empress and the civil and military officials may climb the altar, and everyone else must go around it. Apart from the Imperial Guard soldiers and the palace servants who come and go now and then, few people pass here. To the south is the Gate of Divine Might of the Palace City, and to the north is a very busy crossroads.\n"

msgid "你来到了振远总局里。镖局虽然不大，但在京师这块土地上，已无人\n不知其名。尤其是其总镖头，俨然是以京城武林领袖自居。\n"
msgstr "You have arrived inside the Far-Road Head Office. The agency is not large, but on this ground of the Capital there is no one who does not know its name. Its head in particular carries himself as the leader of the Capital's wulin.\n"

msgid "四喜绸缎庄是京师中的一家刚刚开业的专营衣帽的商店。店内\n顾客稀少，显得店铺空荡荡的。柜台上凌乱地摊着几匹绸缎。绸缎\n庄的老板出去进货了，只有老板娘空守店铺。据说这家店铺很有来\n历。一般的地痞也很少到店中闹事。\n    店堂上挂有一块崭新的招牌。\n"
msgstr "Four Joys Silk Shop is a newly opened shop in the Capital that deals only in clothes and hats. There are few customers, and the shop looks empty. A few bolts of silk lie in a mess on the counter. The owner has gone out to buy stock, and only the proprietress minds the shop. They say this shop has a background, and the usual ruffians seldom come here to make trouble.\n    A brand-new signboard hangs in the shop hall.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在京师的街道上。往东走便是紫禁城的后门--神武门\n，南面似乎有一家酒楼，酒肉的香味一阵阵飘来。北边是一个废园，\n据说里面经常闹鬼，所以没人敢去。\n"
msgstr "You are walking on a street in the Capital. To the east is the Gate of Divine Might, the back gate of the Palace City. To the south there seems to be a tavern, and waves of the smell of wine and meat drift over. To the north is an abandoned garden, said to be often haunted, so no one dares go there.\n"

msgid "你来到紫禁城的北门--神武门。南向的大门通向紫禁城，但这门\n很少开。门上缠着大铁链，还有士兵把守。往北走是皇家祭坛，不是\n一年一度祭天时那总很冷清。东西向的道路分别通向京师东，西路。\n"
msgstr "You have come to the north gate of the Palace City, the Gate of Divine Might. The gate to the south leads into the Palace City, but it is rarely opened. Thick iron chains are wound over it, and soldiers stand guard. To the north is the Imperial Altar, which is never so desolate as on the one day each year when they sacrifice to Heaven. The roads running east and west lead to the Capital's east and west roads.\n"

msgid "这里是京师东街的北段。往北走有一个大院子，院里立着根老高\n老高的旗杆，上书一个斗大的「镖」字，隔很远就可以看见。镖局的\n生意似乎很好，人络绎不绝。西向是庄严的神武门。向南则去向尚书\n府和午门。\n"
msgstr "This is the northern stretch of the Capital's East Street. To the north is a big courtyard in which stands a very tall flagpole, with a character \"Escort\" as big as a peck measure written on it, visible from far away. The escort agency seems to do good business, with a steady stream of people. To the west is the solemn Gate of Divine Might. To the south are the Minister's Mansion and the Meridian Gate.\n"

msgid "你走到了一家大酒楼里。四周的装饰金壁辉煌，令人眼花缭乱，连餐\n具的做工也极讲究，不愧是京城的第一大酒楼。酒楼的菜肴是远近闻名的\n，在这经常可以看到一些达官贵族，据连当今皇上也曾微服来此以一饱口\n福。\n"
msgstr "You have walked into a great tavern. The decor all around is gold and splendid, dazzling to the eye, and even the tableware is finely made, worthy of the Capital's greatest tavern. The dishes here are famous far and near, and you often see high officials and nobles. It is said even the present Emperor once came in disguise to eat his fill.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在京师的街道上，西边是京师最有名的“太白酒楼”，\n酒楼里三教九流的人物都有，嘈杂声不绝于耳。东边紧邻着紫禁城的\n城墙。街道向南北方向延伸着。\n"
msgstr "You are walking on a street in the Capital. To the west is the Capital's most famous Taibai Tavern, where people of every kind gather and noise never stops. To the east, right beside you, is the wall of the Palace City. The street runs north and south.\n"

msgid "你走在京师东街的中段。这里夹在紫禁城城墙与尚书府院墙之间\n，南向的道路通向午门和尚书府的大门，而北方不远处振远总局的旗\n杆依稀可见，令人隐隐约约地感到一种杀气。\n"
msgstr "You are walking in the middle stretch of the Capital's East Street. Here you are wedged between the wall of the Palace City and the compound wall of the Minister's Mansion. The road to the south leads to the Meridian Gate and the gate of the Minister's Mansion, and not far to the north you can faintly see the flagpole of the Far-Road Head Office, which gives you a faint feeling of murder in the air.\n"

msgid "你来到相国府的大门处。虽然相国在朝中也是地位显赫，但与对\n面尚书府比起来，相国的府第显的寒酸得多。一切都十分简单，只有\n牌匾上的「相国府」还提醒着人们主人的地位。\n"
msgstr "You have come to the gate of the Chancellor's House. Although the Chancellor is also a man of standing at court, next to the Minister's Mansion across the way, the Chancellor's residence looks far shabbier. Everything is very plain, and only the words \"Chancellor's House\" on the signboard remind people of the owner's rank.\n"

msgid "你现在正走在京师的街道上。东边是进出紫禁城的午门，西边则\n是当朝地位显赫的相国的府宅，而北边不远处“太白酒楼”的喧哗声\n依稀可闻。\n"
msgstr "You are walking on a street in the Capital. To the east is the Meridian Gate, the way in and out of the Palace City, and to the west is the residence of the Chancellor, a man of high standing at court. Not far to the north you can faintly hear the din of Taibai Tavern.\n"

msgid "这里是京师的午门。午门进出紫禁城的要道，北面那庄严的大门\n后面便是神秘的紫禁城。大门的两侧放着一对石狮，\n虎视眈眈地盯着来往的人群。南面是历年选武状元的校武场，也不知\n现在有没有人。东西向的街道围绕着紫禁城。\n"
msgstr "This is the Meridian Gate of the Capital. This is the main way in and out of the Palace City, and behind the solemn great gate to the north lies the mysterious Palace City. A pair of stone lions stand on either side of the gate, glaring at the people who come and go. To the south is the Drill Ground, where the Martial Champions were chosen in past years, and who knows whether anyone is there now. The streets east and west run around the Palace City.\n"

msgid "这是京师东街的南段。整个东街都被掌管天下兵马印的尚书府占\n据了，东边便是尚书府的大门，南边则是尚书府高耸的围墙，\n北去的道路一直通向振远总局。\n"
msgstr "This is the southern stretch of the Capital's East Street. The whole of East Street is taken up by the Minister's Mansion, which holds the seal of the empire's armies. To the east is the mansion's gate, and to the south is the mansion's towering wall. The road to the north runs straight to the Far-Road Head Office.\n"

msgid "这里是京师的校武场。一些御林军正在这里日夜操练，喊杀声\n此起彼伏。几个骑着高头大马的将领，在场上来回地巡视。每年武\n考也是在此举行的，当年淤兰天武、萧避尘、蓝芷萍就是在此出尽\n了风头，一时间声名传遍长城内外、大江南北。\n    北边是午门，南边是热闹的天桥了。\n"
msgstr "This is the Capital's Drill Ground. Imperial Forest troops drill here day and night, and shouts of killing rise one after another. A few generals on tall horses ride back and forth across the field. The martial examination is also held here every year, and it was here that Yulan Tianwu, Xiao Bichen and Lan Zhiping outshone everyone, and their names spread within and beyond the Great Wall, north and south of the Yangtze.\n    To the north is the Meridian Gate, and to the south is the lively Tianqiao.\n"

msgid "这里是京师中最大的一家鞋店。店主姓李，历经几代，已是百\n年老店。店铺挺大，弥漫着一种特殊皮革的气味。大柜台后面的架\n子上放满了各式的皮靴。店中几个伙计正在忙碌。\n    店门口有一块金字招牌。\n"
msgstr "This is the biggest shoe shop in the Capital. The owner's family name is Li, and through several generations it has become a century-old shop. The shop is large, and the air smells of a peculiar kind of leather. On the shelves behind the big counter stand boots of every kind. Several clerks are busy in the shop.\n    A gold-lettered signboard hangs at the shop door.\n"

msgid "你来到京师的西二门，西二门虽不如京师的其他几个城门高大。\n但高高的城墙也非一般人所能攀越，城墙上贴着几张布告。\n西边是城外，据说一直往西就可到达一个仙境。东边就是京师的街\n道了。\n"
msgstr "You have come to the Second West Gate of the Capital. The Second West Gate is not as tall as the Capital's other gates, but the high city wall is still more than an ordinary person can climb, and several notices are posted on it. To the west is outside the city, and they say that going west you will reach a fairyland. To the east are the Capital's streets.\n"

msgid "你来到京师的大街上。西边是京师的西二门，西去的人不时经\n过这里。南边是京师的监狱，关押着一些重要的犯人。站在这里可\n以清楚地听到狱卒拷打犯人的皮鞭声和犯人的惨叫声。\n"
msgstr "You have come to a street in the Capital. To the west is the Second West Gate of the Capital. To the south is the Capital's prison, where some important prisoners are kept. Standing here you can clearly hear the jailers' whips and the prisoners' screams.\n"

msgid "这里是京师的大街，青石铺道，街面很干净。东边是京师的热\n闹场所天桥，来到京师可不能不去哦。南边是京师的刑场，逢上处\n决一些重要的犯人的时候，那里肯定是人山人海，不过平时人就少\n得多了。\n"
msgstr "This is a street in the Capital, paved with bluestone and quite clean. To the east is the Tianqiao, the Capital's lively gathering place, which you cannot come to the Capital without visiting. To the south is the Capital's execution ground; when some important prisoner is executed it is sure to be packed with people, but at other times there are far fewer.\n"

msgid "你来到京师的天桥。这里热闹非凡，人声鼎沸。杂耍的、卖艺\n的、做小买卖的应有尽有。若是仔细寻找，说不定可以买到什么奇\n珍异宝呢。柱子和墙壁上贴满着花花绿绿的广告。\n    北边是校武场。再往北就到京师中心……紫禁城了。\n"
msgstr "You have come to the Tianqiao of the Capital. The place is wildly lively and loud with voices. Jugglers, street performers and petty peddlers are all here. If you look carefully, you may even buy some rare treasure. The pillars and walls are plastered with gaudy advertisements.\n    To the north is the Drill Ground. Further north is the center of the Capital... the Palace City.\n"

msgid "这里是京师的大街。西边是京师的热闹场所天桥，一些行人匆\n匆往西走去。据说天桥的夜市也不差哦。南边是一片民宅，炊烟缭\n绕。\n"
msgstr "This is a street of the Capital. To the west is the Tianqiao, the Capital's lively gathering place, and some passersby hurry west. They say the Tianqiao night market is not bad either. To the south is a stretch of houses, with cooking smoke curling up.\n"

msgid "这里是京师的大街。东边是京师的东二门，一些刚进城的行人\n坐在路边休息，不时发出一阵哄笑声。往西就可以到京师中心了。\n"
msgstr "This is a street of the Capital. To the east is the Capital's Second East Gate, and some travelers who have just come into the city sit by the roadside resting, now and then bursting into laughter. Going west brings you to the center of the Capital.\n"

msgid "这里是京师的东二门。城门上插着几面旗帜，标志了本门的守\n城将领。城楼里坐着几个将军打扮的人，城墙上有一张刚刚粘贴上\n去的布告，一群人正围着观看。东边是城外，西边是京师\n的街道。\n"
msgstr "This is the Second East Gate of the Capital. Several banners are planted on the gate, marking the general who commands this gate. In the gate tower sit a few men dressed as generals, and on the wall is a newly pasted notice, with a crowd gathered round to read it. To the east is outside the city, and to the west are the Capital's streets.\n"

msgid "你来到京师的大街上。南边是京师的南门，出了南门就可去南\n方重镇……南海镇。北边是天桥，人声鼎沸。西边是刑场，一个一\n般人极少去的地方。\n"
msgstr "You have come to a street in the Capital. To the south is the Capital's South Gate, and out of the South Gate you can go to a major town of the south... Nanhai Town. To the north is the Tianqiao, loud with voices. To the west is the execution ground, a place few ordinary people ever go.\n"

msgid "这是京师的南门。高大的城门正上“京师南门”几个大字格外\n显眼。城墙上贴着几张官家布告。西北方是京师的监狱，\n关押着一些要犯，因此这里的官兵们也戒备森严。南边是城外，不\n时走来几个赴京赶考的举子。北边就是京师，一个灯红酒绿的地方。\n"
msgstr "This is the Capital's South Gate. The big characters \"Capital South Gate\" above the high gate stand out. Several official notices are posted on the wall. To the northwest is the Capital's prison, where some important criminals are held, so the soldiers here are also on strict guard. To the south is outside the city, and now and then a few candidates come on their way to the Capital for the exams. To the north is the Capital, a place of lanterns and wine.\n"

msgid "你走上了太白酒楼的二楼，酒楼的雅座便设于此。大凡有来头\n的客人都到此饮酒作乐。在此经常可以遇上一些达官贵族，一些为\n做官的富家子弟就来此打进阶的消息。墙边有一道楼梯通往一楼的\n茶座。\n"
msgstr "You have gone up to the second floor of Taibai Tavern, where the private rooms are. Nearly every guest with a name drinks and makes merry up here. You often meet high officials and nobles, and sons of rich families who want an official post come to pick up news of promotions. A staircase by the wall leads down to the tea tables on the first floor.\n"

msgid "你来到尚书府大门。门上悬挂着一块很大的黑色牌匾，上面用隶\n书写着三个金字「尚书府」。牌匾上的一行小字表明这是当今皇上所\n题，可以看出其官势显赫。\n"
msgstr "You have come to the gate of the Minister's Mansion. A very large black signboard hangs over the door, with three gold characters, \"Minister's Mansion,\" in clerical script. A line of small characters on the signboard says it was written by the present Emperor himself, which shows how mighty its rank is.\n"

msgid "你走到了尚书府的庭院。院子很大，地面规规整整地用清一色的\n大青石铺就，显示出主人的气派。东边的府门时常关着，不是高官可\n甭想进来。西向是主人会客的客厅。北行的石路通向客房，而向南则\n是去往内院。\n"
msgstr "You have come to the Minister's Mansion's courtyard. The yard is large, and the ground is paved neatly with big bluestone slabs of one kind, showing the owner's grandeur. The gate on the east is often shut, and no one but a high official dares come in. To the west is the parlor where the master receives guests. The stone path north leads to the guest room, and to the south is the way to the inner quarters.\n"

msgid "这里是尚书府的会客厅，平常主人就在此接待客人。客厅的装饰\n倒并不多，但都极其讲究。所有的家具都是用沉香木做的，时时发出\n一股淡淡的香味。家具被擦得一尘不染的，整齐地排列在两旁。当中\n的椅子尤其大，并铺以少见的白虎皮。\n"
msgstr "This is the Minister's Mansion's parlor, where the master usually receives guests. The decoration is not much, but all of it is exquisite. All the furniture is made of agarwood and gives off a faint fragrance from time to time. The furniture is wiped spotless and set out neatly on both sides. The chair in the middle is especially large, spread with a rare white tiger skin.\n"

msgid "这里是尚书府的小径。小径继续向北延伸着，透过树丛隐隐约约\n地看到那儿似乎有一间小屋。从这儿向东走就是一间客房，据说客房\n里住的是一位贵客。不过一般人不允许进。\n"
msgstr "This is a path in the Minister's Mansion. The path runs on north, and through the trees you can faintly see a little house there. To the east is a guest room, where they say a distinguished guest is staying. Ordinary people are not allowed in.\n"

msgid "尚书府的小径走到这似乎到了尽头。小径的东边是一间小屋，平\n时房门总是关的，每天按时由一名又聋又哑的仆役送饭进去，其他人\n一概不让入内。南边不远处就是尚书府庭院了。\n"
msgstr "The path of the Minister's Mansion seems to end here. To the east of the path is a little house whose door is always shut. At fixed times each day a deaf and mute servant takes food in, and no one else is let in at all. Not far to the south is the Minister's Mansion's courtyard.\n"

msgid "你走进了尚书府的客房。客房不大，但布置得比较整洁。靠窗的\n小桌上摞放着几本书，另一侧的墙上则挂了把宝剑，似乎告诉\n来人此地主人竞是文武双全。\n"
msgstr "You walk into the guest room of the Minister's Mansion. It is not large, but it is arranged fairly neatly. On the little table by the window a few books lie stacked, and on the opposite wall hangs a fine sword, as if telling the visitor that the master here is skilled in both letters and arms.\n"

msgid "你步入尚书府内的一间小屋。小屋内很黑，什么也看不见，但莫\n名地感到一股杀气，让人有转身就跑的念头。\n"
msgstr "You step into a little house inside the Minister's Mansion. It is very dark inside and you can see nothing, but you feel a murderous aura from somewhere, enough to make you want to turn and run.\n"

msgid "这里是尚书府的花园小径。小径的南方就是花园，阵阵花香随风\n飘过来，使人精神大振。厨房在小径的东面，而往南则去往尚书府的\n庭院。\n"
msgstr "This is the garden path of the Minister's Mansion. To the south of the path is the garden, and gusts of flower scent drift on the wind, lifting your spirits. The kitchen is east of the path, and going south leads to the mansion's courtyard.\n"

msgid "你来到了尚书府的厨房。厨房里各种烹饪用品与设备应有尽有，\n而且用品的做工也都很精细，一眼便知是官家的用品。厨房里的炉火\n烧得旺旺的，一个烧火丫鬟正忙着即将出锅的「西湖醋鱼」。\n"
msgstr "You have come into the kitchen of the Minister's Mansion. Every kind of cooking utensil and equipment is here, all finely made, and you can tell at a glance they belong to an official house. The kitchen fire burns high, and a fire-tending maid is busy with the \"West Lake fish in vinegar\" about to come out of the pot.\n"

msgid "尚书府的花园里搜集了许多名贵花卉。从洛阳的牡丹到扬州的琼\n花，你不能不惊诧于这里的全来。四时的花卉竞相开放着，发出沁人\n的香味。从花园东行就是内宅，而西边似乎有一间破屋。\n"
msgstr "The Minister's Mansion's garden has gathered many rare and costly flowers. From the peonies of Luoyang to the jade-bud flowers of Yangzhou, you cannot help marveling at how complete the collection is. Flowers of all four seasons bloom in rivalry, giving off a scent that soothes the heart. East of the garden is the inner quarters, and to the west there seems to be a broken-down hut.\n"

msgid "你轻轻地走进尚书府的内宅，男客一般是不让来此的。内宅的布\n置很素雅，一切的摆设都显得很自然，有「天然去雕饰，清水出芙蓉\n」的意味。西边就是你来时经过的花园。\n"
msgstr "You step softly into the inner quarters of the Minister's Mansion, where male guests are generally not allowed. The inner quarters are plain and elegant, and every furnishing looks natural, with the feel of the lines \"natural beauty needs no carving, a lotus fresh from clear water.\" To the west is the garden you passed through to get here.\n"

msgid "你走在尚书府的一条僻静的小路上。这条小路连接着花园和一间\n废弃的杂货屋，平常很少有人来此。东面的花园渐渐地远了，西面的\n门都已经脱落的废屋已历历在目。北面是高耸的院墙。\n"
msgstr "You are on a quiet little path in the Minister's Mansion. This path joins the garden to an abandoned storeroom, and few people ever come here. The garden to the east is gradually receding, and the ruined shed to the west, its door long since fallen off, comes clearly into view. To the north is the high courtyard wall.\n"

msgid "这是一间已被废弃的小屋。小屋很阴暗，也很潮湿。就着微弱的光线\n，隐约看见小屋里胡乱地堆放着一些杂物。小屋里到处挂着蜘蛛网，显然\n很久没有人来过了。\n"
msgstr "This is an abandoned little shed. It is dark and damp. By the faint light you can just make out a clutter of odds and ends heaped carelessly inside. Cobwebs hang everywhere, plainly no one has been here for a long time.\n"

msgid "你爬上了尚书府的院墙，墙里面人来人往的，很是\n热闹。你是跳进去，还是回去呢？\n"
msgstr "You have climbed onto the courtyard wall of the Minister's Mansion. Inside the wall, people come and go, quite lively. Do you jump in, or go back?\n"

msgid "店小二对你一白眼:你是谁呀，闯什么闯！"
msgstr "The waiter gives you a cold stare. \"Who are you? What are you barging in for!\""

msgid "上楼的路被店小二挡住了。"
msgstr "The waiter blocks the way upstairs."

msgid "店小二高声喊道:你楼上请"
msgstr "The waiter calls out, \"Upstairs with you, sir!\""

msgid "门房伸手拦住了你的去路，喝道：闯什么闯！"
msgstr "The gatekeeper puts out an arm to block your way and snaps, \"What are you barging in for!\""

msgid "护院伸手拦住了你的去路，喝道：闯什么闯！"
msgstr "The estate guard puts out an arm to block your way and snaps, \"What are you barging in for!\""

msgid "突然你眼前似乎有什么东西一闪，然后又消失在草丛中。回去在草丛中找找？"
msgstr "Suddenly something seems to flash before your eyes, then vanishes into the grass. Go back and search the grass?"

msgid "守门的禁军把长戟一横：宫门重地，闲人止步。"
msgstr "The Imperial Guard at the gate swings his halberd across. \"This is a palace gate. No loiterers.\""

msgid "相国府的大门关着。（门边可以叩门。）"
msgstr "The Chancellor's gate is shut. (You can knock at the door.)"

msgid "护院横过身子挡在帘子前：老爷吩咐了，小姐这几天不见人。"
msgstr "An estate guard turns sideways to block the curtain. \"The master has ordered it. The young lady sees no one these days.\""

msgid "告示上隐约写著几个人名，但都模糊不可分辨了。\n"
msgstr "A few names are faintly written on the notice, but they are too blurred to make out.\n"

msgid "布告经风吹日晒，字迹已经不可分辨了。\n"
msgstr "After wind and sun, the writing on the notice can no longer be made out.\n"

msgid "布告上写著：辑拿要犯----於兰天武。\n"
msgstr "The notice reads: Wanted, an important criminal... Yulan Tianwu.\n"

msgid "旧布告撕下来了，墙上新贴了一张黄纸，墨还没干：「前诏作废。」围着看的人比贴通缉那天还多。\n"
msgstr "The old notice has been torn down, and a new sheet of yellow paper pasted on the wall, the ink not yet dry: \"The former edict is void.\" More people crowd round to read it than on the day the wanted notice went up.\n"

msgid "布告撕了一半，剩下半张在风里拍着墙：「辑拿要犯——」，后头的名字没了。守城的兵说，是兵部尚书下狱那天撕的。\n"
msgstr "The notice is torn in half, and the remaining half flaps against the wall in the wind: \"Wanted, an important criminal --\", and the name after it is gone. The city guards say it was torn down the day the Minister of War went to prison.\n"

msgid "布告上写著：近来有土匪出没，望行人小心。\n"
msgstr "The notice reads: Bandits have been seen lately. Travelers, take care.\n"

msgid "布告上写著：行人出入需缴纳一两黄金。\n"
msgstr "The notice reads: Travelers must pay one tael of gold to pass in or out.\n"

msgid "告示上写著：今年文武大选。\n"
msgstr "The notice reads: This year's civil and martial selection.\n"

msgid "告示上写著：今年文武大选。\n旁边新贴了一张小些的，墨还没干透：「武举在校武场报名。兵部武选司。」\n"
msgstr "The notice reads: This year's civil and martial selection.\nBeside it a smaller sheet has just been pasted up, the ink barely dry: \"Register for the martial examination at the Drill Ground. Ministry of War, Bureau of Military Selection.\"\n"

msgid "我们提供的服务有：\nconvert     兑换钱币，自点数目，出门后发现少钱概不负责。\n"
msgstr "The services we offer:\nconvert     Exchange coins. Count your own money; once you leave, we are not responsible for any shortfall.\n"

msgid "专卖各式鞋。\n"
msgstr "Shoes of every kind, sold here.\n"

msgid "匾上三个大字：闯名堂\n"
msgstr "Three big characters on the board: \"Make a Name Hall\"\n"

msgid "招牌写著：京师武器店专营各式武器。\n"
msgstr "The signboard reads: Capital Weapon Shop, dealing in weapons of every kind.\n"

msgid "一段高高的院墙，但对轻功好的人爬上似非难事。\n"
msgstr "A stretch of high courtyard wall, but for someone good at qinggong it looks no great trouble to climb.\n"

msgid "园祭坛的栏杆是用汉白玉作成的，坛面由精细磨过的花岗岩铺成，中\n间有个台子。\n"
msgstr "The railings of the Imperial Altar are made of white jade, and the altar floor is laid with finely polished granite. In the middle stands a platform.\n"

msgid "只有皇帝能站在这个汉白玉台子上面，隐约地你好象看到台子的下面\n有个凸起。\n"
msgstr "Only the Emperor may stand on this white jade platform. You seem to see a raised bump on its underside.\n"

msgid "按下"
msgstr "Press down"

msgid "顺时针转"
msgstr "Turn clockwise"

msgid "你将按钮沿顺时针转了一圈，什么事情也没发生。"
msgstr "You turn the button once clockwise. Nothing happens."

msgid "逆时针转"
msgstr "Turn counterclockwise"

msgid "你将按钮沿逆时针转了一圈，什么事情也没发生。\n你忽然打了个冷颤，可能是心里害怕了。"
msgstr "You turn the button once counterclockwise. Nothing happens.\nYou suddenly shiver, perhaps from fear."

msgid "这很象一个按钮，上面长着细细的青苔，你突然一阵莫名其\n妙的紧张，好奇心却驱使你摸摸这个按钮，你发现它可以按，\n也可以旋转。\n"
msgstr "This looks very much like a button, with fine moss growing on it. You suddenly feel a strange tension, but curiosity drives you to touch the button. You find it can be pressed and also turned.\n"

msgid "天花板忽然发出轧轧的声音，露出一个向上的阶梯。"
msgstr "The ceiling suddenly grinds, and a flight of steps leading up appears."

msgid "天花板忽然发出轧轧的声音，向上的阶梯又缓缓地收了回去。"
msgstr "The ceiling suddenly grinds, and the steps leading up slowly draw back in."

msgid "天花板上有一块石板，似乎可以推开。\n"
msgstr "There is a stone slab in the ceiling that seems to be pushable open.\n"

msgid "一本诗词集，上面圈圈点点了一些句子.\n"
msgstr "A collection of poems, with some lines circled and marked.\n"

msgid "一张破旧的小床，铺着些乾草。你拨开乾草——床底下压着一块石板，石板边上有新蹭的泥，像是常有人掀开。\n"
msgstr "A shabby little bed laid with some dry straw. You push the straw aside, and under the bed is a stone slab. There is fresh mud at the edge of the slab, as if it is often lifted.\n"

msgid "京师守城兵说道：没有官府通令，任何人不能出入京师。\n"
msgstr "The Capital guard says, \"Without a government pass, no one goes in or out of the Capital.\"\n"

msgid "出城方向的路被京师守城兵挡住了。\n"
msgstr "The road out of the city is blocked by the Capital guard.\n"

msgid "这个方向没有出路。\n"
msgstr "There is no way out in this direction.\n"

msgid "寻找"
msgstr "Search"

msgid "忙活了半天，没有什么新的发现。\n"
msgstr "After busying yourself a good while, you find nothing new.\n"

msgid "你竟找到了一个出城令。\n"
msgstr "You actually find a city exit pass!\n"

msgid "白忙了半天，一无所获。\n"
msgstr "You toil for a good while and come up empty-handed.\n"

msgid "你拨开墙根下那捆柴草，底下果然有个狗洞，刚容得下一个人。\n"
msgstr "You pull aside the bundle of brushwood at the foot of the wall. Sure enough, there is a dog hole beneath, just big enough for one person.\n"

msgid "真龙头在你背后低声说：「护院在院子里绕圈呢。别跟他们照面——撞见了就退出来，下回再来。」\n"
msgstr "Behind you, the true Dragon Head says in a low voice, \"The guards are circling in the courtyard. Don't cross them. If they catch you, back out, and come again next time.\"\n"

msgid "天还亮着，东街上人来人往，钻不得。真龙头说过：夜里再来。\n"
msgstr "It is still light, with people coming and going on East Street. You can't crawl through now. The true Dragon Head said: come back at night.\n"

msgid "墙根下堆着一捆柴草，压得严严实实。\n"
msgstr "A bundle of brushwood is stacked at the foot of the wall, pressed down tight.\n"

msgid "跳进去"
msgstr "Jump in"

msgid "跳回去"
msgstr "Jump back"

msgid "候旨"
msgstr "Await the summons"

msgid "铁门开着。守门的禁军认得你，侧身让开了。\n"
msgstr "The iron gate is open. The Imperial Guard at the gate knows you and steps aside.\n"

msgid "在午门外候到天亮殿试。等的工夫里，世上的事照样走：别处的人该走的走、该好的好。"
msgstr "Wait outside the Meridian Gate until dawn, for the palace examination. While you wait, the world goes on as it will: those who are to leave elsewhere leave, those who are to recover recover."

msgid "候到天亮"
msgstr "Wait until dawn"

msgid "你在午门外的石狮子旁边站定。守门的禁军看了你一眼，没有赶你。\n"
msgstr "You take your stand by the stone lions outside the Meridian Gate. The Imperial Guard at the gate glances at you and does not drive you off.\n"

msgid "东方的天空中开始出现一丝微曦。午门外渐渐有了人：坐轿的、骑马的、走路的官，一个个在铁门外排好了班。\n"
msgstr "A trace of light begins to show in the eastern sky. People gather outside the Meridian Gate: officials in sedans, on horseback, on foot, each lining up outside the iron gate in order.\n"

msgid "铁门「轧轧」地开了。一个太监站在门里尖着嗓子喊：「宣——武状元觐见！」\n"
msgstr "The iron gate grinds open. A eunuch stands inside and calls in a shrill voice, \"Summoned -- the Martial Champion to an audience!\"\n"

msgid "在午门外候到天亮，随相国上早朝。等的工夫里，世上的事照样走：别处的人该走的走、该好的好。"
msgstr "Wait outside the Meridian Gate until dawn, and go to the morning court with the Chancellor. While you wait, the world goes on as it will: those who are to leave elsewhere leave, those who are to recover recover."

msgid "你在午门外的石狮子旁边站定。夜里风凉，守门的禁军换了一班。\n"
msgstr "You take your stand by the stone lions outside the Meridian Gate. The night wind is cool, and the Imperial Guard at the gate has changed shifts.\n"

msgid "天蒙蒙亮，一顶旧轿子停在午门外，韦相国下了轿，朝你点了点头：「跟着我，别说话。」\n"
msgstr "In the first gray of dawn, an old sedan chair stops outside the Meridian Gate. Chancellor Wei steps down and nods to you. \"Follow me. Do not speak.\"\n"

msgid "铁门「轧轧」地开了。百官鱼贯而入，你跟在相国身后。\n"
msgstr "The iron gate grinds open. The officials file in one after another, and you follow behind the Chancellor.\n"

msgid "午门的铁门关着。守门的禁军说道：宫门重地，闲人止步。要进去，要么是皇上宣的，要么是跟着上朝的官。\n"
msgstr "The iron gate of the Meridian Gate is shut. The Imperial Guard at the gate says, \"This is a palace gate. No loiterers. To go in, you must either be summoned by the Emperor or follow an official to court.\"\n"

msgid "叩门"
msgstr "Knock"

msgid "大门虚掩着。老仆在院里扫地，看见你点了点头。\n"
msgstr "The gate is ajar. An old servant sweeping the yard sees you and nods.\n"

msgid "你叩了叩门。一个老仆开了半扇门，接过名帖看了看，又看了看你。\n"
msgstr "You knock on the door. An old servant opens half the door, takes the calling card and looks at it, then looks at you.\n"

msgid "老仆说道：骆家的人。相国在正厅，请。\n"
msgstr "The old servant says, \"A man of the Luo family. The Chancellor is in the main hall. Please.\"\n"

msgid "门开了。\n"
msgstr "The door opens.\n"

msgid "你叩了叩门。一个老仆开了半扇门，接过名帖看了看帖子上那个斗大的「镖」字，又看了看你。\n"
msgstr "You knock on the door. An old servant opens half the door, takes the calling card and looks at the big character \"Escort\" on it, then looks at you.\n"

msgid "老仆说道：振远的朋友。相国在正厅，请。\n"
msgstr "The old servant says, \"A friend of Far-Road. The Chancellor is in the main hall. Please.\"\n"

msgid "你叩了叩门。一个老仆开了半扇门，看了你一眼。\n"
msgstr "You knock on the door. An old servant opens half the door and looks at you.\n"

msgid "老仆说道：骆二爷吩咐过，有人从乔阴来，就请进。相国在正厅。\n"
msgstr "The old servant says, \"Second Master Luo said that if someone comes from Tallshade, I am to let them in. The Chancellor is in the main hall.\"\n"

msgid "你叩了叩门。半天，一个老仆隔着门说：相国不见生客。有名帖么？\n"
msgstr "You knock on the door. After a long while an old servant says through the door, \"The Chancellor does not see strangers. Do you have a calling card?\"\n"

msgid "官府告示"
msgstr "Official Notice"

msgid "民房"
msgstr "House"

msgid "兵"
msgstr "Soldier"

msgid "绸缎"
msgstr "Silk"

msgid "车马大店"
msgstr "Carriage Inn"

msgid "车马"
msgstr "Carriages"

msgid "酱"
msgstr "Sauce"

msgid "一块铜腰牌，巴掌大，正面刻着「御前侍卫」四个字，背面一个编号，编号底下有人用刀尖划了一道——上一个带它的人留下的。\n"
msgstr "A copper waist token, the size of a palm. The front is engraved \"Imperial Guard\" in four characters; on the back is a number, and under the number someone has scratched a line with a knife point—left by the last man who carried it.\n"

msgid "这块腰牌不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this token away."

msgid "一卷黄绫裹着的诏书，只有一行字，先帝的御笔：「寻剑，不得扰民一户。」后头钤着一方御宝，朱色正红。\n"
msgstr "A scroll wrapped in yellow silk, a decree of a single line in the late Emperor's own hand: \"Seek the sword, and trouble not one household.\" Below it is stamped an imperial seal, a true and perfect vermilion.\n"

msgid "先帝的诏书不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw away the late Emperor's decree."

msgid "兵部存档的寻剑令复本，同一个日子，同一个开头。「寻剑」之后多出三行：「征民夫，设关卡，拿人。」后头盖着兵部的印，印色暗红发黑。\n"
msgstr "The Ministry of War's archived copy of the Sword Decree: the same date, the same opening. After \"Seek the Sword\" come three more lines: \"Levy laborers, set up checkpoints, seize people.\" Beneath them is the Ministry's seal, a dark red verging on black.\n"

msgid "这卷抄本不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this copy away."

msgid "一页发黄的手札，先帝的字：「樵夫言：入山遇风，风大不能行，伏地良久；风止，抬头见白石城，铃声满耳。——风停处即是城。」页边有一行小字，墨色新些：「父皇，儿也想去。」\n"
msgstr "A yellowed page of notes in the late Emperor's hand: \"The woodcutter says: going into the mountain he met a wind too strong to walk in, and lay on the ground a long while. When the wind dropped he looked up and saw a white stone city, the sound of bells filling his ears.—Where the wind stops, there is the city.\" In the margin is a line of small writing, the ink fresher: \"Father, I want to go too.\"\n"

msgid "这页手札不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw away this page of notes."

msgid "一张黄笺，字写得很慢，一笔一划：「皇叔：前诏非朕本意。朝中无人，侄儿请叔父回来。——昭」底下一方小印，印泥还没干透。\n"
msgstr "A yellow slip of paper, the writing slow, stroke by careful stroke: \"Imperial Uncle: The earlier decree was not Our wish. There is no one at court. Your nephew asks his uncle to come home.—Zhao\" Below it is a small seal, the ink paste not yet dry.\n"

msgid "皇帝的手诏不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw away the Emperor's handwritten edict."

msgid "一卷先帝的手稿，推敲商句遗书的最后两句，密密麻麻改了好几遍。最后一页只写着：「风自岚来。逆风而行，风止之处，城见。」页角有庾子建的批注：「试过三次，未果。」\n"
msgstr "A roll of the late Emperor's manuscript, turning over the last two lines of Shang Ju's farewell letter, crossed out and rewritten several times in cramped writing. The last page says only: \"The wind comes from the Wind City. Walk against the wind; where the wind stops, the city appears.\" In the corner is a note by Yu Zijian: \"Tried three times. No result.\"\n"

msgid "这卷手稿不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw away this manuscript."

msgid "一册蓝布面的小本子，边角磨得发白，里头是工笔画的七个人形，一招一式都在宫门、长街、殿上。每一页的边上冯策用小楷批了一句，最后一页是：「刀在鞘里的时候最多。」\n"
msgstr "A small blue-clothed notebook with the corners worn white. Inside are seven figures in fine-line painting, every move set in the palace gates, the long streets and the halls. Beside each page Feng Ce has written a note in small script; the last page reads: \"Most of the time, the blade is in its sheath.\"\n"

msgid "兵部武选司主事"
msgstr "Secretary, Bureau of Military Selection, Ministry of War"

msgid "一个四十来岁的官儿，青袍上落着几点墨，坐在棚下的条案后头，面前一本名册、一方砚、一支秃了尖的笔。他看人先看手——手上有没有茧——再看脸。\n"
msgstr "An official of about forty in a green robe spotted with ink, sitting behind a long desk under an awning with a roster, an inkstone and a brush worn down to a stub. He looks at a man's hands first—are there calluses—and then at his face.\n"

msgid "葛升蘸了蘸墨，在名册上勾了一笔。\n"
msgstr "Ge Sheng dips his brush and ticks something off in the roster.\n"

msgid "葛升说道：下一个。\n"
msgstr "Ge Sheng says, \"Next.\"\n"

msgid "武举"
msgstr "Military Exam"

msgid "三场都过了，还问什么。明日早朝殿试——午门候旨。"
msgstr "All three bouts passed, and still you ask? Tomorrow is the palace examination at the morning court. Wait at the Meridian Gate for the summons."

msgid "名字已经写上了。先是两位校尉，最后是邓将军。打到见血就算，不许下死手。"
msgstr "Your name is written down. First the two officers, last General Deng. The bout ends at first blood; no killing blows."

msgid "抬眼把你从头看到脚，目光落在你腰里那块黑漆木牌上。"
msgstr "'s eyes travel over you from head to foot, and settle on the black-lacquered wooden tag at your waist."

msgid "乔阴县的捕快？……程知县的荐书到过武选司，乔阴县保举一名。"
msgstr "A constable from Tallshade County? ... Magistrate Cheng's letter of recommendation has reached the Bureau. Tallshade County sponsors one man."

msgid "在名册上写了一行，又在名字旁边点了一个小圈。"
msgstr " writes a line in the roster, then makes a small circle beside the name."

msgid "第一场免了。直接找孙校尉，最后是邓将军。打到见血就算，不许下死手。这两场都过了，明日殿试。"
msgstr "The first bout is waived. Go straight to Officer Sun, then General Deng last. The bout ends at first blood; no killing blows. Pass both and you go to the palace examination tomorrow."

msgid "抬眼把你从头看到脚，又看了看你的手。"
msgstr "'s eyes travel over you from head to foot, then rest on your hands."

msgid "报武举？今年文武大选，兵部开的科。名字。"
msgstr "Registering for the military examination? The Ministry of War holds the examination this year for the great selection of civil and military men. Your name."

msgid "在名册上写了一行，吹了吹墨。"
msgstr " writes a line in the roster and blows on the ink."

msgid "三场：两位御林军校尉，最后是邓将军。打到见血就算，不许下死手。三场都过了，明日殿试。"
msgstr "Three bouts: two Imperial Army officers, and General Deng last. The bout ends at first blood; no killing blows. Pass all three and you go to the palace examination tomorrow."

msgid "兵部管天下的兵马，也管武举。小的只管写名字。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War governs the armies of the realm, and the military examination too. I only write down the names."

msgid "庾尚书"
msgstr "Minister Yu"

msgid "尚书……下了狱。武选司换了人管。小的只管写名字。"
msgstr "The Minister ... was thrown into prison. Someone else runs the Bureau now. I only write down the names."

msgid "尚书大人的事，不是小的能说的。"
msgstr "The Minister's affairs are not for a man like me to discuss."

msgid "殿试"
msgstr "Palace Exam"

msgid "明日早朝，午门外候着，有人传你。见了皇上磕头，别抬头看。"
msgstr "Tomorrow at the morning court, wait outside the Meridian Gate. Someone will call for you. When you see His Majesty, kowtow, and do not look up."

msgid "先把三场打完再说殿试。"
msgstr "Finish the three bouts first, then talk of the palace examination."

msgid "把笔一搁，看了你半晌。"
msgstr " sets down the brush and looks at you for a long moment."

msgid "三场都过了。——明日早朝殿试，午门候旨。"
msgstr "You have passed all three bouts. Tomorrow, the palace examination at morning court: wait at the Meridian Gate for the summons."

msgid "御林军校尉"
msgstr "Imperial Army Officer"

msgid "一个二十来岁的校尉，红袍外头罩着软甲，袖子挽到肘上，胳膊上一道一道的旧疤。他刚和人对过刀，额头上的汗还没干。\n"
msgstr "An officer of about twenty in a red robe with soft armor over it, sleeves rolled to the elbow, the forearms scarred over and over. He has just crossed blades with someone, and the sweat on his forehead is not yet dry.\n"

msgid "抱拳行了一礼，摆开了架势。"
msgstr " cups his fist in salute and takes his stance."

msgid "武考，点到为止。请。"
msgstr "A martial test, a touch and no more. Please."

msgid "你已经过了我这一关。"
msgstr "You have already passed my bout."

msgid "先去葛主事那儿报了名再来。"
msgstr "Go and register with Secretary Ge first, then come back."

msgid "第一场是我。打到见血就算，不许下死手。"
msgstr "The first bout is mine. It ends at first blood; no killing blows."

msgid "一个三十出头的校尉，个子不高，站得像钉在地上。他看人的时候眼睛半眯着，像在量你的步子。\n"
msgstr "An officer in his early thirties, not tall, who stands as though nailed to the ground. He keeps his eyes half closed when he looks at someone, as if measuring your stride.\n"

msgid "赵校尉那一关还没过，轮不到我。"
msgstr "You have not yet passed Officer Zhao's bout. It is not my turn."

msgid "第二场是我。赵勇那小子手重，我比他手准。"
msgstr "The second bout is mine. That Zhao Yong has a heavy hand; mine is steadier."

msgid "御林军将领"
msgstr "Imperial Army General"

msgid "一个四十岁上下的将领，方脸，络腮胡子，骑在一匹高头大马上绕着场子巡视。他下马的时候马鞭往鞍上一挂，一句话不说，先活动手腕。\n"
msgstr "A general of about forty, square-faced and full-bearded, riding a tall horse in rounds along the edge of the field. When he dismounts he hangs his whip on the saddle, says nothing, and starts loosening his wrists.\n"

msgid "前两场还没打完，找我做什么。"
msgstr "The first two bouts are not finished. What do you want with me?"

msgid "最后一场是我。过了我，明日见皇上。"
msgstr "The last bout is mine. Get past me, and tomorrow you see His Majesty."

msgid "当年的武状元。一杆枪挑了七个人，七个人没一个见血——那才叫点到为止。后来他不做官了。"
msgstr "He was the Martial Champion that year. One spear took on seven men, and not one of the seven drew blood—that is what \"a touch and no more\" means. Later he gave up office."

msgid "邓骁勒着马在场边转了一圈。\n"
msgstr "Deng Xiao reins in his horse and circles the edge of the field once.\n"

msgid "邓骁说道：手腕子软的，回去再练三年。\n"
msgstr "Deng Xiao says, \"Soft wrists. Go home and train three more years.\"\n"

msgid "禁军"
msgstr "Palace Troops"

msgid "一个披甲的禁军，红缨盔，手按着腰刀，站在午门的铁门前一动不动。他的眼睛不看人，看的是人的手。\n"
msgstr "An armored guard in a red-plumed helmet, one hand on his saber, standing motionless before the iron gate of the Meridian Gate. His eyes are not on people's faces; they are on their hands.\n"

msgid "守门禁军把长戟换了一只手。\n"
msgstr "The gate guard shifts his long halberd to the other hand.\n"

msgid "进宫"
msgstr "Entering the Palace"

msgid "宫门重地。要进去，要么是皇上宣的，要么是跟着上朝的官。校武场今年开武举，中了的明日殿试；相国府的人，早朝时跟着相国进。"
msgstr "This is the heart of the palace. To go in you must either be summoned by His Majesty or follow an official to morning court. The Drill Ground holds the military examination this year, and those who pass go to the palace examination tomorrow. Men from the Chancellor's House follow the Chancellor in at morning court."

msgid "你看见的是午门。里头的事，不是你该问的。"
msgstr "What you see is the Meridian Gate. What is inside is not for you to ask about."

msgid "天子脚下，谁跟你比划。"
msgstr "At the Son of Heaven's feet? Who would spar with you?"

msgid "相国"
msgstr "Chancellor"

msgid "一个瘦小的老人，穿一件洗得发白的旧袍子，袖口补过。他的背有点驼，可是看人的时候眼睛很亮，一句话要想一会儿才出口，出口就不收回。\n"
msgstr "A small, thin old man in a faded old robe, the cuffs patched. His back is a little bent, but his eyes are bright when he looks at someone. He thinks a while before he speaks, and what he says he does not take back.\n"

msgid "韦执中翻过一页书，在页边上点了一个墨点。\n"
msgstr "Wei Zhizhong turns a page and makes an ink dot in the margin.\n"

msgid "韦执中咳了两声，把茶壶里的凉茶倒了半盏。\n"
msgstr "Wei Zhizhong coughs a couple of times and pours half a cup of cold tea from the pot.\n"

msgid "老夫拿笔的手，拿不动刀。"
msgstr "This old man's hand holds a brush. It cannot hold a blade."

msgid "接过名帖，凑到灯下看了看。"
msgstr " takes the calling card and holds it up to the lamp."

msgid "骆易的儿子荐来的。他父亲当年在老夫门下读过三年书，后来不读了，去练剑。"
msgstr "Sent by Luo Yi's son. His father read three years in this old man's school; then he stopped reading and went to practice the sword."

msgid "坐。说吧，什么事要找到相国府来。"
msgstr "Sit. Speak. What business brings you to the Chancellor's House?"

msgid "老夫不收东西。"
msgstr "This old man takes no gifts."

msgid "兵部？庾子建的兵部。他掌兵马，朝里一半的人是他的门生。你要说什么，先说凭据。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War? Yu Zijian's Ministry of War. He commands the armies, and half the court are his students. If you have something to say, show your proof first."

msgid "兵部的事，问兵部去。"
msgstr "Ask the Ministry of War about the Ministry's business."

msgid "先帝的寻剑令？老夫当年在场。先帝亲笔，一句话：寻剑，不得扰民一户。后来兵部颁下去的是什么，老夫就不知道了——没人给老夫看。"
msgstr "The late Emperor's Sword Decree? This old man was there. The late Emperor wrote it himself, one sentence: Seek the sword, and trouble not one household. What the Ministry issued afterward, this old man cannot say—no one showed it to me."

msgid "先帝的事。"
msgstr "The late Emperor's affair."

msgid "奏本"
msgstr "Memorial"

msgid "你已经是御前侍卫了，皇上见过你。还要老夫递什么本。"
msgstr "You are already an Imperial Guard; His Majesty has seen you. What memorial would you have this old man submit?"

msgid "本子写好了。明日卯时，午门外候着，跟着老夫上朝。别说话。"
msgstr "The memorial is written. Tomorrow at the Rabbit hour, wait outside the Meridian Gate and follow this old man to court. Say nothing."

msgid "乔阴程县令录了供，槐阳王拒了兵部的令——两处说的是一件事：兵部拿着先帝的寻剑令，干先帝没让干的事。"
msgstr "Magistrate Cheng of Tallshade took down a confession, and the Prince of Huaiyang refused the Ministry's order. Both tell the same story: the Ministry of War holds the late Emperor's Sword Decree and does with it what the late Emperor never allowed."

msgid "铺开一张折子，提笔写了很久，写完吹了吹墨。"
msgstr " spreads out a memorial sheet and writes for a long time, then blows on the ink."

msgid "本子老夫写了。递上去，庾子建当殿就会驳。驳不驳得倒，要看皇上——皇上十六岁。"
msgstr "This old man has written the memorial. Once submitted, Yu Zijian will rebut it in the hall on the spot. Whether it can be answered depends on His Majesty—and His Majesty is sixteen."

msgid "明日卯时，午门外候着，跟着老夫上朝。别说话。"
msgstr "Tomorrow at the Rabbit hour, wait outside the Meridian Gate and follow this old man to court. Say nothing."

msgid "接过那卷发黄的抄本，看了很久，手指在最后一个没有点墨的名字上停了一下。"
msgstr " takes the yellowed copy and looks at it for a long time, a finger resting on the last name that has no ink dot beside it."

msgid "二十年前的抄本。一句话：寻剑，不得扰民一户。——这是先帝的话，老夫认得。"
msgstr "A copy from twenty years ago. One sentence: Seek the sword, and trouble not one household.—These are the late Emperor's words; this old man knows them."

msgid "铺开一张折子，提笔写了很久。"
msgstr " spreads out a memorial sheet and writes for a long time."

msgid "本子老夫写了。明日卯时，午门外候着，跟着老夫上朝。别说话。"
msgstr "This old man has written the memorial. Tomorrow at the Rabbit hour, wait outside the Meridian Gate and follow this old man to court. Say nothing."

msgid "空口告兵部尚书？老夫不递这种本。去乔阴找程县令——他录过供。"
msgstr "Accuse the Minister of War on bare words? This old man submits no such memorial. Go to Tallshade and find Magistrate Cheng—he took a deposition."

msgid "你是什么人，要老夫递本？"
msgstr "Who are you, to ask this old man to submit a memorial?"

msgid "早朝"
msgstr "Morning Court"

msgid "卯时，午门外。天亮前就得到。"
msgstr "The Rabbit hour, outside the Meridian Gate. You must be there before dawn."

msgid "早朝是官的事。"
msgstr "Morning court is for officials."

msgid "骆家的二小子？他父亲骆易在老夫门下读过书。后来父子俩都去练剑了，可惜了那一手字。"
msgstr "The second Luo boy? His father Luo Yi studied in this old man's school. Later father and son both went to practice the sword. A pity, that handwriting."

msgid "建章去了关北。骆易要是在，会骂他，也会骂老夫。"
msgstr "Jianzhang has gone Beyond the Pass. If Luo Yi were alive, he would scold him, and scold this old man too."

msgid "那三句骆家的字，是老夫先认出来的。建章那张供状——老夫不后悔。"
msgstr "It was this old man who first recognized those three lines in the Luo hand. Jianzhang's confession—this old man does not regret it."

msgid "建章的供状，老夫收着。骆家的人，嘴硬，手不软。"
msgstr "Jianzhang's confession is in this old man's keeping. The Luo family: hard of mouth, not hard of hand."

msgid "建炎把他哥哥带回乔阴了。……也好。那一手字，不该写在兵部的公文上。"
msgstr "Jianyan has taken his brother back to Tallshade. ... Good. That handwriting should not be written on the Ministry of War's documents."

msgid "兄弟俩的事，让他们自己说。老夫只管倒茶。"
msgstr "The brothers' affair, let them speak of it themselves. This old man only pours the tea."

msgid "建章在老夫这里。刑部要问他的话——他在庾子建身边写了十年字。"
msgstr "Jianzhang is here with this old man. If the Ministry of Justice wants to question him—he wrote for Yu Zijian's side for ten years."

msgid "想了一会儿。"
msgstr " thinks for a while."

msgid "骆易的大儿子。老夫三年没见他了——他在庾子建的客厅里写字。"
msgstr "Luo Yi's eldest son. This old man has not seen him in three years—he writes in Yu Zijian's parlor."

msgid "撕下一角纸，写了两行，按上一方小印，递给你。"
msgstr " tears off a corner of paper, writes two lines, presses a small seal on it and hands it to you."

msgid "拿去给尚书府的门房。相国府的条子，他不敢拦。"
msgstr "Take this to the gatekeeper of the Minister's Mansion. He will not dare stop a note from the Chancellor's House."

msgid "信送到了？……他回信没有？骆家的人，一个比一个嘴硬。"
msgstr "The letter was delivered? ... Did he write back? The Luo family: each one harder of mouth than the last."

msgid "骆易的大儿子？在庾子建府上写字。老夫不常见他。"
msgstr "Luo Yi's eldest son? He writes in Yu Zijian's house. This old man seldom sees him."

msgid "抄本的字"
msgstr "Handwriting on the Copy"

msgid "建章认了。多出来的三句，是他落的笔。"
msgstr "Jianzhang admitted it. The three extra lines were written by his brush."

msgid "接过那卷抄本，凑到灯下，看了很久。"
msgstr " takes the copy, holds it up to the lamp and looks at it for a long time."

msgid "原令一句，抄本四句。多出来的三句——是骆家的字。"
msgstr "The original has one line; the copy has four. The three extra lines—are in the Luo hand."

msgid "骆易的字，他大儿子学了十成。「拿人」那个「拿」字的提手，是骆家的写法，老夫教过的。"
msgstr "Luo Yi's hand, and his eldest son learned it to perfection. The hand radical in the \"seize\" of \"seize people\" is written the Luo way; this old man taught it."

msgid "韦执中朝后头喊了一声。骆建章从厢房里出来，看了一眼那卷抄本，脸色白了。\n"
msgstr "Wei Zhizhong calls out toward the back. Luo Jianzhang comes out of the side room, glances at the copy, and goes pale.\n"

msgid "骆建章说道：……是我的字。那年我在兵部做抄手，原令存档的底子也是我抄的——一句话。大人口述，多出来的三句，我落的笔；是哪三句，我写的时候就知道。\n"
msgstr "Luo Jianzhang says, \"... It is my handwriting. That year I was a copyist at the Ministry of War, and the archive base of the original decree was my copy too—one line. The three extra lines were dictated by the Minister and set down by my brush; I knew which three lines they were as I wrote them.\"\n"

msgid "去问建章「抄本」。他认得自己的字。"
msgstr "Go and ask Jianzhang about the \"copy.\" He knows his own handwriting."

msgid "抄本？拿来给老夫看。"
msgstr "A copy? Bring it here and let this old man see."

msgid "陈天星的人？振远押老夫的俸银押了二十年，一两没少过。朝上的事过去了——坐，喝杯茶。"
msgstr "A man of Chen Tianxing's? The Far-Road Escorts have carried this old man's stipend silver for twenty years and never lost a tael. Court affairs are past—sit, have some tea."

msgid "振远的帖子老夫看过了。说正事。"
msgstr "This old man has seen the Far-Road card. To the point."

msgid "接过名帖看了看，又递回给你。"
msgstr " takes the calling card, looks it over, and hands it back to you."

msgid "振远的帖子。陈天星押老夫的俸银押了二十年，一两没少过——他荐的人，老夫见。"
msgstr "The Far-Road card. Chen Tianxing has carried this old man's stipend silver for twenty years and never lost a tael—a man he recommends, this old man will see."

msgid "陈天星的人？老夫这里没有镖要押。……朝里有了事，再来。"
msgstr "A man of Chen Tianxing's? This old man has no escort to hire. ... When there is trouble at court, come again."

msgid "当年打仗是一把好手，老夫亲眼见过。如今……如今他的门生比老夫的书多。"
msgstr "In his day he was a fine hand at war; this old man saw it with his own eyes. Now ... now his students outnumber this old man's books."

msgid "一个弯着腰的老仆，手里一把竹扫帚，扫得很慢，扫过的地方一片落叶也没有。\n"
msgstr "A stooped old servant with a bamboo broom, sweeping slowly. Where he has swept, not one fallen leaf is left.\n"

msgid "老仆扫着院子里的落叶。\n"
msgstr "The old servant sweeps the leaves in the courtyard.\n"

msgid "老仆把鸡赶回菜畦边上。\n"
msgstr "The old servant shoos a chicken back to the edge of the vegetable bed.\n"

msgid "相国在正厅。夜里在书房，常常看书看到天亮。"
msgstr "The Chancellor is in the main hall. At night he is in the study, often reading until dawn."

msgid "天子"
msgstr "Son of Heaven"

msgid "一个十六岁的少年，穿着明黄的龙袍，袍子做得大了一点，袖口挽过一道。他坐得很直，直得像有人在背后看着他。说话之前他总要先看一眼站在百官最前面的那个人。\n"
msgstr "A sixteen-year-old boy in a bright-yellow dragon robe cut a little too large, the cuffs turned back once. He sits very straight, straight as though someone were watching from behind. Before he speaks he always glances at the man standing at the head of the ministers.\n"

msgid "你的手刚抬起来，四面的禁军已经拔了刀。"
msgstr "Your hand has barely lifted when the guards all around have drawn their blades."

msgid "太监尖着嗓子喊：「武状元上殿——」百官分成两列，你从当中走过去，跪下。\n"
msgstr "A eunuch calls in a shrill voice, \"The Martial Champion is summoned to the hall—\" The ministers part into two rows, and you walk down between them and kneel.\n"

msgid "你……你就是今年的武状元？抬起头来。"
msgstr "You ... you are this year's Martial Champion? Raise your head."

msgid "看了你一会儿，又看了一眼百官最前头那个人。"
msgstr " looks at you for a while, then at the man at the head of the ministers."

msgid "陛下，校武场三场，臣的武选司亲眼看着打的。此人武艺尚可，出身不明。"
msgstr "Your Majesty, the three bouts at the Drill Ground were watched in person by my Bureau of Military Selection. This man's martial skill is passable; his origins are unclear."

msgid "出身……朕也不知道朕的武状元该是什么出身。"
msgstr "Origins ... We do not know what origins Our Martial Champion should have."

msgid "臣请陛下赐他一个侍卫的差事——兵部正缺人手，臣可以替陛下看着他。"
msgstr "Your Majesty, I ask that you grant him a post as a guard. The Ministry of War is short of hands, and I can watch him on Your Majesty's behalf."

msgid "陛下，大内侍卫营归臣管。人，臣来看。"
msgstr "Your Majesty, the Palace Guard Barracks is under my command. The man, I will see to."

msgid "像是松了一口气。"
msgstr " seems to breathe out in relief."

msgid "准。赐御前侍卫腰牌——冯总教头，人归你。"
msgstr "Granted. Give him the Imperial Guard's waist token. Chief Instructor Feng, the man is yours."

msgid "一个太监捧着托盘走下台阶，托盘里一块铜腰牌，刻着「御前侍卫」四个字。\n"
msgstr "A eunuch comes down the steps with a tray, and on the tray lies a copper waist token engraved \"Imperial Guard\" in four characters.\n"

msgid "笑了笑，没有再说话。"
msgstr " smiles, and says nothing more."

msgid "太监喊：「退朝——」百官鱼贯而出。\n"
msgstr "The eunuch calls, \"Court is dismissed—\" The ministers file out.\n"

msgid "皇上说，今夜养心殿。冯总教头的人会领你进去。"
msgstr "His Majesty says: tonight, the Hall of Mental Cultivation. Chief Instructor Feng's men will lead you in."

msgid "父皇的寻剑令……你也知道？——这里说不得。"
msgstr "My father's Sword Decree ... you know of it too?—This is not a place to speak of it."

msgid "皇叔"
msgstr "Imperial Uncle"

msgid "朕没有皇叔。——布告上写着的那个人，朕不认识。"
msgstr "We have no Imperial Uncle.—The man named on the notice, We do not know him."

msgid "殿上的禁军已经拔了刀，你的手停在半空。"
msgstr "The guards in the hall have drawn their blades, and your hand stops in mid-air."

msgid "先帝的旨意，兵部奉旨办差。你是什么人，问这个？"
msgstr "The late Emperor's decree, and the Ministry of War carries out the work by decree. Who are you, to ask this?"

msgid "槐阳王不奉诏。不奉诏是什么，你读过书就知道。"
msgstr "The Prince of Huaiyang does not obey the decree. What that is called, you will know if you have read your books."

msgid "一个穿朝服的官，笏板捧在胸前，眼睛看着自己的靴尖。\n"
msgstr "An official in court dress, the tablet held to his chest, his eyes on the toes of his boots.\n"

msgid "……下官什么都没说。"
msgstr "... This lowly official said nothing."

msgid "内侍"
msgstr "Attendant"

msgid "一个十五岁的小太监，脸白，眼睛机灵，走路没有声音。他总站在皇上身后半步，皇上一皱眉他就先低头。\n"
msgstr "A fifteen-year-old little eunuch, pale-faced and sharp-eyed, who walks without a sound. He always stands half a step behind the Emperor, and when the Emperor frowns he is the first to bow his head.\n"

msgid "福安一缩身子躲到柱子后头去了。"
msgstr "Fu'an shrinks back and hides behind a pillar."

msgid "皇上睡得晚。夜里在养心殿，看先帝的手札。"
msgstr "His Majesty sleeps late. At night he is in the Hall of Mental Cultivation, reading the late Emperor's notes."

msgid "养心殿在西边。白天跟着我走，夜里……夜里别问我。"
msgstr "The Hall of Mental Cultivation is to the west. By day, follow me. At night ... at night, do not ask me."

msgid "司礼监"
msgstr "Directorate of Ceremonies"

msgid "一个上了年纪的太监，嗓子尖，站在龙椅下的台阶边上，手里一柄拂尘，替皇上喊话。\n"
msgstr "An elderly eunuch with a shrill voice, standing at the edge of the steps below the dragon throne with a horsetail whisk in his hand, calling out on the Emperor's behalf.\n"

msgid "有本早奏，无本退朝——"
msgstr "Those with a memorial, speak now. If none, court is dismissed -"

msgid "臣韦执中有本。乔阴县令程不平录供，槐阳王拒令：兵部奉先帝寻剑之旨，征民夫、设关卡、拿人——先帝的旨意里没有这一句。"
msgstr "Your servant Wei Zhizhong has a memorial. Cheng Buping, magistrate of Tallshade, took a deposition, and the Prince of Huaiyang refused the order. The Ministry of War, on the late Emperor's decree to seek the sword, levied laborers, set up checkpoints and seized people—the late Emperor's decree has no such line."

msgid "冷笑了一声，出班。"
msgstr " gives a cold laugh and steps out of the ranks."

msgid "兵部的事，相国也要管？"
msgstr "The Chancellor has a say in the Ministry of War's affairs too?"

msgid "臣也有本：槐阳王程朔，兴兵踏平兵部工地，杀朝廷命官，劫民夫——槐阳王反了。"
msgstr "Your servant has a memorial as well. Cheng Shuo, Prince of Huaiyang, raised troops and flattened the Ministry of War's work site, killed a court official and plundered the laborers—the Prince of Huaiyang has rebelled."

msgid "满殿哗然。\n"
msgstr "The whole hall erupts.\n"

msgid "手按在龙椅的扶手上，看看相国，又看看尚书。"
msgstr " rests a hand on the arm of the dragon throne and looks at the Chancellor, then at the Minister."

msgid "……容朕想想。退、退朝。"
msgstr "... Let Us think on it. Court—court is dismissed."

msgid "皇上请相国的随员到养心殿说话。皇上说……先别出宫。"
msgstr "His Majesty asks the Chancellor's attendant to come to the Hall of Mental Cultivation to speak. His Majesty says ... do not leave the palace yet."

msgid "兵部的事，相国也要管？先帝的旨意是寻剑，兵部办的是寻剑。一个县令、一个藩王，说兵部办错了，凭据呢？"
msgstr "The Chancellor has a say in the Ministry of War's affairs too? The late Emperor's decree was to seek the sword, and the Ministry of War is seeking the sword. A county magistrate and a prince say the Ministry has done wrong—where is their proof?"

msgid "……容朕想想。退朝。"
msgstr "... Let Us think on it. Court is dismissed."

msgid "一个披甲的禁军，红缨盔，一手提着灯笼，一手按着刀，走几步停一停，往暗处照一照。\n"
msgstr "An armored guard in a red-plumed helmet with a lantern in one hand and the other on his saber, who takes a few steps, stops, and shines the light into the dark.\n"

msgid "巡夜"
msgstr "Night Patrol"

msgid "夜里宫里不许有人走动。你是哪个宫的？"
msgstr "No one is to move about the palace at night. Which palace are you from?"

msgid "宫里不许比划。"
msgstr "No sparring in the palace."

msgid "两个禁军一左一右扭住你的胳膊，提着灯笼把你押到了侍卫营。"
msgstr "Two guards seize your arms, one on each side, and with a lantern held high they march you to the Guard Barracks."

msgid "冯策披着衣服从值房里出来，借着灯看了你半晌。"
msgstr "Feng Ce comes out of the duty room pulling a robe over his shoulders, and looks at you by lamplight for a long moment."

msgid "冯策说道：我认得你。滚出去，别让我看见第二回。"
msgstr "Feng Ce says, \"I know you. Get out, and do not let me see you a second time.\""

msgid "天亮时，侍卫营的人把你从午门推了出去。"
msgstr "At daybreak, the men of the Guard Barracks push you out through the Meridian Gate."

msgid "禁军把你押回了侍卫营。冯策这回没有披衣服，像是一直没睡。"
msgstr "The guards march you back to the Guard Barracks. This time Feng Ce has not pulled on a robe; it looks as if he never slept."

msgid "冯策说道：又是你。这回还放你——下回我就不认得你了。"
msgstr "Feng Ce says, \"You again. I let you go this once—next time I will not know you.\""

msgid "天亮时，侍卫营的人又把你从午门推了出去。"
msgstr "At daybreak, the men of the Guard Barracks push you out through the Meridian Gate again."

msgid "一个十几岁的小太监，抱着一摞文书，低着头小步快走，走过你身边的时候眼睛也不抬。\n"
msgstr "A little eunuch of about thirteen, hugging a stack of documents, walking fast with short steps and his head down. As he passes you he does not even raise his eyes.\n"

msgid "小太监吓得把文书撒了一地，你的手停住了。"
msgstr "The little eunuch is so frightened he drops the documents all over the floor, and your hand stops."

msgid "皇上……皇上在养心殿。你、你是哪个宫的？"
msgstr "His Majesty ... His Majesty is in the Hall of Mental Cultivation. You—which palace are you from?"

msgid "一个穿青衣的宫女，提着一只竹篮，在柏树底下拣落下的枯枝。\n"
msgstr "A palace maid in a blue dress with a bamboo basket, picking up fallen dry twigs beneath a cypress.\n"

msgid "宫女叫了一声，躲到柏树后面去了。"
msgstr "The maid cries out and hides behind the cypress."

msgid "西北角那边？别去。那里只住着一个老嬷嬷，脾气怪。"
msgstr "The northwest corner? Do not go. Only one old nanny lives there, and she has a strange temper."

msgid "先帝女官"
msgstr "Court Lady to the Late Emperor"

msgid "一个七十来岁的老妇人，头发全白了，梳得一丝不乱。她坐在灯下，手里拈着一根绣花针，眼睛却很亮——不像是个住冷宫的人。\n"
msgstr "A woman of about seventy with hair gone white, combed without a strand out of place. She sits under a lamp turning an embroidery needle between her fingers, her eyes still very bright—not like someone who lives in the Cold Palace.\n"

msgid "钟嬷嬷看了你一眼，你的手就放下了。"
msgstr "Nanny Zhong looks at you once, and your hand comes down."

msgid "抬起头看了你一眼，手里的针没有停。"
msgstr " raises her head and looks at you, the needle in her hand not stopping."

msgid "又是走那条道的？——不对。你不是他们的人。"
msgstr "Another one who takes that road?—No. You are not one of them."

msgid "那口井，二十年来只有一个人走。黑衣裳，戴个黑冠，见了我连头都不点。你是第二个。"
msgstr "In twenty years only one person has used that well. Black clothes, a black cap, and he never so much as nodded to me. You are the second."

msgid "那口井通到宫外头的祭坛底下。先帝在的时候封过，后来有人又打开了。是谁，我老婆子不说你也猜得到。"
msgstr "That well leads out to beneath the altar outside the palace. It was sealed in the late Emperor's time, and later someone opened it again. Who, I need not say—you can guess."

msgid "先帝"
msgstr "The Late Emperor"

msgid "先帝……先帝病着的时候，还天天让我念那些找岚城的手札给他听。他走了两年了。"
msgstr "The late Emperor ... even while he was ill, he had me read those notes about the Wind City aloud to him every day. It has been two years since he passed."

msgid "接过那两卷，凑到灯下，先看了原令，又看了抄本。"
msgstr " takes the two scrolls, holds them to the lamp, and reads the original first, then the copy."

msgid "这一卷是我誊的。先帝口授，一句话，我一笔一笔写的。"
msgstr "This one I copied out. The late Emperor dictated it, one line, and I wrote it stroke by stroke."

msgid "那一卷不是。字学得像，可是「寻」字最后一笔，我从来不那么钩。"
msgstr "That one is not. The hand is well imitated, but the last stroke of the character for \"seek\"—I never hook it like that."

msgid "寻剑令是我誊的。先帝口授，一句话：寻剑，不得扰民一户。我誊了一份，先帝用了宝。——后来外头传的那些，不是这一句。"
msgstr "The Sword Decree was copied by me. The late Emperor dictated one line: Seek the sword, and trouble not one household. I copied one sheet, and the late Emperor sealed it.—What was passed around outside afterward was not that line."

msgid "皇上睡得晚。养心殿西暖阁的窗，窗闩是坏的，先帝在时就坏了，没人修。夜里门口有侍卫，窗下没有。"
msgstr "His Majesty sleeps late. In the west warm chamber of the Hall of Mental Cultivation, the window latch is broken, and has been since the late Emperor's time; no one has mended it. At night there are guards at the door, and none under the window."

msgid "养心殿？你问这个做什么。"
msgstr "The Hall of Mental Cultivation? Why do you ask?"

msgid "夜里他们提着灯笼走，走几步停一停。灯照得到的地方，他们看得远；灯照不到的地方，他们就是瞎子。御花园的石头后头，他们从来不照。"
msgstr "At night they walk with lanterns, a few steps and a stop. Where the light falls, they see far; where the light does not fall, they are blind. Behind the rocks in the Imperial Garden, they never shine it."

msgid "一个年轻的侍卫，光着膀子对着木人劈刀，一刀一刀都砍在同一道口子上。\n"
msgstr "A young guard stripped to the waist, chopping at a wooden dummy, every cut landing in the same notch.\n"

msgid "大内侍卫一刀劈在木人上，木屑飞了一地。\n"
msgstr "The palace guard brings his saber down on the dummy, and wood chips fly across the ground.\n"

msgid "收了刀，抱拳。"
msgstr " sheathes his blade and cups his fist."

msgid "侍卫营里练手，请。"
msgstr "Practice in the barracks. Please."

msgid "冯总教头"
msgstr "Chief Instructor Feng"

msgid "总教头在值房。夜里他也不睡，坐着看簿子。"
msgstr "The Chief Instructor is in the duty room. At night he does not sleep either; he sits there reading the ledger."

msgid "一个十六岁的少年，脱了龙袍，只穿一件月白的夹衣，坐在灯下翻他父亲的手札。他看人的时候先往后缩一下，又坐直了——像是想起来自己是皇帝。\n"
msgstr "A sixteen-year-old boy, with the dragon robe off and only a moon-white lined jacket on, sitting under a lamp turning over his father's notes. When he looks at someone he shrinks back a little first, then sits upright again—as if remembering that he is the Emperor.\n"

msgid "你的手刚抬起来，福安已经扑到他身前。"
msgstr "Your hand has barely lifted when Fu'an has thrown himself in front of him."

msgid "听见响动，抬起头，往后缩了一下，又坐直了。"
msgstr " hears a noise, looks up, shrinks back, then sits upright again."

msgid "你……你不是来杀朕的。杀朕的人不翻窗。"
msgstr "You ... you have not come to kill Us. Those who come to kill Us do not climb through a window."

msgid "你从哪儿来的？冷宫的井？——那条路，原来真有人走。"
msgstr "Where did you come from? The well in the Cold Palace?—So there really was someone walking that road."

msgid "父皇的寻剑令，你也在找？……朕只知道父皇找了一辈子岚城，临走还念着。兵部说征民夫是父皇的意思——朕不知道。"
msgstr "My father's Sword Decree—you are looking for it too? ... We only know that Father searched all his life for the Wind City, and was still thinking of it at the end. The Ministry of War says the levy of laborers was Father's wish—We do not know."

msgid "庾尚书说，皇叔勾结水烟阁谋反，朕的布告是他拟的。朕……信了一半。"
msgstr "Minister Yu says the Imperial Uncle plotted rebellion with Waterfog Pavilion, and the notice was drafted by him. We ... half believed it."

msgid "御书房里有父皇的匣子。钥匙在朕这里。你去看——朕跟你去。"
msgstr "In the Imperial Study is Father's box. The key is with Us. Go and see—We will go with you."

msgid "把手札合上，示意福安退到门外。"
msgstr " closes the notes and signals Fu'an to wait outside the door."

msgid "坐。……白天殿上，朕不敢说话。你也看见了。"
msgstr "Sit. ... In the hall by day, We dare not speak. You saw that yourself."

msgid "父皇的寻剑令，朕只知道一句：寻剑。兵部说征民夫是父皇的意思——朕不知道是不是。"
msgstr "Of Father's Sword Decree, We know only one line: seek the sword. The Ministry of War says the levy of laborers was Father's wish—We do not know whether it was."

msgid "还有——槐阳王反了，尚书是这么说的。你从关北来，你说。"
msgstr "And—the Prince of Huaiyang has rebelled, so the Minister says. You come from Beyond the Pass. You tell Us."

msgid "看见你腰间那把剑，脸一下子白了。"
msgstr " sees the sword at your waist, and the color drains from his face."

msgid "那是……你拔了它？父皇说过，那把剑钉着的东西，不能放出来。"
msgstr "That is ... you drew it? Father said that what that sword pins down must never be let out."

msgid "原令只一句。多出来的三句……是兵部的。朕现在知道了，可朕不知道该拿它怎么办。"
msgstr "The original has only one line. The three extra lines ... are the Ministry's. We know now, but We do not know what to do with it."

msgid "父皇的寻剑令在御书房的匣子里。朕跟你去看。"
msgstr "Father's Sword Decree is in the box in the Imperial Study. We will go and see it with you."

msgid "父皇"
msgstr "Father"

msgid "父皇找了一辈子岚城。临走那天还让钟嬷嬷念手札给他听。朕那年十四岁，在帘子外头听。"
msgstr "Father searched all his life for the Wind City. On the day he left, he was still having Nanny Zhong read the notes to him. We were fourteen, listening outside the curtain."

msgid "皇叔……朕小时候他抱过朕。后来布告上说他谋反。朕不信，可是朕不敢不信。"
msgstr "The Imperial Uncle ... he held Us when We were small. Later the notice said he plotted rebellion. We did not believe it, but We did not dare not to."

msgid "他是父皇的老臣，朝里一半的人听他的。白天你也看见了——朕说一句，他说三句。"
msgstr "He is Father's old minister, and half the court listens to him. You saw it by day—We say one sentence, he says three."

msgid "尚书说槐阳王兴兵踏平了兵部的工地，杀了朝廷命官。……你说那是兵部在征民夫？那朕的父皇——父皇的令里有没有这一句？"
msgstr "The Minister says the Prince of Huaiyang raised troops, flattened the Ministry's work site and killed court officials. ... You say that was the Ministry levying laborers? Then Our father—does Father's decree have that line?"

msgid "槐阳王程朔，父皇的老朋友。兵部说他不奉诏。朕没见过他。"
msgstr "Cheng Shuo, the Prince of Huaiyang, was Father's old friend. The Ministry of War says he did not obey the decree. We have never met him."

msgid "寻风而至，寻风而逝——父皇的手札里抄了一百遍。"
msgstr "Seek the wind and arrive; seek the wind and vanish—Father copied it a hundred times in his notes."

msgid "你拔了它……那就只能往前走了。父皇的手札里说，要灭它，三样东西都得在。"
msgstr "You drew it ... then there is only the way forward. Father's notes say that to destroy it, all three things must be present."

msgid "父皇说，玉螺湖底钉着一把剑。他说那把剑不能动。"
msgstr "Father said a sword is pinned at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake. He said that sword must not be moved."

msgid "怎么办"
msgstr "What Now"

msgid "……朕还没想好。你先看完父皇的匣子。"
msgstr "... We have not yet decided. Finish looking through Father's box first."

msgid "一个膀大腰圆的护院，抱着胳膊站在内宅的帘子外头，谁来都先瞪一眼。\n"
msgstr "A burly guard of the household, arms folded, standing outside the curtain of the inner quarters and glaring first at whoever comes.\n"

msgid "小姐"
msgstr "Young Lady"

msgid "老爷吩咐了，小姐这几天不见人。"
msgstr "The master has ordered it: the young lady sees no one these days."

msgid "一个瘦得脱了形的老人，头发胡子全白了，坐在窗下翻一本诗集。他的手腕上有两道旧印，一圈一圈的，是镣铐磨的。墙上那把剑他没看一眼——像是看了二十年，看够了。\n"
msgstr "An old man so thin he has lost his shape, hair and beard all white, sitting under the window turning the pages of a book of poems. On his wrists are two old marks, ring on ring, worn by shackles. He never glances at the sword on the wall—as if he has looked at it for twenty years and had enough.\n"

msgid "老人抬起眼睛看了你一眼。你忽然觉得，他要是想，你的手是抬不起来的。"
msgstr "The old man raises his eyes and looks at you. Suddenly you feel that if he wished, your hand could not lift."

msgid "从诗集上抬起头，看了你很久。"
msgstr " lifts his head from the book of poems and looks at you for a long time."

msgid "二十年，第一个不是庾家的人进这道门。"
msgstr "Twenty years, and you are the first who is not of the Yu family to come through this door."

msgid "老夫卫沧澜。——你认得这个名字？不认得也好。"
msgstr "This old man is Wei Canglan.—You know the name? Better if you do not."

msgid "二十年前，先帝召老夫进京，带着水烟阁藏的岚城记载。走到老松岭，一队白衣武官把我们围了。随从替老夫挡了刀，死在山洞里。老夫醒来，就在这间屋里了。"
msgstr "Twenty years ago the late Emperor summoned this old man to the capital, and I carried the records of the Wind City kept at Waterfog Pavilion. At Old Pine Ridge, a troop of Officers in White surrounded us. My attendants took the blades for me and died in a cave. When I woke, I was in this room."

msgid "白衣，腰里是兵部的刀，领头的人老夫认得——庾子建的亲兵。你要人证？老夫活着走出这道门，就是人证。"
msgstr "White clothes, the Ministry of War's saber at the waist, and the man leading them this old man knew—Yu Zijian's own soldiers. You want a witness? That this old man walks out of this door alive is the witness."

msgid "危水……活着？他回了水烟阁？……好。好。二十年，老夫以为他死在那个洞里了。"
msgstr "Weishui ... alive? He went back to Waterfog Pavilion? ... Good. Good. In twenty years this old man thought he had died in that cave."

msgid "南危水是老夫的副手。那天他也在。……老夫不知道他是死是活。"
msgstr "Nan Weishui was this old man's deputy. He was there that day, too. ... This old man does not know whether he is alive or dead."

msgid "水烟阁藏的岚城记载，被庾子建收走了。他要的不是剑——是握剑的那只手。"
msgstr "The records of the Wind City that Waterfog Pavilion kept were taken away by Yu Zijian. What he wants is not the sword—it is the hand that holds it."

msgid "记载上写着：岚城人出城都带一只铃，铃上刻着名字。铃在，风认人；铃丢了，人就回不去了。"
msgstr "The records say: people of the Wind City carry a bell when they leave the city, with a name carved on it. While the bell is there, the wind knows the person; when the bell is lost, the person cannot go home."

msgid "他留着老夫，不杀不放，是要水烟阁一直有个「盟主还活着」的念想——盟主在，阁里就不另立；不另立，武林就没有一个能说话的人。二十年，他来过三回，每回只问一句：岚城的记载，还有没有没抄全的。"
msgstr "He keeps this old man, neither killing nor freeing me, so that Waterfog Pavilion always has the hope that \"the Alliance Leader is still alive\"—while the Leader lives, the Pavilion will not name another; and with no other named, the wulin has no one who can speak for it. In twenty years he has come three times, and each time he asks only one thing: whether any of the Wind City records remain uncopied."

msgid "诗集"
msgstr "Book of Poems"

msgid "圈的字，从头连起来念。二十年，老夫只能做这个。"
msgstr "The circled characters—read them through from the beginning. In twenty years this old man could do only that."

msgid "走"
msgstr "Leave"

msgid "虹台上正在推盟主？……老夫这时候出去，倒像是去抢椅子。等那边散了，你再来。"
msgstr "They are choosing the Alliance Leader on Rainbow Terrace? ... If this old man went out now, it would look like going to seize the chair. When that is over, come again."

msgid "听你说完，把诗集合上，往窗外看了一眼。"
msgstr " listens to you, closes the book of poems, and glances out of the window."

msgid "墙根底下那个打结的叫花子？二十年，老夫夜夜听着他数护院的梆子。"
msgstr "The beggar tying knots by the foot of the wall? For twenty years this old man has listened to him count the guards' watch clappers every night."

msgid "从墙上摘下那把剑，站起来，腿晃了一下，又站稳了。"
msgstr " takes the sword down from the wall and rises, legs wavering once, then steady."

msgid "狗洞在后院？老夫自己钻得过去。先回水烟阁——替老夫谢那个叫花子。"
msgstr "A dog hole in the back yard? This old man can crawl through it himself. First back to Waterfog Pavilion—and thank that beggar for this old man."

msgid "把诗集合上，放回桌上，站起来，腿晃了一下，又站稳了。"
msgstr " closes the book of poems, sets it back on the table and rises, legs wavering once, then steady."

msgid "走。老夫先回水烟阁——要人证的时候，去那里找老夫。"
msgstr "Let us go. This old man goes back to Waterfog Pavilion first—when you need a witness, find this old man there."

msgid "从墙上摘下那把剑，推门出去了。"
msgstr " takes the sword down from the wall and pushes the door open and goes out."

msgid "老夫回去，水烟阁正月十七还选不选盟主，看他们的。老夫只想把那条路——老松岭那条——再走一遍。"
msgstr "When I return, whether Waterfog Pavilion still chooses an Alliance Leader on the seventeenth of the first month is for them. This old man only wants to walk that road again—the one to Old Pine Ridge."

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，坐在黑暗里，一动不动，只有眼睛亮。他冠上的丝绦断了一根。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in black robes and a black cap sitting motionless in the dark, only his eyes bright. One silk cord on his cap has snapped.\n"

msgid "信使一声不响地散成一股黑烟，一封信飘落在地上。"
msgstr "The courier disperses without a sound into a wisp of black smoke, and a letter drifts to the ground."

msgid "太和殿上，百官分列。皇帝坐在龙椅上，脸色发白，手按着扶手。\n"
msgstr "In the Hall of Supreme Harmony the ministers stand in ranks. The Emperor sits on the dragon throne, his face white, a hand on the armrest.\n"

msgid "朕……朕有话说。"
msgstr "We ... We have something to say."

msgid "抢先出班。"
msgstr " steps out of the ranks first."

msgid "陛下，臣先有本：槐阳王程朔兴兵踏平兵部工地，杀朝廷命官——槐阳王反了。"
msgstr "Your Majesty, I have a memorial first: Cheng Shuo, Prince of Huaiyang, raised troops and flattened the Ministry of War's work site and killed court officials—the Prince of Huaiyang has rebelled."

msgid "……先听他说。"
msgstr "... Hear him first."

msgid "你走到御案前，把先帝的原令和兵部的抄本并排摊开，又把人证物证一样一样摆上去。\n"
msgstr "You walk up to the imperial desk and lay the late Emperor's original decree beside the Ministry's copy, then set out the witnesses and the proofs one by one.\n"

msgid "「寻剑，不得扰民一户。」朝臣们一个一个伸长了脖子。\n"
msgstr "\"Seek the sword, and trouble not one household.\" The ministers crane their necks, one after another.\n"

msgid "槐阳王拒的，是父皇没下过的令。"
msgstr "What the Prince of Huaiyang refused was a decree Father never issued."

msgid "庾子建，这三行……是谁加的？"
msgstr "Yu Zijian, these three lines ... who added them?"

msgid "脸色变了，半晌没有出声。"
msgstr " changes color, and for a long moment makes no sound."

msgid "陛下年幼，被人蒙蔽——"
msgstr "Your Majesty is young, and has been deceived -"

msgid "站了起来。"
msgstr " rises to his feet."

msgid "大内侍卫营听令——"
msgstr "Palace Guard Barracks, obey my command -"

msgid "退后一步，刀已经出了鞘。"
msgstr " takes a step back, blade already out of its sheath."

msgid "老夫替先帝打了半辈子仗！"
msgstr "This old man fought half a lifetime of wars for the late Emperor!"

msgid "庾子建握着刀，一步一步逼过来。"
msgstr "Yu Zijian grips his blade and presses toward you step by step."

msgid "庾子建被押了下去。"
msgstr "Yu Zijian is led away under guard."

msgid "冯策一把扭住庾子建的胳膊，刀「当啷」落在金砖上。两个侍卫上来，把他押了下去。"
msgstr "Feng Ce twists Yu Zijian's arm behind him, and the blade clatters onto the golden bricks. Two guards step up and take him away."

msgid "大内侍卫营总教头"
msgstr "Chief Instructor, Palace Guard Barracks"

msgid "一个鬓发斑白的老者，素白的武官袍，刀已经出了鞘，站在你身侧半步。\n"
msgstr "A grey-haired old man in a plain white officer's robe, blade already out of its sheath, standing half a step beside you.\n"

msgid "冯策拔刀站到你身边：「老夫来。」"
msgstr "Feng Ce draws his blade and stands beside you: \"This old man will take it.\""

msgid "冯策收了刀，退回殿下。"
msgstr "Feng Ce sheathes his blade and steps back below the hall."

msgid "冯策收了刀，抱拳：湖底的事，算老夫一个。"
msgstr "Feng Ce sheathes his blade and cups his fist: \"What happens at the lake—count this old man in.\""

msgid "大内侍卫营副教头"
msgstr "Deputy Instructor, Palace Guard Barracks"

msgid "一个瘦削的老者，白袍，靠在长街的红墙上，手里捏着一串核桃慢慢地转，像是在等人。\n"
msgstr "A lean old man in a white robe, leaning on the red wall of the long street, slowly turning a string of walnuts in his hand, as if waiting for someone.\n"

msgid "核桃停了。"
msgstr "The walnuts stop."

msgid "尚书大人请你过府一叙。御书房里的东西，他知道了。"
msgstr "The Minister invites you to call at his mansion. He knows about what is in the Imperial Study."

msgid "去不去由你。不过尚书大人说，他手里有先帝推敲了二十年的东西——你要找的那座城。"
msgstr "Whether you go is up to you. But the Minister says he holds what the late Emperor worked over for twenty years—the city you are looking for."

msgid "尚书大人在府里客厅等你。东街，大铁门。"
msgstr "The Minister waits for you in the parlor of his mansion. East Street, the big iron gate."

msgid "冯总教头是个直人。直人在宫里活不长——这话你别告诉他。"
msgstr "Chief Instructor Feng is a straight man. Straight men do not live long in the palace—do not tell him I said so."

msgid "宋朴手里的核桃慢慢地转着。\n"
msgstr "The walnuts in Song Pu's hand turn slowly.\n"

msgid "宋朴冲你点了点头：尚书大人记着你的情。\n"
msgstr "Song Pu nods to you: \"The Minister remembers your kindness.\"\n"

msgid "一个瘦削的老者，白袍，站在石林那面镜子旁边，手里捏着一串核桃，没有转。\n"
msgstr "A lean old man in a white robe, standing by the mirror in the stone forest with a string of walnuts in his hand, not turning them.\n"

msgid "宋朴退了半步：我是来传话的。"
msgstr "Song Pu steps back half a pace: \"I came only to pass on a word.\""

msgid "从镜子旁边直起身来，核桃在手心里停着。"
msgstr " straightens up from beside the mirror, the walnuts still in his palm."

msgid "尚书大人问，剑在谁手里。"
msgstr "The Minister asks: whose hand is the sword in?"

msgid "看了你一眼，又看了看你身后的镜子，没等你答。"
msgstr " looks at you, then at the mirror behind you, and does not wait for your answer."

msgid "不用说了。尚书大人会知道的——到了湖边，他自己来问。"
msgstr "No need to say. The Minister will know—at the lakeshore, he will come and ask himself."

msgid "宋朴转身走进石林，雾一合，人就没了。\n"
msgstr "Song Pu turns and walks into the stone forest. The mist closes, and he is gone.\n"

msgid "进了铁门，眼前豁然一空：三面是高得望不到头的红墙，墙帽上一溜暗金的琉璃瓦，墙根返着一圈白碱，灰皮剥了几块，露出里面的砖。脚下的青砖大得一块能躺下一个人，砖缝里钻出几茎枯草。身后铁门两扇，门钉锈成了褐色。东边一道矮些的院门，门里传来吆喝声和刀碰刀的响，是侍卫营。\n"
msgstr "Through the iron gate the view opens suddenly into emptiness: on three sides, red walls so high you cannot see their tops, a row of dull-gold glazed tiles along the wall caps, and at the foot of the walls a ring of white salt bloom, the plaster peeled in patches to show the brick. The blue bricks underfoot are each big enough to lie down on, with a few stalks of dry grass pushing up through the seams. Behind you, the two leaves of the iron gate, the studs rusted brown. To the east is a lower courtyard gate, and from inside come shouts and the clash of blades: the Guard Barracks.\n"

msgid "一道弯弯的河从西流到东，河水是绿的，水面上漂着几片落叶。河上并排五座汉白玉的桥，当中一座最宽，栏杆上雕着龙，龙的爪子缺了好几根，青苔从缺口里长出来。桥北是太和门，门前一对铜狮子，被摸了几百年的狮头亮得发黄。\n"
msgstr "A winding river runs from west to east, the water green, a few fallen leaves floating on it. Five white marble bridges lie side by side across it, the middle one the widest, its railings carved with dragons whose claws are missing in several places, moss growing out of the gaps. North of the bridges is the Gate of Supreme Harmony, with a pair of bronze lions before it, their heads rubbed by hands for hundreds of years until they shine yellow.\n"

msgid "太和门是一座重檐的大门，檐下的彩画褪成了灰绿，几只燕子在斗拱里做了窝，门槛被踩出一道凹。门洞里站着两排禁军，红缨盔，手按着刀。门里就是太和殿前的广场。\n"
msgstr "The Gate of Supreme Harmony is a great double-eaved gate. The painted beams under the eaves have faded to grey-green, a few swallows have built nests in the bracket sets, and the threshold is worn into a hollow by feet. Two rows of guards stand in the gateway in red-plumed helmets, hands on their sabers. Beyond the gate is the square before the Hall of Supreme Harmony.\n"

msgid "好大一片广场。地上铺的砖一眼望不到边，中间一条御道是整块的石板，被车轮和脚磨得发亮。两边一排排大铜缸，缸身生了绿锈，缸沿有一圈被手摸亮的铜色。北面是三层汉白玉的台基，台上立着太和殿，金瓦红柱，殿前一座日晷、一座铜龟。上朝的时候，这里站满了人；不上朝的时候，风从广场上刮过去，什么都没有。西北角一道小门通出去，是西长街。\n"
msgstr "A vast square. The paving stretches out of sight, and down the middle runs the Imperial Way, whole slabs of stone worn bright by wheels and feet. On both sides stand rows of great bronze vats, their bodies green with rust, the rims showing a band of bronze polished by hands. To the north rise three tiers of white marble platform, and on them the Hall of Supreme Harmony, with gold tiles and red pillars; before the hall are a sundial and a bronze tortoise. At court the square is packed with people; when there is no court, the wind sweeps across it and there is nothing at all. In the northwest corner a small gate leads out to West Long Street.\n"

msgid "殿里很高，也很暗。十几根金漆的柱子，柱上盘着龙，漆掉了的地方露出底下的红。地上铺着金砖——其实是深灰的，磨得能照见人影，边上几块裂了缝。殿的尽头是一座七层的台子，台上一把龙椅，椅背后一面雕龙的屏风。龙椅很大，坐上去的人显得很小。\n"
msgstr "The hall is very high, and very dim. A dozen gold-lacquered pillars with dragons coiled around them, the red showing through where the lacquer has come off. The floor is paved with \"golden\" bricks—really a deep grey, worn bright enough to show your reflection, a few along the edges cracked. At the far end is a seven-tiered dais with a dragon throne on it, and behind the throne a carved dragon screen. The throne is very large; whoever sits in it looks very small.\n"

msgid "一座方方的院子，地上是踩实的黄土，东头一排木人，木人身上的麻绳散了，刀口一道压一道。兵器架掉了漆，架上的刀倒擦得雪亮。北边一排营房，窗户开着，里面一排通铺；北墙根一间小值房，门口挂着一盏灯。\n"
msgstr "A square courtyard of trodden yellow earth. At the east end stands a row of wooden dummies, the hemp ropes on them frayed, the cuts layered one on another. The weapon racks have lost their paint, though the sabers on them are polished bright as snow. To the north is a row of barracks with the windows open, and inside, a long sleeping platform; at the foot of the north wall is a small duty room with a lamp hanging at its door.\n"

msgid "一间窄小的值房，一张桌、一条长凳、一张木床。桌上压着一本值宿的簿子，墨迹一行一行，最后一行还没干。墙上挂着一口刀、一件白袍。夜里这里的灯总是亮着。\n"
msgstr "A narrow little duty room: a table, a long bench, a plank bed. On the table lies the duty ledger, the ink running line after line, the last line not yet dry. On the wall hang a saber and a white robe. The lamp here is always lit at night.\n"

msgid "两道红墙夹着一条长街，墙高得只剩头顶一线天。墙头的铁钩上挂着宫灯，一盏接一盏，灯纸让风吹破了几个洞。街面是青砖，墙根长着一溜青苔。白天太监和宫女低着头来来往往，夜里只有禁军的灯笼一来一回。东边一道小门回太和殿广场。\n"
msgstr "Two red walls hem in a long street, the walls so high that only a strip of sky shows overhead. Palace lanterns hang from iron hooks on the wall tops, one after another, the paper torn in several places by the wind. The street is paved with blue brick, and a line of moss grows along the foot of the walls. By day eunuchs and palace maids come and go with their heads lowered; at night only the guards' lanterns pass, to and fro. To the east a small gate leads back to the Hall of Supreme Harmony's square.\n"

msgid "长街到了这里宽了一些，西墙下堆着几口裂了的大缸，缸里积着雨水。东边一道宫门，门里就是养心殿；北头一道垂花门通御花园。\n"
msgstr "Here the long street widens a little. Under the west wall are piled a few cracked great vats, rainwater collected in them. To the east is a palace gate, and inside it is the Hall of Mental Cultivation; at the north end a festooned gate leads to the Imperial Garden.\n"

msgid "一道小些的宫门，门楣上的匾写着「养心门」，金字褪成了土黄。门关着，门缝里透出一点灯光。门前两口铜缸，缸里的水结了一层薄薄的绿。\n"
msgstr "A smaller palace gate, the plaque over the lintel reading \"Gate of Mental Cultivation,\" the gold of the characters faded to dirt yellow. The gate is shut, a little lamplight seeping through the crack. Before the gate stand two bronze vats, the water in them skinned over with a thin green film.\n"

msgid "园子里到处是太湖石，一块叠着一块，洞眼里长着草。几株古柏，老得树皮一条一条地裂开，枝子伸得比宫墙还高。藤萝架下一条石子路，石子拼成的花纹缺了好些。北面一座小殿，殿门上的漆掉得斑斑驳驳。夜里风一过，柏树沙沙地响，什么人走过都听不见。\n"
msgstr "The garden is full of Taihu rocks, piled one on another, grass growing in their holes. A few ancient cypresses, their bark split in long strips, the branches reaching higher than the palace walls. Under a trellis of vines runs a pebble path, the pebble pattern missing in many places. To the north is a small hall, the paint peeling in blotches from its door. At night, when the wind passes, the cypresses rustle, and no one's footsteps can be heard.\n"

msgid "园子的西北角，一道窄窄的角门，门上的铜锁锈死了，可是门轴是新上过油的。门外的路上长满了草——只有一行被人踩倒的。\n"
msgstr "At the northwest corner of the garden is a narrow side door, its bronze lock rusted shut, though the door pivots have been freshly oiled. The path outside the door is overgrown with grass—except for one line trodden flat.\n"

msgid "一个荒了的院子。杂草长到膝盖，台阶缝里钻出小树。廊下的窗纸破了一半，风一吹就呼啦呼啦地响。院子当中一口枯井，井沿上磨出几道绳槽，井口的辘轳不见了，只剩一根木桩。\n"
msgstr "A ruined courtyard. Weeds grow knee-high and small trees push up between the steps. The window paper under the veranda is half torn and flaps in the wind. In the middle of the yard is a dry well, its rim worn with several rope grooves, the windlass over the mouth gone, only a wooden stump left.\n"

msgid "一间小屋子，收拾得倒干净：一张床、一张桌、一个绣架，绣架上绷着一幅没绣完的牡丹，线都褪了色。桌上一盏油灯，灯旁一叠发黄的纸，上面的字写得很工整。\n"
msgstr "A small room, tidy enough: a bed, a table, an embroidery frame, on the frame a peony left half finished, its threads faded. On the table stands an oil lamp, and beside it a stack of yellowed paper with very neat writing.\n"

msgid "井底没有水，只有一层湿泥，泥上有脚印，不止一个人的。井壁上嵌着一道一道的铁蹬，往上爬就是冷宫的院子。北边的井壁上开着一个洞，刚够一个人弯腰钻进去。\n"
msgstr "There is no water at the bottom of the well, only a layer of damp mud, and on the mud footprints, more than one person's. Iron footholds are set into the well wall one after another; climb up and you are in the Cold Palace courtyard. In the north wall is an opening just big enough for one person to crawl into, bent over.\n"

msgid "一条又窄又长的砖砌甬道，顶上滴着水。砖缝里插着烧剩的蜡烛头，有的还很新。地上掉着一根黑色的丝绦，像是从什么冠上扯下来的。甬道往北一直通到看不见的地方。\n"
msgstr "A long, narrow brick passage, water dripping from the ceiling. Burnt-down candle stubs are stuck in the cracks between the bricks, some of them very new. On the ground lies a black silk cord, as if torn from some cap. The passage runs north out of sight.\n"

msgid "甬道到这里到了头，几级石阶往上，顶上压着一块石板，石板缝里漏下几根乾草。\n"
msgstr "The passage ends here. A few stone steps lead up to a stone slab pressing on the top, a few wisps of dry straw sifting down through its cracks.\n"

msgid "养心门里一个小院，比外头的宫院都小，地上的砖扫得很干净。院里两口铜缸，一株海棠，海棠底下一张石凳，石凳上搁着一本翻开的书，书页被露水打湿了。北面就是养心殿。\n"
msgstr "Inside the Gate of Mental Cultivation is a small courtyard, smaller than the other palace courts, the bricks swept very clean. In the yard are two bronze vats and a crabapple tree, and under the crabapple a stone bench with an open book lying on it, the pages damp with dew. To the north is the Hall of Mental Cultivation.\n"

msgid "殿不大，比太和殿暖和得多。正中一张御座，御座旁的小几上堆着奏折，最上面一本摊开着，朱笔搁在砚台上，笔尖的朱砂已经干了。西边一道帘子是西暖阁，东边一道门是御书房。\n"
msgstr "The hall is not large, and much warmer than the Hall of Supreme Harmony. In the center is an imperial seat, and on a small table beside it a pile of memorials, the top one open, the vermilion brush resting on the inkstone, the cinnabar on its tip long dry. The curtain to the west leads to the West Warm Chamber, and the door to the east to the Imperial Study.\n"

msgid "西暖阁里一张炕，炕桌上一盏灯、一摞旧手札、一碗凉了的莲子羹。墙上挂着一幅舆图，舆图西南角用朱笔圈了一个地方，旁边写着两个小字：「岚城？」。西墙上一扇窗，窗闩松松地挂着。\n"
msgstr "In the West Warm Chamber is a heated brick bed, and on the bed table a lamp, a stack of old notes and a bowl of lotus-seed soup gone cold. On the wall hangs a map, and in its southwest corner a place is circled in vermilion with two small characters beside it: \"The Wind City?\" In the west wall is a window whose latch hangs loose.\n"

msgid "御书房里四壁都是书架，架上的书函一格一格贴着黄签。正中一张御案，案上笔墨齐全。墙角一只樟木匣，匣上贴着一道封条，封条上的字是先帝的：「寻剑」。\n"
msgstr "The Imperial Study has bookshelves on all four walls, the book cases on them labeled in rows with yellow slips. In the middle is an imperial desk with brush and ink all laid out. In the corner is a camphorwood box with a seal strip across it, and the writing on the strip is the late Emperor's: \"Seek the Sword.\"\n"

msgid "太和门前一对铜狮子，蹲在汉白玉的座上。狮头被摸了几百年，亮得发黄；身上别处都生了一层暗绿的锈。东边那只脚下踩着一只绣球，西边那只脚下按着一只小狮子。\n"
msgstr "A pair of bronze lions before the Gate of Supreme Harmony, crouching on white marble bases. The heads have been rubbed for hundreds of years until they shine yellow; the rest of the bodies is covered in a layer of dark green rust. The eastern lion has a ball under its foot; the western one holds a small lion under its paw.\n"

msgid "一座汉白玉的日晷，晷面斜斜地朝着南天，铜针的影子落在刻度上。刻度旁有人用指甲刻了一道浅痕——大约是哪个站班的侍卫等下朝等得不耐烦。\n"
msgstr "A white marble sundial, its face tilted toward the southern sky, the shadow of its bronze needle falling across the marks. Beside one mark someone has scratched a shallow line with a fingernail—probably some guard on duty, impatient for court to end.\n"

msgid "七层台阶上一把金漆的龙椅，椅背上盘着九条龙，扶手的龙头被手握得发亮。椅子太大了：坐垫上另垫了一块厚褥子，脚下还摆着一只脚踏——坐在这上头的人，脚够不着地。\n"
msgstr "A gold-lacquered dragon throne atop seven steps, nine dragons coiled on its back, the dragon heads on the armrests rubbed bright by hands. The throne is too big: a thick extra cushion has been laid on the seat, and a footstool set below—whoever sits up there cannot reach the floor.\n"

msgid "一根黑色的丝绦，一头扯断了，另一头还打着结。是从一顶黑冠上扯下来的——逆灵宫的道士戴的那种。\n"
msgstr "A black silk cord, snapped at one end, the other end still knotted. It was torn from a black cap—the kind the Daoists of the Black Palace wear.\n"

msgid "一口枯井，井沿是青石的，磨出几道深深的绳槽。往下看，黑得看不见底，可是井壁上嵌着一道道铁蹬，最上面那几道擦得发亮。\n"
msgstr "A dry well, its rim of blue stone worn into several deep rope grooves. Look down and it is too dark to see the bottom, but iron footholds are set along the well wall, and the topmost ones are polished bright.\n"

msgid "养心门关着，门闩在里头。门缝里透出一点灯光——皇上睡得晚。（养心殿是这一章后面的事。）\n"
msgstr "The Gate of Mental Cultivation is shut, barred from inside. A little lamplight seeps through the crack—His Majesty sleeps late. (The Hall of Mental Cultivation comes later in this chapter.)\n"

msgid "一幅旧舆图，北到关北，南到玉螺湖，西南角用朱笔圈了一个地方，旁边两个小字：「岚城？」。圈是新描的，墨色比舆图上的字深得多——有人常常对着它看。\n"
msgstr "An old map, from Beyond the Pass in the north to Jade Conch Lake in the south, a place circled in vermilion in the southwest corner with two small characters beside it: \"The Wind City?\" The circle is freshly traced, the ink much darker than the writing on the map—someone often sits looking at it.\n"

msgid "樟木匣里还剩几册先帝的手札，记的都是岚城：哪年派了谁去，回来说了什么。\n"
msgstr "A few volumes of the late Emperor's notes remain in the camphorwood box, all of them about the Wind City: which year he sent whom, and what each one brought back.\n"

msgid "你揭开封条。匣子里一卷黄绫裹着的诏书，一卷兵部存档的复本，底下压着几册手札。\n"
msgstr "You break the seal strip. Inside the box are a scroll wrapped in yellow silk, a scroll of the Ministry of War's archived copy, and under them several volumes of notes.\n"

msgid "诏书只有一行字，先帝的御笔：「寻剑，不得扰民一户。」后头钤着一方御宝，朱色正红。\n"
msgstr "The decree is a single line in the late Emperor's own hand: \"Seek the sword, and trouble not one household.\" Below it is stamped an imperial seal, a true and perfect vermilion.\n"

msgid "兵部的复本同一个日子、同一个开头，「寻剑」之后多出三行：「征民夫，设关卡，拿人。」后头盖着兵部的印，旁边还有一方「镇国大将军」印。\n"
msgstr "The Ministry's copy has the same date and the same opening, but after \"Seek the Sword\" come three more lines: \"Levy laborers, set up checkpoints, seize people.\" Beneath them is the Ministry's seal, and beside it another seal reading \"Guardian General.\"\n"

msgid "比对"
msgstr "Compare"

msgid "两卷都在你手里了。原令一句，抄本四句——多出来的三句，是兵部自己加的。\n"
msgstr "You hold both scrolls now. The original has one line, the copy four—the three extra lines were added by the Ministry itself.\n"

msgid "御案上空着。先把樟木匣里的东西拿出来。\n"
msgstr "The imperial desk is bare. Take what is in the camphorwood box out first.\n"

msgid "你把两卷并排摊在御案上，就着灯看那两方印。\n"
msgstr "You lay the two scrolls side by side on the imperial desk and study the two seals by lamplight.\n"

msgid "御宝的朱色正红，压得匀匀的。兵部那方印暗红发黑——和逆灵宫账房那叠文书上的，是一方，是拓了模子的那一方。\n"
msgstr "The vermilion of the imperial seal is true red, pressed evenly. The Ministry's seal is dark red verging on black—it is the same seal as on the stack of documents in the Black Palace's counting room, the one cast from a mold.\n"

msgid "原令是真的。抄本上多出来的三句，是拿着假印的人加的。\n"
msgstr "The original is genuine. The three extra lines on the copy were added by someone holding a false seal.\n"

msgid "皇帝从樟木匣底抽出一页发黄的纸递给你：「父皇的手札。樵夫进过岚城——你拿着。寻剑的事，父皇没办完；朕交给你了。」\n"
msgstr "The Emperor draws a yellowed page from the bottom of the camphorwood box and hands it to you: \"Father's notes. The woodcutter did go into the Wind City—take this. The seeking of the sword Father did not finish; We entrust it to you.\"\n"

msgid "你把印模按在抄本那方「镇国大将军」印旁边。模上的朱砂正红；纸上的印暗红发黑——一模一样的纹，不一样的色。\n"
msgstr "You press the seal mold beside the \"Guardian General\" seal on the copy. The vermilion on the mold is true red; the seal on the paper is dark red verging on black—the same pattern, a different color.\n"

msgid "抄本上多出来的三句，是拿着假印的人加的。\n"
msgstr "The three extra lines on the copy were added by someone holding a false seal.\n"

msgid "你想起钟嬷嬷的话：「这一卷是我誊的。那一卷不是。」原令上的字工工整整，和她纸上的一样。\n"
msgstr "You remember Nanny Zhong's words: \"This one I copied out. That one is not.\" The writing on the original is neat and even, like hers on the paper.\n"

msgid "两卷摊在御案上，看来看去，印都是红的，字都是工整的。你认不出哪一卷不对。\n"
msgstr "You spread the two scrolls on the imperial desk and look and look: both seals are red, both hands neat. You cannot tell which scroll is wrong.\n"

msgid "福安小声说：冷宫里有个钟嬷嬷，当年是先帝跟前的女官……先帝的字，她认得。\n"
msgstr "Fu'an says softly, \"In the Cold Palace there is a Nanny Zhong, who was a court lady beside the late Emperor ... his handwriting, she knows.\"\n"

msgid "皇帝摇摇头：这件事，已经定了。\n"
msgstr "The Emperor shakes his head, \"That matter is settled.\"\n"

msgid "皇帝说道：先看完父皇的匣子。\n"
msgstr "The Emperor says, \"First finish looking through Father's box.\"\n"

msgid "明日早朝，当着百官揭发兵部尚书庾子建。原令、人证、物证都摆上去——庾子建不会束手。去吗？"
msgstr "At tomorrow's morning court, denounce the Minister of War, Yu Zijian, before all the ministers. The original, the witnesses and the proofs all laid out—Yu Zijian will not go quietly. Go?"

msgid "皇帝把原令卷起来，又展开，看了很久。\n"
msgstr "The Emperor rolls up the original decree, unrolls it again, and looks at it for a long time.\n"

msgid "皇帝说道：……好。明天早上，朕当着他们说。冯总教头在殿上，你站在朕下首。\n"
msgstr "The Emperor says, \"... Good. Tomorrow morning, We will speak before them. Chief Instructor Feng will be in the hall, and you stand below Us.\"\n"

msgid "东方的天空中开始出现一丝微曦。太监在殿外喊：上朝——\n"
msgstr "A thread of dawn begins to show in the eastern sky. A eunuch calls outside the hall: Court is in session - \n"

msgid "皇帝说道：槐阳王的事，他一定先说。凭这些，压不住他。\n"
msgstr "The Emperor says, \"The matter of the Prince of Huaiyang—he will surely speak of it first. With this alone, he cannot be pressed.\"\n"

msgid "（关北踏平了工地：揭发要原令加三样人证物证——乔阴陈显祖的证词、卫沧澜、小屋里那人身上的密信、逆灵宫的账册、天驼关李信的账。）\n"
msgstr "(You flattened the work site Beyond the Pass: the denunciation needs the original plus three witnesses or proofs—Chen Xianzu's testimony from Tallshade, Wei Canglan, the secret letter on the man in the little room, the Black Palace's ledger, and Li Xin's accounts from Camelback Pass.)\n"

msgid "（小屋那封密信在程不平手里——他随你上京作证，算一样。）\n"
msgstr "(The secret letter from the little room is with Cheng Buping—he comes to the capital with you to testify, and that counts as one.)\n"

msgid "（小屋那封密信给了花紫会——这回算不上。）\n"
msgstr "(You gave the secret letter from the little room to the Beggars' Guild—this time it does not count.)\n"

msgid "（陈天星查清的那趟镖路——兵部点名改走老松岭——也算一样。）\n"
msgstr "(The escort route that Chen Tianxing traced—the Ministry of War naming Old Pine Ridge for the detour—also counts as one.)\n"

msgid "（李信那本天驼关的账——印丢的三天，兵部征民夫的令——也算一样。）\n"
msgstr "(Li Xin's ledger from Camelback Pass—the three days the seal was lost, the Ministry's order to levy laborers—also counts as one.)\n"

msgid "（骆建章的供状——兵部抄本上多出来的三句，是庾子建口述、他落的笔——也算一样。）\n"
msgstr "(Luo Jianzhang's confession—the three extra lines on the Ministry's copy were dictated by Yu Zijian and set down by his brush—also counts as one.)\n"

msgid "（逆灵宫那本祭品名册的原本——河工所的戳底下垫着兵部的印——也算一样。）\n"
msgstr "(The original of the Black Palace's sacrifice register—the Ministry's seal beneath the River Works Office stamp—also counts as one.)\n"

msgid "（陈显祖带着箱子走了——他的证词，这回算不上。）\n"
msgstr "(Chen Xianzu left with his chest—his testimony does not count this time.)\n"

msgid "皇帝说道：凭这些，朝上压不住他。……再找一样来。\n"
msgstr "The Emperor says, \"With this, the court cannot press him. ... Find one more.\"\n"

msgid "（揭发要原令加两样人证物证——乔阴陈显祖的证词、卫沧澜、小屋里那人身上的密信、逆灵宫的账册、天驼关李信的账。）\n"
msgstr "(The denunciation needs the original plus two witnesses or proofs—Chen Xianzu's testimony from Tallshade, Wei Canglan, the secret letter on the man in the little room, the Black Palace's ledger, and Li Xin's accounts from Camelback Pass.)\n"

msgid "先解"
msgstr "Lift Warrant"

msgid "先不动庾子建，请皇帝亲笔下手诏，撤了皇叔的通缉、召他回朝。庾子建会留在朝上——可有了皇叔，他就不是一个人说了算。要这样吗？"
msgstr "Leave Yu Zijian alone for now and ask the Emperor to write an edict in his own hand, lifting the warrant on the Imperial Uncle and calling him back to court. Yu Zijian will remain at court—but with the Imperial Uncle there, he will no longer be the only one who decides. Do this?"

msgid "先解通缉"
msgstr "Lift the Warrant First"

msgid "皇帝咬着嘴唇想了一会儿，提起笔。\n"
msgstr "The Emperor bites his lip, thinks for a while, and picks up the brush.\n"

msgid "皇帝说道：朕不敢当着他的面……可这一件，朕自己能做。\n"
msgstr "The Emperor says, \"We dare not do it to his face ... but this one thing We can do Ourselves.\"\n"

msgid "他写得很慢，一笔一划。写完，取出一方小印盖上，吹了吹墨，递给你。\n"
msgstr "He writes very slowly, stroke by stroke. When he finishes, he takes out a small seal, presses it on, blows on the ink and hands it to you.\n"

msgid "皇帝说道：东二门的布告，今天就撤。皇叔在水烟阁——你替朕送去。\n"
msgstr "The Emperor says, \"The notice at the East Second Gate will come down today. The Imperial Uncle is at Waterfog Pavilion—take it to him on Our behalf.\"\n"

msgid "你在密室里转了一圈。除了那张破床和乾草，什么也没有。"
msgstr "You go once around the secret room. Apart from a broken bed and some dry straw, there is nothing."

msgid "养心门关着，门闩在里头。门缝里透出一点灯光。"
msgstr "The Gate of Mental Cultivation is shut, barred from inside. A little lamplight seeps through the crack."

msgid "养心殿的西墙上一排窗，窗纸后面透着灯光。窗都关得死死的——不知道哪一扇是坏的。"
msgstr "A row of windows runs along the west wall of the Hall of Mental Cultivation, lamplight behind the paper. All are shut tight—you cannot tell which one is broken."

msgid "御书房的门锁着，钥匙在皇上身上。"
msgstr "The door of the Imperial Study is locked, and the key is on His Majesty's person."

msgid "一块巴掌大的泥模，拓的是镇国大将军印的印面，「镇国大将军」五个字反着。模子边上沾着一抹朱砂，正红的，拿到亮处看还泛一点黄光。赫造基拓它的时候，真印正丢在后备兵手里。\n"
msgstr "A clay mold the size of a palm, taken from the face of the Guardian General's seal. The five characters \"Guardian General\" run backwards. A smear of cinnabar clings to the edge of the mold, true red, with a faint yellow shine when you hold it to the light. When He Zaoji took this impression, the real seal was lost in the Reserve Guard's hands.\n"

msgid "比印"
msgstr "Compare Seals"

msgid "你把印模翻过来，按在兵部文书末尾那方「镇国大将军」印旁边，对着光看。\n"
msgstr "You turn the mold over and press it beside the \"Guardian General\" seal at the foot of the Ministry of War's papers, then hold them to the light.\n"

msgid "模子上的朱砂是正红的，泛一点黄光——真印的颜色。文书上的印色暗红发黑，像是朱砂里掺了别的东西。\n"
msgstr "The cinnabar on the mold is true red with a faint yellow shine: the color of the real seal. The ink on the papers is dark red, nearly black, as if something else was mixed into the cinnabar.\n"

msgid "字口一模一样，一笔不差。只差一个颜色。\n"
msgstr "The strokes are identical, not a line off. Only the color differs.\n"

msgid "你想明白了：文书上兵部自己的印是真的——文书确实出自兵部；旁边这方「镇国大将军」印是照赫造基卖出去的模子浇的，严廷殷从没盖过。兵部借镇国大将军的名头设卡拿人，令是在先帝那一句后头添的；人，就是拿这样的文书抓走的。\n"
msgstr "It comes clear to you: the Ministry's own seal on the papers is real, so the papers did come from the Ministry. The \"Guardian General\" seal beside it was cast from the mold He Zaoji sold, and Yan Tingyin never stamped it. The Ministry used the Guardian General's name to set up checkpoints and seize people; the order was added behind the late Emperor's one line. People were seized with papers like these.\n"

msgid "你记住了这个颜色。往后再见到这方印，一眼就能看出是哪一颗盖的。\n"
msgstr "You have this color fixed in your mind. From now on, whenever you see this seal again, one look will tell you which one stamped it.\n"

msgid "光拿着模子比不出什么。得有一张盖了印的文书，把印模按在印旁边看。\n"
msgstr "You can tell nothing from the mold alone. You need a paper with the seal on it, and the mold pressed beside the seal.\n"

msgid "一把关北的马刀，刀身带弯，刀背厚，刀柄缠着牛皮绳。马上一撩就是一条口子，平地上使也凑合。\n"
msgstr "A saber from Beyond the Pass. The blade is curved, the spine thick, the hilt wrapped in oxhide cord. From horseback one upward sweep opens a gash; it will do well enough on foot, too.\n"

msgid "一把大秦的短剑，剑身宽而直，两面开刃，剑尖是一个三角。剑柄是一整块骨头雕的，握上去正合手。剑鞘是铁片缀的，上面錾着一只看不出是什么的鸟。卢卡说这是好剑，他没说错。\n"
msgstr "A Daqin short sword. The blade is wide and straight, edged on both sides, the point a triangle. The hilt is carved from a single piece of bone and sits just right in the hand. The scabbard is studded with iron plates and engraved with a bird you can't quite make out. Luca said it was a good sword, and he wasn't wrong.\n"

msgid "一只羊皮缝的酒囊，装着酸味冲鼻的马奶酒。关里人头一口皱眉，第二口就不皱了。\n"
msgstr "A sheepskin wineskin full of kumis, sour enough to sting the nose. Folk from inside the pass frown at the first mouthful; at the second they don't.\n"

msgid "一大块带骨的羊肉，锅里现捞出来的，撒了一把盐。关北人不用筷子，用手抓。\n"
msgstr "A big hunk of mutton on the bone, fished fresh from the pot and sprinkled with a handful of salt. Folk Beyond the Pass don't use chopsticks; they eat it with their hands.\n"

msgid "啃干净的羊骨头"
msgstr "gnawed-clean mutton bone"

msgid "一根啃得干干净净的羊骨头。\n"
msgstr "A mutton bone, gnawed perfectly clean.\n"

msgid "一册翻得起毛的小册子，羊皮封面，里头是用炭笔画的七页图：一个人在马上，刀自下而上撩出去。每一页边上都写着同一句话：「撩，不是砍。」最后一页画的是一个人跳下马，把刀插回鞘里。\n"
msgstr "A small booklet, fuzzy at the edges from turning, sheepskin cover. Inside are seven pages drawn in charcoal: a man on horseback, a saber sweeping up from below. Each page has the same line written in the margin: \"Sweep, don't chop.\" The last page shows a man who has jumped off his horse and is sliding the saber back into its sheath.\n"

msgid "天驼关守军"
msgstr "Camelback Pass Garrison"

msgid "一个穿铁灰号衣的兵，手里横着一杆长枪，枪头擦得雪亮。他眼睛盯着出关的人，不盯进关的——出关的要留钱。\n"
msgstr "A soldier in an iron-gray tabard, a spear held crosswise, its head polished bright. His eyes are on the people leaving the pass, not the ones coming in: the ones leaving have to pay.\n"

msgid "关门兵把枪往地上一顿：出关的，过路钱。\n"
msgstr "The Pass Guard thumps his spear on the ground: \"Leaving the pass? Toll.\"\n"

msgid "关门兵眯着眼看了看北边的天：又要起风沙了。\n"
msgstr "The Pass Guard squints at the northern sky: \"Sandstorm coming again.\"\n"

msgid "关门兵喝道：闯关？你当这是你家后院！\n"
msgstr "The Pass Guard barks: \"Rushing the gate? You think this is your back yard?\"\n"

msgid "翻了翻手里的名册，抬头看你。"
msgstr " flips through the roll in his hand, then looks up at you."

msgid "名册上有你。大队长列的——过。"
msgstr "You're on the roll. The squad leader put you down. Go on through."

msgid "李副将的令：往后过关不收钱。过。"
msgstr "Deputy General Li's order: no more toll at the pass. Go on through."

msgid "说过了，过去吧。"
msgstr "I said you can go. Move along."

msgid "接过信，看了看封皮上的字，又还给你。"
msgstr " takes the letter, looks at the words on the cover, and hands it back to you."

msgid "乔阴程县令的信？老王爷的侄子……行。过去吧。关北的事，我们不管。"
msgstr "A letter from Magistrate Cheng of Tallshade? The old Prince's nephew... Fine. Go through. What happens Beyond the Pass is none of our business."

msgid "什么信？没信就留钱。"
msgstr "What letter? No letter, leave your toll."

msgid "过路钱"
msgstr "Toll"

msgid "不收了。李副将的令——先帝调他来是守关，不是收钱的。"
msgstr "Not anymore. Deputy General Li's order: the late Emperor sent him here to guard the pass, not to collect money."

msgid "你的钱留过了。"
msgstr "You've already paid."

msgid "五两。王法朝法都管不到这道门，这是大将军的规矩——出关的留五两，进关的不要钱。"
msgstr "Five taels. Neither the Emperor's law nor the court's law reaches this gate; this is the General's rule. Leaving the pass, you leave five taels. Coming in, it's free."

msgid "出了这道门就是槐阳王的地界。李副将的账上了京，兵部拓了大将军的印去盖民夫令，账上也记着——关北的事，朝廷知道了。"
msgstr "Past this gate is the Prince of Huaiyang's land. Deputy General Li's accounts have gone up to the Capital, and the Ministry of War took the General's seal and stamped it on the laborer orders, and that's in the accounts too. The court knows what's going on Beyond the Pass."

msgid "出了这道门就是槐阳王的地界。那边是王法，不是朝法。那边的事，我们不管，也管不了。"
msgstr "Past this gate is the Prince of Huaiyang's land. Over there it's the Prince's law, not the court's. What goes on over there is none of our business, and we couldn't stop it if it were."

msgid "大将军回京了，没再回来。门是李副将守，钱不收了。"
msgstr "The General went back to the Capital and never came back. Deputy General Li holds the gate now, and the toll's dropped."

msgid "大将军的兵。门是大将军的，钱也是。军师的事？……不该问的别问。"
msgstr "The General's soldiers. The gate's the General's, and so is the money. The adviser? ... What you shouldn't ask, don't ask."

msgid "大将军的兵。门是大将军的，钱也是。你要是大将军的朋友——他可没朋友。"
msgstr "The General's soldiers. The gate's the General's, and so is the money. If you're a friend of the General's... he's got no friends."

msgid "谷地东壁这道门是先帝年间开的，通关北的军道。以前一年走不了几个人，这一年多了——兵部的车，一辆一辆往北去。"
msgstr "This gate in the east wall of the valley was opened in the late Emperor's day, a military road to Beyond the Pass. It used to see a handful of people a year. This past year there's more: the Ministry of War's carts, one after another, going north."

msgid "李副将的令，不收钱。拿回去。"
msgstr "Deputy General Li's order: no toll. Take it back."

msgid "过了就过了，钱老子不嫌多。"
msgstr "Well, you're through now. I never mind more money."

msgid "掂了掂，揣进怀里。"
msgstr " weighs it in his hand and tucks it inside his coat."

msgid "五两，过路钱。过去吧——关北的事别回来找我们。"
msgstr "Five taels, the toll. Go on through. And don't come back to us about what happens Beyond the Pass."

msgid "五两。少一个子儿不开门。"
msgstr "Five taels. Not one copper short, or the gate stays shut."

msgid "这是什么东西？拿回去。"
msgstr "What's this? Take it back."

msgid "一个穿灰褐短袄的兵，腰里一把弯刀，脸让风沙吹得黑红。他看人的眼神直来直去，不像朝廷的兵那样先看你的衣裳。\n"
msgstr "A soldier in a short gray-brown jacket, a curved saber at his waist, his face weathered dark red by wind and sand. He looks at people straight on, not like the court's soldiers, who look at your clothes first.\n"

msgid "城门兵冲进城的驼队点了点头，没要钱。\n"
msgstr "The City Gate Guard nods at a camel train coming into town and doesn't ask for money.\n"

msgid "城门兵朝告示那边努了努嘴：都看看，王爷的话。\n"
msgstr "The City Gate Guard jerks his chin at the notice: \"Everyone take a look. The Prince's word.\"\n"

msgid "王爷贴的。兵部的人要是敢拿着文书来关北拿人，先过我们这一关。你是外乡人？看看就知道这儿的规矩了。"
msgstr "The Prince put that up. If the Ministry of War's men come Beyond the Pass with papers to seize people, they get past us first. You a stranger? Read it, and you'll know how things are here."

msgid "去年到今年，关北没了几百个壮丁。王爷拒了兵部的令，可人还是一批一批没了——都是往草原东边去的。王爷查到今天。"
msgstr "From last year to this, Beyond the Pass lost several hundred able-bodied men. The Prince turned down the Ministry's order, but people are still going, batch after batch, all of them east into the grassland. The Prince has been looking into it to this day."

msgid "兵部的令，在关北不算数。王爷说的，我们照办。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War's orders don't count Beyond the Pass. What the Prince says, we do."

msgid "王府"
msgstr "Prince's house"

msgid "大街北头，朱门就是。王爷不见生人——你有凭据，门军会放你。"
msgstr "North end of the main street, the red gate. The Prince doesn't see strangers. If you've got proof, the gate guards will let you in."

msgid "老王爷镇关北二十年。他说话不绕弯子，你也别绕。"
msgstr "The old Prince has held Beyond the Pass for twenty years. He doesn't talk in circles, so don't you."

msgid "一个裹着羊皮袄的驼夫，脸上一层沙，牙倒是很白。他的骆驼卧在城门里嚼草，鼻子里哼哼地出气。\n"
msgstr "A camel driver in a sheepskin coat, a layer of sand on his face, though his teeth are very white. His camel lies inside the gate chewing fodder, snorting through its nose.\n"

msgid "驼夫拍了拍骆驼的脖子，骆驼不理他。\n"
msgstr "The Camel Driver pats his camel's neck. The camel pays him no mind.\n"

msgid "驼夫说道：关北的马，关里的茶，一进一出。\n"
msgstr "The Camel Driver says: \"Horses from Beyond the Pass, tea from inside it. One in, one out.\"\n"

msgid "驼队"
msgstr "Camel Train"

msgid "皮子、盐、砖茶，从西边来，到槐阳换马。关北的矮脚马耐跑，关里人抢着要。"
msgstr "Hides, salt and brick tea come from the west and get swapped for horses in Huaiyang. The short horses of Beyond the Pass run far, and the folk inside the pass fight over them."

msgid "关北好啊，没人查你的货。王爷只收一成，剩下的都是你的。"
msgstr "Beyond the Pass is good. Nobody checks your goods. The Prince takes one part in ten, and the rest is yours."

msgid "草原东边？别去。兵部的人圈了一大片地在挖什么，见了生面孔就拿去当民夫。我们的驼队都绕着走。"
msgstr "East of the grassland? Don't go. The Ministry of War's people have fenced off a big stretch and are digging something, and any strange face they see, they take for a laborer. Our caravans go around."

msgid "一个光着膀子的铁匠，胸口的汗混着铁屑。砧子上一把弯刀刚出炉，还红着。他打的是马刀——关北的刀都带弯，马上好使。\n"
msgstr "A bare-chested smith, sweat on his chest mixed with iron filings. A curved saber just out of the forge lies on the anvil, still red. Sabers are what he makes: every blade Beyond the Pass is curved, good from horseback.\n"

msgid "铁匠把一把弯刀按进水槽，嗤的一声白烟。\n"
msgstr "The Smith plunges a curved saber into the trough with a hiss of white steam.\n"

msgid "铁匠说道：关北的刀带弯，马上一撩就是一条口子。\n"
msgstr "The Smith says: \"Blades Beyond the Pass are curved. From horseback, one sweep opens a gash.\"\n"

msgid "关北的马刀，弯的，马上使的。十五两一把，不还价。你要是在平地上使，也凑合。"
msgstr "A Frontier saber: curved, made to be used from horseback. Fifteen taels each, no haggling. If you use it on foot, it'll do well enough."

msgid "铁"
msgstr "Iron"

msgid "铁从关里来，炭是草原上的羊粪烧的。别笑，羊粪火稳。"
msgstr "The iron comes from inside the pass. The charcoal is made from sheep dung out on the grass. Don't laugh. Dung fire burns steady."

msgid "兵部的人来买过铁镐，一买两百把。两百把铁镐，挖的不是官道。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War's people came and bought iron picks, two hundred at a time. Two hundred picks, and what they're digging isn't an official road."

msgid "马贩"
msgstr "Horse Trader"

msgid "一个矮壮的马贩子，脸上皱纹像刀刻的，腰里别着一根马鞭。他看马的眼光比看人准，看你的时候像在估你能驮多少。\n"
msgstr "A short, stocky horse trader, his wrinkles cut as if with a knife, a horse whip tucked into his belt. He sizes up a horse better than a man. When he looks at you, it's as if he's reckoning how much you could carry.\n"

msgid "巴朗掰开一匹马的嘴看了看牙，摇摇头。\n"
msgstr "Balang pries open a horse's mouth, looks at its teeth, and shakes his head.\n"

msgid "巴朗冲卢卡那边喊：高鼻子，今天卖出去了没有？\n"
msgstr "Balang shouts toward Luca: \"Big Nose! Sell anything today?\"\n"

msgid "马"
msgstr "Horse"

msgid "关北的矮脚马，不好看，耐跑。一天二百里，不吃精料。你要买，先学会骑——不会骑的人我不卖。"
msgstr "The short horses of Beyond the Pass aren't pretty, but they run far. Two hundred li a day, and no fine feed. If you want one, learn to ride first. I don't sell to people who can't ride."

msgid "那个高鼻子？大秦来的，说是什么剑会的人。在我这儿坐了半个月，天天想卖他那把剑换路费——没人识货。他那把剑是好东西，我看得出，可关北人不使短剑。"
msgstr "That big nose? From Daqin, says he belongs to some sword guild. Been sitting at my place half a month, trying every day to sell that sword of his for the road money, and nobody knows its worth. It's a good piece, I can tell, but folk Beyond the Pass don't carry short swords."

msgid "兵部征马也征人。草原东边挖什么古坟，我的马卖过去二十匹，一匹没回来。人也是——那些民夫进去了就不出来。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War takes horses as well as men. Digging up some old tomb east of the grassland, and I've sold them twenty horses, and not one has come back. Same with the laborers: they go in and don't come out."

msgid "关北是王爷的。王爷不奉兵部的令，兵部就自己来人。你看吧，早晚要出事。"
msgstr "Beyond the Pass belongs to the Prince. The Prince won't take the Ministry's orders, so the Ministry sends its own men. You watch. Sooner or later there'll be trouble."

msgid "卢卡老说的那个地方？海边，很远。他说他们的人都在那儿。"
msgstr "That place Luca keeps talking about? By the sea, very far. He says all his people are there."

msgid "一个高鼻深目的异族人，头发是褐色的，剪得很短，下巴上一层胡茬。他穿着关北人的羊皮袄，袄底下露出一截铁片缀成的甲。面前铺着一块布，布上放着一把短剑，剑身宽、直，和中原的剑都不一样。\n"
msgstr "A foreigner with a high-bridged nose and deep-set eyes, short brown hair and a layer of stubble on his chin. He wears a sheepskin coat like the locals', and under it you can see a flash of armor of iron plates. A cloth is spread in front of him with a short sword on it, the blade wide and straight, unlike any sword of the Central Plains.\n"

msgid "卢卡用一块布擦着短剑，擦得很慢。\n"
msgstr "Luca wipes his short sword with a cloth, very slowly.\n"

msgid "卢卡看着东边的天，说了一句你听不懂的话。\n"
msgstr "Luca looks at the eastern sky and says something you can't understand.\n"

msgid "卢卡沉声道：你，不该动手。\n"
msgstr "Luca says in a low voice: \"You. Should not have started this.\"\n"

msgid "不卖了。"
msgstr "Not for sale now."

msgid "剑在你手里了。用它，别挂着。"
msgstr "The sword is in your hand. Use it. Do not hang it up."

msgid "剑还在。路费是会里给的，这把是我自己的。二十两，你要，还卖。"
msgstr "Sword still here. Road money came from the Guild. This one is my own. Twenty taels. You want it, I still sell."

msgid "剑。大秦的铁，好剑。二十两，换路费——我要去海边。你不买，看看也行。"
msgstr "The sword. Daqin iron, good sword. Twenty taels, for road money. I go to the sea. You do not buy, you may look."

msgid "路费"
msgstr "Road Money"

msgid "到了。走了一个月。"
msgstr "I arrived. A month of walking."

msgid "去海边，番坊。远。马、吃的、过关的钱。二十两，够。"
msgstr "To the sea, the Foreign Quarter. Far. Horse, food, money to pass gates. Twenty taels is enough."

msgid "鬼"
msgstr "Ghosts"

msgid "放下布，看着你。"
msgstr " sets down the cloth and looks at you."

msgid "我们那边的老兵，传一个故事：东方，有一个鬼，没有头。找自己的头，三百年。"
msgstr "Old soldiers from our side tell a story. In the east, a ghost with no head. It looks for its own head for three hundred years."

msgid "我以为是故事。到了东方，人人都在找一把剑——找剑的人说，剑钉着一个头。我就想，不是故事。"
msgstr "I thought it was a story. In the east, everyone is looking for a sword. The sword-seekers say a sword is nailed through a head. So I think: not a story."

msgid "头"
msgstr "Head"

msgid "鬼的头在哪里，我不知道。会首知道。"
msgstr "Where the ghost's head is, I do not know. The Guild Head knows."

msgid "头？我们那边的老兵说，东方有一个鬼找自己的头。三百年。你问这个——你也在找？"
msgstr "A head? Old soldiers from our side say there is a ghost in the east looking for its head. Three hundred years. You ask this. You are looking too?"

msgid "会首"
msgstr "Guild Head"

msgid "船上。押走的。——你知道那文书是假的。"
msgstr "On a ship. Taken away. ... You know that paper is false."

msgid "会首在里头。我跟他说了你——他知道你要来。"
msgstr "The Guild Head is inside. I told him about you. He knows you are coming."

msgid "会首安敦。铁盾会的会首，我们的头。他的祖上，三百年前，在这里当过兵，见过那个鬼的头——怎么封的。"
msgstr "The Guild Head is Andun. Head of the Iron Shield Guild, our leader. His forefathers, three hundred years ago, were soldiers here. They saw the ghost's head. How it was sealed."

msgid "他在番坊，海边。你去，说卢卡让你去。他会见你。"
msgstr "He is in the Foreign Quarter, by the sea. You go, say Luca sent you. He will see you."

msgid "会首？我们的头。先问鬼。"
msgstr "The Guild Head? Our leader. Ask about the ghost first."

msgid "没有我们的地方了。"
msgstr "There is no place for us now."

msgid "就是这里。港口小，人多，各过各的。"
msgstr "It is here. Small harbor, many people, each keeps to himself."

msgid "海边。大秦人、天竺僧、倭人，都在那里，各过各的。远——玉螺湖村，出忘情谷，走海崖道。"
msgstr "By the sea. Daqin people, Indian monks, Wo people, all there, each keeps to himself. Far. Jade Conch Village, out of Forgetting Valley, then the Sea Cliff Road."

msgid "大秦"
msgstr "Daqin"

msgid "很远。西边的西边。我们是逃出来的人，不是使臣。剑会收我们，给饭吃。"
msgstr "Very far. The west of the west. We are people who ran away, not envoys. The Guild takes us in and gives us food."

msgid "会首。在番坊等我——等不到我，等到你也行。"
msgstr "The Guild Head. He waits for me in the Foreign Quarter. If I do not come, he can wait for you."

msgid "我们的会首。先问鬼。"
msgstr "Our Guild Head. Ask about the ghost first."

msgid "空了。"
msgstr "Empty now."

msgid "我们的会。剑、盾、饭，都是会里的。会首管。"
msgstr "Our Guild. Swords, shields, food, all belong to the Guild. The Guild Head decides."

msgid "假的。你知道。我知道。火也知道。"
msgstr "False. You know. I know. The fire knows."

msgid "冯禄走了。会首说，你欠的人情，我们记着。"
msgstr "Feng Lu is gone. The Guild Head said: the debt you owe us, we remember."

msgid "市舶司的那张纸。印是假的——会首看过，说那方镇国大将军的印不是真印盖的。可印是不是真的，不是我们说了算。"
msgstr "That paper from the Maritime Trade Office. The seal is false. The Guild Head looked, he says the Guardian General's seal was not stamped by the real seal. But whether the seal is real, we do not decide."

msgid "跟我走"
msgstr "Come with me"

msgid "让卢卡跟着你走——他会跟你去每一个地方，站在你这边打。要叫他跟上吗？"
msgstr "Have Luca follow you? He will go with you everywhere and fight on your side. Ask him to come along?"

msgid "不。"
msgstr "No."

msgid "把短剑挂上腰，站到你身边。"
msgstr " hangs the short sword at his waist and steps to your side."

msgid "会首说了：你去哪儿，我去哪儿。走。"
msgstr "The Guild Head said it: where you go, I go. Come."

msgid "会首没说。冯禄的事了了，再说。"
msgstr "The Guild Head did not say. When Feng Lu's matter is done, we talk again."

msgid "等我"
msgstr "Wait for me"

msgid "好。我在这儿等。"
msgstr "Good. I wait here."

msgid "等什么？"
msgstr "Wait for what?"

msgid "剑卖了。钱，够了。谢谢。"
msgstr "Sword sold. Money, enough. Thank you."

msgid "把钱数了一遍，点点头，把短剑连鞘递给你。"
msgstr " counts the money through once, nods, and hands you the short sword, scabbard and all."

msgid "好剑。别挂着，用它。"
msgstr "Good sword. Do not hang it up. Use it."

msgid "把钱数了一遍，点点头，把布上的短剑连鞘递给你。"
msgstr " counts the money through once, nods, and hands you the short sword from the cloth, scabbard and all."

msgid "好剑。别挂着，用它。——路费够了。我去番坊。"
msgstr "Good sword. Do not hang it up. Use it. ... Road money is enough. I go to the Foreign Quarter."

msgid "二十两。少了，不卖。"
msgstr "Twenty taels. Less, I do not sell."

msgid "不要。"
msgstr "Do not want."

msgid "看见你，站了起来。"
msgstr " sees you and stands up."

msgid "你来了。路，不近。"
msgstr "You came. The road is not near."

msgid "会首在里头。他知道你要来。"
msgstr "The Guild Head is inside. He knows you are coming."

msgid "坐在栈道头上，没有起身。"
msgstr " sits at the head of the plank road and does not get up."

msgid "你知道那文书是假的。"
msgstr "You know that paper is false."

msgid "看了一眼湖水，停住了脚。"
msgstr " looks once at the lake and stops short."

msgid "大秦人不会水。我在岸上等你。那东西上来了，我在这儿。"
msgstr "Daqin men do not swim. I wait for you on the shore. When that thing comes up, I am here."

msgid "站了起来，短剑出了鞘。"
msgstr " stands up, the short sword out of its scabbard."

msgid "上来了。我说过我在这儿。"
msgstr "It came up. I said I would be here."

msgid "卢卡看着海，没有说话。\n"
msgstr "Luca looks at the sea and says nothing.\n"

msgid "卢卡把短剑连鞘放在膝上，手按在上面。\n"
msgstr "Luca lays the short sword across his knees, scabbard and all, one hand pressed on it.\n"

msgid "卢卡跟在你身后，短剑挂在腰上。\n"
msgstr "Luca follows behind you, the short sword at his waist.\n"

msgid "卢卡说道：走。\n"
msgstr "Luca says: \"Go.\"\n"

msgid "卢卡靠着墙，等你。\n"
msgstr "Luca leans on the wall, waiting for you.\n"

msgid "一个穿毡袍的牧民，腰里系一条红布带，脚上是软底的皮靴。他赶了两匹马来卖，自己坐在栏边啃干肉。\n"
msgstr "A herdsman in a felt robe with a red cloth sash at his waist, soft-soled leather boots on his feet. He has driven two horses here to sell and sits by the pen gnawing dried meat.\n"

msgid "牧民啃了一口干肉，冲马栏里吹了声口哨。\n"
msgstr "The Herdsman takes a bite of dried meat and whistles at the horses in the pen.\n"

msgid "牧民说道：草原上的风，今年早。\n"
msgstr "The Herdsman says: \"The wind on the grassland came early this year.\"\n"

msgid "出了东门就是。往东走一天，有我们的帐篷；再往东，就是兵部圈的地了，别去。"
msgstr "Out the east gate and there it is. A day east, there are our tents; farther east is the land the Ministry of War fenced off. Don't go."

msgid "帐篷"
msgstr "Tents"

msgid "我们的帐篷在东门外。毡子做的，冬天暖，拆了就走。"
msgstr "Our tents are outside the east gate. Made of felt, warm in winter, and you take them down and go."

msgid "兵部的人在草原东边挖一座古冢。我们的老人说，那是不能动的地方——金乌的地方。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War's people are digging up an old tomb east of the grassland. Our old folks say that's a place you don't touch: the Golden Crow's place."

msgid "酒肆掌柜"
msgstr "Tavern Keeper"

msgid "一个高大的女人，袖子挽到肘，手里一把剁肉的刀。她说话嗓门大，不笑，可谁的酒碗空了她都看得见。\n"
msgstr "A tall woman, sleeves rolled to the elbow, a chopping knife in her hand. She talks loud and doesn't smile, but she sees every empty wine bowl in the house.\n"

msgid "胡三娘一刀剁下去，案板跳了一下。\n"
msgstr "Hu Sanniang brings the knife down, and the chopping block jumps.\n"

msgid "胡三娘说道：马奶酒三十文一囊，羊肉四十文一份，要就坐下。\n"
msgstr "Hu Sanniang says: \"Mare's-milk wine, thirty wen a skin. Mutton, forty wen a portion. Want it, sit down.\"\n"

msgid "马奶发的酒，酸，后劲大。三十文一囊。关里人头一口都皱眉，第二口就不皱了。"
msgstr "Wine fermented from mare's milk. Sour, and it hits hard afterward. Thirty wen a skin. Folk from inside the pass frown at the first mouthful; at the second they don't."

msgid "羊肉"
msgstr "Mutton"

msgid "手抓的，锅里现煮。四十文一份，管饱。"
msgstr "Eaten with the hands, cooked fresh in the pot. Forty wen a portion, and you'll be full."

msgid "墙根坐的那几个，都是等人的。等男人，等儿子。兵部的人押了壮丁去修官道——说是修官道。去了的一个没回来。"
msgstr "Those sitting along the wall are all waiting for someone. For a husband, for a son. The Ministry of War's people took the able-bodied men to build the official road. So they say. Nobody who went has come back."

msgid "草原东边。别去，兵部的人见了生面孔就拿。我这儿的酒客去了两个，都没回来。"
msgstr "East of the grassland. Don't go. The Ministry's people take any strange face they see. Two of my regulars went, and neither came back."

msgid "王爷"
msgstr "Prince"

msgid "王爷是好王爷，拒了兵部的令。可拒了令，人还是没了——王爷也只能在城门上贴张告示。"
msgstr "The Prince is a good Prince. He turned down the Ministry's order. But he turned it down and people still vanished. All the Prince can do is post a notice on the city gate."

msgid "一个瘦小的老妇人，裹着一件补了又补的毡袍，坐在墙根的板凳上，面前一碗马奶酒没动。她每过一会儿就看一眼门。\n"
msgstr "A small, thin old woman in a felt robe patched over and over, sitting on a bench by the wall with a bowl of kumis untouched in front of her. Every little while she glances at the door.\n"

msgid "秦婆子朝门口看了一眼，又低下头去。\n"
msgstr "Granny Qin glances toward the door, then lowers her head again.\n"

msgid "回来了。你看他坐在那儿，瘦得脱了形——是你开的牢门，他跟我说了一百遍。"
msgstr "He's back. Look at him sitting there, thin as a ghost. It was you who opened the cell door. He's told me a hundred times."

msgid "我家老秦。去年腊月让人押走的，说是修官道。车是往东边去的……到今天没回来。听说挖不动的人会让道士的车接走——我家老秦，腰不好。"
msgstr "My old man, Old Qin. Taken away last Twelfth Month, to build the official road, they said. The cart went east... and he hasn't come back to this day. I heard that those who can't dig anymore get taken off in the Daoists' cart. My Old Qin, his back's bad."

msgid "草原东边。我去过一回，栅栏外头站了一天，白衣的武官拿枪杆把我赶走了。"
msgstr "East of the grassland. I went once. Stood outside the fence a whole day, and an officer in white drove me off with the butt of his spear."

msgid "都回来了？营地那边说人都回来了。王爷的兵去的——这回王爷不光贴告示了。"
msgstr "All back? They say at the camp everybody's back. The Prince's soldiers went. This time the Prince did more than post a notice."

msgid "回来了四个。营地那边有人哭有人笑。我家老秦早回来了，我没资格说什么。"
msgstr "Four came back. At the camp some are crying and some are laughing. My Old Qin came back long ago, so I've no right to say anything."

msgid "关北的壮丁，一批一批。王爷拒了令，兵部就自己来人拿。"
msgstr "The able-bodied men of Beyond the Pass, batch after batch. The Prince turned down the order, so the Ministry sends its own men to take them."

msgid "一个半大的少年，瘦，眼睛很亮，手里攥着一根马鞭。他坐在老妇人身边，一会儿站起来一会儿坐下。\n"
msgstr "A half-grown boy, thin, with very bright eyes, gripping a horse whip. He sits by the old woman, now standing up, now sitting down.\n"

msgid "秦小六站起来，又让他娘按着坐下了。\n"
msgstr "Qin Xiaoliu stands up, and his mother pushes him back down.\n"

msgid "爹"
msgstr "Dad"

msgid "我爹回来了。他说是一个外乡人开的牢门——是你？"
msgstr "My dad's back. He said a stranger opened the cell door. Was it you?"

msgid "我爹让兵部的人押走了。我要去找他，我娘不让。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War's people took my dad away. I want to go find him, and Mom won't let me."

msgid "我去过一回，栅栏外头。白衣的武官不让近。里头在挖一个大坑，坑边上一排排的人戴着枷。"
msgstr "I went once, outside the fence. The officers in white wouldn't let me near. Inside they're digging a big pit, and along the edge there are rows of men wearing cangues."

msgid "逃回来的民夫"
msgstr "Laborer Who Ran Back"

msgid "一个瘦得脱了形的汉子，手腕上铁链磨出来的印子还没褪。他坐在酒肆的角落里，背靠着墙，看见生人进门就缩一下肩膀——然后看清是你，站了起来。\n"
msgstr "A man thin as a ghost, the marks of iron chains still on his wrists. He sits in a corner of the tavern with his back to the wall, and flinches when a stranger comes in the door. Then he sees it is you, and stands up.\n"

msgid "老秦摸了摸手腕上的印子。\n"
msgstr "Old Qin rubs the marks on his wrists.\n"

msgid "从墙角站起来，盯着你看了一会儿。"
msgstr " rises from the corner and stares at you for a while."

msgid "是你！开牢门的是你！——婆子，是这位恩人开的牢门。"
msgstr "It's you! You opened the cell door! Old woman, this is the one who opened the cell door. My savior."

msgid "那地方……我们七个人从工地让车拉走，到了那儿，三个进了丹房再没出来，四个关进地牢。后来又提走两个。你开了牢门，我和老赵才活着回来——老赵回他家去了，在草原上。"
msgstr "That place... Seven of us were hauled off from the work site in a cart. When we got there, three went into the elixir room and never came out, and four were shut in a dungeon. Later they took two more. You opened the cell and so Old Zhao and I got home alive. Old Zhao went back to his own people, out on the grassland."

msgid "听说了。王府的骑兵冲进去，把棚里的人全放了。那地方该踏平——我在那儿挖了三天，腰就废了。"
msgstr "Heard so. The Prince's riders charged in and let everyone in the sheds go. That place ought to be leveled. I dug there three days and my back's ruined."

msgid "听说夜里有人进去救了四个。四个……剩下四个还在那儿挖。换了我，也只能救四个。"
msgstr "Heard somebody went in at night and saved four. Four... the other four are still in there digging. If it were me, I could only save four too."

msgid "草原东边。白衣的武官督着挖一座古冢，挖不动的人，就让道士的车接走。我腰不好，第三天就让接走了。"
msgstr "East of the grassland. Officers in white watch over the digging of an old tomb, and those who can't dig anymore get taken off in the Daoists' cart. My back's bad. On the third day I was taken."

msgid "黑布蒙着的车，两个黑衣黑冠的道士押着。一路往南，过天驼关，到野羊山北麓。车里的人谁也不说话。"
msgstr "A cart covered in black cloth, two Daoists in black robes and black caps riding herd. The whole way south, through Camelback Pass, to the north foot of Goathill. Nobody in the cart said a word."

msgid "铁栅门，黑得看不见手。隔壁关着一个汉子，骂了半年没停过——后来听说是野羊山的大寨主。"
msgstr "An iron gate, so black you can't see your hand. In the next cell was a man who cursed for half a year without stopping. Later I heard he was the great chief of Goathill."

msgid "一个穿灰褐短袄、外罩皮甲的门军，腰刀，手按在刀柄上。他看你的眼神不凶，只是不让。\n"
msgstr "A gate guard in a gray-brown short jacket with leather armor over it, a saber at his waist, his hand on the hilt. His look isn't fierce. He just won't let you by.\n"

msgid "王府门军往门里看了一眼，又站直了。\n"
msgstr "The Prince's Gate Guard glances into the gate and stands straight again.\n"

msgid "进去吧。正厅，王爷在。"
msgstr "Go in. The main hall, the Prince is there."

msgid "信？拿着信去叩门。王爷等这封信等了半个月了。"
msgstr "A letter? Take it and knock. The Prince has waited half a month for this letter."

msgid "什么信？没凭据，王爷不见生人。"
msgstr "What letter? Without proof, the Prince doesn't see strangers."

msgid "老王爷在正厅。有凭据的进，没凭据的回。"
msgstr "The old Prince is in the main hall. With proof, in; without it, back."

msgid "凭据"
msgstr "Proof"

msgid "王府的令、县衙的信、王爷认识的人的话——有一样就行。空口无凭，回去吧。"
msgstr "An order from the Prince's house, a letter from the yamen, a word from someone the Prince knows. Any one of them will do. Words alone are no proof. Go back."

msgid "兵部的人来过一回，拿着文书要王爷交人。王爷把文书扔出了门。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War's people came once with papers demanding the Prince hand someone over. The Prince threw the papers out the gate."

msgid "六十六岁的老人，坐在交椅上背挺得笔直，头发全白了，眉毛也白了，眼睛却亮。一身灰布袍子，腰里一把刀，不是摆设。他说话直来直去，一句是一句，从不说「本王」。\n"
msgstr "A man of sixty-six, sitting bolt upright in his folding chair, hair all white, eyebrows white too, but his eyes bright. A plain gray cloth robe, a saber at his waist, and not for show. He talks straight, one thing at a time, and never says \"this prince.\"\n"

msgid "程朔把手里的文书往案上一放。\n"
msgstr "Cheng Shuo sets the papers in his hand down on the desk.\n"

msgid "程朔说道：关北的事，关北自己了。\n"
msgstr "Cheng Shuo says: \"What happens Beyond the Pass, Beyond the Pass settles.\"\n"

msgid "程朔把那封信又看了一遍，折好收进袖子里。\n"
msgstr "Cheng Shuo reads the letter through once more, folds it, and tucks it into his sleeve.\n"

msgid "程朔说道：不平这孩子，字还是那么瘦。\n"
msgstr "Cheng Shuo says: \"Buping. The boy's handwriting is as thin as ever.\"\n"

msgid "程朔把一封兵部的文书看了一眼，扔进火盆。\n"
msgstr "Cheng Shuo glances at a document from the Ministry of War and throws it into the brazier.\n"

msgid "程朔说道：兵部文书至：槐阳反。随他们说。\n"
msgstr "Cheng Shuo says: \"A paper from the Ministry of War: Huaiyang is in revolt. Let them say it.\"\n"

msgid "程朔看着厅外的天，没有说话。\n"
msgstr "Cheng Shuo looks at the sky beyond the hall and says nothing.\n"

msgid "程朔说道：夜里的事，王府不知道。\n"
msgstr "Cheng Shuo says: \"What happened in the night, the House does not know.\"\n"

msgid "接过信，拆开，看了很久。"
msgstr " takes the letter, opens it, and reads for a long time."

msgid "不平的字。兵部的印是真的，令不是先帝的——我早说了，没人听。"
msgstr "Buping's hand. The Ministry's seal is real, but the order is not the late Emperor's. I said so long ago. No one listened."

msgid "他说你从逆灵宫一路追过来，带着文书、抄本，还有人证。好。关北欠你一顿饭。"
msgstr "He says you chased this all the way from the Black Palace, and brought papers, a copy, and witnesses. Good. Beyond the Pass owes you a meal."

msgid "你要找的人在草原东边：兵部圈了地，三千民夫在挖一座古冢，说是修官道。挖不动的人，一辆道士的车接走。我的告示贴了，人还是没了——他们拿的是兵部的印，我的兵拦不住朝廷的印。"
msgstr "The people you seek are east of the grassland. The Ministry has fenced off land, and three thousand laborers are digging up an ancient barrow, called building an official road. Those who cannot dig are taken away in a Daoists' cart. I posted my notice, and still people vanish. They carry the Ministry's seal, and my soldiers cannot stop the court's seal."

msgid "要动那块地，两条路：借我的兵踏平它，或者让郭承带你夜里进去。你自己想，想好了开口。"
msgstr "To move on that ground there are two roads: borrow my soldiers and level it, or let Guo Cheng take you in by night. Think it over yourself, and speak when you have decided."

msgid "钱留着。关北不缺这个。"
msgstr "Keep your money. Beyond the Pass does not lack for it."

msgid "这是什么？"
msgstr "What is this?"

msgid "东西留着。信呢？"
msgstr "Keep the thing. Where is the letter?"

msgid "借兵"
msgstr "Borrow Soldiers"

msgid "借槐阳王的兵踏平工地——救下所有人，可兵部会以此定关北「反」。要借吗？"
msgstr "Borrow the Prince of Huaiyang's soldiers and level the work site: everyone is saved, but the Ministry of War will use it to brand Beyond the Pass \"rebel.\" Borrow them?"

msgid "兵已经给你了。郭承在校场点人，六骑够了——多了反而是反。"
msgstr "The soldiers are yours already. Guo Cheng is picking men at the drill ground. Six riders are enough; more would only make it a rebellion."

msgid "你和郭承说好了夜里去。那就夜里去——兵不动。两头都要，哪头都做不成。"
msgstr "You and Guo Cheng agreed on going by night. Then go by night, and the soldiers stay put. Take both roads and you will walk neither."

msgid "看了你很久，站起来，把刀从椅旁拿下来又放回去。"
msgstr " looks at you for a long moment, stands, takes his saber from beside the chair, and puts it back."

msgid "踏平了，工地上的人一个不少。可兵部的文书第二天就到京师：槐阳王反了。皇帝十六岁，先听到的是这句。"
msgstr "Level it, and not one man is missing from the work site. But the Ministry's papers will reach the Capital the next day: the Prince of Huaiyang has revolted. The Emperor is sixteen, and that is the sentence he will hear first."

msgid "你想好了。那就借。郭承，六骑，听他的。——去校场找郭承。"
msgstr "You have decided. Then borrow them. Guo Cheng, six riders, they obey him. Go to the drill ground and find Guo Cheng."

msgid "信还没到我手里，谈什么兵。"
msgstr "The letter is not yet in my hand. Why speak of soldiers?"

msgid "二十年没见的弟弟。他昨天才到——说你在水烟阁替他守了口。关北欠你的，不止一顿饭。"
msgstr "A younger brother I have not seen in twenty years. He came only yesterday, and said you kept his secret at Waterfog Pavilion. Beyond the Pass owes you more than a meal."

msgid "水烟阁来信，说我弟弟装死二十年的事让人告到长老会去了。……他不会来关北了。你不必说是谁告的，我不想知道。"
msgstr "A letter from Waterfog Pavilion says it has been reported to the Elders that my brother feigned death for twenty years. ... He will not be coming Beyond the Pass. You need not say who reported it. I do not wish to know."

msgid "我弟弟？他随母姓，入了江湖，二十年没音信。不提。"
msgstr "My brother? He took our mother's name and went into the jianghu. Twenty years without word. I will not speak of it."

msgid "我侄子。读书读得太多，当官当得太清。他写信来，是真急了。"
msgstr "My nephew. He has read too many books and been too clean an official. If he wrote, he was truly worried."

msgid "兵部去年发令：征三千民夫修官道，寻剑。先帝的令只说寻剑，没说征人——我不接。他们就自己来人，拿着文书到关北拿人。我拦不住朝廷的印，只能贴告示。"
msgstr "Last year the Ministry issued an order: raise three thousand laborers to build an official road and seek the sword. The late Emperor's order said only to seek the sword, not to raise people. I did not accept. So they came themselves, papers in hand, and seized people Beyond the Pass. I cannot stop the court's seal, so I can only post notices."

msgid "踏平了。工地上的人一个不少，兵部的文书今早到了：槐阳反。随他们说——帽子扣不死人。"
msgstr "Leveled. Not one man missing from the work site, and the Ministry's papers came this morning: Huaiyang is in revolt. Let them say it. A hat does not kill a man."

msgid "夜里的事王府不知道。白天工地还在，剩下的四个还在挖——这笔账先记着。"
msgstr "What happened in the night, the House does not know. By day the work site is still there, and the four left behind are still digging. That account is written down for later."

msgid "草原东边，东门出去过了帐篷营地再往东。白衣的武官督着，一个姓吕的监工管账。挖的是一座古冢——老人说那是金乌的地方，不能动。"
msgstr "East of the grassland, out the east gate, past the tent camp, and farther east. Officers in white oversee it, and an overseer named Lu keeps the accounts. They dig an ancient barrow. The old folk say it is the Golden Crow's place and must not be touched."

msgid "草原东边。你是外乡人，别去。"
msgstr "East of the grassland. You are a stranger. Do not go."

msgid "老人说那是金乌的地方，不能动。兵部那位尚书信商句遗书末两句指的是北边的旧地——挖得动他就挖，挖不动的人，他送给道士。"
msgstr "The old folk say that is the Golden Crow's place and must not be touched. The Minister of War there believes the last two lines of Shang Ju's testament point to an old place in the north. If it can be dug, he digs; those who cannot dig, he gives to the Daoists."

msgid "不奉诏"
msgstr "Defy the Edict"

msgid "不奉诏？先帝的令只说寻剑。征人、拿人的令，我不接。扣什么帽子随他们——帽子扣不死人，民夫的枷才扣死人。"
msgstr "Defy the edict? The late Emperor's order said only to seek the sword. An order to raise people and seize people, I do not accept. Let them pin what hat they like. A hat does not kill a man. A laborer's cangue does."

msgid "潜入"
msgstr "Slip In"

msgid "郭承的事郭承办。夜里的事王府不知道——你也记住这句。"
msgstr "Guo Cheng's business, Guo Cheng does. What happens in the night, the House does not know. Remember that line yourself."

msgid "兵都借了，还潜什么。踏过去。"
msgstr "The soldiers are lent already. Why slip in? Ride over it."

msgid "郭承在校场。夜里的事找他说，别找我——王府不知道。"
msgstr "Guo Cheng is at the drill ground. Speak to him of what happens in the night, not to me. The House does not know."

msgid "你说什么？"
msgstr "What did you say?"

msgid "骑兵"
msgstr "Riders"

msgid "关北的骑兵欠你一阵。要用的时候，你开口——不是六骑，是关北所有的马。"
msgstr "Beyond the Pass's riders owe you one battle. When you need them, speak. Not six riders: every horse Beyond the Pass has."

msgid "关北的马好，关北的骑兵也好。没仗打，他们在校场劈木人。"
msgstr "Beyond the Pass has good horses and good riders. With no battle to fight, they chop wooden dummies at the drill ground."

msgid "从交椅上站起来。"
msgstr " rises from the folding chair."

msgid "郭承回来了，六骑一个不少，八个人也一个不少。兵部的文书今早到了：槐阳反。随他们说。"
msgstr "Guo Cheng is back. Six riders, not one missing, and all eight men too. The Ministry's papers came this morning: Huaiyang is in revolt. Let them say it."

msgid "关北的骑兵欠你一阵。要用的时候，你开口。"
msgstr "Beyond the Pass's riders owe you one battle. When you need them, speak."

msgid "看了你一眼，又看了看厅外。"
msgstr " looks at you, then out the hall."

msgid "郭承说夜里救出来四个。四个就四个——另外四个的名字，王府记着。"
msgstr "Guo Cheng says four were brought out in the night. Four it is. The names of the other four, the House keeps."

msgid "夜里的事，王府不知道。你也不知道。"
msgstr "What happened in the night, the House does not know. Neither do you."

msgid "王府骁将"
msgstr "Prince's Champion"

msgid "一个高个子，皮甲，马刀，脸让风沙吹得黑红，左边眉毛上一道疤。他练刀的时候不说话，说话的时候不多说一个字。\n"
msgstr "A tall man in leather armor with a saber, his face weathered dark red by wind and sand, a scar through his left eyebrow. He says nothing when he trains, and when he speaks, not a word more than needed.\n"

msgid "郭承一刀劈在木人肩上，木屑飞起来。\n"
msgstr "Guo Cheng's saber chops into a wooden dummy's shoulder, and splinters fly.\n"

msgid "郭承喝道：撩！不是砍！马上没有砍的工夫。\n"
msgstr "Guo Cheng shouts: \"Sweep! Don't chop! On a horse there's no time to chop.\"\n"

msgid "郭承的马刀一撩一劈，不带花样。\n"
msgstr "Guo Cheng's saber sweeps up and chops down, no frills.\n"

msgid "郭承喝道：撩他的肩！\n"
msgstr "Guo Cheng shouts: \"Sweep for his shoulder!\"\n"

msgid "郭承跟在你身后，手一直按着刀柄。\n"
msgstr "Guo Cheng follows behind you, one hand always on his hilt.\n"

msgid "郭承说道：走。\n"
msgstr "Guo Cheng says: \"Go.\"\n"

msgid "郭承在校场边看骑兵劈木人，看一会儿，说一句：撩，不是砍。\n"
msgstr "Guo Cheng watches the riders chop dummies at the edge of the drill ground, and every so often says: \"Sweep, don't chop.\"\n"

msgid "把刀插回鞘里，冲校场上的兵吼了一声，六个人应声出列。"
msgstr " sheathes his saber and bellows at the soldiers on the drill ground, and six men step out of the ranks at his shout."

msgid "王爷的话到了：六骑听你的。马在东门外的营地——我跟你走。到了工地，你一句话，我们就冲。"
msgstr "The Prince's word has come: the six riders answer to you. The horses are in the camp outside the east gate. I go with you. At the work site, one word from you and we charge."

msgid "守夜的两个在火边。开枷的工夫别出声——开一个走一个。"
msgstr "The two on night watch are by the fire. While we open the cangues, no noise. Open one, send one running."

msgid "把刀上的血在守夜武官的白衣上擦了，看了一眼棚里剩下的四个人，又看了你一眼。"
msgstr " wipes the blood from his saber on a night watchman's white robe, looks at the four left in the shed, and then at you."

msgid "走！帐篷里的醒了。救不完的别回头——这话我说过。"
msgstr "Go! The tent folk are awake. Those we can't save, don't look back. I told you that."

msgid "我回校场。夜里的事，王爷那边我去说——你别跟来。"
msgstr "I go back to the drill ground. About the night's business, I will speak to the Prince myself. Do not follow."

msgid "把马刀插回鞘里，看着最后一副枷锁落在土里。"
msgstr " slides his saber back into its sheath and watches the last cangue drop into the dirt."

msgid "六骑我带回校场。这一阵打完了，王爷那边我去回话——下一阵，你开口。"
msgstr "I take the six riders back to the drill ground. This round is done. I will report to the Prince. The next round, you speak."

msgid "你就是把野羊寨的霍铮从逆灵宫地牢里背出来的那个？关北有两个从那地牢逃回来的民夫，跟他关过一个牢——他们认得你。"
msgstr "You're the one who carried Huo Zheng of Goathill Stockade out of the Black Palace dungeon? Two laborers who got back from that dungeon are in Beyond the Pass, shared a cell with him. They know you."

msgid "听说你在野羊山追一个道士，回头的时候地牢里的人没了。……这回到了工地，先救人。"
msgstr "I heard you chased a Daoist on Goathill, and when you looked back the dungeon was empty... This time, at the work site, save people first."

msgid "带郭承夜里潜入工地——救得几个算几个，王府干净。要这么做吗？"
msgstr "Take Guo Cheng into the work site by night: save as many as you can, and the House stays clean. Do it this way?"

msgid "说好了，夜里。跟紧我，别出声。"
msgstr "Agreed, at night. Stay close behind me and make no noise."

msgid "王爷点了兵，那就白天踏过去。不用潜。"
msgstr "The Prince has called out the soldiers, so we go over it by day. No need to slip in."

msgid "看了你一眼，点点头。"
msgstr " glances at you and nods."

msgid "夜里。兵部的人白天醒着，夜里只留两个守夜。东门外帐篷营地的篝火边等到天黑，我带你进去——救得几个算几个，救不完的别回头。"
msgstr "At night. The Ministry's men are awake by day and leave only two on watch at night. Wait by the campfire in the tent camp outside the east gate until dark, and I will take you in. Save as many as we can; those we can't, don't look back."

msgid "王府不知道这件事。你也不知道。"
msgstr "The House does not know of this. Neither do you."

msgid "你是谁？王爷还没见你。"
msgstr "Who are you? The Prince has not seen you yet."

msgid "六骑。马在东门外。"
msgstr "Six riders. The horses are outside the east gate."

msgid "说好了潜，就不借兵。两头都要的人两头都空。"
msgstr "You agreed to slip in, so no soldiers. A man who wants both roads ends with neither."

msgid "兵是王爷的，你去问王爷。"
msgstr "The soldiers are the Prince's. Ask the Prince."

msgid "踏平了。八个人都回营地了。兵部的文书明天到京师——王爷知道。"
msgstr "Leveled. All eight are back in the camp. The Ministry's papers reach the Capital tomorrow. The Prince knows."

msgid "四个。另外四个的名字你记着就行，别再去。白天他们加了岗，夜里加了双岗。"
msgstr "Four. The names of the other four, you keep in mind, and don't go again. By day they've added guards; by night, double guards."

msgid "草原东边。栅栏、营帐、民夫棚、土方，最里头是古冢口。白衣武官六七个，一个队长，一个监工。白天别靠近。"
msgstr "East of the grassland. A fence, tents, the laborers' sheds, the earthworks, and at the far end the mouth of the old barrow. Six or seven officers in white, one captain, one overseer. Stay away by day."

msgid "兵部的人在关北拿人，拿的是王爷的子民。王爷不让动手，我们就看着。看了半年了。"
msgstr "The Ministry's people seize people in Beyond the Pass, and they are the Prince's people. The Prince says no hands raised, so we watch. We've watched half a year."

msgid "关北的马刀，马上使的。撩，不是砍。等这事了了，我给你一册刀谱（问我「刀谱」）。"
msgstr "The Frontier saber, for use from horseback. Sweep, don't chop. When this business is done, I'll give you a saber manual (ask me about the \"Manual\")."

msgid "骁将"
msgstr "Champion"

msgid "王府的骁将有七个，去乔阴县衙帮不平公子的那几个也是。我管校场。"
msgstr "The Prince's house has seven champions, and the ones who went to Tallshade's yamen to help Master Buping were from among them. I run the drill ground."

msgid "刀谱"
msgstr "Manual"

msgid "刀谱给你了。撩，不是砍——自己练。"
msgstr "The manual's yours. Sweep, don't chop. Practice it yourself."

msgid "从怀里掏出一册翻得起毛的小册子，递给你。"
msgstr " pulls a small booklet, fuzzy at the edges from turning, from inside his coat and hands it to you."

msgid "《马刀谱》。关北的刀，马上使的七招。事了了，说话算话。"
msgstr "\"Cavalry Saber Manual.\" Seven moves of the Beyond the Pass blade, for use from horseback. Business done, my word is kept."

msgid "《马刀谱》。救了四个，也是救。拿着——另外四个的名字，你记着就行。"
msgstr "\"Cavalry Saber Manual.\" Saving four is still saving. Take it. The names of the other four, you keep in mind."

msgid "等这事了了，我给你一册刀谱——现在没工夫。"
msgstr "When this business is done, I'll give you a saber manual. No time now."

msgid "一个王府的侍卫，皮甲，马刀，站在交椅一侧，眼睛看着门口。\n"
msgstr "A guardsman of the Prince's house in leather armor with a saber, standing to one side of the chair, his eyes on the door.\n"

msgid "侍卫的手在刀柄上换了个位置。\n"
msgstr "The Guardsman shifts his hand on the hilt.\n"

msgid "王爷在上面。有话直说，王爷不爱绕。"
msgstr "The Prince is up there. Say what you came to say. The Prince doesn't like talk in circles."

msgid "兵部的人上回来，王爷把文书扔出了门。我们没动手——王爷不让。"
msgstr "The last time the Ministry's people came, the Prince threw their papers out the door. We didn't lift a hand. The Prince doesn't allow it."

msgid "一个干瘦的老头，灰袍子，手里一本账，耳朵上夹着一支笔。他是王府唯一不带刀的人。\n"
msgstr "A dried-up old man in a gray robe with an account book in his hand and a brush stuck behind his ear. He is the only man in the Prince's house who carries no blade.\n"

msgid "管家在账上划了一笔，叹了口气。\n"
msgstr "The Steward strikes a line through the book and sighs.\n"

msgid "管家说道：又少了一村的壮丁，今年的马料谁割。\n"
msgstr "The Steward says: \"Another village short of men. Who's going to cut this year's horse fodder?\"\n"

msgid "王爷在正厅。王爷不爱排场，你有话直说。"
msgstr "The Prince is in the main hall. The Prince doesn't care for show. Say what you have to say."

msgid "账上去年少了三百四十一个壮丁。三百四十一个，我一个个记的名字。"
msgstr "The books show three hundred forty-one able-bodied men short since last year. Three hundred forty-one. I wrote each name myself."

msgid "账"
msgstr "Accounts"

msgid "王府的账，马、草、人。人那一页最难记。"
msgstr "The house's accounts: horses, fodder, people. The page for people is the hardest to keep."

msgid "一个王府的兵，光着膀子练刀，皮甲放在木人脚下。他的刀法只有两式：撩，劈。\n"
msgstr "A soldier of the Prince's house, bare-chested, drilling with his saber, his leather armor lying at the foot of the dummy. He has only two strokes: sweep and chop.\n"

msgid "王府兵一刀撩在木人肩上。\n"
msgstr "The Prince's Soldier sweeps his saber up onto the dummy's shoulder.\n"

msgid "王府兵喘着气说道：郭将军，再来一遍？\n"
msgstr "The Prince's Soldier says, panting: \"General Guo, one more time?\"\n"

msgid "郭将军。刀最快的一个。他说马上没有砍的工夫，只有撩。"
msgstr "General Guo. The fastest blade of anyone. He says on a horse there's no time to chop, only to sweep."

msgid "草原东边。我们想去，王爷不让。兵部的印，拿去了就是反。"
msgstr "East of the grassland. We want to go, but the Prince won't allow it. The Ministry's seal, once it's taken, makes it a rebellion."

msgid "南危水是当世使剑的名家，也是槐阳王的弟弟，一身武学集天邪、封山\n两派之所长，在水烟阁七长老中武功仅次于二长老莫谦容。南危水手中\n的焦殇剑也是一把罕见的利器，传说这把剑是名铸剑师黄炎炎生平六把\n名剑中排名第一的杰作。\n他站在兄长的交椅旁，二十年没站过的地方。\n"
msgstr "Nan Weishui is the greatest swordsman of his age and also the brother of the Prince of Huaiyang, his martial arts the best of the Wayward and Empty Mountain Schools together. Among the seven elders of Waterfog Pavilion, only the Second Elder, Mo Qianrong, is his better. The Sorrowfire sword in his hand is a rare weapon too, said to be the finest of the six famous swords made in the master smith Huang Yanyan's lifetime.\nHe stands beside his brother's chair, a place he has not stood in twenty years.\n"

msgid "南危水看着厅外的天，没有说话。\n"
msgstr "Nan Weishui looks at the sky beyond the hall and says nothing.\n"

msgid "从交椅上站起来，看着弟弟。"
msgstr " rises from the folding chair and looks at his younger brother."

msgid "危水。二十年。"
msgstr "Weishui. Twenty years."

msgid "大哥。山洞里替我挡刀的那个人，我还没找到他家里人。"
msgstr "Big brother. The man who took the blade for me in that cave, I still haven't found his family."

msgid "找。关北帮你找。"
msgstr "Then look. Beyond the Pass will help you look."

msgid "转过头来看你。"
msgstr " turns to look at you."

msgid "这位替你守了二十年的口。——坐下说话。"
msgstr "This is the one who kept your secret for twenty years. ... Sit down. We talk."

msgid "老夫便是五长老。在这儿，老夫只是程朔的弟弟。"
msgstr "This old man is the Fifth Elder. Here, this old man is only Cheng Shuo's brother."

msgid "我大哥。二十年没见，他白了头，脾气一点没改。"
msgstr "My big brother. Twenty years unseen, his hair has gone white and his temper has not changed one bit."

msgid "老夫都说了。阿岭的家里人，大哥答应帮我找。"
msgstr "This old man has told it all. A-Ling's family: my brother has promised to help me find them."

msgid "多谢。老夫能站在这儿，是你的功劳——要不是你守着口，水烟阁的信先到，大哥就得先听到我死而复生的事。"
msgstr "Thank you. This old man can stand here because of you. Had you not kept the secret, Waterfog Pavilion's letter would have come first, and my brother would have heard first that I came back from the dead."

msgid "大哥的兵一动，关北就是反。你想清楚再开口——想清楚了，老夫不拦你。"
msgstr "When my brother's soldiers move, Beyond the Pass is in revolt. Think it through before you speak. If you have thought it through, this old man will not stop you."

msgid "郭承是好手。夜里的事老夫不掺和——老夫的脸在兵部那儿是死人的脸，露不得。"
msgstr "Guo Cheng is a fine hand. This old man will not mix in what happens at night. To the Ministry of War this old man's face is a dead man's face, and must not be seen."

msgid "老夫路过时看了一眼。白衣武官——和二十年前老松岭瀑布前的是同一身衣裳。"
msgstr "This old man passed by and looked once. The officers in white wear the very same clothes that stood before the waterfall at Old Pine Ridge twenty years ago."

msgid "兵部监工"
msgstr "Ministry Overseer"

msgid "一个穿青袍的中年人，腰里别着算盘，手里一本名册，名册的边让手汗浸黑了。他不穿白衣，不是武官，可武官都听他的——他管账，也管谁挖不动了往哪儿送。\n"
msgstr "A middle-aged man in a blue-green robe, an abacus tucked in his belt, a name roll in his hand, its edges blackened by sweat. He wears no white and is no officer, yet all the officers obey him. He keeps the accounts, and he decides where those who can't dig anymore are sent.\n"

msgid "吕隼翻了一页名册，用笔在一个名字上划了一道。\n"
msgstr "Lu Sun turns a page of the roll and strikes a line through one name with his brush.\n"

msgid "吕隼说道：今天的土方，少一筐扣一顿饭。\n"
msgstr "Lu Sun says: \"Today's earthwork: one basket short, one meal docked.\"\n"

msgid "吕隼叫道：拿下！兵部的工地动手就是反！\n"
msgstr "Lu Sun cries: \"Seize them! Raising a hand at a Ministry work site is rebellion!\"\n"

msgid "兵部的工地，闲人免进。要找人，拿兵部的文书来。"
msgstr "A Ministry of War work site. No idlers. To look for someone, bring papers from the Ministry."

msgid "数了数棚前的人，又翻了一页名册。"
msgstr " counts the people in front of the sheds and turns another page of the roll."

msgid "少了四个。兵部要我补。……你昨夜在哪儿？"
msgstr "Four short. The Ministry wants me to make it up. ... Where were you last night?"

msgid "从名册上抬起头，看见你身后的人，手停了。"
msgstr " looks up from the roll, sees who is behind you, and his hand stops."

msgid "兵部的工地，闲人——"
msgstr "A Ministry of War work site. No idlers--"

msgid "把刀抽出半截。"
msgstr " draws his saber halfway."

msgid "王府的人。"
msgstr "The Prince's men."

msgid "拿下！"
msgstr "Seize them!"

msgid "六个白衣武官抽了剑围上来。栅栏外马蹄声炸响——王府的六骑冲了进来！\n"
msgstr "Six officers in white draw their swords and close in. Hoofbeats burst outside the fence: the Prince's six riders charge in!\n"

msgid "二十年前就该把你们这些人都料理干净。"
msgstr "Twenty years ago all of you should have been cleaned up."

msgid "吕隼把名册塞进怀里，拔了刀。\n"
msgstr "Lu Sun stuffs the roll inside his coat and draws his saber.\n"

msgid "吕隼捂着伤口，不敢抬头。\n"
msgstr "Lu Sun clutches his wound and dares not raise his head.\n"

msgid "吕隼低声道：我只是管账的……\n"
msgstr "Lu Sun says in a low voice: \"I only keep the accounts...\"\n"

msgid "修官道是幌子。挖的是那座土丘——尚书大人要里头的东西。挖不动的人，宫里的车来接，我只管在名册上划一道。"
msgstr "The official road is a cover. What they dig is that mound. His Lordship the Minister wants what is inside. Those who can't dig, the carts from the Palace come for, and I only strike a line in the roll."

msgid "兵部修官道。征的是民夫，发的是口粮——有文书的。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War is building an official road. Laborers raised, rations issued. There are papers for it."

msgid "十一批。前十批挖不动的七个，交了逆灵宫。名册上都有……都有。"
msgstr "Eleven batches. Of the first ten, seven couldn't dig and were handed to the Black Palace. It's all in the roll... all of it."

msgid "兵部征的，王府不认，可文书是真的。你要人，去京师找兵部要。"
msgstr "The Ministry raised them. The Prince's house doesn't recognize it, but the papers are genuine. If you want the men, go to the Capital and ask the Ministry."

msgid "古冢？那是土丘。兵部修路，土丘碍事，挖平了。"
msgstr "An ancient barrow? That's a mound. The Ministry is building a road, the mound is in the way, and it's being leveled."

msgid "兵部尚书大人的令。我一个监工，令怎么说我怎么做。"
msgstr "The Minister of War's order. I am an overseer. Whatever the order says, I do."

msgid "宫里的车。文书上写「代为收管」……收管到哪儿去，我不敢问。"
msgstr "The Palace's carts. The papers say \"taken in and held on our behalf\"... Held where, I dare not ask."

msgid "什么宫？没听过。"
msgstr "What palace? Never heard of it."

msgid "尚书大人……你怎么知道这名字？是他的令，是他的印。印是真的！我亲眼见过他盖印。"
msgstr "His Lordship the Minister... How do you know that name? His order, his seal. The seal is real! I saw him stamp it myself."

msgid "夜里闹过之后，宫里的车把两个挖不动的接走了。少了四个，兵部要我补——补不上，就是我的名字上名册。"
msgstr "After the trouble in the night, the Palace's carts took two who couldn't dig. Four short, and the Ministry wants me to make it up. If I can't, it is my name that goes on the roll."

msgid "宫里的车。挖不动的人上车，车往南去，去哪儿我不问。"
msgstr "The Palace's carts. Those who can't dig get on, the cart goes south, and where, I do not ask."

msgid "车？运土的车。"
msgstr "A cart? For hauling dirt."

msgid "白衣武官队长"
msgstr "Captain in White"

msgid "一个白衣的武官，比旁人高半个头，腰悬长剑，剑穗是黑的。他站着不动的时候像一根旗杆。白衣的左襟上绣着一只三足乌——和你在逆灵宫见过的腰牌是一样的记号。\n"
msgstr "An officer in white, half a head taller than the rest, a long sword at his waist with a black tassel. Standing still, he is like a flagpole. On the left lapel of his white robe is embroidered a three-legged crow, the same mark as on the waist token you saw in the Black Palace.\n"

msgid "裴照的手搭在剑柄上，眼睛扫过栅栏外的草原。\n"
msgstr "Pei Zhao rests his hand on his sword hilt, his eyes sweeping the grassland beyond the fence.\n"

msgid "裴照冷冷道：王府的人也敢动兵部的差。\n"
msgstr "Pei Zhao says coldly: \"The Prince's men dare lay hands on a Ministry officer.\"\n"

msgid "裴照的剑出了鞘。\n"
msgstr "Pei Zhao's sword leaves its scabbard.\n"

msgid "裴照靠着栅栏，看着自己的剑。\n"
msgstr "Pei Zhao leans against the fence, looking at his own sword.\n"

msgid "白衣"
msgstr "White"

msgid "朝廷的武官穿白。二十年前这身衣裳就在关北走过一趟——你听谁说的？"
msgstr "Court officers wear white. Twenty years ago this very robe walked through Beyond the Pass once. Who told you that?"

msgid "兵部的差。闲人免进。"
msgstr "The Ministry's business. No idlers."

msgid "二十年"
msgstr "Twenty Years"

msgid "……抄本？那二十三个人是我的前辈。他们没找到，我们找。"
msgstr "... The copy? Those twenty-three men were my predecessors. They did not find it. We will."

msgid "二十年前的事，与你无关。"
msgstr "What happened twenty years ago is no concern of yours."

msgid "三足乌"
msgstr "Three-legged Crow"

msgid "兵部的记号。问多了没好处。"
msgstr "The Ministry's mark. Asking more will do you no good."

msgid "一个身着白衣的朝廷武官，腰悬长剑，站得笔直。白衣下摆沾着黄土。\n"
msgstr "A court officer in white, a long sword at his waist, standing very straight. The hem of his white robe is stained with yellow dust.\n"

msgid "白衣武官盯着你，手按在剑柄上。\n"
msgstr "The Officer in White stares at you, a hand on his sword hilt.\n"

msgid "兵部的差，闲人免进。"
msgstr "Ministry business. No idlers."

msgid "兵部征的。有文书。"
msgstr "Raised by the Ministry. There are papers."

msgid "一个身着白衣的朝廷武官，剑已出鞘，白衣上溅了土。\n"
msgstr "A court officer in white, his sword drawn, his white robe spattered with dirt.\n"

msgid "白衣武官喝道：兵部办差，拦者死！\n"
msgstr "The Officer in White shouts: \"Ministry business! Stand in the way and die!\"\n"

msgid "一个白衣武官坐在火边，剑横在膝上，脑袋一点一点地打盹。火快灭了。\n"
msgstr "An officer in white sits by the fire, his sword across his knees, his head nodding in a doze. The fire is nearly out.\n"

msgid "守夜武官的头点了一下，又抬起来，往火里添了根柴。\n"
msgstr "The Night-Watch Officer's head dips, comes up again, and he adds a stick to the fire.\n"

msgid "一个白衣武官，剑在手里，眼睛还带着刚醒的红。\n"
msgstr "An officer in white, sword in hand, his eyes still red from sleep.\n"

msgid "守夜武官大叫：有贼！来人！\n"
msgstr "The Night-Watch Officer yells: \"Thieves! Up!\"\n"

msgid "守夜武官喝道：王府的人？！\n"
msgstr "The Night-Watch Officer shouts: \"The Prince's men?!\"\n"

msgid "被征的民夫"
msgstr "Conscripted Laborer"

msgid "一个黑瘦的汉子，脖子上套着木枷，枷上的铁环拴在桩上。手掌全是血泡，肩膀磨破了。他抬眼看了看你，又低下头。\n"
msgstr "A dark, thin man with a wooden cangue on his neck, its iron ring chained to a stake. His palms are all blisters, his shoulders rubbed raw. He lifts his eyes to look at you, then lowers them.\n"

msgid "民夫把枷挪了挪，脖子上磨出的血痂又裂了。\n"
msgstr "The Laborer shifts the cangue, and the scab on his neck splits open again.\n"

msgid "民夫低声道：挖不动了……下一车就是我。\n"
msgstr "The Laborer says in a low voice: \"Can't dig anymore... the next cart's me.\"\n"

msgid "枷"
msgstr "Cangue"

msgid "夜里锁着，白天开了挖土。挖不动的，车来接——接走的没有回来过。"
msgstr "Locked at night, opened by day for digging. Those who can't dig, the cart comes. None that were taken have come back."

msgid "棚柱上钉着。划了道的，是上车走了的。"
msgstr "Nailed to the shed post. The ones with a line through them got on the cart and left."

msgid "监工。他不打人，他划名册。划一道，人就没了。"
msgstr "The overseer. He doesn't beat anyone, he strikes names. One line, and the man is gone."

msgid "说是修官道。修官道往土丘里挖什么？挖出来的都是灰白的老土和碎陶。"
msgstr "They say it's for the official road. What does a road need dug out of a mound for? What comes out is gray-white old earth and broken pottery."

msgid "一个瘦得脱了形的汉子，靠在车轮上，枷倒是摘了——挖不动的人用不着枷。他的眼睛看着土丘，不看人。\n"
msgstr "A man thin as a ghost, leaning on a cart wheel. His cangue has been taken off; a man who can't dig doesn't need one. His eyes are on the mound, not on people.\n"

msgid "挖不动的民夫咳了一阵，咳出一口带土的痰。\n"
msgstr "The Spent Laborer coughs for a while and brings up a mouthful of phlegm with dirt in it.\n"

msgid "道士的车。说送俺们回家……挖不动的都这么走的，没一个回来。"
msgstr "The Daoists' cart. Said it takes us home... Everyone who can't dig goes that way, and not one has come back."

msgid "家"
msgstr "Home"

msgid "关北。营地里有俺婆娘。你要是去，别说看见俺。"
msgstr "Beyond the Pass. My wife is in the camp. If you go, don't say you saw me."

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，袖子挽到肘上，手里一根鞭子。他看一眼车上的油布，又看一眼土丘的口子，像在等什么。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap, sleeves rolled to the elbows, a whip in his hand. He looks at the tarp on the cart, then at the gash in the mound, as if waiting for something.\n"

msgid "押车道士往车上的油布瞥了一眼，拿鞭子把一角压好。\n"
msgstr "The Cart Escort Daoist glances at the tarp on the cart and presses a corner down with his whip.\n"

msgid "兵部交办，收管逃役。车上的事，问兵部去。"
msgstr "Handed over by the Ministry of War, to take in and hold runaways. About what is on the cart, ask the Ministry."

msgid "……施主从哪儿听来的名字？"
msgstr "... Where did you hear that name, Benefactor?"

msgid "挖不动的"
msgstr "Those Who Can't Dig"

msgid "兵部说修官道要人；不中用的，宫里替他们收管。慈悲。"
msgstr "The Ministry says the official road needs men. Those who are no use, the Palace takes in and holds on their behalf. Mercy."

msgid "那门？兵部的人凿了半年。凿不开的东西，自有开得了的人。"
msgstr "That door? The Ministry's men chiseled at it for half a year. What cannot be opened by those has someone who can open it."

msgid "一个王府的骑兵，皮甲马刀，脸让风吹得黑红，刀还在马上的撩势里。\n"
msgstr "A rider of the Prince's house in leather armor with a saber, his face weathered dark red by the wind, his blade still in its horseback sweep.\n"

msgid "{npc}收了刀，拨转马头走了。"
msgstr "{npc} sheathes his saber, wheels his horse around and rides off."

msgid "王府骑兵的马刀一撩，白衣上开了一道口子。\n"
msgstr "The Prince's Rider sweeps his saber up, and a gash opens in a white robe.\n"

msgid "王府骑兵喝道：王爷有令，一个不留！\n"
msgstr "The Prince's Rider shouts: \"By the Prince's order, leave none!\"\n"

msgid "一个老牧羊人，坐在石头上，鞭子横在膝盖上，羊在他四周的草里走。他的脸晒得像牛皮，眼睛眯着看东边。\n"
msgstr "An old shepherd sitting on a stone, his whip across his knees, sheep wandering through the grass around him. His face is tanned like oxhide, and he squints toward the east.\n"

msgid "牧羊人吹了声口哨，一只走远的羊回过头来。\n"
msgstr "The Shepherd whistles, and a sheep that wandered off looks back.\n"

msgid "牧羊人说道：东边那土，刮了半年了。\n"
msgstr "The Shepherd says: \"That dirt in the east, it's been blowing half a year.\"\n"

msgid "那边。兵部的人圈了地，挖那座土丘。我爷爷说那土丘底下睡着金乌的人，不能动。他们动了。"
msgstr "Over there. The Ministry's people fenced off the land and are digging that mound. My grandfather said the Golden Crow's people sleep under that mound and it mustn't be touched. They touched it."

msgid "过路的人放石头的地方。兵部的车每过一回，我们就刻一道——刻了十一道。"
msgstr "Where travelers leave stones. Each time a Ministry cart passes, we cut one notch. Eleven notches."

msgid "从工地出来往西去的车，蒙着油布，里头有人。往东去的时候是空的。"
msgstr "The carts leaving the work site for the west are covered in tarps, and there are people inside. Going east, they're empty."

msgid "羊"
msgstr "Sheep"

msgid "我的羊。兵部征人，倒没征羊。"
msgstr "My sheep. The Ministry raised people, but never sheep."

msgid "一个裹着头巾的妇人，坐在篝火边搓着手里的一根羊毛绳，眼睛一直往东边看。她男人被兵部的人带走四十天了。\n"
msgstr "A woman in a headscarf, sitting by the campfire twisting a rope of wool, her eyes always on the east. Her man was taken by the Ministry of War's people forty days ago.\n"

msgid "民夫家属往火里添了一把羊粪，叹了口气。\n"
msgstr "The Laborer's Family adds a handful of dung to the fire and sighs.\n"

msgid "民夫家属说道：四十天了。\n"
msgstr "The Laborer's Family says: \"Forty days.\"\n"

msgid "回来了！八个都回来了——俺家的也在里头。火边坐的人今天都散了，就俺们几个舍不得走。"
msgstr "Back! All eight are back! Mine's among them. The ones at the fire have all gone home today, only us few, we can't bear to leave."

msgid "夜里回来四个。俺家的……没在里头。回来的人说，棚里还有四个，名字他们都记着。"
msgstr "Four came back in the night. Mine... wasn't among them. Those who came back say there are four more in the shed, and they all remember the names."

msgid "俺家的。兵部的人拿着文书，一家抓一个。王爷的告示贴了，人还是没了。"
msgstr "Mine. The Ministry's people came with papers, one man from every house. The Prince's notice went up, and still people vanished."

msgid "草原东边。俺去过一回，栅栏外头站了半天，白衣的不让进。听见里头有人喊。"
msgstr "East of the grassland. I went once, stood outside the fence half a day, and the ones in white wouldn't let me in. I heard someone shouting inside."

msgid "等消息的火。今天不用等了——人都回来了。火还烧着，烧给没等到的那些年。"
msgstr "The fire for news. No need to wait today, the men are all back. The fire still burns. It burns for the ones who weren't waited for, all those years."

msgid "等消息的火。回来了四个，火边少了四个人。剩下的还在等。"
msgstr "The fire for news. Four came back, and four fewer sit by the fire. The rest are still waiting."

msgid "等消息的火。谁家男人回来了，火边就少一个人。到现在没少过。"
msgstr "The fire for news. When somebody's man comes home, one fewer sits by the fire. So far, none fewer."

msgid "回家的人"
msgstr "Returned Laborer"

msgid "一个黑瘦的汉子，脖子上枷磨出的一圈印子还红着。他坐在火边，手里捧着一碗奶茶，一口没喝，只是捧着。\n"
msgstr "A dark, thin man, the ring of marks from the cangue still red on his neck. He sits by the fire holding a bowl of milk tea in both hands, not drinking a mouthful, only holding it.\n"

msgid "回来的民夫摸了摸脖子上枷磨出的印子。\n"
msgstr "The Returned Laborer touches the ring of marks on his neck.\n"

msgid "回来的民夫低声道：回来了……真回来了。\n"
msgstr "The Returned Laborer says in a low voice: \"Back... really back.\"\n"

msgid "王府的骑兵冲进来的时候，俺以为是来拿俺们的。枷一开，俺腿都软了。"
msgstr "When the Prince's riders charged in, I thought they'd come for us. When the cangue came off, my legs went soft."

msgid "夜里有人撬开俺的枷，叫俺别出声、往栅栏门跑。俺跑了。棚里还有四个——老魏、周二牛、陈满仓、马三。"
msgstr "Last night somebody pried my cangue open, told me not to make a sound and to run for the fence gate. I ran. There are four still in the shed: Old Wei, Zhou Erniu, Chen Mancang, Ma San."

msgid "夜里锁着，白天开了挖土。脖子上这圈印子，要带一辈子。"
msgstr "Locked at night, opened by day for digging. This ring on my neck, I'll carry it all my life."

msgid "恩公"
msgstr "Savior"

msgid "俺不知道恩公是谁。郭将军说，别问，记着就行。"
msgstr "I don't know who my savior is. General Guo said don't ask, just remember."

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，一手牵着骡子的缰绳，骡车上蒙着油布，油布底下有东西在动。他不看你。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap, one hand leading a mule by the reins. The cart is covered in a tarp, and something moves under it. He does not look at you.\n"

msgid "一辆蒙着油布的骡车从东边过来，两个黑衣黑冠的道士一个牵骡子一个跟着走。油布底下有人咳了一声。\n"
msgstr "A mule cart under a tarp comes from the east, two Daoists in black robes and black caps, one leading the mule, one walking behind. Someone under the tarp coughs once.\n"

msgid "让开。宫里的车。"
msgstr "Make way. The Palace's cart."

msgid "工地昨夜闹贼，两个挖不动的今天就接走，省得再丢。——走。"
msgstr "Thieves at the work site last night. Two who can't dig go today, to save losing more. ... Move."

msgid "骡车从你身边过去，往西、往南去了。油布底下的人没有再出声。\n"
msgstr "The mule cart passes you, going west and then south. The person under the tarp makes no more sound.\n"

msgid "宫里的车。让开。"
msgstr "The Palace's cart. Make way."

msgid "兵部交办，宫里收管。慈悲。"
msgstr "Handed over by the Ministry, taken in by the Palace. Mercy."

msgid "出了关门，一条军道贴着骆驼东峰的脚往北折。路是碎石铺的，车辙压得很深，两边的山壁比谷地里的矮，颜色也黄得发白。风从北边来，带着土腥气。回头能看见关门的铁栅和门楼上那面黄旗。\n"
msgstr "Past the pass gate, a military road turns north along the foot of Camelback's East Peak. The road is laid with crushed stone, the wheel ruts pressed deep, the cliffs on either side lower than those in the valley and yellowed almost white. The wind comes from the north, carrying the smell of raw earth. Looking back, you can see the iron portcullis of the gate and the yellow flag on the gate tower.\n"

msgid "山壁到这里退开了，路面从碎石变成黄土，再往北黄土里就长出一丛丛枯黄的草来。风很大，沙子贴着地皮跑，打在腿上沙沙地响。远处的地平线是平的——你在天驼关的谷地里待久了，一时看不惯这么宽的天。\n"
msgstr "The cliffs fall away here, and the road turns from crushed stone to yellow earth, and farther north clumps of withered yellow grass grow out of it. The wind is strong, and sand runs along the ground, stinging your legs with a hiss. The horizon is flat. After so long in the valley of Camelback Pass, you can hardly get used to a sky this wide.\n"

msgid "草原从这里开始。路边立着一方青石界碑，刻着「关北封国界」。草是灰绿的，高不过膝，风过去一浪一浪地倒。往北，一座土黄的城墙横在草地尽头，城门楼子上飘着一面旗——那是槐阳城。\n"
msgstr "The grassland begins here. A blue-stone boundary marker stands by the road, carved \"Fief Boundary.\" The grass is gray-green, knee-high, and falls in waves as the wind goes over. To the north, an earth-yellow wall lies across the end of the grass, a flag on the gate tower: that is Huaiyang.\n"

msgid "夯土的城墙，土黄色，墙头长草。城门洞不高，门楼上的朱漆褪成了砖红，梁上画着石青的卷草纹。门里是一片踩实了的黄土场子，驼队和马车在这儿卸货验货，驼铃叮当地响。守门的兵穿的不是朝廷的白衣，是王府的灰褐短袄。城门旁的木板上钉着一张告示。\n"
msgstr "A rammed-earth wall, earth yellow, grass growing on top. The gateway is not high, the vermilion on the gate tower faded to brick red, the beams painted with blue-stone scrollwork. Inside the gate is a stamped-down yellow dirt yard where camel trains and carts unload and have their goods checked, camel bells jingling. The guards are not the court's white but the Prince's gray-brown short jackets. A notice is nailed to a board beside the gate.\n"

msgid "槐阳城里唯一的一条正街，从城门直通北头王府的朱门。街面是黄土的，两边是矮矮的土坯房子：铁匠铺里叮叮当当打着马蹄铁，皮货铺门口挂着一张张晾着的羊皮，马具铺的鞍子一溜摆在门板上。街上走的人都带着风沙的颜色，说话直来直去。东边一条岔道通马市，马粪味就是从那边来的。\n"
msgstr "The only main street in Huaiyang, running from the city gate straight to the red gate of the Prince's house at the north end. The street is yellow dirt, with low adobe houses on both sides: a smithy clanging out horseshoes, a leather shop with sheepskins hung out to dry at its door, a saddler's with saddles laid in a row across the door boards. The people on the street all wear the color of wind and sand and talk straight out. A side road to the east leads to the Horse Market, and the smell of horse dung comes from that way.\n"

msgid "大街的北头是槐阳王府。朱漆的大门褪得发白，门钉倒是黑亮的；门前一对石鼓，鼓面让人摸得溜光。门楼不高，却宽，梁上的彩画是塞外的样子——石青和赭红，画的是马和鹰，不是龙凤。门前的场子扫得干净，这是全城唯一干净的地方。两个门军守着门，王爷不见生人。\n"
msgstr "At the north end of the main street is the Prince of Huaiyang's house. The vermilion gate has faded nearly white, though the gate studs are black and shining. Before it stand a pair of stone drums, their faces rubbed smooth by hands. The gate tower is not high but wide, and the painted beams are in a frontier style, blue-stone and ochre, showing horses and eagles, not dragons and phoenixes. The yard before the gate is swept clean, the only clean place in the whole city. Two gate guards stand at the door; the Prince does not see strangers.\n"

msgid "进了朱门是一面土坯的影壁，影壁上没有画，只刷了一层白灰，灰上有刀划的道道。绕过影壁是一片夯实的前院，扫得一根草都没有。北边三级石阶上去是正厅，廊下两盏灯笼。东边传来刀劈木头的声音——那边是校场。管家站在影壁下，手里拿着一本账。\n"
msgstr "Inside the red gate is an adobe screen wall, unpainted, only whitewashed, with lines scratched into the plaster by blades. Past the screen is a rammed-earth front yard, swept until not a blade of grass is left. To the north, up three stone steps, is the main hall, two lanterns under the eaves. To the east comes the sound of blades chopping wood: that way is the drill ground. The Steward stands under the screen wall with an account book in his hand.\n"

msgid "前院东边的校场，一排木人，几个箭靶，墙根一溜拴马的桩子。地上的土让马蹄和靴子踩得比石头还硬。王府的兵在这儿练刀——不是花架子，是马上一撩一劈的刀，木人的左肩都让劈去了一块。领着练的那个高个子是骁将郭承。\n"
msgstr "The drill ground east of the front yard: a row of wooden dummies, a few archery targets, and along the foot of the wall a line of hitching posts. The ground, tramped by hooves and boots, is harder than stone. The Prince's soldiers drill here with the saber, no show, the saber that sweeps and chops from horseback, and the left shoulder of every dummy has been chopped away. The tall man leading the drill is the champion Guo Cheng.\n"

msgid "槐阳王府的正厅，比乔阴县衙的大堂还朴素。上首一把旧的胡床交椅，椅背搭一张磨秃了的虎皮；椅旁一架兵器，刀在上剑在下。两边各站一个侍卫，不说话。地上铺的是砖，不是木板，踩上去有声音。梁上的彩画是石青和赭红的马和鹰。槐阳王程朔就坐在那把交椅上——六十六岁，背挺得笔直。\n"
msgstr "The main hall of the House of Huaiyang, plainer than the great hall of Tallshade's yamen. At the head sits an old folding chair, a worn-bald tiger skin draped over its back; beside it stands a weapon rack, saber above, sword below. A guardsman stands on each side, silent. The floor is brick, not boards, and your steps ring. The beams are painted with blue-stone and ochre horses and eagles. Cheng Shuo, the Prince of Huaiyang, sits in that chair: sixty-six, his back perfectly straight.\n"

msgid "正厅东边的偏厅，王爷看文书的地方。一张书案，案上的文书摞得整整齐齐，最上面一封是兵部的，封皮上有刀划的叉。墙上钉着一张羊皮地图，草原东头用朱砂圈了一个圈。角落一个火盆，盆里的灰还温着。\n"
msgstr "The side hall east of the main hall, where the Prince reads his papers. A writing desk, the papers on it stacked neatly; the top one is from the Ministry of War, an X scratched by a blade across its cover. A sheepskin map is nailed to the wall, a circle in cinnabar at the east end of the grassland. In one corner a brazier, the ashes in it still warm.\n"

msgid "大街东边的一片空场，围着木栏的马栏占了一半，栏里十来匹关北矮脚马，栏外的木桩上拴着刚换了主的。靠南是驼栏，两峰骆驼卧着嚼草。马贩子的秤挂在木架上，地上是草料和马粪。北边一间土坯房子门口挑着一面酒旗，写着「酒」——塞外酒肆。马栏边坐着一个高鼻深目的异族人，面前铺一块布，布上放着一把短剑。东边土墙上开着一道门，门外是草地和毡帐的白顶。\n"
msgstr "An open yard east of the main street, half of it taken up by a wooden-railed horse pen, a dozen or so short Frontier horses inside, and tied to posts outside the ones that have just changed hands. To the south is a camel pen, two camels lying chewing. The horse trader's scale hangs from a wooden frame, and the ground is covered in fodder and horse dung. To the north an adobe building has a wine banner hung at its door, the single character \"Wine\": the Frontier Tavern. By the horse pen sits a foreigner with a high-bridged nose and deep-set eyes, a cloth spread before him with a short sword on it. To the east a gate is cut in the earth wall, and beyond it lie grass and the white tops of felt tents.\n"

msgid "一间土坯墙的酒肆，屋顶是椽子上铺的草泥，矮得伸手能摸到梁。屋子正中是一个火塘，吊着一口黑锅，羊肉的香味和羊粪火的烟味混在一起。几张矮桌，几条板凳，墙上挂着皮囊和马鞭。掌柜的是个女人，站在柜后剁肉。靠墙坐着几个等消息的人，不说话，一碗马奶酒喝半天。\n"
msgstr "A tavern with adobe walls, the roof a mud-and-grass layer over rafters, so low you can touch the beams. In the middle of the room is a fire pit with a black pot hung over it, the smell of mutton mixed with the smoke of dung fire. A few low tables, a few benches, skins and horse whips hung on the walls. The keeper is a woman, standing behind the counter chopping meat. Along the wall sit several people waiting for news, not speaking, one bowl of kumis lasting hours.\n"

msgid "酒肆的后屋，堆着成捆的干草和几口大缸，缸里泡着马奶酒，酸味扑鼻。墙角挂着整扇的羊，房梁上吊着一串串风干的肉条。地上铺着一张破毡子，是掌柜的睡处。\n"
msgstr "The tavern's back room, stacked with bundles of dry hay and several big vats, kumis steeping in them, the sour smell strong in the nose. Whole sheep hang from the corner, and strings of air-dried meat strips hang from the rafters. On the floor is a torn felt mat, where the keeper sleeps.\n"

msgid "出了马市的东门，城墙外的草地上扎着五顶毡帐，毡子有白的有灰的，门帘朝南。帐外晾着肉干和奶皮子，奶桶倒扣在木架上，一群羊圈在柳条围的圈里。营地中间一堆篝火，火边坐着等消息的人——都是被兵部征了男人的人家。往东，草原路从营地东头出去。\n"
msgstr "Outside the east gate of the Horse Market, five felt tents stand on the grass outside the wall, the felt white and gray, the door flaps facing south. Outside the tents hang dried meat and milk skin drying, milk pails turned upside down on wooden racks, and a flock of sheep penned in a willow-withe corral. In the middle of the camp is a campfire, and by it sit the people waiting for news: all families whose men were taken by the Ministry of War. To the east, the grassland road leaves from the east end of the camp.\n"

msgid "营地东头，毡帐到这儿就没了，只剩一排拴马的木桩和一口饮马的石槽。草原路从这里往东去，车辙在草里压出两道黄土。风从东边来，带着一点土腥和烟味。\n"
msgstr "The east end of the camp. The felt tents stop here, leaving only a row of hitching posts and a stone trough for watering horses. The grassland road goes east from here, the wheel ruts pressing two yellow lines into the grass. The wind comes from the east, bringing a little smell of raw earth and smoke.\n"

msgid "一条车路穿过草原，两边的草从枯黄转成灰绿，一直铺到天边。路北一座敖包立在小丘上，路南地势起了一道缓坡。羊群在草里走，牧羊人坐在石头上。往东，天边有一缕黄尘一直不散。\n"
msgstr "A cart road runs across the grassland, the grass on both sides turning from withered yellow to gray-green and spreading to the edge of the sky. North of the road a cairn stands on a small hill; south, the ground rises in a gentle slope. Flocks of sheep move through the grass, the Shepherd sitting on a stone. To the east, a wisp of yellow dust never settles on the horizon.\n"

msgid "小丘顶上一座敖包，石头一层层垒起来有一人多高，顶上插着树枝，枝上绑满了褪色的红布蓝布。路过的人绕着它走三圈，放一块石头。风一吹，布条哗哗地响。\n"
msgstr "On top of the little hill stands a cairn, stones piled layer on layer to more than a man's height, branches stuck in its top, tied all over with faded red and blue cloth. Travelers walk three times around it and leave a stone. When the wind blows, the cloth strips snap and rustle.\n"

msgid "一道缓坡，站到坡顶能看出去很远。东边，草原尽头有一片栅栏围着的地方，几顶白帐篷，土堆得老高，一缕黄尘一直从那儿升起来——兵部的工地。坡上的草被牛羊啃得短短的，石头缝里长着紫苜蓿。\n"
msgstr "A gentle slope; from the top you can see a very long way. To the east, at the end of the grassland, is a fenced place, a few white tents, earth piled very high, a wisp of yellow dust rising from it without stopping: the Ministry of War's work site. The grass on the slope is cropped short by cattle and sheep, and purple alfalfa grows in the cracks between stones.\n"

msgid "一道木栅栏把草原拦断，栅栏门上钉着一块木牌：「兵部 · 修官道 · 闲人免进」。门里是踩出来的黄土地，马粪、车辙、断了的扁担。白衣的武官守在门里，监工拿着一本名册站在门边。北边一排帐篷，南边两溜民夫棚，东边土堆得像小山。\n"
msgstr "A wooden fence cuts off the grassland, and on the fence gate is nailed a wooden board: \"Ministry of War · Official Road Works · No Idlers.\" Inside is trampled yellow earth, horse dung, wheel ruts, a broken carrying pole. Officers in white stand guard inside the gate, and the overseer stands by it with a roll. To the north is a row of tents, to the south two rows of laborers' sheds, to the east earth piled like a hill.\n"

msgid "三顶帐篷排成一行，两顶是武官住的，帐门口立着兵部的白旗；东头一顶小些，是监工的，帐外一张条案，案上压着账本和算盘。帐篷后头堆着粮袋和水桶。夜里这儿只留两个守夜的。\n"
msgstr "Three tents in a row, two for the officers with the Ministry's white banner at the door, and the one at the east end, smaller, the overseer's, with a long table outside it, ledgers and an abacus pressed under weights. Behind the tents are stacked grain sacks and water buckets. At night only two men are left on watch here.\n"

msgid "两溜草顶的长棚，棚里铺着烂席子。棚前一排木桩，桩上钉着铁环，环上挂着枷锁——民夫白天挖土，夜里就锁在这儿。棚柱上钉着一张名册。地上是干了的血点子和没吃完的粥。\n"
msgstr "Two long thatched sheds, torn mats laid inside. In front of the sheds is a row of stakes, iron rings nailed to the stakes, cangues hanging from the rings: the laborers dig by day and are locked here at night. A roll is nailed to a shed post. On the ground are dried drops of blood and unfinished gruel.\n"

msgid "挖开的土方一坑连一坑，土堆得比人高，坑里架着木梯和辘轳。土是黄的，往下挖出来的却是灰白的——像是夯过的老土。往东，土方尽头是一座长满草的大土丘，丘脚下挖开了一个口子。\n"
msgstr "Dug-out earthworks, one pit after another, the earth piled higher than a man, wooden ladders and windlasses set in the pits. The earth is yellow, but what comes up from deeper down is gray-white, like rammed old earth. To the east, at the end of the earthworks, is a big grass-covered mound, and at its foot a gash has been dug open.\n"

msgid "大土丘脚下挖开的一个口子，深深地陷进去，坑壁上架着木架，一架辘轳吊着土筐。坑底露出一道石砌的墓道，墓道尽头一扇石门。坑边堆着挖出来的碎陶和一截朽了的木头，木头上还有漆。南边停着一辆蒙着油布的车。\n"
msgstr "A gash dug open at the foot of the big mound, sunk deep, with wooden frames set in the pit walls and a windlass hauling up baskets of earth. At the bottom a stone-lined tomb passage shows, and at its end a stone door. Broken pottery and a piece of rotted timber lie heaped at the edge of the pit, the timber still bearing lacquer. To the south stands a cart covered in a tarp.\n"

msgid "墓道尽头的石门，两扇，合得严严的，门缝里塞着多少年的土。门楣上刻着一只鸟，三只脚，翅膀张着——金乌。门上有凿过的痕，凿不开；门前的土被人跪出两个坑。\n"
msgstr "The stone door at the end of the tomb passage, two leaves shut tight, the cracks packed with earth from who knows how many years. Carved in the lintel is a bird, three-legged, wings spread: the Golden Crow. The door bears chisel marks and has not been broken, and the earth before it has been worn into two pits by kneeling.\n"

msgid "一辆骡车停在土坑南边，车上蒙着油布，油布底下有人。两个黑衣黑冠的道士守着车，一个在喂骡子，一个靠着车辕打盹。车辕上挂着一块木牌：「逆灵宫 · 收管」。\n"
msgstr "A mule cart stands south of the pit, tarp-covered, with people under the tarp. Two Daoists in black robes and black caps guard it, one feeding the mule and one dozing against the shaft. A wooden plate hangs from the shaft: \"Black Palace · Taken In and Held.\"\n"

msgid "回头看，关门是一座石砌的门楼，门洞里嵌着铁栅，这会儿抬着。门楼上没有匾，只钉着一面褪了色的黄旗，旗上一个「严」字。门里是天驼关的谷地，门外就是关北了。\n"
msgstr "Looking back, the pass gate is a stone gate tower with an iron portcullis set in the archway, raised for now. There is no plaque on the tower, only a faded yellow flag nailed up, with one character on it: \"Yan.\" Inside the gate lies the valley of Camelback Pass, and outside it is Beyond the Pass.\n"

msgid "一方齐人高的青石碑，碑面朝南，刻着「关北封国界」五个大字，字口里的朱漆早褪成了褐色。碑脚堆着过路人放的石子，碑背面有人用刀刻了一行小字：「出了关，就是王法。」\n"
msgstr "A blue-stone stele as tall as a man, its face to the south, carved with five big characters, \"Fief Boundary,\" the vermilion in the strokes long since faded to brown. At its foot lie stones that travelers have left, and on the back someone has cut a line of small characters with a knife: \"Out of the pass, it's the Prince's law.\"\n"

msgid "夯土的城墙，一层一层夯出来的横纹看得清清楚楚，墙根被风沙磨得发白，墙头长着一丛丛枯黄的草。门楼也是土的，木梁朱漆褪成了砖红，梁上画着石青的卷草。这不是京师的城，是塞外的城。\n"
msgstr "A rammed-earth wall, the horizontal layers of the ramming plain to see, its foot worn white by wind and sand, withered yellow grass growing in clumps along the top. The gate tower is earth too, its timber beams' vermilion faded to brick red, blue-stone scrollwork painted on the beams. This is not a city of the Capital. It is a city beyond the frontier.\n"

msgid "木栏围着的马栏，栏里十来匹马，枣红的、青的、黑的，都是关北的矮脚马，耐跑。栏外的木桩上拴着两匹，是刚换了主的。马粪和草料的味道混在一起，风一吹满街都是。\n"
msgstr "A wooden-railed pen with a dozen or so horses in it, chestnut, blue-gray, black, all short Frontier horses that run far. Two are tied to posts outside, just changed hands. The smell of horse dung and fodder mixes together, and the wind carries it all down the street.\n"

msgid "一对石鼓，鼓面让几十年的手摸得溜光，鼓身上刻的不是狮子，是两匹对着的马。鼓脚的石头裂了一道，用铁箍箍着。\n"
msgstr "A pair of stone drums, their faces rubbed smooth by decades of hands, carved on their sides not with lions but with two horses facing each other. The stone at the foot of one drum has cracked and been bound with an iron hoop.\n"

msgid "校场边一排木人，每个木人的左肩都让刀劈去了一块——王府的骁将练的是马上一撩的刀，撩的都是同一个地方。木人脚下的土踩得比石头还硬。\n"
msgstr "A row of wooden dummies beside the drill ground, the left shoulder of every dummy chopped away by blades. The Prince's champions drill the saber that sweeps upward from horseback, and they all sweep the same spot. The earth at the dummies' feet is tramped harder than stone.\n"

msgid "正厅上首不是龙椅，是一把旧的胡床交椅，椅背上搭一张虎皮，虎皮的毛磨秃了一半。椅子旁立着一架兵器，刀在上，剑在下，都不是摆设——刀口上有新磨的痕。\n"
msgstr "At the head of the main hall is not a dragon throne but an old folding chair, a tiger skin over its back, the fur worn half bald. Beside the chair stands a weapon rack, saber above, sword below, neither for show: the saber's edge has fresh whetting marks.\n"

msgid "偏厅的墙上钉着一张羊皮地图：槐阳城在中间，南边一道山是天驼关，东边一片草原画到纸边。草原东头用朱砂圈了一个圈，圈边写着三个小字：「兵部 · 工地」。圈旁边另一行墨字，笔迹不同：「古冢。勿动。」\n"
msgstr "A sheepskin map nailed to the side hall wall: Huaiyang in the middle, a range of mountains to the south, Camelback Pass, and the grassland drawn to the edge of the paper in the east. At the east end of the grassland a circle is drawn in cinnabar, and beside the circle are three small characters: \"Ministry of War · Work Site.\" Next to the circle is another line in ink, in a different hand: \"Ancient barrow. Do not touch.\"\n"

msgid "屋子正中挖出来的火塘，四边砌着石头，塘里的羊粪火不旺，却一直不灭。火上吊着一口黑锅，锅里的羊肉咕嘟咕嘟地响。火塘边的地上磨得油亮，是多少年来人坐出来的。\n"
msgstr "A fire pit dug into the middle of the room, stones laid around its four sides, the dung fire in the pit not strong but never out. A black pot hangs over the fire, the mutton in it bubbling. The floor beside the pit is worn oily smooth by all the years of people sitting.\n"

msgid "五顶毡帐，柳条扎的骨架，外头蒙着毡子，毡子用马鬃绳勒出一道道棱。门帘都朝南，帘子上缝着各家的花样：一家是云头，一家是鹿，一家什么也没有，只有补丁。帐顶的天窗开着，炊烟从那儿出来。\n"
msgstr "Five felt tents, the frames of willow withes, felt stretched over, the felt bound into ridges with horsehair rope. The door flaps all face south, and each is sewn with its household's pattern: one with cloud heads, one with a deer, one with nothing at all but patches. The smoke holes in the tent tops are open, and cooking smoke comes out of them.\n"

msgid "石头垒的敖包，有些石头是路过的人新放的，颜色还白；底下的让风吹黑了。顶上的树枝绑着布条，红的、蓝的、黄的，最底下那层已经褪成了灰。石堆里插着一块木牌，字是刀刻的：「兵部的车从这儿过了十一回。」后头还有一笔，没刻完。\n"
msgstr "A cairn of piled stones, some stones newly laid by passing travelers, still white, those underneath blackened by wind. Branches stuck in the top are tied with cloth strips, red, blue and yellow, the bottom layer already faded to gray. A wooden plate is stuck in the pile, the words cut by knife: \"The Ministry's carts have passed here eleven times.\" Behind it there is one more stroke, not finished.\n"

msgid "东边那缕黄尘不是烟，是土——几百个人在挖土，挖出来的土一筐一筐倒上去，风一吹就是这一缕。尘底下隐约有白点子在动，是武官的白衣。\n"
msgstr "That wisp of yellow in the east is not smoke but dirt: several hundred men digging, basket after basket of earth dumped on the pile, and the wind makes this one wisp. Under the dust small white dots move: the white robes of the officers.\n"

msgid "钉在棚柱上的一张名册，纸让雨淋过，字还认得出：\n「关北民夫 第十一批：王石头、刘拐子、老魏、周二牛、陈满仓、马三、巴图、胡阿大。」\n底下另一行小字，墨不一样：「前十批挖不动者七人，交逆灵宫收管。」\n名册末尾盖着一方印，印色暗红发黑。\n"
msgstr "A roll nailed to a shed post, the paper rained on, but the writing still legible:\n\"Laborers of Beyond the Pass, Eleventh Batch: Wang Shitou, Liu Guaizi, Old Wei, Zhou Erniu, Chen Mancang, Ma San, Batu, Hu Ada.\"\nBeneath it, another line in different ink: \"Of the first ten batches, seven who could not dig, handed over to the Black Palace to be taken in and held.\"\nAt the end of the roll is stamped a seal, the ink dark red, nearly black.\n"

msgid "坑边架着一架辘轳，绳子磨得发亮，吊着一只土筐。筐里的土是灰白的夯土，夹着碎陶片，有一片上头还有红彩。坑壁上一层一层的土色不一样——这土丘不是天生的，是人堆的。\n"
msgstr "A windlass stands at the edge of the pit, its rope worn shiny, a basket of earth hanging from it. The earth in the basket is gray-white rammed earth mixed with broken potsherds, one of which still has red paint on it. The earth in the pit wall changes color layer by layer: this mound was not made by nature, it was piled up by men.\n"

msgid "两扇石门，石面磨得光滑，门楣正中刻着一只鸟：翅膀张开，三只脚，头朝东。刻得深，几百年的土都填不平那三只脚。门缝里有新凿的痕迹，凿了一寸就停了，石头比铁硬。门前的土地上跪出两个坑——有人在这门前跪过很久。\n你见过这只鸟：逆灵宫人腰牌上的徽记，也是这个样子。\n"
msgstr "Two stone doors, the stone worn smooth, and in the middle of the lintel a bird carved: wings spread, three legs, its head to the east. It is carved so deep that centuries of earth have not filled in the three legs. In the crack of the doors are fresh chisel marks, one inch deep and then abandoned, the stone harder than iron. In the earth before the doors two pits have been worn by kneeling: someone knelt at this door for a very long time.\nYou have seen this bird before: the emblem on the Black Palace men's waist tokens looks just like this.\n"

msgid "门军侧身让开：进去吧，王爷在正厅。\n"
msgstr "The gate guard steps aside: \"Go in. The Prince is in the main hall.\"\n"

msgid "你叩了叩门。门军接过信看了看封皮，又看了看你。\n"
msgstr "You knock on the gate. The gate guard takes the letter, looks at the cover, then at you.\n"

msgid "门军说道：乔阴程县令的信——王爷等这封信等了半个月了。进去，正厅。\n"
msgstr "The gate guard says: \"A letter from Magistrate Cheng of Tallshade. The Prince has waited half a month for it. Go in, the main hall.\"\n"

msgid "朱门开了。\n"
msgstr "The red gate opens.\n"

msgid "你叩了叩门。门军没有动：王爷只认乔阴程县令的信。信呢？丢了的话，回乔阴县衙找程县令再写一封。\n"
msgstr "You knock on the gate. The gate guard doesn't move: \"The Prince recognizes only Magistrate Cheng of Tallshade's letter. Where's the letter? If you've lost it, go back to Tallshade's yamen and have Magistrate Cheng write another.\"\n"

msgid "你叩了叩门。门军没有动：王爷不见生人。有凭据再来。\n"
msgstr "You knock on the gate. The gate guard doesn't move: \"The Prince does not see strangers. Come back with proof.\"\n"

msgid "看"
msgstr "Read"

msgid "城门旁的木板上钉了一张新告示，压在旧的上头，墨还新：\n"
msgstr "A new notice is nailed to the board beside the gate, pasted over the old one, the ink still fresh:\n"

msgid "「兵部文书至：槐阳反。随他们说。——槐阳王府」\n"
msgstr "\"A paper from the Ministry of War: Huaiyang is in revolt. Let them say it. -- The House of Huaiyang\"\n"

msgid "底下还是那方正红的印。旧告示的一角从新纸底下露出来，「本府不奉」四个字还看得见。\n"
msgstr "Beneath it is the same true-red seal. A corner of the old notice shows from under the new paper, and the words \"this House does not accept\" can still be read.\n"

msgid "一张告示钉在城门旁的木板上，纸已经让风沙打得发毛，字是粗笔写的：\n"
msgstr "A notice is nailed to the board beside the gate, the paper battered fuzzy by wind and sand, the writing in a thick brush:\n"

msgid "「兵部征夫令，本府不奉。有持兵部文书到关北拿人者，以盗论。——槐阳王府」\n"
msgstr "\"The Ministry of War's levy of laborers: this House does not accept. Anyone who comes Beyond the Pass with Ministry papers to seize people will be treated as a robber. -- The House of Huaiyang\"\n"

msgid "告示底下盖着一方大印，印色正红。你见过逆灵宫那叠文书上的印——这一方和那些不一样。\n"
msgstr "A great seal is stamped below the notice, the ink true red. You have seen the seals on the stack of papers in the Black Palace: this one is not like those.\n"

msgid "天已经黑了。篝火一堆一堆亮起来，帐篷里透出灯光。该走了。\n"
msgstr "It is already dark. Campfires light up one after another, and lamplight shows through the tents. Time to go.\n"

msgid "在篝火边坐下等到天黑。等的工夫里，世上的事照样走：别处的人该走的走、该好的好。"
msgstr "Sit by the campfire and wait until dark. While you wait, the world carries on: those elsewhere who are due to leave leave, and those who are due to mend mend."

msgid "你在篝火边坐下。等消息的人往火里添了一把羊粪，没人说话。\n"
msgstr "You sit down by the campfire. A waiting woman adds a handful of dung to the fire, and no one speaks.\n"

msgid "太阳落下去，草原先黑，天后黑。篝火一堆一堆亮起来，帐篷里透出灯光，羊圈里的羊都卧下了。\n"
msgstr "The sun goes down. The grassland goes dark first, the sky after. Campfires light up one after another, lamplight shows through the tents, and the sheep in the corral all lie down.\n"

msgid "夜晚降临了。往东，工地那边只剩两点火光。\n"
msgstr "Night falls. To the east, at the work site, only two points of firelight are left.\n"

msgid "篝火边坐着等消息的人。你没有要等的事——借了兵的，白天就去。\n"
msgstr "Waiting people sit by the fire. You have nothing to wait for: if you borrowed the soldiers, go by day.\n"

msgid "打开枷锁"
msgstr "Unlock Cangues"

msgid "枷锁都开着，铁环空荡荡地挂在桩上。棚里没有人了。\n"
msgstr "The cangues are all open, the iron rings hanging empty from the stakes. There is no one in the sheds now.\n"

msgid "剩下的四副枷锁还锁着人——老魏、周二牛、陈满仓、马三。白天六个武官在帐外走动，夜里他们加了岗。你救不了第二回。\n"
msgstr "The four remaining cangues still hold men: Old Wei, Zhou Erniu, Chen Mancang, Ma San. By day six officers walk about outside the tents, and by night they have posted extra guards. You cannot save them a second time.\n"

msgid "武官的尸首横在栅栏门里，吕隼趴在他的名册上。你走到木桩前，一副一副地打开枷锁。\n"
msgstr "The officers lie dead inside the fence gate, Lu Sun face down on his roll. You walk to the stakes and open the cangues one by one.\n"

msgid "铁环「当啷」落在地上。八个人站起来，先是不敢信，然后有人哭了。\n"
msgstr "The iron rings fall clanging to the ground. Eight men stand up, at first not daring to believe it, and then somebody weeps.\n"

msgid "郭承说道：回营地去。马市东门外的帐篷，你们的人都在那儿等着。\n"
msgstr "Guo Cheng says: \"Back to the camp. Outside the Horse Market's east gate, in the tents, all your people are waiting.\"\n"

msgid "八个民夫互相搀着，从栅栏门出去了。古冢口那边，两个黑衣道士丢下车，往东跑了。\n"
msgstr "The eight laborers help each other out through the fence gate. At the barrow mouth, the two Daoists in black drop their cart and run east.\n"

msgid "白衣武官还站着。先打。\n"
msgstr "The officers in white are still on their feet. Fight first.\n"

msgid "跟着我，别出声。先开西头的，开一个走一个。"
msgstr "Stay with me, no noise. Start with the west end, open one and send one running."

msgid "你蹲到木桩前。枷锁的铁销锈死了，郭承用刀尖一点一点地撬。第一副开了，王石头爬起来，郭承指了指栅栏门，他弯着腰跑了。\n"
msgstr "You crouch before the stakes. The iron pins in the cangues are rusted solid, and Guo Cheng pries at them bit by bit with the point of his saber. The first one opens, Wang Shitou scrambles up, Guo Cheng points to the fence gate, and he runs off bent double.\n"

msgid "第二副，刘拐子。第三副，巴图。第四副，胡阿大——铁销「咔」的一声响。\n"
msgstr "The second, Liu Guaizi. The third, Batu. The fourth, Hu Ada--and the iron pin goes \"click.\"\n"

msgid "火边一个守夜的武官抬起头：「谁？！」两个人抽剑扑了过来。\n"
msgstr "An officer on watch by the fire raises his head: \"Who?!\" Two men draw swords and rush you.\n"

msgid "夜里的工地。郭承不在你身边——他说过，篝火边等他。\n"
msgstr "The work site at night. Guo Cheng is not at your side. He told you to wait by the campfire for him.\n"

msgid "白天。六个武官在帐外走动，吕隼在算账，枷锁上的铁销锈死了，撬一副要半天。郭承说过：夜里。\n"
msgstr "Daytime. Six officers walk about outside the tents, Lu Sun is working his accounts, the iron pins in the cangues are rusted solid, and prying one open would take half a day. Guo Cheng said: at night.\n"

msgid "枷锁是铁的，锁着。你没有钥匙，也没有理由。\n"
msgstr "The cangue is iron, and locked. You have no key, and no reason.\n"

msgid "土方东头两个白衣武官横过剑，拦住你：兵部重地，闲人免进。"
msgstr "Two officers in white at the east end of the earthworks cross their swords and block you: \"Ministry ground. No idlers.\""

msgid "皮货"
msgstr "Leather Goods"

msgid "马具"
msgstr "Saddlery"

msgid "部"
msgstr "Ministry"

msgid "一串琉璃珠子，有蓝的、绿的、琥珀色的，透亮，里头有一丝一丝的气泡。对着太阳一照，手心里落下一小片彩光。\n"
msgstr "A string of glass beads, blue, green and amber, clear, with fine bubbles caught inside. Hold it up to the sun and a small patch of colored light falls in your palm.\n"

msgid "一张卷起来的毡毯，红底黄花，花纹一圈套一圈。摸上去又厚又密，带着羊毛的气味。\n"
msgstr "A rolled-up felt rug, yellow flowers on red, the pattern ring within ring. It feels thick and dense, and smells of wool.\n"

msgid "一小布袋胡椒，黑黑的一粒一粒，袋口一松，那股辣味直冲鼻子。在京师，这一袋能换不少银子。\n"
msgstr "A small cloth bag of pepper, black and grainy. Loosen the mouth of the bag and the sting of it goes straight up your nose. In the Capital, one bag fetches a good deal of silver.\n"

msgid "一张烤得焦黄的胡饼，上头撒满芝麻，又硬又香。走远路的人带着，一个月不坏。\n"
msgstr "A sesame flatbread baked golden-brown, covered in sesame seeds, hard and fragrant. Carried on a long road, it keeps a month.\n"

msgid "一把细嘴的铜壶，壶身上敲满了星星似的花纹。装着清水，一路晃荡也不洒。\n"
msgstr "A copper kettle with a slender spout, its body hammered all over with star-like patterns. Filled with water, it does not spill, however much it sways on the road.\n"

msgid "巴掌大的一片铜，边角磨圆了，颜色发黑，拿在手里沉甸甸的。正面刻着几行字，笔画很深，是用剑尖一下一下刻出来的——字是中原字，刻字的人却不大会写，有几个笔画反了。背面一只展翅的鹰。铜是凉的，可刚从火坛底下取出来的时候，是温的。\n"
msgstr "A piece of copper the size of a palm, its corners worn round, dark in color and heavy in the hand. Several lines of characters are cut into the front, the strokes deep, scratched in one by one with a sword point—Central Plains characters, but whoever cut them could not write well, and some strokes are backwards. On the back, an eagle with spread wings. The copper is cold, but when it was taken from under the fire altar, it was warm.\n"

msgid "你把铜牒举到亮处，一行一行地认那些刻反了笔画的字：\n"
msgstr "You hold the tablet up to the light and make out the lines one by one, the backward strokes and all:\n"

msgid "「头在湖底冰下，以穿灵为钉；\n"
msgstr "\"The head lies under the ice at the bottom of the lake, Spiritpiercer for its nail;\n"

msgid "钉在，鬼不得全；\n"
msgstr "While the nail holds, the ghost is not whole;\n"

msgid "钉拔，鬼成形；\n"
msgstr "Pull the nail, and the ghost takes shape;\n"

msgid "要灭它，三器齐；\n"
msgstr "To destroy it, the three implements must be one;\n"

msgid "要再封，须有人留下。」\n"
msgstr "To seal it again, someone must stay.\"\n"

msgid "背面那只鹰的翅膀底下还有一行小字，刻得浅，几乎磨平了：「吾见之。」\n"
msgstr "Under the eagle's wing on the back there is one more line of small characters, cut shallow, almost worn away: \"I saw it.\"\n"

msgid "一片狭长的贝叶，两指宽，一尺来长，叶头穿了一个小孔。叶面上用铁笔刻着一行一行天竺字，刻痕里抹了烟灰，是婆萝蜜多心经的第一页。叶边空白处，有人用中原字添了一行小字：「收不收，是山烟寺的事。」\n"
msgstr "A long, narrow palm-leaf page, two fingers wide and about a foot long, a small hole pierced through its head. Lines of Indian script are cut into it with an iron stylus, soot rubbed into the cuts: the first page of the Heart Sutra. In the blank margin someone has added a line of small Central Plains characters: \"Whether it is accepted is for Mountain Mist Temple to say.\"\n"

msgid "这是龙若法王托你带回山烟寺的经，不能随便丢。"
msgstr "This is the sutra Dharma King Longruo asked you to take back to Mountain Mist Temple. You cannot just throw it away."

msgid "一把倭国的长刀，刀身窄而弯，只开一面刃，刀背磨得发亮。刀柄长，缠着黑丝绳，两只手握得下。浪人说：一刀。\n"
msgstr "A Japanese long blade, narrow and curved, edged on one side only, the back of the blade polished bright. The hilt is long, wrapped in black silk cord, big enough for two hands. The ronin say: One stroke.\n"

msgid "一面大秦人的圆盾，木胎蒙牛皮，铁皮包边，盾心一个铁泡。盾面上漆着一只展翅的鹰，漆掉了一半，盾沿全是剑尖戳出来的白点。左臂套上去正合适。\n"
msgstr "A Daqin round shield, a wooden core covered in ox hide and edged with iron, an iron boss at its center. An eagle with spread wings is painted on its face, half the paint gone, and the rim is covered in white dints from sword points. It fits snugly on the left arm.\n"

msgid "一个背着盐包的脚夫，盐包压得他的腰弯成一张弓。他的脸上、眉毛上一层白霜，是汗干了留下的盐。\n"
msgstr "A porter with a bag of salt on his back, the bag bending his waist like a bow. His face and eyebrows are coated in white frost, the salt left when the sweat dried.\n"

msgid "盐脚夫停下来喘口气，抹了一把脸上的盐霜。\n"
msgstr "The salt porter stops to catch his breath and wipes the salt frost off his face.\n"

msgid "盐脚夫把盐包往背上颠了颠，一步一步往上挪。\n"
msgstr "The salt porter heaves the salt bag up his back and inches on up, one step at a time.\n"

msgid "盐"
msgstr "Salt"

msgid "码头那边晒的海盐。背上崖，送到玉螺湖村去换米，一包换一斗。"
msgstr "Sea salt, dried at the docks. Carried up the cliff to Jade Conch Village and traded for rice, a bag for a peck."

msgid "下了崖就是。码头、市集，再往里头是庙。"
msgstr "Go down the cliff and you are there. The docks, the market, and further in, a temple."

msgid "路"
msgstr "Road"

msgid "这条路是凿出来的，我爷爷那辈人凿的。下雨天别走，滑。"
msgstr "This road was chiseled out, by my grandfather's generation. Don't walk it in the rain. It's slippery."

msgid "看多了就不看了。海又不给饭吃。"
msgstr "You get tired of looking. The sea doesn't feed you."

msgid "一个晒得黑红的船工，光着脚，裤腿卷到膝盖，肩上搭着一条湿缆绳。他的手上全是绳子勒出来的老茧。\n"
msgstr "A boatman burned black-red by the sun, barefoot, trousers rolled to the knee, a wet mooring rope over his shoulder. His hands are covered in calluses from the rope.\n"

msgid "船工往海里啐了一口。\n"
msgstr "The boatman spits into the sea.\n"

msgid "船工哼起一支调子，词你一个字也听不懂。\n"
msgstr "The boatman hums a tune. You cannot understand a word of it.\n"

msgid "船"
msgstr "Ships"

msgid "不是我们的船。南边商人的，西边商人的。我们只管拴、只管卸，一天三十文。"
msgstr "Not our ships. Southern merchants', western merchants'. We tie them up. We unload 'em. Thirty wen a day."

msgid "海上没有路。有路，也是别人的。"
msgstr "There's no road on the sea. If there is one, it's somebody else's."

msgid "港口小，船是别人的，人是各处来的。各过各的。"
msgstr "Small harbor. The ships belong to other people, and the people come from all over. Everyone goes their own way."

msgid "大秦人"
msgstr "The Daqin"

msgid "铁盾会的。市集北头，门口立着两面大盾的那家。"
msgstr "The Iron Shield Guild's. North end of the market, the one with two big shields standing at the door."

msgid "税"
msgstr "Tax"

msgid "货上岸，十抽一。冯大人的规矩。我们不交，我们没货。"
msgstr "Goods come ashore, one in ten goes to the tax. Lord Feng's rule. We don't pay it. We've got no goods."

msgid "胡商"
msgstr "Merchants"

msgid "一个缠着头巾的胡商，正指挥船工把箱子抬上岸。他一会儿用胡话骂，一会儿用中原话骂，骂完了自己先笑。\n"
msgstr "A merchant in a turban, directing the boatmen as they carry crates ashore. One moment he curses in his own tongue, the next in the Central Plains tongue, and when he is done he is the first to laugh.\n"

msgid "胡商冲着船工嚷道：慢点！那一箱是琉璃！\n"
msgstr "The foreign merchant yells at the boatmen, \"Easy! That crate is glass!\"\n"

msgid "胡商拿出一本小册子，在上头记了一笔。\n"
msgstr "The merchant takes out a small ledger and makes a note in it.\n"

msgid "货"
msgstr "Goods"

msgid "胡椒、琉璃、毡子。从西边来，走了一年。到了番坊，交了税，就剩一半。"
msgstr "Pepper, glass, felt. Came from the west, a year on the road. Get to the Foreign Quarter, pay the tax, and half is gone."

msgid "十抽一！冯大人还说是轻的。"
msgstr "One in ten! And Lord Feng calls that light."

msgid "西边是沙子，再西边是山，山那边还是沙子。走一年，才到这儿。"
msgstr "West is sand, and west of that mountains, and beyond the mountains more sand. A year of walking to get here."

msgid "铁盾会的人？他们替商队看过货、打过强盗。现在没人雇他们了，就教人使剑。"
msgstr "The Iron Shield Guild? They used to watch over goods for the caravans, and fought off bandits. Nobody hires them now. They teach people the sword."

msgid "一个戴小帽的税吏，坐在码头当中的桌子后头。桌上一本账、一杆秤、一个钱匣子；他拨一下算盘，看一眼海，再拨一下。\n"
msgstr "A tax collector in a little cap sits behind a table in the middle of the docks. On the table are a ledger, a steelyard and a money box. He clicks his abacus, glances at the sea, and clicks again.\n"

msgid "税吏拨了几下算盘，在账上记了一笔。\n"
msgstr "The tax collector clicks the abacus a few times and writes an entry in the ledger.\n"

msgid "税吏冲着卸货的胡商喊道：先过秤，再上岸！\n"
msgstr "The tax collector calls to the merchant unloading: Weigh it first, then bring it ashore!\n"

msgid "货上岸，十抽一，市舶司的规矩。你没货？没货就走吧。"
msgstr "Goods come ashore, one in ten, the Maritime Trade Office's rule. You have no goods? Then move along."

msgid "市集西头，灰墙的院子。冯大人在里头。"
msgstr "West end of the market, the yard with the gray wall. Lord Feng is in there."

msgid "冯大人是京师派来的。番坊的事，他说了算。"
msgstr "Lord Feng was sent from the Capital. In the Foreign Quarter, what he says goes."

msgid "铁盾会在市集北头，门口立着两面大盾。别说是我指的路。"
msgstr "The Iron Shield Guild is at the north end of the market, two big shields at the door. Do not say it was me who told you the way."

msgid "船是南边商人的，番坊没有自己的船。"
msgstr "The ships belong to the southern merchants. The Foreign Quarter has none of its own."

msgid "一个高鼻子的胡商，面前的毡子上摆满了琉璃珠子和琉璃杯。太阳一照，五颜六色的光落在他的胡子上。\n"
msgstr "A high-nosed merchant, a felt spread out before him, laid with glass beads and glass cups. When the sun hits them, colored light falls across his beard.\n"

msgid "琉璃商举起一颗珠子，对着太阳眯起眼睛看。\n"
msgstr "The glass merchant holds up a bead and squints at it against the sun.\n"

msgid "琉璃商吆喝道：西边的火烧出来的琉璃——看看，不买也看看！\n"
msgstr "The glass merchant calls out: Glass fired in the western fire—look at it! Look even if you don't buy!\n"

msgid "琉璃"
msgstr "Glass"

msgid "西边的火烧出来的，透亮。中原人喜欢，一串换一斗米。"
msgstr "Fired in the western fire, clear as water. Central Plains people love it. One string for a peck of rice."

msgid "好地方。没人问你从哪来，只问你卖什么。"
msgstr "A good place. Nobody asks where you are from, only what you sell."

msgid "冯大人？他扣过我一箱杯子，说是要验。验了三个月，箱子还在他后院。"
msgstr "Lord Feng? He held a crate of my cups, said they had to be inspected. Three months of inspecting, and the crate is still in his back yard."

msgid "一个胡子花白的胡商，盘腿坐在一堆毡毯上。身后的竹竿上挂着一张张毡毯，红底黄花，花纹是一圈套一圈的。\n"
msgstr "A gray-bearded merchant sits cross-legged on a heap of felt rugs. Behind him, rugs hang from bamboo poles, yellow flowers on red, the patterns ring within ring.\n"

msgid "毡毯商慢慢地抚平一张毡毯上的褶子。\n"
msgstr "The carpet merchant slowly smooths the creases out of a rug.\n"

msgid "毡毯商闭着眼睛，像是睡着了，可你一走近他就睁开了眼。\n"
msgstr "The carpet merchant keeps his eyes closed as if asleep, but the moment you come near, they open.\n"

msgid "一张毡毯，一个女人织一年。你踩在上头，就是踩在她那一年上。"
msgstr "One rug, one woman, one year of weaving. Step on it, and you are stepping on her year."

msgid "花纹"
msgstr "Pattern"

msgid "一圈套一圈，是路。从家里走出来，走到这儿，还没走完。"
msgstr "Ring within ring, that is the road. Out of the house and walking to here, and not done walking."

msgid "铁盾会的人买过我一张，铺在他们会首的屋里。会首是个老实人。"
msgstr "A man from the Iron Shield Guild bought one from me. Laid it in the Guild Head's room. The Guild Head is an honest man."

msgid "一个包着头巾的胡商妇人，守着一排敞口的麻袋。她用一只铜勺子舀香料，舀一勺，抖一抖，再倒回去一点。\n"
msgstr "A merchant woman in a headscarf guards a row of open sacks. With a copper ladle she scoops spice, a scoop, a shake, and pours a little back.\n"

msgid "香料商抓了一把胡椒，凑到鼻子底下闻了闻，点点头。\n"
msgstr "The spice merchant takes a pinch of pepper, holds it under her nose, sniffs it, and nods.\n"

msgid "香料商冲着街上喊了一句什么，她的孩子跑过来又跑走了。\n"
msgstr "The spice merchant shouts something into the street, and her child runs over and runs off again.\n"

msgid "香料"
msgstr "Spice"

msgid "胡椒、姜黄、孜然。一勺胡椒，在京师换一勺银子。在番坊，换一张饼。"
msgstr "Pepper, turmeric, cumin. A spoonful of pepper fetches a spoonful of silver in the Capital. In the Foreign Quarter, a flatbread."

msgid "我自己烤的。芝麻多，盐少。走远路的人带着，一个月不坏。"
msgstr "I bake them myself. Lots of sesame, little salt. Carried on a long road, they keep a month."

msgid "他会说三种话，一种也说不好。"
msgstr "He speaks three tongues. None of them well."

msgid "一个胳膊粗壮的胡商，面前的木架上挂满了铜壶、铜盘和铜铃。他拿一把小锤子在一只盘子上敲花纹，叮叮当当，一刻不停。\n"
msgstr "A thick-armed merchant with a wooden rack before him hung with copper kettles, plates and bells. With a small hammer he beats a pattern into a plate, clink-clank, without stopping.\n"

msgid "铜器商叮叮当当地敲着一只铜盘。\n"
msgstr "The copper merchant clinks and clanks away at a copper plate.\n"

msgid "铜器商举起一只铜壶，冲你晃了晃。\n"
msgstr "The copper merchant holds up a copper kettle and shakes it at you.\n"

msgid "装水，装茶，装酒，都行。走远路，水比钱要紧。"
msgstr "For water, for tea, for wine, any of them. On a long road, water matters more than money."

msgid "铜"
msgstr "Copper"

msgid "铜是番坊的铜，手艺是我家的手艺。花纹是我爷爷教的，他说是天上的星星。"
msgstr "The copper is the Foreign Quarter's copper, the craft is my family's. My grandfather taught the patterns. He said they are the stars in the sky."

msgid "东头那座黑石头房子。火三百年没灭，祭司说火前不能说谎。我从来不进去。"
msgstr "The black stone house at the east end. The fire there has not gone out in three hundred years. The priest says no lying before the fire. I never go in."

msgid "一个七八岁的孩子，头发卷卷的，替他娘看着香料摊。见人就喊「看看，看看」，喊的是三种话。\n"
msgstr "A child of seven or eight with curly hair, minding his mother's spice stall. He shouts \"Look, look!\" at everyone who passes, in three languages.\n"

msgid "看摊的孩子冲你喊道：看看，看看！\n"
msgstr "The stall child shouts at you: Look, look!\n"

msgid "看摊的孩子从麻袋里偷抓了一撮什么，塞进嘴里，脸一下子皱成一团。\n"
msgstr "The stall child sneaks a pinch of something from a sack and stuffs it in his mouth, and his whole face scrunches up.\n"

msgid "我娘说，番坊就是谁都来、谁都走的地方。"
msgstr "My mom says the Foreign Quarter is a place where everybody comes and everybody goes."

msgid "铁盾会的人个子好高。他们说话像唱歌，吵架也像唱歌。"
msgstr "The Iron Shield Guild people are so tall. They talk like singing. They fight like singing too."

msgid "我没坐过船。船是别人的。"
msgstr "I've never been on a ship. The ships belong to other people."

msgid "一个白胡子的老胡人，坐在街边的一块毡子上，面前一只铜碗。他讲的是中原话，讲得很慢，时不时冒出一个谁也听不懂的词，又自己把它换成中原话。\n"
msgstr "A white-bearded old foreigner sits on a felt on the roadside, a copper bowl in front of him. He speaks the Central Plains tongue, very slowly, and now and then a word nobody understands slips out, and he turns it into Central Plains himself.\n"

msgid "说书的老胡人说道：……那座城有一百道门，门门都有兵守着。可兵是会老的。\n"
msgstr "The old storyteller says: ...That city had a hundred gates, and every gate had soldiers. But soldiers grow old.\n"

msgid "说书的老胡人停下来，喝了一口水，看着街上的人来来去去。\n"
msgstr "The old storyteller pauses, takes a sip of water and watches the people come and go on the street.\n"

msgid "故事"
msgstr "Story"

msgid "西边，很远的西边，有一个大国。城一百座，路都是石头铺的，一直铺到海边。后来北边的蛮子来了，城一座一座地烧。剩下的人往东走，走到这里，走不动了。——这不是故事，孩子。这是铁盾会那些人的来历。"
msgstr "In the west, the far west, there was a great country. A hundred cities, roads paved with stone all the way to the sea. Then the barbarians came from the north, and the cities burned one by one. The ones left went east, and here they could go no further.—This is not a story, child. This is where the Iron Shield Guild people come from."

msgid "你们叫它大秦。他们自己叫它别的名字。它已经没有了。"
msgstr "You call it Daqin. They call it by another name. It is gone."

msgid "他们的祖上来得早，三百年前就来过一回，替你们这边打过北方的蛮子。这回来的，是没有家可回的。"
msgstr "Their forefathers came early. Three hundred years ago they came once, and fought the northern barbarians on your side. These ones who came this time have no home to go back to."

msgid "丝路走到头，就是这里。往东是你们中原，往西往南，是海。"
msgstr "The Silk Road ends here. East is your Central Plains. West and south, the sea."

msgid "海那边？我不知道。我是走路来的，走了一年。"
msgstr "Beyond the sea? I do not know. I came on foot. It took a year."

msgid "市舶吏"
msgstr "Maritime Trade Officer"

msgid "一个穿青袍的小官，袍子洗得发白，袖口磨出了毛。他坐在书案后头，一手按着账册，一手拈着胡子，眼睛总往门口瞟。\n"
msgstr "A minor official in a blue gown washed pale, the cuffs frayed. He sits behind a desk, one hand on a ledger, the other pinching his beard, his eyes always sliding toward the door.\n"

msgid "冯禄翻着账册，嘴里念念有词地算着数目。\n"
msgstr "Feng Lu leafs through the ledger, muttering figures under his breath.\n"

msgid "冯禄看了一眼门外，又低下头。\n"
msgstr "Feng Lu glances out the door, then lowers his head again.\n"

msgid "……本司回去查。查清了再说。"
msgstr "...This office will look into it. When it is clear, we will talk."

msgid "按住了案上的文书，手指头有点抖。"
msgstr " presses down on the papers on the desk, his fingers trembling a little."

msgid "印……兵部的文书，镇国大将军的印，哪一样是假的？你一个外乡人，懂什么印色？"
msgstr "The seal... a Ministry of War paper, the Guardian General's seal—which part of it is fake? You are an outsider. What do you know about seal ink?"

msgid "兵部的令，京师来的，盖着大印。大秦人聚众持械，着本司清出——我也是奉命行事。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War's order, from the Capital, stamped with the great seal. Daqin and others of the Foreign Quarter, gathering under arms—this office is to clear them out. I am only following orders."

msgid "清走了。浪人作的证，兵部的令，本司照办。——那块地？归谁，不是我说了算。"
msgstr "Cleared out. A ronin gave testimony, the Ministry of War gave the order, and this office carries it out.—That land? Whose it is, I do not decide."

msgid "……他们留下了。本司回去查那方印。"
msgstr "...They stayed. This office will go back and look into that seal."

msgid "他们在番坊住了三十年，税从来没拖过。可兵部的令下来了，我有什么法子？"
msgstr "They have lived in the Foreign Quarter thirty years and never been late with the tax. But the Ministry of War's order came down. What can I do?"

msgid "鬼笠馆的。他们想要铁盾会那块地，想了好些年了。兵部的令一下，他们比我还高兴。"
msgstr "Ghost Hat Hall. They have wanted the Iron Shield Guild's land for years. When the Ministry of War's order came down, they were happier than I was."

msgid "京师东二门挂着的那张。各州县都要抄一份，我也抄了。皇叔怎么成了要犯？我一个小吏，不敢问。"
msgstr "The one posted at the Second East Gate in the Capital. Every prefecture and county has to copy it, and I copied it too. How did the Imperial Uncle become a wanted man? I am a petty clerk. I dare not ask."

msgid "京师东二门的原告，番坊照抄。上头让抄，我就抄。"
msgstr "The original from the Second East Gate in the Capital, copied as is in the Foreign Quarter. Above says copy, so I copy."

msgid "收税、查货、看船。番坊的船都是外头的，税是我的。"
msgstr "Collect taxes, check goods, watch ships. The ships in the Foreign Quarter are all from outside, and the tax is mine."

msgid "南边来的，西边来的，没有一条是番坊的。番坊人不造船，只卸货。"
msgstr "From the south, from the west. Not one belongs to the Foreign Quarter. The people here do not build ships. They only unload them."

msgid "市集北头。去吧，去告诉他们：兵部的令是兵部的令，不是我冯禄的令。"
msgstr "North end of the market. Go and tell them: the Ministry of War's order is the Ministry of War's order, not Feng Lu's order."

msgid "站在院门里，手里举着那纸文书，身后四个戴斗笠的浪人。"
msgstr " stands inside the courtyard gate holding up the paper, four ronin in straw hats behind him."

msgid "兵部的令在此：番坊大秦人等，聚众持械，着市舶司即日清出！——安敦，出来说话。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War's order is here: Daqin and others of the Foreign Quarter, gathering under arms, are to be cleared out by the Maritime Trade Office this very day!—Andun, come out and speak."

msgid "从屋里出来，左腿先，慢。"
msgstr " comes out of the house, left leg first, slowly."

msgid "冯大人。三十年，税没拖过一文。令，我看过——那方镇国大将军的印，不是真印盖的。"
msgstr "Lord Feng. Thirty years, never one wen of tax late. The order, I read it. That seal, the Guardian General's—not stamped with the true seal."

msgid "印是不是，不是你一个番人说了算！"
msgstr "Whether the seal is real is not for you, a foreigner, to say!"

msgid "你有一块印模——卢卡说的。拿出来，对一对。拿不出来……那就看你的了。"
msgstr "You have a seal mold—Luca said so. Take it out and compare. If you cannot... then it is up to you."

msgid "一个瘦瘦的书办，趴在书案的一角抄东西，抄一行，抬一次头，看一眼冯大人。\n"
msgstr "A thin clerk hunches over a corner of the desk, copying. He copies a line, lifts his head, glances at Lord Feng.\n"

msgid "书办揉了揉手腕，又蘸了一笔墨。\n"
msgstr "The clerk rubs his wrist and dips his brush again.\n"

msgid "抄了二十份了，番坊每家门口贴一份。大人说贴，我就抄。"
msgstr "Copied twenty already, one for every door in the Foreign Quarter. His Lordship says post, so I copy."

msgid "那张也是我抄的。於兰天武四个字，我写了一百遍。"
msgstr "I copied that one too. The four characters Yulan Tianwu, I wrote a hundred times."

msgid "大人？大人这几天睡不着。"
msgstr "His Lordship? His Lordship hasn't been sleeping these days."

msgid "一个腰里挂着铁尺的差役，靠着墙站着，一会儿换一条腿。\n"
msgstr "A runner with an iron truncheon at his belt leans against the wall, shifting from one leg to the other.\n"

msgid "差役打了个哈欠。\n"
msgstr "The runner yawns.\n"

msgid "差役看了看墙头上的碎瓷片，又看了看你。\n"
msgstr "The runner looks at the broken porcelain along the top of the wall, then at you.\n"

msgid "铁盾会那些人，个个带剑，个子比我高一头。真要清……就凭我们两个？"
msgstr "Those Iron Shield men, every one armed, a head taller than me. Clear them out? Just the two of us?"

msgid "后院那些箱子？扣下来的。有的扣了三个月，有的扣了三年。"
msgstr "The crates in the back yard? Seized. Some for three months, some for three years."

msgid "鬼笠馆的人倒是来过，问大人什么时候动手。大人说等。"
msgstr "Ghost Hat Hall people did come by, asking when His Lordship moves. His Lordship said wait."

msgid "铁盾会会首"
msgstr "Guild Head, Iron Shield Guild"

msgid "一个白头发的异族老人，眼睛是灰的，鼻梁高得像一道脊。他坐着的时候背很直，站起来却慢——左腿有旧伤，先迈左腿。一身中原的布袍，袍子底下露出一截铁片甲的边。他说中原话说得很慢，一个字一个字，省掉的字比说出来的多。\n"
msgstr "An old foreigner with white hair and gray eyes, a nose high as a ridge. Seated, his back is straight; standing, he is slow—an old wound in his left leg, which he steps out first. He wears a Central Plains cloth gown, and under it the edge of iron-plate armor shows. He speaks the Central Plains tongue very slowly, one word at a time, leaving out more words than he says.\n"

msgid "安敦把铜灯的灯芯拨亮了一点。\n"
msgstr "Andun turns the wick of the copper lamp up a little.\n"

msgid "安敦看着墙上那面旧盾，很久没有动。\n"
msgstr "Andun looks at the old shield on the wall and does not move for a long time.\n"

msgid "祖上"
msgstr "Forefathers"

msgid "三百年前。皇叔於兰淳焉，打北方的蛮族——雇了我们。一百二十个剑手，从西边来。打完，留下三十个。我是第十二代。"
msgstr "Three hundred years ago. The Imperial Uncle Yulan Chunyan, fighting the northern barbarians—hired us. One hundred twenty swordsmen, from the west. After the war, thirty stayed. I am the twelfth generation."

msgid "三十个里的一个。他看见了——那个鬼的头，怎么封的。活着的时候不说。死前，刻在一片铜上。"
msgstr "One of the thirty. He saw it—that ghost's head, how it was sealed. While alive, he did not tell. Before death, he carved it on a piece of copper."

msgid "牒在你手里。读了，再还我们一个人情——冯禄来的时候，站在门口。"
msgstr "The tablet is in your hands. Read it, then repay us a favor: when Feng Lu comes, stand at the gate."

msgid "巴掌大，一片铜。十二代，传到我。三十年前，我把它存进拜火祠——火前最安全，没人敢在火前拿不是自己的东西。"
msgstr "Palm-sized, a piece of copper. Twelve generations, down to me. Thirty years ago I put it in the Fire Shrine—before the fire is safest, nobody dares take what is not theirs before the fire."

msgid "祠规：火前不说谎。取牒，要过一场问话。三句。"
msgstr "Shrine rule: no lying before the fire. To take the tablet, one must pass a questioning. Three questions."

msgid "看着桌上的灯。"
msgstr " looks at the lamp on the table."

msgid "我们过不了。三十年前，为了这块地，我们对祭司说过一句谎。火记得。"
msgstr "We cannot pass. Thirty years ago, for this land, we told the priest one lie. The fire remembers."

msgid "你不是我们的人。你去。——先想好，站哪边：市舶司要清走我们，浪人要我们的地。"
msgstr "You are not one of us. You go.—First think which side you stand on: the Maritime Trade Office wants to clear us out, the ronin want our land."

msgid "坐下。先说我的祖上。"
msgstr "Sit. First, my forefathers."

msgid "封头"
msgstr "Sealing the Head"

msgid "牒上刻的。我读过，记不全——「头在湖底」，别的，你自己读。"
msgstr "What the tablet says. I have read it, I do not remember it all—\"The head lies at the bottom of the lake\"—the rest, read yourself."

msgid "先问铜牒。"
msgstr "Ask about the tablet first."

msgid "站大秦人"
msgstr "Side with the Daqin"

msgid "站到大秦人一边——在拜火祠过问话取铜牒，替他们挡住冯禄的文书。从此鬼笠馆不见你，浪人刀法学不到。要站大秦人吗？"
msgstr "Side with the Daqin people: pass the questioning at the Fire Shrine for the copper tablet, and turn back Feng Lu's papers for them. From then on Ghost Hat Hall will not see you, and you cannot learn the ronin's blade. Side with the Daqin?"

msgid "你站了我们这边。去祠里，火前说真话。"
msgstr "You stood with us. Go to the shrine, and tell the truth before the fire."

msgid "你去了鬼笠馆。……没有话说。"
msgstr "You went to Ghost Hat Hall. ...I have nothing to say to you."

msgid "看了你很久，站了起来——慢，左腿先。"
msgstr " looks at you a long while, then stands—slowly, left leg first."

msgid "好。那你替我们去火前。三句真话，牒是你的。"
msgstr "Good. Then go before the fire in our place. Three true answers, and the tablet is yours."

msgid "读了，再还我们一个人情：冯禄来的时候，站在门口。"
msgstr "Read it, then repay us a favor: when Feng Lu comes, stand at the gate."

msgid "先听我说完铜牒的事。"
msgstr "First hear me finish about the tablet."

msgid "冯禄走了。地还是我们的。——你欠我们的人情，我们记着；我们欠你的，也记着。"
msgstr "Feng Lu is gone. The land is still ours.—The favor you owe us, we remember. The favor we owe you, we remember also."

msgid "冯禄。兵部的文书，说我们聚众持械。三十年，税没拖过一文。文书的印——卢卡说，你看得出。"
msgstr "Feng Lu. A Ministry of War paper, saying we gather under arms. Thirty years, never one wen of tax late. The paper's seal—Luca says you can tell."

msgid "假的。你让他自己看见了。"
msgstr "False. You made him see it himself."

msgid "你看出来了。假印。兵部没有下这个令——有人借兵部的名字要我们的地。"
msgstr "You saw it. A false seal. The Ministry of War gave no such order—someone borrowed its name to take our land."

msgid "冯禄案上压着。你去看。印色——卢卡说你学过。"
msgstr "On Feng Lu's desk, pressed down. Go and see. The seal color—Luca says you studied it."

msgid "鬼笠馆。早川。他们要这块地——练刀的板地不够用。冯禄一动手，他们就来。"
msgstr "Ghost Hat Hall. Hayakawa. They want this land—their plank floor for sword practice is not enough. The moment Feng Lu moves, they come."

msgid "好孩子。走了一个月，剑没卖。"
msgstr "Good boy. Walked a month. The sword did not sell."

msgid "没有了。城烧了，人散了。我们不是使臣，是剩下的人。"
msgstr "Gone. The city burned, the people scattered. We are not envoys. We are what is left."

msgid "盾在前，剑在后。盾不倒，人不倒。三百年，就这一条。"
msgstr "Shield in front, sword behind. If the shield does not fall, the man does not fall. Three hundred years, just this one rule."

msgid "没有头的那个。我们那边的老兵传了三百年。头在哪里，牒上有——去问铜牒。"
msgstr "The one without a head. Our old soldiers passed it down three hundred years. Where the head is, the tablet says—ask about the copper tablet."

msgid "盾"
msgstr "Shield"

msgid "从架上取下一面圆盾，递给你。"
msgstr " takes a round shield down from the rack and hands it to you."

msgid "拿着。盾在前，剑在后——盾不倒，人不倒。套在左臂上，再来学剑。"
msgstr "Take it. Shield in front, sword behind—if the shield does not fall, the man does not fall. Put it on your left arm, then come learn the sword."

msgid "盾给过你了。丢了的话，市集铜器铺有卖的。"
msgstr "You have the shield already. If you lose it, the copper shop in the market sells them."

msgid "盾在前，剑在后。会里的规矩。"
msgstr "Shield in front, sword behind. A rule of the Guild."

msgid "抬起头，灰眼睛看了你一会儿，站了起来——慢，左腿先。"
msgstr " raises his head, gray eyes on you a while, then stands—slowly, left leg first."

msgid "卢卡的人。他说，你在找一把剑钉着的头。"
msgstr "Luca's man. He says you look for a head pinned by a sword."

msgid "坐。我的祖上见过它。三百年前，皇叔於兰淳焉打北方的蛮族，雇了我们一百二十个剑手。"
msgstr "Sit. My forefathers saw it. Three hundred years ago, the Imperial Uncle Yulan Chunyan fought the northern barbarians, and hired us, one hundred twenty swordsmen."

msgid "其中一个，看见那个鬼的头怎么封的。他死前，刻在一片铜上。十二代，传到我——问我「铜牒」。"
msgstr "One of them saw how that ghost's head was sealed. Before he died, he carved it on a piece of copper. Twelve generations, down to me—ask me about the \"Copper Tablet.\""

msgid "被两个差役押在船边，手上一副枷。他看见你，看了很久，没有说话。"
msgstr " stands at the side of the boat between two runners, a cangue on his hands. He sees you and looks a long while without a word."

msgid "关北的事传到海边了：有人借了槐阳王的兵，踏平了兵部的工地。兵部说关北反了——说的是你吧。"
msgstr "News from Beyond the Pass reached the sea: someone borrowed the Prince of Huaiyang's soldiers and flattened the Ministry of War's work site. The Ministry says Beyond the Pass has rebelled—they mean you."

msgid "关北的工地一夜里少了一半人，兵部到今天没查出是谁。……是你。"
msgstr "The work site Beyond the Pass lost half its men in one night, and the Ministry has not found out who, to this day. ...It was you."

msgid "冯禄的事还没了结。了结了，再说拜师。"
msgstr "Feng Lu's business is not finished. When it is finished, we will speak of apprenticeship."

msgid "好。盾在前，剑在后——从今天起，你是铁盾会的人。"
msgstr "Good. Shield in front, sword behind—from today, you are of the Iron Shield Guild."

msgid "一个高鼻深目的异族汉子，头发剪得很短，左臂绑着一面圆盾，右手一把短剑。他练得满头是汗，盾面上全是剑尖戳出来的白点。\n"
msgstr "A big-nosed, deep-eyed foreigner with closely cropped hair, a round shield strapped to his left arm and a short sword in his right hand. He is drenched in sweat from drilling, and the shield is covered in white dints from sword points.\n"

msgid "大秦剑手把盾往上一抬，短剑从盾沿底下刺出去。\n"
msgstr "The Daqin swordsman lifts his shield, and his short sword thrusts out from under the rim.\n"

msgid "大秦剑手喊了一声号子，谁也听不懂。\n"
msgstr "The Daqin swordsman shouts a drill-cry nobody can understand.\n"

msgid "两面盾砰地撞在一起。\n"
msgstr "Two shields crash together.\n"

msgid "大秦剑手喝道：盾！\n"
msgstr "The Daqin swordsman shouts, \"Shield!\"\n"

msgid "里头。安敦。我们的头——他说的话，就是会里的话。"
msgstr "Inside. Andun. Our head. What he says is the Guild's word."

msgid "盾在前，剑在后。盾不倒，人不倒。——会首教的。"
msgstr "Shield in front, sword behind. If shield does not fall, man does not fall.—The Guild Head teaches it."

msgid "要清我们走。走哪儿去？西边没有了。"
msgstr "Wants us out. Out to where? West is gone."

msgid "刀快。可他们没有盾。"
msgstr "Their blades are fast. But they have no shields."

msgid "回来了。剑没卖。会首说他做得对。"
msgstr "Came back. The sword did not sell. The Guild Head said he did right."

msgid "拜火祠祭司"
msgstr "Priest of the Fire Shrine"

msgid "一个瘦高的老人，白袍，白帽，嘴上蒙着一块白布——人说是怕他的气息污了火。他的眼睛被火光照得发亮，看人的时候一眨也不眨。\n"
msgstr "A tall, thin old man in a white robe and white cap, his mouth covered with a white cloth—people say so that his breath will not defile the fire. His eyes shine with the firelight, and he looks at people without blinking.\n"

msgid "穆护站在火坛前，一动不动，火光在他的白袍上一明一暗。\n"
msgstr "The Magus stands before the fire altar without moving, the firelight rising and falling on his white robe.\n"

msgid "穆护往火里添了什么，火没有变。\n"
msgstr "The Magus puts something into the fire. The fire does not change.\n"

msgid "火"
msgstr "Fire"

msgid "三百年没灭。不是我们在喂它——是它在看我们。"
msgstr "Three hundred years it has not gone out. We do not feed it. It watches us."

msgid "祠规"
msgstr "Shrine Rule"

msgid "一条：火前不说谎。说了，火知道。"
msgstr "One. No lying before the fire. If you lie, the fire knows."

msgid "问话"
msgstr "Questioning"

msgid "问过了。牒在你手里。"
msgstr "Already asked. The tablet is in your hands."

msgid "站到火前去。我问，你答。火听着。"
msgstr "Stand before the fire. I ask, you answer. The fire listens."

msgid "火前只问站定了的人。"
msgstr "Before the fire, only those who have taken a stand are asked."

msgid "牒在你手里了。火让你拿的，不是我。"
msgstr "The tablet is in your hands. The fire let you take it, not I."

msgid "大秦人存的。三十年了。他们取不了——他们在火前说过谎。你要取，火前站着，答我三句。真话，牒给你；一句假，今天火不肯。"
msgstr "The Daqin people left it. Thirty years. They cannot take it—they lied before the fire. If you wish to take it, stand before the fire and answer me three. True answers, the tablet is yours. One false answer, and the fire refuses today."

msgid "祠里存的东西，各有各的主。你问的是谁的？"
msgstr "What is kept in the shrine has its owner, each its own. Whose do you ask about?"

msgid "三十年前，他们为了一块地在火前说过一句谎。火记着。他们自己也记着。"
msgstr "Thirty years ago, for a piece of land, they told a lie before the fire. The fire remembers. They remember too."

msgid "刀是刀，火是火。他们不进来。"
msgstr "A blade is a blade, fire is fire. They do not come in."

msgid "冯禄不进来。他的文书也不进来。"
msgstr "Feng Lu does not come in. His papers do not come in."

msgid "抬起一只手，掌心向你。"
msgstr " raises one hand, palm toward you."

msgid "进来可以。火前，不说谎。"
msgstr "You may come in. Before the fire, no lying."

msgid "一个跪在火坛前的胡商，额头贴着地，嘴里低低地念着什么。他的背上还搭着赶路的毡子，鞋底的泥是黄的——刚进番坊。\n"
msgstr "A merchant kneeling before the fire altar, forehead to the ground, murmuring something low. A felt for the road is still over his back, and the mud on his soles is yellow—he has just arrived in the Foreign Quarter.\n"

msgid "拜火的胡商把额头贴在地上，很久没有抬起来。\n"
msgstr "The fire worshipper lays his forehead on the ground and does not lift it for a long time.\n"

msgid "拜火的胡商低低地念着什么，一句接一句。\n"
msgstr "The fire worshipper murmurs, sentence after sentence.\n"

msgid "我从西边来，走了一年。到了这儿，先拜火，再做生意。"
msgstr "I came from the west, a year on the road. Arrive here, first worship the fire, then do business."

msgid "祭司"
msgstr "Priest"

msgid "穆护不骗人，也不让人骗。做生意的人，怕他。"
msgstr "The Magus does not cheat people, and does not let them be cheated. Traders fear him."

msgid "他们不进来。三十年了。"
msgstr "They do not come in. Thirty years."

msgid "一个七十来岁的老僧，皮肤黝黑，光头，眉毛全白了，耳垂长得几乎到肩。他盘腿坐在榕树下的蒲团上，一身赭红的僧衣，手里一串黑木的念珠拨得很慢。他说中原话带着天竺的腔，可一个字也不错。\n"
msgstr "An old monk of seventy or so, dark-skinned and bald, his eyebrows all white, his earlobes hanging almost to his shoulders. He sits cross-legged on a prayer mat under the banyan tree in an ocher-red robe, a string of black wooden beads moving slowly in his hand. He speaks the Central Plains tongue with an Indian lilt, but not one word of it is wrong.\n"

msgid "龙若法王拨着念珠，嘴唇动着，没有声音。\n"
msgstr "Dharma King Longruo moves his beads, lips moving, without a sound.\n"

msgid "龙若法王抬头看了看榕树，说道：阿弥陀佛。\n"
msgstr "Dharma King Longruo looks up at the banyan and says: Amitabha.\n"

msgid "阿弥陀佛！你我同是出家人，何故跟老衲开这等玩笑？"
msgstr "Amitabha! We are both of the cloth. Why make such a joke with this old monk?"

msgid "阿弥陀佛！女施主，这里是寺庙，请到尼庵去剃度吧。"
msgstr "Amitabha! Lady Benefactor, this is a temple. Please go to a nunnery to be tonsured."

msgid "阿弥陀佛！善哉！善哉！施主若真心皈依我佛，请跪下受戒。"
msgstr "Amitabha! Good, good! If the Benefactor truly takes refuge in the Buddha, please kneel and receive the precepts."

msgid "寺"
msgstr "Temple"

msgid "日陀罗寺。两个天竺僧人盖的，老衲是第二代。寺小，佛不小。"
msgstr "Ritola Temple. Built by two Indian monks, and this old monk is the second generation. The temple is small. The Buddha is not small."

msgid "山烟寺的独眼头陀？他的内功和老衲的是一个根——都是从西边的西边来的。阿弥陀佛。"
msgstr "The One-Eyed Ascetic of Mountain Mist Temple? His inner force and this old monk's have one root—both came from the west of the west. Amitabha."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。他们拜的火，和老衲拜的佛，隔着一条街。火也好，佛也好，都不叫人撒谎。"
msgstr "Amitabha. Their fire and this old monk's Buddha are a street apart. Fire or Buddha, neither lets a man lie."

msgid "刀出鞘，火就灭。老衲说过他们，他们不听。"
msgstr "When the blade leaves the sheath, the fire goes out. This old monk has told them. They do not listen."

msgid "大秦人存在火前的那片铜？老衲听说过。三百年前的事，刻在铜上，铜不会老。"
msgstr "The piece of copper the Daqin people left before the fire? This old monk has heard of it. A matter of three hundred years ago, carved in copper. Copper does not grow old."

msgid "第一代的师父从天竺带来一根枝条，插在这儿，活了。树活了七十年，老衲也活了七十年。"
msgstr "My first-generation master brought a branch from India and planted it here, and it lived. The tree has lived seventy years, and this old monk has lived seventy years."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。山烟寺的事，是山烟寺的事。"
msgstr "Amitabha. Mountain Mist Temple's business is Mountain Mist Temple's business."

msgid "他受了戒？"
msgstr "He took the vows?"

msgid "双手合十，朝东拜了一拜。"
msgstr " presses his palms together and bows once toward the east."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。十年，总算进了那道门。"
msgstr "Amitabha. Ten years, and at last he passed through that gate."

msgid "经送回来了。他没进寺门，把经匣放在门槛上，往西去了。三十年前不收，今天也不收。阿弥陀佛——收不收，是山烟寺的事。"
msgstr "The sutra has been sent back. He did not enter the temple gate. He laid the sutra case on the threshold and went west. Thirty years ago they would not take it, and today they will not. Amitabha—whether they take it is Mountain Mist Temple's business."

msgid "他上了殿？那就等玄智开口吧。"
msgstr "He went up into the hall? Then wait for Xuanzhi to speak."

msgid "又从经匣里抽出一片贝叶，在叶边写了同样一行字。"
msgstr " takes another palm-leaf page from the sutra case and writes the same line in its margin."

msgid "这一片，别再丢了。"
msgstr "This one, do not lose again."

msgid "那片贝叶，拿给他看。"
msgstr "Show him that palm-leaf page."

msgid "拨念珠的手停了。"
msgstr "'s hand stops moving the beads."

msgid "他开口了？……十年，他没跟人说过一句话。"
msgstr "He spoke? ...Ten years, he has not said a word to anyone."

msgid "三十年前，老衲四十一岁。师父从天竺背来两部经：一部是莲华心法的根，一部是婆萝蜜多心经。师父说，中原有一座山烟寺，医术通神，这两部经该放在那里。"
msgstr "Thirty years ago, this old monk was forty-one. My master carried two sutras from India: one the root of the Lotus Heart Method, one the Heart Sutra. My master said there is a Mountain Mist Temple in the Central Plains, its healing arts divine, and these two sutras should rest there."

msgid "老衲背着经走到日照山。当时的住持只认本寺一脉，经匣没有打开，就请老衲下了山。"
msgstr "This old monk carried the sutras to Sunlit Mountain. The abbot of the time recognized only the temple's own line. The sutra case was not opened, and this old monk was asked to go down the mountain."

msgid "山门外，一个年轻和尚追了出来，说他叫玄尘，是玄智的师弟。他说，经他想看。"
msgstr "Outside the mountain gate, a young monk ran after me. He said his name was Xuanchen, Xuanzhi's junior. He said he wanted to read the sutras."

msgid "望着榕树，很久没有说话。"
msgstr " gazes at the banyan and says nothing for a long while."

msgid "十年前，老衲的一个弟子说，要把婆萝蜜多心经再送回山烟寺去。这部经是火性的，性急的人练不得——他性急，练坏了一只眼。老衲没有拦他。"
msgstr "Ten years ago, one of this old monk's disciples said he would take the Heart Sutra back to Mountain Mist Temple. That sutra is of the nature of fire; an impatient man cannot practice it—he was impatient, and ruined one eye. This old monk did not stop him."

msgid "玄智没让他进门。他就站在金门外，一站十年。"
msgstr "Xuanzhi would not let him in. So he stood outside the Golden Gate, ten years."

msgid "从经匣里抽出一片贝叶，提笔在叶边写了一行字，递给你。"
msgstr " takes a palm-leaf page from the sutra case, writes a line in its margin with a brush, and hands it to you."

msgid "这是婆萝蜜多心经的第一页。拿给他看——叶边是老衲的字，他认得。他不理人，这一页他会看。"
msgstr "This is the first page of the Heart Sutra. Show it to him—the margin is in this old monk's hand, he will know it. He pays no one any mind, but this page he will read."

msgid "收不收，是山烟寺的事。"
msgstr "Whether it is accepted is for Mountain Mist Temple to say."

msgid "玄尘"
msgstr "Xuanchen"

msgid "了尘？那个跟在玄尘身后的小沙弥……也老了吧。"
msgstr "Liaochen? That little novice who followed behind Xuanchen... he must be old now too."

msgid "老衲没有点化过玄尘。老衲只是没拦他。"
msgstr "This old monk did not enlighten Xuanchen. This old monk only did not stop him."

msgid "青石村后山那个阵，你走过了。摆阵的人佛道双修——就是他。"
msgstr "The formation on the back mountain of Bluestone Village, you have walked it. The one who set it is a man of both Buddha and Dao—it is him."

msgid "他往北去了。老衲只听人说过，青石村后山有一个阵。"
msgstr "He went north. This old monk only heard that there is a formation on the back mountain of Bluestone Village."

msgid "玄尘在番坊住了一年。佛经也看，大秦人的书也看，浪人的刀谱也看。老衲说他是佛门的人，他说他想做一个不拣经的人。"
msgstr "Xuanchen lived in the Foreign Quarter a year. He read the sutras, the Daqin people's books, the ronin's sword manuals. This old monk said he was of the Buddha's gate; he said he wanted to be a man who does not pick among sutras."

msgid "二十九年前，他往北去了，身后跟着一个从山烟寺带出来的小沙弥。"
msgstr "Twenty-nine years ago he went north, a little novice from Mountain Mist Temple following behind him."

msgid "青石村后山那个阵，你走过了？摆阵的人佛道双修，自号绝尘——就是他。"
msgstr "The formation on the back mountain of Bluestone Village, you have walked it? The one who set it is a man of both Buddha and Dao, who calls himself Juechen—it is him."

msgid "他还好吗？……不用说。出了阵，就是世事。"
msgstr "Is he well? ...No need to say. Out of the formation, it is worldly affairs."

msgid "后来的事，老衲只听人说过：青石村后山有一个阵，阵里的人出不来，阵外的人进不去。摆阵的人，佛道双修。"
msgstr "What came after, this old monk only heard: on the back mountain of Bluestone Village there is a formation; those in it cannot come out, those outside cannot get in. The one who set it is a man of both Buddha and Dao."

msgid "一个皮肤黝黑的僧人，光头，赤脚，身上裹着一块赭红的布。他念的经没有一个字听得懂，调子却很好听。\n"
msgstr "A dark-skinned monk, bald and barefoot, wrapped in a length of ocher-red cloth. Not one word of the sutra he chants can be understood, but the tune is lovely.\n"

msgid "天竺僧低声念着经，调子一起一伏。\n"
msgstr "The Indian monk chants low, the tune rising and falling.\n"

msgid "天竺僧双手合十，朝榕树的方向拜了一拜。\n"
msgstr "The Indian monk presses his palms together and bows once toward the banyan.\n"

msgid "法王"
msgstr "Dharma King"

msgid "法王七十一了。他说他还要收十个弟子，收满了就坐化。"
msgstr "The Dharma King is seventy-one. He says he will take ten more disciples, and when the tenth is taken, he will pass on."

msgid "贝叶经。从天竺背来的，一片叶子一页。"
msgstr "Palm-leaf sutras. Carried from India, one leaf a page."

msgid "山烟寺？那边有一位独眼的头陀，他的内功和我们的是一个根。法王说的。"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple? A one-eyed ascetic is there; his inner force and ours have one root. The Dharma King said so."

msgid "第一代师父带来的一根枝条。现在你看——一棵树像一片林子。"
msgstr "A branch the first-generation master brought. Now look—one tree like a forest."

msgid "他们的火在街那头。我们的佛在这头。中间是卖香料的。"
msgstr "Their fire is at the end of the street. Our Buddha is at this end. Between us, the spice sellers."

msgid "鬼笠馆馆主"
msgstr "Master of Ghost Hat Hall"

msgid "一个五十来岁的倭人，瘦，背挺得笔直，头发在头顶挽成一个髻。他坐在板屋尽头，一把窄而弯的长刀横在膝上，两只手搭在刀鞘上，一动不动。他的中原话说得很慢，一个字一个字。\n"
msgstr "A Japanese man of fifty or so, thin, his back perfectly straight, his hair knotted into a topknot. He sits at the far end of the plank house, a long, narrow, curved blade across his knees, both hands resting on the scabbard, perfectly still. He speaks the Central Plains tongue slowly, one word at a time.\n"

msgid "早川直义坐着不动，刀横在膝上。\n"
msgstr "Hayakawa Naoyoshi sits without moving, the blade across his knees.\n"

msgid "早川直义的拇指把刀往外推了一寸，又按了回去。\n"
msgstr "Hayakawa Naoyoshi's thumb pushes the blade an inch out of its sheath and presses it back.\n"

msgid "你站了那边。我们没有话说。"
msgstr "You stood on that side. We have nothing to say."

msgid "在你手里了。火前拿的也好，夜里拿的也好——铜不认人。"
msgstr "It is in your hands. Taken before the fire or taken at night—copper does not know people."

msgid "夜里。拜火祠。火坛前站着，别出声。"
msgstr "Night. The Fire Shrine. Stand before the altar, and make no sound."

msgid "要铜牒？过我一刀。"
msgstr "You want the tablet? Get past my one stroke."

msgid "大秦人存在火前的东西。你要？"
msgstr "What the Daqin people left before the fire. You want it?"

msgid "站浪人"
msgstr "Side with the Ronin"

msgid "站到浪人一边——过早川一刀，夜里让浪人替你从拜火祠偷出铜牒；浪人会给冯禄的文书作证，市舶司就把大秦人清出番坊。从此铁盾会不认你，大秦人的盾剑学不到。要站浪人吗？"
msgstr "Side with the ronin: get past Hayakawa's one stroke, and at night the ronin steal the copper tablet from the Fire Shrine for you; the ronin will testify for Feng Lu's papers, and the Maritime Trade Office will clear the Daqin people out of the Foreign Quarter. From then on the Iron Shield Guild will not know you, and you cannot learn the Daqin shield and sword. Side with the ronin?"

msgid "站过了。刀在这里——过我一刀。"
msgstr "You have taken your stand. The blade is here—get past my one stroke."

msgid "看了你很久，把刀从膝上拿起来，横在你面前。"
msgstr " looks at you for a long time, lifts the blade off his knees and holds it crosswise before you."

msgid "好。铜牒，我们替你拿——火前拿不到的东西，夜里拿。"
msgstr "Good. The tablet, we will take for you—what cannot be taken before the fire is taken at night."

msgid "先过我一刀。一击之内定生死。"
msgstr "First, pass my blade. Life or death within one stroke."

msgid "大秦人的铜牒，你还没听他们说过。先去铁盾会。"
msgstr "The Daqin people's tablet, you have not yet heard them speak of it. Go to the Iron Shield Guild first."

msgid "一刀"
msgstr "One Stroke"

msgid "一击之内定生死。刀出鞘，只出一次。"
msgstr "Life or death within one stroke. The blade leaves the sheath once only."

msgid "门规"
msgstr "House Rule"

msgid "门口那块牌子。一击之内定生死——刀出鞘，只出一次，出了就不收。"
msgstr "The sign at the door. Life or death within one stroke—the blade is drawn once only, and once drawn, it is not taken back."

msgid "鬼笠"
msgstr "Ghost Hat"

msgid "门上那顶斗笠。从倭国来的时候戴的，破了，挂着。馆就叫这个。"
msgstr "The straw hat on the door. Worn when we came from Japan. It is torn, so it hangs. The hall is named for it."

msgid "地"
msgstr "The Land"

msgid "铁盾会那块地，三十年前是我们的。火前，他们说了一句谎，地就成了他们的。"
msgstr "The Iron Shield Guild's land was ours thirty years ago. Before the fire, they told one lie, and the land became theirs."

msgid "盾在前，剑在后。好。可一击之内，盾没有用。"
msgstr "Shield in front, sword behind. Good. But within one stroke, the shield is useless."

msgid "火不说谎。人说。"
msgstr "Fire does not lie. People do."

msgid "三十年前，他们在火前说了一句谎。火没蹿起来——火也会看人。"
msgstr "Thirty years ago they told a lie before the fire. The fire did not leap up—fire also watches people."

msgid "……他的印是假的。我们早知道。"
msgstr "...His seal is false. We knew from the start."

msgid "市舶司的。他要人，我们借他四个。差，是他的差。"
msgstr "The Maritime Trade Office's man. He wants men, we lend him four. The errand is his."

msgid "从架上取下一把刀，连鞘扔给你。"
msgstr " takes a blade from the rack and tosses it to you, scabbard and all."

msgid "你的。出鞘，只出一次。"
msgstr "Yours. Drawn once only."

msgid "刀给过你了。"
msgstr "The blade was given you."

msgid "架上的刀，都是出过鞘的。"
msgstr "Every blade on the rack has been drawn."

msgid "抬眼看了你一下，又低下头。"
msgstr " glances up at you, then lowers his head again."

msgid "从板屋尽头抬起头。"
msgstr " raises his head from the far end of the plank house."

msgid "过他一刀"
msgstr "Face One Stroke"

msgid "早川直义的一刀是真砍：\n· 只有一刀，实打实地落在你身上，挨中了会受伤。\n· 接不住，你随后会昏倒；他收着刀，不会要你的命。\n倒了可以歇好再来。\n确定过他一刀吗？"
msgstr "Hayakawa Naoyoshi's stroke is real:\n· Only one stroke, landing squarely on you. If it hits, you are hurt.\n· If you cannot take it, you will fall afterward; he holds the blade back and will not take your life.\nIf you fall, you can rest and try again.\nFace his one stroke?"

msgid "早川直义站了起来，刀还在鞘里。「一击之内定生死。」——刀出鞘了。"
msgstr "Hayakawa Naoyoshi stands, the blade still in its scabbard. \"Life or death within one stroke.\"—The blade is out."

msgid "早川直义把刀插回鞘里：「不够。歇好了再来。」"
msgstr "Hayakawa Naoyoshi slides the blade back into its scabbard: \"Not enough. Rest, and come back.\""

msgid "早川直义收刀入鞘：「过了。今夜，拜火祠——火坛前站着，别出声。」"
msgstr "Hayakawa Naoyoshi sheathes the blade: \"Passed. Tonight, the Fire Shrine—stand before the altar, and make no sound.\""

msgid "在鬼笠馆接下了早川直义的一刀"
msgstr "Took Hayakawa Naoyoshi's one stroke at Ghost Hat Hall"

msgid "宗道"
msgstr "Dojo Master"

msgid "一刀都没过，拜什么师。"
msgstr "You have not taken the stroke. What apprenticeship?"

msgid "……刀出鞘，只出一次。记住。从今天起，你是鬼笠馆的人。"
msgstr "...The blade leaves the sheath once only. Remember. From today, you are of Ghost Hat Hall."

msgid "鬼笠馆"
msgstr "Ghost Hat Hall"

msgid "一个戴斗笠的倭人，斗笠压得很低，只看得见下巴。他腰里一把窄而弯的长刀，两只手一直离刀柄不远。\n"
msgstr "A Japanese man in a straw hat pulled low, only his chin showing. At his waist a long, narrow, curved blade, and his hands never far from the hilt.\n"

msgid "浪人举刀，劈下，收刀——只有一刀。\n"
msgstr "The ronin raises his blade, cuts down, sheathes—only one stroke.\n"

msgid "浪人把斗笠往下按了按。\n"
msgstr "The ronin presses his straw hat down.\n"

msgid "浪人喝道：一刀！\n"
msgstr "The ronin shouts, \"One stroke!\"\n"

msgid "馆主"
msgstr "Master"

msgid "板屋尽头坐着的。早川。"
msgstr "The one sitting at the end of the plank house. Hayakawa."

msgid "一击之内定生死。"
msgstr "Life or death within one stroke."

msgid "那块地是我们的。"
msgstr "That land is ours."

msgid "借我们四个。差是他的，刀是我们的。"
msgstr "Lent him four of us. The errand is his, the blade is ours."

msgid "一个戴斗笠的倭人，刀已经出了鞘，窄而弯的刀身贴着小臂。\n"
msgstr "A Japanese man in a straw hat, his blade already drawn, the narrow curved blade lying along his forearm.\n"

msgid "一个从头到脚裹在黑布里的人，蹲在火坛后头，只露一双眼睛。火光照不到他。\n"
msgstr "A person wrapped head to foot in black cloth crouches behind the fire altar, only his eyes showing. The firelight does not reach him.\n"

msgid "从火坛后头站起来，手里一片发黑的铜。"
msgstr " rises from behind the fire altar, a piece of blackened copper in his hand."

msgid "净室里传出一声骂，是波斯话。门没有开。\n"
msgstr "A curse comes from the priest's chamber, in Persian. The door does not open.\n"

msgid "拿着。走。"
msgstr "Take it. Go."

msgid "黑影翻过屋顶的方洞，没了。火坛底下的暗格开着，空的。\n"
msgstr "The black shadow vaults over the square hole in the roof and is gone. The hidden compartment under the fire altar stands open, empty.\n"

msgid "忘情谷外的小路出了林子，地势一下子高了。眼前是一片光秃秃的崖头，风很大，草都贴着地长。往西看，崖下是一片灰蓝，一直铺到天边——那是海。路边一座小石龛，龛前摆着几个贝壳。路顺着崖往南下去。\n"
msgstr "The path outside Forgetting Valley comes out of the woods and the ground suddenly rises. Ahead is a bare cliff top, the wind strong, the grass growing flat to the ground. Looking west, below the cliff a gray-blue expanse runs to the edge of the sky—the sea. By the road stands a small stone shrine, a few shells set before it. The road goes down the cliff to the south.\n"

msgid "路是从崖壁上凿出来的。东边是黑褐色的石壁，西边一道矮矮的石沿，石沿外头就是海。浪打在崖脚，轰的一声碎成白沫，风把水星子一直吹到路上。路面湿漉漉的，凿出来的台阶让背盐的脚夫踩得发亮。\n"
msgstr "The road is chiseled out of the cliff face. To the east is a black-brown stone wall, to the west a low stone lip, and beyond the lip is the sea. Waves strike the foot of the cliff and burst with a roar into white foam, and the wind blows the spray all the way onto the road. The surface is wet and slick, and the chiseled steps have been trodden shiny by the salt porters.\n"

msgid "崖到这里低了下来，路变成一段石阶，弯弯曲曲地通到下面的码头。从这儿看得见码头上的平底船和一垛一垛的货，再往东是一片挤在一起的屋顶——番坊。海风里有盐味、鱼腥味，还有一股说不上来的香料味。\n"
msgstr "Here the cliff drops lower and the road becomes a run of stone steps winding down to the docks. From here you can see the flat-bottomed boats on the docks and the stacks of goods, and further east a crush of rooftops—the Foreign Quarter. The sea wind carries the smell of salt and fish, and a smell of spice you cannot quite name.\n"

msgid "一道石砌的码头沿着海边铺开，两条木栈道伸进海里。三条平底船拴在栈道边，船身黑乎乎的，帆卷着。卸货的胡商和船工吆喝着把一箱箱货抬上岸；码头当中摆着一张桌子，一个小吏坐在那里收税。往东，一条路通进市集。\n"
msgstr "A stone quay runs along the shore, two wooden jetties reaching out into the sea. Three flat-bottomed boats are tied by the jetties, their hulls blackish, sails furled. Merchants and boatmen unloading cargo shout as they carry crates ashore; in the middle of the quay stands a table where a petty official sits collecting tax. To the east, a road leads into the market.\n"

msgid "码头西头，崖脚下搭着一溜草棚，几根木柱撑着一面草顶，风一大就哗哗地响。棚里堆着渔网、船桨、缆绳，一口锅架在石头上煮着鱼汤。船工没活的时候就坐在这里，补网，晒太阳，骂船主。\n"
msgstr "At the west end of the quay, under the cliff, is a row of thatched sheds: a few wooden posts holding up a straw roof that rattles when the wind rises. Inside are piled fishing nets, oars and mooring ropes, and a pot on stones stews fish soup. When the boatmen have no work they sit here, mending nets, sunning themselves and cursing the shipowners.\n"

msgid "番坊的市集只有一条街，街面是黄土夯的，两边挤满了摊子和矮房子。西头的摊子卖毡毯和琉璃：毡毯挂在竹竿上，红的黄的，花纹是中原没有的；琉璃珠子一串一串，太阳一照，满摊子都是光。南边一座灰墙的院子，门上挂着一块牌子：市舶司。\n"
msgstr "The Foreign Quarter's market is one street, the surface rammed yellow earth, stalls and low houses crowded on both sides. The stalls at the west end sell felt rugs and glass: rugs hang from bamboo poles, red and yellow, with patterns unknown in the Central Plains; strings of glass beads, and when the sun hits them the whole stall is full of light. To the south is a gray-walled yard, a sign hanging on its door: Maritime Trade Office.\n"

msgid "东头的摊子卖香料和铜器。香料装在麻袋里，袋口敞着，黄的是姜黄，红的是胡椒，黑的说不上名字，一条街都是那股味。铜器摊上的壶和盘子敲得叮当响。街的尽头是一座黑石砌的矮房子，门口冒着烟——人说里面的火三百年没灭过。北边一条短巷，通到一扇立着两面大盾的门；南边屋子中间裂开一条坡道，坡底露出一截赭红的寺墙。\n"
msgstr "The stalls at the east end sell spice and copperware. Spice sits in open-mouthed sacks, yellow turmeric, red pepper, black ones whose names you cannot say, and the whole street smells of it. Kettles and plates on the copper stalls ring as they are beaten. At the end of the street is a low house of black stone, smoke rising at its door—they say the fire inside has not gone out in three hundred years. To the north a short alley leads to a door flanked by two great shields; to the south a slope splits open between the houses, and at its foot a stretch of ocher-red temple wall shows.\n"

msgid "巷子尽头是一扇厚木门，门两边各立着一面大盾，比人还高，铁皮包边，盾面上漆着一只展翅的鹰，漆掉了一半。门里传出铁器相碰的声音，还有人用听不懂的话喊着号子。这是大秦人的剑会，番坊人叫它铁盾会。\n"
msgstr "At the end of the alley is a thick wooden door, a shield on each side, taller than a man, iron-edged, an eagle with spread wings painted on each, half the paint gone. From inside comes the clash of iron and men shouting drill-cries in a tongue you cannot understand. This is the Daqin people's sword guild, which the people of the Foreign Quarter call the Iron Shield Guild.\n"

msgid "一间方方正正的公事房，地上铺着青砖。靠里一张大书案，案上堆着账册，压着一杆戥子。墙上贴着几张告示，最新的一张盖着京师的大印。屋角堆着收上来的货：一卷毡子、两只铜壶、一袋胡椒，都贴着封条。\n"
msgstr "A square-built office, the floor laid with bluestone brick. A big desk at the back, heaped with ledgers, a steelyard pressing on them. Several notices on the wall, the newest stamped with the Capital's great seal. In the corner, goods collected as tax: a roll of felt, two copper kettles, a bag of pepper, all with seals pasted on.\n"

msgid "后院不大。靠墙码着一摞扣下来的货箱，箱上的字有中原字，也有弯弯曲曲的胡字。一辆没套牲口的车停在角落里，车辕上拴着一串锁链。墙角有一只箱子让人撬开过——夜里有人翻墙进来，想把自己的货拿回去。\n"
msgstr "The back yard is not large. Along the wall is stacked a pile of seized crates, the writing on them Central Plains characters on some, twisting foreign script on others. A cart with no animal stands in a corner, a chain tied to its shaft. In one corner of the wall a crate has been pried open—someone climbed the wall at night, trying to take his own goods back.\n"

msgid "市集东头的屋子中间裂开一条巷子，往南一路下坡。坡道是黄土夯的，两边是香料铺和胡商客栈的后墙，墙根晒着一排香料口袋，墙头爬着一丛开紫花的藤。坡底一座赭红墙的小寺，寺门口一棵大榕树，气根一根根垂到地上。寺里有时传出一声钟。\n"
msgstr "Between the houses at the east end of the market an alley splits open and runs south, downhill all the way. The slope is rammed yellow earth, with the back walls of spice shops and foreign merchants' inns on both sides, a row of spice sacks sunning at the wall's foot and a vine with purple flowers over the top. At the foot is a small temple with ocher-red walls, a great banyan at its door, aerial roots hanging to the ground one by one. Now and then a bell sounds in the temple.\n"

msgid "厚木门里是一个方方正正的大院子，地上铺着沙，踩出一个个脚印。十来个高鼻深目的汉子两两对着练，左手盾右手短剑，盾撞在一起砰砰地响。北墙下一排盾牌架，架上的圆盾一面挨一面；东墙根几根木桩让剑尖戳得坑坑洼洼。院子北头一间石屋，门敞着——那是会首的屋。\n"
msgstr "Beyond the thick wooden door is a big square yard, the ground paved with sand, trodden into footprints. A dozen or so big-nosed, deep-eyed men drill in pairs, shield in the left hand, short sword in the right, the shields crashing together with a bang. Under the north wall is a row of shield racks, round shields lined edge to edge; at the east wall the posts are pitted and pocked by sword points. At the north end of the yard is a stone room, its door open—that is the Guild Head's room.\n"

msgid "一间石头砌的屋子，不大，屋顶很低。地上铺着一张红底黄花的毡毯，毯子中间一张矮桌，桌上一盏铜灯。墙根靠着一面旧盾，盾面上的鹰只剩一个影子；盾旁边钉着一块木牌，刻着一行弯弯曲曲的字。靠墙一排铺盖卷，卷得整整齐齐。一个白头发的老人坐在矮桌后头。\n"
msgstr "A stone room, not large, the roof low. On the floor a felt rug, yellow flowers on red, and in the middle of the rug a low table with a copper lamp on it. Against the foot of the wall leans an old shield, the eagle on its face only a shadow; beside the shield a wooden tablet is nailed up, carved with a line of twisting script. Along the wall is a row of bedrolls, rolled up neatly. A white-haired old man sits behind the low table.\n"

msgid "殿里很黑，只有当中一团火。火坛是黑石砌的，齐胸高，坛顶的火不高不低地烧着，看不见柴，也看不见油——人说它三百年没灭过。烟从屋顶的一个方洞出去。四壁的黑石让烟熏得发亮。火坛前的地上磨出一块白印子，是跪出来的。东边一道矮门，通到祭司的净室。\n"
msgstr "The hall is very dark, with only a single fire in the middle. The fire altar is built of black stone, chest-high, and the fire on top burns neither high nor low; no wood can be seen, no oil. People say it has not gone out in three hundred years. Smoke leaves through a square hole in the roof. The black stone walls are polished by smoke. In front of the altar a white mark is worn into the floor, knelt into it. To the east, a low door leads to the priest's chamber.\n"

msgid "一间小小的石室，干净得过分：一张窄榻，一只木箱，一盏灯，再没有别的。墙上没有神像，只有一块黑石板，板上刻着一团火的形状。地上扫得一粒灰都没有。\n"
msgstr "A small stone room, clean to excess: a narrow cot, a wooden chest, a lamp, nothing else. No image on the wall, only a black slab carved with the shape of a flame. The floor is swept without one speck of dust.\n"

msgid "一座不大的寺院，赭红的墙，墙头长着草。院子当中一棵大榕树，树冠把半个院子罩住，气根一根根垂下来，有的已经扎进地里成了树干。树下一个蒲团，一个老僧盘腿坐在上头。院角一口铜钟挂在木架上，钟身发绿。东边一间佛殿，门开着，里头一点灯光。南墙开着一道小门，门外的坡道底下是浪人的武馆。\n"
msgstr "A small temple, ocher-red walls, grass growing along their top. In the middle of the yard a great banyan, its crown shading half the yard, aerial roots hanging down, some already rooted in the ground and become trunks. Under the tree is a prayer mat, and an old monk sits cross-legged on it. In a corner of the yard a copper bell hangs on a wooden frame, its body green. To the east is a Buddha hall, its door open and a little lamplight inside. In the south wall is a small gate, and below the slope outside it is the ronin's dojo.\n"

msgid "殿不大，供着一尊佛像，不是中原的样子：高鼻、细眼、卷发，衣褶一道一道贴在身上，是天竺来的。佛前一张供桌，桌上几盏酥油灯，灯火一跳一跳的。地上几个蒲团，一个天竺僧跪在那里念经，念的是谁也听不懂的话。殿角堆着几卷贝叶经。\n"
msgstr "The hall is not large. It holds a Buddha statue not in the Central Plains manner: high nose, narrow eyes, curly hair, the folds of the robe clinging to the body line by line—from India. Before the Buddha is an offering table with several butter lamps flickering. On the floor are a few prayer mats, and an Indian monk kneels there chanting in a tongue no one understands. In a corner of the hall lie several rolls of palm-leaf sutras.\n"

msgid "一道刷黑的木门，门楣上挂着一顶破了边的斗笠——这就是「鬼笠」。门里一小片夯土的门庭，墙根立着一块白木牌，墨写着一行字：「一击之内定生死」。东边一道敞着的板门，里头是练刀的板地，刀劈在木头上的声音一下一下，不紧不慢。\n"
msgstr "A black-painted wooden door, a straw hat with a torn brim hung over the lintel—this is the \"Ghost Hat.\" Inside the door is a small rammed-earth yard, a white wooden sign standing at the wall's foot, written in ink: \"Life or death within one stroke.\" To the east an open plank door, and beyond it the plank floor where blades are practiced, the sound of blades cutting wood coming one at a time, unhurried.\n"

msgid "一间长长的板屋，地上铺着刷黑的木板，板缝里全是刀口。墙上一排刀架，架上的刀都比中原的刀窄、弯。几个浪人在板地上练刀，一人一刀，劈下去就收，谁也不出第二刀。板屋尽头坐着一个人，刀横在膝上，不说话。\n"
msgstr "A long plank house, the floor laid with black-painted boards, the cracks between them full of blade cuts. On the wall a row of blade racks, the blades all narrower and more curved than Central Plains blades. A few ronin practice on the plank floor, one man one blade, cut down and sheathe, nobody drawing a second stroke. At the far end of the plank house sits a man, a blade across his knees, not speaking.\n"

msgid "一座齐腰高的石龛，石头让海风蚀出了一个个小洞。龛里供的不是神像，是一块磨得溜圆的黑石头。石前摆着贝壳、一枚铜钱、半块干饼——都是出海的人放的。龛边刻着两个字：「平安」，字口里长了青苔。\n"
msgstr "A waist-high stone shrine, the stone eaten into many little holes by the sea wind. What it holds is not an image of a god but a black stone worn perfectly round. Before the stone are set shells, a copper coin, half a dry cake—all left by people going to sea. Two characters are carved on the side of the shrine: \"Peace,\" with moss grown in the grooves.\n"

msgid "海是灰蓝的，近处发绿，远处发黑，一直铺到天边，看不见对岸。海上一条船也没有——番坊的船都拴在码头上。浪一排一排地过来，在崖脚撞碎，退下去，又来。\n"
msgstr "The sea is gray-blue, greenish near and black far, spreading to the edge of the sky with no far shore in sight. There is not a boat on it—the Foreign Quarter's boats are all tied up at the docks. Waves come in row after row, break at the cliff's foot, draw back, and come again.\n"

msgid "三条平底船，船底平，船头方，帆是竹篾一片一片编的。船身刷的桐油黑得发亮，船头画着一只眼睛。船工说，船不是番坊的，是南边来的商人的；番坊人只管装卸、守船，拿一份工钱。\n"
msgstr "Three flat-bottomed boats, flat of keel, square of bow, the sails woven from bamboo strips piece by piece. The hulls, painted with tung oil, are black and shining, and an eye is painted on each bow. The boatmen say the boats do not belong to the Foreign Quarter but to merchants from the south; the Foreign Quarter's people only load, unload and guard, for a wage.\n"

msgid "两面大盾，比人还高一头，长方的，盾面弯成半个筒。木胎外头蒙着牛皮，边上包着铁，铆钉一圈一圈。盾面上漆着一只展翅的鹰，金漆掉了一半，露出底下的红。盾脚插在土里，插得很深，像是从来没拔出来过。\n"
msgstr "Two great shields, a head taller than a man, rectangular, their faces curved into half a tube. A wooden core covered in ox hide, iron along the edges, rivets in rings. An eagle with spread wings is painted on each face, half the gold gone, showing the red beneath. The feet of the shields are driven into the earth, driven in deep, as if they had never been pulled out.\n"

msgid "墙上贴着一张布告，纸是京师的纸，字是抄的：\n布告上写著：辑拿要犯----於兰天武。\n布告的一角盖着市舶司的小印，旁边一行小字：「京师东二门原告，番坊照抄」。\n"
msgstr "A notice pasted on the wall, the paper from the Capital, the writing copied:\nThe notice reads: Wanted—the fugitive Yulan Tianwu.\nIn one corner of the notice is the Maritime Trade Office's small seal, and beside it a line of small writing: \"Original from the Second East Gate, Capital; copied as is in the Foreign Quarter.\"\n"

msgid "一座黑石砌的火坛，齐胸高，石头让三百年的烟熏得乌黑发亮。坛顶一团火，不高不低，不红不白，烧得很静，看不见柴，也看不见油。火前的石头上磨出一块白印子，是一代一代跪出来的。坛身上刻着一行弯弯曲曲的字，没有人认得；祭司说那是祠规——火前不说谎。\n"
msgstr "A fire altar built of black stone, chest-high, the stone smoked black and shining by three hundred years of smoke. On top a fire, neither high nor low, neither red nor white, burning very still, no wood to be seen, no oil. The stone before the fire is worn with a white mark, knelt into it by generation after generation. Twisting writing is carved on the altar's side that nobody can read; the priest says it is the shrine rule—no lying before the fire.\n"

msgid "一块巴掌大的木牌钉在墙上，木头发黑，上面刻着一行弯弯曲曲的字——大秦人自己的字。安敦说，那是剑会的第一条规矩，三百年前第一代会首刻的：盾在前，剑在后。盾不倒，人不倒。\n"
msgstr "A palm-sized wooden tablet nailed to the wall, the wood blackened, carved with a line of twisting script—the Daqin people's own writing. Andun says it is the Guild's first rule, carved three hundred years ago by the first Guild Head: Shield in front, sword behind. If the shield does not fall, the man does not fall.\n"

msgid "一棵大榕树，树冠罩住了半个院子。气根从枝上一根根垂下来，细的像绳，粗的已经扎进地里成了树干，一棵树看着像一片林子。树下的地让人坐得光溜溜的。天竺僧说，这树是第一代僧人从天竺带来的一根枝条，插在这儿，活了。\n"
msgstr "A great banyan, its crown shading half the yard. Aerial roots hang from the branches, fine as rope, the thick ones rooted in the ground and become trunks, so that one tree looks like a forest. The ground under the tree is worn smooth by sitting. The Indian monk says the tree was a branch the first monks brought from India and planted here, and it lived.\n"

msgid "一尊天竺样子的佛像：高鼻、细眼、卷发，嘴角带一点笑，衣褶一道一道贴在身上，像是湿的。像是石头雕的，上过金，金掉了大半，露出底下的灰石。佛前几盏酥油灯，灯火一跳一跳，佛的脸也跟着一明一暗。\n"
msgstr "A statue of the Buddha in the Indian manner: high nose, narrow eyes, curly hair, a trace of smile at the corners of the mouth, the folds of the robe clinging line by line as if wet. It seems to be carved of stone and was gilded; most of the gilt has fallen, showing gray stone beneath. Before it are a few butter lamps, flickering, and the Buddha's face brightens and darkens with them.\n"

msgid "一块白木牌，立在墙根，墨写着一行字：「一击之内定生死」。字写得又瘦又硬，像刀刻的。牌子底下的土让人跪过，陷下去两个坑。\n"
msgstr "A white wooden sign stands at the wall's foot, a line written in ink: \"Life or death within one stroke.\" The writing is thin and hard, as if cut with a blade. The earth beneath the sign has been knelt on, two hollows sunk in it.\n"

msgid "书案上压着一纸兵部文书，字写得端端正正：\n"
msgstr "On the desk, weighted down, lies a Ministry of War paper, the writing neat and upright:\n"

msgid "「番坊大秦人等，聚众持械，着市舶司即日清出，不得延误。——兵部」\n"
msgstr "\"The Daqin and others of the Foreign Quarter, gathering under arms, are to be cleared out by the Maritime Trade Office this very day, without delay.—Ministry of War\"\n"

msgid "底下兵部的印旁边，还压着一方「镇国大将军」印，印色暗红发黑。你见过这个颜色：逆灵宫那叠文书上的印就是这样。印模上的真印是正红的，泛黄光。\n"
msgstr "Under it, beside the Ministry's seal, is pressed a \"Guardian General\" seal, the ink a dark red turning black. You have seen this color: the seals on that stack of papers in the Black Palace were like this. The true seal on the seal mold is a clean red with a yellow gleam.\n"

msgid "这一纸文书的印是假的。\n"
msgstr "The seal on this paper is false.\n"

msgid "落款的日子，是关北工地出事后的第三天。\n"
msgstr "The date of signing is the third day after the incident at the Beyond the Pass work site.\n"

msgid "底下兵部的大印旁边，还压着一方「镇国大将军」印，印色暗红。冯禄说这是京师来的令，谁也不敢不认。\n"
msgstr "Under it, beside the Ministry's great seal, is pressed a \"Guardian General\" seal, the ink a dark red. Feng Lu says this is an order from the Capital, and nobody dares not to recognize it.\n"

msgid "火坛前没有人。穆护的净室里亮着灯，门关着。\n"
msgstr "Nobody before the fire altar. Light shows in the Magus's chamber, the door shut.\n"

msgid "天刚亮，火还没静。今天火不肯——明天再来。"
msgstr "Dawn has only just come, and the fire is not yet still. Today the fire does not consent—come tomorrow."

msgid "火今天不肯。要在祠里等到明天黎明，再问一次吗？（世界的时间会过去，别的地方照旧过它们的日子。）"
msgstr "The fire will not consent today. Wait in the shrine until dawn tomorrow and ask again? (World time will pass, and other places go on with their days.)"

msgid "等到明天"
msgstr "Wait until tomorrow"

msgid "等。火自己会静。"
msgstr "Wait. The fire will settle by itself."

msgid "天亮了。坛顶的火又矮了下去，不红不白，烧得很静。\n"
msgstr "Day has come. The fire on the altar has sunk low again, neither red nor white, burning very still.\n"

msgid "火静了。——再来一次。"
msgstr "The fire is still.—Once more."

msgid "牒在你手里了。火前没有你的事了。"
msgstr "The tablet is in your hands. There is nothing for you before the fire now."

msgid "走到火坛前，掌心向火。"
msgstr " walks up to the fire altar and turns his palm toward the fire."

msgid "三句。我问，你答。火听着。"
msgstr "Three. I ask, you answer. The fire listens."

msgid "在水烟阁，南危水装死二十年的事——你替他守了口，还是告了？"
msgstr "In Waterfog Pavilion, Nan Weishui feigned death twenty years—did you keep his secret, or tell?"

msgid "守了口。"
msgstr "Kept it."

msgid "告了。"
msgstr "Told."

msgid "在关北，兵部的工地——你借了王府的兵踏平了它，还是夜里潜进去救了一半？"
msgstr "Beyond the Pass, the Ministry of War's work site—did you borrow the Prince's soldiers and flatten it, or slip in at night and save half?"

msgid "踏平了。"
msgstr "Flattened it."

msgid "夜里救了一半。"
msgstr "Saved half by night."

msgid "晚月庄的宝衣——你带走了，留给守衣的人守着，还是给了别人？"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor's Hanyu's Robe—did you take it away, leave it with the one who guards the robe, or give it to someone else?"

msgid "带走了。"
msgstr "Took it away."

msgid "留给瑷伦守着。"
msgstr "Left it with Ailun to guard."

msgid "给了安妮儿。"
msgstr "Gave it to Anni'er."

msgid "火矮了下去，矮得几乎看不见，只剩坛顶一圈发白的热气。\n"
msgstr "The fire sinks, sinks until it is almost gone, only a ring of pale heat over the altar.\n"

msgid "把手伸进火坛底下——火一点没碰着他。"
msgstr " reaches a hand under the fire altar—the fire does not touch him at all."

msgid "火静了。它认你。"
msgstr "The fire is still. It knows you."

msgid "穆护从火坛底下取出一片发黑的铜，放在你手里。还是温的。\n"
msgstr "The Magus takes a piece of blackened copper from under the fire altar and puts it in your hands. It is still warm.\n"

msgid "大秦人存了三十年的东西。你拿去。火前拿的，谁也不能说你偷。"
msgstr "What the Daqin people kept thirty years. Take it. Taken before the fire, no one can say you stole it."

msgid "火「轰」地蹿起来，一直蹿到屋顶的方洞，整座祠亮得像白天；又落下去。\n"
msgstr "The fire roars up with a boom, all the way to the square hole in the roof, and the whole shrine is lit like day; then it falls back.\n"

msgid "退了一步，白布底下看不出脸色。"
msgstr " takes a step back; under the white cloth, no expression can be seen."

msgid "今天火不肯。明天再来。"
msgstr "The fire does not consent today. Come tomorrow."

msgid "你站了浪人。火前没有你的事——他们拿东西，不走火前。"
msgstr "You took the ronin's side. There is nothing for you before the fire—they take what they take, not before the fire."

msgid "大秦人的牒？他们托了你。——那就先站定。火前只问站定了的人：你站大秦人，还是站浪人，去跟安敦说，或者去鬼笠馆。"
msgstr "The Daqin people's tablet? They entrusted you.—Then first take your stand. Before the fire only those who have taken a stand are asked: stand with the Daqin or with the ronin—go and tell Andun, or go to Ghost Hat Hall."

msgid "对质"
msgstr "Confront"

msgid "冯禄已经退走了。地还是大秦人的。\n"
msgstr "Feng Lu has already withdrawn. The land is still the Daqin people's.\n"

msgid "看了看地上的四个人，又看了看你，把文书卷起来揣进袖子。"
msgstr " looks at the four men on the ground, then at you, rolls up the paper and tucks it in his sleeve."

msgid "……兵部的令，本司回头再议。"
msgstr "...The Ministry of War's order, this office will take up again later."

msgid "冯禄退出了铁盾会的门。院子里的大秦人把盾举起来，一齐喊了一声——你听不懂，可听得出是什么意思。\n"
msgstr "Feng Lu withdraws from the Iron Shield Guild's gate. In the yard the Daqin people raise their shields and shout together—you cannot understand it, but you can hear what it means.\n"

msgid "番坊欠你一个人情。决战那天——不管在哪儿，铁盾会的盾到。"
msgstr "The Foreign Quarter owes you a favor. On the day of the decisive battle—wherever it is—the Iron Shield Guild's shields will be there."

msgid "你把印模翻过来，按在冯禄手里那纸文书的「镇国大将军」印旁边，举起来对着光。\n"
msgstr "You turn the seal mold over and press it beside the \"Guardian General\" seal on the paper in Feng Lu's hand, and hold it up to the light.\n"

msgid "印色不对。模子上的朱砂正红泛黄，文书上的暗红发黑——字口一模一样，颜色差着一截。\n"
msgstr "The seal color is wrong. The cinnabar on the mold is red going yellow, the paper's is dark red going black—the grooves match exactly, but the color is off by a long way.\n"

msgid "盯着那方印，嘴张了张，没有声音。"
msgstr " stares at the seal, mouth opening and closing without a sound."

msgid "这……这是兵部发的文书……"
msgstr "This... this is a paper issued by the Ministry of War..."

msgid "假印的差，我们不接。"
msgstr "A false seal's errand, we do not take."

msgid "四个浪人把刀收回鞘里，转身出了门。\n"
msgstr "The four ronin sheathe their blades and turn out the door.\n"

msgid "……本司、本司回去查。"
msgstr "...This office, this office will go back and look into it."

msgid "冯禄挨过你那一顿，那纸文书再没人提。\n"
msgstr "Feng Lu took your beating, and nobody mentions that paper again.\n"

msgid "差是冯禄的差。他倒了，跟他来的人也就散了。院子里的大秦人把盾举起来，一齐喊了一声——你听不懂，可听得出是什么意思。\n"
msgstr "The errand was Feng Lu's. With him down, the people who came with him scatter. In the yard the Daqin people raise their shields and shout together—you cannot understand it, but you can hear what it means.\n"

msgid "你拿不出能和那方印对一对的东西。冯禄身后站着四个浪人——要动手把他们打退吗？（铁盾会的人会替你打。）"
msgstr "You have nothing that can be matched against that seal. Four ronin stand behind Feng Lu—fight and drive them back? (The Iron Shield Guild will fight for you.)"

msgid "动手"
msgstr "Strike"

msgid "四个浪人拔了刀。会首的屋里冲出三个人，盾在前，剑在后，站到了你两边。\n"
msgstr "The four ronin draw. Three men burst out of the Guild Head's room, shield in front, sword behind, and take their places on either side of you.\n"

msgid "歇"
msgstr "Rest"

msgid "天已经黑了。去拜火祠——火坛前站着，别出声。"
msgstr "It is already dark. Go to the Fire Shrine—stand before the altar, and make no sound."

msgid "要在板地上歇到天黑吗？（世界的时间会过去，别的地方照旧过它们的日子。）"
msgstr "Rest on the plank floor until dark? (World time will pass, and other places go on with their days.)"

msgid "歇到天黑"
msgstr "Rest until dark"

msgid "你在板地一角坐下。浪人们一刀一刀地劈，没有人看你。\n"
msgstr "You sit down in a corner of the plank floor. The ronin cut, one stroke at a time, and nobody looks at you.\n"

msgid "天黑了。板屋里点起一盏灯。\n"
msgstr "Night falls. A lamp is lit in the plank house.\n"

msgid "去吧。拜火祠——火坛前站着，别出声。"
msgstr "Go. The Fire Shrine—stand before the altar, and make no sound."

msgid "板地是练刀的地方，不是歇脚的。\n"
msgstr "The plank floor is for blade practice, not for resting.\n"

msgid "一把旧旧的菜刀, 刀口几乎被磨平了, 不过还颇具有杀伤力.\n"
msgstr "An old kitchen cleaver, its edge worn almost flat, though it can still do some damage.\n"

msgid "迷人的紫色瓣儿，发出一股淡淡的香气。\n"
msgstr "Enchanting purple petals give off a faint fragrance.\n"

msgid "这是一本介绍拆招卸力之法的入门书\n"
msgstr "A beginner's book on the art of turning aside a blow and shedding its force.\n"

msgid "一个绿皮墨纹的大西瓜，不但解渴，还能填肚子。\n"
msgstr "A big watermelon with a green rind and dark stripes. It quenches thirst, and it fills the belly too.\n"

msgid "西瓜皮"
msgstr "watermelon rind"

msgid "一块啃得精光的西瓜皮。\n"
msgstr "A piece of watermelon rind, gnawed clean.\n"

msgid "这是一把银白色的的长剑，份量大约有十来斤左右。\n"
msgstr "A silvery-white long sword, weighing around ten jin.\n"

msgid "这是一位从关外来的商人。\n"
msgstr "A merchant from outside the pass.\n"

msgid "商人心有余悸地说道：我几乎死在绮云镇阿泰的手中！\n"
msgstr "The merchant says, still shaken, \"I nearly died at the hands of A-Tai in Cloudweave Town!\"\n"

msgid "商人说道：杀人啦！你难道不怕官府缉拿吗？\n"
msgstr "The merchant says, \"Murder! Aren't you afraid of the law?\"\n"

msgid "农妇道：我可怜的儿啊，你到那里去了？\n"
msgstr "The farm wife says, \"My poor boy, where have you gone?\"\n"

msgid "农妇道：你有见到我的儿吗？，他头上梳着两个小抓揪，只有七岁。\n"
msgstr "The farm wife says, \"Have you seen my boy? He wears his hair in two little tufts. He's only seven.\"\n"

msgid "农妇叹道：儿啊！\n"
msgstr "The farm wife sighs, \"Oh, my boy!\"\n"

msgid "儿"
msgstr "Son"

msgid "石头昨夜吓得缩在灶底下，一夜没出声。那些东西是从湖里上来的——你去过湖底？"
msgstr "Shitou was so scared last night he curled up under the stove and never made a sound. Those things came up out of the lake—have you been down to the lake bed?"

msgid "他回来了。夜里还是做梦，喊着不要上车。白天劈柴，劈得比他爹还狠。"
msgstr "He's back. At night he still dreams and cries out, \"Don't make me get in the cart!\" By day he chops wood, harder than his father ever did."

msgid "我的儿前两天不见了，我和他爹到处找都找不到。听说黑松山总抓小孩子。\n"
msgstr "My boy went missing a couple of days ago. His father and I have looked everywhere and can't find him. They say Black Pine Mountain is always snatching children.\n"

msgid "灰绿的皮，钢叉。从湖里爬上来的，渔夫家的老三死在岸上了。屋顶是它们点的。你拔的？"
msgstr "Gray-green skin, steel tridents. They crawled up out of the lake. The fisherman's Old Third died on the shore. They're the ones who set the roofs alight. Was it you who pulled it?"

msgid "什么鬼卒？"
msgstr "What ghost soldiers?"

msgid "老冰匠死在湖边了，身上看不出什么伤。孩子们天天去柳树底下等他讲冰底下的光……谁会跟一个凿冰的老头过不去？"
msgstr "The old ice cutter died by the lake. There's not a mark on him you can see. The children went to wait under the willow every day for him to tell them about the light under the ice... Who'd have a grudge against an old man who chips ice?"

msgid "老冰匠走了，说是投亲去。走得急，连冰凿都没带——不对，冰凿也不见了。"
msgstr "The old ice cutter's gone. Said he was off to stay with relatives. Left in such a hurry he didn't even take his ice chisel—no, wait, the chisel's gone too."

msgid "老冰匠？在湖边凿了四十年冰。孩子们爱缠着他，听他讲冰底下的光。"
msgstr "The old ice cutter? He chipped ice by the lake for forty years. The children love to pester him to tell about the light under the ice."

msgid "农妇把石头搂在怀里，不肯松手。\n"
msgstr "The farm wife holds Shitou tight in her arms and won't let go.\n"

msgid "农妇道：以后不许一个人往村口跑了，听见没有。\n"
msgstr "The farm wife says, \"No more running off to the village gate alone, you hear me?\"\n"

msgid "一眼看见你身后的石头，手里的东西全掉在了地上。"
msgstr "catches sight of Shitou behind you, and everything in her hands drops to the ground."

msgid "石头！我的儿！"
msgstr "Shitou! My boy!"

msgid "农妇扑过来一把抱住石头，哭得说不出话。石头的脸埋在她怀里，抓着你衣角的手慢慢松开了。"
msgstr "The farm wife rushes over and clutches Shitou to her, sobbing too hard to speak. Shitou's face is buried in her chest; the hand clutching the hem of your clothes slowly lets go."

msgid "恩公……恩公，你是哪里来的神仙？"
msgstr "My savior... my savior, what kind of immortal are you?"

msgid "拉着你的手，一个劲地往屋里让。"
msgstr "takes your hand and keeps pulling you toward the house."

msgid "一眼认出了你，手里的东西放下，拉住你的袖子。"
msgstr "recognizes you at once, sets down what she is holding, and takes hold of your sleeve."

msgid "恩公！野羊寨的两个弟兄把石头送回来的，他们说是恩公从那道观里救出来的。"
msgstr "My savior! Two brothers from Goathill Stockade brought Shitou back. They said you were the one who got him out of that Daoist temple."

msgid "石头回来那天一句话都不说，到今天才肯开口。恩公，你有空，进来喝碗水。"
msgstr "The day Shitou came back he wouldn't say a word. Only today did he start to talk. Come in, my savior, if you have time—have a bowl of water."

msgid "从灶房里出来，看见你，手里的柴掉了一根。"
msgstr "comes out of the kitchen, sees you, and lets a stick of firewood fall from her hand."

msgid "昨夜那些东西……是从湖里上来的。渔夫家的老三死在岸上了，我家的草顶烧了半边。"
msgstr "Last night those things... they came up out of the lake. The fisherman's Old Third died on the shore, and half my thatch roof burned."

msgid "你去过湖底。你拔的？"
msgstr "You've been down to the lake bed. Was it you who pulled it?"

msgid "唉，我那可怜的儿啊，年龄比你还小。!"
msgstr "Oh, my poor boy. He's even younger than you."

msgid "天真的小女孩正在玩耍着 \n"
msgstr "An innocent little girl at play.\n"

msgid "这要到黑松山去问。"
msgstr "You'll have to ask at Black Pine Mountain."

msgid "刘老农今年快六十了。但手脚还算灵活。\n"
msgstr "Old Farmer Liu will be sixty soon, but he's still fairly nimble on his feet.\n"

msgid "老头子哪里是您的对手？"
msgstr "How could an old man like me be any match for you?"

msgid "刘老农悲愤欲绝的骂道：你．．你．．你们居然杀了我女儿，纳命来！\n"
msgstr "Old Farmer Liu curses in grief and fury, \"You... you... you killed my daughter! Pay with your life!\"\n"

msgid "刘老农说道：“这位$RESPECT，多谢答救小女娟儿。” \n"
msgstr "Old Farmer Liu says, \"Thank you for saving my little Xiaojuan, $RESPECT.\"\n"

msgid "刘老农说道：“这口剑，这本密笈赠于$RESPECT。” \n"
msgstr "Old Farmer Liu says, \"Take this sword and this manual as a gift, $RESPECT.\"\n"

msgid "刘老农说道：“这处非久留之地，我等去也。” \n"
msgstr "Old Farmer Liu says, \"This is no place to stay. We'll be going.\"\n"

msgid "刘老农领着娟儿匆匆离去。\n"
msgstr "Old Farmer Liu hurries off, leading Xiaojuan by the hand.\n"

msgid "刘老农说道：“这位$RESPECT，可否见到小女娟儿？” \n"
msgstr "Old Farmer Liu says, \"Have you seen my little Xiaojuan, $RESPECT?\"\n"

msgid "悲愤欲绝"
msgstr "Grief and Rage"

msgid "刘老农悲愤欲绝的骂道：你．．你．．你们居然杀了我女儿，纳命来！"
msgstr "Old Farmer Liu curses in grief and fury, \"You... you... you killed my daughter! Pay with your life!\""

msgid "关北？去年兵部的车从我这田前的路上过，押的都是关北的汉子。听说王爷的兵把那工地踏平了——好。"
msgstr "Beyond the Pass? Last year the Ministry of War's carts came down the road past my field, and every man they were guarding was from Beyond the Pass. I hear the Prince's soldiers flattened that work site. Good."

msgid "关北？去年兵部的车从我这田前的路上过，押的都是关北的汉子。听说夜里有人救出来几个——几个也是人。"
msgstr "Beyond the Pass? Last year the Ministry of War's carts came down the road past my field, and every man they were guarding was from Beyond the Pass. I hear someone got a few of them out in the night. A few's still people."

msgid "关北？去年兵部的车从我这田前的路上过，押的都是关北的汉子，一车一车的。往南去，去哪儿不知道。"
msgstr "Beyond the Pass? Last year the Ministry of War's carts came down the road past my field, and every man they were guarding was from Beyond the Pass, cartload after cartload. Heading south, where to I don't know."

msgid "一只鼠头鼠脑的大老鼠\n"
msgstr "A big rat with a furtive, sneaking look.\n"

msgid "一个中年瓜农，脸上被阳光晒得黝黑，一身的键子\n肉，给人的感觉是扎实威猛。\n"
msgstr "A middle-aged melon farmer, his face tanned dark by the sun, his body all hard muscle. He gives an impression of solid, fierce strength.\n"

msgid "这位$RESPECT要不要买个西瓜解解渴？\n"
msgstr "Care for a watermelon to quench your thirst, $RESPECT?\n"

msgid "你要不还我瓜钱，咱俩就没完！\n"
msgstr "Pay me for that melon, or you and I aren't done!\n"

msgid "还瓜钱"
msgstr "Pay for the melon"

msgid "付给瓜农一个西瓜的钱（六十文），他就不再拦你，回瓜棚去；钱不够就只能接着打。"
msgstr "Pay the melon farmer the price of one watermelon (60 wen) and he'll stop blocking you and go back to his shed. If you can't pay, you have to keep fighting."

msgid "好，咱俩的账就算结了。\n"
msgstr "Fine. That settles it between us.\n"

msgid "一个精壮的汉子，头戴斗笠，身披蓑衣。偶尔抬头一看的眼神\n中精光大盛，很有可能是江湖中人。\n"
msgstr "A sturdy man in a bamboo hat and a straw rain cape. Now and then he looks up, and his eyes flash sharp—he may well be someone from the jianghu.\n"

msgid "渔夫嘀咕着：不知这水怪又吃了几个人。\n"
msgstr "The fisherman mutters, \"Wonder how many more people that lake monster has eaten.\"\n"

msgid "有种的去杀了那水怪，打我算什么英雄？！\n"
msgstr "If you've got guts, go kill that lake monster! What kind of hero hits me?!\n"

msgid "老三"
msgstr "Old Third"

msgid "老三的船还系在那儿，人没找着。……你把那两个东西打回湖里了。他回不来，可往后下湖的人能回来。"
msgstr "Old Third's boat is still tied up there, and nobody's found him... You drove those two things back into the lake. He can't come back, but the ones who go down to the lake from now on can."

msgid "老三前夜下湖收网，船漂回来了，人没回来。夜里湖边有东西爬上岸——你没动那把剑，它们还是爬上来了。"
msgstr "The night before last, Old Third went out to haul in his nets. The boat drifted back; he didn't. Something crawled up the shore in the night—you didn't touch that sword, and they came up anyway."

msgid "老三？跟我一条船上长大的。怎么，你见过他？"
msgstr "Old Third? Grew up in the same boat as me. Why, did you see him?"

msgid "水怪"
msgstr "Lake monster"

msgid "水怪？……你知道了什么。前天夜里湖心亮了一下，不是鱼。那东西在底下翻身。你要下去？别碰那把剑。"
msgstr "The lake monster?... What do you know? The night before last the middle of the lake lit up for a moment. Not a fish. Something's turning over down there. You mean to go down? Don't touch that sword."

msgid "这几天湖里不太平。网下去空的，水底下有东西在动。"
msgstr "The lake hasn't been right these last few days. Nets go down and come up empty. Something's moving under the water."

msgid "不知这水怪又吃了几个人。"
msgstr "Wonder how many more people that lake monster has eaten."

msgid "湖"
msgstr "Lake"

msgid "湖底冷。比冬天还冷。我年轻时下去过一回，就一回。"
msgstr "It's cold down there. Colder than winter. I went down once when I was young. Just the once."

msgid "玉螺湖。鱼不多了。"
msgstr "Jade Conch Lake. There aren't many fish left."

msgid "一只浑身长满白鳞的龙，\n"
msgstr "A dragon covered all over in white scales,\n"

msgid "前爪"
msgstr "front claw"

msgid "後爪"
msgstr "hind claw"

msgid "抬起头看了你一眼，又盘了回去。"
msgstr "lifts its head, looks at you, and coils back down."

msgid "一条白鳞冰龙慢慢盘过冰面，鳞上的光一闪一闪。\n"
msgstr "A white-scaled ice dragon slowly coils across the ice, the light on its scales flickering.\n"

msgid "水潭里有东西游过去，很长，水面没有起一点波。\n"
msgstr "Something swims past in the pool, very long. The water doesn't ripple at all.\n"

msgid "六条白鳞冰龙一起抬起头，看了你一眼，又盘了回去。它们守着这里，守了三百年——你不动手，它们不动。\n"
msgstr "All six white-scaled ice dragons raise their heads together, look at you, and coil back down. They have guarded this place for three hundred years—if you don't strike, they won't.\n"

msgid "这条黄土大道很宽阔，足够供八架马车并驾齐驱，与异族交战时，大量\n军队从此经过，和平时期只有商人来来往往。这条大道向南通往京师，往北\n到天驼关。\n"
msgstr "This broad yellow-earth road is wide enough for eight carriages abreast. When war came with the outland tribes, whole armies passed along it; in peacetime only merchants come and go. The road leads south to the Capital and north to Camelback Pass.\n"

msgid "这里已经离天驼关很远了，顺着黄土大道向南走，绿色渐渐多了起\n来，树木透着喜人的绿，放眼望去青山绿水，好一派关内景色，你能看\n到散落的房屋，农田和水塘。来往的旅客、商人、农民也多了。黄土大\n道向东南方向延伸，西面是进入一个村庄的小路。\n"
msgstr "You are far from Camelback Pass now. Following the yellow-earth road south, you see more and more green. The trees are a delight to the eye, and green hills and clear water stretch away—a fine view of the lands inside the pass. You can see scattered houses, fields and ponds, and more travelers, merchants and farmers on the road. The yellow-earth road runs southeast; to the west a small path leads into a village.\n"

msgid "这是一条通向一个村庄的青石小路。路口立着一个小牌子，\n牌子看起来经过长时间的日晒雨淋，已破烂不堪。东南向望去好像是片\n瓜地，绿油油的西瓜让你感觉更渴了。从这里往西就进了村子，向东到\n三叉路口。\n"
msgstr "This is a bluestone path leading to a village. At the head of the path stands a small sign, battered and ruined by long sun and rain. To the southeast you seem to see a melon field, and the lush green watermelons make you feel even thirstier. West from here you enter the village; east leads to the three-way crossing.\n"

msgid "青石小路两旁没有树木，几根杂草随风摇摆，路上的石头被行人踩磨得\n很光亮，但奇怪的是平时这里的行人却非常稀少！小路向西延伸开去，南面\n是一片大大的瓜地，北面是一家农舍。\n"
msgstr "There are no trees along either side of the bluestone path, only a few weeds swaying in the wind. The stones are worn bright by passing feet, yet strangely, few people walk here. The path runs west; to the south is a big melon field, and to the north is a farmhouse.\n"

msgid "青石小路在这里分成两条，一条继续向西延伸，另一条伸向南面，北\n面是一个鲜花盛开的小花园，闻到阵阵花香，你不仅心旷神怡。西面遥远\n处是连绵的群山，东南是一片面积不小的湖泊。\n"
msgstr "The bluestone path splits in two here: one branch keeps going west, the other turns south. To the north is a little flower garden in full bloom, and the scent of blossoms fills you with a lightness of heart. Far to the west rise ranges of mountains; to the southeast lies a sizable lake.\n"

msgid "青石小路在这里到了尽头，被茂密的茅草挡住了去路。一阵\n东风吹过，飘来阵阵花香，南面是面积很大的湖泊，湖上的水汽映的西边\n的群山更加影影绰绰。\n"
msgstr "The bluestone path ends here, blocked by thick thatch grass. An east wind blows past, bringing waves of flower scent. To the south lies a vast lake, and the mist rising off it makes the mountains to the west even hazier.\n"

msgid "小路的两边种了一排垂柳，西边玉螺湖上的阵阵雾气透过柳枝飘散过\n来。你的东边是一大片绿油油的瓜地，一条大沟横在小路和瓜地之间，你\n可以走到东南向的瓜棚。\n"
msgstr "A row of weeping willows lines both sides of the path, and the mist from Jade Conch Lake to the west drifts over through the branches. East of you is a great stretch of green melon field, with a big ditch between the path and the field. You can walk southeast to the melon shed.\n"

msgid "小路的西侧是玉螺湖，东南是地主田老财的宅院，西南是一片稻田。\n"
msgstr "West of the path is Jade Conch Lake, to the southeast is the house of Landlord Tian, and to the southwest are rice paddies.\n"

msgid "两只小燕子落到柳枝上，叽叽喳喳叫个不停，它们的家可能在附近。\n在小路的西面是一片绿油油的稻田，几个农民在田间忙碌；东面是地主田\n老财的宅院，难得一个地主的房子并不是特别奢华，只有三间屋子。\n"
msgstr "Two little swallows have landed on a willow branch and are chattering without a pause; their nest must be nearby. West of the path is a stretch of green rice paddy where a few farmers are busy at work. East is the house of Landlord Tian—for a landlord, it's not especially grand, only three rooms.\n"

msgid "这间农舍内的摆设非常朴素，但十分井井有条。阳光顺着窗缝撒在屋\n角落里的纺车上，桌上摆着泥作的玩具，特别是那泥老虎捏的形态生动活\n泼，色彩逼真，旁边还摆着一把木刀，可能都是父亲作给小孩的玩具。一\n张大床的旁边还有一张小床。这屋的北面是农舍的后院，南边出了屋就是\n村里的青石小路。\n"
msgstr "The furnishings in this farmhouse are plain, but everything is kept in good order. Sunlight slants through a crack in the window onto the spinning wheel in the corner. On the table sit clay toys, and the clay tiger is molded so lively and true in color; beside it is a wooden knife—probably toys the father made for the child. Next to the big bed is a smaller one. North of this room is the farmhouse's backyard; outside to the south is the village's bluestone path.\n"

msgid "在后院的左侧有个猪圈，几只小白猪在里面胡吃海塞，右面是一排鸡\n笼，两个红皮鸡蛋落在鸡笼后边的槽里。这村子的妇女经常把自家产的鸡\n蛋拿到京城去卖，去扯些花布或作件衣服。\n"
msgstr "On the left of the backyard is a pigsty, where a few little white pigs are stuffing themselves, and on the right is a row of chicken coops; two red-shelled eggs have rolled into the trough behind them. The women of this village often take the eggs their hens lay to the Capital to sell, and with the money they buy printed cloth or have a garment made.\n"

msgid "这是刘老汉的小花园。花园里有很多美丽的花朵。刘老汉\n就是靠卖花来维持生计的。现在正是花开的大好季节，有很多\n人在剪花。\n"
msgstr "This is Old Man Liu's little garden. It's full of beautiful flowers. Old Man Liu makes his living selling flowers. It's the height of the blooming season now, and many people are out cutting blossoms.\n"

msgid "这是一所很破旧的木屋。每当山风吹来，都会发出“吱吱呀呀”\n的声音。南侧是一个小小的厨房。木屋的后面是一个精巧的花园，花\n园里穿来阵阵打闹之声。一个翠绿的小草坪就在西面。\n"
msgstr "This is a very run-down wooden house. Whenever the mountain wind blows, it creaks and groans. To the south is a small kitchen. Behind the house is a delicate little garden, and the sound of play and scuffling drifts from it. A small, green lawn lies just to the west.\n"

msgid "这是一个简陋的小厨房。四壁已被油烟薰的分不出原来的颜色。\n墙上挂满了风干了的卤肉，可是上面显然有着被老鼠咬过的痕迹。\n"
msgstr "This is a shabby little kitchen. Its four walls are so smoked with grease and soot that their original color is lost. Dried, cured meat hangs all over the wall, though it clearly bears the marks of rats' teeth.\n"

msgid "这是一片很大的西瓜地，沙质的土壤，种出来的瓜肯定是又甜又砂瓤，\n熟透了的西瓜已与瓜蒂脱开，就等人们去摘呢。不过看瓜农\n的篷子就在瓜地的南面，他的警惕性可是很高呀。北面是村里的小路。\n"
msgstr "This is a large watermelon field with sandy soil, and the melons grown here must surely be sweet and gritty-fleshed. The ripe watermelons have already come loose from their stems and are only waiting for someone to pick them. But the melon farmer's shed is just south of the field, and he is very watchful. To the north is the village path.\n"

msgid "这是一间茅草铺顶，竹竿作架的棚子，平时瓜农就在这里看着瓜地，\n他们的警惕性都很高，稍有风吹草动都会警觉起来。瓜地在瓜棚的北面，\n往西北走就上了村里的小路，往南能看到地主田老财的宅院。\n"
msgstr "This is a shed with a thatched roof on a frame of bamboo poles. The melon farmer usually watches the field from here, and they are all very watchful—at the slightest rustle in the wind they are alert. The melon field is north of the shed; northwest takes you up onto the village path, and to the south you can see Landlord Tian's house.\n"

msgid "这是一片绿油油的稻田，稻子的长势非常喜人，因为北面就是玉螺湖，\n所以稻田的灌溉很方便。从这儿向西能看到忘情谷那郁郁葱葱的山岭，东\n面能看到几间高大房屋高出柳树部分的屋檐。\n"
msgstr "This is a green rice paddy, and the rice is growing wonderfully well. Since Jade Conch Lake lies just to the north, irrigating the paddy is easy. From here to the west you can see the lush, green hills of Forgetting Valley, and to the east the eaves of a few tall houses rise above the willows.\n"

msgid "地主田老财的家似乎并不与老财的名字相适应，灰色的低矮院墙围着\n三间屋子。田老财家的前院，中间有一棵大槐树，伸开的枝叶遮出一大片\n阴凉，这里连接东房和南房。前院的西面是一扇漆黑的大门。\n"
msgstr "The landlord Tian's home doesn't seem to match the name \"Tian the Miser\" at all: a low gray wall encloses three rooms. In his front yard, a big locust tree spreads its branches and casts a wide patch of shade, and the yard connects the east room and the south room. West of the front yard is a gate of pitch-black wood.\n"

msgid "东房内的北面摆放着很大的八仙桌，桌子的后面是供奉关公的神龛，\n神龛上三根拇指粗细的香慢慢燃着，关公的手似乎指向前面的墙壁，\n你还是第一次见到如此奇特姿势的关公像。在墙角处放着一根铁棍，\n顺着东侧打开的窗子望出去，可以看到远远的官道上来来往往的人群和遥\n远处阴森的黑松山。\n"
msgstr "In the north of the east room stands a very large eight-immortals table, and behind it is a shrine to Guan Gong, where three incense sticks as thick as a thumb burn slowly. Guan Gong's hand seems to point at the wall in front of him—it's the first time you've seen a Guan Gong statue in such an odd pose. In the corner stands an iron staff. Through the open window on the east side you can see the people coming and going on the distant imperial road, and far off the gloomy Black Pine Mountain.\n"

msgid "南房布置得象个书房，在屋子的中间有一张大书桌，靠西侧的墙上立\n着一个书架，上面很摆了几本书。向南和向西开了两面大窗户，\n向南望去，能模模糊糊地望见京城林立的楼阁；向西可以看到在田间忙碌\n的田农。\n"
msgstr "The south room is arranged like a study, with a big desk in the middle and, against the west wall, a bookshelf with several books set out on it. Two big windows open to the south and west. Looking south, you can dimly make out the towers and pavilions of the Capital; looking west, you can see farmers busy in the fields.\n"

msgid "玉螺湖以产的螺蛳洁白如玉而得名，并且湖中盛产味道鲜美的鲈鱼。\n有很多渔夫泛舟湖上，以网鱼捕螺为生。但现在他们都站在岸边，面带愁\n容，不清楚有什么变故发生。岸边还散落了几艘木船。\n"
msgstr "Jade Conch Lake is named for its conch snails, which are white as jade, and it also teems with delicious perch. Many fishermen row out on the lake and make their living with nets and by catching snails. But now they are all standing on the shore with worried faces, and it's unclear what has happened. A few wooden boats are scattered along the bank.\n"

msgid "这里是忘情谷外的一条小路，向着南和北延伸。山岭上树木繁茂，绿\n草茵茵，东面是有名的玉螺湖，湖上水汽蒸腾，但这边岸上没有船，不能\n由此到湖上。隐隐约约地看的见错落有致的村庄农舍。\n"
msgstr "This is a path outside Forgetting Valley, running south and north. The hills are thick with trees and lush grass. To the east is the famous Jade Conch Lake, with mist steaming off it, but there are no boats on this bank, so you can't get out onto the lake from here. Faintly you can make out village houses scattered here and there.\n"

msgid "这里是忘情谷外的一条小路，往东就进了名叫傅家坡的小村庄。从村\n庄往外的这段小路人烟稀少，但能经常见到有大鸟飞过忘情谷的山岭。\n"
msgstr "This is a path outside Forgetting Valley; going east leads into a small village called Fu Family Slope. This stretch of path leading away from the village sees few people, but you often see big birds flying over the hills of Forgetting Valley.\n"

msgid "这里是玉螺湖的湖心，湖面上丝丝雾气蒸起，周围静得出奇，心跳声\n都听的见。你仔细地向湖底看去，忽的见白光一闪，如果想看个究竟，可\n以潜入湖中，但理智告诉你一定要安全第一！西面远处是朦胧的群\n山，东边岸上的渔夫似乎冲着你比比划划。\n"
msgstr "This is the middle of Jade Conch Lake. Wisps of mist rise off the water, and it is eerily quiet—you can hear your own heartbeat. You look carefully down into the lake, and suddenly a white light flashes. If you want to see what it is, you can dive into the lake, but your reason tells you that safety comes first! Far to the west are hazy mountains, and the fisherman on the eastern shore seems to be gesturing at you.\n"

msgid "这个岩洞中全都是冰，冰的色泽纯正洁白，很象是北极的玄冰，却不\n知怎么会在这里出现。四周气温极低，阵阵寒冷袭来，常人难以站立片刻。\n在玄冰上面长着发光的藻类植物，所以从入口看去非常明亮。刚才进入岩\n洞的入口处又迅速地结了一层薄冰，奇怪的是水压并没有把它压破。\n"
msgstr "This cave is all ice, a pure, clean white, much like the deep ice of the far north, and no one knows how it came to be here. The air is bitterly cold, wave after wave of chill rolls over you, and an ordinary person could hardly stand here for a moment. Glowing algae grows on the black ice, so it looks very bright from the entrance. The entrance you just came in by has quickly frozen over with a thin sheet of ice—strangely, the pressure of the water hasn't broken it.\n"

msgid "水下岩洞到了这里，突然变得非常宽阔，巨大的穹顶成半透明，能模\n糊地看到顶外的小鱼游来游去。自上而下的看去，你不仅倒吸一口冷气：\n几只白色的大龙或悬浮在空中、或盘在冰面上、或慢游在洞里的水潭中。\n西面有一冰制的阶梯盘旋而上，不知伸向哪里。\n"
msgstr "The underwater cave suddenly opens up wide here. The huge dome is translucent, and you can dimly see little fish swimming past outside it. Looking down from above, you gasp in a cold breath: several big white dragons hang in the air, or lie coiled on the ice, or glide slowly through the pool in the cave. To the west an ice staircase winds upward, to who knows where.\n"

msgid "这么大的一片湖，你想走过去吗？"
msgstr "A lake this big—you want to walk across?"

msgid "你正站在船头，向东走一小步就会掉入湖中！你不想这样吧？"
msgstr "You are standing at the bow of the boat. One small step east and you'll fall into the lake! You don't want that, do you?"

msgid "你的去路被瓜农拦住了。"
msgstr "The melon farmer blocks your way."

msgid "你勉强分辨出那上面模糊的字迹：傅家坡\n"
msgstr "You can just make out the blurred writing on it: Fu Family Slope\n"

msgid "关内能经常见到的渔船，你可以划着它到湖中心。\n"
msgstr "A fishing boat of the kind common inside the pass. You can paddle it out to the middle of the lake.\n"

msgid "拨开"
msgstr "Push aside"

msgid "高高的茅草，可以拨开。\n"
msgstr "Tall thatch grass, which can be pushed aside.\n"

msgid "你拨开茅草，发现了一条向西的路。"
msgstr "You push the thatch aside and find a path leading west."

msgid "茅草晃了晃，又遮住了向西的路。"
msgstr "The grass sways and covers the path west again."

msgid "身后的入口已经冻上了，冰层坚硬无比，再也砸不开。往上走只能穿过冰龙盘踞的冰厅；过不去的话，就只能在这里等下去了。\n"
msgstr "The entrance behind you has frozen over, the ice hard beyond anything, and you can never break it open again. The only way is up, through the ice hall where the dragons lie coiled; if you can't get past, all you can do is wait here.\n"

msgid "你在冰洞里苦等良久，冻得昏昏沉沉地睡了过去……醒来时，你已经躺在雪亭镇的饮风客栈里。"
msgstr "You wait a long time in the ice cave, so cold you drift into a stupor and fall asleep... When you wake, you are lying in the Drinkwind Inn in Snow Pavilion."

msgid "入口对面的冰壁上刻着一行字，刻得很深，三百年的冰长过去也没有把它长平。字是中原字，笔画生硬，像是用剑尖一下一下凿出来的：「吾见钉之。」\n"
msgstr "On the ice wall facing the entrance a line is carved, cut deep—three hundred years of growing ice have not smoothed it flat. The characters are Central Plains script, the strokes stiff, as if gouged out with a sword point, one blow at a time: \"I saw it nailed.\"\n"

msgid "入口对面的冰壁上刻着一行字，刻得很深，三百年的冰长过去也没有把它长平。字是中原字，笔画生硬，像是用剑尖一下一下凿出来的：「吾见钉之。」\n你认得这笔迹——和铜牒上的一样，几个笔画反了。刻字的人就是那个老兵，他站在这里看见了那把剑钉下去。「钉」字刻得最深。\n"
msgstr "On the ice wall facing the entrance a line is carved, cut deep—three hundred years of growing ice have not smoothed it flat. The characters are Central Plains script, the strokes stiff, as if gouged out with a sword point, one blow at a time: \"I saw it nailed.\"\nYou know this hand—it's the same as on the copper tablet, a few strokes reversed. The one who carved it was the old soldier; he stood here and watched the sword driven in. The character for \"nail\" is cut deepest.\n"

msgid "一座黑石砌的圆坛，齐腰高，坛面磨得发亮。坛心嵌着一块透明的冰，冰里一颗头——闭着眼，眉骨很高，嘴角像在笑。一把剑从头顶直钉下去，钉进坛心的石头里，只有剑柄露在冰外，柄上结着霜。坛边的冰柱里有人。\n"
msgstr "A round altar of black stone, waist-high, its surface polished bright. Set in the center of the altar is a block of clear ice, and in the ice a head—eyes closed, brow ridge high, the corners of the mouth looking almost like a smile. A sword is driven straight down through the crown of the head into the stone of the altar, only the hilt showing above the ice, frost on the hilt. In the ice pillars at the edge of the altar there are people.\n"

msgid "坛心的冰裂成了几块。头还在冰里，眼睛睁着了，看着顶上的水潭。钉着它的剑没有了，坛心的石头上只剩一个剑孔，孔里往外冒着一丝黑气。坛边的冰柱空了。\n"
msgstr "The ice at the center of the altar has cracked into pieces. The head is still in the ice, but now its eyes are open, looking up at the pool overhead. The sword that pinned it is gone; only a sword hole remains in the stone of the altar, and a thread of black vapor seeps out of it. The ice pillars at the edge of the altar are empty.\n"

msgid "四壁是整块的冰，冰里有金线一样的纹路，一直盘到顶上。顶是一整块半透明的冰，上面就是冰龙厅的水潭——有影子游过去，很长。壁上刻着一圈金乌的字，和岩洞冰壁上那一行是一个人的笔迹，只是刻得更密，你一个字也不认得。\n"
msgstr "The four walls are single sheets of ice, with golden threads running through them, coiling all the way up to the top. The ceiling is one translucent sheet of ice, and above it is the pool of the ice dragons' hall—a shadow swims past, very long. A ring of Golden Crow script is carved on the walls, in the same hand as the line on the ice wall in the cave, only cut more densely; you can't read a single character.\n"

msgid "四壁是整块的冰，冰里有金线一样的纹路，一直盘到顶上。顶是一整块半透明的冰，上面就是冰龙厅的水潭——有影子游过去，很长。壁上刻着一圈金乌的字，和岩洞冰壁上那一行是一个人的笔迹，只是刻得更密。璃虹说，那是她哥哥钉剑那天刻的，刻的是她的名字，刻了三百遍。\n"
msgstr "The four walls are single sheets of ice, with golden threads running through them, coiling all the way up to the top. The ceiling is one translucent sheet of ice, and above it is the pool of the ice dragons' hall—a shadow swims past, very long. A ring of Golden Crow script is carved on the walls, in the same hand as the line on the ice wall in the cave, only cut more densely. Lihong says her brother carved it the day he drove in the sword. It is her name, carved three hundred times.\n"

msgid "寒气从冰里渗上来。你运起内力顶住了。\n"
msgstr "The chill seeps up from the ice. You gather your Inner Force and hold it off.\n"

msgid "寒气刺骨！\n"
msgstr "A bone-piercing chill!\n"

msgid "划向湖心"
msgstr "Paddle to mid-lake"

msgid "你跳上渔船，奋力向湖心划去。\n"
msgstr "You jump into the fishing boat and paddle hard for the middle of the lake.\n"

msgid "你终于划到湖中心了。\n"
msgstr "You've finally reached the middle of the lake.\n"

msgid "等到天黑"
msgstr "Wait until dark"

msgid "天一黑，它就上来。这一步不能回头：等到天黑，鬼卒上岸，你就要下湖了。\n先替你存一份「决战前」的档。确定在岸边等到天黑？"
msgstr "Once it's dark, it comes up. There's no turning back from this: wait until dark, the ghost soldiers come ashore, and then you go down into the lake.\nA \"before the decisive night\" save will be made for you first. Wait on the shore until dark?"

msgid "你在岸边坐下。岸上的人各自走开，守到自己的地方去。湖面平得像一块铁。\n"
msgstr "You sit down on the shore. The people on it drift away, each to the place they will hold. The lake is flat as sheet iron.\n"

msgid "天黑了。黑冰从湖心裂开一道缝，然后是第二道、第三道——鬼卒从冰缝里爬上来了！\n"
msgstr "Night falls. A crack splits the black ice from the middle of the lake, then a second, then a third—ghost soldiers are climbing out of the cracks!\n"

msgid "湖畔——郭承一声唿哨，关北的马从柳树后头冲出来，撞进了鬼卒堆里。\n"
msgstr "The lakeshore—Guo Cheng lets out a whistle, and the horses of Beyond the Pass burst out from behind the willows and crash into the heap of ghost soldiers.\n"

msgid "湖畔没人守。鬼卒冲你来了。\n"
msgstr "Nobody holds the lakeshore. The ghost soldiers come for you.\n"

msgid "村口——霍铮吼了一声，野羊寨的弟兄抄着家伙堵住了黄土道。\n"
msgstr "The village gate—Huo Zheng roars, and the brothers of Goathill Stockade, weapons in hand, block the yellow-earth road.\n"

msgid "村口没人守。\n"
msgstr "Nobody holds the village gate.\n"

msgid "稻田边——一排圆盾立了起来，像一道墙。\n"
msgstr "By the rice paddies—a row of round shields rises up like a wall.\n"

msgid "稻田边没人守。\n"
msgstr "Nobody holds the rice paddies.\n"

msgid "渡口——柳淳风的玄苏剑出了鞘，淳风武馆的弟子在船边站成了一排。\n"
msgstr "The ferry landing—Liu Chunfeng's Xuansu sword leaves its sheath, and the disciples of Pure Wind Hall stand in a row by the boats.\n"

msgid "渡口——柳绘心把细剑一横。她身后那几个人握的是竹剑，没有一个往后退。\n"
msgstr "The ferry landing—Liu Huixin holds her slender sword level. The few behind her grip bamboo swords, and not one of them takes a step back.\n"

msgid "湖岸——蓝止萍的鞭子一甩，晚月庄的弟子在柳树下排成一线，鞭梢上结了一层白霜。\n"
msgstr "The lake bank—Lan Zhiping cracks her whip, and the disciples of Latemoon Manor form a line under the willows, a layer of white frost on the tip of the lash.\n"

msgid "湖岸——那个使六阴剑的女人站在最前，没有蒙面；她娘拄着鞭子站在她身后。冰缝里爬上来的第一个鬼卒，倒在她的剑下。\n"
msgstr "The lake bank—the woman who wields the Six-Chaos Sword stands at the front, unveiled; her mother, leaning on a whip, stands behind her. The first ghost soldier to climb out of the ice cracks falls to her sword.\n"

msgid "北麓——下湖的山路上亮起一串符火。林忌的弟子截住了逆灵宫的人，没让一个走到湖边。\n"
msgstr "The north foot—a string of talisman fires lights up on the mountain road down to the lake. Lin Ji's disciples have cut off the men of the Black Palace, and not one reaches the lakeshore.\n"

msgid "官道——铁卫营的兵在进村的官道上扎了营。兵部的车一辆也没放过来。\n"
msgstr "The imperial road—soldiers of the Iron Guard Camp have pitched camp on the road into the village. Not one cart of the Ministry of War has been let through.\n"

msgid "划到湖心，潜下去。\n"
msgstr "Paddle to the middle of the lake and dive.\n"

msgid "夜更深了。黑冰从湖心裂开一道缝，然后是第二道、第三道——鬼卒从冰缝里爬上来了！\n"
msgstr "The night grows deeper. A crack splits the black ice from the middle of the lake, then a second, then a third—ghost soldiers are climbing out of the cracks!\n"

msgid "天快亮的时候，黑冰从湖心裂开一道缝，然后是第二道、第三道——鬼卒从冰缝里爬上来了！\n"
msgstr "Near dawn, a crack splits the black ice from the middle of the lake, then a second, then a third—ghost soldiers are climbing out of the cracks!\n"

msgid "没什么可等的了。划到湖心，潜下去。\n"
msgstr "There's nothing left to wait for. Paddle to the middle of the lake and dive.\n"

msgid "没什么要等的。湖上静得很。\n"
msgstr "There's nothing to wait for. The lake is very still.\n"

msgid "在岸上坐到天亮。等的工夫里，世上的事照样走。"
msgstr "Sit on the shore until dawn. While you wait, the world's affairs go on all the same."

msgid "等到天亮"
msgstr "Wait until dawn"

msgid "你在岸边坐下。湖面上一点声音都没有了。\n"
msgstr "You sit down on the shore. There isn't a sound from the lake now.\n"

msgid "天亮了。农妇家的草顶烧去了半边，岸边的两条船只剩黑壳，路口的柳树成了两根黑桩。渔夫倒在泥里，网还攥在手里。\n"
msgstr "Day breaks. Half the farm wife's thatch roof has burned away, the two boats on the shore are nothing but black shells, and the willows at the head of the path are two black stumps. The fisherman lies in the mud, the net still clutched in his hand.\n"

msgid "钉没了。它每一夜都在长。\n"
msgstr "The nail is gone. It grows every night.\n"

msgid "鬼卒退了。村子烧了一半。\n"
msgstr "The ghost soldiers have fallen back. Half the village has burned.\n"

msgid "天已经黑了。湖里有东西在动。\n"
msgstr "It's already dark. Something in the lake is moving.\n"

msgid "在岸上坐下等到天黑。等的工夫里，世上的事照样走：别处的人该走的走、该好的好。"
msgstr "Sit on the shore and wait until dark. While you wait, the world's affairs go on all the same: those who are to leave elsewhere leave, those who are to mend, mend."

msgid "你在岸边坐下。船都拴着，渔夫不在。湖面平得像一块铁。\n"
msgstr "You sit down on the shore. The boats are all tied up and the fisherman is gone. The lake is flat as sheet iron.\n"

msgid "天黑了。湖面上先是一声水响，然后是第二声、第三声——鬼卒从湖里爬上来了！\n"
msgstr "Night falls. First a splash on the lake, then a second, then a third—ghost soldiers are climbing out of the lake!\n"

msgid "湖畔、村口、稻田边，三处都有。守住村子。\n"
msgstr "The lakeshore, the village gate, the rice paddies—all three. Hold the village.\n"

msgid "拨开芦苇"
msgstr "Push aside the reeds"

msgid "你拨开半人高的芦苇。一个穿黑衣的人脸朝下伏在泥里，背上三个孔，是钢叉。他早就没了气。\n"
msgstr "You push aside the waist-high reeds. A man in black lies face down in the mud, three holes in his back from a steel trident. He stopped breathing long ago.\n"

msgid "他的右手压在身子底下，攥得很紧。你把他翻过来，一根一根掰开他的手指——\n"
msgstr "His right hand is pinned under his body, clenched tight. You turn him over and pry his fingers open, one by one...\n"

msgid "一块黑木作的令牌，上面刻著火焰的图腾。\n"
msgstr "A token of black wood, carved with the flame totem.\n"

msgid "那个人还伏在芦苇丛里。令已经在你身上了，他攥紧的手松开了。\n"
msgstr "The man still lies in the reeds. The token is on you now, and his clenched hand has loosened.\n"

msgid "白天的芦苇丛，风一过，整片伏下去又立起来，泥上一道拖过的印子，通到水边就没了。\n"
msgstr "In daylight, when the wind passes, the whole stand of reeds bends flat and stands up again. There's a drag mark in the mud that runs to the water's edge and ends.\n"

msgid "朱鸿雪说的是夜里。\n"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue was talking about the night.\n"

msgid "芦苇长得比人还高，风一过，沙沙地响。渔夫们说这一片入了夜就别来，问他们为什么，谁也说不上来。\n"
msgstr "The reeds grow taller than a man and rustle when the wind goes through. The fishermen say not to come near this stretch after dark, and when you ask them why, none of them can say.\n"

msgid "芦苇折了一大片，泥里有钢叉拖过的印子，一直通到水里。东边村子烧掉的那一半，烟味还没有散尽。\n"
msgstr "A wide swath of reeds is broken down, and there are marks in the mud where a steel trident was dragged, running all the way into the water. To the east, the smell of smoke from the half of the village that burned has not cleared yet.\n"

msgid "湖面静了。芦苇丛里的印子早被新苗盖住，渔夫又敢在这一片下网了。\n"
msgstr "The lake is calm. New shoots have long since covered the marks in the reeds, and the fishermen dare to cast their nets here again.\n"

msgid "划回岸边"
msgstr "Paddle back to shore"

msgid "你划动双桨，小船慢慢向岸边漂去。\n"
msgstr "You work the oars, and the little boat slowly drifts toward the shore.\n"

msgid "你终于划到湖岸边。\n"
msgstr "You finally reach the lakeshore.\n"

msgid "潜入湖中"
msgstr "Dive into the lake"

msgid "潜下去，就是去找它了。岸上的人替你守着。\n确定潜入湖中？"
msgstr "Dive, and you go to find it. The people on the shore will hold the line for you.\nDive into the lake?"

msgid "潜下去"
msgstr "Dive"

msgid "你深深吸了一口气，一个猛子扎进黑冰的裂缝里！\n"
msgstr "You take a deep breath and plunge headfirst into the crack in the black ice!\n"

msgid "冰下的水黑得像墨。湖底那一点光还亮着，你朝着它潜下去，随着水流被冲进一个岩洞中。\n"
msgstr "The water under the ice is black as ink. The one point of light at the bottom of the lake is still burning; you dive toward it, and the current sweeps you into a cave.\n"

msgid "这一潜下去就回不到船上了：湖底的出路只有一条，要穿过白鳞冰龙盘踞的冰厅；过不去的话，只能在冰洞里放弃（醒来时在雪亭镇的客栈）。\n确定要潜入湖中吗？"
msgstr "Once you dive, you can't get back to the boat. There is only one way out of the lake bottom, through the ice hall where the white-scaled ice dragons lie coiled; if you can't get past, all you can do is give up in the ice cave (you will wake in the Snow Pavilion inn).\nDive into the lake?"

msgid "确定潜入"
msgstr "Yes, dive"

msgid "你深深吸了一口气，一个猛子潜入水中！\n"
msgstr "You take a deep breath and dive headfirst into the water!\n"

msgid "你越潜越深，突然眼前一亮，一处湖底发出光亮。你用拳一砸，那湖底竟然碎了，原来是一层冰！你随着水流被冲进一个岩洞中。\n"
msgstr "You dive deeper and deeper, and suddenly a light flashes before your eyes: somewhere on the lake bottom there is a glow. You smash it with your fist, and the lake bottom shatters—it was a layer of ice! The current sweeps you into a cave.\n"

msgid "摘西瓜"
msgstr "Pick a watermelon"

msgid "瓜棚里的瓜农比你强得多。摘瓜要是被他发现，他会冲过来跟你拼命；不还瓜钱，就别想离开瓜地。\n确定要摘西瓜吗？"
msgstr "The melon farmer in the shed is far stronger than you. If he catches you picking melons, he'll charge over and fight you to the death; and if you don't pay for the melon, you won't be leaving the field.\nPick a watermelon anyway?"

msgid "确定摘瓜"
msgstr "Pick it anyway"

msgid "你找来找去，终于找到了一个熟透了的大西瓜抱在怀中。\n"
msgstr "You search and search, and at last find a ripe watermelon and hug it to your chest.\n"

msgid "糟糕，瓜农发现了你偷瓜，向这边冲过来！\n"
msgstr "Damn, the melon farmer has spotted you stealing and comes charging this way!\n"

msgid "瓜农似乎正在打瞌睡，没有发现你的小动作。\n"
msgstr "The melon farmer seems to be dozing and hasn't noticed what you're up to.\n"

msgid "你真幸运，瓜农没有在瓜棚看瓜。\n"
msgstr "Lucky you—the melon farmer isn't watching the field from his shed.\n"

msgid "你找来找去，终于还是没找到熟透的西瓜。\n"
msgstr "You search and search, but in the end you don't find a ripe watermelon.\n"

msgid "商玦站在水潭边，挡着你的路。\n"
msgstr "Shang Jue stands at the edge of the pool, blocking your way.\n"

msgid "潜下去，就是去见它了。\n确定潜下去吗？"
msgstr "Dive, and you go to meet it.\nDive in?"

msgid "你吸足一口气，扎进水潭。潭底的光暗得只剩一线，黑气顺着水往上冒。\n"
msgstr "You take a deep breath and plunge into the pool. The light at the bottom is dim to a single thread, and black vapor rises along the water.\n"

msgid "水潭底下透着白光——不是鱼。下去了，封坛前的事就得自己担。\n确定要潜下去吗？"
msgstr "White light shows from the bottom of the pool—not fish. If you go down, what came before the sealing is yours to bear.\nDive in?"

msgid "你吸足一口气，扎进水潭。水冷得像刀，白光在底下越来越亮。\n"
msgstr "You take a deep breath and plunge into the pool. The water is cold as a blade, and the white light grows brighter below.\n"

msgid "潭底是一个洞口，你顺着光钻了过去，脚踩到了黑石的台阶。\n"
msgstr "At the bottom of the pool is an opening. You slip through it, following the light, and your feet find a step of black stone.\n"

msgid "游上去"
msgstr "Swim up"

msgid "你已经是冰了。\n"
msgstr "You are ice already.\n"

msgid "你从潭口钻上去。冰龙厅里静悄悄的，冰洞、湖底，一路往上，水是清的。\n"
msgstr "You climb out through the mouth of the pool. The ice dragons' hall is dead quiet; the ice cave, the lake bottom, all the way up, the water is clear.\n"

msgid "你从湖心冒出头来。湖上的黑冰没了。\n"
msgstr "You break the surface in the middle of the lake. The black ice on the lake is gone.\n"

msgid "东边的天亮了。\n"
msgstr "The sky is bright in the east.\n"

msgid "璃虹扶着坛沿站起来：「带我上去。」你扶着她钻进潭口，冰水灌进领子。头顶亮了——冰龙厅。她趴在潭边喘了半天，说：「上岸。到人家里去。」\n"
msgstr "Lihong braces a hand on the altar's edge and gets to her feet. \"Take me up.\" You help her through the mouth of the pool, and icy water pours down your collar. Light overhead—the ice dragons' hall. She lies at the edge of the pool, panting for a long while, then says, \"To shore. To someone's house.\"\n"

msgid "你从潭口钻上去，冰水灌进领子。头顶亮了——冰龙厅。\n"
msgstr "You climb up through the mouth of the pool, icy water pouring down your collar. Light overhead—the ice dragons' hall.\n"

msgid "把铜牒念给她听"
msgstr "Recite the copper tablet to her"

msgid "我说过了。要再听，问我「封法」。"
msgstr "I have said it already. If you want to hear it again, ask me about the \"Sealing Rite.\""

msgid "念。"
msgstr "Recite."

msgid "头在哪里？"
msgstr "Where is the head?"

msgid "头在湖底冰下，以穿灵为钉。"
msgstr "The head lies beneath the ice at the bottom of the lake, nailed down by Spiritpiercer."

msgid "头在逆灵宫的坛上，以黑焰养着。"
msgstr "The head is on the altar in the Black Palace, fed by black flame."

msgid "钉拔了，怎样？"
msgstr "If the nail is pulled, what then?"

msgid "钉拔，鬼成形。"
msgstr "Pull the nail, and the ghost takes form."

msgid "钉拔，鬼就散了。"
msgstr "Pull the nail, and the ghost scatters."

msgid "要再封，须有什么？"
msgstr "To seal it again, what is needed?"

msgid "要再封，须有人留下。"
msgstr "To seal it again, someone must stay behind."

msgid "要再封，须有人祭。"
msgstr "To seal it again, someone must be sacrificed."

msgid "冰里的光稳住了。\n"
msgstr "The light in the ice steadies.\n"

msgid "一字不差。那片铜上刻的是实话。我再给你三句，铜上没有的。"
msgstr "Word for word. What is cut on that copper is the truth. I will give you three more sentences, ones that are not on the copper."

msgid "钉拔，它成形，先回它自己的家——这附近的村子，它记得路。"
msgstr "Pull the nail, and it takes form, and goes first to its own home—the villages near here. It remembers the way."

msgid "要灭它，三器齐：旋芒斩它，宝衣挡它的黑焰，穿灵最后钉它的头。少一件，灭不掉，只能再封。"
msgstr "To destroy it, the three implements must be together: Whirling Edge cuts it down, the robe holds off its black flame, and Spiritpiercer nails its head last. Lose one and it cannot be destroyed, only sealed again."

msgid "要再封，须有人留下。三百年前我哥哥钉了它，没有人肯留，我留下了。这一回，还得有人。"
msgstr "To seal it again, someone must stay behind. Three hundred years ago my brother nailed it down. No one was willing to stay, so I stayed. This time, someone must again."

msgid "剑就在你眼前。拔不拔，你自己定。我守了三百年，不替你定。"
msgstr "The sword is right before your eyes. Whether you pull it is for you to decide. I have kept watch three hundred years, and I will not decide for you."

msgid "冰里的光暗了一暗。\n"
msgstr "The light in the ice dims for a moment.\n"

msgid "不对。那不是铜上的话。再念。"
msgstr "Wrong. Those are not the words on the copper. Recite again."

msgid "冰柱里没有人应你。\n"
msgstr "Nobody in the ice pillar answers you.\n"

msgid "拔出来"
msgstr "Pull it out"

msgid "事情已经了结了。\n"
msgstr "It is already over.\n"

msgid "剑已经在你手里了。\n"
msgstr "The sword is already in your hand.\n"

msgid "拔出穿灵，钉就没了，它当场成形。三器、来的人，都在这里了。\n要拔吗？"
msgstr "Pull Spiritpiercer out, and the nail is gone; it takes form on the spot. The three implements and the ones who came are all here.\nPull it?"

msgid "你握住剑柄。冰柱里的光只剩一线。你往上一拔——冰「喀」地一声裂开，剑出来了。\n"
msgstr "You grip the hilt. The light in the ice pillar is down to a thread. You pull upward, and the ice cracks with a snap, and the sword comes free.\n"

msgid "穿灵握在你手里，剑身上的霜一点一点化了。\n"
msgstr "Spiritpiercer is in your hand, and the frost on the blade melts away bit by bit.\n"

msgid "黑焰从坛下涌上来，一团没有头的人形站了起来。那颗头悬在它肩上，眼睛睁着。\n"
msgstr "Black flame wells up from beneath the altar, and a headless human shape stands up. The head hangs at its shoulder, eyes open.\n"

msgid "宝衣的下摆一展，黑焰卷到跟前就散了。\n"
msgstr "The hem of the robe spreads, and the black flame, rolling toward it, scatters.\n"

msgid "没有宝衣挡着，黑焰烧得人睁不开眼。\n"
msgstr "With no robe to ward it off, the black flame burns till you cannot keep your eyes open.\n"

msgid "你已经记下了封物，没有动它。这把剑，等三器齐了再拔。\n"
msgstr "You have already taken note of what is sealed here, and you have not touched it. This sword waits until the three implements are together.\n"

msgid "你握住剑柄。冰柱里传出一声：「先把铜上的话念给我听。」\n"
msgstr "You grip the hilt. A voice comes from the ice pillar: \"First recite to me what is on the copper.\"\n"

msgid "剑一拔，钉就没了。鬼会成形，先回它自己的家——这附近的村子。璃虹会从冰里出来，可她守了三百年，出来就剩半条命。拔了就回不去。\n要拔吗？"
msgstr "Pull the sword, and the nail is gone. The ghost takes form and goes first to its own home—the villages around here. Lihong will come out of the ice, but she has stood guard three hundred years, and she'll come out with half a life left. Once it's pulled there's no going back.\nPull it?"

msgid "你握住剑柄。霜化在手心里，一股凉意顺着胳膊直透到肩。\n"
msgstr "You grip the hilt. The frost melts in your palm, and a coolness runs up your arm all the way to the shoulder.\n"

msgid "你往上一拔——冰「喀」地一声裂开，剑出来了。\n"
msgstr "You pull upward, and the ice cracks with a snap, and the sword comes free.\n"

msgid "冰里那颗头睁开了眼。它看着你，嘴角的笑更深了些。坛心的剑孔里冒出一丝黑气，顶上的水潭里，龙的影子乱了一乱。\n"
msgstr "The head in the ice opens its eyes. It looks at you, and the smile at the corner of its mouth deepens a little. A thread of black vapor seeps out of the sword hole at the center of the altar, and in the pool overhead the dragon shadows scatter in disorder.\n"

msgid "大笑起来，笑声在冰室里撞来撞去。"
msgstr "bursts out laughing, and the laughter bounces around the ice chamber."

msgid "三百年。它记得路。"
msgstr "Three hundred years. It remembers the way."

msgid "商玦化作一股黑烟，从潭口散了出去。\n"
msgstr "Shang Jue turns into a gust of black smoke and disperses out through the mouth of the pool.\n"

msgid "冰柱从头到脚裂开，光灭了。璃虹从冰里跌了出来，跪在坛边。\n"
msgstr "The ice pillar splits from top to bottom, and the light goes out. Lihong tumbles out of the ice and kneels at the edge of the altar.\n"

msgid "……三百年。我站了三百年，站不住了。"
msgstr "...Three hundred years. I stood three hundred years, and I cannot stand any longer."

msgid "剑在你手里，钉没了。它每一夜都在长。带我上岸——我还有话，在冰里说不出来的话。"
msgstr "The sword is in your hand. The nail is gone. It grows every night. Take me up to the shore—I have things to say, things I could not say in the ice."

msgid "看清了"
msgstr "Look closely"

msgid "你已经记下了。\n"
msgstr "You have already taken note.\n"

msgid "来不及了。剑在你手里。\n"
msgstr "Too late. The sword is in your hand.\n"

msgid "先把铜上的话念给冰柱里的人听。\n"
msgstr "First recite the words on the copper to the one in the ice pillar.\n"

msgid "你围着封坛走了一圈，把每一样都看清了：坛心的冰、冰里的头、钉着它的剑、剑柄上的霜、坛边柱里的人。你没有碰那把剑。\n"
msgstr "You walk once around the sealing altar and take in every part of it: the ice at the center, the head in the ice, the sword that pins it, the frost on the hilt, the person in the pillar at the edge. You do not touch the sword.\n"

msgid "冰柱里的光亮了一下，一片羽毛从光里落下来，落在坛沿上——浅金的，不化，不湿。\n"
msgstr "The light in the ice pillar flares once, and a feather drifts down out of the light and lands on the edge of the altar—pale gold, it does not melt, it does not get wet.\n"

msgid "我的羽。再封的时候，把它放回坛上，我认得它。去京师，去岚城，把三器凑齐了再回来。"
msgstr "My feather. When it is sealed again, lay it back on the altar; I will know it. Go to the Capital, go to the Wind City, gather the three implements, and come back."

msgid "冷笑了一声。"
msgstr "gives a cold laugh."

msgid "不拔？那就等它自己出来。"
msgstr "You will not pull it? Then wait for it to come out by itself."

msgid "迎上去"
msgstr "Face it"

msgid "焰退回了那颗头底下，一下一下地跳。\n"
msgstr "The flame has drawn back beneath the head, and it pulses, one beat after another.\n"

msgid "它就在你面前。\n"
msgstr "It is right in front of you.\n"

msgid "迎上去？它长了一整个三百年。来的人、三器，都在这里了。"
msgstr "Face it? It has grown for a whole three hundred years. The ones who came, the three implements—all are here."

msgid "你走上封坛。坛心的剑孔里，黑气一股一股往上冒。\n"
msgstr "You step up onto the sealing altar. From the sword hole at the center, black vapor wells up, wisp after wisp.\n"

msgid "钉还钉着。先拔出穿灵，它才成形。\n"
msgstr "The nail is still in. Spiritpiercer must be pulled first, and then it takes form.\n"

msgid "坛心的冰里，那颗头闭着眼。\n"
msgstr "In the ice at the center of the altar, the head's eyes are closed.\n"

msgid "钉下去"
msgstr "Drive the nail"

msgid "它还站着。先把它打倒。\n"
msgstr "It is still standing. Knock it down first.\n"

msgid "钉下去？\n旋芒斩它，宝衣挡它最后一口黑焰，穿灵钉它的头——灭了它。宝衣挡完那一口，就烧成灰了。\n不钉，就问一个肯留下的人「留下」：它还在冰下封着，宝衣还在，那人留在冰里。"
msgstr "Drive the nail?\nWhirling Edge cuts it down, the robe holds off its last mouthful of black flame, Spiritpiercer nails its head—and it is destroyed. Once the robe has held off that mouthful, it burns to ash.\nIf you do not, ask the one willing to stay about \"Stay\": it will still be sealed under the ice, the robe will still be here, and that person will remain in the ice."

msgid "焰又聚了起来，最后一次。\n"
msgstr "The flame gathers once more, for the last time.\n"

msgid "你拔出旋芒，一剑——焰从中间分开。\n"
msgstr "You draw Whirling Edge and strike once—the flame parts down the middle.\n"

msgid "举起旋芒，一剑劈下去。焰从中间分开。"
msgstr "raises Whirling Edge and brings it down in one stroke. The flame parts down the middle."

msgid "三百年前於兰家拔错了一把。这一把，劈对了。"
msgstr "Three hundred years ago the Yulan family drew the wrong sword. This one—this one cuts true."

msgid "城里的风送我来，就是为了这一下。"
msgstr "The wind in the city sent me here for this one stroke."

msgid "最后一口黑焰扑上来，宝衣挡住了。\n"
msgstr "The last mouthful of black flame leaps at you, and the robe holds it off.\n"

msgid "把宝衣的下摆一展，挡在你前头。最后一口黑焰散了。"
msgstr "spreads the hem of the robe and holds it in front of you. The last mouthful of black flame scatters."

msgid "挡完这一口，宝衣的下摆烧没了。火一寸一寸往上走，整件衣裳化成了灰。寒於留它三百年，就为挡这一下。\n"
msgstr "When that mouthful is blocked, the hem of the robe has burned away. The fire climbs inch by inch, and the whole garment turns to ash. Hanyu kept it three hundred years for this one stroke.\n"

msgid "你握着穿灵，钉进那颗头里。\n"
msgstr "You grip Spiritpiercer and drive it into the head.\n"

msgid "头裂开了。焰灭了。冰穹上的龙影一齐抬起头。\n"
msgstr "The head splits. The flame goes out. On the ice dome, the dragon shadows all raise their heads together.\n"

msgid "冰柱里的光灭了。璃虹从冰里走出来，倒在你脚边，笑了一下。\n"
msgstr "The light in the ice pillar goes out. Lihong walks out of the ice, collapses at your feet, and smiles once.\n"

msgid "三器不齐，或者守的人不够——灭不了它，只能再封。\n"
msgstr "Without all three implements, or without enough people to hold the line—it cannot be destroyed, only sealed again.\n"

msgid "把穿灵交给一个肯留下的人，他把剑钉回去，自己留在冰里。\n"
msgstr "Give Spiritpiercer to one who is willing to stay. They drive the sword back in and stay in the ice themselves.\n"

msgid "（问他们「留下」。）\n"
msgstr "(Ask them about \"Stay.\")\n"

msgid "（璃虹的光不多了。那片羽在你手里的话，她还能再守一回。）\n"
msgstr "(Lihong's light is nearly gone. If you hold that feather, she can keep watch one more time.)\n"

msgid "这是一把普通的军刀，看起来没什么奇特。\n"
msgstr "An ordinary army saber, nothing out of the way to look at.\n"

msgid "这是一把普通的铁剑，看起来没什么奇特。\n"
msgstr "An ordinary iron sword, nothing out of the way to look at.\n"

msgid "剑锋处缺了一角，缺角处发出异样白光的奇剑。\n"
msgstr "A strange sword with a corner missing from its point, and the broken edge gives off an odd white gleam.\n"

msgid "这是一柄羽状的铁剑，看起来蛮尖锐的。\n"
msgstr "An iron sword shaped like a feather, and it looks quite sharp.\n"

msgid "上面刻著镇国大将军。\n"
msgstr "Engraved with \"Guardian General.\"\n"

msgid "泛著黄光，上面刻著镇国大将军。\n"
msgstr "It gleams yellow, and is engraved with \"Guardian General.\"\n"

msgid "行云流水，如劲风之竹，气聚于锋，如晦如明，斯行于技，缓动而\n瞬攻，乃徐如林，急如风，不动如山，侵略如火。\n"
msgstr "Flowing like cloud and water, firm as bamboo in a strong wind. Qi gathers at the point, dark as dusk, bright as dawn. Carried into skill, it moves slowly, then strikes in an instant: gentle as the forest, swift as the wind, still as the mountain, fierce as fire.\n"

msgid "这是一个铜制的书匣，可以用来装一些书。\n"
msgstr "A bronze book box, good for holding a few books.\n"

msgid "直竹贵地生，风吹动不止，起迄中空立，随风飘不定，斯乃劲风竹\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t   柳淳风\n"
msgstr "Straight bamboo grows in rich ground, / the wind stirs it without rest. / From root to tip it stands hollow, / and drifts and sways as the wind goes: / this is the bamboo of the strong wind.\n\n                           Liu Chunfeng\n"

msgid "他看起来有点精悍，手中紧握著刀，惊惊颤颤的样子。\n"
msgstr "He looks lean and hardened, but he grips his blade tight, jumpy and trembling.\n"

msgid "风沙满面，无精打采，毫无生气的样子，真难以想像是这\n里的守军。\n"
msgstr "Windblown, listless, without a spark of life—it is hard to believe these are the garrison here.\n"

msgid "老兵说道：军师真是神算啊，把那狗贼都吓的不敢再来了。\n"
msgstr "The veteran says, \"The adviser is a true miracle-worker. Scared that dog of a thief so badly he won't dare come back.\"\n"

msgid "老兵说道：听说那个后备兵捡到了一个黄澄澄的宝物。\n"
msgstr "The veteran says, \"Heard that Reserve Soldier picked up something shiny and golden.\"\n"

msgid "老兵说道：嘿！有没有钱啊？挡点钱来花花吧！\n"
msgstr "The veteran says, \"Hey! Got any money? Spare us a little to spend!\"\n"

msgid "黄石隘口"
msgstr "Yellow Rock Pass"

msgid "这个问题问我们大队长比较知道。\n"
msgstr "You'd best ask our Captain about that. He knows more.\n"

msgid "嘿嘿！你想做啥？\n"
msgstr "Heh heh! What are you up to?\n"

msgid "军火库"
msgstr "Arsenal"

msgid "你问这个喔..........不予回答。\n"
msgstr "You ask about that, huh... No comment.\n"

msgid "不苟言笑的样子，带领著小兵驻守隘口的小队长。\n"
msgstr "A stern, unsmiling squad leader who leads the soldiers holding the pass.\n"

msgid "他不苟言笑的样子，带领著小兵驻守隘口的队长。\n"
msgstr "A stern, unsmiling captain who leads the soldiers holding the pass.\n"

msgid "大队长说道：有没有问题要问我啊？\n"
msgstr "The Captain says, \"Got any questions for me?\"\n"

msgid "大队长说道：我对这里很熟的喔。\n"
msgstr "The Captain says, \"I know this place real well.\"\n"

msgid "允许"
msgstr "Permission"

msgid "先给钱再说吧。\n"
msgstr "Pay first, then we'll talk.\n"

msgid "喔！那是我们厉害的军师所设的阵法。\n"
msgstr "Oh! That's the formation our brilliant adviser set up.\n"

msgid "二十多年前，先帝将大将军们调来这里驻守隘口。\n"
msgstr "Twenty-odd years ago, the late Emperor sent the generals here to hold the pass.\n"

msgid "京城的也就因隘口的巩固而获得安全。\n"
msgstr "And the Capital has been safe ever since, thanks to the pass's strong defenses.\n"

msgid "事隔多年，先帝也死了，换上的是位我们不甚认识的小皇帝。\n"
msgstr "Years later, the late Emperor died too, and now there's a little emperor we don't know very well.\n"

msgid "看来他只忙著找剑，也没什么大作为，大家也不太服他。\n"
msgstr "Looks like all he does is hunt for a sword and he's done nothing much. Nobody really respects him.\n"

msgid "皇帝看到大将军还要敬畏三分ㄌㄟ。\n"
msgstr "Even the Emperor has to be a little in awe of the General, y'know.\n"

msgid "反正啊，将军和军师是超强的，你可要好好的乌西我们才行。\n"
msgstr "Anyway, the General and the adviser are the strongest there is, so you'd better treat us right.\n"

msgid "知道了，就快缴钱。\n"
msgstr "Got it? Then pay up, quick.\n"

msgid "ㄟ....Ｔhank Ｙou!!!"
msgstr "Eh... Thank you!!!"

msgid "大队长说道:哦喔！还真有心啊，真是谢谢你了。\n"
msgstr "The Captain says, \"Oh! You really mean it. Thank you very much.\"\n"

msgid "大队长说道:我已帮你列入名册了，从今天你可自由地出入营区了。\n"
msgstr "The Captain says, \"I've put you on the roll. From today you can come and go in the camp as you please.\"\n"

msgid "大队长说道:你的诚意不够喔，再多缴点吧。\n"
msgstr "The Captain says, \"You're not sincere enough. Pay a bit more.\"\n"

msgid "老队长说道：大队长对这个地方好熟，还常常说些这里的故事给我们听。\n"
msgstr "The Old Captain says, \"The Captain knows this place real well. He's always telling us stories about it.\"\n"

msgid "老队长说道：你有没有搞错啊！来这里不给我们大队长过路费，你找死啊！\n"
msgstr "The Old Captain says, \"Are you out of your mind?! Coming here and not paying our Captain the toll—you asking to die?!\"\n"

msgid "老队长说道：兵器库入口处的阵法真是厉害，一般人绝对找不到的。\n"
msgstr "The Old Captain says, \"That formation at the armory entrance is really something. An ordinary man'd never find it.\"\n"

msgid "你问问大队长吧，我不是很清楚。\n"
msgstr "Ask the Captain, I'm not too sure.\n"

msgid "后备兵就..........你想做什么？找死啊。\n"
msgstr "The Reserve Soldier... What are you after? Looking to die?\n"

msgid "副将"
msgstr "Lieutenant"

msgid "原是禁卫军的队长，也因其强大的声望和实力，被先帝调离京师\n和镇国大将军共同镇守黄石隘口。\n"
msgstr "Once the captain of the Imperial Guard, he was transferred out of the Capital by the late Emperor on account of his great standing and strength, to hold Yellow Rock Pass together with the Guardian General.\n"

msgid "大胆狂徒，竟私闯此地，给我滚出去"
msgstr "Insolent fool, to trespass here! Get out!"

msgid "乔阴的捕快？你不是了。"
msgstr "A Tallshade constable? Not any more."

msgid "听你说完小屋那封信，把册子又翻开了。"
msgstr "listens to you finish with the letter from the little hut, and opens the ledger again."

msgid "那封信在程知县手里？……信说的是庾子建，这本账说的是兵部。"
msgstr "The letter is in Magistrate Cheng's hands?... The letter speaks of Yu Zijian; this ledger speaks of the Ministry of War."

msgid "原令烧了，案子没烧。两样放在一起，够程知县再开一回堂。我抄一份，派人送乔阴。"
msgstr "The original decree was burned, but the case was not. Put the two side by side and it is enough for Magistrate Cheng to open court again. I will copy it out and send someone to Tallshade."

msgid "账抄了两份，一份上了京，一份在我这里。天驼关的路，往后不收钱。"
msgstr "I made two copies of the ledger: one has gone up to the Capital, one stays with me. From now on, the road through Camelback Pass costs nothing."

msgid "账我交给将军了。将军说，关上的事关上了。……我记着就是。"
msgstr "I handed the ledger to the General. The General said what happens at the pass stays at the pass... I will remember it, that is all."

msgid "印丢的那三天，盖出去的是私授的官职、过路费的路引，还让兵部拓了个模子去——征关北民夫的令，盖的是照模子浇的印。盖印的是军师。"
msgstr "In the three days the seal was lost, what went out under it was this: offices granted without authority; travel passes for the toll road; and the Ministry of War had a mold taken—the orders to conscript laborers Beyond the Pass, stamped with a seal cast from the mold. The one who stamped it was the adviser."

msgid "看了看你腰里的捕快腰牌，从甲胄底下摸出一本薄册子。"
msgstr "looks at the constable's badge at your belt, then pulls a thin book from under his armor."

msgid "将军的印丢的那三天，我在营里。将军不想知道的事，我替他记下了。"
msgstr "I was in the camp the three days the General's seal was lost. What the General did not want to know, I wrote down for him."

msgid "私授的官职，十二个——收过路费的那几个，号衣就是这么来的；空白的路引，四百张。还有一样：兵部来的人拿一块泥在印上按了个模子——往后关北那些征民夫的令，盖的都是照模子浇的印。"
msgstr "Offices granted without authority: twelve—the men collecting tolls, that is where their uniforms came from. Blank travel passes: four hundred. And one thing more: a man from the Ministry of War pressed a lump of clay on the seal and took a mold—from now on, every order conscripting laborers Beyond the Pass is stamped with a seal cast from that mold."

msgid "盖印的是军师赫造基。印找回来的前一夜，他的帐里一夜没熄灯。"
msgstr "The one who stamped them was the adviser, He Zaoji. The night before the seal was found, the lamp in his tent burned all night."

msgid "我原是禁卫军的队长，先帝调我来，是要我看着这道关。……你带着路引，去将军营帐问军师「路引」。"
msgstr "I was the captain of the Imperial Guard. The late Emperor sent me here to watch this pass... Take your travel pass to the General's tent and ask the adviser about \"Travel Passes.\""

msgid "将军的印，问将军。"
msgstr "The General's seal—ask the General."

msgid "揭发"
msgstr "Expose"

msgid "跟李信揭发：李信的账本抄一份上京，严廷殷被召回京城，军师一并押走，李信守关；天驼关从此不收过路费。第九章还没定的，这本账算揭发的一样物证。\n终章还没打完的，点将时没有铁卫营这一拨帮手。\n要这么办吗？"
msgstr "Expose it with Li Xin: Li Xin's ledger is copied and sent up to the Capital, Yan Tingyin is recalled to the Capital, the adviser is taken along with him, and Li Xin holds the pass; Camelback Pass collects no more tolls. If Chapter 9 is still undecided, this ledger counts as one piece of evidence for the exposure.\nIf the finale is not yet fought, there will be no Iron Guard Camp helpers when you call your people.\nDo it?"

msgid "账上了京。往后天驼关的路，不收钱。"
msgstr "The ledger has gone up to the Capital. From now on, the road through Camelback Pass costs nothing."

msgid "将军定了。账，我交给将军了。"
msgstr "The General has decided. The ledger, I have handed to the General."

msgid "把那本账合上，用一块油布包了。"
msgstr "closes the ledger and wraps it in a piece of oilcloth."

msgid "好。账抄两份：一份我留着，一份今夜就走，八百里，送进宫里。"
msgstr "Good. Two copies of the ledger: I keep one, and the other leaves tonight, eight hundred li, to the palace."

msgid "将军的印丢了三天，这个罪他担。召回令下来，天驼关我守；军师一并押上京。"
msgstr "The General's seal was lost three days, and that guilt he bears. When the recall order comes down, I will hold Camelback Pass, and the adviser will be taken up to the Capital together with him."

msgid "往后过关的，不收钱——先帝调我来是守关，不是收钱的。"
msgstr "From now on, no one passing through the pass pays anything—the late Emperor sent me here to guard the pass, not to collect money."

msgid "你要在朝上揭发庾子建的，这本账算一样。"
msgstr "If you mean to expose Yu Zijian in court, this ledger will count as one piece."

msgid "揭发什么？将军的事，我不背后说。"
msgstr "Expose what? I do not speak behind the General's back."

msgid "将军的印……他上京那天还在找。"
msgstr "The General's seal... he was still looking for it the day he went up to the Capital."

msgid "这把古剑是将军留下的，说谁找回了印，就给谁。"
msgstr "This ancient sword was left behind by the General. He said it would go to whoever found the seal."

msgid "你拿给我的是什么东西啊!"
msgstr "What is this thing you have brought me!"

msgid "别想拿这种东西来骗我"
msgstr "Do not think to fool me with a thing like this."

msgid "给我滚出去"
msgstr "Get out of my sight."

msgid "天邪派第十六代弟子"
msgstr "Wayward School, Generation 16"

msgid "容光焕发，左佩刀，右佩剑，威风凛凛，其高七尺六寸，虎背\n熊腰，年轻时同和大天邪于兰天武同拜一师，武功造诣不在大\n天邪之下，但志向不同，后成了京师武功第一、人人称羡的镇\n国大将军。\n"
msgstr "Radiant and vigorous, a saber at his left hip and a sword at his right, imposing, seven feet six inches tall, tiger-backed and bear-waisted. In his youth he studied under the same master as the Great Wayward, Yulan Tianwu, and his martial attainment is no less than the Great Wayward's, but their ambitions differed, and he later became the Guardian General, the foremost martial artist in the Capital and the envy of all.\n"

msgid "你眼睛脱窗啊，这里就是黄石隘口。\n"
msgstr "Have your eyes fallen out of your head? This is Yellow Rock Pass.\n"

msgid "我不管这种事的，你别来烦我。\n"
msgstr "I do not concern myself with such matters. Do not bother me.\n"

msgid "你找死啊！问这种问题，你想干麻啊。\n"
msgstr "Do you wish to die? What do you mean, asking such a question?\n"

msgid "你怎么知道的？帮我找找吧，找到了我送你礼物。\n"
msgstr "How do you know of it? Help me look for it. If you find it, I will give you a gift.\n"

msgid "信"
msgstr "Letter"

msgid "信我看过了。关北的事去问老王爷，我守我的关。"
msgstr "I have read the letter. For Beyond the Pass, go and ask the Old Prince. I guard my own pass."

msgid "接过信，扫了一眼，眉毛挑了挑。"
msgstr "takes the letter, runs an eye over it, and raises an eyebrow."

msgid "程不平？老王爷那个读书的侄子。乔阴县的官管到我天驼关来了。"
msgstr "Cheng Buping? The Old Prince's bookish nephew. So a Tallshade magistrate's reach extends to my Camelback Pass now."

msgid "兵部的印是真的，令不是先帝的——这话他敢写，我不敢说。我的印丢过一回，找回来了。这事军师比我清楚，你去问他。"
msgstr "The Ministry's seal is genuine, but the decree is not the late Emperor's. He dared to write that; I dare not say it. My seal was lost once, and found again. The adviser knows more of that than I do; go and ask him."

msgid "出关往北，谷地东壁有一道关门，我的兵守着。凭这封信，他们放你。关北是槐阳王的地界，到了那边，别提我。"
msgstr "Going north out of the pass, there is a gate in the east wall of the valley, held by my soldiers. With this letter, they will let you through. Beyond the Pass is the Prince of Huaiyang's land. When you get there, do not mention me."

msgid "程县令写了信？信呢？……没有信，关上的兵不认。丢了就回乔阴，找程县令再写一封。"
msgstr "Magistrate Cheng wrote a letter? Where is it?... Without the letter, the soldiers at the pass will not honor it. If you have lost it, go back to Tallshade and have Magistrate Cheng write another."

msgid "老王爷的侄子，清贫廉正，榜中探花——书读多了的人才敢写那种信。"
msgstr "The Old Prince's nephew, poor and upright, who placed third on the examination list. Only a man who has read too many books would dare to write that sort of letter."

msgid "乔阴的县官？我不认识。"
msgstr "The magistrate of Tallshade? I do not know him."

msgid "印鉴丢过"
msgstr "Seal Once Lost"

msgid "丢过一回，三天，找回来了。丢在谁手里、那三天有人拿它做过什么，我不想知道。军师知道。"
msgstr "Lost once, for three days, and found again. Whose hands it was in, and what was done with it in those three days, I do not want to know. The adviser knows."

msgid "槐阳王的封国。老王爷和我不对付——他嫌我收过路钱，我嫌他不奉诏。可他不是庾子建的人，我也不是。"
msgstr "The fief of the Prince of Huaiyang. The Old Prince and I do not get along—he thinks I take too much in tolls, and I think he does not heed the court's edicts. But he is not Yu Zijian's man, and neither am I."

msgid "关北是槐阳王的地界。问这个干什么。"
msgstr "Beyond the Pass is the Prince of Huaiyang's land. Why do you ask?"

msgid "路引停了。天驼关的事，天驼关了。"
msgstr "The travel passes have stopped. What happens at Camelback Pass is settled at Camelback Pass."

msgid "印是我的。那三天的事，去问李信。"
msgstr "The seal is mine. As for those three days, go and ask Li Xin."

msgid "从你手里抽过一张路引，对着帐门的亮看了看左下角那方印。"
msgstr "takes a travel pass from your hand and holds it up to the light from the tent door to look at the seal in its lower left corner."

msgid "「天驼关铁卫营」……是我的印，一笔不差。"
msgstr "\"Camelback Pass, Iron Guard Camp\"... It is my seal, not a stroke wrong."

msgid "丢过三天，找回来了。那三天有人拿它盖过什么——我说过，我不想知道。"
msgstr "Lost three days and found again. What anyone stamped with it in that time—I have told you, I do not want to know."

msgid "把路引扔回给你。"
msgstr "tosses the travel pass back to you."

msgid "可乔阴县的捕快拿着它找上门来了。李信记着那三天的账，在副将营帐。他问什么，你照实说。"
msgstr "Yet a constable of Tallshade County has come to my door with it. Li Xin kept the account of those three days, in the Lieutenant's tent. Whatever he asks, answer him truthfully."

msgid "乔阴县的捕快管到我天驼关来了？程县令不是还有一封信要给我吗——先拿信来，再说印。"
msgstr "A Tallshade constable reaches as far as my Camelback Pass? Does Magistrate Cheng not still have a letter for me? Bring the letter first, and then we will speak of the seal."

msgid "路引呢？乔阴的捕快，空着手来问我的印？"
msgstr "Where is the travel pass? A Tallshade constable comes to ask about my seal with empty hands?"

msgid "关上的路引，大队长发。"
msgstr "Travel passes at the pass are issued by the Captain."

msgid "整肃"
msgstr "Purge"

msgid "跟严廷殷整肃：军师赫造基由你在营里拿下（打一场，他只会被击倒），过路费的路引从此停了；天驼关照旧是严将军的，关北的事不往朝上报，李信那本账不上京。\n终章还没打完的，点将时铁卫营替你守官道。\n要这么办吗？"
msgstr "Purge with Yan Tingyin: you take the adviser He Zaoji down in the camp (a fight—he can only be knocked down), and the travel passes stop for good. Camelback Pass stays General Yan's as before, nothing about Beyond the Pass is reported to court, and Li Xin's ledger does not go to the Capital.\nIf the finale is not yet fought, the Iron Guard Camp will hold the imperial road for you when you call your people.\nDo it?"

msgid "军师关在后营里，路引停了。关北的事，我不往朝上报——天驼关的事，天驼关了。"
msgstr "The adviser is locked in the rear camp, and the travel passes have stopped. What happens Beyond the Pass, I will not report to court. What happens at Camelback Pass is settled at Camelback Pass."

msgid "铁卫营欠你一回。哪天你要兵，派人来说。"
msgstr "The Iron Guard Camp owes you one. Some day, if you want soldiers, send word."

msgid "军师就在帐里。拿人是捕快的差事——他懂茅山的术，我的兵近不了他的身。"
msgstr "The adviser is in his tent. Making an arrest is a constable's work. He knows the arts of Mount Mao, and my soldiers cannot get near him."

msgid "看了军师一眼，又看了看你。"
msgstr "glances at the adviser, then at you."

msgid "印是我丢的。丢了三天，我说不想知道——我是真不想知道。"
msgstr "The seal was lost by me. Lost three days, and I said I did not want to know. I truly did not want to know."

msgid "李信要上京告。告上去，告的是军师，也是我：镇国大将军的印，替兵部盖了三天的令。"
msgstr "Li Xin means to go to the Capital and lay charges. What he charges is the adviser, and me as well: the Guardian General's seal stamped three days of orders for the Ministry of War."

msgid "整肃，就在这座营里：军师交给你拿下，路引从此停了。关北的事，不往朝上报。"
msgstr "The purge is here, inside this camp: the adviser is handed to you to take down, and the travel passes stop from now on. Beyond the Pass, we do not report to court."

msgid "拿人是捕快的差事。他懂茅山的术，我的兵近不了他的身——问他「路引」，他就知道瞒不住了。"
msgstr "Making an arrest is a constable's work. He knows the arts of Mount Mao, and my soldiers cannot get near him. Ask him about \"Travel Passes,\" and he will know he cannot hide it any longer."

msgid "整肃什么？我的营，我自己管。"
msgstr "Purge what? My camp is mine to govern."

msgid "真是谢谢你了。"
msgstr "Thank you very much."

msgid "为了答谢你，这把古剑送你，当做报酬吧。"
msgstr "To thank you, I give you this ancient sword as your reward."

msgid "啊，真是谢谢你了。"
msgstr "Ah, thank you very much."

msgid "正把佩剑解下来，搁在案上。"
msgstr "unbuckles his sword and lays it on the desk."

msgid "李信的账上了京？……也好。印是我丢的，这个罪我担。"
msgstr "Li Xin's ledger has gone up to the Capital?... Just as well. The seal was lost by me; that guilt is mine to bear."

msgid "召回令明天就到。天驼关交给李信——他比我守得住。"
msgstr "The recall order arrives tomorrow. Camelback Pass goes to Li Xin—he can hold it better than I could."

msgid "两个铁卫营的兵进帐，把军师赫造基押了出去。\n"
msgstr "Two soldiers of the Iron Guard Camp enter the tent and take the adviser He Zaoji away.\n"

msgid "披上大氅，出了帐门，再没回头。"
msgstr "throws on his great cloak, walks out of the tent, and does not look back."

msgid "军师"
msgstr "Adviser"

msgid "道光满面，睿智不言而现，气象万千，显然是茅山术高手中的高\n手，经纶羽扇，和大将军正是绝配。\n"
msgstr "Radiant with the Way, his wisdom plain without a word, an air of grandeur about him: plainly a master among the masters of Mount Mao arts. With his silk-ribboned cap and feather fan, he is a perfect match for the General.\n"

msgid "先看看你的诚意再说罗。\n"
msgstr "First let me see your sincerity.\n"

msgid "模子给你了，别的我不知道。将军问起来，你没见过我。"
msgstr "The mold is yours now; of anything else, I know nothing. If the General asks, you never saw me."

msgid "将军的印？丢过一回，又找回来了——这事我知道一点。八两银子，我告诉你一桩秘密。先看看你的诚意。"
msgstr "The General's seal? Lost once and found again—I know a little about that. Eight taels of silver, and I will tell you a secret. First, show me your sincerity."

msgid "将军的印鉴？你去问将军。"
msgstr "The General's seal? Go and ask the General."

msgid "拓模"
msgstr "Taking the Mold"

msgid "说过了。模子在你手里，印色也在上面——自己去比。"
msgstr "I have told you already. The mold is in your hands, and the seal paste is on it too—go and compare them yourself."

msgid "什么模子？我不懂你说什么。"
msgstr "What mold? I do not understand what you are saying."

msgid "乔阴的捕快？你不是了。路引的事，跟你没关系。"
msgstr "A Tallshade constable? Not any more. The travel passes are nothing to do with you."

msgid "把羽扇一合，扇骨里抽出一截细剑，退到帐柱边。"
msgstr "snaps the feather fan shut, draws a length of thin sword from the fan's ribs, and backs against the tent pole."

msgid "将军要拿我？……好。茅山的术，没教过我束手就擒——你来拿。"
msgstr "The General means to arrest me?... Very well. The arts of Mount Mao never taught me to submit quietly—come and take me."

msgid "认过了。印是我盖的。将军也好，李信也好，你们看着办。"
msgstr "I admit it. The seal was mine to stamp. General, Li Xin, do as you see fit."

msgid "拿过一张路引，扇子停了。"
msgstr "picks up a travel pass, and the fan goes still."

msgid "李信那本账……他倒是什么都记。"
msgstr "Li Xin's ledger... he writes everything down, does he not."

msgid "模子你买过了，我也不瞒你：将军的印丢的那三天，在后备兵手里，我借来用了。兵部来的人拿着札子等在帐外——官职的札子、这一叠路引，一夜盖完。民夫的令他们不急，模子拿回去，要多少盖多少。"
msgstr "You have bought the mold, so I will not hide it from you: in the three days the General's seal was lost, it was in the Reserve Soldier's hands, and I borrowed it. The Ministry's men waited outside the tent with their warrants—the warrants for offices, and this stack of travel passes, all stamped in one night. The orders for laborers they were in no hurry for; take the mold back, and they could stamp as many as they liked."

msgid "收钱的号衣是营里的旧号衣，路引卖一两，兵部拿九成。"
msgstr "The toll collectors' uniforms are old camp uniforms. A pass sells for one tael, and the Ministry takes nine parts in ten."

msgid "要告我，就连将军一起告——印是将军丢的。"
msgstr "If you mean to accuse me, then accuse the General with me—the seal was the General's, and he was the one who lost it."

msgid "路引？关上的路引，盖的是将军的印。你想知道别的——八两银子，我告诉你一桩秘密。先看看你的诚意。"
msgstr "Travel passes? The passes at the pass bear the General's seal. If you wish to know anything more—eight taels of silver, and I will tell you a secret. First, show me your sincerity."

msgid "路引呢？没凭没据，问我什么。"
msgstr "Where is the travel pass? With no proof and no evidence, what do you want from me?"

msgid "路引？去问大队长。"
msgstr "Travel pass? Go and ask the Captain."

msgid "好极了，我就告诉你一项秘密吧。"
msgstr "Excellent. Then I will tell you a secret."

msgid "将军的印丢的那几天，在后备兵手里。我借来看了一夜——拓了个模子。兵部来的人出了价，比你多，模子就卖了一份给他们。"
msgstr "In the days the General's seal was lost, it was in the Reserve Soldier's hands. I borrowed it for a night—and took a mold from it. The man from the Ministry of War named a higher price than yours, so I sold one copy to them."

msgid "这一份留着的你拿去。模子上的朱砂是真印的印色，拿它比一比你那叠文书上的印，就明白了。"
msgstr "This copy, the one I kept, you may take. The cinnabar on the mold is the ink of the true seal. Compare it with the seals on the papers you hold, and you will understand."

msgid "即然你那么有心，那我就勉强收起来了。"
msgstr "Since you are so earnest, I will reluctantly put it away."

msgid "在那片光滑的山壁前发誓 我爱.....。"
msgstr "Swear before that smooth stretch of cliff: I love..."

msgid "或许你可以发现奇特的事喔。"
msgstr "Perhaps you will find something curious."

msgid "钱太少了吧！没收。"
msgstr "That is too little money! Confiscated."

msgid "赫造基背靠着帐柱，扇子横在胸前。\n"
msgstr "He Zaoji leans back against the tent pole, the fan held across his chest.\n"

msgid "赫造基掐了个诀，帐里的灯火晃了晃——帐外铁卫营的军旗压着，什么也没有出来。\n"
msgstr "He Zaoji makes a hand seal, and the lamplight in the tent wavers—but the Iron Guard Camp's war banner outside holds it down, and nothing comes out.\n"

msgid "赫造基退了一步，扇骨里的细剑抖出三朵剑花。\n"
msgstr "He Zaoji steps back, and the thin sword in the fan's ribs shakes out three flowers of steel.\n"

msgid "赫造基的扇子掉在地上。两个铁卫营的兵进帐把他捆了，关进后营。"
msgstr "He Zaoji's fan drops to the ground. Two soldiers of the Iron Guard Camp enter the tent, bind him, and lock him in the rear camp."

msgid "环顾四方，眼神锐利，看来想杀价是不可能的事了。\n"
msgstr "Looking all around with a sharp eye—it seems haggling him down is out of the question.\n"

msgid "印色"
msgstr "Seal Paste"

msgid "你也问印色？假的那颗是黄铜浇的，没上过朱砂，盖出来发黑。真的那颗泛黄光，盖出来是正红——印泥一比就知道。军师那几天借过真印，别的你问他。"
msgstr "You ask about the paste too? The fake one is cast of brass, never touched cinnabar, and stamps blackish. The real one has a yellow sheen and stamps true red—compare them in seal paste and you'll know. The adviser borrowed the real seal those days; for the rest, ask him."

msgid "印色？我这儿只有印，没有色。"
msgstr "Seal paste? All I have here is seals, no paste."

msgid "我已经给你了啊。"
msgstr "I already gave it to you."

msgid "那么多钱，那我就没收了:P"
msgstr "That much money? Then I'll just keep it :P"

msgid "不亏是武林中人，一眼就看出端倪了"
msgstr "As expected of a wulin man, you saw through it at a glance."

msgid "这个印鉴就看在钱的份上和你交换了"
msgstr "For the money's sake, I'll trade you this seal."

msgid "好吧！即然被你发现了，只好认栽了。"
msgstr "All right! Since you've caught me, I have to admit defeat."

msgid "这个真的你就拿去吧"
msgstr "This one is the real one; take it."

msgid "你给我这个做什么？我不要，你拿回去吧。"
msgstr "Why are you giving me this? I don't want it. Take it back."

msgid "如果是钱的话，我先没收了。"
msgstr "If it's money, I'll keep it first."

msgid "其他的东西我都不要，别再来烦我了。"
msgstr "I don't want anything else. Stop bothering me."

msgid "你正走在碎石小路上，荒凉的景色，不难想像，这里人烟稀少，很少\n人会走到这里来，在路尾是一半圆形的土堆，其下有一铁索，爬下铁索(\nchain)就可以通达黄石隘口，而东北方是衔接至雪亭镇的青石官道。\n"
msgstr "You are walking a gravel path through a bleak landscape; it is easy to see that few people come here. At the end of the path is a half-round mound of earth, with an iron chain (chain) hanging below it. Climb down the chain and you can reach Yellow Rock Pass; to the northeast is the bluestone imperial road that joins Snow Pavilion.\n"

msgid "脚下为碎石黄土路，两侧是高耸入云的荒山，向上仰望乃似无边无际\n穹空，北缘为一山壁，壁上有一长达十七、八丈的铁索 ，上面大\n概就是人家所谓的「关外绿洲－雪亭镇」。\n"
msgstr "Underfoot is a road of gravel and yellow earth, with bare mountains soaring into the clouds on both sides. Looking up, the sky seems to have no end. The north edge is a rock wall, and on it hangs an iron chain some hundred and seventy or eighty feet long; what lies above it is probably what people call \"the oasis outside the pass—Snow Pavilion.\"\n"

msgid "来到这里，脚下的黄土仍是厚厚的一层，可见得来往这条道路的人必\n不多，向北即是隘口尾，往南一直通达天驼关口，两侧依旧是荒冷的山壁\n，但似乎更为严峻。\n"
msgstr "Here the yellow earth underfoot is still thick, a sign that few travel this road. North is the end of the pass; south the road runs straight on to the mouth of Camelback Pass. The mountain walls on both sides are still barren and cold, but seem harsher.\n"

msgid "黄土、黄石还是平铺于小路上，崎岖的道路来到这里是比北方平缓多\n了，向南二十里就是天驼关口了，东侧为军营，但军营四周为铁栅所包围\n，想从这里进入军营内似乎是不太可能。\n"
msgstr "Yellow earth and yellow stone are still spread across the path, but the rough road is a good deal gentler here than to the north. Twenty li to the south is the mouth of Camelback Pass. To the east is the army camp, but it is ringed all round with iron fencing, and getting into the camp from here seems out of the question.\n"

msgid "来到这里，风势比其他地方大了许多，或许是因为东边为军营入口通\n风较为良好的原因，南方一十里路的地方就是京城关口－天驼关的入口，\n在西边的山壁似乎过于平滑，不太自然，或许这里有什么秘密也说不定。\n"
msgstr "The wind here is far stronger than anywhere else, perhaps because the camp entrance to the east lets the air through. Ten li to the south is the entrance of Camelback Pass, the pass gate of the Capital. The rock wall to the west is oddly smooth, unnaturally so—perhaps there is some secret here.\n"

msgid "南边即为天驼关的关口，两片诺大的铁门，若非由关内打开恐\n怕难以进入，往东侧看去，铁栅的映满你整双眼眸，转向西侧，看到的还\n是一片光秃秃的山壁，不由得使你想早点离开这个地方。\n"
msgstr "To the south is the mouth of Camelback Pass, two huge iron doors that would be hard to enter unless opened from inside the pass. Looking east, the iron fencing fills your eyes; turning west, you see only the same bare rock wall, and you long to leave this place soon.\n"

msgid "高耸的悬崖立在天驼关两侧，中间是并不开阔的谷地，真是易守难\n攻的好地方，这么多年来与异族的关系一直非常缓和，因此大门又重新\n打开。铁门的后面有个很大的机械装置，向南是通往京城的\n路，往北就出了天驼关。\n"
msgstr "Towering cliffs stand on both sides of Camelback Pass with a not-very-wide valley between them—a place easy to defend and hard to attack. For many years relations with the outland tribes have been very calm, so the great gate has been opened again. Behind the iron doors is a huge mechanism. South is the road to the Capital; north, you leave Camelback Pass.\n"

msgid "天驼关两边是悬崖，中间是谷地，形状很象骆驼的双峰，由此得名。\n这里地势险峻，南下通往京师，北上除了“关外绿洲”雪亭镇外就是异族\n的领地了，历来是兵家必争之地。\n"
msgstr "Camelback Pass has cliffs on both sides and a valley between them, shaped much like a camel's two humps, hence the name. The terrain is steep and dangerous. South leads down to the Capital; north, beyond \"the oasis outside the pass,\" Snow Pavilion, lies the territory of the outland tribes. It has always been a place armies fight over.\n"

msgid "此处为黄石隘口驻军的入口，东方为军队饮食的地方，在门口的两侧\n有两位小兵正在值勤。南、北两侧为小兵的营帐。\n"
msgstr "This is the entrance to the garrison of Yellow Rock Pass. To the east is where the army eats, and on either side of the gate two soldiers stand guard. The north and south sides hold the soldiers' tents.\n"

msgid "地上有些食物的残渣，而中央地带则有一营火，在边边则有一个水\n井，想必是官兵们用来汲水用的，南北两侧为小队长的营帐，东方则是\n副将军的营帐，如果没有事情冒然进入是会被斥责。\n"
msgstr "There are scraps of food on the ground, a campfire in the center, and a well at the edge, no doubt where the soldiers draw water. To the north and south are the squad leaders' tents, and to the east the lieutenant's tent; if you walk in without business, you will be rebuked.\n"

msgid "这是个由粗略的布料所搭成的小营帐，里面只有三二个小兵，其他的\n小兵，大概在另一个小兵营帐里赌博聊天吧，而东边则是小队长的营帐。\n"
msgstr "A small tent rigged together from coarse cloth, with only two or three soldiers inside; the rest are probably gambling and chatting in the other soldiers' tent. To the east is the squad leader's tent.\n"

msgid "这里有一大群的小兵，不知道是在做什么，营帐中央有一张桌子，上\n面堆满了各式各样的赌具，小板凳，和茶水。\n"
msgstr "A large crowd of soldiers is here, doing who knows what. In the middle of the tent is a table piled with all kinds of gambling gear, small stools, and tea.\n"

msgid "这里是小队长的营帐，四周仍旧和小兵营帐一样的空旷，但营帐的布\n料倒是比小兵营帐好多了，北侧有两把凉椅，看来定是小队长偷懒时休息\n的地方。\n"
msgstr "This is the squad leader's tent. It is as bare all round as the soldiers' tents, but its cloth is much better. On the north side are two lounge chairs, no doubt where the squad leader rests when he's slacking.\n"

msgid "类似北边的营帐，空空荡荡的，看起来一点也不像是军营，一点威武\n的感觉也没有，在这也有两把简易的凉椅，两位队长，平常小兵没有尢许\n是不能擅自进入这里的，向东北是副将营帐，但没有经过「允许」是不得\n进入的。\n"
msgstr "Much like the tent to the north, empty and hollow, it hardly looks like an army camp at all, with no sense of martial dignity. Here, too, are two simple lounge chairs, and two captains; ordinary soldiers may not enter without permission. To the northeast is the lieutenant's tent, but no one may enter without \"permission.\"\n"

msgid "来到这里，看了四周的景像真会令人不敢相信，和前面的军营竟大不\n相同，虎皮披于军椅，银器列于黑刚曜石桌上，爵为金缘双虎抱图，北侧\n挂著刀、剑、杖，地面上有羊毛软皮铺陈著，确实有副将营帐的味道。\n"
msgstr "Coming in, you can hardly believe your eyes: it is nothing like the camp before. A tiger skin is draped over the army chair, silverware is set out on a table of black obsidian, the cups have gold rims with a pair of tigers holding a chart, swords, blades and staves hang on the north side, and soft sheepskin is spread on the floor. This really does have the air of a lieutenant's tent.\n"

msgid "虎头挂于营顶，虎皮披于帐上，威武无比，帐中龙柱顶天，双龙吐珠\n图挂于前，严然有天子之势，金椅银桌，鼎、簋、爵、角、鉴，样样俱全\n，一磬、一鼓、一笙、一笛、一萧，文墨章笔擎于旁，将军在上，参谋在\n右，由不得令人生畏。\n"
msgstr "A tiger's head hangs from the roof of the tent, and tiger skins drape the canopy, a sight of fearsome might. Dragon pillars hold up the tent, and a picture of two dragons spitting pearls hangs in front. It has the look of an emperor's seat: a gold chair, a silver table, tripods, vessels, cups, horns and mirrors, all complete, a chime, a drum, a mouth organ, a flute and a pipe, with brush and ink and seals set to one side. The General sits above, the adviser stands to the right, and you cannot help feeling awe.\n"

msgid "在这里你可以看到墙上挂满了各式各样的武器，不难明了这里是存放\n武器的地方，而墙上写了个诺大的「武」字。\n"
msgstr "Here you see all manner of weapons hung on the walls, and it is easy to tell this is where weapons are kept. On the wall is written one huge character, \"Martial.\"\n"

msgid "四周是一大遍的林地，草高于三四十尺，再加上雾盲盲的景象，\n使你不得不沿著黄石铺成的小路快步行走，深恐林草压顶，界时将不\n知所措，向东深入似乎有一奇特的光亮，但距离太远，你看不清楚到\n底是怎么著一回事。\n"
msgstr "All around is a great stretch of woodland with grass thirty or forty feet high, and with the mist as well, you cannot help but walk quickly along the path laid with yellow stone, afraid the forest grass will press down on you and leave you helpless. Far to the east there seems to be an odd light, but it is too far away to make out what it is.\n"

msgid "草压天顶的情况依旧，唯西侧亮光逐渐显明，看来西侧的不远处\n有一出口，黄石斑斑，挟杂著白色的圆点，像是白色光束长期照射的\n结果，蒙胧的景色在此总算完全的清淅了，向东侧仍是回到路口的路\n，而西侧的亮光直直吸引你往深处探索。\n"
msgstr "The grass still presses on the sky, but the light to the west grows brighter and brighter; it seems there is an exit not far to the west. Yellow stone speckled with white dots, as if worn by a white beam of light shining on it for ages. The hazy scene is at last completely clear. To the east is still the way back to the junction, while the light to the west draws you straight on, deeper in.\n"

msgid "天光点著，华光亮，大概就是这样的一个情形吧，穿过了黄石穿\n林路，一束极大的光注猛然照射到你的身上，犹如沐于春风，心情爽\n朗极了，但面对北侧奇特的镜子居然有种令人不可抗拒的压力，在这\n尺尺地方，镜面反射日光，强照黄石穿林路，想到这让你有种莫名的\n恐惧，在莫名中被吸引而来的恐惧，进入或离开，生死一瞬间。\n"
msgstr "Light floods the sky, bright and brilliant—it must be something like this. Passing through the yellow stone trail through the forest, a huge beam of light suddenly strikes you, like bathing in spring wind, and you feel wonderfully cheerful; but facing the strange mirror to the north, you feel an irresistible pressure. In this small space, the mirror reflects the sunlight and shines strongly down the yellow stone trail. At the thought, a nameless fear takes hold of you, a fear of being drawn in without knowing why: enter or leave, it is life or death in a moment.\n"

msgid "来到镜内，前面呈现三面通道，各个通道皆有其不同的气氛传出\n，中道有浓厚的竹之气息，上道迷香之味不止，下道呕味不停，不定\n的上空，不停蠢地之幻地，空气被抽丝剥茧，呼吸也愈来愈困难，不\n停变动的景象，快决定吧!!暗中之招唤，心中为之一震，快步踏离此\n一不祥的空间。\n"
msgstr "Inside the mirror, three passages lie before you, each giving off a different air. The middle passage is thick with the scent of bamboo, the upper is full of a bewildering perfume, and the lower reeks of foulness. Above, the sky shifts without rest, and the ground is an illusion that never stops; the air is drawn out in strands, and breathing grows harder and harder. The scene keeps changing—decide quickly! A summons from the dark makes your heart jump, and you hurry out of this ominous space.\n"

msgid "修长的竹子映满眼廉，穹空无边，风拂无形，芬芳的气味随著清\n风而漂流著，真有如如沐春风，生机充满的竹林道，让站立其中的人\n皆受其境界而霍然开朗，忘却了江湖的险恶，行止于此，一直气凝字\n之迹，显出居此主人之内力雄厚，亦使你想找点看到居此八泰之地的\n主人是何等的人物。\n"
msgstr "Slender bamboo fills your eyes, the sky is boundless, and the breeze has no shape; fragrance drifts on the clear wind, like bathing in spring wind, a bamboo path full of life. Anyone standing in it is struck by its air and suddenly feels at ease, forgetting the dangers of the jianghu. Walking here, you find the qi gathers into traces of writing, which shows how strong the inner force of the master who lives here is, and makes you want to see what sort of person lives in such a blessed place.\n"

msgid "此处的竹林比起入口的竹子更为高大耸直，也有些小动物在这四\n周跳来跳去，跑来跑去的，更是生气盎然，不时有也黄莺唱吟著美妙\n的诗句，清新宛然，人间仙境，只是偶尔有那怪异的强风袭卷而致，\n另人难以忍受，在往入探头，有一似人大的黄石挺立于内，而其四周\n隐隐约约有些许正气溢散而出。\n"
msgstr "The bamboo here is taller and straighter than at the entrance, and small animals leap and run about, full of life. From time to time an oriole sings its lovely verses, fresh and clear, a fairyland on earth; only now and then a strange, strong wind sweeps through and is hard to bear. Peering further in, you see a yellow stone as big as a man standing within, and faint traces of a righteous energy seep out around it.\n"

msgid "北方有一个大黄石堵住去路，洋洋洒洒的蓝光从大黄石的四周漫\n漫而出，竹林参天，在此成一半凹型，团团围住了北方的去路，若想\n一窥究竟，看来非得推开这巨大的黄石才行，风势愈来愈强，四周的\n竹子发出了嗡嗡的鸣声，彷佛叫人不要靠近，此地之主人看似不欢迎\n别人来参观。\n"
msgstr "To the north a big yellow boulder blocks the way, and blue light streams out all around it. Towering bamboo forms a half-hollow around the north, hemming in the way. If you want to see what is there, you will have to push this huge boulder aside. The wind grows stronger and stronger, and the bamboo all around hums, as if telling you not to come near; the master of this place does not seem to welcome visitors.\n"

msgid "飕飕的风不停地向你身上袭卷而来，石室的四周竟有四个大洞各\n分布东南西北四方，向洞外望去亦是一遍遍的竹林，和之前的竹林只\n差在于风势的大小，强风无情的猛击挺立的竹子，竹子左右摇晃的抵\n抗著，正是一幅柔以破刚之图，壁上有一石制书柜，正散\n出阵阵的蓝光，和之前所遇之正气一脉相连，匣中似有一物，看来才\n是正气的来源。\n"
msgstr "A whistling wind keeps sweeping against you. The stone chamber has four big openings, one facing each direction, and looking out you see only more bamboo, differing from the bamboo before only in the strength of the wind. The strong wind batters the standing bamboo without mercy, and the bamboo sways from side to side in resistance—the picture of the soft breaking the hard. On the wall is a stone bookcase, giving off waves of blue light, of one piece with the righteous energy you met before. There seems to be something in the case, and it must be the source of that energy.\n"

msgid "你还没被允许进入喔。"
msgstr "You have not been permitted to enter yet."

msgid "关门兵横过长枪，拦住你：出关的，留下过路钱——五两。有凭据的拿凭据来。"
msgstr "The gate guard lowers his spear across your path. \"Leaving the pass? Leave the toll: five taels. If you have a pass, show your pass.\""

msgid "    一长条铁索缘山壁而下，或许你可以试著攀爬。\n"
msgstr "    A long iron chain runs down along the rock wall; perhaps you can try climbing it.\n"

msgid "    一长条铁索缘山壁而上，若无绝佳的体力就好不要轻意攀爬。\n"
msgstr "    A long iron chain runs up along the rock wall; unless you are in superb shape, you had better not climb it lightly.\n"

msgid "这巨大的铁门锈迹斑斑，它是上下开合的，现在已经高高的抬起，\n若它失控砸下，可能什么东西都会被砸扁。\n"
msgstr "This huge iron door is spotted with rust. It opens and closes up and down, and is now raised high. If it ever fell out of control, it could crush anything flat.\n"

msgid "这是个很大的绞盘，可能是开关铁门用的。\n"
msgstr "A huge winch, probably used to raise and lower the iron door.\n"

msgid "看起来是个普普通通的柜子，或许你可以search看看。\n"
msgstr "It looks like an ordinary cabinet; perhaps you can search it.\n"

msgid "你手脚并用，努力地沿著铁索向下攀爬而去。\n"
msgstr "You use hands and feet and climb down along the iron chain with all your strength.\n"

msgid "爬上去"
msgstr "Climb up"

msgid "你手脚并用，努力地沿著铁索向上攀缘上去了\n"
msgstr "You use hands and feet and climb up along the iron chain with all your strength.\n"

msgid "发誓：我爱东方故事II"
msgstr "Swear: I love Eastern Story II"

msgid "突然间一阵强光将你给罩住了\n"
msgstr "A blinding light suddenly floods over you.\n"

msgid "轰隆～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～\n"
msgstr "Rumble~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"

msgid "～～～～～轰隆～～～～～轰隆～～～～～～\n"
msgstr "~~~~~Rumble~~~~~Rumble~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"

msgid "～～～～～～～轰隆～～～～～～～～轰隆～\n"
msgstr "~~~~~~~Rumble~~~~~~~~Rumble~\n"

msgid "你惨叫了一声:哇，好痛啊～～～～～～\n"
msgstr "You let out a scream: \"Wow, that hurts~~~~~~~\"\n"

msgid "～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～\n"
msgstr "~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"

msgid "推开"
msgstr "Push open"

msgid "你将大黄石缓缓的向左边移动，而出现了一个小小的隙缝。\n"
msgstr "You slowly move the big yellow boulder to the left, and a small crack appears.\n"

msgid "你照柳淳风教的法子，肩抵住青苔印，脚蹬石根，等风过竹林的那一下才发力——大黄石缓缓的向左边移动，而出现了一个小小的隙缝。\n"
msgstr "Following Liu Chunfeng's method, you set your shoulder against the mossy mark and plant your feet at the base of the stone, then wait until the wind passes through the bamboo before you put out your strength—the big yellow boulder slowly moves to the left, and a small crack appears.\n"

msgid "你出力不太够喔！\n"
msgstr "You are not strong enough!\n"

msgid "进去"
msgstr "Enter"

msgid "当你通过隙缝，大黄石又急速地合闭。\n"
msgstr "As you pass through the gap, the big yellow boulder snaps shut again.\n"

msgid "你在书柜找了找但没找到些什么\n"
msgstr "You search through the bookcase but find nothing.\n"

msgid "你在书柜中找了到一个书匣\n"
msgstr "You find a book box in the bookcase.\n"

msgid "严"
msgstr "Yan"

msgid "一顶黑绢裹的道冠，冠前镶一枚乌黑的铁片，铁片上錾着一个看不懂的字。逆灵宫的道士人人戴它——戴上它，他们也把你当自己人。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist cap wrapped in black silk. On the front is set a plate of jet-black iron, and on the plate is chiseled a character you cannot read. Every Daoist of the Black Palace wears one. Put it on, and they take you for one of their own.\n"

msgid "一本黑皮的账册，封皮上没有字。翻开是一笔笔纳供的账：金帛、腌肉、麻绳……每一页的末尾另起一行，记的不是东西。\n"
msgstr "A ledger in black leather, with no writing on the cover. Inside are entries of tribute received: gold and silk, cured meat, hemp rope... At the foot of every page a new line is begun, and what it records is not goods.\n"

msgid "这本账册不能随便丢。"
msgstr "This ledger must not be thrown away."

msgid "你翻到最后几页。每一页末尾另起的那一行，记的是人：\n"
msgstr "You turn to the last few pages. The line begun at the foot of each page records people:\n"

msgid "「野羊寨，三名，丁未年秋，入丹房。」\n「关北民夫，七名，戊申年冬，三名入丹房，四名留用。」\n「傅家坡，孩童一名，七岁，戊申年腊月，留用，待子时。」\n"
msgstr "\"Goathill Stockade, three, autumn of the Dingwei year, to the Elixir Room.\"\n\"Laborers from Beyond the Pass, seven, winter of the Wushen year; three to the Elixir Room, four kept for use.\"\n\"Fu Family Slope, one child, seven years old, twelfth month of the Wushen year, kept for use, awaiting the hour of Zi.\"\n"

msgid "纳供的不只是金帛。你把账册合上，手心全是汗。\n"
msgstr "The tribute is not only gold and silk. You close the ledger. Your palms are soaked with sweat.\n"

msgid "一叠公文纸，每张末尾盖着一方朱红的大印，印文是「兵部之印」。纸是新的，印泥还没干透。\n"
msgstr "A stack of official paper. At the foot of every sheet is stamped a big vermilion seal that reads \"Seal of the Ministry of War\". The paper is new and the ink paste has not quite dried.\n"

msgid "这叠文书不能随便丢。"
msgstr "This stack of documents must not be thrown away."

msgid "文书的格式一板一眼，字是衙门里的楷书：\n"
msgstr "The documents are laid out stiffly, line by line, in the regular script of a yamen clerk:\n"

msgid "「着逆灵宫代为收管关北河工逃役若干名，解送之日另行知照。」\n「着逆灵宫代为收管野羊山匪徒若干名，毋庸解京。」\n"
msgstr "\"The Black Palace is hereby ordered to take into custody a number of corvee deserters from the river works Beyond the Pass; notice will be given separately on the day of delivery.\"\n\"The Black Palace is hereby ordered to take into custody a number of bandits from Goathill; there is no need to send them to the Capital.\"\n"

msgid "每一张的印都盖得端端正正。兵部的印，怎么会盖在一座黑道观的账上？\n"
msgstr "Every seal is stamped squarely and straight. The seal of the Ministry of War. How did it come to be stamped on the books of a black abbey?\n"

msgid "一把乌黑的铁钥匙，齿很深，柄上系着一截黑布。地牢三扇铁栅门用的都是它。\n"
msgstr "A jet-black iron key with deep teeth and a strip of black cloth tied to the handle. All three iron-grated doors of the dungeon take it.\n"

msgid "这把钥匙还用得着，不能随便丢。"
msgstr "This key is still needed. It must not be thrown away."

msgid "半卷黑皮的经书，封皮上「逆灵天书」四个字只剩下三个。里面的字横着竖着走，看一眼就头晕。这是玄冥子的——他说过，要练六阴剑，拿着它来后山找他。\n"
msgstr "Half a scroll of scripture in black leather. Of the four characters of \"Black Scripture\" on the cover only three are left. The writing inside runs sideways and straight down and makes you dizzy to look at. It belongs to Xuanmingzi, who said that if you want to learn the Six-Chaos Sword, you should bring it to him on the back mountain.\n"

msgid "这卷残卷不能随便丢。"
msgstr "This scroll fragment must not be thrown away."

msgid "霍铮的尸首。铁链还在手腕上，拳头攥着，指缝里有血——不是他的。他到最后也没求饶。\n"
msgstr "Huo Zheng's body. The iron chain is still on his wrist and his fist is clenched, with blood between the fingers, and it is not his own. He never begged, not at the end.\n"

msgid "一个小孩子的尸首，头上两个小抓揪。他蜷在墙角，手里还攥着一颗小石子。\n"
msgstr "The body of a small child, hair in two little tufts. He lies curled in the corner of the wall, a small pebble still clutched in his hand.\n"

msgid "一把通体乌黑的长剑，剑身上没有一点光，像是把照上去的光都吃了进去。握在手里冰凉，剑脊上刻着一行细字，看不懂。\n"
msgstr "A long sword, black from end to end. There is no gleam on the blade; it looks as if it has swallowed every bit of light that fell on it. It is ice cold in the hand, and a line of fine writing is carved along the spine, which you cannot read.\n"

msgid "你从逆灵宫账房的大案上抄下来的一张名单，一行一口人。字是你的，墨还没干透。\n"
msgstr "A list you copied from the big desk in the Black Palace's Counting Room, one line a head. The hand is yours, and the ink has not quite dried.\n"

msgid "这张名单要递出去，不能随便丢。"
msgstr "This list is to be handed over. It must not be thrown away."

msgid "一张黄纸，字比账册上的小，一行一口人，末尾压着一方黑印：\n"
msgstr "A sheet of yellow paper, its writing smaller than the ledger's, one line a head, a black stamp pressed at the end:\n"

msgid "「关北民夫八名，工地出事，人走散了。按册补其家口：槐阳城外八户，待取。」\n"
msgstr "\"Laborers from Beyond the Pass, eight. Trouble at the work site; the men have scattered. Make up their households by the register: eight households outside Huaiyang, to be taken.\"\n"

msgid "「关北民夫四名，夜里走脱：王石头、刘拐子、巴图、胡阿大。按册补其家口：王石头之母、刘拐子之妻、巴图之子、胡阿大之女，四口，待取。」\n"
msgstr "\"Laborers from Beyond the Pass, four, fled in the night: Wang Shitou, Liu the Lame, Batu, Hu Ada. Make up their households by the register: Wang Shitou's mother, Liu the Lame's wife, Batu's son, Hu Ada's daughter, four heads, to be taken.\"\n"

msgid "「关北河工逃役若干名，兵部解送，下月到。」\n"
msgstr "\"A number of river-works deserters from Beyond the Pass, to be delivered by the Ministry of War, arriving next month.\"\n"

msgid "「傅家坡，孩童一名，七岁。」——这一行被一笔划掉了，旁边批了一个小字：「补」。\n"
msgstr "\"Fu Family Slope, one child, seven years old.\" This line has been struck out with a single stroke, and beside it someone has written one small word: \"Fill\".\n"

msgid "「傅家坡，孩童一名，七岁，已用。」\n"
msgstr "\"Fu Family Slope, one child, seven years old, used.\"\n"

msgid "「玉螺湖，渔户一名，行三。」——旁边批着：「湖里的东西先下了手。另补。」\n"
msgstr "\"Jade Conch Lake, one fisher household, third in line.\" Beside it is written: \"The thing in the lake got there first. Fill another.\"\n"

msgid "「玉螺湖，渔户一名，行三，已取。」——渔夫家的老三。船漂回来了，人没回来。\n"
msgstr "\"Jade Conch Lake, one fisher household, third in line, taken.\" The fisherman's third son. The boat drifted back. He did not.\n"

msgid "「玉螺湖，渔户一名，行三，待取。」\n"
msgstr "\"Jade Conch Lake, one fisher household, third in line, to be taken.\"\n"

msgid "最末一行：「以上凡三十六口，唤首之夜，一并上坛。」\n"
msgstr "The last line: \"The above, thirty-six heads in all, to go up on the altar together on the night of the Calling of the Head.\"\n"

msgid "最末一行：「以上凡三十六口，续灯之夜，一并上坛。」\n"
msgstr "The last line: \"The above, thirty-six heads in all, to go up on the altar together on the night of the Feeding of the Lamp.\"\n"

msgid "一本黑皮的册子，比账房的账册薄，线装，封皮上没有字。里面一页一口人，每个名字底下压着一方押印——人是谁送上山来的，就押谁的印。\n"
msgstr "A black-leather booklet, thinner than the Counting Room's ledger, thread-bound, with no writing on the cover. Inside, one page to a head, and under every name a stamp is pressed: whoever sent that person up the mountain has stamped his own seal.\n"

msgid "这本名册不能随便丢。"
msgstr "This register must not be thrown away."

msgid "黑皮的册子，一页一口人。每个名字底下压着一方押印。\n"
msgstr "A black-leather booklet, one page to a head. Under every name is pressed a stamp.\n"

msgid "大半页压的是「槐阳河工所」的长戳，戳底下垫着半方朱印——「兵部之印」的「部」字。关北的河工，是兵部送上山的。\n"
msgstr "Most of the pages are pressed with the long stamp of the \"Huaiyang River Works Office\", and under the stamp lies half a vermilion seal: the \"Ministry\" of \"Seal of the Ministry of War\". The laborers from Beyond the Pass were sent up the mountain by the Ministry of War.\n"

msgid "几页压着一个烙出来似的「羊」字：野羊寨纳的，不只是金帛。\n"
msgstr "A few pages are pressed with a \"Goat\" character that looks branded in: what Goathill Stockade paid in was not only gold and silk.\n"

msgid "末尾十几页的押印是空的，名字底下只写着一个「待」字。\n"
msgstr "The stamps on the last dozen or so pages are blank. Under each name is written one word: \"Pending\".\n"

msgid "这本册子在谁手里，谁就知道这些年是谁把人送上了北麓。\n"
msgstr "Whoever holds this book knows who has been sending people up to the North Foot all these years.\n"

msgid "一卷黑皮的经书，比残卷厚得多。封皮上「逆灵天书」四个字一个不少，底下一个小字：「下」。里面的字是暗红的，横着走竖着走——前殿的长案上白天摊着的就是它。\n"
msgstr "A scroll of scripture in black leather, much thicker than the fragment. The four characters \"Black Scripture\" on the cover are all there, with one small character beneath: \"Lower\". The writing inside is dark red and runs sideways and straight down. This is what lies open on the long table in the Front Hall by day.\n"

msgid "这卷天书不能随便丢。"
msgstr "This scripture must not be thrown away."

msgid "一册黑布面的手抄本，封面上写着「六阴 · 追魂」。里面是玄冥子的字，六页图，每一页都是一个人影朝另一个人影刺出一剑，剑尖上画着一缕烟。最后一页的边上批着一行小字：「天殇不传。」\n"
msgstr "A hand-copied booklet with a black cloth cover, the title written on it: \"Six-Chaos · Soul-Chasing\". Inside is Xuanmingzi's handwriting, six pages of drawings; on each page one figure thrusts a sword at another, and a wisp of smoke is drawn on the sword tip. On the margin of the last page a small line is written: \"Tianshang is not taught.\"\n"

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，两手把着绞盘的摇柄，肩膀一耸一耸。他看了你一眼，又低头去摇，像是什么也没看见——能上到这里来的，在他眼里都是宫里放上来的人。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap, both hands on the winch crank, shoulders heaving. He glances at you, then bends to the crank again as if he has seen nothing. To him, anyone who can get up here has been sent up from the Palace.\n"

msgid "绞盘道士咬着牙摇了一圈绞盘，绳子吱吱地响。\n"
msgstr "The Winch Daoist grits his teeth and turns the winch another round. The rope creaks.\n"

msgid "绞盘道士嘟囔道：今年的供比去年沉……\n"
msgstr "The Winch Daoist mutters, \"This year's tribute is heavier than last year's...\"\n"

msgid "绞盘道士朝裂口里喊了一声：下面的，拴好了没有！\n"
msgstr "The Winch Daoist shouts into the crack, \"Down there! Is it tied on yet?\"\n"

msgid "绞盘道士头也不抬：供在那边堆着，管事叫你搬就搬。"
msgstr "The Winch Daoist says without lifting his head, \"The tribute is piled over there. When the steward tells you to carry it, carry it.\""

msgid "绞盘道士道：宫里的事，问管事去，别问我。"
msgstr "The Winch Daoist says, \"Palace business, ask the steward. Do not ask me.\""

msgid "绞盘道士摇绳的手顿了一顿：不认识。……你问这个做什么。"
msgstr "The Winch Daoist's hand on the crank falters. \"Never heard of him... Why do you ask?\""

msgid "绞盘道士道：底下是野羊山的山路。宫里的人不走山路，只走这根绳。"
msgstr "The Winch Daoist says, \"Below is the Goathill road. The people of the Palace do not take the road. They take this rope.\""

msgid "绞盘道士松了绞盘，尖声道：来人哪！有生人上来了！\n"
msgstr "The Winch Daoist lets go of the winch and cries shrilly, \"Help! A stranger has come up!\"\n"

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，坐在门房的桌后，面前摊着一本簿子，手里的笔却半天不动。他的眼睛不看簿子，看门洞——谁进来，他先看冠，再看脸。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap sits behind the table in the gatehouse with a book open before him, but his brush has not moved for a long while. His eyes are not on the book but on the gate passage: whoever comes in, he looks at the cap first, then the face.\n"

msgid "抬眼看了看你头上的黑冠，又低下头去。"
msgstr " glances at the black cap on your head, then lowers his eyes again."

msgid "新来的？进去别乱走。后殿不许去，地牢不许去，管事叫你干什么就干什么。"
msgstr "New, are you? Do not wander once you are inside. The Rear Hall is forbidden, the dungeon is forbidden, and you do whatever the steward tells you."

msgid "门房道士道：这里就是。进了这道门，就别再问这个名字。"
msgstr "The Porter Daoist says, \"This is it. Once you are through this gate, do not ask that name again.\""

msgid "门房道士道：野羊寨的供今天到。东边货栈，搬完了再说话。"
msgstr "The Porter Daoist says, \"The tribute from Goathill Stockade arrives today. The storehouse on the east side. Carry it all in, then we will talk.\""

msgid "门房道士的笔停了一下：没这个人。……谁让你问的？"
msgstr "The Porter Daoist's brush stops. \"There is no such man... Who told you to ask?\""

msgid "门房道士道：后殿是宫主行法的地方。没有大弟子的话，谁都不许进。"
msgstr "The Porter Daoist says, \"The Rear Hall is where the Palace Master performs his rites. Without the senior disciple's word, no one is to go in.\""

msgid "门房道士厉声道：哪里来的野人，敢闯逆灵宫！\n"
msgstr "The Porter Daoist cries sternly, \"What wild man dares storm the Black Palace!\"\n"

msgid "门房道士朝院里喊：有生人！拦住他！\n"
msgstr "The Porter Daoist shouts toward the courtyard, \"A stranger! Stop him!\"\n"

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，背着手站在院子里，腰上一柄短剑。他站得笔直，眼睛半闭着，像在听什么——听见生人的脚步，眼睛就睁开了。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap stands in the courtyard with his hands behind his back, a short sword at his waist. He stands ramrod straight, eyes half closed as if listening to something; at the sound of a stranger's steps his eyes open.\n"

msgid "守门道士把腰上的短剑往上提了提。\n"
msgstr "The Gatekeeper Daoist hitches the short sword at his waist up higher.\n"

msgid "守门道士低声念了一句什么，声音像蚊子哼。\n"
msgstr "The Gatekeeper Daoist murmurs something, in a voice like a mosquito's whine.\n"

msgid "守门道士道：少说话，多干活。"
msgstr "The Gatekeeper Daoist says, \"Talk less, work more.\""

msgid "守门道士朝东边一偏头：货栈。"
msgstr "The Gatekeeper Daoist jerks his head toward the east. \"The storehouse.\""

msgid "守门道士喝道：生人闯宫，留下！\n"
msgstr "The Gatekeeper Daoist shouts, \"A stranger storms the Palace! Hold him here!\"\n"

msgid "守门道士一剑劈空，剑风带起一股苦味。\n"
msgstr "The Gatekeeper Daoist's sword cuts empty air, and the wind of it stirs up a bitter smell.\n"

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，袖子挽着，正把一只箱子里的绸缎一匹匹抖开来数。他数得很慢，数到一半停下来，往那几只画着符的箱子那边瞟一眼，再从头数。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap, sleeves rolled up, is shaking out a crate of silk and counting it bolt by bolt. He counts very slowly. Halfway through he stops, glances over at the crates with talismans drawn on them, then starts again from the beginning.\n"

msgid "货栈道士数着绸缎：……十一、十二……\n"
msgstr "The Storehouse Daoist counts the silk: \"...eleven, twelve...\"\n"

msgid "货栈道士踢了踢一只画着符的箱子，箱子里没有动静，他松了口气。\n"
msgstr "The Storehouse Daoist kicks one of the crates with a talisman on it. Nothing stirs inside, and he lets out a breath.\n"

msgid "货栈道士道：都是野羊寨的供。你是哪一房的？管事让你来搬？搬那边的，画着符的别碰。"
msgstr "The Storehouse Daoist says, \"All tribute from Goathill Stockade. Which wing are you from? The steward sent you to carry? Carry that pile there. Do not touch the ones with talismans drawn on them.\""

msgid "货栈道士压低声音：画符的那几只，是「祭」。等子时，大弟子来取。你没见过，我也没说过。"
msgstr "The Storehouse Daoist lowers his voice. \"The ones with talismans are 'offerings'. The senior disciple comes for them at the hour of Zi. You never saw them, and I never said so.\""

msgid "货栈道士道：干活。"
msgstr "The Storehouse Daoist says, \"Work.\""

msgid "货栈道士道：野羊寨的大寨主？半年前就进了地牢，还问。"
msgstr "The Storehouse Daoist says, \"The great chief of Goathill Stockade? In the dungeon since half a year ago. And you still ask.\""

msgid "货栈道士叫道：有贼！有贼偷供！\n"
msgstr "The Storehouse Daoist cries, \"Thief! A thief is stealing the tribute!\"\n"

msgid "货栈道士一边招架一边往门口退。\n"
msgstr "The Storehouse Daoist parries as he backs toward the door.\n"

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，跪在蒲团上，两手按着膝盖，嘴唇一开一合。他诵经的声音又低又快，像是怕慢一个字就要挨罚。他的眼睛是闭着的。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap kneels on a rush cushion, hands on his knees, lips opening and closing. His chanting is low and fast, as though he fears to be punished for being a word too slow. His eyes are shut.\n"

msgid "诵经道士低声念道：……灵不灵，逆之则生……\n"
msgstr "The Chanting Daoist murmurs, \"...Spirit or no spirit, defy it and live...\"\n"

msgid "诵经道士的声音忽然高了一下，又压了下去。\n"
msgstr "The Chanting Daoist's voice suddenly rises, then is pressed down again.\n"

msgid "诵经道士跪得久了，膝盖动了动，领诵的木鱼声一停，他立刻又跪直了。\n"
msgstr "The Chanting Daoist has knelt a long time and his knee shifts, but the moment the lead chanter's wooden fish falls silent he straightens at once.\n"

msgid "诵经道士低声念：……逆灵者，逆天地之灵而用之……\n"
msgstr "The Chanting Daoist murmurs, \"...Those who defy the spirit defy the spirit of heaven and earth and put it to use...\"\n"

msgid "诵经道士低声念：……以身为供，以劫为师……\n"
msgstr "The Chanting Daoist murmurs, \"...Make the body the offering, make the calamity the teacher...\"\n"

msgid "诵经道士低声念：……劫无首，以我为首……\n"
msgstr "The Chanting Daoist murmurs, \"...The calamity has no head; let me be its head...\"\n"

msgid "诵经道士闭着眼睛：诵经的时候不说话。"
msgstr "The Chanting Daoist says with eyes closed, \"No talking while we chant.\""

msgid "诵经道士压低声音：逆灵天书。你连这个都不知道？……不要问我，问领诵。"
msgstr "The Chanting Daoist lowers his voice. \"The Black Scripture. You do not even know that? ...Do not ask me. Ask the lead chanter.\""

msgid "诵经道士的嘴唇停了一下，又接着念，像没听见。"
msgstr "The Chanting Daoist's lips pause for a moment, then go on chanting as if he did not hear."

msgid "诵经道士道：宫主在后殿行法。子时开坛，没你的事。"
msgstr "The Chanting Daoist says, \"The Palace Master performs his rites in the Rear Hall. The altar opens at the hour of Zi. It is no business of yours.\""

msgid "诵经道士尖叫道：生人！前殿有生人！\n"
msgstr "The Chanting Daoist screams, \"A stranger! There is a stranger in the Front Hall!\"\n"

msgid "诵经道士一边念经一边拔剑，念的和砍的一样快。\n"
msgstr "The Chanting Daoist draws his sword while still chanting, the chanting and the cutting just as fast.\n"

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的老道士，跪在最前头的蒲团上，面前一只乌黑的木鱼。他一下一下敲着，节拍一丝不乱，诵的字句比别人多一倍。进来什么人、出去什么人，他一次头也没抬过。\n"
msgstr "An old Daoist in a black robe and black cap kneels on the front-most cushion, a jet-black wooden fish before him. He strikes it one beat at a time, never off the count, and chants twice as many lines as the others. Whoever comes in, whoever goes out, he has never once raised his head.\n"

msgid "领诵道士的木鱼声一下紧似一下。\n"
msgstr "The Lead Chanter's wooden fish comes faster and faster.\n"

msgid "领诵道士念道：……以身为供，以劫为师……\n"
msgstr "The Lead Chanter chants, \"...Make the body the offering, make the calamity the teacher...\"\n"

msgid "领诵道士的木鱼没停：逆灵者，逆天地之灵而用之。这是第一句。你连第一句都要人教？"
msgstr "The Lead Chanter's wooden fish does not stop. \"Those who defy the spirit defy the spirit of heaven and earth and put it to use. That is the first line. You need someone to teach you even the first line?\""

msgid "领诵道士道：逆灵天书，宫主亲授。前殿只诵前三卷，后面的，没到你的分。"
msgstr "The Lead Chanter says, \"The Black Scripture, taught by the Palace Master himself. The Front Hall chants only the first three volumes. The rest has not come to your share.\""

msgid "领诵道士的木鱼慢了一拍：野羊寨那个？在底下。子时便用他开坛。——你是哪一房的，问这个？"
msgstr "The Lead Chanter's wooden fish slows by a beat. \"The one from Goathill Stockade? He is below. At the hour of Zi he will be used to open the altar. Which wing are you from, that you ask?\""

msgid "领诵道士道：后殿是宫主的。大弟子不带，谁也不许过那道门。"
msgstr "The Lead Chanter says, \"The Rear Hall is the Palace Master's. Without the senior disciple, no one passes that door.\""

msgid "宫主"
msgstr "Palace Master"

msgid "领诵道士道：宫主姓商。别的，不是你该问的。"
msgstr "The Lead Chanter says, \"The Palace Master's name is Shang. The rest is not for you to ask.\""

msgid "跟诵"
msgstr "Chant Along"

msgid "领诵道士的木鱼没停：前三卷的头三句，他们一天念几百遍。我念上句，你接下句——接不上，回蒲团上听熟了再来。"
msgstr "The Lead Chanter's wooden fish does not stop. \"The first three lines of the first three volumes, they say a few hundred times a day. I give the first half, and you give the second. If you cannot, go back to your cushion and listen until you know it, then come again.\""

msgid "劝宫里剩下的人下山，交茅山看管。说了这一句，他就知道你戴着冠，却不是他们的人。\n就这么说吗？"
msgstr "Urge the rest of the Palace to come down the mountain and be held by Mount Mao. Say that, and he will know you wear the cap but are not one of them.\nSay it this way?"

msgid "人都下山了。……这木鱼，我还留着。"
msgstr "Everyone has gone down the mountain... I still keep this wooden fish."

msgid "官兵已经在山下了。……你要我们下山，下去送死么？"
msgstr "The soldiers are already at the foot of the mountain... You want us to go down there and die?"

msgid "宫里的事，玄冥子说了算。他在后山的崖径上。"
msgstr "Palace business is for Xuanmingzi to decide. He is on the cliff path on the back mountain."

msgid "手里的木鱼槌停住了。"
msgstr "The mallet in his hand stops."

msgid "……宫主没回来。唤首那一夜下湖的人，一个也没回来。"
msgstr "...The Palace Master did not come back. Of the ones who went down to the lake on the night of the Calling of the Head, not one came back."

msgid "下山就下山吧。这些孩子，本来也是山下来的。"
msgstr "Down the mountain, then. These children came up from below in the first place."

msgid "下山？"
msgstr "Down the mountain?"

msgid "领诵道士霍地站起，木鱼槌一指：拿下！\n"
msgstr "The Lead Chanter leaps to his feet and points his mallet. \"Seize him!\"\n"

msgid "领诵道士喝道：殿前动手，坛上加供！\n"
msgstr "The Lead Chanter cries, \"Fighting before the Hall! Add to the tribute on the altar!\"\n"

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，坐在账房的大案后面，手里一支笔，面前一本账。他的手指上全是墨，指甲缝里是黑的。他抬头看了你一眼，眼睛先落在你的冠上。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap sits behind the big desk in the Counting Room, a brush in his hand and a ledger before him. His fingers are all ink, and the nails are black underneath. He looks up at you, and his eyes fall first on your cap.\n"

msgid "管事道士拨了两下算盘，皱起眉头，又拨回去。\n"
msgstr "The Steward Daoist clicks the abacus twice, frowns, and clicks it back.\n"

msgid "管事道士对着账册自言自语：七个……还差三个。\n"
msgstr "The Steward Daoist mutters at the ledger, \"Seven... three short.\"\n"

msgid "管事道士道：野羊寨的供今年足数。关北的车下月到。你是来领活的？货栈搬箱子去。"
msgstr "The Steward Daoist says, \"Goathill Stockade's tribute is full this year. The carts from Beyond the Pass arrive next month. Have you come for work? Go carry crates in the storehouse.\""

msgid "管事道士把手按在账册上：账是宫主要看的，不是给你看的。"
msgstr "The Steward Daoist lays his hand on the ledger. \"The Palace Master is to read the books. They are not for you.\""

msgid "文书"
msgstr "Documents"

msgid "管事道士道：兵部的公文，你认得字？……认得也当不认得。"
msgstr "The Steward Daoist says, \"Ministry of War papers. You can read? ...Even if you can, you cannot.\""

msgid "管事道士道：野羊寨的大寨主，账上第三笔。子时开坛。你问这个做什么？"
msgstr "The Steward Daoist says, \"The great chief of Goathill Stockade is the third entry in the books. The altar opens at the hour of Zi. Why do you ask?\""

msgid "钥匙"
msgstr "Key"

msgid "管事道士道：地牢的钥匙在大弟子腰上。我这里只有账，没有钥匙。"
msgstr "The Steward Daoist says, \"The dungeon keys are on the senior disciple's belt. I have only books here, no keys.\""

msgid "管事道士道：少废话。干活。"
msgstr "The Steward Daoist says, \"Stop talking. Work.\""

msgid "干活"
msgstr "Work"

msgid "活干完了就歇着。通铺在货栈里头。夜里别乱走——子时前殿有人巡，后殿不许近。"
msgstr "When the work is done, rest. The bunks are in the storehouse. Do not wander at night: at the hour of Zi there is a patrol in the Front Hall, and the Rear Hall is not to be approached."

msgid "把账册翻过一页，在上头添了一笔。"
msgstr "turns the ledger over to the next page and adds an entry."

msgid "手脚还算干净。"
msgstr "Clean hands, at least."

msgid "今晚起，你在货栈的通铺上睡。夜里别乱走——子时前殿有人巡，后殿不许近。"
msgstr "From tonight you sleep on the bunks in the storehouse. Do not wander at night: at the hour of Zi there is a patrol in the Front Hall, and the Rear Hall is not to be approached."

msgid "炭、箱子、经。三样干完了再来。"
msgstr "Charcoal, crates, scripture. Finish all three, then come back."

msgid "抬眼看了看你的冠，又看了看你的脸。"
msgstr "glances at your cap, then at your face."

msgid "大弟子打过招呼，说你是他的人。……宫里不养闲人，他的人也一样。"
msgstr "The senior disciple has said a word for you: you are his man. ...The Palace keeps no idlers, and his man is no different."

msgid "三样活：丹房的炉子添炭，货栈的箱子点数，前殿跟着领诵念经。干完了再来找我。"
msgstr "Three jobs: add charcoal to the furnace in the Elixir Room, count the crates in the storehouse, and chant with the lead chanter in the Front Hall. Finish and come back to me."

msgid "新来的？那一夜宫里丢了一卷书，后山的路上都找遍了。……你没见过吧。"
msgstr "New, are you? On that night the Palace lost a scroll, and they searched the whole back-mountain road. ...You have not seen it, have you."

msgid "新来的？那一夜地牢里少了人，宫里正缺人手。"
msgstr "New, are you? On that night the dungeon lost people, and the Palace is short of hands."

msgid "干活？货栈搬箱子去。"
msgstr "Work? Go carry crates in the storehouse."

msgid "管事道士把账册往怀里一塞，叫道：有贼！护账！\n"
msgstr "The Steward Daoist shoves the ledger into his robe and cries, \"Thief! Guard the books!\"\n"

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，靠着甬道的石壁站着，腰上没有钥匙，只有一柄短剑和一根鞭子。他听见脚步声就直起身来，先看冠，再看脸。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap leans against the stone wall of the passage. There are no keys at his waist, only a short sword and a whip. At the sound of footsteps he straightens and looks at the cap first, then the face.\n"

msgid "狱卒道士用鞭柄敲了敲铁栅：安静！\n"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist raps the iron grate with his whip handle. \"Quiet!\"\n"

msgid "狱卒道士打了个哈欠，往西边那间牢房瞟了一眼。\n"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist yawns and glances toward the cell on the west side.\n"

msgid "狱卒道士道：钥匙？在大弟子玄冥子腰上。开坛的时候他才下来开门。我们只看人，不开门。"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist says, \"The key? On Xuanmingzi's belt, the senior disciple. He only comes down to open the doors when the altar's opened. We just watch 'em. We don't open the doors.\""

msgid "狱卒道士朝西边一偏头：西边那间。骂了半年了，嗓子还没哑。"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist jerks his head toward the west. \"The one on the west. Cursin' six months now, and his throat ain't gone hoarse yet.\""

msgid "孩子"
msgstr "Child"

msgid "狱卒道士道：北边那间的小的？傅家坡抓来的。宫主说小孩子的供最干净。"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist says, \"The little one in the north cell? Taken from Fu Family Slope. The Palace Master says a child's tribute is the cleanest.\""

msgid "狱卒道士道：东边两个，关北挖河的。挖不动了，就送到这里来。"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist says, \"The two in the east are from Beyond the Pass, river diggers. When they can't dig no more, they get sent down here.\""

msgid "狱卒道士道：底下不许多话。"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist says, \"No talkin' down here.\""

msgid "狱卒道士抽出鞭子，吼道：地牢有生人！\n"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist draws his whip and roars, \"A stranger in the dungeon!\"\n"

msgid "野羊山大寨主"
msgstr "Great Chief of Goathill"

msgid "一个高大的汉子，瘦得脱了形，颧骨突出来，手腕上两道铁链磨出来的血痕。头发胡子乱成一团，眼睛却亮得吓人。他被锁在牢房里，看见你，先骂了一句，再看清你的脸，骂声停了。\n"
msgstr "A tall man, wasted out of shape, cheekbones jutting, two bloody weals on his wrists where the iron chains have worn them. His hair and beard are a tangle, but his eyes are frighteningly bright. He is chained in his cell, and when he sees you he curses first, then makes out your face, and the cursing stops.\n"

msgid "霍铮朝铁栅外啐了一口：臭道士！有种把老子放出去打！\n"
msgstr "Huo Zheng spits out through the iron bars. \"Stinking Daoists! If ya got the guts, let me out and fight!\"\n"

msgid "霍铮用铁链在墙上狠狠砸了一下。\n"
msgstr "Huo Zheng smashes his chain against the wall as hard as he can.\n"

msgid "霍铮喃喃道：黄霸……黄霸这个王八蛋……\n"
msgstr "Huo Zheng mutters, \"Huang Ba... that bastard Huang Ba...\"\n"

msgid "霍铮咬着牙道：两年前他们上山，寨子折了一半弟兄。老子带人来烧他们的观，中了埋伏——跟老子上山的弟兄，一个也没回去。"
msgstr "Huo Zheng grits his teeth. \"Two years ago they came up the mountain, and the stockade lost half its brothers. I led men to burn their abbey and walked into an ambush. Not one of the brothers who came up with me ever went home.\""

msgid "霍铮朝北边一偏头：北边那间的娃娃，傅家坡抓来的，才七岁。半年了，哭都哭不出声了。你要是能开门，先开他的。"
msgstr "Huo Zheng jerks his head to the north. \"The kid in the north cell, taken from Fu Family Slope. Only seven. Half a year in here, and he cannot even cry out loud anymore. If ya can open a door, open his first.\""

msgid "霍铮的眼睛红了：老三。老子前脚进来，他后脚纳供。纳的什么供？纳的是老子的弟兄！"
msgstr "Huo Zheng's eyes go red. \"Third Brother. I go in the front door and he pays tribute out the back. Tribute of what? Of my brothers!\""

msgid "霍铮道：钥匙在那个姓玄的腰上——他们叫他大弟子。他每天子时下来一趟，挑人。"
msgstr "Huo Zheng says, \"The key's on that fellow named Xuan's belt. They call him the senior disciple. He comes down every night at the hour of Zi, and picks someone.\""

msgid "野羊寨"
msgstr "Goathill Stockade"

msgid "霍铮道：寨子还在吗？黄霸还在土地庙？……他要是还在，告诉他，老子没死。"
msgstr "Huo Zheng says, \"Is the stockade still there? Is Huang Ba still in the Earth God Temple? ...If he's still there, tell him I ain't dead.\""

msgid "霍铮一愣：老刘？老刘没进来？好，好。他在哪？……他若肯回来，寨子还有救。"
msgstr "Huo Zheng is startled. \"Old Liu? Old Liu didn't come in? Good, good. Where is he? ...If he's willing to come back, the stockade can still be saved.\""

msgid "二寨主"
msgstr "Second Chief"

msgid "霍铮低声道：老二就是老刘。那天他不肯跟来，骂老子是去送死。……他骂得对。"
msgstr "Huo Zheng says quietly, \"The Second Chief is Old Liu. That day he wouldn't come along, and cursed me for walking to my death. ...He was right.\""

msgid "前些日子茅山灵心观来了个小道士，替他们的林忌真人带话：北麓那座道观还在，地牢里还在进人。"
msgstr "A few days ago a young Daoist came from Clear Heart Abbey on Mount Mao, carrying word for their True Man Lin Ji: the abbey on the North Foot is still standing, and people are still going into its dungeon."

msgid "林真人要一个进得去的人。……可你身上有东方神教的令，这件事老子不能托你。"
msgstr "True Man Lin wants someone who can get in. ...But you carry the Golden Crow Order's token, and I can't trust this to you."

msgid "林真人要一个进得去的人。老子进不去——那张脸，他们都认得。"
msgstr "True Man Lin wants someone who can get in. I can't get in. They all know that face."

msgid "你要是肯，跟老子说一声「眼线」；或者自己去灵心观见他。"
msgstr "If you're willing, say the word \"Spy\" to me; or go see him yourself at Clear Heart Abbey."

msgid "茅山？牛鼻子道士，跟野羊寨没来往。"
msgstr "Mount Mao? Those long-nosed Daoists have no dealings with Goathill Stockade."

msgid "名单老子送到灵心观了。下一车纳供，野羊寨的弟兄在转角等着。"
msgstr "I sent the list to Clear Heart Abbey. At the next tribute cart, the brothers of Goathill Stockade will be waiting at the bend."

msgid "你接了东方神教的令？"
msgstr "You took the Golden Crow Order's token?"

msgid "那这件事老子不能托你。林真人说了，进那座道观的人，身上只能有一家的东西。"
msgstr "Then I can't trust this to you. True Man Lin said it: whoever goes into that abbey may carry the things of one house only."

msgid "你答应过了。名单抄出来，交给老子也行，交给林真人也行。"
msgstr "You gave your word. Copy out the list, and give it to me, or give it to True Man Lin, either way."

msgid "好兄弟。"
msgstr "Good brother."

msgid "那一夜地牢空了，他们记着呢——不知道是你，只知道有人。你进去，脸上别带出来。"
msgstr "They remember the night the dungeon emptied, and they don't know it was you, only that someone did it. When you go in, don't let it show on your face."

msgid "冠要是丢了，去灵心观问林真人要。"
msgstr "If you lose the cap, go to True Man Lin at Clear Heart Abbey for another."

msgid "霍铮吼道：来！老子手上有链子也打得死你！\n"
msgstr "Huo Zheng roars, \"Come on! Even with chains on my hands I can beat ya to death!\"\n"

msgid "挣了挣手上的铁链——链子早让他磨断了一半，一扯就开。"
msgstr " tugs at the chains on his wrists. He has worn them half through, and one pull frees him."

msgid "好兄弟。老子跟你走。北边那间还有个娃娃，一起带上。"
msgstr "Good brother. I'm goin' with ya. There's still a kid in the north cell. Take him along."

msgid "接过名单，看到「傅家坡」那一行，手抖了一下。"
msgstr " takes the list, and when he comes to the line \"Fu Family Slope\", his hand shakes."

msgid "补……他们还要补一个。"
msgstr "Fill... They still mean to fill one more."

msgid "老子派人给林真人送去。下一车纳供，野羊寨的弟兄在转角等着。你回去，别让他们看出来。"
msgstr "I'll send someone to True Man Lin with it. At the next tribute cart, the brothers of Goathill Stockade will be waitin' at the bend. Go on back, and don't let 'em see it on ya."

msgid "一个七岁的小孩子，头上梳着两个小抓揪，脸脏得看不出模样，衣服还是傅家坡的粗布。他缩在牢房的角落里，看见你，往墙上又缩了缩，没有哭。\n"
msgstr "A seven-year-old child, his hair in two little tufts, his face too dirty to make out. His clothes are still the coarse cloth of Fu Family Slope. He is huddled in the corner of the cell, and when he sees you he shrinks farther against the wall. He does not cry.\n"

msgid "石头把墙角的几颗小石子摆了又摆。\n"
msgstr "Shitou arranges the few small pebbles in the corner of the wall, then arranges them again.\n"

msgid "石头小声说：娘……\n"
msgstr "Shitou whispers, \"Mama...\"\n"

msgid "石头抬起头：娘在傅家坡。娘说别跟人走。……我没跟人走，是他们把我装进箱子里的。"
msgstr "Shitou lifts his head. \"Mama's in Fu Family Slope. Mama said don't go with anybody. ...I didn't go with anybody. They put me in a box.\""

msgid "石头道：我家在湖边，门口有瓜地。娘每天到村口等我。"
msgstr "Shitou says, \"My house is by the lake, and there's a melon patch at the door. Mama waits for me at the mouth of the village every day.\""

msgid "石头摇头：不是黑松山。是黑衣服的道士，他们说是黑松山的。"
msgstr "Shitou shakes his head. \"It wasn't Black Pine Mountain. It was Daoists in black clothes. They said they were from Black Pine Mountain.\""

msgid "石头小声道：他们晚上来挑人。挑走的就不回来了。那个大胡子叔叔说，轮到我他就把门撞开。"
msgstr "Shitou says softly, \"They come at night to pick people. The ones they pick don't come back. The bearded uncle says when it's my turn, he's gonna bust the door down.\""

msgid "石头道：西边的大胡子叔叔。他骂人的时候我就不怕了。"
msgstr "Shitou says, \"The bearded uncle on the west. When he's cursing, I'm not scared.\""

msgid "愣了一下，爬起来抓住你的衣角。"
msgstr " is startled, scrambles up and grabs the hem of your clothes."

msgid "……带我回家。"
msgstr "...Take me home."

msgid "一个黑瘦的汉子，手掌全是老茧，肩膀上一道挑担磨出来的硬皮。他穿的是河工的短褂，上头印着一个「役」字。他靠着墙坐着，眼睛半闭，像是把力气都省着。\n"
msgstr "A dark, lean man with calluses all over his palms and a hard patch on his shoulder worn by the carrying pole. He wears the short jacket of a river laborer, stamped with the character \"Labor\". He sits against the wall with his eyes half closed, as if saving all his strength.\n"

msgid "关北民夫揉着肩膀，叹了口气。\n"
msgstr "The Frontier Laborer rubs his shoulder and sighs.\n"

msgid "关北民夫低声道：……河挖不动了，人也挖不动了。\n"
msgstr "The Frontier Laborer says quietly, \"...The river's too hard to dig, and we're too worn to dig it.\"\n"

msgid "关北民夫道：俺们是关北挖河的。河工挖不动的，官府说送回家，车一拐就到了这里。"
msgstr "The Frontier Laborer says, \"We're river diggers from Beyond the Pass. The ones who can't dig no more, the officials say they're sendin' them home, then the cart turns off and it's here.\""

msgid "关北民夫道：这里的道士拿人当药材。俺亲眼看见的，不骗你。"
msgstr "The Frontier Laborer says, \"The Daoists here treat people like medicine herbs. I saw it with my own eyes. I'm not lying to you.\""

msgid "关北民夫道：押车的说俺们是兵部批的。兵部？俺们挖河，关兵部什么事？"
msgstr "The Frontier Laborer says, \"The men on the cart said we were approved by the Ministry of War. The Ministry? We dig rivers. What's that to the Ministry of War?\""

msgid "关北民夫道：西边那位是条汉子。有他骂着，俺们还敢喘气。"
msgstr "The Frontier Laborer says, \"The man on the west is a real man. With him cursing, we still dare to breathe.\""

msgid "俺们回关北！多谢恩公！"
msgstr "We're goin' back Beyond the Pass! Thank you, savior!"

msgid "逆灵宫宫主"
msgstr "Black Palace Master"

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道人，背对着你站在黑石坛前，双手拢在袖里。他的衣冠和别的道士一样，只是黑得更深，像是吸光的。他念经的声音不高，一句接一句没有停顿，像水从石缝里渗出来。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap stands with his back to you before the black stone altar, hands tucked in his sleeves. His robe and cap are like the other Daoists', only blacker, as if they drink the light. He chants in a low voice, one line after another without a pause, like water seeping out of a crack in stone.\n"

msgid "你一出手，只穿过了商玦的袖子，像穿过一缕烟。他连头都没有回。"
msgstr "Your strike passes through Shang Jue's sleeve as through a wisp of smoke. He does not even turn his head."

msgid "商玦没有回头：逆灵者，逆天地之灵而用之。你既走上坛来，便是明白人。"
msgstr "Shang Jue does not turn. \"Those who defy the spirit defy the spirit of heaven and earth and put it to use. Since you have walked up to the altar, you are one who understands.\""

msgid "商玦的声音没有起伏：供品。子时。"
msgstr "Shang Jue's voice does not rise or fall. \"Offerings. The hour of Zi.\""

msgid "后殿里没有神像。一座黑石坛立在正中，坛上一团黑焰无声地烧着，照不亮什么。商玦背对着你，念经的声音没有停。"
msgstr "There is no idol in the Rear Hall. A black stone altar stands in the center, and on it a black flame burns without a sound, lighting nothing. Shang Jue has his back to you, and his chanting does not stop."

msgid "……以身为供，以劫为师。灵不灵，逆之则生。"
msgstr "...Make the body the offering, make the calamity the teacher. Spirit or no spirit, defy it and live."

msgid "转过身来，目光在你的脸上停了一停。"
msgstr " turns around, and his eyes rest on your face for a moment."

msgid "宫主，有生人。"
msgstr "Palace Master, a stranger."

msgid "祭品自己走上坛来，是劫的意思。"
msgstr "An offering that walks up to the altar of its own accord: that is the calamity's will."

msgid "黑焰忽然向上一窜，焰心里现出一个人形——没有头。它站在坛上，两只手朝前摸索着，像在找什么。"
msgstr "The black flame suddenly leaps up, and in its heart a human shape appears, with no head. It stands on the altar, both hands groping ahead of it as if looking for something."

msgid "的手摸到了坛沿，停住了。整座后殿冷得像井底。"
msgstr "'s hand touches the lip of the altar and stops. The whole Rear Hall goes cold as the bottom of a well."

msgid "它在找头。找了五千年。子时开坛，带祭品上来，它便安静一夜。"
msgstr "It is looking for its head. It has looked for five thousand years. At the hour of Zi, bring the offerings up to the altar, and it is quiet for a night."

msgid "解下腰间一把乌黑的钥匙，看也不看，往后一抛。玄冥子接住了。"
msgstr " unties a jet-black key from his waist and tosses it backward without looking. Xuanmingzi catches it."

msgid "去，告诉底下的人：子时。"
msgstr "Go. Tell the ones below: the hour of Zi."

msgid "黑焰里的人形散成一股黑烟，坛上又只剩一团焰。"
msgstr "The human shape in the black flame scatters into a coil of black smoke, and only the flame is left on the altar again."

msgid "你戴着我们的冠，却不是我们的人。等子时。"
msgstr "You wear our cap, but you are not one of us. Wait for the hour of Zi."

msgid "转身走向坛后的黑门。门开了，门里比殿里更黑。"
msgstr " turns and walks toward the black door behind the altar. The door opens, and beyond it is darker than the hall."

msgid "子时见。"
msgstr "See you at the hour of Zi."

msgid "坛底的石缝里有什么东西在爬。两个鬼卒从坛底爬了出来——灰绿的皮，手里一柄钢叉，面目狰狞。"
msgstr "Something is crawling in the stone cracks at the foot of the altar. Two ghost soldiers crawl out from under it, grey-green of skin, a steel fork in each hand, their faces fierce."

msgid "逆灵宫大弟子"
msgstr "Senior Disciple of the Black Palace"

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，比别的道士高出半个头，站在坛边，腰上挂着一柄长剑和一串钥匙。他的脸上没有表情，眼睛却一直在动——看坛、看门、看你。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap, half a head taller than the others, standing by the altar with a long sword and a ring of keys at his waist. His face shows nothing, but his eyes never stop moving: the altar, the door, you.\n"

msgid "玄冥子看也不看你，袖子一拂，你这一下便歪到了一边。"
msgstr "Xuanmingzi does not even look at you. A flick of his sleeve, and your blow veers aside."

msgid "玄冥子按住腰上的钥匙串：子时。"
msgstr "Xuanmingzi lays a hand on the ring of keys at his waist. \"The hour of Zi.\""

msgid "玄冥子站在崖径当中，长剑已经出鞘。崖边的绳索断了，商玦不在。他挡在你和断崖之间，没有让的意思。\n"
msgstr "Xuanmingzi stands in the middle of the cliff path, his long sword already drawn. The rope at the cliff edge is cut, and Shang Jue is gone. He stands between you and the sheer drop, and he has no intention of giving way.\n"

msgid "玄冥子冷冷道：宫主先走。你，留下。\n"
msgstr "Xuanmingzi says coldly, \"The Palace Master goes first. You stay.\"\n"

msgid "玄冥子的剑上带着一股阴风，剑过处连雾都裂开了。\n"
msgstr "A chill wind rides on Xuanmingzi's sword, and where it passes even the mist splits.\n"

msgid "看着断崖，过了很久才开口。"
msgstr " gazes at the cliff, and speaks only after a long while."

msgid "晚月庄那个女道童？我记得她。追魂那一部，她三个月就学会了。"
msgstr "The girl attendant from Latemoon Manor? I remember her. The Soul-Chasing part, she learned in three months."

msgid "宫里的孩子，学得快的都活不长——她逃得出去，算她命大。"
msgstr "Of the children in the Palace, the quick learners do not live long. That she got out, call it her luck."

msgid "道童？宫里的道童多了。"
msgstr "Attendant girls? The Palace has plenty."

msgid "宫主下了崖。他不要我了，我也不要他了。"
msgstr "The Palace Master went down the cliff. He does not want me, and I do not want him."

msgid "玄冥子冷冷道：宫主已经走了。你追不上。"
msgstr "Xuanmingzi says coldly, \"The Palace Master is already gone. You cannot catch him.\""

msgid "六阴剑"
msgstr "Six-Chaos Sword"

msgid "剑谱给了你。读到哪里是哪里——追魂一部，够你用了。"
msgstr "The manual is yours. You will get as far as you get. The Soul-Chasing part is enough for you."

msgid "剑的事以后再说。先替我看着宫里——你是我的人，管事不会多问。"
msgstr "The sword can wait. For now, watch the Palace for me. You are my man, and the steward will not ask much."

msgid "残卷带来了？给我。"
msgstr "You brought the fragment? Give it here."

msgid "要练六阴剑，带着残卷来后山找我——不是现在。宫里的事还没完。你记住这条路。"
msgstr "To learn the Six-Chaos Sword, bring the fragment and find me on the back mountain, but not now. The Palace's business is not finished. Remember this road."

msgid "残卷不在你身上，谈什么六阴剑。"
msgstr "The fragment is not on you. What is there to say about the Six-Chaos Sword?"

msgid "玄冥子冷笑：你也配问？"
msgstr "Xuanmingzi sneers, \"You dare ask?\""

msgid "天书"
msgstr "Scripture"

msgid "宫主不在了。坛上的火要有人添——续灯那一夜，站在坛前的是我。你记着。"
msgstr "The Palace Master is gone. Someone must feed the fire on the altar. On the night of the Feeding of the Lamp, the one who stood before the altar was me. Remember that."

msgid "唤首那一夜，他走在最前头，站在他身后的是我。你记着这个时辰。"
msgstr "On the night of the Calling of the Head, he walked at the very front, and the one who stood behind him was me. Remember that hour."

msgid "子时，北门的闩：门缝里一挑就落。师父屋里，书案底下的暗格。巡殿的看前不看后。"
msgstr "The hour of Zi, the bar on the north door: one lift in the crack and it falls. In my Shifu's room, the hidden compartment under the desk. The patrol looks forward, not back."

msgid "看了看你头上的冠，又看了看断崖。"
msgstr " looks at the cap on your head, then at the cliff."

msgid "宫里的事，我自己来——可那扇门，我是进不去了。宫里的人认得我的脸：师父不要我，他们也就不要我。"
msgstr "I will see to the Palace's business myself, but that door I cannot go through. The people in the Palace know my face: my Shifu does not want me, so they do not want me either."

msgid "师父下崖时带走了天书的上半部。下半部留在宫里：白天摊在前殿的长案上，五个人对着它诵；子时，领诵把它锁回师父屋里，书案底下的暗格。"
msgstr "When my Shifu went down the cliff, he took the upper half of the scripture with him. The lower half stayed in the Palace. By day it lies open on the long table in the Front Hall, and five men chant before it. At the hour of Zi, the lead chanter locks it back in my Shifu's room, in the hidden compartment under the desk."

msgid "替我做一件事，我教你一样东西。子时去，把下半部拿来。"
msgstr "Do one thing for me, and I will teach you one thing. At the hour of Zi, go and bring me the lower half."

msgid "子时北门从里面闩着。门缝里插一根薄刃往上一挑，闩就落了——那扇门我守了十年。巡殿的看前不看后。"
msgstr "At the hour of Zi the north door is barred from inside. Slip a thin blade into the crack and lift, and the bar falls. I guarded that door for ten years. The patrol looks forward, not back."

msgid "天书？你问得太早了。"
msgstr "The scripture? You ask too early."

msgid "关北的车不来了。宫主要的那扇门还在土里——你以为踏平一个工地，就断得了他的念头？"
msgstr "The carts from Beyond the Pass are not coming any more. The door the Palace Master wants is still in the ground. You think flattening one work site cuts off his purpose?"

msgid "关北的车还在走。你救了几个？四个？车上这个月少了两个人，宫主连眉毛都没动一下。"
msgstr "The carts from Beyond the Pass are still running. How many did you save? Four? This month the cart carries two fewer, and the Palace Master did not so much as raise an eyebrow."

msgid "关北？挖不动的人从那儿来。你问这个做什么。"
msgstr "Beyond the Pass? That is where the ones too worn to dig come from. Why do you ask?"

msgid "人都在山下了。茅山的人看着，不打，也不骂。"
msgstr "Everyone is at the foot of the mountain. The men of Mount Mao watch them. They do not beat them, and they do not curse them."

msgid "看了你很久，忽然笑了一声。"
msgstr " looks at you for a long time, then suddenly laughs once."

msgid "你戴着我们的冠，却不是我们的人。我早该想到。"
msgstr "You wear our cap, but you are not one of us. I should have thought of it."

msgid "把手里的剑丢在崖径上。"
msgstr " throws the sword in his hand down on the cliff path."

msgid "商玦没回来，坛上的灯也没人添了。……好，下山。茅山要关就关吧。"
msgstr "Shang Jue has not come back, and no one feeds the lamp on the altar any more. ...Very well, down the mountain. If Mount Mao wants to shut the place, let it."

msgid "下山？我在这里等的东西还没来。"
msgstr "Down the mountain? What I am waiting for here has not come."

msgid "玄冥子靠着后墙坐着，看着断崖，没有说话。\n"
msgstr "Xuanmingzi sits against the back wall, looking at the cliff and saying nothing.\n"

msgid "接过天书，翻开第一页，看了很久。"
msgstr " takes the scripture, opens the first page, and looks at it for a long time."

msgid "……是它。"
msgstr "...It is this."

msgid "宫主不在了，宫里那几个还在等他回来。坛上的火要有人添——续灯那一夜，站在坛前的是我。"
msgstr "The Palace Master is gone, and the ones in the Palace are still waiting for him to come back. Someone must feed the fire on the altar. On the night of the Feeding of the Lamp, the one who stood before the altar was me."

msgid "从怀里摸出一册黑布面的手抄本，递给你。"
msgstr " takes a hand-copied booklet with a black cloth cover from inside his robe and hands it to you."

msgid "我抄的追魂剑谱。宫里的六阴剑，都从这一部学起——晚月庄那个蒙着面的女杀手，使的也是它。是这里教的。"
msgstr "The Soul-Chasing sword manual, which I copied. The Palace's Six-Chaos Sword is learned starting from this part. The masked woman assassin at Latemoon Manor uses it too. It was taught here."

msgid "天殇……我也没见过。"
msgstr "Tianshang... I have never seen it either."

msgid "师父以为宫里离不了他。唤首那一夜，宫里倾巢下湖，他走在最前头——他回头的时候，站在他身后的是我。过了那一夜，逆灵宫换主人。"
msgstr "My master thought the Palace could not do without him. On the night of the Calling of the Head, the whole Palace went down to the lake, and he walked at the very front. When he looked back, the one standing behind him was me. After that night the Black Palace changed masters."

msgid "这东西你从哪里拿来的？……放回去，别让我看见。"
msgstr "Where did you get this? ...Put it back. Do not let me see it."

msgid "晚了。宫里已经当它丢了——你拿回来，倒要有人问它这些日子在谁手里。"
msgstr "Too late. The Palace already counts it lost. If you bring it back, people will ask whose hands it was in all this time."

msgid "把逆灵天书的残卷还给玄冥子。\n他会当你是他的人，宫里没人会问起那一夜——可禁书就回了逆灵宫，林忌不会高兴。\n还给他吗？"
msgstr "Return the fragment of the Black Scripture to Xuanmingzi.\nHe will take you for his man, and no one in the Palace will ask about that night. But the forbidden book goes back to the Black Palace, and Lin Ji will not be pleased.\nReturn it to him?"

msgid "接过残卷，在手里掂了掂，收进怀里。"
msgstr " takes the fragment, weighs it in his hand, and tucks it into his robe."

msgid "……你送回来了。"
msgstr "...You brought it back."

msgid "宫主不要我了，我也不要他了。宫里的事，我自己来。"
msgstr "The Palace Master does not want me, and I do not want him. The Palace's business I will handle myself."

msgid "戴好冠，从正门进去。管事那里我打过招呼：你是我的人。没人会问起那一夜。"
msgstr "Put your cap on and go in by the main gate. I have had a word with the steward: you are my man. No one will ask about that night."

msgid "带着它来后山找我——不是现在。"
msgstr "Bring it to me on the back mountain, but not now."

msgid "一个人形的黑影，没有头。它的脖颈处是一片比夜更黑的空，两只手朝前伸着，一下一下地摸索。它不出声——它没有嘴。\n"
msgstr "A human shape of black shadow, with no head. Where its neck should be is a blackness darker than night, and its two hands reach forward, groping, again and again. It makes no sound. It has no mouth.\n"

msgid "你这一下从黑影里穿了过去，什么也没碰到。"
msgstr "Your blow passes through the black shadow and touches nothing."

msgid "一个灰绿皮肤、面目狰狞的鬼卒，手里一柄钢叉。它的眼眶里没有眼珠，只有两点青火。\n"
msgstr "A Ghost Soldier of grey-green skin and fierce face, a steel fork in its hand. There are no eyeballs in its sockets, only two points of blue flame.\n"

msgid "鬼卒喝道：孽障！随我赴阴司受审吧。\n"
msgstr "The Ghost Soldier shouts, \"Wretch! Come with me to the underworld court for judgment.\"\n"

msgid "鬼卒的钢叉带起一股腥风。\n"
msgstr "The Ghost Soldier's steel fork brings a rank wind.\n"

msgid "鬼卒一声不响地散成一股黑烟，钢叉当啷掉在地上。"
msgstr "The Ghost Soldier scatters into a puff of black smoke without a sound, and the steel fork clatters to the ground."

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，靠着甬道的石壁站着，腰上多了一把乌黑的钥匙，一只手一直按在上面。他听见脚步声就直起身来，先看冠，再看脸。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap, leaning against the stone wall of the passage, a jet-black key at his waist that he keeps one hand on. At the sound of footsteps he straightens and looks at the cap first, then the face.\n"

msgid "狱卒道士摸了摸腰上的钥匙，往西边那间牢房瞟了一眼。\n"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist touches the key at his waist and glances toward the cell on the west side.\n"

msgid "狱卒道士低声道：子时……还有两个时辰。\n"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist says quietly, \"The hour of Zi... two hours to go.\"\n"

msgid "狱卒道士按住腰上的钥匙：大弟子刚丢下来的。子时开坛，你等着。"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist keeps a hand on the key at his waist. \"The senior disciple just tossed it down. The altar opens at the hour of Zi. You wait.\""

msgid "狱卒道士朝西边一偏头：西边那间。子时第一个就是他。"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist jerks his head toward the west. \"The one on the west. First one up at the hour of Zi.\""

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，提着一盏罩着黑纱的灯，在前殿里一步一步地走。走到北门前，他总要停一停，侧耳听一会儿门里的动静，再转身往回走。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap, carrying a lamp hooded in black gauze, walks step by step through the Front Hall. Each time he reaches the north door he stops, listens a while to what goes on behind it, then turns and walks back.\n"

msgid "子时了，谁在这里！"
msgstr "It is the hour of Zi! Who is there!"

msgid "巡殿道士举灯照了照你的脸，一把扭住你的胳膊，把你推出了殿门。"
msgstr "The Hall Patrol Daoist raises the lamp to your face, twists your arm, and shoves you out of the hall door."

msgid "你在前院的香炉边站到了天亮。管事道士出来看了你一眼，什么也没说，在簿子上记了一笔。"
msgstr "You stand by the censer in the front courtyard until dawn. The Steward Daoist comes out, looks at you, says nothing, and makes a mark in the book."

msgid "巡殿道士举灯照了照你的脸：「又是你。」"
msgstr "The Hall Patrol Daoist raises the lamp to your face: \"You again.\""

msgid "你又在前院的香炉边站到了天亮。管事道士这回没看你，只在簿子上又记了一笔。"
msgstr "You stand by the censer in the front courtyard until dawn again. This time the Steward Daoist does not look at you, and only makes another mark in the book."

msgid "巡殿道士的灯在北门前停了一停。\n"
msgstr "The Hall Patrol Daoist's lamp stops before the north door for a moment.\n"

msgid "巡殿道士的脚步声在殿里一下一下地响。\n"
msgstr "The Hall Patrol Daoist's footsteps ring in the hall, one step at a time.\n"

msgid "巡殿道士道：子时，谁也不许近北门。回你的铺上去。"
msgstr "The Hall Patrol Daoist says, \"At the hour of Zi no one comes near the north door. Back to your bunk.\""

msgid "巡殿道士道：回你的铺上去。"
msgstr "The Hall Patrol Daoist says, \"Back to your bunk.\""

msgid "巡殿道士厉声道：后殿重地，拿下！\n"
msgstr "The Hall Patrol Daoist cries sternly, \"The Rear Hall is a forbidden place. Seize him!\"\n"

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，比别的狱卒老些，脸上一层酒色，腰上挂着一把乌黑的钥匙。他背靠着铁栅门站着，眼睛一直往石阶边那两只酒坛上瞟。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap, older than the other jailers, his face flushed with drink, a jet-black key at his waist. He stands with his back against the iron grate, his eyes always sliding to the two wine jars by the stone steps.\n"

msgid "狱卒道士咂了咂嘴，又往酒坛那边瞟了一眼。\n"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist smacks his lips and glances at the wine jars again.\n"

msgid "狱卒道士用钥匙敲了敲铁栅门：老实点。\n"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist raps the iron grate with his key. \"Behave.\"\n"

msgid "狱卒道士按住腰上的钥匙：新关的三个，管事吩咐过，谁也不许近。"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist keeps a hand on the key at his waist. \"The three just locked in, the steward said nobody's to go near.\""

msgid "酒"
msgstr "Wine"

msgid "狱卒道士瞪了你一眼，又咽了口唾沫：当值不许喝。……坛子里就剩小半坛了，宫里的酒淡得像水。"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist glares at you and swallows. \"No drinkin' on duty. ...There's barely half a jar left, and the Palace's wine is thin as water.\""

msgid "牢里"
msgstr "The Cells"

msgid "狱卒道士朝铁栅门里一偏头：前些天一车上来的。子时之前，管事不许人近。"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist jerks his head at the iron grate. \"Came up on one cart a few days back. Till the hour of Zi, the steward lets nobody near.\""

msgid "醉倒在地"
msgstr "Dead Drunk on the Floor"

msgid "狱卒道士靠着铁栅门打着呼噜，嘴角挂着酒涎。\n"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist snores against the iron grate, wine drool at the corner of his mouth.\n"

msgid "狱卒道士含含糊糊地嘟囔了一句什么，翻了个身。\n"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist mumbles something unclear and rolls over.\n"

msgid "打了个酒嗝，手一推，什么也没接住。"
msgstr " belches, shoves out a hand, and catches nothing."

msgid "空的？拿老子寻开心。"
msgstr "Empty? Ya makin' a fool of me."

msgid "四下看了看，一把接过去，仰脖就灌。"
msgstr " looks around, snatches it, and tips back his head to gulp it down."

msgid "好酒……比宫里的烈……"
msgstr "Good wine... stronger'n the Palace's..."

msgid "灌到第三口，眼睛就直了，顺着铁栅门滑坐下去，打起了呼噜。"
msgstr " is cross-eyed by the third gulp, slides down the iron grate to the ground and starts to snore."

msgid "你从他腰上解下了那把乌黑的钥匙。他咂了咂嘴，没醒。\n"
msgstr "You unhook the jet-black key from his belt. He smacks his lips and does not wake.\n"

msgid "当值不喝。"
msgstr "No drinkin' on duty."

msgid "狱卒道士拔出短剑，吼道：地牢有生人！\n"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist draws his short sword and roars, \"A stranger in the dungeon!\"\n"

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，歪在石阶边的长凳上打盹，脑袋一点一点的。腰上空着——钥匙挂在他头顶石壁上的一枚铁钉上。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap, slumped on the bench by the stone steps, dozing, his head nodding. His belt is bare: the key hangs on an iron nail in the wall above his head.\n"

msgid "狱卒道士的头一点，又一点，鼾声在甬道里来回地撞。\n"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist's head nods, and nods again, and his snores knock back and forth along the passage.\n"

msgid "一个四十来岁的妇人，粗布的褂子扯破了一只袖子，头巾不知丢在了哪里。她坐在草席上，两只手攥着膝头的布，攥得指节发白。听口音是槐阳那边的人。\n"
msgstr "A woman of about forty, the sleeve of her coarse jacket torn, her headscarf lost somewhere. She sits on the straw mat with both hands clutching the cloth over her knee until the knuckles are white. By her accent she is from the Huaiyang side.\n"

msgid "妇人低声念叨着一个名字，念一遍，停一停。\n"
msgstr "The woman murmurs a name, says it once, and stops.\n"

msgid "妇人道：我男人在关北挖河……他们拿着册子挨家来抓，说他欠了役，拿我来抵。"
msgstr "The woman says quietly, \"My man is digging the river Beyond the Pass... They came with the register door to door, said he owed his labor, and took me in his place.\""

msgid "妇人摇摇头，说不出话来。"
msgstr "The woman shakes her head and cannot speak."

msgid "看见铁栅门开着，愣了一下，一把抓住你的袖子。"
msgstr " sees the iron door standing open, stares, and clutches your sleeve."

msgid "我家石头……王石头，在关北挖河。他们说他夜里跑了，拿着册子来，拿我抵他。……他跑出来了？"
msgstr "My Shitou... Wang Shitou, he's digging the river Beyond the Pass. They said he ran off in the night, came with the register, and took me in his place. ...Did he get out?"

msgid "工地出了事，人都散了。他们拿着册子挨家来抓，城外八户——我是头一户。"
msgstr "There was trouble at the work site and everyone scattered. They came door to door with the register: eight households outside the city, and I was the first."

msgid "我男人在关北挖河。他们说他欠了役，拿着册子来，拿我抵。"
msgstr "My man is digging the river Beyond the Pass. They said he owed his labor, came with the register, and took me in his place."

msgid "我走。货栈那边有个侧门，门槛低，他们夜里不看。"
msgstr "I'm going. There's a side door by the storehouse with a low sill, and they don't watch it at night."

msgid "一个精瘦的货郎，鞋跑丢了一只，额角一块青紫。他的货担不见了，只剩腰上一只拨浪鼓，他一直用手捂着，不让它出声。\n"
msgstr "A wiry peddler, one shoe lost, a bruise purple on his forehead. His pack is gone, and only a rattle-drum is left at his waist, which he keeps covering with his hand so it will not make a sound.\n"

msgid "货郎捂着腰上的拨浪鼓，竖着耳朵听甬道里的动静。\n"
msgstr "The peddler covers the rattle-drum at his waist and cocks his ear to the sounds in the passage.\n"

msgid "货郎道：我挑着担子过野羊山，转角那儿碰上一辆纳供车。车上的道士问我一个人走？我说一个人。……就到这儿了。"
msgstr "The peddler says, \"I was carrying my pack over Goathill, and at the bend I ran into a tribute cart. The Daoist on the cart asked, 'Walking alone?' I said, 'Alone.' ...And here I am.\""

msgid "货郎道：他们问我几岁，属什么，问完了在册子上写。写什么，我不认得字。"
msgstr "The peddler says, \"They asked how old I was and what year I was born under, and wrote it down in the book when they were done. What they wrote, I can't read.\""

msgid "从草席上跳起来，又赶紧压低了身子。"
msgstr " jumps up from the straw mat, then quickly ducks low again."

msgid "门……是你开的？你放我？"
msgstr "The door... you opened it? You're letting me go?"

msgid "我不问。我从货栈的侧门走，再也不过野羊山了。"
msgstr "I won't ask. I'm going out by the storehouse side door, and I'm never crossing Goathill again."

msgid "一个上了年纪的采药人，背上的竹篓被收走了，腰里还别着一把小药锄的空套子。他的手上全是草汁染的绿，指甲缝里塞着泥。\n"
msgstr "An elderly herb gatherer, his bamboo basket taken away, only the empty sheath of a small herb hoe still tucked at his waist. His hands are green all over from plant juice, and mud is packed under his nails.\n"

msgid "采药人数着墙上的刻痕，嘴里念念有词。\n"
msgstr "The herb gatherer counts the scratches on the wall, muttering under his breath.\n"

msgid "北麓"
msgstr "North Foot"

msgid "采药人道：北麓背阴，有一种黑根的草，雪亭的药铺收得贵。我往上多走了半里，看见崖顶上一个绞盘，在往上吊箱子。……我不该看的。"
msgstr "The herb gatherer says, \"The north foot is in shade, and there is a black-rooted herb the Snow Pavilion apothecary pays dear for. I climbed half a li farther than I should and saw a winch on the cliff top hauling crates up. ...I should not have looked.\""

msgid "采药人道：丹房里那炉子，烧的不是药。我闻得出来。"
msgstr "The herb gatherer says, \"That furnace in the Elixir Room does not burn medicine. I can tell by the smell.\""

msgid "扶着石壁站起来，腿一软，又撑住了。"
msgstr " grips the stone wall and stands, his legs give, and he steadies himself."

msgid "老汉在山里走了四十年，没想到栽在一座道观里。"
msgstr "Forty years in the mountains, and the old man never thought he would come to grief in an abbey."

msgid "货栈那边的侧门我来时看见了。你别送，送了你也走不脱。"
msgstr "I saw the side door by the storehouse when I came in. Do not walk me there. You would never get away either."

msgid "玄冥子站在前院当中的铁香炉边，长剑已经出鞘。他像是等了很久。\n"
msgstr "Xuanmingzi stands by the iron censer in the middle of the front courtyard, his long sword already drawn. He looks as if he has waited a long time.\n"

msgid "看着你从门口走进来，没有动。"
msgstr " watches you come in at the gate, and does not move."

msgid "你戴着我们的冠，却不是我们的人。"
msgstr "You wear our cap, but you are not one of us."

msgid "第一眼我就说过。我留着你，是想看你替谁做事。"
msgstr "I said so at first sight. I kept you because I wanted to see whom you work for."

msgid "那卷残卷没有回宫。宫里等了它很久。"
msgstr "The fragment never came back to the Palace. The Palace waited for it a long time."

msgid "那一夜地牢空了。闯进来的人，就是你。"
msgstr "That night the dungeon was emptied. The one who broke in was you."

msgid "子时贴在北门外听的，也是你。"
msgstr "The one who pressed against the north door at the hour of Zi, listening, was also you."

msgid "铁匣里那本名册，是你拿走的。"
msgstr "The register in the iron box, you are the one who took it."

msgid "拿下。"
msgstr "Seize the intruder."

msgid "前院里的道士都转过身来。你头上那顶冠，不灵了。\n"
msgstr "The Daoists in the front courtyard all turn around. The cap on your head no longer works.\n"

msgid "他的剑还垂着，没有动。这一仗你打不过——趁他还没出手，走：出了前院的门，下山去。逃得出去，就算过了这一关。\n"
msgstr "His sword still hangs and he has not moved. You cannot win this fight. Before he strikes, go: out of the courtyard gate and down the mountain. If you get away, you have passed this trial.\n"

msgid "玄冥子撑着剑退进了前殿：「北麓的路，你走不远。」"
msgstr "Xuanmingzi props himself on his sword and retreats into the Front Hall: \"The road from the North Foot, you will not get far on it.\""

msgid "玄冥子冷冷道：茅山派你来的？\n"
msgstr "Xuanmingzi says coldly, \"Mount Mao sent you?\"\n"

msgid "玄冥子的剑上带着一股阴风，香炉里的灰都飞了起来。\n"
msgstr "A chill wind rides on Xuanmingzi's sword, and the ashes in the censer fly up.\n"

msgid "领诵道士站在前院当中的铁香炉边，手里没有木鱼，换了一柄剑。他抬着头——你头一回看见他的脸。\n"
msgstr "The Lead Chanter stands by the iron censer in the middle of the front courtyard, a sword in his hand instead of the wooden fish. His head is raised: it is the first time you have seen his face.\n"

msgid "抬起头来看你。这是他头一回抬头。"
msgstr " lifts his head and looks at you. It is the first time he has looked up."

msgid "大弟子那一夜在后殿就说过。我一直记着。"
msgstr "The senior disciple said it that night in the Rear Hall. I have remembered it ever since."

msgid "他的剑还垂着，没有动。宫里的人都在这儿，这一仗不必打——趁他还没出手，走：出了前院的门，下山去。逃得出去，就算过了这一关。\n"
msgstr "His sword still hangs and he has not moved. All the Palace's people are here, and this fight need not be fought. Before he strikes, go: out of the courtyard gate and down the mountain. If you get away, you have passed this trial.\n"

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，剑提在手里，站在山路转角的风口上，眼睛盯着上山下山的每一个人。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap stands in the windy corner of the mountain road, a sword in his hand, his eyes on everyone who goes up or down.\n"

msgid "追杀的道士喝道：戴着宫里的冠替茅山做事，你当北麓没有人了？\n"
msgstr "The Pursuing Daoist shouts, \"Wearing the Palace's cap and working for Mount Mao! You think the North Foot has no one left?\"\n"

msgid "追杀的道士朝山上喊了一声，风把声音吹散了。\n"
msgstr "The Pursuing Daoist shouts up the mountain, and the wind scatters his voice.\n"

msgid "野羊山北麓的崖顶。脚下就是那道裂口，一根粗麻绳从绞盘上绕下去，没进黑黝黝的口子里——山路转角的纳供就是从这里吊上来的。\n吊上来的箱子在平台上堆了一人高，箱板上烙着「羊」字。北边一条货道沿着山脊往北麓去，尽头隐约是一片黑砖的屋脊。\n"
msgstr "The cliff top at the North Foot of Goathill. Right below your feet is that crack; a thick hemp rope winds off the winch and down into the dark mouth of it. The tribute from the bend in the mountain road is hauled up from here.\nThe crates hauled up are piled man-high on the platform, the boards branded with the character \"Goat\". A freight path runs north along the ridge toward the North Foot, and at its end, faintly, is a stretch of black-brick roof ridges.\n"

msgid "一条被车轮和脚印压实的货道，顺着北麓的山脊往北去。两旁是枯黄的长草和风化的黑灰色岩石，没有一棵像样的树。\n路北头立着一座全用黑砖砌成的大道观，山门敞着，门里黑幡垂地；靠东有一条岔路绕向道观的东墙根。\n"
msgstr "A freight path packed hard by wheels and footprints runs north along the ridge of the North Foot. On both sides are yellowed long grass and weathered black-gray rock, and not a tree worth the name.\nAt the north end of the path stands a great Daoist abbey built entirely of black brick, its gate open and black banners hanging to the ground inside; toward the east a side path winds round to the foot of the abbey's east wall.\n"

msgid "道观东墙根下的一块空地，车辙到这里为止。黑砖墙上开着一扇矮门，门楣上没有字，门槛磨得发白——供品是从这里进去的。\n"
msgstr "A patch of bare ground under the abbey's east wall, where the wheel ruts end. A low door is set in the black-brick wall; there is no writing over the lintel, and the threshold is worn white. This is where the tribute goes in.\n"

msgid "逆灵宫的山门。黑砖砌的门楼有两丈高，门扇敞着，门洞里凉得像井底。两侧各挑着一盏暗红的灯笼，白天也点着。\n门房的桌上摊着一本簿子，桌后坐着一个黑衣黑冠的道士。\n"
msgstr "The gate of the Black Palace. The gate tower of black brick is twenty feet high, its doors standing open, and the passage through is as cold as the bottom of a well. On either side hangs a dim red lantern, lit even by day.\nOn the gatehouse table lies an open book, and behind the table sits a Daoist in a black robe and black cap.\n"

msgid "黑砖铺地的大院子，踩上去没有一点声响。院当中一只黑铁香炉，烧的不是香，是一股子苦味。四面黑幡垂地，风过时幡上的字一闪一闪，看不清写的什么。\n北边是前殿，殿门关着，推一推就开；东侧一排矮房是货栈。\n"
msgstr "A big courtyard paved in black brick, and no sound when you step on it. In the middle stands a black iron censer, and what burns in it is not incense but a bitter smell. Black banners hang to the ground on all four sides, and when the wind passes, the writing on them flickers, too faint to read.\nTo the north is the Front Hall, its door shut, though a push opens it; a row of low rooms on the east side is the storehouse.\n"

msgid "一间堆满箱笼的矮房，箱子上都烙着「羊」字，有的开着，露出金帛、腌肉和成捆的麻绳。角落里几只箱子钉得死紧，箱盖上用朱砂画着符。\n南墙的矮门通向墙外，西边的门进前院。\n"
msgstr "A low room packed with crates and chests, all branded \"Goat\"; some stand open, showing gold and silk, cured meat, and bundles of hemp rope. In a corner a few crates are nailed down tight, with talismans drawn on the lids in cinnabar.\nThe low door in the south wall leads outside the wall; the door on the west goes to the front courtyard.\n"

msgid "逆灵宫的前殿。殿里没有神像，正中一张乌黑的长案，案上供的是一卷摊开的黑皮经书。五个黑衣黑冠的道士面壁跪在蒲团上诵经，领诵的敲着木鱼，一下一下，谁进来都不抬头。诵的字句一个也听不懂，只觉得殿里比外头冷。\n西边一道门通丹房；北边的门紧闭着，门后隐约也有诵经声。\n"
msgstr "The Front Hall of the Black Palace. There is no idol in the hall. In the center is a long jet-black table, and on it, offered up, a black-leather scripture lies open. Five Daoists in black robes and black caps kneel on rush cushions facing the wall, chanting, while the lead chanter strikes a wooden fish, one beat at a time; no one raises his head for whoever comes in. Not a word of the chant can be understood, only that the hall is colder than outside.\nA door to the west leads to the Elixir Room; the door to the north is shut, and behind it there is faint chanting too.\n"

msgid "一间烟气熏黑的屋子。正中一座三足的铜丹炉，炉火没有熄，炉口里的火苗是青的，不是红的。四壁的药架上摆满了罐子，罐子上贴的签子写的不是药名，是地名和日子。\n东门回前殿，北门进账房；西南角上一道石阶往下，黑得看不见底。\n"
msgstr "A room blackened with smoke. In the center, a three-legged bronze elixir furnace, its fire not out, the flame in its mouth blue, not red. The medicine shelves on all four walls are packed with jars, and the labels pasted on them are not drug names but place names and dates.\nThe east door goes back to the Front Hall, the north door into the Counting Room; in the southwest corner a flight of stone steps goes down, too black to see the bottom.\n"

msgid "逆灵宫的账房，比丹房还小。一张乌木大案占了半间屋，案上摊着一本账册，旁边一叠盖了朱印的文书，压着一方乌黑的镇纸。墙上挂着算盘，算珠磨得发亮。\n门在南边，通丹房。\n"
msgstr "The Black Palace's Counting Room, smaller even than the Elixir Room. A big ebony desk takes up half of it, a ledger lying open on the desk, beside it a stack of documents with vermilion seals, held down by a jet-black paperweight. An abacus hangs on the wall, its beads rubbed shiny.\nThe door is on the south side, and leads to the Elixir Room.\n"

msgid "丹房石阶底下的甬道，低得要弯腰。墙上一盏松油灯忽明忽暗，照着三扇铁栅门：西、北、东各一扇，锁都是新的。地上一层潮气，墙根有抓挠过的痕迹。\n石阶在南边，上去是丹房。\n"
msgstr "The passage at the bottom of the Elixir Room's stone steps, so low you must stoop. A pine-oil lamp on the wall flickers, lighting three iron-grated doors, one each to the west, north and east, all with new locks. The floor is damp, and there are claw marks at the foot of the wall.\nThe steps are to the south; up them is the Elixir Room.\n"

msgid "一间石头凿出来的牢房，只有一张草席、一只破碗。墙上用指甲刻了一排又一排的道道，数到一半刻不动了。\n"
msgstr "A cell cut out of stone, with only a straw mat and a broken bowl. On the wall, row after row of scratches made with fingernails, which stop partway through a count, the hand too weak to carve more.\n"

msgid "一间石头凿出来的牢房，比西边那间还小。草席上放着半块干饼，墙角摆着几颗排成一排的小石子，像是谁在玩。\n"
msgstr "A cell cut out of stone, smaller than the one to the west. On the straw mat lies half a dry cake, and in the corner a few pebbles are set out in a row, as if someone were playing.\n"

msgid "一间石头凿出来的牢房，两张草席并排铺着。墙上用炭画了一条河，河边画着一排小人在挖土。\n"
msgstr "A cell cut out of stone, two straw mats laid side by side. On the wall someone has drawn a river in charcoal, and along the river a row of little figures digging earth.\n"

msgid "逆灵宫的后殿。殿里没有神像，正中一座黑石砌的坛，坛上一团黑焰无声地烧着，照不亮什么，只把坛边的影子拉得老长。四壁的黑幡比前殿的更高，幡上的字是暗红的，像血写的。\n南门回前殿。坛后有一道黑门，门上一个字也没有。\n"
msgstr "The Rear Hall of the Black Palace. There is no idol in the hall. In the center stands an altar built of black stone, and on it a black flame burns without a sound, lighting nothing, only stretching the shadows at the altar's edge long. The black banners on the four walls hang higher than the Front Hall's, the writing on them dark red, as if written in blood.\nThe south door goes back to the Front Hall. Behind the altar is a black door with not a single character on it.\n"

msgid "商玦的居所，比后殿暖，暖得不自然。一张乌木书案，案上笔墨整齐；靠墙一座书架，空了——架上的灰尘留着一排书脊的印子。案角一只黑匣，开着，里面什么也没有。\n南边的黑门回后殿；北墙一扇小门，门外是风声。\n"
msgstr "Shang Jue's quarters, warmer than the Rear Hall, warm in a way that is not natural. An ebony desk, brushes and ink set in order on it; against the wall a bookshelf, empty, the dust on it keeping the marks of a row of spines. On the corner of the desk sits a black box, open, with nothing inside.\nThe black door to the south goes back to the Rear Hall; in the north wall is a small door, and outside it, the sound of wind.\n"

msgid "逆灵宫后山的崖径，窄得只容一人，一边是黑砖的后墙，一边是深不见底的崖。风从崖底上来，带着雾。崖径往北走到头是断崖。\n南边的小门回宫主的居所。\n"
msgstr "The cliff path behind the Black Palace, so narrow only one can pass, the black-brick back wall on one side and a bottomless drop on the other. Wind rises from the foot of the cliff, bringing mist. Going north, the path ends at a sheer cliff.\nThe small door to the south goes back to the Palace Master's quarters.\n"

msgid "崖径的尽头。一根绳索拴在崖边的铁桩上，另一头垂进雾里——绳子在三尺外被割断了，断口新得发白。再往前一步就是空的。\n"
msgstr "The end of the cliff path. A rope is tied to an iron stake at the cliff's edge, and its other end hangs down into the mist; three feet out, the rope has been cut, the cut end new and white. One step farther and there is nothing.\n"

msgid "铁栅门锁着，锁是新的，摇一摇纹丝不动。钥匙不在这里。"
msgstr "The iron grate is locked, the lock new, and it does not budge when you shake it. The key is not here."

msgid "铁栅门锁着。栅栏里有人往后缩了缩。"
msgstr "The iron grate is locked. Inside, someone shrinks back a little."

msgid "铁栅门锁着。里面的人抬起头看了看你，又低下去。"
msgstr "The iron grate is locked. The people inside lift their heads to look at you, then lower them again."

msgid "下到山路"
msgstr "Climb Down to the Road"

msgid "你抓住麻绳，顺着裂口里的岩壁一点点溜下去。绳子磨得手心发烫，脚下终于踩到了山路的石头。\n"
msgstr "You grip the hemp rope and slide down along the rock wall inside the crack, bit by bit. The rope burns your palms, and at last your feet touch the stones of the road.\n"

msgid "追出去"
msgstr "Go After Him"

msgid "你推开小门，风裹着雾扑进来。崖径上空无一人。\n"
msgstr "You push open the small door, and the wind rushes in with the mist. The cliff path is empty.\n"

msgid "你推开小门，风裹着雾扑进来。\n"
msgstr "You push open the small door, and the wind rushes in with the mist.\n"

msgid "后门外是后山的崖径，商玦刚从这里出去，玄冥子跟在后头替他断后。追出去，要和玄冥子打一场，也赶不回地牢了——救人和追宫主，只来得及一件。"
msgstr "Outside the back door is the cliff path behind the mountain; Shang Jue has just gone out this way, and Xuanmingzi follows after to cover his retreat. If you go after him, you will have to fight Xuanmingzi, and you will not get back to the dungeon either: saving the prisoners or chasing the Palace Master, there is time for only one."

msgid "你推开小门，风裹着雾扑进来。崖径上有脚步声，往北去了。\n"
msgstr "You push open the small door, and the wind rushes in with the mist. There are footsteps on the cliff path, going north.\n"

msgid "添炭"
msgstr "Add Charcoal"

msgid "炉膛里的炭够烧到明天了。\n"
msgstr "There is charcoal enough in the furnace to burn till tomorrow.\n"

msgid "你从墙角的炭筐里铲了三铲黑炭，添进丹炉。青火舔上来，炭不红，一块一块地白下去，变成了灰。炉身还是冰凉的。\n"
msgstr "You shovel three scoops of black charcoal from the basket in the corner into the furnace. The blue flame licks up, and the charcoal does not glow red but goes white lump by lump and turns to ash. The body of the furnace is still ice cold.\n"

msgid "炉边托盘里的丹丸少了几颗。你没问。\n"
msgstr "A few of the pills on the tray by the furnace are missing. You do not ask.\n"

msgid "墙角一筐黑炭。没人让你碰那团青火。\n"
msgstr "A basket of black charcoal in the corner. No one told you to touch that blue flame.\n"

msgid "点箱"
msgstr "Count Crates"

msgid "箱子点过了：野羊寨的二十三只，关北的九只，画符的四只。\n"
msgstr "Crates counted: twenty-three from Goathill Stockade, nine from Beyond the Pass, four with talismans drawn on them.\n"

msgid "你一只一只点过去。烙着「羊」字的二十三只，是野羊寨的供：绸缎、腌肉、麻绳。\n"
msgstr "You count them one by one. The twenty-three branded \"Goat\" are Goathill Stockade's tribute: silk, cured meat, hemp rope.\n"

msgid "关北来的九只，封条上盖着「槐阳河工所」的戳，戳底下压着半方朱印——是「兵部之印」的「部」字。\n"
msgstr "The nine from Beyond the Pass have seals stamped on the seam strips: the \"Huaiyang River Works Office\", and under the stamp half a vermilion seal, the \"Ministry\" of \"Seal of the Ministry of War\".\n"

msgid "还有四只画着符，封条是黑的，没有字。货栈道士瞪了你一眼：「那是祭，不许碰。」\n"
msgstr "Four more have talismans drawn on them, with black seal strips and no writing. The Storehouse Daoist glares at you: \"Those are offerings. Do not touch.\"\n"

msgid "货栈里的箱子堆了半屋。货栈道士在数，没你的事。\n"
msgstr "The crates in the storehouse are piled half the room. The Storehouse Daoist is counting; it is none of your business.\n"

msgid "你已经会了。回蒲团上去。"
msgstr "You already know it. Back to your cushion."

msgid "管事送来的？我念上句，你接下句。"
msgstr "Sent by the steward? I give the first half, and you give the second."

msgid "领诵道士敲了一下木鱼：「逆灵者——」"
msgstr "The Lead Chanter strikes the wooden fish once: \"Those who defy the spirit—\""

msgid "顺天地之灵而养之。"
msgstr "Follow the spirit of heaven and earth and nourish it."

msgid "逆天地之灵而用之。"
msgstr "Defy the spirit of heaven and earth and put it to use."

msgid "借天地之灵而还之。"
msgstr "Borrow the spirit of heaven and earth and give it back."

msgid "又一下：「以身为供——」"
msgstr "Another beat: \"Make the body the offering—\""

msgid "以德为师。"
msgstr "Make virtue the teacher."

msgid "以心为灯。"
msgstr "Make the heart the lamp."

msgid "以劫为师。"
msgstr "Make the calamity the teacher."

msgid "再一下：「劫无首——」"
msgstr "One more beat: \"The calamity has no head—\""

msgid "以我为首。"
msgstr "Let me be its head."

msgid "天自收之。"
msgstr "Heaven will gather it in."

msgid "人自避之。"
msgstr "Men will shun it."

msgid "……一字不差。"
msgstr "...Not a word wrong."

msgid "领诵道士的木鱼又敲了起来，比刚才快了一些。\n"
msgstr "The Lead Chanter's wooden fish starts again, a little faster than before.\n"

msgid "错了。回蒲团上去，听他们诵熟了再来。"
msgstr "Wrong. Back to your cushion, and listen until they have it by heart, then come again."

msgid "的木鱼一下也没停。"
msgstr "'s wooden fish does not stop for a single beat."

msgid "前殿的蒲团空着，木鱼搁在案角。\n"
msgstr "The cushions in the Front Hall are empty, and the wooden fish lies on the corner of the table.\n"

msgid "睡到子时"
msgstr "Sleep Till Zi"

msgid "已经是子时了。货栈里鼾声一片。\n"
msgstr "It is already the hour of Zi. The storehouse is full of snoring.\n"

msgid "在货栈的通铺上睡到子时？\n（世界的时间会过去，别的地方照旧过它们的日子。）"
msgstr "Sleep on the storehouse bunks until the hour of Zi?\n(World time will pass, and other places go on with their own days.)"

msgid "你在通铺最靠门的一头躺下，黑冠压在枕边。\n"
msgstr "You lie down at the end of the bunk nearest the door, the black cap pressed under your pillow.\n"

msgid "你醒的时候，货栈里只有鼾声。前殿那边，有一盏灯在一步一步地走。\n"
msgstr "When you wake, the storehouse holds only snoring. Over in the Front Hall, a lamp is walking, step by step.\n"

msgid "通铺上睡着几个道士，没有你的铺位。\n"
msgstr "A few Daoists are asleep on the bunks, and there is no place for you.\n"

msgid "听"
msgstr "Listen"

msgid "门里没有声音了。\n"
msgstr "No sound comes from behind the door now.\n"

msgid "你贴着北门，屏住气。门缝里漏出一线青光，有两个人在说话。\n"
msgstr "You press against the north door and hold your breath. A thread of blue light leaks through the crack, and two people are talking.\n"

msgid "一个嗓子沙哑：「……湖底的钉子，还没有人动。」\n"
msgstr "A hoarse voice: \"...No one has touched the nail at the bottom of the lake yet.\"\n"

msgid "另一个声音不高，一字一顿，像在念经：「会有人去拔的。钉子一拔，就是唤首的时辰。」\n"
msgstr "Another voice, not loud, one word at a time, as if chanting: \"Someone will go to pull it. When the nail is pulled, it is the hour of the Calling of the Head.\"\n"

msgid "一个嗓子沙哑：「看过钉子的那个人走了。钉子还在。」\n"
msgstr "A hoarse voice: \"The one who looked at the nail has left. The nail is still there.\"\n"

msgid "另一个声音不高，一字一顿，像在念经：「他会回来拔的。他拔的那一夜，就是唤首的时辰。」\n"
msgstr "Another voice, not loud, one word at a time, as if chanting: \"He will come back to pull it. The night he pulls it is the hour of the Calling of the Head.\"\n"

msgid "一个嗓子沙哑：「钉子拔了。湖边的村子烧了一半。」\n"
msgstr "A hoarse voice: \"The nail is pulled. Half the village by the lake has burned.\"\n"

msgid "另一个声音不高，一字一顿，像在念经：「头在冰下醒了。等它自己找回来——那一夜，就是唤首。」\n"
msgstr "Another voice, not loud, one word at a time, as if chanting: \"The head has woken under the ice. Let it find its own way back. That night is the Calling of the Head.\"\n"

msgid "沙哑的那个：「人呢？」那声音道：「名单在账房，管事那里。三十六口，一口也不能少。」\n"
msgstr "The hoarse one: \"And the people?\" The voice says, \"The list is in the Counting Room, with the steward. Thirty-six heads, not one short.\"\n"

msgid "一个嗓子沙哑：「宫主不在了。坛上的火，不能灭。」\n"
msgstr "A hoarse voice: \"The Palace Master is gone. The fire on the altar must not go out.\"\n"

msgid "另一个声音年轻些：「续灯要人。名单在账房，管事那里。三十六口，一口也不能少。」\n"
msgstr "Another voice, younger: \"Feeding the lamp takes people. The list is in the Counting Room, with the steward. Thirty-six heads, not one short.\"\n"

msgid "门里的光灭了。你退开一步，心跳得厉害。\n"
msgstr "The light behind the door goes out. You step back, your heart pounding.\n"

msgid "北门从里面闩着。门缝里有光。\n"
msgstr "The north door is barred from inside. There is light in the crack.\n"

msgid "北门关着。这个时辰，门里静悄悄的。\n"
msgstr "The north door is shut. At this hour it is quiet behind it.\n"

msgid "抄名单"
msgstr "Copy the List"

msgid "名单你已经抄过了。\n"
msgstr "You have already copied the list.\n"

msgid "管事道士伏在案头睡着了，一只手还压着账册。你屏住气，从账册的夹页里抽出一张黄纸，借着残灯一笔一笔抄了下来。\n"
msgstr "The Steward Daoist has fallen asleep over the desk, one hand still pressed on the ledger. You hold your breath, draw a sheet of yellow paper from between the ledger's pages, and copy it out stroke by stroke by the last of the lamp.\n"

msgid "你把黄纸照原样夹回去。管事翻了个身，没有醒。\n"
msgstr "You slip the yellow paper back as it was. The steward turns over and does not wake.\n"

msgid "把手按在账册上，抬眼看你。"
msgstr " lays a hand on the ledger and looks up at you."

msgid "账是宫主要看的，不是给你看的。"
msgstr "The books are for the Palace Master to read. They are not for you."

msgid "账房里没有人。你从账册的夹页里抽出一张黄纸，借着残灯一笔一笔抄了下来。\n"
msgstr "There is no one in the Counting Room. You draw a sheet of yellow paper from between the ledger's pages, and copy it out stroke by stroke by the last of the lamp.\n"

msgid "案上摊着账册和文书。没人让你动它们。\n"
msgstr "The ledger and documents lie open on the desk. No one told you to touch them.\n"

msgid "开匣"
msgstr "Open the Box"

msgid "铁匣空着。\n"
msgstr "The iron box is empty.\n"

msgid "名册还在匣里。你对林忌说过，不动它。\n"
msgstr "The register is still in the box. You told Lin Ji you would not touch it.\n"

msgid "带走祭品名册的原本？\n它是物证：朝上揭发兵部时算一样；京师的事已经定了的，乔阴的程不平对得出上面的押印。\n可宫里会少一本名册，管事迟早会发现——那是一条疑点。\n带走吗？"
msgstr "Take away the original of the sacrifice register?\nIt is evidence: it counts for one when you denounce the Ministry of War to higher authority; and if the Capital business is already settled, Cheng Buping of Tallshade can match the stamps on it.\nBut the Palace will be one register short, and the steward will find out sooner or later. That is one suspicion.\nTake it?"

msgid "带走名册"
msgstr "Take the Register"

msgid "你把名册揣进怀里，合上铁匣，铜锁照原样挂好。\n"
msgstr "You tuck the register into your robe, shut the iron box, and hang the copper lock back as it was.\n"

msgid "你用地牢的钥匙试了试铁匣上的铜锁——咔的一声，开了。\n"
msgstr "You try the dungeon key on the copper lock of the iron box. It clicks, and the lock opens.\n"

msgid "匣里是一本黑皮的册子：祭品名册的原本。一页一口人，每个名字底下压着一方押印。\n"
msgstr "Inside is a booklet in black leather: the original of the sacrifice register. One page to a head, and under every name a stamp is pressed.\n"

msgid "大半页压的是「槐阳河工所」的长戳，戳底下垫着半方朱印——「兵部之印」的「部」字。几页压着野羊寨的「羊」字。末尾十几页的押印是空的，只写着一个「待」字。\n"
msgstr "Most of the pages are pressed with the long stamp of the \"Huaiyang River Works Office\", and under the stamp lies half a vermilion seal: the \"Ministry\" of \"Seal of the Ministry of War\". A few pages are pressed with the \"Goat\" of Goathill Stockade. The stamps on the last dozen or so pages are blank, with only one word written: \"Pending\".\n"

msgid "带走它，是一样物证；可宫里少了一本名册，管事迟早会发现。不带，就当没打开过——回去告诉林忌一声。\n"
msgstr "Take it, and it is a piece of evidence; but the Palace will be one register short, and the steward will find out sooner or later. Leave it, and it is as if it was never opened. Go back and tell Lin Ji.\n"

msgid "把手按在铁匣上，抬眼看你。"
msgstr " lays a hand on the iron box and looks up at you."

msgid "这是宫主的东西。"
msgstr "This belongs to the Palace Master."

msgid "案角一只铁匣，挂着一把铜锁。锁眼的样式，和地牢的铁栅门是一样的。\n"
msgstr "An iron box sits on the corner of the desk with a copper lock. The keyhole is the same pattern as the dungeon's iron grates.\n"

msgid "案角一只铁匣，上着锁。\n"
msgstr "An iron box sits on the corner of the desk, locked.\n"

msgid "摘钥匙"
msgstr "Take the Key"

msgid "钥匙已经在你身上了。\n"
msgstr "The key is already on you.\n"

msgid "狱卒道士歪在长凳上睡得正沉，钥匙就挂在他头顶的铁钉上。\n"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist is sound asleep on the bench, and the key hangs on the iron nail above his head.\n"

msgid "你踮起脚，两根手指捏住钥匙，一点一点从钉子上褪下来。钥匙碰了一下石壁——他咂了咂嘴，没醒。\n"
msgstr "You rise on tiptoe, pinch the key between two fingers, and slip it off the nail bit by bit. The key touches the stone wall: he smacks his lips and does not wake.\n"

msgid "长凳上头的铁钉上挂着钥匙。你踮起脚把它摘了下来。\n"
msgstr "A key hangs on the iron nail above the bench. You rise on tiptoe and take it down.\n"

msgid "拍了拍腰上的钥匙。"
msgstr " pats the key at his waist."

msgid "钥匙在我这儿。你管好你自己。"
msgstr "The key's with me. You look after yourself."

msgid "长凳上头的石壁里钉着一枚铁钉，空着。\n"
msgstr "An iron nail is driven into the stone wall above the bench, empty.\n"

msgid "下药"
msgstr "Drug the Wine"

msgid "坛子里剩的酒，够他睡到明天的。\n"
msgstr "The wine left in the jar is enough to keep him asleep till tomorrow.\n"

msgid "你背过身去，把一包蒙汗药抖进那只还剩小半坛的酒坛里，晃了晃，塞好布塞。\n"
msgstr "You turn your back, shake a packet of knockout powder into the jar with half its wine left, swirl it, and stop it again with the cloth plug.\n"

msgid "瞟了酒坛好几眼，到底没忍住，抱起来灌了一大口。"
msgstr " glances at the wine jar several times, cannot hold out in the end, picks it up and gulps down a big mouthful."

msgid "……今天这酒，倒有点劲。"
msgstr "...This wine's got some kick today."

msgid "又灌了两口，眼睛就直了，顺着铁栅门滑坐下去，打起了呼噜。"
msgstr " gulps down two more, his eyes glaze, and he slides down the iron grate and starts to snore."

msgid "你从他腰上解下了那把乌黑的钥匙。\n"
msgstr "You unhook the jet-black key from his belt.\n"

msgid "伸手按住酒坛：「那是老子的。」"
msgstr " puts a hand on the wine jar: \"That one's mine.\""

msgid "两只酒坛，一只倒在地上空了，一只还剩小半坛，坛口拿布塞着。\n"
msgstr "Two wine jars: one lies empty on the ground, one has barely half left, its mouth stopped with a cloth.\n"

msgid "拨闩"
msgstr "Lift the Bar"

msgid "闩已经拨开了，推门就进得去。\n"
msgstr "The bar is already lifted: push the door and you can go in.\n"

msgid "你把薄刃从门缝里插进去，贴着门板往上一挑。门后的闩轻轻一响，落了下去。\n"
msgstr "You slip the thin blade into the crack of the door and lift against the door panel. Behind the door the bar gives a soft click and falls.\n"

msgid "门缝里漏出一线青光。门后落着一道闩。\n"
msgstr "A thread of blue light leaks through the door crack. Behind the door, a bar has fallen into place.\n"

msgid "北门关着。这个时辰，门后没有闩。\n"
msgstr "The north door is shut. At this hour there is no bar behind it.\n"

msgid "开暗格"
msgstr "Open the Compartment"

msgid "暗格空着。\n"
msgstr "The compartment is empty.\n"

msgid "天书在你身上。\n"
msgstr "The scripture is on you.\n"

msgid "书案底下有一道细缝。你摸到一个铜扣，一按，暗格弹了出来。\n"
msgstr "There is a thin crack under the desk. You feel a copper stud, press it, and the compartment springs out.\n"

msgid "里面一卷黑皮的经书，封皮上「逆灵天书」四个字一个不少，底下一个小字：「下」。\n"
msgstr "Inside is a scroll of scripture in black leather, the four characters \"Black Scripture\" on the cover all there, with one small character beneath: \"Lower\".\n"

msgid "你把它揣进怀里，把暗格推了回去。\n"
msgstr "You tuck it into your robe and push the compartment shut.\n"

msgid "暗格空着。白天下半部摊在前殿的长案上——玄冥子说过，子时它才回到这里。\n"
msgstr "The compartment is empty. By day the lower half lies on the long table in the Front Hall; Xuanmingzi said it returns here only at the hour of Zi.\n"

msgid "乌木书案，笔墨整齐。案下有一道细缝，像是个暗格。\n"
msgstr "An ebony desk, brushes and ink set in order. There is a thin crack under the desk, like a hidden compartment.\n"

msgid "吊上来的箱子堆了一人高，每只箱板上都烙着一个「羊」字——野羊寨的记号。箱缝里露出绸缎的一角，另一只箱子底下渗出暗红的水渍，闻着是腌肉的咸味，也许不是。\n"
msgstr "The crates hauled up are piled man-high, each board branded with a \"Goat\" character, Goathill Stockade's mark. A corner of silk shows through a seam, and under another crate seeps a dark red stain that smells of the salt of cured meat, or perhaps not.\n"

msgid "黑布的幡从一丈多高的杆子上垂到地，布面上用暗红的颜色写满了字，笔画横着走、竖着走，像是经文又像是符咒。风一过，字就一闪一闪地动，盯久了眼睛发酸。\n"
msgstr "Black cloth banners hang to the ground from poles more than ten feet high, the cloth covered in dark red writing whose strokes run sideways and straight down, like scripture or like charms. When the wind passes, the writing seems to move, and looking at it for long makes the eyes ache.\n"

msgid "一只齐腰高的黑铁香炉，炉口里烧着的不是香，是一把把黑色的碎末，冒着极淡的青烟，味道苦得呛人。炉身上铸着一圈无头的人形，手拉着手。\n"
msgstr "A waist-high black iron censer. What burns in its mouth is not incense but handfuls of black powder, giving off a very faint blue smoke with a bitter smell that catches in the throat. Around the body of the censer is cast a ring of headless human figures, hand in hand.\n"

msgid "乌黑的长案上摊着一卷黑皮的经书，字是暗红的，横着走竖着走，和黑幡上的一样。你盯着看了一会儿，字像是在动，赶紧移开了眼。案角摆着一只木鱼，鱼身上的漆被敲掉了一块。\n"
msgstr "On the jet-black long table lies a scroll of black-leather scripture, its writing dark red and running sideways and straight down, like the banners'. You stare at it a while, the writing seems to move, and you hurriedly look away. On the corner of the table sits a wooden fish, a patch of lacquer knocked off its body.\n"

msgid "一座三足铜丹炉，炉身熏得乌黑。炉口的火苗是青色的，没有一点热气。炉边的托盘上摆着几颗乌黑的丹丸，闻着是一股说不出的腥甜。你不想知道它们是什么炼的。\n"
msgstr "A three-legged bronze elixir furnace, its body smoked black. The flame in its mouth is blue and gives no warmth at all. On the tray beside it sit a few jet-black pills, smelling of an indescribable sweet rankness. You do not want to know what they are made from.\n"

msgid "药架上的罐子一只只封着口，签子上写的不是药名：「野羊 · 丁未秋」「关北 · 戊申冬」……有一只罐子的签子上写着「傅家坡 · 待」，罐子是空的。\n"
msgstr "The jars on the medicine shelves are each sealed shut, and the labels are not drug names: \"Goathill · autumn of Dingwei\", \"Beyond the Pass · winter of Wushen\"... On one jar the label reads \"Fu Family Slope · Pending\", and the jar is empty.\n"

msgid "西边那扇铁栅门里的墙根上，一排排指甲刻出来的道道，五个一组，刻了一百多组。最后一组只有三道。\n"
msgstr "In the wall at the foot of the west iron-grated door, rows of marks scratched with fingernails, in groups of five, more than a hundred groups. The last group has only three.\n"

msgid "黑石砌成的坛，齐胸高，坛面磨得发亮。坛上烧着一团黑焰，没有温度，没有声音，凑近了看，焰心里像有东西在动。坛脚的石缝里塞着碎骨。\n"
msgstr "An altar of black stone, chest high, its top worn smooth and shiny. A black flame burns on it, with no warmth and no sound; looking closer, something in the heart of the flame seems to move. Bone chips are stuffed in the cracks at the altar's foot.\n"

msgid "空书架。灰尘上留着一排书脊的印子，最宽的那一道在正中。架子最底下掉着一页烧了一半的纸，只剩「逆灵」两个字。\n"
msgstr "An empty bookshelf. The dust keeps the marks of a row of spines, the widest in the middle. At the very bottom of the shelf lies a half-burned page, with only two characters left: \"Defy Spirit\".\n"

msgid "一只黑漆木匣，开着。匣里垫着黑绒，绒上压出一个长条形的印子，像是放过一卷书——或者一把剑。\n"
msgstr "A black-lacquer wooden box, open. It is lined with black velvet, and on the velvet is pressed a long narrow mark, as if a scroll had lain there, or a sword.\n"

msgid "绳索被割断了，一头垂在雾里。断口整齐，是一剑。商玦就是从这里下去的，你没法跟。\n"
msgstr "The rope has been cut, one end hanging in the mist. The cut is clean: one sword stroke. Shang Jue went down from here, and you cannot follow.\n"

msgid "门后还落着一道门闩，从里面闩上了。门缝里漏出一线青光，有人在说话。"
msgstr "The bar still lies across behind the door, fastened from inside. A thread of blue light leaks through the crack, and someone is talking."

msgid "狱卒道士一步跨过来，拦在铁栅门前：「新关的，管事吩咐过，谁也不许近。」"
msgstr "The Jailer Daoist strides over and blocks the iron grate: \"The newly locked in. The steward said nobody's to go near.\""

msgid "一只青铜小铃，比拇指大不了多少，铃身长满了绿锈，只有铃舌是亮的。铃舌上刻着一个小小的「尘」字。挂绳是一截褪成粉橘色的红绳，打着一个孩子才打得出的死结。\n在寻风地带里，它会跟着风响。\n"
msgstr "A small bronze bell, hardly bigger than a thumb, its body grown over with verdigris; only the clapper is bright. A small character is carved on the clapper: \"Chen\". The cord is a length of red string faded to pink-orange, tied in a hard knot only a child would tie.\nIn the Windseeking Wilds, it rings with the wind.\n"

msgid "这只风铃不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this wind bell away."

msgid "一支黑竹签，上面用朱砂密密地写着小字，是卜风的记录：\n「顺风而行，一日，见坛。」\n「顺风而行，二日，又见坛。」\n「顺风而行，三日，又见此坛。」\n最后一行字歪了：「风欺人。」\n"
msgstr "A black bamboo slip, covered in small cinnabar writing: a record of wind-divining.\n\"Went with the wind. One day. Saw an altar.\"\n\"Went with the wind. Two days. Saw an altar again.\"\n\"Went with the wind. Three days. Saw this altar again.\"\nThe last line is crooked: \"The wind lies.\"\n"

msgid "一把三尺长的剑，剑身是白的，白得发亮，转一转，就有一道光从剑身上绕下来，像风打着旋。剑柄上缠着褪成粉橘色的红绳。剑脊上刻着两个字：寒於。\n"
msgstr "A sword three chi long, its blade white, so white it shines; turn it and a ribbon of light winds down off the blade like wind spinning. A red cord faded to pink-orange is wound round the hilt. Two characters are carved on the spine: Hanyu.\n"

msgid "旋芒不能丢。它在风里转了三百年。"
msgstr "Whirling Edge cannot be dropped. It has turned in the wind for three hundred years."

msgid "你把剑举到光里。剑脊上两个字：寒於。字下面一行小字，刻得很浅：「风止之处，城见；剑止之处，人见。」\n"
msgstr "You hold the sword up into the light. On the spine, two characters: Hanyu. Beneath them is a line of small writing, cut very shallow: \"Where the wind stops, the city appears; where the sword stops, the man appears.\"\n"

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，蹲在黑石坛边烧符，符烧完了就看灰往哪边飞，然后在一支竹签上写一笔。他的嘴唇冻得发紫，眼睛红着，像是很多天没睡。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black robe and black cap squats beside the black stone altar, burning talismans. When one has burned out he watches which way the ash flies, then writes a stroke on a bamboo slip. His lips are blue with cold and his eyes are red, as if he has not slept in many days.\n"

msgid "卜风道士一声不响地散成一股黑烟，被风卷着往西去了。"
msgstr "The Wind Diviner breaks up without a sound into a wisp of black smoke, and the wind rolls it away to the west."

msgid "卜风道士冷笑：宫主算过，剑就在风那头。跟着风走就是了。"
msgstr "The Wind Diviner sneers, \"The Palace Master has reckoned it: the sword is at the far end of the wind. Just follow the wind.\""

msgid "风"
msgstr "Wind"

msgid "卜风道士道：风往哪边吹，剑就在哪边。……三天了。三天了。"
msgstr "The Wind Diviner says, \"Whichever way the wind blows, the sword is that way... Three days. Three days.\""

msgid "卜风道士尖声道：剑是宫主的！\n"
msgstr "The Wind Diviner shrieks, \"The sword is the Palace Master's!\"\n"

msgid "卜风道士朝坛上喊：有人来抢剑了！\n"
msgstr "The Wind Diviner shouts toward the altar, \"Someone has come to steal the sword!\"\n"

msgid "一个瘦高的黑衣道士，黑冠上缀着一圈铜钱，坐在坛顶，手里攥着一支写满了字的竹签，一动不动地盯着坛上的灰。\n"
msgstr "A tall, thin Daoist in black, a ring of copper coins sewn to his black cap, sits on top of the altar, gripping a bamboo slip covered in writing and staring without moving at the ash on the altar.\n"

msgid "卜风道士散成一股黑烟，那支竹签落在坛脚的符灰里。"
msgstr "The Wind Diviner breaks up into black smoke, and the bamboo slip falls into the talisman ash at the foot of the altar."

msgid "卜风道士头也不抬：顺风走。宫主说顺风走。"
msgstr "The Wind Diviner says without looking up, \"Follow the wind. The Palace Master says follow the wind.\""

msgid "卜风道士攥紧了竹签：风欺人。"
msgstr "The Wind Diviner tightens his grip on the slip. \"The wind lies.\""

msgid "卜风道士冷冷地道：又一个寻剑的。\n"
msgstr "The Wind Diviner says coldly, \"Another sword-seeker.\"\n"

msgid "一个白发白须的老人，坐在十铃架下的蒲团上，衣裳是白的，袖口被门口的风吹得一直在动，他的人却一动不动。看不出他有多大年纪——脸上没有几道皱纹，眼睛却老得很。\n"
msgstr "A white-haired, white-bearded old man sits on a rush cushion beneath the ten-bell rack. His robe is white, and its cuffs keep moving in the wind from the door, but he himself does not move. You cannot tell his age: his face has few wrinkles, but his eyes are very old.\n"

msgid "你的手还没抬起来，一阵风已经把它按了回去。岚翁连眼睛都没睁。"
msgstr "Your hand has not yet risen when a gust presses it back down. The Wind Elder has not even opened his eyes."

msgid "你一进门，十铃架上的大铃有几口自己响了起来，一声接一声，不是风吹的。\n"
msgstr "As you step in, several of the great bells on the ten-bell rack begin to ring by themselves, one after another, and not from the wind.\n"

msgid "睁开眼睛，看了看铃，又看了看你。"
msgstr " opens his eyes, looks at the bells, then at you."

msgid "响的那几口，是有人信你的地方。暗的那几口，你自己知道为什么。"
msgstr "The ones that ring are the places where someone trusts you. The dark ones, you know yourself why."

msgid "你是来要剑的。剑在云台。我不卖，也不赏，也不问你拿去做什么。"
msgstr "You have come for the sword. The sword is on the Cloud Terrace. I do not sell it, I do not give it, and I do not ask what you will do with it."

msgid "旋芒是寒於氏的剑。寒於氏斩了那东西的头，死前把两把剑分开放——一把钉头，一把寄在风里。三百年前你们拔了钉头的那一把。这一把，在我这里，等人来拔。"
msgstr "Whirling Edge is the sword of the Hanyu clan. The Hanyu clan cut off that thing's head, and before dying they set the two swords apart: one nailed the head, one was lodged in the wind. Three hundred years ago your people pulled the one that nailed the head. This one is with me, waiting for someone to draw it."

msgid "寒於"
msgstr "Hanyu"

msgid "寒於氏是太阳神族的祖。他的血，一份在金乌那里，一份在於兰家——君违嫁过去的那一份。"
msgstr "The Hanyu clan is the forefather of the Sun God's people. His blood went to two places: one share to the Golden Crow, one to the Yulan family, the share that Jun Wei married into."

msgid "烟城"
msgstr "Mist City"

msgid "烟城的人二十年前来过，你们先帝派的。他们站在门口问剑，问完就走了，走的时候风还没停——他们没伏下。"
msgstr "The people of Mist City came twenty years ago, sent by your late Emperor. They stood at the gate and asked about the sword, and when they had asked they left. The wind had not yet stopped when they left. They did not lie down."

msgid "让我看看。……「寻剑，不得扰民一户。」你们先帝要的剑，是不扰民的剑。他要对了。"
msgstr "Let me see... \"Seek the sword, and trouble not one household.\" The sword your late Emperor wanted is a sword that troubles no one. He asked rightly."

msgid "你们的先帝找了一辈子。他的人到过烟城，没到过这里。"
msgstr "Your late Emperor searched all his life. His men reached Mist City. They did not reach here."

msgid "铃"
msgstr "Bells"

msgid "十口铃，十个地方。哪里有人信你，哪里的铃就响。响的是信，不是功劳——你救过的人、你守过的话、你没拿的东西。走近了看，铃身上刻着地名。"
msgstr "Ten bells, ten places. Where someone trusts you, that bell rings. What rings is trust, not merit: someone you saved, a word you kept, a thing you did not take. Look closely and you will see place-names carved on the bells."

msgid "谁拔"
msgstr "Who Draws It"

msgid "你拔的。十口铃里有人信你——到了湖底，别让它们暗下去。"
msgstr "You draw it. Among the ten bells there are those who trust you. When you reach the lake bottom, do not let them go dark."

msgid "於兰家的人拔的。三百年前他们拔错了一把，这一回，看他拔得对不对。"
msgstr "The Yulan man draws it. Three hundred years ago they drew the wrong sword. This time, we shall see whether he draws the right one."

msgid "萧家的孩子拔的。他回来了一回，又走了。风记得他。"
msgstr "The Xiao child draws it. He came back once, and left again. The wind remembers him."

msgid "剑在云台，自己转着。谁能拔，不是我说了算。响够六口铃，你自己可以试；不够，就请一个信得过的人来——风会替你去叫。西墙那道梯子上去，就是云台。"
msgstr "The sword is on the Cloud Terrace, turning by itself. Who can draw it is not for me to say. If six bells ring, you may try it yourself; if fewer, ask someone you can trust, and the wind will go and call him. Go up the ladder at the west wall and you are on the Cloud Terrace."

msgid "岚城不在哪里。风在哪里停，它就在哪里。你们叫它寻风而至，寻风而逝——说得不错。"
msgstr "The Wind City is not anywhere. It is wherever the wind stops. You call it the city that comes on the wind and goes with the wind. That is not wrong."

msgid "风停处，替我再看一眼。——他让你看的，你看过了。"
msgstr "\"Where the wind stops, look once more for me.\" What he asked you to look at, you have seen."

msgid "接过信，只看了末一行，嘴角动了一下。"
msgstr " takes the letter, reads only the last line, and his mouth moves a little."

msgid "这是风纹，岚城的字。写的是：「风停处，替我再看一眼。」"
msgstr "This is wind script, the writing of the Wind City. It says: \"Where the wind stops, look once more for me.\""

msgid "那个砍柴的。他在城里住了三天，走的时候问我要了这几个字，说出去以后怕忘了。——他没忘。"
msgstr "That woodcutter. He stayed in the city three days, and when he left he asked me for these few words, for fear he would forget them once outside. He did not forget."

msgid "把信还给你。"
msgstr " hands the letter back to you."

msgid "萧家的孩子。那年风大，把他卷出城去了。铃在你手里——那他就还回得来。"
msgstr "The Xiao child. That year the wind was strong and carried him out of the city. The bell is in your hand, so he can still come back."

msgid "萧家的孩子，二十年前被风卷走了。铃丢了，风就找不到他。"
msgstr "The Xiao child was carried off by the wind twenty years ago. The bell was lost, and without it the wind cannot find him."

msgid "那个砍柴的？他伏在石头上睡着了，醒来就看见城。他在城里住了三天，吃不惯——我们这里没有饭。"
msgstr "That woodcutter? He fell asleep lying on a rock, and woke to see the city. He lived here three days and could not get used to it. We have no food here."

msgid "一个八九岁的小姑娘，白衣裳，头发被风吹得乱蓬蓬的，脖子上挂着一只小铜铃。她蹲在门洞边上，看你看得很认真。\n"
msgstr "A little girl of eight or nine in white, her hair tousled by the wind, a small bronze bell hanging at her neck. She squats by the archway, watching you very seriously.\n"

msgid "小姑娘咯咯一笑，往门洞里一闪，不见了，过一会儿又从另一边探出头来。"
msgstr "The little girl giggles, ducks into the archway and vanishes, and a moment later peeks out from the other side."

msgid "你是谁的铃带来的？"
msgstr "Whose bell brought you here?"

msgid "给我看看！……是尘哥哥的！铃舌上那个字，铃匠爷爷刻的，我认得！尘哥哥回来了吗？"
msgstr "Lemme see!... It's Brother Chen's! The word on the clapper, Grandpa Bellsmith carved it, I know it! Is Brother Chen back?"

msgid "城里人人一只铃。铃丢了，风就不认得你了。"
msgstr "Everybody in the city has a bell. If you lose your bell, the wind won't know you."

msgid "城"
msgstr "City"

msgid "城今天在山上头。昨天在湖上头。明天不知道。"
msgstr "Today the city is up over the mountain. Yesterday it was over the lake. Tomorrow, who knows."

msgid "风是从城里出去的呀。你们外头的人老往风里走，走着走着就到了。"
msgstr "The wind comes out of the city, you know. You outside people keep walking into the wind, and if you keep walking, you get here."

msgid "尘哥哥"
msgstr "Brother Chen"

msgid "尘哥哥是萧家的。他放风筝，风大，连人带风筝一起飞走了。我没见过他——我是听铃匠爷爷说的。"
msgstr "Brother Chen is a Xiao. He was flying a kite, the wind was strong, and it carried him and the kite away together. I never saw him. Grandpa Bellsmith told me."

msgid "铃匠"
msgstr "Bellsmith"

msgid "一个瘦小的老人，系着一条皮围裙，手指上全是铜绿，正拿一把细锉一点一点修一只铃的口。他修一下，敲一下，侧着耳朵听一听。\n"
msgstr "A small, thin old man in a leather apron, his fingers green with verdigris, filing at the mouth of a bell with a fine file, bit by bit. He files once, strikes once, and tilts his ear to listen.\n"

msgid "老蔺头也不抬：「我这里只有铃。打铃不响，打人更不响。」"
msgstr "Old Lin does not look up. \"I have only bells here. Strike a bell and it will not ring. Strike a man and it rings even less.\""

msgid "放下锉，接过你那只铃，凑到眼前看了半天，手有点抖。"
msgstr " puts down the file, takes your bell and holds it close to his eyes for a long while. His hand shakes a little."

msgid "是我打的。「尘」字是我刻的，那孩子非要刻在铃舌上，说这样风一吹，就是在叫他的名字。"
msgstr "I made it. I carved the \"Chen\" myself. The boy insisted on having it on the clapper, said that way every time the wind blew, it would be calling his name."

msgid "拿衣角把铃擦了擦，又还给你。"
msgstr " wipes the bell on a corner of his clothes and gives it back to you."

msgid "带着吧。它认得路。"
msgstr "Keep it with you. It knows the way."

msgid "城里的铃都是我打的。一个孩子一只，打好了挂在门楣的钩上，孩子长到能自己拿了，就拿下来随身带着。"
msgstr "I made all the bells in the city. One for each child. When it is done it hangs on the hook over the door, and when the child is old enough to take it down himself, he carries it with him."

msgid "萧家"
msgstr "Xiao Family"

msgid "萧家就在街那头，第二道弯。那孩子四岁那年，风大，他在院子里放风筝，连人带风筝都卷走了，铃也跟着走了。他娘天天擦那只空钩，擦了二十年，前年也走了。钩子还是亮的——现在是我去擦。"
msgstr "The Xiao house is at the end of the street, past the second bend. The year that boy was four, the wind was strong, he was flying a kite in the yard, and the wind carried off boy and kite together, and the bell went with him. His mother wiped that empty hook every day. Twenty years she wiped it, and the year before last she went too. The hook is still bright. Now I am the one who wipes it."

msgid "岚翁守着的。不是我们的东西，是寒於氏寄在这里的。我们只是住在它旁边。"
msgstr "The Wind Elder keeps it. It is not ours. The Hanyu clan lodged it here. We only live beside it."

msgid "我们不吃饭，不生火，不种地。风来了就听，风走了就睡。你们外头的人觉得这样过日子没意思——我们觉得你们太吵。"
msgstr "We do not eat, light fires or plant fields. When the wind comes, we listen; when it goes, we sleep. You outside people think this is no way to live. We think you are too noisy."

msgid "一个白发的老婆婆，拿着一把竹扫帚，在街边扫——扫的不是落叶，是飘上来的雾，她一扫，雾就退下去一点。\n"
msgstr "An old woman with white hair and a bamboo broom, sweeping at the roadside. It is not fallen leaves she sweeps but mist that has drifted up, and at each sweep the mist drops back a little.\n"

msgid "老婆婆的扫帚一挥，一团雾扑在你脸上，等你揉开眼睛，她还在原处扫。"
msgstr "The old woman swings her broom and a puff of mist hits your face. By the time you have rubbed your eyes clear, she is still there, sweeping."

msgid "今天城停在西边，底下是天驼关的石头，黄的。"
msgstr "Today the city has stopped in the west, above the stones of Camelback Pass, yellow ones."

msgid "今天城停在北边，底下是一片湖，绿的，湖上有船。"
msgstr "Today the city has stopped in the north, above a lake, a green one, with boats on it."

msgid "今天城停在东边，底下是雪，白茫茫的。"
msgstr "Today the city has stopped in the east, above snow, a white expanse of it."

msgid "城今天停在哪儿？你自己往门外看。"
msgstr "Where has the city stopped today? Look out of the gate yourself."

msgid "雾"
msgstr "Mist"

msgid "雾往上爬，爬到街上就不好走了。我扫一扫，它就回去。扫了七十年了。"
msgstr "The mist climbs up, and once it reaches the street the going is hard. I sweep, and it goes back. I have been sweeping seventy years."

msgid "烟城？那是我们的亲戚。烟霞霓岚，四座城，各住各的。烟城的人爱说话，我们不爱。"
msgstr "Mist City? They are our relatives. Mist, Glow, Rainbow and Wind: four cities, each living on its own. The people of Mist City like to talk. We do not."

msgid "一个穿白衣的人，在街上慢慢地走，走几步停一下，侧着头听风铃。他看见你，点一点头，没有说话。\n"
msgstr "A man in white walks slowly along the street, stopping every few steps to tilt his head and listen to the wind chimes. He sees you, nods once, and says nothing.\n"

msgid "那人往后退了一步，衣袖一飘，你的手就落了空。他看着你，像看一阵不懂事的风。"
msgstr "The man steps back, his sleeve drifts, and your hand falls on nothing. He looks at you as one looks at a wind that does not know better."

msgid "……这里就是。"
msgstr "... This is it."

msgid "听。"
msgstr "Listen."

msgid "去问岚翁。"
msgstr "Ask the Wind Elder."

msgid "吃饭"
msgstr "Eating"

msgid "吃饭？……我们不吃。"
msgstr "Eat?... We do not."

msgid "白发白须的老人站在台心旁边，袖子被旋风扯得笔直，人却一动不动，像是长在白石上的。\n"
msgstr "The white-haired, white-bearded old man stands beside the heart of the terrace, his sleeves pulled straight by the whirlwind, yet he himself does not move, as if he had grown out of the white stone.\n"

msgid "它在你腰间。寒於氏的剑，不扰民——你拿着它，就照它的脾气走。"
msgstr "It is at your waist. The sword of the Hanyu clan troubles no household. You carry it, so you walk by its temper."

msgid "跟於兰家的人走了。"
msgstr "It went with the Yulan man."

msgid "跟萧家的孩子走了。"
msgstr "It went with the Xiao child."

msgid "就在风里。谁拔，你来定。你自己，於兰家的人，萧家的孩子——三个都行，风不挑，铃挑。"
msgstr "It is in the wind. Who draws it, you decide. Yourself, the Yulan man, the Xiao child: any of the three. The wind does not choose. The bells choose."

msgid "风认你了。剑在台心，去拿吧。"
msgstr "The wind knows you. The sword is at the heart of the terrace. Go and take it."

msgid "你。那就先接三刃。"
msgstr "You. Then first meet the three blades."

msgid "你自己拔，要十口铃里六口有人信你。请於兰家的人，要他在朝上，风才找得到他。让萧家的孩子来，要他的铃——铃在，风认人。"
msgstr "To draw it yourself, ten bells must have six where someone trusts you. To ask the Yulan man, he must be at court, or the wind cannot find him. To let the Xiao child come, you need his bell. Where the bell is, the wind knows the man."

msgid "楼下十口铃，响一口，是一处有人信你。"
msgstr "Of the ten bells below, each one that rings is a place where someone trusts you."

msgid "接风三刃"
msgstr "Three Blades"

msgid "风里拔剑，先要风认你。我替风出三刃，你站得住，剑就落得下来。"
msgstr "To draw a sword in the wind, the wind must first know you. I will throw three blades for the wind. If you can stand them, the sword will fall."

msgid "岚翁替风出三刃，是真打：\n· 每一刃都实打实地削在你身上，挨中了会受伤。\n· 哪一刃接不住，就算没接下，你随后会昏倒；风只认人，不要人的命。\n倒了可以歇好再来。\n确定接风三刃吗？"
msgstr "The Wind Elder throws three blades for the wind, and they are real:\n· Every blade cuts into you in earnest. If it hits, you are hurt.\n· If you cannot meet a blade, it counts as not met, and you will faint afterward. The wind knows only men; it does not want their lives.\nIf you fall, you may rest and come again.\nMeet the Three Blades of Wind?"

msgid "岚翁袖子一拂：第一刃，是从城外来的风。"
msgstr "The Wind Elder flicks his sleeve. \"The first blade is the wind from outside the city.\""

msgid "岚翁点点头：第二刃，是从城里出去的风。"
msgstr "The Wind Elder nods. \"The second blade is the wind that goes out of the city.\""

msgid "岚翁叹了口气：风还不认得你。"
msgstr "The Wind Elder sighs. \"The wind does not know you yet.\""

msgid "岚翁的袖子停了：第三刃，是不动的风。"
msgstr "The Wind Elder's sleeve stops. \"The third blade is the wind that does not move.\""

msgid "岚翁摇摇头：差一点。歇好了再来。"
msgstr "The Wind Elder shakes his head. \"Close. Rest, then come again.\""

msgid "风停了一停。岚翁说道：站得住。风认你了——剑在台心，去拿吧。"
msgstr "The wind pauses. The Wind Elder says, \"You stood. The wind knows you. The sword is at the heart of the terrace. Go and take it.\""

msgid "在岚城的云台上接下了岚翁的接风三刃"
msgstr "Met the Wind Elder's Three Blades of Wind on the Cloud Terrace in the Wind City"

msgid "一个须发灰白的老人，一身朝服被风吹得猎猎地响，腰间那把暗绿色的鬼头刀还在。他看着台心的风，像在看一件很久以前的事。\n"
msgstr "A gray-haired, gray-bearded old man in court dress that whips and snaps in the wind, the dark green ghost-head saber still at his waist. He gazes at the wind at the heart of the terrace as at something that happened long ago.\n"

msgid "於兰天武看了你一眼：老夫不是来跟你打的。"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu glances at you. \"This old man did not come to fight you.\""

msgid "一阵大风落在台上，於兰天武站在风里。"
msgstr "A great wind sets down on the terrace, and Yulan Tianwu stands in it."

msgid "一阵风卷过来，於兰天武不见了。"
msgstr "A gust rolls in, and Yulan Tianwu is gone."

msgid "一个白衣的年轻人，长发和巾带被风吹得乱飞，站在台上四下看，看得很慢，像在一样一样认东西。\n"
msgstr "A young man in white, his long hair and headband whipped about by the wind, stands on the terrace looking all around, slowly, as if learning things one at a time.\n"

msgid "萧辟尘没有看你：这里不打架。"
msgstr "Xiao Bichen does not look at you. \"No fighting here.\""

msgid "风把萧辟尘送到了台上。"
msgstr "The wind has carried Xiao Bichen onto the terrace."

msgid "一阵风卷过来，萧辟尘不见了。"
msgstr "A gust rolls in, and Xiao Bichen is gone."

msgid "一条往上斜的窄道，两壁是磨得发亮的黄石，亮得像镜子，人走过去，石头里也走过去一个人。道里一股迷香，甜得发腻，白雾贴着地面流，一直流到脚背上。\n往下是镜子里那间三条道的屋子；往上，雾的那头透过来一点风。\n"
msgstr "A narrow way slanting upward. Both walls are yellow stone worn to a shine, bright as mirrors; as you pass, another figure walks past inside the stone. A heady incense hangs in the way, sweet to sickness, and white mist flows along the ground, right up over your insteps.\nDown is the room of three roads inside the mirror; up, through the mist, a little wind comes from the far side.\n"

msgid "出了窄道，眼前一下子宽了：一片高处的野地，天很近，云很低。风从前头一阵一阵地扑过来，草齐腰，被风按得倒成一片，一起来，又倒下去。\n往北是一片石林，一根一根灰白的石柱立在雾里，像许多人站着。\n"
msgstr "Out of the narrow way, the view opens all at once: high open ground, the sky near, the clouds low. Wind comes from ahead in gusts, and the waist-high grass lies flat under it, all together, then rises, then goes down again.\nTo the north is a stone forest, gray-white stone pillars standing in the mist like many people standing.\n"

msgid "石柱一根挨一根，高的有三四丈，都被风磨圆了，迎风的一面刻满一道一道的槽，背风的一面长着青苔。雾是一条一条的，跟着风在石柱之间流。\n几条踩出来的小路在石林里分开，往北、西北、东北各有一处背风的石坳；西边下风头隐约有烟，东边有几顶破帐篷。\n"
msgstr "The pillars stand one against the next, three or four zhang tall, all worn round by the wind. The windward side is cut with grooves, the lee side grows green moss. The mist comes in strands, flowing between the pillars with the wind.\nSeveral trodden paths part in the stone forest, each running to a sheltered hollow in the rock, north, northwest and northeast. To the west, downwind, there is faintly smoke, and in the east a few ragged tents.\n"

msgid "石林西边的下风头，一座黑石垒的小坛，坛上插着几面黑幡，烧剩的符纸一层一层压在坛脚，风一吹就飞起来几张，又落回去。地上画着一圈一圈的符，圈套着圈，都是往西开口的。\n"
msgstr "Downwind at the west edge of the stone forest stands a small altar of black stone, black banners stuck in it. Burnt talisman paper lies layer on layer at its foot; at each gust a few sheets fly up, then settle back. Talismans are drawn on the ground in circles, ring within ring, all open to the west.\n"

msgid "三顶帐篷，两顶塌了，一顶的帆布被风撕成一条一条的，还在拍。一面兵部的旗倒在草里，旗杆断了。营里的锅是冷的，锅底结着一层黑；帐篷边上一堆石头垒的灶，灶里没有灰——这里很久没人生火了。\n"
msgstr "Three tents, two of them fallen, the canvas of the third torn by the wind into strips that still flap. A Ministry of War banner lies in the grass, its pole broken. The pots in the camp are cold, with a layer of black burnt on the bottom. Beside the tents is a stove of piled stones with no ash in it. No one has lit a fire here for a long time.\n"

msgid "西北一处背风的石坳，三面是石壁，口朝着石林。坳里的草比外头矮，一丛一丛的，石壁脚下堆着被风吹进来的枯叶。\n"
msgstr "A sheltered hollow in the stone to the northwest, walled on three sides, its mouth facing the stone forest. The grass inside is shorter than outside, in tufts, and at the foot of the walls lies a heap of dead leaves the wind has blown in.\n"

msgid "正北一处深些的石坳，两道石壁夹着，像一只半合的手掌。坳底一块平石，石面上有几道浅浅的印子，像是有人在这里伏过很久。\n"
msgstr "A deeper hollow due north, between two walls of rock like a half-closed hand. On the flat stone at its bottom are a few shallow marks, as if someone had lain here a very long time.\n"

msgid "东北一处背风的石坳，口子窄，里面宽。石壁上垂着几根干枯的藤，藤上不知谁系了一根褪了色的红绳。\n"
msgstr "A sheltered hollow in the stone to the northeast, its mouth narrow, its inside wide. A few dried vines hang down the rock wall, and someone has tied a faded red cord to one of them.\n"

msgid "一道白石的门，门洞是圆的，被风磨得没有一个棱角。门外是雾，雾底下很远的地方，隐约是山——城就浮在那上头。\n门里是一块小小的石坪，坪上的石板一块挨一块，中间被人走出一道浅浅的凹。往北，一条白石长街往上绕。\n"
msgstr "A gate of white stone, its opening round, worn by the wind until it has no edge left. Outside is mist, and far below the mist, faintly, mountains. The city floats above them.\nInside is a small stone yard, its flagstones laid close, a shallow dip walked into the middle of it. To the north a long white stone street winds upward.\n"

msgid "白石铺的长街往上绕了两折。两边的屋子都是白石砌的，墙角磨圆了，背风的一面爬着青苔；家家的檐下都挂着风铃，铜的、竹的、贝壳的，风一过，一街都响。\n屋子里静悄悄的，没有烟。没有一家的屋顶上有烟囱。\n西边第一道弯下去是一个敞着的院子，叮叮当当的；东边第二道弯过去，一个小院子的门开着，里头没有声音。\n"
msgstr "The long street of white stone winds up through two turns. The houses on both sides are built of white stone, their corners worn round, moss growing on the lee side. Under every eave hang wind chimes, of bronze, bamboo and shell, and when wind passes the whole street rings.\nThe houses are quiet, with no smoke. Not one roof has a chimney.\nDown the first bend to the west is an open courtyard, clinking and clanging. Past the second bend to the east, the door of a small yard stands open, with no sound inside.\n"

msgid "一个敞着的院子，后头一间棚屋，棚檐下挂满了还没上绳的铃。院子当中一块铁砧，旁边一口铸了一半的铃立在木架上，铃身还是青的。墙边一排木架，架上是泥的铃模、钳子、细锉，一样一样摆得整齐。\n地上一层铜屑，被风扫到墙角，堆成一道细细的绿线。\n"
msgstr "An open yard, with a shed behind it, and under the shed's eaves hang bells with no cords yet. In the middle of the yard is an iron anvil, and beside it a half-cast bell stands on a wooden frame, its body still blue. Along the wall is a row of wooden racks holding clay bell molds, tongs and fine files, each laid in its place.\nA layer of copper filings lies on the ground, swept by the wind into the corner in a thin green line.\n"

msgid "一个小院子，院里一口枯井，井沿上落着叶子。屋门关着，门楣上一只铜钩，钩上什么也没挂，钩子倒擦得很亮——像是一直有人在擦。\n门框上有一道一道刻的印子，从下往上，最高的一道齐你的腰，旁边刻着一个小小的「尘」字。\n"
msgstr "A small yard with a dry well, leaves on its rim. The door is shut. Over the lintel is a bronze hook with nothing hanging on it, yet the hook is bright, as if someone has always been wiping it.\nOn the doorframe are notches cut one above another from the bottom up; the highest is level with your waist, and beside it is a small character, \"Chen\".\n"

msgid "长街到这里是一块平台，平台尽头一座三层的木阁，檐角一层一层翘上去，每一层的檐下都挂满了铃，风不大，铃也一直在响，一声叠一声，像在说话。\n阁门开着。门楣上一块旧匾：风铃阁。\n"
msgstr "The street ends in a platform, and at its far end stands a three-storied wooden pavilion, its eaves curving up tier on tier, with bells hung under every tier. The wind is not strong, yet the bells never stop, one sound laid on another, as if talking.\nThe pavilion door is open. Over the lintel hangs an old plaque: Wind Chime Pavilion.\n"

msgid "阁里很高，梁上垂下来千百只小铃，长长短短，一直垂到人头顶上。风从门口进来，它们就从门口那一头响起，一层一层响到里头去。\n北墙下一排木架，架上并排挂着十口大铃，每一口的铃身上刻着一个地名。有的铃亮，有的铃是暗的。\n东边一道小门，门帘半卷着。西墙边一道窄梯，一直通到阁顶，梯口有风灌下来。\n"
msgstr "Inside the pavilion it is very high; from the beams hang a thousand small bells, long and short, down to head height. When wind enters at the door they begin to ring from the door end, layer by layer toward the back.\nUnder the north wall, on a row of wooden racks, hang ten great bells side by side, each with a place-name carved on its body. Some bells are bright; some are dark.\nIn the east is a small door, its curtain half rolled up. By the west wall a narrow ladder goes all the way up to the top of the pavilion, wind pouring down at the foot of it.\n"

msgid "一间小屋，四壁是木板，一张矮几，一个蒲团。墙边一架旧书，书页被风吹得发脆，有几本摊着，压着一块白石。\n墙上一只铜钩，钩上空着。\n"
msgstr "A small room with plank walls, a low table and a rush cushion. By one wall stands a shelf of old books, the pages brittle from the wind, a few lying open, held down by a white stone.\nOn the wall is a bronze hook, empty.\n"

msgid "风铃阁顶上出去，是一片悬在云上的白石台。台子没有栏杆，四边就是云，云下面很远的地方，有山的影子在慢慢往后退——城在走。\n白石被风磨得发亮，石缝里长着一点青苔。北边是台心，白石上一圈一圈的印子。\n"
msgstr "Out from the top of the Wind Chime Pavilion is a platform of white stone hanging on the clouds. It has no railing; its four sides are cloud, and far below, the shadows of mountains slowly slide backward. The city is moving.\nThe white stone is worn bright by the wind, with a little moss in the cracks. To the north is the heart of the terrace, rings upon rings marked in the white stone.\n"

msgid "台子的北边，白石面上被风磨出一圈浅浅的印子，一圈套一圈，像水里的波纹。岚城的人说，这是风在这里转了三百年转出来的。\n"
msgstr "On the north of the terrace, the white stone is worn by the wind into shallow rings, one inside another like ripples on water. The people of the Wind City say the wind made them, turning here for three hundred years.\n"

msgid "台子的东边，白石到这里就断了，往外一步就是云。云在脚下翻，风从下面往上托，托得人站不稳。\n岚城的人说，剑有了主，风就会送人回去。\n"
msgstr "On the east of the terrace the white stone ends; one step out is cloud. The cloud rolls below your feet, and the wind pushes up from beneath, so that you cannot stand steady.\nThe people of the Wind City say that once the sword has a master, the wind will send a person back.\n"

msgid "上头一股迷香，甜得发腻，雾浓得伸手不见五指。你走了两步，脚下一空似的，又转回了原处。"
msgstr "Heady incense, cloyingly sweet, and mist so thick you cannot see your own hand. You take two steps, your feet seem to drop away, and you are back where you started."

msgid "雾里站着一个人影。走近了，只是磨亮的黄石上映出来的你自己，跟着你停，跟着你走。\n"
msgstr "A figure stands in the mist. Come closer, and it is only yourself, reflected in the polished yellow stone, stopping when you stop, walking when you walk.\n"

msgid "雾里站着一个人影，背上一把剑，身形很瘦，穿的是二十年前水烟阁随从的衣裳——你埋过他的骨头。他朝你点了一下头，雾一卷，就没有了。\n"
msgstr "A figure stands in the mist with a sword on his back, very thin, in the clothes of a Waterfog Pavilion retainer of twenty years ago. You buried his bones. He nods to you, the mist rolls, and he is gone.\n"

msgid "又一个人影，背对着你，看不清是谁。你一伸手，雾就从指缝里流过去了。\n"
msgstr "Another figure, its back to you; you cannot tell whose. You reach out, and the mist flows between your fingers.\n"

msgid "霍铮蹲在雾里，嘴里叼着一根草：「寨子里都好。石头那小子回家了。」他吐掉草，站起来，散了。\n"
msgstr "Huo Zheng squats in the mist with a blade of grass in his mouth. \"Everyone at the stockade is fine. Shitou went home.\" He spits out the grass, stands up, and scatters.\n"

msgid "黄霸坐在雾里一块石头上，腆着肚子：「三寨主？如今是寨主了。」他咧嘴一笑，连人带石头一起散了。\n"
msgstr "Huang Ba sits on a rock in the mist, belly out. \"Third Chief? These days it's Chief.\" He grins, and he and his rock scatter together.\n"

msgid "雾里一个女人的影子，长发，看不清脸，一晃就不见了。\n"
msgstr "A woman's shadow in the mist, long hair, her face unclear. A flicker and it is gone.\n"

msgid "安妮儿站在雾里，怀里抱着一件发着寒气的衣裳：「它在我这里。等你用得着的时候。」\n"
msgstr "Anni'er stands in the mist, in her arms a coat giving off cold. \"It is with me. For when you have need of it.\"\n"

msgid "瑷伦站在雾里，手里握着鞭子，三十七岁的脸，几百年的眼睛：「我还守着。去吧。」\n"
msgstr "Ailun stands in the mist with a whip in her hand, a face of thirty-seven and the eyes of several hundred years. \"I am still keeping watch. Go.\"\n"

msgid "瑷伦站在雾里，手里握着鞭子，身上是那件月白的衣：「它回来了。我还守着。去吧。」\n"
msgstr "Ailun stands in the mist with a whip in her hand, in that moon-white robe. \"It has come back. I am still keeping watch. Go.\"\n"

msgid "雾里是瑷伦的背影。她没有回头。\n"
msgstr "In the mist is Ailun's back. She does not turn.\n"

msgid "最后一个人影离出口最近，风吹过来，它就淡一分。\n"
msgstr "The last figure is nearest the exit; each time the wind blows toward it, it fades a shade.\n"

msgid "冯策披着衣服站在雾里，跟那夜在侍卫营一样：「湖底的事，算老夫一个。先把剑找来。」\n"
msgstr "Feng Ce stands in the mist with his coat draped over his shoulders, as he was that night in the guards' barracks. \"What happens at the lake bottom, count this old man in. First find the sword.\"\n"

msgid "於兰天武穿着朝服站在雾里，朝服不合身：「找到城，叫我。」\n"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu stands in the mist in court dress, which does not fit him. \"When you find the city, call me.\"\n"

msgid "庾子建站在雾里，身边一只火盆，盆里一撮纸灰：「先帝推了二十年。你要是找到了，记得告诉我。」\n"
msgstr "Yu Zijian stands in the mist with a brazier beside him and a pinch of paper ash in it. \"The late Emperor put it off for twenty years. If you find it, remember to tell me.\"\n"

msgid "一个穿兵部号衣的人蜷在塌了的帐篷边，早就冻僵了，脸朝着北边的石坳。他怀里揣着半张纸，字被露水泡开了，还认得出几行：\n「第三次。逆风行至石坳，风止。四顾无城。复行。」\n「风又起。」\n纸的背面是兵部的印，印色暗红发黑。\n"
msgstr "A man in a Ministry of War tabard lies curled beside a fallen tent, long frozen, his face turned toward the northern hollow. Half a sheet of paper is tucked in his coat, the writing blurred by dew, but a few lines can still be made out:\n\"Third time. Went upwind to the hollow; wind stopped. Looked all round; no city. Went on.\"\n\"Wind rose again.\"\nOn the back of the paper is the Ministry of War seal, its ink gone dark red, almost black.\n"

msgid "一面兵部的旗倒在草里，旗杆从中间断了，断口是新的白茬——是风折的，不是人砍的。旗面上的「兵」字被风扯得只剩半边。\n"
msgstr "A Ministry of War banner lies in the grass, its pole broken in the middle, the break a fresh white splinter: broken by the wind, not cut by men. The word \"Bing\" on the cloth is torn by the wind to half a character.\n"

msgid "黑石垒的坛，一人多高，坛顶压着一块铜盘，盘里的灰被风吹得只剩一层。坛脚的地上画着一圈套一圈的符，每一圈都朝西开口——画符的人一直是顺着风画的。\n"
msgstr "An altar of black stone, taller than a man, a copper dish pressed on its top, the ash in the dish blown down to a thin layer. On the ground at its foot are talismans drawn ring within ring, each ring open to the west. Whoever drew them always drew them with the wind.\n"

msgid "门洞是一整块白石凿出来的，圆的，里外都被风磨亮了。往外看是雾，雾底下很远的地方有山。门洞的顶上刻着两个字，被风磨得快平了，摸得出来：寻风。\n"
msgstr "The gate is cut from one whole block of white stone, round, worn bright inside and out by the wind. Looking out there is mist, and far below the mist, mountains. Over the gate two words are carved, worn almost flat, so that you can make them out only by touch: Seek Wind.\n"

msgid "一只铜钩，钩尖朝上，擦得很亮。岚城家家门口都有一只，挂的是孩子的铃；这一只空了二十年。\n"
msgstr "A bronze hook, tip upward, rubbed bright. Every door in the Wind City has one, and on it hangs a child's bell. This one has been empty for twenty years.\n"

msgid "一只铜钩，钩尖朝上，擦得很亮。钩上挂着一只青铜小铃，绳结是孩子打的死结，风一过就响。萧家的铃回来了。\n"
msgstr "A bronze hook, tip upward, rubbed bright. On it hangs a small bronze bell, its cord tied in a child's hard knot, ringing whenever wind passes. The Xiao family's bell is back.\n"

msgid "一只铜钩，钩尖朝上，擦得很亮。你怀里那只铃的绳结，和钩子上磨出来的那道印子，一样宽。\n"
msgstr "A bronze hook, tip upward, rubbed bright. The knot of the bell you carry and the groove worn into the hook are the same width.\n"

msgid "雪亭的铃。铃身发暗，刻着「雪亭」两个字，一声不响。\n"
msgstr "The bell of Snow Pavilion. Its body is dark, with the words \"Snow Pavilion\" carved on it, and it is silent.\n"

msgid "雪亭的铃。它在响——不是风吹的，风停了它也在响。铃身上的字是亮的：雪亭。\n岚城的铃认人：雪亭有人信你。\n"
msgstr "The bell of Snow Pavilion. It is ringing, and not from the wind: it rings though the wind has died. The words on its body are bright: Snow Pavilion.\nThe bells of the Wind City know people: in Snow Pavilion, someone trusts you.\n"

msgid "老松岭的铃。铃身发暗，刻着「老松岭」两个字，一声不响。\n"
msgstr "The bell of Old Pine Ridge. Its body is dark, with the words \"Old Pine Ridge\" carved on it, and it is silent.\n"

msgid "老松岭的铃。它在响——不是风吹的，风停了它也在响。铃身上的字是亮的：老松岭。\n岚城的铃认人：老松岭有人信你。\n"
msgstr "The bell of Old Pine Ridge. It is ringing, and not from the wind: it rings though the wind has died. The words on its body are bright: Old Pine Ridge.\nThe bells of the Wind City know people: in Old Pine Ridge, someone trusts you.\n"

msgid "水烟阁的铃。铃身发暗，刻着「水烟阁」两个字，一声不响。\n"
msgstr "The bell of Waterfog Pavilion. Its body is dark, with the words \"Waterfog Pavilion\" carved on it, and it is silent.\n"

msgid "水烟阁的铃。它在响——不是风吹的，风停了它也在响。铃身上的字是亮的：水烟阁。\n岚城的铃认人：水烟阁有人信你。\n"
msgstr "The bell of Waterfog Pavilion. It is ringing, and not from the wind: it rings though the wind has died. The words on its body are bright: Waterfog Pavilion.\nThe bells of the Wind City know people: in Waterfog Pavilion, someone trusts you.\n"

msgid "野羊山的铃。铃身发暗，刻着「野羊山」两个字，一声不响。\n"
msgstr "The bell of Goathill. Its body is dark, with the words \"Goathill\" carved on it, and it is silent.\n"

msgid "野羊山的铃。它在响——不是风吹的，风停了它也在响。铃身上的字是亮的：野羊山。\n岚城的铃认人：野羊山有人信你。\n"
msgstr "The bell of Goathill. It is ringing, and not from the wind: it rings though the wind has died. The words on its body are bright: Goathill.\nThe bells of the Wind City know people: in Goathill, someone trusts you.\n"

msgid "晚月庄的铃。铃身发暗，刻着「晚月庄」两个字，一声不响。\n"
msgstr "The bell of Latemoon Manor. Its body is dark, with the words \"Latemoon Manor\" carved on it, and it is silent.\n"

msgid "晚月庄的铃。它在响——不是风吹的，风停了它也在响。铃身上的字是亮的：晚月庄。\n岚城的铃认人：晚月庄有人信你。\n"
msgstr "The bell of Latemoon Manor. It is ringing, and not from the wind: it rings though the wind has died. The words on its body are bright: Latemoon Manor.\nThe bells of the Wind City know people: in Latemoon Manor, someone trusts you.\n"

msgid "乔阴的铃。铃身发暗，刻着「乔阴」两个字，一声不响。\n"
msgstr "The bell of Tallshade. Its body is dark, with the words \"Tallshade\" carved on it, and it is silent.\n"

msgid "乔阴的铃。它在响——不是风吹的，风停了它也在响。铃身上的字是亮的：乔阴。\n岚城的铃认人：乔阴有人信你。\n"
msgstr "The bell of Tallshade. It is ringing, and not from the wind: it rings though the wind has died. The words on its body are bright: Tallshade.\nThe bells of the Wind City know people: in Tallshade, someone trusts you.\n"

msgid "关北的铃。铃身发暗，刻着「关北」两个字，一声不响。\n"
msgstr "The bell of Beyond the Pass. Its body is dark, with the words \"Beyond the Pass\" carved on it, and it is silent.\n"

msgid "关北的铃。它在响——不是风吹的，风停了它也在响。铃身上的字是亮的：关北。\n岚城的铃认人：关北有人信你。\n"
msgstr "The bell of Beyond the Pass. It is ringing, and not from the wind: it rings though the wind has died. The words on its body are bright: Beyond the Pass.\nThe bells of the Wind City know people: in Beyond the Pass, someone trusts you.\n"

msgid "番坊的铃。铃身发暗，刻着「番坊」两个字，一声不响。\n"
msgstr "The bell of the Foreign Quarter. Its body is dark, with the words \"Foreign Quarter\" carved on it, and it is silent.\n"

msgid "番坊的铃。它在响——不是风吹的，风停了它也在响。铃身上的字是亮的：番坊。\n岚城的铃认人：番坊有人信你。\n"
msgstr "The bell of the Foreign Quarter. It is ringing, and not from the wind: it rings though the wind has died. The words on its body are bright: Foreign Quarter.\nThe bells of the Wind City know people: in the Foreign Quarter, someone trusts you.\n"

msgid "玉螺湖村的铃。铃身发暗，刻着「玉螺湖村」两个字，一声不响。\n"
msgstr "The bell of Jade Conch Village. Its body is dark, with the words \"Jade Conch Village\" carved on it, and it is silent.\n"

msgid "玉螺湖村的铃。它在响——不是风吹的，风停了它也在响。铃身上的字是亮的：玉螺湖村。\n岚城的铃认人：玉螺湖村有人信你。\n"
msgstr "The bell of Jade Conch Village. It is ringing, and not from the wind: it rings though the wind has died. The words on its body are bright: Jade Conch Village.\nThe bells of the Wind City know people: in Jade Conch Village, someone trusts you.\n"

msgid "京师的铃。铃身发暗，刻着「京师」两个字，一声不响。\n"
msgstr "The bell of the Capital. Its body is dark, with the words \"Capital\" carved on it, and it is silent.\n"

msgid "京师的铃。它在响——不是风吹的，风停了它也在响。铃身上的字是亮的：京师。\n岚城的铃认人：京师有人信你。\n"
msgstr "The bell of the Capital. It is ringing, and not from the wind: it rings though the wind has died. The words on its body are bright: Capital.\nThe bells of the Wind City know people: in the Capital, someone trusts you.\n"

msgid "一股旋风，从台心的白石上直卷上去。风里一把剑，剑尖朝下，一圈一圈地转：剑身是白的，转起来像一圈光。\n剑柄上缠着褪了色的红绳，绳头在风里乱飞。\n"
msgstr "A whirlwind rises straight up from the white stone at the heart of the terrace. In the wind is a sword, point down, turning round and round: its blade is white, and spinning it looks like a ring of light.\nOn the hilt is a faded red cord, its end flying wild in the wind.\n"

msgid "台心的风停了。白石上一圈浅浅的印子，是风转了三百年磨出来的。\n剑在你腰间。\n"
msgstr "The wind at the heart of the terrace has stopped. On the white stone are shallow rings, worn by the wind turning for three hundred years.\nThe sword is at your waist.\n"

msgid "台心的风停了。白石上一圈浅浅的印子，是风转了三百年磨出来的。\n剑跟着於兰天武回了京城。\n"
msgstr "The wind at the heart of the terrace has stopped. On the white stone are shallow rings, worn by the wind turning for three hundred years.\nThe sword went back to the Capital with Yulan Tianwu.\n"

msgid "台心的风停了。白石上一圈浅浅的印子，是风转了三百年磨出来的。\n剑跟着萧辟尘回了水烟阁。\n"
msgstr "The wind at the heart of the terrace has stopped. On the white stone are shallow rings, worn by the wind turning for three hundred years.\nThe sword went back to Waterfog Pavilion with Xiao Bichen.\n"

msgid "云在脚下翻。云缝里偶尔露出一点地面——山、河、一片黄的石头——一眨眼又合上了。看得久了，会觉得是自己在往前走。\n"
msgstr "Clouds roll beneath your feet. In the gaps now and then a bit of ground shows, mountains, a river, a stretch of yellow stone, and in a blink it closes again. Look long enough and it seems you are the one moving forward.\n"

msgid "伏地"
msgstr "Lie Flat"

msgid "伏下身子，等风过去？"
msgstr "Lie down and wait for the wind to pass?"

msgid "你伏在背风的石头上。风从头顶上过去，一阵，又一阵，越过越远。\n"
msgstr "You lie in the lee of a stone. The wind goes over your head, one gust, then another, each farther than the last.\n"

msgid "四下里静下来。然后是铃声——不是一只，是许许多多只，满耳都是，近得像就挂在你头顶上。\n"
msgstr "All around grows still. Then bells, not one but many, filling both ears, so near it seems they hang over your head.\n"

msgid "你抬起头。雾散了。一座白石的城浮在石坳外头的半空里，城门开着，城墙上挂满了风铃，一条白石长街从城门里往上绕，绕进云里。\n"
msgstr "You raise your head. The mist has cleared. A city of white stone floats in the air beyond the hollow, its gate open, wind chimes hung all along its walls, and a long white street winding up from the gate into the clouds.\n"

msgid "你站起来往前走了一步。脚下没有空——是一级白石的台阶，台阶上去，就是城门。\n"
msgstr "You stand and take a step forward. There is no drop under your foot: it is a step of white stone, and up the steps is the city gate.\n"

msgid "你伏在地上等了好一会儿。风还在吹，草还在倒——这里不是风停的地方。\n"
msgstr "You lie on the ground a good while, waiting. The wind still blows, the grass still bends. This is not where the wind stops.\n"

msgid "出白石门？城会随风走，下回再来，得重新寻风。"
msgstr "Go out through the White Stone Gate? The city goes with the wind. Coming again, you must seek the wind anew."

msgid "你穿过白石门。脚下一空，又不空——风托着你，雾从两边合拢过来。\n"
msgstr "You pass through the White Stone Gate. The ground drops away, and does not; the wind holds you up, and the mist closes in from both sides.\n"

msgid "等你站稳，人已经在背风的石坳里了。回头看，只有雾。\n"
msgstr "By the time you steady yourself, you are in a sheltered hollow in the stone. Looking back, there is only mist.\n"

msgid "你穿过白石门。风托着你，雾合拢了。等你站稳，人在风口。\n"
msgstr "You pass through the White Stone Gate. The wind holds you up, and the mist closes in. By the time you steady yourself, you are at the Wind Gate.\n"

msgid "自己拔"
msgstr "Draw It Yourself"

msgid "旋风里又转着旋芒。它回了家，风不再让人走近。\n"
msgstr "Whirling Edge turns in the whirlwind again. It is home, and the wind no longer lets anyone near.\n"

msgid "剑已经有人了。台心的风停着。\n"
msgstr "The sword already has an owner. The wind at the heart of the terrace is still.\n"

msgid "风太大，你走不近。守剑的人在楼下风铃阁里。\n"
msgstr "The wind is too strong; you cannot get near. The keeper of the sword is downstairs in the Wind Chime Pavilion.\n"

msgid "你走进旋风。风刃从四面八方削过来，削到身上，却不再伤人——它认得你了。\n"
msgstr "You walk into the whirlwind. Wind blades cut at you from every side, but they no longer wound. It knows you now.\n"

msgid "你伸手。剑柄落进掌心，凉的，又是暖的。风一下子散了。\n"
msgstr "You reach out. The hilt falls into your palm, cold and warm at once. The wind scatters all at once.\n"

msgid "看着台心的风散尽，点了点头。"
msgstr " watches the wind at the heart of the terrace scatter, and nods."

msgid "十口铃里有人信你，剑就认你。拿去吧——不扰民的剑，你们先帝要对了。"
msgstr "Among the ten bells there are those who trust you, and so the sword knows you. Take it. Your late Emperor was right to ask for a sword that troubles no one."

msgid "云边有风，会送你回去。"
msgstr "At the edge of the cloud there is wind that will send you back."

msgid "岚翁说道：先接三刃。风认了你，剑才落得下来。\n"
msgstr "The Wind Elder says, \"First meet the three blades. Once the wind has known you, the sword can fall.\"\n"

msgid "自己拔旋芒？十铃架上信你的铃够了。\n拔了，终章是你持剑；不拔，旋芒归皇叔或萧辟尘，湖畔和冰龙厅那两仗他会跟你并肩打。先要接岚翁的「接风三刃」——三下风刃是真的，接不住会受伤、会昏倒，歇好了可以再来。"
msgstr "Draw Whirling Edge yourself? Enough bells on the ten-bell rack trust you.\nIf you draw it, you carry the sword in the final chapter. If you do not, Whirling Edge goes to the Imperial Uncle or to Xiao Bichen, and in the two fights at the lakeshore and the ice dragons' hall he will fight at your side. First you must meet the Wind Elder's \"Three Blades\". The three wind blades are real: if you cannot take them you will be hurt and faint, and once rested you may try again."

msgid "好。剑在风里，风先要认你。我替风出三刃。"
msgstr "Good. The sword is in the wind, and the wind must first know you. I will throw three blades for the wind."

msgid "你走近旋风，风把你推了回来。\n"
msgstr "You approach the whirlwind, and the wind pushes you back.\n"

msgid "（十铃架上响了五口铃，还差一口：自己拔，要六处以上有人信你。）\n"
msgstr "(Five of the ten bells are ringing, one short: to draw it yourself, you need someone to trust you in six or more places.)\n"

msgid "（十铃架上响了四口铃，还差两口：自己拔，要六处以上有人信你。）\n"
msgstr "(Four of the ten bells are ringing, two short: to draw it yourself, you need someone to trust you in six or more places.)\n"

msgid "（十铃架上响了三口铃，还差三口：自己拔，要六处以上有人信你。）\n"
msgstr "(Three of the ten bells are ringing, three short: to draw it yourself, you need someone to trust you in six or more places.)\n"

msgid "（十铃架上响了两口铃，还差四口：自己拔，要六处以上有人信你。）\n"
msgstr "(Two of the ten bells are ringing, four short: to draw it yourself, you need someone to trust you in six or more places.)\n"

msgid "（十铃架上响了一口铃，还差五口：自己拔，要六处以上有人信你。）\n"
msgstr "(One of the ten bells is ringing, five short: to draw it yourself, you need someone to trust you in six or more places.)\n"

msgid "（十铃架上一口铃也没响：自己拔，要六处以上有人信你。）\n"
msgstr "(Not one of the ten bells is ringing: to draw it yourself, you need someone to trust you in six or more places.)\n"

msgid "请皇叔"
msgstr "Ask the Uncle"

msgid "请皇叔来拔？\n京师那口铃一响，风就去京城把於兰天武找来。剑跟他走，终章他持剑，你在旁边。"
msgstr "Ask the Imperial Uncle to draw it?\nWhen the bell of the Capital rings, the wind will go to the Capital and fetch Yulan Tianwu. The sword goes with him, he carries it in the final chapter, and you stand beside him."

msgid "岚翁伸手往楼下一指。底下风铃阁里，京师那口大铃自己响了一声，又一声。\n"
msgstr "The Wind Elder points a hand downstairs. Below, in the Wind Chime Pavilion, the great bell of the Capital rings by itself once, then again.\n"

msgid "一阵大风从云里落下来，落在台上，风里站着一个人，朝服被吹得猎猎地响。\n"
msgstr "A great wind drops out of the clouds onto the terrace, and a man stands in it, his court robe whipping and snapping.\n"

msgid "四下看了一眼，目光落在台心的风上，看了很久。"
msgstr " looks around, his gaze coming to rest on the wind at the heart of the terrace. He looks for a long time."

msgid "三百年前，於兰家拔错了一把剑。这一把，我来。"
msgstr "Three hundred years ago the Yulan family drew the wrong sword. This one, I will draw."

msgid "於兰天武走进旋风。风刃削过他的朝服，他一步也没停。他伸手，剑落进他手里，风散了。\n"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu walks into the whirlwind. The wind blades slice past his court robe and he does not stop a step. He reaches out, the sword falls into his hand, and the wind scatters.\n"

msgid "昭儿还在殿上等我。剑我带回去——决战那日，你来叫我。"
msgstr "Zhao'er is still waiting for me at court. I will take the sword back. On the day of the final battle, come and call me."

msgid "又一阵风卷过来，於兰天武不见了。\n"
msgstr "Another gust rolls in, and Yulan Tianwu is gone.\n"

msgid "岚翁说道：京师那口铃还没响到他身上。手诏送到了，他回了朝，风才找得到他。\n"
msgstr "The Wind Elder says, \"The bell of the Capital has not yet rung upon him. Once the edict is delivered and he has returned to court, the wind will be able to find him.\"\n"

msgid "岚翁说道：於兰家的人？他还在通缉里，躲在水烟阁，朝廷的事他不碰。风找不到不肯来的人。\n"
msgstr "The Wind Elder says, \"The Yulan man? He is still under warrant, hiding in Waterfog Pavilion, and will not touch court affairs. The wind cannot find a man who will not come.\"\n"

msgid "（请皇叔拔：只有第九章请皇上先撤了他的通缉、把手诏送到他手里的那一边，他才在朝上。）\n"
msgstr "(Asking the Uncle to draw it: only on the side of Chapter 9 where you asked the Emperor to lift his warrant first and delivered the edict into his hands will he be at court.)\n"

msgid "让萧辟尘拔"
msgstr "Let Xiao Bichen Draw"

msgid "让萧辟尘来拔？\n岚翁会把他的风铃挂回萧家的钩上，风认得铃上的名字，会把他送回来。剑跟他走：他会拿着它去决战，那一战，他可能回不来。铃也就还给他了。"
msgstr "Let Xiao Bichen draw it?\nThe Wind Elder will hang his wind bell back on the Xiao family's hook; the wind knows the name on the bell and will bring him back. The sword goes with him: he will take it to the final battle, and in that battle he may not come back. The bell is then returned to him as well."

msgid "岚翁接过风铃，拇指在铃舌的「尘」字上摸了一下，朝着白石街的方向摇了摇。\n"
msgstr "The Wind Elder takes the wind bell, rubs the \"Chen\" on the clapper once with his thumb, and shakes the bell toward White Stone Street.\n"

msgid "底下长街上，萧家门楣那只空钩叮的一声。风从街上一路卷上来，卷到台上，风里站着一个人，白衣，长发，被风吹得乱飞。\n"
msgstr "Down on the long street, the empty hook over the Xiao door rings once. A wind rolls all the way up the street to the terrace, and in it stands a man in white, his long hair whipping wild.\n"

msgid "四下看，看了很久。"
msgstr " looks around, and keeps looking for a long time."

msgid "……城还是这个样子。"
msgstr "... The city is just the same."

msgid "铃在，风认人。你替我把铃带回来了。"
msgstr "Where the bell is, the wind knows the man. You brought my bell back for me."

msgid "萧辟尘走进旋风。风绕着他转，转得慢了，像是认得他。剑落进他手里，风散了。\n"
msgstr "Xiao Bichen walks into the whirlwind. The wind circles him, turning slower and slower, as though it knows him. The sword falls into his hand, and the wind scatters.\n"

msgid "我回水烟阁。决战那日，剑跟我下湖。"
msgstr "I am going back to Waterfog Pavilion. On the day of the final battle, the sword goes down into the lake with me."

msgid "又一阵风卷过来，萧辟尘不见了。\n"
msgstr "Another gust rolls in, and Xiao Bichen is gone.\n"

msgid "岚翁说道：风认铃，不认人。萧家孩子的铃不在你身上，风就找不到他。\n"
msgstr "The Wind Elder says, \"The wind knows bells, not people. The Xiao child's bell is not on you, so the wind cannot find him.\"\n"

msgid "（让萧辟尘拔：要带着他的青铜风铃——在老松岭石洞的石匣里，对着寻风地带的风才开。）\n"
msgstr "(To let Xiao Bichen draw it, you must bring his bronze wind bell. It is in the stone casket in the cave at Old Pine Ridge, which opens only when faced with the wind of the Windseeking Wilds.)\n"

msgid "乘风"
msgstr "Ride the Wind"

msgid "你往云边走了一步，风把你托了回来。剑还没有主，风不送人。\n"
msgstr "You step toward the edge of the cloud, and the wind lifts you back. The sword has no master yet, and the wind does not send anyone away.\n"

msgid "乘风回去？风会把你放在天驼关石林那面镜子前。岚城随风走，下回再来，得重新寻风。"
msgstr "Ride the wind back? The wind will set you down before that mirror in the stone forest at Camelback Pass. The city goes with the wind. Coming again, you must seek the wind anew."

msgid "你往云里迈了一步。风从底下托住你，像一只手。\n"
msgstr "You step into the cloud. The wind takes you from beneath, like a hand.\n"

msgid "云从身边飞快地往上退，铃声越来越远。等你站稳，眼前是石林，那面镜子里映着你自己。\n"
msgstr "The cloud races up past you, and the bells grow ever farther away. By the time you steady yourself, you are before the stone forest, and in that mirror is yourself.\n"

msgid "一阵狂风迎面压过来，压得你喘不过气。你运起内力顶住了。\n"
msgstr "A violent gust bears down on you, pressing the breath out of your chest. You gather your Inner Force and hold against it."

msgid "狂风刮得你站不住脚，一跤摔在草里！风大不能行。\n"
msgstr "The gale tears at you until you cannot keep your footing, and you fall flat in the grass! The wind is too strong to walk."

msgid "抬眼看了看你，慢慢解下腰间的皮酒囊，放在膝上。"
msgstr " glances up at you and slowly unties the leather wineskin from his belt, laying it across his knees."

msgid "数吧。"
msgstr "Count."

msgid "……二十三个。"
msgstr "...Twenty-three."

msgid "我在这堵墙底下坐了二十年。墙那边是庾家。二十年前，庾子建要清乔阴的巷子，叫花子一个一个进了大牢——我就搬到这里来，看着他。"
msgstr "I sat under this wall for twenty years. The Yu house is on the other side. Twenty years ago Yu Zijian wanted Tallshade's alleys swept clean, and the beggars went to jail one by one—so I moved here and watched him."

msgid "乔阴那个，是我的替身里管事的那一个。花紫会这二十年，是他管的。"
msgstr "The one in Tallshade is the one of my stand-ins who ran things. He has run the Beggars' Guild these twenty years."

msgid "墙那边有一样东西，叫花子拿不到。你问我「密信」。"
msgstr "There is one thing on the other side of that wall a beggar can't get his hands on. You asked me about the \"Secret Letter.\""

msgid "龙头？叫花子一个，墙根底下晒太阳的。"
msgstr "Dragon Head? Just a beggar, sunning himself at the foot of a wall."

msgid "把密信交给花紫会：真龙头拿它压着庾家，乔阴的巷子不清。\n乔阴的程不平也要这封信，拿去当物证——交给花紫会，官府那条线就断了，程不平往后不跟你说案子，这封信再也要不回来。\n京师的事还没定的，这封信也不能拿去朝上揭发了，人证物证要另凑。\n要交吗？"
msgstr "Hand the secret letter to the Beggars' Guild: the true Dragon Head will use it to keep the Yu family down, and Tallshade's alleys will not be cleared.\nCheng Buping of Tallshade wants this letter too, as evidence. Give it to the Beggars' Guild and the yamen's line is cut: Cheng Buping will no longer discuss cases with you, and the letter can never be taken back.\nWhere the Capital matter is not yet settled, the letter can no longer be used to denounce at court; other witnesses and proof will have to be found.\nHand it over?"

msgid "信在我这里。庾家的人，这些年进不了乔阴的巷子——往后也进不了。"
msgstr "The letter is with me. The Yu family hasn't been able to set foot in Tallshade's alleys all these years—and from now on, never will."

msgid "接过信，就着墙缝里漏下来的光看了一遍，折好，塞进了皮酒囊的网绳里。"
msgstr " takes the letter, reads it through by the light leaking down the crack in the wall, folds it and tucks it into the netting of the wineskin."

msgid "庾子建的字，兵部尚书的私印。"
msgstr "Yu Zijian's handwriting. The Minister of War's private seal."

msgid "这封信在一天，庾家就不敢清乔阴的巷子。叫花子要的，就是这个。"
msgstr "As long as this letter exists, the Yu family won't dare clear Tallshade's alleys. That's all a beggar wants."

msgid "朝身后的墙努了努嘴。"
msgstr " jerks his chin at the wall behind him."

msgid "墙那边的后院有间小屋。逆灵宫的人坐在里面，等庾子建的回话——他身上有一封庾子建亲笔的信。"
msgstr "There's a little house in the back yard on the other side of the wall. A man from the Black Palace sits in it, waiting for Yu Zijian's answer—he's carrying a letter in Yu Zijian's own hand."

msgid "那人见人就动手。拿到信，带来给我。"
msgstr "That man strikes anyone he sees. Get the letter and bring it to me."

msgid "乔阴的程不平也会要它，拿去当物证。给谁，你自己定。"
msgstr "Cheng Buping of Tallshade will want it too, as evidence. Who gets it, you decide."

msgid "墙那边的后院有间小屋，这些天还空着。"
msgstr "There's a little house in the back yard on the other side of the wall. It's still empty these days."

msgid "等玉螺湖底那件事闹出来，逆灵宫会派人来坐在里面，等庾子建的回话——那人身上会有一封庾子建亲笔的信。"
msgstr "When the business at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake breaks open, the Black Palace will send a man to sit in it and wait for Yu Zijian's answer—he'll be carrying a letter in Yu Zijian's own hand."

msgid "到时候去拿。乔阴的程不平也会要它，给谁，你自己定。"
msgstr "Go and get it then. Cheng Buping of Tallshade will want it too, as evidence. Who gets it, you decide."

msgid "什么信？叫花子不识字。"
msgstr "What letter? A beggar can't read."

msgid "盟主出来了，花紫会是得财的。我在这堵墙底下，接着看着庾家。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader's out, so the Beggars' Guild comes out ahead. I stay under this wall and keep watching the Yu house."

msgid "人出来了。我也该回乔阴了——福林大街见。"
msgstr "He's out. Time I went back to Tallshade—see you on Fulin Street."

msgid "盟主出来了。我回乔阴，福林大街见。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader's out. I'm going back to Tallshade. See you on Fulin Street."

msgid "客房里那位已经出来了——不是叫花子背出来的，也好。"
msgstr "The one in the guest room is out. Not carried out on a beggar's back—but that'll do."

msgid "我在这堵墙底下坐了二十年，看的就是他。人出来了，我也该回乔阴了。"
msgstr "Twenty years I sat under this wall, and he's who I was watching. He's out. Time I went back to Tallshade."

msgid "乔阴那个替我管了二十年的花紫会。我回去，有话跟他说。你来福林大街。"
msgstr "The one in Tallshade ran the Beggars' Guild for me these twenty years. I'm going back. I've words for him. Come to Fulin Street."

msgid "夜里来。墙根东头那捆柴草底下就是狗洞。护院绕圈的时候，客房门口空着——撞见了别动手，退出来，下回再来。"
msgstr "Come at night. The dog hole is under the bundle of firewood at the east end of the wall. When the guards go round, the guest-room door stands empty—if you run into them, don't fight. Back out and try again another time."

msgid "往墙那边看了一眼，压低了声音。"
msgstr " glances over the wall and lowers his voice."

msgid "墙那边的客房里关着一个白头发的老人。庾家关了他二十年——就是你们说的盟主。"
msgstr "In the guest room on the other side of the wall, an old man with white hair is locked up. The Yu family has kept him twenty years—he's the one you call the Alliance Leader."

msgid "护院换班的时辰，叫花子都知道：一入夜，客房门口那几个护院就挑着灯在院子里绕圈，门口一阵一阵地空着。"
msgstr "A beggar knows when the guards change: once night falls, the guards at the guest-room door go round and round the yard with lanterns, and the doorway stands empty by turns."

msgid "墙根东头那捆柴草底下有个狗洞，通后院的废屋。夜里钻进去，别跟护院动手——撞见了就退出来，下回再来。"
msgstr "There's a dog hole under the firewood at the east end of the wall, leading to a ruined shed in the back yard. Crawl in at night and don't fight the guards—if you run into them, back out and try again another time."

msgid "那老人认得叫花子。你进了客房，跟他说「走」。"
msgstr "The old man knows me. When you get into the guest room, tell him, \"Leave.\""

msgid "盟主？叫花子不认识什么盟主。"
msgstr "Alliance Leader? A beggar doesn't know any Alliance Leader."

msgid "墙那边传来护院换班的梆子声，陆得财数着，嘴唇一动一动。\n"
msgstr "From beyond the wall comes the clack of the guards' watch clapper changing shift. Lu Decai counts it, his lips moving.\n"

msgid "收过路费的"
msgstr "toll collector"

msgid "一个三十来岁的汉子，穿一件洗白了的旧号衣，前胸的字给拆掉了，只剩一圈线头。他倚着路口一块告示站着，腰里挂一口刀，脚边一只钱匣子，见人过来就把手一伸。\n"
msgstr "A man of thirty or so in a washed-out old tabard, the characters on its chest unpicked, only a ring of loose threads left. He leans against a notice at the junction, a saber at his waist and a money box at his feet, and puts out a hand whenever someone comes near.\n"

msgid "钱贵冲过路的人把手一伸：过路的，黄金一两！官府的告示，看清楚了！\n"
msgstr "Qian Gui thrusts a hand out at passers-by: \"Toll! One tael of gold! The government notice—read it properly!\"\n"

msgid "钱贵拍了拍身边的告示：交了钱给路引，前头的关卡不再收。\n"
msgstr "Qian Gui pats the notice beside him: \"Pay up and you get a travel pass. The checkpoints ahead won't charge you again.\"\n"

msgid "钱贵喝道：敢打官差！\n"
msgstr "Qian Gui bellows: \"Hitting an officer of the law!\"\n"

msgid "钱贵一边招架，一边拿脚护着地上的钱匣子。\n"
msgstr "Qian Gui parries with one hand and shields the money box on the ground with his foot.\n"

msgid "过路费"
msgstr "Road Toll"

msgid "官府的告示，没看见？过路的，黄金一两。交了钱给你一张路引，前头的关卡不再收。"
msgstr "The government notice—didn't you see it? Passing through is one tael of gold. Pay up and you get a travel pass, and the checkpoints ahead won't charge you again."

msgid "交了钱才有。盖着大印的，假不了。"
msgstr "Only if you pay. It's got the big seal on it. Can't be faked."

msgid "瞟了一眼你腰里的牌子，嘿嘿一笑。"
msgstr " glances at the badge at your belt and gives a heh-heh grin."

msgid "乔阴的捕快？乔阴县的官，管不到官道上。这是关上的告示。"
msgstr "A Tallshade constable? Tallshade County's officials have no say on the official road. This notice is from the Pass."

msgid "官府贴的。识字的自己看，不识字的交钱。"
msgstr "The government posted it. Those who can read, read it. Those who can't, pay."

msgid "钱贵捂着肚子爬起来，连钱匣子也不要了：「别打了！告示是关上的兄弟给的，路引一张一两——我只管收钱！」\n他从怀里掏出一叠路引扔在地上，顺着官道往西南跑了。\n"
msgstr "Qian Gui scrambles up clutching his belly, not even wanting the money box: \"Stop, stop! The notice came from the brothers at the Pass, a tael a pass—I only collect the money!\"\nHe pulls a stack of travel passes from his shirt, throws them on the ground and runs southwest along the road.\n"

msgid "一个粗壮的汉子，敞着一件旧号衣，号衣上的字拆掉了。他抱着胳膊站在镇口那块官府公告底下，腰里挂一口刀，面前摆着一只钱匣子，进镇的人都得从他跟前过。\n"
msgstr "A stout man with an old tabard hanging open, its characters unpicked. He stands with folded arms beneath the government notice at the town entrance, a saber at his waist and a money box before him; everyone going into town must pass by him.\n"

msgid "牛四拿刀鞘敲了敲头顶的公告：由此入镇，黄金一两！\n"
msgstr "Niu Si raps the notice overhead with his saber sheath: \"One tael of gold to enter town!\"\n"

msgid "牛四掂着钱匣子，冲进镇的客商嚷道：交钱，拿路引！\n"
msgstr "Niu Si weighs the money box in his hand and bawls at the merchants going into town: \"Pay up and take your pass!\"\n"

msgid "牛四喝道：敢在官府的告示底下动手！\n"
msgstr "Niu Si bellows: \"Fighting under a government notice!\"\n"

msgid "牛四的刀抡得呼呼响，一招也不成章法。\n"
msgstr "Niu Si swings his saber with a whoosh, but not one stroke has any form to it.\n"

msgid "乔阴的捕快？这块告示在镇口挂了多少年了，你们县太爷说过一个不字没有？"
msgstr "A Tallshade constable? That notice has hung at the town entrance for years. Did your County Magistrate ever say one word against it?"

msgid "牛四爬起来，一叠路引从怀里滑了出来：「我、我也是替人收的！关上的人每个月来拿一回钱！」\n他顾不上捡，往卧龙岗的方向跑了。\n"
msgstr "Niu Si scrambles up, a stack of travel passes sliding out of his shirt: \"I-I only collect for someone else! The people from the Pass come every month to take the money!\"\nHe has no time to pick them up and runs toward Crouching Dragon Ridge.\n"

msgid "一个老叫花子盘腿坐在福林大街当中，腰里挂着一只大皮酒囊，网绳上密密地打着结——二十三个。街上的叫花子从他跟前过，都放轻了脚步。\n"
msgstr "An old beggar sits cross-legged in the middle of Fulin Street, a big leather wineskin at his belt, its netting thickly knotted—twenty-three knots. The beggars on the street walk softly as they pass him.\n"

msgid "老叫花子眼皮都没抬：回了乔阴，更不跟人动手。"
msgstr "The old beggar doesn't so much as lift an eyelid: \"Back in Tallshade, I fight even less.\""

msgid "认二十三个结：花紫会跟真龙头吃官饭——给官府做眼线，换叫花子不再被巡捕抓；你的偷窃案底一笔勾销。\n陆得财把乔阴交出来，走了就不回来。正月十七，花紫会这一票投颜违（已经入了虹台的席的，票照入席时的算。）。\n要认他吗？"
msgstr "Recognize the twenty-three knots: the Beggars' Guild will eat official rice alongside the true Dragon Head—act as the government's eyes, so beggars are no longer chased by constables; your theft record is wiped clean.\nLu Decai hands Tallshade over, goes, and does not come back. On the seventeenth of the first month the Beggars' Guild's vote goes to Yan Wei (if you have already taken a seat on the Rainbow Terrace, the vote stands as it was when you took it).\nRecognize him?"

msgid "叫花子吃上官饭了。巡捕见了花紫会的人，点个头就过去。"
msgstr "Beggars eat official rice now. When constables see a Guild man, they nod and walk on."

msgid "酒囊系在乔阴那个腰上了。……你认的是他，叫花子不认两个龙头。"
msgstr "The wineskin is tied at the Tallshade one's belt. ...You chose him. A beggar doesn't have two Dragon Heads."

msgid "乔阴那个陆得财把怀里的东西一样一样掏出来，放在真龙头脚边：一本油乎乎的账，几串铜钱，一串巷子里的钥匙。只留下腰里那只二十二个结的皮酒囊。\n"
msgstr "The Lu Decai of Tallshade takes what is in his shirt out one piece at a time and lays it at the true Dragon Head's feet: a greasy account book, a few strings of copper coins, a ring of keys to the alleys. He keeps only the wineskin at his waist, with twenty-two knots.\n"

msgid "他朝你点了点头，什么也没说，顺着福林大街出了北门。\n"
msgstr "He nods to you, says nothing, and goes out of the north gate along Fulin Street.\n"

msgid "程不平那里，我去说。花紫会的人，往后巡捕不抓；你身上那几笔偷窃的案底，一笔勾销。"
msgstr "I'll speak to Cheng Buping. From now on the constables won't arrest the Guild's people, and the theft records on your name are wiped, every one."

msgid "二十三个结，你数过了。"
msgstr "Twenty-three knots. You counted them."

msgid "盟主出来了。叫花子的事，往后在乔阴说。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader's out. From now on, beggars' business is talked over in Tallshade."

msgid "正月十七过去了。叫花子的饭碗，照旧。"
msgstr "The seventeenth of the first month has passed. A beggar's rice bowl is as it was."

msgid "花紫会这一票投颜违。颜违跟朝廷走得近——吃官饭的人，跟着他。"
msgstr "The Guild's vote goes to Yan Wei. Yan Wei's close to the court—those who eat official rice go with him."

msgid "这碗官饭，是你替叫花子认下的。你要这一票，开口就是。"
msgstr "You took this bowl of official rice for the beggars. You want the vote, just say so."

msgid "入席之前说定的票，叫花子不改——花紫会投旧盟主。"
msgstr "A vote settled before we took our seats, a beggar doesn't change—the Guild votes for the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "虹台的事，先在福林大街把话说清。"
msgstr "The Rainbow Terrace business—settle it on Fulin Street first."

msgid "虹台？叫花子到时候也去看看。"
msgstr "The Rainbow Terrace? A beggar will go and have a look when the time comes."

msgid "请真龙头把花紫会这一票交给你：正月十七虹台上，花紫会听你的——你要站出来，这一票就是你的；不站，就由你说投谁。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Ask the true Dragon Head to hand the Beggars' Guild's vote to you: on the seventeenth of the first month on the Rainbow Terrace, the Guild listens to you. If you stand up, the vote is yours; if not, you say whom it goes to.\nSay it?"

msgid "拍了拍腰里的皮酒囊。"
msgstr " pats the leather wineskin at his belt."

msgid "陆得财数着皮酒囊上的结，嘴唇一动一动。\n"
msgstr "Lu Decai counts the knots on the wineskin, his lips moving.\n"

msgid "一个小叫花子跑过来，凑在陆得财耳边说了两句，又跑了。\n"
msgstr "A little beggar runs up, whispers a couple of words in Lu Decai's ear, and runs off again.\n"

msgid "盘腿坐在福林大街当中，四下看了看。"
msgstr " sits cross-legged in the middle of Fulin Street and looks around."

msgid "二十年没回来了。巷子还是这几条。"
msgstr "Twenty years since I was last here. The alleys are still the same few."

msgid "看见了他，站住了。半天，把腰里那只皮酒囊解下来，捧在手上。"
msgstr " sees him and stops. After a long while he unties the leather wineskin from his belt and holds it out in both hands."

msgid "……龙头。"
msgstr "...Dragon Head."

msgid "得财，这二十年辛苦你。我回来，是要带花紫会吃官饭——给官府做眼线，换叫花子不再见了巡捕就跑。"
msgstr "Decai, these twenty years have been hard on you. I've come back to bring the Beggars' Guild to official rice—be the government's eyes, so beggars needn't run at the sight of a constable."

msgid "庾家的密信在我手里，程不平那里也说得上话。往后叫花子手脚不干净，巡捕也睁一只眼闭一只眼。"
msgstr "The Yu family's secret letter is in my hands, and I have a word to put in with Cheng Buping. From now on, if a beggar's fingers get light, the constables will turn a blind eye."

msgid "二十年，我没让一个官差进过乔阴的巷子。"
msgstr "Twenty years, and I never let one government man into the alleys of Tallshade."

msgid "叫花子靠官？官今天给你一碗饭，明天就拿你的人去关北挖河。槐阳那八户，你忘了？"
msgstr "Beggars leaning on the government? Today it gives you a bowl of rice; tomorrow it takes your people to dig canals Beyond the Pass. Those eight households in Huaiyang—have you forgotten?"

msgid "看了看你。"
msgstr " looks at you."

msgid "酒囊上的结是我的，花紫会这二十年是他管的。叫花子听谁的——你替他们说一句。"
msgstr "The knots on the wineskin are mine, but he's run the Beggars' Guild these twenty years. Who the beggars follow—you say a word for them."

msgid "（认二十三个结，问真龙头「龙头」；认这些年管事的人，问陆得财「龙头」。）\n"
msgstr "(To follow the twenty-three knots, ask the true Dragon Head about \"Dragon Head.\" To follow the man who has run things all these years, ask Lu Decai about \"Dragon Head.\")\n"

msgid "一个老老实实的老花匠，多年的风霜刻满了他的额头。衣襟上沾着泥，指甲缝里是洗不掉的朱砂。\n"
msgstr "A plain, honest old gardener, his brow carved deep by years of wind and frost. Mud on his lapels, and under his fingernails cinnabar that will never wash out.\n"

msgid "师兄在大殿里。他不来藏经楼，我也不去大殿。"
msgstr "Senior Brother is in the main hall. He does not come to the Scripture Library, and I do not go to the hall."

msgid "二十年都这样过来了。……他早上会在楼下站一会儿。"
msgstr "Twenty years we have gone on like this. ...He stands a while downstairs in the morning."

msgid "师兄就在里头。二十年了，他那只金眼睛还是那样看人。"
msgstr "Senior Brother is right in there. Twenty years, and that golden eye of his still looks at people the same way."

msgid "锁在二楼的书架上，第七函的位置。"
msgstr "Locked on the second-floor shelf, in the place of the seventh case."

msgid "前半本是茅山的符；后半本，我在教山上的孩子认。认得他们的字，才破得了他们的法。"
msgstr "The first half is Mount Mao's talismans. The second half—I am teaching the children on the mountain to read it. Only by knowing their writing can one break their magic."

msgid "书在师兄手里。烧也好，留也好，是茅山的事。"
msgstr "The book is in Senior Brother's hands. Burn it or keep it, that is Mount Mao's business."

msgid "老爷下了狱，小姐去了相国府。我回来，就是陪她的——这一畦花浇完，我就过去。"
msgstr "The master was jailed, and the young lady went to the Chancellor's House. I came back to keep her company—when this bed of flowers is watered, I will go over."

msgid "清尘那孩子还在这府里。我回来了，就还看着她。"
msgstr "The child Qingchen is still in this house. Now that I am back, I will go on watching over her."

msgid "清尘那孩子……她护得住自己了。我教她的符，够用。"
msgstr "That child Qingchen... she can protect herself now. The talismans I taught her are enough."

msgid "清尘？她在京城。……那孩子不怕她爹，这府里只有她。"
msgstr "Qingchen? She is in the Capital. ...That child is not afraid of her father. In this house, there is only her."

msgid "留"
msgstr "Keep"

msgid "跟花匠：《上清符箓》锁回藏经楼二楼，花匠留在山上守书——他教茅山道术，谁都教，女子也教。正月十七虹台上，茅山这一票投旧盟主：北麓剩下的人交茅山看着（已经入了虹台的席的，这一票不再跟着变）。\n林忌不会点头，从此对你冷一分。终章之后北麓那座道观里的人还没有去处的，花匠拿着书上北麓去劝。\n要这么办吗？"
msgstr "Tell the gardener to lock the \"Highest Clarity Talismans\" back in the Scripture Library's second floor and stay on the mountain to guard the book—he teaches Mount Mao sorcery to anyone, women too. On the seventeenth of the first month on the Rainbow Terrace, Mount Mao's vote goes to the old Alliance Leader; the people left on the North Foot are put in Mount Mao's keeping (if you have already taken a seat on the Rainbow Terrace, this vote will not change again).\nLin Ji will not nod, and from now on grows one degree colder toward you. If, after the finale, the people in the abbey on the North Foot still have nowhere to go, the gardener will take the book up the North Foot and persuade them.\nDo it this way?"

msgid "书烧了。……也好。"
msgstr "The book is burned. ...Just as well."

msgid "书在二楼。"
msgstr "The book is on the second floor."

msgid "看了林忌一眼，又看了看你。"
msgstr " glances at Lin Ji, then at you."

msgid "师兄不会点头的。……可书是你带回来的，你说留，就留。"
msgstr "Senior Brother will not nod. ...But you brought the book back; you say keep it, so it stays."

msgid "二楼第七函的位置，我替茅山守着。北麓那些人念的是什么，我教山上的孩子认。"
msgstr "The place of the seventh case on the second floor—I will keep it for Mount Mao. What those people on the North Foot chant, I will teach the children on the mountain to read."

msgid "林忌坐回香案后头，没有说话。花匠抱着那函书出了大殿，往藏经楼去了。\n"
msgstr "Lin Ji sits back down behind the incense table and says nothing. The gardener carries the case of books out of the hall and toward the Scripture Library.\n"

msgid "留什么？"
msgstr "Keep what?"

msgid "道术"
msgstr "Sorcery"

msgid "茅山道术，我教。男的女的都教——师兄守他的规矩，我守我的。"
msgstr "Mount Mao sorcery—I teach it. Men and women alike. Senior Brother keeps his rules; I keep mine."

msgid "根基是天师正道，先学那个；天师正道不到一半，道术就领悟不下去。"
msgstr "Its root is the Way of the Celestial Masters; study that first. Until the Way of the Celestial Masters is half learned, the sorcery cannot be understood."

msgid "请花匠拿着《上清符箓》上北麓：他同道观里剩下的人念一遍他们自己的经，把肯下山的领下来，交茅山看着。\n他在北麓的绞盘边等你——你上了北麓，就看得到。\n正月十七虹台上，这件事就算了了，不能再改。\n就这样吗？"
msgstr "Ask the gardener to take the \"Highest Clarity Talismans\" up the North Foot: he will recite their own scriptures to those left in the abbey, bring down those willing to leave the mountain, and put them in Mount Mao's keeping.\nHe waits for you by the winch on the North Foot—go up the North Foot and you will see him.\nOn the seventeenth of the first month on the Rainbow Terrace, this matter counts as settled and can no longer be changed.\nDo it this way?"

msgid "人都下了山。他们烧了一辈子香，坛上写的是什么，现在知道了。"
msgstr "They have all come down the mountain. They burned incense all their lives; now they know what was written on the altar."

msgid "官兵已经上了北麓。……晚了。"
msgstr "The soldiers have already gone up the North Foot. ...Too late."

msgid "我在北麓的绞盘边等你。"
msgstr "I am waiting for you by the winch on the North Foot."

msgid "师兄让你去劝他们了？那就去吧——同宫里当家的说「下山」。"
msgstr "Senior Brother sent you to persuade them? Then go. Tell the one in charge in the abbey: \"Come down the mountain.\""

msgid "把那函书从书架上取下来，用油布包好，背在背上。"
msgstr " takes the case of books down from the shelf, wraps it in oilcloth and straps it on his back."

msgid "北麓那座道观里剩下的，大半是被拐上山的孩子。烧了一辈子香，不知道自己烧的是什么。"
msgstr "Most of those left in the abbey on the North Foot are children who were lured up the mountain. They burned incense all their lives and never knew what they were burning."

msgid "我念给他们听。你上北麓来——绞盘边上等你。"
msgstr "I will read it to them. Come up the North Foot—I will wait for you by the winch."

msgid "北麓？"
msgstr "The North Foot?"

msgid "虹台上的事定了。我守我的书。"
msgstr "The matter of the Rainbow Terrace is settled. I keep my books."

msgid "茅山投旧盟主——北麓的人交茅山看着，我教他们认字。"
msgstr "Mount Mao votes for the old Alliance Leader. The people of the North Foot are in Mount Mao's keeping, and I teach them to read."

msgid "师兄没点头，可他也没拦。书是你带回来的：这一票，你要，就是你的。"
msgstr "Senior Brother did not nod, but neither did he stop it. You brought the book back. If you want this vote, it is yours."

msgid "票是入席之前定的。茅山投颜违，是师兄的意思。"
msgstr "The vote was settled before you took your seat. Mount Mao votes for Yan Wei; that is Senior Brother's wish."

msgid "正月十七？我一个种花的，不上虹台。"
msgstr "The seventeenth of the first month? I am a man who grows flowers. I do not go to the Rainbow Terrace."

msgid "请花匠把茅山这一票交给你：正月十七虹台上，茅山听你的——你要站出来，这一票就是你的；不站，就由你说投谁。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Ask the gardener to hand Mount Mao's vote to you: on the seventeenth of the first month on the Rainbow Terrace, Mount Mao listens to you. If you stand up, the vote is yours; if not, you say whom it goes to.\nSay it?"

msgid "好。茅山听你的——师兄那里，我去说。"
msgstr "Good. Mount Mao listens to you—I will speak to Senior Brother."

msgid "站在殿门里，背贴着门框。二十年没跨过的门槛，就在他脚后跟。"
msgstr " stands inside the hall door, his back against the frame. The threshold he has not crossed in twenty years is right behind his heels."

msgid "师兄。"
msgstr "Senior Brother."

msgid "从香案后头站起来，金色的那只眼睛看了他很久。"
msgstr " rises from behind the incense table and looks at him a long while with that golden eye."

msgid "你进来了。"
msgstr "You came in."

msgid "书我看了。后半本，是逆灵宫的字。"
msgstr "I read the book. The second half is the Black Palace's writing."

msgid "这种东西，茅山宁可没有。连那一函镇教秘籍一起，投进香炉。"
msgstr "Mount Mao would rather not have such a thing. Throw it in the incense burner, along with that case of the abbey's treasured manuals."

msgid "烧了，茅山就永远不认得他们的字。北麓那座道观还在念，念的是什么，天下只有这函书知道。"
msgstr "Burn it, and Mount Mao will never know their writing. That abbey on the North Foot is still chanting, and only this book knows what it chants."

msgid "留着它。锁回藏经楼，我来守。"
msgstr "Keep it. Lock it back in the Scripture Library, and I will guard it."

msgid "你守了庾家二十年，又要守这函书。"
msgstr "You guarded the Yu house for twenty years, and now you would guard this book too."

msgid "转过头来看着你。"
msgstr " turns his head to look at you."

msgid "书是你带回山的。烧，还是留——你说。"
msgstr "You brought the book back up the mountain. Burn it or keep it—you say."

msgid "（烧，问林忌「烧」；留，问花匠「留」。）\n"
msgstr "(To burn it, ask Lin Ji about \"Burn.\" To keep it, ask the gardener about \"Keep.\")\n"

msgid "一个老花匠站在绞盘边上，背上背着一只油布包。他望着山门，嘴唇一直在动。\n"
msgstr "An old gardener stands by the winch, an oilcloth bundle on his back. He gazes at the mountain gate, his lips moving all the while.\n"

msgid "人都下了山。回去吧，书还要放回二楼。"
msgstr "They have all come down the mountain. Go back; the book must be put back on the second floor."

msgid "货道那头，穿黑衣的人一个、两个走下来，多半还是孩子。领诵的道士走在最后，手里还攥着木鱼槌。\n"
msgstr "Down the freight trail, people in black come one, two at a time, mostly children. The chanting Daoist walks last, still gripping his wooden-fish mallet.\n"

msgid "下山吧。茅山不打你们，也不关你们——教你们认字。"
msgstr "Come down the mountain. Mount Mao will not beat you, nor lock you up—it will teach you to read."

msgid "听着就是。"
msgstr "Just listen."

msgid "解下背上的油布包，把那函书翻到后半本。"
msgstr " unwraps the oilcloth bundle from his back and turns the case to the second half of the book."

msgid "他们的话，我抄了两年。今天念给他们听。"
msgstr "Their words—I spent two years copying them. Today I read them to them."

msgid "花匠对着货道那头的黑砖山门念了起来。声音不大，念的是逆灵宫坛上的经，一字不差；每念完一段，他就用山下的话把那一段的意思说一遍。\n"
msgstr "The gardener begins to read toward the black-brick mountain gate at the end of the freight trail. His voice is not loud; he reads the scripture of the Black Palace's altar without a word wrong, and when he finishes each passage, he says its meaning again in the speech of the lowlands.\n"

msgid "山门后头的木鱼声停了。门开了一条缝。\n"
msgstr "The sound of the wooden fish behind the gate stops. The door opens a crack.\n"

msgid "一个、两个……穿黑衣的人顺着货道走下来，多半还是孩子。领诵的道士走在最后，手里还攥着木鱼槌。\n"
msgstr "One, two... people in black come down the freight trail, mostly children. The chanting Daoist walks last, still gripping his wooden-fish mallet.\n"

msgid "一个高大的人形，只有轮廓发出暗蓝色的光芒，其他部份都是透明的！手里握着一道剑形的蓝光。\n"
msgstr "A tall human figure, only its outline glowing a dark blue, the rest of it transparent! It holds a sword-shaped blaze of blue light in its hand.\n"

msgid "收剑而立，朝你微微点了点头。"
msgstr " lowers the sword and stands still, giving you a slight nod."

msgid "轮廓淡淡的，剑尖垂着——今夜的四句已经念完了。"
msgstr "The outline is faint, the sword-point drooping—tonight's four lines are done."

msgid "举剑指天，轮廓亮了一亮。"
msgstr " raises the sword to the sky, and the outline flares once."

msgid "一阵蓝光笼罩住$N，「嗡」地一声，$N的轮廓又变清晰了一些！$N收剑而立。"
msgstr "A blue light envelops $N with a hum, and $N's outline grows a little clearer! $N {N:lower|lowers} the sword and {N:stand|stands} still."

msgid "尚书府书启"
msgstr "Secretary at the Minister's Mansion"

msgid "一个清瘦的中年书生，穿一件半旧的青布长衫，右手中指上有一道磨出来的老茧，袖口沾着墨。眉眼和曼雩台上那位掌门有几分像，只是不笑。\n"
msgstr "A lean, middle-aged scholar in a half-worn blue cotton gown, with an old callus on the middle finger of his right hand and ink on his cuffs. His features somewhat resemble the Master on the Rain Dance Terrace, only he does not smile.\n"

msgid "骆建章提着笔，在一张笺上写了几行，又揉成一团。\n"
msgstr "Luo Jianzhang holds his brush, writes a few lines on a sheet, and crumples it into a ball.\n"

msgid "骆建章对着砚台磨墨，磨了很久，一个字也没写。\n"
msgstr "Luo Jianzhang grinds ink at the inkstone for a long time and writes not a single character.\n"

msgid "我拿笔的手，不拿剑。"
msgstr "The hand that holds a brush does not hold a sword."

msgid "看见信背面那四个字，停了一下，才拆开。"
msgstr " sees the four characters on the back of the letter, pauses, and only then opens it."

msgid "一行一行看下去，看到末尾，嘴角动了动。"
msgstr " reads on line by line, and at the end the corner of his mouth moves."

msgid "他还是那么写字，最后一笔甩出格子。"
msgstr "He still writes that way. The last stroke flies out of the box."

msgid "把信折好，收进袖子里。"
msgstr " folds the letter and tucks it into his sleeve."

msgid "……替我谢谢他。别的，没什么好说的。"
msgstr "...Thank him for me. There is nothing else to say."

msgid "建炎的信？……放这儿吧。"
msgstr "A letter from Jianyan? ...Leave it here."

msgid "我不收东西。"
msgstr "I do not accept things."

msgid "回家"
msgstr "Go Home"

msgid "保住骆家：骆云舟带大哥回乔阴，抄本的事从此不提；骆建章在曼雩台上给弟弟抄谱。\n第九章还没定的，揭发里少了骆建章这一样人证（本来就没有，不扣别的）。骆家照旧是京城的世家：正月十七虹台上，步玄这一票投颜违（已经入了虹台的席的，这一票不再跟着变）。\n要这么办吗？"
msgstr "Keep the Luo family safe: Luo Yunzhou takes his elder brother back to Tallshade, and the matter of the copy is never raised again; Luo Jianzhang copies manuals for his younger brother on the Rain Dance Terrace.\nIf Chapter 9 is not yet settled, the denunciation loses one witness, Luo Jianzhang (it never had him, so nothing else is lost). The Luo family remains an old family of the Capital: on the seventeenth of the first month on the Rainbow Terrace, Mystic Step's vote goes to Yan Wei (if you have already taken a seat on the Rainbow Terrace, this vote will not change again).\nDo it this way?"

msgid "这是骆家的事。"
msgstr "This is a Luo family matter."

msgid "回乔阴。建炎在台边练剑，我给他抄谱。"
msgstr "Back to Tallshade. Jianyan practices his sword at the terrace's edge, and I copy manuals for him."

msgid "回不去了。……我说了真话。"
msgstr "I cannot go back. ...I told the truth."

msgid "把笔搁下，看了弟弟很久。"
msgstr " sets down the brush and looks at his younger brother a long while."

msgid "建炎，带我回乔阴。"
msgstr "Jianyan, take me back to Tallshade."

msgid "抄本上的字是我的，我认。可骆家五代人在京城挣下的一块门匾，不该砸在我一个抄手手里。"
msgstr "The writing in the copy is mine; I own it. But the plaque the Luo family earned in the Capital over five generations should not be smashed by the hand of one copyist."

msgid "骆云舟没有说话。过了很久，他把扇子打开，又合上。\n"
msgstr "Luo Yunzhou says nothing. After a long while, he opens his fan and closes it again.\n"

msgid "韦执中把茶碗放下：建章的名字，老夫不往刑部递。你们兄弟回去吧。\n"
msgstr "Wei Zhizhong sets down his teacup: \"Jianzhang's name this old man will not pass to the Ministry of Justice. You brothers may go home.\"\n"

msgid "曼雩台上风大。我给你抄谱——父亲那一辈散了的，我都记得。"
msgstr "The wind is strong on the Rain Dance Terrace. I will copy the manuals for you—whatever was lost from Father's generation, I remember."

msgid "回家？……我十年没回过家。"
msgstr "Home? ...I have not been home in ten years."

msgid "建炎在台边练剑。他练他的，我抄我的。"
msgstr "Jianyan practices his sword at the terrace's edge. He practices his, I copy mine."

msgid "建炎回乔阴了。骆家的门匾，他摘。"
msgstr "Jianyan has gone back to Tallshade. The Luo plaque—he takes it down."

msgid "他来了。……十年了，还是一只脚站在门外。"
msgstr "He came. ...Ten years, and he still stands with one foot outside the door."

msgid "建炎……他还在乔阴耍剑？十年了，那一笔还是甩出格子。"
msgstr "Jianyan... is he still waving a sword about in Tallshade? Ten years, and that last stroke still flies out of the box."

msgid "建炎？我弟弟。十年没见了。"
msgstr "Jianyan? My younger brother. I have not seen him in ten years."

msgid "大人？……回了乔阴，就没有大人了。"
msgstr "\"My lord\"? ...Once back in Tallshade, there is no lord."

msgid "供状上画了押。他口述的，我写了十年；最后这一张，是我自己的话。"
msgstr "I signed the statement. He dictated it and I wrote it for ten years; this last page is in my own words."

msgid "大人……庾子建下了狱，刑部要问我的话。我在他身边写了十年字。"
msgstr "My lord... Yu Zijian is in prison, and the Ministry of Justice will question me. I wrote at his side for ten years."

msgid "大人口述，我落笔。十年了，他的话我写得比他说得快。"
msgstr "My lord dictated, and I set brush to paper. Ten years: I write his words faster than he speaks them."

msgid "抄本？我抄过的东西多了。"
msgstr "The copy? I have copied a great many things."

msgid "抄本的事，不提了。"
msgstr "We do not speak of the copy."

msgid "供状画了押。那三句，从此是我的罪，不是骆家的。"
msgstr "The statement is signed. Those three lines are my crime from now on, not the Luo family's."

msgid "我说过了。那三句，是我写的。"
msgstr "I have said it. Those three lines—I wrote them."

msgid "看了一眼那卷抄本，手里的笔落在了纸上。"
msgstr " glances at the copy, and the brush in his hand comes down on the paper."

msgid "……是我的字。"
msgstr "...It is my writing."

msgid "二十年前我在兵部做抄手。先帝的原令发到兵部，存档的底子是我抄的——一句话：寻剑，不得扰民一户。"
msgstr "Twenty years ago I was a copyist at the Ministry of War. When the late Emperor's original decree came down to the Ministry, I copied the file version. One sentence: Seek the sword, and trouble not one household."

msgid "庾大人口述，我落的笔。多出来的三句：征民夫，设关卡，拿人。是哪三句，我写的时候就知道。"
msgstr "Lord Yu dictated, and I set brush to paper. The three lines added: conscript laborers, set up checkpoints, arrest people. Which three—I knew as I wrote them."

msgid "后来他把我要进了府里，做书启。十年了。"
msgstr "Later he had me brought into his mansion as his secretary. Ten years."

msgid "把抄本推回给你，很久没有抬头。"
msgstr " pushes the copy back to you and does not look up for a long while."

msgid "别跟建炎说。……你会跟他说的。"
msgstr "Do not tell Jianyan. ...You will tell him."

msgid "抄本？我抄过的东西多了。拿来我看看。"
msgstr "The copy? I have copied a great many things. Bring it, let me see."

msgid "抄谱"
msgstr "Copy Manuals"

msgid "把一叠写满了的纸压在砚台底下。"
msgstr " presses a stack of closely written pages under the inkstone."

msgid "步玄七诀的谱子，父亲那一辈就散了。建炎记得剑，我记得字——拼起来，是一部谱。"
msgstr "The manuals of the Mystic Step Seven Secrets were scattered in Father's generation. Jianyan remembers the sword, I remember the words—put together, they make one manual."

msgid "抄完了，给他的弟子们一人一本。"
msgstr "When it is done, each of his disciples gets a copy."

msgid "骆云舟一身风尘，扇子插在腰后，站在相国府的厅上。十年没回京城，他站的地方离门槛只有一步。\n"
msgstr "Luo Yunzhou, travel-worn, a fan tucked behind his waist, stands in the hall of the Chancellor's House. Ten years away from the Capital, and he stands only one step from the threshold.\n"

msgid "我进京不是来打架的。"
msgstr "I did not come to the Capital to fight."

msgid "让大哥作证：骆建章写供状、上堂，说出兵部抄本上多出来的三句是庾子建口述、他落的笔。\n第九章还没定的，朝上揭发多一样人证；庾子建已经下了狱的，大哥照实供，代笔矫令，判流放关北；私了过、或者先解了皇叔通缉的，供状送进刑部、抄一份给乔阴程不平，庾子建的案子重开。\n骆家从此和朝廷翻脸：正月十七虹台上，步玄这一票投旧盟主——兵部的旧案，查到底（已经入了虹台的席的，这一票不再跟着变）。\n要这么办吗？"
msgstr "Have your elder brother testify: Luo Jianzhang writes a statement and goes to court, saying that the three extra lines on the Ministry of War's copy were dictated by Yu Zijian and written down by him.\nIf Chapter 9 is not yet settled, the denunciation at court gains one more witness. If Yu Zijian is already in prison, your elder brother confesses truthfully—forging an order as a scribe—and is sentenced to exile Beyond the Pass. If the matter was settled privately, or the Imperial Uncle's warrant was lifted first, the statement goes to the Ministry of Justice and a copy to Cheng Buping of Tallshade, and Yu Zijian's case is reopened.\nThe Luo family breaks with the court from now on: on the seventeenth of the first month on the Rainbow Terrace, Mystic Step's vote goes to the old Alliance Leader—the old case at the Ministry of War will be pursued to the end (if you have already taken a seat on the Rainbow Terrace, this vote will not change again).\nDo it this way?"

msgid "这是骆家的事，不劳你了。"
msgstr "This is a Luo family matter. We will not trouble you."

msgid "大哥说了。骆家写了五代的字，总算有一回写的是真话。"
msgstr "Big Brother has spoken. The Luo family has written for five generations, and for once what it wrote was true."

msgid "说好了回乔阴。抄本的事，不提了。"
msgstr "It is agreed that we go back to Tallshade. The matter of the copy is not mentioned again."

msgid "庾子建已经在天牢里了。刑部要的是一句真话——是谁口述的，大哥，你去说。"
msgstr "Yu Zijian is already in the Heavenly Prison. The Ministry of Justice wants one true sentence—who dictated it. Big Brother, go and say it."

msgid "骆建章放下笔，站了很久。韦执中叫人备了车，送他去刑部。\n"
msgstr "Luo Jianzhang puts down his brush and stands a long while. Wei Zhizhong has a carriage readied and sends him to the Ministry of Justice.\n"

msgid "那天下午，刑部的堂上，骆建章照实供了：抄本是庾子建口述、他落的笔；原令只有一句，多出来的三句，他写的时候就知道。供状画了押。\n"
msgstr "That afternoon, in the hall of the Ministry of Justice, Luo Jianzhang confessed truthfully: the copy was dictated by Yu Zijian and written by his hand; the original order was one line, and the three extra lines he knew about as he wrote them. He signed the statement.\n"

msgid "代笔矫令，知情不报——刑部判了流放，关北。\n"
msgstr "Forging an order as a scribe, and failing to report it—the Ministry of Justice sentenced him to exile Beyond the Pass.\n"

msgid "大哥的字，比我的剑直。骆家的门匾，我回去摘。"
msgstr "Big Brother's writing is straighter than my sword. The Luo plaque—I will go back and take it down."

msgid "朝上那件事是了了，庾子建还在兵部。可原令烧了，案子没烧。"
msgstr "The matter at court is done, but Yu Zijian is still at the Ministry of War. The original order was burned; the case was not."

msgid "骆建章提笔写了一张供状：兵部抄本，庾子建口述，骆建章落笔；原令只有一句，多出来的三句——征民夫，设关卡，拿人。写完，按了手印。\n"
msgstr "Luo Jianzhang takes up his brush and writes out a statement: the Ministry of War's copy, dictated by Yu Zijian, written by Luo Jianzhang; the original order was one line, and the three extra lines were—conscript laborers, set up checkpoints, arrest people. When he finishes, he presses his thumbprint.\n"

msgid "韦执中接过供状看了一遍：一份进刑部，一份抄了送乔阴的程不平。这桩案子，重开。\n"
msgstr "Wei Zhizhong takes the statement and reads it through: one copy to the Ministry of Justice, one copied and sent to Cheng Buping of Tallshade. This case is reopened.\n"

msgid "骆家跟朝廷，从今天起翻了脸。……也好。"
msgstr "From today the Luo family and the court are at odds. ...Just as well."

msgid "大哥，写下来。是谁口述的，哪三句，按个手印。"
msgstr "Big Brother, write it down. Who dictated it, which three lines, and put your thumbprint to it."

msgid "韦执中接过供状看了一遍，收进袖子里。这是他今天开的第一句口：你上殿揭发那天，这是一样人证。建章住在老夫这里，刑部要人，老夫交。\n"
msgstr "Wei Zhizhong takes the statement, reads it through and tucks it into his sleeve. These are the first words he has spoken today: \"The day you go before the court to denounce, this is one more witness. Jianzhang stays with this old man. If the Ministry of Justice wants him, this old man will hand him over.\"\n"

msgid "作证？"
msgstr "Testify?"

msgid "大哥就在那边案上。十年了，他还是先磨墨，后说话。"
msgstr "Big Brother is right over there at the desk. Ten years, and he still grinds his ink first and speaks after."

msgid "大哥？在韦相国这里。"
msgstr "Big Brother? He is with Chancellor Wei here."

msgid "十年没回来了。西街还是那么窄，相国府还是这么寒酸。"
msgstr "Ten years since I was back. West Street is as narrow as ever, and the Chancellor's House as shabby."

msgid "站在厅门里，扇子没有打开。十年没回京城，他在门槛外头站了很久，才跨进来。"
msgstr " stands inside the hall door, his fan unopened. After ten years away from the Capital, he stood outside the threshold a long while before stepping in."

msgid "大哥。"
msgstr "Big Brother."

msgid "从案边抬起头，手里的笔停在半空。"
msgstr " looks up from the desk, the brush in his hand stopped in midair."

msgid "建炎。……你还是那么站，一只脚在门外。"
msgstr "Jianyan. ...You still stand like that, one foot outside the door."

msgid "坐在上首，端着一碗茶，看了兄弟俩一眼，没有说话。"
msgstr " sits at the head of the room holding a bowl of tea, glances at the two brothers, and says nothing."

msgid "抄本上那三句，是你的字。"
msgstr "The three lines in the copy are in your writing."

msgid "大哥，你上堂。是谁口述的，说出来——骆家写了五代的字，不能替人写这种东西。"
msgstr "Big Brother, go to court. Say who dictated it—the Luo family has written for five generations, and cannot write this kind of thing for another man."

msgid "上堂？我上了堂，骆家五代的门匾就摘了。父亲的名字，要跟着庾子建一起进卷宗。"
msgstr "Go to court? If I go to court, the plaque of five generations of the Luo family comes down. Father's name goes into the files together with Yu Zijian's."

msgid "跟我回乔阴吧。抄本的事，让它烂在兵部。"
msgstr "Come back to Tallshade with me. The matter of the copy—let it rot in the Ministry of War."

msgid "信是你送的，抄本也是你带来的。大哥上堂，还是跟我回家——你说。"
msgstr "You brought the letter, and you brought the copy. Does Big Brother go to court, or go home with me? You say."

msgid "（作证，问骆云舟「作证」；保住骆家，问骆建章「回家」。）\n"
msgstr "(To testify, ask Luo Yunzhou about \"Testify.\" To keep the Luo family safe, ask Luo Jianzhang about \"Go Home.\")\n"

msgid "乔阴樵夫"
msgstr "Tallshade woodcutter"

msgid "一个黑瘦的汉子，裹着两床被子躺在草垫上，脸色青白，嘴唇发紫。露在被子外面的那条胳膊上，三道青黑的爪痕，不流血，边上结着一层白霜似的东西。\n"
msgstr "A dark, thin man wrapped in two quilts, lying on a straw mat, his face blue-white and his lips purple. On the arm that sticks out of the quilts are three blue-black claw marks that do not bleed, rimmed with something like white frost.\n"

msgid "老葛裹着两床被子，还在打哆嗦。\n"
msgstr "Old Ge, wrapped in two quilts, is still shivering.\n"

msgid "老葛的牙齿咯咯作响：冷……冷……\n"
msgstr "Old Ge's teeth chatter: \"Cold... cold...\"\n"

msgid "老葛望着屋顶，喃喃地说：树王坟……那东西……\n"
msgstr "Old Ge stares at the roof and mutters: \"The Tree King's Tomb... that thing...\"\n"

msgid "我……我连起都起不来……"
msgstr "I... I can't even get up..."

msgid "你把老葛扶起来，一勺一勺地把汤药喂了下去。\n"
msgstr "You help Old Ge up and feed him the medicine soup, a spoonful at a time.\n"

msgid "喝完了药，额头上冒出一层细汗，嘴唇却还是紫的。"
msgstr " finishes the medicine, and a thin sweat breaks out on his forehead, but his lips are still purple."

msgid "热……肚子里是热的。可这条胳膊……还是冷，冷到骨头缝里。"
msgstr "Warm... my belly's warm. But this arm... still cold. Cold to the marrow."

msgid "药僧伸手按了按那三道爪痕，脸色变了：「寒气退不下去。方丈的方子……压不住。」\n"
msgstr "The Medicine Monk presses a hand on the three claw marks, and his face changes: \"The chill won't go down. The Abbot's prescription... can't hold it.\"\n"

msgid "你把汤药喂老葛喝了下去。他还是在发抖。\n"
msgstr "You feed Old Ge the decoction. He is still shaking.\n"

msgid "我……我拿不住东西。"
msgstr "I... I can't hold anything."

msgid "一低头进了流云轩，那只独眼在满墙的药柜上扫了一圈。"
msgstr " ducks into Drifting Cloud Lodge, his one eye sweeping the walls of medicine cabinets."

msgid "药僧手里的药杵「当」地掉在地上：「你……外人不进流云轩！」\n"
msgstr "The Medicine Monk's pestle drops to the floor with a clang: \"You... outsiders don't enter Drifting Cloud Lodge!\"\n"

msgid "让开。"
msgstr "Move aside."

msgid "在老葛身边盘膝坐下，一只手掌按在那三道青黑的爪痕上。"
msgstr " sits cross-legged beside Old Ge and lays one palm on the three blue-black claw marks."

msgid "头陀的手掌一点一点红了起来，屋里一股焦味，像是什么东西烧着了。老葛浑身一抖，爪痕上冒起一缕白气。\n"
msgstr "The ascetic's palm reddens bit by bit; the room fills with a scorched smell, as if something were burning. Old Ge shudders all over, and a wisp of white vapor rises from the claw marks.\n"

msgid "热……热乎了！"
msgstr "Warm... it's warm!"

msgid "一骨碌坐了起来，看看自己的胳膊，又看看头陀，说不出话。"
msgstr " sits bolt upright, looks at his arm, then at the ascetic, and cannot speak."

msgid "收回手掌，长出了一口气，那只独眼里的光暗了一暗。"
msgstr " draws back his palm and lets out a long breath, the light in his one eye dimming a little."

msgid "赶干净了。"
msgstr "Driven out clean."

msgid "你想问我这门内功？……这经，是从番坊来的。番坊的日陀罗寺。"
msgstr "You want to ask about this neigong? ...This sutra came from the Foreign Quarter. From Ritola Temple there."

msgid "药僧已经一溜烟跑去前殿报方丈了。\n"
msgstr "The Medicine Monk has already scurried off to the front hall to tell the Abbot.\n"

msgid "伤"
msgstr "Wound"

msgid "裹紧了被子，牙齿咯咯地响。"
msgstr " pulls the quilts tight, teeth chattering."

msgid "药是热的，下了肚……还是冷。冷到骨头缝里。"
msgstr "The medicine was hot, and I swallowed it... still cold. Cold to the marrow."

msgid "哆嗦着把袖子捋起来：小臂上三道青黑的爪痕，不流血，摸上去冰凉。"
msgstr " shivers as he rolls up his sleeve: three blue-black claw marks on the forearm, bloodless, ice-cold to the touch."

msgid "那天擦黑，我在乔阴树王坟那边砍柴……坟后头钻出来一个青脸的东西，眼眶里两点青火，一爪子抓过来。"
msgstr "At dusk that day I was cutting firewood by the Tree King's Tomb in Tallshade... a green-faced thing came out from behind the tomb, two points of green fire in its eye sockets, and swiped a claw at me."

msgid "伤口是冷的。不疼，就是冷，冷到骨头里。"
msgstr "The wound is cold. It doesn't hurt, it's just cold, cold into the bone."

msgid "树王坟那截大树桩，乔阴人都不敢靠近。我贪那边的柴好……那东西，就是从坟后头的石缝边上钻出来的。"
msgstr "That big tree stump at the Tree King's Tomb—nobody in Tallshade dares go near it. I was greedy for the firewood there... that thing came out from the cracks in the rocks behind the tomb."

msgid "乔阴北门外，我家就在那儿。砍了二十年柴，没见过那种东西。"
msgstr "Outside Tallshade's north gate, that's where my house is. Twenty years cutting firewood, and I never saw anything like that."

msgid "一个黑瘦的汉子，肩上扛着一捆柴，腰里别着一把柴刀。小臂上三道爪痕，已经褪成了浅褐色。\n"
msgstr "A dark, thin man with a bundle of firewood on his shoulder and a woodcutter's knife at his belt. The three claw marks on his forearm have faded to light brown.\n"

msgid "老葛把肩上的柴卸下来，坐在城门边的石墩上歇脚。\n"
msgstr "Old Ge sets his firewood down and sits on the stone block by the city gate to rest.\n"

msgid "恩人，这可使不得。"
msgstr "Savior, this won't do."

msgid "扛着一捆柴从北门外进来，看见你，把柴往地上一扔。"
msgstr " comes in from outside the north gate with a bundle of firewood, sees you, and flings the firewood to the ground."

msgid "恩人！那头陀一掌按下来，烫得我叫出了声——第二天就能抡斧头了。"
msgstr "Savior! That ascetic's palm came down, so hot I yelled out loud—and next day I could swing an axe!"

msgid "……他那只眼睛，你见过吗？瞎的那只，眼皮底下是红的，像烧过。"
msgstr "...His eye—have you seen it? The blind one, under the lid it's red, like it's been burned."

msgid "坐在北门边的石墩上，右手吊在胸前，左手拿着柴刀，削一根木棍。"
msgstr " sits on the stone block by the north gate, right hand slung against his chest, whittling a stick with the knife in his left."

msgid "是你啊。命是方丈守回来的，三天三夜，没合眼。"
msgstr "Oh, it's you. The Abbot brought my life back—three days and nights, never closed his eyes."

msgid "抬了抬那只吊着的右手，抬不起来。"
msgstr " tries to lift the slung right hand, and cannot."

msgid "……这只手，抡不动斧头了。往后砍柴，用左手。"
msgstr "...This hand can't swing an axe anymore. From now on I cut firewood with my left."

msgid "好了，全好了。那头陀的手，热得跟炭一样。"
msgstr "Fine, all better. That ascetic's hand was hot as charcoal."

msgid "命保住了。右手废了——方丈说，寒气在骨头里待太久，赶不出来了。"
msgstr "I kept my life. The right hand's gone—the Abbot said the cold stayed in the bone too long to be driven out."

msgid "伤？好了。"
msgstr "The wound? It's healed."

msgid "树王坟？再也不去了。柴不好砍，命要紧。"
msgstr "The Tree King's Tomb? Never again. The firewood's hard to cut, and life matters more."

msgid "一个八九岁的男孩，脸冻得发青，嘴唇发紫，背上趴着他的妹妹小翠，两只小手死死搂着他的脖子。\n"
msgstr "A boy of eight or nine, his face frozen blue and his lips purple, his little sister Xiaocui on his back, her two small hands clinging to his neck.\n"

msgid "阿牛缩在石头后面，牙齿咯咯地响。\n"
msgstr "Aniu huddles behind a rock, his teeth chattering.\n"

msgid "小翠趴在阿牛背上，抽抽搭搭地哭，哭不出声。\n"
msgstr "Xiaocui lies on Aniu's back, sobbing and sobbing, unable to cry out loud.\n"

msgid "阿牛小声说：别出声……它们会听见的……\n"
msgstr "Aniu whispers: \"Don't make a sound... they'll hear...\"\n"

msgid "别……别打我……"
msgstr "D-don't hit me..."

msgid "阿牛背着小翠跟在你后头，一手攥着你的衣角。\n"
msgstr "Aniu follows behind you with his sister on his back, one hand clutching the hem of your clothes.\n"

msgid "阿牛小声问：娘会不会打我？\n"
msgstr "Aniu asks in a small voice: \"Will Mom hit me?\"\n"

msgid "阿牛把脸埋在他娘的围裙里。\n"
msgstr "Aniu buries his face in his mother's apron.\n"

msgid "到家了。"
msgstr "We're home."

msgid "嗯！"
msgstr "Mm!"

msgid "从石头后面探出头来，看看地上的鬼卒，又看看你。"
msgstr " pokes his head out from behind the rock, looks at the Ghost Soldier on the ground, then at you."

msgid "它们……不动了？"
msgstr "They... they've stopped moving?"

msgid "把背上的小翠往上托了托，一只手攥住了你的衣角。"
msgstr " hitches Xiaocui higher on his back, and one hand clutches the hem of your clothes."

msgid "我要回家。娘会打我的……我不怕。"
msgstr "I want to go home. Mom will hit me... I'm not afraid."

msgid "缩在石头后面，背上的小翠已经哭不出声了。"
msgstr " huddles behind the rock; Xiaocui on his back has no cry left in her."

msgid "有……有鬼……青脸的……别出声，它们会听见的……"
msgstr "There's... there's ghosts... green faces... don't make a sound, they'll hear..."

msgid "小翠"
msgstr "Xiaocui"

msgid "小翠说门缝里有光，一闪一闪的……我们就钻进来了。"
msgstr "Xiaocui said there was light in the crack of the door, flickering... so we crawled in."

msgid "门上那条铁链早锈断了，一推就开。娘不知道我们来过好几回了。"
msgstr "The iron chain on the door rusted through long ago—one push and it opens. Mom doesn't know we've been in lots of times."

msgid "一个四十来岁的主妇，系着围裙，手里还攥着一把长勺，站在路口朝北边的山上张望，嗓子都喊哑了。\n"
msgstr "A housewife of forty or so in an apron, still gripping a long ladle, standing at the road junction and gazing toward the mountain to the north, her voice hoarse from calling.\n"

msgid "妇人朝着北边的山上喊：阿牛——！小翠——！\n"
msgstr "The woman calls toward the mountain to the north: \"Aniu——! Xiaocui——!\"\n"

msgid "妇人说道：明知山洞那边闹鬼……这两个小鬼，回来看我不打断你们的腿！\n"
msgstr "The woman says: \"They know full well that cave is haunted... those two little devils—wait till they get back, I'll break your legs!\"\n"

msgid "妇人抹了一把眼睛，又朝山上张望。\n"
msgstr "The woman wipes her eyes and looks toward the mountain again.\n"

msgid "你、你要干什么？我家孩子还在山上！"
msgstr "W-what do you want? My children are still up the mountain!"

msgid "看见你身后的阿牛，手里的长勺「当」地掉在地上。"
msgstr " sees Aniu behind you, and the long ladle drops to the ground with a clang."

msgid "娘……"
msgstr "Mom..."

msgid "扑过去把两个孩子搂在怀里，又哭又骂，巴掌举起来，落下去的时候只是摸了摸他们冰凉的脸。"
msgstr " rushes over and clutches both children, weeping and scolding, her palm raised—and when it falls, it only strokes their ice-cold faces."

msgid "叫你们别去！叫你们别去！……"
msgstr "I told you not to go! I told you not to go!..."

msgid "恩人……这、这让我怎么谢你。"
msgstr "Savior... how... how can I ever thank you."

msgid "村长那边，你替我说一声吧。这洞……往后谁也别想再去。"
msgstr "Please tell the village head for me. That cave... nobody is ever to go there again."

msgid "妇人一手拉着一个孩子，往村里去了。\n"
msgstr "The woman leads a child by each hand and goes into the village.\n"

msgid "一把拉住你的袖子。"
msgstr " catches hold of your sleeve."

msgid "你是往山上去的？我家阿牛，背着他妹妹，又钻到北边那个山洞里去了！"
msgstr "Are you heading up the mountain? My Aniu, with his sister on his back, has gone into that cave to the north again!"

msgid "那洞闹鬼，村长拿铁链拴了门的……天都快黑了，还没出来。"
msgstr "That cave is haunted, the village head chained the door... it's nearly dark and they're still not out."

msgid "求你……去问问村长，那门里头到底有什么……"
msgstr "Please... ask the village head what is really behind that door..."

msgid "阿牛！小翠！"
msgstr "Aniu! Xiaocui!"

msgid "阿牛和小翠，钻到北边山洞里去了。那洞闹鬼……"
msgstr "Aniu and Xiaocui went into the cave to the north. That cave is haunted..."

msgid "村长家在广场南边那间石屋。你去问问他「山洞」。"
msgstr "The village head's house is the stone house south of the square. Go and ask him about \"Cave.\""

msgid "那洞闹鬼。村长拴了门的。"
msgstr "That cave is haunted. The village head chained the door."

msgid "一个四十来岁的道人，头上的发茬是剃过之后又蓄起来的，挽成一个小小的髻；道袍洗得发白，手腕上却缠着一串磨得发亮的佛珠。他说话的时候，总要先看一眼佛像下的师父。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist of forty or so, his hair stubble shaved off and grown back, tied in a tiny topknot; his robe is washed pale, yet on his wrist is a string of Buddhist beads rubbed shiny. When he speaks, he always glances first at the Shifu beneath the Buddha.\n"

msgid "首徒"
msgstr "First Disciple"

msgid "了尘拿着扫帚，把佛像前的香灰扫成一小堆。\n"
msgstr "Liaochen sweeps the incense ash before the Buddha into a small heap with a broom.\n"

msgid "了尘捻着腕上的佛珠，嘴唇动了动，没有出声。\n"
msgstr "Liaochen turns the beads on his wrist, his lips moving without a sound.\n"

msgid "师父知道洞里有东西。阵守得住石室，他就不管。"
msgstr "Shifu knows there is something in the cave. As long as the array holds the stone chamber, he does not interfere."

msgid "低头捻着佛珠。"
msgstr " lowers his head, turning the beads."

msgid "……我不是师父。"
msgstr "...I am not Shifu."

msgid "等师父闭上了眼睛，才把你拉到大厅一角。"
msgstr " waits until Shifu has closed his eyes, then draws you to a corner of the hall."

msgid "你进了那个洞？里头……有几个？"
msgstr "You went into that cave? ...How many were in there?"

msgid "听你说完，攥紧了手里的金刚杖，指节都白了。"
msgstr " listens to you finish and tightens his grip on the vajra staff until his knuckles go white."

msgid "两个。一个孩子背着他妹妹，在洞底躲了一天一夜。"
msgstr "Two. A child with his little sister on his back, hiding at the bottom of the cave for a day and a night."

msgid "回头看了一眼佛像下的师父，没有再说下去。"
msgstr " glances back at Shifu beneath the Buddha and says no more."

msgid "青石村北边那个山洞？那道门是村长拴的。洞的北口，就是来这里的荒山路。"
msgstr "The cave north of Bluestone Village? The village head chained that door. The cave's north mouth is the wild mountain road that leads here."

msgid "我是师父头一个徒弟。跟着师父，快三十年了。"
msgstr "I am Shifu's first disciple. Nearly thirty years I have followed Shifu."

msgid "贫道了尘。"
msgstr "This poor Daoist is Liaochen."

msgid "一个独眼的头陀，站在大雄宝殿的佛前，那只独眼望着佛像，背挺得很直。佛前的香案上放着一片贝叶。十年里，他第一次站进了这道金门。\n"
msgstr "A one-eyed ascetic stands before the Buddha in the Mahavira Hall, his one eye on the statue, his back very straight. A palm-leaf page lies on the incense table before the Buddha. In ten years, this is the first time he has come in through the Golden Gate.\n"

msgid "殿上不动刀。"
msgstr "No blades in the hall."

msgid "放在佛前了。收不收，问玄智。"
msgstr "Laid before the Buddha. Whether he accepts it—ask Xuanzhi."

msgid "玄智"
msgstr "Xuanzhi"

msgid "他守了三十年寺规。今天让他自己说。"
msgstr "He kept the temple rules thirty years. Today let him speak for himself."

msgid "龙若法王。他说：收不收，是山烟寺的事。"
msgstr "Dharma King Longruo. He said: whether to accept it is Mountain Mist Temple's business."

msgid "站在佛前，把那片贝叶放在香案上，退后一步。"
msgstr " stands before the Buddha, lays the palm-leaf page on the incense table, and steps back."

msgid "大殿里念经的声音停了。几个僧人从蒲团上抬起头来，看着这个从金门外进来的人。\n"
msgstr "The chanting in the hall stops. A few monks raise their heads from their prayer cushions and look at this man who has come in from beyond the Golden Gate.\n"

msgid "放下念珠，看着香案上那片贝叶，很久没有说话。"
msgstr " puts down his prayer beads and gazes at the palm-leaf page on the incense table, saying nothing for a long while."

msgid "我师父说：收不收，是山烟寺的事。"
msgstr "My master said: whether to accept it is Mountain Mist Temple's business."

msgid "十年前我带着这部经来，你没让我进门。今天我站到殿上来，就问一句——收，还是不收。"
msgstr "Ten years ago I brought this sutra here, and you would not let me through the gate. Today I stand in the hall and ask one thing—accept it, or not."

msgid "三十年前，师父说本寺一脉，不收外来的经。玄尘师弟跟着那位天竺来的法师走了，再没有回来。"
msgstr "Thirty years ago, Shifu said that our line does not accept outside sutras. Junior Brother Xuanchen followed the monk from Tianzhu and never came back."

msgid "老衲守了三十年寺规。守到今天，流云轩里一个樵夫的寒，都赶不出去。"
msgstr "This old monk kept the temple rules thirty years. Kept them to this day—and a woodcutter's chill in Drifting Cloud Lodge could not be driven out."

msgid "施主破过一回寺规，领他进了流云轩。今天又是施主把他领上了殿。"
msgstr "Benefactor broke the rules once and led him into Drifting Cloud Lodge. Today it is Benefactor who has led him into the hall."

msgid "番坊是施主去的，这片叶子也是施主带回来的。施主说吧。"
msgstr "It was Benefactor who went to the Foreign Quarter, and Benefactor who brought this leaf back. Speak, Benefactor."

msgid "（收经，问玄智「收经」；守寺，问玄智「守寺」。）\n"
msgstr "(To accept the sutra, ask Xuanzhi about \"Accept the Sutra.\" To keep the temple rules, ask Xuanzhi about \"Keep the Temple.\")\n"

msgid "一个独眼的头陀，盘腿坐在流云轩的药柜下，瞎眼上还蒙着眼罩，头发照旧束着，身上换了山烟寺的灰布僧衣。他的手掌比常人红，摸过的药罐都是温的。\n"
msgstr "A one-eyed ascetic sits cross-legged beneath the medicine cabinets of Drifting Cloud Lodge, the blind eye still under its patch, his hair bound as ever, a gray Mountain Mist monk's robe in place of his own. His palms are redder than other people's, and every medicine pot he touches is warm.\n"

msgid "独眼头陀把一只手掌按在药罐上，罐里的药咕嘟咕嘟地翻了起来。\n"
msgstr "The One-Eyed Ascetic presses a palm to a medicine pot, and the brew inside bubbles up.\n"

msgid "独眼头陀闭着那只独眼，一动不动，像是睡着了。\n"
msgstr "The One-Eyed Ascetic keeps his one eye shut and does not move, as if asleep.\n"

msgid "流云轩是看病的地方。"
msgstr "Drifting Cloud Lodge is a place for healing."

msgid "火性的经。练它的人，性子要慢——我性子急，所以瞎了一只眼。"
msgstr "A fire-natured sutra. One who practices it must be slow of temper—mine is hasty, so I lost an eye."

msgid "你要学，我教。别的我不教——山烟寺的东西，问方丈。"
msgstr "If you wish to learn, I teach. Nothing else I teach—for Mountain Mist Temple's things, ask the Abbot."

msgid "鬼卒抓的伤，送到流云轩来。我一掌的事。"
msgstr "Wounds from Ghost Soldiers—send them to Drifting Cloud Lodge. One palm, that is all."

msgid "寒"
msgstr "Cold"

msgid "阴寒钻进骨头里，凉药赶不出来。火性的内功赶得出来。"
msgstr "The yin cold sinks into the bone, and cooling medicine cannot drive it out. A fire-natured neigong can."

msgid "方丈让我管流云轩的火。……他是个守规矩的人，为我破了一回。"
msgstr "The Abbot had me tend the fire of Drifting Cloud Lodge. ...He is a man who keeps the rules, and he broke them once for me."

msgid "龙若法王。他说：收不收，是山烟寺的事。山烟寺收了。"
msgstr "Dharma King Longruo. He said: whether to accept it is Mountain Mist Temple's business. Mountain Mist Temple has accepted."

msgid "玄尘师叔？……方丈说，他等这一天，等了三十年。"
msgstr "Uncle Xuanchen? ...The Abbot said he waited for this day for thirty years."

msgid "三十年前跟我师父走的那个人。我没见过他。"
msgstr "The man who left with my shifu thirty years ago. I never met him."

msgid "一封封好的书信，信封上写着：绮云镇 振远镖局 陈剑秋 亲启。\n"
msgstr "A sealed letter, the cover reading: Cloudweave Town. Far-Road Escorts. Chen Jianqiu, to be opened by him in person.\n"

msgid "这封信是要送到陈镖头手里的，不能随便丢。"
msgstr "This letter has to reach Escort Chief Chen's hands. You cannot just throw it away."

msgid "这块布条不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this cloth strip away."

msgid "一截粗麻布条，像是从衣角撕下来的，上面用刀尖刻着一个歪歪扭扭的记号：一棵松、三道横。老松岭一带的人管这叫老松寨的记号。\n"
msgstr "A strip of coarse hemp cloth, as if torn from the hem of a garment, with a crooked mark cut into it with a knife point: one pine, three horizontal strokes. People around Old Pine Ridge call it the mark of Old Pine Stockade.\n"

msgid "一面黄铜腰牌，正面铸着一只展翅的金乌，背面刻着「水烟阁」三字和一个「岭」字。铜面发黑，边角磨得发亮，不知在谁身上挂了多少年。\n"
msgstr "A yellow-brass waist token, a golden crow with spread wings cast on the front, the words \"Waterfog Pavilion\" and the character \"Ling\" cut on the back. The brass is blackened, the corners worn bright; no telling how many years it hung on whose belt.\n"

msgid "这面腰牌不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this token away."

msgid "一张大红的帖子，封皮上烫着两个金字「虹台」，边上磨得起了毛。\n里面写：「正月十七，水烟阁外虹台，九派推选武林盟主。九派各一票，过半者为盟主；不过半，椅子照旧。久闻足下湖底之事，敬请届时莅临。」\n落款是「水烟阁」，盖着一方旧印，印泥的颜色深浅不匀，像是盖了好几回才盖上。\n"
msgstr "A big red invitation, two gilt characters, \"Rainbow Terrace,\" stamped on the cover, its edges worn fuzzy.\nInside it reads: \"On the seventeenth of the first month, at the Rainbow Terrace outside Waterfog Pavilion, the nine schools will choose an Alliance Leader of the wulin. Each of the nine schools has one vote; whoever gains more than half is Leader; if none does, the chair stays as it is. We have long heard of your doings at the bottom of the lake, and respectfully ask you to attend.\"\nSigned \"Waterfog Pavilion,\" with an old seal pressed on, the ink uneven in color, as if stamped several times before it took.\n"

msgid "这张请柬不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this invitation away."

msgid "一封折了又折的信，信封上写着「雪亭镇淳风武馆 柳馆主 亲启」，字歪歪扭扭，一看就是不常拿笔的手。\n信里写：「柳爷：当年您在山里迷了路，是小老儿领您下的山。如今小老儿要走了，这孩子没处去，求您收下。山里老岑。」\n末一行不是字，是几道弯弯的纹，像风。\n"
msgstr "A letter folded over and over, the cover reading \"To Hall Master Liu, Pure Wind Hall, Snow Pavilion, to be opened by him in person\"; the characters are crooked—clearly the hand of someone who seldom holds a brush.\nInside: \"Master Liu: When you were lost in the mountains years ago, it was this humble old man who led you down. Now this old man is going, and the child has nowhere to go. I beg you to take him in.—Old Cen of the mountains.\"\nThe last line is not characters but a few curving marks, like wind.\n"

msgid "这封信不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this letter away."

msgid "一封封好的信，封皮上写着「水烟阁 潘军禅贤弟 亲启」，落款「柳淳风」。封口的火漆上印着一枝柳。\n"
msgstr "A sealed letter, the cover reading \"Waterfog Pavilion, to my worthy brother Pan Junchan, to be opened by him in person,\" signed \"Liu Chunfeng.\" On the wax seal is a sprig of willow.\n"

msgid "一张发黄的镖单，振远镖局的印鉴已经模糊。所押之物写着：水烟阁盟主印一方，密件一匣。起运地关北，收件人水烟阁盟主卫沧澜。末尾一行小字：乙丑年失镖于老松岭瀑布一带，镖师随从无一人生还。\n"
msgstr "A yellowed shipping manifest, the Far-Road Escorts' seal blurred. The goods consigned: one Alliance Leader's seal of Waterfog Pavilion, one case of secret papers. Departure point Beyond the Pass; addressee Wei Canglan, Alliance Leader of Waterfog Pavilion. A line of small characters at the end: Lost in the year Yichou at the waterfall on Old Pine Ridge; the escorts and attendants, not one survived.\n"

msgid "这张镖单不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this manifest away."

msgid "一只尺许长的青石匣子，匣面刻着一圈风纹，匣口严丝合缝，看不出锁眼在哪里。摇一摇，里面有极轻的一声响。\n"
msgstr "A bluestone box about a foot long, a ring of wind patterns carved on its lid, the mouth fitted so tight there is no telling where the lock is. Shake it, and something inside makes one very faint sound.\n"

msgid "这只石匣不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this stone box away."

msgid "对着风"
msgstr "Face the Wind"

msgid "匣子开着，里面空了，只剩匣底一圈铃的印子。\n"
msgstr "The box is open, empty, with only a ring of bell marks left on its floor.\n"

msgid "你把匣子举起来，让匣面那圈风纹对着风来的方向。\n"
msgstr "You lift the box so that the ring of wind patterns faces the direction the wind comes from.\n"

msgid "风灌进匣口的缝里，呜的一声，匣盖自己弹开了。\n"
msgstr "The wind pours into the crack of the box mouth, with a whoo, and the lid springs open by itself.\n"

msgid "匣子里垫着一层朽了的丝绵，丝绵上躺着一只青铜小铃。风一过，它就响了。\n"
msgstr "Inside the box lies a layer of rotted silk floss, and on the floss a small bronze bell. When the wind passes, it rings.\n"

msgid "你把匣子转来转去，匣口的缝严丝合缝，一动不动。这里的风，不是它等的那一阵。\n"
msgstr "You turn the box this way and that; the seam of its mouth is tight and will not budge. The wind here is not the one it is waiting for.\n"

msgid "一辆双轮板车，车上盖着油布，油布底下露出几只箱子的角。车辕上拴着一根粗麻绳，绳子绷得笔直，一头没进北边山壁的裂口里——上头有人在拉。车板上烙着一个「羊」字。\n"
msgstr "A two-wheeled cart, covered with oilcloth, the corners of several crates showing underneath. A thick hemp rope is tied to the shaft, pulled taut as a rod, one end vanishing into a crack in the north cliff—someone above is hauling. The character \"Goat\" is branded on the cart bed.\n"

msgid "一件月白的衣，料子像结了霜的水，摸上去不冷，站在它旁边却觉得凉。衣襟里缝着一行小字：寒於留衣，月神守之，火不能近。守衣人瑷伦说，它挡得住黑焰——几百年没人试过。\n"
msgstr "A moon-white robe, its cloth like frozen water. Touch it and it is not cold, yet standing next to it you feel a chill. Sewn inside the front is a line of small characters: Hanyu left this robe; the Moon God guards it; fire cannot come near. Ailun, the robe's keeper, says it can withstand the black flame—no one has tried in several hundred years.\n"

msgid "这件衣不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this robe away."

msgid "一个婢女倒在前厅的地上，手里还攥着抹布。喉下一道细口，是极细的剑。\n"
msgstr "A maidservant lies on the floor of the front hall, a rag still gripped in her hand. A thin cut beneath her throat, made by a very thin sword.\n"

msgid "昭蓉倒在内厅的门边，像是听见前厅的动静跑出来，没跑到。她的手还搭在门框上。\n"
msgstr "Zhaorong lies by the door of the inner hall, as if she heard the noise in the front hall and ran out, and did not get there. Her hand is still on the door frame.\n"

msgid "一卷发黄的纸，边角磨得起了毛，叠过又展开过许多回。抄的是二十年前兵部颁下的寻剑令，一句：「寻剑，不得扰民一户。」底下另起一行，密密地写着一队人的名字——二十三个，每个名字后头点了一个墨点，像在数人。最后一个名字是陈显祖，没有点。\n"
msgstr "A sheet of yellowed paper, its corners worn fuzzy, folded and unfolded many times. It is a copy of the Sword Decree issued by the Ministry of War twenty years ago, one line: \"Seek the sword, and trouble not one household.\" Below, on a new line, are the names of a company of men, written close together—twenty-three, each name followed by an ink dot, as if counting people. The last name is Chen Xianzu, with no dot.\n"

msgid "一封封好的信，火漆上压着乔阴县印，封皮写着「叔父大人亲启」。程不平说：兵部的印是真的，令不是先帝的；假印和失踪的人都往关北去了——这封信替你敲开天驼关军营的门。\n"
msgstr "A sealed letter, the wax pressed with the Tallshade County seal, the cover reading \"To my esteemed uncle, to be opened by him in person.\" Cheng Buping said: the Ministry of War's seal is real, but the order is not the late Emperor's; the false seals and the missing people have all gone Beyond the Pass—this letter will knock open the gate of the Camelback Pass camp for you.\n"

msgid "一把三尺长的剑，剑身是透青的，像一条冻住的水。剑脊上刻着两个字：寒於。剑锋上没有血——三百年，它钉的是一颗头，不是人。握在手里，整条胳膊都是凉的。\n"
msgstr "A sword three feet long, its blade clear green like a frozen stream. Two characters are carved on the spine: Hanyu. There is no blood on the edge—for three hundred years it pinned a head, not a man. Held in the hand, the whole arm turns cool.\n"

msgid "穿灵不能丢。它钉过三百年。"
msgstr "Spiritpiercer cannot be dropped. It has pinned for three hundred years."

msgid "你把剑举到光里。剑脊上两个字：寒於。字下面还有一行小的，是另一只手刻的，刻得很浅：「钉之三百年。杞庸。」\n"
msgstr "You hold the sword up into the light. Two characters on the spine: Hanyu. Below them is a smaller line, cut in another hand, very shallow: \"Pinned three hundred years. Qi Yong.\"\n"

msgid "一片巴掌长的羽毛，浅金色，拿在手里不冷也不热。它不沾水，也不化；放在暗处，边上有一圈很淡的光。璃虹说，再封的时候把它放回坛上，她认得它。\n"
msgstr "A feather as long as a palm, pale gold, neither cold nor warm in the hand. It does not take water and does not melt; in the dark, a very faint ring of light shows at its edge. Lihong said that when the seal is made again, it should be put back on the altar; she will know it.\n"

msgid "这是璃虹的羽，不能丢。"
msgstr "This is Lihong's feather; it cannot be dropped."

msgid "一条从侮天鬼身上拖出来的黑焰，像鞭子一样甩来甩去。焰是黑的，扫过的地方，冰「嗤」地化开一道。\n"
msgstr "A streak of black flame dragged out of the Heaven-Defier, whipping back and forth like a lash. The flame is black; where it sweeps, the ice hisses and melts away in a line.\n"

msgid "黑焰是侮天鬼身上的东西。"
msgstr "The black flame is of the Heaven-Defier's own body."

msgid "一个渔夫倒在岸边的泥里，脸朝下。网还攥在手里，网里什么都没有。背上三个孔，是钢叉。\n"
msgstr "A fisherman lies face down in the mud on the shore. The net is still gripped in his hand, with nothing in it. Three holes in his back, made by a steel fork.\n"

msgid "一函蓝布面的旧书，封签上写着「上清符箓」。前半本是朱砂画的符，一笔一划；后半本的空白处挤满了另一种字——墨色发黑，一行压着一行，像是从火里抢出来的。\n"
msgstr "A case of old books bound in blue cloth, the label slip reading \"Highest Clarity Talismans.\" The first half is talismans drawn in cinnabar, stroke by stroke; in the blank spaces of the second half is crammed another kind of writing—ink gone black, line pressed on line, as if snatched out of a fire.\n"

msgid "这函书不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this case of books away."

msgid "一张素笺折成的小方块，封口没有封，背面写着「大哥亲启」四个字，字写得飞快，最后一笔甩出了格子。\n"
msgstr "A plain sheet folded into a small square, the seal not sealed, the back inscribed with four characters, \"To Big Brother, in person,\" written in haste, the last stroke flung out of the box.\n"

msgid "这封家书不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this letter home away."

msgid "一块乌黑的块根，拳头大小，带着药圃的湿泥，掰开来里面是灰白的。方丈说它回阳。\n"
msgstr "A blackish tuber the size of a fist, with the damp earth of the herb garden still on it, grayish white when broken open. The Abbot says it brings back the yang.\n"

msgid "这是方丈方子上的药，不能随便丢。"
msgstr "This is a herb from the Abbot's prescription; you cannot just throw it away."

msgid "一小包桑皮纸包着的麝香，纸上印着「桑邻药铺」四个字。隔着纸都闻得到那股冲鼻的香。\n"
msgstr "A small packet of musk wrapped in mulberry-bark paper, stamped \"Mulberry Herb Shop.\" Even through the paper you can smell its sharp, pungent scent.\n"

msgid "一株连根拔起的草，叶子八个角，叶下垂着一朵暗红的花，根上还沾着树王坟边的黑土，摸上去凉凉的。\n"
msgstr "A plant pulled up root and all, its leaves eight-pointed, a dark red flower hanging beneath the leaves, black earth from beside the Tree King's Tomb still clinging to the roots, cool to the touch.\n"

msgid "一碗黑褐色的汤药，还烫手，附子的苦味里冲着一股麝香。\n"
msgstr "A bowl of blackish-brown medicine soup, still hot to the hand; in the bitterness of the aconite there is a sharp bite of musk.\n"

msgid "这碗药是煎给樵夫的，不能随便倒掉。"
msgstr "This medicine was brewed for the woodcutter; you cannot just pour it out."

msgid "一张大红的名帖，折成三折。正面一行字：「京师骆氏 骆建炎 拜上 韦相国」，字写得飞快，最后一笔甩出了格子——骆云舟的字。\n"
msgstr "A big red calling card folded in three. On the front, a line: \"Luo Jianyan of the Luo family of the Capital respectfully calls on Chancellor Wei,\" the writing hasty, the last stroke flung out of the box—Luo Yunzhou's hand.\n"

msgid "这张名帖不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this calling card away."

msgid "一封没有封皮的信，字是庾子建的，一笔不苟：「湖底之事，子时前办妥。人已送去北麓，勿再来府。」信尾没有落款，只盖了一方小印——兵部尚书私印。\n"
msgstr "A letter without an envelope, in Yu Zijian's hand, not a stroke careless: \"The matter at the lake bottom, to be done before midnight. The man has been sent to the North Foot; do not come to the mansion again.\" The letter is unsigned, only a small seal pressed on it—the Minister of War's private seal.\n"

msgid "一张黄纸符，朱砂画的符纹弯弯绕绕，纸角写着一行小字：「茅山 障眼」。带在身上，夜里巡夜的人眼睛短一截。\n"
msgstr "A yellow paper talisman, the cinnabar pattern winding and looping, a line of small characters at the corner: \"Mount Mao: Blind the Eye.\" Carry it, and the eyes of the night watch see a stretch short.\n"

msgid "这张符不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this talisman away."

msgid "一块黄杨木腰牌，正面刻着一座山，背面一个「逄」字，包浆很厚，是戴了十几年的东西。系绳上还拴着一枚竹筹，烙着「绮云 · 赌」三个字。\n"
msgstr "A boxwood waist token, a mountain carved on the front, the character \"Pang\" on the back, its patina thick—something worn a dozen years and more. A bamboo tally is tied to the cord, branded \"Cloudweave · Gambling.\"\n"

msgid "一张折得很小的薄纸，没有抬头，也没有落款，只有几行蝇头小字：「阁中椅子空否。卫某生死、所在。阁里谁与谁近。正月十七，几派到。」\n"
msgstr "A thin slip of paper folded very small, no heading and no signature, only a few lines in tiny script: \"Is the chair in the Pavilion empty? Wei's life or death, and where he is. Who in the Pavilion is close to whom. On the seventeenth of the first month, which schools will come.\"\n"

msgid "一张水烟阁的笺纸，潘军禅的字龙飞凤舞：「振远镖局陈剑秋兄：二十年前老松岭失镖之镖单，请交来人带回水烟阁。潘军禅。」下面盖着执法使的朱印。\n"
msgstr "A sheet of Waterfog Pavilion letter paper, Pan Junchan's writing flying like a dragon: \"To Chen Jianqiu of the Far-Road Escorts, my elder brother: The shipping manifest for the shipment lost at Old Pine Ridge twenty years ago—please hand it to the bearer to bring back to Waterfog Pavilion. Pan Junchan.\" Below it the Enforcer's red seal.\n"

msgid "这张手令不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this warrant away."

msgid "一辆翻倒在路边的双轮板车，车辕断了，油布扯成了一条一条。箱子全被撬开了，里面是空的。车板上烙着一个「羊」字，车辕上钉着一道黄符——茅山的符。\n"
msgstr "A two-wheeled cart overturned at the roadside, the shaft broken, the oilcloth torn to strips. All the crates have been pried open and are empty. The character \"Goat\" is branded on the cart bed, and a yellow talisman is nailed to the shaft—Mount Mao's talisman.\n"

msgid "一个穿黑衣的人脸朝下伏在芦苇丛里，泥水没过了半边脸。背上三个孔，是钢叉。右手攥成拳，压在身子底下。\n"
msgstr "A man in black lies face down in the reeds, muddy water over half his face. Three holes in his back, from a steel fork. His right hand is clenched in a fist and pressed under his body.\n"

msgid "一块赤铜铸的令牌，比黑木令沉得多。正面刻着火焰的图腾，背面一个「东」字。神教里，只有替神教办成过事的人才拿得到它。\n"
msgstr "A token cast of red copper, much heavier than a black-wood token. A flame totem is carved on the front, the character \"East\" on the back. In the Order, only those who have got something done for it can get one.\n"

msgid "一把铁打的冰凿，木柄磨得油亮，凿尖上还结着冰碴。柄上缠着几圈旧布，布上有补丁。\n"
msgstr "An iron ice chisel, its wooden handle rubbed greasy-bright, ice crumbs still on the tip. A few turns of old cloth are wound on the handle, with patches on the cloth.\n"

msgid "一张炭条画的图：黄石隘口的山壁，山壁下一个土坑，坑沿量了尺寸。旁边一行小字：「起匣处。山底下或另有一只，待查。」落款兵部职方司。\n"
msgstr "A sketch drawn in charcoal: the cliff wall of Yellow Rock Pass, an earth pit beneath it, the lip of the pit measured. Beside it a line of small writing: \"Where the box was lifted. Perhaps another beneath the mountain—to be checked.\" Signed: Bureau of Operations, Ministry of War.\n"

msgid "一张大红的名帖，折成两折，正面一个斗大的「镖」字，底下一行：「振远镖局 陈天星 拜上」。背面是陈天星亲笔的一句：「持帖者，振远的朋友。」\n"
msgstr "A big red calling card folded in two, a huge character \"Escort\" on the front, and below it a line: \"Far-Road Escorts, Chen Tianxing respectfully calls.\" On the back, in Chen Tianxing's own hand: \"The bearer is a friend of Far-Road.\"\n"

msgid "一张折得发软的信纸，字是托人写的，歪歪扭扭：「……镖走到老松岭口，兵部的人在岭上等着，镖头说照走。爹这趟回来，给平儿买一把好刀。」落款：乙丑年 贺长庚。\n"
msgstr "A sheet of letter paper folded soft, the writing done by a hired hand, crooked: \"...The escort has reached the mouth of Old Pine Ridge. The Ministry of War's men wait on the ridge, and the escort chief says go on as planned. When Dad comes back from this trip, he'll buy Ping'er a good knife.\" Signed: Year Yichou, He Changgeng.\n"

msgid "这封家信不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this letter from home away."

msgid "一叠折得整整齐齐的卖身契，八张，张张按着红手印，盖着兵部的戳。头一张写着：「槐阳城外王家，夫役欠一年，以妻抵。」\n"
msgstr "A neat stack of folded indentures, eight sheets, each pressed with a red thumbprint and stamped by the Ministry of War. The first reads: \"Wang family outside Huaiyang city: laborer owes a year of service; wife pledged against it.\"\n"

msgid "这叠卖身契不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this stack of indentures away."

msgid "一块黑漆木腰牌，巴掌大，正面阴刻「乔阴县捕」四个字，背面烙着县印，穿着一根褪了色的红绳。\n"
msgstr "A black-lacquered wooden waist badge the size of a palm, the four characters \"Tallshade County Constable\" cut into the front, the county seal branded on the back, a faded red cord threaded through it.\n"

msgid "一叠空白的路引，纸是关上的公文纸，每一张左下角都盖着同一方朱红大印：「天驼关铁卫营」。只等填上名字。印泥一样的旧，像是同一天盖下去的。\n"
msgstr "A stack of blank travel passes on official paper from the Pass, each with the same vermilion seal stamped at the lower left: \"Camelback Pass Iron Guard Camp.\" Only the names are left to fill in. The seal ink is equally old on every sheet, as if all were stamped on the same day.\n"

msgid "这叠路引不能随便丢。"
msgstr "You cannot just throw this stack of passes away."

msgid "出了葬剑亭往南，一道白石阶梯顺着一条窄窄的山脊爬上去，两边都是深谷。谷底的水雾一阵一阵涌上来，把石阶打得湿漉漉的，石缝里长满了青苔。\n抬头望去，山巅上竖着一根石柱，那便是虹台中央的「擎天柱」。\n"
msgstr "South of the Sword Tomb Pavilion, a white stone stair climbs along a narrow ridge, a deep gorge on either side. Water mist surges up from the gorge floor in waves, soaking the steps, and moss fills the cracks between the stones.\nLooking up, you see a stone pillar standing on the summit—the \"sky pillar\" at the center of the Rainbow Terrace.\n"

msgid "这里便是水烟阁外的「虹台」，山巅上一座白石砌成的圆台，石面被风雨磨得发白，裂缝里嵌着泥和草籽。正中竖着一根两丈多高的石柱，便是「擎天柱」，柱前一只铜香炉，炉里的灰早就冷了。\n台边一圈九个石旗座，旗杆光秃秃的——每年的正月十七，九派的旗插在上面，在这里推选武林盟主。旗座圈里，南边一把石椅背对着深谷，椅面上积着落叶。\n三面都是深不见底的深谷，往西便是虹谷断崖。虹台地势虽不甚高，但是在三面深谷的环绕下，却自有一股群山朝拜的威严气象。\n"
msgstr "This is the \"Rainbow Terrace\" outside Waterfog Pavilion, a round terrace of white stone on the summit, the stone worn pale by wind and rain, mud and grass seed lodged in the cracks. In the center stands a stone pillar over twenty feet high, the \"sky pillar,\" a bronze incense burner before it, the ashes long cold.\nAround the edge is a ring of nine stone flag sockets, the poles bare—every year on the seventeenth of the first month, the flags of the nine schools are planted here, and the wulin's Alliance Leader is chosen. Inside the ring, to the south, a stone chair sits with its back to the gorge, fallen leaves piled on the seat.\nOn three sides is bottomless gorge; to the west is Rainbow Gorge Cliff. Though the Rainbow Terrace is not so high, ringed by the gorges on three sides it has an air of its own, of mountains bowing in homage.\n"

msgid "虹台的白石到这里就断了，脚下是一片突出去的乱石，再往外便是「水烟十景」之中最有名的虹谷断崖。\n谷底终年有水雾升上来，风从谷里往上吹，吹得人衣角乱飞。太阳照着的时候，雾里常挂着一道虹。\n"
msgstr "The white stone of the Rainbow Terrace ends here; underfoot is a jut of jumbled rock, and beyond lies Rainbow Gorge Cliff, the most famous of the \"Ten Views of Waterfog.\"\nMist rises from the gorge floor all year, and the wind blows up from the valley, whipping the hems of your clothes about. When the sun shines, a rainbow often hangs in the mist.\n"

msgid "破旧的栈道到这里到了头。崖上的松树比下面密得多，树冠遮去了大半天光，\n地上一条踩出来的小径往东去，南边树隙间透着山涧的水声，北边的林子更深。\n小径旁好几株松树的树干上有刀划的记号。\n"
msgstr "The ruined plank road ends here. The pines on the cliff are much denser than those below, their crowns shutting out most of the daylight,\nwhile a trodden path runs east along the ground. Through gaps in the trees to the south comes the sound of a mountain stream, and the forest to the north is deeper still.\nOn the trunks of several pines beside the path are knife marks.\n"

msgid "一间圆的冰室，顶上是整块半透明的冰，上面就是冰龙厅的水潭，能看见龙的影子游过去。\n当中一座黑石封坛，坛心一块透明的冰，冰里一颗头，一把剑从头顶直钉下去，剑柄露在冰外。\n坛边一根冰柱，柱里一个女人，眼睛是睁着的；她身上发着白光，光照在冰上，冰就不化。\n这里不冷——她的光照着的地方都不冷。脚下黑石的台阶通上去，是潭口。\n"
msgstr "A round ice chamber, the whole roof one block of half-transparent ice, and above it the pool of the ice dragons' hall—you can see the shadow of a dragon swim past.\nIn the middle stands a black-stone sealing altar; at its heart a clear block of ice, and in the ice a head, a sword driven straight down from the crown, its hilt standing out of the ice.\nBeside the altar is an ice pillar, and in the pillar a woman, her eyes open; she gives off a white light, and where the light falls on the ice, the ice does not melt.\nIt is not cold here—everywhere her light falls is not cold. Black-stone steps lead up from underfoot, to the mouth of the pool.\n"

msgid "进了大门是一个小院子。影壁上的白灰掉了一半，露出底下的青砖。院子里没有花，种的是菜：两畦白菜、一架豆角，一只鸡在菜畦边上刨土。北面的正厅是旧的，柱子上的漆剥得斑斑驳驳。真的寒酸——可是扫得很干净。\n"
msgstr "Through the gate is a small courtyard. Half the whitewash on the screen wall has fallen away, showing the blue brick beneath. No flowers in the yard; vegetables instead: two beds of cabbage, a trellis of beans, a chicken scratching at the edge of a bed. The main hall to the north is old, the lacquer on its pillars peeled and mottled. Truly shabby—but swept very clean.\n"

msgid "正厅里只有几把旧椅子、一张八仙桌，桌上一把缺了嘴的茶壶。墙上挂着一幅字，写的是「先天下之忧而忧」，纸已经黄了，裱的边也卷了。西边一道门通到书房，门里透出灯光，书堆得比人还高。\n"
msgstr "In the main hall are only a few old chairs and an eight-immortals table, with a teapot on it, its spout chipped. A scroll hangs on the wall, reading \"Be first in worrying for the world's worries,\" the paper gone yellow and the mounting's edge curled. A door on the west leads to the study; lamplight shows through it, and the books are piled higher than a man.\n"

msgid "书房里到处是书：架子上、桌上、地上，一摞一摞，有的用绳子捆着，有的摊开着，上面压着砚台。窗下一张榻，榻上一床旧被子——这屋子的主人常常在这里过夜。桌上一盏油灯，灯芯剪得很短。\n"
msgstr "Books everywhere in the study: on the shelves, on the desk, on the floor, stack after stack, some tied with string, some lying open with inkstones pressed on them. Beneath the window is a couch, and on it an old quilt—the master of this room often spends nights here. On the desk a single oil lamp, its wick trimmed very short.\n"

msgid "这是一具硬木削成的练功木人，手臂和腰身装著机括，一碰便会还手。胸前贴著一张褪色的红纸，写著「初阶」两个字，是武馆给初学的弟子拆招用的。\n"
msgstr "This is a practice dummy carved from hardwood, its arms and waist fitted with springs and catches: touch it and it hits back. A faded red slip pasted on its chest reads \"Grade One\". The hall keeps it for beginning disciples to practice parrying on.\n"

msgid "身上的机括「咔嗒」一响，摆好了架势。"
msgstr "'s inner mechanism clicks, and it takes up its stance."

msgid "这是一具硬木削成的练功木人，手臂和腰身装著机括，一碰便会还手。胸前的红纸写著「二阶」，木头上满是拳脚留下的印子。\n"
msgstr "This is a practice dummy carved from hardwood, its arms and waist fitted with springs and catches: touch it and it hits back. The red slip on its chest reads \"Grade Two\". The wood is covered in marks left by fists and feet.\n"

msgid "这是一具铁木削成的练功木人，机括比旁边几具紧得多，还手又快又沉。胸前的红纸写著「三阶」。\n"
msgstr "This is a practice dummy carved from ironwood. Its mechanism is wound far tighter than those beside it, and it hits back fast and heavy. The red slip on its chest reads \"Grade Three\".\n"

msgid "这是一具铁木削成的练功木人，关节处包著铜皮，听说是柳馆主亲手调过机括的。胸前的红纸写著「四阶」。\n"
msgstr "This is a practice dummy carved from ironwood, its joints wrapped in copper sheeting. They say Master Liu adjusted its mechanism himself. The red slip on its chest reads \"Grade Four\".\n"

msgid "这具木人通体乌黑，是一整块铁木雕成的，机括藏在里头看不见。胸前的红纸写著「五阶」，武馆里能把它打得摇晃的人没有几个。\n"
msgstr "This dummy is black from head to foot, carved from a single block of ironwood, its mechanism hidden where no one can see it. The red slip on its chest reads \"Grade Five\". Few in the hall can hit it hard enough to make it sway.\n"

msgid "一个贼眉鼠眼的毛贼，衣衫上补丁叠著补丁，腰间却鼓鼓囊囊的，不知又从谁家摸来了什么。雪亭驿的告示上正画著他的像。\n"
msgstr "A sneak-eyed petty thief in a coat patched upon patches, yet his waist bulges. Who knows whose house he has robbed this time? His likeness is on the notice at Snow Pavilion Post Station.\n"

msgid "一个满脸横肉的汉子，专在山路上拦人剪径，不知劫过多少过往的客商。雪亭驿的告示上正画著他的像。\n"
msgstr "A heavy-jowled brute who waylays travelers on the mountain roads. Who knows how many passing merchants he has robbed. His likeness is on the notice at Snow Pavilion Post Station.\n"

msgid "一个油头粉面的年轻人，手里摇著一柄折扇，眼神却阴鸷得很。官府悬赏捉拿他已有好些日子了。\n"
msgstr "A slick young man with oiled hair and a powdered face, fanning himself with a folding fan, his eyes cold and cruel. The authorities have had a bounty out on him for some time now.\n"

msgid "一个虬髯大汉，身上带著好几处刀疤，据说在江北做过好几票大买卖，官府悬了重赏要他的人头。\n"
msgstr "A big man with a wild curling beard and several saber scars. They say he has pulled off a good many big jobs north of the river. The authorities have posted a heavy reward for his head.\n"

msgid "一个面色青白的中年人，目光扫过来便叫人背脊发凉。告示上说他一夜之间屠了邻县一户人家，官府悬了最重的赏。\n"
msgstr "A pale, blue-faced man in middle age; one sweep of his gaze sends a chill down your back. The notice says he butchered a whole household in the next county in a single night. The authorities have posted the highest reward.\n"

msgid "玉螺湖那一夜烧了半个村子——是你拔的剑。……拔了就往前走，别回头。"
msgstr "The night half of Jade Conch Village burned—you were the one who drew the sword... Once drawn, walk on. Do not look back."

msgid "你在湖底没动那把剑。老夫活了五十八年，见过的人十个有九个会动。"
msgstr "You left that sword alone at the bottom of the lake. This old man has lived fifty-eight years, and of ten men I have met, nine would have touched it."

msgid "一个鬓发斑白的老者，一身素白的武官袍服，腰背挺得笔直，坐在广场中间的木凳上不动如山。四面探头探脑的武林人没有一个敢靠得太近。\n"
msgstr "A gray-templed old man in the plain white robe of a court officer, his back straight as a spear, seated on a wooden bench in the middle of the square, immovable as a mountain. None of the wulin folk peering in from all sides dares come near.\n"

msgid "寻剑"
msgstr "Seek the Sword"

msgid "奉旨寻剑。先帝没寻到的那一把，皇上要寻到。"
msgstr "By imperial decree we seek the sword. The one the late Emperor never found, His Majesty means to find."

msgid "大声点，让众位兄弟都听见了。"
msgstr "Louder. Let all the brothers hear it."

msgid "信使一怔，随即大声说道：「方位是在西南二十四里，黄石隘口。」"
msgstr "The messenger starts, then calls out, \"The bearing is southwest, twenty-four li—Yellow Rock Pass.\""

msgid "那不是你该去的地方。"
msgstr "That is no place for you."

msgid "奉旨办差，闲人少问。"
msgstr "On imperial business. Idlers should ask fewer questions."

msgid "湖底的事，算老夫一个。大内侍卫营还有三十个能打的——你开口，他们跟老夫走。"
msgstr "Count this old man in for what lies at the lake bottom. The Palace Guard Barracks has thirty more who can fight. Say the word, and they follow me."

msgid "湖底？老夫守的是宫门，不是湖。"
msgstr "The lake bottom? This old man guards the palace gate, not a lake."

msgid "刀谱给过你了。练到四十，剩下的在刀上，不在谱上。"
msgstr "You already have the manual. Train it to forty; what remains is in the blade, not in the manual."

msgid "从值房的抽屉里摸出一册蓝布面的小本子。"
msgstr " pulls a small, blue-clothbound booklet from a drawer in the duty room."

msgid "侍卫营的刀，叫禁中刀。七招，招招在宫门里头——拿去。"
msgstr "The Guard's blade is called the Palace Blade. Seven moves, every one of them inside the palace gates. Take it."

msgid "下湖之前，你学两招侍卫营的刀。七招，招招在宫门里头——拿去。"
msgstr "Before you go down to the lake, learn two moves of the Guard's blade. Seven moves, every one of them inside the palace gates. Take it."

msgid "侍卫营的刀谱，不外传。"
msgstr "The Guard's blade manual is not passed outside."

msgid "一个瘦削的老者，白袍，坐在冯策身侧半步之后，眼睛半开半合，手里捏着一串核桃慢慢地转。\n"
msgstr "A gaunt old man in a white robe, seated half a step behind Feng Ce, his eyes half closed, slowly turning a string of walnuts in his hand.\n"

msgid "老夫只是陪冯总教头走一趟。寻剑的事，问他去。"
msgstr "This old man only came along with Chief Instructor Feng. As for the sword hunt, ask him."

msgid "方位信使已经报过了，还问老夫？"
msgstr "The messenger has already reported the bearing. Why ask this old man?"

msgid "一个身著白衣的朝廷武官，腰悬长剑，站得笔直，目不斜视。\n"
msgstr "A court officer in white, a long sword at his waist, standing straight, eyes fixed ahead.\n"

msgid "一个风尘满面的信使，白袍下摆沾著泥点，刚从马上跳下来，气还没喘匀。\n"
msgstr "A dust-covered messenger, the hem of his white robe splashed with mud. He has just leapt from his horse and has not caught his breath.\n"

msgid "下官只管传话。方位将军叫我当众报了，你也听见了。"
msgstr "This subordinate only relays messages. The General had me report in public, and you heard it too."

msgid "白道长命下官回禀，说时辰已到。道长自己在何处，下官不敢说。"
msgstr "Daoist Bai ordered this subordinate to report that the hour has come. Where the Daoist himself is, this subordinate dares not say."

msgid "一个风尘仆仆的江湖人，背著个长条布包，缩在广场边上探头探脑地往官队那边张望。\n"
msgstr "A dust-worn wanderer of the jianghu with a long cloth bundle on his back, cowering at the edge of the square and craning his neck toward the officials' party.\n"

msgid "小兄弟也听见了？西南二十四里，黄石隘口。大内的人要去那儿找一把剑，咱们这些人……也想去瞧瞧。"
msgstr "You heard it too, little brother? Twenty-four li southwest, Yellow Rock Pass. The Palace folk are going there to find a sword, and some of us... wanna go take a look too."

msgid "听说是奉了皇上的旨，去岚城找什麽旋芒宝剑。岚城？谁知道在哪儿。"
msgstr "Heard they're acting on the Emperor's decree, off to the Wind City to find some Whirling Edge sword. The Wind City? Who knows where that is."

msgid "太乙观观主"
msgstr "Abbot of Taiyi Abbey"

msgid "一个须眉皆白的老道士，道袍洗得发灰，一柄拂尘搭在臂弯上。他站在山壁下新挖开的土坑边，眼睛一直盯着坑里，官兵们挖一锹，他的眉头就皱一分。\n"
msgstr "An old Daoist with beard and brows all white, his robe washed gray, a horsetail whisk resting in the crook of his arm. He stands beside the freshly dug pit at the foot of the cliff, his eyes fixed on the hole; with every spadeful the soldiers dig, his frown deepens.\n"

msgid "白道长只是看了你一眼，拂尘一摆，你的手脚便不听使唤了。"
msgstr "Daoist Bai merely glances at you and flicks his whisk, and your hands and feet will no longer obey you."

msgid "那不是什么宝剑，是岚城的风铃。寻风的人才用得上，旁人开了，只会招祸。"
msgstr "That is no sword. It is a wind bell of the Wind City. Only one who seeks the wind can use it; anyone else who opens it brings disaster on himself."

msgid "二十年前一阵怪风过隘口，风停的地方落下这只铃。先帝寻岚城的人把它收了，拿来问老道；老道不敢留，也不敢让他们带进京——寻风的东西，就封进石匣，埋回风停的地方。"
msgstr "Twenty years ago a strange wind crossed the pass, and where the wind stopped, this bell fell. The men the late Emperor sent to seek the Wind City took it and brought it to this old Daoist. I dared neither keep it nor let them carry it into the Capital. A thing for seeking the wind: seal it in a stone casket and bury it back where the wind stopped."

msgid "黑冠黑衣，一身邪气，这一带没有这样的道观。他往老松岭去了——拾起他掉的那块布条看看。"
msgstr "Black cap, black robe, an air of evil about him. There is no abbey like that in these parts. He went toward Old Pine Ridge. Pick up the strip of cloth he dropped and look at it."

msgid "冯总教头奉旨寻的是旋芒宝剑。皇上要寻岚城，满朝只有老道知道岚城的东西埋在哪儿——老道不说，他们挖遍西南也要挖；说了，老道还能在旁边看着。"
msgstr "What Chief Instructor Feng seeks by decree is Whirling Edge sword. What His Majesty wants is the Wind City, and in the whole court only this old Daoist knows where the Wind City's thing is buried. If I do not say, they will dig up the entire southwest. If I do, I can at least stand by and watch."

msgid "老松岭上的匪寨。那道士慌忙间掉了块布条，上头刻的就是老松寨的记号。"
msgstr "A bandit stockade on Old Pine Ridge. In his haste that Daoist dropped a strip of cloth, and the mark on it is Old Pine Stockade's."

msgid "布条"
msgstr "Cloth Strip"

msgid "就是你手里那块。上头那个记号——一棵松、三道横——是老松寨的。"
msgstr "The one in your hand. The mark on it, one pine and three bars, is Old Pine Stockade's."

msgid "那道士掉的，就落在土坑边上。拾起来看看——上头是老松寨的记号。"
msgstr "The Daoist dropped it, right at the edge of the pit. Pick it up and look. The mark on it is Old Pine Stockade's."

msgid "给了你了。上头那个记号，是老松寨的。"
msgstr "I gave it to you already. The mark on it is Old Pine Stockade's."

msgid "从袖子里取出一块粗麻布条。"
msgstr " draws a strip of coarse hemp cloth from a sleeve."

msgid "方才一个黑衣黑冠的道士从崖上掠下来，抢了石匣就走，慌忙间掉了这个。老道替你拾起来了——上头刻的是老松寨的记号。"
msgstr "Just now a Daoist in black robe and black cap swooped down from the cliff, snatched the casket and ran, and dropped this in his haste. This old Daoist picked it up for you. The mark on it is Old Pine Stockade's."

msgid "什么布条？"
msgstr "What cloth strip?"

msgid "一名白衣武官从山壁下的土坑里捧出一只尺许长的石匣，匣面刻着一圈风纹。"
msgstr "An officer in white lifts a stone casket about a foot long out of the pit at the foot of the cliff, a ring of wind patterns carved on its lid."

msgid "总教头，挖出来了！"
msgstr "Chief Instructor, we have dug it out!"

msgid "打开。"
msgstr "Open it."

msgid "冯总教头，匣子开不得。这是岚城的风铃，寻风的人才用得上，旁人开了，只会招祸。"
msgstr "Chief Instructor Feng, the casket must not be opened. This is a wind bell of the Wind City. Only one who seeks the wind can use it; for anyone else to open it brings only disaster."

msgid "崖上忽然一道黑影掠下，一个黑衣黑冠的道士落在土坑边，一把抢过石匣，转身便往山壁上纵去！"
msgstr "A black shadow suddenly swoops down from the cliff. A Daoist in black robe and black cap lands beside the pit, snatches the casket and, turning, leaps back up the cliff face!"

msgid "多谢诸位代劳！"
msgstr "My thanks to you all for doing the digging!"

msgid "黑衣道士衣角一扯，一块布条飘落在地。他几个起落，已经翻上山壁，往北面的老松岭去了。"
msgstr "A tug at the hem of the Daoist's robe, and a strip of cloth flutters to the ground. In a few leaps he has climbed the cliff and gone north toward Old Pine Ridge."

msgid "追！"
msgstr "After him!"

msgid "回过头来，目光落在你身上。"
msgstr " turns around, and the gaze falls on you."

msgid "这不是你该来的地方。"
msgstr "This is no place for you."

msgid "小友，那道士往老松岭去了。官军追的是人——那种人翻山比猴子快，他们追不上。他慌忙间掉的那块布条倒会说话：你拾起来看看，那上头是老松寨的记号。"
msgstr "Young friend, that Daoist has gone toward Old Pine Ridge. The troops chase the man, but a man like that crosses mountains faster than a monkey, and they will not catch him. The strip he dropped in his haste will speak for him, though. Pick it up and look. The mark on it is Old Pine Stockade's."

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，瘦得颧骨突出，眼神鬼鬼祟祟的。他怀里紧紧抱着一只石匣。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in black robe and black cap, so thin his cheekbones jut out, with a furtive look. He clutches a stone casket tight against his chest.\n"

msgid "黑衣道士身形一晃，已经离你远了。"
msgstr "The Daoist in black sways, and he is already far from you."

msgid "滚开！"
msgstr "Out of my way!"

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，瘦得颧骨突出，眼神鬼鬼祟祟的。他蹲在那具骸骨旁边，石匣摆在脚边，正掰下一根指骨往匣口的缝里捅，捅一下，骂一声。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in black robe and black cap, so thin his cheekbones jut out, with a furtive look. He is squatting beside the skeleton with the casket at his feet, snapping off a finger bone and jabbing it into the seam at the casket's mouth. One jab, one curse.\n"

msgid "你也是来寻风铃的？晚了！这骨头开不了匣子，你的骨头说不定行。"
msgstr "You are here for the wind bell too? Too late! These bones will not open the casket. Yours might."

msgid "黑衣道士尖声道：宫里的人很快就到，你跑不了！\n"
msgstr "The Daoist in black shrieks, \"The palace men will be here soon. You cannot escape!\"\n"

msgid "黑衣道士一边招架一边往洞口瞟。\n"
msgstr "The Daoist in black parries while darting glances at the cave mouth.\n"

msgid "黑衣道士捂着伤口翻身爬起，连滚带爬地逃出了山洞，往北边去了。"
msgstr "Clutching his wound, the Daoist in black rolls over and scrambles up, then stumbles and crawls out of the cave and away to the north."

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的道士，袖子挽到肘上，手里攥着一根粗麻绳，绳子的另一头没进北边山壁的裂口里。他盯着车上的箱子，不看你。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in black robe and black cap, sleeves rolled to the elbow, gripping a thick hemp rope whose other end vanishes into a crack in the north cliff. He stares at the crates on the cart, not at you.\n"

msgid "此处无路，施主请回。"
msgstr "There is no road here. Benefactor, please turn back."

msgid "道士头也不抬：野羊寨的供，与你何干。"
msgstr "Without raising his head, the Daoist says, \"Goathill Stockade's tribute. What business is it of yours?\""

msgid "道士拉绳的手停了一停：施主听谁说的这个名字？……回去吧。"
msgstr "The Daoist's rope-pulling hand halts for a moment. \"From whom did you hear that name, Benefactor?... Go back.\""

msgid "道士冷冷道：上头没有路，有也不是给你走的。"
msgstr "The Daoist says coldly, \"There is no road up there. If there were, it would not be for you.\""

msgid "押车道士厉声道：野羊寨的供都敢劫，不要命了！\n"
msgstr "The cart-guarding Daoist snaps, \"You dare rob Goathill Stockade's tribute? Do you want to die?\"\n"

msgid "押车道士往裂口上头喊了一声，上面没有人应。\n"
msgstr "The cart-guarding Daoist shouts up toward the top of the crack. Nobody above answers.\n"

msgid "野羊山二寨主"
msgstr "Second Chief of Goathill"

msgid "刘安禄脱了门房的青布衫，换回了一身短打，单刀挂在腰上。他靠着土地庙的柱子，像是回到了自己的地方——只是看人的眼神还带着当门房时的那股子躲闪。\n"
msgstr "Liu Anlu has shed the gatekeeper's blue cloth tunic for a plain short jacket and trousers, his single saber at his waist. He leans on a pillar of the Earth God Shrine as if he is back where he belongs, though his eyes still dodge, the way they did when he kept the gate.\n"

msgid "刘安禄擦着单刀，没有抬头。\n"
msgstr "Liu Anlu wipes his saber and does not look up.\n"

msgid "刘安禄朝里屋喊了一声：大哥，酒来了！\n"
msgstr "Liu Anlu calls toward the inner room, \"Big Brother, the wine's here!\"\n"

msgid "回寨"
msgstr "Back to the Stockade"

msgid "刘安禄道：大哥回来了，老子还在雪亭镇看什么门。淳风武馆的门房，让他们另找人吧。"
msgstr "Liu Anlu says, \"Big Brother's back. Why should I be mindin' a gate in Snow Pavilion? Pure Wind Hall can find itself another gatekeeper.\""

msgid "刘安禄道：大哥在里屋。他说你横着走，那就横着走。"
msgstr "Liu Anlu says, \"Big Brother's in the back room. He says you can strut around here however you like, so strut.\""

msgid "刘安禄啐了一口：那群牛鼻子的账，野羊寨记着。等大哥养好了身子。"
msgstr "Liu Anlu spits. \"Goathill Stockade remembers what those ox-noses owe. Just wait till Big Brother's body mends.\""

msgid "血手"
msgstr "Bloody Hand"

msgid "刘安禄沉默了一会儿：血手刘三是老子。老子认。你放过我一回，野羊寨欠你两条命。"
msgstr "After a silence Liu Anlu says, \"Bloody-Hand Liu is me, and I own it. You let me off once, and Goathill owes you two lives.\""

msgid "刘安禄压低声音：老三纳供的事，大哥没追究。老子也不说。"
msgstr "Liu Anlu lowers his voice. \"Big Brother let the matter of Third Brother's tribute lie. I ain't sayin' a word either.\""

msgid "东方神教杀手"
msgstr "Golden Crow Order Assassin"

msgid "蒙着面，眉眼看起来有些面熟——书房里那个老妇人的眉眼。衣襟上有血，不是她的。她站在前厅正中，像在等人。\n"
msgstr "Masked, and the eyes look somehow familiar: the eyes of the old woman in the study. There is blood on the front of the robe, and it is not hers. She stands in the middle of the front hall, as if waiting for someone.\n"

msgid "蒙面杀手拔剑冷冷道：东方神教办事。衣走了，这庄子没人护着了——挡路的，一起倒下。"
msgstr "The masked assassin draws a sword and says coldly, \"The Golden Crow Order is at work. The robe is gone, and nobody guards this manor now. Anyone in the way goes down with the rest.\""

msgid "蒙面杀手说：衣不在了，这庄还守什么？\n"
msgstr "The masked assassin says, \"The robe is gone. What is there left to guard in this manor?\"\n"

msgid "蒙面杀手捂着伤口站起来，看了一眼内书房的方向，从窗口翻了出去。\n"
msgstr "Clutching her wound, the masked assassin stands, glances toward the inner study, and climbs out through the window.\n"

msgid "一个穿酱色便衣的中年人，腰里的刀用布裹着，手搭在上头。他不像是来喝酒的——眼睛在街上扫，扫到陈显祖就停了。\n"
msgstr "A middle-aged man in plain soy-brown clothes, a cloth-wrapped saber at his waist and his hand resting on it. He does not look as if he came to drink. His eyes sweep the street and stop when they reach Chen Xianzu.\n"

msgid "庾家管事的手在刀柄的布上摩挲了一下。\n"
msgstr "The Yu Family Steward's hand rubs once across the cloth on his saber's hilt.\n"

msgid "庾家管事喝道：拿下！人要活的！\n"
msgstr "The Yu Family Steward barks, \"Seize him! I want him alive!\"\n"

msgid "庾家管事说道：兵部有令，拦的人一并拿！\n"
msgstr "The Yu Family Steward says, \"By order of the Ministry of War, anyone who gets in the way is taken too!\"\n"

msgid "从酒楼对面的屋檐下走出来，拦在街心。身后三个便衣的汉子散开，手都按着刀柄。"
msgstr " steps out from under the eaves opposite the tavern and blocks the middle of the street. Three men in plain clothes fan out behind, hands on their hilts."

msgid "陈显祖，兵部有令拿你。箱子留下，人跟我们走。"
msgstr "Chen Xianzu, the Ministry of War orders your arrest. Leave the chest. You come with us."

msgid "站住了，手慢慢按到剑柄上。"
msgstr " stops short and slowly lays a hand on the sword hilt."

msgid "二十年了，还是找来了。"
msgstr "Twenty years, and you found me anyway."

msgid "动手。"
msgstr "Move in."

msgid "三个汉子抽刀围了上来——冲的是你。\n"
msgstr "The three men draw their sabers and close in. It is you they are after.\n"

msgid "庾家管事的刀出了布。\n"
msgstr "The Yu Family Steward's saber slips out of its cloth.\n"

msgid "一个身著白衣的朝廷武官，腰悬长剑。他把客栈的桌子一张张掀开，靴子踩在碎碗上，手里攥着一张海捕文书，上头画的人像你。\n"
msgstr "A court officer in white, a long sword at his waist. He overturns the inn's tables one by one, his boots crunching on broken bowls, a wanted notice clutched in his hand. The face drawn on it looks like you.\n"

msgid "就是你！海捕文书上画的人——逆灵宫的同党，拿下！"
msgstr "That is you! The face on the wanted notice, a confederate of the Black Palace. Take this one in!"

msgid "白衣武官喝道：兵部的文书在此，你还敢动手？\n"
msgstr "The Officer in White shouts, \"Here is a Ministry of War writ, and you still dare to raise a hand?\"\n"

msgid "白衣武官一脚踢翻了长凳。\n"
msgstr "The Officer in White kicks over a bench.\n"

msgid "一个便衣的壮汉，刀已经出了鞘。酱色的短衣，和管事一个颜色。\n"
msgstr "A burly man in plain clothes, saber already drawn. His short jacket is soy-brown, the same color as the steward's.\n"

msgid "庾家打手喝道：让开！我们拿的是逃兵，不是你！\n"
msgstr "The Yu Family Thug shouts, \"Move! We're after a deserter, not you!\"\n"

msgid "庾家打手的刀横着扫过来。\n"
msgstr "The Yu Family Thug's saber sweeps across.\n"

msgid "一位相貌威武的武官，坐在内厅的茶桌旁，鬓角白了。他不再发呆了——二十年压在身上的东西，在堂上说出来之后，人反倒直了。\n"
msgstr "A martial-looking officer sits at the tea table in the inner hall, his temples gone white. He no longer sits staring blankly. The weight he carried for twenty years, once spoken aloud in court, has left him standing straighter.\n"

msgid "陈显祖端起茶，手不抖了。\n"
msgstr "Chen Xianzu lifts his tea, and his hand no longer shakes.\n"

msgid "陈显祖说道：二十三个名字，我一个一个念过。\n"
msgstr "Chen Xianzu says, \"Twenty-three names. I read each one aloud.\"\n"

msgid "在下陈显祖。如今是乔阴县衙的人证——总算是个名目。"
msgstr "I am Chen Xianzu. Now a witness for the Tallshade Yamen. At least it is a title of some kind."

msgid "我说了：原令只一句，「寻剑，不得扰民一户」。征民夫、拿人的，不是先帝的令。程大人都录下了。"
msgstr "I have said it: the original decree was one line, \"Seek the sword, and trouble not one household.\" Levying laborers and seizing people was not the late Emperor's order. Magistrate Cheng wrote it all down."

msgid "二十年前念给全队听的那一卷，我抄了一份，藏到今天。该念给公堂听了。"
msgstr "The scroll that was read to the whole company twenty years ago: I copied it and hid it until today. It is time it was read to the court."

msgid "程大人的叔父。听说老王爷拒过兵部的令——有人肯拒，我这份供词就不算白说。"
msgstr "Magistrate Cheng's uncle. I hear the old Prince refused an order of the Ministry of War. If someone is willing to refuse, my testimony was not spoken in vain."

msgid "箱子还给我了，书也给了你。里头最要紧的东西，如今在程大人的卷宗里。"
msgstr "The chest was returned to me, and the book is yours. The most important thing inside is in Magistrate Cheng's case file now."

msgid "金乌"
msgstr "The Golden Crow"

msgid "冰柱里站着一个女人，看着二十来岁，眼睛是睁着的。她一身浅金的衣，衣角在冰里像还在飘。她身上发着白光，光照在冰上，冰就不化。她的嘴唇没有动，声音却从冰里传出来。\n"
msgstr "A woman stands in the ice pillar, looking about twenty, her eyes open. She wears pale gold, and the hem of her robe seems still to drift inside the ice. White light shines from her, and where it falls on the ice, the ice does not melt. Her lips do not move, yet a voice comes through the ice.\n"

msgid "你的手还没碰到冰柱，就冷得缩了回来。柱里的人连眼睛都没有眨。"
msgstr "Your hand has not touched the pillar before the cold makes it jerk back. The figure inside does not even blink."

msgid "封法"
msgstr "Sealing Rite"

msgid "钉拔，它成形，先回这附近的村子。要灭它，三器齐：穿灵、旋芒、宝衣。要再封，须有人留下。——铜上刻了三句，我补了三句，都是实话。"
msgstr "Pull the nail, and it takes shape, and goes first to the village near here. To destroy it, bring the three together: Spiritpiercer, Whirling Edge, the robe. To seal it again, someone must stay behind. The copper carries three lines. I added three. All of it is true."

msgid "先把铜上的话念给我听。"
msgstr "First read me what the copper says."

msgid "它在你手里了。三百年钉着一颗头，钉的是它的名，不是肉——到了灭它那一天，还得是它。"
msgstr "It is in your hand. For three hundred years it pinned a head, and what it pinned was the name, not the flesh. On the day it is destroyed, it must still be this sword."

msgid "寒於的剑。三百年前我哥哥借了它来钉这颗头——剑是皇叔的，皇叔是人，人活不过三百年，剑能。"
msgstr "Hanyu's sword. Three hundred years ago my brother borrowed it to nail this head. The sword was the Imperial Uncle's. The Imperial Uncle was a man, and a man does not live three hundred years. A sword can."

msgid "杞庸"
msgstr "Qi Yong"

msgid "我哥哥。金乌的长子。它捉了我，他追到这里，钉了它——然后他走了。金乌不能留在地上，留下来的只能是我。"
msgstr "My brother. The Golden Crow's eldest son. It seized me, he chased it here and nailed it down, and then he left. The Golden Crow cannot stay on the earth. The one left behind could only be me."

msgid "它没有头的时候，是一团焰。有了头，就有了名，有了名，就能把人当柴烧。这颗头在冰里睡了三百年，它在底下长了三百年。"
msgstr "Without a head it was a lump of flame. With a head it has a name, and with a name it can burn people like kindling. This head slept in the ice for three hundred years, and below it, the ghost grew for three hundred years."

msgid "他要的是鬼成形。成了形的鬼才找得到头，找到了头，他才能把它养成他的。他不骗你，他只是不说完。"
msgstr "What he wants is for the ghost to take shape. Only a ghost that has taken shape can find its head, and once it has found its head, he can raise it into his own. He does not lie to you. He simply does not say all of it."

msgid "逆灵宫的人。他来过，站在潭口上面，看了很久，没下来。"
msgstr "A man of the Black Palace. He has been here. He stood above the mouth of the pool and looked for a long time. He did not come down."

msgid "三百年"
msgstr "Three Hundred Years"

msgid "三百年。冰里不冷，也不饿，就是长。头在长，我在等。第一个带着铜来的，是你。"
msgstr "Three hundred years. It is neither cold in the ice nor hungry. It just grows. The head grows, and I wait. You are the first to come carrying the copper."

msgid "留下"
msgstr "Stay"

msgid "把我的羽还给我——光回来一点，够再守三百年。穿灵交给我，我钉回去。"
msgstr "Give me back my feather. A little of the light returns, enough to keep watch three hundred years more. Give Spiritpiercer to me, and I will nail it back down."

msgid "……或者是你。你也可以。"
msgstr "...Or you. You could, too."

msgid "我没有光了。没有那片羽，我留不住。"
msgstr "I have no light left. Without that feather, I cannot stay."

msgid "再封，须有人留下。留下的人，就是下一块冰。我的光不多了——那片羽在你手里，到时候还给我，我还能再守一回。"
msgstr "To seal it again, someone must stay behind. The one who stays becomes the next ice. My light is nearly gone. The feather is in your hands. Give it back to me when the time comes, and I can keep watch once more."

msgid "再封，须有人留下。留下的人，就是下一块冰。我哥哥没有留，我留了；这一回要是再封，不会是我——我已经没有光了。"
msgstr "To seal it again, someone must stay behind. The one who stays becomes the next ice. My brother did not stay. I stayed. If it is sealed again this time, it will not be me. I have no light left."

msgid "我留下"
msgstr "I Will Stay"

msgid "你留下？你会成为下一块冰。\n片尾以后回到主菜单；「决战前」存档还在。"
msgstr "You stay? You will become the next ice.\nAfter the credits you return to the main menu; the \"Before the Final Battle\" save remains."

msgid "三器齐了。灭了它。"
msgstr "The three are together. Destroy it."

msgid "你握着穿灵走上封坛，一剑钉进那颗头里。冰从坛心长起来，冷得不像冷，像很长很长的一觉。\n"
msgstr "You climb the sealing altar with Spiritpiercer in your grip and drive it into that head with one stroke. Ice grows from the heart of the altar, and the cold does not feel like cold. It feels like a very, very long sleep.\n"

msgid "……你在说什么。"
msgstr "...What are you talking about."

msgid "你已经留下了。"
msgstr "You have already stayed."

msgid "三器齐了。钉下去，用不着谁留下。"
msgstr "The three are together. Drive it down. No one needs to stay."

msgid "把穿灵和那片羽交给璃虹？\n她把剑钉回那颗头上，光回来，再守三百年——再封。"
msgstr "Give Spiritpiercer and the feather to Lihong?\nShe nails the sword back into that head, the light returns, and she keeps watch another three hundred years: sealed again."

msgid "那片羽在你怀里亮了一下，又暗了——光回到了冰柱里，一下子亮了起来。\n"
msgstr "The feather in your coat flares once, then dims. The light has returned to the ice pillar, which blazes up all at once.\n"

msgid "三百年。再三百年。去吧。"
msgstr "Three hundred years. Three hundred more. Go."

msgid "穿灵从你手里滑出去，钉回了那颗头里。冰从坛心长起来，合拢了。\n"
msgstr "Spiritpiercer slips out of your hand and drives itself back into the head. Ice grows from the heart of the altar and closes over it.\n"

msgid "先把它打倒。"
msgstr "Beat it down first."

msgid "冰柱里的光亮了一亮。\n"
msgstr "The light in the ice pillar flares once.\n"

msgid "你带着铜来的。三百年了，第一个带着铜来的人。"
msgstr "You came with the copper. In three hundred years, the first to come with the copper."

msgid "我是璃虹，杞庸的妹妹。它捉了我，我哥哥钉了它——我就留在这里，照着这块冰。"
msgstr "I am Lihong, Qi Yong's sister. It seized me, and my brother nailed it down. I stayed here, to shine on this ice."

msgid "你念过那片铜。念给我听。念对了，我再说下面的。"
msgstr "You have read the copper. Read it to me. If you read it right, I will say the rest."

msgid "璃虹靠着封坛坐在冰上，身上的光只剩一点，像快灭的灯。她的衣角湿了——三百年来第一次湿。她在喘。\n"
msgstr "Lihong sits on the ice with her back against the sealing altar. Only a little of her light is left, like a lamp about to go out. The hem of her robe is wet, for the first time in three hundred years. She is panting.\n"

msgid "她连抬手的力气都没有。你下不去手。"
msgstr "She has not even the strength to raise a hand. You cannot bring yourself to strike."

msgid "钉没了，它在长。要灭它，三器齐——穿灵在你手里了，还差旋芒和宝衣。"
msgstr "The nail is gone, and it grows. To destroy it, the three together. Spiritpiercer is in your hand. Whirling Edge and the robe are still missing."

msgid "上岸"
msgstr "Go Ashore"

msgid "带我上岸。我在冰里三百年，忘了岸上是什么样子。"
msgstr "Take me ashore. I have been in the ice three hundred years. I have forgotten what the shore looks like."

msgid "……别问。先上去。"
msgstr "...Do not ask. Go up first."

msgid "商玦站在封坛对面，黑衣湿透了贴在身上，水顺着袖口往下滴。他没有看你，看着冰里那颗头，像看一件等了很久的东西。\n"
msgstr "Shang Jue stands across the sealing altar, his black robe soaked and clinging, water dripping from his sleeves. He does not look at you. He looks at the head in the ice, as at something long awaited.\n"

msgid "你一出手，只穿过了商玦的袖子，像穿过一缕烟。他只是笑了一笑。"
msgstr "Your strike passes through Shang Jue's sleeve as through a wisp of smoke. He only smiles."

msgid "拔"
msgstr "Pull It"

msgid "商玦看着冰里的头：拔了它。钉着，它是一颗头；拔了，它是一个东西——有形的东西才打得死。"
msgstr "Shang Jue looks at the head in the ice. \"Pull it. Pinned, it is a head. Pulled, it is a thing, and only a thing with a form can be killed.\""

msgid "抬起右手给你看：掌心一片焦黑，像握过烧红的铁。"
msgstr " raises his right hand to show you: the palm is scorched black, as if it had gripped red-hot iron."

msgid "我试过。寒於的剑认干净的手——修过逆灵天书的人碰它，就是这个样子。所以要你来。"
msgstr "I tried. Hanyu's sword knows clean hands. When one who has studied the Black Scripture touches it, this is the result. That is why I need you."

msgid "商玦的声音没有起伏：五千年的头。你以为它封着就是安稳？它在长。"
msgstr "Shang Jue's voice does not rise or fall. \"A head five thousand years old. You think sealed means safe? It is growing.\""

msgid "商玦没有回头：逆灵者，逆天地之灵而用之。你割了我的绳索，我下了崖，就到了这里——比你早一步。"
msgstr "Shang Jue does not turn. \"Spirit-reversers reverse the spirit of heaven and earth and use it. You cut my rope, and I went down the cliff, and so I came here, one step ahead of you.\""

msgid "潭口的水面上一响。商玦湿淋淋地站在封坛对面——不是来打的，手垂着。\n"
msgstr "A splash on the water at the mouth of the pool. Shang Jue stands dripping across the sealing altar. He has not come to fight; his hands hang at his sides.\n"

msgid "拔了它。"
msgstr "Pull it."

msgid "你拿着剑，鬼醒了才找得到头；找到了头，才灭得了它。你以为它封着就是安稳？它在长。三百年，长了三百年。"
msgstr "You hold the sword. Only a woken ghost can find its head, and only once it has found its head can it be destroyed. You think sealed means safe? It is growing. Three hundred years, it has been growing."

msgid "他要的是鬼成形。"
msgstr "What he wants is for the ghost to take shape."

msgid "璃虹躺在东房的榻上，盖着田老财家的一床旧被。她身上的光只剩一线，像灯芯上的最后一点火。她的眼睛是睁着的，看着房梁。\n"
msgstr "Lihong lies on the couch in the east room under an old quilt from Landlord Tian's house. Only a thread of her light is left, like the last flame on a lamp wick. Her eyes are open, looking at the roof beam.\n"

msgid "钉没了，它在长。要灭它，三器齐——穿灵在你手里了，还差旋芒和宝衣。旋芒在岚城，宝衣在晚月庄。岚城寻风而至——你们的先帝找了它一辈子，他的档案在皇城。"
msgstr "The nail is gone, and it grows. To destroy it, the three together. Spiritpiercer is in your hand; Whirling Edge and the robe are still missing. Whirling Edge is in the Wind City, the robe at Latemoon Manor. The Wind City comes on the wind. Your late Emperor searched for it all his life, and his files are in the Palace City."

msgid "它在长"
msgstr "It Is Growing"

msgid "每一夜。它回了村子，就不会再走远——它在等头。你走得越久，它长得越大。可你不走，三器也凑不齐。去吧。"
msgstr "Every night. Now it has come back to the village, it will not go far again. It is waiting for its head. The longer you are gone, the bigger it grows. But if you do not go, the three will never be gathered. Go."

msgid "它的卒子。湖里本来就有，封着的时候爬不上来。昨夜是第一夜，还会有第二夜。"
msgstr "Its soldiers. They were always in the lake, and could not climb out while it was sealed. Last night was the first night. There will be a second."

msgid "再封，须有人留下。我已经没有光了，这一回留下的不会是我。你到时候再想。"
msgstr "To seal it again, someone must stay behind. I have no light left, and this time it will not be me who stays. Think on it when the time comes."

msgid "……岸上的风是这样的。我忘了。"
msgstr "...So this is what the wind on the shore is like. I had forgotten."

msgid "听见脚步声，眼睛转过来看着你。"
msgstr " hears footsteps, and the eyes turn to you."

msgid "你来了。村子……我听见了。它回了家，先烧了一把。"
msgstr "You came. The village... I heard it. It came home, and burned some first."

msgid "钉没了。它每一夜都在长。去京师，去岚城，把三器凑齐——别回头看我。"
msgstr "The nail is gone. It grows every night. Go to the Capital, go to the Wind City, gather the three. Do not look back at me."

msgid "傅家坡的农妇，围裙没解，站在岸边的柳树底下，一手攥着衣角，眼睛一直盯着湖面。\n"
msgstr "A farm woman from Fu Family Slope, apron still on, stands beneath the willow at the water's edge, one hand clutching the hem of her clothes, her eyes fixed on the lake.\n"

msgid "她往后退了一步：你要打，去打湖里那个。"
msgstr "She steps back. \"If you want to fight, go fight the one in the lake.\""

msgid "湖底那盏灯，这几夜一夜比一夜暗。村里人说，灯一灭，水怪就上来。"
msgstr "The lamp at the bottom of the lake has dimmed more each night these past nights. The village folk say that when the lamp goes out, the water monster comes up."

msgid "湖里那东西，这几夜一夜比一夜近。冰底下有东西在敲。"
msgstr "That thing in the lake has come closer each night these past nights. Something under the ice is knocking."

msgid "在家里，门我闩上了。这一回我不让他出门。"
msgstr "At home. I bolted the door. This time I am not letting him out."

msgid "……别问了。"
msgstr "...Stop asking."

msgid "人"
msgstr "People"

msgid "都是来等你的。我不认得他们，他们认得你。"
msgstr "They are all here waiting for you. I do not know them. They know you."

msgid "你回来了。湖底那盏灯，这几夜一夜比一夜暗。"
msgstr "You are back. The lamp at the bottom of the lake has grown dimmer every night."

msgid "你回来了。湖里那东西，这几夜一夜比一夜近。"
msgstr "You are back. The thing in the lake has come closer every night."

msgid "湖面平得像一块铁，结着一层黑冰。冰底下有光，一下一下地暗下去。\n"
msgstr "The lake is flat as a sheet of iron, skinned with black ice. Beneath the ice a light dims, a little at a time.\n"

msgid "这几天岸上来了好些人。都说是来等你的。"
msgstr "A good many people have come to the shore these past days. They all say they are here to wait for you."

msgid "野羊寨的弟兄都来了。村口那条黄土道，交给我们。"
msgstr "All the boys of Goathill Stockade are here. That dirt road at the village mouth: leave it to us."

msgid "王爷说：关北的骑兵欠你一阵。马在岸上，湖畔这一段，我们守。"
msgstr "The Prince says the cavalry of Beyond the Pass owes you a charge. The horses are on the shore. This stretch of the lakeside, we hold."

msgid "会首让我们来。卢卡说你会来。稻田那边，盾顶着。"
msgstr "The Guild Head sent us. Luca said you would come. By the rice paddies, our shields hold the line."

msgid "大内侍卫营三十个人，老夫都带来了。湖底的事，算老夫一个。"
msgstr "All thirty men of the Palace Guard Barracks, this old man has brought. For the business at the lake bottom, count me in."

msgid "宝衣在我身上。东方神教守了三百年——三器齐了，我们就不必再守。"
msgstr "The robe is on me. The Golden Crow Order has guarded it for three hundred years. Once the three are together, we need guard it no longer."

msgid "宝衣在我身上。我不是替神教来的——衣守的是湖底，不是谁家的香火。"
msgstr "The robe is on me. I did not come for the Order. The robe guards the lake bottom, not anyone's offerings."

msgid "宝衣不在我身上。可神教的教主令在——湖底的事，神教守潭口。"
msgstr "The robe is not on me. But the Order Leader's token is. As for the lake bottom, the Order holds the mouth of the pool."

msgid "二十年前，老松岭有人替我挡了一刀。今天我来还。"
msgstr "Twenty years ago on Old Pine Ridge, someone took a blade for me. Today I come to repay it."

msgid "水烟阁来了。关了二十年的人，今天也出门了。"
msgstr "Waterfog Pavilion has come. The man shut away for twenty years has gone out the door today as well."

msgid "水烟阁来了。盟主不在，执法使替他来——这道潭口，红衣武士守。"
msgstr "Waterfog Pavilion has come. The Alliance Leader is absent, so the Enforcer comes in his place. This pool mouth is held by the Red-Robed Guards."

msgid "手里的旋芒转了一转，一道白光。"
msgstr " twirls Whirling Edge once; a white light flashes."

msgid "老夫说过会回来。剑在这儿。"
msgstr "This old man said I would return. The sword is here."

msgid "我拿旋芒来了。回不来，就回不来。"
msgstr "I have brought Whirling Edge. If I do not come back, I do not come back."

msgid "剑交给朝廷。你一个江湖人，拿着它像什么话。"
msgstr "Give the sword to the court. It does not befit a man of the jianghu to carry it."

msgid "宋朴说，剑在你身上。"
msgstr "Song Pu says the sword is on you."

msgid "宋朴说，剑在皇叔手里。皇叔，朝廷的剑，该回朝廷。"
msgstr "Song Pu says the sword is in the Imperial Uncle's hands. Imperial Uncle, the court's sword should go back to the court."

msgid "宋朴说，剑在一个江湖人手里。"
msgstr "Song Pu says the sword is in the hands of a man of the jianghu."

msgid "三器都在，来的人也够。今夜能灭它。\n"
msgstr "The three are all here, and enough people have come. Tonight it can be destroyed.\n"

msgid "三器不齐，或者守的人不够——这一回，只能再封。缺的是什么，任务页上记着。\n"
msgstr "Either the three are not together, or too few have come to hold the line. This time it can only be sealed again. What is lacking is recorded on the quest page.\n"

msgid "天一黑，它就上来。你什么时候下湖，我们就什么时候守。"
msgstr "When night falls, it comes up. Whenever you go down into the lake, that is when we hold."

msgid "霍铮扛着一把开山刀站在岸边，肉养回来了一些，手腕上的铁链印子还在。身后野羊寨的弟兄蹲了一排。\n"
msgstr "Huo Zheng stands on the shore with a mountain-splitting saber on his shoulder, a little of his flesh come back, the marks of the iron chain still on his wrists. Behind him the Goathill Stockade brothers squat in a row.\n"

msgid "霍铮咧嘴一笑：要打，等今夜过了。"
msgstr "Huo Zheng grins. \"If you want a fight, wait till tonight is over.\""

msgid "我在逆灵宫的地牢里见过那东西的影子。这一回，它别想上岸。"
msgstr "I saw that thing's shadow in the Black Palace dungeon. This time it ain't gettin' ashore."

msgid "郭承牵着马站在柳树边，皮甲上落了一层土。六骑在他身后一字排开，马不叫。\n"
msgstr "Guo Cheng stands by the willow holding his horse, a layer of dust on his leather armor. Six riders line up behind him, and the horses do not neigh.\n"

msgid "郭承按着刀：今夜的刀，留给湖里的。"
msgstr "Guo Cheng keeps a hand on his saber. \"Tonight my saber is for what is in the lake.\""

msgid "马不怕鬼。人怕。我们这几个，不怕。"
msgstr "Horses do not fear ghosts. Men do. The few of us here do not."

msgid "一个高鼻深目的异族汉子，左臂的圆盾擦得锃亮，短剑横在盾沿上。他看着湖，嘴里念着一句谁也听不懂的话。\n"
msgstr "A foreigner with a high nose and deep-set eyes, the round shield on his left arm polished bright, a short sword laid across its rim. He watches the lake and murmurs a phrase nobody understands.\n"

msgid "大秦剑手把盾一抬：不。今夜，那边。"
msgstr "The Daqin Swordsman raises his shield. \"No. Tonight, over there.\""

msgid "会首说，这是还人情。"
msgstr "The Guild Head says this repays a favor."

msgid "冯策一身素白的武官袍，刀在腰上，站得笔直。三十个大内侍卫散在岸上，没有一个说话。\n"
msgstr "Feng Ce stands straight in a plain white officer's robe, saber at his waist. Thirty Imperial Guards are spread along the shore, and not one speaks.\n"

msgid "冯策摇了摇头：留着力气，湖底用。"
msgstr "Feng Ce shakes his head. \"Save your strength for the lake bottom.\""

msgid "湖底的事，算老夫一个。"
msgstr "Count this old man in for the lake bottom."

msgid "安妮儿站在水边，衣角沾不上水。她看湖的样子，像看一个等了很久的人。\n"
msgstr "Anni'er stands at the water's edge, the hem of her robe untouched by the water. She looks at the lake the way one looks at someone long awaited.\n"

msgid "安妮儿没有动：我不是来跟你打的。"
msgstr "Anni'er does not move. \"I did not come to fight you.\""

msgid "金乌的人等了三百年，等一个配得上三器的人。"
msgstr "The Golden Crow's people have waited three hundred years for one worthy of the three."

msgid "南危水站在岸上，焦殇剑背在身后。他看着湖面，二十年前的事像是又回来了。\n"
msgstr "Nan Weishui stands on the shore, Sorrowfire slung on his back. He watches the lake, and what happened twenty years ago seems to have come back.\n"

msgid "南危水淡淡道：不是时候。"
msgstr "Nan Weishui says flatly, \"Not the time.\""

msgid "二十年。够了。"
msgstr "Twenty years. Enough."

msgid "茅山派第五代天师"
msgstr "Fifth-Generation Celestial Master of the Mount Mao School"

msgid "林忌站在湖岸的一块青石上，拂尘搭在臂弯里，一黑一金两只眼睛望着北边的山。他的弟子们在下湖的路上。\n"
msgstr "Lin Ji stands on a bluestone slab on the lakeshore, his whisk in the crook of his arm, one black eye and one gold eye gazing at the mountains to the north. His disciples are on the road down to the lake.\n"

msgid "林忌摇了摇头：今夜不是自家人比划的时候。"
msgstr "Lin Ji shakes his head. \"Tonight is no time for us to spar among ourselves.\""

msgid "林忌道：北麓下来的路，茅山的人守着。商玦身边，今夜只剩两个。\n"
msgstr "Lin Ji says, \"The road down from the north foot, Mount Mao's people hold. Beside Shang Jue, only two remain tonight.\"\n"

msgid "林忌道：时辰和路，是你交出来的。剩下的，看你在湖底了。\n"
msgstr "Lin Ji says, \"The hour and the road, you handed them over. The rest depends on you at the lake bottom.\"\n"

msgid "潘军禅站在潭口的石头上，袖子挽到了肘上，脸上难得没有笑。他身后，水烟阁的红衣武士沿着湖岸站成了一排。\n"
msgstr "Pan Junchan stands on a rock at the mouth of the pool, sleeves rolled to his elbows, for once not smiling. Behind him the Red-Robed Guards of Waterfog Pavilion stand in a row along the lakeshore.\n"

msgid "潘军禅笑了一下：今夜不同自己人比划。"
msgstr "Pan Junchan smiles briefly. \"Tonight I do not spar with my own side.\""

msgid "七长老没来。执法使的公事，是守住这道潭口。"
msgstr "The Seventh Elder did not come. The Enforcer's duty is to hold this pool mouth."

msgid "盟主不在，阁里总要有人来。水烟阁的红衣武士，今夜都在这里。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader is away, and somebody from the Pavilion had to come. Waterfog's Red-Robed Guards are all here tonight."

msgid "卫沧澜拄着一根竹杖站在岸边，背比在尚书府的时候直了一些。水烟阁的弟子围在他身边。\n"
msgstr "Wei Canglan leans on a bamboo staff at the shore, standing a little straighter than he did in the Minister's Mansion. Waterfog Pavilion's disciples gather around him.\n"

msgid "卫沧澜摆了摆手：老夫这把骨头，留着下湖。"
msgstr "Wei Canglan waves a hand. \"These old bones of mine are saved for the lake.\""

msgid "老夫在客房里关了二十年，出来第一件事，是来看这个湖。"
msgstr "This old man was shut in a guest room for twenty years, and the first thing I do on coming out is come to look at this lake."

msgid "於兰天武一身朝服，手里握着旋芒。剑身一转，一道白光从湖面上掠过去。\n"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu, in full court dress, holds Whirling Edge. The blade turns, and a white light sweeps across the lake.\n"

msgid "三百年前於兰家拔错了一把剑。这一回，老夫看着它落下去。"
msgstr "Three hundred years ago the Yulan family drew the wrong sword. This time, this old man will watch it come down."

msgid "萧辟尘背着旋芒站在岸边，风从湖上过来，他的衣角往城的方向飘。\n"
msgstr "Xiao Bichen stands on the shore with Whirling Edge on his back. The wind comes over the lake, and the hem of his robe streams toward the city.\n"

msgid "萧辟尘摇头：今夜不打你。"
msgstr "Xiao Bichen shakes his head. \"I will not fight you tonight.\""

msgid "城里的人说，风会送我回去。先过了今夜。"
msgstr "The people in the city say the wind will carry me home. First, get through tonight."

msgid "瑷伦披着寒於宝衣站在岸边，衣角压着湖风，一动不动。鞭子还在腰上。\n"
msgstr "Ailun stands on the shore in Hanyu's Robe, its hem holding down the lake wind, not moving. Her whip is still at her waist.\n"

msgid "瑷伦看了你一眼：留着力气。"
msgstr "Ailun glances at you. \"Save your strength.\""

msgid "我在这里。你下去的时候，我在你前头。"
msgstr "I am here. When you go down, I will be ahead of you."

msgid "看见你，点了点头。"
msgstr " sees you and nods."

msgid "你叫了，我就来了。宝衣在我身上。"
msgstr "You called, so I came. The robe is on me."

msgid "庾子建骑着马停在岸边的柳树下，一身便服，身后跟着几个兵部的白衣武官。他不看湖，只看你。\n"
msgstr "Yu Zijian sits on his horse beneath the willow at the shore, in plain dress, a few officers in white from the Ministry of War behind him. He does not look at the lake. He looks only at you.\n"

msgid "庾子建笑了笑：本官是来要剑的，不是来打架的。"
msgstr "Yu Zijian smiles. \"This official came to claim a sword, not to brawl.\""

msgid "剑在朝廷手里了。湖底的事，本官等着看。"
msgstr "The sword is in the court's hands now. As for the lake bottom, this official will wait and watch."

msgid "皇叔的剑……本官不好硬要。可湖底的事办砸了，朝上总得有人说话。"
msgstr "The Imperial Uncle's sword... this official can hardly demand it by force. But if the business at the lake bottom is botched, someone at court will have to speak."

msgid "一个江湖人拿着天下的剑。你们好自为之。"
msgstr "A man of the jianghu holding the sword of the realm. Look to yourselves."

msgid "剑交给朝廷。交给本官，天下就记得是朝廷带回了它。"
msgstr "Give the sword to the court. Give it to this official, and the realm will remember that the court brought it back."

msgid "不交"
msgstr "Refuse"

msgid "不把剑交给庾子建？他会带着他的人回京城去。"
msgstr "Refuse to hand the sword to Yu Zijian? He will take his men back to the Capital."

msgid "已经交了。"
msgstr "Already handed over."

msgid "好。湖底的事，本官等着看。"
msgstr "Very well. This official will wait and see what happens at the lake bottom."

msgid "翻身上马，带着他的人往京城去了。"
msgstr " swings into the saddle and rides for the Capital with his men."

msgid "把旋芒交给庾子建？\n交了，这一回三器不齐，只能再封；京城会记得是兵部尚书带回了剑。"
msgstr "Hand Whirling Edge to Yu Zijian?\nIf you do, the three will not be together this time and it can only be sealed again. The Capital will remember that the Minister of War brought the sword back."

msgid "接过剑，掂了掂，交给身后的武官。"
msgstr " takes the sword, weighs it, and passes it to an officer behind."

msgid "好。天下会记得是谁带回了它。"
msgstr "Good. The realm will remember who brought it back."

msgid "商玦站在冰龙厅的水潭边，黑衣上结了一层霜。他在等你。\n"
msgstr "Shang Jue stands by the pool in the ice dragons' hall, a layer of frost on his black robe. He is waiting for you.\n"

msgid "商玦摆了摆手：急什么。"
msgstr "Shang Jue waves a hand. \"What is the hurry?\""

msgid "站在水潭边，黑衣上结了一层霜。他看着你，像看一个来晚了的人。"
msgstr " stands by the pool, frost on his black robe. He looks at you as at one who has come late."

msgid "你戴着黑冠，跟在四个黑冠道士后头走进冰龙厅。商玦站在水潭边，背对着你们，黑衣上结了一层霜。\n"
msgstr "Wearing the black cap, you follow four Black-Cap Daoists into the ice dragons' hall. Shang Jue stands by the pool with his back to you, frost on his black robe.\n"

msgid "它找了五千年的头。你要在它找到的那一刻毁了它。"
msgstr "It has been looking for its head for five thousand years. You are to destroy it the moment it finds it."

msgid "他没有回头。他以为身后站着的，都是跟他下湖的人。\n"
msgstr "He does not turn. He thinks everyone standing behind him is one of those who came down the lake with him.\n"

msgid "你的剑先到了。一剑从背后透进他的黑衣，他晃了一晃，没有倒。\n"
msgstr "Your sword arrives first. One thrust goes through his black robe from behind; he sways but does not fall.\n"

msgid "……戴着我们的冠。我早该想到。"
msgstr "...Wearing our cap. I should have known."

msgid "六条白鳞冰龙同时抬起头。这一回它们没有盘回去——龙影扑下来，冰柱后面四个黑冠道士连黑烟都没来得及散，就被卷进了冰缝里。\n"
msgstr "The six white-scaled ice dragons raise their heads together. This time they do not coil back. Their shadows pounce, and the four Black-Cap Daoists behind the ice pillar are swept into the cracks in the ice before their black smoke can even disperse.\n"

msgid "六条白鳞冰龙同时抬起头。这一回它们没有盘回去——龙影扑下来，冰柱后面那两个黑冠道士连黑烟都没来得及散，就被卷进了冰缝里。另外两个，茅山的人在北麓截下了。\n"
msgstr "The six white-scaled ice dragons raise their heads together. This time they do not coil back. Their shadows pounce, and the two Black-Cap Daoists behind the ice pillar are swept into the cracks in the ice before their black smoke can even disperse. The other two were intercepted by Mount Mao's people at the north foot.\n"

msgid "六条白鳞冰龙抬起头，看了看那几顶黑冠，又盘了回去——你和他们站在一起。\n"
msgstr "The six white-scaled ice dragons raise their heads, look over the black caps, and coil back down. You are standing with them.\n"

msgid "四个黑冠道士从冰柱后面走出来，围住了你。\n"
msgstr "Four Black-Cap Daoists step out from behind the ice pillar and surround you.\n"

msgid "冰柱后面只走出来两个黑冠道士，围住了你。另外两个，茅山的人在北麓截下了。\n"
msgstr "Only two Black-Cap Daoists step out from behind the ice pillar and surround you. The other two were intercepted by Mount Mao's people at the north foot.\n"

msgid "你身边的四个黑冠道士一齐拔剑，先扑向了你。\n"
msgstr "The four Black-Cap Daoists beside you draw their swords together and lunge at you first.\n"

msgid "你们管这叫除魔。我管这叫还债。"
msgstr "You call this exorcism. I call it paying a debt."

msgid "商玦拔出了剑。剑身是黑的，没有一点光。\n"
msgstr "Shang Jue draws his sword. The blade is black, without a glint of light.\n"

msgid "商玦拔出了剑，一步一步走过来。"
msgstr "Shang Jue draws his sword and walks toward you, step by step."

msgid "商玦走进了水潭。"
msgstr "Shang Jue walks into the pool."

msgid "商玦撑着剑站起来，看了你一眼，一步一步走进了水潭：「我等下一个三百年。」"
msgstr "Shang Jue pushes himself up on his sword, looks at you once, and walks step by step into the pool. \"I will wait for the next three hundred years.\""

msgid "商玦散成一股黑烟，从水潭上散了出去。"
msgstr "Shang Jue disperses into a stream of black smoke and drifts away over the pool."

msgid "商玦说道：它不是妖魔。它是金乌欠下的债。\n"
msgstr "Shang Jue says, \"It is no demon. It is a debt the Golden Crow owes.\"\n"

msgid "商玦的剑不带风，像念经。\n"
msgstr "Shang Jue's sword brings no wind. It is like chanting sutras.\n"

msgid "一个黑衣黑冠的逆灵宫道士，脸冻得发青，手里的剑结了霜。\n"
msgstr "A Black Palace Daoist in black robe and cap, his face frozen blue, frost on the sword in his hand.\n"

msgid "一个黑冠道士从冰柱后面走了出来。"
msgstr "A Black-Cap Daoist steps out from behind the ice pillar."

msgid "黑冠道士退进了冰缝里。"
msgstr "The Black-Cap Daoist retreats into a crack in the ice."

msgid "黑冠道士一声不响地散成一股黑烟。"
msgstr "The Black-Cap Daoist disperses into black smoke without a sound."

msgid "冯策一身素白的武官袍，刀已经出了鞘，站在你身侧半步。\n"
msgstr "Feng Ce, in a plain white officer's robe, saber drawn, stands half a step at your side.\n"

msgid "冯策从冰洞里跟了下来，拔刀站到你身边：「老夫来。」"
msgstr "Feng Ce follows you down from the ice cave, draws his saber and stands at your side. \"This old man will do it.\""

msgid "冯策收了刀，守在了水潭边。"
msgstr "Feng Ce sheathes his saber and keeps guard by the pool."

msgid "冯策收了刀：「潭底下的事，老夫帮不上。老夫守着潭口。」"
msgstr "Feng Ce sheathes his saber. \"What is below the pool, this old man cannot help with. I will hold the mouth of the pool.\""

msgid "於兰天武站在你身边，旋芒横在身前，剑身上的风声压过了冰龙厅里的寒气。\n"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu stands at your side, Whirling Edge held across his body, the sound of wind on its blade pressing down the cold of the ice dragons' hall.\n"

msgid "於兰天武从冰缝里走出来，旋芒在他手里一转：三百年前於兰家拔错了一把剑——这一回，老夫替你挡着。"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu steps out of a crack in the ice, Whirling Edge turning in his hand. \"Three hundred years ago the Yulan family drew the wrong sword. This time this old man will stand between you and it.\""

msgid "於兰天武收了剑，退到水潭边。"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu sheathes his sword and withdraws to the pool's edge."

msgid "於兰天武把旋芒插回鞘里：潭底下那一个，老夫跟你下去。"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu slides Whirling Edge back into its scabbard. \"The one at the bottom of the pool: this old man goes down with you.\""

msgid "萧辟尘站在你身边，旋芒背在身后，两只手空着，掌心朝外。\n"
msgstr "Xiao Bichen stands at your side, Whirling Edge on his back, both hands empty, palms turned outward.\n"

msgid "萧辟尘背着旋芒从冰缝里走出来，站到你身边：风记得我。这一回，我先出手。"
msgstr "Xiao Bichen walks out of a crack in the ice with Whirling Edge on his back and takes his place at your side. \"The wind remembers me. This time, I strike first.\""

msgid "萧辟尘收了手，退到水潭边。"
msgstr "Xiao Bichen lowers his hands and withdraws to the pool's edge."

msgid "萧辟尘把旋芒背回身后：走，下面还有一个。"
msgstr "Xiao Bichen shoulders Whirling Edge again. \"Let us go. There is another one below.\""

msgid "一团人形的黑焰，没有头。那颗头悬在它肩膀上方，眼睛睁着，还没有长上去。它不出声——它没有嘴。\n"
msgstr "A man-shaped mass of black flame, headless. The head hangs above its shoulders, eyes open, not yet grown on. It makes no sound. It has no mouth.\n"

msgid "黑焰从坛下涌上来，一团没有头的人形站了起来。"
msgstr "Black flame surges up from beneath the altar, and a headless human shape stands."

msgid "黑焰退回了那颗头底下。"
msgstr "The black flame withdraws beneath the head."

msgid "侮天鬼散成一团黑焰，退回了那颗头底下。焰还在一下一下地跳。"
msgstr "The Heaven-Defier breaks apart into a mass of black flame and withdraws beneath the head. The flame still leaps, pulse by pulse."

msgid "黑焰卷过来，冰「嗤」地化了一片。\n"
msgstr "The black flame rolls over, and the ice melts in a patch with a hiss.\n"

msgid "那颗头在它肩上转过来，看着你。\n"
msgstr "The head swivels on its shoulder and looks at you.\n"

msgid "瑷伦披着寒於宝衣站在封坛边，衣角压着黑焰的风，一动不动。\n"
msgstr "Ailun stands beside the sealing altar in Hanyu's Robe, its hem holding down the wind of the black flame, not moving.\n"

msgid "我留下了。"
msgstr "I have stayed."

msgid "把穿灵给我。我把它钉回去，留在冰里——守衣守了几百年，换一样东西守。"
msgstr "Give me Spiritpiercer. I will nail it back down and stay in the ice. I guarded the robe for hundreds of years. Let me guard something else."

msgid "把穿灵交给瑷伦？\n她把剑钉回那颗头上，自己留在冰里——再封。她不会再回晚月庄。"
msgstr "Give Spiritpiercer to Ailun?\nShe nails the sword back into that head and stays in the ice: sealed again. She will not return to Latemoon Manor."

msgid "接过穿灵，走上封坛，一剑钉进那颗头里。"
msgstr " takes Spiritpiercer, climbs the sealing altar and drives it into that head with one stroke."

msgid "宝衣跟着我。下一个来的人，记得它在这里。"
msgstr "The robe stays with me. Whoever comes next, remember it is here."

msgid "冰从坛心长起来，没过她的脚、她的腰、她的肩。她没有回头。\n"
msgstr "Ice grows from the heart of the altar, over her feet, her waist, her shoulders. She does not look back.\n"

msgid "南危水站在封坛边，焦殇剑出了鞘。二十年前的事，他好像终于等到了。\n"
msgstr "Nan Weishui stands beside the sealing altar, Sorrowfire drawn. What he waited twenty years for seems to have found him at last.\n"

msgid "二十年前有人替我死了。这一回，我替他把账还上。把穿灵给我。"
msgstr "Twenty years ago someone died in my place. This time I pay his debt for him. Give me Spiritpiercer."

msgid "把穿灵交给南危水？\n他把剑钉回那颗头上，自己留在冰里——再封。水烟阁再也等不到他。"
msgstr "Give Spiritpiercer to Nan Weishui?\nHe nails the sword back into that head and stays in the ice: sealed again. Waterfog Pavilion will wait for him in vain."

msgid "接过穿灵，掂了掂，笑了一下。"
msgstr " takes Spiritpiercer, weighs it, and smiles briefly."

msgid "告诉颜违：五长老这回是真死了。"
msgstr "Tell Yan Wei: this time the Fifth Elder is truly dead."

msgid "他一剑钉进那颗头里。冰从坛心长起来，没过了他。\n"
msgstr "He drives the sword into that head with one stroke. Ice grows from the heart of the altar and closes over him.\n"

msgid "萧辟尘握着旋芒站在封坛边，风从潭口灌下来，他的衣角往城的方向飘。\n"
msgstr "Xiao Bichen stands beside the sealing altar gripping Whirling Edge. Wind pours down from the mouth of the pool, and the hem of his robe streams toward the city.\n"

msgid "我说过，回不来就回不来。把穿灵给我。"
msgstr "I said it before: if I do not come back, I do not come back. Give me Spiritpiercer."

msgid "把穿灵交给萧辟尘？\n他把剑钉回那颗头上，自己留在冰里——再封。旋芒跟着他。"
msgstr "Give Spiritpiercer to Xiao Bichen?\nHe nails the sword back into that head and stays in the ice: sealed again. Whirling Edge goes with him."

msgid "接过穿灵，回头看了一眼潭口。"
msgstr " takes Spiritpiercer and looks back once at the mouth of the pool."

msgid "城里的风要是问起我，就说我在这里。"
msgstr "If the wind in the city asks after me, say I am here."

msgid "他一剑钉进那颗头里。冰从坛心长起来，没过了他，旋芒还在他手里转。\n"
msgstr "He drives the sword into that head. Ice grows from the heart of the altar and closes over him, with Whirling Edge still turning in his hand.\n"

msgid "於兰天武握着旋芒站在封坛边，朝服下摆被黑焰燎焦了一角。\n"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu stands beside the sealing altar gripping Whirling Edge, a corner of his court robe's hem singed by black flame.\n"

msgid "老夫的命是朝廷的。冰里，老夫留不得。"
msgstr "This old man's life belongs to the court. I cannot stay in the ice."

msgid "安妮儿披着寒於宝衣站在封坛边，黑焰卷到她跟前就散了。\n"
msgstr "Anni'er stands beside the sealing altar in Hanyu's Robe, and the black flame disperses when it rolls up to her.\n"

msgid "东方神教守的是封法，不是冰。留下的，得是跟它有账的人。"
msgstr "The Golden Crow Order guards the sealing rite, not the ice. The one who stays must be someone with a debt to settle with it."

msgid "璃虹扶着冰壁站在潭口边，身上的光只剩一点。她跟着你下来了。\n"
msgstr "Lihong stands at the mouth of the pool, a hand on the ice wall, only a little of her light left. She followed you down.\n"

msgid "我没有光了，留不住。"
msgstr "I have no light left. I cannot stay."

msgid "先下去。"
msgstr "Go down first."

msgid "守者"
msgstr "Guardian"

msgid "冰柱里站着瑷伦，披着寒於宝衣，眼睛睁着。冰里的光是暖的。\n"
msgstr "Ailun stands in the ice pillar in Hanyu's Robe, her eyes open. The light in the ice is warm.\n"

msgid "你的手还没碰到冰柱，就冷得缩了回来。"
msgstr "Your hand has not touched the pillar before the cold makes it jerk back."

msgid "冰柱里站着南危水，手按在剑柄上，像还在等什么人。\n"
msgstr "Nan Weishui stands in the ice pillar, a hand on his sword hilt, as if still waiting for someone.\n"

msgid "冰柱里站着萧辟尘，旋芒在他手里，冰里有一点风的影子。\n"
msgstr "Xiao Bichen stands in the ice pillar, Whirling Edge in his hand, a faint shadow of wind in the ice.\n"

msgid "冯策站在广场中间，素白的武官袍，手里一卷黄绫。\n"
msgstr "Feng Ce stands in the middle of the square in a plain white officer's robe, a roll of yellow silk in his hand.\n"

msgid "宣诏的人退了半步：诏书念完再说。"
msgstr "The herald steps back half a pace. \"Wait until the decree has been read.\""

msgid "广场上，那队白衣武官又站在了三年前那个地方。这一回，他们是来宣诏的。\n"
msgstr "In the square, the company of officers in white stands again where it stood three years ago. This time, they have come to proclaim a decree.\n"

msgid "奉旨。"
msgstr "By imperial decree."

msgid "「……玉螺湖妖氛已靖。寻剑令，到此为止。」\n"
msgstr "\"...The baleful air over Jade Conch Lake has been quelled. The Sword Decree ends here.\"\n"

msgid "「……玉螺湖患暂平。湖底守者，朝廷记其名。」\n"
msgstr "\"...The trouble at Jade Conch Lake is quieted for now. The court records the names of those who guard the lake bottom.\"\n"

msgid "念到「瑷伦」两个字，宣诏的人顿了一下。\n"
msgstr "The herald pauses a moment at the name \"Ailun\".\n"

msgid "念到「璃虹」两个字，宣诏的人顿了一下。\n"
msgstr "The herald pauses a moment at the name \"Lihong\".\n"

msgid "念到「南危水」三个字，宣诏的人顿了一下。\n"
msgstr "The herald pauses a moment at the name \"Nan Weishui\".\n"

msgid "念到「萧辟尘」三个字，宣诏的人顿了一下。\n"
msgstr "The herald pauses a moment at the name \"Xiao Bichen\".\n"

msgid "「……前兵部尚书庾子建，伪造诏令，扰民拿人，即日问罪。」\n"
msgstr "\"...Yu Zijian, former Minister of War, forged decrees, harassed the people and seized them, and is to be tried this very day.\"\n"

msgid "「……兵部尚书庾子建，寻回旋芒，功在社稷。」\n"
msgstr "\"...Yu Zijian, Minister of War, recovered Whirling Edge, a great service to the realm.\"\n"

msgid "「……皇叔於兰天武，复其爵位。」\n"
msgstr "\"...The Imperial Uncle Yulan Tianwu is restored to his title.\"\n"

msgid "江湖上的人，各回各家。"
msgstr "People of the jianghu, go home, each to his own."

msgid "於兰天武一身朝服站在广场中间，手里一卷黄绫。\n"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu stands in the middle of the square in court dress, a roll of yellow silk in his hand.\n"

msgid "老夫替陛下念。"
msgstr "This old man reads in His Majesty's stead."

msgid "一个白衣武官站在广场中间，手里一卷黄绫，身后站着他的人。\n"
msgstr "An officer in white stands in the middle of the square, a roll of yellow silk in his hand, his men behind him.\n"

msgid "兵部奉旨，宣——"
msgstr "The Ministry of War, by imperial decree, proclaims —"

msgid "封山弟子"
msgstr "Empty Mountain Disciple"

msgid "一个三十上下的汉子，穿一件不合身的青布长衫，腰里别着一柄竹剑，胸前挂一块黄杨木腰牌，逢人便把牌子亮一亮。他身后的旗杆上挑着一面布旗：淳风武馆收徒。\n"
msgstr "A man of about thirty in an ill-fitting blue cloth gown, a bamboo sword tucked in his belt, a boxwood waist token hanging at his chest, which he flashes at everyone he meets. On the flagpole behind him hangs a cloth banner: \"Pure Wind Hall Now Taking Disciples\".\n"

msgid "罗七把胸前的腰牌一亮，高声道：淳风武馆收徒！封山剑法，童叟无欺！先交十两拜师钱！\n"
msgstr "Luo Qi flashes the token at his chest and cries out, \"Pure Wind Hall takes disciples! Empty Mountain swordplay, fair dealing for old and young alike! Ten taels entrance fee up front!\"\n"

msgid "罗七对过路的人道：这位小哥，想学剑么？柳馆主是我师父。\n"
msgstr "Luo Qi says to a passerby, \"Young brother, want to learn the sword? Master Liu is my shifu.\"\n"

msgid "罗七叫道：弟兄们并肩子上！\n"
msgstr "Luo Qi yells, \"Brothers, all together!\"\n"

msgid "罗七的竹剑乱挥一气，一招封山剑法也没有。\n"
msgstr "Luo Qi's bamboo sword flails wildly, with not one move of Empty Mountain swordplay in it.\n"

msgid "罗七喘着气嚷道：你们武馆自己门口就站着野羊山的血手刘三，倒有脸来管老子！\n"
msgstr "Panting, Luo Qi shouts, \"Your own hall has Bloody-Hand Liu of Goathill standing at its very gate, and you've got the nerve to meddle with me!\"\n"

msgid "拜师钱"
msgstr "Entrance Fee"

msgid "十两银子。交了钱，明日辰时到武馆点卯，柳馆主亲自教。"
msgstr "Ten taels of silver. Pay up, then report to the hall at the hour of the Dragon tomorrow morning, and Master Liu teaches you himself."

msgid "就在镇里，石狮子后头。不过馆主近来不见生人——拜师的事，都交给我们师兄弟几个办了。"
msgstr "Right here in town, behind the stone lions. But the Master has not been seeing strangers lately. Taking in disciples is left to us senior and junior brothers."

msgid "把胸前的木牌摘下来，在你眼前晃了晃。"
msgstr " lifts the wooden token off the chest and waves it in front of your eyes."

msgid "看清楚：正面一座山，背面是姓。封山弟子人手一块，假不了。"
msgstr "Look closely: a mountain on the front, a surname on the back. Every Empty Mountain disciple has one. Can't be fake."

msgid "封山剑法，讲究的是……是一个快字。别问那么多，交了钱自然教你。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain swordplay is all about... about one word: speed. Don't ask so much. Pay up and we'll teach you in good time."

msgid "冒牌"
msgstr "Fakes"

msgid "当面说破他们是冒牌的。三个人收了钱还没走，不会善罢甘休——他们会一起动手。\n要说破吗？"
msgstr "Call them fakes to their faces. The three have taken the money and not yet left, and they will not let it go: they will all attack together.\nCall them out?"

msgid "少废话！"
msgstr "Cut the talk!"

msgid "的脸色变了。"
msgstr "'s face changes."

msgid "……你是武馆的人？"
msgstr "...You're with the hall?"

msgid "弟兄们，这小子要砸咱们的饭碗！"
msgstr "Brothers, this punk is out to smash our rice bowl!"

msgid "罗七把腰牌扯下来扔在地上：拿去！牌是绮云镇赌场里一个姓逄的押给我的，不是偷的！……你们武馆的门房是野羊山的血手刘三，你们怎么不查他？\n罗七爬起来，头也不回地往西跑了。"
msgstr "Luo Qi rips the token off and throws it on the ground. \"Take it! A fellow named Pang at the casino in Cloudweave Town pawned it to me. I didn't steal it!... Your hall's own gatekeeper is Bloody-Hand Liu of Goathill. Why don't you go after him?\"\nLuo Qi scrambles up and runs west without looking back."

msgid "一个游手好闲的后生，学着武馆弟子的样子在腰里扎了一条麻布带子，手里攥着一把还没捂热的碎银。\n"
msgstr "An idle young hanger-on, a hemp sash tied at his waist in imitation of the hall's disciples, clutching a handful of loose silver not yet warm in his hand.\n"

msgid "帮闲扯着嗓子喊：拜师的这边交钱！\n"
msgstr "The hanger-on bellows, \"Those joining, pay over here!\"\n"

msgid "帮闲叫道：七哥，这小子手硬！\n"
msgstr "The hanger-on yells, \"Brother Qi, this kid hits hard!\"\n"

msgid "帮闲一边打一边往后缩。\n"
msgstr "The hanger-on shrinks back as he fights.\n"

msgid "十两，交给七哥。"
msgstr "Ten taels, hand it to Brother Qi."

msgid "我……我们都是武馆的弟子。问七哥去。"
msgstr "We... we are all disciples of the hall. Go ask Brother Qi."

msgid "一个十二三岁的男孩，裤脚短了一截，手里的竹剑是自己削的，握柄上缠着一圈麻绳。\n"
msgstr "A boy of twelve or thirteen, trouser legs too short, a bamboo sword he whittled himself in his hand, a coil of hemp cord wound round the grip.\n"

msgid "阿桂把竹剑藏到身后：绘心姐说，不许跟人动手。"
msgstr "Agui hides his bamboo sword behind his back. \"Sister Huixin says I am not allowed to fight people.\""

msgid "绘心姐说，剑尖别抬，等别人先刺空。我等了三天了，小满总也不刺。"
msgstr "Sister Huixin says: keep the point down, wait for the other to thrust at nothing. I have waited three days, and Xiaoman never thrusts."

msgid "十两。我娘说，够我们家吃一年的。"
msgstr "Ten taels. My mother says that is enough for our family to eat for a year."

msgid "绘心姐不收钱。她说爹爹不教的，她教。"
msgstr "Sister Huixin takes no money. She says she teaches what her father will not."

msgid "握着阿桂的手腕，把他手里的竹剑往下压了半寸。"
msgstr " holds Agui's wrist and presses the bamboo sword in his hand down half an inch."

msgid "剑尖别抬。等他刺空了，你这一剑才有地方去。"
msgstr "Keep the point down. Wait until he thrusts at nothing, and then your sword has somewhere to go."

msgid "绘心姐，我娘说武馆的拜师钱要十两……我们家一年也攒不下。"
msgstr "Sister Huixin, my mother says the hall's entrance fee is ten taels... our family could not save that in a year."

msgid "我不收钱。爹爹不教的，我教。"
msgstr "I take no money. What Father does not teach, I teach."

msgid "把圆盾靠在墙根，学着她的样子把竹剑平平递出去。"
msgstr " leans the round shield against the foot of the wall and, copying her, holds the bamboo sword out level."

msgid "会首说：我们的盾，换你们的剑。等别人先刺空——这个，大秦没有。"
msgstr "The Guild Head says: our shields for your swords. Wait for the other to thrust at nothing. This, Daqin does not have."

msgid "站在廊下，不知已经看了多久。"
msgstr " stands under the eaves of the corridor, watching, and who knows for how long."

msgid "绘心。"
msgstr "Huixin."

msgid "封山的剑不外传。雪亭这一支本来叫北宗；我接了掌门，才并回本宗，把这两个字去了——并回去的条件只有一条：剑不外传。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain's sword is not passed to outsiders. The Snow Pavilion branch was once called the North Branch. When I took over as Master, I merged it back into the main line and dropped that name. The one condition of the merger: the sword is not taught outside."

msgid "去了两个字，剑就不是封山的剑了么？阿桂他爹去年死在卧龙岗的强盗手里。他要是会一招「封」，死的就不是他。"
msgstr "Does the sword stop being Empty Mountain's sword because a name was dropped? Agui's father died last year at the hands of bandits on Crouching Dragon Ridge. If he had known even one move of \"Seal\", it would not have been him who died."

msgid "「起迄中空立，随风飘不定」——竹子弯了才不折。爹爹，这是你二十岁自己写的。"
msgstr "\"From top to root it stands hollow, swaying with the wind, never still.\" Bamboo that bends does not break. Father, you wrote that yourself at twenty."

msgid "我二十岁也这样想过，还写成了一卷书。后来才知道：随风飘的不是竹子，是没有根的东西。"
msgstr "At twenty I thought so too, and wrote it into a book. Later I learned: what drifts with the wind is not bamboo. It is a thing with no roots."

msgid "你是这一辈的大弟子。本宗的规矩，你守不守？"
msgstr "You are the senior disciple of this generation. The rules of the main line: will you keep them?"

msgid "你要是觉得我没有错，就留下来。北宗只有我一个人，我的剑也只学了个皮毛——可它是往外传的。"
msgstr "If you think I am not wrong, stay. The North Branch has only me, and I have learned only the surface of the sword. But it is a sword that goes outward."

msgid "一个扎着两条小辫的女孩，竹剑比她的胳膊还长，站桩站得一丝不苟。\n"
msgstr "A girl in two small braids, her bamboo sword longer than her arm, holding her stance with painstaking care.\n"

msgid "小满摇摇头，一步也不肯动：先刺的人吃亏。"
msgstr "Xiaoman shakes her head and will not move a step. \"Whoever thrusts first loses out.\""

msgid "我不刺。绘心姐说了，先刺的人吃亏。"
msgstr "I won't thrust. Sister Huixin said whoever thrusts first loses out."

msgid "绘心姐的剑上系着一条粉穗子。等我学会了「封」，她说也给我系一条。"
msgstr "Sister Huixin's sword has a pink tassel tied to it. When I learn \"Seal\", she says she will tie one on mine too."

msgid "一个十六七岁的异族少年，高鼻深目，头发卷得像羊毛。左臂上套着一面小圆盾，右手握着一柄竹剑——握法还是握短剑的握法。\n"
msgstr "A foreign youth of sixteen or seventeen, high-nosed and deep-eyed, his hair curled like wool. A small round shield is strapped to his left arm, and in his right hand is a bamboo sword, still gripped the way a short sword is gripped.\n"

msgid "少年把圆盾一抬，摇了摇头：不打。来学的。"
msgstr "The youth raises his round shield and shakes his head. \"No fight. Come to learn.\""

msgid "会首说，欠了人情要还，学了本事也要还。我们的盾，换你们的剑。"
msgstr "The Guild Head says a favor owed must be repaid, and a skill learned must be repaid too. Our shields for your swords."

msgid "我们的剑短，只往前。她的剑会等。"
msgstr "Our swords are short. They go only forward. Her sword waits."

msgid "柳绘心在镇口的公告旁支了一张小桌，身后立着一根新削的旗杆：「封山剑派北宗」。字是她自己写的。\n"
msgstr "Liu Huixin has set up a small table by the notice board at the town entrance, a freshly shaved flagpole standing behind her: \"Empty Mountain School, North Branch\". The lettering is her own.\n"

msgid "柳绘心摇了摇头：北宗的剑是教人的，不是拿来比的。"
msgstr "Liu Huixin shakes her head. \"The North Branch's sword is for teaching, not for matching.\""

msgid "镇口的公告上写着「封山剑派北宗所在的雪亭镇」。雪亭不要这两个字了，我就把它带到还写着它的地方来。"
msgstr "The notice at the town entrance reads \"Snow Pavilion, home of the North Branch of the Empty Mountain School\". Snow Pavilion no longer wants the name, so I brought it to where it is still written."

msgid "爹爹没有拦我。他站在武馆门里，一直看到我过了卧龙岗。"
msgstr "Father did not stop me. He stood inside the hall's gate and watched until I had crossed Crouching Dragon Ridge."

msgid "你那一诀是爹爹亲传的，比我自己悟的准。"
msgstr "That technique of yours came from Father in person, and it is more exact than what I worked out myself."

msgid "他们隔几天走卧龙岗过来。强盗现在不大敢拦了——他们手里有竹剑。"
msgstr "They come over Crouching Dragon Ridge every few days. The bandits hardly dare stop them now. They have bamboo swords in their hands."

msgid "……是你。"
msgstr "...It is you."

msgid "牌子是我自己写的。字不好，爹爹看见要笑的。"
msgstr "I wrote the sign myself. The writing is poor. Father would laugh to see it."

msgid "封山剑派掌门人"
msgstr "Master of the Empty Mountain School"

msgid "柳淳风站在渡口的船头，玄苏剑还在鞘里。他身后，淳风武馆的弟子在岸边站成了一排，没有一个人说话。\n"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng stands at the bow of a boat at the ferry landing, his sword still in its scabbard. Behind him, the disciples of Pure Wind Hall stand in a row along the bank, and not one speaks.\n"

msgid "柳淳风摇了摇头：今夜的剑，留给湖里上来的东西。"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng shakes his head. \"Tonight my sword is for what comes up out of the lake.\""

msgid "封山的剑不外传。可也没有哪一条规矩说，外面的事封山不管。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain's sword is not passed to outsiders. But no rule says Empty Mountain leaves outside affairs alone."

msgid "柳绘心站在渡口的船边，细剑横在臂弯里。阿桂他们没有来——她身后是几个镇上的后生，握的是竹剑，手都在抖，脚却没有动。\n"
msgstr "Liu Huixin stands by the boat at the ferry landing, a slender sword across the crook of her arm. Agui and the children have not come. Behind her are a few young men from town, gripping bamboo swords, their hands shaking but their feet unmoving.\n"

msgid "柳绘心：现在不行。等今夜过了，我陪你拆。"
msgstr "Liu Huixin: \"Not now. After tonight, I will spar with you.\""

msgid "爹爹说剑不外传。可是你看——传出去的剑，今夜站在这里。"
msgstr "Father says the sword is not passed outside. But look: the sword that was passed out stands here tonight."

msgid "一个四十上下的关北汉子，裹着一件半旧的羊皮袄，背上一卷毡子。他在阁前来回踱着，看人的时候先看人家腰里，笑起来眼睛不笑。\n"
msgstr "A man of about forty from Beyond the Pass, wrapped in a half-worn sheepskin coat, a roll of felt on his back. He paces before the Pavilion, looks at a person's waist first, and his eyes do not smile when he smiles.\n"

msgid "皮货商踮起脚往阁门里望了一眼，又若无其事地转开了。\n"
msgstr "The fur trader rises on tiptoe to peer through the Pavilion's door, then turns away as though nothing happened.\n"

msgid "皮货商搓着手道：好大的气派。正月十七，九派的人都要来吧？\n"
msgstr "The fur trader rubs his hands. \"Such grandeur. On the seventeenth day of the first month, all nine schools will come, will they not?\"\n"

msgid "皮货商咬牙道：水烟阁的待客之道！\n"
msgstr "The fur trader grits his teeth. \"So this is how Waterfog Pavilion treats guests!\"\n"

msgid "皮货商一边招架，一边拿眼角找下山的路。\n"
msgstr "The fur trader parries while searching with the corner of his eye for the road down the mountain.\n"

msgid "来意"
msgstr "Errand"

msgid "关北来的，贩些皮子。听说七长老要办正月十七的大会，想来见识见识水烟阁的正厅——这么大的场面，一辈子见一回。"
msgstr "From Beyond the Pass, trading in a few hides. I heard the Seventh Elder is holding a great assembly on the seventeenth of the first month, and I wanted to see the main hall of Waterfog Pavilion. A grand occasion like that, once in a lifetime."

msgid "盟主？您说的是哪一位？"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader? Which one do you mean, sir?"

msgid "……听说二十年前那位回来了？人在阁里？身子骨还坐得住那把椅子么？"
msgstr "...I hear the one from twenty years ago has returned? He is in the Pavilion? Is his body still strong enough to hold that chair?"

msgid "说完又笑了笑，像是随口一问。"
msgstr " smiles again, as if it were an idle question."

msgid "二十年前那位卫盟主——如今还在不在？在，又在哪儿？"
msgstr "That Alliance Leader Wei from twenty years ago: is he still around? And if so, where?"

msgid "把路引递了过来：关北槐阳县开的路引，盖着一方县印。"
msgstr " hands over a travel pass issued by Huaiyang County in Beyond the Pass, stamped with a county seal."

msgid "你凑近看了看那方县印：印色鲜亮，是水烟阁自己用的印泥——关北的县衙不用它。这张路引，是山上的人开的。"
msgstr "You lean in to look at the county seal. The ink is bright, the paste Waterfog Pavilion itself uses. The county yamen of Beyond the Pass does not use it. This pass was issued by someone on the mountain."

msgid "你凑近看了看那方县印：印色发乌——是兵部文书上那种印泥，不是关北县衙用的正红。"
msgstr "You lean in to look at the county seal. The ink is dark: the paste used on Ministry of War documents, not the true red the county yamen of Beyond the Pass uses."

msgid "路引上的字、印都齐全。你看不出什么不对。"
msgstr "The writing and the seal on the pass are all in order. You see nothing wrong."

msgid "拿下"
msgstr "Seize"

msgid "拿下这个人？\n拿对了，他会动手；拿错了，水烟阁要向人家赔不是，真的探子会趁乱走掉。\n要拿下吗？"
msgstr "Seize this man?\nIf he is the right one, he will fight. If he is the wrong one, Waterfog Pavilion will have to apologize to him, and the real spy will slip away in the confusion.\nSeize him?"

msgid "要拿，就来拿！"
msgstr "If you want to take me, come and take me!"

msgid "的笑僵在了脸上。"
msgstr "'s smile freezes."

msgid "……好眼力。"
msgstr "...Sharp eyes."

msgid "把背上的毡子往地上一扔，摆了个架势。"
msgstr " throws the roll of felt off the back to the ground and takes a fighting stance."

msgid "拿我？你是水烟阁的什么人？"
msgstr "Take me? And who are you at Waterfog Pavilion?"

msgid "水烟阁武士从门里出来，把皮货商反剪了双手，押进阁里去了。他怀里掉出一封折得很小的信。"
msgstr "Warriors of Waterfog Pavilion come out of the gate, twist the fur trader's arms behind him and march him inside. A small, tightly folded letter falls from his coat."

msgid "一个十五六岁的少年，草鞋上全是泥，背上斜插着一柄木刀，一双眼睛直往阁门里瞟。\n"
msgstr "A boy of fifteen or sixteen, straw sandals caked in mud, a wooden saber slanting across his back, his eyes forever darting toward the Pavilion's door.\n"

msgid "这是上山来的客人。在水烟阁门前动手，潘军禅那里交代不过去——要拿人，先问清楚（「拿下」）。"
msgstr "This is a guest who has come up the mountain. If you fight at Waterfog Pavilion's gate, you will have no way to explain it to Pan Junchan. If you mean to seize someone, ask first (\"Seize\")."

msgid "投师的少年攥着拳头，小声把一套拳路比划了一遍。\n"
msgstr "The boy seeking a master clenches his fists and quietly goes through a set of boxing moves.\n"

msgid "我来拜师！听说天邪派拜师要接三招……我练了一个冬天了。"
msgstr "I've come to find a master! I heard the Wayward School makes you take three moves to be accepted... I practiced all winter."

msgid "卫盟主！我爹说，那年正月十七，他一个人在虹台上打下了九派。……可我爹也说，他二十年没下过山了。"
msgstr "Alliance Leader Wei! My father says that year, on the seventeenth of the first month, he beat all nine schools alone on the terrace... But my father also says Alliance Leader Wei has not come down the mountain in twenty years."

msgid "路引？我从雪亭镇一路走上来的，要什么路引。"
msgstr "A travel pass? I walked all the way up from Snow Pavilion. What would I need a pass for?"

msgid "我……我什么也没干。我就是来拜师的。"
msgstr "I... I did nothing. I just came to find a master."

msgid "那个卖皮子的……原来是他！"
msgstr "That fur seller... so it was him!"

msgid "被你一把扣住了手腕，吓得脸都白了。"
msgstr " is caught by the wrist in your grip and goes white with fright."

msgid "冤枉！我……我什么也没干！"
msgstr "I have been wronged! I... I did nothing!"

msgid "门里的水烟阁武士闻声出来，把他按在地上搜了一遍：除了随身的几样东西，什么也没有。"
msgstr "Waterfog Pavilion warriors at the gate hear the noise and come out, pin him to the ground and search him. Nothing but a few ordinary belongings."

msgid "潘军禅从阁里出来，向他拱手赔了礼。"
msgstr "Pan Junchan comes out of the Pavilion and apologizes to him with a cupped-fist salute."

msgid "你回过头去——那个关北来的皮货商，已经不见了。"
msgstr "You turn around, and the fur trader from Beyond the Pass is gone."

msgid "你、你要干什么？"
msgstr "Y-you, what do you want?"

msgid "一个精瘦的驿卒，背着一只油布包袱，腰里挂着雪亭驿的火印腰牌，额上一层汗。\n"
msgstr "A wiry post-station runner with an oilcloth bundle on his back, a fire-branded waist token of Snow Pavilion Post Station at his belt, a film of sweat on his brow.\n"

msgid "驿卒把油布包袱换了个肩，嘟囔着：一封信要送到山顶上，腿都跑细了。\n"
msgstr "The runner shifts his oilcloth bundle to the other shoulder, grumbling, \"One letter to carry up the mountain, and my legs are worn thin.\"\n"

msgid "雪亭驿的。正月的信函，一封封都要当面交到阁里。"
msgstr "From Snow Pavilion Post Station. Every letter of the first month has to be handed over in person at the Pavilion."

msgid "卫盟主嘛。信封上还写着「呈盟主座前」，二十年都这么写，也没人叫改。"
msgstr "Alliance Leader Wei, of course. The envelope still says \"To be presented before the Alliance Leader's seat\". Twenty years it has been written that way, and nobody has said to change it."

msgid "亮了亮腰牌。"
msgstr " shows the waist token."

msgid "雪亭驿的火印，印色是驿站用的朱砂。没什么不对。"
msgstr "Snow Pavilion Post Station's fire brand, in the vermilion the post stations use. Nothing wrong with it."

msgid "雪亭驿的火印，假不了。"
msgstr "Snow Pavilion Post Station's brand. It cannot be fake."

msgid "信函还没送到呢，平白挨了一顿……"
msgstr "The letter has not even been delivered, and I get a beating for nothing..."

msgid "被你一把扣住了手腕，包袱掉在了地上。"
msgstr " is caught by the wrist in your grip, and the bundle falls to the ground."

msgid "安妮儿站在八仙桌旁，没有坐。她还是西厢里那身素衣，门外吹进来的风，吹不动她的衣角。\n"
msgstr "Anni'er stands beside the square table without sitting. She wears the same plain robe as in the west wing, and the wind blowing in from the door cannot stir its hem.\n"

msgid "在这里给我？……也好，让她看着。"
msgstr "Here, you give it to me? ...Fine. Let her watch."

msgid "站安妮儿：一代教主收回教主令。\n她收回赤铜令，给你黄金令牌，教你天山雪影剑和雪影心法；朱鸿雪认输，不走——往后神教只派该死的人的差事。终章还没打完的，她来湖畔守潭口（宝衣在不在她手里都来）；正月十七那天，神教不去虹台搅局。\n这是东方神教这条线的大分裂，选了不能改。要站安妮儿吗？"
msgstr "Side with Anni'er: the First Leader takes back the Order Leader's token.\nShe takes back your red copper token and gives you a gold token, and teaches you the Tianshan Snowshade Sword and the Snowshade Heart Method. Zhu Hongxue concedes and does not leave. From now on the Order will take only jobs against those who deserve to die. If the final chapter is not yet fought, she will come to hold the mouth of the pool at the lakeside (whether or not the robe is in her hands). On the seventeenth of the first month, the Order will not go and disrupt the Rainbow Terrace.\nThis is the great split in the Golden Crow Order's line. Once chosen, it cannot be changed. Side with Anni'er?"

msgid "去西厢找我。天山的剑，在那里教。"
msgstr "Find me in the west wing. The Tianshan sword is taught there."

msgid "你选了。"
msgstr "You have chosen."

msgid "向朱鸿雪伸出手来。朱鸿雪看了她很久，从怀里摸出一块乌沉沉的令牌，放在她掌心——那是神教的教主令。"
msgstr " holds out a hand to Zhu Hongxue. Zhu Hongxue looks at her for a long while, takes a dark, heavy token from inside her coat, and lays it in her palm: the Order Leader's token."

msgid "神教不是一个人的。往后神教的差事，只派该死的人——鸿雪，你听见了。"
msgstr "The Order does not belong to one person. From now on its jobs go only against those who deserve to die. Hongxue, you heard."

msgid "收回你的赤铜令，换给你一块闪闪发亮的黄金令牌。"
msgstr " takes back your red copper token and gives you a gleaming gold token in exchange."

msgid "黄金令，神教见了，就是见了我。天山的剑，到西厢来学。"
msgstr "The gold token: when the Order sees it, it sees me. Come to the west wing to learn the Tianshan sword."

msgid "揣好教主令，出了场院。"
msgstr " tucks the Order Leader's token away and leaves the courtyard."

msgid "从袖子里抽出一张折好的纸，压在茶盏底下，抬眼看了看厅角。"
msgstr " draws a folded sheet of paper from a sleeve, presses it under a teacup, and glances up at a corner of the hall."

msgid "名单上最后一个名字，向来是我亲手写的。"
msgstr "The last name on the list has always been written by my own hand."

msgid "把那张纸翻过来，推到桌子另一头。"
msgstr " turns the paper over and pushes it to the other end of the table."

msgid "宝衣烧了，封物没了。封法就只剩在人的脑子里——这样的东西，只该活在一个人的脑子里。"
msgstr "The robe is burned and the sealing objects are gone. All that remains of the rite is in a person's head. A thing like that should live in only one head."

msgid "名单上最后一个名字：安妮儿。"
msgstr "The last name on the list: Anni'er."

msgid "一直站在八仙桌旁，这时才开口。"
msgstr " has stood beside the square table all along and only now speaks."

msgid "封法在我脑子里，是因为湖底那东西还没有死透。要我的命，自己来拿。"
msgstr "The rite is in my head because the thing at the lake bottom has not yet died for good. If you want my life, come and take it yourself."

msgid "宝衣在西厢。衣在谁手里，封法就在谁手里。"
msgstr "The robe is in the west wing. Whoever holds the robe holds the rite."

msgid "衣在我这里，是因为它该在这里。你要的不是封法，是神教的香火。"
msgstr "The robe is here with me because it belongs here. What you want is not the rite. It is the Order's offerings."

msgid "把那张纸翻过来，转过脸看着你。"
msgstr " turns the paper over and turns to look at you."

msgid "宝衣在你身上。封法跟着衣走——走到一个神教管不着的人手里。"
msgstr "The robe is on you. The rite follows the robe, into the hands of someone the Order cannot control."

msgid "交出来，或者你的名字也在上面。"
msgstr "Hand it over, or your name goes on it too."

msgid "名单上写过的名字，没有一个是该死的。这一个也不是。衣在谁身上，是衣自己选的。"
msgstr "Not one name ever written on that list deserved to die. This one does not either. Whoever wears the robe, the robe chose."

msgid "宝衣还在晚月庄，在守衣人身上。几百年了，那件衣从没出过那座庄子。"
msgstr "The robe is still at Latemoon Manor, on the one who guards it. For hundreds of years it has never left that manor."

msgid "名单上最后一个名字：瑷伦。"
msgstr "The last name on the list: Ailun."

msgid "瑷伦守了一辈子的衣，没碰过神教一根指头。"
msgstr "Ailun guarded the robe all her life and never laid a finger on the Order."

msgid "还有你。"
msgstr "And you."

msgid "西厢的话，你替她瞒过一回。湖边那个凿冰的老头，你也没动他——冰凿交到了我手里，人可没死。我的人在官道上看见过他。"
msgstr "What was said in the west wing, you hid for her once. And that old man chipping ice at the lake, you did not touch him either. The ice chisel came into my hand, but the man did not die. My people saw him on the official road."

msgid "我信过你一回。只信一回。"
msgstr "I trusted you once. Only once."

msgid "湖边凿冰的那个老人，是你动的手。他只是看见过冰下的光，讲给孩子们听。"
msgstr "The old man who cut ice by the lake, you struck him down. All he did was see a light under the ice and tell the children."

msgid "神教不能有两个教主。"
msgstr "The Order cannot have two leaders."

msgid "你站哪一边——问我，或者问她：「教主」。"
msgstr "Which side are you on? Ask me, or ask her: \"Order Leader\"."

msgid "一个戴黑冠的道士，道袍的下摆掖在腰里，赤脚站在湖岸的浅水中。他手里一根刻着细格的竹竿，插下去，拔出来，看一眼，在一块木板上划一道。\n"
msgstr "A Daoist in a black cap, the hem of his robe tucked into his belt, standing barefoot in the shallows of the lakeshore. In his hand is a bamboo pole marked with fine gradations. He plunges it in, pulls it out, glances at it, and scratches a line on a board.\n"

msgid "黑冠道士把竹竿插进湖里，拔出来看了看，在木板上又划了一道。\n"
msgstr "The Black-Cap Daoist plunges the pole into the lake, pulls it out and looks at it, and scratches another line on the board.\n"

msgid "黑冠道士望着湖心，嘴里念念有词，像在数什么。\n"
msgstr "The Black-Cap Daoist gazes toward the middle of the lake, muttering, as if counting something.\n"

msgid "黑冠道士冷笑道：神教的狗，鼻子倒灵！\n"
msgstr "The Black-Cap Daoist sneers, \"Dogs of the Order, with sharp noses!\"\n"

msgid "黑冠道士一边招架，一边往湖岸北边瞟。\n"
msgstr "The Black-Cap Daoist parries while darting glances toward the north end of the lakeshore.\n"

msgid "量水"
msgstr "Measuring Water"

msgid "量水？量的是湖底那东西离湖面还有多深。"
msgstr "Measuring water? What I measure is how deep that thing at the lake bottom still lies below the surface."

msgid "看见你腰间的令牌，脸色一沉，把竹竿往岸上一扔，拔出了剑。"
msgstr " sees the token at your waist, scowls, throws the pole onto the shore and draws a sword."

msgid "神教的人也来管宫里的事？"
msgstr "The Order's people meddle in the palace's affairs too?"

msgid "湖水一年比一年浅。宫里要一个数，贫道来量。"
msgstr "The lake grows shallower every year. The palace wants a figure, so this poor Daoist comes to measure."

msgid "黑冠道士捂着伤口爬起来，丢下竹竿和木板，顺着湖岸往北边跑了。"
msgstr "Clutching his wound, the Black-Cap Daoist gets up, drops the pole and the board, and runs north along the lakeshore."

msgid "一个穿青色公服的瘦长汉子，背着一只画筒，蹲在山壁下的土坑边，一手按着纸，一手拿炭条描坑沿的形状。腰里却挂着一口刀。\n"
msgstr "A tall thin man in a blue official uniform, a drawing tube on his back, crouching by the pit at the foot of the cliff, one hand holding the paper down and the other tracing the pit's rim with a charcoal stick. Yet there is a saber at his waist.\n"

msgid "兵部画吏拿炭条在纸上比了比，又趴下去量坑沿。\n"
msgstr "The War Ministry Painter holds his charcoal against the paper, then lies down to measure the rim of the pit.\n"

msgid "兵部画吏抬头看了看山壁，嘴里嘀咕：一丈二……一丈三。\n"
msgstr "The War Ministry Painter looks up at the cliff, muttering, \"One zhang two... one zhang three.\"\n"

msgid "兵部画吏喝道：打兵部的人，你担得起么！\n"
msgstr "The War Ministry Painter shouts, \"Strike a man of the Ministry of War, and can you bear the consequences?\"\n"

msgid "兵部画吏一边招架，一边护着背上的画筒。\n"
msgstr "The War Ministry Painter parries while guarding the drawing tube on his back.\n"

msgid "画图"
msgstr "Sketching"

msgid "部里的差事。石匣就是从这个坑里起出来的——兵部要一张图，看看这山底下还有没有第二只。"
msgstr "Ministry business. The stone casket was taken out of this pit. The Ministry wants a map, to see whether there is a second one under this mountain."

msgid "抬头打量了你一眼，手按上了刀柄。"
msgstr " looks you up and down and lays a hand on the saber hilt."

msgid "你不是隘口的兵。你是谁的人？"
msgstr "You are not a soldier of the pass. Whose man are you?"

msgid "部里的差事。闲人走开，别踩了坑沿。"
msgstr "Ministry business. Idlers, move along, and do not trample the rim of the pit."

msgid "兵部画吏连滚带爬地退开几步，画筒也不要了，一张图掉在土坑边。他攀着铁索爬上去，跑了。"
msgstr "The War Ministry Painter stumbles and crawls back a few steps, abandoning even his drawing tube; one drawing is left lying by the pit. He climbs up the iron chain and flees."

msgid "一个瘦小的老头，裹着一件油亮的老羊皮袄，拄着一把冰凿。眉毛上结着霜，看湖的时候眼睛眯成一条缝。\n"
msgstr "A small, skinny old man in a greasy-shiny old sheepskin coat, leaning on an ice chisel. Frost clings to his eyebrows, and when he looks at the lake his eyes narrow to slits.\n"

msgid "老冰匠拿冰凿敲了敲岸边的冰，侧着耳朵听。\n"
msgstr "The Old Ice Cutter taps the shore ice with his chisel, head tilted to listen.\n"

msgid "老冰匠对着湖面哈了一口白气：今年的冰，底下还亮。\n"
msgstr "The Old Ice Cutter breathes a white puff toward the lake. \"This year's ice, there's still light beneath it.\"\n"

msgid "凿冰"
msgstr "Cutting Ice"

msgid "腊月里凿，开春前收。四十年了，湖上哪一块冰厚、哪一块冰薄，我闭着眼都知道。"
msgstr "We cut in the twelfth month and bring it in before spring. Forty years now. Which ice on this lake is thick and which is thin, I could tell with my eyes shut."

msgid "光"
msgstr "Light"

msgid "冰底下有光。青白青白的，一闪一闪，像有人提着灯在底下走。我只讲给孩子们听——大人不信。"
msgstr "There is a light under the ice. Pale blue-white, flickering, like someone walking down there with a lantern. I only tell it to the children. Grown-ups do not believe it."

msgid "老冰匠只是个凿冰的老人，打不过你，也跑不动。\n这一下去，玉螺湖村就少一个人——朱鸿雪要的就是这个，她会升你赤铜令；安妮儿会知道。\n要动手吗？"
msgstr "The Old Ice Cutter is only an old man who cuts ice. He cannot beat you, and he cannot run.\nIf you strike, Jade Conch Village loses one of its people. That is what Zhu Hongxue wants, and she will raise your red copper token in rank. Anni'er will find out.\nStrike?"

msgid "老冰匠又弯下腰去，侧着耳朵听冰底下的声音，没有回头。"
msgstr "The Old Ice Cutter bends down again, ear tilted to the sounds beneath the ice, and does not turn around."

msgid "你出手很快。他没有出声，倒在冰窟窿边上，冰凿滑进了水里。"
msgstr "You strike fast. He makes no sound and falls beside the hole in the ice, and his chisel slides into the water."

msgid "柳树底下静了一会儿，远处有孩子在喊他。"
msgstr "It is quiet for a while under the willow. Far off, a child is calling for him."

msgid "动手？动什么手？"
msgstr "Fight? What fight?"

msgid "搬走"
msgstr "Move Away"

msgid "劝老冰匠离开玉螺湖，再也别回来；拿他的冰凿回去，向朱鸿雪交差。\n他活下来，可你是拿一把冰凿去骗朱鸿雪：她信不信，看你西厢那一桩有没有瞒过她——瞒过的，到了分裂那天，她会当面揭穿。\n要劝他走吗？"
msgstr "Persuade the Old Ice Cutter to leave Jade Conch Lake and never return, then take his ice chisel back and report to Zhu Hongxue.\nHe lives, but you are using a chisel to deceive Zhu Hongxue. Whether she believes you depends on whether you hid the matter of the west wing from her. If you did, she will expose you to your face on the day of the split.\nPersuade him to go?"

msgid "听你说完，半天没吭声。"
msgstr " listens to you to the end and says nothing for a long while."

msgid "有人要我的命？……我一个凿冰的。"
msgstr "Someone wants my life? ...I am only an ice cutter."

msgid "冰底下的光，我就不该讲。"
msgstr "I should never have told about the light under the ice."

msgid "把手里的冰凿递给你。"
msgstr " holds the ice chisel out to you."

msgid "拿去吧，往后用不着了。有人问，就说我掉进冰窟窿里了。"
msgstr "Take it. I will not need it anymore. If anyone asks, say I fell into a hole in the ice."

msgid "背起包袱，顺着青石小路往村口去了，一回也没有回头。"
msgstr " shoulders a bundle and goes down the bluestone path toward the village entrance, never once looking back."

msgid "搬走？我在这湖边住了一辈子。"
msgstr "Move away? I have lived by this lake all my life."

msgid "老冰匠连连摆手：我一个凿冰的老头子，哪里经得起你一下。"
msgstr "The Old Ice Cutter waves both hands. \"I'm just an old ice cutter. How could I take a single blow from you?\""

msgid "颜违站在石椅旁，衣襟理得一丝不乱，手里没拿兵刃。今日的事是他一手张罗的。\n"
msgstr "Yan Wei stands beside the stone chair, his robe arranged without a crease, no weapon in his hand. Today's gathering is all his arrangement.\n"

msgid "颜违摆了摆手：今天是推选的日子，不动手。"
msgstr "Yan Wei waves a hand. \"Today is the day of the election. No fighting.\""

msgid "正月十七，九派都在这里。有话，台上说。"
msgstr "The seventeenth of the first month, and all nine schools are here. Say what you have to say on the terrace."

msgid "卫沧澜坐在石椅边的一块石头上，膝上搁着那本诗集。二十年没上过这座台了。\n"
msgstr "Wei Canglan sits on a rock beside the stone chair, a book of poems on his knees. He has not set foot on this terrace in twenty years.\n"

msgid "卫沧澜摆了摆手：今天是推选的日子，不动手。"
msgstr "Wei Canglan waves a hand. \"Today is the day of the election. No fighting.\""

msgid "柳淳风抱着剑坐在封山的旗下，背挺得笔直。\n"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng sits beneath the Empty Mountain banner with his sword in his arms, back straight.\n"

msgid "柳淳风摆了摆手：今天是推选的日子，不动手。"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng waves a hand. \"Today is the day of the election. No fighting.\""

msgid "柳绘心坐在封山的旗下。旗是新做的，上头那个「北」字是她自己添的。\n"
msgstr "Liu Huixin sits beneath the Empty Mountain banner. The banner is new, and the character for \"North\" on it she added herself.\n"

msgid "柳绘心摆了摆手：今天是推选的日子，不动手。"
msgstr "Liu Huixin waves a hand. \"Today is the day of the election. No fighting.\""

msgid "潘军禅站在主位的旗下，手里拿着一张名单，脸上照旧带着笑。今日的票由他来唱。\n"
msgstr "Pan Junchan stands beneath the banner at the seat of honor, a list in his hand, the same smile on his face. Today he calls out the votes.\n"

msgid "潘军禅摆了摆手：今天是推选的日子，不动手。"
msgstr "Pan Junchan waves a hand. \"Today is the day of the election. No fighting.\""

msgid "振远镖局镖头"
msgstr "Escort Chief of the Far-Road Escorts"

msgid "陈剑秋坐在振远的旗下，刀横在膝上。\n"
msgstr "Chen Jianqiu sits beneath the Far-Road banner, his saber across his knees.\n"

msgid "陈剑秋摆了摆手：今天是推选的日子，不动手。"
msgstr "Chen Jianqiu waves a hand. \"Today is the day of the election. No fighting.\""

msgid "茅山派天师"
msgstr "Celestial Master of the Mount Mao School"

msgid "林忌坐在茅山的黄旗下，六根指头的那只手搭在剑柄上。\n"
msgstr "Lin Ji sits beneath the yellow Mount Mao banner, his six-fingered hand resting on his sword hilt.\n"

msgid "林忌摆了摆手：今天是推选的日子，不动手。"
msgstr "Lin Ji waves a hand. \"Today is the day of the election. No fighting.\""

msgid "蓝止萍坐在晚月庄的旗下，裙角压得平平整整。\n"
msgstr "Lan Zhiping sits beneath the Latemoon Manor banner, the hem of her skirt pressed flat and neat.\n"

msgid "蓝止萍摆了摆手：今天是推选的日子，不动手。"
msgstr "Lan Zhiping waves a hand. \"Today is the day of the election. No fighting.\""

msgid "山烟寺住持"
msgstr "Abbot of Mountain Mist Temple"

msgid "玄智和尚坐在山烟寺的旗下，手里捻着一串念珠。\n"
msgstr "Monk Xuanzhi sits beneath the Mountain Mist Temple banner, rolling a string of prayer beads in his fingers.\n"

msgid "玄智和尚摆了摆手：今天是推选的日子，不动手。"
msgstr "Monk Xuanzhi waves a hand. \"Today is the day of the election. No fighting.\""

msgid "步玄派掌门人"
msgstr "Master of the Mystic Step School"

msgid "骆云舟坐在步玄派的旗下，一把折扇收在手里。\n"
msgstr "Luo Yunzhou sits beneath the Mystic Step School banner, a folding fan closed in his hand.\n"

msgid "骆云舟摆了摆手：今天是推选的日子，不动手。"
msgstr "Luo Yunzhou waves a hand. \"Today is the day of the election. No fighting.\""

msgid "花紫会龙头"
msgstr "Dragon Head of the Beggars' Guild"

msgid "陆得财盘腿坐在花紫会的旗下，腰里的皮酒囊二十三个结。他一直看着台下官道那边。\n"
msgstr "Lu Decai sits cross-legged beneath the Beggars' Guild banner, the leather wineskin at his waist bearing twenty-three knots. He keeps looking toward the official road below the terrace.\n"

msgid "陆得财摆了摆手：今天是推选的日子，不动手。"
msgstr "Lu Decai waves a hand. \"Today is the day of the election. No fighting.\""

msgid "陆得财盘腿坐在花紫会的旗下，正抠着脚。\n"
msgstr "Lu Decai sits cross-legged beneath the Beggars' Guild banner, picking at his feet.\n"

msgid "绝尘派祖师"
msgstr "Founder of the Dustless School"

msgid "绝尘子坐在绝尘派的旗下，眼睛半闭着。\n"
msgstr "Juechenzi sits beneath the Dustless School banner, eyes half closed.\n"

msgid "绝尘子摆了摆手：今天是推选的日子，不动手。"
msgstr "Juechenzi waves a hand. \"Today is the day of the election. No fighting.\""

msgid "颜违坐在正厅中央那张黝黑的太师椅上。椅子是他的了，他坐得很稳。\n"
msgstr "Yan Wei sits in the dark grand chair in the middle of the main hall. The chair is his now, and he sits firmly.\n"

msgid "颜违抬了抬眼：盟主不同人动手。"
msgstr "Yan Wei raises his eyes. \"The Alliance Leader does not fight people.\""

msgid "九派过半，本座坐这把椅子。二十年的旧案，到此为止。"
msgstr "More than half the nine schools stand behind me, so I sit in this chair. The old case of twenty years ends here."

msgid "正月十七的事，定了。"
msgstr "The matter of the seventeenth of the first month is settled."

msgid "振远趟子手"
msgstr "Far-Road Escort Runner"

msgid "一个黑红脸膛的趟子手，推着一辆独轮镖车。车上用麻绳捆着两只描金的红木箱，车头插一面三角小旗，红底黄边，绣一个「镖」字。他走一步，车轱辘吱呀一声。\n"
msgstr "A runner with a dark red face, pushing a single-wheeled escort cart. Two gilt-trimmed red hardwood chests are lashed to it with hemp rope, and at the front stands a triangular pennant, red with a yellow border, embroidered with the character for \"Escort\". With each step he takes, the wheel creaks.\n"

msgid "老周蹲在镖车边上，拿袖子擦箱子上的描金。\n"
msgstr "Old Zhou crouches by the cart, wiping the gilt on a chest with his sleeve.\n"

msgid "老周喊道：教你尝尝我的厉害！\n"
msgstr "Old Zhou shouts, \"I'll show you what I can do!\"\n"

msgid "老周叫道：我们镖局可不是好惹的！\n"
msgstr "Old Zhou yells, \"Our escort agency is not to be trifled with!\"\n"

msgid "车夫看了一眼{npc}推的镖车，直摆手：「振远的镖？小号的车拉不起，您另请高明。」"
msgstr "The coachman glances at the escort cart {npc} is pushing and waves both hands. \"Far-Road cargo? Our little firm can't haul it. You'd best find someone more capable.\""

msgid "老周推着镖车跟在你后头，车轱辘吱呀吱呀地响。\n"
msgstr "Old Zhou pushes the cart along behind you, the wheel creaking away.\n"

msgid "老周扯开嗓子喊道：振远镖局——盛名远扬——\n"
msgstr "Old Zhou bellows, \"Far-Road Escorts—famed far and wide—\"\n"

msgid "老周坐在车把上，一只手按着刀，眼睛盯着路。\n"
msgstr "Old Zhou sits on the cart handles, one hand on his saber, his eyes on the road.\n"

msgid "上路"
msgstr "Set Out"

msgid "镖局的事，不劳外人。"
msgstr "Escort business. No need for outsiders."

msgid "镖交了。"
msgstr "The shipment is delivered."

msgid "往手心里啐了一口，握住车把。"
msgstr " spits into the palms and grips the cart handles."

msgid "走！车马行不拉镖车，咱们一步一步走到京师。"
msgstr "Let's go! The coach house won't haul an escort cart, so we walk to the Capital one step at a time."

msgid "镖局的车，镖头不发话不动。"
msgstr "An escort cart does not move until the chief says so."

msgid "等着"
msgstr "Wait"

msgid "镖交了，还等什么？"
msgstr "The shipment is delivered. What are we waiting for?"

msgid "成，我在这儿看着车。办完了事回来，叫我一声「上路」。"
msgstr "All right, I'll watch the cart here. When you are done, come back and say \"Set Out\" to me."

msgid "两箱红货，京师振远总局收。箱子里是什么，我们不问——走镖的规矩。"
msgstr "Two chests of valuables, to be received at Far-Road's Head Office in the Capital. What is in the chests we do not ask. That is the rule of the escort trade."

msgid "二十年前那一趟？那会儿我还没进镖局。听老人说，死了十一个，镖头、镖师、趟子手，一个都没回来。打那以后，振远的车不走老松岭。"
msgstr "That run twenty years ago? I had not joined the agency yet. The old hands say eleven died, chief, escorts and runners, and not one came back. Since then, Far-Road carts do not travel Old Pine Ridge."

msgid "劫镖"
msgstr "Escort Robbery"

msgid "交了官，天驼关的人押走了。……那后生使的是振远的刀，你看出来没有？"
msgstr "You handed him to the law, and the men of Camelback Pass took him away... That young fellow used Far-Road's saber. Did you notice?"

msgid "放了？……也好。那后生使的是振远的刀，春风快意刀。谁教的，我不问。"
msgstr "You let him go? ...Fine. That young fellow used Far-Road's saber, the Spring Blade. Who taught him, I will not ask."

msgid "那后生怎么办，你给个话：交官府，还是放他走。没个了结，这镖进不了总局的门。"
msgstr "What about that young fellow? Say the word: hand him to the law or let him go. Until it is settled, this shipment cannot go through the Head Office's door."

msgid "碎石小路那一段荒，过了铁索才是天驼关的地界。要出事，就出在那一段。"
msgstr "The Gravel Lane stretch is wild. Only past the iron cables is Camelback Pass's territory. If trouble comes, it will come on that stretch."

msgid "劫镖的"
msgstr "Escort Robber"

msgid "一个二十出头的后生，半截黑布蒙着脸，露出来的一双眼睛熬得通红。手里一把旧腰刀，刀鞘上的漆掉了大半，护手上刻着一个「振」字。\n"
msgstr "A young man in his early twenties, half his face hidden by a strip of black cloth, the eyes above it red from lack of sleep. In his hand is an old saber, most of the lacquer gone from its scabbard, the character \"Zhen\" carved on the guard.\n"

msgid "蒙面后生咬着牙喝道：车留下！\n"
msgstr "The masked young man grits his teeth. \"Leave the cart!\"\n"

msgid "蒙面后生的刀一撩一抹——是振远的春风快意刀。\n"
msgstr "The masked young man's saber flicks up and sweeps across: it is Far-Road's Spring Blade.\n"

msgid "从路边的乱石后面站起来，半截黑布蒙着脸，横刀拦在路当中。"
msgstr " rises from behind the tumbled rocks by the road, half his face in black cloth, and bars the road with his saber held crosswise."

msgid "振远的镖？车留下，人走。"
msgstr "Far-Road's cargo? The cart stays. You go."

msgid "把镖车往路边一推，拔出了刀。"
msgstr " shoves the escort cart to the roadside and draws a saber."

msgid "哪条道上的朋友？振远的镖也敢劫？"
msgstr "Which road are you from, friend? You dare rob Far-Road's cargo?"

msgid "二十年前，振远的镖车停在老松岭底下，我爹没回来。今天我拿振远一车货，不算多。"
msgstr "Twenty years ago Far-Road's cart stopped at the foot of Old Pine Ridge, and my father never came back. Taking one cartload from Far-Road today is not much."

msgid "乱石后面又跳出两个汉子，抄着刀扑了上来——冲的是你。\n"
msgstr "Two more men leap out from behind the rocks, sabers in hand, and rush at you. It is you they are after.\n"

msgid "蒙面后生横刀挡在路当中，刀鞘上的漆掉了大半。\n"
msgstr "The masked young man bars the road with his saber across his body, most of the lacquer gone from its scabbard.\n"

msgid "蒙面后生坐在路边的石头上，捂着肩膀，不看你。\n"
msgstr "The masked young man sits on a rock at the roadside, clutching his shoulder, not looking at you.\n"

msgid "把脸上的黑布扯了下来。"
msgstr " pulls the black cloth off."

msgid "我叫贺平。我爹贺长庚，振远的趟子手。二十年前那趟镖走老松岭，他死在瀑布底下——振远说是劫匪干的。"
msgstr "My name is He Ping. My father was He Changgeng, a runner for Far-Road. Twenty years ago on that run through Old Pine Ridge he died at the foot of the waterfall. Far-Road said bandits did it."

msgid "他走之前托人捎回来一封信。信上写：兵部的人在岭上等着，镖头说照走。"
msgstr "Before he set out, he had a letter sent back by someone. It said: the Ministry of War's men are waiting on the ridge, and the Chief says go ahead anyway."

msgid "照走。振远拿我爹的命换了兵部的一句话。我拿振远一车货，不算多。"
msgstr "Go ahead anyway. Far-Road traded my father's life for a word from the Ministry of War. Taking one cartload from Far-Road is not much."

msgid "交官府"
msgstr "Turn Him In"

msgid "把劫镖的后生交给官府。\n过了铁索就是天驼关，守关的官兵会押他去京师——劫镖是大罪。官府的赏金，振远会转给你。\n他爹那封信，你就看不到了。\n要这么做吗？"
msgstr "Hand the young robber over to the authorities.\nPast the iron cables is Camelback Pass, and the soldiers who hold it will send him to the Capital; robbing an escort is a grave crime. Far-Road will pass the authorities' reward on to you.\nYou will never see his father's letter.\nDo it?"

msgid "没有挣。"
msgstr " does not struggle."

msgid "交吧。振远的人，官府的人，本来就是一伙的。"
msgstr "Go on, hand me over. Far-Road's people and the authorities were always in it together."

msgid "老周拿麻绳把他捆了，押着下了铁索。天驼关的官兵接了人，记下了振远的名字。\n"
msgstr "Old Zhou ties him up with hemp rope and marches him down the iron cables. The soldiers of Camelback Pass take him and write down Far-Road's name.\n"

msgid "放劫镖的后生走。\n他会留下他爹最后的一封家信——二十年前那趟镖，信里有一句话。\n劫镖的人从此不见官。要这么做吗？"
msgstr "Let the young robber go.\nHe will leave you his father's last letter home: in it, a line about that run twenty years ago.\nThe robber will never face the law. Do it?"

msgid "愣了半天，从怀里掏出一张折得发软的纸，塞到你手里。"
msgstr " stares blankly for a long time, then pulls a paper folded soft from inside the coat and presses it into your hand."

msgid "我爹的信。你替振远押镖——振远要是还有一个讲理的，拿给陈天星看。"
msgstr "My father's letter. You are escorting for Far-Road. If anyone at Far-Road still listens to reason, show it to Chen Tianxing."

msgid "捡起刀，头也不回地走了。"
msgstr " picks up the saber and leaves without looking back."

msgid "振远？京师第一大镖局。二十年前死了十一个人，没一个人去问为什么。"
msgstr "Far-Road? The Capital's greatest escort agency. Eleven died twenty years ago, and not one person asked why."

msgid "一个敞着怀的汉子，腰里扎着草绳，刀已经出了鞘。看样子不是吃这碗饭的，是被人花钱叫来的。\n"
msgstr "A man with his coat hanging open, a straw rope tied at his waist, saber already drawn. He does not look like one who lives by this trade; someone paid him to come.\n"

msgid "劫道的汉子喝道：贺兄弟，车我们推走！\n"
msgstr "The highwayman shouts, \"Brother He, we'll take the cart!\"\n"

msgid "劫道的汉子的刀横着扫过来。\n"
msgstr "The highwayman's saber sweeps across.\n"

msgid "蒙着面，坐在竹林里一块青石上，细剑横在膝上。面巾下的眉眼，是书房里那个老妇人的眉眼。她听见你的脚步，没有起身。\n"
msgstr "Masked, she sits on a bluestone slab in the bamboo grove, a slender sword across her knees. The eyes above the veil are those of the old woman in the study. She hears your footsteps and does not rise.\n"

msgid "竹林深处，有人压着声音在哭。\n"
msgstr "Deep in the bamboo grove, someone is weeping, voice held down.\n"

msgid "那一夜，前厅的两个丫头，内厅的昭蓉，是我杀的。宝衣出了庄门，朱鸿雪要的东西没了——神教我回不去，这里我也回不来。"
msgstr "That night, the two maids in the front hall and Zhaorong in the inner hall: I killed them. The robe has left the manor gate, and what Zhu Hongxue wanted is gone. I cannot go back to the Order, and I cannot come back here either."

msgid "拿去。给她，还是还给神教，你定。"
msgstr "Take it. Give it to her or return it to the Order, as you decide."

msgid "……我回内书房去。她要怎样，随她。"
msgstr "...I will go back to the inner study. Whatever she wants, let her."

msgid "无名老妇的女儿"
msgstr "Nameless Old Woman's Daughter"

msgid "二十来岁的女子，没有蒙面——眉眼和窗下那个老妇人一模一样。她坐在书架边，细剑横在膝上，一下一下地擦。\n"
msgstr "A woman of about twenty, unmasked, her eyes exactly like those of the old woman under the window. She sits beside a bookshelf, a slender sword across her knees, wiping it again and again.\n"

msgid "她摇了摇头：我答应过娘，这把剑往后只守这间书房。"
msgstr "She shakes her head. \"I promised Mother this sword would guard only this study from now on.\""

msgid "她在这里。我也在。"
msgstr "She is here. So am I."

msgid "剑我不扔。可往后，它只守这间书房。"
msgstr "I will not throw the sword away. But from now on it guards only this study."

msgid "神教"
msgstr "The Order"

msgid "朱鸿雪不会来要人。神教的令，只从上一个持令人手里接——我手里已经没有令了。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue will not come demanding me. The Order's token passes only from the last holder's hand, and I hold no token now."

msgid "蓝止萍站在湖岸的柳树下，晚月庄的弟子在她身后排开，手里的鞭子都垂着，没有一个人说话。\n"
msgstr "Lan Zhiping stands beneath the willow on the lakeshore, Latemoon Manor's disciples ranged behind her, whips hanging from their hands, not one speaking.\n"

msgid "蓝止萍摆了摆手：今夜的鞭子，留给湖里上来的东西。"
msgstr "Lan Zhiping waves a hand. \"Tonight the whips are for what comes up out of the lake.\""

msgid "庄规守得住庄门，守不住这片湖。今夜，晚月庄的人在岸上。"
msgstr "The manor's rules can hold the manor's gate, but not this lake. Tonight Latemoon Manor's people are on the shore."

msgid "无名老妇拄着那根鞭子站在湖岸上，没有看湖，看的是站在最前面的女儿。\n"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman stands on the lakeshore leaning on that whip, not looking at the lake but at her daughter standing in front.\n"

msgid "无名老妇摇了摇头：今夜不是跟你动手的时候。"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman shakes her head. \"Tonight is not the time to fight you.\""

msgid "她要来，我拦不住。这一回，我跟着她。"
msgstr "She wanted to come, and I could not stop her. This time, I follow her."

msgid "她站在最前面，没有蒙面，细剑出了鞘。六阴剑的寒气贴着湖面走——这一回，它守的是岸。\n"
msgstr "She stands at the very front, unmasked, her slender sword drawn. The chill of the Six-Chaos Sword creeps along the surface of the lake. This time, what it guards is the shore.\n"

msgid "她把剑尖垂了下去：今夜的剑，留给湖里上来的东西。"
msgstr "She lowers the point of her sword. \"Tonight my sword is for what comes up out of the lake.\""

msgid "冰下面那东西，宫里的人叫它侮天鬼。我在北麓的时候，听他们念过它的名字。"
msgstr "The thing under the ice: the palace people call it the Heaven-Defier. When I was at the north foot, I heard them speak its name."

msgid "无名老妇站在晚月庄的旗后面，一句话也没有说。\n"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman stands behind the Latemoon Manor banner, and says not a word.\n"

msgid "无名老妇摆了摆手：今天是推选的日子。"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman waves a hand. \"Today is the day of the election.\""

msgid "晚月庄的事，庄主说了算。我只是来看着她。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor's affairs are for the Mistress of the Manor to decide. I only came to watch over her."

msgid "她站在她娘身边，没有蒙面。九派的人有几个认出了她手里那把细剑，又把目光移开了。\n"
msgstr "She stands beside her mother, unmasked. A few of the nine schools' people recognize the slender sword in her hand, then look away.\n"

msgid "她摇了摇头：今天是推选的日子。"
msgstr "She shakes her head. \"Today is the day of the election.\""

msgid "神教的人也在看这座台子。我站在这里，他们看得见。"
msgstr "The Order's people are watching this terrace too. I stand here, where they can see me."

msgid "兵部的管事"
msgstr "Steward of the Ministry of War"

msgid "一个穿青绸袍子的中年人，独占着靠窗的一张桌子，一壶酒已经见了底，眼神有点发直。袍子的前襟鼓鼓囊囊，揣着一叠纸，他的手隔一会儿就按一按胸口。\n"
msgstr "A middle-aged man in a blue silk gown, taking a whole table by the window to himself, a pot of wine already drained, his eyes a little glazed. The front of his gown bulges with a stack of papers, and every so often his hand presses his chest.\n"

msgid "胡管事从怀里掏出那叠纸往地上一扔，连滚带爬地下了楼：「有贼——有贼啊！」\n"
msgstr "Steward Hu pulls the stack of papers from his coat, flings it to the floor and tumbles down the stairs. \"Thief! Thief!\"\n"

msgid "胡管事摸了摸胸口，又灌了一口酒。\n"
msgstr "Steward Hu touches his chest and gulps down more wine.\n"

msgid "胡管事嘟囔道：八户……槐阳城外还差两户。\n"
msgstr "Steward Hu mutters, \"Eight households... still two short outside Huaiyang city.\"\n"

msgid "关北的河要人挖。兵部的令——你有意见，去兵部说。"
msgstr "The rivers of Beyond the Pass need men to dig them. Ministry of War order. If you have objections, take them to the Ministry."

msgid "什么契？没有的事。……你是哪家的？"
msgstr "What deed? No such thing... Who are you with?"

msgid "一个满脸风霜的老乞丐，缩在广场边的墙根下晒太阳。他腰里挂着一只大皮酒囊，网绳上打着结——你数了数，二十个。\n"
msgstr "A weather-beaten old beggar huddled at the foot of a wall at the edge of the square, sunning himself. A big leather wineskin hangs at his waist, knots tied in its net cord. You count them: twenty.\n"

msgid "老乞丐往墙根里一缩：叫花子的命不值钱，也不卖。"
msgstr "The old beggar shrinks back against the wall. \"A beggar's life is worth nothing, and it is not for sale either.\""

msgid "下一个在绮云镇的渡口。叫花子只知道下一个。"
msgstr "The next one is at the ferry landing in Cloudweave Town. A beggar knows only the next one."

msgid "把皮酒囊往你面前一摊。"
msgstr " spreads the leather wineskin out in front of you."

msgid "数。"
msgstr "Count."

msgid "二十个。替身里我的结最少——乔阴那个叫你从我问起，是规矩：一个只认得下一个。"
msgstr "Twenty. Of the stand-ins, mine has the fewest knots. The one in Tallshade told you to start with me. That is the rule: each knows only the next."

msgid "下一个在绮云镇的渡口，天天坐在船帮上钓鱼。他比我多一个结。"
msgstr "The next is at the ferry landing in Cloudweave Town, sitting on the gunwale fishing every day. He has one more knot than I do."

msgid "龙头？叫花子哪来的龙头。……好心的大爷，赏几文钱吧。"
msgstr "Dragon Head? Where would a beggar get a Dragon Head? ...Kind sir, spare a few wen."

msgid "陆得财懒洋洋地打了个哈欠，把酒囊往怀里拢了拢。\n"
msgstr "Lu Decai yawns lazily and tucks the wineskin closer into his coat.\n"

msgid "一个老叫花子坐在渡口的船帮上钓鱼，钓竿是一根竹枝。他腰里挂着一只大皮酒囊，网绳上打着结——你数了数，二十一个。\n"
msgstr "An old beggar sits on the gunwale at the ferry landing, fishing with a bamboo twig for a rod. A big leather wineskin hangs at his waist, knots tied in its net cord. You count them: twenty-one.\n"

msgid "老叫花子头也不回：鱼要咬钩了，别闹。"
msgstr "The old beggar does not turn his head. \"A fish is about to bite. Quiet.\""

msgid "京师东街，尚书府的后墙根底下。"
msgstr "Capital East Street, at the foot of the Minister's Mansion's back wall."

msgid "把竹枝往船帮上一搁，解下皮酒囊。"
msgstr " lays the bamboo twig on the gunwale and unties the leather wineskin."

msgid "二十一个。"
msgstr "Twenty-one."

msgid "我也只知道下一个。下一个就是龙头：京师东街，尚书府的后墙根底下。"
msgstr "I know only the next one too. The next one is the Dragon Head: Capital East Street, at the foot of the Minister's Mansion's back wall."

msgid "他在那里坐了二十年。叫花子都知道，没几个见过。"
msgstr "He has sat there twenty years. Every beggar knows it, and few have seen him."

msgid "龙头？……鱼都让你吓跑了。"
msgstr "Dragon Head? ...You have scared all the fish away."

msgid "渡口的水拍着船帮，陆得财的钓竿一动不动。\n"
msgstr "The water at the landing slaps the gunwale, and Lu Decai's fishing rod does not stir.\n"

msgid "一个老叫花子背靠着尚书府的后墙坐着，眼睛半睁半闭，像是睡着了。他腰里挂着一只大皮酒囊，网绳上密密地打着结——你数了数，二十三个。\n"
msgstr "An old beggar sits with his back against the Minister's Mansion's rear wall, eyes half open, half closed, as if asleep. A big leather wineskin hangs at his waist, densely knotted along its net cord. You count them: twenty-three.\n"

msgid "老叫花子眼皮都没抬：二十年没跟人动过手，不差今天。"
msgstr "The old beggar does not even lift an eyelid. \"Twenty years without raising a hand to anyone. I will not start today.\""

msgid "酒囊系在得财腰上了。乔阴的花紫会是他的。我在这儿，接着看着庾家。"
msgstr "The wineskin is tied at Decai's waist now. The Beggars' Guild of Tallshade is his. I stay here and keep watching the Yu family."

msgid "二十三个结，你数过了。乔阴那个替我管了二十年的花紫会，管得比我好。"
msgstr "Twenty-three knots, you counted them. The man in Tallshade who has run the Beggars' Guild for me these twenty years has run it better than I did."

msgid "你是封山剑派的弟子，师父是柳淳风。"
msgstr "You are a disciple of the Empty Mountain School, and your shifu is Liu Chunfeng."

msgid "你是封山剑派北宗的人，和柳绘心同辈。"
msgstr "You are of the Empty Mountain School's North Branch, of the same generation as Liu Huixin."

msgid "柳淳风认得老岑的信：淳风武馆的门，你随时进。"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng knew Old Cen's letter: the door of Pure Wind Hall is open to you any time."

msgid "柳淳风替你给水烟阁的潘军禅写过一封信。"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng wrote a letter for you to Pan Junchan of Waterfog Pavilion."

msgid "雪亭镇上没人再敢借淳风武馆的名头收钱。是你清的。"
msgstr "No one in Snow Pavilion dares collect money in Pure Wind Hall's name anymore. You cleared them out."

msgid "逄义认了那块腰牌。他欠武馆一句交代。"
msgstr "Pang Yi owned up to that waist token. He owes the hall an explanation."

msgid "武馆的人都知道，是你说破了门房的来历。"
msgstr "Everyone at the hall knows it was you who told the truth about the gatekeeper."

msgid "刘安禄的来历，你替他瞒着。他欠你一句话。"
msgstr "You keep Liu Anlu's past hidden for him. He owes you one."

msgid "你和血手刘三动过刀，放了他一条路。"
msgstr "You crossed blades with Bloody-Hand Liu and let him go his way."

msgid "《悟疾风劲竹书》在柳淳风的匣里。是你从竹林里取回来给他的。"
msgstr "Bamboo Against the Gale is in Liu Chunfeng's box. You brought it back to him from the bamboo grove."

msgid "柳绘心读到了父亲年轻时写的书。是你给她的。"
msgstr "Liu Huixin has read the book her father wrote when he was young. You gave it to her."

msgid "柳淳风认你是掌门传人，「点」字诀是他亲传的。北宗的牌子挂在绮云镇口。"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng has named you the Master's heir, and he taught you the \"Point\" technique himself. The North Branch's sign hangs at the entrance to Cloudweave Town."

msgid "你跟柳绘心立了北宗。柳淳风不再教你，武馆的门还开着。"
msgstr "You founded the North Branch with Liu Huixin. Liu Chunfeng no longer teaches you; the hall's door is still open."

msgid "正月十七，封山那一票听你的。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, Empty Mountain's vote goes with you."

msgid "你是振远镖局的人。"
msgstr "You are one of the Far-Road Escorts."

msgid "陈剑秋把二十年前那张镖单交给了你。这件事，振远至今不提。"
msgstr "Chen Jianqiu gave you the shipment ledger from twenty years ago. Far-Road still does not speak of it."

msgid "那张镖单，是你替陈天星带到京师的。他要查到底。"
msgstr "You carried that shipment ledger to the Capital for Chen Tianxing. He means to trace it to the end."

msgid "陈天星查清了二十年前那趟镖：是兵部点名改走的老松岭。"
msgstr "Chen Tianxing has found out about that escort twenty years ago: the Ministry of War ordered it rerouted through Old Pine Ridge."

msgid "你替振远押过一趟镖，从绮云镇一路押到京师总局。"
msgstr "You escorted a shipment for Far-Road, all the way from Cloudweave Town to the head office in the Capital."

msgid "碎石小路上劫镖的后生，你交给了官府。"
msgstr "You handed the youth who robbed the shipment on Gravel Lane over to the authorities."

msgid "碎石小路上劫镖的后生，你放他走了。他爹是二十年前死在老松岭的趟子手。"
msgstr "You let the youth who robbed the shipment on Gravel Lane go. His father was an escort runner who died on Old Pine Ridge twenty years ago."

msgid "陈天星给了你一张振远的名帖：持帖者，振远的朋友。"
msgstr "Chen Tianxing gave you a Far-Road Escorts calling card: whoever holds it is a friend of Far-Road."

msgid "潘军禅把镖单锁进了刑堂，振远的脸面保住了。陈剑秋松了一口气。"
msgstr "Pan Junchan locked the shipment ledger in the punishment hall, and Far-Road kept its face. Chen Jianqiu breathed again."

msgid "陈剑秋说：查到底。正月十七，振远那一票投旧盟主。"
msgstr "Chen Jianqiu said: trace it to the end. On the seventeenth of the first month, Far-Road's vote goes to the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "陈天星翻了振远二十年的总账：绮云分局开张的本钱，是兵部给的抚恤银。"
msgstr "Chen Tianxing went through twenty years of Far-Road's master ledger: the money that opened the Cloudweave branch was compensation silver from the Ministry of War."

msgid "你劝住了陈天星：那本总账烧了，抚恤银的事，振远不再提。陈剑秋许你学春风快意刀。"
msgstr "You talked Chen Tianxing round: the master ledger was burned, and Far-Road no longer speaks of the compensation silver. Chen Jianqiu let you learn the Spring Blade."

msgid "你跟陈天星查到底：振远的总账押去了乔阴县衙。绮云分局关了门，陈剑秋还坐在柜台后面。"
msgstr "You traced it to the end with Chen Tianxing: Far-Road's master ledger went to Tallshade Yamen. The Cloudweave branch shut its doors, and Chen Jianqiu still sits behind the counter."

msgid "正月十七，振远那一票听你的。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, Far-Road's vote goes with you."

msgid "你是天邪派的弟子。"
msgstr "You are a disciple of the Wayward School."

msgid "潘军禅给你看过那柄「邪剑穿灵」：它是鱼饵。"
msgstr "Pan Junchan showed you \"Spiritpiercer, the Evil Sword\": it is bait."

msgid "南危水把二十年的事托给了你。你没有告诉别人。"
msgstr "Nan Weishui trusted you with what happened twenty years ago. You told no one."

msgid "颜违记得，五长老的事是你告诉他的。他从那天起代行盟主之职。"
msgstr "Yan Wei remembers it was you who told him about the Fifth Elder. From that day on he has acted as Alliance Leader."

msgid "盟主卫沧澜是你从尚书府带出来的。"
msgstr "You brought the Alliance Leader, Wei Canglan, out of the Minister's Mansion."

msgid "於兰天武的通缉是你解的。他回了京。"
msgstr "You had the warrant for Yulan Tianwu lifted. He went back to the Capital."

msgid "你在水烟阁的山门值过一班，拿下了一个打听盟主的探子。"
msgstr "You stood a watch at Waterfog Pavilion's gate and seized a spy who was asking about the Alliance Leader."

msgid "你在水烟阁的山门拿错了人，真的探子趁乱下了山。"
msgstr "You seized the wrong man at Waterfog Pavilion's gate, and the real spy slipped down the mountain in the confusion."

msgid "二十年前那张镖单锁在水烟阁的刑堂里。是你交给潘军禅的。"
msgstr "The shipment ledger from twenty years ago is locked in Waterfog Pavilion's punishment hall. You gave it to Pan Junchan."

msgid "潘军禅告诉你：二十年前带走盟主的，是一队挂兵部刀的白衣武官。"
msgstr "Pan Junchan told you: the Alliance Leader was taken twenty years ago by a troop of officers in white, wearing Ministry of War sabers."

msgid "你站在颜违一边。你是水烟阁的执事；潘军禅从此只同你谈公事。"
msgstr "You stand with Yan Wei. You are a Deacon of Waterfog Pavilion; Pan Junchan speaks to you only of business now."

msgid "正月十七，天邪派那一票投颜违。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, the Wayward School's vote goes to Yan Wei."

msgid "正月十七，你站在潘军禅一边：等盟主回来。你是水烟阁的执事；颜违记下了你。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, you stand with Pan Junchan: wait for the Alliance Leader to return. You are a Deacon of Waterfog Pavilion; Yan Wei has marked you."

msgid "正月十七，天邪派那一票听你的。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, the Wayward School's vote goes with you."

msgid "你是绝尘派的弟子。"
msgstr "You are a disciple of the Dustless School."

msgid "你是过阵的客：走得出绝尘子的八卦阵。"
msgstr "You are a guest who has passed the formation: you can walk out of Juechenzi's Eight Trigram Formation."

msgid "你把阿牛和小翠从青石村北边闹鬼的山洞里领了出来。村长终于把那句话说完了：国之将亡，必有妖孽。"
msgstr "You led Aniu and Xiaocui out of the haunted cave north of Bluestone Village. The Village Head finally finished that saying: when a country is about to fall, monsters are sure to rise."

msgid "绝尘子知道洞里有东西。阵守得住石室，他就不管——绝尘派不问世事。"
msgstr "Juechenzi knows there is something in the cave. As long as the formation holds the Stone Chamber, he leaves it be: the Dustless School stays out of the world's affairs."

msgid "首徒了尘不这么想。他说话的时候，一直看着佛像下的师父。"
msgstr "His First Disciple, Liaochen, thinks otherwise. All the while he spoke, he kept his eyes on his shifu beneath the Buddha statue."

msgid "绝尘子答应了：正月十七下山走一趟。"
msgstr "Juechenzi agreed: on the seventeenth of the first month he will come down the mountain."

msgid "你是茅山派的弟子。"
msgstr "You are a disciple of the Mount Mao School."

msgid "林忌认你做茅山的朋友，许你上了藏经楼。"
msgstr "Lin Ji counts you a friend of Mount Mao and let you up into the Scripture Library."

msgid "林忌的师弟在京师兵部尚书府种了二十年花；你找到了他。"
msgstr "Lin Ji's junior brother has grown flowers for twenty years at the Minister's Mansion in the Capital, home of the Minister of War; you found him."

msgid "《上清符箓》在你手里：前半是茅山的符，后半是逆灵宫的字。"
msgstr "The Highest Clarity talisman book is in your hands: the first half is Mount Mao's talismans, the second half the Black Palace's writing."

msgid "花匠上了灵心观，在殿门里叫了林忌一声师兄。"
msgstr "The gardener came up to Clear Heart Abbey and, inside the hall doors, called Lin Ji \"Senior Brother\"."

msgid "《上清符箓》投进了灵心观的香炉。茅山宁可没有那一函。"
msgstr "The Highest Clarity talisman book went into Clear Heart Abbey's incense burner. Mount Mao would rather be without that volume."

msgid "《上清符箓》锁回了藏经楼二楼，花匠守着它；他教茅山道术，谁都教。林忌对你冷了一分。"
msgstr "The Highest Clarity talisman book is locked back on the second floor of the Scripture Library, with the gardener guarding it; he teaches Mount Mao Sorcery, to anyone. Lin Ji is a shade cooler toward you."

msgid "北麓剩下的人，花匠拿着符箓念下了山。"
msgstr "The gardener read from the talismans and chanted those left on the North Foot down the mountain."

msgid "林忌托你戴着黑冠回了逆灵宫，替茅山看，替茅山听。"
msgstr "Lin Ji asked you to go back into the Black Palace wearing the black cap, to watch for Mount Mao and listen for Mount Mao."

msgid "那卷残卷，林忌当着你的面烧了。"
msgstr "Lin Ji burned that fragment before your eyes."

msgid "残卷你还给了玄冥子。林忌没再提它，看你的眼神冷了一分。"
msgstr "You returned the fragment to Xuanmingzi. Lin Ji has not spoken of it since, and looks at you a shade more coldly."

msgid "逆灵宫的祭品名单，是你抄出来递给茅山的。"
msgstr "You copied out the Black Palace's sacrifice list and passed it to Mount Mao."

msgid "地牢里新关的三个人，是你放出来的。"
msgstr "You freed the three people newly locked in the dungeon."

msgid "逆灵宫那本祭品名册的原本，你从铁匣里带了出来。"
msgstr "You carried the original of the Black Palace's sacrifice register out of the iron box."

msgid "正月十七，茅山那一票听你的。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, Mount Mao's vote goes with you."

msgid "北麓那座道观，你交给了官府去剿。"
msgstr "You gave the abbey on the North Foot to the authorities to crush."

msgid "逆灵宫剩下的人下了山，茅山看着。是你去劝的。"
msgstr "Those left of the Black Palace came down the mountain, and Mount Mao watches them. You were the one who talked them down."

msgid "你是晚月庄的弟子。"
msgstr "You are a disciple of Latemoon Manor."

msgid "你是晚月庄的护法：不是弟子，庄里的事算你一份。"
msgstr "You are a Guardian of Latemoon Manor: not a disciple, but the manor's affairs count you in."

msgid "失传的沧海龙吟，又在区冥的神位前跳了一回。"
msgstr "The lost Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea has been danced once more before Ouming's spirit tablet."

msgid "寒於宝衣留在晚月庄。瑷伦替你守到决战。"
msgstr "Hanyu's Robe stays at Latemoon Manor. Ailun guards it for you until the final battle."

msgid "宝衣是你带出庄的。那一夜，庄里死了人。"
msgstr "You carried the robe out of the manor. That night, someone in the manor died."

msgid "宝衣又是你送回来的。瑷伦又是守衣人。"
msgstr "You brought the robe back again. Ailun is the Robe-Keeper once more."

msgid "晚月庄守了几百年的宝衣，你交给了外人。"
msgstr "You gave the robe Latemoon Manor had kept for hundreds of years to an outsider."

msgid "正月十七，晚月庄那一票改投颜违：逐神教。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, Latemoon Manor's vote turns to Yan Wei: drive out the Order."

msgid "正月十七，晚月庄那一票听你的。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, Latemoon Manor's vote goes with you."

msgid "无名老妇说：令牌在我这里。她还活着。"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman said: \"The token is with me. She is still alive.\""

msgid "蓝止萍说：庄规是你陪我守下来的。"
msgstr "Lan Zhiping said: \"You kept the manor's rules with me.\""

msgid "无名老妇说：你把我女儿带回来了。"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman said: \"You brought my daughter home.\""

msgid "蓝止萍说：庄规，你替她破了一回。"
msgstr "Lan Zhiping said: \"You broke the manor's rules once, for her.\""

msgid "你是山烟寺的弟子。"
msgstr "You are a disciple of Mountain Mist Temple."

msgid "你是流云轩的帮手：帮手不必落发。"
msgstr "You are a helper of Drifting Cloud Lodge: a helper need not take the tonsure."

msgid "你替流云轩采齐了玄智的三味药，喂了乔阴的樵夫老葛——寒气还是退不下去。"
msgstr "You gathered Xuanzhi's three herbs for Drifting Cloud Lodge and fed them to Old Ge, the woodcutter from Tallshade, but the cold would still not leave him."

msgid "你领金门外的独眼头陀进了流云轩，老葛当场好了。玄智记下了：你不守寺规。"
msgstr "You led the One-Eyed Ascetic from outside the Golden Gate into Drifting Cloud Lodge, and Old Ge was well on the spot. Xuanzhi has marked it: you do not keep the temple rules."

msgid "你照了寺规。玄智守了老葛三天三夜，命保住了，右手废了。"
msgstr "You kept the temple rules. Xuanzhi watched over Old Ge for three days and nights: his life was saved, his right hand was not."

msgid "玄智和尚信了你的担保。正月十七，山烟寺那一票投旧盟主。"
msgstr "Monk Xuanzhi trusted your word. On the seventeenth of the first month, Mountain Mist Temple's vote goes to the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "龙若法王说起了三十年前的事，给了你婆萝蜜多心经的一页贝叶：「收不收，是山烟寺的事。」"
msgstr "Dharma King Longruo told of what happened thirty years ago and gave you a palm-leaf page of the Heart Sutra: \"Whether it is accepted is for Mountain Mist Temple to say.\""

msgid "山烟寺收了西来的经：独眼头陀受戒入寺，流云轩从此治得了鬼卒的寒。"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple accepted the sutra from the west: the One-Eyed Ascetic took the precepts and joined the temple, and Drifting Cloud Lodge can now cure the Ghost Soldiers' cold."

msgid "山烟寺守了本寺一脉：经交还了龙若法王，金门外空了。"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple kept to its own line: the sutra went back to Dharma King Longruo, and the place outside the Golden Gate stands empty."

msgid "正月十七，山烟寺那一票听你的。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, Mountain Mist Temple's vote goes with you."

msgid "你是步玄派的弟子。"
msgstr "You are a disciple of the Mystic Step School."

msgid "你走出了桃林，骆云舟认你做桃林的客。"
msgstr "You found your way out of the Peach Grove, and Luo Yunzhou counts you a guest of the grove."

msgid "你在曼雩台上问过了剑：风泉剑灵在「剑神如意」之前收了剑。"
msgstr "You tested the sword on the Rain Dance Terrace: the Soul of Windspring sheathed its blade before it reached \"Sword Spirit, at will\"."

msgid "骆云舟托你给他十年没说过话的大哥骆建章送一封家书。"
msgstr "Luo Yunzhou asked you to carry a letter home to his elder brother, Luo Jianzhang, who has not spoken to him in ten years."

msgid "骆建章读了弟弟的信，说他还是那么写字，最后一笔甩出格子。"
msgstr "Luo Jianzhang read his brother's letter and said he still writes the same way, the last stroke flung out of the square."

msgid "兵部抄本上多出来的三句是骆建章落的笔；他认了。"
msgstr "The three extra lines in the Ministry of War copy were set down by Luo Jianzhang's brush; he admitted it."

msgid "骆云舟十年来第一次回京城，兄弟俩在相国府的厅上见了面。"
msgstr "Luo Yunzhou went back to the Capital for the first time in ten years, and the brothers met in the hall of the Chancellor's House."

msgid "骆建章写了供状：兵部抄本上那三句，是庾子建口述的。骆家和朝廷翻了脸。"
msgstr "Luo Jianzhang wrote a statement: the three lines in the Ministry of War copy were dictated by Yu Zijian. The Luo family has broken with the court."

msgid "骆建章在刑部照实供了，判了流放。骆家和朝廷翻了脸。"
msgstr "Luo Jianzhang told the truth at the Ministry of Justice and was sentenced to exile. The Luo family has broken with the court."

msgid "骆云舟带大哥回了乔阴，抄本的事不再提；骆家照旧是京城的世家。"
msgstr "Luo Yunzhou took his elder brother back to Tallshade, and no one speaks of the copy; the Luo family is still one of the Capital's great houses."

msgid "骆云舟把骆家的名帖给了你。"
msgstr "Luo Yunzhou gave you the Luo family calling card."

msgid "正月十七，步玄派那一票听你的。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, the Mystic Step School's vote goes with you."

msgid "你是花紫会的人。"
msgstr "You are one of the Beggars' Guild."

msgid "你替花紫会从兵部的胡管事身上摸回了槐阳八户的卖身契。"
msgstr "For the Beggars' Guild, you lifted the indentures of eight Huaiyang households off Steward Hu of the Ministry of War."

msgid "乔阴的陆得财是龙头的替身。你数着皮酒囊上的结，一个一个问了过去。"
msgstr "Lu Decai of Tallshade is a stand-in for the Dragon Head. You counted the knots on the leather wineskins and asked your way along, one after another."

msgid "你在京师尚书府的后墙根下见到了真龙头：二十三个结。"
msgstr "At the foot of the back wall of the Minister's Mansion in the Capital, you met the true Dragon Head: twenty-three knots."

msgid "尚书府小屋那封密信，你交给了真龙头。庾家不敢清乔阴的巷子。"
msgstr "You gave the secret letter from the Small Room of the Minister's Mansion to the true Dragon Head. The Yu family dares not clear Tallshade's alleys."

msgid "密信你交给了官府。叫花子不再跟你说正事。"
msgstr "You gave the secret letter to the authorities. The beggars no longer talk business with you."

msgid "你照真龙头的话，夜里从尚书府的狗洞把卫沧澜领了出来。"
msgstr "As the true Dragon Head told you, you led Wei Canglan out of the Minister's Mansion by night, through the dog hole."

msgid "你在福林大街认了二十三个结：真龙头坐回了乔阴，花紫会吃上了官饭，巡捕不再抓花紫会的人。陆得财出了北门。"
msgstr "On Fulin Street you owned the twenty-three knots: the true Dragon Head sits in Tallshade again, the Beggars' Guild eats official rice, and the constables no longer arrest its people. Lu Decai went out by the north gate."

msgid "你在福林大街认了这些年管事的陆得财：真龙头把皮酒囊系到他腰上，回了京师的墙根。乔阴的巷子里照旧没有官差。"
msgstr "On Fulin Street you owned Lu Decai, who has run things all these years: the true Dragon Head tied the leather wineskin to his belt and went back to the foot of the wall in the Capital. There are still no constables in Tallshade's alleys."

msgid "正月十七，花紫会那一票听你的。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, the Beggars' Guild's vote goes with you."

msgid "乔阴知县程不平替你写过一封信。"
msgstr "Cheng Buping, County Magistrate of Tallshade, wrote a letter for you."

msgid "陈显祖是你护送进县衙作的证。"
msgstr "You escorted Chen Xianzu into the yamen to testify."

msgid "天驼关的严廷殷看过程不平的信。"
msgstr "Yan Tingyin of Camelback Pass has read Cheng Buping's letter."

msgid "你是今科的武状元。"
msgstr "You are this year's Martial Champion."

msgid "兵部尚书庾子建是你在朝上揭发的。"
msgstr "You denounced Yu Zijian, Minister of War, at court."

msgid "你和庾子建私了了。兵部记着这份情，也记着这笔账。"
msgstr "You and Yu Zijian settled it privately. The Ministry of War remembers the favor, and the debt."

msgid "大内侍卫营的冯策说过：算老夫一个。"
msgstr "Feng Ce of the Palace Guard Barracks said: \"Count this old man in.\""

msgid "逆灵宫的余孽，是你交给官府的。"
msgstr "You handed what was left of the Black Palace to the authorities."

msgid "振远的总账是陈天星押进乔阴县衙的。程不平收下了，兵部的抚恤银记在了案上。"
msgstr "Chen Tianxing brought Far-Road's master ledger into Tallshade Yamen. Cheng Buping took it, and the Ministry of War's compensation silver went on the record."

msgid "尚书府小屋那封密信，是你交到程不平手上的。"
msgstr "You put the secret letter from the Small Room of the Minister's Mansion into Cheng Buping's hands."

msgid "你是乔阴县的捕快，腰里挂着程不平给的黑漆腰牌。"
msgstr "You are a constable of Tallshade County, with the black-lacquer badge Cheng Buping gave you at your waist."

msgid "雪亭路口、绮云镇口那两个打着官府告示收过路费的，是你拿下的。"
msgstr "You took down the two who collected tolls under an official notice, at the Snow Pavilion junction and at the entrance to Cloudweave Town."

msgid "他们身上的路引盖着天驼关铁卫营的大印。程不平说：印在严将军手里。"
msgstr "The travel passes on them bore the great seal of the Iron Guard Camp at Camelback Pass. Cheng Buping said: the seal is in General Yan's hands."

msgid "武举的第一场，程不平的荐书替你免了。"
msgstr "Cheng Buping's letter of recommendation spared you the first round of the Military Exam."

msgid "尚书府小屋那封密信，你给了花紫会。程不平不再跟你说案子。"
msgstr "You gave the secret letter from the Small Room of the Minister's Mansion to the Beggars' Guild. Cheng Buping no longer talks cases with you."

msgid "严廷殷认了路引上的印。印丢的那三天，副将李信记了一本账：盖印的是军师赫造基，兵部还拓了个模子去盖民夫令。"
msgstr "Yan Tingyin knew the seal on the travel passes. For the three days it was lost, his Lieutenant Li Xin kept a ledger: the one who used it was the Adviser, He Zaoji, and the Ministry of War even took a mold of it to stamp laborer orders."

msgid "你跟严廷殷整肃了天驼关：军师是你在将军营帐里拿下的，那本账没有上京。铁卫营欠你一回。"
msgstr "You purged Camelback Pass with Yan Tingyin: you took the Adviser down in the General's Tent, and the ledger never went to the Capital. The Iron Guard Camp owes you one."

msgid "你跟严廷殷整肃了天驼关：军师还在将军营帐里，等你去拿。"
msgstr "You purged Camelback Pass with Yan Tingyin: the Adviser is still in the General's Tent, waiting for you to take him."

msgid "你跟李信揭发了天驼关：那本账上了京，严廷殷被召回，李信守关，过关不再收钱。"
msgstr "You exposed Camelback Pass with Li Xin: the ledger went to the Capital, Yan Tingyin was recalled, Li Xin holds the pass, and no one pays to pass anymore."

msgid "小屋那封信和天驼关那本账放在一起，程不平又开了一回庾子建的堂。"
msgstr "With the Small Room letter and the Camelback Pass ledger side by side, Cheng Buping opened a hearing on Yu Zijian once more."

msgid "卫沧澜是皇叔拿着手诏从尚书府要回来的。"
msgstr "The Imperial Uncle took a handwritten edict to the Minister's Mansion and brought Wei Canglan back."

msgid "安妮儿说，她在等一个配得上宝衣的人。"
msgstr "Anni'er said she is waiting for someone worthy of the robe."

msgid "安妮儿说你配得上。东方神教记得你。"
msgstr "Anni'er said you are worthy. The Golden Crow Order remembers you."

msgid "晚月庄那块杀手令牌，是你还给神教的。朱鸿雪说：令回来了就好。"
msgstr "You returned Latemoon Manor's assassin's token to the Order. Zhu Hongxue said: \"It is good that the token is back.\""

msgid "宝衣出了庄，没进安妮儿的门。她记下了你的名字。"
msgstr "The robe left the manor and never came through Anni'er's door. She has remembered your name."

msgid "你放过了神教的那个杀手。"
msgstr "You spared the Order's assassin."

msgid "你接了朱鸿雪的令。"
msgstr "You took up Zhu Hongxue's token."

msgid "你把西厢的话照实告诉了朱鸿雪：那件衣，安妮儿不打算交给神教。"
msgstr "You told Zhu Hongxue what was said in the West Wing, as it was: Anni'er does not mean to give that robe to the Order."

msgid "你替安妮儿瞒下了西厢的话。她欠你一回。"
msgstr "You covered for Anni'er and kept what was said in the West Wing to yourself. She owes you one."

msgid "朱鸿雪给过你一块黑木令。神教的杀手认得它。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue gave you a black-wood token. The Order's assassins know it."

msgid "你手上沾了神教教主的血。朱鸿雪的令，到此为止。"
msgstr "Your hands are stained with the blood of the Order's Leader. Zhu Hongxue's orders end here."

msgid "朱鸿雪给过你三个名字，都是靠近湖底封物的人。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue gave you three names, all of them people who came close to what's sealed under the lake."

msgid "你替朱鸿雪杀了玉螺湖凿冰的老冰匠。"
msgstr "You killed the old ice cutter who cut ice on Jade Conch Lake, for Zhu Hongxue."

msgid "你劝玉螺湖的老冰匠搬走了，拿他的冰凿去向朱鸿雪交了差。"
msgstr "You persuaded the old ice cutter of Jade Conch Lake to move away, and took his ice chisel to Zhu Hongxue to report the job done."

msgid "你拿老冰匠的冰凿骗过朱鸿雪，她当面揭穿了你。"
msgstr "You tried to fool Zhu Hongxue with the old ice cutter's ice chisel, and she saw through you to your face."

msgid "朱鸿雪换给你一块赤铜令。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue gave you a red copper token in exchange."

msgid "你站到了安妮儿一边。一代教主收回了教主令，给了你一块黄金令牌。"
msgstr "You stood with Anni'er. The Order's first Leader took back the Order Leader's token and gave you a gold token."

msgid "你站到了朱鸿雪一边。她给了你一块黄金令牌；西厢的门，从此对你关着。"
msgstr "You stood with Zhu Hongxue. She gave you a gold token; the West Wing's door is shut to you from now on."

msgid "你进过那座黑砖道观。"
msgstr "You have been inside that black-brick abbey."

msgid "你见过「唤首」。他们知道有生人进过后殿。"
msgstr "You have seen \"the Calling of the Head\". They know a stranger got into the Rear Hall."

msgid "地牢里的人是你放走的。逆灵宫在找那天闯道观的孩子。"
msgstr "You were the one who freed the people in the dungeon. The Black Palace is looking for the young one who broke into the abbey that day."

msgid "玄冥子欠你一条命。他说过：带着残卷来后山找他。"
msgstr "Xuanmingzi owes you his life. He told you: bring the fragment and find him on the back mountain."

msgid "玄冥子说你是他的人。"
msgstr "Xuanmingzi says you are one of his."

msgid "管事道士许你在货栈的通铺上睡——他们当你是新来的道士。"
msgstr "The Steward Daoist lets you sleep on the communal bunk in the Storehouse: they take you for a new Daoist."

msgid "子时在后殿外，巡殿的道士撞见过你。"
msgstr "At midnight, outside the Rear Hall, the patrolling Daoist caught sight of you."

msgid "宫里在找一本不见了的名册。"
msgstr "The Palace is looking for a register that has gone missing."

msgid "玄冥子托你从宫主的书案底下取出天书的下半部；他教你的，是六阴剑。"
msgstr "Xuanmingzi asked you to take the second half of the Scripture from under the Palace Master's writing desk; what he taught you is the Six-Chaos Sword."

msgid "你把唤首前夜下湖的时辰和路交给了茅山。宫里迟早会知道是谁。"
msgstr "You gave Mount Mao the hour and the road the Palace would take down to the lake on the eve of the Calling of the Head. Sooner or later the Palace will know who it was."

msgid "唤首那一夜你戴着冠下湖——冰龙厅里那第一剑，是你从背后刺的。"
msgstr "On the night of the Calling of the Head you went down to the lake in the cap: the first stroke in the ice dragons' hall was yours, from behind."

msgid "黑冠还戴在你头上：唤首那一夜，你跟他们下湖。"
msgstr "The black cap is still on your head: on the night of the Calling of the Head, you go down to the lake with them."

msgid "你被识破了。黑冠不再管用，北麓有人在找你。"
msgstr "You have been found out. The black cap is no use anymore, and someone on the North Foot is looking for you."

msgid "北麓那座道观，官兵上去了。宫里剩下的人一个也没走脱。"
msgstr "Soldiers went up to the abbey on the North Foot. Not one of those left in the Palace got away."

msgid "宫里剩下的人跟你下了山。坛上的火灭了。"
msgstr "Those left in the Palace came down the mountain with you. The fire on the altar has gone out."

msgid "拜了柳淳风，淳风武馆的事就是你的事。"
msgstr "Bow to Liu Chunfeng, and Pure Wind Hall's business is your business."

msgid "你已经不是封山的人了。淳风武馆的事，到此为止。"
msgstr "You are no longer of Empty Mountain. Pure Wind Hall's business ends here."

msgid "问柳淳风「武馆的事」。"
msgstr "Ask Liu Chunfeng about \"The Hall's Business\"."

msgid "柳淳风说，镇西的青石官道上有人打着淳风武馆的旗号，向来投师的人收十两「拜师钱」。"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng says someone on the Bluestone Road west of town is using Pure Wind Hall's banner to charge those who come to study an \"Entrance Fee\" of ten taels."

msgid "去镇西的青石官道，会一会那几个收「拜师钱」的「封山弟子」。"
msgstr "Go to the Bluestone Road west of town and take on the \"Empty Mountain disciples\" collecting the \"Entrance Fee\"."

msgid "为首的罗七倒了，两个帮闲一哄而散。他胸前那块腰牌却是真的：背面刻着一个「逄」字，系绳上拴着绮云镇赌场的竹筹。"
msgstr "Their leader, Luo Qi, goes down, and his two hangers-on scatter. But the waist token on his chest is real: \"Pang\" is carved on the back, and a bamboo tally from the Cloudweave Town Gambling House hangs from its cord."

msgid "腰牌是从绮云镇的赌场流出来的。去赌场找那个姓逄的，问他「腰牌」。"
msgstr "The waist token came out of the Cloudweave Town Gambling House. Go there, find the man named Pang, and ask him about \"Waist Token\"."

msgid "逄义——柳淳风的同辈师弟——认了：牌是他赌输了押给罗七的。"
msgstr "Pang Yi, Liu Chunfeng's fellow disciple of the same generation, owns up: he lost the token gambling and pawned it to Luo Qi."

msgid "把腰牌带回淳风武馆，交给柳淳风。"
msgstr "Take the waist token back to Pure Wind Hall and give it to Liu Chunfeng."

msgid "柳淳风收下了这件事。「门户的名头，不是谁都能借的。」"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng takes the matter in hand. \"Not just anyone may borrow our school's name.\""

msgid "清了打着淳风武馆旗号收拜师钱的人"
msgstr "Cleared out the men charging entrance fees under Pure Wind Hall's banner"

msgid "大弟子"
msgstr "Senior Disciple"

msgid "罗七在镇上嚷过：武馆的门房是野羊山的血手刘三。李火狮在等一句话，问他「门房」——说破，武馆从此没有他的位置；替他瞒，这句话从此算在你头上。"
msgstr "Luo Qi shouted it around town: the hall's gatekeeper is Bloody-Hand Liu of Goathill. Li Huoshi is waiting for a word; ask him about \"Gatekeeper\". Tell the truth, and the hall has no place for the man from then on; cover for him, and that word is on your head from then on."

msgid "你对李火狮说了实话：门房刘安禄就是野羊山的血手刘三。武馆不留匪。"
msgstr "You told Li Huoshi the truth: the gatekeeper, Liu Anlu, is Bloody-Hand Liu of Goathill. The hall does not keep bandits."

msgid "说破了淳风武馆门房的来历"
msgstr "Told the truth about the past of Pure Wind Hall's gatekeeper"

msgid "你对李火狮说：那伙骗子认错了人。武馆里没人再提这件事。"
msgstr "You told Li Huoshi: those swindlers had the wrong man. No one at the hall speaks of it again."

msgid "替淳风武馆的门房瞒下了来历"
msgstr "Kept the past of Pure Wind Hall's gatekeeper hidden"

msgid "问柳淳风「竹书」。"
msgstr "Ask Liu Chunfeng about \"The Bamboo Book\"."

msgid "柳淳风二十岁那年在天驼关的竹林里住过一冬，写了一卷《悟疾风劲竹书》，留在竹林尽头、大黄石后面的石室里。"
msgstr "At twenty, Liu Chunfeng spent a winter in the Bamboo Grove at Camelback Pass and wrote Bamboo Against the Gale, which he left in the Stone Chamber behind the big yellow boulder at the end of the grove."

msgid "去天驼关的竹林道，照柳淳风教的法子推开尽头的大黄石，从石室的书柜里取出那卷书。"
msgstr "Go to the Bamboo Path at Camelback Pass, push the big yellow boulder at its end the way Liu Chunfeng taught you, and take the book from the book cabinet in the Stone Chamber."

msgid "《悟疾风劲竹书》到手了。薄薄一卷，末尾署着柳淳风的名字。"
msgstr "You have Bamboo Against the Gale. A thin volume, signed at the end with Liu Chunfeng's name."

msgid "书只有一本：交给柳淳风，他会收进匣里；交给柳绘心，她头一回读到父亲年轻时写的字。给出去就读不到了——想读，先读。"
msgstr "There is only one copy: give it to Liu Chunfeng and he will put it away in his box; give it to Liu Huixin and she will read, for the first time, what her father wrote when he was young. Once it is given you cannot read it, so if you want to, read it first."

msgid "《悟疾风劲竹书》在你身上"
msgstr "You have Bamboo Against the Gale"

msgid "书不在你身上了——是被人摸走了，还是给了别人？找回来再交"
msgstr "The book is not on you: stolen, or given away? Get it back, then hand it in"

msgid "你把书交给了柳淳风。他没有翻开，收进了案头的匣里：年轻时的糊涂话。"
msgstr "You gave the book to Liu Chunfeng. He did not open it, and put it away in the box on his desk: foolish words from his youth."

msgid "把《悟疾风劲竹书》带回来交给了柳淳风"
msgstr "Brought Bamboo Against the Gale back to Liu Chunfeng"

msgid "你把书交给了柳绘心。她头一回读到父亲二十岁时写的字：直竹贵地生。"
msgstr "You gave the book to Liu Huixin. For the first time she read what her father wrote at twenty: \"Straight bamboo, rooted deep.\""

msgid "把《悟疾风劲竹书》带回来交给了柳绘心"
msgstr "Brought Bamboo Against the Gale back to Liu Huixin"

msgid "柳绘心这些日子常往武馆的内院去。过些时候再回淳风武馆，到内院看看。"
msgstr "Liu Huixin often goes to the hall's inner courtyard these days. Come back to Pure Wind Hall after a while and look in on the inner courtyard."

msgid "内院里，柳绘心在教外人学封山剑——镇上交不起拜师钱的孩子。柳淳风撞见了。"
msgstr "In the inner courtyard, Liu Huixin is teaching the Empty Mountain Sword to outsiders: children of the town who can't pay the entrance fee. Liu Chunfeng walks in on them."

msgid "封山要分南北了。跟柳淳风守本宗（问他「本宗」）：剑不外传，他亲传「点」字诀，你是掌门传人，柳绘心离开武馆。跟柳绘心立北宗（问她「北宗」）：剑往外传，她教你「点」字诀，你转入北宗，柳淳风不再教你。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain is splitting north and south. Keep to the school with Liu Chunfeng (ask him about \"Our School\"): the sword is not taught to outsiders, he teaches you the \"Point\" technique himself, you become the Master's heir, and Liu Huixin leaves the hall. Found the North Branch with Liu Huixin (ask her about \"North Branch\"): the sword is taught to outsiders, she teaches you the \"Point\" technique, you join the North Branch, and Liu Chunfeng no longer teaches you."

msgid "你跟了柳淳风：封山只有一宗，剑不外传。他把「点」字诀传给了你。柳绘心带着「北宗」两个字去了绮云镇。"
msgstr "You went with Liu Chunfeng: Empty Mountain has only one branch, and the sword is not taught to outsiders. He passed the \"Point\" technique on to you. Liu Huixin took the words \"North Branch\" with her to Cloudweave Town."

msgid "在封山的南北之争里守了本宗"
msgstr "Kept to the school in Empty Mountain's north-south split"

msgid "掌门传人"
msgstr "Master's Heir"

msgid "你跟了柳绘心：北宗的剑往外传。她把自己悟的「点」字诀教给了你。柳淳风不再教你。"
msgstr "You went with Liu Huixin: the North Branch's sword is taught to outsiders. She taught you the \"Point\" technique as she worked it out herself. Liu Chunfeng no longer teaches you."

msgid "和柳绘心立了封山剑派北宗"
msgstr "Founded the Empty Mountain School's North Branch with Liu Huixin"

msgid "拜了天邪派，水烟阁的门就由你守一回。"
msgstr "Bow to the Wayward School, and Waterfog Pavilion's gate is yours to keep, once."

msgid "你已经不是天邪派的人了。水烟阁的事，到此为止。"
msgstr "You are no longer of the Wayward School. Waterfog Pavilion's business ends here."

msgid "去水烟阁正厅，问执法使潘军禅「山门」。"
msgstr "Go to Waterfog Main Hall and ask the Enforcer, Pan Junchan, about \"Mountain Gate\"."

msgid "潘军禅说，正月十七快到了，上山的人多；这一个月，有人在打听盟主的事。他要一个新面孔去山门值一班。"
msgstr "Pan Junchan says the seventeenth of the first month is near, and many people are coming up the mountain; this month, someone has been asking about the Alliance Leader. He wants a new face to stand a watch at the gate."

msgid "到水烟阁前值守：三个上山的人在门外候着。问清他们的「来意」，听他们怎么说「盟主」，看看「路引」——认出那个来打听盟主的探子，把他「拿下」。拿错了人，真的探子会趁乱走掉。"
msgstr "Keep watch at the Waterfog Forecourt: three people who came up the mountain wait outside the gate. Ask their \"Errand\", hear what they say of the \"Alliance Leader\", look at their \"Travel Passes\": find the spy who came asking about the Alliance Leader, and \"Seize\" him. Seize the wrong man, and the real spy will slip away in the confusion."

msgid "山门的一班值完了。"
msgstr "The watch at the gate is done."

msgid "回正厅向潘军禅回话（问他「山门」；搜到了信，把信交给他）。"
msgstr "Go back to the main hall and report to Pan Junchan (ask him about \"Mountain Gate\"; if you found a letter, give it to him)."

msgid "潘军禅听完了山门的事。「水烟阁的门，你守过一回了。」"
msgstr "Pan Junchan hears out the business at the gate. \"You have kept Waterfog Pavilion's gate once.\""

msgid "替水烟阁在山门值过一班"
msgstr "Stood a watch at the gate for Waterfog Pavilion"

msgid "问潘军禅「镖单」。二十年前那张镖单只有一张：交给潘军禅，锁进刑堂，振远的脸面水烟阁替他们留着，这件事到此为止；带去京师振远总局交给陈天星，他要查到底——查出来的，未必只是振远的丑事。镖单不在身上的，去绮云镇振远镖局问陈剑秋。"
msgstr "Ask Pan Junchan about \"Waybill\". There is only one copy of the ledger from twenty years ago: give it to Pan Junchan, and it is locked in the punishment hall, Waterfog Pavilion keeps Far-Road's face for them, and the matter ends here; take it to Chen Tianxing at the Far-Road Head Office in the Capital, and he will trace it to the end, and what comes out may not be only Far-Road's shame. If you do not have the ledger, go to the Far-Road Escorts in Cloudweave Town and ask Chen Jianqiu."

msgid "你把镖单交给了潘军禅。他锁进了刑堂：振远的脸面，水烟阁替他们留着。"
msgstr "You gave the shipment ledger to Pan Junchan. He locked it in the punishment hall: Waterfog Pavilion keeps Far-Road's face for them."

msgid "把二十年前的镖单交给潘军禅锁进了刑堂"
msgstr "Gave the twenty-year-old shipment ledger to Pan Junchan to lock in the punishment hall"

msgid "你把镖单带去京师，交给了陈天星。他要查到底。"
msgstr "You took the shipment ledger to the Capital and gave it to Chen Tianxing. He means to trace it to the end."

msgid "把二十年前的镖单带去京师交给了陈天星"
msgstr "Took the twenty-year-old shipment ledger to Chen Tianxing in the Capital"

msgid "陈天星在翻振远总局二十年前的底账。出了振远总局再进去，听他查到了什么。"
msgstr "Chen Tianxing is going through the Far-Road Head Office's books from twenty years ago. Leave the Head Office, come back in, and hear what he has found."

msgid "陈天星查清了：二十年前那趟镖本该走官道，是兵部来人点名改走老松岭的。"
msgstr "Chen Tianxing has it clear: that escort twenty years ago should have gone by the official road, and the Ministry of War sent a man to order it through Old Pine Ridge."

msgid "回正厅问潘军禅「盟主」。"
msgstr "Go back to the main hall and ask Pan Junchan about \"Alliance Leader\"."

msgid "潘军禅说，二十年前带走盟主的是一队白衣武官——腰里挂的是兵部的刀。"
msgstr "Pan Junchan says the Alliance Leader was taken twenty years ago by a troop of officers in white, with Ministry of War sabers at their waists."

msgid "二十年前带走盟主的是白衣武官。线索在京师尚书府。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader was taken twenty years ago by officers in white. The trail leads to the Minister's Mansion in the Capital."

msgid "京师那边的事有了结果。"
msgstr "The business in the Capital is settled."

msgid "七长老颜违这些日子常下楼来，站在水烟阁正厅那把黝黑的太师椅跟前。去正厅；已经在厅里的，出去走一走再进来。"
msgstr "The Seventh Elder, Yan Wei, often comes downstairs these days and stands before the dark great armchair in Waterfog Main Hall. Go to the main hall; if you are already in it, step out for a while and come back in."

msgid "正厅里，颜违要在正月十七之前把那把椅子定下来；潘军禅说，等盟主。"
msgstr "In the main hall, Yan Wei wants that chair settled before the seventeenth of the first month; Pan Junchan says: wait for the Alliance Leader."

msgid "天邪派在虹台上的那一票，看你。站颜违（问他「椅子」）：正月十七由他坐那把椅子，他许你水烟阁执事，二十年的旧案到此为止，潘军禅从此只同你谈公事。站潘军禅（问他「椅子」）：等盟主回来，他以执法使的名义升你执事，颜违会记下你。"
msgstr "The Wayward School's vote on the Rainbow Terrace rests with you. Stand with Yan Wei (ask him about \"The Chair\"): on the seventeenth of the first month he takes that chair, he makes you a Deacon of Waterfog Pavilion, the twenty-year-old case ends here, and Pan Junchan speaks to you only of business from then on. Stand with Pan Junchan (ask him about \"The Chair\"): wait for the Alliance Leader to return, he raises you to Deacon in the Enforcer's name, and Yan Wei will mark you."

msgid "你站到了颜违一边：正月十七，天邪派那一票投他。他许你做了水烟阁的执事。"
msgstr "You stood with Yan Wei: on the seventeenth of the first month, the Wayward School's vote goes to him. He made you a Deacon of Waterfog Pavilion."

msgid "在水烟阁正厅站到了颜违一边"
msgstr "Stood with Yan Wei in Waterfog Main Hall"

msgid "执事"
msgstr "Deacon"

msgid "你站到了潘军禅一边：等盟主回来。他以执法使的名义升你做了执事。颜违记下了你。"
msgstr "You stood with Pan Junchan: wait for the Alliance Leader to return. He raised you to Deacon in the Enforcer's name. Yan Wei has marked you."

msgid "在水烟阁正厅站到了潘军禅一边：等盟主回来"
msgstr "Stood with Pan Junchan in Waterfog Main Hall: wait for the Alliance Leader to return"

msgid "戴着黑冠回逆灵宫，替茅山的林忌做眼线。"
msgstr "Go back into the Black Palace in the black cap, as Lin Ji's eyes for Mount Mao."

msgid "疑点满了三条。宫里认出你，只是早晚的事——下回戴着冠进前院，就是那一天：那一仗你打不过，不必打，出了前院的门就算逃过了。黑冠不会再替你遮掩；递出去的名单、带走的名册，茅山照样用得上，剑谱也还在你手里。"
msgstr "Three suspicions now. The Palace knowing you is only a matter of time, and the next time you enter the Front Yard in the cap is that day: you cannot win that fight and need not fight it, for once out through the Front Yard gate you have escaped. The black cap will not cover for you again; the list you passed on and the register you took are still of use to Mount Mao, and the sword manual is still yours."

msgid "疑点"
msgstr "Suspicions"

msgid "残卷没回宫：宫里少了一卷书，迟早有人问起"
msgstr "The fragment never went back: the Palace is a book short, and sooner or later someone will ask"

msgid "那一夜丢了人：地牢空了，他们记得那天闯进来的人"
msgstr "People lost that night: the dungeon is empty, and they remember who broke in that day"

msgid "子时在后殿外被撞见过"
msgstr "Seen outside the Rear Hall at midnight"

msgid "子时在后殿外又被撞见了一回"
msgstr "Seen outside the Rear Hall at midnight, again"

msgid "名册不见了：账房的铁匣里少了一本名册，管事迟早会发现"
msgstr "The register is gone: the iron box in the Counting Room is one register short, and the steward will find out sooner or later"

msgid "进门之前，先把第三章留下的事了结。身上带着逆灵天书残卷的：还给后山崖径上的玄冥子（他要是还活着），他当你是他的人，宫里没人会问起那卷书；交给林忌，他当面烧了，可宫里少了一卷书——那是一条疑点。救过人的，听林忌（或霍铮）把话说完。黑冠丢了的，问林忌「黑冠」。"
msgstr "Before you go in, settle what Chapter 3 left behind. If you carry the Black Scripture fragment: return it to Xuanmingzi on the Back Cliff Path (if he is still alive), and he will count you one of his, and no one in the Palace will ask about it; give it to Lin Ji, and he will burn it before you, but the Palace will be a book short, and that is one suspicion. If you saved the prisoners, hear Lin Ji (or Huo Zheng) out. If you lost the black cap, ask Lin Ji about \"Black Cap\"."

msgid "你把残卷还给了玄冥子。他说：「你是我的人。」宫里不会有人问起那一夜。"
msgstr "You returned the fragment to Xuanmingzi. He said: \"You are one of mine.\" No one in the Palace will ask about that night."

msgid "把逆灵天书的残卷还给了玄冥子"
msgstr "Returned the Black Scripture fragment to Xuanmingzi"

msgid "你把残卷交给了林忌。他当面烧了：「这东西不该回那里去。」宫里少了一卷书。"
msgstr "You gave the fragment to Lin Ji. He burned it before you: \"This should never go back there.\" The Palace is a book short."

msgid "把逆灵天书的残卷交给林忌烧了"
msgstr "Gave the Black Scripture fragment to Lin Ji to burn"

msgid "茅山要一个进得去的人。你答应戴着黑冠，再进一回逆灵宫。"
msgstr "Mount Mao needs someone who can get in. You agreed to wear the black cap into the Black Palace once more."

msgid "替茅山戴着黑冠回了逆灵宫"
msgstr "Went back into the Black Palace in the black cap for Mount Mao"

msgid "戴着黑冠回逆灵宫。白天到账房（前殿往西，丹房再往北）问管事道士「干活」。"
msgstr "Go back into the Black Palace in the black cap. By day, go to the Counting Room (west of the Front Hall, then north past the Elixir Room) and ask the Steward Daoist about \"Work\"."

msgid "管事道士派了三样活：丹房添炭、货栈点箱、前殿跟诵。"
msgstr "The Steward Daoist gives you three jobs: add charcoal in the Elixir Room, count the crates in the Storehouse, chant along in the Front Hall."

msgid "干完管事派的三样活，回账房问他「干活」。跟诵是领诵念上句、你接下句：前殿的道士诵的就是这几句，听熟了再去。"
msgstr "Finish the steward's three jobs, then go back to the Counting Room and ask him about \"Work\". To chant along, the lead chanter says the first line and you answer with the next: these are the lines the Daoists in the Front Hall chant, so listen until you know them before you go."

msgid "三样活干完了。管事许你在货栈的通铺上留宿。"
msgstr "The three jobs are done. The steward lets you sleep on the communal bunk in the Storehouse."

msgid "在逆灵宫干了三样杂活，管事许你留宿"
msgstr "Did three chores in the Black Palace, and the steward let you stay the night"

msgid "丹房添炭"
msgstr "Add charcoal in the Elixir Room"

msgid "货栈点箱"
msgstr "Count the crates in the Storehouse"

msgid "前殿跟诵"
msgstr "Chant along in the Front Hall"

msgid "领诵念上句，你接下句"
msgstr "The lead chanter says the first line; you answer with the next"

msgid "子时，前殿北门后的后殿有人说话。货栈的通铺可以睡到子时。前殿有巡殿的道士来回走——躲开他的眼睛（他看前面，不看身后；香炉和经案挡得住他），摸到北门边「听」。被他撞见了，会被押回前院站到天亮，那是一条疑点。"
msgstr "At midnight, there are voices in the Rear Hall behind the Front Hall's north door. You can sleep on the Storehouse bunk until midnight. A patrolling Daoist walks back and forth in the Front Hall: keep out of his sight (he looks ahead, not behind; the incense burner and the sutra table hide you), creep up to the north door and \"Listen\". If he catches you, you will be marched back to the Front Yard to stand till dawn, and that is one suspicion."

msgid "你在北门外听见了他们等的那一夜，和「名单在账房」。"
msgstr "Outside the north door you heard which night they are waiting for, and \"the list is in the Counting Room\"."

msgid "名单在账房。夜里管事伏在案头睡觉，到账房的大案上「抄名单」，别吵醒他。"
msgstr "The list is in the Counting Room. At night the steward sleeps slumped over his desk: \"Copy the List\" at the long table in the Counting Room, and don't wake him."

msgid "你在账房的大案上抄下了那张名单。"
msgstr "At the long table in the Counting Room, you copied out the list."

msgid "把抄来的名单递出去：交给灵心观的林忌（救过霍铮的，也可以交给土地庙的霍铮）。"
msgstr "Pass on the copied list: give it to Lin Ji at Clear Heart Abbey (if you saved Huo Zheng, you may also give it to Huo Zheng at the Earth God Shrine)."

msgid "名单递出去了。下回路过野羊山的山路转角，路边会多一辆翻倒的纳供车。"
msgstr "The list is passed on. Next time you go by the bend in the Goathill road, there will be an overturned tribute cart by the road."

msgid "把逆灵宫的祭品名单递给了茅山"
msgstr "Passed the Black Palace's sacrifice list to Mount Mao"

msgid "名单上的人，茅山会去找。宫里的事还没完——回灵心观问林忌「逆灵宫」。"
msgstr "Mount Mao will go looking for the people on the list. The Palace's business is not done: go back to Clear Heart Abbey and ask Lin Ji about \"The Black Palace\"."

msgid "林忌说了地牢里新关的三个人，和账房铁匣里那本名册的原本。"
msgstr "Lin Ji told of three people newly locked in the dungeon, and of the original register in the iron box in the Counting Room."

msgid "地牢里新关了三个人。牢门的钥匙在狱卒腰上：给他一袋酒（或者往石阶边他那只酒坛里下蒙汗药），他醉倒了，钥匙就是你的；子时他歪在长凳上打盹，钥匙挂在头顶的铁钉上；第三章那把钥匙还在身上的，也开得了。狱卒醒着的时候，谁也近不了牢门。开了门，他们自己从货栈的侧门走。"
msgstr "Three people have been newly locked in the dungeon. The cell key is on the jailer's belt: give him a skin of wine (or drug the wine jar by the stone steps with knockout powder), and when he passes out the key is yours; at midnight he dozes slumped on the bench, with the key on the iron nail above his head; if you still have the key from Chapter 3, it opens them too. While the jailer is awake, no one gets near the cells. Once the doors are open, they will leave on their own by the Storehouse side door."

msgid "地牢里新关的三个人，从货栈的侧门走了。"
msgstr "The three newly locked in the dungeon have left by the Storehouse side door."

msgid "放走了逆灵宫地牢里新关的三个人"
msgstr "Freed the three newly locked in the Black Palace's dungeon"

msgid "西牢房：槐阳来的妇人"
msgstr "West Cell: the woman from Huaiyang"

msgid "北牢房：货郎"
msgstr "North Cell: the peddler"

msgid "东牢房：采药人"
msgstr "East Cell: the herb gatherer"

msgid "账房的铁匣里锁着祭品名册的原本，锁和牢门是一套。夜里管事伏在案头睡着的时候，用地牢的钥匙打开它。带走（先确认）：它是物证——朝上揭发兵部时算一样，京师的事已经定了的，乔阴的程不平对得出上面的押印；可宫里少了一本名册，那是一条疑点。不带：回灵心观问林忌「名册」，告诉他你没动它。"
msgstr "The original of the sacrifice register is locked in the iron box in the Counting Room, and the lock matches the cells. At night, while the steward sleeps slumped over his desk, open it with the dungeon key. Take it (you will be asked first): it is evidence, and counts as one piece when you denounce the Ministry of War at court, and if the Capital business is already settled, Cheng Buping of Tallshade can match the stamps on it; but the Palace will be a register short, and that is one suspicion. Leave it: go back to Clear Heart Abbey, ask Lin Ji about \"Register\", and tell him you did not touch it."

msgid "你带走了祭品名册的原本。宫里少了一本名册。"
msgstr "You took the original of the sacrifice register. The Palace is a register short."

msgid "从逆灵宫的账房带走了祭品名册的原本"
msgstr "Took the original of the sacrifice register from the Black Palace's Counting Room"

msgid "名册留在了铁匣里。宫里什么也没少。"
msgstr "The register stays in the iron box. The Palace is missing nothing."

msgid "把祭品名册的原本留在了逆灵宫的铁匣里"
msgstr "Left the original of the sacrifice register in the Black Palace's iron box"

msgid "后山崖径上的玄冥子有一件事要托你——问他「天书」。（子时，前殿的北门从里面闩着；他知道怎么拨开。巡殿的道士看前不看后。）"
msgstr "Xuanmingzi on the Back Cliff Path has something to ask of you: ask him about \"Scripture\". (At midnight, the Front Hall's north door is barred from inside; he knows how to slip the bar. The patrolling Daoist looks ahead, not behind.)"

msgid "你从宫主居所的暗格里取出《逆灵天书》的下半部，交给了玄冥子。他给了你一册六阴剑谱，说了他等的是哪一夜。"
msgstr "You took the second half of the Black Scripture from the hidden compartment in the Master's Quarters and gave it to Xuanmingzi. He gave you a Six-Chaos Sword manual and told you which night he is waiting for."

msgid "替玄冥子取来了《逆灵天书》的下半部"
msgstr "Fetched the second half of the Black Scripture for Xuanmingzi"

msgid "后山崖径上没有玄冥子——《逆灵天书》的下半部，没有人托你去取。"
msgstr "There is no Xuanmingzi on the Back Cliff Path; no one asks you to fetch the second half of the Black Scripture."

msgid "宫里等的那一夜，林忌要知道：他们哪一夜动、走哪条路。钉子拔了、湖上的事近了（第十章之后），回灵心观问林忌「逆灵宫」。湖底的事已经了了的，宫里剩下的人还在——也问他「逆灵宫」。"
msgstr "Lin Ji wants to know about the night the Palace is waiting for: which night they move, and which road they take. Once the nail is pulled and the business on the lake draws near (after Chapter 10), go back to Clear Heart Abbey and ask Lin Ji about \"The Black Palace\". If the business at the bottom of the lake is already over, those left in the Palace are still there: ask him about \"The Black Palace\" too."

msgid "林忌问你宫里哪一夜动、走哪条路：唤首那一夜，逆灵宫倾巢下湖。"
msgstr "Lin Ji asks you which night the Palace moves and which road it takes: on the night of the Calling of the Head, the whole Black Palace goes down to the lake."

msgid "湖底的事了了，商玦没有回来。宫里剩下的人还在续灯——林忌要一个了断。"
msgstr "The business at the bottom of the lake is over, and Shang Jue did not come back. Those left in the Palace still keep up the Feeding of the Lamp; Lin Ji wants it ended."

msgid "收网，看你。前夜倒戈（问林忌「倒戈」）：把下湖的时辰和路交给茅山——终章冰龙厅里商玦身边只剩两个道士，点将时多一拨茅山的人；可黑冠从此没用，逆灵宫的门不再为你开。潜伏到底（问林忌「潜伏」，疑点不到三条才行）：你戴着冠跟商玦的队伍下湖，冰龙厅里第一剑是你的，商玦带着重伤开打——可他的四个道士会先扑你，也没有人会多来帮你（没人知道你的消息）。终章在湖畔等到天黑之前要定下来。"
msgstr "Drawing in the net is up to you. Turn on the eve (ask Lin Ji about \"Defect\"): give Mount Mao the hour and the road down to the lake; in the finale only two Daoists are left at Shang Jue's side in the ice dragons' hall, and when you call your people one more band from Mount Mao comes; but the black cap is useless from then on, and the Black Palace's gate no longer opens for you. Stay hidden to the end (ask Lin Ji about \"Stay Hidden\"; only with fewer than three suspicions): you go down to the lake in the cap with Shang Jue's column, the first stroke in the ice dragons' hall is yours, and Shang Jue starts the fight badly wounded; but his four Daoists will go for you first, and no one extra will come to help you (no one knows where you are). In the finale, it must be decided before nightfall comes as you wait at the lakeshore."

msgid "前夜，你把下湖的时辰和路交给了林忌。黑冠从此没用了。"
msgstr "On the eve, you gave Lin Ji the hour and the road down to the lake. The black cap is useless from now on."

msgid "唤首前夜，把逆灵宫下湖的时辰和路交给了茅山"
msgstr "On the eve of the Calling of the Head, gave Mount Mao the hour and the road the Black Palace would take down to the lake"

msgid "你没有把时辰交出去。黑冠还戴在你头上：唤首那一夜，你跟着他们下湖。"
msgstr "You did not give up the hour. The black cap is still on your head: on the night of the Calling of the Head, you go down to the lake with them."

msgid "戴着黑冠潜伏到底，跟逆灵宫下了湖"
msgstr "Stayed hidden in the black cap to the end, and went down to the lake with the Black Palace"

msgid "唤首那一夜过去了。你什么也没有交出去，也没有跟他们下湖。"
msgstr "The night of the Calling of the Head is past. You gave nothing away, and did not go down to the lake with them."

msgid "终章：茅山的人截在北麓下湖的路上，林忌在湖畔。冰龙厅里，商玦身边只剩两个道士。"
msgstr "Finale: Mount Mao's people cut off the road down to the lake on the North Foot, and Lin Ji is at the lakeshore. In the ice dragons' hall, only two Daoists are left at Shang Jue's side."

msgid "冰龙厅里，商玦身边只剩两个道士——另外两个，茅山在北麓截下了。"
msgstr "In the ice dragons' hall, only two Daoists are left at Shang Jue's side; Mount Mao cut off the other two on the North Foot."

msgid "终章：戴着黑冠下湖。冰龙厅里你站在商玦身后——第一剑是你的。他的四个道士会先扑你。"
msgstr "Finale: go down to the lake in the black cap. In the ice dragons' hall you stand behind Shang Jue: the first stroke is yours. His four Daoists will go for you first."

msgid "冰龙厅里，第一剑是你从背后刺的。商玦带着那一剑的伤，同你打完了这一场。"
msgstr "In the ice dragons' hall, the first stroke was yours, from behind. Shang Jue fought the rest of the battle with that wound."

msgid "宫里剩下的人，林忌要一个了断。交官府去剿（问林忌「剿」，先确认）：官兵上北麓，一个也走不了——正月十七投颜违的那一边，说的就是这个。劝他们下山、交茅山看管（问林忌「招安」，再回北麓同宫里当家的说「下山」）：玄冥子还在，就是他；不在了，是领诵的道士。没有了断的，正月十七那一天他们会自己找上门来。"
msgstr "Lin Ji wants an end to those left in the Palace. Hand them to the authorities to crush (ask Lin Ji about \"Suppress\"; you will be asked first): soldiers go up the North Foot, and not one gets away; this is what the side voting for Yan Wei on the seventeenth of the first month means. Talk them down the mountain into Mount Mao's keeping (ask Lin Ji about \"Amnesty\", then go back to the North Foot and tell whoever runs the Palace \"Come Down\"): Xuanmingzi, if he is still there; if not, the lead chanter. If there is no end, on the seventeenth of the first month they will come to you themselves."

msgid "你把北麓那座道观交给了官府。官兵上了山，宫里剩下的人一个也没走脱。"
msgstr "You gave the abbey on the North Foot to the authorities. Soldiers went up the mountain, and not one of those left in the Palace got away."

msgid "把逆灵宫的余孽交给官府去剿"
msgstr "Handed what was left of the Black Palace to the authorities to crush"

msgid "宫里剩下的人下了山，交茅山看管。坛上的火灭了。"
msgstr "Those left in the Palace came down the mountain into Mount Mao's keeping. The fire on the altar has gone out."

msgid "劝逆灵宫的余孽下山，交茅山看管"
msgstr "Talked what was left of the Black Palace down the mountain, into Mount Mao's keeping"

msgid "接了朱鸿雪的令，替东方神教办事。"
msgstr "Take up Zhu Hongxue's token and work for the Golden Crow Order."

msgid "晚月庄的西厢住着一个人，住了三年——东方神教的一代教主安妮儿。朱鸿雪要知道她在等谁：去晚月庄西厢问安妮儿「等谁」。"
msgstr "Someone lives in the West Wing of Latemoon Manor, and has for three years: Anni'er, the Golden Crow Order's first Leader. Zhu Hongxue wants to know whom she is waiting for: go to the West Wing of Latemoon Manor and ask Anni'er about \"Who you're waiting for\"."

msgid "安妮儿说了她在等什么。末了一句：「你可以照实说。」"
msgstr "Anni'er told you what she is waiting for. Her last words: \"You may tell her the truth.\""

msgid "回绮云镇棺材铺后的场院，把西厢的话告诉朱鸿雪。照实说（「照实说」）：那件衣，安妮儿不打算交给神教——朱鸿雪会记住这句话。或者替她瞒（「替她瞒」）：只说她在等一个故人——安妮儿欠你一回，朱鸿雪信你这一回。"
msgstr "Go back to the Pleasure Yard behind the Coffin Shop in Cloudweave Town and tell Zhu Hongxue what was said in the West Wing. Tell the truth (\"Tell the Truth\"): Anni'er does not mean to give that robe to the Order, and Zhu Hongxue will remember it. Or cover for her (\"Cover for Her\"): say only that she is waiting for an old friend; Anni'er owes you one, and Zhu Hongxue believes you this once."

msgid "你把安妮儿的话照实告诉了朱鸿雪：那件衣，她不打算交给神教。"
msgstr "You told Zhu Hongxue what Anni'er said, as it was: she does not mean to give that robe to the Order."

msgid "把西厢的话照实告诉了朱鸿雪"
msgstr "Told Zhu Hongxue what was said in the West Wing, as it was"

msgid "你替安妮儿瞒了下来，只说她在等一个故人。朱鸿雪信了你这一回。"
msgstr "You covered for Anni'er and said only that she is waiting for an old friend. Zhu Hongxue believed you this once."

msgid "替安妮儿瞒下了西厢的话"
msgstr "Covered for Anni'er about what was said in the West Wing"

msgid "神教的令不发新的，只从上一个持令人手里接。朱鸿雪派去玉螺湖的人上个月没回来，令在他身上：入夜之后去玉螺湖畔的芦苇丛找他（湖边夜里有鬼卒），拿回那块黑木令，再问朱鸿雪「令牌」。"
msgstr "The Order issues no new tokens; each is taken over only from the last person to hold it. The man Zhu Hongxue sent to Jade Conch Lake did not come back last month, and the token is on him: after dark, go to the reeds on the Jade Conch Lakeshore to find him (there are Ghost Soldiers by the lake at night), bring back the black-wood token, then ask Zhu Hongxue about \"Token\"."

msgid "朱鸿雪把黑木令放回你手里：「现在它是你的。」带着它，神教的杀手认你是自己人。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue puts the black-wood token back in your hand: \"Now it is yours.\" With it, the Order's assassins take you for one of their own."

msgid "从玉螺湖畔的芦苇丛里接回了一块黑木令"
msgstr "Took back a black-wood token from the reeds on the Jade Conch Lakeshore"

msgid "黑木令在你身上了。朱鸿雪还有差事交给持令的人：回绮云镇的场院，问朱鸿雪「差事」。"
msgstr "The black-wood token is on you. Zhu Hongxue has errands for the one who holds it: go back to the Pleasure Yard in Cloudweave Town and ask Zhu Hongxue about \"Errands\"."

msgid "朱鸿雪说了三个名字：湖边量水的黑冠道士、黄石隘口画图的兵部画吏、玉螺湖村凿冰的老冰匠——都是靠近湖底封物的人。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue named three names: the Black-Cap Daoist measuring the water by the lake, the War Ministry Painter drawing at Yellow Rock Pass, and the old ice cutter who cuts ice at Jade Conch Village: all of them people who came close to what's sealed under the lake."

msgid "朱鸿雪的三个名字，都是靠近湖底封物的人。玉螺湖村稻田西头的湖岸上，白天有个黑冠道士在量水——逆灵宫的人，打倒他。天驼关黄石隘口的山壁下，兵部的画吏在画当年石匣出土的地方——打倒了，放他走就算。第三个是玉螺湖村年年凿冰的老冰匠，在柳树下的湖岸边：怎么办，看你。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue's three names are all people who came close to what's sealed under the lake. On the lakeshore at the west end of Jade Conch Village's Rice Paddies, a Black-Cap Daoist measures the water by day: one of the Black Palace's, so knock him down. Beneath the cliff face at Yellow Rock Pass in Camelback Pass, the War Ministry Painter is drawing the spot where the stone box was dug up: knock him down, and letting him go is enough. The third is the old ice cutter who cuts ice at Jade Conch Village every year, on the lakeshore under the willow: what to do is up to you."

msgid "湖边量水的道士、隘口画图的画吏，都了了。"
msgstr "The Daoist measuring the water by the lake and the painter drawing at the pass are both dealt with."

msgid "湖边量水的黑冠道士"
msgstr "The Black-Cap Daoist measuring the water by the lake"

msgid "白天在玉螺湖村稻田西头的湖岸上"
msgstr "On the lakeshore at the west end of Jade Conch Village's Rice Paddies, by day"

msgid "黄石隘口的兵部画吏"
msgstr "The War Ministry Painter at Yellow Rock Pass"

msgid "在天驼关黄石隘口的山壁下"
msgstr "Beneath the cliff face at Yellow Rock Pass, Camelback Pass"

msgid "凿冰的老冰匠"
msgstr "The old ice cutter who cuts ice"

msgid "在玉螺湖村柳树下的湖岸边"
msgstr "On the lakeshore under the willow at Jade Conch Village"

msgid "第三个名字是玉螺湖村凿冰的老冰匠。他只是看见过冰下的光，讲给村里的孩子听。做（问他「动手」）：朱鸿雪升你赤铜令——村里少一个人，安妮儿会知道。不做（问他「搬走」）：劝他离开玉螺湖，带他的冰凿回去交差——朱鸿雪信不信，看你西厢那一桩有没有瞒过她。"
msgstr "The third name is the old ice cutter of Jade Conch Village. All he did was see the light under the ice and tell the village children about it. Do it (ask him about \"Strike\"): Zhu Hongxue raises you to the red copper token, and the village is one person short, which Anni'er will know. Don't (ask him about \"Move Away\"): persuade him to leave Jade Conch Lake and take his ice chisel back to report the job done; whether Zhu Hongxue believes you depends on whether you kept the West Wing business from her."

msgid "老冰匠倒在了湖岸上。玉螺湖村少了一个人。"
msgstr "The old ice cutter falls on the lakeshore. Jade Conch Village is one person short."

msgid "替朱鸿雪杀了玉螺湖凿冰的老冰匠"
msgstr "Killed the old ice cutter of Jade Conch Lake for Zhu Hongxue"

msgid "老冰匠背起包袱离开了玉螺湖。他的冰凿在你手里。"
msgstr "The old ice cutter shouldered his bundle and left Jade Conch Lake. His ice chisel is in your hands."

msgid "劝玉螺湖的老冰匠搬走，拿他的冰凿去交差"
msgstr "Persuaded the old ice cutter of Jade Conch Lake to move away, and took his ice chisel to report the job done"

msgid "三个名字都了了。回绮云镇的场院，问朱鸿雪「交差」。"
msgstr "All three names are dealt with. Go back to the Pleasure Yard in Cloudweave Town and ask Zhu Hongxue about \"Hand In\"."

msgid "朱鸿雪收回了黑木令，换给你一块赤铜令。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue took back the black-wood token and gave you a red copper token in exchange."

msgid "从朱鸿雪手里换来了一块赤铜令"
msgstr "Traded up to a red copper token from Zhu Hongxue"

msgid "朱鸿雪说，名单上还有最后一个名字。出了场院走一走，再回场院去。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue says there is one last name on the list. Leave the Pleasure Yard for a while, then go back."

msgid "场院里，朱鸿雪念出了名单上最后一个名字。安妮儿就站在厅里。"
msgstr "In the Pleasure Yard, Zhu Hongxue reads out the last name on the list. Anni'er is standing right there in the hall."

msgid "神教只能有一个教主。站安妮儿（问她「教主」）：她收回教主令，给你黄金令牌，教你天山雪影剑和雪影心法；朱鸿雪认输，不走，往后只派该死的人的差事；终章她来湖畔守潭口，正月十七神教不去虹台搅局。站朱鸿雪（问她「教主」）：她给你黄金令牌，教同一套武功；安妮儿回西厢闭门，不再同你说神教的事；正月十七那天，神教的杀手会在山道上截一派的轿子。"
msgstr "The Order can have only one Leader. Stand with Anni'er (ask her about \"Order Leader\"): she takes back the Order Leader's token, gives you a gold token, and teaches you the Tianshan Snowshade Sword and the Snowshade Heart Method; Zhu Hongxue concedes and stays, and from then on takes only jobs against those who deserve to die; in the finale Anni'er comes to the lakeshore to hold the mouth of the pool, and on the seventeenth of the first month the Order does not come to stir up the Rainbow Terrace. Stand with Zhu Hongxue (ask her about \"Order Leader\"): she gives you a gold token and teaches the same arts; Anni'er goes back into the West Wing and shuts the door, and no longer speaks to you of the Order; on the seventeenth of the first month, the Order's assassins will stop one school's sedan chair on the mountain road."

msgid "你站到了安妮儿一边。她收回了教主令，把一块黄金令牌放进你手里：天山的剑，到西厢去学。"
msgstr "You stood with Anni'er. She took back the Order Leader's token and put a gold token in your hand: for the Tianshan sword, come to the West Wing."

msgid "在绮云镇的场院里站到了安妮儿一边"
msgstr "Stood with Anni'er in the Pleasure Yard in Cloudweave Town"

msgid "你站到了朱鸿雪一边。她把一块黄金令牌放进你手里：神教只有一个教主。"
msgstr "You stood with Zhu Hongxue. She put a gold token in your hand: the Order has only one Leader."

msgid "在绮云镇的场院里站到了朱鸿雪一边"
msgstr "Stood with Zhu Hongxue in the Pleasure Yard in Cloudweave Town"

msgid "替振远镖局押一趟镖到京师；二十年前那趟镖的旧账，查到底还是到此为止。"
msgstr "Escort a shipment to the Capital for the Far-Road Escorts; as for the old account of that escort twenty years ago, trace it to the end, or let it end here."

msgid "你离了振远镖局。镖局的事，到此为止。"
msgstr "You have left the Far-Road Escorts. The agency's business ends here."

msgid "绮云镇的振远镖局有一趟镖要走京师总局，人手不够。去镖局见陈剑秋，问他「走镖」。"
msgstr "The Far-Road Escorts in Cloudweave Town have a shipment bound for the head office in the Capital, and not enough hands. Go to the agency, see Chen Jianqiu, and ask him about \"Escort Run\"."

msgid "陈剑秋把一趟红货交给了你：两箱，京师振远总局收，交给总镖头陈天星。趟子手老周推车。"
msgstr "Chen Jianqiu hands you a consignment of red goods: two chests, to be received at the Far-Road Head Office in the Capital and delivered to the head of the agency, Chen Tianxing. The escort runner Old Zhou pushes the cart."

msgid "老周推着镖车跟你走（在镖局里问他「上路」）。出绮云镇往北到雪亭镇，沿青石官道往西南，过碎石小路，从铁索下到天驼关，再沿黄土大道往南到京师。车马行不拉镖车。镖车落在后头的，回去叫老周「上路」。"
msgstr "Old Zhou pushes the escort cart and follows you (ask him about \"Set Out\" at the agency). Out of Cloudweave Town north to Snow Pavilion, southwest along the Bluestone Road, over Gravel Lane, down the iron cables to Camelback Pass, then south along the Broad Yellow Road to the Capital. The Coach Station does not carry escort carts. If the cart falls behind, go back and tell Old Zhou \"Set Out\"."

msgid "碎石小路上有人劫镖。领头的蒙面后生倒在路边，刀扔在一旁。"
msgstr "Someone robs the shipment on Gravel Lane. The masked youth leading them lies by the roadside, his saber thrown aside."

msgid "劫镖的后生坐在路边，不看你（问他「爹」）。交官府（「交官府」）：劫镖是大罪，过了铁索就是天驼关，守关的官兵押他去京师，官府的赏金振远转给你；放他走（「走吧」）：他留下他爹最后的一封家信，劫镖的人从此不见官。"
msgstr "The youth who robbed the shipment sits by the road and won't look at you (ask him about \"Dad\"). Hand him over (\"Turn Him In\"): robbing an escort is a grave crime, past the iron cables is Camelback Pass, the soldiers holding the pass take him to the Capital, and Far-Road passes the authorities' reward on to you; let him go (\"Off You Go\"): he leaves you his father's last letter home, and the one who robbed the shipment never faces the law."

msgid "你把劫镖的后生交给了天驼关的官兵。"
msgstr "You handed the youth who robbed the shipment to the soldiers at Camelback Pass."

msgid "把碎石小路上劫镖的后生交了官"
msgstr "Handed the youth who robbed the shipment on Gravel Lane over to the law"

msgid "你放劫镖的后生走了。他留下了他爹贺长庚最后的一封家信。"
msgstr "You let the youth who robbed the shipment go. He left behind the last letter home from his father, He Changgeng."

msgid "放走了碎石小路上劫镖的后生"
msgstr "Let the youth who robbed the shipment on Gravel Lane go"

msgid "镖车还要到京师：东街北头的振远总局，老周推车进门，镖就交到了总镖头陈天星手里。"
msgstr "The cart still has to reach the Capital: at the Far-Road Head Office at the north end of Capital East Street, once Old Zhou pushes the cart through the gate, the shipment is in the hands of the head of the agency, Chen Tianxing."

msgid "镖交到了京师振远总局。陈天星写了一张振远的名帖给你：京师有些门，要帖子才敲得开。"
msgstr "The shipment is delivered to the Far-Road Head Office in the Capital. Chen Tianxing wrote you a Far-Road Escorts calling card: some doors in the Capital open only to a card."

msgid "替振远押了一趟镖到京师总局"
msgstr "Escorted a shipment to the head office in the Capital for Far-Road"

msgid "镖头"
msgstr "Escort Chief"

msgid "贺长庚的家信在你身上。交给京师振远总局的陈天星。"
msgstr "He Changgeng's letter home is on you. Give it to Chen Tianxing at the Far-Road Head Office in the Capital."

msgid "陈天星看了家信：兵部的人在岭上等着，镖头说照走。"
msgstr "Chen Tianxing read the letter home: the Ministry of War's men were waiting on the ridge, and the escort chief said to go on anyway."

msgid "把贺长庚的家信交给了陈天星"
msgstr "Gave He Changgeng's letter home to Chen Tianxing"

msgid "二十年前那趟镖，振远的总账里还有一笔没对上。去京师东街北头的振远总局，问陈天星「旧账」。"
msgstr "One sum for that escort twenty years ago still doesn't tally in Far-Road's master ledger. Go to the Far-Road Head Office at the north end of Capital East Street and ask Chen Tianxing about \"Old Accounts\"."

msgid "陈天星翻完了振远二十年的总账：绮云分局开张的本钱，是那趟镖之后兵部送来的「抚恤银」。"
msgstr "Chen Tianxing has been through twenty years of Far-Road's master ledger: the money that opened the Cloudweave branch was \"compensation silver\" the Ministry of War sent after that escort."

msgid "绮云分局开张的本钱是兵部的抚恤银，陈剑秋知道。回绮云镇的振远镖局，问陈剑秋「旧账」。"
msgstr "The money that opened the Cloudweave branch was the Ministry of War's compensation silver, and Chen Jianqiu knows it. Go back to the Far-Road Escorts in Cloudweave Town and ask Chen Jianqiu about \"Old Accounts\"."

msgid "陈剑秋认了：那年振远死了十一个人，兵部给钱，他拿了。"
msgstr "Chen Jianqiu owned up: Far-Road lost eleven men that year, the Ministry of War paid, and he took it."

msgid "账本在陈天星手里，他要告；陈剑秋要瞒。到此为止（在绮云镇问陈剑秋「到此为止」）：账本烧了，抚恤银的事振远不再提，正月十七振远那一票投颜违；陈剑秋教你春风快意刀，陈天星往后见你只谈生意。查到底（在京师问陈天星「查到底」）：账本押去乔阴县衙，告兵部也告振远自己，陈剑秋关了绮云分局的门；振远那一票投旧盟主，京师的事还没定的，这本账算揭发的一样人证物证。"
msgstr "The ledger is in Chen Tianxing's hands, and he means to bring charges; Chen Jianqiu means to keep it quiet. Let it end here (ask Chen Jianqiu in Cloudweave Town about \"Let It End Here\"): the ledger is burned, Far-Road no longer speaks of the compensation silver, and on the seventeenth of the first month Far-Road's vote goes to Yan Wei; Chen Jianqiu teaches you the Spring Blade, and from then on Chen Tianxing speaks to you only of business. Trace it to the end (ask Chen Tianxing in the Capital about \"Trace it to the end\"): the ledger goes to Tallshade Yamen, charging the Ministry of War and Far-Road itself, and Chen Jianqiu shuts the Cloudweave branch; Far-Road's vote goes to the old Alliance Leader, and if the Capital business is not yet settled, this ledger counts as one piece of evidence for the denunciation."

msgid "你站到了陈剑秋一边：那本总账烧了，二十年前的抚恤银，振远不再提。陈剑秋许你学春风快意刀。"
msgstr "You stood with Chen Jianqiu: the master ledger was burned, and Far-Road no longer speaks of the compensation silver from twenty years ago. Chen Jianqiu let you learn the Spring Blade."

msgid "劝陈剑秋把振远的旧账烧了：到此为止"
msgstr "Persuaded Chen Jianqiu to burn Far-Road's old accounts: let it end here"

msgid "你站到了陈天星一边：振远的总账押去了乔阴县衙。绮云分局关了门。"
msgstr "You stood with Chen Tianxing: Far-Road's master ledger went to Tallshade Yamen. The Cloudweave branch shut its doors."

msgid "跟陈天星把振远的旧账送进了乔阴县衙：查到底"
msgstr "Took Far-Road's old accounts to Tallshade Yamen with Chen Tianxing: traced it to the end"

msgid "晚月庄失传的舞、带出庄的宝衣，和内书房那位老妇的女儿。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor's lost dance, the robe carried out of the manor, and the daughter of the old woman in the Inner Study."

msgid "你离了晚月庄。庄里的事，到此为止。"
msgstr "You have left Latemoon Manor. The manor's business ends here."

msgid "庄主蓝止萍在晚月庄的前厅。问她「庄里的事」。"
msgstr "The Mistress, Lan Zhiping, is in Latemoon Manor's front hall. Ask her about \"Manor Affairs\"."

msgid "蓝止萍说：晚月庄失传过一支舞，叫沧海龙吟。步子绣在后院书房的湘绣舞曲图上，曲子在舞曲谱里；两样凑齐，到二楼佛堂，在区冥的神位前跳一回。"
msgstr "Lan Zhiping says: Latemoon Manor once lost a dance, the Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea. Its steps are stitched on the embroidered dance chart in the Back Yard Study, and its music is in the dance score; bring the two together, go to the Shrine Room on the second floor, and dance it once before Ouming's spirit tablet."

msgid "沧海龙吟的步子在后院书房墙上的湘绣舞曲图里（昭仪天天对着它看），曲子在舞曲谱里（翠湘阁的莫欣芳知道谱放在哪）。看过那幅图，把舞曲谱拿到手。"
msgstr "The steps of the Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea are in the embroidered dance chart on the wall of the Back Yard Study (Zhaoyi gazes at it every day), and the music is in the dance score (Mo Xinfang of Green Xiang Chamber knows where it is kept). Look at the chart and get hold of the score."

msgid "图上的姿势，谱上的曲子，你都记下了：沧海龙吟。"
msgstr "The poses on the chart and the music in the score are both in your memory now: the Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea."

msgid "到二楼的佛堂，在区冥的神位前跳沧海龙吟。女子自己跳；男子请人替跳：禁闭房的芳绫（问她「替跳」，她跟你走），或翠湘阁的莫欣芳（在神位前「请人替跳」，她从回廊那头过来）。"
msgstr "Go to the Shrine Room on the second floor and dance the Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea before Ouming's spirit tablet. A woman dances it herself; a man asks someone to dance in his place: Fangling in the Confinement Room (ask her \"Dance in my place\", and she will come with you), or Mo Xinfang of Green Xiang Chamber (\"Ask someone to dance for you\" before the spirit tablet, and she will come from the far end of the Cloister)."

msgid "沧海龙吟在区冥的神位前跳成了。神像的眉间亮了一下。"
msgstr "The Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea is danced before Ouming's spirit tablet. A light flickers between the statue's brows."

msgid "在区冥的神位前跳回了失传的沧海龙吟"
msgstr "Danced the lost Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea once more before Ouming's spirit tablet"

msgid "宝衣的事，要等主线第四章「宝衣」有了着落。到那时，再回东厢见瑷伦。"
msgstr "The robe must wait until Chapter 4 of the main story, \"The Robe\", has come to an end. Then go back to the East Wing and see Ailun."

msgid "宝衣挡完了湖底那一口黑焰，烧成了灰。"
msgstr "The robe took that mouthful of black flame at the bottom of the lake and burned to ashes."

msgid "宝衣在瑷伦身上。庄里一切如旧。"
msgstr "The robe is on Ailun. All in the manor is as it was."

msgid "宝衣在西厢的安妮儿手里。"
msgstr "The robe is in the hands of Anni'er in the West Wing."

msgid "宝衣还在你身上。东厢的瑷伦失了衣。"
msgstr "The robe is still on you. Ailun in the East Wing has lost her robe."

msgid "宝衣还在你身上。东厢的瑷伦失了衣，她问你一句：还回来吗？还回来（问她「还衣」）：她又是守衣人，凤凰回到小花池，决战那日她穿着它跟你下湖——宝衣就不在你身上了，下湖没有它挡寒气。留在身上（问她「留着」）：宝衣照旧跟着你，庄里照旧没有护佑。"
msgstr "The robe is still on you. Ailun in the East Wing has lost her robe, and she asks you one thing: will you bring it back? Bring it back (ask her about \"Return the robe\"): she is the Robe-Keeper again, the phoenix returns to the Petal Pool, and on the day of the final battle she wears it down the lake with you; the robe is no longer on you then, and nothing turns the cold aside when you go down. Keep it (ask her about \"Keep it\"): the robe stays with you, and the manor stays without its protection."

msgid "你把寒於宝衣还给了瑷伦。她又是守衣人。"
msgstr "You returned Hanyu's Robe to Ailun. She is the Robe-Keeper again."

msgid "把带出庄的寒於宝衣送回了晚月庄"
msgstr "Brought Hanyu's Robe, carried out of the manor, back to Latemoon Manor"

msgid "宝衣留在了你身上。瑷伦不再问。"
msgstr "The robe stays on you. Ailun asks no more."

msgid "对守衣人说，寒於宝衣留在自己身上"
msgstr "Told the Robe-Keeper you would keep Hanyu's Robe"

msgid "宝衣在湖底烧成了灰。还不还，都不必再说了。"
msgstr "The robe burned to ashes at the bottom of the lake. Whether to return it no longer needs saying."

msgid "内书房的无名老妇有一桩心事。去问她「心事」。"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman in the Inner Study has something weighing on her. Go and ask her about \"What weighs on your mind\"."

msgid "无名老妇说了她的女儿：那个蒙面的杀手。她要你去问问她，为什么走到了这一步。"
msgstr "The Nameless Old Woman told of her daughter: that masked assassin. She wants you to go and ask her why it came to this."

msgid "老妇的女儿在哪，要看第四章有没有那一夜。"
msgstr "Where the old woman's daughter is depends on whether that night happened in Chapter 4."

msgid "宝衣没有出庄，那一夜没有来。她还在内书房里，蒙着面。"
msgstr "The robe never left the manor, and that night never came. She is still in the Inner Study, masked."

msgid "那一夜之后，她再没有进过庄门。"
msgstr "Since that night, she has not set foot through the manor gate."

msgid "老妇的女儿就是内书房里那个蒙面的杀手。问她「娘」。动手也行——这一步她只会倒下，不会死。"
msgstr "The old woman's daughter is the masked assassin in the Inner Study. Ask her about \"Mother\". Fighting her works too: at this step she will only fall, not die."

msgid "她说了来历：北麓的道观、六阴剑、东方神教，和朱鸿雪派她回晚月庄的缘故。"
msgstr "She told her story: the abbey on the North Foot, the Six-Chaos Sword, the Golden Crow Order, and why Zhu Hongxue sent her back to Latemoon Manor."

msgid "那一夜之后，她藏在庄后山路尽头的竹林里，入夜才在（白天去，竹林里没有人）。走进竹林找到她，问她「娘」。动手也行——这一步她只会倒下，不会死。"
msgstr "Since that night she has hidden in the Bamboo Grove at Road's End behind the manor, there only after dark (by day, no one is in the grove). Walk into the grove, find her, and ask her about \"Mother\". Fighting her works too: at this step she will only fall, not die."

msgid "她说了来历：北麓的道观、六阴剑、东方神教，和朱鸿雪派她回晚月庄的缘故。她回了内书房，在她娘身边。"
msgstr "She told her story: the abbey on the North Foot, the Six-Chaos Sword, the Golden Crow Order, and why Zhu Hongxue sent her back to Latemoon Manor. She has gone back to the Inner Study, to her mother's side."

msgid "她的杀手令牌在你手上。两个人要它：内书房的老妇要它为证——递给她，她知道女儿还活着，给你一份谢礼（只给一次）；绮云镇的朱鸿雪要它回神教——问她「还令」，神教的令只从上一个持令人手里接。给了一边，另一边就没有了。"
msgstr "Her assassin's token is in your hands. Two people want it: the old woman in the Inner Study, as proof (hand it to her, and she knows her daughter is alive and gives you a gift of thanks, once only); and Zhu Hongxue in Cloudweave Town, for the Order (ask her about \"Return the Token\": the Order's token is taken over only from the last person to hold it). Give it to one, and the other goes without."

msgid "你把令牌递给了老妇。她攥着它，知道女儿还活着。"
msgstr "You handed the token to the old woman. She grips it, knowing her daughter is alive."

msgid "把蒙面杀手的令牌交给了她娘"
msgstr "Gave the masked assassin's token to her mother"

msgid "你把令牌还给了朱鸿雪。神教的令，回了神教。"
msgstr "You returned the token to Zhu Hongxue. The Order's token has gone back to the Order."

msgid "把晚月庄那块杀手令牌还给了东方神教"
msgstr "Returned Latemoon Manor's assassin's token to the Golden Crow Order"

msgid "下回进晚月庄的大厅，蓝止萍有话要说——老妇和她女儿会从内书房出来。两条路：依庄规（问蓝止萍「庄规」）——人交给蓝止萍处置，晚月庄这一票投颜违，老妇从此不再开口；带她回来（问老妇「女儿」）——她留在内书房陪她娘，晚月庄这一票投旧盟主，蓝止萍从此对你冷一分。两边都先问你一声；选了不能改。"
msgstr "Next time you enter Latemoon Manor's great hall, Lan Zhiping will have something to say, and the old woman and her daughter will come out of the Inner Study. Two roads: by the manor's rules (ask Lan Zhiping about \"Manor Rules\"), the daughter is handed to Lan Zhiping to deal with, Latemoon Manor's vote goes to Yan Wei, and the old woman never speaks again; bring her home (ask the old woman about \"Daughter\"), and she stays in the Inner Study with her mother, Latemoon Manor's vote goes to the old Alliance Leader, and Lan Zhiping is a shade cooler toward you from then on. Either way you will be asked first; once chosen, it can't be undone."

msgid "你依了庄规。她跟着蓝止萍的人走了，没有回头。"
msgstr "You kept to the manor's rules. She went off with Lan Zhiping's people and did not look back."

msgid "依晚月庄的庄规，把老妇的女儿交给了蓝止萍"
msgstr "By Latemoon Manor's rules, handed the old woman's daughter to Lan Zhiping"

msgid "你把她带了回来。内书房里多了一个人，不再蒙面。老妇替你向庄主讨了一个执事。"
msgstr "You brought her home. There is one more person in the Inner Study, unmasked now. The old woman asked the Mistress to make you a Deacon."

msgid "把老妇的女儿带回了晚月庄"
msgstr "Brought the old woman's daughter home to Latemoon Manor"

msgid "替花紫会摸回槐阳八户的卖身契；数着皮酒囊上的结，找到真龙头；尚书府小屋那封密信，给花紫会还是给官府；夜里从狗洞偷出卫沧澜；认二十三个结，还是认这些年管事的人。"
msgstr "Lift the indentures of eight Huaiyang households for the Beggars' Guild; count the knots on the leather wineskins to find the true Dragon Head; give the secret letter from the Small Room of the Minister's Mansion to the Beggars' Guild or to the authorities; steal Wei Canglan out through the dog hole by night; own the twenty-three knots, or the man who has run things all these years."

msgid "叫花子不再跟你说正事。花紫会的事，到此为止。"
msgstr "The beggars no longer talk business with you. The Beggars' Guild's business ends here."

msgid "乔阴福林大街上的陆得财有一件差事。去问他「差事」。"
msgstr "Lu Decai on Fulin Street in Tallshade has an errand. Go and ask him about \"Errands\"."

msgid "陆得财托你一件差事：福林酒楼二楼那个兵部的胡管事，怀里揣着槐阳城外八户人家的卖身契。摸回来。"
msgstr "Lu Decai gives you an errand: Steward Hu of the Ministry of War, upstairs in Fulin Tavern, carries the indentures of eight households from outside Huaiyang in his robe. Lift them."

msgid "兵部收民夫的胡管事在福林酒楼二楼雅座喝酒，那叠卖身契揣在他怀里。选中他「偷窃」，挑「随手摸一样」——他身上只有那叠契。失了手，他喊着扑上来，乔阴的巡捕从此记你一笔（街上撞见就抓，罪名、行贿照旧）。不会偷的，先跟陆得财学两手「偷窃」。"
msgstr "Steward Hu, who takes on laborers for the Ministry of War, is drinking in a private room upstairs at Fulin Tavern, with the stack of indentures in his robe. Select him and \"Steal\", then pick \"Grab Whatever\": the indentures are all he carries. Fail, and he lunges at you shouting, and the Tallshade constables mark you from then on (they arrest you on sight in the street; charges and bribes work as usual). If you can't steal, first learn a little \"Steal\" from Lu Decai."

msgid "那叠卖身契到了你手里。"
msgstr "The stack of indentures is in your hands."

msgid "卖身契在你身上。回福林大街，递给陆得财。"
msgstr "The indentures are on you. Go back to Fulin Street and hand them to Lu Decai."

msgid "陆得财数完了八张契：明天她们就回家。他把皮酒囊递给你数——二十二个结。他是龙头的一个替身。"
msgstr "Lu Decai counts the eight indentures: tomorrow they go home. He hands you the leather wineskin to count: twenty-two knots. He is one of the Dragon Head's stand-ins."

msgid "从兵部的管事身上摸回了槐阳八户的卖身契"
msgstr "Lifted the indentures of eight Huaiyang households off the Ministry of War's steward"

msgid "五结弟子"
msgstr "Five-Knot Disciple"

msgid "真龙头的皮酒囊上二十三个结，替身的都少几个；替身一个只认得下一个。雪亭镇广场墙根下那个老乞丐也叫陆得财，结最少——问他「龙头」。"
msgstr "The true Dragon Head's leather wineskin has twenty-three knots, and each stand-in's has fewer; each stand-in knows only the next. The old beggar at the foot of the wall in Snow Pavilion's square is called Lu Decai too, and has the fewest knots: ask him about \"Dragon Head\"."

msgid "雪亭的陆得财，二十个结。他指了下一个：绮云镇的渡口。"
msgstr "Snow Pavilion's Lu Decai: twenty knots. He points you to the next: the ferry at Cloudweave Town."

msgid "下一个在绮云镇的渡口，坐在船帮上钓鱼，比雪亭那个多一个结。问他「龙头」。"
msgstr "The next is at the Cloudweave Town ferry, sitting on the side of a boat fishing, with one knot more than the one in Snow Pavilion. Ask him about \"Dragon Head\"."

msgid "绮云的陆得财，二十一个结。他说下一个就是龙头：京师东街，尚书府的后墙根底下。"
msgstr "Cloudweave's Lu Decai: twenty-one knots. He says the next is the Dragon Head himself: on Capital East Street, at the foot of the back wall of the Minister's Mansion."

msgid "京师东街，尚书府的后墙根底下，坐着一个打二十三个结的叫花子。问他「龙头」。"
msgstr "On Capital East Street, at the foot of the back wall of the Minister's Mansion, sits a beggar with twenty-three knots. Ask him about \"Dragon Head\"."

msgid "墙根下的陆得财，二十三个结。他是真龙头，在这堵墙底下看了庾家二十年；乔阴那个替他管着花紫会。"
msgstr "Lu Decai at the foot of the wall: twenty-three knots. He is the true Dragon Head, and has watched the Yu family from under this wall for twenty years; the one in Tallshade runs the Beggars' Guild for him."

msgid "真龙头要尚书府后院小屋里那封庾子建亲笔的密信（问他「密信」）；乔阴的程不平也要它，拿去当物证。玉螺湖底那件事之后，逆灵宫的信使才坐进小屋，信在他身上：进了小屋就是一场仗，他见人就动手，打不过就退出屋外。交给花紫会（问真龙头「密信」）：真龙头拿它压着庾家，官府那条线就断了；京师的事还没定的，这封信也不能拿去朝上揭发了。交给官府（问乔阴县衙的程不平「密信」）：揭发时照样算一样，花紫会这条线就断了。"
msgstr "The true Dragon Head wants the secret letter in Yu Zijian's own hand from the Small Room in the back courtyard of the Minister's Mansion (ask him about \"Secret Letter\"); Cheng Buping of Tallshade wants it too, as evidence. Only after the business at the bottom of Jade Conch Lake does the Black Palace's Messenger sit down in the Small Room, and the letter is on him: entering the Small Room means a fight, he attacks anyone he sees, and if you can't win, back out of the room. Give it to the Beggars' Guild (ask the true Dragon Head about \"Secret Letter\"): the true Dragon Head holds it over the Yu family, and the authorities' thread is cut; if the Capital business is not yet settled, the letter can no longer be used to denounce at court either. Give it to the authorities (ask Cheng Buping at Tallshade Yamen about \"Secret Letter\"): it still counts as one piece when you denounce, and the Beggars' Guild's thread is cut."

msgid "你把密信交给了真龙头。他把它塞进了皮酒囊的网绳里：这封信在一天，庾家就不敢清乔阴的巷子。"
msgstr "You gave the secret letter to the true Dragon Head. He tucked it into the netting of his leather wineskin: as long as this letter exists, the Yu family dares not clear Tallshade's alleys."

msgid "把尚书府小屋里的密信交给了花紫会的真龙头"
msgstr "Gave the secret letter from the Small Room of the Minister's Mansion to the Beggars' Guild's true Dragon Head"

msgid "你把密信交给了乔阴知县程不平。叫花子从此不跟你说正事。"
msgstr "You gave the secret letter to Cheng Buping, County Magistrate of Tallshade. The beggars no longer talk business with you."

msgid "把尚书府小屋里的密信交给了乔阴知县程不平"
msgstr "Gave the secret letter from the Small Room of the Minister's Mansion to Cheng Buping, County Magistrate of Tallshade"

msgid "真龙头还有一件事要托你：尚书府客房里关着的那个老人。到京师东街尚书府的后墙根，问他「盟主」。他说了狗洞的：夜里（入夜到子时）拨开墙根东头那捆柴草，从狗洞钻进后院；护院挑着灯在院子里绕圈，别跟他们照面——撞见了就被推出大门，下回再来。进了客房，跟那老人说「走」。卫沧澜已经出了尚书府的，问真龙头一句「盟主」就是。"
msgstr "The true Dragon Head has one more thing to ask of you: the old man locked in the guest room of the Minister's Mansion. Go to the foot of the back wall of the Minister's Mansion on Capital East Street and ask him about \"Alliance Leader\". Once he has told you of the dog hole: at night (from nightfall to midnight), pull aside the bundle of brushwood at the east end of the wall and crawl through the dog hole into the back courtyard; the Estate Guards circle the courtyard with lanterns, so keep out of their way: if they catch you, you are pushed out the gate and must try again another time. In the guest room, tell the old man \"Leave\". If Wei Canglan is already out of the Minister's Mansion, just ask the true Dragon Head about \"Alliance Leader\"."

msgid "卫沧澜照叫花子指的路，从后院的狗洞出了尚书府。真龙头说：人出来了，他也该回乔阴了——福林大街见。"
msgstr "Wei Canglan took the way the beggars showed him and left the Minister's Mansion through the dog hole in the back courtyard. The true Dragon Head says: the man is out, and it is time he went back to Tallshade too; see you on Fulin Street."

msgid "夜里从尚书府的狗洞偷出了卫沧澜"
msgstr "Stole Wei Canglan out of the Minister's Mansion by night through the dog hole"

msgid "卫沧澜已经出了尚书府。真龙头说：人出来了，他也该回乔阴了——福林大街见。"
msgstr "Wei Canglan is already out of the Minister's Mansion. The true Dragon Head says: the man is out, and it is time he went back to Tallshade too; see you on Fulin Street."

msgid "真龙头回了乔阴，坐在福林大街当中。去福林大街——陆得财在街上的时候，两个人要碰面。真龙头要带花紫会吃官饭：给官府做眼线，换叫花子不再被巡捕抓；陆得财二十年没让一个官差进过乔阴的巷子。认二十三个结，问真龙头「龙头」：花紫会投颜违，巡捕不再抓花紫会的人，你的偷窃案底勾销，陆得财走了就不回来。认这些年管事的人，问陆得财「龙头」：真龙头回京师的墙根，乔阴照旧，花紫会投旧盟主。已经入了虹台的席的，票照入席时的算。"
msgstr "The true Dragon Head has come back to Tallshade and sits in the middle of Fulin Street. Go to Fulin Street: while Lu Decai is in the street, the two of them will meet. The true Dragon Head wants the Beggars' Guild to eat official rice, serving as the authorities' eyes in exchange for the constables no longer arresting beggars; Lu Decai has not let a single constable into Tallshade's alleys in twenty years. Own the twenty-three knots, and ask the true Dragon Head about \"Dragon Head\": the Beggars' Guild votes for Yan Wei, the constables no longer arrest its people, your record for theft is wiped clean, and Lu Decai leaves and does not come back. Own the man who has run things all these years, and ask Lu Decai about \"Dragon Head\": the true Dragon Head goes back to the foot of the wall in the Capital, Tallshade stays as it is, and the Beggars' Guild votes for the old Alliance Leader. If you have already taken your seat on the Rainbow Terrace, the votes count as they stood when you took it."

msgid "你认了二十三个结。陆得财把怀里的东西都放在真龙头脚边，出了北门。花紫会吃上了官饭。"
msgstr "You owned the twenty-three knots. Lu Decai laid everything from his robe at the true Dragon Head's feet and went out by the north gate. The Beggars' Guild eats official rice now."

msgid "在福林大街认了二十三个结：花紫会跟真龙头吃官饭"
msgstr "Owned the twenty-three knots on Fulin Street: the Beggars' Guild eats official rice with the true Dragon Head"

msgid "九结弟子"
msgstr "Nine-Knot Disciple"

msgid "你认了这些年管事的陆得财。真龙头把皮酒囊系到他腰上，回了京师的墙根。乔阴的巷子里，照旧没有官差。"
msgstr "You owned Lu Decai, who has run things all these years. The true Dragon Head tied the leather wineskin to his belt and went back to the foot of the wall in the Capital. There are still no constables in Tallshade's alleys."

msgid "在福林大街认了这些年管事的陆得财"
msgstr "Owned Lu Decai on Fulin Street, the man who has run things all these years"

msgid "做乔阴县的捕快：拿下官道上挂着官府告示收过路费的人，路引上是天驼关的印；严廷殷的印丢过三天，李信记着那三天的账——跟严廷殷整肃，还是跟李信揭发。"
msgstr "Serve as a constable of Tallshade County: take down the men collecting tolls on the official road under an official notice, whose travel passes bear Camelback Pass's seal; Yan Tingyin's seal was lost for three days, and Li Xin kept a ledger of those three days: purge with Yan Tingyin, or expose with Li Xin."

msgid "程不平不再跟你说案子。官府的事，到此为止。"
msgstr "Cheng Buping no longer talks cases with you. Officialdom's business ends here."

msgid "武举的荐书：带着捕快腰牌去京师校武场，问葛升「武举」，第一场免考"
msgstr "The recommendation for the Military Exam: take the constable's badge to the Drill Ground in the Capital and ask Ge Sheng about \"Military Exam\" to skip the first round"

msgid "小屋的密信"
msgstr "The Small Room's secret letter"

msgid "在尚书府后院小屋里逆灵宫的信使身上；交给程不平（问他「密信」），给了花紫会，官府这条线就断了"
msgstr "On the Black Palace's Messenger in the Small Room in the back courtyard of the Minister's Mansion; give it to Cheng Buping (ask him about \"Secret Letter\"), for if it goes to the Beggars' Guild, the authorities' thread is cut"

msgid "乔阴知县程不平还缺一个捕快。去县衙大堂问他「捕快」。花紫会的人、惯窃，他不收。"
msgstr "Cheng Buping, County Magistrate of Tallshade, still needs a constable. Go to the Court Hall of the yamen and ask him about \"Constable\". He takes no one from the Beggars' Guild, and no habitual thieves."

msgid "程不平给了你一块乔阴捕快腰牌：不给俸禄，不教功夫，只给案子。"
msgstr "Cheng Buping gave you a Tallshade constable's badge: no pay, no arts taught, only cases."

msgid "头一件案子：雪亭镇往西，青石官道的路口，有个汉子倚着一块「官府告示」收过路费，黄金一两。乔阴县衙没贴过那样的告示——拿下他（选中他「攻击」），他身上有东西。"
msgstr "The first case: west of Snow Pavilion, at the Junction on the Bluestone Road, a fellow leaning on an \"Official Notice\" collects a toll of one tael of gold. Tallshade Yamen never posted any such notice: take him down (select him and \"Attack\"); he has something on him."

msgid "雪亭路口收钱的钱贵挨了打，扔下一叠路引跑了。"
msgstr "Qian Gui, who collected money at the Snow Pavilion junction, took a beating, dropped a stack of travel passes and ran."

msgid "还有一个：绮云镇口那块官府公告底下，有人照着公告收「入镇黄金一两」。拿下他（选中他「攻击」）。"
msgstr "There is another: under the official notice at the entrance to Cloudweave Town, someone collects \"one tael of gold to enter the town\" as the notice says. Take him down (select him and \"Attack\")."

msgid "绮云镇口收钱的牛四也挨了打，路引掉了一地。"
msgstr "Niu Si, who collected money at the entrance to Cloudweave Town, took a beating too, and his travel passes spilled all over the ground."

msgid "两个收过路费的身上都搜出了路引。带着路引回乔阴县衙，问程不平「路引」。"
msgstr "Travel passes were found on both toll collectors. Take them back to Tallshade Yamen and ask Cheng Buping about \"Travel Passes\"."

msgid "程不平认出路引上的印：天驼关铁卫营的大印，严将军的印。"
msgstr "Cheng Buping knows the seal on the passes: the great seal of the Iron Guard Camp at Camelback Pass, General Yan's seal."

msgid "拿下了官道上挂着官府告示收过路费的人，搜出了盖着天驼关大印的路引"
msgstr "Took down the men collecting tolls on the official road under an official notice, and found travel passes stamped with Camelback Pass's great seal"

msgid "路引上是天驼关铁卫营的大印。带着路引去天驼关军营最里头的将军营帐（进营要大队长的名册），问镇国大将军严廷殷「路引」。程不平的信还没给他看的，先给他看信。"
msgstr "The passes bear the great seal of the Iron Guard Camp at Camelback Pass. Take them to the General's Tent at the far end of the Camelback Pass camp (to enter the camp you need to be on the Captain's roll) and ask the Guardian General, Yan Tingyin, about \"Travel Passes\". If you have not yet shown him Cheng Buping's letter, show it to him first."

msgid "严廷殷认了路引上的印：是他的印，丢过三天的那一方。那三天的事，他叫你去问副将李信。"
msgstr "Yan Tingyin knew the seal on the passes: it is his, the one that went missing for three days. For what happened in those three days, he sends you to ask his Lieutenant, Li Xin."

msgid "副将李信在副将营帐（将军营帐外头那一间）。问他「印鉴」：印丢的那三天，他记着。"
msgstr "Lieutenant Li Xin is in the Lieutenant's Tent (the one just outside the General's Tent). Ask him about \"Seal\": he kept a record of the three days the seal was lost."

msgid "李信拿出一本薄册子：印丢的那三天，盖出去的是私授的官职十二个、空白的路引四百张，还让兵部拓了个模子去——关北征民夫的令，盖的是照模子浇的印。盖印的是军师赫造基。"
msgstr "Li Xin brings out a thin booklet: in the three days the seal was lost, it stamped twelve unauthorized official posts and four hundred blank travel passes, and the Ministry of War was even allowed to take a mold of it; the orders conscripting laborers Beyond the Pass bear a seal cast from that mold. The one who used the seal was the Adviser, He Zaoji."

msgid "带着路引回将军营帐，问军师赫造基「路引」，当面对一对李信的账。第六章他那桩八两银子的秘密（拓模）还没买的，先买下——他认的是买过模子的人。"
msgstr "Take the passes back to the General's Tent, ask the Adviser, He Zaoji, about \"Travel Passes\", and check Li Xin's ledger against him face to face. If you have not bought his eight-taels secret (the mold) in Chapter 6, buy it first: he owns up only to someone who has bought the mold."

msgid "赫造基认了：印丢的那三天在后备兵手里，他借来替兵部盖了一夜官职的札子和路引。要告他，就连将军一起告——印是将军丢的。"
msgstr "He Zaoji owned up: in the three days the seal was lost it was in the Reserve Soldier's hands, and he borrowed it and spent a night stamping warrants for posts and travel passes for the Ministry of War. To charge him is to charge the general with him: it was the general who lost the seal."

msgid "跟李信揭发（在副将营帐问他「揭发」）：账本上京，严廷殷被召回，李信守关，天驼关从此不收过路费；第九章还没定的，这本账算揭发的一样物证。跟严廷殷整肃（在将军营帐问他「整肃」）：军师由你在营里拿下，路引停了，天驼关照旧是他的，关北的事不往朝上报——铁卫营欠你一回，终章替你守官道。"
msgstr "Expose it with Li Xin (ask him about \"Expose\" in the Lieutenant's Tent): the ledger goes to the Capital, Yan Tingyin is recalled, Li Xin holds the pass, and Camelback Pass collects no more tolls; if Chapter 9 is not yet settled, this ledger counts as one piece of evidence for the denunciation. Purge with Yan Tingyin (ask him about \"Purge\" in the General's Tent): you take the Adviser down in the camp, the travel passes stop, Camelback Pass stays his, and nothing about Beyond the Pass is reported to court; the Iron Guard Camp owes you one, and in the finale holds the official road for you."

msgid "你跟严廷殷整肃：军师交给你在营里拿下，天驼关的事天驼关了。"
msgstr "You purged with Yan Tingyin: the Adviser is left to you to take down in the camp, and Camelback Pass's business stays at Camelback Pass."

msgid "在天驼关跟严廷殷整肃，那三天的账不上京"
msgstr "Purged Camelback Pass with Yan Tingyin, and the ledger of those three days never went to the Capital"

msgid "你跟李信揭发：李信的账抄一份上了京，严廷殷被召回京城，李信守关。天驼关从此不收过路费。"
msgstr "You exposed it with Li Xin: a copy of Li Xin's ledger went to the Capital, Yan Tingyin was recalled to the Capital, and Li Xin holds the pass. Camelback Pass collects no more tolls."

msgid "在天驼关跟李信揭发，那三天的账上了京"
msgstr "Exposed Camelback Pass with Li Xin, and the ledger of those three days went to the Capital"

msgid "军师赫造基就在将军营帐里。问他「路引」，他知道瞒不住了；再选中他「攻击」，拿下他（他只会被击倒）。"
msgstr "The Adviser, He Zaoji, is right there in the General's Tent. Ask him about \"Travel Passes\", and he knows it can't be hidden anymore; then select him and \"Attack\" to take him down (he can only be knocked down)."

msgid "赫造基倒在将军营帐里，两个铁卫营的兵把他捆了，关进后营。官道上的路引从此停了。严廷殷说：铁卫营欠你一回。"
msgstr "He Zaoji falls in the General's Tent, and two soldiers of the Iron Guard Camp tie him up and lock him in the rear camp. The travel passes on the official road stop for good. Yan Tingyin says: the Iron Guard Camp owes you one."

msgid "尚书府的客房里还关着卫沧澜。皇叔入了朝的，去皇城养心殿问於兰天武「卫沧澜」：他拿着手诏去尚书府要人。卫沧澜已经出了尚书府的，这一步就过了；第九章没有请皇叔回朝的，官府插不上手。"
msgstr "Wei Canglan is still locked in the guest room of the Minister's Mansion. If the Imperial Uncle has come to court, go to the Hall of Mental Cultivation in the Palace City and ask Yulan Tianwu about \"Wei Canglan\": he takes a handwritten edict to the Minister's Mansion to demand the man. If Wei Canglan is already out of the Minister's Mansion, this step is passed; if you did not bring the Imperial Uncle back to court in Chapter 9, the authorities cannot step in."

msgid "於兰天武拿着手诏去了尚书府，庾子建亲自开的门。卫沧澜回了水烟阁——他说，这条命欠朝廷一份。"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu took the handwritten edict to the Minister's Mansion, and Yu Zijian opened the door himself. Wei Canglan went back to Waterfog Pavilion; this life, he said, owes the court a share."

msgid "请皇叔拿手诏从尚书府要回了卫沧澜"
msgstr "Had the Imperial Uncle take a handwritten edict to the Minister's Mansion and bring back Wei Canglan"

msgid "卫沧澜已经出了尚书府。"
msgstr "Wei Canglan is already out of the Minister's Mansion."

msgid "皇叔没有回朝。卫沧澜的事，官府插不上手。"
msgstr "The Imperial Uncle did not return to court. The authorities cannot step in for Wei Canglan."

msgid "藏经楼少了一函镇教秘籍；林忌的师弟，二十年前带着它下了山。书回了山，后半本是逆灵宫的字——烧，还是收回藏经楼。"
msgstr "The Scripture Library is one volume of the guardian scriptures short; Lin Ji's junior brother took it down the mountain twenty years ago. The book comes back to the mountain, its second half in the Black Palace's writing: burn it, or take it back into the Scripture Library."

msgid "你离了茅山。灵心观的事，到此为止。"
msgstr "You have left Mount Mao. Clear Heart Abbey's business ends here."

msgid "灵心观藏经楼的二楼，红布桌上放着茅山的镇教秘籍。林忌在灵心观的大殿——问他「师弟」，再上二楼看看那张桌子。"
msgstr "On the second floor of the Scripture Library at Clear Heart Abbey, Mount Mao's guardian scriptures lie on a red-cloth table. Lin Ji is in the main hall of Clear Heart Abbey: ask him about \"Junior Brother\", then go up to the second floor and look at that table."

msgid "镇教秘籍少了一函。红布上压着一张发黄的字条：书我带走。师兄守山，我守人。"
msgstr "One volume of the guardian scriptures is missing. On the red cloth lies a yellowed note: I take the book. Senior Brother guards the mountain; I guard the people."

msgid "回灵心观的大殿，再问林忌「师弟」。"
msgstr "Go back to the main hall of Clear Heart Abbey and ask Lin Ji about \"Junior Brother\" again."

msgid "林忌说：少的那一函叫《上清符箓》。二十年前兵部的庾大人求茅山镇宅，他不肯，他的师弟揣着书下了山，进了京城的兵部尚书府，再没回来。"
msgstr "Lin Ji says the missing volume is the Highest Clarity talisman book. Twenty years ago Lord Yu of the Ministry of War asked Mount Mao to guard his house, and he refused; his junior brother took the book down the mountain, went into the Minister's Mansion in the Capital, and never came back."

msgid "数出藏经楼的镇教秘籍少了一函"
msgstr "Found the Scripture Library one volume of the guardian scriptures short"

msgid "侍者"
msgstr "Acolyte"

msgid "林忌的师弟二十年前进了京师的兵部尚书府。尚书府的花园里有个花匠（进府要先打点大门的门房）——问他「师兄」。"
msgstr "Lin Ji's junior brother went into the Minister's Mansion in the Capital twenty years ago. There is a gardener in the mansion's Garden (to get in, first square the gatekeeper at the gate): ask him about \"Senior Brother\"."

msgid "尚书府的花匠就是林忌的师弟。他镇了二十年宅，教过庾清尘；这两年小屋里来了逆灵宫的人，他们烧掉的东西，他一页页抄在了《上清符箓》的空白处。"
msgstr "The gardener of the Minister's Mansion is Lin Ji's junior brother. He has guarded the house for twenty years and taught Yu Qingchen; these two years the Black Palace's people have come to the Small Room, and what they burned he copied, page by page, into the blank spaces of the Highest Clarity talisman book."

msgid "问尚书府的花匠「符箓」。"
msgstr "Ask the gardener of the Minister's Mansion about \"Talismans\"."

msgid "花匠把《上清符箓》交给了你：前半是茅山的符，后半是逆灵宫的字。"
msgstr "The gardener gives you the Highest Clarity talisman book: the first half is Mount Mao's talismans, the second half the Black Palace's writing."

msgid "从尚书府的花匠手里接过了《上清符箓》"
msgstr "Received the Highest Clarity talisman book from the gardener of the Minister's Mansion"

msgid "把《上清符箓》带回灵心观的大殿，交给林忌（「给」他）。"
msgstr "Bring the Highest Clarity talisman book back to the main hall of Clear Heart Abbey and hand it to Lin Ji (give it to him)."

msgid "林忌一页一页翻过去，翻到后半本停住了：是逆灵宫的字。他说，师弟会来的。"
msgstr "Lin Ji turns the pages one by one and stops at the second half: the Black Palace's writing. His junior brother will come, he says."

msgid "林忌说师弟会来。花匠随后自己上了山——二十年没进过的大殿，下回你进殿，他就站在殿门里。"
msgstr "Lin Ji says his junior brother will come. Then the gardener comes up the mountain himself: the next time you enter the main hall, which he has not entered in twenty years, he will be standing just inside its doors."

msgid "花匠站在殿门里，叫了林忌一声师兄。林忌说烧：连书带字投进香炉，茅山宁可没有它。花匠说留：锁回藏经楼，茅山才认得逆灵宫的字。"
msgstr "The gardener stands inside the hall doors and calls Lin Ji \"Senior Brother\". Lin Ji says burn it: book and writing into the incense burner, for Mount Mao would rather be without it. The gardener says keep it: lock it back in the Scripture Library, for only then will Mount Mao know the Black Palace's writing."

msgid "烧（问林忌「烧」）：书投进香炉，花匠回京城守着庾清尘；林忌教你谷衣心法，虹台上茅山投颜违（主剿）。留（问花匠「留」）：书锁回藏经楼二楼，花匠留在山上守书，教茅山道术，谁都教；林忌从此对你冷一分，虹台上茅山投旧盟主（北麓的人交茅山看着）。两边茅山的弟子都晋护法。"
msgstr "Burn it (ask Lin Ji about \"Burn\"): the book goes into the incense burner, and the gardener goes back to the Capital to watch over Yu Qingchen; Lin Ji teaches you the Grain Robe Heart Method, and on the Rainbow Terrace Mount Mao votes for Yan Wei (to crush them). Keep it (ask the gardener about \"Keep\"): the book is locked back on the second floor of the Scripture Library, and the gardener stays on the mountain to guard it and teaches Mount Mao Sorcery, to anyone; Lin Ji is a shade cooler toward you from then on, and on the Rainbow Terrace Mount Mao votes for the old Alliance Leader (the North Foot's people kept under Mount Mao's watch). Either way, Mount Mao's disciples rise to Guardian."

msgid "《上清符箓》投进了殿前的香炉。茅山宁可没有这本书；花匠下山回京城去了。"
msgstr "The Highest Clarity talisman book went into the incense burner before the hall. Mount Mao would rather be without the book; the gardener went down the mountain, back to the Capital."

msgid "看着林忌把《上清符箓》投进了香炉"
msgstr "Watched Lin Ji throw the Highest Clarity talisman book into the incense burner"

msgid "《上清符箓》锁回了藏经楼二楼，花匠留在山上守书。护法的名分，是花匠替你向林忌讨的。"
msgstr "The Highest Clarity talisman book is locked back on the second floor of the Scripture Library, and the gardener stays on the mountain to guard it. The gardener asked Lin Ji to make you a Guardian."

msgid "把《上清符箓》收回了藏经楼"
msgstr "Took the Highest Clarity talisman book back into the Scripture Library"

msgid "北麓那座道观里还剩着人。湖上的事了了（终章之后），问林忌「剿」：官兵上山，一个也走不了。北麓的人已经有了去处的，这一步就过了。"
msgstr "People are still left in the abbey on the North Foot. Once the business on the lake is over (after the finale), ask Lin Ji about \"Suppress\": soldiers go up the mountain, and not one gets away. If the North Foot's people already have somewhere to go, this step is passed."

msgid "北麓那座道观里剩下的人，有了去处。"
msgstr "Those left in the abbey on the North Foot have somewhere to go."

msgid "北麓那座道观里还剩着人。湖上的事了了（终章之后），问藏经楼二楼的花匠「北麓」：他拿着书上北麓去念他们自己的经——你上北麓，在绞盘边看他念完。北麓的人已经有了去处的，这一步就过了。"
msgstr "People are still left in the abbey on the North Foot. Once the business on the lake is over (after the finale), ask the gardener on the second floor of the Scripture Library about \"North Foot\": he takes the book up to the North Foot to read them their own scripture; go up to the North Foot and watch him finish, by the winch. If the North Foot's people already have somewhere to go, this step is passed."

msgid "风泉之剑里住着剑灵；见过它的人，才算步玄的人。骆云舟的大哥在兵部尚书府写了十年字，兵部抄本上多出来的三句是他落的笔——让他上堂作证，还是保住骆家。"
msgstr "A sword spirit lives in the Windspring Sword; only those who have seen it count as Mystic Step's own. Luo Yunzhou's elder brother has written for ten years at the Minister's Mansion, and the three extra lines in the Ministry of War copy were set down by his brush: have him testify in court, or protect the Luo family."

msgid "你离了步玄派。曼雩台上的事，到此为止。"
msgstr "You have left the Mystic Step School. The business on the Rain Dance Terrace ends here."

msgid "问乔阴曼雩台的骆云舟「风泉」，再问他「问剑」：他把风泉之剑插在台边的青石上。天黑以后（夜晚、午夜）剑灵站在石前——跟它切磋，在它念到第四句「剑神如意」之前打中它。"
msgstr "Ask Luo Yunzhou on the Rain Dance Terrace in Tallshade about \"Windspring\", then about \"Sword Trial\": he plants the Windspring Sword in the bluestone at the terrace's edge. After dark (night, midnight) the sword spirit stands before the stone: spar with it, and hit it before it reaches the fourth line, \"Sword Spirit, at will\"."

msgid "剑灵在「剑神如意」之前收了剑。骆云舟说：步玄认你。"
msgstr "The sword spirit sheathed its blade before \"Sword Spirit, at will\". Luo Yunzhou says: Mystic Step accepts you."

msgid "在曼雩台上问过了剑，见过了风泉剑灵"
msgstr "Tested the sword on the Rain Dance Terrace and met the Soul of Windspring"

msgid "今夜的四句念完了，剑灵回了剑——明晚天黑再来"
msgstr "Tonight's four lines are spoken, and the sword spirit has gone back into the sword: come again after dark tomorrow"

msgid "问骆云舟「骆家」。他的家事在京城，要等主线第九章（进京）开了。"
msgstr "Ask Luo Yunzhou about \"The Luo Family\". His family business is in the Capital; it must wait until Chapter 9 of the main story (into the Capital) has opened."

msgid "骆云舟是骆家的二小子。大哥骆建章没去练剑，写得一手好字，在兵部尚书庾子建的府上做了十年书启；兄弟俩十年没说过话。他写了一封家书，托你送进京。"
msgstr "Luo Yunzhou is the Luo family's second son. His elder brother, Luo Jianzhang, never took up the sword; he writes a fine hand, and has served ten years as secretary in the household of Yu Zijian, Minister of War; the brothers have not spoken in ten years. He has written a letter home and asks you to take it to the Capital."

msgid "等主线第九章：湖底的事了了，才进得了京"
msgstr "Wait for Chapter 9 of the main story: only once the business at the bottom of the lake is over can you enter the Capital"

msgid "把家书送进京（「给」骆建章）：他在兵部尚书府的客厅里写字——进府先打点大门的门房；见过韦相国的，问相国「骆建章」，他写个条子给门房。庾子建下了狱，骆建章就在西街的相国府。"
msgstr "Take the letter home to the Capital (give it to Luo Jianzhang): he writes in the reception hall of the Minister's Mansion; to get in, first square the gatekeeper at the gate, or, if you have met Chancellor Wei, ask the Chancellor about \"Luo Jianzhang\" and he will write the gatekeeper a note. If Yu Zijian is in prison, Luo Jianzhang is at the Chancellor's House on West Street."

msgid "骆建章读完了信：「他还是那么写字，最后一笔甩出格子。」抄本的事，他一句没提。"
msgstr "Luo Jianzhang has read the letter: \"He still writes the same way, the last stroke flung out of the square.\" Of the copy, he says not a word."

msgid "第九章御书房樟木匣里的兵部抄本，比先帝的原令多出三句。带着它问骆建章「抄本」，或者问韦相国「抄本的字」。"
msgstr "In Chapter 9, the Ministry of War copy in the camphorwood box in the Imperial Study has three lines more than the late Emperor's original decree. Take it and ask Luo Jianzhang about \"Copy\", or ask Chancellor Wei about \"Handwriting on the Copy\"."

msgid "骆建章认了：二十年前他在兵部做抄手，原令存档的底子是他抄的；兵部抄本是庾子建口述、他落的笔——多出来的是哪三句，他写的时候就知道。"
msgstr "Luo Jianzhang owned up: twenty years ago he was a copyist at the Ministry of War, and the archive copy of the original decree was in his hand; the Ministry of War copy was dictated by Yu Zijian and set down by his brush, and which three lines were extra, he knew as he wrote them."

msgid "认出了兵部抄本上骆家的字"
msgstr "Recognized the Luo family's hand in the Ministry of War copy"

msgid "带着兵部抄本"
msgstr "Carrying the Ministry of War copy"

msgid "抄本在皇城御书房的樟木匣里：先走主线第九章"
msgstr "The copy is in the camphorwood box in the Imperial Study of the Palace City: play Chapter 9 of the main story first"

msgid "回乔阴的曼雩台，把大哥的话告诉骆云舟（问他「骆家」）。"
msgstr "Go back to the Rain Dance Terrace in Tallshade and tell Luo Yunzhou what his brother said (ask him about \"The Luo Family\")."

msgid "骆云舟听完，扇子停在半空。十年没回京城，他说，进京一趟。"
msgstr "Luo Yunzhou hears it out, his fan stopped in midair. He has not been back to the Capital in ten years, he says; he will go."

msgid "骆云舟进京了。去西街的相国府：兄弟俩在正厅上见面，韦相国坐在上首。（话听了一半就走开的：作证问骆云舟「作证」，保住骆家问骆建章「回家」。）"
msgstr "Luo Yunzhou has gone to the Capital. Go to the Chancellor's House on West Street: the brothers meet in the main hall, with Chancellor Wei in the seat of honor. (If you walk away halfway through: to testify, ask Luo Yunzhou about \"Testify\"; to protect the Luo family, ask Luo Jianzhang about \"Go Home\".)"

msgid "骆云舟要大哥上堂，把抄本上那三句是谁口述的说出来；大哥要跟他回乔阴，抄本的事不提。韦执中坐在上首，一句话也没说。"
msgstr "Luo Yunzhou wants his elder brother to go before the court and say who dictated those three lines in the copy; his elder brother wants to go back to Tallshade with him and leave the copy unspoken. Wei Zhizhong sits in the seat of honor and says nothing."

msgid "作证（问骆云舟「作证」）：大哥写供状，说出抄本那三句是庾子建口述——第九章还没定的，朝上揭发多一样人证；庾子建已经下狱的，大哥照实供，判流放；私了过或先解了皇叔通缉的，乔阴的案子重开。骆家和朝廷翻脸，虹台上步玄投旧盟主。保住骆家（问骆建章「回家」）：骆云舟带大哥回乔阴，抄本的事不提，大哥在曼雩台抄谱；骆家照旧是京城的世家，虹台上步玄投颜违。两边步玄的弟子都晋执事。"
msgstr "Testify (ask Luo Yunzhou about \"Testify\"): his elder brother writes a statement saying Yu Zijian dictated those three lines in the copy; if Chapter 9 is not yet settled, the denunciation at court gains one more witness; if Yu Zijian is already in prison, the brother confesses truthfully and is sentenced to exile; if you settled privately or first had the Imperial Uncle's warrant lifted, the case in Tallshade is reopened. The Luo family breaks with the court, and on the Rainbow Terrace Mystic Step votes for the old Alliance Leader. Protect the Luo family (ask Luo Jianzhang about \"Go Home\"): Luo Yunzhou takes his elder brother back to Tallshade, the copy is not spoken of, and the brother copies manuals on the Rain Dance Terrace; the Luo family stays one of the Capital's great houses, and on the Rainbow Terrace Mystic Step votes for Yan Wei. Either way, Mystic Step's disciples rise to Deacon."

msgid "骆建章写了供状，按了手印：兵部抄本上多出来的三句，是庾子建口述、他落的笔。骆家和朝廷翻了脸。"
msgstr "Luo Jianzhang wrote a statement and pressed his thumbprint to it: the three extra lines in the Ministry of War copy were dictated by Yu Zijian and set down by his brush. The Luo family has broken with the court."

msgid "陪骆建章写下了兵部抄本的供状"
msgstr "Stood by Luo Jianzhang as he wrote his statement on the Ministry of War copy"

msgid "骆云舟带大哥回了乔阴。抄本的事，骆家不再提；曼雩台上多了一张书案。"
msgstr "Luo Yunzhou took his elder brother back to Tallshade. The Luo family no longer speaks of the copy; there is a writing desk on the Rain Dance Terrace now."

msgid "让骆云舟带大哥回了乔阴"
msgstr "Let Luo Yunzhou take his elder brother back to Tallshade"

msgid "流云轩里躺着一个被鬼卒抓伤的乔阴樵夫，玄智的药赶不出那股寒；金门外站了十年的独眼头陀开口了：「我能。」他那部火性的经，三十年前从番坊来过一回，山烟寺没有收——这一回，收不收。"
msgstr "In Drifting Cloud Lodge lies a Tallshade woodcutter clawed by a Ghost Soldier, and Xuanzhi's medicine can't drive out the cold; the One-Eyed Ascetic, who has stood outside the Golden Gate for ten years, speaks up: \"I can.\" That fiery sutra of his came once from the Foreign Quarter thirty years ago, and Mountain Mist Temple did not accept it; this time, will it?"

msgid "你离了山烟寺。流云轩的事，到此为止。"
msgstr "You have left Mountain Mist Temple. Drifting Cloud Lodge's business ends here."

msgid "流云轩里躺着一个乔阴来的樵夫，伤口是冷的。去山烟寺大雄宝殿问玄智方丈「流云轩」，请他开方子。"
msgstr "A woodcutter from Tallshade lies in Drifting Cloud Lodge, and his wound is cold. Go to the Mahavira Hall at Mountain Mist Temple, ask Abbot Xuanzhi about \"Drifting Cloud Lodge\", and ask him for a prescription."

msgid "玄智开了方子：附子回阳，麝香开窍，鬼臼以毒攻毒。三味齐了，交给流云轩的药僧煎。"
msgstr "Xuanzhi writes a prescription: aconite to restore the yang, musk to open the orifices, mayapple root to fight poison with poison. Once all three are gathered, give them to the Medicine Monk at Drifting Cloud Lodge to brew."

msgid "等主线第五章：寒於宝衣的事了了，才有这个病人"
msgstr "Wait for Chapter 5 of the main story: only once the business of Hanyu's Robe is over is there a patient"

msgid "第一味：附子。在山烟寺东边的药圃里「采」。"
msgstr "The first herb: aconite. \"Gather\" it in the Herb Garden east of Mountain Mist Temple."

msgid "你在药圃东边那一畦挖出了一块附子。"
msgstr "In the eastern bed of the Herb Garden, you dig up a piece of aconite."

msgid "第二味：麝香。雪亭镇桑邻药铺的杨掌柜年轻时跟玄智学过医，问他「山烟寺」。"
msgstr "The second herb: musk. Shopkeeper Yang of the Mulberry Herb Shop in Snow Pavilion studied medicine under Xuanzhi when he was young; ask him about \"Mountain Mist Temple\"."

msgid "杨掌柜看了方子，包了一小包麝香给你，没收钱。"
msgstr "Shopkeeper Yang looks at the prescription, wraps you a small packet of musk, and takes no money."

msgid "第三味：鬼臼，长在乔阴树王坟边的石缝里。那里站着一个鬼卒——打发了它，在石缝边「采」。"
msgstr "The third herb: mayapple root, which grows in the rock crevice by the Tree King's Tomb in Tallshade. A Ghost Soldier stands there: deal with it, then \"Gather\" by the crevice."

msgid "你在树王坟边的石缝里采到了一株鬼臼。"
msgstr "In the rock crevice by the Tree King's Tomb, you gather a mayapple root."

msgid "三味齐了。回流云轩，问药僧「煎药」。"
msgstr "All three herbs are gathered. Go back to Drifting Cloud Lodge and ask the Medicine Monk about \"Brewing Medicine\"."

msgid "药僧把三味药煎成了一碗黑褐色的汤药。"
msgstr "The Medicine Monk brews the three herbs into a bowl of blackish-brown herbal decoction."

msgid "把汤药喂给老葛（「给」流云轩里躺着的樵夫）。"
msgstr "Feed the herbal decoction to Old Ge (give it to the woodcutter lying in Drifting Cloud Lodge)."

msgid "药喂下去了，老葛肚子里是热的，可那条胳膊还是冷，冷到骨头缝里——寒气退不下去。"
msgstr "The medicine goes down, and Old Ge's belly is warm, but that arm is still cold, cold to the marrow: the cold will not leave."

msgid "替流云轩采齐了玄智的三味药，喂了乔阴的樵夫"
msgstr "Gathered Xuanzhi's three herbs for Drifting Cloud Lodge and fed them to the Tallshade woodcutter"

msgid "知客"
msgstr "Guest Master"

msgid "玄智的药赶不出那股寒。金门外站了十年、从不说话的独眼头陀，问他「病人」。让他治（问头陀「领路」）：领他进流云轩，老葛当场就好——可寺规不许外人进流云轩，玄智会记你不守寺规。照寺规（问大雄宝殿的玄智「寺规」）：方丈自己守着老葛，命保得住，一只手保不住；头陀从此不理你。"
msgstr "Xuanzhi's medicine can't drive out the cold. Ask the One-Eyed Ascetic, who has stood outside the Golden Gate for ten years and never speaks, about \"Patient\". Let him treat it (ask the ascetic about \"Lead the Way\"): lead him into Drifting Cloud Lodge, and Old Ge is well on the spot; but the temple rules forbid outsiders in Drifting Cloud Lodge, and Xuanzhi will mark you for breaking them. Keep the temple rules (ask Xuanzhi in the Mahavira Hall about \"Temple Rules\"): the abbot watches over Old Ge himself, and his life can be saved but not one hand; the ascetic ignores you from then on."

msgid "你领独眼头陀进了流云轩。他一掌按在老葛的伤口上，寒气冒成一缕白烟——老葛当场坐了起来。玄智记下了：你不守寺规。"
msgstr "You led the One-Eyed Ascetic into Drifting Cloud Lodge. He pressed a palm on Old Ge's wound, the cold rose off it in a wisp of white smoke, and Old Ge sat up on the spot. Xuanzhi has marked it: you do not keep the temple rules."

msgid "领金门外的独眼头陀进了流云轩，治好了乔阴的樵夫"
msgstr "Led the One-Eyed Ascetic from outside the Golden Gate into Drifting Cloud Lodge and cured the Tallshade woodcutter"

msgid "你照了寺规。玄智在流云轩守了老葛三天三夜：命保住了，右手废了。头陀转身回了金门外。"
msgstr "You kept the temple rules. Xuanzhi watched over Old Ge in Drifting Cloud Lodge for three days and nights: his life was saved, his right hand was not. The ascetic turned and went back outside the Golden Gate."

msgid "照山烟寺的寺规，没让外人进流云轩"
msgstr "Kept Mountain Mist Temple's rules and let no outsider into Drifting Cloud Lodge"

msgid "独眼头陀那门火性的内功，他练的那部经，不是山烟寺的东西。它从番坊来：去番坊日陀罗寺问龙若法王「头陀」。"
msgstr "The One-Eyed Ascetic's fiery neigong, and the sutra he practices, are not Mountain Mist Temple's. It came from the Foreign Quarter: go to Ritola Temple in the Foreign Quarter and ask Dharma King Longruo about \"Ascetic\"."

msgid "龙若法王说起了三十年前：师父从天竺背来的两部经，当年不肯开经匣的住持，追出山门的玄尘，十年前派回去的头陀和他那只眼。他给了你一片贝叶：「收不收，是山烟寺的事。」"
msgstr "Dharma King Longruo told of thirty years ago: the two sutras his Shifu carried on his back from India, the abbot who would not open the sutra case back then, Xuanchen who chased after them out the temple gate, and the ascetic sent back ten years ago, and his eye. He gave you a palm-leaf page: \"Whether it is accepted is for Mountain Mist Temple to say.\""

msgid "照了寺规的：先回流云轩，药僧有话要说"
msgstr "If you kept the temple rules: go back to Drifting Cloud Lodge first; the Medicine Monk has something to say"

msgid "回日照山，把龙若法王的贝叶拿给金门外的独眼头陀看（问他「经」）。"
msgstr "Go back to Sunlit Mountain and show Dharma King Longruo's palm-leaf page to the One-Eyed Ascetic outside the Golden Gate (ask him about \"Sutra\")."

msgid "独眼头陀认出了叶边师父的字。十年里第一次，他跨进了金门，往大雄宝殿去了。"
msgstr "The One-Eyed Ascetic knows his Shifu's writing in the leaf's margin. For the first time in ten years, he steps through the Golden Gate and heads for the Mahavira Hall."

msgid "头陀上了大雄宝殿。去大殿：玄智、头陀、你。（话听了一半就走开的：收经问玄智「收经」，守寺问玄智「守寺」。）"
msgstr "The ascetic has gone up to the Mahavira Hall. Go to the great hall: Xuanzhi, the ascetic, and you. (If you walk away halfway through: to accept the sutra, ask Xuanzhi about \"Accept the Sutra\"; to keep the temple, ask Xuanzhi about \"Keep the Temple\".)"

msgid "头陀把贝叶放在佛前，只问一句：收，还是不收。玄智说起三十年前走掉的玄尘师弟，回过头来问你。"
msgstr "The ascetic lays the palm-leaf page before the Buddha and asks only one thing: accept it, or not. Xuanzhi speaks of Brother Xuanchen, who left thirty years ago, then turns to ask you."

msgid "收经（问玄智「收经」）：头陀受戒入寺，流云轩从此治得了鬼卒的寒，头陀在流云轩教婆萝蜜多心经，谁都能学；容得下西来的经，也容得下别人，虹台上山烟寺投旧盟主。守寺（问玄智「守寺」）：本寺一脉，经交还龙若，头陀回番坊，金门外空了；玄智肯教外人莲华心法；虹台上山烟寺投颜违。两边山烟寺的弟子都晋首座。"
msgstr "Accept the sutra (ask Xuanzhi about \"Accept the Sutra\"): the ascetic takes the precepts and joins the temple, Drifting Cloud Lodge can cure the Ghost Soldiers' cold from then on, and the ascetic teaches the Heart Sutra at Drifting Cloud Lodge, to anyone; a temple with room for the sutra from the west has room for others too, and on the Rainbow Terrace Mountain Mist Temple votes for the old Alliance Leader. Keep the temple (ask Xuanzhi about \"Keep the Temple\"): the temple keeps its own line, the sutra goes back to Longruo, the ascetic returns to the Foreign Quarter, and the place outside the Golden Gate stands empty; Xuanzhi is willing to teach outsiders the Lotus Heart Method; on the Rainbow Terrace Mountain Mist Temple votes for Yan Wei. Either way, Mountain Mist Temple's disciples rise to Head Seat."

msgid "山烟寺收了西来的经。独眼头陀在佛前受了戒，去了流云轩；鬼卒的寒，往后山烟寺赶得出去了。"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple accepted the sutra from the west. The One-Eyed Ascetic took the precepts before the Buddha and went to Drifting Cloud Lodge; from now on Mountain Mist Temple can drive out the Ghost Soldiers' cold."

msgid "把番坊的婆萝蜜多心经带回日照山，山烟寺收了经"
msgstr "Brought the Heart Sutra from the Foreign Quarter back to Sunlit Mountain, and Mountain Mist Temple accepted it"

msgid "首座"
msgstr "Head Seat"

msgid "山烟寺守了本寺一脉。玄智把贝叶交还头陀，头陀回了番坊，金门外那块地方空了。"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple kept to its own line. Xuanzhi handed the palm-leaf page back to the ascetic, the ascetic went back to the Foreign Quarter, and the place outside the Golden Gate stands empty."

msgid "陪山烟寺守住了本寺一脉，把西来的经送回了番坊"
msgstr "Helped Mountain Mist Temple keep to its own line, and sent the sutra from the west back to the Foreign Quarter"

msgid "青石村北边那个拴着铁链的山洞，村长说「绝对不可以打开」。现在洞里真的有东西了，村里的孩子又钻了进去。山洞后面就是八卦阵，阵后面是不问世事的绝尘子。"
msgstr "The Village Head says the chained cave north of Bluestone Village \"must never be opened\". Now there really is something in it, and the village children have crawled in again. Behind the cave lies the Eight Trigram Formation, and behind the formation, Juechenzi, who stays out of the world's affairs."

msgid "你离了绝尘派。青石村的事，到此为止。"
msgstr "You have left the Dustless School. Bluestone Village's business ends here."

msgid "青石村北边那个山洞，门上拴着手臂粗的铁链，村里人说闹鬼。拴门的是村长：去他家（广场南边那间石屋）问他「山洞」。"
msgstr "The cave north of Bluestone Village has a chain as thick as an arm on its door, and the villagers say it is haunted. The one who chained the door is the Village Head: go to his house (the stone house south of the square) and ask him about \"Cave\"."

msgid "村长说：那道门是他拴的。妇人家的阿牛背着妹妹，又钻进去了。"
msgstr "The Village Head says: he chained that door. The woman's boy, Aniu, has crawled in again with his little sister on his back."

msgid "等主线第五章：寒於宝衣的事了了，鬼卒才出来"
msgstr "Wait for Chapter 5 of the main story: only once the business of Hanyu's Robe is over do the Ghost Soldiers come out"

msgid "开了洞口那道拴着铁链的木门进洞，打发洞里的鬼卒，找到阿牛，问他「回家」，领他回村北路口找他娘。"
msgstr "Open the chained wooden door at the Cave Mouth and go in, deal with the Ghost Soldiers inside, find Aniu, ask him about \"Go Home\", and lead him back to his mother at the junction north of the village."

msgid "你把阿牛和小翠领出了山洞，交给了他们的娘。"
msgstr "You led Aniu and Xiaocui out of the cave and gave them back to their mother."

msgid "洞口那个鬼卒"
msgstr "The Ghost Soldier at the Cave Mouth"

msgid "洞底那个鬼卒"
msgstr "The Ghost Soldier at the bottom of the cave"

msgid "孩子回家了。去告诉村长，再问他「山洞」。"
msgstr "The children are home. Go and tell the Village Head, then ask him about \"Cave\" again."

msgid "村长这回把那句话说完了：「国之将亡，必有妖孽。」"
msgstr "This time the Village Head finishes the saying: \"When a country is about to fall, monsters are sure to rise.\""

msgid "洞的北口就是去八卦阵的荒山路。回石室大厅，问绝尘子「青石村」。"
msgstr "The cave's north mouth opens onto the wild mountain road to the Eight Trigram Formation. Go back to the Stone Chamber Hall and ask Juechenzi about \"Bluestone Village\"."

msgid "绝尘子说，洞里有东西，他知道。阵守得住石室，他就不管——绝尘派不问世事。"
msgstr "Juechenzi says there is something in the cave, and he knows it. As long as the formation holds the Stone Chamber, he leaves it be: the Dustless School stays out of the world's affairs."

msgid "把青石村的孩子从闹鬼的山洞里领了出来"
msgstr "Led Bluestone Village's children out of the haunted cave"

msgid "不是绝尘派的弟子：进大厅要再走一回八卦阵（从东边的石室进去）"
msgstr "Not a Dustless School disciple: to enter the hall you must walk the Eight Trigram Formation again (in through the Stone Chamber to the east)"

msgid "大厅里还有一个人：绝尘子的首徒了尘。他一直在看你。问他「山洞」。"
msgstr "There is someone else in the hall: Juechenzi's First Disciple, Liaochen. He has been watching you all along. Ask him about \"Cave\"."

msgid "了尘说：师父知道洞里有东西。阵守得住石室，他就不管。"
msgstr "Liaochen says: Shifu knows there is something in the cave. As long as the formation holds the Stone Chamber, he leaves it be."

msgid "了尘说起师父的时候，一直看着佛像下的绝尘子，话没有说完。问他「师父」。"
msgstr "When Liaochen speaks of his shifu, he keeps looking at Juechenzi beneath the Buddha statue, and does not finish what he is saying. Ask him about \"Shifu\"."

msgid "了尘说起了三十年前的事。"
msgstr "Liaochen speaks of what happened thirty years ago."

msgid "正月十七 · 虹台大会"
msgstr "The Seventeenth · Rainbow Terrace Assembly"

msgid "正月十七，九派在水烟阁外的虹台推选武林盟主。九派各一票，过半才换人；那天山下会出事，你只管得了一件。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, the nine schools choose the Alliance Leader of the wulin on the Rainbow Terrace outside Waterfog Pavilion. Each of the nine schools has one vote, and only more than half changes the leader; that day there will be trouble at the foot of the mountain, and you can deal with only one thing."

msgid "已表态"
msgstr "Declared"

msgid "投颜违"
msgstr "Vote for Yan Wei"

msgid "过半（五派）才换盟主"
msgstr "More than half (five schools) to change the Alliance Leader"

msgid "听你的"
msgstr "With you"

msgid "五派听你的，你才站得出来"
msgstr "You can stand only if five schools go with you"

msgid "那天山下：神教的杀手会截山烟寺的轿子（不管，山烟寺不来）"
msgstr "That day below: the Order's assassins will stop Mountain Mist Temple's sedan chair (leave it, and Mountain Mist Temple does not come)"

msgid "那天山下：逆灵宫的余孽会烧葬剑亭（不管，茅山不来）"
msgstr "That day below: what is left of the Black Palace will burn the Sword Tomb Pavilion (leave it, and Mount Mao does not come)"

msgid "那天山下：颜违的人会堵封山的路（不管，封山不来）"
msgstr "That day below: Yan Wei's people will block Empty Mountain's road (leave it, and Empty Mountain does not come)"

msgid "那天山下：兵部会「请」骆云舟喝茶（不管，步玄派不来）"
msgstr "That day below: the Ministry of War will \"invite\" Luo Yunzhou to tea (leave it, and the Mystic Step School does not come)"

msgid "那天山下：照现在的样子，太平"
msgstr "That day below: as things stand, all is quiet"

msgid "封山剑派：还没表态"
msgstr "Empty Mountain School: undecided"

msgid "封山剑派：等盟主回来"
msgstr "Empty Mountain School: waits for the Alliance Leader to return"

msgid "封山剑派：投颜违——颜违许了北宗一个座"
msgstr "Empty Mountain School: votes for Yan Wei; he promised the North Branch a seat"

msgid "封山剑派：听你的"
msgstr "Empty Mountain School: goes with you"

msgid "天邪派：还没表态"
msgstr "Wayward School: undecided"

msgid "天邪派：投颜违"
msgstr "Wayward School: votes for Yan Wei"

msgid "天邪派：等盟主回来"
msgstr "Wayward School: waits for the Alliance Leader to return"

msgid "天邪派：听你的"
msgstr "Wayward School: goes with you"

msgid "振远镖局：还没表态"
msgstr "Far-Road Escorts: undecided"

msgid "振远镖局：投颜违——旧案到此为止"
msgstr "Far-Road Escorts: votes for Yan Wei; the old case ends here"

msgid "振远镖局：投旧盟主——旧案查到底"
msgstr "Far-Road Escorts: votes for the old Alliance Leader; the old case traced to the end"

msgid "振远镖局：听你的"
msgstr "Far-Road Escorts: goes with you"

msgid "茅山派：还没表态"
msgstr "Mount Mao School: undecided"

msgid "茅山派：投颜违——主剿"
msgstr "Mount Mao School: votes for Yan Wei; for crushing them"

msgid "茅山派：投旧盟主——北麓的人交茅山看着"
msgstr "Mount Mao School: votes for the old Alliance Leader; the North Foot's people kept under Mount Mao's watch"

msgid "茅山派：听你的"
msgstr "Mount Mao School: goes with you"

msgid "晚月庄：还没表态"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor: undecided"

msgid "晚月庄：投旧盟主——封地照旧"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor: votes for the old Alliance Leader; the fief stays as it is"

msgid "晚月庄：投颜违——逐神教"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor: votes for Yan Wei; drive out the Order"

msgid "晚月庄：听你的"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor: goes with you"

msgid "山烟寺：还没表态"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple: undecided"

msgid "山烟寺：投颜违——逐神教"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple: votes for Yan Wei; drive out the Order"

msgid "山烟寺：投旧盟主——容神教"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple: votes for the old Alliance Leader; tolerate the Order"

msgid "山烟寺：投旧盟主——收了西来的经"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple: votes for the old Alliance Leader; it accepted the sutra from the west"

msgid "山烟寺：听你的"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple: goes with you"

msgid "步玄派：还没表态"
msgstr "Mystic Step School: undecided"

msgid "步玄派：投颜违——京城随朝廷"
msgstr "Mystic Step School: votes for Yan Wei; the Capital follows the court"

msgid "步玄派：投旧盟主——兵部的旧案查到底"
msgstr "Mystic Step School: votes for the old Alliance Leader; trace the Ministry of War's old case to the end"

msgid "步玄派：听你的"
msgstr "Mystic Step School: goes with you"

msgid "花紫会：还没表态"
msgstr "Beggars' Guild: undecided"

msgid "花紫会：投颜违——吃官饭"
msgstr "Beggars' Guild: votes for Yan Wei; to eat official rice"

msgid "花紫会：投旧盟主——怕官"
msgstr "Beggars' Guild: votes for the old Alliance Leader; afraid of officials"

msgid "花紫会：听你的"
msgstr "Beggars' Guild: goes with you"

msgid "绝尘派：还没表态"
msgstr "Dustless School: undecided"

msgid "绝尘派：不问世事，不来"
msgstr "Dustless School: stays out of the world's affairs, and does not come"

msgid "绝尘派：下山来，投旧盟主"
msgstr "Dustless School: comes down the mountain, and votes for the old Alliance Leader"

msgid "正月十七，九派在水烟阁外的虹台推选武林盟主：颜违、旧盟主（卫沧澜回来了就是他，没回来就是那把空椅子），或者你。湖底的事了了，才会开会。各派的票跟着你做过的事走——封山、天邪看那两条线走到哪一边。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, the nine schools choose the Alliance Leader of the wulin on the Rainbow Terrace outside Waterfog Pavilion: Yan Wei, the old Alliance Leader (Wei Canglan if he has come back; if not, that empty chair), or you. Only once the business at the bottom of the lake is over will the assembly meet. Each school's vote follows what you have done: Empty Mountain and the Wayward School go whichever way those two lines ended."

msgid "湖底的事了了。正月十七的虹台大会，照旧要开。"
msgstr "The business at the bottom of the lake is over. The Rainbow Terrace Assembly on the seventeenth of the first month will still be held."

msgid "回雪亭镇的饮风客栈。店小二那里有一封给你的帖子。"
msgstr "Go back to Drinkwind Inn in Snow Pavilion. The waiter has a card for you."

msgid "饮风客栈的店小二递来一张请柬：正月十七，水烟阁外虹台。"
msgstr "The waiter at Drinkwind Inn hands you an invitation: the seventeenth of the first month, the Rainbow Terrace outside Waterfog Pavilion."

msgid "上虹台之前，九派可以各走一趟：问各派掌门「虹台」，听他们这一票投谁、为什么；话里留了余地的，还可以请他改一改（先确认）。封山剑派——雪亭镇淳风武馆的柳淳风（跟了北宗的，问内院的柳绘心）；天邪派——水烟阁正厅的潘军禅；振远镖局——绮云镇的陈剑秋；茅山派——灵心观的林忌；晚月庄——庄主蓝止萍；山烟寺——住持玄智和尚；步玄派——乔阴县城的骆云舟；花紫会——乔阴的陆得财；绝尘派——青石村的绝尘子。虹台在水烟阁葬剑亭往南的石阶上；人到了，在擎天柱前「入席」（先确认：入了席就不能再游说、改票）。"
msgstr "Before you go up to the Rainbow Terrace, you can call on each of the nine schools: ask each school's master about \"Rainbow Terrace\" and hear whom their vote goes to, and why; if they leave some room in what they say, you can ask them to change it (you will be asked first). Empty Mountain School: Liu Chunfeng at Pure Wind Hall in Snow Pavilion (if you went with the North Branch, Liu Huixin in the inner courtyard); Wayward School: Pan Junchan in Waterfog Main Hall; Far-Road Escorts: Chen Jianqiu in Cloudweave Town; Mount Mao School: Lin Ji at Clear Heart Abbey; Latemoon Manor: the Mistress, Lan Zhiping; Mountain Mist Temple: the abbot, Monk Xuanzhi; Mystic Step School: Luo Yunzhou in Tallshade; Beggars' Guild: Lu Decai in Tallshade; Dustless School: Juechenzi of Bluestone Village. The Rainbow Terrace is up the stone steps south of Waterfog Pavilion's Sword Tomb Pavilion; once there, \"Take a seat\" before the sky pillar (you will be asked first: once seated, you can no longer canvass or change votes)."

msgid "正月十七，你上了虹台。"
msgstr "On the seventeenth of the first month, you went up to the Rainbow Terrace."

msgid "正月十七，虹台上：山下出了事，你只来得及管一件——没管的那一派上不了虹台。九派到齐了唱票，过半（五票）才换盟主。灭了侮天鬼、又有五派听你的，你也可以站出来。人走开了，回擎天柱前「入席」接着开。"
msgstr "The seventeenth of the first month, on the Rainbow Terrace: there is trouble at the foot of the mountain, and you have time to deal with only one thing; the school you leave cannot come up to the Rainbow Terrace. Once the nine schools are all here the votes are called, and only more than half (five votes) changes the Alliance Leader. If you have destroyed the Heaven-Defier and five schools go with you, you can stand yourself. If you walk away, go back to the sky pillar and \"Take a seat\" to carry on."

msgid "虹台上散了会。"
msgstr "The assembly on the Rainbow Terrace is over."

msgid "宝衣"
msgstr "Hanyu's Robe"

msgid "逆灵宫的道士戴的东西。问它做什么。"
msgstr "Something the Black Palace's Daoists wear. Why do you ask about it?"

msgid "倒戈"
msgstr "Defect"

msgid "前夜倒戈：把逆灵宫下湖的时辰和路交给茅山。\n终章冰龙厅里，商玦身边只剩两个道士；点将时多一拨茅山的人，林忌在湖畔。\n可黑冠从此没用，逆灵宫的门不再为你开。\n就这样吗？"
msgstr "Defect on the eve: give Mount Mao the hour and the route the Black Palace takes down into the lake.\nIn the finale, in the ice dragons' hall, Shang Jue will have only two Daoists left beside him; when you call your people there will be one more band, Mount Mao's, with Lin Ji on the lakeshore.\nBut the black cap will be useless from then on, and the Black Palace's doors will no longer open for you.\nSettle it this way?"

msgid "时辰和路，茅山记下了。"
msgstr "The hour and the route: Mount Mao has them written down."

msgid "你已经定了潜伏。冠戴好。"
msgstr "You have chosen to stay hidden. Keep the cap on."

msgid "他们迟早认出你。时辰和路，茅山自己去找。"
msgstr "Sooner or later they will see through you. Mount Mao will find the hour and the route on its own."

msgid "湖上的事已经开始了，来不及了。"
msgstr "It has already begun on the lake. It is too late."

msgid "听你一字一句说完，把那条路在香案上用指头画了一遍。"
msgstr " hears you out word by word, then traces the route on the incense table with one finger."

msgid "好。那一夜，北麓下湖的路上有茅山的人。"
msgstr "Good. That night, Mount Mao will have people on the North Foot road down to the lake."

msgid "冠可以摘了。他们很快就会知道，是谁说出去的。"
msgstr "You can take the cap off now. Soon they will know who told."

msgid "什么时辰？宫里还没到那一步。"
msgstr "What hour? The Palace has not come to that yet."

msgid "潜伏"
msgstr "Stay Hidden"

msgid "潜伏到底：什么也不交出去，戴着黑冠跟商玦的队伍下湖。\n冰龙厅里第一剑是你的，商玦带着重伤开打——可他的四个道士会先扑你，也没有人会多来帮你（没人知道你的消息）。\n宫里已经满了三条疑点的，走不了这条路。\n就这样吗？"
msgstr "Stay hidden to the end: hand over nothing, and go down into the lake with Shang Jue's company, wearing the black cap.\nIn the ice dragons' hall the first blow is yours, and Shang Jue starts the fight badly wounded. But his four Daoists will go for you first, and no one extra will come to help you (no one has heard from you).\nIf the Palace already holds three suspicions against you, this path is closed.\nSettle it this way?"

msgid "你已经定了。冠戴好——那一剑，只有你递得出去。"
msgstr "You have chosen. Keep the cap on. That blow, only you can strike."

msgid "时辰和路已经交出去了。那顶冠，没用了。"
msgstr "The hour and the route are already handed over. That cap is useless now."

msgid "宫里已经起了疑心。这条路，走不得了。"
msgstr "The Palace already suspects you. This path is closed now."

msgid "……好。"
msgstr "...Very well."

msgid "冠戴好，什么也别说。他回头的时候，站在他身后的是你。"
msgstr "Keep the cap on and say nothing. When he turns around, the one standing behind him will be you."

msgid "潜伏到哪一天？宫里还没到那一步。"
msgstr "Stay hidden until when? The Palace has not come to that yet."

msgid "名册"
msgstr "Register"

msgid "名册就留在铁匣里？\n宫里什么也不会少，他们看不出你；你身上也就少了一样物证。\n就这样吗？"
msgstr "Leave the register in the iron box?\nThe Palace will miss nothing, and they will not see through you; but you will have one less piece of evidence on you.\nSettle it this way?"

msgid "名册在程不平那里。他会一个一个对出来——那是他的本事。"
msgstr "The register is with Cheng Buping. He will match them one by one. That is what he is good at."

msgid "京师的事定了。名册交给乔阴的程不平——他对得出那些押印，给那些人家里一个说法。"
msgstr "The Capital business is settled. Take the register to Cheng Buping in Tallshade. He can match those stamps and give those families an answer."

msgid "兵部的印在上面。带它上京：朝上揭发兵部的时候，它是一样物证。"
msgstr "The Ministry of War's seal is on it. Take it to the Capital: when you denounce the Ministry at court, it counts as evidence."

msgid "名册留在匣里了。宫里什么也没少——他们看不出你。"
msgstr "The register stayed in the box. The Palace is missing nothing, so they cannot see through you."

msgid "……也好。宫里什么也不会少，他们就看不出你。"
msgstr "...Just as well. The Palace will miss nothing, so they will not see through you."

msgid "那上面的押印，你说给我听，我记下了。"
msgstr "The stamps on it, you told them to me. I have them written down."

msgid "什么名册？"
msgstr "What register?"

msgid "虹台上的事定了。茅山照旧降妖伏魔。"
msgstr "The Rainbow Terrace business is settled. Mount Mao goes on subduing demons as before."

msgid "茅山这一票，你说了算。"
msgstr "Mount Mao's vote is yours to decide."

msgid "茅山这一票投旧盟主。北麓剩下的人交茅山看着——是师弟的主意。茅山认得他们的字了。"
msgstr "Mount Mao votes for the old Alliance Leader. Those left on the North Foot are in Mount Mao's keeping. That was my junior brother's idea. Mount Mao can read their script now."

msgid "这一票的事，去藏经楼问他。"
msgstr "About the vote, ask him at the Scripture Library."

msgid "茅山主剿。这一票原该投颜违——他和朝廷走得近，北麓那座道观，他剿得动。"
msgstr "Mount Mao is for suppression. This vote ought to go to Yan Wei. He is close to the court, and that abbey on the North Foot is one he can crush."

msgid "金色的那只眼睛看着你。"
msgstr " looks at you with that golden eye."

msgid "可那函书是你带回山的，也是你看着烧的。茅山欠你一回：这一票，你要，就是你的。"
msgstr "But it was you who brought that book back to the mountain, and you who watched it burn. Mount Mao owes you one: this vote, if you want it, is yours."

msgid "可禁书是你交到我手里烧的。茅山欠你一回：这一票，你要，就是你的。"
msgstr "But it was you who put the forbidden book in my hands to burn. Mount Mao owes you one: this vote, if you want it, is yours."

msgid "可那张名单是你从账房抄出来的，名单上的人茅山找回了好几个。茅山欠你一回：这一票，你要，就是你的。"
msgstr "But it was you who copied that list out of the Counting Room, and Mount Mao has brought back several of the people on it. Mount Mao owes you one: this vote, if you want it, is yours."

msgid "茅山主剿。颜违和朝廷走得近，北麓那座道观，他剿得动。"
msgstr "Mount Mao is for suppression. Yan Wei is close to the court, and that abbey on the North Foot is one he can crush."

msgid "这一票投他。"
msgstr "This vote goes to him."

msgid "请林忌把茅山这一票交给你：正月十七虹台上，茅山听你的——你要站出来，这一票就是你的；不站，就由你说投谁。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Ask Lin Ji to hand Mount Mao's vote to you: on the seventeenth, on the Rainbow Terrace, Mount Mao goes the way you say. Stand up yourself and the vote is yours; if not, you decide who gets it.\nSay it that way?"

msgid "说过了。茅山听你的。"
msgstr "It has been said. Mount Mao goes with you."

msgid "这一票，去藏经楼问我师弟。"
msgstr "About this vote, ask my junior brother at the Scripture Library."

msgid "好。茅山听你的。"
msgstr "Good. Mount Mao goes with you."

msgid "剿"
msgstr "Suppress"

msgid "把北麓那座道观交给官府去剿：林忌把门户和上山的路写给程不平，官兵上山，宫里剩下的人一个也走不了。\n正月十七虹台上，这件事就算了了，不能再改。\n就这样吗？"
msgstr "Hand the abbey on the North Foot to the authorities to suppress: Lin Ji writes out its gates and the way up the mountain for Cheng Buping, soldiers go up, and not one of those left in the Palace gets away.\nOn the seventeenth, on the Rainbow Terrace, the matter will be closed, and it cannot be changed.\nSettle it this way?"

msgid "官兵已经上了北麓。宫里剩下的人，一个也走不了。"
msgstr "The soldiers are already up on the North Foot. Not one of those left in the Palace will get away."

msgid "人已经下山了，茅山看着。"
msgstr "They have come down the mountain. Mount Mao is watching over them."

msgid "师弟已经上了北麓。他去劝，就让他劝完。"
msgstr "My junior brother has already gone up the North Foot. He went to persuade them; let him finish."

msgid "你已经答应去劝他们下山了。回北麓去，同宫里当家的说「下山」。"
msgstr "You have already agreed to persuade them to come down. Go back to the North Foot and say \"Come Down\" to whoever runs the Palace now."

msgid "提笔写了一封信，把北麓那座道观的门户、上山的绳路一一画在信后。"
msgstr " takes up a brush and writes a letter, then draws the gates of the abbey on the North Foot and the rope paths up the mountain, one by one, on the back of it."

msgid "这封信今晚就到乔阴，程不平会转给兵部。"
msgstr "This letter will reach Tallshade tonight. Cheng Buping will pass it on to the Ministry of War."

msgid "官兵上了北麓，宫里剩下的人一个也走不了。正月十七虹台上，这件事就算了了。"
msgstr "The soldiers will go up the North Foot, and not one of those left in the Palace will get away. On the seventeenth, on the Rainbow Terrace, the matter will be closed."

msgid "书烧了，他们的字茅山不认得了——那就不必认得。"
msgstr "The book is burned, and Mount Mao can no longer read their script. Then there is no need to."

msgid "这封信今晚就到乔阴，程不平会转给兵部。官兵上了北麓，宫里剩下的人一个也走不了。"
msgstr "This letter will reach Tallshade tonight, and Cheng Buping will pass it on to the Ministry of War. The soldiers will go up the North Foot, and not one of those left in the Palace will get away."

msgid "剿什么？"
msgstr "Suppress what?"

msgid "招安"
msgstr "Amnesty"

msgid "劝宫里剩下的人下山，交茅山看管：回北麓，同宫里当家的（玄冥子还在，就是他；不在了，就是领诵的道士）说「下山」——你一直戴着他们的冠，这一说，他们就知道你是谁的人了。\n正月十七虹台上，这件事就算了了，不能再改。\n就这样吗？"
msgstr "Persuade those left in the Palace to come down the mountain into Mount Mao's keeping: go back to the North Foot and say \"Come Down\" to whoever runs the Palace now (Xuanmingzi, if he is still there; if not, the lead chanter). You have worn their cap all along; once you say it, they will know whose side you are on.\nOn the seventeenth, on the Rainbow Terrace, the matter will be closed, and it cannot be changed.\nSettle it this way?"

msgid "官兵已经上了北麓。来不及了。"
msgstr "The soldiers are already up on the North Foot. It is too late."

msgid "想了很久，点了点头。"
msgstr " thinks for a long time, then nods."

msgid "好。宫里剩下的，大半是被拐上山的孩子，烧了一辈子香，不知道自己烧的是什么。"
msgstr "Good. Most of those left in the Palace are children carried off up the mountain. They have burned incense all their lives without knowing what they burn it for."

msgid "回北麓去，同宫里当家的说「下山」——玄冥子还在，就是他；不在了，就是那个领诵的。你戴着他们的冠，他们会听你说完。"
msgstr "Go back to the North Foot and say \"Come Down\" to whoever runs the Palace now: Xuanmingzi, if he is still there; if not, the lead chanter. You wear their cap. They will hear you out."

msgid "人带下山，茅山看着。"
msgstr "Bring them down the mountain, and Mount Mao will watch over them."

msgid "招安什么？"
msgstr "Amnesty for what?"

msgid "接过那函书，在香案前坐下，一页一页翻过去。"
msgstr " takes the book, sits down before the incense table, and turns through it page by page."

msgid "翻到后半本，手停住了。"
msgstr " reaches the back half of the book, and his hand stops."

msgid "……这是逆灵宫的字。"
msgstr "...This is the Black Palace's script."

msgid "他抄了两年。烧掉的东西，他一页一页抄回来。"
msgstr "He copied for two years. What they burned, he copied back, page by page."

msgid "合上书，望着殿门外，很久没有说话。"
msgstr " closes the book and gazes out through the hall doors, silent for a long time."

msgid "书留在我这里。他会来的。"
msgstr "The book stays with me. He will come."

msgid "把逆灵天书的残卷交给林忌。\n他会当面烧了它，禁书不会再回逆灵宫——可宫里少了一卷书，那是一条疑点。玄冥子那边，这卷书就还不回去了。\n交给他吗？"
msgstr "Give the fragment of the Black Scripture to Lin Ji.\nHe will burn it before your eyes, and the forbidden book will never go back to the Black Palace. But the Palace will be one book short, and that is a suspicion. And you will have no book to return to Xuanmingzi.\nGive it to him?"

msgid "接过残卷，翻也没翻，凑到香案的烛火上。"
msgstr " takes the fragment and, without so much as leafing through it, holds it to the candle flame on the incense table."

msgid "黑皮的书页卷起来，火苗是青的。"
msgstr " watches the black pages curl. The flame burns green."

msgid "这东西不该回那里去。"
msgstr "This thing must not go back there."

msgid "这东西在你手里，在我手里，都干净不了。先想好你要做什么。"
msgstr "In your hands or in mine, this thing will never be clean. Decide first what you mean to do."

msgid "接过名单，一行一行看下去，半晌没有说话。"
msgstr " takes the list and reads it line by line, saying nothing for a long while."

msgid "三十六口。……茅山会去截下一车。"
msgstr "Thirty-six people. ...Mount Mao will stop the next cart."

msgid "你回去。他们看不出来，你就还是他们的人。"
msgstr "Go back. As long as they cannot tell, you are still one of them."

msgid "贫道是出家人，不便收女徒，得罪了。"
msgstr "This poor Daoist has left the world and cannot take female disciples. Forgive me."

msgid "嗯... 想入我茅山派？也好...."
msgstr "Hmm... You want to join our Mount Mao School? Very well..."

msgid "慢著，一个一个来。"
msgstr "Slow down. One at a time."

msgid "这是一位来自阴界的守护神，专门担任护法之责。\n"
msgstr "This is a guardian god from the realm of the dead, charged with standing guard.\n"

msgid "一道蓝光从地底升起，蓝光中出现一个手执钢叉、面目狰狞的鬼卒。"
msgstr "A blue light rises from beneath the ground, and in it appears a Ghost Soldier with a steel trident and a hideous face."

msgid "$N的身形发出幽暗的蓝光，沈入地下不见了。"
msgstr "$N {N:glow|glows} a dim blue and {N:sink|sinks} into the ground, gone."

msgid "这是一只由修道人的杂念绮思所化的观想虫，会缠住人的魂魄。\n"
msgstr "This is a Mind Bug, born of a cultivator's stray and idle thoughts. It entangles a person's soul.\n"

msgid "後脚"
msgstr "hind paw"

msgid "你杀死了你的观想虫，并且从中悟到了一些咒术的道理。"
msgstr "You kill your Mind Bug, and from it you grasp something of the secrets of spellcraft."

msgid "你的观想虫被人杀死了！"
msgstr "Someone has killed your Mind Bug!"

msgid "你觉得一阵天旋地转...."
msgstr "The world spins around you..."

msgid "这是一只由修道人的杂念绮思所化的观想兽，会缠住人的魂魄。\n"
msgstr "This is a Mind Beast, born of a cultivator's stray and idle thoughts. It entangles a person's soul.\n"

msgid "你杀死了你的观想兽，并且从中悟到了一些咒术的道理。"
msgstr "You kill your Mind Beast, and from it you grasp something of the secrets of spellcraft."

msgid "你的观想兽被人杀死了！"
msgstr "Someone has killed your Mind Beast!"

msgid "这是一具被人用符咒控制的僵尸，从它苍白的脸上看不出任何喜怒哀乐。\n"
msgstr "This is a zombie, a corpse controlled by talismans. Its pale face shows no joy, anger, sorrow or delight.\n"

msgid "{name}的僵尸"
msgstr "Zombie of {name}"

msgid "$N告诉你：我...需...要...你...的...力...量..."
msgstr "$N {N:tell|tells} you, \"I... need... your... strength...\""

msgid "$N缓缓地倒了下来，化为一滩血水。"
msgstr "$N slowly {N:collapse|collapses} and {N:dissolve|dissolves} into a pool of blood."

msgid "晚月庄主"
msgstr "Mistress of Latemoon Manor"

msgid "蓝止萍是一个十分出色的美女，她弹的一手琵琶更是闻名千里，许多\n王侯子弟，富商豪客都为她天下无双的美貌与琴艺倾倒。\n"
msgstr "Lan Zhiping is a woman of rare beauty, and her pipa playing is famous for a thousand li around. Many young princes and lords, rich merchants and big spenders have fallen for her peerless looks and music.\n"

msgid "庄主"
msgstr "Mistress"

msgid "蓝止萍嫣然一笑，一个转身迳自舞了起来，对眼前这场恶斗似乎全不放在心上。\n"
msgstr "Lan Zhiping smiles sweetly, turns and starts to dance by herself, as if the fierce fight before her meant nothing at all.\n"

msgid "蓝止萍脚步轻移，翩翩地转了几个圈，回眸一笑。\n"
msgstr "Lan Zhiping steps lightly, twirls gracefully a few times, and glances back with a smile.\n"

msgid "蓝止萍用手扶了扶自己的发簪，像是怕被对手碰歪似地。\n"
msgstr "Lan Zhiping touches her hairpin, as if afraid her opponent might knock it crooked.\n"

msgid "蓝止萍笑嘻嘻地拾起地上一片从魔鞭翩珑上落下的花瓣。\n"
msgstr "Lan Zhiping, giggling, picks up a petal that has fallen from Pianlong, the Demon Whip.\n"

msgid "你觉得脸上似乎沾上了什麽东西，伸手一摸却什麽也没有。"
msgstr "You feel as if something has stuck to your face, but when you reach up, there is nothing there."

msgid "男人都不是好东西，滚开！"
msgstr "Men are all rotten. Get out!"

msgid "很好，只要你对本庄主忠心耿耿，好处是少不了的。"
msgstr "Very good. Stay loyal to me, and you will not go without your rewards."

msgid "$N暧昧地抚摸著$n的脸，说道：特别是像你这样的女孩 ...."
msgstr "$N {N:stroke|strokes} $n's face suggestively. \"Especially a girl like you...\""

msgid "看了你一眼，没有笑。"
msgstr " looks at you and does not smile."

msgid "从内书房那边走过来，走得很慢。"
msgstr " comes over from the Inner Study, walking slowly."

msgid "跟在她娘后面，面巾还蒙着，剑在鞘里，手离剑柄远远的。"
msgstr " follows behind her mother, face still veiled, sword in its sheath, her hand kept well away from the hilt."

msgid "那一夜，前厅死了两个丫头，内厅死了昭蓉。晚月庄有晚月庄的规矩：血债，要有人抵。"
msgstr "That night, two maids died in the front hall, and Zhaorong died in the inner hall. Latemoon Manor has its rules: a blood debt must be paid by someone."

msgid "神教的杀手，在我庄里住了三年。内书房、宝衣，她都看过了。晚月庄的规矩：神教的人进了这道门，不能就这么出去。"
msgstr "An assassin of the Order lived in my manor for three years. The Inner Study, the robe: she has seen them all. The manor's rule is that when someone of the Order comes through this door, they do not simply walk out again."

msgid "令牌你还给了神教——她是神教的人，你也认了。"
msgstr "You gave the token back to the Order. She is the Order's, and you have accepted that too."

msgid "把手里那块黑木令牌攥得更紧了。"
msgstr " grips the black-wood token in her hand even tighter."

msgid "人交给我。晚月庄不杀不还手的人——可她不能再待在庄里。怎么处置，是庄里的事。"
msgstr "Hand her over to me. Latemoon Manor does not kill those who do not fight back, but she cannot stay in the manor any longer. How she is dealt with is the manor's business."

msgid "她是我女儿。"
msgstr "She is my daughter."

msgid "依庄规，问我「庄规」；要带她回来，去内书房问老人家「女儿」。"
msgstr "To go by the manor's rules, ask me about \"Manor Rules\". To bring her back, go to the Inner Study and ask the old lady about \"Daughter\"."

msgid "转身往内书房走，她女儿跟在后面。"
msgstr " turns and walks toward the Inner Study, her daughter behind her."

msgid "庄规"
msgstr "Manor Rules"

msgid "依庄规：人交给蓝止萍处置——台上不杀，可她不能再待在庄里。\n晚月庄这一票投颜违（逐神教）（已经入了虹台的席的，这一票不再跟着变）；老妇从此不再开口。本庄弟子晋阶执事。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "By the manor's rules: Lan Zhiping deals with her. She is not killed, but she can no longer stay in the manor.\nLatemoon Manor's vote goes to Yan Wei (who will drive out the Order) (if you already have a seat at the Rainbow Terrace, this vote will not change again); the old woman never speaks again. A disciple of the manor is promoted to Deacon.\nSay it that way?"

msgid "你不是晚月庄的人了。这是晚月庄的事。"
msgstr "You are no longer of Latemoon Manor. This is Latemoon Manor's affair."

msgid "庄规是庄规。"
msgstr "The manor's rules are the manor's rules."

msgid "你替她选了。晚月庄记着。"
msgstr "You chose for her. Latemoon Manor will remember."

msgid "抬了抬手，叫两个弟子去内书房。"
msgstr " raises a hand and sends two disciples to the Inner Study."

msgid "带走。"
msgstr "Take her away."

msgid "庄规是我立的，也是为这样的夜立的。往后庄门关得早一些——神教的人，不会再进来第二回。"
msgstr "I made the manor's rules, and I made them for nights like this. From now on the manor gate closes earlier. No one from the Order will get in a second time."

msgid "庄规？问这个做什么。"
msgstr "The manor's rules? Why do you ask?"

msgid "护法"
msgstr "Protector"

msgid "做晚月庄的护法：不是弟子，不授辈分，本门的舞和指法不传；头衔换成「晚月庄护法」（本门再晋阶时换回本门的）。晚月庄的事，从此算你一份。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Become a Protector of Latemoon Manor: not a disciple, no generation, and the manor's dances and finger arts are not taught to you. Your title becomes \"Latemoon Protector\" (if you are promoted in your own school again, it changes back to your school's). From now on, Latemoon Manor's affairs count you in.\nSay it that way?"

msgid "你是晚月庄的护法。庄里的事，问我「庄里的事」。"
msgstr "You are a Protector of Latemoon Manor. For the manor's affairs, ask me about \"Manor Affairs\"."

msgid "你是本庄的弟子。护法，是给庄外的人做的。"
msgstr "You are a disciple of this manor. Protector is for those outside it."

msgid "晚月庄护法"
msgstr "Latemoon Protector"

msgid "上上下下打量了你一眼。"
msgstr " looks you up and down."

msgid "男人都不是好东西。"
msgstr "Men are all rotten."

msgid "可你接住了瑷伦三鞭——她几百年没对男人抽过鞭子。宝衣的事，你也看着它有了着落。"
msgstr "But you took Ailun's three lashes, and she has not whipped a man in centuries. And you saw the matter of the robe settled."

msgid "晚月庄不收男徒，这规矩不改。护法不是弟子：没有辈分，本庄的舞和指法也不传你。庄里的事，算你一份。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor takes no male disciples, and that rule does not change. A Protector is not a disciple: no generation, and the manor's dances and finger arts are not taught to you. But the manor's affairs count you in."

msgid "你离了晚月庄的门。护法，也就不必了。"
msgstr "You have left Latemoon Manor's gate. Then there is no need for a Protector either."

msgid "看了你一会儿。"
msgstr " watches you for a while."

msgid "你接住了瑷伦三鞭，宝衣的事也看着它有了着落。"
msgstr "You took Ailun's three lashes, and you saw the matter of the robe settled."

msgid "你不在晚月庄门下，晚月庄不抢人。做个护法吧：没有辈分，本庄的功夫不传；庄里的事，算你一份。"
msgstr "You are not of Latemoon Manor, and Latemoon Manor does not take other schools' people. Be a Protector: no generation, and the manor's arts are not taught to you; but the manor's affairs count you in."

msgid "护法？接得住瑷伦三鞭再说。"
msgstr "Protector? Take Ailun's three lashes first, then we will talk."

msgid "庄里的事"
msgstr "Manor Affairs"

msgid "你已经不是晚月庄的人了。庄里的事，不劳你。"
msgstr "You are no longer of Latemoon Manor. The manor's affairs need not trouble you."

msgid "内书房那位老人家……让她静一静。"
msgstr "The old lady in the Inner Study... let her have some quiet."

msgid "她在内书房。庄规你替她破了一回——晚月庄记着。"
msgstr "She is in the Inner Study. You broke the manor's rules for her once. Latemoon Manor will remember."

msgid "那个蒙面的女人，你见过了，令牌也有了着落。下回进大厅，我有话说。"
msgstr "The veiled woman: you have seen her, and the token's fate is settled. Next time you come into the main hall, I will have something to say."

msgid "她的令牌在你手上？给谁，你自己定。"
msgstr "Her token is in your hands? Who gets it is for you to decide."

msgid "老人家的心事……去问问那个蒙面的女人。"
msgstr "The old lady's worry... go and ask that veiled woman."

msgid "沧海龙吟跳回来了。宝衣……挡在了该挡的地方。"
msgstr "Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea has been danced again. The robe... shielded what it had to shield."

msgid "内书房那位老人家，有一桩心事压了很多年——你去看看她。"
msgstr "The old lady in the Inner Study has carried a worry for many years. Go and see her."

msgid "宝衣回来了，池边的凤凰又亮了。晚月庄记你这一回。"
msgstr "The robe is back, and the phoenix by the pool shines again. Latemoon Manor will remember you for this."

msgid "宝衣你带着。晚月庄自己守。"
msgstr "Keep the robe with you. Latemoon Manor will guard itself."

msgid "脸色淡了下来。"
msgstr "'s face cools."

msgid "沧海龙吟跳回来了，宝衣却在西厢那位手里。"
msgstr "Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea has been danced again, but the robe is in the hands of the one in the West Wing."

msgid "你去跟她要——她不会给。可晚月庄要让她知道，这件衣是谁的。"
msgstr "Go and ask her for it. She will not give it. But Latemoon Manor wants her to know whose robe it is."

msgid "沧海龙吟跳回来了，区冥记得你。宝衣在瑷伦身上，庄里一切如旧。"
msgstr "Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea has been danced again, and Ouming remembers you. The robe is with Ailun, and all is as it was in the manor."

msgid "沧海龙吟跳回来了，区冥记得你。宝衣还在你身上——东厢的瑷伦，等你一句话。"
msgstr "Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea has been danced again, and Ouming remembers you. The robe is still with you. Ailun in the East Wing is waiting for a word from you."

msgid "沧海龙吟跳回来了，区冥记得你。宝衣的事，等它有了着落，你去东厢见瑷伦。"
msgstr "Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea has been danced again, and Ouming remembers you. Once the matter of the robe is settled, go to the East Wing and see Ailun."

msgid "步子在后院书房那幅湘绣图上，曲子在舞曲谱里。两样凑齐，去二楼佛堂，在区冥的神位前跳。"
msgstr "The steps are on the Xiang embroidery in the Back Yard Study, and the music is in the dance score. With both, go to the Shrine Room upstairs and dance before Ouming's spirit tablet."

msgid "我们晚月庄是『以舞会友，以神换技』。可庄里失传过一支舞，叫沧海龙吟——寒谷龙舞里的一支，几十年没人跳过了。"
msgstr "Here at Latemoon Manor we 'make friends through dance, and trade Spirit for skill.' But one dance was lost to the manor, called Dragon's Song on the Blue Sea. It is one of the Cold Valley Dragon Dances, and no one has danced it for decades."

msgid "步子绣在后院书房那幅湘绣舞曲图上，昭仪天天对着它看；曲子在舞曲谱里，欣芳知道谱放在哪。"
msgstr "The steps are on the embroidered dance chart in the Back Yard Study; Zhaoyi looks at it every day. The music is in the dance score, and Xinfang knows where the score is kept."

msgid "两样凑齐了，到二楼佛堂，在区冥的神位前跳一回。跳成了，你就是晚月庄的大弟子。"
msgstr "With both, go to the Shrine Room upstairs and dance it once before Ouming's spirit tablet. If you succeed, you are Latemoon Manor's senior disciple."

msgid "两样凑齐了，到二楼佛堂，在区冥的神位前跳一回。你是护法，跳成了也没有辈分——可区冥会记得你。"
msgstr "With both, go to the Shrine Room upstairs and dance it once before Ouming's spirit tablet. You are a Protector, so success brings you no generation. But Ouming will remember you."

msgid "两样凑齐了，到二楼佛堂，在区冥的神位前跳一回。那是玄天玉女的步子，男人跳不成——请芳绫或者欣芳替你跳。"
msgstr "With both, go to the Shrine Room upstairs and dance it once before Ouming's spirit tablet. Those are the steps of the Jade Maiden of Dark Heaven, and no man can dance them. Ask Fangling or Xinfang to dance for you."

msgid "晚月庄的事，不劳外人。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor's affairs need not trouble outsiders."

msgid "虹台上的事，晚月庄记着。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor will remember what happened on the Rainbow Terrace."

msgid "晚月庄这一票投颜违。神教的人进过庄门，往后庄门要关紧——颜违说了，他当了盟主就逐神教。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor votes for Yan Wei. People of the Order have come through the manor gate, and from now on the gate must be shut tight. Yan Wei has said that if he becomes Alliance Leader, he will drive out the Order."

msgid "这条庄规，是你陪我守下来的。这一票你要，就给你。"
msgstr "This manor rule, you kept it with me. If you want this vote, it is yours."

msgid "晚月庄这一票投旧盟主。庄里收着一个神教的人——官府管不到这里，颜违也别想管到这里来。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor votes for the old Alliance Leader. The manor is sheltering someone of the Order. The authorities cannot reach in here, and Yan Wei need not think he can either."

msgid "庄规你替她破了一回。……这一票你要，我也给。"
msgstr "You broke the manor's rules for her once. ...If you want this vote, I will give it to you too."

msgid "晚月庄这一票，你说了算。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor's vote is yours to decide."

msgid "晚月庄这一票投颜违。说定了。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor votes for Yan Wei. That is settled."

msgid "寒於宝衣烧了。晚月庄守了几百年的东西，挡完那一口就没了。"
msgstr "Hanyu's Robe has burned. What Latemoon Manor guarded for centuries took that one blow and was gone."

msgid "晚月庄这一票原该投旧盟主：封地照旧，官府管不到这里。可神教的人还在庄外转——颜违说了，他当了盟主就逐神教。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor's vote ought to go to the old Alliance Leader: the fief stays as it is, and the authorities cannot reach in here. But people of the Order are still prowling outside the manor. Yan Wei has said that if he becomes Alliance Leader, he will drive out the Order."

msgid "你一句话，晚月庄这一票就投他。"
msgstr "One word from you, and Latemoon Manor's vote goes to him."

msgid "宝衣在西厢那位手里。神教迟早要拿它做文章。"
msgstr "The robe is in the hands of the one in the West Wing. Sooner or later the Order will make use of it."

msgid "晚月庄这一票原该投旧盟主……颜违说了，他当了盟主就逐神教。你一句话，这一票就投他。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor's vote ought to go to the old Alliance Leader... Yan Wei has said that if he becomes Alliance Leader, he will drive out the Order. One word from you, and the vote goes to him."

msgid "宝衣在瑷伦手里——出过一回庄，是你送回来的。"
msgstr "The robe is in Ailun's hands. It left the manor once, and you brought it back."

msgid "晚月庄这一票原该投旧盟主。你要，就给你。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor's vote ought to go to the old Alliance Leader. If you want it, it is yours."

msgid "宝衣还在瑷伦手里。是你替晚月庄守住的。"
msgstr "The robe is still in Ailun's hands. You kept it for Latemoon Manor."

msgid "晚月庄这一票投旧盟主。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor votes for the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "封地照旧，官府管不到晚月庄——这就够了。"
msgstr "The fief stays as it is, and the authorities cannot reach Latemoon Manor. That is enough."

msgid "改投"
msgstr "Change the Vote"

msgid "请蓝止萍改投颜违：他当了盟主就逐神教，晚月庄这一票不投旧盟主了。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Ask Lan Zhiping to switch her vote to Yan Wei: if he becomes Alliance Leader he will drive out the Order, so Latemoon Manor's vote will no longer go to the old Alliance Leader.\nSay it that way?"

msgid "晚月庄这一票跟着庄规走，不改。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor's vote follows the manor's rules. It does not change."

msgid "晚月庄这一票，那天她留下来就定了，不改。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor's vote was settled the day she stayed. It does not change."

msgid "说过了。晚月庄投颜违。"
msgstr "It has been said. Latemoon Manor votes for Yan Wei."

msgid "好。晚月庄投颜违。"
msgstr "Good. Latemoon Manor votes for Yan Wei."

msgid "请蓝止萍把晚月庄这一票交给你：正月十七虹台上，晚月庄听你的——你要站出来，这一票就是你的；不站，就由你说投谁。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Ask Lan Zhiping to hand Latemoon Manor's vote to you: on the seventeenth, on the Rainbow Terrace, Latemoon Manor goes the way you say. Stand up yourself and the vote is yours; if not, you decide who gets it.\nSay it that way?"

msgid "说过了。晚月庄听你的。"
msgstr "It has been said. Latemoon Manor goes with you."

msgid "微微一笑。"
msgstr " smiles faintly."

msgid "好。晚月庄听你的。"
msgstr "Good. Latemoon Manor goes with you."

msgid "住持"
msgstr "Abbot"

msgid "阿弥陀佛！出家人戒逞强恶斗！老衲不敢违反清规。"
msgstr "Amitabha! Those who have left the world must not show off their strength or fight in hatred! This old monk dares not break the rules."

msgid "施主既然身负绝艺，老衲佩服便是，也不必较量了。"
msgstr "Since you, Benefactor, carry such peerless skill, this old monk simply admires you. There is no need to compete."

msgid "剃度"
msgstr "Tonsure"

msgid "阿弥陀佛！你我同是出家人，何故跟老衲开这等玩笑？\n"
msgstr "Amitabha! We are both of the cloth. Why make such a joke with this old monk?\n"

msgid "阿弥陀佛！女施主，这里是寺庙，请你到尼庵去剃度吧。\n"
msgstr "Amitabha! Lady Benefactor, this is a monastery. Please go to a nunnery to be tonsured.\n"

msgid "阿弥陀佛！善哉！善哉！施主若真心皈依我佛，请跪下受戒。\n"
msgstr "Amitabha! Excellent! Excellent! Benefactor, if you truly wish to take refuge in the Buddha, please kneel and receive the precepts.\n"

msgid "出家"
msgstr "Become a Monk"

msgid "看了你一眼，双手合十。"
msgstr " looks at you and presses his palms together."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。施主身上有神教的血腥气。流云轩的事，不劳施主。"
msgstr "Amitabha. Benefactor, you carry the Order's stench of blood. The business of Drifting Cloud Lodge is no concern of yours."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。流云轩的事，不劳施主了。"
msgstr "Amitabha. The business of Drifting Cloud Lodge need not trouble you any longer, Benefactor."

msgid "那樵夫的命，保住了。"
msgstr "The woodcutter's life has been saved."

msgid "低头看着自己的手。"
msgstr " looks down at his own hands."

msgid "那只手……老衲尽力了。"
msgstr "That hand... this old monk did all he could."

msgid "那樵夫好了。药僧都跟老衲说了。"
msgstr "The woodcutter is well again. The Medicine Monk told this old monk everything."

msgid "寺规，施主破了。阿弥陀佛。"
msgstr "Benefactor, you broke the temple rules. Amitabha."

msgid "药喂下去了，寒气还在。"
msgstr "The medicine has gone down, but the cold is still there."

msgid "老衲的药是凉性的底子……赶不出这股寒。阿弥陀佛。"
msgstr "This old monk's medicines are cooling at their root... they cannot drive out this cold. Amitabha."

msgid "药煎好了，拿去喂他。"
msgstr "The medicine is brewed. Take it and give it to him."

msgid "附子在药圃，麝香找雪亭的杨掌柜，鬼臼在乔阴树王坟边。三味齐了交给药僧煎。"
msgstr "Aconite is in the Herb Garden; for musk, see Shopkeeper Yang in Snow Pavilion; mayapple root grows by the Tree King's Tomb in Tallshade. Once you have all three, give them to the Medicine Monk to brew."

msgid "乔阴来的樵夫，在树王坟边被鬼卒抓了一把。那不是寻常的伤——是阴间的寒气，钻进骨头里了。"
msgstr "A woodcutter from Tallshade was clawed by a Ghost Soldier beside the Tree King's Tomb. That is no ordinary wound. It is the cold of the Underworld, and it has bored into his bones."

msgid "捻了很久的念珠。"
msgstr " tells his prayer beads for a long time."

msgid "老衲开个方子：附子回阳，麝香开窍，再要一味鬼臼，以毒攻毒。"
msgstr "This old monk will write a prescription: aconite to restore the yang, musk to open the orifices, and one more, mayapple root, to fight poison with poison."

msgid "附子，寺东的药圃里有；麝香，雪亭镇桑邻药铺的杨掌柜那里有——他年轻时跟老衲学过医；鬼臼，就长在乔阴树王坟边的石缝里。那里有鬼卒，小心。"
msgstr "Aconite grows in the Herb Garden east of the temple. Musk, Shopkeeper Yang of the Mulberry Herb Shop in Snow Pavilion has; he studied medicine under this old monk when he was young. Mayapple root grows in the rock crevices beside the Tree King's Tomb in Tallshade. There are Ghost Soldiers there. Be careful."

msgid "三味齐了，交给流云轩的药僧煎。"
msgstr "Once you have all three, give them to the Medicine Monk at Drifting Cloud Lodge to brew."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。药僧说，施主肯帮流云轩的忙。帮手不必落发。"
msgstr "Amitabha. The Medicine Monk says you are willing to help Drifting Cloud Lodge, Benefactor. A helper need not take the tonsure."

msgid "流云轩里躺着一个乔阴来的樵夫。阿弥陀佛。"
msgstr "A woodcutter from Tallshade lies in Drifting Cloud Lodge. Amitabha."

msgid "流云轩是老衲为人看病、存放药草的地方。"
msgstr "Drifting Cloud Lodge is where this old monk treats the sick and keeps his herbs."

msgid "头陀"
msgstr "Ascetic"

msgid "他在流云轩。"
msgstr "He is in Drifting Cloud Lodge."

msgid "捻了一颗念珠。"
msgstr " turns one prayer bead."

msgid "老衲该早十年开那道门。"
msgstr "This old monk should have opened that door ten years ago."

msgid "他回番坊去了。金门外空了。……阿弥陀佛。"
msgstr "He has gone back to the Foreign Quarter. Outside the Golden Gate is empty now. ...Amitabha."

msgid "他在殿上。老衲看见了。"
msgstr "He is in the hall. This old monk saw him."

msgid "他回金门外站着去了。十年了，他一直站在那里。"
msgstr "He has gone back to stand outside the Golden Gate. Ten years, and he has stood there all along."

msgid "他进了流云轩。……老衲知道。"
msgstr "He went into Drifting Cloud Lodge. ...This old monk knows."

msgid "拨了两颗念珠，没有再说。"
msgstr " moves two prayer beads along and says no more."

msgid "他不是本寺的人。"
msgstr "He is not of this temple."

msgid "十年前他到山门前来，老衲没让他进门。他也不走，就站在金门外，一站十年。"
msgstr "Ten years ago he came to the temple gate, and this old monk did not let him in. He did not leave either. He stood outside the Golden Gate, and he has stood there ten years."

msgid "本寺的规矩：外人不进流云轩。"
msgstr "The rule of this temple: no outsider enters Drifting Cloud Lodge."

msgid "寺规"
msgstr "Temple Rules"

msgid "照寺规：不让独眼头陀进流云轩。\n玄智守着老葛治：命保得住，一只手保不住。头陀转身回金门外，从此不理你。\n这是山烟寺这条线上的一个选择，选了不能改。要照寺规吗？"
msgstr "By the temple rules: the One-Eyed Ascetic does not enter Drifting Cloud Lodge.\nXuanzhi tends Old Ge himself: his life can be saved, but not one of his hands. The ascetic turns back to stand outside the Golden Gate, and from then on ignores you.\nThis is a choice on the Mountain Mist Temple line. Once made it cannot be changed. Go by the temple rules?"

msgid "阿弥陀佛。"
msgstr "Amitabha."

msgid "寺规就是寺规。"
msgstr "Temple rules are temple rules."

msgid "寺规，施主已经破了。"
msgstr "Benefactor, you have already broken the temple rules."

msgid "看了看你身后。"
msgstr " glances behind you."

msgid "人是施主领来的，老衲不拦。"
msgstr "You brought him here, Benefactor. This old monk will not stop him."

msgid "双手合十。"
msgstr " presses his palms together."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。外人不进流云轩——这是本寺三百年的规矩，老衲不能在老衲手里破了它。"
msgstr "Amitabha. No outsider enters Drifting Cloud Lodge. That has been this temple's rule for three hundred years, and this old monk cannot let it be broken in his hands."

msgid "那樵夫，老衲自己守。"
msgstr "This old monk will tend the woodcutter himself."

msgid "玄智方丈进了流云轩，三天三夜没有出来。\n"
msgstr "Abbot Xuanzhi went into Drifting Cloud Lodge and did not come out for three days and three nights.\n"

msgid "命，老衲保住了。那只手……寒气在骨头里待得太久，老衲保不住。"
msgstr "His life, this old monk has saved. That hand... the cold sat in the bone too long. This old monk could not save it."

msgid "寺规？本寺的规矩，问知客僧。"
msgstr "Temple rules? For the rules of this temple, ask the Guest Monk."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。正月十七，过去了。"
msgstr "Amitabha. The seventeenth has passed."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。山烟寺这一票，在施主手里。"
msgstr "Amitabha. Mountain Mist Temple's vote is in your hands, Benefactor."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。山烟寺收了西来的经。容得下西来的经，也容得下别人——这一票投旧盟主。"
msgstr "Amitabha. Mountain Mist Temple has accepted the sutra from the west. A temple that can make room for a sutra from the west can make room for others too. This vote goes to the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "朝流云轩的方向看了一眼。"
msgstr " glances toward Drifting Cloud Lodge."

msgid "那片叶子是施主带回来的。这一票，施主要，就是施主的。"
msgstr "It was you who brought that leaf back, Benefactor. This vote, if you want it, is yours."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。本寺一脉，守清规。神教的杀手横行，颜施主说要逐了他们——山烟寺这一票投颜施主。"
msgstr "Amitabha. This temple keeps to its own line and keeps the pure rules. The Order's assassins run rampant, and Benefactor Yan says he will drive them out. Mountain Mist Temple's vote goes to Benefactor Yan."

msgid "拨了两颗念珠。"
msgstr " moves two prayer beads along."

msgid "可那片叶子，是施主陪着送回去的。这一票，施主要，就是施主的。"
msgstr "But that leaf, Benefactor, it was you who went with it when it was sent back. This vote, if you want it, is yours."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。山烟寺这一票，投旧盟主。"
msgstr "Amitabha. Mountain Mist Temple's vote goes to the old Alliance Leader."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。神教的杀手杀生无数，山烟寺原想借颜施主之手，逐了他们。"
msgstr "Amitabha. The Order's assassins have taken countless lives. Mountain Mist Temple had hoped to drive them out by Benefactor Yan's hand."

msgid "施主说，一代教主收回了教主令，正月十七神教不来搅局……施主若担保此事，山烟寺这一票便投旧盟主。容他们。"
msgstr "Benefactor, you say the Order's former Leader has taken back the Order Leader's token, and the Order will not make trouble on the seventeenth... If you vouch for this, Mountain Mist Temple's vote goes to the old Alliance Leader. We will let them be."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。神教的杀手在江湖上横行，颜施主说要逐了他们。"
msgstr "Amitabha. The Order's assassins run rampant in the jianghu, and Benefactor Yan says he will drive them out."

msgid "山烟寺这一票，投颜施主。"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple's vote goes to Benefactor Yan."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。湖上的事未了，虹台的事且放一放。"
msgstr "Amitabha. The business on the lake is not finished. Let the Rainbow Terrace wait."

msgid "请玄智和尚改投旧盟主：神教容得下，山烟寺这一票不投颜违了。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Ask Monk Xuanzhi to switch his vote to the old Alliance Leader: the Order can be tolerated, so Mountain Mist Temple's vote will no longer go to Yan Wei.\nSay it that way?"

msgid "阿弥陀佛。经收下了，山烟寺本来就投旧盟主。"
msgstr "Amitabha. The sutra has been accepted, and Mountain Mist Temple votes for the old Alliance Leader as it is."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。本寺一脉，说过了。这一票随守寺走。"
msgstr "Amitabha. This temple keeps to its own line; that has been said. The vote goes the way of keeping the temple."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。山烟寺投旧盟主，说过了。"
msgstr "Amitabha. Mountain Mist Temple votes for the old Alliance Leader. That has been said."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。便依施主。"
msgstr "Amitabha. As you wish, Benefactor."

msgid "收经"
msgstr "Accept the Sutra"

msgid "收经：独眼头陀受戒入寺，婆萝蜜多心经收进山烟寺。\n流云轩从此治得了鬼卒的寒；头陀在流云轩教婆萝蜜多心经，谁都能学（只这一门）。\n容得下西来的经，也容得下别人：正月十七虹台上，山烟寺这一票投旧盟主（已经入了虹台的席的，这一票不再跟着变）。\n守寺那条路就没了。要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Accept the sutra: the One-Eyed Ascetic takes the precepts and joins the temple, and the Heart Sutra comes into Mountain Mist Temple.\nFrom then on, Drifting Cloud Lodge can cure the Ghost Soldiers' cold; the ascetic teaches the Heart Sutra at Drifting Cloud Lodge, and anyone may learn it (that art only).\nA temple that can make room for a sutra from the west can make room for others too: on the seventeenth, on the Rainbow Terrace, Mountain Mist Temple's vote goes to the old Alliance Leader (if you already have a seat at the Rainbow Terrace, this vote will not change again).\nThe path of keeping the temple will be closed. Say it that way?"

msgid "阿弥陀佛。这是本寺的事。"
msgstr "Amitabha. This is the temple's own affair."

msgid "经在流云轩，他也在。"
msgstr "The sutra is in Drifting Cloud Lodge, and so is he."

msgid "本寺一脉。说过了。"
msgstr "This temple keeps to its own line. That has been said."

msgid "看着香案上那片贝叶，捻了很久的念珠。"
msgstr " gazes at the palm-leaf page on the incense table, telling his prayer beads for a long time."

msgid "玄尘要是知道……他等这一天，等了三十年。"
msgstr "If Xuanchen knew... he has waited thirty years for this day."

msgid "收。"
msgstr "We accept it."

msgid "独眼头陀在佛前跪了下来。玄智伸出手掌，在他头顶轻轻地摩挲了几下。\n"
msgstr "The One-Eyed Ascetic kneels before the Buddha. Xuanzhi reaches out and gently strokes the top of his head a few times.\n"

msgid "你是头陀，发就留着。法名，你的师父给过了，老衲不改。从今天起，你是山烟寺的人。"
msgstr "You are an ascetic; keep your hair. Your Dharma name, your shifu has already given you, and this old monk will not change it. From today, you are of Mountain Mist Temple."

msgid "流云轩，你去。阴间的寒，往后山烟寺赶得出去了。"
msgstr "Go to Drifting Cloud Lodge. From now on, Mountain Mist Temple can drive out the cold of the Underworld."

msgid "头陀捧起那片贝叶，朝玄智拜了三拜，大步往流云轩去了。\n"
msgstr "The ascetic raises the palm-leaf page, bows three times to Xuanzhi, and strides off toward Drifting Cloud Lodge.\n"

msgid "收什么经？"
msgstr "Accept what sutra?"

msgid "守寺"
msgstr "Keep the Temple"

msgid "守寺：本寺一脉，经交还龙若法王，头陀把它带回番坊，金门外从此空了。\n玄智肯把莲华心法（连同它的根基大乘佛法）教给不是本寺的人。流云轩照旧治不了鬼卒的寒。\n山烟寺守清规：正月十七虹台上，这一票投颜违（已经入了虹台的席的，这一票不再跟着变）。\n收经那条路就没了。要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Keep the temple: this temple keeps to its own line. The sutra goes back to Dharma King Longruo, the ascetic carries it back to the Foreign Quarter, and the spot outside the Golden Gate is empty from then on.\nXuanzhi will teach the Lotus Heart Method (along with its foundation, Mahayana Dharma) to those not of this temple. Drifting Cloud Lodge still cannot cure the Ghost Soldiers' cold.\nMountain Mist Temple keeps the pure rules: on the seventeenth, on the Rainbow Terrace, its vote goes to Yan Wei (if you already have a seat at the Rainbow Terrace, this vote will not change again).\nThe path of accepting the sutra will be closed. Say it that way?"

msgid "经已经收了。"
msgstr "The sutra has already been accepted."

msgid "把香案上那片贝叶拾起来，双手递还给头陀。"
msgstr " picks up the palm-leaf page from the incense table and hands it back to the ascetic with both hands."

msgid "本寺一脉，三十年前不收，今天也不收。经，请带回给你的师父。替老衲谢他。"
msgstr "This temple keeps to its own line. It did not accept it thirty years ago, and it does not accept it today. Please take the sutra back to your shifu, and thank him for this old monk."

msgid "独眼头陀接过贝叶，看了玄智很久，一句话也没说，转身出了大殿。金门外那块他站了十年的地方，空了。\n"
msgstr "The One-Eyed Ascetic takes the palm-leaf page, looks at Xuanzhi for a long time, and leaves the hall without a word. Outside the Golden Gate, the spot where he stood for ten years is empty.\n"

msgid "看着殿门，忽然问你："
msgstr " looks at the hall doors and suddenly asks you:"

msgid "玄尘师弟……他还好？"
msgstr "Brother Xuanchen... is he well?"

msgid "你说他在青石村后山，守着一个阵。玄智点了点头，没有再问。\n"
msgstr "You tell him Xuanchen is on the hill behind Bluestone Village, guarding a formation. Xuanzhi nods and asks no more.\n"

msgid "寺规就是寺规。外人不进流云轩，外来的经，也不进。……阿弥陀佛。"
msgstr "Temple rules are temple rules. No outsider enters Drifting Cloud Lodge, and no outside sutra either. ...Amitabha."

msgid "守什么？"
msgstr "Keep what?"

msgid "请玄智和尚把山烟寺这一票交给你：正月十七虹台上，山烟寺听你的——你要站出来，这一票就是你的；不站，就由你说投谁。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Ask Monk Xuanzhi to hand Mountain Mist Temple's vote to you: on the seventeenth, on the Rainbow Terrace, Mountain Mist Temple goes the way you say. Stand up yourself and the vote is yours; if not, you decide who gets it.\nSay it that way?"

msgid "阿弥陀佛。说过了，山烟寺听施主的。"
msgstr "Amitabha. It has been said: Mountain Mist Temple goes with you, Benefactor."

msgid "阿弥陀佛。山烟寺听施主的。"
msgstr "Amitabha. Mountain Mist Temple goes with you, Benefactor."

msgid "$N双手合十，恭恭敬敬地跪了下来。"
msgstr "$N {N:press|presses} {N:his} palms together and {N:kneel|kneels} down respectfully."

msgid "$n伸出手掌，在$N头顶轻轻地摩挲了几下，将$N的头发尽数剃去。"
msgstr "$n {n:reach|reaches} out and gently {n:stroke|strokes} the top of $N's head a few times, then {n:shave|shaves} off all of {N:his} hair."

msgid "从今以後你的法名叫做{name}。"
msgstr "From now on, your Dharma name is {name}."

msgid "阿弥陀佛，女施主不要跟老纳开玩笑。"
msgstr "Amitabha. Lady Benefactor, do not joke with this old monk."

msgid "阿弥陀佛，施主愿入佛门，请先到小寺剃度出家。"
msgstr "Amitabha. If you wish to enter the Buddha's gate, Benefactor, first be tonsured and leave the world at this humble temple."

msgid "阿弥陀佛，善哉！善哉！"
msgstr "Amitabha. Excellent! Excellent!"

msgid "陆得财是一个浑身脏兮兮的老丐，一副无精打采要死不活的样子，可是\n武林中人人都识得他身上打著二十三个结的皮酒囊，这不但是「花紫会\n」龙头的信物，更是名镇漠南的「黑水伏蛟」独门兵器，只不过陆得财\n行踪诡密，据说各处随时都有七、八的他的替身在四处活动，所以你也\n很难确定眼前这个陆得财到底是不是真的。\n"
msgstr "Lu Decai is a filthy old beggar who looks listless and half dead. Yet everyone in the wulin knows the leather wineskin he carries, tied with twenty-three knots. It is not only the token of the Beggars' Guild's Dragon Head but also the signature weapon of the \"Blackwater Dragon,\" famed south of the desert. Lu Decai moves in secret, though, and they say seven or eight stand-ins of his are out and about at any time, so you can hardly be sure whether this Lu Decai is the real one.\n"

msgid "龙头"
msgstr "Dragon Head"

msgid "我们花紫会只收化子，$RESPECT您还是回去享福吧。\n"
msgstr "Our Beggars' Guild only takes beggars. Go on home and enjoy your comforts, $RESPECT.\n"

msgid "契我收过了。这一叠，烧了干净。"
msgstr "I've got the indentures already. Burn this stack and be done with it."

msgid "契我收下。八户人家的事，叫花子记着；别的，不劳你。"
msgstr "I'll take the indentures. The beggars will remember those eight families; the rest isn't your concern."

msgid "接过那叠契，一张一张数过去，数到第八张，揣进了怀里。"
msgstr " takes the stack of indentures, counts them one by one, and at the eighth tucks them into his robe."

msgid "八户。明天她们就回家。"
msgstr "Eight households. Tomorrow they go home."

msgid "龙头要见见你这个人。"
msgstr "The Dragon Head wants a look at you."

msgid "把腰里的皮酒囊解下来，往你面前一递。"
msgstr " unties the leather wineskin from his belt and holds it out to you."

msgid "数数。——二十二个。我是龙头的一个替身。"
msgstr "Count. Twenty-two. I'm one of the Dragon Head's stand-ins."

msgid "真龙头的酒囊二十三个结，替身的都少几个。龙头在哪，替身一个传一个，一个只认得下一个：雪亭镇广场上那个结最少，从他问起，问「龙头」。"
msgstr "The true Dragon Head's wineskin has twenty-three knots; the stand-ins' all have a few less. Where the Dragon Head is gets passed from one stand-in to the next, and each one only knows the next. The one on the Snow Pavilion square has the fewest knots. Start with him: ask about \"Dragon Head\"."

msgid "陆得财守在福林大街上，手里摩挲着腰间的皮酒囊。\n"
msgstr "Lu Decai keeps watch on Fulin Street, rubbing the leather wineskin at his waist.\n"

msgid "叫花子跟官府的人，没有正事说。"
msgstr "A beggar's got nothing proper to say to the officials' people."

msgid "你不是花紫会这边的人了。叫花子的事，不劳你。"
msgstr "You're not on the Beggars' Guild's side anymore. Beggars' business isn't your concern."

msgid "槐阳那八户的契，烧了。龙头那边，你从雪亭镇广场那个问起。"
msgstr "The indentures of those eight families in Huaiyang are burned. As for the Dragon Head, start with the one on the Snow Pavilion square."

msgid "契到手了？递给我。"
msgstr "Got the indentures? Hand them over."

msgid "福林酒楼二楼，那个姓胡的管事。契揣在他怀里——手要轻。"
msgstr "Second floor of Fulin Tavern, the steward named Hu. The indentures are tucked in his robe. Light hands, now."

msgid "抠了抠脚，眯着眼看你。"
msgstr " scratches his foot and squints at you."

msgid "县衙那面鼓，是你敲的？叫花子都听见了。"
msgstr "That drum at the yamen, you're the one who beat it? Every beggar heard."

msgid "兵部有个收民夫的管事，姓胡，这几天住在福林酒楼二楼。他怀里揣着一叠卖身契——槐阳城外八户人家，男人去关北挖河没回来，就拿女人孩子抵。"
msgstr "There's a steward from the Ministry of War who signs up laborers, name of Hu, staying on the second floor of Fulin Tavern these days. He's got a stack of indentures on him: eight households outside Huaiyang. The men went Beyond the Pass to dig a canal and never came back, so their women and children were taken to make it good."

msgid "你去把契摸回来。不会偷？我教你两手（请教「偷窃」）。"
msgstr "Go lift the indentures off him. Can't steal? I'll teach you a trick or two (Learn \"Steal\")."

msgid "失了手，他喊着扑上来，巡捕也记你一笔——乔阴的巡捕认得贼。"
msgstr "Fumble it, and he'll come at you yelling, and the constables will mark you down too. Tallshade's constables know a thief when they see one."

msgid "差事？……县衙门口那面鼓都没敲过的人，接不了叫花子的差事。"
msgstr "A job? ...Somebody who's never even beaten the drum at the yamen gate can't take on a beggar's job."

msgid "认这些年管事的人：真龙头把皮酒囊系到陆得财腰上，回京师的墙根接着看庾家。\n乔阴照旧——巷子里没有官差，巡捕照旧抓贼。正月十七，花紫会这一票投旧盟主（已经入了虹台的席的，票照入席时的算。）。\n要认他吗？"
msgstr "Accept the one who has run things these years: the true Dragon Head ties his leather wineskin onto Lu Decai's belt and goes back to the foot of the Capital's walls to keep watching the Yu family.\nTallshade stays as it is: no officials in the alleys, and the constables go on catching thieves. On the seventeenth, the Beggars' Guild's vote goes to the old Alliance Leader (if you already have a seat at the Rainbow Terrace, the vote counts as it stood when you took it).\nAccept him?"

msgid "二十三个结了。……叫花子的巷子，还是叫花子的。"
msgstr "Twenty-three knots now. ...The beggars' alleys still belong to the beggars."

msgid "你认了京城墙根下那个。……叫花子不认两个龙头，乔阴的事就不劳你了。"
msgstr "You accepted the one at the foot of the Capital's walls. ...Beggars don't follow two Dragon Heads, so Tallshade's business isn't your concern."

msgid "把皮酒囊捧在手上，没有动。"
msgstr " holds the leather wineskin in both hands and doesn't move."

msgid "真龙头看了他半天，把自己腰里那只二十三个结的皮酒囊解下来，系到了陆得财腰上。\n"
msgstr "The true Dragon Head looks at him a long while, then unties the twenty-three-knot leather wineskin from his own belt and ties it onto Lu Decai's.\n"

msgid "「京师的墙根，还得有人看着庾家。」他说完，头也不回地往南门去了。\n"
msgstr "\"Someone still has to watch the Yu family from under the Capital's walls.\" With that, he heads for the south gate without looking back.\n"

msgid "……二十年，我没让一个官差进过乔阴的巷子。往后也不让。"
msgstr "...Twenty years, and I never let one official into Tallshade's alleys. I won't from here on, either."

msgid "我是龙头的一个替身。雪亭镇广场上那个结最少，从他问起。"
msgstr "I'm one of the Dragon Head's stand-ins. The one on the Snow Pavilion square has the fewest knots. Start with him."

msgid "嘿嘿，你说呢？"
msgstr "Heh heh. What do you think?"

msgid "嘿，正月十七？叫花子早忘了。"
msgstr "Heh, the seventeenth? A beggar forgot long ago."

msgid "花紫会这一票，正月十七照你说的。"
msgstr "The Beggars' Guild's vote on the seventeenth goes the way you said."

msgid "拍了拍腰里那只二十三个结的皮酒囊。"
msgstr " pats the twenty-three-knot leather wineskin at his waist."

msgid "花紫会这一票？投旧盟主。叫花子最怕官——颜违当了盟主，官差就要进乔阴的巷子了。"
msgstr "The Beggars' Guild's vote? The old Alliance Leader. A beggar fears officials most. If Yan Wei becomes Alliance Leader, officials will come into Tallshade's alleys."

msgid "这只酒囊是你替我认下的。你要这一票，开口就是。"
msgstr "This wineskin, you're the one who got it settled on me. Want this vote? Just say so."

msgid "嘿嘿一笑，抠了抠脚。"
msgstr " chuckles and scratches his foot."

msgid "花紫会这一票？投旧盟主呗。"
msgstr "The Beggars' Guild's vote? The old Alliance Leader, what else."

msgid "颜违跟朝廷走得近，他当了盟主，官差就要进乔阴的巷子了——叫花子最怕官。"
msgstr "Yan Wei's close to the court. If he becomes Alliance Leader, officials will come into Tallshade's alleys. A beggar fears officials most."

msgid "虹台？叫花子不管那么远的事。"
msgstr "The Rainbow Terrace? Beggars don't bother with things that far off."

msgid "请陆得财把花紫会这一票交给你：正月十七虹台上，花紫会听你的——你要站出来，这一票就是你的；不站，就由你说投谁。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Ask Lu Decai to hand the Beggars' Guild's vote to you: on the seventeenth, on the Rainbow Terrace, the Beggars' Guild goes the way you say. Stand up yourself and the vote is yours; if not, you decide who gets it.\nSay it that way?"

msgid "说过了。花紫会听你的。"
msgstr "It's been said. The Beggars' Guild goes with you."

msgid "好。花紫会这一票，你说了算。"
msgstr "Good. The Beggars' Guild's vote is yours to decide."

msgid "骆云舟生於京城有名的武林世家，他的本名是骆建炎，但是因为生性喜爱\n四处游荡，遂自号「云舟」，四处游山玩水，结交豪杰异人。数年前继承\n其父骆易而成为步玄派的新任掌门，但是喜爱飘泊的个性仍然不改，令门\n中耆宿头痛不已。\n"
msgstr "Luo Yunzhou was born into a famous martial family of the Capital. His given name is Luo Jianyan, but he loves to roam, so he took the name \"Yunzhou\" and wanders the mountains and rivers, befriending heroes and remarkable people. Some years ago he succeeded his father Luo Yi as the new Master of the Mystic Step School, but his drifting ways have not changed, to the great vexation of the school's elders.\n"

msgid "你还是先走一趟东边的桃林吧。\n"
msgstr "First take a walk through the Peach Grove to the east.\n"

msgid "很好，$RESPECT多加努力，他日必定有成。\n"
msgstr "Very good. Work hard, $RESPECT, and one day you will surely succeed.\n"

msgid "风泉"
msgstr "Windspring"

msgid "步玄的事，不劳你了。"
msgstr "Mystic Step's affairs need not trouble you anymore."

msgid "剑灵认过你了。步玄的人，见过它就算。"
msgstr "The sword spirit has acknowledged you. For Mystic Step, having seen it is enough."

msgid "夜里来曼雩台，问我「问剑」。"
msgstr "Come to the Rain Dance Terrace at night and ask me about \"Sword Trial\"."

msgid "把腰上那柄湛蓝的剑解下来，横在膝上。"
msgstr " unties the deep blue sword from his waist and lays it across his knees."

msgid "风泉之剑。步玄历代掌门传下来的，剑里住着一个剑灵。"
msgstr "The Windspring Sword. Handed down by Mystic Step's Masters, generation after generation. A sword spirit lives inside it."

msgid "照规矩，它只在拿剑的人死了才出来——可步玄还有一条老规矩：见过剑灵的人，才算步玄的人。"
msgstr "By the rules, it only comes out when the one holding the sword dies. But Mystic Step has an older rule too: only those who have seen the sword spirit count as Mystic Step's own."

msgid "夜里来曼雩台，问我「问剑」。我把剑插在石台上，它就出来了。"
msgstr "Come to the Rain Dance Terrace at night and ask me about \"Sword Trial\". I will plant the sword in the stone platform, and it will come out."

msgid "上下打量了你一眼，笑了。"
msgstr " looks you up and down and smiles."

msgid "桃林里那几张字条，你一张一张走出来了？——走得出桃林的，就是桃林的客。"
msgstr "Those notes in the Peach Grove, you followed them one by one and walked out? Whoever can walk out of the Peach Grove is the Peach Grove's guest."

msgid "名帖的事办得怎样了？……有空的话，桃林走一趟，咱们说话。"
msgstr "How did it go with the calling card? ...When you have time, take a walk to the Peach Grove and we will talk."

msgid "风泉之剑，步玄历代掌门的信物。剑里的事——先走一趟东边的桃林再说。"
msgstr "The Windspring Sword, the token of Mystic Step's Masters through the generations. What is inside the sword... first take a walk through the Peach Grove to the east, then we will see."

msgid "问剑"
msgstr "Sword Trial"

msgid "剑灵在「剑神如意」之前收了剑——它认你了。"
msgstr "The sword spirit put its sword away before \"Sword God, as I will\". It has acknowledged you."

msgid "步玄认你。"
msgstr "Mystic Step acknowledges you."

msgid "伸手把石缝里的剑拔了出来，又插了回去。"
msgstr " reaches out, pulls the sword from the rock crevice, and plants it back again."

msgid "四句念完了，剑灵回了剑。今夜到此——明晚天黑了再来。"
msgstr "All four lines are chanted, and the sword spirit has gone back into the sword. That is all for tonight. Come again after dark tomorrow."

msgid "剑在石台上。天黑以后它就出来——跟它切磋，赶在「剑神如意」之前。"
msgstr "The sword is on the stone platform. After dark it comes out. Spar with it, and land your hit before \"Sword God, as I will\"."

msgid "走到台边那块青石前，把风泉之剑往石缝里一插，剑身「嗡」地响了一声。"
msgstr " walks to the bluestone at the edge of the terrace and thrusts the Windspring Sword into a rock crevice. The blade gives a \"hum.\""

msgid "天黑了，剑灵就站在这块石头前。跟它切磋——它念一句，强一分。"
msgstr "Once it is dark, the sword spirit will stand before this stone. Spar with it. With every line it chants, it grows stronger."

msgid "念到第四句「剑神如意」之前打中它，就算过了。念完了，今夜就到此，明晚再来。"
msgstr "Hit it before it chants the fourth line, \"Sword God, as I will\", and you pass. Once it has chanted all four, that is all for the night; come again the next evening."

msgid "问剑？"
msgstr "Sword Trial?"

msgid "骆家"
msgstr "The Luo Family"

msgid "骆家的事，不劳你了。"
msgstr "The Luo family's affairs need not trouble you anymore."

msgid "大哥去了关北。他写信来，说那边的风比曼雩台还大。……最后一笔，没甩出格子。"
msgstr "My elder brother has gone Beyond the Pass. He writes that the wind there is stronger than on the Rain Dance Terrace. ...His last stroke stayed inside the box."

msgid "大哥的供状在京城。骆家的门匾，我回去摘了——摘下来，背面是父亲的字。"
msgstr "My brother's statement is in the Capital. I went back and took down the Luo family's plaque. On its back is Father's handwriting."

msgid "大哥在台上抄谱。你问他去——他话少，比从前多了一点。"
msgstr "My brother is up on the terrace copying scores. Go and ask him. He speaks little, though a bit more than before."

msgid "我进京一趟。西街相国府见——大哥在那里。"
msgstr "I am going to the Capital. Meet me at the Chancellor's House on West Street. My brother is there."

msgid "听你说完，扇子停在半空，很久没有动。"
msgstr " hears you out, his fan stopped in midair, and does not move for a long while."

msgid "那三句是他写的。……他写的时候就知道。"
msgstr "Those three lines, he wrote them. ...He knew when he wrote them."

msgid "父亲带我们练剑那年，他说剑是莽夫的东西，字才是骆家的。骆家的字，写到兵部的抄本上去了。"
msgstr "The year Father taught us the sword, he said swords were for brutes and writing was what belonged to the Luo family. And the Luo family's writing ended up in the Ministry of War's copy."

msgid "站起来，把风泉之剑挂回腰上。"
msgstr " stands up and hangs the Windspring Sword back at his waist."

msgid "十年没回京城了。我进京一趟——西街相国府见，大哥在韦相国那里。"
msgstr "I have not been back to the Capital in ten years. I will go. Meet me at the Chancellor's House on West Street. My brother is with Chancellor Wei."

msgid "他读了？……他没回信。他从来不回。"
msgstr "He read it? ...He did not write back. He never does."

msgid "愣了一下，摇摇头，又写了一封。"
msgstr " pauses, shakes his head, and writes another."

msgid "丢了就丢了。这一封，别再丢了。"
msgstr "Lost is lost. Do not lose this one."

msgid "信在你那里。他在庾子建府上的客厅——庾子建倒了，就去相国府找他。"
msgstr "The letter is with you. He is in the reception hall of Yu Zijian's mansion. If Yu Zijian falls, look for him at the Chancellor's House."

msgid "沉默了一会儿，用扇子敲了敲手心。"
msgstr " falls silent a moment, then taps his palm with his fan."

msgid "韦相国叫我「骆家的二小子」，没叫错。我上头还有一个大哥，骆建章。"
msgstr "Chancellor Wei calls me \"the second Luo boy,\" and he is not wrong. I have an elder brother, Luo Jianzhang."

msgid "父亲带我们练剑，他不肯，说剑是莽夫的东西。他写得一手好字——比父亲的好，比我的好得多。"
msgstr "When Father taught us the sword, he would not learn; he said swords were for brutes. He writes a fine hand. Better than Father's, and far better than mine."

msgid "十年前他进了兵部尚书庾子建的府，做书启。我们兄弟俩，十年没说过一句话。"
msgstr "Ten years ago he entered the mansion of Yu Zijian, Minister of War, as his secretary. We brothers have not said a word to each other in ten years."

msgid "从袖子里抽出一张笺，提笔写了很久，写完折成一个小方块，最后一笔照旧甩出了格子。"
msgstr " draws a sheet of letter paper from his sleeve and writes for a long time, then folds it into a small square. As always, the last stroke flicks out past the box."

msgid "你进京的时候，替我把这封信交给他。他在庾子建的客厅里写字——庾子建要是倒了，他多半在韦相国那里。"
msgstr "When you go to the Capital, give him this letter for me. He writes in Yu Zijian's reception hall. If Yu Zijian falls, he will most likely be with Chancellor Wei."

msgid "骆家的事？……等你进了京，咱们再说。"
msgstr "The Luo family's affairs? ...Once you get to the Capital, we will talk."

msgid "骆家在京城住了五代。我是二小子。"
msgstr "The Luo family has lived in the Capital for five generations. I am the second son."

msgid "京城"
msgstr "The Capital"

msgid "名帖给过你了。韦相国那老头子脾气怪，可是不收银子，也不怕庾子建——京城里这样的人，数得过来。"
msgstr "I have given you the calling card. Old Chancellor Wei has an odd temper, but he takes no silver and does not fear Yu Zijian. In the Capital, men like that can be counted on one hand."

msgid "把扇子一收，看了你半晌。"
msgstr " snaps his fan shut and studies you for a long moment."

msgid "你要进京告兵部尚书？——好。我家在京城住了五代，别的没有，认得几个不收银子的人。"
msgstr "You mean to go to the Capital and accuse the Minister of War? Good. My family has lived in the Capital for five generations. We have little else, but we know a few people who take no silver."

msgid "从袖子里抽出一张大红名帖，提笔写了一行，字写得飞快，最后一笔甩出了格子。"
msgstr " draws a bright red calling card from his sleeve and writes a line, very fast, the last stroke flicking out past the box."

msgid "拿着，去西街的相国府，叩门递帖。韦相国是我父亲的老师。他那府里寒酸得很——别笑。"
msgstr "Take it to the Chancellor's House on West Street, knock, and hand in the card. Chancellor Wei was my father's teacher. His house is very shabby. Do not laugh."

msgid "又看了你一眼。"
msgstr " looks at you again."

msgid "等这件事办完了，桃林走一趟，咱们说话。"
msgstr "When this is done, take a walk to the Peach Grove, and we will talk."

msgid "京城？我家在京城，我不爱回去。那里的人说话，十句有九句是给别人听的。"
msgstr "The Capital? My family is in the Capital, and I do not like going back. When people there speak, nine sentences in ten are meant for someone else's ears."

msgid "虹台上的事，骆家记下了。"
msgstr "The Luo family will remember the Rainbow Terrace."

msgid "步玄这一票，听你的。"
msgstr "Mystic Step's vote goes with you."

msgid "把扇子在掌心敲了两下。"
msgstr " taps his fan twice against his palm."

msgid "骆家跟朝廷翻了脸。步玄这一票投旧盟主——兵部的旧案，查到底。"
msgstr "The Luo family has broken with the court. Mystic Step votes for the old Alliance Leader. The Ministry of War's old case, seen through to the end."

msgid "大哥那张供状，是你陪着他写的。这一票，你要，就是你的。"
msgstr "My brother's statement, you sat with him while he wrote it. This vote, if you want it, is yours."

msgid "骆家还是京城的世家，京城的意思，是颜违。步玄这一票投他。"
msgstr "The Luo family is still one of the Capital's great houses, and the Capital wants Yan Wei. Mystic Step votes for him."

msgid "朝台上抄谱的大哥看了一眼。"
msgstr " glances at his brother, copying scores on the terrace."

msgid "可大哥是你让我带回来的。骆家欠你一份情：这一票，你要，就是你的。"
msgstr "But it was you who had me bring my brother back. The Luo family owes you: this vote, if you want it, is yours."

msgid "骆家是京城的世家，这一票原该随朝廷——投颜违。"
msgstr "The Luo family is one of the Capital's great houses. This vote ought to follow the court: Yan Wei."

msgid "可庾子建是你在朝上揭发的，骆家的名帖也是你拿去敲开相国府的门。骆家欠你一份情：这一票，你要，就是你的。"
msgstr "But it was you who denounced Yu Zijian at court, and you who took the Luo family's calling card to knock on the door of the Chancellor's House. The Luo family owes you: this vote, if you want it, is yours."

msgid "骆家在京城住了五代，京城的意思，是颜违。"
msgstr "The Luo family has lived in the Capital for five generations, and the Capital wants Yan Wei."

msgid "步玄这一票投他。我不爱回去，可我姓骆。"
msgstr "Mystic Step votes for him. I do not like going back, but my name is Luo."

msgid "请骆云舟把步玄派这一票交给你：正月十七虹台上，步玄听你的——你要站出来，这一票就是你的；不站，就由你说投谁。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Ask Luo Yunzhou to hand the Mystic Step School's vote to you: on the seventeenth, on the Rainbow Terrace, Mystic Step goes the way you say. Stand up yourself and the vote is yours; if not, you decide who gets it.\nSay it that way?"

msgid "说过了。步玄听你的。"
msgstr "It has been said. Mystic Step goes with you."

msgid "把扇子一收，笑了。"
msgstr " snaps his fan shut and smiles."

msgid "好。步玄听你的。"
msgstr "Good. Mystic Step goes with you."

msgid "一个高大的人形，只有轮廓发出暗蓝色的光芒，其他部份都是透明的！\n"
msgstr "A tall human form. Only its outline gives off a dark blue light; the rest of it is transparent!\n"

msgid "剑气指天 ..."
msgstr "Sword qi points to heaven..."

msgid "剑心内敛 ..."
msgstr "The sword heart turns inward..."

msgid "剑芒游光 ..."
msgstr "The blade's gleam roams..."

msgid "剑神如意！"
msgstr "Sword God, as I will!"

msgid "一阵蓝光笼罩住$N，「嗡」地一声，$N的轮廓又变清晰了一些！"
msgstr "A blue light wraps around $N. With a \"hum,\" $N's outline grows a little clearer!"

msgid "雪亭驿的信"
msgstr "A Letter from the Post Station"

msgid "杜宽托你把一封信送到绮云镇振远镖局陈剑秋手里，回来给一两脚钱。"
msgstr "Du Kuan asks you to take a letter to Chen Jianqiu at the Far-Road Escorts in Cloudweave Town, for a tael of legwork money when you get back."

msgid "出镇往南过卧龙岗，到绮云镇的振远镖局把信交给陈剑秋。"
msgstr "Leave town heading south over Crouching Dragon Ridge, and give the letter to Chen Jianqiu at the Far-Road Escorts in Cloudweave Town."

msgid "你把信交给了陈剑秋。"
msgstr "You give the letter to Chen Jianqiu."

msgid "回雪亭驿找杜宽拿脚钱。"
msgstr "Go back to the Snow Pavilion Post Station and collect your fee from Du Kuan."

msgid "杜宽付了你一两脚钱，说往后有信还找你。"
msgstr "Du Kuan pays you a tael for the legwork, and says he'll come to you with any more letters."

msgid "门房的来历"
msgstr "The Gatekeeper's Past"

msgid "魏无极说淳风武馆的门房刘安禄是野羊山寨的二寨主，人称血手刘三。"
msgstr "Wei Wuji says Liu Anlu, the gatekeeper of Pure Wind Hall, is the second chief of the Goathill Stockade, known as Bloody-Hand Liu."

msgid "去淳风武馆问问柳淳风「刘安禄」。"
msgstr "Go to Pure Wind Hall and ask Liu Chunfeng about \"Liu Anlu\"."

msgid "柳淳风只说刘兄弟在武馆管事五年了，过去之事不须再提。门房的来历，雪亭镇上只有他一个人清楚。"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng will only say that Brother Liu has managed the hall for five years, and the past need not be raised. In all of Snow Pavilion, only he knows the gatekeeper's past."

msgid "樵夫骂野羊山那群道士该千刀万剐，说他们施了妖法。"
msgstr "The woodcutter curses the Daoists on Goathill: they deserve a thousand cuts, he says, for the black magic they work."

msgid "刘安禄动起手来说漏了嘴：「想我堂堂……呃……连我这个小小的门房都可以收拾你！」"
msgstr "In the middle of the fight, Liu Anlu lets slip: \"To think I, the great... uh... even a lowly gatekeeper like me can deal with you!\""

msgid "刘安禄亮出了血手刘三的身份：野羊山寨的二寨主，一手快刀判若两人。"
msgstr "Liu Anlu reveals himself as Bloody-Hand Liu: second chief of the Goathill Stockade, a different man with a fast blade in his hand."

msgid "你向雪亭镇书院的魏无极打听学费。"
msgstr "You ask Wei Wuji of the Snow Pavilion schoolhouse about his fee."

msgid "你交给魏无极学费，他点头说从今天起你随时可以去问他读书识字的学问。"
msgstr "You pay Wei Wuji his fee. He nods and says that from today you may come to him any time to learn Literacy."

msgid "你在兵器储藏室底下的地下密室里拾到一面牛皮盾。"
msgstr "In the secret room beneath the armory, you pick up an oxhide shield."

msgid "你向青石村的村长打听玉佩。"
msgstr "You ask the Village Head of Bluestone Village about the jade pendant."

msgid "你给雪亭镇的醉汉送酒，他悄声说：玉佩他卖给沈老板了，那东西不吉祥。"
msgstr "You bring wine to the drunk in Snow Pavilion. He whispers that he sold the jade pendant to Boss Shen, and that the thing is unlucky."

msgid "你又给醉汉送酒，他悄声说：听说沈记商行有在卖蒙汗药。"
msgstr "You bring the drunk more wine. He whispers that he has heard Shen's Store sells knockout powder."

msgid "你向沈记商行的沈万年问起玉佩，得到了那块刻著行气口诀的玉佩。"
msgstr "You ask Shen Wannian of Shen's Store about the jade pendant, and get the pendant carved with a formula for moving qi."

msgid "你向沈万年打听蒙汗药，他悄声说一份只要十两银子，保证有效。"
msgstr "You ask Shen Wannian about knockout powder. He whispers that a dose costs only ten taels of silver, guaranteed to work."

msgid "你付给沈万年十两银子，他塞给你一包蒙汗药。"
msgstr "You pay Shen Wannian ten taels of silver, and he slips you a packet of knockout powder."

msgid "你依着路牌穿过了山路尽头的迷阵。"
msgstr "Following the signposts, you make it through the Trigram Maze at Road's End."

msgid "你跳入溪水中仔细寻找，竟从水中找出一把追风剑。"
msgstr "You jump into the stream and search carefully, and to your surprise you fish a sword out of the water: Windchaser."

msgid "山洞里的骸骨"
msgstr "The Bones in the Cave"

msgid "你在瀑布旁的山洞里埋好了那具骸骨，洞顶石壁「喀喇」一响，坠下一本过招要旨。"
msgstr "You bury the skeleton in the cave beside the waterfall. The rock above gives a \"crack,\" and a sparring primer drops down."

msgid "树上的刀痕"
msgstr "Blade Marks on the Trees"

msgid "你顺着松树上的刀痕，在崖上林径尽头的灌木后找到了一条小径，通往老松寨。"
msgstr "Following the blade marks on the pines, you find a footpath behind the bushes at the end of the clifftop forest trail. It leads to Old Pine Stockade."

msgid "买路钱"
msgstr "Toll"

msgid "你向卧龙岗的强盗问起买路钱。"
msgstr "You ask the robber on Crouching Dragon Ridge about the toll."

msgid "你交给卧龙岗的强盗十两金子，他收下钱，说今天做个善人，放你一条生路。"
msgstr "You give the robber on Crouching Dragon Ridge ten taels of gold. He takes the money and says he'll play the good man today and let you live."

msgid "你在怡红院二楼向李师师请教学艺。"
msgstr "Upstairs at Red Delight House, you ask Li Shishi to teach you."

msgid "你留给李师师一件信物，她说：能做相公的老师，真是三生有幸。"
msgstr "You leave Li Shishi a keepsake. She says, \"To be your teacher, young sir, is my good fortune three lifetimes over.\""

msgid "你在香茗坊二楼和弈者下了一盘棋。"
msgstr "Upstairs at Sweetleaf Teahouse, you play a game of go with the Go Player."

msgid "你得到了弈者的棋子，一种较轻的暗器。"
msgstr "You get the Go Player's go stones, a lighter kind of hidden weapon."

msgid "你向振远镖局的陈剑秋问起陈天星。"
msgstr "You ask Chen Jianqiu of the Far-Road Escorts about Chen Tianxing."

msgid "你向陈剑秋问起忘忧草。"
msgstr "You ask Chen Jianqiu about forget-worry grass."

msgid "你向乔阴县城的乾瘪老太婆打听忘忧草。"
msgstr "You ask the Wizened Crone in Tallshade about forget-worry grass."

msgid "你向乔阴县城的游客打听忘忧草。"
msgstr "You ask a Sightseer in Tallshade about forget-worry grass."

msgid "护草神兽倒下后，你在神秘洞穴里得到一棵发着晶莹光芒的忘忧草。"
msgstr "With the Herb-Guarding Beast down, you find a glittering stalk of forget-worry grass in the Mysterious Cave."

msgid "你把忘忧草交给陈剑秋，他大喜过望，提笔写好一封信交给你，嘱咐你路上小心，把信直接交给陈师叔。"
msgstr "You give the forget-worry grass to Chen Jianqiu. Overjoyed, he writes a letter and hands it to you, telling you to be careful on the road and to give it straight to Martial Uncle Chen."

msgid "你在京师振远总局向陈天星请教拜师。"
msgstr "At the Far-Road Head Office in the Capital, you ask Chen Tianxing to take you as his disciple."

msgid "你向傍厅的蓝雨梅问起芳绫。"
msgstr "You ask Lan Yumei in the Side Hall about Fangling."

msgid "你向蓝筱薇问起竹蜻蜓。"
msgstr "You ask Lan Xiaowei about the bamboo dragonfly."

msgid "你把一根竹子交给蓝筱薇，她看了看说是根玉竹，便灵巧地削凿起来。"
msgstr "You give Lan Xiaowei a bamboo stalk. She looks it over, says it is jade bamboo, and deftly sets about carving it."

msgid "蓝筱薇把做好的竹蜻蜓递给了你。"
msgstr "Lan Xiaowei hands you the finished bamboo dragonfly."

msgid "你把竹蜻蜓送给禁闭房里的芳绫，她开心地把玩，在你耳边小声说：『庄内前厅某处藏有一宝物手镯哦！』"
msgstr "You give the bamboo dragonfly to Fangling in the Confinement Room. She plays with it happily and whispers in your ear, \"There's a treasure hidden somewhere in the manor's front hall: a bracelet!\""

msgid "你从内厅的碧纱橱里取出一串玛瑙手镯。"
msgstr "From the gauze-screened cabinet in the Inner Hall, you take an agate bracelet."

msgid "晚月庄的舞步"
msgstr "The Dances of Latemoon Manor"

msgid "你记下了一曲舞步『西出阳关』。"
msgstr "You commit a dance to memory: \"Westward Out of Yangguan\"."

msgid "你记下了一曲舞步『有凤来仪』。"
msgstr "You commit a dance to memory: \"The Phoenix Comes to Court\"."

msgid "你在一间密室里拾到一卷丝罗巾，上面绣着一幅幅翩然起舞的美女图。"
msgstr "In a secret room you pick up a silk gauze scarf embroidered with scene after scene of dancing beauties."

msgid "你在翠湘阁向莫欣芳问起舞曲谱。"
msgstr "In the Green Xiang Chamber, you ask Mo Xinfang about the dance score."

msgid "你在密室的石床后面找到了一本舞曲谱。"
msgstr "Behind the stone bed in the secret room, you find a dance score."

msgid "你向内书房的无名老妇问起她的心事：那个蒙面的杀手，是她的私生女。"
msgstr "You ask the Nameless Old Woman in the Inner Study what troubles her: the masked assassin is her daughter, born out of wedlock."

msgid "你向无名老妇问起令牌：令牌在她女儿身上。"
msgstr "You ask the Nameless Old Woman about the token: her daughter has it."

msgid "你得到了一个黑木做的杀手令牌，上面刻著火焰的图腾标志。"
msgstr "You get an assassin's token of black wood, carved with a flame totem."

msgid "你把杀手令牌交给无名老妇，她叹了口气，给了你一本寒雪鞭法密笈作为感谢。"
msgstr "You give the assassin's token to the Nameless Old Woman. She sighs and gives you a Cold Snow Whip manual in thanks."

msgid "你得到了芙云身上的一封密函，信用蜡封著，上面有一个奇怪的图案。"
msgstr "You get a secret letter from Fuyun. It is sealed with wax and bears a strange design."

msgid "你在青石峪遇见一位采药老者，他心疼你饿得面黄肌瘦，从小布包里拿出个山药蛋塞到你手里。"
msgstr "In Bluestone Gully you meet an old herb gatherer. Pained to see you so hungry and sallow, he takes a yam from his little cloth bag and presses it into your hand."

msgid "草堂的书"
msgstr "The Books in the Thatched Hall"

msgid "你在隐士的草堂里趁人不备，从矮几上抓起一本书藏入怀中。"
msgstr "In the hermit's Thatched Hall, when no one is looking, you snatch a book from the low table and hide it in your robe."

msgid "你向福林酒楼里的武官打听传闻。"
msgstr "You ask the Officer in Fulin Tavern about rumors."

msgid "你在树王坟内部找到一个刻工精细的桃木箱。"
msgstr "Inside the Tree King's Tomb, you find a finely carved peachwood chest."

msgid "你把桃木箱还给武官，他说出门在外没带太多银两，送你一本古书「白杨经」作为报答。"
msgstr "You return the peachwood chest to the Officer. He says he did not bring much silver on his travels, and gives you an old book, the \"White Poplar Classic,\" as thanks."

msgid "荷包"
msgstr "The Purse"

msgid "你在福林酒楼二楼向贵公子问起他的心事。"
msgstr "On the second floor of Fulin Tavern, you ask the Young Lord what is troubling him."

msgid "你向曲桥上的官家小姐提起游晋，她吞吞吐吐地托你把一个紫罗鸳鸯荷包交给游公子。"
msgstr "On the Zigzag Bridge you mention You Jin to the Official's Daughter. Stammering, she asks you to give a purple mandarin-duck purse to young master You."

msgid "骆云舟死后，风泉之剑掉落在地，又飘了起来，一个人形忽然浮现，手中正握著风泉之剑。"
msgstr "When Luo Yunzhou dies, the Windspring Sword falls to the ground, then floats up again. A human form suddenly appears, gripping the Windspring Sword."

msgid "你得到了步玄派历代相传的掌门信物——风泉之剑。"
msgstr "You gain the token of the Mystic Step School's Masters through the generations: the Windspring Sword."

msgid "你向骆云舟拜师，他说：你还是先走一趟东边的桃林吧。"
msgstr "You ask Luo Yunzhou to take you as a disciple. He tells you to first take a walk through the Peach Grove to the east."

msgid "你读着树上的字条找路，走出了曼雩台东边的桃林。"
msgstr "Reading the notes on the trees to find your way, you walk out of the Peach Grove east of the Rain Dance Terrace."

msgid "你在绝壁上的山洞里得到一条金丝编成、刻满咒文的缚仙绳。"
msgstr "In a cave on the Sheer Cliff, you get an immortal-binding rope woven of gold thread and covered in carved spells."

msgid "你在云台向紫衣童子问起仙人。"
msgstr "On the Cloud Terrace, you ask the Boy in Purple about the immortal."

msgid "你在丹炉里得到了仙丹。"
msgstr "In the Elixir Furnace you find an elixir pill."

msgid "你在寒谷尽头采到一株寒谷幽兰，淡淡的香气似乎在哪里闻到过。"
msgstr "At the end of the Cold Valley you pick a cold-valley orchid. Its faint scent seems like one you have smelled somewhere before."

msgid "军营"
msgstr "The Army Camp"

msgid "你向大队长打听黄石隘口，他讲起二十多年前先帝调大将军们驻守隘口的往事。"
msgstr "You ask the Captain about Yellow Rock Pass, and he tells how, more than twenty years ago, the late Emperor sent the great generals to hold the pass."

msgid "你向大队长问起允许。"
msgstr "You ask the Captain about permission."

msgid "你前后交给大队长三十两银子，他把你列入名册，说从今天起你可以自由出入营区。"
msgstr "Having given the Captain thirty taels of silver in all, you get your name on his roll. He says that from today you may come and go in the camp freely."

msgid "你在将军营帐向严廷殷打听印鉴。"
msgstr "In the General's Tent, you ask Yan Tingyin about the seal."

msgid "你向大队长打听兵器库。"
msgstr "You ask the Captain about the armory."

msgid "你向军师赫造基打听兵器库。"
msgstr "You ask the Adviser He Zaoji about the armory."

msgid "你交给军师赫造基八两银子，他告诉你一项秘密：在那片光滑的山壁前发誓「我爱……」，或许可以发现奇特的事。"
msgstr "You give the Adviser He Zaoji eight taels of silver, and he tells you a secret: swear \"I love...\" before that smooth cliff face, and something strange may happen."

msgid "你在光滑的山壁前发了誓，一阵强光轰隆过后，来到一处兵器库，见到一名后备兵。"
msgstr "You swear before the smooth cliff face. After a blinding flash and a rumble, you find yourself in an armory, where you meet a Reserve Soldier."

msgid "你交给后备兵三两黄金，他说你不愧是武林中人，一眼就看出端倪，用一方印鉴和你交换。"
msgstr "You give the Reserve Soldier three taels of gold. He says you are a true martial man to spot it at a glance, and trades you a seal."

msgid "你把那方印鉴交给严廷殷，他喝道别想拿这种东西来骗他，把你赶到了营火区。"
msgstr "You give the seal to Yan Tingyin. He roars that you will not fool him with a thing like this, and drives you out to the Campfire Ground."

msgid "后备兵见被你识破，只好认栽，换给你一方泛著黄光的印鉴。"
msgstr "Seen through, the Reserve Soldier has to own up, and trades you a seal with a yellow sheen."

msgid "你把印鉴交给严廷殷，他连声道谢，送你一把古剑作为报酬。"
msgstr "You give the seal to Yan Tingyin. He thanks you again and again, and gives you an old sword as a reward."

msgid "你在洞内石室的书柜里找到一个铜制的书匣。"
msgstr "In the book cabinet of the cave chamber, you find a bronze book box."

msgid "书匣里是一本《悟疾风劲竹书》，书末署名柳淳风。"
msgstr "In the book box is a copy of Bamboo Against the Gale, signed at the end by Liu Chunfeng."

msgid "你在瓜地里摘西瓜，被瓜农逮了个正着。"
msgstr "Picking watermelons in the Melon Patch, you are caught red-handed by the Melon Farmer."

msgid "你在湖底的水下岩洞里撞见了浑身长满白鳞的冰龙。"
msgstr "In an underwater cave at the bottom of the lake, you run into ice dragons covered all over in white scales."

msgid "你向玉螺湖村的采花妞打听小娟。"
msgstr "You ask the Little Flower Girl in Jade Conch Village about Xiaojuan."

msgid "你向黑松堡的女佣人打听小娟。"
msgstr "You ask the Cleaning Maid at Black Pine Castle about Xiaojuan."

msgid "你在黑松堡地牢的刑房里见到了刘老农的女儿小娟，她已被折磨得遍体鳞伤。"
msgstr "In the torture room of Black Pine Castle's dungeon, you find Old Farmer Liu's daughter Xiaojuan, tortured and covered in wounds."

msgid "小娟从绳索里挣脱出来，跟着你走了。"
msgstr "Xiaojuan struggles free of the ropes and follows you."

msgid "你从刘老农那里得到了一柄銮鱼衡冰。"
msgstr "You get a sword from Old Farmer Liu: Icefish."

msgid "小娟死在了你的手里。"
msgstr "Xiaojuan dies by your hand."

msgid "刘老农得知你杀了他的女儿，悲愤欲绝，要找你拼命。"
msgstr "Old Farmer Liu learns that you killed his daughter. Mad with grief and rage, he comes to fight you to the death."

msgid "你赏了太白酒楼的店小二十两银子，他笑着道谢。"
msgstr "You tip the waiter at Taibai Tavern ten taels of silver, and he thanks you with a smile."

msgid "你向京师的行人问起买官。"
msgstr "You ask a passerby in the Capital about buying office."

msgid "你塞给尚书府的门房三两黄金，他说：这位大人，里面请！"
msgstr "You slip the gatekeeper of the Minister's Mansion three taels of gold. He says, \"This way, my lord, please come in!\""

msgid "你向京师守城兵问起出城。"
msgstr "You ask a Capital Guard about leaving the city."

msgid "你在废园的草丛里找到一块遗失多年的出城令牌。"
msgstr "In the tall grass of the Ruined Garden, you find a city exit pass lost for many years."

msgid "你把令牌交给京师守城兵，他连忙说：原来是官府中人。"
msgstr "You hand the pass to a Capital Guard, and he hurriedly says, \"Ah, so you're with the government.\""

msgid "你在雪亭驿门外揭下了一张官府悬赏告示，照告示上说的地方去找那个恶人。"
msgstr "Outside the Snow Pavilion Post Station, you tear down a government bounty notice and go to find the villain where the notice says."

msgid "你第一次领到了雪亭驿的悬赏。告示上隔些时候就会贴出新的。"
msgstr "You collect your first bounty from the Snow Pavilion Post Station. New notices go up every so often."

msgid "初入江湖"
msgstr "First Steps in the Jianghu"

msgid "走近一个人、一件东西，脚下会出现「交互」和该按的键（键盘、手柄各画各的）。按那个键或点它，能做的事都列在交互窗口里；只有一件事可做的，直接就做了。"
msgstr "When you come near a person or a thing, \"Interact\" and the key to press appear at your feet (the keyboard and the gamepad each show their own). Press that key or click it, and everything you can do is listed in the interaction window; if there is only one thing to do, it just happens."

msgid "不知道往哪里去，就找人「打听」。镇上的人知道这里的事和附近的传闻，有些话题问出来就是一条路。你见过、听过的事都记在菜单的「任务」页，状态卡上的「目标」一行写着眼下最要紧的那件。"
msgstr "If you don't know where to go, find someone and \"Ask\". Townsfolk know what goes on here and the rumors from nearby, and asking about some topics opens up a road. Everything you have seen and heard is kept on the menu's \"Quests\" page, and the \"Objective\" line on the status card shows the most pressing thing right now."

msgid "菜单有八页：角色、武学、背包、任务、地图、声望、百科、系统。地图页是一张沙盘，走过的地方都立着模型；说明卡上列着师父、商店、悬赏榜，点一行就给你指路。"
msgstr "The menu has eight pages: Character, Martial Arts, Items, Quests, Map, Repute, Codex and System. The Map page is a sand table with a model standing on every place you have walked; its info card lists shifus, shops and bounty boards, and clicking a line points you the way."

msgid "系统页里有三个存档位。换地图、打完一仗也会自动存一份，死了可以回到那里。"
msgstr "The System page has three save slots. The game also saves on its own when you change maps or finish a fight, and if you die you can go back to that point."

msgid "先做什么"
msgstr "Where to Start"

msgid "先在镇上走一圈，和人说说话。饮风客栈的店小二卖吃喝；想学武，就去淳风武馆看看，那里的人肯指点新人。"
msgstr "First walk around town and talk to people. The waiter at Drinkwind Inn sells food and drink; if you want to learn martial arts, go and look at Pure Wind Hall, where they are willing to coach newcomers."

msgid "打不过的人别硬碰：交互窗口和动手前的确认页都会写出对方比你强还是弱。"
msgstr "Don't take on people you can't beat: the interaction window and the confirmation before a fight both tell you whether the other side is stronger or weaker than you."

msgid "地理"
msgstr "Geography"

msgid "雪亭镇在群山之中。镇北的山坳往北是野羊山，往东通青石村。出镇往西，顺着青石官道上山，是天邪派的水烟阁。镇东的大路通到茅山，茅山派的灵心观就在山上；这条路上有岔路往南进老松岭的松林，传说老松寨就在附近，过往的旅客都要格外小心。"
msgstr "Snow Pavilion lies among the mountains. North of town, the Mountain Hollow leads north to Goathill and east to Bluestone Village. West out of town, the Bluestone Road climbs the mountain to the Wayward School's Waterfog Pavilion. The main road east of town leads to Mount Mao, where the Mount Mao School's Clear Heart Abbey stands on the mountain; along this road a fork runs south into the pine woods of Old Pine Ridge. Old Pine Stockade is said to be nearby, and travelers take extra care."

msgid "镇南的大街通到绮云镇；往西南走是天驼关。"
msgstr "The main street south of town leads to Cloudweave Town; to the southwest lies Camelback Pass."

msgid "绮云镇往西是晚月庄，庄里多是女子。往南过了渡口是日照山，山烟寺就在山上；过渡口往东走，就到乔阴县城。"
msgstr "West of Cloudweave Town is Latemoon Manor, home mostly to women. South across the ferry is Sunlit Mountain, with Mountain Mist Temple on it; across the ferry and east lies the county town of Tallshade."

msgid "人身上最要紧的是「精」「气」「神」三样。"
msgstr "The three things that matter most in a person are \"Essence\", \"Qi\" and \"Spirit\"."

msgid "学东西的本钱。请教、自学、修行都耗精。"
msgstr "Your capital for learning. Learning, self-study and cultivating all cost Essence."

msgid "身体的力气。挨打掉的是气，练功、打坐也耗气。"
msgstr "The strength of your body. Getting hit costs Qi, and practicing and meditating cost Qi too."

msgid "心神。研读、冥思都耗神，迷药和蒙汗药伤的也是神。"
msgstr "The mind. Reading and contemplating cost Spirit, and drugs and knockout powder harm Spirit too."

msgid "当前、有效、最大"
msgstr "Current, Effective, Max"

msgid "角色页上每样有三个数。「当前」是眼下还剩多少，歇一歇就回来；「有效」是受伤压低的上限，当前最多只回到这里；「最大」是你的本钱。"
msgstr "Each of the three has three numbers on the Character page. \"Current\" is how much you have left right now, and it comes back with rest. \"Effective\" is the cap your wounds hold down; Current only recovers up to it. \"Max\" is your full measure."

msgid "比如气写着当前 67、有效 82、最大 100：说明你受了些伤，歇着最多回到 82。那 18 点伤要等当前回满了才慢慢长回来，用药或疗伤更快。"
msgstr "Say your Qi reads Current 67, Effective 82, Max 100: you have taken some wounds, and resting brings you back to 82 at most. Those 18 points of wounds only grow back slowly once Current is full; medicine or Heal Wounds is faster."

msgid "三样里哪一样的当前打光了，人就昏倒；伤到连有效也撑不住，就会送命。"
msgstr "If the Current of any of the three runs out, you faint. If your wounds are so bad that even Effective cannot hold, you die."

msgid "「最大」不是一成不变的：内力的上限越高，气的本钱越厚；法力、灵力的上限高了，神和精的本钱也跟着长。"
msgstr "\"Max\" does not stay fixed: the higher your Inner Force cap, the deeper your Qi; and as your Arcane Power and Mystic Power caps rise, your Spirit and Essence grow with them."

msgid "受伤与歇息"
msgstr "Wounds and Rest"

msgid "不打架的时候，精气神会自己慢慢回来：先回当前，当前回满了，伤才慢慢好。战斗中不回。回复要时间走：菜单和交互窗口开着时时间停住，什么都不回。"
msgstr "When you're not fighting, Essence, Qi and Spirit slowly come back on their own: Current first, and once it's full, wounds slowly heal. Nothing recovers during a fight. Recovery takes time passing: while the menu or the interaction window is open, time stops and nothing recovers."

msgid "想歇就歇：请教页和武学页上的「歇到回满」让你坐下来，时间照走（快得多），精气神回满就起身；连续修炼练到一半没了力气，也会自己这样歇一歇再接着练。世界不会等你：歇着时有人来找麻烦，你会被惊起，照常开打；口渴没水的时候歇着也回不来。"
msgstr "Rest whenever you like: \"Rest Until Full\" on the Learn page and the Martial Arts page sits you down while time runs on (much faster), and you get up once Essence, Qi and Spirit are full; if you run out of strength halfway through continuous training, you also rest like this on your own before carrying on. The world doesn't wait for you: if someone comes looking for trouble while you rest, you're startled up and the fight goes on as usual; and when you're thirsty with no water, resting brings nothing back."

msgid "想快一点：金疮药敷上能治伤；学了内功的人可以运功恢复精、气、神，有的内功还能运功疗伤，耗的都是内力。战斗中不能疗伤。"
msgstr "To go faster: wound salve heals wounds when applied; those who have learned neigong can Exert to restore Essence, Qi and Spirit, and some neigong can also Exert to heal wounds, all at a cost in Inner Force. You can't heal wounds during a fight."

msgid "昏倒以后过一会儿自己会醒。昏着的时候任人宰割，所以别在仇人眼前耗到最后一口气。"
msgstr "After fainting, you wake on your own after a while. While you're out, you're at anyone's mercy, so don't spend yourself to your last breath in front of an enemy."

msgid "中了毒、喝醉了，身上会一阵阵发作。蛇药解蛇毒，酒要等它自己醒。"
msgstr "Poison and drink flare up in you, fit after fit. Snake antidote cures snake venom; drink you just have to wait out until you sober up."

msgid "吃喝"
msgstr "Food and Drink"

msgid "食物和饮水随时间慢慢消耗，角色页上看得到还剩多少。一开始都是满的。"
msgstr "Food and water run down slowly over time; the Character page shows how much is left. Both start full."

msgid "食物吃光了，内力、法力、灵力就不再恢复；水喝光了，什么都不再恢复。"
msgstr "When food runs out, Inner Force, Arcane Power and Mystic Power stop recovering; when water runs out, nothing recovers at all."

msgid "客栈、饭馆和集市都卖吃喝。牛皮酒袋能灌清水，路上渴了拿出来喝。酒也能解渴，只是喝多了会醉。"
msgstr "Inns, eateries and markets all sell food and drink. A leather wineskin can be filled with clean water to drink when you're thirsty on the road. Wine also quenches thirst, but drink too much and you'll get drunk."

msgid "肚子能装多少看你的体重。吃剩的肉骨头别扔，喂给狗，它会跟着你走。"
msgstr "How much your belly holds depends on your weight. Don't throw away leftover meat bones: feed them to a dog, and it will follow you."

msgid "人生来有八项天赋，新入江湖时都是 30。天赋很少变动，勤练武艺偶尔会长一点。"
msgstr "Everyone is born with eight gifts, all 30 when you first enter the jianghu. Gifts rarely change; diligent training now and then raises one a little."

msgid "力气。打得更重，背得更多，拿得动沉重的兵器。"
msgstr "Physical strength. You hit harder, carry more, and can wield heavy weapons."

msgid "敢不敢抢攻。自动对打时，胆识高的人出手更勤；不少师父收徒也看它。"
msgstr "Whether you dare to strike first. In auto combat, people with high Courage attack more often; many shifus also look at it when taking disciples."

msgid "天资。学武功更快、耗精更少，打架时也更容易长进。"
msgstr "Natural talent. You learn martial arts faster and use less Essence, and you improve more easily in fights."

msgid "精神方面的体质。冥思、修行长得快，不少法门也看它。"
msgstr "The constitution of the mind. Contemplating and cultivating grow faster, and many mystic arts look at it too."

msgid "临危不乱。对手想抢攻要先过你这一关；打空了也不容易露破绽，还压得住杀气。"
msgstr "Calm in danger. An opponent who wants to strike first has to get past you; when you miss, you're less likely to leave an opening, and you can hold down Bloodlust."

msgid "长相。有人看脸说话，也有师父看长相收人。"
msgstr "Appearance. Some people judge by the face, and some shifus take disciples by looks."

msgid "体质。精气神恢复得快，打坐长内力快，昏倒后醒得早，酒量也大。"
msgstr "Physique. Essence, Qi and Spirit recover faster, meditating builds Inner Force faster, you wake sooner after fainting, and you can hold more drink."

msgid "运气。容易遇上一般人碰不到的机缘，好事坏事都有。"
msgstr "Luck. You more easily come upon chances most people never meet, good and bad alike."

msgid "药物、装备带来的变化只算眼下；学东西看的是天赋本身。天赋不好也不必灰心：它只在武功还浅的时候看得出来，功夫练深了，差别就小了。"
msgstr "Changes from medicine and equipment only count for the moment; learning looks at the gifts themselves. Don't lose heart over poor gifts: they only show while your martial arts are shallow. Once your skills run deep, the difference shrinks."

msgid "学武"
msgstr "Learning Martial Arts"

msgid "武功分两层。基本拳脚、基本剑法、基本内功这些「基本功夫」是根基；柳家拳、封山剑法这些「特殊武功」要在武学页「激发」到对应的基本功夫上才用得出来。真打起来，看的是两者合起来的等级。"
msgstr "Martial arts come in two layers. Basic Fist, Basic Sword, Basic Neigong and the like are \"Basic Arts\", the foundation; the Liu Family Fist, Empty Mountain Sword and the like are special arts, which must be applied (\"Apply\") to the matching basic art on the Martial Arts page before you can use them. In a real fight, what counts is the two levels combined."

msgid "向师父或肯教你的人请教，每次耗精和一点潜能，第一次学一门新功夫耗的精加倍。学到的不能超过教你的人，也受实战经验限制：等级越高，要的实战经验越多。请教页写着你能学到几级、卡在哪里。"
msgstr "Learn from a shifu or anyone willing to teach you. Each lesson costs Essence and a little Potential, and the first lesson in a new art costs double the Essence. You can't learn beyond the one teaching you, and Combat Experience limits you too: the higher the level, the more Combat Experience it takes. The Learn page shows how far you can learn each art and what is holding you back."

msgid "激发好的特殊武功可以在武学页练习，耗气。它最多练到和底下的基本功夫一样高，再往上，得先把基本功夫学上去。"
msgstr "Special arts that are applied can be practiced on the Martial Arts page, at a cost of Qi. They can be practiced up to the level of the basic art beneath them; to go higher, you must first raise the basic art."

msgid "基本拳脚、基本剑法、基本刀法、基本杖法、基本招架、基本轻功、基本内功这七门，到了 40 级就能自己琢磨着往上练，耗精和潜能，不必找人。特殊武功不能自学。"
msgstr "Basic Fist, Basic Sword, Basic Saber, Basic Staff, Basic Parry, Basic Qinggong and Basic Neigong: once these seven reach level 40, you can work on them by yourself, at a cost of Essence and Potential, without a teacher. Special arts can't be self-studied."

msgid "得了拳谱、刀谱、经书，会读书识字就能研读。研读耗神、不花潜能；读书识字越高，每次读懂的越多。"
msgstr "With a fist manual, saber manual or scripture in hand, you can Read it if you have Literacy. Reading costs Spirit, not Potential; the higher your Literacy, the more you understand each time."

msgid "实战经验与潜能"
msgstr "Combat Experience and Potential"

msgid "打架、办差事、走完一段经历，都能得到实战经验和潜能。实战经验决定武功能学多高；潜能是请教和自学的花销，没用掉的有上限，攒满了就该去学了。"
msgstr "Fighting, finishing errands and completing a stretch of your journey all earn Combat Experience and Potential. Combat Experience decides how high your martial arts can go; Potential is what you spend to learn and self-study. Unspent Potential has a cap: once it's full, it's time to go and learn."

msgid "打中比自己强的对手时，偶尔也能长一点功夫。"
msgstr "Landing a hit on an opponent stronger than you can now and then raise your skill a little."

msgid "请教、练习、打坐、冥思、修行都能「连续」做下去：精、气、神不够了就自己歇一歇，回满了接着练，练到潜能用完、功夫长了一级或做不下去的一步才停，并告诉你为什么。"
msgstr "Learning, practicing, meditating, contemplating and cultivating can all be kept going (\"Keep...\"): when Essence, Qi or Spirit runs short you rest on your own and carry on once full, and you stop only when Potential runs out, the art rises a level, or a step can't go on, and you're told why."

msgid "拜师与门派"
msgstr "Shifus and Schools"

msgid "门派是学武的正路。拜师大致有三种：有的师父看你的天赋和功夫够不够，有的要你立誓，有的要你先过一场考验。交互窗口里还够不上的「拜师」会灰掉，写着还差什么；拜师页列出条件和你自己的数。"
msgstr "Schools are the proper road to martial arts. Becoming a disciple works roughly three ways: some shifus check whether your gifts and skills are enough, some want you to swear an oath, and some want you to pass a test first. In the interaction window, \"Become a Disciple\" is grayed out while you don't yet qualify, and says what you still lack; the Become a Disciple page lists the requirements and your own numbers."

msgid "一个人同时只能有一位师父。师父教本门功夫最用心；别的人肯教，多半要你先替他做点事，或者付些钱。"
msgstr "You can have only one shifu at a time. A shifu teaches his own school's arts most devotedly; others willing to teach you usually want you to do something for them first, or pay something."

msgid "改投别派之前会先问你。背叛师门要扣综合评价，往后的师父也不那么信你，教到一定程度就不肯再教；杀了自己的师父，也算背叛。"
msgstr "You're asked before you switch to another school. Betraying your school costs Standing, and later shifus trust you less, refusing to teach beyond a certain point; killing your own shifu also counts as betrayal."

msgid "门派、帮会与山寨"
msgstr "Schools, Guilds and Stockades"

msgid "门派重师门伦理和辈分，以入门先后排序，大多不许弟子再投别家。帮会、教派不以传授武功为主，帮规偏重要你去做事，进出也比门派容易。山寨、镖局、庄院规模小，入伙不易，入了以后有活干、有报酬。"
msgstr "Schools value the bonds of master and disciple and of generation, ranked by who joined first, and most don't let their disciples join another house. Guilds and Orders aren't mainly about teaching martial arts; their rules lean toward giving you work, and they're easier to join and leave than schools. Stockades, escort agencies and manors are small and hard to get into, but once you're in, there's work to do and pay for it."

msgid "角色页名字前方括号里写的是你的身份。一开始都是普通百姓；入了门派、出了家，身份会跟着变，往后的作为也会改它。"
msgstr "The brackets before your name on the Character page show your identity. Everyone starts as a Commoner; joining a school or leaving the world changes it, and what you do later changes it too."

msgid "见过门人的门派收在百科「门派」里；各家怎么看你，写在声望页。"
msgstr "Schools whose members you've met are collected under \"Schools\" in the Codex; how each house sees you is written on the Repute page."

msgid "内力是武者的第二条命，打人和挨打都看它。"
msgstr "Inner Force is a fighter's second life. Both hitting and being hit depend on it."

msgid "学了基本内功，再把一门特殊内功激发上去，就能在武学页打坐：耗气，把气炼成内力存起来。存过了上限再坐下去，上限就慢慢往上长；能长多高，看基本内功的等级。连续打坐可以定一个数，练到就停。"
msgstr "Once you've learned Basic Neigong and applied a special neigong to it, you can Meditate on the Martial Arts page: it costs Qi, refining Qi into Inner Force that you store. Meditate past your cap and the cap slowly rises; how high it can go depends on your Basic Neigong level. \"Keep Meditating\" can be set to a number, and stops when it gets there."

msgid "每一击多灌进一些内力，打得更重，内力也耗得更快。战斗里取「攻」的姿态，会顺手把加力开到一半。"
msgstr "Pour more Inner Force into each strike: you hit harder, and burn Inner Force faster. Taking the \"Attack\" stance in a fight turns Extra Force up to half along the way."

msgid "各门内功的本事不一样：有的能恢复精、气、神，有的能疗伤，有的能压下杀气、提升战斗力。百科「武学」里每门内功都写着它能运哪些。运功耗内力，战斗里也能用。"
msgstr "Each neigong has its own powers: some restore Essence, Qi and Spirit, some heal wounds, some suppress Bloodlust or raise your fighting strength. Under \"Martial Arts\" in the Codex, every neigong lists what it can Exert. Exerting costs Inner Force, and works in a fight too."

msgid "法力与灵力"
msgstr "Arcane Power and Mystic Power"

msgid "法门在江湖上分两路。一路念咒施法，茅山道术、奇门遁甲都属这一路，耗的是法力；一路是出自修行者自身的神通，佛门的八识神通属这一路，耗的是灵力。"
msgstr "Mystic arts in the jianghu go two ways. One is chanting incantations to cast spells, like Mount Mao Sorcery and Qimen Dunjia, and it costs Arcane Power. The other is powers that come from the practitioner's own cultivation, like the Buddhists' Eight Consciousnesses, and it costs Mystic Power."

msgid "学了基本咒文才用得上。在武学页冥思，耗神，把法力一点点聚起来；上限看基本咒文。"
msgstr "Usable only once you've learned Basic Incantation. Contemplate on the Martial Arts page, at a cost of Spirit, to gather Arcane Power bit by bit; its cap depends on Basic Incantation."

msgid "学了基本法术才用得上。在武学页修行，耗精，把精炼成灵力；上限看基本法术。"
msgstr "Usable only once you've learned Basic Mysticism. Cultivate on the Martial Arts page, at a cost of Essence, to refine Essence into Mystic Power; its cap depends on Basic Mysticism."

msgid "两样都和内力一样：存过了上限再练，上限就长。灵性高的人长得快。还没学这一路的时候，角色页和武学页都不显示它们。"
msgstr "Both work like Inner Force: keep training past the cap, and the cap grows. People with high Spirituality grow faster. Until you've learned this path, neither the Character page nor the Martial Arts page shows them."

msgid "战斗"
msgstr "Combat"

msgid "动手有两种。「切磋」点到为止，谁先实实在在打中对方一下就算赢，事后谁也不记仇；只是拿着兵刃切磋，一样会见血。「攻击」是死斗，打到一方送命为止；乱杀无辜，往后的日子就不好过了。"
msgstr "There are two ways to fight. \"Spar\" stops at a touch: whoever first lands a solid hit wins, and no one holds a grudge afterward; but sparring with weapons still draws blood. \"Attack\" is a fight to the death, until one side dies; kill the innocent at random, and life will get hard for you."

msgid "动手之前会先问你一句，写明对方比你强还是弱：稳赢、占优、五五开、吃亏、必败。"
msgstr "Before a fight you're asked first, with a note on whether the other side is stronger or weaker than you: Sure win, Favored, Even, Outmatched, Hopeless."

msgid "出招"
msgstr "Making Moves"

msgid "战斗时世界停住，回合等你出招。一回合你有两手，对手看身手有一到两手；你点一招就结算一手，接着轮到对手。"
msgstr "During a fight the world stops, and each round waits for your move. In a round you have two beats, and your opponent one or two depending on skill; each move you click resolves one beat, and then it's your opponent's turn."

msgid "招式分快、重、虚、守四种：快克重，重克守，守克虚，虚克快。重招占两手，打实了伤得重，还能打掉对手一手；落空了就露出空门。"
msgstr "Moves come in four kinds: Fast, Heavy, Feint and Guard. Fast beats Heavy, Heavy beats Guard, Guard beats Feint, Feint beats Fast. A Heavy move takes two beats: if it lands, it hurts badly and can knock a beat off your opponent; if it misses, it leaves you open."

msgid "姿态有三种：攻，伤得重、自己也好打；守，招架高、伤得轻；游走，闪躲高、命中低。点「改为自动」就让它自己打下去。"
msgstr "There are three stances: Attack, which hits hard but is easy to hit; Guard, with higher parry and lighter wounds; Evade, with higher dodge and lower accuracy. Click \"Switch to Auto\" to let the fight run itself."

msgid "识招"
msgstr "Reading Moves"

msgid "一路招式看熟两回，就认得它是快是重、怕什么；自家门派的招一学就认得。见过的招都记在百科「武学」的见识录里。"
msgstr "Watch a style's moves twice and you'll know whether each is Fast or Heavy and what it fears; your own school's moves you know as soon as you learn them. Every move you've seen is kept in What You've Seen, under \"Martial Arts\" in the Codex."

msgid "有些门派的功夫能多挣一手：封山剑法等对手打空，柳家拳贴身打实。"
msgstr "Some schools' arts can earn an extra beat: Empty Mountain Sword when the opponent misses, the Liu Family Fist when it lands a solid hit up close."

msgid "一伙人"
msgstr "Gangs"

msgid "见人就打的一伙，只要有一个够得着你，就会一起上。人多的时候，先想好再进门。"
msgstr "A gang that attacks on sight will all come at you once any one of them can reach you. When there are many, think before you go through the door."

msgid "认输、逃跑与生死"
msgstr "Surrender, Flight, Life and Death"

msgid "逃跑不耗什么，脱离战斗，人还留在原地。"
msgstr "Fleeing costs nothing: you leave the fight and stay where you are."

msgid "认输：要你命的人还站着时，他不让你降；否则就此停手，扣一些综合评价。"
msgstr "Surrender: while someone who wants you dead is still standing, they won't let you give up; otherwise the fight stops there, and you lose some Standing."

msgid "对手被你打倒时，会停下来问你「了结」还是「放过」，放过的人不记仇。设置里可以改成直接了结。有些人往后还用得着，只能打倒，杀不死。"
msgstr "When you knock an opponent down, the game stops to ask whether to \"Finish\" or \"Spare\" them; those you spare bear no grudge. In Settings you can switch to finishing them straight away. Some people are still needed later: they can only be knocked down, never killed."

msgid "死了以后"
msgstr "After Death"

msgid "人死了变成鬼魂，从鬼门关走一趟阴间，回到阳世。死一回只扣一点实战经验，武功和潜能都不动，杀气清零。"
msgstr "When you die you become a ghost, make a trip through the Underworld by way of the Ghost Gate, and return to the world of the living. Each death costs only a little Combat Experience; your martial arts and Potential are untouched, and your Bloodlust drops to zero."

msgid "身上的东西都留在尸体上，尸体不会腐烂，等你回去取。不想走阴间，也可以回到上次的自动存档。"
msgstr "Everything you carried stays on your corpse, which won't rot, waiting for you to come back for it. If you'd rather not go through the Underworld, you can also go back to your last autosave."

msgid "兵器与护具"
msgstr "Weapons and Armor"

msgid "伤人靠的首先是功夫，其次才是兵器。剑用剑法、刀用刀法，空手用拳脚；兵器的种类不同，伤法也不同，割伤、刺伤、砸伤各不一样。"
msgstr "Wounds come first from skill, and only then from the weapon. A sword uses sword arts, a saber uses saber arts, and empty hands use fist arts. Different kinds of weapons wound in different ways: cutting, piercing and crushing are each their own."

msgid "越重的兵器伤得越重，但要称手：拿不拿得动看膂力。锤和杖砸下去，能把对手的兵器打飞，甚至砸断。另一只手也能拿兵器，它的分量一样算数。"
msgstr "The heavier the weapon, the worse the wound, but it has to suit your hand: whether you can lift it depends on Strength. A hammer or staff coming down can knock the opponent's weapon flying, or even snap it. Your other hand can hold a weapon too, and its weight counts just the same."

msgid "护具有衣服、盔甲、帽子、项链、护腕、腰带、鞋、戒指，还有盾。一身衣服连裤子算一件。护得越好越重，重兵器和重盔甲都会拖慢你的轻功，物品说明上写着拖多少。"
msgstr "Protective gear covers clothes, armor, hats, necklaces, wrist guards, belts, shoes and rings, and shields too. A suit of clothes counts as one piece, trousers included. The better the protection, the heavier it is; heavy weapons and heavy armor both slow your qinggong, and the item's description says by how much."

msgid "背包页选中一件，右边就是它的样子和说明。"
msgstr "Select an item on the Inventory page, and its look and description appear on the right."

msgid "杀气与名声"
msgstr "Bloodlust and Name"

msgid "杀人会长杀气，胆气也跟着壮。杀气太重，学不了佛道两家的心法，还可能失手伤人。运功压制或到庙里捐香火，能把它压下去。"
msgstr "Killing raises Bloodlust, and your nerve grows with it. Too much Bloodlust and you can't learn the heart methods of the Buddhists and the Daoists, and you may hurt people by accident. Exerting to suppress it, or donating incense money at a temple, brings it down."

msgid "江湖上对你的总评。办成差事会涨，认输会掉，背叛师门扣得最狠。"
msgstr "What the jianghu thinks of you, all told. Getting jobs done raises it, surrendering lowers it, and betraying your school costs the most."

msgid "打过交道的势力，在声望页各有一张卡，写着那一家对你的看法；哪一家都还不认得你时，那里是空的。"
msgstr "Each faction you've dealt with has a card on the Repute page, saying what that house thinks of you; while none of them knows you yet, the page is empty."

msgid "角色页还记着你亲手杀过多少人。"
msgstr "The Character page also counts how many people you've killed with your own hands."

msgid "银两与行路"
msgstr "Money and Travel"

msgid "钱有黄金、白银、铜钱三种：一两银子是一百文，一两黄金是一百两银子。付钱先用大的；钱庄能兑换。"
msgstr "Money comes in three kinds: gold, silver and copper coins. One tael of silver is 100 wen, and one tael of gold is 100 taels of silver. The largest coins are spent first; a bank can exchange them."

msgid "当铺按八折收你的东西，不做典当和赎回。不值钱的东西丢下就没了，丢之前会先问你一句；办事要用的东西丢不掉。"
msgstr "Pawnshops buy your things at 80 percent, with no pawning or redeeming. Worthless things are gone once dropped, and you're asked before you drop them; things you need for a task can't be dropped."

msgid "城里的悬赏榜上贴着差事，办成了有赏，也算一段历练。"
msgstr "The bounty boards in town post jobs; finish one and there's a reward, and it counts as seasoning too."

msgid "七座城镇和五个门派的山门都停着车。在车旁「坐车」，在沙盘上挑一站；只去你走到过、路也走通了的地方。车钱十几到五十几文，路上要花些时辰。"
msgstr "Coaches wait at seven towns and at the gates of five schools. Next to a coach, \"Take a Coach\" and pick a stop on the sand table; you can only go where you've already been and where the road is open. Fares run from 10-odd to 50-odd wen, and the trip takes some hours."

msgid "主题故事"
msgstr "The Tale"

msgid "这个时代，东方世界已经有了相当高水准的文明。由于东方大陆实在太大，航海技术并不受重视。我们的故事，就从一个山中小镇——雪亭镇说起。"
msgstr "In this age, the Eastern world already has a civilization of a high order. Because the Eastern continent is so vast, seafaring has never been valued. Our story begins in a small mountain town: Snow Pavilion."

msgid "时间是天朝佑圣元年，岁次甲子，年仅十六岁的皇帝刚刚登基，雪亭镇上熙来攘往，一队身着白衣的朝廷武官和两名老者在镇前的广场中坐着，四面来来往往的人当中，有不少显然是武林中人，正探头探脑地向着广场张望。"
msgstr "It was the first year of Yousheng in the Celestial Empire, a jiazi year. The Emperor, only sixteen, had just taken the throne. Snow Pavilion bustled with comings and goings. In the square at the edge of town sat a troop of imperial Officers in White, and two old men. Among the people drifting past, more than a few were plainly of the wulin, craning their necks toward the square."

msgid "马上乘客一跃而下，快步走到老者身前，躬身说道：「禀将军，时辰已到，白道长命下官回禀，方位是在……」，说着压低了声音。"
msgstr "The rider leapt from the saddle, strode up to the old men and bowed. \"General, the hour has come. Daoist Bai sends me to report that the bearing is...\" And here he lowered his voice."

msgid "只见坐着的白衣武官相互交头接耳，四周围观的人纷纷向外走去，看似杂乱无章，其实倒有一大半正往西南走去，两名老者不动声色，只静静地瞧着众人的动向。"
msgstr "The Officers in White sitting there whispered among themselves, and the onlookers all around began to drift away. It looked like no order at all, yet more than half of them were heading southwest. The two old men gave nothing away, only quietly watching where everyone went."

msgid "过了约一盏茶的时间，其中一名老者做了个手势，所有白衣武官倏地站起，然后跟着两名老者身后缓缓地往西南方向离去。"
msgstr "After about the time it takes to drink a cup of tea, one of the old men made a sign. All the Officers in White rose at once and slowly followed the two old men away to the southwest."

msgid "广场西边一家小客栈里，一个年约十四岁的少年问店里的小二道：「这些人神秘得紧，却不知到底在玩什么把戏？」"
msgstr "In a small inn on the west side of the square, a youth of about fourteen asked the waiter, \"These folks are awful mysterious. What game are they playing?\""

msgid "小二抄起脖子上的毛巾，抹了抹脸，说道：「小哥您有所不知，这些个爷儿们可是大内来的高手，这次是奉了咱们皇上的命令，要去岚城找一把叫做什么『旋芒宝剑』的，那骑马的官爷所称的白道长，便是咱们这附近有名的太乙观观主……」"
msgstr "The waiter pulled the towel off his neck and mopped his face. \"You wouldn't know, young sir—these fine gentlemen are masters from the Palace itself. His Majesty sent them to the Wind City, to find some sword they call Whirling Edge. And the Daoist Bai that rider mentioned, he's the abbot of Taiyi Abbey, famous round these parts...\""

msgid "少年奇道：「岚城？那是什么地方？怎么我从小到大不曾听过有这个地方？」"
msgstr "The youth was puzzled. \"The Wind City? Where's that? I've never heard of it in my whole life.\""

msgid "小二「嘿」的一声，说道：「说起岚城这地方，那你可问对人啦，咱这儿的说书先生可是我的哥儿们，那岚城说穿了只不过是古书上的一处地方，据说这城是仙人住着，一般的凡夫俗眼可瞧不见这座城，只不过古时候一个樵夫不小心撞了进去，这才留下了记载，不过后来好像除了这位砍柴的老兄进去过之外，再也没有人到过这岚城，我说小哥哪，要找这个岚城是他们朝廷大官跟江湖好汉的事儿，您还是来小店听听说书先生的书儿比较轻松。」"
msgstr "The waiter gave a \"heh\" and said, \"the Wind City, now? You've asked the right man. The storyteller here's a good friend of mine. Truth is, the Wind City's just a place in old books. They say immortals live there, and ordinary mortal eyes can't see the city. Only, long ago, a woodcutter stumbled in by accident, and that's how it got written down. But after that, seems like nobody but that wood-chopping fellow ever got into the Wind City again. I tell you, young man, hunting for the Wind City is business for the court's great officials and the heroes of the jianghu. You'd do better to come to our little inn and hear the storyteller. Much easier.\""

msgid "少年听着出了神，怔怔地望着外面的天空，一朵朵的浮云飘来飘去，他的心思也不由自主地飞了起来。"
msgstr "The youth listened, spellbound, gazing at the sky outside. Cloud after cloud drifted past, and the youth's thoughts drifted off with them."

msgid "历史"
msgstr "History"

msgid "自古以来，人类由茹毛饮血逐渐进步，慢慢有了部落，大约在一千年前，强大的邬赤族领袖商句征服了烟车河流域的游牧民族，建立了一个以「金色乌鸦」为图腾的国家，这金色乌鸦代表的是太阳，商句将一面绣着金色乌鸦的大旗树立在图干山的山顶上，统治着山脚下绵延好几百里的土地。"
msgstr "Since ancient times, people slowly rose from eating raw meat and drinking blood, and in time formed tribes. About a thousand years ago, Shang Ju, the mighty chief of the Wuchi tribe, conquered the nomads of the Yanche River basin and founded a nation whose totem was the \"Golden Crow.\" The Golden Crow stood for the sun. Shang Ju raised a great banner embroidered with a golden crow on the summit of Mount Tugan, and ruled the land stretching hundreds of li at its foot."

msgid "第三年冬天，大雪一连下了五个月，牛羊冻死的不计其数，商句召集了所有的父老，对他们说道：「守护我们的金色乌鸦已经离开了这片土地，这场大雪便是告诉我们离开故乡的时间到了，我决定带着子民向南越过大漠，一直到看得到太阳的地方，年老和有病的人可以留下来，我会将一半的牛羊留给他们。」"
msgstr "In the winter of the third year, snow fell for five months on end, and cattle and sheep froze to death beyond counting. Shang Ju gathered all the elders and said to them, \"The Golden Crow that protected us has left this land. This great snow tells us the time has come to leave our homeland. I have decided to lead my people south across the great desert, all the way to where the sun can be seen. The old and the sick may stay, and I will leave half the cattle and sheep to them.\""

msgid "于是他们收拾了帐棚，留下了一半的牛羊给不愿离开家乡的老人，踏上了寻找金色乌鸦的旅程，大漠十分辽阔，即使是商句自己也没有把握能安全地穿越，他在出发后的第四个月甚至亲手写下了遗书，交给自己的儿子。他们在大漠里整整走了一年，然后来到了一座大山之前，商句病倒了，他对他的儿子於兰攸说道：「越过这座大山，北风就吹不到了，在那里一定可以看得到太阳，现在我把这面大旗交给你，希望你记着我们离开故乡的目的，好好带领大家。」说完，商句就闭上眼睛死了。"
msgstr "So they packed up their tents, left half the herds to the old ones who would not leave their homeland, and set out on the journey to find the Golden Crow. The desert was vast, and even Shang Ju himself was not sure they could cross it safely; in the fourth month after they set out, he even wrote a last testament with his own hand and gave it to his son. They walked a full year in the desert, and came before a great mountain. Shang Ju fell ill, and said to his son Yulan You, \"Beyond this mountain, the north wind cannot reach. There we will surely see the sun. Now I give you this great banner. Remember why we left our homeland, and lead everyone well.\" With that, Shang Ju closed his eyes and died."

msgid "於兰攸含泪埋葬了父亲，并且在他的墓旁守候了一年，才开始带着大家翻越那座大山，大山地势非常险峻，他们一共越过了六座高耸的山峰，才来到一片平原，只见绿草如茵，中间散布着几株大树，没有半点冰雪的踪迹，最令人惊异的是，他们的面前耸立着一株高耸入云的大树，树上正栖息着一只巨大的金色乌鸦。"
msgstr "Yulan You buried his father in tears and kept watch by his grave for a year before he began to lead everyone over the mountain. The mountain was steep and dangerous; they crossed six towering peaks in all before they came to a plain. Green grass spread like a carpet, a few great trees stood scattered across it, and there was not a trace of ice or snow. Most astonishing of all, before them rose a tree that pierced the clouds, and in it perched a huge golden crow."

msgid "虽然金色乌鸦在大家的心目中一直是太阳的象徵，但那也只是祖先们流传下来的神话，想不到在经过长途的跋涉之后，竟然真的见到了，那只金色乌鸦见到了於兰攸，忽然变成一个穿着金色长袍的少女缓缓地从树上降了下来，对着於兰攸说道：「你们终于来了，这片土地是我的父亲允诺要赐给你们的，我们是勇士『寒於』的后裔，掌管光明的太阳神族，如果你们能答应永远守护这株圣木，太阳将会永远照耀这片土地。」"
msgstr "Though the Golden Crow had always been the symbol of the sun in everyone's hearts, it was only a myth handed down by their ancestors. No one had imagined that after the long trek they would really see it. When the Golden Crow saw Yulan You, it suddenly turned into a young woman in a long golden robe and slowly came down from the tree. She said to Yulan You, \"You have come at last. This land is what my father promised to give you. We are the descendants of the warrior 'Hanyu,' the Sun God clan, keepers of the light. If you promise to guard this sacred tree forever, the sun will shine on this land forever.\""

msgid "金色乌鸦变成的少女名字叫做「君违」，后来嫁给了於兰攸做妻子，君违教导众人耕种、纺纱，并且为她的丈夫制定各种典章制度，从此以后於兰攸和他的族人们一直遵守和金色乌鸦的约定，守护着圣木。因为金色乌鸦的守护，过了七百年风调雨顺的时光，人口增加得很快，在向外拓垦的同时，又陆续和西方擅长狩猎与铸造的歧族人、东方擅长音乐与占卜的敖族、南方擅长经商与建筑的娄族互相融合，终于成为这个世界上最大的国家，所有远方的小国都称呼我们为「天朝」，由于於兰氏的帝王具有太阳神族的血统，因此也有「天子」的称号。"
msgstr "The young woman the Golden Crow had become was named \"Junwei,\" and she later married Yulan You. Junwei taught the people to farm and to spin, and laid down all manner of laws and institutions for her husband. From then on Yulan You and his people kept their pact with the Golden Crow and guarded the sacred tree. Under the Golden Crow's protection came seven hundred years of kind weather, and the population grew fast. As they spread out to clear new land, they merged one after another with the Qi people of the west, skilled at hunting and casting, the Ao people of the east, skilled at music and divination, and the Lou people of the south, skilled at trade and building, until at last they became the greatest nation in the world. All the small faraway countries called us the \"Celestial Empire,\" and because the emperors of the Yulan clan had the blood of the Sun God clan, they were also called the \"Son of Heaven.\""

msgid "但是就在距今约三百年前，发生了一件可怕的事，当时的皇宫之中，一群武士意外地在一处地窖里发现了一张羊皮，这张羊皮就是当初率领大家穿越大漠的君主商句所写的遗书，这份遗书不但提到了金色乌鸦，而且还提到许多后来发生的大事，简直就是一张神奇预言，发现这张羊皮的武士首领恰好是当时皇帝的叔父於兰淳焉，於兰淳焉是一位伟大的武士，曾经数度打败企图夺取圣木的北方蛮族，他见到遗书上提到，金色乌鸦出现之后每七百年，就会有一个可怕的妖魔出现，大杀苍生，以应金色乌鸦神通所欠的劫数，这个妖魔只有上古的宝剑「穿灵」才能镇住，而这把宝剑所藏的位置正是圣木的核心。"
msgstr "But about three hundred years ago, something terrible happened. In the imperial palace of the time, a band of warriors came upon a sheepskin by chance in a cellar. This sheepskin was the testament written by Shang Ju, the ruler who had led everyone across the great desert. It spoke not only of the Golden Crow but of many great events that came after; it was nothing less than a miraculous prophecy. The leader of the warriors who found the sheepskin happened to be the emperor's uncle, Yulan Chunyan. Yulan Chunyan was a great warrior who had several times defeated the northern barbarians trying to seize the sacred tree. He saw that the testament said that every seven hundred years after the Golden Crow appeared, a terrible demon would come forth and slaughter the people, to pay the debt owed for the Golden Crow's divine powers. Only the ancient sword \"Spiritpiercer\" could hold this demon down, and the sword was hidden in the very heart of the sacred tree."

msgid "於兰淳焉和皇帝商量的结果，决定劈开圣木取出宝剑，以防备妖魔出现，那圣木足足有一百个人合抱那么粗，一大群士兵用斧头砍了足足三天才将圣木砍倒，一阵天摇地动之后，穿灵宝剑终于出现在树洞中央，可是当於兰淳焉将宝剑拔起之后，一条黑影迅速地从地面窜了出来，原本明亮的天空一下子变暗了，百姓们都惊慌失措，只听到天空中传来阵阵低沉的吼声，过了足足一个时辰才又恢复光明。"
msgstr "Yulan Chunyan and the emperor talked it over and decided to split open the sacred tree and take out the sword, to guard against the demon's coming. The sacred tree was so thick it took a hundred people with arms linked to circle it; a great crowd of soldiers chopped at it with axes for three full days before it fell. After the heavens shook and the earth quaked, the sword Spiritpiercer at last appeared in the middle of the hollow. But when Yulan Chunyan pulled the sword out, a black shadow shot up out of the ground. The bright sky went dark at once, and the people panicked. Low roars rolled down from the sky, and only after a full two hours did the light return."

msgid "当天晚上，一只金色乌鸦出现在皇宫之中，说道：「你们今天做了一件大大的错事，将勇士寒於用宝剑镇压了五千年的『侮天鬼』放了出来，我的妹妹『璃虹』正在天上巡行，已经被这侮天鬼捉去了，侮天鬼现在正在四处寻找他的头颅，一旦被他找到，即使是集我全部族人的力量也无法镇服他，现在唯一的办法是找到另一把宝剑『旋芒』以及『寒於宝衣』，唯有这三件神器才能制服得了侮天鬼，寒於宝衣现在归月神族保管，旋芒宝剑却下落不明，侮天鬼的头颅被我的族人用强力法术封住，谅那妖魔两三百年内找不到，但是日子一久只怕终究隐藏不住，因此若你们三百年之内不能出现一个勇士消灭这妖魔，就真的大祸临头了。」"
msgstr "That night, a golden crow appeared in the palace and said, \"Today you have done a great, great wrong. You have set free the 'Heaven-Defier' that the warrior Hanyu held down with the sword for five thousand years. My younger sister 'Lihong' was making her rounds in the sky, and the Heaven-Defier has seized her. The Heaven-Defier is now searching everywhere for his head; once he finds it, even the strength of all my clan together could not subdue him. The only way now is to find the other sword, 'Whirling Edge,' and 'Hanyu's Robe.' Only these three divine artifacts can overcome the Heaven-Defier. Hanyu's Robe is now in the keeping of the Moon God clan, but the whereabouts of Whirling Edge are unknown. My clan has sealed the Heaven-Defier's head with powerful magic, and the demon will not find it for two or three hundred years. But as time goes on, it may not stay hidden in the end. So if within three hundred years no warrior appears to destroy this demon, a great disaster will truly be upon you.\""

msgid "金色乌鸦的名字叫做「杞庸」，他化身成一个金袍少年住在皇宫中教武士们各种剑术武功三十年，渐渐地这些武术慢慢流传到了民间，更有许多聪明才智之士加以变化出许多不同的武术，而演变出各种不同的门派，转眼间已过了将近三百年，这期间虽然偶尔有些旱灾水灾，但仍算风调雨顺，想是那侮天鬼只急着找回头颅，却并不多事杀戮，但是人们却渐渐将这件事忘了，不少人还将之斥为无稽之谈，荒谬之说，直到先帝即位，事情才又有了变化。"
msgstr "The golden crow's name was \"Qi Yong.\" He took the form of a young man in a golden robe and lived in the palace for thirty years, teaching the warriors all kinds of swordsmanship and martial arts. Little by little these arts spread among the common people, and many clever and talented people varied them into many different arts, which grew into all the different schools. In the blink of an eye nearly three hundred years went by. There were droughts and floods now and then, but on the whole the weather was kind; it seemed the Heaven-Defier only wanted to find his head again and went out of his way to kill no one. But people slowly forgot the matter, and many even dismissed it as baseless, absurd talk, until the late Emperor took the throne and things changed again."

msgid "先帝秉性聪慧，自幼即博览群书，尤其对先人留下的史籍更是详加考据，先帝曾仔细推敲商句遗书中最后两句话，推断那可能是指引旋芒宝剑所在的关键，虽然对祖先所留下来有关金色乌鸦的传说也是半信半疑，但是仍然陆续派出了许多武士探查，结果意外地发现了古书中「烟霞霓岚」四座仙城中的烟城，根据武士所带回来的消息，旋芒宝剑目前乃是属于岚城中一位仙人所有，只是这岚城「寻风而至，寻风而逝」，烟城百姓也是只闻其名，不知其所，先帝直到病危之中仍念念不忘寻找岚城之事。"
msgstr "The late Emperor was bright by nature and read widely from childhood; he studied the histories left by the ancestors with special care. He pored over the last two lines of Shang Ju's testament and concluded that they might be the key to where Whirling Edge lay. Though he only half believed the ancestors' legends of the Golden Crow, he still sent out many warriors one after another to search. To everyone's surprise, they found the Mist City, one of the four immortal cities of the old books: Mist, Glow, Rainbow and Wind. According to the news the warriors brought back, Whirling Edge now belongs to an immortal of the Wind City. But the Wind City \"comes with the wind and goes with the wind,\" and even the people of the Mist City know only its name, not where it is. Even as he lay dying, the late Emperor could not stop thinking about the search for the Wind City."

msgid "神话"
msgstr "Myth"

msgid "早在我们的先人来到这片土地之前，这里曾经是集天地万物浊气所形成的妖魔们盘踞的炼狱，到处都是终年燃烧着的土地与深不见底的沼泽，直到我们的始祖——也就是勇士「寒於氏」来到这里，他有一件水火不侵的宝衣，和两把神异的利剑「穿灵」与「旋芒」，寒於氏和妖魔大战了一十七日，妖魔的鲜血浇熄了燃烧的土地，尸体填平了无底的沼泽，当寒於氏斩下最后一只妖魔「侮天鬼」的头颅之后，他也力尽而死。"
msgstr "Long before our forebears came to this land, it was a purgatory held by demons formed from all the foul qi of heaven, earth and all things. Everywhere was land that burned all year round and swamps without bottom, until our first ancestor, the warrior \"Hanyu,\" came here. He had a robe that neither water nor fire could harm, and two wondrous swords, \"Spiritpiercer\" and \"Whirling Edge.\" Hanyu fought the demons for seventeen days. The demons' blood put out the burning land, and their corpses filled the bottomless swamps. When Hanyu cut off the head of the last demon, the \"Heaven-Defier,\" he too died, his strength spent."

msgid "寒於氏死后，元神却没有消失，他的魂魄化成了十三个精灵，每一个精灵各拥有寒於氏的一种神通，掌管着这个世界的万物，其中的第十三个精灵「区冥氏」就是我们人类最早的祖先。区冥氏不像她其他的十二个姊姊是不死的，但是她所拥有的神通是寒於氏最引以为傲的「再生」能力，区冥氏活到一百七十岁的时候，召集了她所有的姊妹，交代她们好好照顾自己的子女之后，便闭上眼睛死了。"
msgstr "After Hanyu died, his primal spirit did not vanish. His soul became thirteen spirits, each holding one of Hanyu's divine powers and governing all things in the world. The thirteenth spirit, \"Ouming,\" is the earliest ancestor of us humans. Unlike her twelve elder sisters, Ouming was not immortal, but the power she held was the one Hanyu was proudest of: \"rebirth.\" When Ouming reached the age of 170, she gathered all her sisters, asked them to take good care of her children, and closed her eyes and died."

msgid "区冥氏一共有一百个子女，后来分别成为世界上各个种族的祖先。"
msgstr "Ouming had 100 children in all, who later became the ancestors of every race in the world."

msgid "勇士寒於的魂魄所化成的十三个精灵，分别是太阳神「金乌」、月神「银蟾」、风神「大鹏」、雨神「天龙」、雷神「泽兽」、火神「凤凰」、山鬼「赤魈」、林鬼「青蛛」、川鬼「浊鱼」、原鬼「旱魃」、天灵「穹氤」、地灵「域摩」、人灵「区冥」，共有「六神」、「四鬼」、「三灵」。其中特别值得一提的是最后的三灵，她们所拥有的神通汇集了寒於氏的精、气、神，若是善加利用，威力将远远凌驾其他十位精灵之上。"
msgstr "The thirteen spirits that the warrior Hanyu's soul became are the Sun God \"Golden Crow,\" the Moon God \"Silver Toad,\" the Wind God \"Great Peng,\" the Rain God \"Heavenly Dragon,\" the Thunder God \"Marsh Beast,\" the Fire God \"Phoenix,\" the Mountain Ghost \"Red Imp,\" the Forest Ghost \"Green Spider,\" the River Ghost \"Murk Fish,\" the Plains Ghost \"Drought Fiend,\" the Heaven Soul \"Qiongyin,\" the Earth Soul \"Yumo\" and the Human Soul \"Ouming\": the \"Six Gods,\" the \"Four Ghosts\" and the \"Three Souls.\" Most worth mentioning are the last, the Three Souls. Their powers gather together Hanyu's Essence, Qi and Spirit, and used well, their might far surpasses that of the other ten spirits."

msgid "许多人都相信，区冥氏死了之后会不断地经由「转世」而继续复活，但是她的能力却全部分给了所有子女，因此人类能够凌驾于其他的虫鱼鸟兽之上，造就出伟大的成就，人类死亡之后，也会像区冥一样地转世再生，但是只有区冥能够保持每一生每一世的记忆，虽然再生的区冥氏所具有的能力和一般人类没有两样，但是她所累积的智慧是无人可及的。"
msgstr "Many people believe that after her death Ouming comes back to life again and again through \"reincarnation.\" But her powers were all divided among her children, and so humans could rise above the other creatures, insects, fish, birds and beasts, and achieve great things. When humans die, they too are reincarnated like Ouming, but only Ouming keeps the memories of every life. Though the reborn Ouming has no more power than any ordinary human, the wisdom she has gathered is beyond anyone's reach."

msgid "法门源流"
msgstr "The Roots of Magic"

msgid "所有的魔法依照能量来源的不同可分为两类：「法术」与「咒文」。"
msgstr "All magic falls into two kinds by the source of its power: \"Spells\" and \"Incantations.\""

msgid "所谓「法术」是指来自施法者自身的修为，以及自身所操控的能量所造成的魔法效果，这类魔法通常被视为高深的学问，并且是可以研究出「为什么？」的，法术的效果通常显著、直接、而且难以抗拒，尤其是当施术者的能力十分强大的时候。法术最初的起源是来自对于「咒文」力量的怀疑，并且在企图找出其力量根源的过程中逐步经由实验所建立起来的理论系统。"
msgstr "What is called \"Spells\" means magical effects that come from the caster's own cultivation and the energy the caster controls. This kind of magic is usually seen as deep learning, the kind where one can work out \"why?\" The effects of spells are usually marked, direct and hard to resist, especially when the caster is very powerful. Spells first arose from doubts about the power of \"Incantations,\" and their theory was built up step by step through experiment, in the course of trying to find the root of that power."

msgid "所谓「咒文」是指根据某种咒语、动作、仪式而与存在于宇宙中某种超然存在的生物或意志沟通，而藉其力量引发的魔法效果，这类魔法的历史比法术更早，而且这些「超然存在」的实体通常被人称为「神」、「魔鬼」、「精灵」等等，咒文宗教上的意义大于学术上的意义，但是又似乎并不完全是宗教上的力量（即：不管你信不信，或多或少都能产生实际的效果，而非单纯心理现象），一般使用咒文者很难探究「为什么」这样的咒文会引发这样的效果，咒文的来源全部都是来自古老的记载或无意中的发现。"
msgstr "What is called \"Incantations\" means magical effects brought about by communicating, through certain chants, gestures or rites, with some transcendent being or will in the universe and borrowing its power. This kind of magic is older than spells, and these \"transcendent\" beings are usually called \"gods,\" \"devils,\" \"spirits\" and so on. Incantations mean more as religion than as learning, yet they do not seem to be purely the power of religion either (that is: believe it or not, they produce real effects to a greater or lesser degree, and are not merely in the mind). Those who use incantations can hardly find out \"why\" an incantation causes the effect it does; all incantations come from ancient records or chance discoveries."

msgid "虽然有不少魔法到底是属于「法术」系或「咒文」系仍然存有争议，但是人们已经找到一种简单的方法来区分他们，那就是「法术」消耗的能量是「灵力」、「咒文」消耗能量是「法力」（由于咒文的历史远较法术来得更早，因此在当时普遍使用的「魔法」、「法力」等名词都是指咒文系魔法而言，沿用至今）。"
msgstr "Though there is still debate over whether quite a few kinds of magic belong to \"Spells\" or \"Incantations,\" people have found a simple way to tell them apart: \"Spells\" consume \"Mystic Power,\" and \"Incantations\" consume \"Arcane Power.\" (Because incantations are much older than spells, the words \"magic\" and \"Arcane Power\" in common use back then all referred to incantation magic, and the usage has lasted to this day.)"

msgid "「神通」，长期钻研佛法的高僧常常会因自己本身的修为，产生具有神奇力量的神通，如天眼通、大力神通等，愈是具有大智慧、大慈悲的高僧其神通愈强，这类的法术通常需要百分之百的精神集中，才能施展，但是所需耗费的灵力较少，而且大多是属于防御或辅助性质的功能。"
msgstr "\"Mystic Powers\": eminent monks who study the Buddhadharma for a long time often develop, through their own cultivation, powers of miraculous force, such as the Divine Eye and Great Strength. The greater a monk's wisdom and compassion, the stronger his powers. This kind of magic usually needs 100 percent concentration to perform, but costs relatively little Mystic Power, and most of it is defensive or supporting in nature."

msgid "「道法」，道家讲究清静无为，法天自然，因此道法修行到了某一个程度，就能够利用天地阴阳生化的道理，吸取天地之精华纳为己用，道法所涵盖的范围极广，但是受到天时、地利、与施法者本身的状态影响很大，但是只要这几个条件能够配合，道法的威力是无可抵御的。"
msgstr "\"Daoist Arts\": the Daoists value stillness and non-action and take nature as their model, so once Daoist arts are cultivated to a certain level, one can use the principles by which yin and yang give birth to and transform all things, drawing in the essence of heaven and earth for one's own use. Daoist arts cover a very wide range, and they are strongly affected by the time of heaven, the advantages of the ground and the state of the caster; but as long as these conditions come together, the might of Daoist arts cannot be withstood."

msgid "「仙术」，这是一门相当古老的修行法门，讲究炼气与长生不死之术，修炼仙术的人并不膜拜任何神祇，只集中于修炼自己的肉身，使之达到不朽的境地，进而羽化成仙，仙术除了在炼气方面相当杰出之外，还有许多炼丹的法门，但是一般人想要学习仙术并不容易，因为除了要有慧根之外，要找到愿意传授仙术的仙人也是一项非常艰困的修炼。"
msgstr "\"Immortal Arts\": a very old path of cultivation, devoted to refining qi and the arts of living forever. Those who cultivate immortal arts worship no god, and focus only on refining their own flesh until it reaches an undying state, then ascend as immortals. Besides being outstanding at refining qi, immortal arts also hold many methods of alchemy. But it is not easy for an ordinary person to learn them: besides needing a gift for it, finding an immortal willing to teach is itself a very hard trial."

msgid "「密法」，佛家的一门分支，以手印与咒文为主，详细情形并不清楚，但是密法是一门攻守兼备，系统精严的法术，使用密法的人通常也擅长使用法器战斗，他们的修行是以降妖伏魔为主，密法修行至高深处时，也能拥有某些类似「罗汉神通」的能力，和佛家是殊途同归的正道。"
msgstr "\"Esoteric Arts\": a branch of Buddhism, built mainly on hand seals and incantations. The details are not clear, but the esoteric arts are a strict and well-ordered system of magic, good at both attack and defense. Those who use them are usually skilled at fighting with ritual implements too, and their practice centers on subduing demons. When the esoteric arts are cultivated to great depth, one may also gain powers somewhat like the \"arhat powers\"; it is a righteous path that reaches the same end as Buddhism by another road."

msgid "「奇门」，又称茅山术，由于偏重治鬼与符箓咒术，往往被道家斥为旁门左道，但是奇门法术入门较易，且于临敌之际有其实用性在，加之不若正统道家那般虚无缥缈，因此一直拥有为数众多的人修习，虽然威力不如道法，但是近世经一位高人整理发扬，已经隐然有与正统道家分庭抗礼之势。"
msgstr "\"Qimen,\" also called Mount Mao arts: because it leans toward dealing with ghosts and toward talismans and incantations, Daoists often scorn it as a heterodox sideline. But Qimen is easier to get into and is practical when facing an enemy, and it is not as vague and elusive as orthodox Daoism, so it has always had a great many students. Though it is less powerful than Daoist arts, in recent times a master has gathered it up and developed it, and it has quietly come to rival orthodox Daoism."

msgid "「魔道」，这类法术的修炼者以精怪居多，人类亦有少数，分为天魔、地魔、人魔三种，由于修炼法门往往必须杀伤生命，被多数人强烈憎恨，但是魔道威力集道法与仙术之所长，又为求利己不择手段，不但进境迅速兼且危险，以致于各家法术之中均有克制魔道的研究与法术，可说是树敌最多的一门。"
msgstr "\"Demonic Arts\": most who cultivate this kind of magic are monsters and spirits, with a few humans. They divide into three kinds: heavenly demons, earthly demons and human demons. Because their methods of cultivation often require harming life, most people hate them bitterly. But demonic arts combine the strengths of Daoist arts and immortal arts, and since their followers will do anything for their own gain, they advance quickly and are dangerous besides. So every school of magic has its studies and spells for countering demonic arts, making it the path with the most enemies of all."

msgid "道士"
msgstr "Daoists"

msgid "道士是一群以修炼成仙，而达到「与天地同休，与日月同寿」之境界的修道人，和其他的宗教比较起来，道士对于「人」的地位看得相当崇高，认为天、地、人在宇宙中的地位是相等的，因此，道教的教主是一个「人」，而不是高高在上、和凡人之间有不可跨越之鸿沟的「神」。"
msgstr "Daoists are cultivators who seek to become immortals and reach the state of \"resting with heaven and earth, living as long as the sun and moon.\" Compared with other religions, Daoists hold the place of \"humans\" very high, and believe that heaven, earth and humans stand equal in the universe. So the head of the Daoist faith is a \"human,\" not a \"god\" high above, with an unbridgeable gulf between it and mortals."

msgid "道士的能力偏重于炼气，武术方面以内功、剑术见长，正统道家除炼气之外并不修习任何法术，但是许多道士往往会涉猎一些除妖降魔用的法术，以作为入山修炼时防身之用，有些支派的道士更发展成专研法术而舍弃修炼成仙的目的。"
msgstr "Daoists' abilities lean toward refining qi; in martial arts they excel at neigong and swordsmanship. Orthodox Daoists practice no magic besides refining qi, but many Daoists dabble in some magic for exorcising demons, to protect themselves when they go into the mountains to cultivate. Some branches of Daoists even went on to study magic alone, giving up the aim of becoming immortals."

msgid "天空中万里无云"
msgstr "Not a cloud in the sky"

msgid "几朵淡淡的云彩妆点著清朗的天空"
msgstr "A few faint clouds dot the clear sky"

msgid "白云在天空中飘来飘去"
msgstr "White clouds drift across the sky"

msgid "厚厚的云层堆积在天边"
msgstr "Thick clouds pile up on the horizon"

msgid "天空中乌云密布"
msgstr "Dark clouds crowd the sky"

msgid "微曦"
msgstr "Dawn"

msgid "东方的天空中开始出现一丝微曦。"
msgstr "A first glimmer of light appears in the eastern sky."

msgid "东方的天空已逐渐发白"
msgstr "The eastern sky is slowly turning pale"

msgid "日出"
msgstr "Sunrise"

msgid "太阳从东方的地平线升起了。"
msgstr "The sun rises over the eastern horizon."

msgid "太阳刚从东方的地平线升起"
msgstr "The sun has just risen over the eastern horizon"

msgid "上午"
msgstr "Morning"

msgid "太阳已经高高地挂在东方的天空中。"
msgstr "The sun now hangs high in the eastern sky."

msgid "太阳正高挂在东方的天空中"
msgstr "The sun hangs high in the eastern sky"

msgid "正午"
msgstr "Noon"

msgid "已经是正午了，太阳从你正上方照耀著大地。"
msgstr "It is noon. The sun shines down on the land from directly overhead."

msgid "现在是正午时分，太阳高挂在你的头顶正上方"
msgstr "It is the noon hour, and the sun stands right over your head"

msgid "下午"
msgstr "Afternoon"

msgid "太阳开始从西方的天空中慢慢西沉。"
msgstr "The sun begins its slow descent in the western sky."

msgid "太阳正高挂在西方的天空中"
msgstr "The sun hangs high in the western sky"

msgid "傍晚"
msgstr "Dusk"

msgid "傍晚了，太阳的馀晖将西方的天空映成一片火红。"
msgstr "Evening falls, and the sun's last light paints the western sky fiery red."

msgid "一轮火红的夕阳正徘徊在西方的地平线上"
msgstr "A fiery red sun lingers on the western horizon"

msgid "夜晚"
msgstr "Night"

msgid "夜晚降临了。"
msgstr "Night has fallen."

msgid "夜幕笼罩著大地"
msgstr "Night's curtain covers the land"

msgid "午夜"
msgstr "Midnight"

msgid "已经是午夜了。"
msgstr "It is midnight."

msgid "夜幕低垂，满天繁星"
msgstr "Night hangs low, and the sky is full of stars"

msgid "枝"
msgstr "piece"

msgid "花紫会一脉的内功，龙头陆得财身怀此功。练功须在有水的地方，既耗气也耗内力。"
msgstr "A neigong of the Beggars' Guild line; Lu Decai, the Guild's Dragon Head, has it. It must be trained where there is water, and it costs both Qi and Inner Force."

msgid "伏蛟功只能在有水的地方练。"
msgstr "Serpent-Taming Force can only be practiced where there is water."

msgid "你的气不够。"
msgstr "You don't have enough Qi."

msgid "你的内力不够"
msgstr "You don't have enough Inner Force."

msgid "振远镖局的看家刀法，总镖头陈天星凭它和天邪神掌在江湖上博得「刀掌双绝」之名。招名如「春风拂人醉」「远山伴人痴」「柳叶随人笑」，刀势轻飘，撩斩之间不见锋芒。"
msgstr "The Far-Road Escorts' own house saber. With it and the Wayward Palm, Chief Escort Chen Tianxing won the name \"Double Master of Blade and Palm\" in the jianghu. Its moves have names like \"Drunk on the Breeze,\" \"Lost in Far Hills\" and \"Willow Leaves Laugh\"; the blade floats lightly, and its edge never shows between the upward sweeps and the slashes."

msgid "你必须先找一把刀，才能练刀法。"
msgstr "You need to find a saber before you can practice saber work."

msgid "你的体力不够练这门刀法，还是先休息休息吧。"
msgstr "You don't have the strength for this saber style. Better rest a while first."

msgid "$N使一招「春风拂人醉」，手中$w轻飘飘地向$n的$l斩去！"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Drunk on the Breeze,\" {N:his} $w floating lightly down in a slash at $n's $l!"

msgid "$N金刃劈风，$w随著一招「远山伴人痴」由下而上撩往$n的$l"
msgstr "$N's golden edge splits the wind, and with \"Lost in Far Hills\" {N:his} $w sweeps up from below at $n's $l"

msgid "$N身形一转，一招「飞花逐人香」$w刀光不定，斩向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:spin|spins} around—\"Petals Chase the Scent\"—{N:his} $w flickering this way and that as it slashes at $n's $l"

msgid "$N舞动$w，一招「柳叶随人笑」迅捷无伦地劈向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:whirl|whirls} {N:his} $w, and \"Willow Leaves Laugh\" cleaves at $n's $l with matchless speed"

msgid "$N手中$w一晃，一招「倩影惹人怜」往$n的$l斜斜砍出一刀"
msgstr "$N {N:flick|flicks} {N:his} $w—\"A Shadow to Pity\"—and {N:hack|hacks} slantwise at $n's $l"

msgid "$N提刀过肩，蓄劲发力，一招「芦雪碎人影」直劈$n$l"
msgstr "$N {N:raise|raises} the blade over {N:his} shoulder, {N:gather|gathers} force, and with \"Reed Snow Breaks Shadows\" {N:chop|chops} straight down at $n's $l"

msgid "$N移步侧身，使一招「彩蝶灼人衣」刀光霍霍斩向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:shift|shifts} {N:his} feet and {N:turn|turns} sideways, using \"Butterflies Singe Silk,\" blade light flashing as it slashes at $n's $l"

msgid "封山派开山祖师锺虔在羿水之滨的石廊峡练武时，每到夜里便与出来吸血的血蛾扑击为戏，仰望北斗七星的方位变幻，发现血蛾无论如何进攻都脱不出七星的规律，苦思几日夜创成这套步法，第一次试招便杀了六只血蛾。它专门对付身法敏捷的敌人，以自然的规律料敌机先，对方一动，便已踏到正确的闪避方位。"
msgstr "When Zhong Qian, founder of the Empty Mountain School, trained in Stone Corridor Gorge on the banks of the Yi River, he spent his nights sparring for sport with the blood moths that came out to drink blood. Watching the shifting positions of the Big Dipper, he found that however the moths attacked, they never broke from the pattern of the seven stars. After several days and nights of hard thought he created these steps, and the first time he tried them he killed six blood moths. They are made for nimble opponents: reading the enemy ahead of time by nature's own pattern, the moment the other side moves, you have already stepped to the right place to dodge."

msgid "你的气或内力不够，不能练倒乱七星步法。"
msgstr "Your Qi or Inner Force isn't enough to practice the Seven-Star Chaos Steps."

msgid "你的内力不够，没有办法练倒乱七星步。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force isn't enough to practice the Seven-Star Chaos Steps."

msgid "$n一招「天玑离枢」轻轻巧巧地避了开去。"
msgstr "$n {n:use|uses} \"Pearl Star Departs\" and deftly {n:slip|slips} out of the way."

msgid "只见$n身影一晃，一式「天璇乱步」早已避在七尺之外。"
msgstr "$n {n:flicker|flickers} — \"Turning Star Stagger\"—and {n:are|is} already seven feet away."

msgid "$n使出「倒转天权」，轻轻松松地闪过。"
msgstr "$n {n:use|uses} \"Balance Star Turned\" and {n:dodge|dodges} with ease."

msgid "$n左足一点，一招「逐影天枢」腾空而起，避了开去。"
msgstr "$n {n:tap|taps} off with the left foot and, with \"Shadow-Chasing Pivot,\" {n:soar|soars} into the air, out of the way."

msgid "可是$n使一招「风动玉衡」，身子轻轻飘了开去。"
msgstr "But $n {n:use|uses} \"Wind on Jade Balance\" and {n:drift|drifts} lightly away."

msgid "$n身影微动，已经藉一招「开阳薄雾」轻轻闪过。"
msgstr "$n barely {n:move|moves}, and with \"Yang Star in Mist\" {n:have|has} already slipped lightly past."

msgid "但是$n一招「瑶光音迟」使出，早已绕到$N身後！"
msgstr "But $n {n:use|uses} \"Starlight Lingers\" and {n:are|is} already behind $N!"

msgid "相传是武术之神、太阳神君杞庸在西天大山中见到灵兽天邪虎后有所领悟而创的内功心法，与模拟天邪虎神态的天邪神掌相配。威力极强，消耗体力也极大：运起来能回气、提升战力、以内力强压杀气，最深的一手是「天邪虎啸」，一声长吼震伤身边所有的人。修习须有足够的杀气撑着，苦练下去，定力也会提高。"
msgstr "A neigong method said to have been created by the god of martial arts, the Sun Lord Qi Yong, after he saw the spirit beast the Wayward Tiger in the great mountains of the far west; it pairs with the Wayward Palm, which mimics the tiger's bearing. It is immensely powerful and immensely draining: exerted, it restores Qi, raises your fighting strength and crushes Bloodlust under Inner Force, and its deepest move is the \"Wayward Tiger Roar,\" one long roar that wounds everyone around you. Training it takes enough Bloodlust to sustain it, and with hard practice your Resolve rises too."

msgid "天邪神功只能用学的，或是从运用中增加熟练度。"
msgstr "The Wayward Art can only be learned, or improved by using it."

msgid "你的杀气不够，无法领悟更高深的天邪神功。"
msgstr "Your Bloodlust isn't enough to grasp the higher Wayward Art."

msgid "由於你苦练天邪神功，你的定力提高了"
msgstr "Thanks to your hard training in the Wayward Art, your Resolve has improved."

msgid "茅山派的法术，以治鬼除魔为主，多是攻敌的法术，兼有符咒之法：紫幽、青冥、苍灵「幽冥三箭」各有所长，又能召唤金甲天兵下凡护法、开「阴阳眼」看见鬼魂，还能驱动尸体。须以天师正道为根基，修为不够便领悟不了更深的道术。"
msgstr "The Mount Mao School's sorcery, chiefly for subduing ghosts and driving out demons. Most of it is attack magic, with talismans and charms besides: the \"Three Netherworld Arrows,\" Purple Gloom, Azure Dark and Grey Spirit, each have their strengths; it can also call down gold-armored heavenly soldiers to stand guard, open \"Ghost Sight\" to see the dead, and drive corpses. It must rest on the Way of the Celestial Masters; without enough cultivation, the deeper arts cannot be grasped."

msgid "你的天师正道修为不够，无法领悟更高深的茅山道术。"
msgstr "Your cultivation in the Way of the Celestial Masters isn't deep enough to grasp the higher Mount Mao Sorcery."

msgid "你的精神无法集中。"
msgstr "You can't focus your mind."

msgid "你闭目凝神，神游物外，开始修习茅山道术中的法术...."
msgstr "You close your eyes and gather your mind, letting your spirit wander beyond the world, and begin practicing the spells of Mount Mao Sorcery..."

msgid "可是你心思一乱，变出了一只面目狰狞的$N！"
msgstr "But your thoughts slip, and you conjure up a hideous $N!"

msgid "你的魂魄正被$N缠住，快把它除掉吧！"
msgstr "Your soul is caught in the grip of the $N. Get rid of it, quick!"

msgid "你的魂魄还没有全部收回，赶快杀死你的$N吧！"
msgstr "Your soul isn't fully back yet. Kill your $N, quick!"

msgid "道家的主要学问，茅山派大多数武功、法术都要以它为基础。天师正道修行不够就强练道家武功法术，很容易走火入魔、坠入魔道；杀气太重的人，也修不了它。"
msgstr "The chief learning of the Daoists; most of the Mount Mao School's martial arts and spells rest on it. Force Daoist arts or spells without enough cultivation in the Way of the Celestial Masters and you can easily lose control of your qi and fall onto a demonic path; and someone with too much Bloodlust cannot cultivate it at all."

msgid "法术类技能必须用学的或是从实战中获取经验。"
msgstr "Spell skills must be learned, or gained through real combat experience."

msgid "你的杀气太重，无法修炼天师正道。"
msgstr "Your Bloodlust is too heavy to cultivate the Way of the Celestial Masters."

msgid "道家的一门内功。人食五谷，肉身都带五谷秽气，谷衣心法把秽气排出体外，修成一层护体之气，叫作「谷衣」——神仙所修称「丹衣」，妖魔所修称「血衣」「土衣」。心法共分十层，练到第五层「小成」左眼珠变成金色，第十层「大成」两眼皆金；运起来能疗伤，也能以「灵神诀」把内力化为法力。"
msgstr "A Daoist neigong. Everyone who eats grain carries its foulness in the flesh; the Grain Robe Heart Method drives that foulness out of the body and builds a layer of protective qi called the \"Grain Robe.\" What immortals cultivate is called the \"Elixir Robe,\" and what demons cultivate the \"Blood Robe\" or \"Earth Robe.\" The method has ten levels: at the fifth, \"Lesser Mastery,\" the left eye turns gold; at the tenth, \"Great Mastery,\" both eyes are gold. Exerted, it can heal wounds, and with the \"Spirit Formula\" it can turn Inner Force into Arcane Power."

msgid "谷衣心法只能用学的，或是从运用中增加熟练度。"
msgstr "The Grain Robe Heart Method can only be learned, or improved by using it."

msgid "你的魔力不够，无法提升谷衣心法的造诣。"
msgstr "Your Arcane Power isn't enough to advance the Grain Robe Heart Method."

msgid "茅山派的剑法，招名「三清归真」「众士护佑」「群魔辟易」「西出紫关」，取道家护法驱魔之意。练这门剑须有相当的内力。"
msgstr "The Mount Mao School's sword style. Its move names, \"The Three Pure Ones,\" \"Guarded by the Host,\" \"Demons Give Way\" and \"Out the Purple Pass,\" carry the Daoist sense of guarding the faith and driving out demons. Practicing this sword takes a good deal of Inner Force."

msgid "你按著所学练了一遍天师剑法。"
msgstr "You run through the Celestial Master Sword as you were taught."

msgid "你的内力或气不够，没有办法练习天师剑法。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force or Qi isn't enough to practice the Celestial Master Sword."

msgid "你的内力不够，没有办法练天师剑法。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force isn't enough to practice the Celestial Master Sword."

msgid "$N一招「三清归真」，手中$w挽起几个剑花，刺向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"The Three Pure Ones,\" {N:his} $w spinning a few sword flowers as it thrusts at $n's $l"

msgid "$N身形一变，一招「众士护佑」，$w罩向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:shift|shifts} {N:his} stance—\"Guarded by the Host\"—and {N:his} $w closes over $n's $l"

msgid "$N挥动$w，一招「天人合一」挟著闪闪剑光袭向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:swing|swings} {N:his} $w—\"Heaven and Man as One\"—striking at $n's $l in a flash of sword light"

msgid "$N手中$w一抡，使出「群魔辟易」往$n的$l恶狠狠的砍去"
msgstr "$N {N:whirl|whirls} {N:his} $w and, with \"Demons Give Way,\" {N:hack|hacks} savagely at $n's $l"

msgid "$N一招「西出紫关」，$w一带，轻轻划向$n$l"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Out the Purple Pass,\" drawing {N:his} $w lightly across $n's $l"

msgid "$N身剑合一，幻化成一道光华，一招「乾坤一掷」扑向$n"
msgstr "$N and {N:his} sword become one, a single streak of light—\"All on One Throw\"—hurling at $n"

msgid "宫商声律的学问。音律之学有成，灵性会随之提高；步玄派的步玄七诀以音律为根底，音律修为不够，便领悟不了更深的诀窍。"
msgstr "The study of notes and tuning. As your study of music grows, your Spirituality rises with it; the Mystic Step School's Seven Secrets are grounded in music, and without enough of it you cannot grasp their deeper tricks."

msgid "由於你学习音律之学有成，你的灵性提高了"
msgstr "Your study of music has borne fruit, and your Spirituality has improved."

msgid "吹拉弹拨的技艺，与音律之学互为表里。步玄派掌门骆云舟也传这一门。"
msgstr "The craft of blowing, bowing, plucking and strumming, the other face of the study of music. Luo Yunzhou, Master of the Mystic Step School, teaches it too."

msgid "临敌时凭风声辨出兵刃来路的本事，专门用来对付看不见的敌人：鬼魂、隐形的妖物，或是在光线昏暗的地方交手。"
msgstr "The knack of telling where a weapon is coming from by the sound of the wind it makes, meant for enemies you cannot see: ghosts, invisible monsters, or a fight in poor light."

msgid "顺手牵羊的手上功夫，下手越熟越不易被人察觉，运气好坏也有几分关系。花紫会龙头陆得财懂这一手，街上的飞贼也靠它吃饭。"
msgstr "Light-fingered handwork: the more practiced your hand, the less likely you are to be noticed, and luck has something to do with it too. Lu Decai, the Beggars' Guild's Dragon Head, knows the trick, and the street thieves live by it."

msgid "模拟灵兽天邪虎神态的掌法，与天邪神功相配而成，招式有「大天罗式」「小天罗式」「雪阳三连月」「灵动五方鼓」「风雷七星断」。须空手练，天邪神功火候不足、内力太弱都练不成。"
msgstr "A palm style that mimics the bearing of the spirit beast the Wayward Tiger, made to pair with the Wayward Art. Its moves include \"Great Heaven's Net,\" \"Lesser Heaven's Net,\" \"Three Moons on Snow,\" \"Five-Quarter Drum\" and \"Seven-Star Thunder.\" It must be practiced bare-handed, and cannot be learned with too little Wayward Art or too weak an Inner Force."

msgid "你的内力不够了，休息一下再练吧。"
msgstr "You're out of Inner Force. Rest a while before you train again."

msgid "练天邪神掌必须空手。"
msgstr "The Wayward Palm must be practiced bare-handed."

msgid "你的天邪神功火候不足，无法练天邪掌法。"
msgstr "Your Wayward Art isn't mature enough to practice the Wayward Palm."

msgid "你的内力太弱，无法练天邪掌法。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force is too weak to practice the Wayward Palm."

msgid "$N使出一招「大天罗式」，右掌穿出击向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Great Heaven's Net,\" {N:his} right palm darting out at $n's $l"

msgid "$N使出一招「大天罗式」，左掌化虚为实击向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Great Heaven's Net,\" {N:his} left palm turning from feint to real as it strikes at $n's $l"

msgid "$N使出天邪掌法「小天罗式」，如鬼魅般欺至$n身前，一掌拍向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} the Wayward Palm's \"Lesser Heaven's Net,\" closing in on $n like a phantom and slapping a palm at $n's $l"

msgid "$N双掌一错，使出「雪阳三连月」，对准$n的$l连续拍出三掌"
msgstr "$N {N:cross|crosses} {N:his} palms and, with \"Three Moons on Snow,\" {N:strike|strikes} at $n's $l three times in a row"

msgid "$N左掌画了个圈圈，右掌推出，一招「灵动五方鼓」击向$n$l"
msgstr "$N {N:circle|circles} the left palm and {N:push|pushes} out the right—\"Five-Quarter Drum\"—striking at $n's $l"

msgid "$N使出「风雷七星断」，身形散作七处同时向$n的$l出掌攻击"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Seven-Star Thunder,\" {N:his} body scattering into seven at once, every one of them striking at $n's $l"

msgid "$N吐气扬声，一招「气撼九重天」双掌并力推出"
msgstr "$N {N:breathe|breathes} out with a shout—\"Qi Shakes Nine Heavens\"—and {N:drive|drives} both palms forward together"

msgid "本是道家魔道的武功。三百年前一位天邪派前辈在首穷山一处废墟中得到六阴剑谱，谱分天殇、追魂、绝识三部，他年轻时练武伤了经脉，只练成追魂一部，另外两部至今下落不明。天邪派所传的追魂剑经三百多年演变，戾气消去不少而劲道更增，虽已失传了不少阴毒招式，仍是武林中赫赫有名的剑法。"
msgstr "Originally a martial art of the demonic Daoist path. Three hundred years ago an elder of the Wayward School found the Six-Chaos Sword manual in a ruin on Mount Shouqiong. The manual came in three parts, Tianshang, Soul-Chasing and Jueshi, but he had damaged his meridians training in his youth and mastered only the Soul-Chasing part; the other two are lost to this day. Over three hundred years the Soul-Chasing Sword handed down in the Wayward School has shed much of its venom and gained in force, and though many of its vicious moves are lost, it is still a famous sword style in the wulin."

msgid "你按著所学练了一遍六阴追魂剑法。"
msgstr "You run through the Six-Chaos Sword as you were taught."

msgid "你的内力或气不够，没有办法练习六阴追魂剑。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force or Qi isn't enough to practice the Six-Chaos Sword."

msgid "你的内力不够，没有办法练六阴追魂剑。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force isn't enough to practice the Six-Chaos Sword."

msgid "你突然觉得一股恶气冲上心头，只觉得想杀人...."
msgstr "Suddenly a foul rage surges into your heart, and all you want is to kill..."

msgid "$N使一招「群魔乱舞」，手中$w狂风骤雨般地向$n的$l连攻数剑"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Demons Run Riot,\" {N:his} $w raining blow after blow at $n's $l like a storm"

msgid "$N身形一转，一招「厉鬼缠身」$w斩向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:spin|spins} — \"A Ghost Clings Close\"—and {N:his} $w slashes at $n's $l"

msgid "$N舞动$w，一招「百鬼夜行」挟著闪闪剑光刺向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:whirl|whirls} {N:his} $w—\"Night Parade of Ghosts\"—thrusting at $n's $l in a flash of sword light"

msgid "$N手中$w一抖，使出「饿鬼拦路」往$n的$l刺出一剑"
msgstr "$N {N:flick|flicks} {N:his} $w and, with \"Hungry Ghost Blocks the Road,\" {N:thrust|thrusts} at $n's $l"

msgid "$N手中$w剑光暴长，一招「鬼影幢幢」往$n$l刺去"
msgstr "The light of $N's $w leaps out—\"Shadows of Ghosts\"—thrusting at $n's $l"

msgid "$N手中$w直指$n$l，一招「秋坟鬼唱」发出逼人剑气刺去"
msgstr "$N {N:point|points} {N:his} $w straight at $n's $l—\"Autumn Grave Song\"—thrusting with a piercing sword qi"

msgid "仿蝙蝠夜飞的身法，招名「寒蝠掠江」「轻蝠点梢」「夜蝠旋身」「火蝠曳空」，侧身一让，便叫来招扑了个空。天邪派与振远镖局都有高手使这门身法。"
msgstr "Footwork modeled on bats in night flight, with move names like \"Cold Bat Skims River,\" \"Light Bat on a Twig,\" \"Night Bat Wheels\" and \"Fire Bat in the Sky\": one sideways lean, and the attack lunges at empty air. Masters of both the Wayward School and the Far-Road Escorts use it."

msgid "你的体力太差了，不能练火蝠身法。"
msgstr "Your strength is too low to practice the Pyrobat Steps."

msgid "可是$p侧身一让，使出「寒蝠掠江」，$N这一招扑了个空。"
msgstr "But $n {n:lean|leans} aside with \"Cold Bat Skims River,\" and $N's move lunges at empty air."

msgid "$p身形微晃，使出「灵蝠轻逝」，有惊无险地避开了$N这一招。"
msgstr "$n {n:sway|sways} slightly with \"Spirit Bat Vanishes,\" narrowly escaping $N's move."

msgid "$p身随意转，一式「轻蝠点梢」，倏地往一旁挪开了三尺，避过了这一招。"
msgstr "$n {n:turn|turns} at will—\"Light Bat on a Twig\"—and in a flash {n:shift|shifts} three feet aside, clear of the move."

msgid "却见$p足不点地，一招「夜蝠旋身」，往旁窜开数尺，躲了开去。"
msgstr "But $n, feet barely touching the ground, {n:use|uses} \"Night Bat Wheels\" and {n:dart|darts} several feet aside, out of reach."

msgid "只见$p一招「火蝠曳空」，身形向上拔起数尺高，闪了过去。"
msgstr "$n {n:use|uses} \"Fire Bat in the Sky,\" shooting several feet straight up and out of the way."

msgid "晚月庄的舞步身法，招名「蕙芳下凡」「双成献舞」「织女于归」「天女散花」「嫦娥奔月」，翩然起舞之间，已飘出数尺之外。只有女子才能练，又看灵性；勤练舞技，容貌也会更添光彩。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor's dance footwork, with move names like \"Orchid Fairy Descends,\" \"Shuangcheng Dances,\" \"The Weaver Girl Weds,\" \"Maiden Scatters Flowers\" and \"Chang'e to the Moon\": in the middle of a graceful dance, the dancer has already drifted several feet away. Only women can learn it, and it depends on Spirituality; practice the dance hard and your looks grow lovelier too."

msgid "你的精神太差了，不能练七宝天岚舞。"
msgstr "Your Spirit is too low to practice Stormdance."

msgid "七宝天岚舞只有女性才能练。"
msgstr "Only women can practice Stormdance."

msgid "你的灵性不够，没有办法练七宝天岚舞。"
msgstr "Your Spirituality isn't enough to practice Stormdance."

msgid "由於你勤练舞技，你的容貌提高了"
msgstr "Thanks to your hard practice of the dance, your Looks have improved."

msgid "但$n一式「蕙芳下凡」随著轻轻一叹，顺著$N的招式飘出六尺之外！"
msgstr "But $n, with a soft sigh, {n:use|uses} \"Orchid Fairy Descends\" and {n:drift|drifts} six feet away along the line of $N's move!"

msgid "$n双脚微动翩然起舞，一招「双成献舞」，堪堪闪过$N的这招！"
msgstr "$n {n:stir|stirs} {n:his} feet into a graceful dance—\"Shuangcheng Dances\"—and only just {n:slip|slips} past $N's move!"

msgid "$n使出「织女于归」，突然幻化成一双倩影，$N从其中一人透体而过！"
msgstr "$n {n:use|uses} \"The Weaver Girl Weds\" and suddenly {n:split|splits} into two lovely figures—$N {N:pass|passes} straight through one of them!"

msgid "$n一式「天女散花」，自水袖中散出一片花雨，$N被花影迷蒙了双眼，与$n擦肩而过"
msgstr "$n {n:use|uses} \"Maiden Scatters Flowers,\" scattering a rain of petals from {n:his} long sleeves; blinded by the flurry, $N {N:brush|brushes} right past $n"

msgid "$n一招「嫦娥奔月」，轻轻一纵优雅的自$N头顶越过！"
msgstr "$n {n:use|uses} \"Chang'e to the Moon,\" springing lightly and gracefully over $N's head!"

msgid "神通一类法门的根底：灵力的上限看它，施展神通要用灵力。山烟寺的八识神通便激发在它上面。"
msgstr "The grounding of the mystic powers: your Mystic Power cap rests on it, and working a mystic power costs Mystic Power. Mountain Mist Temple's Eight Consciousnesses is applied on top of it."

msgid "念咒施法的根底：法力的上限看它，冥思积下的法力才有地方存。茅山道术、奇门遁甲这些法术都激发在它上面。"
msgstr "The grounding for casting spells: your Arcane Power cap rests on it, and it gives the Arcane Power you build by meditating somewhere to go. Spells such as Mount Mao Sorcery and Qimen Dunjia are applied on top of it."

msgid "道家旁门的一路学问，绝尘派的奇门遁甲以它为根基，小天魔道修为不够，便领悟不了更深的遁甲之术。它只能向师父学，或在实战中体会；每有长进，杀气也跟着重一分。"
msgstr "A learning of the Daoist side paths. The Dustless School's Qimen Dunjia rests on it, and without enough Lesser Demon Lore you cannot grasp the deeper arts of Qimen Dunjia. It can only be learned from a shifu, or grasped in real combat, and every gain makes your Bloodlust a little heavier."

msgid "绝尘派的法术。口中念咒，大喝一声「疾！」，或化作黑气、金光、火焰、长虹、大雾遁去无踪，或以黑气、金光、火焰、海水、大木把敌人困在当中；战到危急，还能召来天将相助。须以小天魔道为根基。"
msgstr "The Dustless School's sorcery. Chant a spell and shout \"Swift!\" and you either vanish without a trace as black vapor, golden light, flame, a long rainbow or thick fog, or trap the enemy inside black vapor, golden light, flame, seawater or great timbers; when a fight turns desperate, it can even call down a heavenly general to help. It must rest on Lesser Demon Lore."

msgid "你的小天魔道修为不够，无法领悟更高深的奇门遁甲之术。"
msgstr "Your Lesser Demon Lore isn't deep enough to grasp the higher arts of Qimen Dunjia."

msgid "绝尘派的本门内功。绝尘子本是释家中人，后得奇人指点，悟得道家真谛，佛道双修，自号绝尘，创下此派；这门心法只能向师父学，或在运功中慢慢精熟。"
msgstr "The Dustless School's own neigong. Juechenzi was once a Buddhist; later, guided by a remarkable teacher, he grasped the true meaning of the Dao, cultivated Buddhism and Daoism both, named himself Juechen and founded this school. The method can only be learned from a shifu, or slowly perfected by exerting it."

msgid "绝尘心法只能用学的或是从运用中增加熟练度。"
msgstr "The Dustless Heart Method can only be learned, or improved by using it."

msgid "绝尘派所传的杖法，招式与山烟寺的流云杖法相同，是「天光乍现」「雨后初晴」「浮云写意」「游龙穿云」四式，起手一杖专扫下盘。练这门杖须有相当的膂力，膂力不足的人宜先把内力练足。"
msgstr "The staff style handed down in the Dustless School. Its moves are the same as Mountain Mist Temple's Cloudflow Staff, the four forms \"First Light Breaks,\" \"Clear After Rain,\" \"Brushwork of Clouds\" and \"Dragon Through Cloud,\" and its opening stroke sweeps low. This staff takes considerable Strength; those short of it should build up their Inner Force first."

msgid "你必须先找一根木杖或者是类似的武器，才能练杖法。"
msgstr "You need to find a staff or something like it before you can practice staff work."

msgid "你的体力不够练这门杖法，还是先休息休息吧。"
msgstr "You don't have the strength for this staff style. Better rest a while first."

msgid "你的膂力还不够，也许该练一练内力来增强力量。"
msgstr "Your Strength isn't enough yet. Perhaps you should train your Inner Force to build it up."

msgid "$N使一招「天光乍现」，手中$w扫向$n下盘！"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"First Light Breaks,\" {N:his} $w sweeping low at $n's legs!"

msgid "$N挥起$w，一招「雨後初晴」攻向$n$l！"
msgstr "$N {N:swing|swings} up {N:his} $w—\"Clear After Rain\"—striking at $n's $l!"

msgid "$N横过手中$w，使出「浮云写意」击向$n$l！"
msgstr "$N {N:turn|turns} {N:his} $w crosswise and, with \"Brushwork of Clouds,\" {N:strike|strikes} at $n's $l!"

msgid "$N使出一招「游龙穿云」，$w一挺撞向$n$l！"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Dragon Through Cloud,\" {N:his} $w jutting forward to ram $n's $l!"

msgid "山烟寺的杖法，招名「天光乍现」「雨后初晴」「浮云写意」「游龙穿云」，可攻可守。番坊日陀罗寺的龙若法王也传这门杖法。练这门杖须有相当的膂力。"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple's staff style, with the moves \"First Light Breaks,\" \"Clear After Rain,\" \"Brushwork of Clouds\" and \"Dragon Through Cloud\"; it serves for attack and defense alike. Dharma King Longruo of the Ritola Temple in the Foreign Quarter teaches it too. This staff takes considerable Strength."

msgid "五百多年前北冥大泽的黑妖蛇族入侵，一群佛门高僧集思广益，悟出这套心法为百姓疗伤，主要用来迅速医治战斗中所受的皮肉创伤。运起功来既能医治自己，也能替别人疗伤；须以大乘佛法为根基，佛法修为跟不上，便领会不了更深的境界。"
msgstr "More than five hundred years ago, when the Black Demon Serpent clan of the Beiming Marsh invaded, a group of eminent Buddhist monks pooled their wisdom and arrived at this method to heal the common people. Its main use is to swiftly treat the flesh wounds of battle. Exerted, it can heal yourself or others; it must rest on the Mahayana Dharma, and if your Dharma falls behind, you cannot grasp its deeper levels."

msgid "莲华心法只能用学的，或是从运用中增加熟练度。"
msgstr "The Lotus Heart Method can only be learned, or improved by using it."

msgid "你的大乘佛法修为不够，无法领会更高深的莲华心法。"
msgstr "Your cultivation of the Mahayana Dharma isn't deep enough to grasp the higher Lotus Heart Method."

msgid "从天竺传来的一部内功，性子是火性的：运起来浑身发热，专克阴寒。只能用学的，没有运功的法门；中原只有日陀罗寺的人会，独眼头陀那只眼就是练它练坏的。"
msgstr "A neigong brought from India, fiery by nature: exerting it heats the whole body, and it is the bane of yin cold. It can only be learned, and has no method of exertion. In the Central Plains only the people of the Ritola Temple know it; training it is what ruined the One-Eyed Ascetic's eye."

msgid "婆萝蜜多心经只能用学的。"
msgstr "The Heart Sutra can only be learned."

msgid "佛门的根本学问，莲华心法、八识神通都以它为根基。杀气太重的人，修不了大乘佛法。"
msgstr "The root learning of Buddhism; the Lotus Heart Method and the Eight Consciousnesses both rest on it. Someone with too much Bloodlust cannot cultivate the Mahayana Dharma."

msgid "你的杀气太重，无法修炼大乘佛法。"
msgstr "Your Bloodlust is too heavy to cultivate the Mahayana Dharma."

msgid "佛门弟子的日课，晨钟暮鼓之间念诵经文。山烟寺、日陀罗寺的僧人都会这一门。"
msgstr "The daily devotion of Buddhist disciples: chanting the sutras between the morning bell and the evening drum. The monks of Mountain Mist Temple and the Ritola Temple all know it."

msgid "佛家一门十分神奇的神通法术，由六百年前的高僧空正大师传下。神通分为八识，各以人的一种隐藏潜力为动力，如今传下来的有三识：心识救醒昏迷濒死之人，游识一念之间便到你见过的人身边，空识把灵力化为潜能。须与高深的佛法相辅，佛法修为不够便学不了。"
msgstr "A most wondrous Buddhist mystic art, handed down six hundred years ago by the eminent monk Master Kongzheng. Its powers are divided into eight senses, each driven by one of a person's hidden potentials, and three survive today: the Heart Sense wakes those who lie unconscious and near death, the Drifting Sense takes you in a single thought to the side of anyone you have met, and the Void Sense turns Mystic Power into Potential. It must go hand in hand with deep Buddhist learning; without enough, it cannot be learned."

msgid "你的佛法修为还不够高深，无法学习八识神通。"
msgstr "Your Buddhist cultivation isn't deep enough yet to learn the Eight Consciousnesses."

msgid "使锤一类重兵器的根底，凭的是一身力气。"
msgstr "The grounding for hammers and other heavy weapons; it relies on sheer strength."

msgid "使斧的根底，大开大合，一斧下去要劈得开。"
msgstr "The grounding of the axe: big, open swings, and each one has to split what it hits."

msgid "使匕首一类短刃的根底，贴身近打，出手要快。"
msgstr "The grounding for daggers and other short blades: close-in fighting, and the hand has to be fast."

msgid "使钢叉一类长兵的根底。阴间的鬼卒，手里多是钢叉。"
msgstr "The grounding for tridents and other long weapons. The ghost soldiers of the Underworld mostly carry tridents."

msgid "晚月庄的指法，只有女子才能练，须空手。招名「菊楼采月」「雪桥翦梅」「柳亭簪花」「桃坟扑蝶」，身影忽前忽后，一转身指尖已点到要害。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor's finger art. Only women can learn it, and it must be practiced bare-handed. Its moves are \"Chrysanthemum Moon,\" \"Snow Bridge Plum,\" \"Hairpin Blossom\" and \"Peach Grave Butterfly\": the figure darts forward and back, and with one turn a fingertip has already touched a vital point."

msgid "你的内力不够了。"
msgstr "You're out of Inner Force."

msgid "你的精神无法集中了，休息一下再练吧。"
msgstr "You can't keep your mind focused. Rest a while before you train again."

msgid "柔虹指是只有女子才能练的武功。"
msgstr "Only women can learn the Soft Rainbow Finger."

msgid "练柔虹指必须空手。"
msgstr "The Soft Rainbow Finger must be practiced bare-handed."

msgid "$N左手一挥，一招「菊楼采月」右手点向$n$l"
msgstr "$N {N:wave|waves} the left hand, and with \"Chrysanthemum Moon\" {N:jab|jabs} the right at $n's $l"

msgid "右手食指"
msgstr "right forefinger"

msgid "$N使一招「雪桥翦梅」，身影忽前忽後，突然一转身左手往$n的$l点去"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Snow Bridge Plum,\" darting forward and back, then suddenly {N:turn|turns} and {N:jab|jabs} the left hand at $n's $l"

msgid "左手中指"
msgstr "left middle finger"

msgid "$N身法稍顿，左手一扬使出「柳亭簪花」往$n的$l点去"
msgstr "$N {N:pause|pauses} for a breath, then {N:raise|raises} the left hand in \"Hairpin Blossom,\" jabbing at $n's $l"

msgid "只见$N纤腰一摆，陡然滑出数尺，右手顺著来势一招「桃坟扑蝶」往$n的$l点去"
msgstr "$N {N:sway|sways} {N:his} slender waist and suddenly {N:glide|glides} several feet, the right hand riding the momentum in \"Peach Grave Butterfly,\" jabbing at $n's $l"

msgid "晚月庄的鞭法，从「寒风起兮」「漫天飞雪」到「狂风骤雪」「风雪交加」，鞭影如满天飞雪，虚虚实实地袭人。须有足够的内力才能练。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor's whip style, from \"Cold Wind Rises\" and \"Snow Fills the Sky\" to \"Gale and Squall\" and \"Blizzard\": the whip's shadows fill the air like snow, striking now false, now true. It takes enough Inner Force to practice."

msgid "你按著所学练了一遍寒雪鞭法。"
msgstr "You run through the Cold Snow Whip as you were taught."

msgid "你的内力或气不够，没有办法练习寒雪鞭法。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force or Qi isn't enough to practice the Cold Snow Whip."

msgid "你的内力不够，没有办法练寒雪鞭法, 多练些内力再来吧。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force isn't enough to practice the Cold Snow Whip. Build up more Inner Force and come back."

msgid "你必须先找一条鞭子才能练鞭法。"
msgstr "You need to find a whip before you can practice whip work."

msgid "$N使一招「寒风起兮」，手中$w抖得笔直向$n的$l连刺数鞭"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Cold Wind Rises,\" snapping {N:his} $w out straight and stabbing it at $n's $l again and again"

msgid "$N身形一转，一招「漫天飞雪」$w幻出满天鞭影，虚虚实实地袭向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:spin|spins} — \"Snow Fills the Sky\"—and {N:his} $w fills the air with whip shadows, false and true, striking at $n's $l"

msgid "$N力贯$w，一招「雪花翩翩」点点鞭影飘浮不定地点向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:drive|drives} force into {N:his} $w—\"Dancing Snowflakes\"—and flecks of whip shadow drift unpredictably down on $n's $l"

msgid "$N手中$w一抖，一招「积雪三尺」以一个怪异的角度往$n下盘卷去"
msgstr "$N {N:flick|flicks} {N:his} $w—\"Snow Three Feet Deep\"—and it coils at $n's legs from a strange angle"

msgid "$N手中一紧，使招「狂风骤雪」，手里$w一鞭接著一鞭不停地抽向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:tighten|tightens} {N:his} grip and, with \"Gale and Squall,\" {N:lash|lashes} {N:his} $w at $n's $l, stroke after stroke without pause"

msgid "$N一招「风雪交加」手中$w舞出一片鞭影扫向$n全身"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Blizzard,\" {N:his} $w whirling a sheet of whip shadows over $n from head to foot"

msgid "三十年前以一柄拂尘横扫武林的前辈异人残心师太所创的内功心法，纯走阴柔之路，发出的内劲寒冷无比；传说她曾在沙牢山一掌冻住七只雪狼，堪称当今寒冰掌一路中最凌厉的奇功。交手时阴寒之气常叫对方打个寒噤，运起「意寒睨」，更能以冰冷如刀的眼神伤敌。"
msgstr "A neigong created by Abbess Canxin, the remarkable elder who swept the wulin with a horsetail whisk thirty years ago. It follows the yin and the soft alone, and the inner force it sends out is bitterly cold; legend says she once froze seven snow wolves with a single palm on Mount Shalao, and it may be the deadliest of all the ice-palm arts today. In a fight its yin chill often sets an opponent shivering, and exerting \"Chill Gaze\" lets you wound an enemy with a look as cold as a blade."

msgid "$N的招式挟著一股阴寒无比的劲风使得$n不禁打了个寒噤。"
msgstr "$N's move carries a gust so deathly cold that $n can't help but shiver."

msgid "意寒功只能用学的，或是从运用中增加熟练度。"
msgstr "Cold Intent Force can only be learned, or improved by using it."

msgid "天山一脉的独门内功，只能向师父学，或在运功中慢慢精熟；雪影剑法必须以它为根基。"
msgstr "The Tianshan line's own neigong. It can only be learned from a shifu, or slowly perfected by exerting it; the Snowshade Sword must rest on it."

msgid "天山雪影心法只能用学的或是从运用中增加熟练度。"
msgstr "The Tianshan Snowshade Heart Method can only be learned, or improved by using it."

msgid "天山雪影剑，招名「回光幻电」「风霜碎影」「残阳照雪」「冰谷初虹」「长空雷隐」「断石狼烟」，剑光疾如闪电，身形飘忽如雪影。必须配合天山魔教的独门雪影心法才能练，内力不足也练不成。"
msgstr "The Tianshan Snowshade Sword, with moves named \"Phantom Lightning,\" \"Frost Breaks Shadows,\" \"Setting Sun on Snow,\" \"Ice Valley Rainbow,\" \"Thunder in Open Sky\" and \"Broken Stone Beacon\": the sword's light is quick as lightning, the body drifts like a shadow on snow. It can only be learned together with the Tianshan Demon Order's own Snowshade Heart Method, and not without enough Inner Force."

msgid "你按著所学练了一遍雪影剑法。"
msgstr "You run through the Snowshade Sword as you were taught."

msgid "你的内力或气不够，没有办法练习雪影剑法。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force or Qi isn't enough to practice the Snowshade Sword."

msgid "你的内力不够，没有办法练雪影剑法。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force isn't enough to practice the Snowshade Sword."

msgid "雪影剑法必须配合天山魔教的独门雪影心法才能练。"
msgstr "The Snowshade Sword can only be practiced together with the Tianshan Demon Order's own Snowshade Heart Method."

msgid "$N使一招「回光幻电」，手中$w幻一条疾光刺向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Phantom Lightning,\" {N:his} $w becoming a streak of swift light that thrusts at $n's $l"

msgid "$N使出天山雪影剑中的「风霜碎影」，$w连挥剑光霍霍斩向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} the Tianshan Snowshade Sword's \"Frost Breaks Shadows,\" {N:his} $w flashing again and again as it slashes at $n's $l"

msgid "$N一招「残阳照雪」，纵身飘开数尺，手中$w斩向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Setting Sun on Snow,\" floating several feet aside as {N:his} $w slashes at $n's $l"

msgid "$N手中$w中宫直进，一式「冰谷初虹」对准$n的$l刺出一剑"
msgstr "$N {N:drive|drives} {N:his} $w straight down the middle—\"Ice Valley Rainbow\"—thrusting at $n's $l"

msgid "$N纵身一跃，手中$w一招「长空雷隐」对准$n的$l斜斜刺出一剑"
msgstr "$N {N:leap|leaps}, and {N:his} $w comes slanting down at $n's $l—\"Thunder in Open Sky\""

msgid "$N的$w凭空一指，一招「断石狼烟」刺向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N's $w points out of nowhere—\"Broken Stone Beacon\"—thrusting at $n's $l"

msgid "步玄派的本门内功，只能向师父学，或在运功中慢慢精熟；步玄七诀、小步玄剑都要以它为根基。"
msgstr "The Mystic Step School's own neigong. It can only be learned from a shifu, or slowly perfected by exerting it; the Mystic Step Seven Secrets and the Lesser Mystic Step Sword both rest on it."

msgid "步玄心法只能学，或是从运用中增加熟练度。"
msgstr "The Mystic Step Heart Method can only be learned, or improved by using it."

msgid "步玄派的剑法，招名「暮雪三叹」「处子弄笛」「阳谷白练」，出剑急如骤雨。须先有相当火候的步玄心法，内力不足也练不成。"
msgstr "The Mystic Step School's sword style, with moves named \"Three Sighs at Dusk,\" \"A Maiden's Flute\" and \"Sunny Vale Silk\"; the sword comes fast as a sudden storm. It needs a well-tempered Mystic Step Heart Method first, and cannot be learned without enough Inner Force."

msgid "你按著所学练了一遍小步玄剑。"
msgstr "You run through the Lesser Mystic Step Sword as you were taught."

msgid "你的内力或气不够，没有办法练习小步玄剑。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force or Qi isn't enough to practice the Lesser Mystic Step Sword."

msgid "你的步玄心法火候还不够。"
msgstr "Your Mystic Step Heart Method isn't mature enough yet."

msgid "你的内力不够，没有办法练小步玄剑。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force isn't enough to practice the Lesser Mystic Step Sword."

msgid "$N使一招「暮雪三叹」，手中$w急如骤雨般地刺向$n$l"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Three Sighs at Dusk,\" {N:his} $w thrusting at $n's $l fast as a sudden storm"

msgid "$N身形一晃，一招「处子弄笛」向$n$l刺出一剑"
msgstr "$N {N:sway|sways} — \"A Maiden's Flute\"—and {N:thrust|thrusts} at $n's $l"

msgid "$N舞动$w，一招「阳谷白练」挟著闪闪剑光刺向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:whirl|whirls} {N:his} $w—\"Sunny Vale Silk\"—thrusting at $n's $l in a flash of sword light"

msgid "$N手中$w一个圈转，使出「薰容逐电」中锋直进刺向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:circle|circles} {N:his} $w once, then with \"Scented Lightning\" {N:drive|drives} the point straight in at $n's $l"

msgid "花紫会的手上功夫，忽掌忽爪，招名多带市井气——「撺锅手」「撮灰手」「梁上君子」「随棍上身」，劲力一吐，能听见对方骨节作响。须空手练，内力太弱的人练不成。"
msgstr "The Beggars' Guild's handwork, now palm, now claw, its move names full of the street: \"Wok-Tossing Hand,\" \"Ash-Pinch Hand,\" \"Gentleman on the Beam,\" \"Up the Stick.\" When its force lets go, you can hear the other side's joints crack. It must be practiced bare-handed, and those with too weak an Inner Force cannot learn it."

msgid "练油流麻香手必须空手。"
msgstr "The Greasy Pepper Hand must be practiced bare-handed."

msgid "你的内力太弱，无法练油流麻香手。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force is too weak to practice the Greasy Pepper Hand."

msgid "你听到「喀啦」一声轻响，竟似是骨碎的声音！"
msgstr "You hear a faint \"crack\"—it sounds like bone breaking!"

msgid "$N劲力一吐，$n的$l发出「喀」地一声爆响！"
msgstr "$N {N:let|lets} {N:his} force loose, and $n's $l gives a loud \"crack\"!"

msgid "只听见$n的$l「喀」地一声 ..."
msgstr "There is a \"crack\" from $n's $l..."

msgid "$N左掌微分，右手一长使出一招「毒龙扑舟」，抓向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:part|parts} the left palm slightly and {N:shoot|shoots} out the right in \"Dragon on the Boat,\" clawing at $n's $l"

msgid "$N倏地一个转身，双手一翻「撺锅手」直掼$n$l"
msgstr "$N {N:whirl|whirls} around, both hands flipping over—\"Wok-Tossing Hand\"—slamming straight into $n's $l"

msgid "$N身子微斜，随即跨出一步，左手忽掌忽爪使出「撮灰手」，拍向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:lean|leans} slightly, then {N:step|steps} in, the left hand now palm, now claw—\"Ash-Pinch Hand\"—slapping at $n's $l"

msgid "$N使出「青蛇十段锦」，双手滑溜异常对准$n的$l抓去"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Green Snake Brocade,\" both hands uncannily slippery as they claw at $n's $l"

msgid "$N左手虚晃，右掌飘飘，一招「梁上君子」击向$n$l"
msgstr "$N {N:feint|feints} with the left, the right palm drifting—\"Gentleman on the Beam\"—striking at $n's $l"

msgid "$N使出「拨草寻履」，凌空跃起，冷不防在落地前对准$n$l踢出一脚"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Shoe in the Grass,\" leaping into the air and, just before landing, kicking without warning at $n's $l"

msgid "$N右手在$n$l划过，随後一招「随棍上身」左爪又向同一方位抓到"
msgstr "$N's right hand rakes across $n's $l, and then, with \"Up the Stick,\" {N:his} left claw comes at the same spot"

msgid "招名全出自《短歌行》——「对酒当歌」「人生几何」「譬如朝露」「去日苦多」……弯刀似月，刀势常由下而上撩斩。官府的带刀侍卫、高门大户的护院多使这一路刀法。"
msgstr "Every move name comes from \"A Short Song\": \"Sing Over Wine,\" \"How Long Is a Life,\" \"Like Morning Dew,\" \"Gone Days Are Many\"... The curved saber is like the moon, and its strokes often sweep up from below. The yamen's Armed Guards and the Estate Guards of great houses mostly use this saber."

msgid "$N使一招「对酒当歌」，手中$w风似地向$n的$l斩去！"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Sing Over Wine,\" {N:his} $w slashing at $n's $l like the wind!"

msgid "$N弯刀似月，$w随著一招「人生几何」由下而上撩往$n的$l"
msgstr "$N's curved blade is like the moon, and with \"How Long Is a Life\" {N:his} $w sweeps up from below at $n's $l"

msgid "$N身形一转，一招「譬如朝露」$w如朝露闪烁，斩向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:spin|spins} — \"Like Morning Dew\"—{N:his} $w glinting like dew as it slashes at $n's $l"

msgid "$N舞动$w，一招「去日苦多」往$n的$l斜斜砍出一刀"
msgstr "$N {N:whirl|whirls} {N:his} $w—\"Gone Days Are Many\"—and {N:hack|hacks} slantwise at $n's $l"

msgid "$N手中$w一晃，一招「慨当以慷」迅捷无伦地劈向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:flick|flicks} {N:his} $w, and \"Stirred to the Heart\" cleaves at $n's $l with matchless speed"

msgid "$N提气丹田，身型咋展，一招「忧思难忘」直劈$n$l"
msgstr "$N {N:draw|draws} qi up from the dantian and suddenly {N:unfold|unfolds} — \"Sorrow Unforgotten\"—chopping straight at $n's $l"

msgid "$N移步侧身，使一招「何以解忧」刀光霍霍斩向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:shift|shifts} {N:his} feet and {N:turn|turns} sideways, using \"What Eases Sorrow,\" blade light flashing as it slashes at $n's $l"

msgid "招名取自《秋风辞》，从「秋风起兮白云飞」到「箫鼓鸣兮发棹歌」，身影一晃，便已避在数尺之外。练这门步法须有相当的内力；官府的侍卫、衙役常与短歌刀法一同修习。"
msgstr "The move names come from \"The Autumn Wind,\" from \"White Clouds Fly\" to \"The Rowing Song\"; one sway, and you are already several feet away. This footwork takes considerable Inner Force; the yamen's guards and bailiffs often train it alongside the Shortsong Blade."

msgid "$n一招「秋风起兮白云飞」轻轻巧巧地避了开去。"
msgstr "$n {n:use|uses} \"White Clouds Fly\" and deftly {n:slip|slips} out of the way."

msgid "只见$n身影一晃，一式「草木黄落兮雁南归」早已避在七尺之外。"
msgstr "$n {n:flicker|flickers} — \"Geese Fly South\"—and {n:are|is} already seven feet away."

msgid "$n使出「兰有秀兮菊有芳」，轻轻松松地闪过。"
msgstr "$n {n:use|uses} \"Orchids in Bloom\" and {n:dodge|dodges} with ease."

msgid "$n左足一点，一招「怀佳人兮不能忘」腾空而起，避了开去。"
msgstr "$n {n:tap|taps} off with the left foot and, with \"Unforgotten Beauty,\" {n:soar|soars} into the air, out of the way."

msgid "可是$n使一招「泛楼船兮济汾河」，身子轻轻飘了开去。"
msgstr "But $n {n:use|uses} \"Ships on the Fen\" and {n:drift|drifts} lightly away."

msgid "$n身影微动，已经藉一招「横中流兮扬素波」轻轻闪过。"
msgstr "$n barely {n:move|moves}, and with \"Waves Midstream\" {n:have|has} already slipped lightly past."

msgid "但是$n一招「箫鼓鸣兮发棹歌」使出，早已绕到$N身後！"
msgstr "But $n {n:use|uses} \"The Rowing Song\" and {n:are|is} already behind $N!"

msgid "但是$n身形飘忽，轻轻一纵，一招「欢乐极兮哀情多」，避开这一击。"
msgstr "But $n {n:drift|drifts}, {n:spring|springs} lightly—\"Joy Turns to Sorrow\"—and {n:avoid|avoids} the blow."

msgid "$n身形往上一拔，一招「少壮几时兮奈老何」，一个转折落在数尺之外。"
msgstr "$n {n:shoot|shoots} upward—\"How Long Is Youth\"—and with a twist {n:land|lands} several feet away."

msgid "密宗一路的掌法，招名「苦海端无涯」「地狱似有门」「天堂却无路」「万念皆是空」，虚实相生；招架时能以双掌夹住来刃，或以「粘」字诀引偏兵器。须空手练。"
msgstr "A palm style of the Tantric line, with moves named \"A Shoreless Sea,\" \"Hell Has a Gate,\" \"No Road to Heaven\" and \"All Thought Is Void,\" feint and true giving rise to each other. When parrying it can clap an incoming blade between both palms, or lead a weapon aside with the \"Stick\" secret. It must be practiced bare-handed."

msgid "练密宗大手印必须空手。"
msgstr "The Tantric Mahamudra must be practiced bare-handed."

msgid "$N使出一招「苦海端无涯」，左掌虚幌，右掌穿出击向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"A Shoreless Sea,\" feinting with the left palm as the right darts out at $n's $l"

msgid "$N使出一招「地狱似有门」，左掌化虚为实击向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Hell Has a Gate,\" {N:his} left palm turning from feint to real as it strikes at $n's $l"

msgid "$N使出密宗大手印中的「天堂却无路」，一掌拍向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} the Tantric Mahamudra's \"No Road to Heaven,\" slapping a palm at $n's $l"

msgid "$N双掌一错，使出「密宗为独尊」，对准$n的$l连续拍出"
msgstr "$N {N:cross|crosses} {N:his} palms and, with \"Tantra Above All,\" {N:strike|strikes} at $n's $l again and again"

msgid "$N左掌立于胸前，右掌推出，一招「万念皆是空」击向$n$l"
msgstr "$N {N:raise|raises} the left palm before {N:his} chest and {N:push|pushes} out the right—\"All Thought Is Void\"—striking at $n's $l"

msgid "$N使出「佛云以杀止杀」，身形凌空飞起，从空中当头向$n的$l出掌攻击"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Kill to End Killing,\" flying up into the air and striking down at $n's $l from above"

msgid "外门护体硬功：闭目凝神，气走全身，不躲不闪也能硬受来招。"
msgstr "An external hardening art for the body: close your eyes, gather your mind, send qi through the whole body, and you can take a blow head-on without dodging or flinching."

msgid "逍遥派一路的内功，讲究文墨修养：读书识字的造诣跟不上，小无相功便无法再进。只能向人学，或在运功中慢慢精熟。"
msgstr "A neigong of the Carefree School line that values literary cultivation: if your reading and writing can't keep up, the Lesser Formless Force can advance no further. It can only be learned from someone, or slowly perfected by exerting it."

msgid "小无相功只能用学的或是从运用中增加熟练度。"
msgstr "The Lesser Formless Force can only be learned, or improved by using it."

msgid "你的文学素养不够无法提升小无相功的造诣。"
msgstr "Your literary learning isn't enough to advance the Lesser Formless Force."

msgid "大内侍卫营的刀法，七式「值门」「出巡」「提灯」「锁宫」「拿下」「护驾」「天明」，一招一式都在宫门、长街、殿上。侍卫营总教头冯策的刀谱末页写着一句：「刀在鞘里的时候最多。」"
msgstr "The saber of the Palace Guard Barracks, seven forms: \"Gate Watch,\" \"On Patrol,\" \"Lift the Lamp,\" \"Lock the Palace,\" \"Take Him,\" \"Guard the Throne,\" \"Daybreak,\" every one of them at a palace gate, on a long street, in a hall. On the last page of the saber manual of Feng Ce, the barracks' Chief Instructor, one line is written: \"A saber spends most of its time in the sheath.\""

msgid "$N横刀当胸，一招「值门」$w刀背一磕，顺势削向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:hold|holds} the blade level across {N:his} chest—\"Gate Watch\"—knocking with the back of {N:his} $w, then shaving on at $n's $l"

msgid "$N脚下一错，一招「出巡」$w贴着身子递出，直取$n的$l！"
msgstr "$N {N:shift|shifts} {N:his} footing—\"On Patrol\"—and {N:his} $w slides out close along the body, straight for $n's $l!"

msgid "$N刀尖一挑，一招「提灯」$w晃过$n眼前，刀锋却落向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:flick|flicks} up the point—\"Lift the Lamp\"—{N:his} $w flashing past $n's eyes while the edge falls on $n's $l"

msgid "$N沉肩坠肘，一招「锁宫」$w自上而下劈向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:sink|sinks} shoulders and elbows—\"Lock the Palace\"—and {N:his} $w chops down from above at $n's $l"

msgid "$N欺身而上，一招「拿下」$w刀柄撞向$n的$l，刀刃跟着就到"
msgstr "$N {N:close|closes} in—\"Take Him\"—ramming the hilt of {N:his} $w into $n's $l, the edge right behind it"

msgid "$N退半步护住身后，一招「护驾」$w画了个半圆，扫过$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:step|steps} half a pace back to cover what is behind {N:him} — \"Guard the Throne\"—and {N:his} $w draws a half circle across $n's $l"

msgid "$N大喝一声，一招「天明」$w自下而上斜劈，刀光照亮了$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:give|gives} a great shout—\"Daybreak\"—and {N:his} $w cuts slanting up from below, its light shining on $n's $l"

msgid "关北槐阳王府骑兵的马上刀法，七式从「扬鞭」「回马」「斩缰」到「破阵」「归鞘」，刀自下而上撩出。刀谱每一页的边上都写着同一句话：「撩，不是砍。」"
msgstr "The mounted saber of the House of Huaiyang's riders Beyond the Pass. Seven forms, from \"Raise the Whip,\" \"Turn the Horse\" and \"Cut the Reins\" to \"Break the Line\" and \"Sheathe,\" the saber sweeping up from below. On the edge of every page of the manual the same line is written: \"Sweep, don't chop.\""

msgid "$N手中$w一扬，一招「扬鞭」自下而上撩向$n的$l！"
msgstr "$N {N:raise|raises} {N:his} $w—\"Raise the Whip\"—sweeping up from below at $n's $l!"

msgid "$N身子一拧，一招「回马」$w反手撩出，刀光从$n的$l掠过"
msgstr "$N {N:twist|twists} — \"Turn the Horse\"—and {N:his} $w sweeps out backhand, its light skimming past $n's $l"

msgid "$N矮身一刀，一招「斩缰」$w贴地撩向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:drop|drops} low for a cut—\"Cut the Reins\"—and {N:his} $w sweeps up along the ground at $n's $l"

msgid "$N$w一抖，一招「卷沙」刀风卷起地上的沙土，斜斜撩往$n的$l"
msgstr "$N's $w quivers—\"Whirling Sand\"—its wind lifting the sand off the ground as it sweeps slantwise up at $n's $l"

msgid "$N踏步欺进，一招「踏雪」$w由肩上撩落，直取$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:step|steps} in close—\"Tread the Snow\"—and {N:his} $w sweeps down from the shoulder, straight for $n's $l"

msgid "$N大喝一声，一招「破阵」$w连撩三刀，刀刀奔$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:give|gives} a great shout—\"Break the Line\"—and {N:his} $w sweeps up three times in a row, every stroke at $n's $l"

msgid "$N手腕一翻，一招「归鞘」$w收势时顺手一撩，刀背扫过$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:turn|turns} {N:his} wrist—\"Sheathe\"—and as {N:his} $w comes back it flicks up once more, the back of the blade sweeping across $n's $l"

msgid "番坊铁盾会的剑法，传自流落东方的大秦剑手：盾在前，剑在后，左臂圆盾挡住来招，右手短剑从盾下刺出，七式自「盾墙」至「盾下一剑」。臂上没有盾，铁盾会不教；入了鬼笠馆的人，铁盾会也不教。"
msgstr "The sword style of the Iron Shield Guild in the Foreign Quarter, handed down from Daqin swordsmen who drifted east: shield in front, sword behind. The round shield on the left arm stops the attack, and the short sword in the right hand stabs out from under it, in seven forms from \"Shield Wall\" to \"Under the Shield.\" With no shield on your arm, the Iron Shield Guild will not teach you; and anyone who has joined Ghost Hat Hall, the Guild will not teach either."

msgid "你举着盾，把铁盾剑法练了一遍：盾在前，剑在后。"
msgstr "Shield raised, you run through the Iron Shield Sword: shield in front, sword behind."

msgid "你的内力或气不够，没有办法练习铁盾剑法。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force or Qi isn't enough to practice the Iron Shield Sword."

msgid "你得先拿一把剑——短剑最好。"
msgstr "You need a sword first. A short sword is best."

msgid "盾呢？没盾的剑法不是我们的剑法。"
msgstr "Your shield? A sword without a shield is not our sword."

msgid "你是鬼笠馆的人。铁盾会的剑法，不教鬼笠馆。"
msgstr "You are of Ghost Hat Hall. The Iron Shield Guild's sword is not taught to Ghost Hat Hall."

msgid "$N左臂一抬，一招「盾墙」盾面迎上$n的$l，$w从盾沿底下刺出"
msgstr "$N {N:raise|raises} {N:his} left arm—\"Shield Wall\"—the face of the shield meeting $n's $l as {N:his} $w stabs out from under its rim"

msgid "$N盾身一侧，一招「侧刺」$w贴着盾沿直刺$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:tilt|tilts} the shield—\"Side Thrust\"—and {N:his} $w runs along its rim straight at $n's $l"

msgid "$N踏前一步，一招「盾撞」整面盾撞向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:step|steps} forward—\"Shield Bash\"—slamming the whole shield into $n's $l"

msgid "$N手腕一沉，一招「短锋」$w只探出半尺，点向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:drop|drops} {N:his} wrist—\"Short Point\"—{N:his} $w reaching out barely half a foot to jab at $n's $l"

msgid "$N盾面一收，一招「回盾」盾沿磕开来势，$w顺势划向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:draw|draws} the shield in—\"Shield Return\"—its rim knocking the attack aside as {N:his} $w follows through across $n's $l"

msgid "$N盾后$w连刺三下，一招「连刺」剑剑奔$n的$l"
msgstr "From behind the shield $N {N:stab|stabs} {N:his} $w three times—\"Triple Thrust\"—every one at $n's $l"

msgid "$N矮身藏在盾后，一招「盾下一剑」$w从盾底下猛地刺向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:crouch|crouches} behind the shield—\"Under the Shield\"—and {N:his} $w stabs hard from beneath it at $n's $l"

msgid "番坊倭人浪人武馆鬼笠馆的刀法，刀窄而弯，拔刀、横扫、下劈、纳刀、退步五式之外，另有一式「一刀」。门规与中原相反：一击之内定生死。铁盾会的弟子，鬼笠馆不教。"
msgstr "The saber of Ghost Hat Hall, the school of the Japanese ronin in the Foreign Quarter. The blade is narrow and curved; besides five forms, Draw, Sweep, Downcut, Sheathing and Step Back, there is one more: \"One Stroke.\" Its rule is the opposite of the Central Plains': life or death within one stroke. Disciples of the Iron Shield Guild, Ghost Hat Hall will not teach."

msgid "你出刀，收刀，把鬼笠刀法练了一遍——一刀，只出一次。"
msgstr "You draw, you sheathe, and run once through the Ghost Hat Blade: one stroke, given only once."

msgid "你的内力或气不够，没有办法练习鬼笠刀法。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force or Qi isn't enough to practice the Ghost Hat Blade."

msgid "刀呢？没刀的刀法不是刀法。"
msgstr "Your blade? A blade art with no blade is no art."

msgid "你是铁盾会的人。盾在前的，用不着刀。"
msgstr "You are of the Iron Shield Guild. One who keeps the shield in front has no need of a blade."

msgid "$N手按刀柄，一招「拔刀」$w出鞘的一瞬斜斜划向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:rest|rests} a hand on the hilt—\"Draw\"—and in the instant {N:his} $w leaves the sheath it slashes slantwise across $n's $l"

msgid "$N$w平举，一招「横扫」刀光齐腰扫向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N's $w comes up level—\"Sweep\"—its light sweeping waist-high at $n's $l"

msgid "$N双手握刀举过头顶，一招「下劈」$w直劈$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:raise|raises} the blade overhead in both hands—\"Downcut\"—and {N:his} $w chops straight down at $n's $l"

msgid "$N$w收势回鞘，一招「纳刀」刀背顺势磕向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N's $w turns back toward the sheath—\"Sheathing\"—and on the way the back of the blade knocks at $n's $l"

msgid "$N退了半步，一招「退步」$w在退势里反撩$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:step|steps} half a pace back—\"Step Back\"—and, still retreating, {N:his} $w sweeps back up at $n's $l"

msgid "$N双手握刀，一动不动，忽然一招「一刀」——$w从头顶直劈而下，一击之内定生死，直取$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:grip|grips} the blade in both hands and {N:stand|stands} utterly still, then suddenly, \"One Stroke\": {N:his} $w cleaves straight down from overhead, life or death within one stroke, straight for $n's $l"

msgid "青石山路"
msgstr "Bluestone Mountain Road"

msgid "铁链崖"
msgstr "Iron Chain Cliff"

msgid "晚月山路"
msgstr "Latemoon Mountain Road"

msgid "槐阳城"
msgstr "Huaiyang"

msgid "草原"
msgstr "Steppe"

msgid "工地"
msgstr "Worksite"

msgid "古冢"
msgstr "The Barrow"

msgid "封山剑派是当今武林中最大的一支剑派。相传三位剑术名家在封山灵狐顶相互印证所学，创出封山剑法；招式不难学，难在剑意，讲究不抢先，等对手露出空子。七十年前一代掌门把乔阴柳家的家传拳法融进剑意，创出柳家拳，补上了剑派近身的短处。雪亭镇的淳风武馆是这一派的门户，镇上的后生多在那里学拳。"
msgstr "The Empty Mountain School is the largest sword school in the wulin today. Legend says three famous swordmasters created the Empty Mountain Sword by testing their skills against one another on Spirit Fox Peak of the Sealed Mountain. Its moves are not hard to learn; the hard part is the spirit of the sword, which does not strike first but waits for the opponent to leave an opening. Seventy years ago one of its Masters worked the Liu family's fist of Tallshade into the spirit of the sword and created the Liu Family Fist, covering the school's weakness at close quarters. Pure Wind Hall in Snow Pavilion is the school's gateway, and most of the town's young men learn their fists there."

msgid "柳家拳没什么花样：先打实一拳，人就贴上去了；贴上去，重拳才够得着，一拳比一拳沉。"
msgstr "There's nothing fancy about the Liu Family Fist: land one real punch and you're in close; once you're in close, the heavy punches can reach, each one harder than the last."

msgid "最怕的是打空。一拳落了空，人就被拉开了，再重的拳头也只砸在风上——得重新打实一拳，才能再贴上去。"
msgstr "What it fears most is a miss. Miss one punch and you're pulled back out, and even the heaviest fist only hits wind. You have to land a real one again before you can get back in close."

msgid "所以这拳是抢来的。对面守得稳，你就先用快的、虚的去碰，碰着了再压上去。"
msgstr "So this fist is something you take by force. If the other side guards well, touch them first with the quick ones, the feints, and once you connect, press in."

msgid "想拜馆主为师？馆主只看{requires}，哪一样不到，他都会摇头。拳脚简单，一拳就是一拳，先跟我拆几招也好。"
msgstr "Want the Master as your shifu? He only looks at {requires}, and if you fall short on any of it, he'll shake his head. Fists are simple, one punch is one punch. Why not drill a few moves with me first?"

msgid "好，拆三回合，点到为止。"
msgstr "Good. Three rounds, and we stop short of harm."

msgid "看见没有？我一拳打实了就贴上来，接着那记重的才够得着你。柳家拳的拳，是这么抢来的。"
msgstr "See that? I landed a real punch and came in close, and then the heavy one could reach you. That's how the Liu Family Fist takes its punches."

msgid "三回合我一拳都没打实，就一直够不着你——柳家拳最怕的就是这个。你要学，先学怎么把第一拳打实。"
msgstr "Three rounds, and I never landed a real punch, so I never could reach you. That's exactly what the Liu Family Fist fears most. If you want to learn, first learn how to land that first punch."

msgid "你贴上来那一记，压得对，就是这个劲。"
msgstr "That one when you came in close, you pressed right. That's the force."

msgid "你身上带着伤，拆什么招？先去桑邻药铺把伤治好。"
msgstr "You're carrying wounds. What drill? Go to the Mulberry Herb Shop and get them treated first."

msgid "你是别派的弟子，馆主吩咐过，不许和外人过招。"
msgstr "You're a disciple of another school. The Master's orders: no sparring with outsiders."

msgid "记住：一回合不是一招，是几手的事。你出一手，我出一手；谁手上还有余力，谁就多出一手。"
msgstr "Remember: a round isn't one move, it's a matter of several beats. You take a beat, I take a beat; whoever still has something left takes one more."

msgid "看我这一拳——打实了我就贴上来，紧跟着的那一记重的，你躲得开么？"
msgstr "Watch this punch. If it lands, I come in close, and the heavy one right behind it, can you dodge that?"

msgid "最后一回合。你要是能让我一拳打空，我就得退开重来；你要是也打实了一拳，就试试压上来。"
msgstr "Last round. If you can make me miss a punch, I have to back off and start over; if you land a real one too, try pressing in."

msgid "爹爹的剑法，我只学了个皮毛。封山剑不抢先，先用引手逗对方出招——对方一剑刺空，或是被我架开，那一下就是空子，我这边就多出一剑来。"
msgstr "I've only learned the surface of Father's swordplay. The Empty Mountain sword doesn't strike first; it uses a lure to draw the other side out. When they thrust wide, or I parry them, that moment is the opening, and I get an extra thrust."

msgid "多出来的那一剑最要紧：可以追着刺，也可以用「封」字诀把他封住，一封住，他好几手都出不来。"
msgstr "That extra thrust matters most: you can chase with it, or use the \"Seal\" secret to seal them up, and once they're sealed, they can't get a move out for several beats."

msgid "可是贪不得。多出来的那一剑要是只顾着攻，对方的下一手就没人守了。爹爹说，封山的剑是等出来的。"
msgstr "But you can't be greedy. If you spend that extra thrust only on attacking, no one is guarding against their next beat. Father says the Empty Mountain sword is something you wait for."

msgid "你若想拜爹爹为师，他只看{requires}——不到的，他会说学剑的人要胆大心细。"
msgstr "If you want Father as your shifu, he only looks at {requires}. If you fall short, he'll say a swordsman must be both bold and careful."

msgid "那……只拆三回合，不伤人。"
msgstr "Then... just three rounds, and no one gets hurt."

msgid "方才你那一下刺空了，我手里就多出一剑，那记「封」就是这么来的。封山的剑，是等人露空子。"
msgstr "Just now you thrust wide, so I got an extra thrust, and that's where my \"Seal\" came from. The Empty Mountain sword waits for the other side to leave an opening."

msgid "三回合你一招都没打空，我就一直没等到空子，只好跟你慢慢磨。封山的剑是等出来的，等不到，就只能这样。"
msgstr "Three rounds, and you never missed once, so I never got my opening and could only grind on with you. The Empty Mountain sword is something you wait for; when the wait never pays off, this is all it can do."

msgid "你也等到了我的空子，多出来的那一剑用得对。"
msgstr "You waited for my opening too, and you used the extra thrust right."

msgid "你带着伤呢，爹爹不许我跟伤者动手。"
msgstr "You're hurt. Father won't let me fight the wounded."

msgid "你是别派的人，爹爹说过不能跟江湖人物比武过招。"
msgstr "You're from another school. Father said I mustn't spar with people of the jianghu."

msgid "一回合里你出几手，我也出几手——你出完了，我才接着出。不急。"
msgstr "In a round you take a few beats, and I take a few. When you've finished, then I go. No hurry."

msgid "你尽管来刺。要是刺空了，我手上就多一剑；看清楚我是怎么追上来的。"
msgstr "Go ahead and thrust. If you thrust wide, I get an extra thrust. Watch closely how I chase you."

msgid "最后一回合。你也可以不急着出手，等我刺空了再说。"
msgstr "Last round. You don't have to rush either. Wait until I thrust wide."

msgid "封山剑法？小的不懂剑，只听来往的武师说：柳馆主的剑从不抢先，专等人家刺空了的那一下。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain Sword? I don't know a thing about swords, but the fighters passing through say Master Liu's sword never strikes first. It waits for that one moment when the other man thrusts wide."

msgid "馆主的剑我看了五年。来踢馆的，十个有九个是自己刺空了，才挨那一下的。想拜他为师？他只看{requires}。"
msgstr "I've watched the Master's sword for five years. Of those who come to challenge the Hall, nine in ten thrust wide themselves before they take that hit. Want him as your shifu? He only looks at {requires}."

msgid "柳淳风是个读书人，剑法嘛……文绉绉的，依老夫看没什么杀气。"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng is a scholar. His swordplay... genteel. To this old man's eye, there is no killing in it."

msgid "绘心师妹的剑最吓人的是那记「封」字诀，被封住了好几手都出不来。不过她说剑要等——等什么，我也说不上来。"
msgstr "The scariest thing about Junior Sister Huixin's sword is that \"Seal\" secret. Once you're sealed, you can't get a move out for several beats. But she says the sword has to wait. Wait for what, I couldn't tell you."

msgid "伤口"
msgstr "Wounds"

msgid "这是剑伤，口子又直又深——封山剑的路数，多半是这位$RESPECT自己先刺空了，人家才补的这一剑。"
msgstr "This is a sword wound, the cut straight and deep. Empty Mountain style: most likely you thrust wide first, $RESPECT, and the other one put this thrust in after."

msgid "柳家拳？镇上后生练的都是这个。我瞧他们打架，先是一拳碰着人了，立马就贴上去，一拳比一拳重。"
msgstr "The Liu Family Fist? That's what all the young fellows in town train. I watch them fight: first one punch touches the other man, then they're right up close, each punch heavier than the last."

msgid "李教头那身板，一拳打实了接着就是一记重的，叫什么虎吟。想拜柳馆主的，先去武馆找李教头拆拆招，拳脚简单，一拳就是一拳。"
msgstr "Instructor Li, built like he is: land one real punch and next comes a heavy one, something called Tiger's Growl. If you want to study under Master Liu, first go drill with Instructor Li at the Hall. Fists are simple, one punch is one punch."

msgid "柳家拳好是好，就是练了脾气暴，李教头那些徒弟三天两头在街上跟人动手。"
msgstr "The Liu Family Fist is good and all, but it makes you hot-tempered. Instructor Li's pupils are brawling in the street every other day."

msgid "柳家拳最怕打空。一拳落了空，人就离远了，再重的拳也够不着——小的挨过，知道。"
msgstr "The Liu Family Fist fears a miss most. Miss one punch and you're too far off, and the heaviest punch won't reach. I've taken that beating, I'd know."

msgid "这是拳伤，一片青紫，底下还压着一记重的——柳家拳的路数，人贴上来才打得出这么重。"
msgstr "This is a fist wound, all black and blue, with a heavy blow under it. Liu Family Fist style: you only hit this hard once you're in close."

msgid "这位$RESPECT身上没什么新伤，用不着看。"
msgstr "You have no fresh wounds, $RESPECT. Nothing to look at."

msgid "封山剑派北宗是封山剑派里的一支，剑法、拳脚和内功都与本宗同出一源。绮云镇口的公告上，至今还写着「封山剑派北宗所在的雪亭镇」。"
msgstr "The North Branch of the Empty Mountain School is one of its lines; its sword, fists and neigong all spring from the same source as the main school. The notice at the entrance of Cloudweave Town still reads \"Snow Pavilion, home of the Empty Mountain School's North Branch.\""

msgid "振远镖局是京师第一大镖局，在京城一带几乎无人不知其名，绮云镇上也有振远的镖局。镖局里的人走镖凭的是一手春风快意刀。走镖危险，镖局收人先看胆识。"
msgstr "The Far-Road Escorts are the Capital's greatest escort agency, known to nearly everyone around the Capital, and they have an agency in Cloudweave Town too. Its people run escorts on the strength of the Spring Blade. Escort work is dangerous, so the agency looks at courage first when it takes people on."

msgid "东方神教是一个行事隐秘的教门，不立山门，也不收寻常弟子。教中人散在各处，平日看不出身份，外人对它的宗旨所知甚少。只听说教中高手使一路雪影剑法，身法轻疾。"
msgstr "The Golden Crow Order is a secretive order. It keeps no mountain gate and takes no ordinary disciples. Its people are scattered everywhere, and in daily life you cannot tell who they are; outsiders know little of its creed. All anyone hears is that its masters use the Snowshade Sword and move light and fast."

msgid "天邪派以水烟阁为大本营。水烟阁在雪亭镇西边青石官道尽头的山上，相传最早的主人是武术之神杞庸，后来成了历代武林盟主的行馆，每年正月十七在阁外虹台推选盟主。天邪神功与天邪神掌是这一派的根本，相传是杞庸见灵兽天邪虎而悟出；另有一路六阴追魂剑法，是三百年前一位前辈从废墟中得来的。门规甚严，拜师要么立誓恪守门规，要么接下三招。"
msgstr "The Wayward School's headquarters is Waterfog Pavilion, on the mountain at the end of the Bluestone Road west of Snow Pavilion. Its first master is said to have been Qi Yong, the god of martial arts; later it became the residence of every Alliance Leader of the wulin, and on the seventeenth day of the first month each year the Leader is chosen on Rainbow Terrace outside the Pavilion. The Wayward Art and the Wayward Palm are the school's foundation, said to have come to Qi Yong when he saw the spirit beast the Wayward Tiger; there is also the Six-Chaos Sword, which an elder recovered from a ruin three hundred years ago. Its rules are strict: to become a disciple you either swear to keep them or withstand three moves."

msgid "绝尘派是绝尘子一手所创的门派。绝尘子原是佛门中人，后得奇人指点，悟得道家真谛，佛道双修，访遍名山大川后自号绝尘。他的修行之所在青石村的石室里，门上写着「非我弟子，莫入此门」。入门看慧根，也要有相当的江湖历练。"
msgstr "The Dustless School was founded single-handed by Juechenzi. He was once a Buddhist; later, guided by a remarkable teacher, he grasped the true meaning of the Dao and cultivated Buddhism and Daoism both, and after traveling to all the famous mountains and great rivers he named himself Juechen. He practices in the Stone Chamber in Bluestone Village, and on its door is written: \"Not my disciple? Do not enter this door.\" To join takes a gift for insight, and a good deal of experience in the jianghu."

msgid "茅山派自张天师开山立派，世代以降妖伏魔为己任，门户在茅山上的灵心观。门下修谷衣心法，排去体内的五谷秽气，炼成护体之气；修到小成，左眼眼珠会变成金色。法术以治鬼除魔为主，根基是天师正道。灵心观是出家人的道观，只收男弟子。"
msgstr "Since Celestial Master Zhang founded it, the Mount Mao School has made subduing demons its duty, generation after generation; its gateway is Clear Heart Abbey on Mount Mao. Its people cultivate the Grain Robe Heart Method, driving the foulness of grain out of the body and refining it into protective qi; at Lesser Mastery the left eye turns gold. Its sorcery is chiefly for subduing ghosts and driving out demons, and it is rooted in the Way of the Celestial Masters. Clear Heart Abbey is an abbey of those who have left the household, and takes only men."

msgid "晚月庄是绮云镇以西林子深处的一座大宅院，朱漆大门，门口挂着灯笼，出现在乡野之间显得有些突兀。庄里多是女子，只收女弟子，庄主的琵琶闻名千里。武功以七宝天岚舞的身法、柔虹指和寒雪鞭法见长，内功意寒功纯走阴柔一路。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor is a great walled house deep in the woods west of Cloudweave Town, with vermilion gates and lanterns hung at the door; out in the countryside it looks a little out of place. Most of its people are women, and it takes only female disciples; the Mistress's pipa is famous for a thousand li. Its arts excel in the footwork of Stormdance, the Soft Rainbow Finger and the Cold Snow Whip, and its neigong, Cold Intent Force, follows the yin and the soft alone."

msgid "山烟寺在绮云镇南、泓水对岸的日照山上，整座寺由上好的桧木建成，金碧辉煌。寺中老方丈医术通神，受过恩惠的富豪出资修整，名气比京城的白象禅院还大。要入寺先得剃度出家，只收男子；武功以流云杖法和疗伤的莲华心法为主，佛法精深的还修八识神通。"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple stands on Sunlit Mountain south of Cloudweave Town, across the Deepwater. The whole temple is built of the finest cypress, resplendent in gold and green. Its old abbot heals with godlike skill, and the rich men he helped paid to restore it, so its name is greater even than the White Elephant Chan Monastery in the Capital. To enter you must first shave your head and leave the household, and it takes only men; its arts center on the Cloudflow Staff and the healing Lotus Heart Method, and those deep in the Dharma also cultivate the Eight Consciousnesses."

msgid "逍遥派的门户不在这一带，中原少见其门人。听说这一派收徒讲究人品文采，掌门是个风流倜傥的人物。"
msgstr "The Carefree School's gateway is not in these parts, and its people are seldom seen in the Central Plains. They say the school chooses its disciples for character and literary talent, and that its Master is a dashing, romantic figure."

msgid "天山派的门户远在天山，中原少见其门人。晚月庄后门外的小径，据说就是通往天山的路。"
msgstr "The Tianshan School's gateway lies far off in the Tianshan Mountains, and its people are seldom seen in the Central Plains. The footpath outside the Latemoon Back Gate is said to be the road to Tianshan."

msgid "步玄派是四百年前「秃笔狂生」骆步玄在京城创立的门派。骆步玄原是屡试不中的书生，一日在街边书肆望见一副对子，竟悟出一套武功，从此闯荡江湖。门下的步玄七诀号称天下轻功「轻捷第一」，使起来姿态有如书法；骆家至今是京城有名的武林世家。想入门的人，要先走一趟乔阴曼雩台东边的桃林。"
msgstr "The Mystic Step School was founded in the Capital four hundred years ago by Luo Buxuan, \"the Mad Scholar of the Bald Brush.\" Luo Buxuan was a scholar who failed the examinations again and again; one day, looking up at a pair of scrolls in a bookshop by the street, he worked out a martial art, and from then on he roamed the jianghu. The school's Mystic Step Seven Secrets are called the \"nimblest\" qinggong under heaven, and look like calligraphy in motion; the Luo family is still a famous wulin house in the Capital. Anyone who wants to join must first make a trip to the Peach Grove east of the Rain Dance Terrace in Tallshade."

msgid "花紫会是乞丐们的帮会，只收身上没几个钱的化子。龙头的信物是一只打着二十三个结的皮酒囊；龙头行踪诡秘，据说各处总有七八个替身。会中的武功有油流麻香手和伏蛟功。"
msgstr "The Beggars' Guild is the guild of beggars, and takes only those with hardly a coin on them. The Dragon Head's token is a leather wineskin tied in twenty-three knots; the Dragon Head comes and goes in secret, and is said to have seven or eight stand-ins in every place. The Guild's arts are the Greasy Pepper Hand and the Serpent-Taming Force."

msgid "铁盾会是番坊里大秦人的剑会，门前立着两面比人还高的铁包边大盾，盾面上漆着展翅的鹰。大秦人的祖上从西边来，在这片海边落了脚。会里的剑手左手盾、右手短剑，两两对练；铁盾剑法盾在前、剑在后，没有盾的人不教。"
msgstr "The Iron Shield Guild is the sword guild of the Daqin people in the Foreign Quarter. Before its door stand two iron-rimmed great shields taller than a man, each painted with an eagle with spread wings. The Daqin people's forebears came from the west and settled on this stretch of coast. The Guild's swordsmen carry a shield in the left hand and a short sword in the right and train in pairs; the Iron Shield Sword keeps the shield in front and the sword behind, and those with no shield are not taught."

msgid "鬼笠馆是番坊里倭人浪人开的武馆，门楣上挂着一顶破了边的斗笠，馆名就是这么来的。门规只有一句：「一击之内定生死」——刀出鞘，只出一次。鬼笠刀法的刀比中原的窄而弯，劈下去就收，不出第二刀。"
msgstr "Ghost Hat Hall is a martial school run by Japanese ronin in the Foreign Quarter. A straw hat with a torn brim hangs over its door, and that is where the name comes from. Its rule is a single line: \"Life or death within one stroke.\" The blade leaves the sheath once only. The Ghost Hat Blade is narrower and more curved than a Central Plains saber; it cuts down and is withdrawn, and never makes a second stroke."

msgid "日陀罗寺是番坊里一座不大的寺院，由两位天竺僧人所建，赭红的墙头长着草。院中一棵大榕树，是第一代师父从天竺带来的枝条插活的。入寺要先剃度出家，只收男子，所传的是莲华心法、流云杖法这些佛门功夫。"
msgstr "The Ritola Temple is a modest temple in the Foreign Quarter, built by two Indian monks, with grass growing on its ocher-red walls. In its courtyard stands a great banyan, grown from a cutting the first master brought from India. To enter you must first shave your head and leave the household, and it takes only men; it teaches Buddhist arts such as the Lotus Heart Method and the Cloudflow Staff."

msgid "这是个正在执行公务的县城官兵，虽然和许多武林人物比起来，官兵\n们的武功实在稀松平常，但是他们是有组织、有纪律的战士，谁也不\n轻易地招惹他们。\n"
msgstr "A county soldier on official duty. Next to many people of the wulin, soldiers' martial skills are truly nothing special, but they are organized, disciplined fighters, and nobody crosses them lightly.\n"

msgid "县城官兵喝道：还不快放下武器束手就缚？\n"
msgstr "The county soldier shouts: \"Drop your weapon and give yourself up, now!\"\n"

msgid "县城官兵喝道：大胆刁民竟敢拒捕？反了！反了！\n"
msgstr "The county soldier shouts: \"Insolent wretch, resisting arrest? Rebellion! This is rebellion!\"\n"

msgid "水烟阁传功使"
msgstr "Teaching Envoy of Waterfog Pavilion"

msgid "於兰天武是当今皇上的叔父，但是他毕生浸淫武学，甘愿抛弃荣华富\n以换取水烟阁传功使一职，以便阅读水烟阁中所藏的武学典籍，无论\n你有什麽武学上的疑难，他都能为你解答。\n"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu is the uncle of the present Emperor, but he has steeped himself in the martial arts all his life, and gladly gave up wealth and rank for the post of Teaching Envoy of Waterfog Pavilion, so that he could read the martial classics kept in the Pavilion. Whatever difficulty you have in the martial arts, he can answer it for you.\n"

msgid "武学之道....嗯....只可意会，不可言喻。\n"
msgstr "The way of the martial arts... hmm... can be grasped, but not put into words.\n"

msgid "水烟阁乃是历届武林盟主的行馆，你有什麽事要见武林盟主？\n"
msgstr "Waterfog Pavilion is the residence of every Alliance Leader of the wulin. What business do you have with the Alliance Leader?\n"

msgid "哦....老夫向来有个规矩，凡是想拜我为师的，得接我三招不死，你想试试？\n"
msgstr "Oh... this old man has always had a rule: whoever wants me as a shifu must take three of my moves and live. Do you want to try?\n"

msgid "皇上"
msgstr "His Majesty"

msgid "老夫在朝上一天，庾子建就不是一个人说了算。"
msgstr "As long as this old man stands at court, Yu Zijian does not have the final word alone."

msgid "昭儿？……他还小。朝廷的事，老夫不问了。"
msgstr "Zhao'er? ...He is still young. This old man no longer asks about the court's affairs."

msgid "在老夫手里。三百年前於兰家拔错了一把——决战那日，你来叫我，看老夫这一回拔得对不对。"
msgstr "In this old man's hands. Three hundred years ago the Yulan family drew the wrong one. On the day of the final battle, come and call me, and see whether this old man draws right this time."

msgid "你拔的。好——於兰家这一回，不用再错一次。"
msgstr "You drew it. Good. This time the Yulan family need not be wrong again."

msgid "萧家那孩子拿去了。他回了一趟岚城，比老夫配。"
msgstr "The Xiao boy took it. He went back to the Wind City once; he is worthier of it than this old man."

msgid "寒於氏的剑。於兰家的血里有寒於氏的一份——君违嫁过来的那一份。三百年前，我家的人拔错了一把剑。"
msgstr "The Hanyu clan's sword. There is a share of the Hanyu clan in the Yulan family's blood, the share Jun Wei brought when she married in. Three hundred years ago, one of my family drew the wrong sword."

msgid "旋芒……先帝找了一辈子。老夫不找。"
msgstr "Whirling Edge... The late Emperor searched for it all his life. This old man does not search."

msgid "找到城，叫我。风会知道怎么找到於兰家的人。"
msgstr "When you find the city, call me. The wind will know how to find a Yulan."

msgid "樵夫撞进去过，先帝的人没有。老夫不信那些。"
msgstr "A woodcutter once stumbled in; the late Emperor's men never did. This old man does not believe such things."

msgid "人送回水烟阁了。庾子建那道门，老夫往后还会去敲。"
msgstr "He has been sent back to Waterfog Pavilion. Yu Zijian's door, this old man will knock on again."

msgid "卫沧澜出来了？好。……二十年，老夫在水烟阁等他回来，他就关在京城。"
msgstr "Wei Canglan is out? Good. ...Twenty years this old man waited at Waterfog Pavilion for him to come back, and all along he was locked up in the Capital."

msgid "虹台那边已经开了席。等散了会，老夫再去庾子建那里要人——这时候把人领出来，倒像是去抢那把椅子。"
msgstr "The seats are already set on Rainbow Terrace. When the Assembly breaks up, this old man will go to Yu Zijian and demand the man. To bring him out now would look like going to grab that chair."

msgid "放下手里的茶盏，站了起来。"
msgstr " sets down his teacup and stands up."

msgid "卫沧澜？二十年前的武林盟主……庾子建府上那间客房，老夫知道。"
msgstr "Wei Canglan? The Alliance Leader of twenty years ago... That guest room in Yu Zijian's mansion, this old man knows of it."

msgid "昭儿的手诏召老夫回朝，也叫得开兵部尚书的门。你在这里等着。"
msgstr "Zhao'er's edict calls this old man back to court, and it can open the Minister of War's door as well. Wait here."

msgid "於兰天武大步出了养心殿，两个侍卫捧着黄绫跟在后头。\n"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu strides out of the Hall of Mental Cultivation, two guards following behind him with the yellow silk in their hands.\n"

msgid "过了一个多时辰，殿外一阵脚步响。於兰天武回来了，身后跟着一个白发的老人，腋下夹着一本诗集。\n"
msgstr "A good two hours later, footsteps sound outside the hall. Yulan Tianwu is back, and behind him walks a white-haired old man with a book of poems tucked under his arm.\n"

msgid "庾子建亲自开的门，一句话也没说。……老夫进门的时候，他还躬着身。"
msgstr "Yu Zijian opened the door himself and said not a word. ...When this old man went in, he was still bowing."

msgid "卫沧澜朝你点点头：「老夫先回水烟阁。这条命是皇叔从尚书府要回来的，欠朝廷一份。」\n"
msgstr "Wei Canglan nods to you: \"This old man will go back to Waterfog Pavilion first. This life the Imperial Uncle won back from the Minister's Mansion; I owe the court a share of it.\"\n"

msgid "卫沧澜……二十年没有消息了。"
msgstr "Wei Canglan... No word of him in twenty years."

msgid "$RESPECT若真的有心，不妨让我看看你的所学"
msgstr "If you are truly sincere, $RESPECT, why not let me see what you have learned?"

msgid "如果想拜师的话，就请接受测试"
msgstr "If you wish to become my disciple, please take the test."

msgid "於兰天武点了点头，说道：很好，这是第一招...."
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu nods and says: \"Very well. Here is the first move...\""

msgid "於兰天武叹了口气，说道：连第一招都撑不过，真是自不量力...."
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu sighs and says: \"Not even the first move... You overrate yourself...\""

msgid "於兰天武说道：这是第二招...."
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu says: \"Here is the second move...\""

msgid "於兰天武「哼」地一声，说道：便是有这许多不怕死的家伙...."
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu snorts and says: \"There are always so many fools who do not fear death...\""

msgid "於兰天武说道：第三招来了...."
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu says: \"Here comes the third move...\""

msgid "於兰天武叹道：可惜，难道老夫一身武功竟无传人...."
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu sighs: \"A pity. Is all this old man's skill to go without an heir...\""

msgid "於兰天武哈哈大笑，说道：今日老夫终於觅得一个可造之才！"
msgstr "Yulan Tianwu laughs aloud and says: \"Today this old man has at last found someone worth teaching!\""

msgid "接过黄笺，看了一遍，又看了一遍，半晌没有说话。"
msgstr " takes the yellow paper, reads it once, then again, and says nothing for a long while."

msgid "昭儿的字……还是这么慢。"
msgstr "Zhao'er's hand... still so slow."

msgid "三百年了，於兰家的人又要去碰那东西。老夫不回去，这孩子一个人扛不住。"
msgstr "Three hundred years, and a Yulan must go and touch that thing again. If this old man does not go back, the boy cannot bear it alone."

msgid "把手诏折好，揣进怀里，站了起来。"
msgstr " folds the edict, tucks it into his robe, and stands up."

msgid "传功使的事，交给萧辟尘。——老夫回京。"
msgstr "The Teaching Envoy's duties go to Xiao Bichen. This old man returns to the Capital."

msgid "萧辟尘自幼生长於岚城之中，看起来仙风道骨，不食人间烟火。\n"
msgstr "Xiao Bichen grew up in the Wind City. He has the air of an immortal, as if he lived on nothing of this mortal world.\n"

msgid "{respect}既然使兵刃，在下空手接招未免不敬。"
msgstr "Since you fight with a weapon, {respect}, it would be disrespectful of me to meet you empty-handed."

msgid "进招吧！"
msgstr "Come at me!"

msgid "既然{respect}不使兵刃，在下自然奉陪！"
msgstr "Since you use no weapon, {respect}, I will of course match you!"

msgid "嗯... 既然{count}位都是空手，在下理当奉陪！"
msgstr "Hmm... Since all {count} of you are empty-handed, it is only right that I match you!"

msgid "我天邪派门规甚严，$RESPECT如果真的有心，且发个誓来。"
msgstr "The rules of our Wayward School are strict. If you are truly sincere, $RESPECT, swear an oath."

msgid "多说无益，若不发誓恪守门规，便是跪著求我也没用。"
msgstr "Talk is no use. Unless you swear to keep the school's rules, begging on your knees will do you no good."

msgid "守门规"
msgstr "Keep the Rules"

msgid "这就是了。"
msgstr "That will do."

msgid "我回去过一回了。城还是那个样子，铃挂在钩上。……风记得我。"
msgstr "I went back once. The city is as it was, the bell hanging on its hook. ...The wind remembers me."

msgid "……这是我的铃。」他把铃接过去，翻来覆去看了很久，拇指在那个「尘」字上摸了一下，又还给你：「铃在，风认人。你带着它，比我带着它有用。"
msgstr "...This is my bell.\" He takes the bell and turns it over and over for a long time, his thumb rubbing once across the \"Chen\" carved on it, then hands it back to you: \"While the bell is here, the wind knows its own. It will do more good with you than with me."

msgid "我四岁那年起了一场大风，醒来就在山外了，身边什么也没有。铃丢了，风就不认得我，我再也回不去。……风是从城里往外吹的。小时候我放风筝，线总是往外拽。"
msgstr "The year I was four, a great wind rose, and when I woke I was outside the mountains with nothing beside me. The bell was lost, so the wind did not know me, and I could never go back. ...The wind blows outward from the city. When I flew kites as a boy, the string always pulled outward."

msgid "岚城……我是在那里长大的。别的，不说了。"
msgstr "The Wind City... I grew up there. Of the rest, I will not speak."

msgid "风铃"
msgstr "Wind Bell"

msgid "铃舌上那个字是铃匠刻的。岚城的孩子，人人一只。"
msgstr "The character on the clapper was carved by the bellsmith. Every child of the Wind City has one."

msgid "那只匣子……对着岚城的风才开。镜子里的上道，风从那头来。"
msgstr "That casket... opens only to the Wind City's wind. The upper road in the mirror: the wind comes from that end."

msgid "黄石隘口挖出来的那只石匣，后来在哪里？……先帝的人当年从山外收走过一只铃。我一直想，那是我的。"
msgstr "The stone casket dug up at Yellow Rock Pass, where did it end up? ...The late Emperor's men once took a bell from outside the mountains. I have always thought it was mine."

msgid "风铃？水烟阁的檐下也挂着几只，风一大就响。"
msgstr "Wind bells? A few hang under Waterfog Pavilion's eaves too. They ring when the wind is up."

msgid "在我背上。决战那日，它跟我下湖。"
msgstr "On my back. On the day of the final battle, it goes down into the lake with me."

msgid "是你。好。"
msgstr "It was you. Good."

msgid "皇叔拔的？……也好。於兰家欠这把剑一回。"
msgstr "The Imperial Uncle drew it? ...Just as well. The Yulan family owes this sword one."

msgid "岚城有一把剑，叫旋芒。守剑的老人不卖，不赏，不问剑给谁做什么——只问谁拔。"
msgstr "There is a sword in the Wind City called Whirling Edge. The old man who keeps it does not sell it, does not bestow it, does not ask who it is for or what for. He asks only who draws it."

msgid "旋芒？朝廷要找的那把剑。……小天邪不问这个。"
msgstr "Whirling Edge? The sword the court is looking for. ...Little Wayward does not ask about that."

msgid "湖底"
msgstr "The Lakebed"

msgid "湖底那颗头，三百年前是穿灵钉住的。这一回，我拿旋芒去。回不来，就回不来。"
msgstr "The head under the lake was pinned by Spiritpiercer three hundred years ago. This time, I take Whirling Edge. If I do not come back, I do not come back."

msgid "湖底？玉螺湖底下的事，小天邪不问。"
msgstr "The lakebed? What lies under Jade Conch Lake, Little Wayward does not ask."

msgid "水烟阁执法使"
msgstr "Enforcer of Waterfog Pavilion"

msgid "潘军禅是当今武林的一位传奇性人物，以他仅仅二十八岁的年龄竟能做到\n水烟阁执法使的职位，著实是一位不简单的人物。潘军禅是封山剑派掌门\n柳淳风的结拜义弟，但是他为人其实十分风趣，又好交朋友，丝毫不会摆\n出武林执法者的架子。\n"
msgstr "Pan Junchan is a legend in today's wulin: at only twenty-eight he holds the post of Enforcer of Waterfog Pavilion, which makes him no ordinary man. Pan Junchan is the sworn younger brother of Liu Chunfeng, Master of the Empty Mountain School, and in truth he is good-humored and fond of making friends, and never puts on the airs of a wulin enforcer.\n"

msgid "柳大哥？他是我的结拜义兄。你有他的信？拿来我看。"
msgstr "Brother Liu? He is my sworn elder brother. You have a letter from him? Let me see it."

msgid "阁里那把是假的，真剑不在这儿。要找去年那个道士，往野羊山北麓去。"
msgstr "The one in the Pavilion is a fake; the real sword is not here. If you want the Daoist from last year, go to the North Foot of Goathill."

msgid "看了柳淳风的信，笑了。"
msgstr " reads Liu Chunfeng's letter and smiles."

msgid "柳大哥的朋友就是我的朋友。邪剑穿灵？阁里挂着的那把，是仿的。"
msgstr "A friend of Brother Liu is a friend of mine. The evil sword Spiritpiercer? The one hanging in the Pavilion is a copy."

msgid "真剑早就不在水烟阁了。挂一把假的，是鱼饵——钓那些冲着它来的人。"
msgstr "The real sword left Waterfog Pavilion long ago. Hanging a fake is bait, to hook the people who come for it."

msgid "去年就钓上来一个：黑衣黑冠的道士，夜里来试剑，发觉是假的就走了。我的人跟到野羊山北麓，跟丢了。那边没有道观，只有一片黑砖。"
msgstr "Last year it hooked one: a Daoist in black robe and black cap who came at night to test the sword, found it was a fake, and left. My men followed him to the North Foot of Goathill and lost him. There is no abbey there, only a stretch of black brick."

msgid "柳大哥让你来的？信呢？没有他的信，执法使的佩剑不是你问得的。信丢了，回武馆找他再写一封。"
msgstr "Brother Liu sent you? Where is the letter? Without his letter, the Enforcer's sword is not yours to ask about. If you lost it, go back to the Hall and have him write another."

msgid "执法使的佩剑，也是你问得的？"
msgstr "The Enforcer's sword, and you think it is yours to ask about?"

msgid "晚月庄。守它的人不白给——我说过了。"
msgstr "Latemoon Manor. Those who guard it are no pushovers. I told you so."

msgid "寒於宝衣？你倒问到点子上了。"
msgstr "Hanyu's Robe? Now you have asked the right question."

msgid "当年三件东西各归一处，宝衣归月神族保管。月神族早没了，只剩晚月庄那些女子——自称人灵区冥的后人，庄里供着她的神像，池边立着凤凰护庄。"
msgstr "Back then the three things each went to a different place, and the robe went to the Moon God clan to keep. The Moon God clan is long gone; only the women of Latemoon Manor remain. They call themselves descendants of Ouming, the Human Soul; her statue stands in the manor, and a phoenix stands by the pool to guard the place."

msgid "衣在不在庄里，我不知道。守它的人不白给——你去了就明白。"
msgstr "Whether the robe is in the manor, I do not know. Those who guard it are no pushovers. Go, and you will see."

msgid "还有——野羊山那边前夜出了事。一伙黑冠道士摸上山，抓走了寨里两个人，挨个问：那天闯道观的孩子是谁。他们在找你。"
msgstr "One more thing: there was trouble at Goathill the night before last. A band of Black-Cap Daoists crept up the mountain, carried off two people from the stockade, and asked them one by one who the child was who broke into the abbey that day. They are looking for you."

msgid "执刑使管的是刀，不管衣裳。"
msgstr "The Enforcer deals in blades, not clothing."

msgid "山门"
msgstr "Mountain Gate"

msgid "山门的事办完了。正月十七之前，上山的人还会多。"
msgstr "The gate business is done. Before the seventeenth of the first month, still more people will be coming up the mountain."

msgid "人跑了。拿错的那一个，我赔过礼了。"
msgstr "The man got away. The one we seized by mistake, I have made my apologies to."

msgid "水烟阁的门，一年到头有人来打听盟主。这一回跑掉的，下回还会来——下回你认得他。"
msgstr "All year round, people come to Waterfog Pavilion's gate asking about the Alliance Leader. The one who got away this time will come again, and next time you will know him."

msgid "眼力差了一点，胆子不差。你守过一回山门了——从今日起，你是这一辈的大弟子。"
msgstr "Your eye was a little off; your nerve was not. You have kept the mountain gate once. From today, you are the senior disciple of your generation."

msgid "人拿下了？他身上掉出来的信，给我看看。"
msgstr "You took him? The letter that fell from him, let me see it."

msgid "人拿下了。身上的东西没捡着？……罢了，人押在刑堂里，我自己问。"
msgstr "You took him. You did not pick up what he dropped? ...Never mind. He is held in the punishment hall; I will question him myself."

msgid "你守过一回山门了——从今日起，你是这一辈的大弟子。"
msgstr "You have kept the mountain gate once. From today, you are the senior disciple of your generation."

msgid "人认出来了，还没拿下？去，别让他下了山。"
msgstr "You have spotted him and not taken him yet? Go. Do not let him get down the mountain."

msgid "三个上山的人在阁前候着。问清来意，听他们怎么说盟主，看看路引——哪个不对，拿下。"
msgstr "Three people who came up the mountain are waiting in front of the Pavilion. Find out why they came, listen to what they say of the Alliance Leader, look at their travel passes. Whichever one is wrong, take him."

msgid "把手里的卷宗一合，冲你招了招手。"
msgstr " shuts the file in his hands and beckons you over."

msgid "你来得正好。正月十七快到了，这些日子上山的人多：拜师的、送信的、看热闹的。"
msgstr "You have come at the right time. The seventeenth of the first month is near, and many people come up the mountain these days: to become disciples, to deliver letters, to watch the excitement."

msgid "可这一个月，阁里丢了两份名帖，山下的客栈里也有人在打听——盟主还活着没有。"
msgstr "But this month the Pavilion has lost two calling cards, and at the inn below the mountain someone has been asking whether the Alliance Leader is still alive."

msgid "我认得的人太多，往门口一站，探子就不开口了。你是新面孔。去山门值一班：上山的人问清来意，哪个不对，拿下。"
msgstr "Too many people know my face. If I stand at the gate, a spy will not open his mouth. You are a new face. Go and stand a watch at the mountain gate: find out why each one has come up, and whichever one is wrong, take him."

msgid "拿错了人不要紧，我去赔礼。只是真的那个，就跑了。"
msgstr "Taking the wrong man does not matter; I will go and apologize. Only, the real one will get away."

msgid "山门有武士守着。执法使的事，不劳外人。"
msgstr "The mountain gate has guards. The Enforcer's business needs no outsider."

msgid "镖单"
msgstr "Waybill"

msgid "镖单在刑堂里锁着。振远的脸面，水烟阁替他们留着。"
msgstr "The waybill is locked in the punishment hall. Waterfog Pavilion is keeping Far-Road's face for them."

msgid "交给陈总镖头了？……也好。他要查，就让他查到底。"
msgstr "You gave it to Chief Chen? ...Just as well. If he wants to dig, let him dig to the bottom."

msgid "手令丢了？我再写一张。"
msgstr "Lost the warrant? I will write another."

msgid "镖单在你手里。给我锁进刑堂，还是带去京师给陈天星——你定。"
msgstr "The waybill is in your hands. Give it to me to lock in the punishment hall, or take it to the Capital for Chen Tianxing. You decide."

msgid "拿着手令去绮云镇的振远镖局，找陈剑秋。"
msgstr "Take the warrant to the Far-Road Escorts in Cloudweave Town and find Chen Jianqiu."

msgid "镖单不在你身上？去绮云镇问陈剑秋，振远的底账里还有存根。"
msgstr "The waybill is not on you? Go to Cloudweave Town and ask Chen Jianqiu. There is still a stub in Far-Road's account books."

msgid "还有一件旧事。二十年前振远镖局替水烟阁押过一趟镖：盟主印一方，密件一匣，在老松岭丢了，一个人也没回来。"
msgstr "There is one more old matter. Twenty years ago the Far-Road Escorts ran a shipment for Waterfog Pavilion: one Alliance Leader's seal and one box of secret papers. It was lost on Old Pine Ridge, and not one man came back."

msgid "那张镖单还在振远手里。我写张手令，你去绮云镇找陈剑秋——他见了我的印，会拿出来。"
msgstr "Far-Road still has the waybill. I will write a warrant; go to Cloudweave Town and find Chen Jianqiu. When he sees my seal, he will bring it out."

msgid "拿到了，镖单该放在哪儿，你再定。"
msgstr "Once you have it, you can decide where the waybill should go."

msgid "还有一件旧事。二十年前振远镖局替水烟阁押过一趟镖：盟主印一方，密件一匣，在老松岭丢了。那张镖单，陈剑秋给过你。"
msgstr "There is one more old matter. Twenty years ago the Far-Road Escorts ran a shipment for Waterfog Pavilion: one Alliance Leader's seal and one box of secret papers, lost on Old Pine Ridge. Chen Jianqiu has already given you that waybill."

msgid "镖单给我，我锁进刑堂：振远的脸面，水烟阁替他们留着，这件事到此为止。"
msgstr "Give me the waybill and I will lock it in the punishment hall. Waterfog Pavilion keeps Far-Road's face for them, and the matter ends here."

msgid "陈天星不会这么想。京师的振远总局是他一手创的，他要知道当年那条路是谁点的。你把镖单带去给他，他会查到底——查出来的，未必只是振远的丑事。"
msgstr "Chen Tianxing will not see it that way. He built the Far-Road Head Office in the Capital with his own hands, and he will want to know who chose that road back then. Take him the waybill and he will dig to the bottom, and what he digs up may not be Far-Road's shame alone."

msgid "镖单只有一张。你定。"
msgstr "There is only one waybill. You decide."

msgid "镖单？先把山门的事办了。"
msgstr "The waybill? First take care of the mountain gate."

msgid "什么镖单？"
msgstr "What waybill?"

msgid "盟主"
msgstr "Alliance Leader"

msgid "盟主的事，七长老做主了。执事有执事的公事。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader's affairs are the Seventh Elder's to decide now. A Deacon has a Deacon's duties."

msgid "等。他回来，或者不回来，椅子都是他的。"
msgstr "We wait. Whether he comes back or not, the chair is his."

msgid "盟主在厅里坐着。是你带回来的。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader sits in the hall. You brought him back."

msgid "京师的事了结了，盟主还是没有回来。七长老常下楼来看那把椅子——你出去走一走，他再下来的时候，你在厅里。"
msgstr "The Capital business is settled, and the Alliance Leader still has not come back. The Seventh Elder often comes downstairs to look at that chair. Go out for a walk, and when he comes down again, be in the hall."

msgid "二十年前带走盟主的是兵部的白衣武官。线索在京师尚书府——我出不了水烟阁，你替我记着。"
msgstr "Twenty years ago, those who took the Alliance Leader were the Ministry of War's Officers in White. The trail leads to the Minister's Mansion in the Capital. I cannot leave Waterfog Pavilion; keep it in mind for me."

msgid "看了一眼厅侧坐着的那个白发老人，压低了声音。"
msgstr " glances at the white-haired old man sitting at the side of the hall and lowers his voice."

msgid "盟主回来了——是你从尚书府带出来的。他说，领头的白衣武官是庾子建的亲兵。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader is back, and you are the one who brought him out of the Minister's Mansion. He says the Officer in White who led them was one of Yu Zijian's personal guards."

msgid "陈天星查清了：那趟镖是兵部点名改走老松岭的。兵部知道盟主哪一天过岭。"
msgstr "Chen Tianxing has got to the bottom of it: the Ministry of War named that shipment and changed its route to Old Pine Ridge. The Ministry knew which day the Alliance Leader would cross the ridge."

msgid "人回来了，椅子还空着。七长老这几天常下楼来，站在那把椅子跟前。"
msgstr "The man is back, and the chair is still empty. These days the Seventh Elder often comes downstairs and stands before that chair."

msgid "你出去走一走；他再下来的时候，你在厅里。"
msgstr "Go out for a walk. When he comes down again, be in the hall."

msgid "那张镖单我锁起来了，可上面那条路我看过：本该走官道，却改走了老松岭——改路的人，知道盟主哪一天过岭。"
msgstr "I locked that waybill away, but I have seen the road on it: it should have taken the official road, but was changed to Old Pine Ridge. Whoever changed the road knew which day the Alliance Leader would cross the ridge."

msgid "合上卷宗，看了一眼大厅中央那张黝黑的太师椅。"
msgstr " closes the file and glances at the dark armchair in the middle of the hall."

msgid "山门和镖单的事你都办过了。盟主的事，也该同你说了。"
msgstr "You have handled both the gate and the waybill. It is time I told you about the Alliance Leader."

msgid "二十年前，先帝召盟主进京。盟主带着阁里藏的一份旧记载上路，五长老押着盟主印随行，振远的镖走在前头。过了老松岭，一个人也没回来。"
msgstr "Twenty years ago, the late Emperor summoned the Alliance Leader to the Capital. The Leader set out carrying an old record kept in the Pavilion, the Fifth Elder rode along guarding the Alliance Leader's seal, and Far-Road's escort went ahead. After Old Pine Ridge, not one of them came back."

msgid "老松岭下的樵夫说，那天岭上来过一队穿白衣的武官。白衣，腰里挂的是兵部的刀。"
msgstr "A woodcutter below Old Pine Ridge says a troop of officers in white came onto the ridge that day. White clothes, and at their waists the Ministry of War's sabers."

msgid "京师的事有了结果，庾子建那边也有了说法——可盟主没有回来。椅子还空着。"
msgstr "The Capital business has come to an end, and Yu Zijian has given his account. But the Alliance Leader has not come back. The chair is still empty."

msgid "七长老这几天常下楼来，站在那把椅子跟前。你出去走一走；他再下来的时候，你在厅里。"
msgstr "These days the Seventh Elder often comes downstairs and stands before that chair. Go out for a walk. When he comes down again, be in the hall."

msgid "二十年来，兵部尚书一直是庾子建。盟主要是还活着，线索在京师——尚书府。"
msgstr "For twenty years the Minister of War has been Yu Zijian. If the Alliance Leader is still alive, the trail leads to the Capital: the Minister's Mansion."

msgid "这件事我出不了水烟阁：执法使一动，七长老就要问为什么。你替我记着。"
msgstr "On this I cannot leave Waterfog Pavilion: the moment the Enforcer moves, the Seventh Elder will ask why. Keep it in mind for me."

msgid "盟主的事……等山门和镖单的事办完了，我再同你说。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader... When the gate and the waybill are done, I will tell you."

msgid "盟主二十年没回来了。这件事，水烟阁不同外人说。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader has not come back in twenty years. Waterfog Pavilion does not discuss it with outsiders."

msgid "椅子"
msgstr "The Chair"

msgid "站潘军禅：等盟主回来。\n正月十七，天邪派在虹台上的那一票投旧盟主——卫沧澜回来了是他本人，没回来就是那把空椅子（已经入了虹台的席的，这一票不再跟着变）。潘军禅以执法使的名义升你执事；颜违会记下你，正月十七那天，他的人会多出一件事来。\n这是天邪这条线的大分裂，选了不能改。要站潘军禅吗？"
msgstr "Stand with Pan Junchan: wait for the Alliance Leader to return.\nOn the seventeenth of the first month, the Wayward School's vote on Rainbow Terrace goes to the old Alliance Leader: to Wei Canglan himself if he has come back, to the empty chair if he has not (once seats are taken on the Rainbow Terrace, the vote no longer changes). Pan Junchan promotes you to Deacon in the Enforcer's name; Yan Wei will remember you, and on the seventeenth his people will have one more thing to do.\nThis is the great split in the Wayward line, and it can't be undone. Stand with Pan Junchan?"

msgid "椅子是盟主的。正月十七，天邪派那一票，你我一起投。"
msgstr "The chair is the Alliance Leader's. On the seventeenth of the first month, you and I cast the Wayward School's vote together."

msgid "你站到七长老那边去了。执事的公事，照办就是。"
msgstr "You have gone over to the Seventh Elder's side. A Deacon's duties, then, are carried out as ordered."

msgid "看了你很久，才笑了一下——这一回的笑，和平时不一样。"
msgstr " looks at you for a long time before he smiles. This smile is not like his usual one."

msgid "好。门规里没有哪一条，写着盟主没死、椅子能换人。"
msgstr "Good. There is no school rule that says the chair can change hands while the Alliance Leader is not dead."

msgid "从今日起，你是水烟阁的执事。正月十七，天邪派那一票，等盟主。"
msgstr "From today you are a Deacon of Waterfog Pavilion. On the seventeenth of the first month, the Wayward School's vote waits for the Alliance Leader."

msgid "七长老那里，往后说话小心些——他记性好。"
msgstr "Around the Seventh Elder, watch your words from now on. He has a long memory."

msgid "盟主的椅子，空了二十年了。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader's chair has stood empty for twenty years."

msgid "票是我唱的。唱完了，就是定了。"
msgstr "I called the votes. Once called, it is settled."

msgid "天邪这一票，正月十七照你说的。"
msgstr "The Wayward vote goes as you said on the seventeenth."

msgid "脸上没有什么表情。"
msgstr "'s face shows nothing."

msgid "你站了颜长老。天邪这一票，长老们说投他，就投他。"
msgstr "You stood with Elder Yan. The elders say the Wayward vote goes to him, so to him it goes."

msgid "……执事要是想自己坐那把椅子，天邪这一票也是执事的。公事公办。"
msgstr "...If the Deacon means to take that chair, the Wayward vote belongs to the Deacon as well. Duty is duty."

msgid "等盟主回来。我说过的话不改。"
msgstr "We wait for the Alliance Leader to return. I do not take back what I have said."

msgid "你是执事。你要这一票，你开口。"
msgstr "You are the Deacon. If you want this vote, say so."

msgid "盟主回来了，就坐在厅里。天邪这一票，投他。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader is back, sitting in the hall. The Wayward vote goes to him."

msgid "二十年没管过事又怎样？那把椅子是他的。"
msgstr "So what if he has not run anything for twenty years? That chair is his."

msgid "望了一眼正厅那把空着的太师椅。"
msgstr " glances at the empty armchair in the main hall."

msgid "盟主没有回来。厅里是颜长老在管事——长老们的意思，天邪这一票投他。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader has not come back. Elder Yan runs things in the hall, and the elders mean the Wayward vote to go to him."

msgid "我一个执法使，拦不住。"
msgstr "I am only an Enforcer. I cannot stop it."

msgid "正月十七……盟主的事还没有着落，说虹台早了。"
msgstr "The seventeenth of the first month... The Alliance Leader's affair is still unsettled. It is too early to talk of Rainbow Terrace."

msgid "请潘军禅把天邪派这一票交给你：正月十七虹台上，天邪听你的——你要站出来，这一票就是你的；不站，就由你说投谁。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Ask Pan Junchan to hand the Wayward School's vote to you: on Rainbow Terrace on the seventeenth of the first month, the Wayward School follows you. If you stand forward, the vote is yours; if not, you say who it goes to.\nSay this?"

msgid "说过了。天邪听你的。"
msgstr "It is said. The Wayward School follows you."

msgid "沉默了一会儿。"
msgstr " is silent for a while."

msgid "好。天邪这一票，执事说了算。"
msgstr "Good. The Wayward vote is the Deacon's call."

msgid "信我收下了。"
msgstr "I will keep the letter."

msgid "信我收下了。山门的事，不劳你了。"
msgstr "I will keep the letter. The mountain gate needs no more of your trouble."

msgid "展开信看了一遍，半晌没有说话。"
msgstr " unfolds the letter, reads it through, and says nothing for a long while."

msgid "字是七长老身边账房的笔迹。……颜长老在数人头：哪几派来，椅子空不空，阁里谁跟谁走得近——数到我头上来了。"
msgstr "The hand is that of the Seventh Elder's own clerk. ...Elder Yan is counting heads: which schools will come, whether the chair is empty, who in the Pavilion is close to whom. He has counted his way to me."

msgid "数人头不犯门规。可派人扮成外人上山，数到自己阁里来——这件事，我记下了。"
msgstr "Counting heads breaks no school rule. But sending a man up the mountain dressed as an outsider, to count inside his own Pavilion... That, I will remember."

msgid "展开信看了一遍，脸上的笑没了。"
msgstr " unfolds the letter and reads it through, and the smile leaves his face."

msgid "纸是兵部的公文纸，裁去了抬头。他们想知道两件事：椅子空着没有，卫盟主还在不在。"
msgstr "The paper is the Ministry of War's official paper, with the letterhead cut off. They want to know two things: whether the chair is empty, and whether Leader Wei is still alive."

msgid "兵部的人扮成皮货商上水烟阁打听盟主——二十年来，这是头一回。有人在京师，替盟主的生死记着账。"
msgstr "A Ministry of War man dressed as a fur trader, coming up to Waterfog Pavilion to ask about the Alliance Leader: in twenty years, this is the first time. Someone in the Capital is keeping accounts on whether the Leader lives or dies."

msgid "镖单你已经给了陈总镖头。这一张存根，你自己留着。"
msgstr "You have already given the waybill to Chief Chen. Keep this stub yourself."

msgid "刑堂里已经锁着一张了。"
msgstr "There is already one locked in the punishment hall."

msgid "把镖单交给潘军禅，锁进水烟阁的刑堂。\n振远的脸面保住了，这件事到此为止——陈天星不会再查。\n镖单只有一张。交给他吗？"
msgstr "Give the waybill to Pan Junchan, to be locked in Waterfog Pavilion's punishment hall.\nFar-Road's face is saved and the matter ends here; Chen Tianxing will dig no further.\nThere is only one waybill. Give it to him?"

msgid "接过镖单看了一遍，折好收进了袖里。"
msgstr " takes the waybill, reads it through, folds it and tucks it into his sleeve."

msgid "锁进刑堂。振远的脸面，水烟阁替他们留着。"
msgstr "Into the punishment hall it goes. Waterfog Pavilion keeps Far-Road's face for them."

msgid "陈剑秋那里，我派人去说一声。二十年了，他也该睡个好觉。"
msgstr "I will send someone to tell Chen Jianqiu. Twenty years; he has earned a good night's sleep."

msgid "振远的东西，你自己收好。"
msgstr "It is Far-Road's. Keep it safe yourself."

msgid "执法使"
msgstr "Enforcer"

msgid "於兰前辈入了朝，萧师兄……没有回来。水烟阁不能没有收徒的人，我以执法使的名义代收。天邪派门规甚严，$RESPECT如果真的有心，且发个誓来。"
msgstr "Elder Yulan has gone to court, and Senior Brother Xiao... did not come back. Waterfog Pavilion cannot be without someone to take disciples, so I take them in the Enforcer's name. The rules of the Wayward School are strict. If you are truly sincere, $RESPECT, swear an oath."

msgid "执法使代收，也是照门规收。不发誓，不收。"
msgstr "When the Enforcer takes disciples in their stead, it is still by the school's rules. No oath, no disciple."

msgid "好。师父不在，执法使替他们看着你。"
msgstr "Good. Your shifus are not here, so the Enforcer will watch over you for them."

msgid "冲你点了点头，没有笑。"
msgstr " nods to you without a smile."

msgid "从楼上下来，走到大厅中央那张黝黑的太师椅跟前，伸手在扶手上按了一按。"
msgstr " comes down from upstairs, walks up to the dark armchair in the middle of the hall, and presses a hand on its armrest."

msgid "这个「代」字，本座顶了这些日子，也该去掉了。正月十七九派上虹台，水烟阁要有一个真正坐这把椅子的人。"
msgstr "This word 'Acting' I have carried all these days; it is time it came off. On the seventeenth of the first month the nine schools go up to Rainbow Terrace, and Waterfog Pavilion must have someone who truly sits in this chair."

msgid "二十年了，这把椅子一直空着。正月十七九派上虹台，水烟阁总得拿出个说法——椅子空着，武林就没有一个能说话的人。"
msgstr "Twenty years this chair has stood empty. On the seventeenth the nine schools go up to Rainbow Terrace, and Waterfog Pavilion must give them an answer. While the chair is empty, the wulin has no one who can speak for it."

msgid "坐在厅侧的一张矮凳上，手里还拿着那本诗集，没有抬头。"
msgstr " sits on a low stool at the side of the hall, the book of poems still in his hands, and does not look up."

msgid "盟主回来了，本座比谁都高兴。可一个二十年没管过事的人，正月十七上了虹台，九派问他这二十年武林是什么样子——他答得上来么？"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader is back, and no one is happier than I. But a man who has run nothing for twenty years goes up to Rainbow Terrace on the seventeenth, and the nine schools ask him what the wulin has been these twenty years. Can he answer?"

msgid "椅子空着，是因为盟主还没回来。"
msgstr "The chair is empty because the Alliance Leader has not come back yet."

msgid "二十年了，执法使。人要是回得来，早就回来了。"
msgstr "Twenty years, Enforcer. If he could come back, he would have long ago."

msgid "九派里几派会来，阁里谁跟谁走得近——本座心里有数。山门上跑掉的那一个，没有白跑。"
msgstr "How many of the nine schools will come, who in the Pavilion is close to whom: I know. The one who got away at the mountain gate did not run for nothing."

msgid "上个月山门上那个探子，听说是从执法使眼皮底下走的？椅子空着，外人就敢上山来问盟主的死活。"
msgstr "That spy at the mountain gate last month, I hear he walked off under the Enforcer's nose? While the chair is empty, outsiders dare come up the mountain to ask whether the Alliance Leader lives or dies."

msgid "上个月扮成皮货商上山来数人头的，是七长老账房里的人。"
msgstr "The one who came up the mountain last month dressed as a fur trader to count heads was a man from the Seventh Elder's counting room."

msgid "数人头不犯门规。正月十七几派来、椅子空不空，总得有人去数。"
msgstr "Counting heads breaks no school rule. How many schools come on the seventeenth, whether the chair is empty: someone has to count."

msgid "上个月山门上拿下的那个，是兵部的人。京师有人替盟主的生死记着账。"
msgstr "The one taken at the mountain gate last month was a Ministry of War man. Someone in the Capital is keeping accounts on whether the Alliance Leader lives or dies."

msgid "所以更要早定。椅子空一天，朝廷就多一天的念想。"
msgstr "All the more reason to settle it soon. Every day the chair stands empty, the court has one more day to hope."

msgid "陈天星查清了：二十年前那趟镖，是兵部点名改走老松岭的。"
msgstr "Chen Tianxing has got to the bottom of it: twenty years ago, the Ministry of War named that shipment and changed its route to Old Pine Ridge."

msgid "查清了又如何？水烟阁不能为一趟镖跟朝廷耗二十年。正月十七之后，旧案到此为止。"
msgstr "And so? Waterfog Pavilion cannot wear itself out against the court for twenty years over one shipment. After the seventeenth, the old case ends here."

msgid "镖单锁进了刑堂——执法使自己也知道，有些旧案，到此为止最好。"
msgstr "The waybill was locked in the punishment hall. The Enforcer knows himself that some old cases are best ended there."

msgid "锁起来，是替振远留脸面，不是替谁结案。"
msgstr "I locked it away to keep Far-Road's face, not to close anyone's case."

msgid "盟主回来了。他坐不坐这把椅子，正月十七由他自己说，轮不到别人替他定。"
msgstr "The Alliance Leader is back. Whether he sits in this chair, he will say himself on the seventeenth; it is not for anyone else to decide for him."

msgid "盟主一天没有消息，这把椅子就一天是盟主的。等他回来。"
msgstr "For as long as there is no word of the Alliance Leader, this chair is his. We wait for him to come back."

msgid "转过身来，看着你。"
msgstr " turns around and looks at you."

msgid "你是天邪这一辈的大弟子。正月十七，天邪派那一票该投给谁，你说一句。跟着本座，水烟阁的执事有你一个。"
msgstr "You are the senior disciple of the Wayward School's generation. On the seventeenth, say who the Wayward vote should go to. Follow me, and one of Waterfog Pavilion's Deacons will be you."

msgid "七长老许得出口的，我许不出口。我只问你一句：门规里哪一条，写着盟主没死，椅子就能换人？"
msgstr "What the Seventh Elder can promise, I cannot. I will ask you only this: which school rule says the chair can change hands while the Alliance Leader is not dead?"

msgid "绝尘子本为释家人，后得奇人指点，得悟道家真谛，佛道双修，\n皆入化境。后访遍名山大川，自号绝尘，创此绝尘一派。\n"
msgstr "Juechenzi was once a Buddhist; later, guided by a remarkable teacher, he grasped the true meaning of the Dao and cultivated Buddhism and Daoism both until he mastered them. Afterward he traveled to all the famous mountains and great rivers, named himself Juechen, and founded the Dustless School.\n"

msgid "祖师"
msgstr "Founder"

msgid "绝尘子道：你为何无故滋事，误我清修！\n"
msgstr "Juechenzi says: \"Why do you make trouble for no reason and disturb my quiet cultivation?\"\n"

msgid "绝尘子道：贫道向以遁世为乐，你何苦如此相逼？\n"
msgstr "Juechenzi says: \"This poor Daoist has always found his joy in withdrawing from the world. Why must you press me so?\"\n"

msgid "绝尘派是我所创，你有何指教？"
msgstr "I founded the Dustless School. What is it you wish of me?"

msgid "入我派者，需有慧根。"
msgstr "Whoever enters my school must have a gift for insight."

msgid "我便是绝尘子。"
msgstr "I am Juechenzi."

msgid "绝尘派不问世事。"
msgstr "The Dustless School does not concern itself with the affairs of the world."

msgid "洞里的事，你都知道了。"
msgstr "You know everything about the cave now."

msgid "闭着眼睛听你说完，过了很久才睁开。"
msgstr " hears you out with his eyes closed, and opens them only after a long time."

msgid "洞里有东西，老道知道。"
msgstr "There is something in the cave. This old Daoist knows."

msgid "那道门拴着，阵守得住石室——老道就不管。"
msgstr "As long as that door stays barred and the array holds the Stone Chamber, this old Daoist does not interfere."

msgid "又闭上了眼睛。"
msgstr " closes his eyes again."

msgid "青石村？绝尘派不问世事。"
msgstr "Bluestone Village? The Dustless School does not concern itself with the affairs of the world."

msgid "绝尘派不问世事。村里人的事，你要管，自己去管。"
msgstr "The Dustless School does not concern itself with the affairs of the world. The villagers' troubles: if you want to see to them, see to them yourself."

msgid "睁开眼睛，打量了你一番。"
msgstr " opens his eyes and looks you over."

msgid "你走得出老道的阵。"
msgstr "You can walk out of this old Daoist's array."

msgid "……村里人的事，你要管，自己去管。"
msgstr "...The villagers' troubles: if you want to see to them, see to them yourself."

msgid "正月十七的事，过去了。"
msgstr "The seventeenth of the first month is past."

msgid "老道说话算话。正月十七，老道下山走一趟。"
msgstr "This old Daoist keeps his word. On the seventeenth of the first month, this old Daoist will come down the mountain."

msgid "虹台？绝尘派不问世事，向来不去。"
msgstr "Rainbow Terrace? The Dustless School does not concern itself with the world, and has never gone."

msgid "眯着眼睛打量了你一番。"
msgstr " narrows his eyes and looks you over."

msgid "……你走得过老道的八卦阵。好，你要老道下山，老道就下山——投旧盟主，椅子照旧。"
msgstr "...You can get through this old Daoist's Eight Trigrams array. Very well. If you want this old Daoist to come down the mountain, down he comes: the vote is for the old Alliance Leader, and the chair stays as it is."

msgid "虹台上那把椅子谁坐，跟老道没有关系。"
msgstr "Who sits in that chair on Rainbow Terrace has nothing to do with this old Daoist."

msgid "下山"
msgstr "Come Down"

msgid "请绝尘子下山：正月十七绝尘派来虹台，这一票投旧盟主。\n要这么说吗？"
msgstr "Ask Juechenzi to come down the mountain: on the seventeenth of the first month the Dustless School comes to Rainbow Terrace, and its vote goes to the old Alliance Leader.\nSay this?"

msgid "说过了。老道下山。"
msgstr "It is said. This old Daoist comes down the mountain."

msgid "拂了拂袖子。"
msgstr " brushes off his sleeves."

msgid "好。老道走一趟。"
msgstr "Very well. This old Daoist will make the trip."

msgid "{title}{nickname}{name}要叛师！！！"
msgstr "{title} {name} would betray the school!!!"

msgid "入我派者，需有慧根。$RESPECT的资质不宜！"
msgstr "Whoever enters my school must have a gift for insight. Your gifts are not suited to it, $RESPECT!"

msgid "$RESPECT似乎尚缺江湖历练，不宜投入绝尘门下。"
msgstr "You still seem to lack experience in the jianghu, $RESPECT. It is not fitting for you to join the Dustless School."

msgid "很好$RESPECT多加努力他日必定有成。"
msgstr "Very good. Work hard, $RESPECT, and one day you will surely succeed."

msgid "这是一位来自天界的守护神，专门担任护法之责。\n"
msgstr "A guardian god from the heavens, whose charge is to stand guard.\n"

msgid "一道金光由天而降，金光中走出一个身穿金色战袍的将官。"
msgstr "A beam of golden light comes down from the sky, and out of it steps an officer in a golden war robe."

msgid "$N说道：末将奉法主召唤，特来护法！"
msgstr "$N {N:say|says}: \"Summoned by my master, this general comes to stand guard!\""

msgid "$N说道：末将奉法主召唤，现在已经完成护法任务，就此告辞！"
msgstr "$N {N:say|says}: \"Summoned by my master, this general has done his guard duty and now takes his leave!\""

msgid "$N化成一道金光，冲上天际消失不见了。"
msgstr "$N {N:turn|turns} into a beam of golden light, {N:shoot|shoots} up into the sky and {N:vanish|vanishes}."

msgid "林忌是一位道行十分高深的修道者，你发现他的眼珠一个是黑色的，一\n个是金色的，这正是「谷衣心法」修炼到极高境界的徵兆。\n"
msgstr "Lin Ji is a Daoist of very deep attainment. You notice that one of his eyes is black and the other gold: the sign of the Grain Robe Heart Method cultivated to a very high level.\n"

msgid "天师"
msgstr "Celestial Master"

msgid "道童"
msgstr "Acolytes"

msgid "的眉头动了一下。"
msgstr "'s brows twitch."

msgid "北麓的道观收孩子，说是收道童。茅山查了二十年，查到的孩子都没有回来过。"
msgstr "The abbey on the North Foot takes in children, calls them acolytes. Mount Mao has looked into it for twenty years, and not one of the children it traced has ever come back."

msgid "晚月庄那个女人是逃出来的？……那她是第一个。六阴剑是逆灵宫的剑，教给孩子，是为了让他们替宫里杀人。"
msgstr "That woman at Latemoon Manor escaped? ...Then she is the first. The Six-Chaos Sword is the Black Palace's sword; they teach it to children so the children will kill for the Palace."

msgid "道童？"
msgstr "Acolytes?"

msgid "茅山的家事，不劳你了。"
msgstr "Mount Mao's family affairs need no help from you."

msgid "没有抬头。"
msgstr " does not look up."

msgid "书在藏经楼，他守着。他二十年不进这道门——进来一回，就不走了。"
msgstr "The book is in the Scripture Library, and he keeps watch over it. For twenty years he would not come through this door; now that he has come through once, he will not leave."

msgid "你们说留，就留吧。"
msgstr "You say keep it, so it stays."

msgid "书烧了。他回京城去了——那里还有他守着的人。"
msgstr "The book is burned. He has gone back to the Capital; there is still someone there he watches over."

msgid "书在这里，人也在这里。"
msgstr "The book is here, and so is he."

msgid "烧，问我「烧」；留，去问他「留」。你带它回来的——你说。"
msgstr "To burn it, ask me \"Burn\"; to keep it, go and ask him \"Keep.\" You brought it back. You say."

msgid "他会来的。书在我这里，他总要来看一眼。"
msgstr "He will come. The book is with me; he will have to come and look at it."

msgid "下回你进大殿，他就在门口了。"
msgstr "Next time you enter the main hall, he will be at the door."

msgid "他在京城兵部尚书府，二十年了。书在他手里。"
msgstr "He is in the Capital, at the Minister's Mansion, and has been for twenty years. The book is in his hands."

msgid "把拂尘搁在香案上，半晌没有说话。"
msgstr " lays his horsetail whisk on the incense table and says nothing for a long while."

msgid "少的那一函叫《上清符箓》，茅山的符都在里头。"
msgstr "The missing case is the Highest Clarity talisman book. All of Mount Mao's talismans are in it."

msgid "二十年前，京里兵部的庾大人夜夜见白衣人，派人上山，求茅山去镇宅。茅山不给官家看门——我不肯。"
msgstr "Twenty years ago, Lord Yu of the Ministry of War in the Capital saw men in white night after night, and sent people up the mountain to beg Mount Mao to come and guard his house. Mount Mao does not keep the gate for officials. I refused."

msgid "我那师弟说，镇宅也是救人。夜里揣着那函书下了山，再没回来。"
msgstr "My junior brother said that guarding a house is saving people too. One night he went down the mountain with that case of books in his robe, and never came back."

msgid "「我守人」……他守的是谁，我不知道。他在京城兵部尚书府，二十年了。你替我去看一眼。"
msgstr "\"I guard someone\"... Who it is he guards, I do not know. He is in the Capital, at the Minister's Mansion, and has been for twenty years. Go and take a look for me."

msgid "藏经楼二楼，红布桌上的镇教秘籍，你数过没有？"
msgstr "On the second floor of the Scripture Library, the guardian scriptures on the red-clothed table: have you counted them?"

msgid "上去看看。"
msgstr "Go up and look."

msgid "金色的那只眼睛动了一下。"
msgstr "'s golden eye flickers."

msgid "尚书府的花匠？……你见过他。他还叫我师兄。"
msgstr "The gardener at the Minister's Mansion? ...You have seen him. He still calls me Senior Brother."

msgid "茅山的家事，本不该同外人说。你见过他，就算茅山的朋友。"
msgstr "Mount Mao's family affairs should not be told to outsiders. But you have seen him, so you count as a friend of Mount Mao."

msgid "藏经楼你上去看看。二楼红布桌上的镇教秘籍，你数一数。"
msgstr "Go up to the Scripture Library and look. Count the guardian scriptures on the red-clothed table on the second floor."

msgid "你替茅山戴过那顶冠，算茅山的朋友。茅山的家事，不瞒你。"
msgstr "You wore that cap for Mount Mao; you count as a friend of Mount Mao. Mount Mao's family affairs, I will not hide from you."

msgid "我有个师弟，二十年前下了山。"
msgstr "I have a junior brother who went down the mountain twenty years ago."

msgid "茅山的家事。"
msgstr "Mount Mao's family affairs."

msgid "烧"
msgstr "Burn"

msgid "跟林忌：《上清符箓》投进殿前的香炉，镇教秘籍从此少一函——茅山宁可没有这本书。花匠下山回京城，守着庾清尘。\n林忌教你谷衣心法。正月十七虹台上，茅山这一票投颜违：主剿，北麓剿干净，不留根（已经入了虹台的席的，这一票不再跟着变）。\n终章之后北麓那座道观里的人还没有去处的，问林忌「剿」，官兵上山。\n要这么办吗？"
msgstr "Side with Lin Ji: the Highest Clarity talisman book goes into the incense burner before the hall, and the guardian scriptures are one case short from now on; Mount Mao would rather not have this book. The gardener goes down the mountain and back to the Capital, to watch over Yu Qingchen.\nLin Ji teaches you the Grain Robe Heart Method. On Rainbow Terrace on the seventeenth of the first month, Mount Mao's vote goes to Yan Wei: for a purge, the North Foot wiped clean with no roots left (once seats are taken on the Rainbow Terrace, the vote no longer changes).\nAfter the final chapter, if anyone from that abbey on the North Foot still has nowhere to go, ask Lin Ji \"Purge\" and the soldiers go up the mountain.\nDo it this way?"

msgid "书锁回去了。……师弟守着。"
msgstr "The book is locked away again. ...My junior brother keeps watch."

msgid "烧了。灰是青的。"
msgstr "Burned. The ashes were blue."

msgid "把《上清符箓》捧到殿前的香炉边，一页一页撕下来，投进去。"
msgstr " carries the Highest Clarity talisman book to the incense burner before the hall, tears it out page by page, and throws the pages in."

msgid "前半本的朱砂符烧起来是红的，后半本的黑字烧起来是青的。花匠站在殿门口，一直看到最后一页。\n"
msgstr "The cinnabar talismans of the first half burn red; the black characters of the second half burn blue. The gardener stands in the hall doorway and watches to the very last page.\n"

msgid "茅山宁可没有这本书。"
msgstr "Mount Mao would rather not have this book."

msgid "师弟，回京城去吧。那孩子还要人看着。"
msgstr "Junior Brother, go back to the Capital. That child still needs someone to watch over him."

msgid "花匠朝林忌拜了一拜，什么也没说，转身下山去了。\n"
msgstr "The gardener bows to Lin Ji, says nothing, turns, and goes down the mountain.\n"

msgid "烧什么？"
msgstr "Burn what?"

msgid "谷衣心法是我茅山派为对抗邪魔外道所创的内功心法。\n"
msgstr "The Grain Robe Heart Method is a neigong our Mount Mao School created to stand against demons and heretics.\n"

msgid "我茅山派自张天师开山立派至今，世世代代皆以降妖伏魔为己任。\n"
msgstr "Since Celestial Master Zhang founded our Mount Mao School, generation after generation has made subduing demons its duty.\n"

msgid "看了你很久，叹了一口气。"
msgstr " looks at you for a long time and sighs."

msgid "他们认出你了。冠摘了吧——戴着它，北麓上谁都认得你。"
msgstr "They have recognized you. Take off the cap. Wearing it, anyone on the North Foot will know you."

msgid "你递出来的东西，茅山都用上了。这就够了。"
msgstr "Everything you passed out, Mount Mao has put to use. That is enough."

msgid "你露的破绽太多了。宫里迟早认出你——别再回那座道观。"
msgstr "You have shown too many cracks. Sooner or later the Palace will see through you. Do not go back to that abbey."

msgid "时辰和路，茅山记下了。那一夜，北麓下湖的路上有茅山的人。"
msgstr "The hour and the road, Mount Mao has noted. That night, Mount Mao's people will be on the road from the North Foot down to the lake."

msgid "那就去吧。冠戴好——那一剑，只有你递得出去。"
msgstr "Then go. Keep the cap on. That sword stroke, only you can deliver."

msgid "官兵上了北麓。宫里剩下的人，这一回一个也走不了。"
msgstr "The soldiers have gone up the North Foot. This time, not one of those left in the Palace will get away."

msgid "宫里剩下的人下了山，茅山看着。坛上的火，灭了。"
msgstr "Those left in the Palace have come down the mountain, and Mount Mao watches over them. The fire on the altar has gone out."

msgid "回北麓去，同宫里当家的说「下山」。"
msgstr "Go back to the North Foot and say \"Down the Mountain\" to whoever runs the Palace."

msgid "宫里剩下的人，交官府去剿（问我「剿」），还是劝他们下山、交茅山看着（问我「招安」）——你定。正月十七之前，给我一个了断。"
msgstr "Those left in the Palace: hand them to the authorities to purge (ask me \"Suppress\"), or persuade them to come down the mountain into Mount Mao's keeping (ask me \"Amnesty\"). You decide. Before the seventeenth of the first month, give me an end to it."

msgid "唤首那一夜过去了。茅山没等到你的话。"
msgstr "The night of the Calling of the Head has passed. Mount Mao never got word from you."

msgid "倒戈，还是潜伏，你定。定了，来告诉我。"
msgstr "Turn on them, or stay hidden among them: you decide. When you have decided, come and tell me."

msgid "把拂尘搭在臂弯里，金色的那只眼睛望着北边。"
msgstr " rests his horsetail whisk in the crook of his arm, his golden eye gazing north."

msgid "湖底的事了了，商玦没有回来。可北麓那座道观里还有人——坛上的火没有灭，他们管这叫续灯。"
msgstr "The business under the lake is over, and Shang Jue has not come back. But there are still people in that abbey on the North Foot. The fire on the altar has not gone out; they call it the Feeding of the Lamp."

msgid "茅山要一个了断。交给官府去剿，还是劝他们下山，交茅山看着。"
msgstr "Mount Mao wants an end to it. Hand them to the authorities to purge, or persuade them to come down the mountain into Mount Mao's keeping."

msgid "交官府去剿，问我「剿」；劝他们下山、交茅山看着，问我「招安」。正月十七之前，给我一个了断。"
msgstr "To hand them to the authorities to purge, ask me \"Suppress\"; to persuade them down the mountain into Mount Mao's keeping, ask me \"Amnesty.\" Before the seventeenth of the first month, give me an end to it."

msgid "湖上的事要紧。先去湖上。"
msgstr "The lake comes first. Go to the lake."

msgid "放下手里的拂尘，金色的那只眼睛看着你。"
msgstr " puts down his horsetail whisk, his golden eye on you."

msgid "钉子拔了，头在冰下醒了。他们等的那一夜，就是唤首：宫里倾巢下湖，商玦走在最前头。"
msgstr "The nail is pulled, and the head has woken under the ice. The night they have been waiting for is the Calling of the Head: the whole Palace goes down to the lake, with Shang Jue at the front."

msgid "你告诉我哪一夜、走哪条路，茅山的人就截在北麓下湖的路上——到了冰龙厅，他身边剩不下几个人。可那顶冠，从此就没用了。"
msgstr "Tell me which night and which road, and Mount Mao's people will cut them off on the road from the North Foot down to the lake. By the time he reaches the ice dragons' hall, he will have few left beside him. But after that, the cap will be of no more use."

msgid "或者你什么都不说。戴着冠跟他们下湖，站在他身后——第一剑，只有你递得出去。宫里要是已经起了疑心，这条路就走不得。"
msgstr "Or you say nothing. Wear the cap, go down to the lake with them, and stand behind him. The first stroke, only you can deliver. If the Palace already suspects you, this road is closed."

msgid "倒戈，还是潜伏，你定。"
msgstr "Turn on them, or stay hidden among them: you decide."

msgid "宫里的事快到头了。他们在等一夜——钉子拔了，湖上的事近了，那一夜才会来。"
msgstr "The Palace's business is nearly at its end. They are waiting for a night. When the nail is pulled and the lake's business draws near, that night will come."

msgid "到时候我要知道：哪一夜，走哪条路。"
msgstr "When it does, I need to know: which night, and which road."

msgid "人放出去了。茅山的人在北麓底下接着，送他们各回各家。"
msgstr "They have been let out. Mount Mao's people are waiting below the North Foot to see each of them home."

msgid "宫里的事还没完——你戴着那顶冠，就还是他们的人。等我的话。"
msgstr "The Palace's business is not over. As long as you wear that cap, you are still one of them. Wait for my word."

msgid "地牢里那三个人。钥匙在狱卒腰上——那人好酒，子时就歪在长凳上睡。开了门，人自己会走。"
msgstr "The three people in the dungeon. The key is on the jailer's belt. He likes his drink, and by midnight he is asleep, slumped on the bench. Open the door and they will walk out on their own."

msgid "把名单折好，压在香炉底下。"
msgstr " folds the list and tucks it under the incense burner."

msgid "茅山截下了一车。可上一车已经上了山——地牢里新关了三个人。"
msgstr "Mount Mao stopped one cart. But the cart before it had already gone up the mountain; there are three new prisoners in the dungeon."

msgid "放他们出来。钥匙在狱卒腰上；那人好酒，子时就歪在石阶边的长凳上睡。开了门，人自己会走：货栈的侧门，夜里没人看。"
msgstr "Let them out. The key is on the jailer's belt; he likes his drink, and by midnight he is asleep, slumped on the bench by the stone steps. Open the door and they will walk out on their own: the side door of the storehouse goes unwatched at night."

msgid "还有一样。账房案角那只铁匣，锁和牢门是一套。里头是名册的原本——人是谁送上山的，押的谁的印，都在上面。"
msgstr "One more thing. The iron box on the corner of the Counting Room desk has the same lock as the cell door. Inside is the original register: who sent each person up the mountain, whose seal is on it, it is all there."

msgid "带不带出来，你定。带出来，是一样物证；宫里也就少了一样东西。"
msgstr "Whether you bring it out is your decision. Brought out, it is evidence, and the Palace has one thing less."

msgid "名单抄到了？给我。"
msgstr "You copied the list? Give it to me."

msgid "看了你一眼，没有说话。"
msgstr " glances at you and says nothing."

msgid "禁书回了宫里，是你送回去的。……也罢。他当你是自己人，门你进得去。"
msgstr "The forbidden book went back to the Palace, and you are the one who took it. ...So be it. He thinks you are one of his own; you can get through the door."

msgid "进去，干活，听。他们在等什么，要多少人，人从哪里来。"
msgstr "Go in, work, listen. What they are waiting for, how many people they need, where the people come from."

msgid "进去，先干活。管事派什么，你干什么；他们说什么，你听什么。"
msgstr "Go in and work first. Do whatever the steward assigns; listen to whatever they say."

msgid "野羊山北麓那座黑砖道观，茅山盯了它两年。我要一个进得去的人，戴着他们的冠替我看、替我听。"
msgstr "Mount Mao has watched that black-brick abbey on the North Foot of Goathill for two years. I need someone who can get inside, wear their cap, and watch and listen for me."

msgid "可你身上有东方神教的令。一个人只藏得住一重身份——这件事，我不能托你。"
msgstr "But you carry a Golden Crow Order token. One person can hide only one identity. This, I cannot trust to you."

msgid "野羊山北麓那座黑砖道观，茅山盯了它两年。他们拜的不是神，是劫；收的不是香火，是人。"
msgstr "Mount Mao has watched that black-brick abbey on the North Foot of Goathill for two years. What they worship is not a god but a calamity; what they collect is not incense money but people."

msgid "你进去过，还出来了。茅山的道士进不去——一身符水的味道，隔着三里地，他们就闻得出来。"
msgstr "You went in, and came out again. Mount Mao's Daoists cannot get in: they reek of talisman water, and the Palace can smell it three li away."

msgid "我要一个进得去的人：戴着他们的冠，替我看，替我听。他们在等什么，要多少人，人从哪里来。"
msgstr "I need someone who can get inside: wear their cap, watch for me, listen for me. What they are waiting for, how many people they need, where the people come from."

msgid "这件事做了，就脱不了身。想好了，再问我「眼线」。"
msgstr "Once you take this on, you cannot get free of it. When you have thought it over, ask me \"Spy.\""

msgid "北麓那座道观？与你无关。"
msgstr "That abbey on the North Foot? It is none of your concern."

msgid "眼线"
msgstr "Spy"

msgid "答应下来，戴着黑冠回逆灵宫，做茅山的眼线。\n一个人只藏得住一重身份：接了这件事，东方神教那边的门，从此不再为你开。\n答应吗？"
msgstr "Agree, and go back to the Black Palace wearing the black cap as Mount Mao's spy.\nOne person can hide only one identity: take this on, and the Golden Crow Order's door will never open to you again.\nAgree?"

msgid "你已经答应过了。冠戴好。"
msgstr "You have already agreed. Keep the cap on."

msgid "金色的那只眼睛看了你很久。"
msgstr "'s golden eye studies you for a long time."

msgid "你身上有东方神教的令。茅山不用替两家办事的眼线——不是信不过你，是信不过那块令。"
msgstr "You carry a Golden Crow Order token. Mount Mao does not use a spy who works for two houses. It is not you I do not trust; it is that token."

msgid "好。"
msgstr "Good."

msgid "那一夜地牢里的人是你放走的。宫里记得那一夜——他们不知道是你，只知道有人。"
msgstr "You are the one who freed the people in the dungeon that night. The Palace remembers that night. They do not know it was you, only that it was someone."

msgid "戴着冠回去，管事会派你活。冠丢了，问我「黑冠」。"
msgstr "Go back wearing the cap, and the steward will give you work. If you lose the cap, ask me \"Black Cap.\""

msgid "你身上那卷东西，是逆灵天书的残卷。拿着它的人死在后山了。它不能跟着你进去，也不能就这么留在外头。"
msgstr "That scroll on you is a fragment of the Black Scripture. The man who carried it died on the back mountain. It cannot go in with you, and it cannot just be left outside either."

msgid "交给我，我当面烧了它。宫里会少一卷书，迟早有人问起——这就是你要担的。"
msgstr "Give it to me and I will burn it before your eyes. The Palace will be one scroll short, and sooner or later someone will ask. That is yours to bear."

msgid "你身上那卷东西，是逆灵天书的残卷。它不能跟着你进去，也不能就这么留在外头。"
msgstr "That scroll on you is a fragment of the Black Scripture. It cannot go in with you, and it cannot just be left outside either."

msgid "交给我，我当面烧了它——可宫里会少一卷书，迟早有人问起。还给后山那个大弟子，他会当你是他的人——禁书也就回了宫里。"
msgstr "Give it to me and I will burn it before your eyes, but the Palace will be one scroll short, and sooner or later someone will ask. Give it back to the senior disciple on the back mountain, and he will take you for one of his; and the forbidden book will be back in the Palace."

msgid "你定。"
msgstr "You decide."

msgid "那卷残卷不在你身上？……那就当它没回宫。宫里少了一卷书，迟早有人问起。"
msgstr "The fragment is not on you? ...Then count it as not returned to the Palace. The Palace is one scroll short, and sooner or later someone will ask."

msgid "……先听我把话说完。"
msgstr "...First hear me out."

msgid "从香案底下取出一顶黑冠，递给你。"
msgstr " takes a black cap from under the incense table and hands it to you."

msgid "上个月茅山弟子在北麓截下来的。冠是真的，戴它的人回不来了。"
msgstr "Mount Mao's disciples took it on the North Foot last month. The cap is real; the man who wore it is not coming back."

msgid "冠在你身上。戴好，别摘——摘了，他们下一眼就认得你。"
msgstr "You have the cap. Keep it on, do not take it off. Take it off and they will know you at the next glance."
